em all!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10245,0,'Drek\'Thar'),(11946,1,0,'You seek to draw the General of the Frostwolf legion out from his fortress? PREPOSTEROUS!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10377,0,'Drek\'Thar'),(11946,2,0,'Stormpike weaklings, face me in my fortress - if you dare!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10376,0,'Drek\'Thar'),(11946,3,0,'Your attacks are slowed by the cold, I think!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8846,0,'Drek\'Thar'),(11946,3,1,'Today, you will meet your ancestors!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8849,0,'Drek\'Thar'),(11946,3,2,'If you will not leave Alterac Valley on your own, then the Frostwolves will force you out!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8847,0,'Drek\'Thar'),(11946,3,3,'You cannot defeat the Frostwolf clan!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8844,0,'Drek\'Thar'),(11946,3,4,'You are no match for the strength of the Horde!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8848,0,'Drek\'Thar'),(11947,0,0,'Die!  Your kind has no place in Alterac Valley!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10055,0,'Captain Galvangar'),(11947,1,0,'I\'ll never fall for that, fool! If you want a battle, it will be on my terms and in my lair.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10378,0,'Captain Galvangar'),(11947,2,0,'Now is the time to attack!  For the Horde!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10057,0,'Captain Galvangar'),(11948,0,0,'Soldiers of Stormpike, your General is under attack! I require aid! Come! Come! Slay these mangy Frostwolf dogs.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10243,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,1,0,'You\'ll never get me out of me bunker, heathens!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10373,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,1,1,'Why don\'t ya try again without yer cheap tactics, pansies! Or are you too chicken???',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10374,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,2,0,'I will tell you this much...Alterac Valley will be ours.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,2,1,'Your attacks are weak!  Go practice on some rabbits and come back when you\'re stronger.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8839,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,2,2,'We will not be swayed from our mission!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8842,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,2,3,'It\'ll take more than you rabble to bring me down!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8841,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,2,4,'We, the Alliance, will prevail!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8843,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,2,5,'The Stormpike clan bows to no one, especially the horde!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8838,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,2,6,'Is that the best you can do?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13130,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11948,3,0,'Take no prisoners! Drive these heathens from our lands!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,12351,0,'Vanndar Stormpike'),(11949,0,0,'Begone, uncouth scum!  The Alliance shall prevail in Alterac Valley!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10054,0,'Captain Balinda Stonehearth'),(11949,1,0,'Filthy Frostwolf cowards! If you want a fight, you\'ll have to come to me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10375,0,'Captain Balinda Stonehearth'),(11949,2,0,'Take heart, Alliance!  Throw these villains from Alterac Valley!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10056,0,'Captain Balinda Stonehearth'),(12136,0,0,'The zeppelin to Grom\'gol has just arrived! All aboard for Stranglethorn!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22097,0,'Snurk Bucksquick'),(12577,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Jarrodenus'),(12578,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Mishellena'),(12596,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Bibilfaz Featherwhistle'),(12616,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Vhulgra'),(12617,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Khaelyn Steelwing'),(12636,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Georgia'),(12740,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Faustron'),(12858,0,0,'Everyone ready?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8284,0,'Torek'),(12858,1,0,'Ok, let\'s move out!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8278,0,'Torek'),(12858,2,0,'Prepare yourselves.  Silverwing is just around the bend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8282,0,'Torek'),(12858,3,0,'Silverwing is ours!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8280,0,'Torek'),(12858,4,0,'Go report that the outpost is taken.  We will remain here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8281,0,'Torek'),(13177,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Vahgruk'),(14354,0,0,'If you want the key, you\'ll have to catch me!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,9349,0,'Pusillin