 to have weakened.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18606,0,'Talbuk Doe'),(20762,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Gur\'zil'),(20774,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Farahlon Lasher'),(20777,0,0,'%s seems to have weakened.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18606,0,'Talbuk Sir'),(20787,0,0,'You\'ve saved me, fleshling! Ameer will hear of this noble act.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18388,0,'Captain Tyralius'),(20904,0,0,'I knew the prince would be angry, but I... I have not been myself. I had to let them out! The great one speaks to me, you see. Wait--outsiders. Kael\'thas did not send you! Good... I\'ll just tell the prince you released the prisoners!',14,0,100,0,0,11222,0,19103,0,'Warden Mellichar'),(20904,1,0,'The naaru kept some of the most dangerous beings in existence here in these cells. Let me introduce you to another....',14,0,100,5,0,11223,0,19104,0,'Warden Mellichar'),(20904,2,0,'Yes, yes... another! Your will is mine!',14,0,100,1,0,11224,0,19106,0,'Warden Mellichar'),(20904,3,0,'Behold, yet another terrifying creature of incomprehensible power!',14,0,100,0,0,11225,0,19107,0,'Warden Mellichar'),(20904,4,0,'What is this? A lowly gnome? I will do better, oh great one.',14,0,100,5,0,11226,0,19109,0,'Warden Mellichar'),(20904,5,0,'Anarchy! Bedlam! Oh, you are so wise! Yes, I see it now, of course!',14,0,100,5,0,11227,0,19110,0,'Warden Mellichar'),(20904,6,0,'One final cell remains. Yes, O great one, right away!',14,0,100,11,0,11228,0,19111,0,'Warden Mellichar'),(20904,7,0,'Welcome, O great one. I am your humble servant.',14,0,100,5,0,11229,0,19114,0,'Warden Mellichar'),(20977,8,0,'I didn\'t even break a sweat on that one!',14,0,100,0,0,11177,0,19824,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_SLAY1'),(20977,7,0,'Aaalllriiiight!! Who ordered up an extra large can of whoop-ass?',14,0,100,0,0,11176,0,19121,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_READY'),(20977,6,0,'And of course I\'ll need some mana. You guys are gonna love this; just wait....',14,0,100,0,0,11175,0,19120,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_DRINK'),(20977,5,0,'Fantastic! Next, some protective spells. Yeah, now we\'re cookin\'!',14,0,100,0,0,11174,0,19119,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_BUFFS'),(20977,4,0,'I just need to get some things ready first. You guys go ahead and get started. I need to summon up some water....',14,0,100,0,0,11173,0,19117,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_WATER'),(20977,3,0,'Prepare to defend yourself, cretin!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,19823,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_INTRO_4'),(20977,2,0,'I have no idea what goes on here, but I will gladly join your fight against this impudent imbecile!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19822,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_INTRO_3'),(20977,1,0,'\"Lowly\"? I don\'t care who you are, friend: no one refers to the mighty Millhouse Manastorm as \"lowly\"!',14,0,100,5,0,11172,0,19116,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_INTRO_2'),(20977,0,0,'Where in Bonzo\'s Brass Buttons am I? And who are-- yaaghh, that\'s one mother of a headache!',14,0,100,6,0,11171,0,19108,0,'Millhouse Manastorm SAY_INTRO_1'),(20983,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Mutated Farahlon Lasher'),(21107,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Rip Pedalslam'),(21291,0,0,'I\'m through asking nicely, fish-man.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,18954,0,'Grom\'tor, Son of Oronok'),(21291,1,0,'Where is the Cipher of Damnation? I know a third of it is in this village.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,18955,0,'Grom\'tor, Son of Oronok'),(21291,2,0,'No... Of course not. What was I thinking? Why would you have a third of the Cipher of Damnation?',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,18958,0,'Grom\'tor, Son of Oronok'),(21291,3,0,'I feel so stupid. Maybe I should unchain you and set you free?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,18959,0,'Grom\'tor, Son of Oronok'),(21291,4,0,'DO I HONESTLY LOOK THAT STUPID TO YOU, NAGA? NOW YOU FEEL PAIN!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,18960,0,'Grom\'tor, Son of Oronok'),(21291,5,0,'%s spits on the Coilskar naga.',16,0,100,5,0,0,0,18962,0,'Grom\'tor, Son of Oronok'),(21291,6,0,'GET UP YOU ROTTEN PIECE OF TRASH! GET UP BEFORE I END YOU!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,18963,0,'Grom\'tor, Son of Oronok'),(21291,7,0,'I\'m listening...',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,18966,0,'Grom\'tor, Son of Oronok'),(21295,0,0,'Whhaaat... are you sssspeaking of, ssssoft-sskin?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18956,0,'Coilskar Commander'),(21295,1,0,'The naga do nottt... have thissss... cipherrr...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18957,0,'Coilskar Commander'),(21295,2,0,'Yesss... Yesss... Ssset me freee...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18961,0,'Coilskar Commander'),(21295,3,0,'%s regains consciousness.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18964,0,'Coilskar Commander'),(21295,4,0,'Do not beat the Coilsssskaarrr commander anymore, orc! I will tell you! The cipherrr... It is hidden in one of the chests at Coilssskarrr Point... The naga there hold the keysss...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18965,0,'Coilskar Commander'),(21295,5,0,'COILSSSKARRR!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,18967,0,'Coilskar Commander'),(21797,0,0,'Your body is mine! Our fates are forever intertwined.',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,19494,0,'Ancient Shadowmoon Spirit'),(22314,0,0,'Woot!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20110,0,'Captive Child'),(22314,0,1,'I think those weird bird guys were going to eat us.  Gross!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20114,0,'Captive Child'),(22314,0,2,'Yay!  We\'re free!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20109,0,'Captive Child'),(22314,0,3,'Gross!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20115,0,'Captive Child'),(22373,3,0,'An Avatar of Terokk!! To arms!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20268,0,'Defender Grashna'),(22373,2,0,'The invaders persist! Hold them off!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20267,0,'Defender Grashna'),(22373,0,0,'%s points to the sky above.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20157,0,'Defender Grashna'),(22373,1,0,'More Minions of Terokk are coming!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20266,0,'Defender Grashna'),(22485,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Halu'),(22935,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Suralais Farwind'),(22936,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Auhula'),(24254,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(24460,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(24051,0,0,'Suffer, insect!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22701,0,'Dragonflayer Invader'),(24461,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(23678,0,0,'%s appears weak!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23041,0,'Chill Nymph'),(23720,0,0,'Thank you! There\'s no telling what those brutes would\'ve done to me.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,22438,0,'Theramore Prisoner'),(23736,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Pricilla Winterwind'),(23768,1,0,'James? James... No, you\'re not James, but I know who you are...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22244,0,'Lynn Hyal'),(23768,2,0,'You\'re the one who tracked down the brutes who did this to us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22245,0,'Lynn Hyal'),(23768,3,0,'I tried so hard to tell Jim... to tell anyone... who was behind this, but I couldn\'t find a way...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22246,0,'Lynn Hyal'),(23768,4,0,'Thank you for helping us and for helping Jim. If you see him, tell him little Jimmy and I love him and that we\'re waiting for him.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22247,0,'Lynn Hyal'),(23768,5,0,'I don\'t know when we\'ll see Daddy again, Jimmy, but I know he loves you and he misses you very much.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22249,0,'Lynn Hyal'),(23769,1,0,'Mommy, when will we see Daddy again?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22248,0,'Jimmy Hyal'),(23859,0,0,'Guards!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Greer Orehammer'),(9462,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'combat Frenzy'),(14344,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(23861,0,0,'Go away, whoever you are! Witch Hill is mine... mine!',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,22359,0,'say Text'),(4385,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(23861,0,1,'Why have you come here, outsider? You will only find pain! Our fate will be yours...',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,22363,0,'say Text'),(23861,0,2,'It is too late for Jarl... its hold is too strong...',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,22366,0,'say Text'),(23861,0,3,'The darkness... the corruption... they came too quickly for anyone to know...',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,22362,0,'say Text'),(23861,0,4,'The manor... someone else... will soon be consumed...',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,22361,0,'say Text'),(23953,4,0,'I join... the night.',14,0,0,0,0,13225,0,29592,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_DEATH'),(23953,3,0,'Aranal, ledel! Their fate shall be yours!',14,0,0,0,0,13224,0,22729,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_SUMMON_SKELETONS'),(23953,2,0,'Darkness waits.',14,0,0,0,0,13223,0,29591,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_SLAY'),(23953,1,0,'Not so fast.',14,0,0,0,0,13222,0,22734,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_FROST_TOMB'),(23953,0,0,'Your blood is mine!',14,0,0,0,0,13221,0,22736,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_AGGRO'),(23975,0,0,'Fire grant me vision...',12,7,100,20,0,0,0,22661,0,'Thoralius the Wise'),(23975,1,0,'Water grant me serenity...',12,7,100,20,0,0,0,22664,0,'Thoralius the Wise'),(23975,2,0,'%s inhales the wispy smoke tendrils emanating from the burner.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,22666,0,'Thoralius the Wise'),(23975,3,0,'Thank you, spirits.',12,7,100,2,0,0,0,22670,0,'Thoralius the Wise'),(24032,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Celea Frozenmane'),(24035,0,0,'Please, let me out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22637,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,1,'The key... you have to find the key!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22638,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,2,'I think I saw a key on one of those vrykul.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22639,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,3,'I don\'t want to be taken down into the catacombs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22640,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,4,'I don\'t want to be sacrificed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22641,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,5,'They\'re performing unholy rites down in the catacombs, and I\'m about to be the sacrifice!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22642,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,6,'Is there no hero to rescue me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22643,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,7,'This is the end.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22644,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,8,'I think I saw a key on one of those Gjalerbron vrykul up top.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23649,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,9,'Thank goodness for you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22652,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,10,'Thank you.  I will not forget this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22646,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,11,'The key... you have to find the key!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22638,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,12,'The vrykul are evil and must be destroyed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22650,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,13,'They\'re performing unholy rites down in the catacombs, and I\'m about to be the sacrifice!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22642,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,14,'This is the end.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22644,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,15,'You have to put a stop to this madness before it\'s too late!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22648,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,0,16,'You saved my life!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22651,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24052,0,0,'We don\'t shoe no mules here. \'Sides, it\'s strictly expedition business right now.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23562,0,'Eldrim Mounder'),(24052,1,0,'Not my problem! If yer so antsy to get yerself a house built, do it \'ere in the fort and quit yer whinin\'!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,23564,0,'Eldrim Mounder'),(24052,2,0,'Now, if you\'d be so kind as to get your ass away from my forge...',12,7,100,25,0,0,0,23566,0,'Eldrim Mounder'),(24061,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'James Ormsby'),(24155,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Tobias Sarkhoff'),(24178,0,0,'%s smells the meat, awakens from his slumber, and roars in anger!',16,0,100,15,0,0,0,22918,0,'Shatterhorn on aggro line and roar at same time'),(35229,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(24211,0,6,'They took us one by one. I\'m sure there are other survivors.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,22951,0,'Freed Winterhoof Longrunner'),(24211,0,5,'Strange ghosts walk the land. Be careful!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,22950,0,'Freed Winterhoof Longrunner'),(24211,0,4,'We should never have traveled through the Rivenwood. Everyone knows this!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,22949,0,'Freed Winterhoof Longrunner'),(24211,0,3,'You saved me from certain death. I owe you.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,22948,0,'Freed Winterhoof Longrunner'),(24211,0,2,'Blessings of the spirits of the land and air upon you.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,22947,0,'Freed Winterhoof Longrunner'),(24211,0,1,'I must return. Good hunting to you.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,22946,0,'Freed Winterhoof Longrunner'),(24211,0,0,'Thank you, stranger.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,22945,0,'Freed Winterhoof Longrunner'),(24238,2,1,'Fight without fear and the Val\'kyr will reward you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23063,0,'Bjorn Halgurdsson'),(24238,2,0,'Drive the invaders out!  For Queen Angerboda!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23062,0,'Bjorn Halgurdsson'),(24238,1,0,'No one speaks of my mother in that manner!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23009,0,'Bjorn Halgurdsson'),(24238,0,0,'[Crude Vrykul] Bjorns mottar haelgond sygar!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23008,0,'Bjorn Halgurdsson'),(24321,0,0,'%s motions for silence.',41,0,100,397,0,0,0,23130,0,'King Ymiron emote'),(24321,1,0,'Vrykul, your king implores you to listen!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,23134,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24321,2,0,'The gods have abandoned us!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,23135,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24321,3,0,'The crowd gasps in horror.',16,0,100,53,0,0,0,23136,0,'King Ymiron emote'),(24321,4,0,'Even now, in our darkest hour, they mock us!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,23137,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24321,5,0,'Where are the titans in our time of greatest need? Our women birth abberations - disfigured runts unable to even stand on their own! Weak and ugly... Useless...',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,23138,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24321,6,0,'Ymiron has toiled. Long have I sat upon my throne and thought hard of our plight. There is only one answer... one reason...',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,23139,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24321,7,0,'For who but the titans themselves could bestow such a curse? What could have such power?',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,23140,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24321,8,0,'And the answer is nothing... For it is the titans that have cursed us!',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,23141,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24321,9,0,'The crowd clamours.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23142,0,'King Ymiron'),(24321,10,0,'On this day all Vrykul will shed their old beliefs! We denounce our old gods! All Vrykul will pledge their allegiance to Ymiron! Ymiron will protect our noble race!',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,23143,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24322,0,0,'Silence!',14,1,100,1,0,0,0,32240,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar yell'),(24322,1,0,'Show them mercy, my king! They are of our flesh and blood!',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,23128,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar yell'),(24322,2,0,'All hail our glorious king, Ymiron!',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,23123,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar yell'),(24323,0,0,'The king is going to speak!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23132,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24323,1,0,'Silence!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23133,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24366,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Nizzle'),(24528,0,0,'How much\'ll it cost me to get my mules shod?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,23561,0,'Brune Grayblade'),(24528,1,0,'You don\'t understand! If I\'m not ready to go soon, all the good homesteading land will be taken!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23563,0,'Brune Grayblade'),(24528,2,0,'That, sir, is a mule!',12,7,100,25,0,0,0,23567,0,'Brune Grayblade'),(24531,2,0,'Of course, darling.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23606,0,'Gavin Ward'),(24531,1,0,'I\'d rather listen to his braying than yours, dear.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23610,0,'Gavin Ward'),(24531,0,0,'Yes, darling. You realize you\'ll be eating dire ram mutton for dinner until the crops are planted...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23608,0,'Gavin Ward'),(24532,2,0,'Remember, honey, we need to get a plot of land with a nice hot spring.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23605,0,'Sabetta Ward'),(24532,1,0,'I\'d sooner butcher that mule of yours! Why did you bring that beast in here, anyway?',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,23609,0,'Sabetta Ward'),(24532,0,0,'And I don\'t want our land to have any of those horrible wolves, or giants, or ugly rams!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23607,0,'Sabetta Ward'),(24534,6,0,'Now, my loyal custo... err, friends, go forth and conquer this land for our people!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,23576,0,'Marrod Silvertongue'),(24534,5,0,'There are more than enough to go around. Should you need other goods, don\'t hesitate to ask!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23575,0,'Marrod Silvertongue'),(24534,4,0,'Axes, picks, seed, nails, food, blankets, water... it\'s all there, waiting for you. I think you\'ll find my prices quite reasonable, too.',12,7,100,25,0,0,0,23574,0,'Marrod Silvertongue'),(24534,3,0,'But, you will not be alone out there. My men and I have prepared pack mules carrying the supplies you\'ll need most.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23573,0,'Marrod Silvertongue'),(24534,2,0,'We will win this land with the sword, and break it with the plow! You are the men and women who will be remembered for taming the wild continent!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23572,0,'Marrod Silvertongue'),(24534,1,0,'True, Northrend is a hard land, but our people are strong, hardy, and equal to the task!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23571,0,'Marrod Silvertongue'),(24534,0,0,'Welcome to Fort Wildervar, brave homesteaders! There\'s a whole continent out there just waiting to be claimed!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23570,0,'Marrod Silvertongue'),(24639,0,0,'Keep quiet, will you?  If anyone catches on, we\'re both dead.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23818,0,'Olga, the Scalawag Wench'),(24639,1,0,'All right, fellas!  Who ordered the spiced rum?  Was it you, Jackie boy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23819,0,'Olga, the Scalawag Wench'),(24639,2,0,'It\'s ok, sweetheart.  This one\'s on the house.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23820,0,'Olga, the Scalawag Wench'),(24710,0,0,'Right!  Let\'s try this so-called dire brew...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27418,0,'Ipfelkofer Ironkeg'),(24710,1,0,'By Bronzebeard\'s beard!  What a drink!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27419,0,'Ipfelkofer Ironkeg'),(24710,2,0,'$n, this beer... well, it might be the best of Brewfest!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,27421,0,'Ipfelkofer Ironkeg'),(24710,3,0,'It is a shame Coren\'s Dire Brew can\'t quench more thirsting throats!  It\'s blasphemy, I know, but  I envy those Dark Iron dwarves!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,27420,0,'Ipfelkofer Ironkeg'),(24710,4,0,'Ho there, and welcome to Brewfest!',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,23691,0,'Ipfelkofer Ironkeg'),(24710,4,1,'Hello, friend! Welcome to the Brewfest Grounds!',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,23692,0,'Ipfelkofer Ironkeg'),(24710,4,2,'Hail, good $c! Welcome to Ironforge\'s annual Brewfest celebration!',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,23693,0,'Ipfelkofer Ironkeg'),(24711,0,0,'Well time\'s money, and time\'s wasting!  Let\'s have that drink...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27435,0,'Tapper Swindlekeg'),(24711,1,0,'Wow!  This really greases the steamplugs!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27436,0,'Tapper Swindlekeg'),(24711,2,0,'If I were an honest goblin, I\'d say this was the best beer of the festival...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27437,0,'Tapper Swindlekeg'),(24711,3,0,'Too bad Coren\'s dead.  If I could buy that brew from him and resell it -- watered down and rebottled under my own label, of course -- I\'d be rich!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27438,0,'Tapper Swindlekeg'),(24711,4,0,'Hey there, and welcome to Brewfest. Come in and have a drink or three!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,23698,0,'Tapper Swindlekeg'),(24711,4,1,'What\'s up, friend? Welcome to the Brewfest Grounds! Now go buy some drinks!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,23700,0,'Tapper Swindlekeg'),(24711,4,2,'Hey hey, it\'s another $c! Welcome to my annual Brewfest celebration... now go feast and drink some!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,23701,0,'Tapper Swindlekeg'),(24779,0,0,'Tonight we feast on you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23806,0,'Dragonflayer Ambusher'),(24779,0,1,'Such easy prey...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23805,0,'Dragonflayer Ambusher'),(24779,0,2,'Who\'s hunting who?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23804,0,'Dragonflayer Ambusher'),(24788,0,0,'Sure thing, love.  Put it on Harry\'s tab, will ya?  He owes me a drink!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23830,0,'Jack Adams'),(24788,1,0,'Free rum?  Why... that\'s me favorite kind!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23821,0,'Jack Adams'),(24788,2,0,'Sweet Neptulon!  That was... one drink... too many!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23822,0,'Jack Adams'),(25288,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Turida Coldwind'),(25322,0,0,'Thank you, $c. May the winds and seas always deliver you safely.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24599,0,'Kaskala Shaman'),(25321,0,2,'Do not allow Kaskala to forget what has happened here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24598,0,'Kaskala Craftsman'),(25321,0,1,'You have my gratitude, $c. I thought I\'d never be free.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24597,0,'Kaskala Craftsman'),(25321,0,0,'Thank you for freeing me! May the tides always favor you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24596,0,'Kaskala Craftsman'),(25678,0,0,'Ah, good... more parts!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24872,0,'Part of the Doctor Razorgin on aggro lines'),(25678,0,1,'Fresh meat!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24871,0,'Part of the Doctor Razorgin on aggro lines'),(25678,0,2,'The doctor is in!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24870,0,'Part of the Doctor Razorgin on aggro lines'),(25678,0,3,'I recommened evisceration!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24873,0,'Part of the Doctor Razorgin on aggro lines'),(25678,0,4,'It\'s no good... you need more work first.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24869,0,'Part of the Doctor Razorgin on aggro lines'),(25678,0,5,'Live, damn you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24868,0,'Part of the Doctor Razorgin on aggro lines'),(25678,0,6,'The doctor is in!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24870,0,'Part of the Doctor Razorgin on aggro lines'),(25753,0,0,'Warning: $r incursion detected!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24978,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25753,0,1,'Activate counter-measures. Repel intruder.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24979,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25753,0,2,'Attention all units, $r inside the perimeter.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24980,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25758,0,0,'Incoming $r flier! Shoot $g him : her; down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27839,0,'Defendo-tank 66D'),(25773,0,1,'Thank you so much! I thought I\'d never wake up from that nightmare!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24968,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25773,0,0,'I\'m flesh and blood again! Thank you, $c!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24967,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25783,0,0,'I\'m flesh and blood again. That\'s all that matters!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,24988,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25814,0,1,'You are cursed and we are the cure.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25001,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(25814,0,0,'We are Mechagnome... resistance is futile.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25000,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(26073,0,0,'Who disturbs my meditation?!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,24619,0,'High Priest Talet-Kha'),(26293,0,0,'The Hulking Jormungar falters for a moment, opening its mouth wide.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,25961,0,'Hulking Jormungar'),(26420,0,0,'Ah, yes. Loken is well known to me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26267,0,'Gavrock'),(26420,1,0,'It is he who commands the sons of iron in their war against us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26268,0,'Gavrock'),(26420,2,0,'From his hiding place, he oversees their preparations for war with the goal of exterminating the stone giants!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26269,0,'Gavrock'),(26484,0,0,'He\'s out to get me, too! I\'d be careful around here if I was you, traveler. You never know which tree he\'s hiding behind!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26266,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,1,0,'That\'s not something Limpy Joe would ask! But yeah, I know Loken.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26265,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26537,1,0,'The zeppelin to Warsong Hold has just arrived! All aboard for Borean Tundra!',14,0,100,22,0,11804,0,0,0,'Greeb Ramrocket'),(26566,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Narzun Skybreaker'),(26602,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Kara Thricestar'),(26668,0,0,'The sensation is... beyond my imagining. I am yours to command, my king.',14,0,0,0,0,13857,0,29686,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_DIALOG_WITH_ARTHAS_2'),(26668,1,0,'I will be happy to slaughter them in your name! Come, enemies of the Scourge! I will show you the might of the Lich King!',14,0,0,0,0,13858,0,29687,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_DIALOG_WITH_ARTHAS_3'),(26668,2,0,'I will vanquish your soul!',14,0,0,0,0,13842,0,29672,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_AGGRO'),(26668,3,0,'You were a fool to challenge the power of the Lich King!',14,0,0,0,0,13845,0,29675,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_SLAY_1'),(26668,3,1,'Your will is done, my king!',14,0,0,0,0,13847,0,29676,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_SLAY_2'),(26668,3,2,'Another soul for my master!',14,0,0,0,0,13848,0,29677,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_SLAY_3'),(26668,4,0,'Nooo! I did not come this far... to...',14,0,0,0,0,13855,0,29683,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_DEATH'),(26668,5,0,'Your death approaches....',14,0,0,0,0,13850,0,29678,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_SACRIFICE_1'),(26668,5,1,'Go now to my master!',14,0,0,0,0,13851,0,29679,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_SACRIFICE_2'),(26668,5,2,'Your end is inevitable.',14,0,0,0,0,13852,0,29680,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_SACRIFICE_3'),(26668,5,3,'Yor-guul mak!',14,0,0,0,0,13853,0,29681,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_SACRIFICE_4'),(26668,5,4,'Any last words?',14,0,0,0,0,13854,0,29682,0,'Svala Sorrowgrave SAY_SACRIFICE_5'),(26817,0,0,'I\'ll blast those gnomish wannabes back to the scrap heap!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24944,0,'Fizzcrank Fighter'),(26817,0,1,'What? You\'re sending me back there?!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24942,0,'Fizzcrank Fighter'),(26844,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Lilleth Radescu'),(26845,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Junter Weiss'),(26846,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Kareg'),(26847,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Omu Spiritbreeze'),(26848,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Kimbiza'),(26850,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Numo Spiritbreeze'),(26852,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Kragh'),(26853,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Makki Wintergale'),(26876,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Samuel Clearbook'),(26877,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Derek Rammel'),(26878,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Rodney Wells'),(26879,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Tomas Riverwell'),(26880,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Vana Grey'),(26881,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Palena Silvercloud'),(26917,0,0,'Mortal champions have long used these weapons to combat evil. I see no reason to keep the swords from them in this battle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37781,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder'),(27113,0,0,'Thank you for rescuing me, but the others are still held on the tiers above!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26189,0,'Prospector Gann'),(27114,0,0,'Thank goodness! I was worried they were going to press me into service in their war against the stone giants!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26190,0,'Prospector Torgan'),(27115,0,0,'These irons are crazy! They keep talking about serving their \'master Loken\' but from what I can tell, only a few receive orders from him.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26191,0,'Prospector Varana'),(27234,0,0,'You are being misled! The Onslaught is all lies! The Scourge and the Forsaken are not our enemies! Wake up!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,26596,0,'Blacksmith Goodman'),(27235,0,0,'Renounce the Scarlet Onslaught! Don\'t listen to the lies of the high general and the grand admiral any longer!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,26598,0,'Lead Cannoneer Zierhut'),(27236,0,0,'Abbendis is nothing but a harlot and Grand Admiral Westwind is selling her cheap like he sold us out!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,26599,0,'Stable Master Mercer'),(27237,0,0,'High General Abbendis personally told me that it was a mistake to come north and that we\'re doomed! I urge you all to lay down your weapons and leave before it\'s too late!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,26597,0,'Commander Jordan'),(27316,0,0,'Stand back, $n, the beast might lash out and harm you.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,26800,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,1,0,'GODFREY! Hear me, fiend! Hear me, for I am the Light, here to deliver you from evil!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,26801,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,2,0,'Good. I have your attention, then, Godfrey?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,26803,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,3,0,'We can do this in one of two ways, Godfrey. First, I will simply ask you to tell me what the unholy markings etched upon the pages of this tome mean. What say you?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,26804,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,4,0,'Then it is option two.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,26809,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,5,0,'I say a prayer for you now, lost soul. May the Light take you gracefully.',12,7,100,68,4000,0,0,26810,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,6,0,'Let the sermon begin.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,26811,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,7,0,'LIGHT TAKE YOU, BEAST!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26812,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,8,0,'BURN IN HOLY FIRE!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26816,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,9,0,'LET THE LIGHT IN, GODFREY GOODARD!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26814,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,10,0,'May the power of Light compel you!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26813,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,11,0,'I thought you would see the Light, Godfrey... Now speak quickly, fiend. What does it say?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,26824,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,12,0,'RUBBISH! Godfrey do you take me for a fool? Do not spew your Scourge propaganda at a man of the Light, heathen! Speak now or I will have the peasants craft a holy water bath and dip you into it like a dog with fleas!',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,26826,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,13,0,'What? There is a mausoleum beneath the old village? What fools we are to not have noticed! We will find and strike down your master now, Godfrey. We will end this nightmare.',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,26829,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,14,0,'You let us worry about how we kill the monster, Godfrey.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,26830,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,15,0,'Return to Halford with the information that the good mayor was kind enough to submit, $n. I will finish here and squeeze whatever else this wretch might know about Thel\'zan. Now, I will show Godfrey the rarely seen \"option three.\"',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,26833,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27316,16,0,'Let\'s you and I have a chat about some things, Godfrey.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,26834,0,'Inquisitor Hallard'),(27344,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Bat Handler Adeline'),(27430,0,0,'The Destructive Ward gains in power.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,26601,0,'Destructive Ward'),(27430,1,0,'The Destructive Ward is fully charged!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,26602,0,'Destructive Ward'),(27447,0,0,'There will be no mercy!',14,0,0,0,0,13649,0,31813,0,''),(27447,1,1,'Blast them! Destroy them!',14,0,0,0,0,13650,0,31814,0,''),(27447,2,2,'%s calls an Azure Ring Captain!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,33077,0,''),(27447,3,3,'They are... too strong! Underestimated their... fortitude.',14,0,0,0,0,13655,0,31819,0,''),(27577,0,0,'%s growls.',16,0,100,0,0,409,0,26802,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,1,0,'%s hisses!',16,0,100,0,0,410,0,26805,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,2,0,'Tell you nothing, preacher.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26806,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,3,0,'What can you do to me that Kel\'Thuzad has not? That the Lich King will not?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26807,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,4,0,'The book is your salvation, yes... but nothing will you know! NOTHING I SAY! NOTHING! ',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26808,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,5,0,'No more LIGHT! NO MORE! I BEG YOU!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26822,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,6,0,'Never felt hurt like this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26823,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,7,0,'It tells of the coming apocalypse. How this world will burn and be reborn from death.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26825,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,8,0,'NOOOO!!! I tell you! I tell you everything!',12,0,100,39,0,0,0,26827,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,9,0,'Humans... Beneath the earth of Wintergarde Village you built a mausoleum! Why do you think Naxxramas attacked that spot? Thel\'zan hides deep in your own crypt and sends a thousand-thousand corpses at you! Perish you will...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26828,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,10,0,'How? Humans truly are stupid, yes? Thel\'zan the Duskbringer! Thel\'zan the Lich! He who is born of human flesh and bone, sacrificed all for power, protected by the Lich King!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26831,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27577,11,0,'You cannot stop Thel\'zan! He bears the dark gift, bestowed upon him by the Lich King himself!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26832,0,'Mayor Godfrey'),(27656,1,0,'You brash interlopers are out of your element! I will ground you!',14,0,100,0,0,13623,0,31873,0,'Ley-Guardian Eregos - SAY_AGGRO'),(27656,0,0,'Simpletons! You cannot comprehend the forces you have set in motion. The ley line conduit will not be disrupted! Your defeat shall be absolute!',14,0,100,0,0,13622,0,31841,3,'Ley-Guardian Eregos - SAY_SPAWN'),(27842,0,0,'Bat gizzards again for the gnomes tonight...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,27129,0,'Fenrick Barlowe text'),(27842,0,1,'What do they expect, making the bats come in at that angle? Broken necks and gamey bat stew, that\'s what they get.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,27127,0,'Fenrick Barlowe text'),(27842,0,2,'\'We like the trees, Fenrick. They provide cover.\' They won\'t let me chop them down, either.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,27126,0,'Fenrick Barlowe text'),(27842,0,3,'I wonder how many reinforcements need to suffer injury before they allow us to chop down these idiotic trees. They\'re costing us a fortune in bats. Maybe I\'ll rig a harness or two...',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,27128,0,'Fenrick Barlowe text'),(27842,1,0,'Guards help!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30163,0,'Common Horde Flight Master'),(27915,0,0,'Good work with the crates! Come talk to me in front of Stratholme for your next assignment!',15,0,0,0,0,0,0,30509,3,'Chromie - SAY_EVENT_START'),(27990,0,0,'You\'re too late, $n. Another visitor from Dalaran came asking after information about the same prismatic dragon blades.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37769,0,'Krasus'),(27990,1,0,'From your description, I\'m certain that the book I loaned our visitor could allow you to easily identify the weapon.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,37770,0,'Krasus'),(27990,2,0,'I\'m afraid you\'ll have to ask the -- Well, perhaps Kalecgos can help.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37772,0,'Krasus'),(27990,3,0,'$n may have found the remains of a prismatic blade, Kalecgos. Will you offer your help to our visitor?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37773,0,'Krasus'),(27990,4,0,'You believe our allies will not be able to control the power of the swords?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37778,0,'Krasus'),(27990,5,0,'As will we all.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,37785,0,'Krasus'),(27990,6,0,'Please, mortal, speak with Arcanist Tybalin in Dalaran. He may be able to negotiate with the Sunreavers for access to the book.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37873,0,'Krasus'),(27990,7,0,'Please, mortal, seek out Magister Hathorel in Dalaran. He might be able to negotiate with the Silver Covenant for access to the book.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37874,0,'Krasus'),(28012,0,0,'The trickster Mage-Lord Urom protects the third ring.  He will appear alone and defenseless, but do not be fooled by appearances!  Urom is a powerful conjurer who commands a menagerie of Phantasmal creatures.  Seek him out above.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,28079,0,''),(28012,1,1,'Your greatest challenge lies ahead.  Ley-Guardian Eregos is a Blue dragon of immense power. You will find him flying above the uppermost ring.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,27389,0,''),(28179,0,0,'The Lich King reacted swiftly to the breach. Faster than I anticipated.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31004,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(28179,1,0,'What would you have me do, Darion?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,31008,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(28179,2,0,'Choose your words wisely, death knight. You stand amidst the company of the devoted.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31010,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(28179,3,0,'We will do this with honor, Darion. We will not sink to the levels of the Scourge to be victorious. To do so would make us no better than the monster that we fight to destroy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31016,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(28518,0,0,'Not sure how ol\' Nass always finds his way back here. Must be by smell....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28440,0,'Stefan Vadu'),(28521,0,0,'Let\'s go to Zul\'Drak he says. We can get to the bottom of this mess, he says...',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28463,0,'Nass'),(28521,0,1,'One more lock of scourge hair gained, one more shred of dignity lost....',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28458,0,'Nass'),(28521,0,2,'Are we finished yet?',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28457,0,'Nass'),(28532,0,0,'Indeed. Watch this, $r.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28760,0,'Bloodrose Datura'),(28532,1,0,'Here, troll... a gift!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28505,0,'Bloodrose Datura'),(28532,2,0,'Ugh... disgusting!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28509,0,'Bloodrose Datura'),(28541,0,0,'For me? Really, mon?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,28511,0,'Captured Drakkari Scout'),(28541,1,0,'It....it be beautiful!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28512,0,'Captured Drakkari Scout'),(28546,0,0,'You wish to confront the master? You must first weather the storm!',14,0,100,0,0,14453,0,30528,0,'Ionar'),(28546,1,0,'The slightest spark shall be your undoing.',14,0,100,0,0,14454,0,30529,0,'Ionar'),(28546,1,1,'No one is safe!',14,0,100,0,0,14455,0,30530,0,'Ionar'),(28546,2,0,'Shocking, I know.',14,0,100,0,0,14456,0,30531,0,'Ionar'),(28546,2,1,'You attempt the impossible.',14,0,100,0,0,14457,0,30532,0,'Ionar'),(28546,2,2,'Your spark of life is... extinguished.',14,0,100,0,0,14458,0,30533,0,'Ionar'),(28546,3,0,'Master... you have guests.',14,0,100,0,0,14459,0,30534,0,'Ionar'),(28563,0,0,'The structure above begins to hum with energy.',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,28536,0,'Freya\'s Presence - On Call of the Lifewarden cast'),(28566,0,0,'Beginning the distillation in 5 seconds.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28514,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,1,0,'Add another orange! Quickly!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,28515,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,2,0,'Put a papaya in the still!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,28517,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,3,0,'Add bananas!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,28516,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,4,0,'Pressure\'s too high! Open the pressure valve!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28519,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,5,0,'The still needs heat! Light the brazier!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28518,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,6,0,'Good job! Keep your eyes open, now.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,28534,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,6,1,'That\'ll do. Never know what it\'ll need next...',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,28535,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,6,2,'Nicely handled! Stay on your toes!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,28533,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,6,3,'Well done! Be ready for anything!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,28524,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,7,0,'It\'s no good! I\'m shutting it down...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28523,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28566,8,0,'We\'ve done it! Come get the cask.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28521,0,'Tipsy McManus'),(28586,0,0,'I am the greatest of my father\'s sons! Your end has come!',14,0,100,0,0,14149,0,31407,0,'General Bjarngrim - Aggro'),(28586,1,0,'%s switches to Defensive Stance!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29834,0,'General Bjarngrim - Announce Defensive Stance'),(28586,2,0,'Give me your worst!',14,0,100,0,0,14150,0,31408,0,'General Bjarngrim - Defensive Stance'),(28586,3,0,'%s switches to Berserker Stance!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29833,0,'General Bjarngrim - Announce Berserker Stance'),(28586,4,0,'GRAAAAAH! Behold the fury of iron and steel!',14,0,100,0,0,14152,0,31410,0,'General Bjarngrim - Berserker Stance'),(28586,4,1,'Flesh... is... weak!',14,0,100,0,0,14154,0,31412,0,'General Bjarngrim'),(28586,4,2,'Bolvin umyol marnjar.',14,0,100,0,0,14155,0,31413,0,'General Bjarngrim'),(28586,5,0,'%s switches to Battle Stance!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29832,0,'General Bjarngrim - Announce Battle Stance'),(28586,6,0,'Defend yourself, for all the good it will do!',14,0,100,0,0,14151,0,31409,0,'General Bjarngrim - Battle Stance'),(28586,7,0,'So ends your curse.',14,0,100,0,0,14153,0,31411,0,'General Bjarngrim - Slay 1'),(28586,8,0,'How can it be...? Flesh is not... stronger!',14,0,100,0,0,14156,0,31414,0,'General Bjarngrim - Death'),(28587,4,0,'%s prepares to shatter his Brittle Golems!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29823,0,'Volkhan - Announce Shattering Stomp'),(28587,3,1,'I will crush you beneath my boots!',14,0,100,0,0,13963,0,31418,0,'Volkhan - Shattering Stomp'),(28587,3,0,'All my work... undone!',14,0,100,0,0,13964,0,31419,0,'Volkhan - Shattering Stomp'),(28587,2,1,'Life from lifelessness... death for you.',14,0,100,0,0,13961,0,31416,0,'Volkhan - Run to Anvil'),(28587,2,0,'Nothing is wasted in the process. You will see....',14,0,100,0,0,13962,0,31417,0,'Volkhan - Run to Anvil'),(28587,1,0,'%s runs to his anvil!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32214,0,'Volkhan - Announce Run to Anvil'),(28587,0,0,'It is you who have destroyed my children? You... shall... pay!',14,0,100,0,0,13960,0,31415,0,'Volkhan - Aggro'),(28601,0,0,'Fool!  You led us to the only being that could stand up to our armies!  You will never bring the Etymidian back to Northrend!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,29968,0,'High Cultist Herenn'),(28859,14,0,'I am unstoppable!',14,0,100,0,2000,14533,0,31783,0,'Malygos - Buffed by a spark'),(28859,13,0,'The powers at work here exceed anything you could possibly imagine!',14,0,100,0,5000,14532,0,31782,0,'Malygos - Surge of Power'),(28859,12,0,'%s takes a deep breath...',41,0,100,0,10000,0,0,33657,0,'Malygos - Surge of Power warning (Phase 2)'),(28859,10,0,'Now your benefactors make their appearance, but they are too late! The powers contained here are sufficient to destroy the world ten times over. What do you think they will do to you?',14,0,100,0,13000,14530,0,31779,0,'Intro Phase 3'),(28859,11,0,'Submit!',14,0,100,0,1000,14531,0,31780,0,'Malygos - Start phase 3'),(28859,9,0,'ENOUGH! If you intend to reclaim Azeroth\'s magic, then you shall have it!',14,0,100,0,7000,14529,0,31778,0,'Malygos - End Phase 2'),(28859,8,2,'Your spirit will linger here forever!',14,0,100,0,3800,14528,0,31777,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 2)'),(28859,8,1,'I am the Spell-Weaver! My power is infinite!',14,0,100,0,5200,14527,0,31776,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 2)'),(28859,8,0,'Your energy will be put to good use.',14,0,100,0,2000,14526,0,31775,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 2)'),(28859,7,0,'Watch helplessly as your hopes are swept away!',14,0,100,0,4000,14525,0,31774,0,'Malygos - Magic Blast'),(28859,5,0,'Few have experienced the pain I will now inflict upon you!',14,0,100,0,5500,14523,0,31765,0,'Malygos - Start phase 2'),(28859,6,0,'I will teach you ignorant children just how little you know of magic.',14,0,100,0,7000,14524,0,31773,0,'Malygos - Anti-Magic Shell'),(28859,4,0,'I had hoped to end your lives quickly, but you have proven more... resilient than I anticipated. Nonetheless, your efforts are in vain. It is you reckless, careless mortals who are to blame for this war. I do what I must, and if it means your extinction.... then SO BE IT!!',14,0,100,0,22900,14522,0,31772,0,'Malygos - End Phase One'),(28859,3,2,'How very naive.',14,0,100,0,4800,14521,0,31769,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 1)'),(28859,3,1,'More artifacts to confiscate.',14,0,100,0,2800,14520,0,31768,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 1)'),(28859,3,0,'Your stupidity has finally caught up with you!',14,0,100,0,3250,14519,0,31767,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 1)'),(28859,2,0,'You will not succeed while I draw breath!',14,0,100,0,3000,14518,0,31781,0,'Malygos - Begin to cast Deep Breath'),(28923,0,0,'I have witnessed the rise and fall of empires... the birth and extinction of entire species... Over countless millennia the foolishness of mortals has remained the only constant. Your presence here confirms this.',14,0,100,0,0,14160,0,30536,0,'Loken'),(28923,1,0,'My master has shown me the future, and you have no place in it. Azeroth will be reborn in darkness. Yogg-Saron shall be released! The Pantheon shall fall!',14,0,100,0,0,14161,0,30537,0,'Loken'),(28923,2,0,'What hope is there for you? None!',14,0,100,0,0,14162,0,30535,0,'Loken'),(28923,3,0,'You cannot hide from fate!',14,0,100,0,0,14163,0,30538,0,'Loken'),(28923,3,1,'Come closer. I will make it quick.',14,0,100,0,0,14164,0,30539,0,'Loken'),(28923,3,2,'Your flesh cannot hold out for long.',14,0,100,0,0,14165,0,30540,0,'Loken'),(28923,4,0,'Only mortal...',14,0,100,0,0,14166,0,30541,0,'Loken'),(28923,4,1,'I... am... FOREVER!',14,0,100,0,0,14167,0,30542,0,'Loken'),(28923,4,2,'What little time you had, you wasted!',14,0,100,0,0,14168,0,30543,0,'Loken'),(28923,5,0,'You stare blindly into the abyss!',14,0,100,0,0,14169,0,30545,0,'Loken'),(28923,6,0,'Your ignorance is profound. Can you not see where this path leads?',14,0,100,0,0,14170,0,30546,0,'Loken'),(28923,7,0,'You cross the precipice of oblivion!',14,0,100,0,0,14171,0,30547,0,'Loken'),(28923,8,0,'My death... heralds the end of this world.',14,0,100,0,0,14172,0,30544,0,'Loken'),(28923,9,0,'%s begins to cast Lightning Nova!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29865,0,'Loken'),(29280,0,0,'Your sacrifice is a testament to your obedience.  Indeed you are worthy of this charge. Arise, and forever be known as Svala Sorrowgrave!',14,0,0,0,0,14732,0,29688,0,'Image of Arthas SAY_DIALOG_OF_ARTHAS_1'),(29280,1,0,'Your first test awaits you. Destroy our uninvited guests.',14,0,0,0,0,14733,0,29689,0,'Image of Arthas SAY_DIALOG_OF_ARTHAS_2'),(29281,0,0,'My liege! I have done as you asked, and now beseech you for your blessing!',14,0,0,0,0,13856,0,29684,0,'Svala SAY_DIALOG_WITH_ARTHAS_1'),(29327,0,0,'It\'s an angry male!',42,0,100,0,0,643,0,33191,0,'Frost Leopard'),(29466,0,0,'I can\'t believe it!  I\'m free to go!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30140,0,'Goblin Prisoner'),(29466,0,1,'I\'m free?  I\'m free!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30139,0,'Goblin Prisoner'),(29466,0,2,'Time to hightail it!  Thanks, friend!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30141,0,'Goblin Prisoner'),(29618,0,0,'Grrrrr!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35156,0,'Snowblind Follower'),(29618,0,1,'Me not afraid!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35159,0,'Snowblind Follower'),(29618,0,2,'Net not stop me! No... net stop me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35158,0,'Snowblind Follower'),(29618,0,3,'No kill me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35157,0,'Snowblind Follower'),(29618,0,4,'No!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35155,0,'Snowblind Follower'),(29618,0,5,'You no take... me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35154,0,'Snowblind Follower'),(29762,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Hyeyoung Parka'),(30146,0,0,'Curse you!  You will not treat me like a beast!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30793,0,'Exhausted Vrykul'),(30146,0,1,'Enough!  I will teach you some manners, wench!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30794,0,'Exhausted Vrykul'),(30146,0,2,'I\'d rather die fighting than live like a slave!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30795,0,'Exhausted Vrykul'),(30146,1,0,'Back... to work...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30796,0,'Exhausted Vrykul'),(30146,1,1,'We will have revenge... some day.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30798,0,'Exhausted Vrykul'),(30146,1,2,'You treat us worse than animals!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30797,0,'Exhausted Vrykul'),(30190,0,0,'Metallic specimen of foreign origin detected.',12,0,100,0,5,0,0,30847,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,1,0,'Beginning analysis ...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30848,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,2,0,'Specimen identified as an alloy of saronite and iron.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30849,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,3,0,'The ore used in this sample originated deep within the crust of Azeroth and was recently unearthed.',12,0,100,275,0,0,0,30850,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,4,0,'The saronite in this sample is nearly pure. Ores like this do not occur naturally on the surface of Azeroth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30851,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,5,0,'This ore can only have been created by a powerful, malevolent force. Attempting to access databanks for more information ...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30854,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,6,0,'Access denied?!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,30859,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,7,0,'Further information can only be accessed from the archives within Ulduar, by order of Keeper Loken.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30860,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,8,0,'But one thing is for certain: this plate\'s size, thickness, and bolt holes point to a use as armor for a colossal structure.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30867,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30190,9,0,'Directive completed. Returning to standby mode.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30861,0,'Attendant Tock'),(30224,0,0,'What\'s on yer mind, lad?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,31065,0,'Crusader Lord Dalfors'),(30225,0,0,'Eversong Woods, Dalfors. I\'m thinking about how beautiful it was before Arthas cut a swathe of death through it...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31070,0,'Crusader Sunborn'),(30271,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Galendror Whitewing'),(30274,0,0,'Might grace you, $c. Let the Scourge feel the fury of a million lost souls!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30976,0,'Freed Crusader Speach'),(30377,0,0,'You are dealing with a being that holds within it the consciousness of the most cunning, intelligent, and ruthless individuals to ever live.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31005,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,1,0,'The Lich King is unlike any foe that you have ever faced, Highlord. Though you bested him upon the holy ground of Light\'s Hope Chapel, you tread now upon his domain.\n',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31006,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,2,0,'You cannot win. Not like this...\n',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,31007,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,3,0,'Nothing. There is nothing that you can do while the Light binds you. It controls you wholly, shackling you to the ground with its virtues.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,31009,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,4,0,'%s shakes his head.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31011,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,5,0,'Look upon the field, Highlord. The Lich King has halted your advance completely and won the upper hand!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,31012,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,6,0,'The breach you created was sealed with Nerubian webbing almost as quickly as it was opened.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31013,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,7,0,'Your soldiers are being used as living shields to stave off artillery fire in the Valley of Echoes, allowing the forces of the Lich King to assault your base without impediment.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31014,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,8,0,'The Lich King knows your boundaries, Highlord. He knows that you will not fire on your own men. Do you not understand? He has no boundaries. No rules to abide. \n',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31015,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30377,9,0,'Then you have lost, Highlord.\n',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31017,0,'The Ebon Watcher'),(30407,0,0,'Let\'s get out of here! Quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31115,0,'Captured Crusader Start'),(30407,1,0,'Faster, hero! We must get back to the Argent Vanguard and warn them of the impending attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31122,0,'Captured Crusader Middle'),(30407,1,1,'There are hundreds of them! Maybe thousands! They will attack at any moment! I\'m sure of it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31123,0,'Captured Crusader Middle'),(30407,1,2,'Had you not come along I would have died for sure!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31124,0,'Captured Crusader Middle'),(30407,1,3,'They\'re planning a huge attack! We need to warn Highlord Fordring!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,31121,0,'Captured Crusader Middle'),(30407,2,0,'Thank you, hero.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,31130,0,'Captured Crusader End'),(30407,2,1,'Thank you, friend, but we\'re not out of trouble yet!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,31114,0,'Captured Crusader End'),(31237,0,0,'You shouldn\'t have done that!  He\'s not going to like it.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32338,0,'Matthias Lehner - On quest accept'),(36827,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(36825,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(36828,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(24972,0,0,'Core overload detected. System malfunction detected...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24008,0,'Erratic Sentry'),(31426,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Doras'),(28859,0,4,'I give you one chance. Pledge fealty to me, and perhaps I will not slaughter you for your insolence.',14,0,100,0,7000,14516,0,31763,0,'Malygos - Intro'),(28859,0,2,'What could you hope to accomplish? To storm brazenly into my domain... to employ magic... against ME?',14,0,100,0,13000,14514,0,31761,0,'Malygos - Intro'),(28859,0,3,'I am without limits here. The rules of your cherished reality do not apply. In this realm, I am in control!',14,0,100,0,10000,14515,0,31762,0,'Malygos - Intro'),(28859,0,0,'Lesser beings, intruding here! A shame that your excess courage does not compensate for your stupidity!',14,0,100,0,10000,14512,0,31759,0,'Malygos - Intro'),(28859,0,1,'None but the blue dragonflight are welcome here. Perhaps this is the work of Alexstrasza? Well, then, she has sent you to your deaths!',14,0,100,0,11000,14513,0,31760,0,'Malygos - Intro'),(32736,0,0,'The view up here is amazing!',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,33031,0,'Scribe Whitman'),(32736,0,1,'Too bad I left my light feathers at home... Slow Fall would work perfect here!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,33032,0,'Scribe Whitman'),(32739,0,0,'The view up here is amazing!',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,33031,0,'Baroness Zildjia'),(32739,0,1,'Too bad I left my light feathers at home... Slow Fall would work perfect here!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,33032,0,'Baroness Zildjia'),(32741,0,0,'The view up here is amazing!',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,33031,0,'Conjurer Weinhaus'),(32741,0,1,'Too bad I left my light feathers at home... Slow Fall would work perfect here!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,33032,0,'Conjurer Weinhaus'),(33008,0,0,'It\'s an angry male!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,33191,0,'Male Icepaw Bear'),(33303,0,0,'Thank you, mortal, for freeing me from this curse. I beg you, take this blade.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33436,0,'Maiden of Winter\'s Breath Lake'),(33303,1,0,'It has brought me naught but ill. Mayhap you can find someone who will contain its power.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33437,0,'Maiden of Winter\'s Breath Lake'),(33788,0,0,'Help shield us from these cutting winds, little sapling.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,33814,0,'Fhyron Shadesong'),(33788,0,1,'There you are.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,33813,0,'Fhyron Shadesong'),(33788,0,2,'Grow, little one.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,33812,0,'Fhyron Shadesong'),(33972,0,0,'Use Shield-Breaker on a Charge Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t$BFollow up with Charge while the target is vulnerable.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_Charger.blp:32|t',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,34034,0,'Argent Tournament - Charge Tutorial'),(33973,0,0,'Put up Defend$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldMastery.blp:32|t$BThen use Thrust on a Melee Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_65.blp:32|t',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,34032,0,'Argent Tournament - Melee Tutorial'),(33974,0,0,'Use Shield-Breaker on a Ranged Target.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t$BThen use Shield-Breaker while the target is defenseless.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldBreak.blp:32|t',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,34035,0,'Argent Tournament - Ranged Tutorial'),(34716,0,0,'Thank you, $c.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35180,0,'Captive Aspirant'),(34716,0,1,'They\'re killing the prisoners! Hurry, help the others.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35181,0,'Captive Aspirant'),(34716,0,2,'I knew I shouldn\'t have come to the tournament!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35184,0,'Captive Aspirant'),(34716,0,3,'I thought I was going to die in there!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35183,0,'Captive Aspirant'),(34723,0,0,'Dat cloud look like da Warchief.',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,35027,0,'Watcher Tolwe - Random'),(34723,0,1,'Dere be a bug.',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,35029,0,'Watcher Tolwe - Random'),(34956,0,0,'They were seconds from strapping me to one of those altars and sucking my soul out. Let\'s get out of here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35790,0,'Kul the Reckless'),(35642,0,0,'If you\'ll excuse me, I\'m afraid I have other business I must attend to.  Please call on me again in the future.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35977,0,'Jeeves'),(36597,0,0,'So the Light\'s vaunted justice has finally arrived? Shall I lay down Frostmourne and throw myself at your mercy, Fordring?',14,0,0,0,0,17349,0,38070,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_INTRO_1'),(36597,1,0,'You\'ll learn of that first hand. When my work is complete, you will beg for mercy -- and I will deny you. Your anguished cries will be testament to my unbridled power...',14,0,0,22,0,17350,0,38071,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_INTRO_2'),(36597,2,0,'I\'ll keep you alive to witness the end, Fordring. I would not want the Light\'s greatest champion to miss seeing this wretched world remade in my image.',14,0,0,0,0,17351,0,38072,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_INTRO_3'),(36597,3,0,'Come then, champions. Feed me your rage!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,38073,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_AGGRO'),(36597,4,0,'I will freeze you from within until all that remains is an icy husk.',14,0,0,0,0,17369,0,38046,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_REMORSELESS_WINTER'),(36597,5,0,'Watch as the world around you collapses!',14,0,0,0,0,17370,0,38047,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_QUAKE'),(36597,6,0,'Val\'kyr, your master calls!',14,0,0,0,0,17373,0,38052,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_SUMMON_VALKYR'),(36597,7,0,'Frostmourne hungers...',14,0,0,0,0,17366,0,38042,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_HARVEST_SOUL'),(36597,8,0,'Frostmourne, OBEY ME!',14,0,0,0,0,17367,0,38043,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_FROSTMOURNE_ESCAPE'),(36597,9,0,'Frostmourne feeds on the soul of your fallen ally!',14,0,0,0,0,17368,0,38044,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_FROSTMOURNE_KILL'),(36597,10,0,'Hope wanes...',14,0,0,0,0,17363,0,38038,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_KILL'),(36597,10,1,'The end has come!',14,0,0,0,0,17364,0,38040,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_KILL'),(36597,11,0,'Face now your tragic end.',14,0,0,0,0,17365,0,38041,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_BERSERK'),(36597,12,0,'%s begins to cast Defile!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,39688,0,'The Lich King - EMOTE_DEFILE_WARNING'),(36597,13,0,' |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_creature_disease_02.blp:16|t You have been infected by |cFFBC05FFNecrotic Plague|r! |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_creature_disease_02.blp:16|t',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,39695,0,'The Lich King - EMOTE_NECROTIC_PLAGUE_WARNING'),(36597,14,0,'No questions remain unanswered. No doubts linger. You ARE Azeroth\'s greatest champions. You overcame every challenge I laid before you. My mightiest servants have fallen before your relentless onslaught... your unbridled fury... ',14,0,0,0,0,17353,0,38074,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_OUTRO_1'),(36597,15,0,'Is it truly righteousness that drives you? I wonder...',14,0,0,0,0,17354,0,38075,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_OUTRO_2'),(36597,16,0,'You trained them well, Fordring. You delivered the greatest fighting force this world has ever known... right into my hands - exactly as I intended! You shall be rewarded for your unwitting sacrifice.',14,0,0,0,0,17355,0,38076,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_OUTRO_3'),(36597,17,0,'Watch now as I raise them from the dead to become masters of the Scourge. They will shroud this world in chaos and destruction. Azeroth\'s fall will come at their hands -- and you will be the first to die.',14,0,0,0,0,17356,0,38077,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_OUTRO_4'),(36597,18,0,'I delight in the irony.',14,0,0,0,0,17357,0,38078,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_OUTRO_5'),(36597,19,0,'Impossible...',14,0,0,0,0,17358,0,38080,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_OUTRO_6'),(36597,20,0,'Now I stand, the lion before the lambs... and they do not fear.',14,0,0,0,0,17361,0,39003,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_OUTRO_7'),(36597,21,0,'They cannot fear...',14,0,0,0,0,17362,0,39004,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_OUTRO_8'),(36612,0,0,'This is the beginning AND the end, mortals. None may enter the master\'s sanctum!',14,0,0,0,0,16950,0,38508,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_ENTER_ZONE'),(36612,1,0,'The Scourge will wash over this world as a swarm of death and destruction!',14,0,0,0,0,16941,0,37684,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_AGGRO'),(36612,2,0,'BONE STORM!',14,0,0,0,0,16946,0,36554,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_BONE_STORM'),(36612,3,0,'Bound by bone!',14,0,0,0,0,16947,0,37695,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_BONESPIKE_1'),(36612,3,1,'Stick around!',14,0,0,0,0,16948,0,37696,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_BONESPIKE_2'),(36612,3,2,'The only escape is death!',14,0,0,0,0,16949,0,37693,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_BONESPIKE_3'),(36612,4,0,'More bones for the offering!',14,0,0,0,0,16942,0,37686,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_KILL_1'),(36612,4,1,'Languish in damnation!',14,0,0,0,0,16943,0,37687,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_KILL_2'),(36612,5,0,'I see... Only darkness.',14,0,0,0,0,16944,0,37688,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_DEATH'),(36612,6,0,'THE MASTER\'S RAGE COURSES THROUGH ME!',14,0,0,0,0,16945,0,37690,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_BERSERK'),(36612,7,0,'%s creates a whirling storm of bone!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,36553,0,'Lord Marrowgar - SAY_BONE_STORM_EMOTE'),(36626,0,0,'No! You killed Stinky! You Pay!',14,0,0,0,0,16907,0,37830,0,'Festergut - SAY_STINKY_DEAD'),(36626,1,0,'Fun time?',14,0,0,0,0,16901,0,37823,0,'Festergut - SAY_AGGRO'),(36626,2,0,'%s farts.',16,0,0,0,0,16911,0,0,0,'Festergut - EMOTE_GAS_SPORE'),(36626,3,0,'%s releases Gas Spores!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,36706,0,'Festergut - EMOTE_WARN_GAS_SPORE'),(36626,4,0,'I not feel so good...',14,0,0,0,0,16906,0,37829,0,'Festergut - SAY_PUNGENT_BLIGHT'),(36626,5,0,'%s begins to cast |cFFFF7F00Pungent Blight!|r',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,36707,0,'Festergut - EMOTE_WARN_PUNGENT_BLIGHT'),(36626,6,0,'%s vomits.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Festergut - EMOTE_PUNGENT_BLIGHT'),(36626,7,0,'Daddy, I did it!',14,0,0,0,0,16902,0,37824,0,'Festergut - SAY_KILL_1'),(36626,7,1,'Dead, dead, dead!',14,0,0,0,0,16903,0,37825,0,'Festergut - SAY_KILL_2'),(36626,8,0,'Fun time over!',14,0,0,0,0,16905,0,37827,0,'Festergut - SAY_BERSERK'),(36626,9,0,'Da ... Ddy...',14,0,0,0,0,16904,0,37826,0,'Festergut - SAY_DEATH'),(36627,0,0,'What? Precious? Noooooooooo!!!',14,0,0,0,0,16993,0,37837,0,'Rotface - SAY_PRECIOUS_DIES'),(36627,1,0,'Weeeeee!',14,0,0,0,0,16986,0,37831,0,'Rotface - SAY_AGGRO'),(36627,2,0,'%s begins to cast Slime Spray!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38363,0,'Rotface - EMOTE_SLIME_SPRAY'),(36627,3,0,'Icky sticky!',14,0,0,0,0,16991,0,37836,0,'Rotface - SAY_SLIME_SPRAY'),(36899,0,0,'%s grows more unstable!',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,36950,0,'Big Ooze - EMOTE_UNSTABLE_2'),(36899,1,0,'%s is growing volatile!',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,36952,0,'Big Ooze - EMOTE_UNSTABLE_3'),(36627,5,0,'I tink I made an angry poo-poo. It gonna blow!',14,0,0,0,0,16992,0,37063,0,'Rotface - SAY_UNSTABLE_EXPLOSION'),(36627,6,0,'Daddy make new toys out of you!',14,0,0,0,0,16988,0,37833,0,'Rotface - SAY_KILL_1'),(36627,6,1,'I brokes-ded it...',14,0,0,0,0,16987,0,37832,0,'Rotface - SAY_KILL_2'),(36627,7,0,'SLEEPY TIME!',14,0,0,0,0,16990,0,37835,0,'Rotface - SAY_BERSERK'),(36627,8,0,'Bad news, daddy...',14,0,0,0,0,16989,0,37834,0,'Rotface - SAY_DEATH'),(36627,9,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_creature_disease_02.blp:16|tYou have |cFF00FF00Mutated Infection!|r',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,37872,0,'Rotface - EMOTE_MUTATED_INFECTION'),(36669,0,0,'It\'s good to finally see you, courier. Krasus has entrusted us with one of the few remaining copies of Ancient Dragonforged Blades.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37620,0,'Arcanist Tybalin'),(36669,1,0,'Here is the book. You must ensure it gets to Caladis Brightspear in Icecrown before the Sunreavers realize what is happening.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37621,0,'Arcanist Tybalin'),(36669,2,0,'Travel quickly! The Sunreavers will not waste any time once they realize that we have the information they seek.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37622,0,'Arcanist Tybalin'),(36670,0,0,'You\'re late, courier. No, I don\'t want any excuses; this errand is far too important.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37580,0,'Magister Hathorel'),(36670,1,0,'Here\'s the tome our representative brought from Wyrmrest. Get this to Myralion Sunblaze immediately.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37581,0,'Magister Hathorel'),(36670,2,0,'Watch your back, courier. I needn\'t remind you of the value of the book, nor the fact that the Silver Covenant will stop at nothing to take it from us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37582,0,'Magister Hathorel'),(36678,0,0,'Just an ordinary gas cloud, but watch out because that\'s no ordinary gas cloud!',14,0,0,432,0,17119,0,37843,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_GASEOUS_BLIGHT'),(36678,1,0,'Oh Festergut, you were always my favorite -- next to Rotface.  The good news is that you left behind so much gas. I can practically taste it!',14,0,0,0,0,17124,0,37848,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_FESTERGUT_DEATH'),(36678,2,0,'Great news, everyone! The slime is flowing again!',14,0,0,1,0,17126,0,38120,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_ROTFACE_OOZE_FLOOD1'),(36678,2,1,'Good news, everyone! I\'ve fixed the poison slime pipes!',14,0,0,1,0,17123,0,37049,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_ROTFACE_OOZE_FLOOD2'),(36678,3,0,'Terrible news, everyone. Rotface is dead, but great news everyone! He left behind plenty of ooze for me to use! What? I\'m a poet and I didn\'t know it... Astounding!',14,0,0,0,0,17146,0,37847,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_ROTFACE_DEATH'),(36678,4,0,'Good news, everyone! I think I\'ve perfected a plague that will destroy all life on Azeroth!',14,0,0,0,0,17114,0,37838,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_AGGRO'),(36678,5,0,'%s begins to cast Unstable Experiment!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38500,0,'Professor Putricide - EMOTE_UNSTABLE_EXPERIMENT'),(36678,6,0,'Two oozes, one room. So many delightful possibilities!',14,0,0,0,0,17122,0,37846,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_PHASE_TRANSITION_HEROIC'),(36678,7,0,'Hrm, I don\'t feel a thing. Wha?! Where\'d those come from?',14,0,0,15,0,17120,0,37844,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_TRANSFORM_1'),(36678,8,0,'Tastes like... Cherry! OH! Excuse me!',14,0,0,15,0,17121,0,37845,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_TRANSFORM_2'),(36678,9,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_herb_evergreenmoss.blp:16|t%s cast |cFF00FF00Malleable Goo!|r',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38499,0,'Professor Putricide - EMOTE_MALLEABLE_GOO'),(36678,10,0,'%s cast |cFFFF7F00Choking Gas Bomb!|r',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38498,0,'Professor Putricide - EMOTE_CHOKING_GAS_BOMB'),(36678,11,0,'Hrm, interesting...',14,0,0,0,0,17115,0,37839,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_KILL_1'),(36678,11,1,'That was unexpected!',14,0,0,0,0,17116,0,38545,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_KILL_2'),(36678,12,0,'Great news, everyone!',14,0,0,0,0,17118,0,38546,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_BERSERK'),(36678,13,0,'Bad news, everyone... I don\'t think I\'m going to make it...',14,0,0,0,0,17117,0,37841,0,'Professor Putricide - SAY_DEATH'),(33044,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(36774,0,0,'You Sunreaver lackeys are all the same.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37768,0,'Silver Covenant Agent'),(32711,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(36776,0,0,'Did you think you would escape with your life?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37880,0,'Sunreaver Agent'),(36789,0,0,'Heroes, lend me your aid. I... I cannot hold them off much longer. You must heal my wounds!',14,0,0,0,0,17064,0,37875,0,'Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_VALITHRIA_ENTER_COMBAT'),(36789,1,0,'I have opened a portal into the Dream. Your salvation lies within, heroes...',14,0,0,0,0,17068,0,37876,0,'Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_VALITHRIA_DREAM_PORTAL'),(36789,2,0,'My strength is returning. Press on, heroes!',14,0,0,0,0,17070,0,37878,0,'Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_VALITHRIA_75_PERCENT'),(36789,3,0,'I will not last much longer.',14,0,0,0,0,17069,0,37877,0,'Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_VALITHRIA_25_PERCENT'),(36789,4,0,'Forgive me for what I do! I... cannot... stop... ONLY NIGHTMARES REMAIN!',14,0,0,0,0,17072,0,0,0,'Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_VALITHRIA_DEATH'),(36789,5,0,'A tragic loss...',14,0,0,0,0,17066,0,0,0,'Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_VALITHRIA_PLAYER_DEATH'),(36789,6,0,'FAILURES!',14,0,0,0,0,17067,0,0,0,'Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_VALITHRIA_BERSERK'),(36789,7,0,'I AM RENEWED! Ysera grant me the favor to lay these foul creatures to rest!',14,0,0,0,0,17071,0,37852,0,'Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_VALITHRIA_SUCCESS'),(36823,0,0,'You have come to bring Arthas to justice? To see the Lich King destroyed?',14,0,0,0,0,17394,0,38114,0,'Terenas Menethil - SAY_TERENAS_INTRO_1'),(36823,1,0,'First, you must escape Frostmourne\'s hold, or be damned as I am; trapped within this cursed blade for all eternity. ',14,0,0,0,0,17395,0,38115,0,'Terenas Menethil - SAY_TERENAS_INTRO_2'),(36823,2,0,'Aid me in destroying these tortured souls! Together we will loosen Frostmourne\'s hold and weaken the Lich King from within!',14,0,0,0,0,17396,0,38116,0,'Terenas Menethil - SAY_TERENAS_INTRO_3'),(36853,0,0,'You are fools to have come to this place. The icy winds of Northrend will consume your souls!',14,0,0,0,0,17007,0,37511,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_AGGRO'),(36853,1,0,'Suffer, mortals, as your pathetic magic betrays you!',14,0,0,0,0,17014,0,37138,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_UNCHAINED_MAGIC'),(36853,2,0,'%s prepares to unleash a wave of blistering cold!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,37108,0,'Sindragosa - EMOTE_WARN_BLISTERING_COLD'),(36853,3,0,'Can you feel the cold hand of death upon your heart?',14,0,0,0,0,17013,0,37137,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_BLISTERING_COLD'),(36853,4,0,'Aaagh! It burns! What sorcery is this!?',14,0,0,0,0,17015,0,38550,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_RESPITE_FOR_A_TORMENTED_SOUL'),(36853,5,0,'Your incursion ends here! None shall survive!',14,0,0,0,0,17012,0,37136,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_AIR_PHASE'),(36853,6,0,'Now, feel my master\'s limitless power and despair!',14,0,0,0,0,17016,0,37109,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_PHASE_2'),(36853,7,0,'%s fires a frozen orb towards $n!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38672,0,'Sindragosa - EMOTE_WARN_FROZEN_ORB'),(36853,8,0,'Perish!',14,0,0,0,0,17008,0,37133,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_KILL 1'),(36853,8,1,'The flaw of mortality....',14,0,0,0,0,17009,0,37134,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_KILL 2'),(36853,9,0,'Enough! I tire of these games!',14,0,0,0,0,17011,0,37140,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_BERSERK'),(36853,10,0,'Free... at last....',14,0,0,0,0,17010,0,37139,0,'Sindragosa - SAY_DEATH'),(36855,0,0,'You have found your way here, because you are among the few gifted with true vision in a world cursed with blindness.',14,0,0,0,0,17272,0,38139,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_INTRO_1'),(36855,1,0,'You can see through the fog that hangs over this world like a shroud, and grasp where true power lies.',14,0,0,0,0,17273,0,38140,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_INTRO_2'),(36855,2,0,'Fix your eyes upon your crude hands: the sinew, the soft meat, the dark blood coursing within.',14,0,0,0,0,16878,0,38134,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_INTRO_3'),(36855,3,0,'It is a weakness; a crippling flaw....  A joke played by the Creators upon their own creations.',14,0,0,0,0,17268,0,38135,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_INTRO_4'),(36855,4,0,'The sooner you come to accept your condition as a defect, the sooner you will find yourselves in a position to transcend it.',14,0,0,0,0,17269,0,38136,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_INTRO_5'),(36855,5,0,'Through our Master, all things are possible. His power is without limit, and his will unbending.',14,0,0,0,0,17270,0,38137,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_INTRO_6'),(36855,6,0,'Those who oppose him will be destroyed utterly, and those who serve -- who serve wholly, unquestioningly, with utter devotion of mind and soul -- elevated to heights beyond your ken.',14,0,0,0,0,17271,0,38138,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_INTRO_7'),(36855,7,0,'What is this disturbance? You dare trespass upon this hallowed ground? This shall be your final resting place!',14,0,0,0,0,16868,0,38122,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_AGGRO'),(36855,8,0,'Enough! I see I must take matters into my own hands!',14,0,0,0,0,16877,0,38126,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_PHASE_2'),(36855,9,0,'%s\'s Mana Barrier shimmers and fades away!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38121,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_PHASE_2_EMOTE'),(36855,10,0,'You are weak, powerless to resist my will!',14,0,0,0,0,16876,0,38127,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_DOMINATE_MIND'),(36855,11,0,'Take this blessing and show these intruders a taste of the Master\'s power!',14,0,0,0,0,16873,0,38130,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_DARK_EMPOWERMENT'),(36855,12,0,'I release you from the curse of flesh!',14,0,0,0,0,16874,0,38132,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_DARK_TRANSFORMATION'),(36855,13,0,'Arise, and exult in your pure form!',14,0,0,0,0,16875,0,38133,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_ANIMATE_DEAD'),(36855,14,0,'Do you yet grasp the futility of your actions?',14,0,0,0,0,16869,0,38123,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_KILL_1'),(36855,14,1,'Embrace the darkness... darkness eternal.',14,0,0,0,0,16870,0,38124,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_KILL_2'),(36855,15,0,'This charade has gone on long enough!',14,0,0,0,0,16872,0,38128,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_BERSERK'),(36855,16,0,'All part of the Master\'s plan.... Your end is inevitable....',14,0,0,0,0,16871,0,38125,0,'Lady Deathwhisper - SAY_DEATH'),(37007,0,0,'The master\'s sanctum has been disturbed!',14,0,0,0,0,16865,0,37443,0,'Deathbound Ward - SAY_TRAP_ACTIVATE'),(37007,0,1,'I... awaken!',14,0,0,0,0,16866,0,38517,0,'Deathbound Ward - SAY_TRAP_ACTIVATE'),(37007,0,2,'Who... goes there...?',14,0,0,0,0,16867,0,38518,0,'Deathbound Ward - SAY_TRAP_ACTIVATE'),(37119,0,0,'This is our final stand. What happens here will echo through the ages. Regardless of outcome, they will know that we fought with honor. That we fought for the freedom and safety of our people.$B$BRemember, hero, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!',14,0,0,22,0,16653,0,37027,2,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_INTRO_1'),(37119,1,0,'Remember, heroes, fear is your greatest enemy in these befouled halls. Steel your heart and your soul will shine brighter than a thousand suns. The enemy will falter at the sight of you. They will fall as the light of righteousness envelops them!',14,0,0,22,0,16654,0,37028,2,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_INTRO_2'),(37119,2,0,'Our march upon Icecrown Citadel begins now!',14,0,0,22,0,16655,0,37029,2,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_INTRO_3'),(37119,3,0,'ARTHAS! I swore that I would see you dead and the Scourge dismantled! I\'m going to finish what I started at Light\'s Hope!',14,0,0,22,0,16656,0,37031,2,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_INTRO_4'),(37119,4,0,'The power of the Light knows no bounds, Saurfang. His soul is under great strain, but he lives - for now.',12,0,0,1,0,16658,0,37056,2,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_INTRO_5'),(37119,5,0,'By the Light, it must be so!',12,0,0,5,0,16657,0,37038,2,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_INTRO_A_5'),(37122,0,0,'Never... could reach... the top shelf...',14,0,0,0,0,16586,0,37074,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_DEATH'),(37122,1,0,'You miserable fools never did manage to select a decent bat wing.',14,0,0,0,0,16587,0,37076,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_RESURRECTED'),(37122,2,0,'THAT was for bringing me spoiled spider ichor!\n',14,0,0,0,0,16588,0,37075,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_KILL'),(37122,3,0,'Don\'t... let Finklestein use me... for his potions...',14,0,0,0,0,16589,0,37077,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_SECOND_DEATH'),(37122,4,0,'The loss of our comrades was unpreventable. They lived and died in the service of the Argent Crusade.',14,0,0,0,0,16590,0,37534,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_SURVIVE_TALK'),(37122,5,0,'Even dying here beats spending another day collecting reagents for that madman, Finklestein. ',14,0,0,0,0,16585,0,36948,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_INTRO_2'),(37123,0,0,'No amount of healing can save me now. Fight on, brothers...',14,0,0,0,0,16810,0,37665,0,'Captain Brandon - SAY_BRANDON_DEATH'),(37123,1,0,'What? This strength...? All of the pain is gone! You... must join me in the eternal embrace of death!\n',14,0,0,0,0,16811,0,37664,0,'Captain Brandon - SAY_BRANDON_RESURRECTED'),(37123,2,0,'It doesn\'t hurt anymore, does it?\n',14,0,0,0,0,16812,0,37658,0,'Captain Brandon - SAY_BRANDON_KILL'),(37123,3,0,'I\'m sorry...',14,0,0,0,0,16813,0,37659,0,'Captain Brandon - SAY_BRANDON_SECOND_DEATH'),(37123,4,0,'You have done much in this war against the Scourge. May the light embrace you. ',14,0,0,0,0,16815,0,37533,0,'Captain Brandon - SAY_BRANDON_SURVIVE_TALK'),(37124,0,0,'Please... burn my remains. Let me live warm in the afterlife...',14,0,0,0,0,16844,0,37666,0,'Captain Grondel - SAY_GRONDEL_DEATH'),(37124,1,0,'No! Why was I denied a death by flame? You must all BURN!  ',14,0,0,0,0,16845,0,37667,0,'Captain Grondel - SAY_GRONDEL_RESURRECTED'),(37124,2,0,'Can you feel the burn?',14,0,0,0,0,16846,0,37660,0,'Captain Grondel - SAY_GRONDEL_KILL'),(37124,3,0,'What... have I done? No!',14,0,0,0,0,16847,0,37661,0,'Captain Grondel - SAY_GRONDEL_SECOND_DEATH'),(37124,4,0,'What can possibly redeem this unholy place? Thank you.',14,0,0,0,0,16849,0,37535,0,'Captain Grondel - SAY_GRONDEL_SURVIVE_TALK'),(37125,0,0,'It was... a worthy afterlife.',14,0,0,0,0,16998,0,37668,0,'Captain Rupert - SAY_RUPERT_DEATH'),(37125,1,0,'There is no escaping the Lich King\'s will. Prepare for an explosive encounter!',14,0,0,0,0,16999,0,37669,0,'Captain Rupert - SAY_RUPERT_RESURRECTED'),(37125,2,0,'So that\'s what happens what you stand too close to a bomb!',14,0,0,0,0,17000,0,37662,0,'Captain Rupert - SAY_RUPERT_KILL'),(37125,3,0,'What an... explosive ending!',14,0,0,0,0,17001,0,37663,0,'Captain Rupert - SAY_RUPERT_SECOND_DEATH'),(37125,4,0,'Beware the dangers that lie ahead... and do try to remain in one piece. ',14,0,0,0,0,17003,0,37536,0,'Captain Rupert - SAY_RUPERT_SURVIVE_TALK'),(37126,0,0,'You may have once fought beside me, Crok, but now you are nothing more than a traitor. Come, your second death approaches!',14,0,0,0,0,17017,0,37024,0,'Sister Svalna - SAY_EVENT_START'),(37126,1,0,'Miserable creatures! Die! ',14,0,0,0,0,17018,0,37065,0,'Sister Svalna - SAY_KILL_CAPTAIN'),(37126,2,0,'Foolish Crok. You brought my reinforcements with you. Arise, Argent Champions, and serve the Lich King in death!',14,0,0,0,0,17019,0,37020,0,'Sister Svanlna - SAY_RESURRECT_CAPTAINS'),(37126,3,0,'Come, Scourgebane. I\'ll show the master which of us is truly worthy of the title of \"Champion\"!',14,0,0,0,0,17020,0,37653,0,'Sister Svalna - SAY_AGGRO'),(37126,4,0,'What a pitiful choice of an ally, Crok!',14,0,0,0,0,17021,0,37654,0,'Sister Svalna - SAY_KILL'),(37126,5,0,'They died so easily. No matter.',14,0,0,0,0,17022,0,37163,0,'Sister Svalna - SAY_CAPTAIN_DEATH'),(37126,6,0,'Perhaps... you were right, Crok. ',14,0,0,0,0,17023,0,37135,0,'Sister Svalna - SAY_DEATH'),(37126,7,0,'%s has impaled $n!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,37977,0,'Sister Svalna - EMOTE_SVALNA_IMPALE'),(37126,8,0,'%s\'s Aether Shield has been shattered by $n!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,37978,0,'Sister Svalna - EMOTE_SVALNA_BROKEN_SHIELD'),(37129,0,0,'Ready your arms, my Argent Brothers. The Vrykul will protect the Frost Queen with their lives.',14,0,0,0,0,16819,0,36945,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_INTRO_1'),(37129,1,0,'Enough idle banter! Our champions have arrived - support them as we push our way through the hall!',14,0,0,0,0,16820,0,36946,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_INTRO_3'),(37129,2,0,'Draw them back to us, and we\'ll assist you. ',14,0,0,0,0,16821,0,37013,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_COMBAT_WP_0'),(37129,3,0,'Quickly, push on!',14,0,0,0,0,16823,0,37015,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_COMBAT_WP_1'),(37129,4,0,'Her reinforcements will arrive shortly, we must bring her down quickly!',14,0,0,0,0,16824,0,37016,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_FINAL_WP'),(37129,5,0,'I\'ll draw her attacks. Return our brothers to their graves, then help me bring her down!',14,0,0,15,0,16825,0,37017,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_COMBAT_SVALNA'),(37129,6,0,'Augh! I must rest for a moment. \n',14,0,0,0,0,16826,0,37164,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_WEAKENING_GAUNTLET'),(37129,7,0,'Champions! I cannot hold her back any longer.',14,0,0,0,0,16827,0,37165,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_WEAKENING_SVALNA'),(37129,8,0,'Vengeance alone... was not enough!',14,0,0,0,0,16828,0,0,0,'Crok Scourgebane - SAY_CROK_DEATH'),(37181,0,0,'You now stand upon the hallowed ground of the Scourge. The Light won\'t protect you here, paladin. Nothing will protect you...',14,0,0,0,0,17230,0,38054,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_INTRO_1'),(37181,1,0,'You could have been my greatest champion, Fordring: A force of darkness that would wash over this world and deliver it into a new age of strife.',14,0,0,0,0,17231,0,38055,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_INTRO_2'),(37181,2,0,'But that honor is no longer yours. Soon, I will have a new champion. ',14,0,0,0,0,17232,0,38056,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_INTRO_3'),(37181,3,0,'The breaking of this one has been taxing. The atrocities I have committed upon his soul. He has resisted for so long, but he will bow down before his king soon.',14,0,0,0,0,17233,0,37034,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_INTRO_4'),(37181,4,0,'In the end, you will all serve me.',14,0,0,0,0,17234,0,38059,0,'The Lich King - SAY_LK_INTRO_5'),(37183,0,0,'NEVER! I... I will never... serve... you...',14,0,0,0,0,17078,0,37035,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon - SAY_BOLVAR_INTRO_1'),(37187,0,0,'Kor\'kron, move out! Champions, watch your backs. The Scourge have been...',14,0,0,22,0,17103,0,37634,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_1'),(37187,1,0,'My boy died at the Wrath Gate. I am here only to collect his body.',12,0,0,397,0,17097,0,37638,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_3'),(37187,2,0,'We named him Dranosh - It means \"Heart of Draenor\" in orcish. I would not let the warlocks take him. My boy would be safe, hidden away by the elders of Garadar.',12,0,0,1,0,17098,0,37640,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_5'),(37187,3,0,'I made a promise to his mother before she died; that I would cross the Dark Portal alone - whether I lived or died, my son would be safe. Untainted...',12,0,0,1,0,17099,0,37641,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_6'),(37187,4,0,'Today, I fulfill that promise.',12,0,0,397,0,17100,0,37642,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_7'),(37187,5,0,'%s charges!',16,0,0,53,0,17104,0,37643,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_8'),(37187,6,0,'Behind you lies the body of my only son. Nothing will keep me from him. ',12,0,0,0,0,17094,0,37525,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_8'),(37187,7,0,'High Overlord Saurfang walks over to his son and kneels before his son\'s body.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_12'),(37187,8,0,'[Orcish] No\'ku kil zil\'nok ha tar.',12,0,0,0,0,17096,0,0,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_13'),(37187,9,0,'Higher Overlord Saurfang picks up the body of his son and walks over towards Varian',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_14'),(37187,10,0,'I will not forget this... kindness. I thank you, Highness',12,0,0,0,0,17095,0,37529,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_15'),(37187,11,0,'%s coughs.',16,0,0,0,0,17105,0,37646,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_HORDE_1'),(37187,12,0,'%s weeps over the corpse of his son.',16,0,0,15,0,17106,0,37647,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_HORDE_2'),(37187,13,0,'You will have a proper ceremony in Nagrand, next to the pyres of your mother and ancestors.\n',12,0,0,0,0,17101,0,37648,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_HORDE_3'),(37187,14,0,'Honor, young heroes... no matter how dire the battle... never forsake it.',12,0,0,0,0,17102,0,37649,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_OUTRO_HORDE_4'),(37187,15,0,'The paladin still lives? Is it possible, Highlord? Could he have survived?',12,0,0,6,0,17107,0,37051,2,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_1'),(37187,16,0,'Then we must save him! If we rescue Bolvar Fordragon, we may quell the unrest between the Alliance and the Horde.',12,0,0,5,0,17108,0,37053,2,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_2'),(37187,17,0,'Our mission is now clear: The Lich King will answer for his crimes and we will save Highlord Bolvar Fordragon!',12,0,0,15,0,17109,0,37054,2,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_3'),(37187,18,0,'Kor\'kron, prepare Orgrim\'s Hammer for its final voyage! Champions, our gunship will find a point to dock on the upper reaches of the citadel. Meet us there!',14,0,0,22,0,17110,0,37055,2,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_4'),(37188,0,0,'%s cries.',16,0,0,18,0,16651,0,37542,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_17'),(37188,1,0,'It was nothing, your majesty. Just... I\'m proud of my king.',12,0,0,0,0,16652,0,37546,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_19'),(37200,0,0,'Let\'s get a move on then! Move ou...',14,0,0,0,0,16974,0,37457,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_INTRO_ALLIANCE_1'),(37200,1,0,'A lone orc against the might of the Alliance???',14,0,0,0,0,16970,0,37460,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_INTRO_ALLIANCE_4'),(37200,2,0,'Charge!!!\n',14,0,0,0,0,16971,0,37461,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_INTRO_ALLIANCE_5'),(37200,3,0,'%s gasps for air.',16,0,0,0,0,16975,0,37502,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_1'),(37200,4,0,'That was Saurfang\'s boy - the Horde commander at the Wrath Gate. Such a tragic end...',12,0,0,0,0,16976,0,37503,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_2'),(37200,5,0,'What in the... There, in the distance!\n',12,0,0,0,0,16977,0,37504,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_3'),(37200,6,0,'A Horde Zeppelin flies up to the rise.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_4'),(37200,7,0,'Soldiers, fall in! Looks like the Horde are comin\' to take another shot!\n',14,0,0,0,0,16978,0,37505,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_5'),(37200,8,0,'The Zeppelin docks, and High Overlord Saurfang hops out, confronting the Alliance soldiers and Muradin',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_6'),(37200,9,0,'Don\'t force me hand, orc. We can\'t let ye pass.',12,0,0,0,0,16972,0,37524,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_7'),(37200,10,0,'I... I can\'t do it. Get back on yer ship and we\'ll spare yer life. ',12,0,0,0,0,16973,0,37526,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_9'),(37200,11,0,'A mage portal from Stormwind appears between the two and Varian Wrynn and Jaina Proudmoore emerge.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_10'),(37200,12,0,'Right away, yer majesty!',12,0,0,0,0,16979,0,37547,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_21'),(37200,13,0,'Could it be, Lord Fordring? If Bolvar lives, mayhap there is hope fer peace between the Alliance and the Horde. We must reach the top o\' this cursed place and free the paladin!',12,0,0,6,0,16980,0,37037,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_2'),(37200,14,0,'Prepare the Skybreaker fer an aerial assault on the citadel!',14,0,0,5,0,16981,0,37043,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_3'),(37200,15,0,'Heroes, ye must fight yer way to a clear extraction point within Icecrown. We\'ll try an\' rendezvous on the ramparts!',14,0,0,22,0,16982,0,37046,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_4'),(37217,0,0,'%s cries out with a loud, baying howl!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,37849,0,'Precious - EMOTE_PRECIOUS_ZOMBIES'),(37491,1,0,'You miserable fools never did manage to select a decent bat wing.',14,0,0,0,0,16587,0,37076,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_RESURRECTED'),(37491,2,0,'THAT was for bringing me spoiled spider ichor!\n',14,0,0,0,0,16588,0,37075,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_KILL'),(37491,3,0,'Don\'t... let Finklestein use me... for his potions...',14,0,0,0,0,16589,0,37077,0,'Captain Arnath - SAY_ARNATH_SECOND_DEATH'),(37493,1,0,'What? This strength...? All of the pain is gone! You... must join me in the eternal embrace of death!\n',14,0,0,0,0,16811,0,37664,0,'Captain Brandon - SAY_BRANDON_RESURRECTED'),(37493,2,0,'It doesn\'t hurt anymore, does it?\n',14,0,0,0,0,16812,0,37658,0,'Captain Brandon - SAY_BRANDON_KILL'),(37493,3,0,'I\'m sorry...',14,0,0,0,0,16813,0,37659,0,'Captain Brandon - SAY_BRANDON_SECOND_DEATH'),(37494,1,0,'No! Why was I denied a death by flame? You must all BURN!  ',14,0,0,0,0,16845,0,37667,0,'Captain Grondel - SAY_GRONDEL_RESURRECTED'),(37494,2,0,'Can you feel the burn?',14,0,0,0,0,16846,0,37660,0,'Captain Grondel - SAY_GRONDEL_KILL'),(37494,3,0,'What... have I done? No!',14,0,0,0,0,16847,0,37661,0,'Captain Grondel - SAY_GRONDEL_SECOND_DEATH'),(37495,1,0,'There is no escaping the Lich King\'s will. Prepare for an explosive encounter!',14,0,0,0,0,16999,0,37669,0,'Captain Rupert - SAY_RUPERT_RESURRECTED'),(37495,2,0,'So that\'s what happens what you stand too close to a bomb!',14,0,0,0,0,17000,0,37662,0,'Captain Rupert - SAY_RUPERT_KILL'),(37495,3,0,'What an... explosive ending!',14,0,0,0,0,17001,0,37663,0,'Captain Rupert - SAY_RUPERT_SECOND_DEATH'),(37813,0,0,'For every Horde soldier that you killed -- for every Alliance dog that fell, the Lich King\'s armies grew. Even now the val\'kyr work to raise your fallen as Scourge.\n',14,0,0,0,0,16701,0,37458,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_ALLIANCE_2'),(37813,1,0,'Things are about to get much worse. Come, taste the power that the Lich King has bestowed upon me!',14,0,0,0,0,16702,0,37459,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_ALLIANCE_3'),(37813,2,0,'Dwarves...',14,0,0,0,0,16703,0,37471,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_ALLIANCE_6'),(37813,3,0,'%s immobilizes Muradin and his guards.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_ALLIANCE_7'),(37813,4,0,'Join me, father. Join me and we will crush this world in the name of the Scourge -- for the glory of the Lich King!',14,0,0,0,0,16704,0,37635,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_2'),(37813,5,0,'Stubborn and old. What chance do you have? I am stronger, and more powerful than you ever were.',14,0,0,5,0,16705,0,37639,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_4'),(37813,6,0,'Pathetic old orc! Come then, heroes. Come and face the might of the Scourge!',14,0,0,15,0,16706,0,37644,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_INTRO_HORDE_9'),(37813,7,0,'BY THE MIGHT OF THE LICH KING!',14,0,0,0,0,16694,0,38464,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_AGGRO'),(37813,8,0,'The ground runs red with your blood!',14,0,0,0,0,16699,0,37995,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_MARK_OF_THE_FALLEN_CHAMPION'),(37813,9,0,'Feast, my minions!',14,0,0,0,0,16700,0,38466,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_BLOOD_BEASTS'),(37813,10,0,'You are nothing!',14,0,0,0,0,16695,0,37991,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_KILL_1'),(37813,10,1,'Your soul will find no redemption here!',14,0,0,0,0,16696,0,37992,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_KILL_2'),(37813,11,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_FRENZY'),(37813,12,0,'I have become... DEATH!',14,0,0,0,0,16698,0,37994,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_BERSERK'),(37813,13,0,'I... Am... Released...',14,0,0,0,0,16697,0,37477,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - SAY_DEATH'),(37879,0,0,'Stand down, Muradin. Let a grieving father pass.',12,0,0,0,0,16690,0,37527,0,'King Varian Wrynn - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_11'),(37879,1,0,'I... I was not at the Wrath Gate, but the soldiers who survived told me much of what happened. Your son fought with honor. He died a hero\'s death. He deserves a hero\'s burial.',12,0,0,0,0,16691,0,37530,0,'King Varian Wrynn - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_16'),(37879,2,0,'Jaina? Why are you crying?',12,0,0,0,0,16692,0,37543,0,'King Varian Wrynn - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_18'),(37879,3,0,'Bah! Muradin, secure the deck and prepare our soldiers for an assault on the upper citadel. I\'ll send out another regiment from Stormwind.\n',12,0,0,0,0,16693,0,37545,0,'King Varian Wrynn - SAY_OUTRO_ALLIANCE_20'),(37915,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Timothy Cunningham'),(37955,0,0,'You have made an... unwise... decision.',14,0,0,0,0,16782,0,38048,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_AGGRO'),(37955,1,0,'Just a taste...',14,0,0,0,0,16783,0,38053,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_VAMPIRIC_BITE'),(37955,1,1,'Know my hunger!',14,0,0,0,0,16784,0,38058,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_VAMPIRIC_BITE'),(37955,2,0,'Yes! Feed, my precious one! You are mine now!',14,0,0,0,0,16790,0,38065,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_MIND_CONTROL'),(37955,3,0,'You thirst for blood!',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,38515,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - EMOTE_BLOODTHIRST'),(37955,4,0,'SUFFER!',14,0,75,0,0,16786,0,38061,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_SWARMING_SHADOWS'),(37955,5,0,'Shadows amass and swarm around $n!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38619,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - EMOTE_SWARMING_SHADOWS'),(37955,6,0,'Can you handle this?',14,0,75,0,0,16787,0,38062,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_PACT_OF_THE_DARKFALLEN'),(37955,7,0,'Here it comes...',14,0,0,0,0,16788,0,38063,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_AIR_PHASE'),(37955,8,0,'Really...? Is that all you\'ve got?',14,0,0,0,0,16791,0,38066,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_KILL'),(37955,8,1,'Such a pity.',14,0,0,0,0,16792,0,38067,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_KILL'),(37955,9,0,'How... unfortunate.',14,0,0,0,0,16789,0,38064,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_WIPE'),(37955,10,0,'This ends NOW!',14,0,0,0,0,16793,0,38068,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_BERSERK'),(37955,11,0,'But... we were getting along... so... well...',14,0,0,0,0,16794,0,38069,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_DEATH'),(37970,0,0,'Naxxanar was merely a setback! With the power of the orb, Valanar will have his vengeance!',14,0,0,0,0,16685,0,38001,0,'Prince Valanar - SAY_VALANAR_INVOCATION'),(37970,1,0,'Invocation of Blood jumps to Prince Valanar!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38589,0,'Prince Valanar - EMOTE_VALANAR_INVOCATION'),(37970,2,0,'My cup runneth over.',14,0,0,0,0,16686,0,38002,0,'Prince Valanar - SAY_VALANAR_SPECIAL'),(37970,3,0,'%s begins casting Empowered Shock Vortex!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38972,0,'Prince Valanar - EMOTE_VALANAR_SHOCK_VORTEX'),(37970,4,0,'Dinner... is served.',14,0,0,0,0,16681,0,37998,0,'Prince Valanar - SAY_VALANAR_KILL_1'),(37970,4,1,'Do you see NOW the power of the Darkfallen?',14,0,0,0,0,16682,0,37999,0,'Prince Valanar - SAY_VALANAR_KILL_2'),(37970,5,0,'BOW DOWN BEFORE THE SAN\'LAYN!',14,0,0,0,0,16684,0,38000,0,'Prince Valanar - SAY_VALANAR_BERSERK'),(37970,6,0,'...why...?',14,0,0,0,0,16683,0,0,0,'Prince Valanar - SAY_VALANAR_DEATH'),(37972,0,0,'Such wondrous power! The Darkfallen Orb has made me INVINCIBLE!',14,0,0,0,0,16727,0,38006,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_KELESETH_INVOCATION'),(37972,1,0,'Invocation of Blood jumps to Prince Keleseth!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38588,0,'Prince Keleseth - EMOTE_KELESETH_INVOCATION'),(37972,2,0,'Blood will flow.',14,0,0,0,0,16728,0,38007,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_KELESETH_SPECIAL'),(37972,3,0,'Were you ever a threat?',14,0,0,0,0,16723,0,38003,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_KELESETH_KILL_1'),(37972,3,1,'Truth is found in death.',14,0,0,0,0,16724,0,38004,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_KELESETH_KILL_2'),(37972,4,0,'%s cackles maniacally.\n',16,0,0,0,0,16726,0,13022,0,'Prince Keleseth - EMOTE_KELESETH_BERSERK'),(37972,5,0,'My queen, they... come.',14,0,0,0,0,16725,0,38005,0,'Prince Keleseth - SAY_KELESETH_DEATH'),(37973,0,0,'Tremble before Taldaram, mortals, for the power of the orb flows through me!',14,0,0,0,0,16857,0,38010,0,'Prince Taldaram - SAY_TALDARAM_INVOCATION'),(37973,1,0,'Invocation of Blood jumps to Prince Taldaram!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38590,0,'Prince Taldaram - EMOTE_TALDARAM_INVOCATION'),(37973,2,0,'Delight in the pain!',14,0,0,0,0,16858,0,38011,0,'Prince Taldaram - SAY_TALDARAM_SPECIAL'),(37973,3,0,'Empowered Flames speed toward $n!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38624,0,'Prince Taldaram - EMOTE_TALDARAM_FLAME'),(37973,4,0,'Worm food.',14,0,0,0,0,16853,0,38008,0,'Prince Taldaram - SAY_TALDARAM_KILL_1'),(37973,4,1,'Beg for mercy!',14,0,0,0,0,16854,0,38009,0,'Prince Taldaram - SAY_TALDARAM_KILL_2'),(37973,5,0,'%s laughs.',16,0,0,0,0,16856,0,37127,0,'Prince Taldaram - EMOTE_TALDARAM_BERSERK'),(37973,6,0,'%s gurgles and dies.',16,0,0,0,0,16855,0,0,0,'Prince Taldaram - EMOTE_TALDARAM_DEATH'),(38004,0,0,'Foolish mortals. You thought us defeated so easily? The San\'layn are the Lich King\'s immortal soldiers! Now you shall face their might combined!',14,0,0,1,0,16795,0,37997,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_INTRO_1'),(38004,1,0,'Rise up, brothers, and destroy our enemies!',14,0,0,0,0,16796,0,38079,0,'Blood-Queen Lana\'thel - SAY_INTRO_2'),(38017,0,0,'Are you certain you should be helping these mortals in their quest for the sword?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37774,0,'Kalecgos'),(38017,1,0,'These blades, Krasus... They were made long ago, when things were... different.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37775,0,'Kalecgos'),(38017,2,0,'Our enemies once turned our strongest weapon against us. What makes you think the prismatic blades will be any different?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37782,0,'Kalecgos'),(38017,3,0,'As you wish, my queen. I will not stand in their way, but I will keep a close watch.',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,37783,0,'Kalecgos'),(38334,0,0,'What are you staring at? Haven\'t you ever seen a genius before?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38276,0,'say text'),(38334,1,0,'This\'ll teach you to mind your own business!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38253,0,'say text'),(38335,0,0,'That\'s right, I\'d like to list some of these \'fireworks\'.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38285,0,'say text'),(38335,1,0,'Those\'ll net me a nice profit when I return from the South Seas.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38286,0,'say text'),(38335,2,0,'You... Don\'t think I don\'t see you. Leave me alone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38287,0,'say text'),(38336,0,0,'Thanks for the great cut and shave, buddy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38288,0,'say text'),(38336,1,0,'Here\'s a little somethin\' extra since I\'ll be away.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38289,0,'say text'),(38336,2,0,'On second thought, keep the whole bag. I have to, uh, get going.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38290,0,'say text'),(38336,3,0,'Did you really think you could corner me this easily?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38291,0,'say text'),(38337,0,0,'What are you staring at? Haven\'t you ever seen a genius before?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38276,0,'say text'),(38337,1,0,'This\'ll teach you to mind your own business!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38253,0,'say text'),(38338,0,0,'That\'s right, I\'d like to list some of these \'fireworks\'.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38285,0,'say text'),(38338,1,0,'Those\'ll net me a nice profit when I return from the South Seas.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38286,0,'say text'),(38338,2,0,'You... Don\'t think I don\'t see you. Leave me alone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38287,0,'say text'),(38339,0,0,'Thanks for the great cut and shave, buddy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38288,0,'say text'),(38339,1,0,'Here\'s a little somethin\' extra since I\'ll be away.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38289,0,'say text'),(38339,2,0,'On second thought, keep the whole bag. I have to, uh, get going.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38290,0,'say text'),(38339,3,0,'Did you really think you could corner me this easily?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38291,0,'say text'),(38472,0,0,'Die, intruders! None shall interfere with the Cult\'s plans!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,38516,0,'Darnavan - SAY_DARNAVAN_AGGRO'),(38472,1,0,'Wh- where am I...?  What a nightmare I have had....  But this is no time to reflect, I have much information to report!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,38512,0,'Darnavan - SAY_DARNAVAN_RESCUED'),(38485,0,0,'Die, intruders! None shall interfere with the Cult\'s plans!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,38516,0,'Darnavan - SAY_DARNAVAN_AGGRO'),(38485,1,0,'Wh- where am I...?  What a nightmare I have had....  But this is no time to reflect, I have much information to report!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,38512,0,'Darnavan - SAY_DARNAVAN_RESCUED'),(38490,0,0,'$n is infected with the Death Plague!',41,0,100,25,0,0,0,38679,0,'Rotting Frost Giant - Death Plague'),(38494,0,0,'$n is infected with the Death Plague!',41,0,100,25,0,0,0,38679,0,'Rotting Frost Giant - Death Plague'),(38579,0,0,'Free at last! It is over, my son. This is the moment of reckoning.',14,0,0,1,0,17397,0,38117,0,'Terenas Menethil - SAY_TERENAS_OUTRO_1'),(38579,1,0,'Rise up, champions of the Light!',14,0,0,0,0,17398,0,38118,0,'Terenas Menethil - SAY_TERENAS_OUTRO_2'),(38995,0,0,'We\'ll grant you a swift death, Arthas. More than can be said for the thousands you\'ve tortured and slain.',14,0,0,0,0,17390,0,38109,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_INTRO_1'),(38995,1,0,'So be it. Champions, attack!',14,0,0,0,0,17391,0,38110,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_INTRO_2'),(38995,2,0,'LIGHT GRANT ME ONE FINAL BLESSING! GIVE ME THE STRENGTH... TO SHATTER THESE BONDS!',14,0,0,0,0,17392,0,38111,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_OUTRO_1'),(38995,3,0,'No more, Arthas! No more lives will be consumed by your hatred!',14,0,0,0,0,17393,0,38112,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - SAY_TIRION_OUTRO_2'),(39217,0,0,'You have come to bring Arthas to justice? To see the Lich King destroyed?',14,0,0,0,0,17394,0,38114,0,'Terenas Menethil - SAY_TERENAS_INTRO_1'),(39217,1,0,'First, you must escape Frostmourne\'s hold, or be damned as I am; trapped within this cursed blade for all eternity. ',14,0,0,0,0,17395,0,38115,0,'Terenas Menethil - SAY_TERENAS_INTRO_2'),(39368,13,0,'Fantastic!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,39432,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,14,0,' However, the most important part of battle is how you celebrate a good hard earned victory!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,39384,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,12,0,'Everyone, cheer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39387,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,11,0,'Reward your fellow soldiers in battle with a resounding cheer.  Now, cheer at me when I tell you to!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39428,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,9,0,'Wow, nice and scary! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39431,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,10,0,'Remember though, a key factor in winning any battle is positive reinforcement.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,39386,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,8,0,'Let me hear that battle roar!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,39395,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,7,0,'When I give the signal, let loose your greatest roar!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39411,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,5,0,'Nice job!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,39430,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,6,0,'When you go into combat, it is important that you know how to intimidate the enemy with a deafening battle roar!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,39385,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,4,0,'Okay, recruits, salute!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,39394,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,3,0,'Show me that discipline with a proper salute when I say so!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,39413,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,2,0,'The first thing you need to learn is proper discipline.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39383,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,1,0,'I am going to teach you all what it takes to be a proper soldier! ',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,39404,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39368,0,0,'All right, you twisted mess of broken gears, let\'s get to work!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39392,0,'Drill Sergeant Steamcrank'),(39746,0,0,'Alexstrasza has chosen capable allies.... A pity that I must END YOU!',14,0,100,0,0,17512,0,39781,0,'Baltharus the Warborn'),(39746,1,0,'You thought you stood a chance?',14,0,50,0,0,17513,0,39782,0,'General Zarithrian'),(39746,1,1,'It\'s for the best.',14,0,50,0,0,17514,0,39783,0,'General Zarithrian'),(39746,2,0,'Turn them to ash, minions!',14,0,100,0,0,17516,0,39785,0,'General Zarithrian'),(39746,3,0,'HALION! I....',14,0,100,0,0,17515,0,39784,0,'General Zarithrian'),(39747,0,0,'You will sssuffer for this intrusion!',14,0,100,0,0,17528,0,39932,0,'Saviana Ragefire'),(39747,1,0,'Burn in the master\'s flame!',14,0,100,0,0,17532,0,39925,0,'Saviana Ragefire'),(39747,2,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Saviana Ragefire'),(39747,3,0,'Halion will be pleased.',14,0,100,0,0,17530,0,39934,0,'Saviana Ragefire'),(39747,3,1,'As it should be....',14,0,100,0,0,17529,0,39933,0,'Saviana Ragefire'),(39751,0,0,'Your power wanes, ancient one.... Soon you will join your friends.',14,0,100,0,0,17525,0,40614,0,'Baltharus the Warborn'),(39751,1,0,'Ah, the entertainment has arrived.',14,0,100,0,0,17520,0,39935,0,'Baltharus the Warborn'),(39751,2,0,'Baltharus leaves no survivors!',14,0,100,0,0,17521,0,39937,0,'Baltharus the Warborn'),(39751,2,1,'This world has enough heroes.',14,0,100,0,0,17522,0,39938,0,'Baltharus the Warborn'),(39751,3,0,'Twice the pain and half the fun.',14,0,100,0,0,17524,0,39939,0,'Baltharus the Warborn'),(39751,4,1,'I... didn\'t see that coming....',14,0,100,0,0,17523,0,39936,0,'Baltharus the Warborn'),(40184,0,0,'O spirit of de tigers, lend $n your power and help us find de answers we seek!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,40334,0,'Vanira'),(40260,0,0,'Sign me up!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,39526,0,'Troll Volunteer JustSpawned'),(40260,0,1,'Anythin\' for Vol\'jin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,40251,0,'Troll Volunteer JustSpawned'),(40260,0,2,'I\'d be glad to help.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,40249,0,'Troll Volunteer JustSpawned'),(40260,0,3,'Just point me at de enemy!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,40253,0,'Troll Volunteer JustSpawned'),(40260,1,0,'Reportin\' for duty.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,40280,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40260,1,1,'Ready to take de fight to Zalazane.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40281,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40260,1,2,'Ready to fight beside Vol\'jin!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,40282,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40260,1,3,'New troll here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,40279,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40260,1,4,'When does de trainin\' start?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,40283,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40264,0,0,'Sign me up!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,39526,0,'Troll Volunteer JustSpawned'),(40264,0,1,'Anythin\' for Vol\'jin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,40251,0,'Troll Volunteer JustSpawned'),(40264,0,2,'I\'d be glad to help.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,40249,0,'Troll Volunteer JustSpawned'),(40264,0,3,'Just point me at de enemy!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,40253,0,'Troll Volunteer JustSpawned'),(40264,1,0,'Reportin\' for duty.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,40280,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40264,1,1,'Ready to take de fight to Zalazane.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40281,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40264,1,2,'Ready to fight beside Vol\'jin!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,40282,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40264,1,3,'New troll here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,40279,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40264,1,4,'When does de trainin\' start?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,40283,0,'Troll Volunteer Quest Turn in'),(40301,0,0,'The tiger matriarch appears! Prove yourself in combat!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,40335,0,'Tiger Matriarch Credit'),(40329,0,0,'Dat be enough for now!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,40320,0,'Zen\'tabra'),(40329,1,0,'Don\'t be lookin\' so surprised. Your shaman friend has sharp eyes, or should I say, sharp frogs.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40321,0,'Zen\'tabra'),(40329,2,0,'My kind, da druids, we been layin\' low for some time now. We been waitin\' to see when an\' if Vol\'jin might return.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,40322,0,'Zen\'tabra'),(40329,3,0,'Now dat it looks like de Darkspear be returnin\' to these isles, maybe de time has come for us to reveal ourselves.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40323,0,'Zen\'tabra'),(40329,4,0,'Go back to Vol\'jin an\' tell him dis: Zen\'tabra stands ready to help him in de coming battle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40324,0,'Zen\'tabra'),(40352,0,0,'Darkspears, we consult de spirits! Drummers, take your places!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,40387,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,1,0,'Spirits, we be gathered here to ask for your guidance.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,40388,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,2,0,'Our leader, Vol\'jin, son of Sen\'jin, issued de call to all Darkspears: reclaim de Echo Isles for our tribe.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40389,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,3,0,'Spirits! I offer me own body to you! Speak through me! Is de time right for mighty Vol\'jin\'s undertaking?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,40390,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,4,0,'De ancestors hear ya, witch doctor!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40391,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,5,0,'Know dat your plans please us, Darkspears. De son of Sen\'jin walks de right path.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40392,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,6,0,'De task in front of ya will not be easy, but ya have our blessin\'.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40393,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,7,0,'Ya gave up your home an\' ya gave up de loas of your ancestors when ya left de Echo Isles. Dey will not be pleased dat you been ignorin\' dem.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40394,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,8,0,'Ya must make amends wit\' Bwonsamdi, de guardian of de dead, if ya hope to defeat Zalazane. It be de only way. Tell de son of Sen\'jin dese things.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40395,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40352,9,0,'De spirits have blessed us wit\' an answer! De Echo Isles will be ours again!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,40396,0,'Witch Doctor Hez\'tok'),(40391,0,0,'Thank ya, scout. Keep up da patrols. But for now, a rest is in order. Dismissed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40413,0,'Vol\'jin'),(40416,0,0,'He got a big army, an\' he be plannin\' somethin\' down dere.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40412,0,'Darkspear Scout'),(40416,0,1,'Zalazane got most of his hexed trolls hidden under de canopy on de big island.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40411,0,'Darkspear Scout'),(40429,0,0,'Thank you! I could not have held out for much longer.... A terrible thing has happened here.',14,0,100,5,0,17491,0,40599,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(40429,1,0,'We believed the Sanctum was well-fortified, but we were not prepared for the nature of this assault.',12,0,100,1,0,17492,0,40600,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(40429,2,0,'The Black dragonkin materialized from thin air, and set upon us before we could react.',12,0,100,1,0,17493,0,40601,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(40429,3,0,'We did not stand a chance. As my brethren perished around me, I managed to retreat here and bar the entrance.',12,0,100,1,0,17494,0,40602,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(40429,4,0,'They slaughtered us with cold efficiency, but the true focus of their interest seemed to be the eggs kept here in the Sanctum.',12,0,100,1,0,17495,0,40603,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(40429,5,0,'The commander of the forces on the ground here is a cruel brute named Zarithrian, but I fear there are greater powers at work.',12,0,100,1,0,17496,0,40604,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(40429,6,0,'In their initial assault, I caught a glimpse of their true leader, a fearsome full-grown twilight dragon.',12,0,100,1,0,17497,0,40605,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(40429,7,0,'I know not the extent of their plans, heroes, but I know this:  They cannot be allowed to succeed!',12,0,100,5,0,17498,0,40606,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(40429,8,0,'Help! I am trapped within this tree!  I require aid!',14,0,100,5,0,17490,0,40598,0,'Sanctum Guardian Xerestrasza'),(18744,0,1,'Will you stop--',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,15825,0,'Aurosalia'),(18744,0,0,'Stop!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,15824,0,'Aurosalia'),(18146,0,0,'%s inclines his head slightly to the pair of guardians in greeting.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14811,0,'Champion Vranesh'),(18146,1,0,'%s arches a sculpted brow at the guards, a disapproving scowl on his face.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14808,0,'Champion Vranesh'),(18146,2,0,'%s glances from guard to guard.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14809,0,'Champion Vranesh'),(18146,3,0,'%s surveys the small ranger practice ground with a condescending smirk.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14810,0,'Champion Vranesh'),(16222,0,0,'Glory to the Sun K-- ah... Silvermoon!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14807,0,'Silvermoon City Guardian'),(16222,1,0,'Our lives are yours, Blood Knight.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14791,0,'Silvermoon City Guardian'),(21873,0,0,'By Nazjatar\'s Depths! ',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,16711,0,'Coilfang Guardian'),(21873,0,1,'Die, warmblood!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,16710,0,'Coilfang Guardian'),(21873,0,2,'For the Master!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,16708,0,'Coilfang Guardian'),(21873,0,3,'Illidan reigns! ',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,16709,0,'Coilfang Guardian'),(21873,0,4,'My blood is like venom!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,16712,0,'Coilfang Guardian'),(29308,0,0,'The hum of magic energy in the air diminishes...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,32345,0,'prince taldaram SAY_1'),(29308,1,0,'Intruders! Who trespasses in the Old Kingdom?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32350,0,'prince taldaram SAY_WARNING'),(29308,2,0,'I will feast on your remains!',14,0,100,0,0,14360,0,31895,0,'prince taldaram SAY_AGGRO'),(29308,3,0,'Bin dorei am\'ovel!',14,0,100,0,0,14365,0,31900,0,'prince taldaram SAY_SLAY_0'),(29308,3,1,'I will drink no blood before its time.',14,0,100,0,0,14366,0,31901,0,'prince taldaram SAY_SLAY_1'),(29308,3,2,'One final... embrace.',14,0,100,0,0,14367,0,31902,0,'prince taldaram SAY_SLAY_2'),(29308,4,0,'Still I hunger. Still... I... thirst.',14,0,100,0,0,14368,0,31903,0,'prince taldaram SAY_DEATH'),(29308,5,0,'So... appetizing.',14,0,100,0,0,14363,0,31898,0,'prince taldaram SAY_FEED1'),(29308,5,1,'Fresh, warm blood... it has been too long.',14,0,100,0,0,14364,0,31899,0,'prince taldaram SAY_FEED2'),(29308,6,0,'Your heartbeat is... music to my ears.',14,0,100,0,0,14361,0,31896,0,'prince taldaram SAY_VANISH1'),(29308,6,1,'I am nowhere.... I am everywhere. I am the watcher unseen.',14,0,100,0,0,14362,0,31897,0,'prince taldaram SAY_VANISH2'),(34064,0,0,'We did it, lads! We got here before Algalon\'s arrival. Maybe we can rig the systems to interfere with his analysis--',14,0,0,0,0,15824,0,34161,0,'Brann Bronzebeard - SAY_BRANN_ALGALON_INTRO_1'),(34064,1,0,'I\'ll head back to the Archivum and see if I can jam his signal. I might be able to buy us some time while you take care of him.',12,0,0,19,0,15825,0,34029,0,'Brann Bronzebeard - SAY_BRANN_ALGALON_INTRO_2'),(34064,2,0,'I know just the place. Will you be all right?',14,0,0,6,0,15823,0,34017,0,'Brann Bronzebeard - SAY_BRANN_ALGALON_OUTRO'),(32871,0,0,'Translocation complete. Commencing planetary analysis of Azeroth.',12,0,0,0,0,15405,0,34026,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_INTRO_1'),(32871,1,0,'Stand back, mortals. I\'m not here to fight you.',12,0,0,0,0,15406,0,34027,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_INTRO_2'),(32871,2,0,'It is in the universe\'s best interest to re-originate this planet should my analysis find systemic corruption. Do not interfere.',12,0,0,0,0,15407,0,34028,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_INTRO_3'),(32871,3,0,'Your actions are illogical. All possible results for this encounter have been calculated. The Pantheon will receive the Observer\'s message regardless of outcome.',14,0,0,0,0,15386,0,33995,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_START_TIMER'),(32871,4,0,'See your world through my eyes: A universe so vast as to be immeasurable - incomprehensible even to your greatest minds.',14,0,0,1,0,15390,0,33998,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_AGGRO'),(32871,5,0,'The stars come to my aid!',14,0,0,0,0,15392,0,33245,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_COLLAPSING_STAR'),(32871,6,0,'%s begins to Summon Collapsing Stars!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,33244,3,'Algalon the Observer - EMOTE_ALGALON_COLLAPSING_STAR'),(32871,7,0,'Witness the fury of the cosmos!',14,0,0,0,0,15396,0,33269,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALONG_BIG_BANG'),(32871,8,0,'%s begins to cast Big Bang!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,34465,3,'Algalon the Observer - EMOTE_ALGALON_BIG_BANG'),(32871,9,0,'You are out of time.',14,0,0,0,0,15394,0,34001,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_ASCEND'),(32871,10,0,'%s begins to cast Cosmic Smash!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,34500,3,'Algalon the Observer - EMOTE_ALGALON_COSMIC_SMASH'),(32871,11,0,'Behold the tools of creation!',14,0,0,0,0,15397,0,33994,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_PHASE_TWO'),(32871,12,0,'I have seen worlds bathed in the Makers\' flames, their denizens fading without as much as a whimper. Entire planetary systems born and razed in the time that it takes your mortal hearts to beat once. Yet all throughout, my own heart devoid of emotion... of empathy. I. Have. Felt. Nothing. A million-million lives wasted. Had they all held within them your tenacity? Had they all loved life as you do?',14,0,0,1,0,15393,0,34000,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_OUTRO_1'),(32871,13,0,'Perhaps it is your imperfections... that which grants you free will... that allows you to persevere against all cosmically calculated odds. You prevail where the Titan\'s own perfect creations have failed.',14,0,0,1,0,15401,0,34012,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_OUTRO_2'),(32871,14,0,'I\'ve rearranged the reply code - your planet will be spared. I cannot be certain of my own calculations anymore.',14,0,0,1,0,15402,0,34013,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_OUTRO_3'),(32871,15,0,'I lack the strength to transmit the signal. You must... hurry... find a place of power... close to the skies.',14,0,0,1,0,15403,0,34016,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_OUTRO_4'),(32871,16,0,'Do not worry about my fate, Bronzen. If the signal is not transmitted in time, re-origination will proceed regardless. Save... your world...',14,0,0,1,0,15404,0,34018,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_OUTRO_5'),(32871,17,0,'Analysis complete. There is partial corruption in the planet\'s life-support systems as well as complete corruption in most of the planet\'s defense mechanisms.',12,0,0,0,0,15398,0,34006,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_DESPAWN_1'),(32871,18,0,'Begin uplink: Reply Code: \'Omega.\' Planetary re-origination requested.',12,0,0,0,0,15399,0,34014,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_DESPAWN_2'),(32871,19,0,'Farewell, mortals. Your bravery is admirable, for such flawed creatures.',12,0,0,0,0,15400,0,34015,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_DESPAWN_3'),(32871,20,0,'Loss of life unavoidable.',14,0,0,0,0,15387,0,33996,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_KILL'),(32871,20,1,'I do what I must.',14,0,0,0,0,15388,0,33997,3,'Algalon the Observer - SAY_ALGALON_KILL'),(37813,14,0,'%s\'s Blood Beasts gain the scent of blood!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,38631,0,'Deathbringer Saurfang - EMOTE_SCENT_OF_BLOOD'),(16577,0,0,'Brothers and sisters, I have been to the promised land. I have tasted in the sublime energy. I have felt bliss - bliss so engrossing and all encompassing that I was left wondering if I had stumbled upon the dreams of gods.',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,12698,0,'Martik Tor\'seldoi'),(16577,1,0,'In paradise, you merely reach out and take from the Nether.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,12703,0,'Martik Tor\'seldoi'),(16577,2,0,'From the very air! Tendrils of arcane energy light up the obsidian sky as plumes of raw magic rise up from fissures in the land. Kneel and drink from the fissure as you do from a stream or well. Pluck a tendril from the heavens as if it were an apple hanging from a branch.',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,12706,0,'Martik Tor\'seldoi'),(16578,0,0,'Tell us more, Martik. What is it? What does it feel like?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,12700,0,'Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(16578,1,0,'But how?',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,12704,0,'Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(16578,2,0,'%s gasps.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,12707,0,'Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(36478,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Soulguard Watchman'),(17226,0,0,'Ok, let\'s go.  I know just the perfect spot!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13589,0,'Viera Sunwhisper'),(17226,1,0,'I can\'t wait to try this wine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13590,0,'Viera Sunwhisper'),(17226,2,0,'What... is happening... to me?  Get this cat away from me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13591,0,'Viera Sunwhisper'),(17226,3,0,'Viera Sunwhisper scurries away, attempting to flee from Twinkle.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13610,0,'Viera Sunwhisper'),(17230,0,0,'Twinkle looks at Viera Sunwhisper with very hungry eyes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13595,0,'Twinkle'),(36764,0,0,'You\'re a beautiful sight... you have no idea.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37269,0,'Alliance Slave'),(36764,0,1,'%s lets his mining pick drag on the ground as she approaches, clearly exhausted.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37284,0,'Alliance Slave'),(36764,0,2,'I owe you a long night of drinking, my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37263,0,'Alliance Slave'),(36764,0,3,'If by life or death I can repay you, I will.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37287,0,'Alliance Slave'),(36764,0,4,'I\'m going to return to the front of the quarry. Kill a few extra for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37294,0,'Alliance Slave'),(36765,0,0,'You\'re a beautiful sight... you have no idea.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37269,0,'Alliance Slave'),(36765,0,1,'%s lets his mining pick drag on the ground as she approaches, clearly exhaust