e front of the quarry. Kill a few extra for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37294,0,'Horde Slave'),(36771,0,0,'You\'re a beautiful sight... you have no idea.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37269,0,'Horde Slave'),(36771,0,1,'%s lets his mining pick drag on the ground as she approaches, clearly exhausted.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37284,0,'Horde Slave'),(36771,0,2,'I owe you a long night of drinking, my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37263,0,'Horde Slave'),(36771,0,3,'If by life or death I can repay you, I will.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37287,0,'Horde Slave'),(36771,0,4,'I\'m going to return to the front of the quarry. Kill a few extra for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37294,0,'Horde Slave'),(36772,0,0,'You\'re a beautiful sight... you have no idea.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37269,0,'Horde Slave'),(36772,0,1,'%s lets his mining pick drag on the ground as she approaches, clearly exhausted.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37284,0,'Horde Slave'),(36772,0,2,'I owe you a long night of drinking, my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37263,0,'Horde Slave'),(36772,0,3,'If by life or death I can repay you, I will.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37287,0,'Horde Slave'),(36772,0,4,'I\'m going to return to the front of the quarry. Kill a few extra for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37294,0,'Horde Slave'),(36773,0,0,'You\'re a beautiful sight... you have no idea.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37269,0,'Horde Slave'),(36773,0,1,'%s lets his mining pick drag on the ground as she approaches, clearly exhausted.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37284,0,'Horde Slave'),(36773,0,2,'I owe you a long night of drinking, my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37263,0,'Horde Slave'),(36773,0,3,'If by life or death I can repay you, I will.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37287,0,'Horde Slave'),(36773,0,4,'I\'m going to return to the front of the quarry. Kill a few extra for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37294,0,'Horde Slave'),(26902,0,0,'How dare you summon me without an offering!',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,26098,0,'Essence of Warlord Jin\'arrak'),(36494,0,0,'Tiny creatures under feet, you bring Garfrost something good to eat!',14,0,100,0,0,16912,0,37218,0,'Forgemaster Garfrost'),(36494,1,0,'Axe too weak. Garfrost make better and CRUSH YOU.',14,0,100,0,0,16916,0,36445,0,'Forgemaster Garfrost'),(36494,2,0,'Garfrost tired of puny mortals. Now your bones will freeze!',14,0,100,0,0,16917,0,36444,0,'Forgemaster Garfrost'),(36494,3,0,'Garfrost hope giant underpants clean. Save boss great shame. For later.',14,0,100,0,0,16915,0,37221,0,'Forgemaster Garfrost'),(36494,4,0,'Will save for snack. For later.',14,0,100,0,0,16913,0,37219,0,'Forgemaster Garfrost'),(36494,4,1,'That one maybe not so good to eat now. Stupid Garfrost! BAD! BAD!',14,0,100,0,0,16914,0,37220,0,'Forgemaster Garfrost'),(36494,5,0,'%s hurls a massive saronite boulder at you!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,37438,0,'Forgemaster Garfrost'),(36494,6,0,'%s casts |cFF00AACCDeep Freeze|r at $n.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,37260,0,'Forgemaster Garfrost'),(33134,5,1,'Powerless to act....',14,0,100,0,0,15778,0,34349,0,'Sara - SAY_SARA_KILL'),(33134,5,0,'Could they have been saved?',14,0,100,0,0,15779,0,34350,0,'Sara - SAY_SARA_KILL'),(33134,4,0,'Let hatred and rage guide your blows!',14,0,100,0,0,15774,0,34345,0,'SAY_SARA_BLESSING_HIT'),(33134,3,0,'Yes! YES! Show them no mercy! Give no pause to your attacks!',14,0,100,0,0,15773,0,34344,0,'Sara - SAY_SARA_FERVOR_HIT'),(33134,2,0,'The time to strike at the head of the beast will soon be upon us! Focus your anger and hatred on his minions!',14,0,100,457,0,15775,0,34346,0,'Sara - SAY_SARA_AGGRO'),(33134,1,0,'What do you want from me? Leave me alone!',14,0,100,0,0,15772,0,34343,0,'Sara - SAY_SARA_ULDUAR_SCREAM_2'),(33134,0,0,'HELP ME! Please get them off of me!',14,0,100,0,0,15771,0,34342,0,'Sara - SAY_SARA_ULDUAR_SCREAM_1'),(9816,0,0,'%s begins to regain its strength!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5565,0,'Pyroguard Emberseer'),(9816,1,0,'%s is nearly at full strength!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5566,0,'Pyroguard Emberseer'),(9816,2,0,'%s regains its power and breaks free of its bonds!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5567,0,'Pyroguard Emberseer'),(9816,3,0,'Ha! Ha! Ha! Thank you for freeing me, fools. Now let me repay you by charring the flesh from your bones.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5268,0,'Pyroguard Emberseer'),(9693,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(9818,0,0,'%s begins to summon in a Blackhand Veteran!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5613,0,'Blackhand Summoner'),(9096,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Rage Talon Dragonspawn'),(4983,0,0,'I noticed some fire on that island over there. A human, too. Let\'s go check it out, $n.',12,1,0,0,0,0,0,1669,0,'Ogron'),(4983,1,0,'That\'s Reethe alright. Let\'s go see what he has to say, yeah?',12,1,0,0,0,0,0,1670,0,'Ogron'),(4980,0,0,'W-what do you want? Just leave me alone...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1674,0,'Paval'),(4980,1,0,'I swear, I didn\'t steal anything from you! Here, take some of my supplies, just go away!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,1675,0,'Paval'),(4983,2,0,'Just tell us what you know about the Shady Rest Inn, and I won\'t bash your skull in.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1707,0,'Ogron'),(4980,2,0,'I... Well, I may of taken a little thing or two from the inn... but what would an ogre care about that?',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,1708,0,'Paval'),(4983,3,0,'Look here, if you don\'t tell me about the fire--',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1709,0,'Ogron'),(4980,3,0,'Not one step closer, ogre!',12,0,0,25,0,0,0,1710,0,'Paval'),(4980,4,0,'And I don\'t know anything about this fire of yours...',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,1711,0,'Paval'),(4980,5,0,'What was that? Did you hear something?',12,0,0,6,0,0,0,1731,0,'Paval'),(5046,0,0,'Paval Reethe! Found you at last. And consorting with ogres now? No fear, even deserters and traitors are afforded some mercy.',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,1714,0,'Caldwell'),(5046,1,0,'Private, show Lieutenant Reethe some mercy.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,1720,0,'Caldwell'),(5045,0,0,'Gladly, sir.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1721,0,'Hallan'),(4980,6,0,'%s staggers backwards as the arrow lodges itself deeply in his chest.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,1732,0,'Paval'),(4980,7,0,'Ugh... Hallan, didn\'t think you had it in you...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1722,0,'Paval'),(5046,2,0,'Now, let\'s clean up the rest of the trash, men!',12,0,0,25,0,0,0,1723,0,'Caldwell'),(4983,4,0,'Damn it! You\'d better not die on me, human!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1724,0,'Ogron'),(4983,5,0,'Still with us, Reethe?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1726,0,'Ogron'),(4980,8,0,'Must be your lucky day. Alright, I\'ll talk. Just leave me alone. Look, you\'re not going to believe me, but it wa... oh, Light, looks like the girl could shoot...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1725,0,'Paval'),(4983,6,0,'Looks dead to me. Not much use to us like this. You\'d better go back and tell Krog what happened.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1729,0,'Ogron'),(4983,7,0,'By the way, thanks for watching my back.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1730,0,'Ogron'),(28328,0,0,'The only thing hurt is your pride, lad. Buck up!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,27765,0,'Drostan to Lucky Wilhelm'),(28328,0,1,'Stop whining. You\'ve still got your luck.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,27764,0,'Drostan to Lucky Wilhelm'),(28328,0,2,'Bah, it\'s an improvement.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27762,0,'Drostan to Lucky Wilhelm'),(28328,0,3,'Calm down, lad, it\'s just birdshot!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27761,0,'Drostan to Lucky Wilhelm'),(28054,0,0,'Not the \'stache! Now I\'m asymmetrical!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27755,0,'Lucky Wilhelm'),(28054,0,1,'Ouch! That\'s it, I quit the target business!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27757,0,'Lucky Wilhelm'),(28054,0,2,'My ear! You grazed my ear!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27756,0,'Lucky Wilhelm'),(28054,1,0,'Good shot!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,27778,0,'Lucky Wilhelm'),(26421,1,0,'Breaking off a piece of its bark, the %s hands it to you before departing.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26041,0,'emote text'),(26421,0,0,'The %s is angered by your request and attacks!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26042,0,'emote text'),(26321,0,0,'The %s gives you its thanks.',16,0,100,0,0,1525,0,26039,0,'Lothalor Ancient'),(17893,0,0,'Hey!  Over here!  Yeah, over here... I\'m in this cage!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14668,0,'Naturalist Bite'),(17959,0,5,'Get back to work you!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(17957,0,0,'Intrudersss with the prisssoner!  Kill them!!!',1