00,0,0,0,0,14308,0,'Image of Medivh'),(23564,0,0,'%s loses all self control and begins to attack friend and foe alike!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23081,0,'Plagued Dragonflayer Tribesman'),(24199,0,0,'%s loses all self control and begins to attack friend and foe alike!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23081,0,'Plagued Dragonflayer Handler'),(34723,0,2,'Ware da ship! A harpy! ...wait, dat be another bird.',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,35028,0,'Watcher Tolwe - Random'),(34723,0,3,'Dere be a bird!',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,35026,0,'Watcher Tolwe - Random'),(34715,0,0,'And there\'s Orgrimmar, huge and menacing like always. Take a quick break, boys, then it\'s back to the Bluff!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,35030,0,'Sky-Captain Blastnut - Dock at Orgrimmar'),(34715,1,0,'Next stop, Thunder Bluff!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,35031,0,'Sky-Captain Blastnut - Leave for Thunder Bluff'),(34715,2,0,'Watch your step! Don\'t want you becoming a smudge down there. Welcome to Thunder Bluff!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,35032,0,'Sky-Captain Blastnut - Dock at Thunder Bluff'),(34715,3,0,'Okay, boys, let\'s get this baby over to Orgrimmar!',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,35033,0,'Sky-Captain Blastnut - Leave for Orgrimmar'),(34721,0,0,'Move it, Zippik! We don\'t have all day!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,35037,0,'Chief Officer Ograh - Leave for Thunder Bluff'),(34721,1,0,'Careful. CAREFUL! Did I feel a shudder? You\'re going to knock that tower down, oaf!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,35034,0,'Chief Officer Ograh - Dock at Orgrimmar & Thunder Bluff'),(34721,2,0,'We\'re behind schedule! Turn this tub east! EAST!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,35035,0,'Chief Officer Ograh - Leave for Orgrimmar'),(34766,0,0,'Step right up! The zeppelin to Orgrimmar has arrived! All aboard to Durotar!',14,0,100,22,0,11804,0,35041,0,'Krendle Bigpockets - Dock at Thunder Bluff'),(34765,1,0,'The zeppelin to Thunder Bluff has arrived! All aboard for a smooth ride across the Barrens!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zelli Hotnozzle'),(19216,0,0,'Friends, it is my great pleasure to welcome you to the temple today.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16735,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,1,0,'A\'dal has been most generous in his revelations to me, a humble servant of the Light.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16740,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,2,0,'In accordance with my divine calling, I must share these revealed truths to all who would hear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16741,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,3,0,'It has been made known to me that inside each of us, the Light resides...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16742,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,4,0,'...that it is a gift, given freely to all naturally born beings.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16743,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,5,0,'It manifests itself as a feeling, small at first and easily ignored, that confirms truths and subtly prods one to do good.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16752,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,6,0,'Simple kindnesses, charitable deeds, service to those in need. These are all fruits of the Light.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16753,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,7,0,'It rewards those who heed its promptings with blessings, both seen and unseen.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16754,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,8,0,'Personal reservoirs of hope and faith are strengthened, and one\'s capacity for greater light increases.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16755,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,9,0,'Over the course of time, through obedience to the Light\'s guidance, one becomes more sensitive to its voice, and its power.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,16756,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,10,0,'Great is the healing and blessing power of the Light\'s most diligent followers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16757,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,11,0,'Sadly, there are those who wander through mortality in defiance of the Light.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16761,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,12,0,'From these the Light withdraws, until only darkness remains.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16762,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,13,0,'Where there is no light, despair, loathing and rage thrive.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16763,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,14,0,'We are born into a perilous age, where the forces of darkness are determined to bring about our destruction.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16764,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,15,0,'These are the times to find yourselves in unison with the Light.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16765,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,16,0,'Hear my words, and let the Light inside of you confirm the truth of them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16766,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,17,0,'Embrace the light that is in you, my friends! Deny yourself all darkness...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16775,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(19216,18,0,'We must endure these trying times faithfully, and one day we will find ourselves victorious.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16776,0,'Grand Anchorite Almonen'),(17379,0,0,'%s urges you to follow him.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13867,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Akida'),(17379,1,0,'%s points to the totem of Coo.',16,0,100,25,0,0,0,13868,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Akida'),(17391,0,0,'%s motions for you to follow him.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13869,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Coo'),(17391,1,0,'[Furbolg] Ritk kin\'chikx azul azure summit...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13870,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Coo'),(17391,2,0,'[Furbolg] Coo xip fly... Jump ilos river. Find Tikti.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13871,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Coo'),(17410,0,0,'[Furbolg] Bear witness to the savage acts of our adversaries, $n. They steal our young... our weak... Imprisoned here, they are left to the devices of the Bristlelimb. Set them free, Promised One!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13950,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Vark'),(17071,0,0,'This is great news!  Your efforts have indeed saved us, $n!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,12846,0,'Technician Zhanaa'),(16550,0,0,'By the seven Ata\'mal crystals!  Others have survived the crash!  Zhanaa, is that you?  It is so good to see you again!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,12845,0,'Image of Technician Dyvuun'),(16550,1,0,'And who do we have here?  No doubt th... crzzzk ...ade this communication possible?  I give you greetings fro... psshzzzk... Azure Watch.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,12752,0,'Image of Technician Dyvuun'),(16550,2,0,'Judging by your signal, we put you... ust southeast of the larger part of the island we crashed onto.  Cross the Crystalbrook River to ge... kshhhhk zzzt. Sorry, there\'s a lot of stat...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,12753,0,'Image of Technician Dyvuun'),(17392,0,0,'%s asks that you follow him.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13874,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Tikti'),(17392,1,0,'[Furbolg] Far you mixik tak come. Gaze upon the kitch\'kal river. Follow. Ilog to Yor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13873,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Tikti'),(17392,2,0,'[Furbolg] Go... Search yitix\'kil bottom river. South!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13875,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Tikti'),(26045,0,0,'You will not master me, puny $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25149,0,'Storm Tempest'),(23602,0,0,'It\'s good to see you defending Theramore with pride, friend.',12,7,100,25,0,0,0,22050,0,'Deserter Agitator'),(23602,0,1,'When you\'re off duty, let\'s go to the inn. I\'ll buy a round and we can reminisce about the good old days.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,22051,0,'Deserter Agitator'),(23602,0,2,'Wouldn\'t you like to bring those days back? I have some friends who know just the way to do that...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,22052,0,'Deserter Agitator'),(23602,1,0,'These people will know Admiral Proudmoore for the true hero he was!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,22048,0,'Deserter Agitator'),(23602,1,1,'You can\'t stop us from exposing the truth about Jaina\'s cowardice!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,22047,0,'Deserter Agitator'),(23602,1,2,'If you think you can stop us, you\'re mistaken, \'friend.\'',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,22046,0,'Deserter Agitator'),(23602,1,3,'It\'s people like you who weaken the Alliance and invite the Horde to take away all we\'ve fought for!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,22049,0,'Deserter Agitator'),(17888,0,0,'Cry for mercy! Your meaningless lives will soon be forfeit!',14,0,100,0,0,11015,0,18240,0,'Kazrogal - SAY_INTRO'),(17888,1,0,'Your death will be a painful one.',14,0,100,0,0,11016,0,18241,0,'Kazrogal - SAY_MARK_1'),(17888,1,1,'You... are marked.',14,0,100,0,0,11052,0,18242,0,'Kazrogal - SAY_MARK_2'),(17888,2,0,'Shaza-kiel!',14,0,100,0,0,11017,0,18243,0,'Kazrogal - SAY_SLAY_1'),(17888,2,1,'You are nothing!',14,0,100,0,0,11053,0,18244,0,'Kazrogal - SAY_SLAY_2'),(17888,2,2,'Miserable nuisance!',14,0,100,0,0,11054,0,18245,0,'Kazrogal - SAY_SLAY_3'),(17842,0,0,'Abandon all hope! The Legion has returned to finish what was begun so many years ago. This time, there will be no escape!',14,0,100,0,0,10999,0,18247,0,'Azgalor - SAY_INTRO'),(17842,1,0,'Suffer, you despicable insect!',14,0,100,0,0,11000,0,18251,0,'Azgalor - SAY_DOOM_1'),(17842,1,1,'Just a taste... of what awaits you.',14,0,100,0,0,11046,0,18252,0,'Azgalor - SAY_DOOM_2'),(17808,2,1,'Pestilence upon you!',14,0,100,0,0,11037,0,18234,0,'Anetheron - SAY_SWARM_2'),(17808,3,0,'Let fire rain from above!',14,0,100,0,0,10980,0,18235,0,'Anetheron - SAY_INFERNO_1'),(17808,3,1,'Earth and sky shall burn!',14,0,100,0,0,11036,0,18236,0,'Anetheron - SAY_INFERNO_2'),(17808,4,0,'Your hopes are lost!',14,0,100,0,0,10981,0,18237,0,'Anetheron - SAY_SLAY_1'),(17808,4,1,'Scream for me.',14,0,100,0,0,11038,0,18238,0,'Anetheron - SAY_SLAY_2'),(17808,4,2,'Pity, no time for a slow death!',14,0,100,0,0,11039,0,18239,0,'Anetheron - SAY_SLAY_3'),(17808,5,0,'The clock... is still... ticking.',14,0,100,0,0,10982,0,18229,0,'Anetheron - SAY_DEATH'),(17767,1,1,'Ashes to ashes, dust to dust!',14,0,100,0,0,11055,0,18223,0,'Rage Winterchill - SAY_DECAY_2'),(17767,2,0,'Succumb to the icy chill... of death.',14,0,100,0,0,11024,0,18224,0,'Rage Winterchill - SAY_NOVA_1'),(17767,2,1,'It will be much colder in your grave.',14,0,100,0,0,11058,0,18225,0,'Rage Winterchill - SAY_NOVA_2'),(17767,3,0,'All life must perish!',14,0,100,0,0,11025,0,18226,0,'Rage Winterchill - SAY_SLAY_1'),(17767,3,1,'Your world is ours now!',14,0,100,0,0,11056,0,18227,0,'Rage Winterchill - SAY_SLAY_2'),(17767,3,2,'Victory to the Legion!',14,0,100,0,0,11057,0,18228,0,'Rage Winterchill - SAY_SLAY_3'),(17767,4,0,'You have won this battle, but not... the... war.',14,0,100,0,0,11026,0,18220,0,'Rage Winterchill - SAY_DEATH'),(17808,0,0,'You are defenders of a doomed world! Flee here, and perhaps you will prolong your pathetic lives!',14,0,100,0,0,10977,0,18230,0,'Anetheron - SAY_INTRO'),(17808,1,0,'You look tired....',14,0,100,0,0,10978,0,18231,0,'Anetheron - SAY_SLEEP_1'),(17808,1,1,'Sweet dreams.',14,0,100,0,0,11545,0,18232,0,'Anetheron - SAY_SLEEP_2'),(17968,5,2,'I am the coming of the end!',14,0,100,0,0,11045,0,18266,0,'Archimonde - SAY_SLAY_3'),(17968,5,1,'All creation will be devoured.',14,0,100,0,0,11044,0,18265,0,'Archimonde - SAY_SLAY_2'),(17968,5,0,'Your soul will languish for eternity.',14,0,100,0,0,10991,0,18264,0,'Archimonde - SAY_SLAY_1'),(17968,4,1,'Manach sheek-thrish!',14,0,100,0,0,11041,0,18263,0,'Archimonde - SAY_DOOMFIRE_2'),(17968,4,0,'This world will burn!',14,0,100,0,0,10990,0,18262,0,'Archimonde - SAY_DOOMFIRE_1'),(17968,3,1,'Away, vermin!',14,0,100,0,0,11043,0,18261,0,'Archimonde - SAY_AIR_BURST_2'),(17968,2,1,'Bow to my will.',14,0,100,0,0,11042,0,18259,0,'Archimonde - SAY_CHARM_2'),(17968,3,0,'A-kreesh!',14,0,100,0,0,10989,0,18260,0,'Archimonde - SAY_AIR_BURST_1'),(17968,2,0,'You are mine now.',14,0,100,0,0,10988,0,18258,0,'Archimonde - SAY_CHARM_1'),(17968,1,0,'Your resistance is insignificant.',14,0,100,0,0,10987,0,18257,0,'Archimonde - SAY_AGGRO'),(30840,1,1,'Say hello to my little friend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31486,0,'Munch arrival'),(30840,2,2,'Arise, Melt!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31487,0,'Summon Melts'),(30840,3,3,'We\'re done here. I\'m out.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31488,0,'Munch oppening portal'),(30839,1,1,'Too weak to finish your own battles? Very well then...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31489,0,'Jayde arrival'),(30839,2,2,'Anything else you need help with before I go? Right, I thought not...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31490,0,'Oppens portal and dissapears'),(30838,1,1,'You challenge death itself! Come then, \"King.\" Face the might of Mograine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31455,0,'Mograine\"s arrival'),(30838,2,1,'I will see you back at the Valley of Echoes. Suffer well, ally.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31456,0,'Opens portal'),(27003,0,0,'I know why you\'ve come - one of those foolish Magnataur on the plains meddled and managed to get the dragons involved.  Do you enjoy serving them like a dog?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26544,0,'Dregmar Runebrand - yell'),(27003,1,0,'You seek their leader... little thing, you wage war against the clans of Grom\'thar the Thunderbringer himself.  Don\'t be so eager to rush to your death.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26186,0,'Dregmar Runebrand yell'),(27003,2,0,'Hah!  So be it.  Blow the horn of a magnataur leader at the ring of torches south of the Blue Dragonshrine.  Make peace with your gods... Grom\'thar will come.  ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26187,0,'Dregmar Runebrand yell'),(27482,0,0,'I\'d nearly given up. You\'ve given me new life!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,26684,0,'Wounded Westfall Infantry say text'),(27482,0,1,'Bless you, friend. I nearly expired....',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,26682,0,'Wounded Westfall Infantry say text'),(27482,0,2,'Without your help, I surely would have died....',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,26685,0,'Wounded Westfall Infantry say text'),(27482,0,3,'Thank you, $r!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,26683,0,'Wounded Westfall Infantry say text'),(28041,0,0,'Careful here, $c. These trolls killed their own snake god!',15,0,50,0,0,0,0,27449,0,'Argent Soldier whisper text'),(28041,0,1,'Watch your back. These Drakkari are a nasty lot.',15,0,50,0,0,0,0,27448,0,'Argent Soldier whisper text'),(28041,0,2,'These Drakkari are just bad news. We need to leave and head to Justice Keep!',15,0,50,0,0,0,0,27452,0,'Argent Soldier whisper text'),(28041,0,3,'See you around.',15,0,50,0,0,0,0,27447,0,'Argent Soldier whisper text'),(28041,0,4,'I wonder where we\'re headed to. And who\'s going to deal with these guys?',15,0,50,0,0,0,0,27451,0,'Argent Soldier whisper text'),(28041,0,5,'Right. I\'d better get back to the sergeant then.',15,0,50,0,0,0,0,27446,0,'Argent Soldier whisper text'),(28041,0,6,'$n? I heard you were dead.',15,0,50,0,0,0,0,35005,0,'Argent Soldier whisper text'),(22019,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Kolphis Darkscale'),(26076,0,0,'What is the meaning of this?! I have not yet finished my feast!',14,0,100,1,1000,0,0,24586,0,'Nafarset on activation'),(30461,0,0,'%s lets out a bellowing roar as she descends upon the nest.',16,0,100,15,0,0,0,31158,0,'Veranus'),(30462,0,0,'Look out below!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31159,0,'Thorim'),(30462,1,0,'Easy there, girl!  Don\'t you recognize your old master?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31160,0,'Thorim'),(30462,2,0,'I will see you at the Temple of Storms.  Looks like I\'m going to have to break her in again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31161,0,'Thorim'),(2768,9,0,'Doctor Draxlegauge will give you further instructions, $n. Many thanks for your help!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,890,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe - SAY_PROGRESS_9'),(34996,1,0,'Hailing from the deepest, darkest caverns of the Storm Peaks, Gormok the Impaler! Battle on, heroes!',14,0,100,0,0,16038,0,35710,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Summing Gormok the Impaler'),(34996,2,0,'Steel yourselves, heroes, for the twin terrors, Acidmaw and Dreadscale, enter the arena!',14,0,100,0,0,16039,0,35711,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Summing Acidmaw and Dreadscale'),(34996,3,0,'The air itself freezes with the introduction of our next combatant, Icehowl! Kill or be killed, champions!',14,0,100,0,0,16040,0,35712,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring Summing Icehowl'),(34996,4,0,'The monstrous menagerie has been vanquished!',14,0,100,0,0,16041,0,35713,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Northrend Beasts Done'),(34996,5,0,'Tragic... They fought valiantly, but the beasts of Northrend triumphed. Let us observe a moment of silence for our fallen heroes.',14,0,0,0,0,16042,0,35714,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Northrend Beasts FAIL'),(34996,6,0,'Grand Warlock Wilfred Fizzlebang will summon forth your next challenge. Stand by for his entry.',14,0,100,0,0,16043,0,35715,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Summing Wilfred Fizzlebang'),(34996,7,0,'Quickly, heroes, destroy the demon lord before it can open a portal to its twisted demonic realm!',14,0,100,5,0,16044,0,35716,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring to Wilfred Fizzlebang - Lord Jaraxxus Intro'),(34996,8,0,'The loss of Wilfred Fizzlebang, while unfortunate, should be a lesson to those that dare dabble in dark magic. Alas, you are victorious and now must face the next challenge.',14,0,100,0,0,16045,0,35717,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Lord Jaraxxus Outro'),(34996,9,0,'Everyone calm down! Compose yourselves! There is no conspiracy at play here! The warlock acted on his own volition, outside of influences from the Alliance. The tournament must go on!',14,0,100,5,0,16046,0,35718,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Lord Jaraxxus Outro'),(34996,10,0,'The next battle will be against the Argent Crusade\'s most powerful knights! Only by defeating them will you be deemed worthy...',14,0,100,0,0,16047,0,35719,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Faction Champions Intro'),(34996,11,0,'Very well. I will allow it. Fight with honor!',14,0,100,1,0,16048,0,35720,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Faction Champions Intro'),(34996,12,0,'A shallow and tragic victory. We are weaker as a whole from the losses suffered today. Who but the Lich King could benefit from such foolishness? Great warriors have lost their lives. And for what? The true threat looms ahead - the Lich King awaits us all in death.',14,0,100,0,0,16049,0,35721,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Faction Champions Outro'),(34996,13,0,'Only by working together will you overcome the final challenge. From the depths of Icecrown come two of the Scourge\'s most powerful lieutenants: fearsome val\'kyr, winged harbingers of the Lich King!',14,0,100,0,0,16050,0,35722,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Twin Val\'kyr Intro'),(34996,14,0,'Let the games begin!',14,0,100,0,0,16037,0,35709,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Twin Val\'kyr Intro'),(34996,15,0,'A mighty blow has been dealt to the Lich King! You have proven yourselves as able bodied champions of the Argent Crusade. Together we will strike against Icecrown Citadel and destroy what remains of the Scourge! There is no challenge that we cannot face united!',14,0,100,5,0,16051,0,35723,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring - Anub\'arak Intro'),(34996,16,0,'Arthas! You are hopelessly outnumbered! Lay down Frostmourne and I will grant you a just death.',14,0,100,25,0,16052,0,35724,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(34995,3,0,'Show them no mercy, Horde champions! LOK\'TAR OGAR! ',14,0,0,0,0,16022,0,35701,0,'Garrosh - Faction Champions Intro'),(34995,2,0,'The Horde demands justice! We challenge the Alliance! Allow us to battle in place of your knights, paladin. We will show these dogs what it means to insult the Horde.',14,0,100,1,0,16023,0,35703,0,'Garrosh Hellscream - Faction Champions Intro'),(34995,1,0,'Treacherous Alliance dogs! You summon a demon lord against warriors of the Horde? Your deaths will be swift!',14,0,100,5,0,16021,0,35699,0,'Garrosh Hellscream - Lord Jaraxxus Outro'),(34995,0,0,'I\'ve seen more worthy challenges in the Ring of Blood. You waste our time, paladin.',14,0,100,1,0,16026,0,35707,0,'Garrosh Hellscream  - Northrend Beasts Outro'),(34990,6,3,'Worthless scrub.',14,0,100,25,0,16062,0,35686,0,'King Varian Wrynn  - Faction Champions Kill Player'),(34990,6,2,'Is this the best the Horde has to offer?',14,0,100,6,0,16063,0,35687,0,'King Varian Wrynn  - Faction Champions Kill Player'),(34990,6,1,'HAH!',14,0,100,5,0,16060,0,35684,0,'King Varian Wrynn - Faction Champions Kill Player'),(34990,6,0,'Hardly a challenge.',14,0,100,274,0,16061,0,35685,0,'King Varian Wrynn - Faction Champions Kill Player'),(34990,4,0,'GLORY TO THE ALLIANCE!',14,0,100,0,0,16067,0,35691,0,'King Varian Wrynn - Victory'),(34990,5,0,'Not even the Lich King\'s most powerful minions can stand against the Alliance. All hail our victors!',14,0,0,0,0,16068,0,35692,0,'King Varian Wrynn - Faction Champions Outro'),(34990,3,0,'Fight for the glory of the Alliance, heroes! Honor your king and your people!',14,0,100,5,0,16065,0,35689,0,'King Varian Wrynn - Faction Champions Intro'),(34990,2,0,'Our honor has been besmirched! They make wild claims and false accusations against us. I demand justice! Allow my champions to fight in place of your knights, Tirion. We challenge the Horde!',14,0,100,5,0,16066,0,35690,0,'King Varian Wrynn - Faction Champions Intro'),(34990,1,0,'The Alliance doesn\'t need the help of a demon lord to deal with Horde filth! Come, pig!',14,0,100,5,0,16064,0,35688,0,'King Varian Wrynn - Lord Jaraxxus Outro'),(34990,0,0,'Your beasts will be no match for my champions, Tirion!',14,0,0,0,0,16069,0,35693,0,'King Varian Wrynn - Northrend Beasts Outro'),(36095,0,0,'Champions, you\'re alive! Not only have you defeated every challenge of the Trial of the Crusader, but also thwarted Arthas\' plans! Your skill and cunning will prove to be a powerful weapon against the Scourge. Well done! Allow one of the Crusade\'s mages to transport you to the surface!',14,0,100,5,0,16053,0,36129,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(36095,1,0,'Let me hand you the chests as a reward, and let its contents will serve you faithfully in the campaign against Arthas in the heart of the Icecrown Citadel!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(34796,0,0,'My slaves! Destroy the enemy!',41,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gormok the Impaler - Snowball'),(35144,0,0,'Upon seeing its companion perish, %s becomes enraged!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36147,0,'Acidmaw to Beasts Controller - Enrage'),(34799,0,0,'Upon seeing its companion perish, %s becomes enraged!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36147,0,'Dreadscale to Beasts Controller - Enrage'),(34797,0,0,'%s glares at $n and lets out a bellowing roar!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35675,0,'Icehowl - Roar'),(34797,1,0,'%s crashes into the Coliseum wall and is stunned!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35317,0,'Icehowl - Fail'),(34797,2,0,'Trampling combatants underfoot, %s goes into a frothing rage!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35318,0,'Icehowl - Enrage'),(35458,0,0,'Thank you, Highlord. Now, challengers, I will begin the ritual of summoning. When I am done a fearsome doomguard will appear!',14,0,100,2,0,16268,0,35726,0,'Wilfred Fizzlebang - Intro'),(35458,1,0,'Prepare for oblivion!',14,0,100,0,0,16269,0,35727,0,'Wilfred Fizzlebang - Intro'),(35458,2,0,'A-HA! I\'ve done it! Behold the absolute power of Wilfred Fizzlebang, master summoner! You are bound to me, demon!',14,0,100,5,0,16270,0,35728,0,'Wilfred Fizzlebang to Wilfred Fizzlebang - Intro'),(35458,3,0,'But I\'m in charge here...',14,0,100,5,0,16271,0,35729,0,'Wilfred Fizzlebang to Wilfred Fizzlebang - Death'),(34780,0,0,'Trifling gnome! Your arrogance will be your undoing!',14,0,100,397,0,16143,0,35730,0,'Lord Jaraxxus to Wilfred Fizzlebang - Intro'),(34780,1,0,'You face Jaraxxus, Eredar Lord of the Burning Legion!',14,0,100,0,0,16144,0,35731,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Aggro'),(34780,2,0,'$n has |cFFFF0000Legion Flames!|r\n',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35194,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Legion Flame'),(34780,3,0,'%s creates a Nether Portal!',41,0,100,0,0,16150,0,35190,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Summing Nether Portal'),(34780,4,0,'Come forth, sister! Your master calls!',14,0,100,0,0,16150,0,35736,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Summoning Mistress of Pain'),(34780,5,0,'$n has |cFF00FFFFIncinerate Flesh!|r',41,0,100,0,0,16149,0,35195,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Incinerate Flesh'),(34780,6,0,'FLESH FROM BONE!',14,0,100,0,0,16149,0,35735,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Incinerate Flesh'),(34780,7,0,'%s creates an |cFF00FF00Infernal Volcano!|r',41,0,100,0,0,16151,0,35191,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Summoning Infernal Volcano emote'),(34780,8,0,'IN-FER-NO!',14,0,100,0,0,16151,0,35737,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Summoning Infernals'),(34780,9,0,'Insignificant gnat!',14,0,0,0,0,16145,0,35732,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Killing a player'),(34780,9,1,'Banished to the Nether!',14,0,0,0,0,16146,0,35733,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Killing a player'),(34780,10,0,'Another will take my place. Your world is doomed...',14,0,100,0,0,16147,0,35734,0,'Lord Jaraxxus - Death'),(34780,11,0,'%s goes into a berserker rag