aste of what the future brings. FOR THE HORDE!',14,0,100,1,0,16024,0,35705,0,'Garrosh Hellscream - Faction Champions Victory'),(34995,5,0,'Do you still question the might of the Horde, paladin? We will take on all comers!',14,0,100,1,0,16025,0,35706,0,'Garrosh Hellscream - Faction Champions Outro'),(34995,6,0,'Weakling!',14,0,100,0,0,16017,0,35694,0,'Garrosh Hellscream - Faction Champions Kill Player'),(34995,6,1,'Pathetic.',14,0,100,0,0,16018,0,35696,0,'Garrosh Hellscream - Faction Champions Kill Player'),(34995,6,2,'Overpowered...',14,0,100,0,0,16019,0,35697,0,'Garrosh Hellscream - Faction Champions Kill Player'),(34995,6,3,'Lok\'tar!',14,0,100,0,0,16020,0,35698,0,'Garrosh Hellscream - Faction Champions Kill Player'),(10184,0,0,'How fortuitous. Usually, I must leave my lair in order to feed.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8286,0,'Onyxia - Aggro'),(10184,1,0,'Learn your place, mortal!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8287,0,'Onyxia - Kill Player'),(10184,2,0,'This meaningless exertion bores me. I\'ll incinerate you all from above!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8288,0,'Onyxia - Phase 2'),(10184,3,0,'It seems you\'ll need another lesson, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8290,0,'Onyxia - Phase 3'),(10184,4,0,'%s takes in a deep breath...',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36542,0,'Onyxia - Deep Breath Emote'),(2981,3,0,'For we are all born of you, and shall all return to you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Hawkwind'),(2981,2,0,'Watch over her as she has watched over us; let her look down on us with joy, through the eternal gaze of An\'she and Mu\'sha, until we too join her in death.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Hawkwind'),(2981,1,0,'May her spirit fly to you swiftly; may the winds carry her gently, and the grass whisper her name.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Hawkwind'),(2981,0,0,'Earth Mother, into your arms we give one of our own. She is Unaya Hawkwind, my mother, and Greatmother to us all; the wisest of our tribe.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Hawkwind'),(50047,0,4,'You\'re $N! The hero that everyone has been talking about! Thank 