un!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zanzili Berserker - Casting Pursuit emote'),(52156,0,0,'I am released through you! Avenge me!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chained Spirit'),(23574,2,0,'Your death gonna be quick, strangers. You shoulda never come to this place....',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,23308,0,'Akil\'zon - EMOTE_ELECTRICAL_STORM'),(52381,0,0,'T\'kulu\'s death removes the protections from a nearby cauldron!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Venomancer T\'Kulu'),(52438,0,0,'CLIMB.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mortaxx'),(52380,0,0,'Mauri\'s death removes the protections from a nearby cauldron!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Venomancer Mauri'),(52148,0,0,'Meddlesome insects! Now you will feel my wrath!',14,0,100,0,0,24268,0,0,0,'Jin\'do the Godbreaker - SAY_INTRO'),(52148,1,0,'Welcome to de great show, friends. Just wait \'til ya see what I got in store for ya.',14,0,100,0,0,24254,0,0,0,'Jin\'do the Godbreaker - SAY_AGGRO'),(52148,2,0,'Jin\'do charges his weapon with the Shadows of Hakkar!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jin\'do the Godbreaker - EMOTE_SHADOWS_OF_HAKKAR'),(52148,3,0,'Now, have a taste of Jin\'do\'s true powah!',14,0,100,0,0,24267,0,0,0,'Jin\'do the Godbreaker - SAY_JINDO_SPIRIT_PHASE'),(52059,0,0,'No. NO! Get out! Leave me here with the memory of my sister!',14,0,100,0,0,24269,0,0,0,'High Priestess Kilnara - SAY_AGGRO'),(52059,1,0,'Feel me agony!',14,0,100,0,0,24284,0,0,0,'High Priestess Kilnara - SAY_WAVE_OF_AGONY'),(52059,2,0,'What have you done? I can\'t... control... RRAAAARRRGHHH!',14,0,100,0,0,24286,0,0,0,'High Priestess Kilnara - SAY_TRANSFROM_1'),(52059,3,0,'Haaa ha ha haa!  Now, heathens... face the TRUE might of Bethekk!',14,0,100,0,0,24287,0,0,0,'High Priestess Kilnara - SAY_TRANSFROM_2'),(52059,4,0,'I told you to leave!',14,0,100,0,0,24277,0,0,0,'High Priestess Kilnara - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(52059,5,0,'This body is useless!',14,0,100,0,0,24274,0,0,0,'High Priestess Kilnara - SAY_DEATH'),(52650,0,0,'Be freed, insects. I will deal with you another time.',14,0,100,0,0,24243,0,0,0,'Shadow of Hakkar - SAY_SHADOW_DEFEATED'),(52222,0,0,'Your deceit is unforgivable, Jin\'do. You spit in the face of a god!',14,0,100,0,0,24246,0,0,0,'Spirit of Hakkar - SAY_SPIRIT_SPIRIT_PHASE'),(52222,1,0,'You overstepped your bounds, Jin\'do. You toy with powers that are beyond you. Have you forgotten who I am? Have you forgotten what I can do?!',14,0,100,0,0,24244,0,0,0,'Spirit of Hakkar - SAY_SPIRIT_DEFEATED'),(23574,0,0,'I be da predator! You da prey...',14,0,100,0,0,12013,0,23235,0,'Akil\'zon - SAY_AGGRO'),(52151,0,0,'Make peace, worms.  I be deliverin\' you to Hakkar myself!',14,0,100,0,0,24289,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - SAY_AGGRO'),(52151,1,0,'Ha ha ha! Is that all you got?',14,0,100,0,0,24293,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(52151,1,1,'Fall to my feet.  Fall to Mandokir, the bloodlord!',14,0,100,0,0,24295,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(52151,1,2,'Your broken body belongs to Hakkar.',14,0,100,0,0,24294,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(52151,2,0,'Go an\' get dem, Ohgan! We WON\'T be fooled again!',14,0,100,0,0,24298,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - SAY_DISMOUNT_OHGAN'),(52151,3,0,'|TInterfaceIconsability_heroicleap.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:96740|h[Devastating Slam]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - EMOTE_DEVASTATING_SLAM'),(52151,4,0,'Rise, Ohgan! Rise, and fight for your master!',14,0,100,0,0,24299,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - SAY_REANIMATE_OHGAN'),(52151,5,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,24291,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - EMOTE_FRENZY'),(52151,6,0,'Off with your head!',14,0,100,0,0,24291,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - SAY_FRENZY'),(52151,7,0,'My blood feeds Hakkar! My soul... feeds... Jin\'do!',14,0,100,0,0,24290,0,0,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - SAY_DEATH'),(52271,0,0,'Today, you\'ll wish you never stirred from your bed!',14,0,100,0,0,24247,0,0,0,'Hazza\'rah - Aggro'),(52271,1,0,'Let us see what horrors stir within your nightmares!',14,0,100,0,0,24249,0,0,0,'Hazza\'rah to Hazza\'rah - Nightmare'),(52271