14,7,100,0,0,0,0,33301,0,'Commander Zanneth'),(31036,3,0,'Show those animals no mercy, $n!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,33101,0,'Commander Zanneth'),(31091,0,0,'The first of the Alliance towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,33296,0,'Commander Dardosh'),(31091,1,0,'Lok\'tar! The second tower falls! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,33297,0,'Commander Dardosh'),(31091,2,0,'The Alliance towers have fallen! We have forced their hand. Finish off the remaining forces!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,33298,0,'Commander Dardosh'),(31091,3,0,'Slay them all, $n!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,33109,0,'Commander Dardosh'),(31108,0,0,'Stop the Horde from retrieving the embers, $n. We cannot risk them having the advantage when the battle resumes!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,33102,0,'Siege Master Stouthandle'),(31109,0,0,'Destroy their foul machines of war, $n!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,33103,0,'Senior Demolitionist Legoso'),(34924,0,0,'The gates have been breached! Defend the keep!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35165,0,'High Commander Halford Wyrmbane'),(51712,0,0,'%s becomes rage!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Rage'),(25584,0,0,'What is the meaning of this disturbance?!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24812,0,'Inquisitor Salrand to Beryl Point InvisMan'),(25584,1,0,'Who dares interrupt my work!? Show yourself, coward!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24820,0,'Inquisitor Salrand to Beryl Point InvisMan'),(25584,2,0,'I\'ve destroyed the key! Your cherished archmage belongs to Malygos!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24816,0,'Inquisitor Salrand'),(24177,1,3,'Bad light... hurt...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22901,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(24177,1,2,'Light... light so bright...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22900,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(24177,1,1,'ARGHHHH...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22899,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(24177,1,0,'BURNS! IT BURNS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22898,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(24177,0,4,'Closer... come closer...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22896,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(24177,0,3,'FOOD! EAT YOU!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22895,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(24177,0,2,'FEED ME...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22894,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(24177,0,1,'So... Hungry...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22893,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(24177,0,0,'BRAINNNS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22892,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(30012,0,0,'You will not defeat me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30810,0,'Victorious Challenger'),(30012,0,1,'You\'re not worthy of Thorim!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30811,0,'Victorious Challenger'),(30012,0,2,'Good luck...  You\'ll need it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30809,0,'Victorious Challenger'),(30012,0,3,'May the best win!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30808,0,'Victorious Challenger'),(29709,0,0,'Return to Brunnhildar Village!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,31604,0,'Freed Proto-Drake'),(29709,0,1,'The proto-drake smells freedom and flies homeward!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32956,0,'Freed Proto-Drake'),(22127,0,0,'It\'s a good thing I was able to make duplicates of the Felsworn Gas Mask.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20215,0,'Wildlord Antelarion'),(28557,0,3,'I\'ve got five kids, $g man:lady;! They\'ll die without me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29012,0,'Scarlet Peasant'),(28557,0,4,'You don\'t have to do this! Nobody has to die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29013,0,'Scarlet Peasant'),(28557,0,5,'Please, no! Spare me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29009,0,'Scarlet Peasant'),(28557,0,6,'Don\'t kill me! I only took this job for the benefits!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29010,0,'Scarlet Peasant'),(20129,0,0,'Greetings, $n. I will guide you through the cavern. Please try and keep up.',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17656,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,1,0,'We do not know if the Caverns of Time have always been accessible to mortals. Truly, it is impossible to tell as the Timeless One is in perpetual motion, changing our timeways as he sees fit. What you see now may very well not exist tomorrow. You may wake up yesterday and have no memory of this place.\n',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17657,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,2,0,'It is strange, I know... Most mortals cannot actually comprehend what they see here, as often, what they see is not anchored within their own perception of reality.\n',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17658,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,3,0,'Follow me, please.',15,0,100,273,0,0,0,17668,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,4,0,'There are only two truths to be found here: First, that time is chaotic, always in flux, and completely malleable and second, perception does not dictate reality.',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17667,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,5,0,'As custodians of time, we watch over and care for Nozdormu\'s realm. The master is away at the moment, which means that attempts are being made to dramatically alter time. The master never meddles in the affairs of mortals but instead corrects the alterations made to time by others. He is reactionary in this regard.\n',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17659,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,6,0,'For normal maintenance of time, the Keepers of Time are sufficient caretakers. We are able to deal with most ordinary disturbances. I speak of little things, such as rogue mages changing something in the past to elevate their status or wealth in the present.\n',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17660,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,7,0,'These tunnels that you see are called timeways. They are infinite in number. The ones that currently exist in your reality are what the master has deemed as \'trouble spots.\'  These trouble spots may differ completely in theme but they always share a cause. That is, their existence is a result of the same temporal disturbance. Remember that should you venture inside one...\n',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17661,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,8,0,'This timeway is in great disarray! We have agents inside right now attempting to restore order. What little information I have indicates that Thrall\'s freedom is in jeopardy. A malevolent organization known as the Infinite Dragonflight is trying to prevent his escape. I fear without outside assistance, all will be lost.\n',15,0,100,25,0,0,0,17663,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,9,0,'We have very little information on this timeway. Sa\'at has been dispatched and is currently inside. The data we have gathered from his correspondence is that the Infinite Dragonflight are once again attempting to alter time. Could it be that the opening of the Dark Portal is being targeted for sabotage? Let us hope not...\n',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17664,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,10,0,'This timeway collapsed and reformed. The result was Stratholme of yore. What could possibly be happening inside?',15,0,100,25,0,0,0,17669,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,11,0,'The timeways are currently ranked in order from least catastrophic to most catastrophic. Note that they are all classified as catastrophic, meaning that any single one of these timeways collapsing would mean that your world would end. We only classify them in such a way so that the heroes and adventurers that are sent here know which timeway best suits their abilities.\n',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17662,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,12,0,'All we know of this timeway is that it leads to Mount Hyjal. The Infinite Dragonflight have gone to great lengths to prevent our involvement. We know next to nothing, mortal. Soridormi is currently attempting to break through the timeway\'s defenses but has thus far been unsuccessful. You might be our only hope of breaking through and resolving the conflict.\n',15,0,100,25,0,0,0,17665,0,'Custodian of Time'),(20129,13,0,'Our time is at an end, $n. I would wish you luck, if such a thing existed.\n',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,17666,0,'Custodian of Time'),(33350,0,0,'Oh, my! I wasn\'t expecting company! The workshop is such a mess. How embarrassing.',14,0,100,0,0,15611,0,34298,0,'Mimiron SAY_AGGRO'),(33350,1,0,'Now, why would you go and do something like that? Didn\'t you see the sign that said, \"DO NOT PUSH THIS BUTTON!\"? How will we finish testing with the self-destruct mechanism active?',14,0,100,0,0,15629,0,34244,0,'Mimiron SAY_HARDMODE_ON'),(33350,2,0,'We haven\'t much time, friends! You\'re going to help me test out my latest and greatest creation. Now, before you change your minds, remember that you kind of owe it to me after the mess you made with the XT-002.',14,0,100,0,0,15612,0,33636,0,'Mimiron SAY_MKII_ACTIVATE'),(33350,3,0,'MEDIC!',14,0,100,0,0,15613,0,34299,0,'Mimiron SAY_MKII_SLAY_1'),(33350,3,1,'I can fix that... or  maybe not! Sheesh, what a mess...',14,0,100,0,0,15614,0,34300,0,'Mimiron SAY_MKII_SLAY_2'),(33350,4,0,'WONDERFUL! Positively marvelous results! Hull integrity at 98.9 percent! Barely a dent! Moving right along.',14,0,100,0,0,15615,0,33638,0,'Mimiron SAY_MKII_DEATH'),(33350,5,0,'Behold the VX-001 Anti-personnel Assault Cannon! You might want to take cover.',14,0,100,0,0,15616,0,33639,0,'Mimiron SAY_VX001_ACTIVATE'),(33350,6,0,'Fascinating. I think they call that a \"clean kill\".',14,0,100,0,0,15617,0,34301,0,'Mimiron SAY_VX001_SLAY_1'),(33350,6,1,'Note to self: Cannon highly effective against flesh.',14,0,100,0,0,15618,0,34302,0,'Mimiron SAY_VX001_SLAY_2'),(33350,7,0,'Thank you, friends! Your efforts have yielded some fantastic data! Now, where did I put-- oh, there it is.',14,0,100,0,0,15619,0,33668,0,'Mimiron SAY_VX001_DEATH'),(33350,8,0,'Isn\'t it beautiful? I call it the magnificent aerial command unit!',14,0,100,0,0,15620,0,33669,0,'Mimiron SAY_AERIAL_ACTIVATE'),(33350,9,0,'Outplayed!',14,0,100,0,0,15621,0,34303,0,'Mimiron SAY_AERIAL_SLAY_1'),(33350,9,1,'You can do better than that!',14,0,100,0,0,15622,0,34304,0,'Mimiron SAY_AERIAL_SLAY_2'),(33350,10,0,'Preliminary testing phase complete. Now comes the true test!',14,0,100,0,0,15623,0,33966,0,'Mimiron SAY_AERIAL_DEATH'),(33350,11,0,'Gaze upon its magnificence! Bask in its glorious, um, glory! I present you with... V-07-TR-0N!',14,0,100,0,0,15624,0,34033,0,'Mimiron SAY_V07TRON_ACTIVATE'),(33350,12,0,'Prognosis: Negative!',14,0,100,0,0,15625,0,34448,0,'Mimiron SAY_V07TRON_SLAY_1'),(33350,12,1,'You\'re not going to get up from that one, friend.',14,0,100,0,0,15626,0,34449,0,'Mimiron SAY_V07TRON_SLAY_2'),(33350,13,0,'It would appear that I\'ve made a slight miscalculation. I allowed my mind to be corrupted by the fiend in the prison, overriding my primary directive. All systems seem to be functional now. Clear.',14,0,100,0,0,15627,0,34086,0,'Mimiron SAY_V07TRON_DEATH'),(33350,14,0,'Oh, my! It would seem that we are out of time, my friends.',14,0,100,0,0,15628,0,34305,0,'Mimiron SAY_BERSERK'),(33515,0,0,'Some things are better left alone!',14,0,100,0,0,15473,0,34341,0,'Auriaya SAY_AGGRO'),(29309,0,0,'The secrets of the deep shall remain hidden.',14,0,100,0,0,14033,0,31884,0,'SAY_AGGRO'),(29309,1,0,'Sleep now in the cold dark....',14,0,100,0,0,14036,0,31888,0,'SAY_SLAY_1'),(29309,1,1,'For the Lich King!',14,0,100,0,0,14037,0,31889,0,'SAY_SLAY_2'),(29309,1,2,'Perhaps we will be allies soon.',14,0,100,0,0,14038,0,31890,0,'SAY_SLAY_3'),(29309,2,0,'Master... is my service... complete?',14,0,100,0,0,14039,0,31891,0,'SAY_DEATH'),(29309,3,0,'The young must not go hungry....',14,0,100,0,0,14034,0,31886,0,'SAY_EGG_SAC_1'),(29309,3,1,'Shhhad ak kereeesshh chak-k-k!',14,0,100,0,0,14035,0,31887,0,'SAY_EGG_SAC_2'),(29309,4,0,'An Ahn\'kahar Guardian hatches!',16,0,100,0,0,14035,0,31894,0,'EMOTE_HATCHES'),(29311,5,0,'Iilth vwah, uhn\'agth fhssh za.',14,0,100,0,0,14048,0,32601,0,'Herald Volazj SAY_DEATH_1'),(29311,4,0,'Ywaq puul skshgn: on\'ma yeh\'glu zuq.',14,0,100,0,0,14047,0,32600,0,'Herald Volazj SAY_SLAY_3'),(29311,3,0,'Uulwi gag erh\'ongg w\'ssh.',14,0,100,0,0,14046,0,32599,0,'Herald Volazj SAY_SLAY_2'),(29311,2,0,'Ywaq ma phgwa\'cul hnakf.',14,0,100,0,0,14045,0,32598,0,'Herald Volazj SAY_SLAY_1'),(29311,1,0,'Gul\'kafh an\'shel. Yoq\'al shn ky ywaq nuul.',14,0,100,0,0,14044,0,32603,0,'Herald Volazj SAY_INSANITY'),(29311,0,0,'Shgla\'yos plahf mh\'naus.',14,0,100,0,0,14043,0,32596,0,'Herald Volazj SAY_AGGRO'),(29310,0,0,'These are sacred halls! Your intrusion will be met with death!',14,0,100,0,0,14343,0,30789,0,'SAY_AGGRO'),(29310,1,0,'Who among you is devoted?',14,0,100,0,0,14343,0,30862,0,'SAY_SACRIFICE_1_1'),(29310,1,1,'You there! Step forward!',14,0,100,0,0,14343,0,31699,0,'SAY_SACRIFICE_1_2'),(29310,2,0,'Yogg-Saron! Grant me your power!',14,0,100,0,0,14343,0,31700,0,'SAY_SACRIFICE_2_1'),(29310,2,1,'Master, a gift for you!',14,0,100,0,0,14343,0,31701,0,'SAY_SACRIFICE_2_2'),(29310,3,0,'Glory to Yogg-Saron!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31702,0,'SAY_SLAY_1'),(29310,3,1,'You are unworthy.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31703,0,'SAY_SLAY_2'),(29310,3,2,'Get up! You haven\'t suffered enough.',14,0,100,0,0,14350,0,31704,0,'SAY_SLAY_3'),(29310,4,0,'Do not expect your sacrilege... to go unpunished.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31705,0,'SAY_DEATH'),(29310,5,0,'The elements themselves will rise up against the civilized world! Only the faithful will be spared!',14,0,100,0,0,14352,0,31706,0,'SAY_PREACHING_1'),(29310,5,1,'Immortality can be yours, but only if you pledge yourself fully to Yogg-Saron!',14,0,100,0,0,14353,0,31707,0,'SAY_PREACHING_2'),(29310,5,2,'Here, on the very borders of his domain, you will experience power you could have never imagined!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31708,0,'SAY_PREACHING_3'),(29310,5,3,'You have traveled long and risked much to be here! Your devotion shall be rewarded.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31709,0,'SAY_PREACHING_4'),(29310,5,4,'The faithful shall be exalted, but there is more work to be done. We will press on until all of Azeroth lies beneath his shadow!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31710,0,'SAY_PREACHING_5'),(27658,0,0,'Thank you for freeing us, mortals.  Beware, the blue flight is alerted to your presence.  Even now, Malygos sends Varos Cloudstrider and his ring guardians to defend the Oculus.  You will need our help to stand a chance.',12,0,100,1,3500,0,0,26937,0,'Belgaristrasz - On freed'),(27756,0,0,'%s flies away.',16,0,100,1,0,2858,0,25992,0,'Ruby - On take off'),(27756,1,0,'Welcome Friend.  Keep your head down and hold on tight!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28136,0,'Ruby - On welcome'),(27756,2,0,'Use Searing Wrath to damage enemies and Evasive Maneuvers if I start taking damage.  Remember I need to build up Evasive Charges by taking damage to perform Evasive Maneuvers!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28254,0,'Ruby - On explaining abilities'),(27756,3,0,'Now that I am at my full power I can perform Martyr.  You can use it to protect other drakes, but I will take lots of damage, so make sure you\'re using Evasive Maneuvers too!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28260,0,'Ruby - On ultimate ability unlocked'),(27756,4,0,'I\'m badly injured!  I can\'t take much more of this!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28257,0,'Ruby - On below 40%'),(27692,0,0,'%s flies away.',16,0,100,1,0,2858,0,25992,0,'Emerald - On take off'),(27692,1,0,'Welcome Friend.  Keep your head down and hold on tight!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28136,0,'Emerald - On welcome'),(27692,2,0,'Use Leeching Poison to damage enemies and keep me healed.  Touch the Nightmare is very powerful, but it hurts me, so only use it when I have a lot of health!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28255,0,'Emerald - On explaining abilities'),(27692,3,0,'Now that I am at my full power I can perform Dream Funnel.  You can use it to heal other drakes, but it drains my health, so make sure you\'re using Leeching Poison too!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28259,0,'Emerald - On ultimate ability unlocked'),(27692,4,0,'I\'m badly injured!  I can\'t take much more of this!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28257,0,'Emerald - On below 40%'),(27755,0,0,'%s flies away.',16,0,100,1,0,2858,0,25992,0,'Amber - On take off'),(27755,1,0,'Welcome Friend.  Keep your head down and hold on tight!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28136,0,'Amber - On welcome'),(27755,2,0,'Use Shock Lance to damage enemies.  If we get in trouble, Stop Time to freeze all enemies in place, then hit them with Shock Lance for massive damage!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28256,0,'Amber - On explaining abilities'),(27755,3,0,'Now that I am at my full power I can perform Temporal Rift.  You can use it to make enemies take extra damage and to get Shock Charges.  Save up Shock Charges and then Shock Lance for huge damage!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28258,0,'Amber - On ultimate ability unlocked'),(27755,4,0,'I\'m badly injured!  I can\'t take much more of this!',15,0,100,1,0,0,0,28257,0,'Amber - On below 40%'),(39863,0,0,'Without pressure in both realms, %s begins to regenerate.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,40476,0,'Halion'),(39863,1,0,'Meddlesome insects! You are too late. The Ruby Sanctum is lost!',14,0,100,1,0,17499,0,39942,0,'Halion'),(39863,2,0,'Your world teeters on the brink of annihilation. You will ALL bear witness to the coming of a new age of DESTRUCTION!',14,0,100,0,0,17500,0,40064,0,'Halion'),(39863,3,0,'The heavens burn!',14,0,100,0,0,17505,0,40068,0,'Halion'),(39863,4,0,'You will find only suffering within the realm of twilight! Enter if you dare!',14,0,100,0,0,17507,0,40067,0,'Halion'),(39863,5,0,'Relish this victory, mortals, for it will be your last. This world will burn with the master\'s return!',14,0,100,0,0,17503,0,40065,0,'Halion'),(39863,6,0,'Another \"hero\" falls.',14,0,100,0,0,17501,0,40066,0,'Halion'),(39863,7,0,'Not good enough....',14,0,100,0,0,17504,0,41619,0,'Halion'),(39863,8,0,'Your efforts force %s further out of the physical realm!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,40228,0,'Halion'),(39863,9,0,'Your companions\' efforts force %s further into the physical realm!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,40079,0,'Halion'),(40142,0,0,'Without pressure in both realms, %s begins to regenerate.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,40476,0,'Halion'),(40142,1,0,'Beware the shadow!',14,0,100,0,0,17506,0,40069,0,'Halion'),(40142,2,0,'I am the light and the darkness! Cower, mortals, before the herald of Deathwing!',14,0,100,0,0,17508,0,40072,0,'Halion'),(40142,3,0,'Your companions\' efforts force %s further into the twilight realm!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,40080,0,'Halion'),(40142,4,0,'Your efforts force %s further out of the twilight realm!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,40227,0,'Halion'),(40083,0,0,'The orbiting spheres pulse with dark energy!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,40071,0,'Shadow Orb'),(7998,0,0,'With your help, I can evaluate these tunnels.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4050,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_0'),(7998,1,0,'Let\'s see if we can find out where these Troggs are coming from.... and put a stop to the invasion!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4051,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_1'),(7998,2,0,'Such devastation... what a horrible mess...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4052,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_2'),(7998,3,0,'It\'s quiet here....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4129,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_3'),(7998,4,0,'...too quiet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4130,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_4'),(7998,5,0,'Look! Over there at the tunnel wall!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4131,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_5'),(7998,6,0,'Trogg incursion! Defend me while I blast the hole closed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4132,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_6'),(7998,7,0,'I don\'t think one charge is going to cut it. Keep fending them off!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4133,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_7'),(7998,8,0,'The charges are set. Get back before they blow!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4134,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_8'),(7998,9,0,'Incoming blast in 10 seconds!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4135,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_9'),(7998,10,0,'Incoming blast in 5 seconds. Clear the tunnel! Stay back!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4136,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_10'),(7998,11,0,'FIRE IN THE HOLE!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32326,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_11'),(7998,12,0,'Well done! Without your help I would have never been able to thwart that wave of troggs.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4206,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_12'),(7998,13,0,'Did you hear something?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27926,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_13'),(7998,14,0,'I heard something over there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4208,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_14'),(7998,15,0,'More troggs! Ward them off as I prepare the explosives!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4209,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_15'),(7998,16,0,'The final charge is set. Stand back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4325,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_16'),(7998,17,0,'10 seconds to blast! Stand back!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4326,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_17'),(7998,18,0,'5 seconds until detonation!!!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4327,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_18'),(7998,19,0,'Superb! Because of your help, my people stand a chance of re-taking our beloved city. Three cheers to you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4446,0,'SAY_BLASTMASTER_19'),(7361,0,0,'We come from below! You can never stop us!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4328,0,'SAY_GRUBBIS'),(33533,1,0,'Look!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34620,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,2,0,'We can dance too!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34618,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,3,0,'We made a new friend!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34615,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,4,0,'We here! Only, if this is world tree, how come it broke when they tried to put whole world in?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34576,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,5,0,'Look! Is that us? We think it\'s us. A bit older, maybe?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34606,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,6,0,'Looks like we blessed by Great Ones! Shrines give magic, make us high-oracle someday? Maybe?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34607,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,7,0,'Wow! A real Great One? We don\'t even think Soo-say has met a real Great One!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34672,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,8,0,'Um, hello, Mr. Great One. We are honored to meet you.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34673,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,9,0,'Maybe you\'re asleep, Mr. Great One? We understand. Must be hard working being Great One, collecting all the shinies we leave for you.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34674,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,10,0,'We brought you a gift, Great One. Maybe you see it when you wake up. Maybe you remember we came to see you, oki?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34675,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,11,0,'So that\'s the queen of the dragons? Hmm... we thought she\'d be bigger. Yes, we did.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34631,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,12,0,'How come she doesn\'t look like the other dragons? Could she turn into a big ol\' dragon if she wanted to?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34632,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,13,0,'Um... Your Majesty, would you turn into a dragon for us?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34633,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33533,14,0,'Oki... How about now?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34634,0,'Oracle Orphan'),(33532,1,0,'Look!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34620,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,2,0,'Got you back!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34622,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,3,0,'Good snowball fight!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34623,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,4,0,'Look! That must be Kekek as a mighty warrior! See? What Kekek tell you?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34610,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,5,0,'Hmm... that Kekek very old. Must be elder, leader of Frenzyheart. This good. Kekek have good future as warrior and leader. Kekek very happy you bring him here. Orphan-lady never do that for Kekek.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34636,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,6,0,'Wow. At last, Kekek get to meet Hemet Nesingwary!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34685,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,7,0,'Even Frenzyheart know all about you after you come to Sholazar. Maybe you teach Kekek your tricks?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34686,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,8,0,'Not sure how reading helps. Kekek can\'t read anyway, but if Hemet Nesingwary say, Kekek try.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34688,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,9,0,'Maybe give up and throw book at animals, but try.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34689,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,10,0,'You think maybe one day, Kekek lead Frenzyheart home, like bear-men fight to get tree-city back? Kekek want own home, not city with purple men, not jungle with big-tongues.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34603,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,11,0,'Kekek thought we go see dragon queen. This just some elf-lady with funny horns.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34655,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,12,0,'But why? Dragons big and powerful. Elf-lady weak. Kekek want to see dragon queen\'s real form.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34664,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(33532,13,0,'Oh! Now Kekek understand. Not want to be crushed by big dragon-lady. Maybe come back sometime when not so crowded. Nice to meet you, dragon-lady.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34666,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(34387,1,0,'No worry, Kekek. You grow up, be strong for Frenzyheart. You lead people back to old home, where there no big-tongue babies.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,35493,0,''),(26917,2,0,'If I was in my dragon form, there wouldn\'t be any room for anyone else, little one.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34635,0,''),(27990,8,0,'Rest assured, Kekek, she is the queen of the dragons. We often take the forms of smaller beings when we work with them.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34665,0,''),(34386,1,0,'We remember this visit, yes we do. Never forget what you learn from your new friend, little Roo. You got great future ahead.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,35492,0,''),(27986,0,0,'Aye, I\'ll try it.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,28549,0,'Hemet Nesingwary'),(27986,1,0,'That\'s exactly what I needed!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28550,0,'Hemet Nesingwary'),(34490,1,0,'Better watch out!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34624,0,''),(34490,2,0,'Got you good!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34621,0,''),(34489,1,0,'Wanna see what I can do?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34617,0,''),(34489,2,0,'Now dance together!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34619,0,''),(27923,0,0,'Hang on to your hat, $n! To Scalawag we go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27272,0,'Lou the Cabin Boy'),(27923,1,0,'YAAARRRRR! Here we be, matey! Scalawag Point!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27273,0,'Lou the Cabin Boy'),(27933,0,0,'Enjoy the ride! It\'s a one way trip!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,27337,0,'Alanya'),(26500,0,0,'I\'ll be waitin\' for ya, mon.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,25877,0,'Image of Drakuru'),(39712,0,0,'They may take our lives, but they\'ll never take...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39708,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque to Milli Featherwhistle 1'),(39712,1,0,'...our INNOVATION!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39722,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque to Milli Featherwhistle 2'),(39712,2,0,'What I want out of each and every one of you is a hard-target search of every refuelling station, residence, warehouse, farmhouse, henhouse, outhouse and doghouse in this area. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39709,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque to Ozzie Togglevolt 1'),(39712,3,0,'Your fugitive\'s name is Mekgineer Thermaplugg.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39723,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque to Ozzie Togglevolt 2'),(39712,4,0,'Go get him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39724,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque to Ozzie Togglevolt 3'),(39712,5,0,'We will not go quietly into the night! We will not vanish without a fight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39710,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque to Tog Rustsprocket 1'),(39712,6,0,' We\'re going to live on! We\'re going to survive! Today we celebrate...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39725,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque to Tog Rustsprocket 2'),(39712,7,0,'...our Autonomy Day!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39726,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque to Tog Rustsprocket 3'),(1268,0,0,'Hmm, I suppose it could work.  But it could really use a little more umph!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39711,0,'Ozzie Togglevolt reply'),(7955,0,0,'What?  I don\'t even know what you\'re talking about!  That\'s terrible!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39712,0,'Milli Featherwhistle reply'),(6119,0,0,'Horrible! Well, all right, maybe it just needs a little cleaning up?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39713,0,'Tog Rustsprocket reply'),(2986,0,0,'Until we meet again, brave one.',12,0,100,113,0,0,0,1589,0,'Dorn Plainstalker'),(24400,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(26825,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(26827,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(23671,0,0,'You think I do not know what you are trying to do? You think I haven\'t been watching you?',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,22787,0,'Halfdan the Ice-Hearted'),(26794,1,0,'Noo!',14,0,0,0,0,13328,0,29605,0,'ormorok SAY_AGGRO'),(26794,2,0,'Aaggh!',14,0,0,0,0,13330,0,29608,0,'ormorok SAY_DEATH'),(26794,3,0,'Back!',14,0,0,0,0,13331,0,29609,0,'ormorok SAY_REFLECT'),(26794,4,0,'Bleed!',14,0,0,0,0,13332,0,29610,0,'ormorok SAY_CRYSTAL_SPIKES'),(26794,5,0,'Kill!',14,0,0,0,0,13329,0,29607,0,'ormorok SAY_KILL'),(15339,0,0,'I am rejuvinated!',14,0,100,0,0,8593,0,0,0,'SAY_SUPREME_1'),(15339,0,1,'My powers are renewed!',14,0,100,0,0,8595,0,0,0,'SAY_SUPREME_2'),(15339,0,2,'My powers return!',14,0,100,0,0,8596,0,0,0,'SAY_SUPREME_3'),(15339,1,0,'Protect the city at all costs!',14,0,100,0,0,8597,0,0,0,'SAY_INTRO_1'),(15339,1,1,'To your posts. Defend the city.',14,0,100,0,0,8600,0,0,0,'SAY_INTRO_2'),(15339,1,2,'Tresspassers will be terminated.',14,0,100,0,0,8601,0,0,0,'SAY_INTRO_3'),(15339,2,0,'Sands of the desert, rise and block out the sun!',14,0,100,0,0,8598,0,11449,0,'SAY_AGGRO'),(15339,3,0,'You are terminated.',14,0,100,0,0,8602,0,11450,0,'SAY_SLAY'),(15339,4,0,'I...have...failed. ',14,0,100,0,0,8594,0,11451,0,'SAY_DEATH'),(15339,5,0,'The walls have been breached!',14,0,100,0,0,8599,0,11720,3,'SAY_KURINAXX_DEATH'),(5702,0,0,'If you\'re here, then it means you are prepared to begin the study of summoning demonic cohorts to do your bidding. We will start with the lowliest creatures you will be able to call and continue from there. Let us begin.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2049,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,1,0,'The easiest creature for you to summon is the imp. You should already be able to bring forth this minion but for completeness\' sake I will start with him.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2050,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,2,0,'This foul little beast is the imp. It is small and weak, making it almost useless as a meatshield, and its damage output is mediocre at best. This creature is best used for support of a larger group.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2051,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,3,0,'Now that you have had a chance to study the imp, let us move on to the next minion you will be able to summon, the voidwalker.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2052,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,4,0,'This demonic entity is known as the Voidwalker. Its strength and endurance are significant, making it ideal for defense. Send it to attack your enemy, then use it as a shield while you use your spells and abilities to drain away your opponent\'s life.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2053,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,5,0,'If you\'ve never seen one, it is a sight to behold. A very impressive creature both on and off the field of battle. Next, let us take a look at what I am sure all you male students have been waiting for. The succubus.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2054,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,6,0,'All right now. Aside from the obvious distractions a minion like this will provide against your more masculine foes, she is also capable of dealing out impressive amounts of damage. However, her fragile endurance makes her almost useless as a shield.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2055,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,7,0,'Study hard and you might one day be able to summon one on your own, but for now it\'s time to move on to the felhunter.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2056,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,8,0,'What you see before you is a felhunter. This creature\'s natural talents include spell lock and other abilities which make it unequalled when facing a magically attuned opponent.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2057,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,9,0,'When facing a spellcaster of any kind, this feral beast will be your best friend. Now, let us take a look at something a bit different. This next creature will aid your travels and make your future journeys much easier. Let\'s take a look at a felsteed.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2058,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,10,0,'I doubt you have had much occasion to see such a creature. These demonic equines will make your travels much faster by acting as your mount as long as you control them. However, they are difficult to control, so be sure you are ready before attempting it.\n',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2059,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(5702,11,0,'There you have it. Our lesson on summoning has come to an end. A new class will begin shortly, so if you wish to brush up, feel free to stay around.',12,33,100,1,0,0,0,2060,0,'Jezelle Pruitt'),(30884,1,1,'It\'s Iskalder! Quickly, use The Bone Witch\'s Amulet!',41,0,100,0,100,0,0,31523,0,'Originaly it as the Bonne witch guide'),(8391,0,0,'You are here to stop the Archduke?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,47647,0,'Lathoric the Black'),(8391,1,0,'Fools.  Obsidion!  Rise, and destroy the interlopers!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,47805,0,'Lathoric the Black'),(10181,0,0,'Sighing, %s kneels down and picks up the amulet.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,19244,0,'npc_lady_sylvanas_windrunner EMOTE_LAMENT_END'),(10181,1,0,'Belore...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19263,0,'npc_lady_sylvanas_windrunner SAY_LAMENT_END'),(7228,0,0,'None may steal the secrets of the Makers!',14,0,100,0,0,5851,0,3261,0,'ironaya SAY_AGGRO'),(17535,0,0,'Oh at last, at last I can go home!',14,0,100,0,0,9190,0,15068,0,'dorothee SAY_DOROTHEE_DEATH'),(17535,1,0,'Don\'t let them hurt us Tito! Oh, you won\'t, will you?',14,0,100,0,0,9191,0,15066,0,'dorothee SAY_DOROTHEE_SUMMON'),(17535,2,0,'Tito! Oh Tito, no!',14,0,100,0,0,9192,0,15069,0,'dorothee SAY_DOROTHEE_TITO_DEATH'),(17535,3,0,'Oh Tito, we simply must find a way home! The old wizard could be our only hope! Strawman, Roar, Tinhead, will you - wait... oh golly, look we have visitors!',14,0,100,0,0,9195,0,15067,0,'dorothee SAY_DOROTHEE_AGGRO'),(17546,0,0,'I\'m not afraid a\' you! Do you wanna\' fight? Huh, do ya\'? C\'mon! I\'ll fight ya\' with both paws behind my back!',14,0,100,0,0,9227,0,19276,0,'roar SAY_ROAR_AGGRO'),(17546,1,0,'You didn\'t have to go and do that!',14,0,100,0,0,9229,0,15133,0,'roar SAY_ROAR_DEATH'),(17546,2,0,'Go ahead and take forty winks.',14,0,100,0,0,9230,0,15131,0,'roar SAY_ROAR_SLAY'),(17543,0,0,'Now what should I do with you? I simply can\'t make up my mind.',14,0,100,0,0,9254,0,19277,0,'strawman SAY_STRAWMAN_AGGRO'),(17543,1,0,'Don\'t let them make... a mattress outta\' me.',14,0,100,0,0,9256,0,15135,0,'strawman SAY_STRAWMAN_DEATH'),(17543,2,0,'I guess I\'m not a failure after all!',14,0,100,0,0,9257,0,15136,0,'strawman SAY_STRAWMAN_SLAY'),(17547,0,0,'I could really use a heart. Say, can I have yours?',14,0,100,0,0,9268,0,19278,0,'tinhead SAY_TINHEAD_AGGRO'),(17547,1,0,'Back to being an old rust bucket.',14,0,100,0,0,9270,0,15155,0,'tinhead SAY_TINHEAD_DEATH'),(17547,2,0,'Guess I\'m not so rusty after all.',14,0,100,0,0,9271,0,15156,0,'tinhead SAY_TINHEAD_SLAY'),(17547,3,0,'%s begins to rust!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14361,0,'tinhead EMOTE_RUST'),(18168,0,0,'Woe to each and every one of you, my pretties!',14,0,100,0,0,9179,0,15050,0,'crone SAY_CRONE_AGGRO'),(18168,0,1,'It will all be over soon!',14,0,100,0,0,9307,0,15332,0,'crone SAY_CRONE_AGGRO2'),(18168,1,0,'How could you? What a cruel, cruel world...',14,0,100,0,0,9178,0,15052,0,'crone SAY_CRONE_DEATH'),(18168,2,0,'Fixed you, didn\'t I?',14,0,100,0,0,9180,0,15051,0,'crone SAY_CRONE_SLAY'),(17521,0,0,'The better to own you with!',14,0,100,0,0,9276,0,14212,0,'wolf SAY_WOLF_AGGRO'),(17521,1,0,'Mmmm... delicious.',14,0,100,0,0,9277,0,15153,0,'SAY_WOLF_SLAY'),(17521,2,0,'Run away little girl, run away!',14,0,100,0,0,9278,0,14213,0,'SAY_WOLF_HOOD'),(17534,0,0,'What devil art thou, that dost torment me thus?',14,0,100,0,0,9196,0,15070,0,'julianne SAY_JULIANNE_AGGRO'),(17534,1,0,'Where is my lord? Where is my Romulo?',14,0,100,0,0,9199,0,0,0,'julianne SAY_JULIANNE_ENTER'),(17534,2,0,'Romulo, I come! Oh... this do I drink to thee!',14,0,100,0,0,9198,0,15072,0,'julianne SAY_JULIANNE_DEATH01'),(17534,3,0,'O happy dagger! This is thy sheath; there rust, and let me die!',14,0,100,0,0,9310,0,15074,0,'julianne SAY_JULIANNE_DEATH02'),(17534,4,0,'Come, gentle night; and give me back my Romulo!',14,0,100,0,0,9200,0,15073,0,'julianne SAY_JULIANNE_RESURRECT'),(17534,5,0,'Parting is such sweet sorrow.',14,0,100,0,0,9201,0,15071,0,'julianne SAY_JULIANNE_SLAY'),(17533,0,0,'Wilt thou provoke me? Then have at thee, boy!',14,0,100,0,0,9233,0,15075,0,'romulo SAY_ROMULO_AGGRO'),(17533,1,0,'Thou smilest... upon the stroke that... murders me.',14,0,100,0,0,9235,0,15078,0,'romulo SAY_ROMULO_DEATH'),(17533,2,0,'This day\'s black fate on more days doth depend. This but begins the woe. Others must end.',14,0,100,0,0,9236,0,0,0,'romulo SAY_ROMULO_ENTER'),(17533,3,0,'Thou detestable maw, thou womb of death; I enforce thy rotten jaws to open!',14,0,100,0,0,9237,0,15077,0,'romulo SAY_ROMULO_RESURRECT'),(17533,4,0,'How well my comfort is revived by this!',14,0,100,0,0,9238,0,15076,0,'romulo SAY_ROMULO_SLAY'),(16812,0,0,'Welcome ladies and gentlemen, to this evening\'s presentation!',14,0,100,0,0,9174,0,14122,0,'barnes OZ1'),(16812,1,0,'Tonight we plumb the depths of the human soul as we join a lost, lonely girl trying desperately--with the help of her loyal companions--to find her way home!',14,0,100,0,0,9338,0,15362,0,'barnes OZ2'),(16812,2,0,'But she is pursued... by a wicked, malevolent crone!',14,0,100,0,0,9339,0,15363,0,'barnes OZ3'),(16812,3,0,'Will she survive? Will she prevail? Only time will tell. And now... on with the show!',14,0,100,0,0,9340,0,15364,0,'barnes OZ4'),(16812,4,0,'Good evening ladies and gentlemen, welcome to this evening\'s presentation!',14,0,100,0,0,9175,0,14057,0,'barnes HOOD1'),(16812,5,0,'Tonight, things are not what they seem... for tonight your eyes may not be trusted!',14,0,100,0,0,9335,0,15359,0,'barnes HOOD2'),(16812,6,0,'Take for instance this quiet elderly woman waiting for a visit from her granddaughter... surely there is nothing to fear from this sweet, gray-haired old lady!',14,0,100,0,0,9336,0,15360,0,'barnes HOOD3'),(16812,7,0,'But don\'t let me pull the wool over your eyes! See for yourself what lies beneath those covers! And now... on with the show!',14,0,100,0,0,9337,0,15361,0,'barnes HOOD4'),(16812,8,0,'Welcome ladies and gentlemen, to this evening\'s presentation!',14,0,100,0,0,9176,0,14122,0,'barnes RAJ1'),(16812,9,0,'Tonight... we explore a tale of forbidden love!',14,0,100,0,0,9341,0,15365,0,'barnes RAJ2'),(16812,10,0,'But beware, for not all love stories end happily, as you may find out. Sometimes, love pricks like a thorn!',14,0,100,0,0,9342,0,15366,0,'barnes RAJ3'),(16812,11,0,'But don\'t take it from me; see for yourself what tragedy lies ahead when the paths of star crossed lovers meet! And now... on with the show!',14,0,100,0,0,9343,0,15367,0,'barnes RAJ4'),(15690,0,0,'Madness has brought you here to me. I shall be your undoing!',14,0,100,0,0,9218,0,15127,0,'malchezaar SAY_AGGRO'),(15690,1,0,'Simple fools! Time is the fire in which you\'ll burn!',14,0,100,0,0,9220,0,15341,0,'malchezaar SAY_AXE_TOSS1'),(15690,2,0,'I see the subtlety of conception is beyond primitives such as you.',14,0,100,0,0,9317,0,0,0,'malchezaar SAY_AXE_TOSS2'),(15690,3,0,'Who knows what secrets hide in the dark.',14,0,100,0,0,9223,0,0,0,'malchezaar SAY_SPECIAL1'),(15690,4,0,'The cerestial forces are mine to manipulate.',14,0,100,0,0,9320,0,0,0,'malchezaar SAY_SPECIAL2'),(15690,5,0,'How can you hope to stand against such overwhelming power?',14,0,100,0,0,9321,0,15342,0,'malchezaar SAY_SPECIAL3'),(15690,6,0,'Surely you did not think you could win.',14,0,100,0,0,9222,0,15124,0,'malchezaar SAY_SLAY1'),(15690,6,1,'Your greed, your foolishness has brought you to this end.',14,0,100,0,0,9318,0,15125,0,'malchezaar SAY_SLAY2'),(15690,6,2,'You are but a plaything. Unfit even to amuse.',14,0,100,0,0,9319,0,15126,0,'malchezaar SAY_SLAY3'),(15690,7,0,'All realities, all dimensions are open to me!',14,0,100,0,0,9224,0,15343,0,'malchezaar SAY_SUMMON1'),(15690,7,1,'You face not Malchezaar alone, but the legions I command!',14,0,100,0,0,9322,0,15344,0,'malchezaar SAY_SUMMON2'),(15690,8,0,'I refuse to concede defeat! I am a prince of the Eredar! I... am...',14,0,100,0,0,9221,0,15123,0,'malchezaar SAY_DEATH'),(16524,0,0,'Please, no more! My son... he\'s gone mad!',14,0,100,0,0,9241,0,13529,0,'aran SAY_AGGRO1'),(16524,0,1,'I\'ll not be tortured again!',14,0,100,0,0,9323,0,15353,0,'aran SAY_AGGRO2'),(16524,0,2,'Who are you? What do you want? Stay away from me!',14,0,100,0,0,9324,0,13530,0,'aran SAY_AGGRO3'),(16524,1,0,'I\'ll show you: this beaten dog still has some teeth!',14,0,100,0,0,9245,0,13519,0,'aran SAY_FLAMEWREATH1'),(16524,1,1,'Burn, you hellish fiends!',14,0,100,0,0,9326,0,13520,0,'aran SAY_FLAMEWREATH2'),(16524,2,0,'I\'ll freeze you all!',14,0,100,0,0,9246,0,13522,0,'aran SAY_BLIZZARD1'),(16524,2,1,'Back to the cold dark with you!',14,0,100,0,0,9327,0,13523,0,'aran SAY_BLIZZARD2'),(16524,3,0,'Yes, yes my son is quite powerful... but I have powers of my own!',14,0,100,0,0,9242,0,13517,0,'aran SAY_EXPLOSION1'),(16524,3,1,'I am not some simple jester! I am Nielas Aran!',14,0,100,0,0,9325,0,13518,0,'aran SAY_EXPLOSION2'),(16524,4,0,'Surely you wouldn\'t deny an old man a replenishing drink? No, no, I thought not.',14,0,100,0,0,9248,0,13514,0,'aran SAY_DRINK'),(16524,5,0,'I\'m not finished yet! No, I have a few more tricks up