ru'),(28016,8,0,'With da help of these mortals, dis region been cleansed of all who oppose us.',12,0,100,0,0,14013,0,28127,0,'Drakuru'),(28016,9,0,'As you wish, master.',12,0,100,396,0,14014,0,28419,0,'Drakuru'),(28016,10,0,'Forgive my deception, mon. It all been for your own good.',12,0,100,396,0,14015,0,28420,0,'Drakuru'),(28016,11,0,'Ya needed ta prove yer worthiness....',12,0,100,396,0,14016,0,28421,0,'Drakuru'),(28016,12,0,'I be needin\' worthy underlings in Zul\'Drak, mon. Ones ready to wield real power.',12,0,100,396,0,14017,0,28422,0,'Drakuru'),(28016,13,0,'You see for yourself now. Da Lich King be generous to dem who obey.',12,0,100,396,0,14018,0,28423,0,'Drakuru'),(28016,14,0,'Follow dis path, mon, and soon you be tastin\' immortality!',12,0,100,396,0,14019,0,28424,0,'Drakuru'),(28498,0,0,'You have done well, Drakuru.',12,0,100,396,0,14749,0,28130,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,1,0,'Your betrayal of the Drakkari Empire has borne me a new army.',12,0,100,396,0,14750,0,28131,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,2,0,'Your army....',12,0,100,0,0,14751,0,28133,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,3,0,'Arise, and accept my gift.',12,0,100,396,0,14752,0,28134,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,4,0,'I charge you now with the cleansing of Zul\'Drak, Drakuru.',12,0,100,397,0,14753,0,28416,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,5,0,'Fail me and it shall be your undoing...',12,0,100,396,0,14754,0,28417,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,6,0,'Succeed, and even greater power shall be yours!',12,0,100,396,0,14755,0,28418,0,'The Lich King'),(12435,0,0,'You\'ll pay for forcing me to do this!',14,0,100,0,0,8275,0,9961,0,'razorgore SAY_EGGS_BROKEN1'),(12435,1,0,'Fools! These eggs are more precious than you know!',14,0,100,0,0,8276,0,9962,0,'razorgore SAY_EGGS_BROKEN2'),(12435,2,0,'No - not another one! I\'ll have your heads for this atrocity!',14,0,100,0,0,8277,0,9963,0,'razorgore SAY_EGGS_BROKEN3'),(12435,3,0,'If I fall into the abyss, I\'ll take all of you mortals with me!',14,0,100,0,0,8278,0,9591,0,'razorgore SAY_DEATH'),(11583,10,0,'Warlocks, you shouldn\'t be playing with magic you don\'t understand. See what happens?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9852,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_WARLOCK'),(11583,9,0,'Shamans, show me what your totems can do!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9854,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_SHAMAN'),(11583,8,0,'Paladins... I\'ve heard you have many lives. Show me.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9853,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_PALADIN'),(11583,7,0,'Priests! If you\'re going to keep healing like that, we might as well make it a little more interesting!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9848,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_PRIEST'),(11583,6,0,'Druids and your silly shapeshifting. Lets see it in action!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9851,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_DRUID'),(11583,5,0,'Warriors, I know you can hit harder than that! Let\'s see it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9855,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_WARRIOR'),(11583,4,0,'Mages too? You should be more careful when you play with magic...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9850,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_MAGE'),(11583,3,0,'This cannot be!  I am the master here!  You mortals are nothing to my kind!  Do you hear me? Nothing!',14,0,100,0,0,8292,0,9971,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_DEATH'),(11583,2,0,'Worthless $n!  Your friends will join you soon enough!',14,0,100,0,0,8293,0,9972,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_SLAY'),(11583,1,0,'Impossible! Rise my minions!  Serve your master once more!',14,0,100,0,0,8291,0,9883,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_RAISE_SKELETONS'),(12017,0,0,'None of your kind should be here!  You\'ve doomed only yourselves!',14,0,100,0,0,8286,0,9967,0,'broodlord SAY_AGGRO'),(12017,1,0,'Clever, mortals - but I am not so easily lured away from my sanctum!',14,0,100,0,0,8287,0,9968,0,'broodlord SAY_LEASH'),(11981,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'flamegor EMOTE_FRENZY'),(14020,0,0,'%s goes into a killing frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,9764,0,'chromaggus EMOTE_FRENZY'),(14020,1,0,'%s flinches as its skin shimmers.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,9793,0,'chromaggus EMOTE_SHIMMER'),(13020,0,0,'Too late, friends! Nefarius\' corruption has taken hold...I cannot...control myself.\n',14,0,100,0,0,8281,0,9886,0,'vaelastrasz SAY_LINE1'),(13020,1,0,'I beg you, mortals - FLEE! Flee before I lose all sense of control! The black fire rages within my heart! I MUST- release it! ',14,0,100,0,0,8282,0,9887,0,'vaelastrasz SAY_LINE2'),(13020,2,0,'FLAME! DEATH! DESTRUCTION! Cower, mortals before the wrath of Lord...NO - I MUST fight this! Alexstrasza help me, I MUST fight it! ',14,0,100,0,0,8283,0,9888,0,'vaelastrasz SAY_LINE3'),(13020,3,0,'Nefarius\' hate has made me stronger than ever before! You should have fled while you could, mortals! The fury of Blackrock courses through my veins! \n',14,0,100,0,0,8285,0,9965,0,'vaelastrasz SAY_HALFLIFE'),(13020,4,0,'Forgive me, $n! Your death only adds to my failure! ',14,0,100,0,0,8284,0,9964,0,'vaelastrasz SAY_KILLTARGET'),(11261,0,0,'The doctor is in!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6715,0,'Doctor Theolen Krastinov SAY_AGGRO'),(14516,0,0,'ENOUGH - this ends now!  You fools will be added to my bone collection!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9784,0,'Death Knight Darkreaver'),(5391,4,0,'%s whispers to $n the secret to opening his strongbox.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2076,0,'Galen Goodward'),(5391,3,0,'Thank you, $n.  I will remember you always.  You can find my strongbox in my camp, north of Stonard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1855,0,'Galen Goodward'),(5391,2,0,'Let us leave this place.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1854,0,'Galen Goodward'),(5391,1,1,'Help!  Please, you must help me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7124,0,'Galen Goodward'),(5391,0,2,'Help!  The beast is on me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1630,0,'Galen Goodward'),(5391,1,0,'I\'m glad you\'re here!  Because I need your help!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1631,0,'Galen Goodward'),(5391,0,1,'Help! I\'m under attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1629,0,'Galen Goodward'),(5391,0,0,'Look out!  The $n attacks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1628,0,'Galen Goodward'),(646,0,0,'We\'re under attack! Avast, ye swabs! Repel the invaders!',14,0,100,0,0,5777,0,1149,0,'smite SAY_AGGRO'),(21249,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(23285,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(22082,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'Shadowmoon Slayer'),(20795,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(21060,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(21061,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(19799,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(22017,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(46963,1,0,'My new life was just beginning...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Death Text'),(46964,2,0,'I thank you for the clearn death.I would not of done the same... ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Death Text'),(46963,0,0,'Even here I find myself beset by fools!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(46964,0,0,'That bitch Sylvanas sent you too,did she?No matter,your journey ends in agony.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(46964,1,0,'Lord Godfrey begins to cast Pistol Barrage!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Cast Text'),(46962,4,0,'I grow tired of this hunt... Time to die!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Cast Text'),(46962,5,0,'Killed by lowly commoners,how droll... ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Death Text'),(4422,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(4516,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(28940,5,0,'I know very litte else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There\'\'s nothing else... You must believe me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29152,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,6,0,'LIES! The pain you are about to endure will be talked about for years to come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29163,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,7,0,'NO! PLEASE! There is one more thing that I forgot to mention... A courier comes soon... From Hearthglen. It...',12,0,100,431,0,0,0,29153,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,8,1,'Tell me what you know about \"Crimson Dawn\" or the beatings will continue!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29134,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,8,2,'I\'m through being courteous with your kind, human! What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29135,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,8,4,'I can keep this up for a very long time, Scarlet dog! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn!\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29137,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,8,5,'What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29133,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,8,6,'\"Crimson Dawn!\" What is it! Speak!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29136,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(4517,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(4514,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(4531,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(4532,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(4520,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(4530,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(15392,0,0,'Kill $N!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(8283,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(14622,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(5860,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(5862,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3887,1,0,'This death is only a temporary respite from my curse.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Death Text'),(4278,0,0,'Intruders in the keep!To arms!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(4278,1,0,'Repel the intruders!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Battle Text'),(4278,2,0,'Our vigilance is eternal...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Death Text'),(46962,0,0,'Tally ho! the hunt begins!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(46962,1,0,'This is just too easy...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Cast Text'),(46962,2,0,'Baron Ashbury begins to cast Stay of Execution!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Cast Text'),(46962,3,0,'HA!Let\'s at least keep it interesting.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Cast Text'),(4421,3,0,'You outsiders will pay for encroaching on our land!',14,0,100,0,0,5815,0,0,0,'combat Text'),(28912,5,0,'I can\'t keep this barrier up much longer... Where is that coward?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29208,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,6,0,'The High Inquisitor comes! Be ready, death knight! Do not let him draw you out of the protective bounds of my anti-magic field! Kill him and take his head!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29210,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,7,0,'Stay in the anti-magic field! Make them come to you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29225,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,8,0,'The death of the High Inquisitor of New Avalon will not go unnoticed. You need to get out of here at once! Go, before more of them show up. I\'ll be fine on my own.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29239,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,9,0,'I\'ll draw their fire, you make your escape behind me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29240,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,10,0,'Your High Inquisitor is nothing more than a pile of meat, Crusaders! There are none beyond the grasp of the Scourge!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,29241,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28471,0,5,'Let us see what atrocity we can pull from the shadow realm this time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29695,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28471,1,0,'Skeletal mages. A perfect opportunity to display the utility of some of our powers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29796,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28471,0,4,'There are many lessons left to learn, let us move onto our next subject...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29793,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28912,11,0,'Stand your ground! Use my anti-magic barrier to dampen their spells!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,29224,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(29080,0,2,'Let $g him:her; through! Quickly, courier, to the High General!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29423,0,'Scarlet Champion'),(29193,3,0,'Please! Spare me! I...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29645,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),(29193,4,0,'You\'re a monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29644,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),(29193,5,0,'Is it too late to change my mind? How about you just kill me instead?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29643,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),(29110,0,15,'Lay down your arms and surrender your souls!',14,0,100,22,0,14802,0,29517,0,'The Lich King'),(28670,1,0,'Devour Scarlet Crusaders to replenish your energy!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,29889,0,'Frostbrood Vanquisher'),(29032,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29286,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,1,0,'You\'ll look me in the eyes when...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29287,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29288,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize those horns anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29289,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,4,0,'You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a tauren!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29290,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,5,0,'Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the rolling plains of Mulgore, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the tauren once! This isn\'t you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29294,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29295,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Mulgore. This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29301,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29302,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29032,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29303,0,'Malar Bravehorn'),(29061,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29310,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,1,0,'I\'d like to stand for...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29311,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29312,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29313,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,4,0,'You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a human!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29314,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,5,0,'Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the hills and valleys of Elwynn, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the Alliance once! This isn\'t you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29315,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29316,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Elwynn. This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29317,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29318,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29061,9,0,'%s dies from her injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29319,0,'Ellen Stanbridge'),(29065,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29331,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29065,9,0,'%s dies from her injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29333,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29110,0,13,'Cower before my terrible creations!',14,0,100,22,0,14800,0,29515,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,12,'Come to me, Crusaders. I will remake you!',14,0,100,22,0,14799,0,29514,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,11,'There is no Light. Only darkness!',14,0,100,22,0,14798,0,29513,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,8,'Where is your Light now, Crusaders?',14,0,100,22,0,14795,0,29510,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,9,'Bow before your king!',14,0,100,22,0,14796,0,29511,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,10,'The Light has abandoned you!',14,0,100,22,0,14797,0,29512,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,6,'Leave no survivors!',14,0,100,22,0,14793,0,29508,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,7,'Soon you will belong to the Scourge.',14,0,100,0,0,14794,0,29509,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,3,'This is the end!',14,0,100,22,0,14789,0,29503,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,4,'There is nowhere to run...',14,0,100,22,0,14791,0,29505,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,5,'Let the destruction of this place serve as a lesson to all those who would dare oppose the Scourge!',14,0,100,22,0,14792,0,29506,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,0,'Living or dead, you will serve me.',14,0,100,22,0,14786,0,28786,0,'The Lich King'),(29110,0,2,'Ravage the living, minions!',14,0,100,22,0,14788,0,29502,0,'The Lich King'),(172557,5,0,'Fall before the Lichsworn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lichsworn Guardian'),(172557,4,0,'More will rise... in my place...',12,0,100,0,0,153668,0,0,0,'Lichsworn Guardian'),(5677,0,0,'Interesting... Now this is more than I expected. Delicious...',12,8,100,0,0,0,0,1991,0,'Summoned Succubus'),(5676,0,0,'Who dares summon the power of the void?',12,8,100,0,0,0,0,1986,0,'Summoned Voidwalker'),(5676,1,0,'You will live forever in torment for this, pathetic warlock.',12,8,100,0,0,0,0,1987,0,'Summoned Voidwalker'),(169072,3,0,'ilisar\'thera\'nal!',12,0,100,1,0,161883,0,198487,0,'Tyrande Whisperwind'),(169072,2,0,'Rescue the others! The Banshee is mine to kill!',12,0,100,1,0,161881,0,198485,0,'Tyrande Whisperwind'),(169071,3,0,'We cannot lose you... to the darkness.',12,0,100,1,0,161884,0,201289,0,'Genn Greymane'),(169073,2,0,'Your courage will be remembered, champion. Al diel shala.',12,0,100,1,0,161879,0,198483,0,'Lor\'themar Theron'),(169071,1,0,'Find those who were taken and bring them home!',12,0,100,1,0,161880,0,198484,0,'Genn Greymane'),(169071,2,0,'Tyrande! Don\'t do this!',12,0,100,1,0,161882,0,198486,0,'Genn Greymane'),(169076,16,0,'The path opens!',12,0,100,1,0,161878,0,198482,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169070,5,0,'The Ebon Blade does not fear death. Here, or in realms beyond.',12,0,100,1,0,161874,0,198478,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(169076,14,0,'But there is no other course. Death comes to claim Azeroth. It falls to you to defend her.',12,0,100,1,0,161876,0,198480,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,15,0,'The time has come. Take up the shattered helm and we will open the rift.',12,0,100,1,0,161877,0,198481,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,13,0,'Living mortals were never intended to cross beyond the veil. Where you are going, you may be unable to return.',12,0,100,1,0,161875,0,198479,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,12,0,'To aid in this task, the Knights of the Ebon Blade shall lend you their strength. Darion Mograine has volunteered to fight at your side.',12,0,100,1,0,161873,0,198477,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,10,0,'But this threat cannot be left unchecked. Therefore, you must venture where I cannot.',12,0,100,1,0,161871,0,198475,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,11,0,'The dangers you face will be considerable. Alone, you may well be outmatched.',12,0,100,1,0,161872,0,198476,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,8,0,'It is that very presence I sense lurking beyond the shattered sky above.',12,0,100,1,0,161869,0,198473,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,9,0,'I dare not travel with you. Even free of the helm, I fear I would become bound to the will of its true master.',12,0,100,1,0,161870,0,198474,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,7,0,'I could sense a dark presence at the edge of my consciousness. Not Arthas... not Ner\'zhul. Something... else.',12,0,100,1,0,161868,0,198472,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,5,0,'Place the Shards of Domination around the circle of runes. Then the ritual can begin.',12,0,100,1,0,161866,0,198470,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,6,0,'When the helm rested upon my head, it took all my will to keep its insidious power in check. Many times, I nearly faltered.',12,0,100,1,0,161867,0,198471,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,4,0,'That is where you must go, if you are to save those Sylvanas has taken. Together, we can open the way.',12,0,100,1,0,161865,0,198469,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,3,0,'During my vigil upon the Frozen Throne, I caught fleeting glimpses into the realms of Death. Among them, I saw a place of inescapable darkness.',12,0,100,1,0,161864,0,198468,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(5634,6,0,'So, $n, I\'m ready to tell you what happened in the Swamp of Sorrows. Hiccup!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1956,0,'Rhapsody Shindigger'),(169076,2,0,'When the Banshee shattered the helm, it tore a gaping wound through the veil between our world and the Shadowlands.',12,0,100,1,0,161863,0,198467,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(5634,5,0,'One more sip of the ol\' fire water and I\'ll be ready to talk. Hiccup! Cheers!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1955,0,'Rhapsody Shindigger'),(5634,2,0,'%s chugs his drink.',16,0,100,92,0,0,0,1952,0,'Rhapsody Shindigger'),(5634,3,0,'Hiccup!',12,7,100,34,0,0,0,1953,0,'Rhapsody Shindigger'),(5634,4,0,'Ok, who pushed me down? Was it you, $n? Someone turn the lights back on. Hiccup!',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,1954,0,'Rhapsody Shindigger'),(5634,0,0,'Time to brew up a Kalimdor Kocktail! Hiccup!',12,7,100,4,0,0,0,1950,0,'Rhapsody Shindigger'),(5634,1,0,'That should do it! Hiccup!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1951,0,'Rhapsody Shindigger'),(169076,0,0,'Enough! The war is over. We can ill afford to start another.',12,0,100,1,0,161857,0,198465,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169076,1,0,'A far more pressing threat is at hand, and we must prepare to face it.',12,0,100,1,0,161858,0,198466,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(169072,1,0,'You dare speak to me of peace? After the atrocities your kind inflicted?!',12,0,100,1,0,161856,0,198464,0,'Tyrande Whisperwind'),(169071,0,0,'I too want Sylvanas to answer for her crimes. But Lor\'themar is right. Anduin wouldn\'t want us to risk the well-being of the Alliance for his sake.',12,0,100,1,0,161854,0,198462,0,'Genn Greymane'),(169075,0,0,'The kaldorei need you if they are to have any hope of finding peace, High Priestess.',12,0,100,1,0,161855,0,198463,0,'Calia Menethil '),(169072,0,0,'Coward! I would pay any price to see the Banshee impaled upon my glaive!',12,0,100,1,0,161853,0,198461,0,'Tyrande Whisperwind'),(169073,0,0,'...the peace remains tenuous. These are troubled times. Our people need stability--Alliance and Horde alike.',12,0,100,1,0,161851,0,198459,0,'Lor\'themar Theron'),(169073,1,0,'We cannot risk sending Azeroth\'s leaders on what might well be a suicide mission. Our friends who were abducted would offer the same counsel.',12,0,100,1,0,161852,0,198460,0,'Lor\'themar Theron'),(169070,3,0,'Bolvar believes he knows where the Banshee has taken those she abducted.',12,0,100,1,0,161849,0,202373,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(169070,4,0,'He awaits you at the Frozen Throne. The leaders of the Alliance and Horde have gathered with him.',12,0,100,1,0,161850,0,198816,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(169070,2,0,'But shattering the helm also freed Bolvar Fordragon from the burden of being the Lich King.',12,0,100,1,0,161848,0,198815,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(169070,0,0,'Before her minions abducted key leaders, the Banshee Queen attacked Icecrown. She cut a path to the Frozen Throne and seized the Helm of Domination.',12,0,100,1,0,161846,0,198813,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(169070,1,0,'Look to the sky and you will see the results of her actions. I... have never beheld anything like this.',12,0,100,1,0,161847,0,198814,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(176554,5,0,'Acherus, the stronghold of the Ebon Blade, has moved to Icecrown Citadel. My death gate will take us there.',12,0,100,1,0,164951,0,201075,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine2'),(176554,6,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon has recovered from his battle with Sylvanas Windrunner. He awaits us, along with our allies.',12,0,100,1,0,164953,0,204225,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(176554,4,0,'Deathlord! Preparations have been made.',12,0,100,1,0,164950,0,204223,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine2'),(176554,2,0,'Nazgrim will tell you of the grim fate that has befallen our allies.',12,0,100,1,0,164954,0,204226,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine(ogrima)'),(176554,3,0,'We have ordered that Acherus be moved just outside Icecrown Citadel. Allow me to open a death gate for us.',12,0,100,1,0,164952,0,204224,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine1'),(176554,1,0,'Whitemane will tell you of the grim fate that has befallen our allies.',12,0,100,1,0,164955,0,204227,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine(stormwind)'),(178580,3,0,'This conductor is a shoddy piece of work!',12,0,100,0,0,181173,0,210999,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(176554,0,0,'Champion! Preparations have been made.',12,0,100,1,0,164949,0,201074,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine1'),(178580,2,0,'Handle that devourer while I finish the repairs!',14,0,100,0,0,181172,0,209749,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(45253,3,0,'As you wish.',12,0,100,1,0,112122,0,153315,0,'Genn Greymane to Player'),(178580,1,0,'Hmm. That\'s not good.',12,0,100,0,0,181171,0,209748,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(45253,2,0,'Hmph. Steady as ever.',12,0,100,1,0,112121,0,153311,0,'Genn Greymane to Player'),(29067,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have ye?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29335,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,1,0,'Well this son o\' Ironforge would like...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29336,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29337,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to ye, $g lad:lass;?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29338,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,4,0,'Ye don\'t remember me, do ye? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain ye o\' everything that made ye a righteous force o\' reckoning. Every last ounce o\' good... Everything that made ye a $g son:daughter; o\' Ironforge!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29339,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,5,0,'Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the snow capped mountains o\' Dun Morogh! Ye were born there, $g lad:lass;. Remember the splendor o\' life, $n! Ye were a champion o\' the dwarves once! This isn\'t ye!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29340,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. Ye must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He\'s a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use ye to accomplish his goals. Ye were once a hero and ye can be again. Fight, damn ye! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29341,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... For KHAAAAAAAAZZZ MODAAAAAANNNNNN!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29342,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29343,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29067,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29344,0,'Donovan Pulfrost'),(29068,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29347,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,1,0,'If you\'d allow me just one...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29348,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29349,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29350,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,4,0,'You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a pint-sized force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a gnome!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29351,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,5,0,'Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember Gnomeregan before those damned troggs! Remember the feel of an arclight spanner, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of gnome-kind once! This isn\'t you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29352,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29353,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Gnomeregan! This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29354,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29355,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(29068,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29356,0,'Goby Blastenheimer'),(82624,1,0,'Stop them!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13822,0,'Grommash Hellscream to Player'),(85141,0,0,'Set us free!',14,0,100,0,0,43877,0,81227,0,'Frostwolf Slave to Player'),(78568,0,0,'You do the fighting and IÂ´ll do the fixin.Now letÂ´s get up on that tank!',12,0,100,0,0,45747,0,83778,0,'Thaelin Darkanvil to Player'),(78558,2,0,'Hold that front! Our work is nearly done!',14,0,100,0,0,44884,0,84590,0,'Archmage Khadgar to Player'),(78558,3,0,'Use whatever means are necessary, champion. Azeroth\'s final hope lies with you.',12,0,100,1,0,44873,0,84516,0,'Archmage Khadgar to Player'),(78554,2,0,'KHADGAR! INCOMING!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vindicator Maraad'),(78558,1,0,'Look! The portal grows weaker!',14,0,100,0,0,44883,0,84589,0,'Archmage Khadgar to Player'),(78529,0,0,'Help us!',14,0,100,0,0,43876,0,41118,0,'Frostwolf Slave to Player'),(78553,1,0,'FURY OF EARTH, GRANT ME YOUR STRENGTH!',14,0,100,0,0,46399,0,84213,0,'Thrall to Khadgar Shield Target'),(78333,3,0,'The bonds weaken. Freedom will be mine!',12,0,100,0,0,45333,0,83282,0,'Gul\'dan to Player'),(78510,0,0,'Give me your blood...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,81241,0,'Bleeding Hollow Hatchet to Player'),(149540,0,0,'You need a Darkmoon Ride Ticket to use the roller coaster.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,168931,0,'Mae Ti to Player'),(78333,1,0,'Yes... Yes!',12,0,100,0,0,45332,0,83259,0,'Gul\'dan to Player'),(78333,2,0,'Grommash will pay for his arrogance.',12,0,100,0,0,45334,0,83260,0,'Gul\'dan to Player'),(56041,0,0,'|cFFFF0000BEWARE:|r Moonfang Dreadhowls now prowl the woods!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,74594,0,'Rona Greenteeth to Player'),(120928,0,0,'If you\'re interested in gettin\' down, the Blight Boar concert starts in twenty!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,130632,0,'Jay Maguire'),(55266,1,0,'Tokens! Tokens! Tokens!',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,53661,0,'Zina Sharpworth to Player'),(55339,0,0,'Tokens! Tokens! Tokens!',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,53661,0,'Trixi Sharpworth to Player'),(55396,0,0,'Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,52979,0,'Darkmoon Faire Greeter to Player'),(55103,0,0,'Try your rod against the crafty darkmoon daggermaw today!',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,95550,0,'Galissa Sundew to Player'),(55264,0,0,'Hurry, hurry, hurry! Step right up and purchase your game tokens!',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,53666,0,'Sazz Coincatcher to Player'),(55266,0,0,'Step right up and get your game tokens!',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,53660,0,'Zina Sharpworth to Player'),(54596,0,0,'D\'you think it\'s from a dragon? Or maybe a giant!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,53061,0,'Raan'),(54601,0,0,'Hammer swingin\' fun! Who wants to swing a hammer?',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,53471,0,'Mola to Player'),(14841,0,0,'Test your aim! Test your aim!',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,53452,0,'Rinling to Player'),(15303,0,0,'Cannon blast!  Who wants to get shot out of a cannon?',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,53466,0,'Maxima Blastenheimer to Player'),(14828,0,0,'Prizes!  Get your prizes right here!  Get over here and turn in your Darkmoon Prize Tickets for valuable prizes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10152,0,'Gelvas Grimegate'),(178988,3,0,'Another trap. Hmm.',12,0,100,0,0,180641,0,0,0,'Spirit Tracker'),(10445,0,0,'Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,53804,0,'Selina Dourman - Welcome Random text'),(178988,1,0,'A trap, as expected. Be wary, $p.',12,0,100,0,0,180640,0,210501,0,'Huln Highmountain to Player'),(178988,2,0,'Someone does not wish to be found.',12,0,100,0,0,180643,0,210504,0,'Huln Highmountain to Player'),(177731,0,0,'I will be reanimated.',12,0,100,0,0,149095,0,189018,0,'Zelmany to Khaliiq'),(178277,0,0,'We control these lands!',12,0,100,0,0,150495,0,0,0,'Shrouded Marauder'),(178282,0,0,'Nowhere to hide!',12,0,100,0,0,151407,0,181033,0,'Crazed Ash Ghoul to Player'),(29070,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29357,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,1,0,'You\'ll look me in the eyes when...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29358,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29359,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize those face tentacles anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29360,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,4,0,'You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a draenei!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29361,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,5,0,'Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the proud mountains of Argus, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the draenei once! This isn\'t you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29362,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29363,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Argus. Don\'t let that happen to this world.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29364,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29365,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(29070,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29366,0,'Valok the Righteous'),(49356,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49388,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,49389,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Kezan, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49387,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49386,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,5,0,'Remember the goblin that you once were, $g brother:sister;! You were my best friend! Fight this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49385,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,4,0,'You don\'t remember me, $n? I lost count of the number of jobs you and I ran back in the day on Kezan. Then I picked up a real bad Kaja\'Cola habit and you saved me! It was you who took me to Kalimdor to join the Steamwheedle Cartel. You were the only good goblin I knew. That\'s how I ended up in the Argent Dawn, because I knew it was what you woulda done. How could this have happened to you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49384,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49382,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49383,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,0,0,'C... can\'t we work this out somehow?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49380,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49356,1,0,'Alright, j... just let me... let me st... stand up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49381,0,'Gally Lumpstain'),(49355,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49377,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,49378,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Gilneas, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49376,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49375,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,5,0,'Remember the worgen that you once were, $g brother:sister;! You were our savior! Fight this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49374,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,4,0,'You don\'t remember me? We were both servants of Arugal back in Silverpine Forest. We put up with his merciless torture for ages. It was you who saved me on that fateful night when we escaped Shadowfang Keep. Without you I would have died. YOU! The most noble worgen I ever knew. What have they done to you, $n? How could this have happened?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49372,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49370,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49371,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,1,0,'Do it while I\'m standing...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49369,0,'Lord Harford'),(49355,0,0,'He\'s sent one of his cowards in to kill me, has he?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49368,0,'Lord Harford'),(29074,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29368,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,1,0,'You\'ll look me in the eyes when...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29369,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29372,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29370,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,4,0,'You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you a blood elf!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29373,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,5,0,'Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember the majestic halls of Silvermoon City, where you were born. Remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the sin\'dorei once! This isn\'t you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29374,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29375,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Silvermoon. This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29376,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29377,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29074,9,0,'%s dies from her injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29378,0,'Lady Eonys'),(29072,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29383,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,1,0,'I want to die like an orc...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29384,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29385,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29386,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,4,0,'You don\'t remember me, do you? Blasted Scourge... They\'ve tried to drain you of everything that made you a righteous force of reckoning. Every last ounce of good... Everything that made you an orc!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29387,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,5,0,'Think, $n. Think back. Try and remember Durotar, $g brother:sister;! Remember the sacrifices our heroes made so that we could be free of the blood curse. Harken back to the Valley of Trials, where we were reborn into a world without demonic influence. We found the splendor of life, $n. Together! This isn\'t you. You were a champion of the Horde once!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29388,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29389,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... For the Horde! This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29390,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29391,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29072,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29392,0,'Kug Ironjaw'),(29073,0,0,'Come ta finish da job, mon?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29403,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,1,0,'Dis troll gonna stand for da...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29404,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,2,0,'$n? Mon?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29405,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize dem tusks anywhere... What... What have dey done ta you, mon?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29406,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,4,0,'You don\'t remember me, mon? Damn da Scourge! Dey gone ta drain you of everytin\' dat made ya a mojo masta. Every last ounce a good... Everytin\' dat made ya a troll hero, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29407,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,5,0,'TINK, $n. Tink back, mon! We be Darkspear, mon! Bruddas and sistas! Remember when we fought da Zalazane and done took he head and freed da Echo Isles? MON! TINK! You was a champion of da Darkspear trolls!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29408,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,6,0,'Listen ta me, $g brudda:sista;. You must fight against da Lich King\'s control. He be a monster dat want ta see dis world - our world - be ruined. Don\'t let he use you ta accomplish he goals. You be a hero once and you be a hero again! Fight it, mon! Fight he control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29409,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,7,0,'Der... Der\'s no more time for me. I be done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or dey\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Sen\'jin Village, mon! Dis world be worth saving!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29410,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out a me misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29411,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(29073,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29412,0,'Iggy Darktusk'),(45253,1,0,'Jaina, you\'re the reason they left the Alliance.',12,0,100,1,0,110935,0,156714,0,'Genn Greymane to Player'),(45253,0,0,'Impossible! It\'s one of Sylvanas\'s tricks. It has to be...',12,0,100,1,0,110927,0,156708,0,'Genn Greymane to Player'),(139636,4,0,'And a massive Zandalari fleet.',12,0,100,1,0,110926,0,156707,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(139636,5,0,'Jaina, perhaps you could help us see what this survivor has witnessed.',12,0,100,1,0,110928,0,156701,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(139636,3,0,'Survivors say they encountered strange and terrifying magics.',12,0,100,1,0,110925,0,156706,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(139636,2,0,'Only one returned.',12,0,100,1,0,110924,0,156705,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(139636,1,0,'A princess. And a prophet.',12,0,100,1,0,110922,0,156703,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(120756,9,0,'And please... look after Jaina.',12,0,100,1,0,112925,0,153314,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(139636,0,0,'Recently, Horde agents broke into the Stockades and freed two Zandalari prisoners.',12,0,100,1,0,110921,0,156702,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(120756,6,0,'So, Genn... how are your sea legs?',12,0,100,1,0,112922,0,153306,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(120756,7,0,'Take a 7th Legion vessel along as an escort.',12,0,100,1,0,112923,0,153312,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(120756,8,0,'Secure a base of operations in Kul Tiras. Our plan must not fail.',12,0,100,1,0,112924,0,153313,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(120756,4,0,'It will be difficult... and dangerous.',12,0,100,1,0,110938,0,156717,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(120756,5,0,'Be careful, Jaina. Light be with you.',12,0,100,1,0,110940,0,156719,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(120756,2,0,'If the Horde makes allies of the Zandalari, we won\'t have the power to stop them.',12,0,100,274,0,110931,0,156709,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(120756,3,0,'I believe it is... and I believe you can.',12,0,100,1,0,110937,0,156716,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(120756,0,0,'Everyone is here. What news do you bring, Spymaster?',12,0,100,1,0,110920,0,156699,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(120756,1,0,'I\'m aware. What of the eight warships we sent in pursuit?',12,0,100,1,0,110923,0,156704,0,'Anduin Wrynn to Player'),(66564,3,0,'I thought I was a goner.I owe you my life.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(227273,0,0,'I hope to learn much from you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(66564,2,0,'Thank you.Time to lick my wounds and get back to the fight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(120590,0,0,'I must prepare my ship. Champion, meet me in the harbor when you are ready to depart.',12,0,100,1,0,112107,1,129944,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore to Player'),(39351,0,0,'You\'ll soon learn that lightning and water don\'t mix!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,40904,0,'Ghislania'),(66564,0,0,'Than you,friend.DonÂ´t worry.It was just a scratch.Now I feel good as new!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(66564,1,0,'IÂ´m alive?Ha!ThatÂ´s more than I can say for those Horde.We tore them up good.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(107574,0,0,'People of Stormwind! Citizens of the Alliance! Your king speaks!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31675,0,'anduin_wrynn_q13188'),(107574,1,0,'Today marks the first of many defeats for the Scourge! Death knights, once in service of the Lich King, have broken free of his grasp and formed a new alliance against his tyranny!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31676,0,'anduin_wrynn_q13188'),(107574,2,0,'You will welcome these former heroes of the Alliance and treat them with the respect that you would give to any ally of Stormwind!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31677,0,'anduin_wrynn_q13188'),(172860,2,0,'Get going! I don\'t have all eternity... Okay I do. But I don\'t want to spend it with YOU.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Ripened Laborer to Player'),(172860,3,0,'How would YOU like it if you were dragged around by your neck? If I were a lil\' bit taller...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Ripened Laborer to Player'),(172715,0,0,'The Master will not be questioned!',12,0,100,0,0,150661,0,181022,0,'Muckpool Investigator to Ripened Laborer'),(172860,1,0,'Work work work... It\'s all we do. Bah... take me to the problem.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ripened Laborer to Player'),(172007,0,0,'Perfect, this will suit me nicely.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Teliah to Teliah'),(172713,0,0,'We will break you, like all the rest!',12,0,100,0,0,150667,0,181025,0,'Muckpool Vandal to Ripened Laborer'),(172713,1,0,'A worthy subject! Let us begin!',12,0,100,0,0,150660,0,181021,0,'Muckpool Vandal to Ripened Laborer'),(169787,0,0,'Please... take my blessing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(24131,3,0,'What? I\'m just sayin\' that\'s how we do things in Grizzly Hills.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23551,0,'Trapper Jethan'),(24131,2,0,'Why not? Just think how much better it\'ll look with the hatchlings to either side --',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,23549,0,'Trapper Jethan'),(18760,3,0,'Alright, let\'s do this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15884,0,'Isla Starmane'),(169785,0,0,'Are... you... real?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(169785,1,0,'Please... take my blessing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(169785,2,0,'Can you... hear me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(169716,2,0,'The last of my strength... is yours.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(169716,0,0,'Someone! Anyone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(169716,1,0,'Somebody save me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(168098,0,0,'You... shall rot... in chains...',12,0,100,0,0,149306,0,188475,0,'Empowered Coldheart Agent to Player'),(169716,3,0,'I... do not... deserve this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(156226,0,0,'We... are all... prisoners...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(166282,0,0,'NOT AGAIN! MUCK IS RABBL\'N!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Muckmaster Rotjaw to Player'),(168003,0,0,'Suffer the Jailer\'s wrath!',12,0,100,0,0,149326,0,188486,0,'Empowered Coldheart Ascendant to Player'),(156219,0,0,'The Jailer will have his prize!',12,0,100,0,0,149350,0,0,0,''),(156219,1,0,'Accursed... mortal...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(156219,2,0,'Your actions... are futile...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(156226,1,0,'Behold true despair!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(22252,1,0,'Time for eating!?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21118,0,'Dragonmaw Peon'),(22252,0,2,'Long live the Dragonmaw! Die you worthless $r!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,1939,0,'Dragonmaw Peon'),(18760,4,0,'Ok, I think I can make it on my own from here.  Thank you so much for breaking me out of there!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15887,0,'Isla Starmane'),(22252,0,0,'For the Dragonmaw!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,1937,0,'Dragonmaw Peon'),(22252,0,1,'Your bones will break under my boot, $r!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,1938,0,'Dragonmaw Peon'),(24139,1,0,'Maybe after everything dies down, you and I can make a deal with some of the surplus. I\'m sure the troops will give your people plenty of business as they head into the Grizzly Hills.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22939,0,'Gil Grisert'),(24139,2,0,'Y\'hear that, Jethan? You\'re not getting that Steelfeather trophy now that we know she\'s a mother.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23548,0,'Gil Grisert'),(156213,0,0,'Abandon... hope...',12,0,100,0,0,149330,0,0,0,''),(24139,0,0,'Much as I\'d like to do business with you, Jethan, all this stuff is the property of the Alliance expeditionary forces.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,22938,0,'Gil Grisert'),(156212,1,0,'Such... futility...',12,0,100,25,0,149313,0,188478,0,'Coldheart Agent to Player'),(22252,1,2,'Me so hungry! YUM!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21120,0,'Dragonmaw Peon'),(156159,0,0,'Darkness awaits you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(156212,0,0,'The Maw... claims... all...',12,0,100,0,0,149303,0,188473,0,'Coldheart Agent to Player'),(34015,0,0,'%s crackles and surges with raw energy!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34085,0,'Tempest Warder'),(24139,3,0,'Jethan!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,23550,0,'Gil Grisert'),(156157,0,0,'Perish in darkness!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(156157,1,0,'Abandon... hope...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(156157,2,0,'Suffer the Jailer\'s wrath!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(156157,3,0,'The Jailer... speaks true...',12,0,100,0,0,149334,0,0,0,''),(29071,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29393,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,1,0,'Ironic, isn\'t it? To be killed...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29394,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29395,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that decay anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29396,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,4,0,'You don\'t remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to a Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29397,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,5,0,'A pact was made, $g brother:sister;! We vowed vengeance against the Lich King! For what he had done to us! We battled the Scourge as Forsaken, pushing them back into the Plaguelands and freeing Tirisifal! You and I were champions of the Forsaken!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29398,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals - AGAIN. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29399,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Tirisfal! This world is worth saving!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29400,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,8,0,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29401,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29071,9,0,'%s dies from his injuries.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29402,0,'Antoine Brack'),(29053,0,0,'What\'s going on in there? What\'s taking so long, $n?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29382,0,'Knight Commander Plaguefist'),(29173,15,0,'Tirion!',14,0,100,0,0,14709,0,29801,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,16,0,'So too do the Knights of the Ebon Blade. Although our kind has no place in your world, we will fight to bring an end to the Lich King. This I vow!',12,0,100,0,0,14710,0,29851,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,14,0,'That day is not today...',12,0,100,0,0,14708,0,29824,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,13,0,'You... betrayed me. You betrayed us all, monster! Face the might of Mograine!',14,0,100,0,0,14707,0,29781,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,12,0,'Argh... what... is...',12,0,100,0,0,14702,0,29768,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,10,0,'Minions, come to my aid!',12,0,100,0,0,14698,0,29742,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,11,0,'Father!',12,0,100,5,0,14701,0,29767,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29176,0,0,'Scourge armies approach!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29724,0,'Korfax, Champion of the Light'),(29178,0,0,'Stand fast, brothers and sisters! The Light will prevail!',14,0,100,0,0,14487,0,29723,0,'Lord Maxwell Tyrosus'),(29173,9,0,'Save your breath, old man. It might be the last you ever draw.',12,0,100,397,0,14700,0,29761,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,8,0,'Stand down, death knights. We have lost. The Light... this place... no hope...',12,0,100,0,0,14699,0,29760,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,7,6,'Ashbringer defies me...',12,0,100,0,0,14697,0,29741,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,7,5,'Power... wanes...',12,0,100,0,0,14696,0,29740,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,7,4,'What is happening to me?',12,0,100,0,0,14695,0,29739,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,7,3,'I... I cannot... The blade fights me...',12,0,100,0,0,14694,0,29738,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,7,2,'You will do as I command! I am in control here!',12,0,100,0,0,14693,0,29737,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,7,1,'OBEY ME, BLADE!',14,0,100,0,0,14692,0,29736,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,7,0,'What is this?! My... I cannot strike...',12,0,100,0,0,14691,0,29735,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,6,7,'Spare no one!',12,0,100,0,0,14690,0,29734,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,6,6,'The Argent Dawn is finished!',12,0,100,0,0,14689,0,29733,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,6,5,'How much longer will your forces hold out?',12,0,100,0,0,14688,0,29732,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29175,12,0,'I make a promise to you now, brothers and sisters: the Lich King will be defeated! On this day, I call for a union.',12,0,100,5,0,14597,0,29847,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,13,0,'The Argent Dawn and the Order of the Silver Hand will come together as one! We will succeed where so many before us have failed!\n',12,0,100,5,0,14598,0,29848,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,11,0,'The Lich King must answer for what he has done, and must not be allowed to cause further destruction in our world.',12,0,100,15,0,14596,0,29846,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,10,0,'And while such things can never be forgotten, we must remain vigilant in our cause!\n',12,0,100,1,0,14595,0,29845,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29173,6,4,'Life is meaningless without suffering!',12,0,100,0,0,14687,0,29731,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29227,4,0,'Do not forget...',12,0,100,1,0,14497,0,29778,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(29173,6,3,'Your life is forfeit.',12,0,100,0,0,14686,0,62815,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29228,4,0,'%s becomes a shade of his past, and walks up to his father.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darion Mograine'),(29228,3,0,'If I die, Father, I would rather it be on my feet, standing in defiance against the undead legions! If I die, let me die with you!',12,0,100,1,0,14706,0,29776,0,'Darion Mograine'),(29227,3,0,'My son, there will come a day when you will command the Ashbringer and, with it, mete out justice across this land. I have no doubt that when that day finally comes, you will bring pride to our people and that Lordaeron will be a better place because of you. But, my son, that day is not today.\n',12,0,100,1,0,14496,0,29777,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(29228,2,0,'Father, I wish to join you in the war against the undead. I want to fight! I can sit idle no longer!',12,0,100,1,0,14705,0,29774,0,'Darion Mograine'),(29227,2,0,'Darion Mograine, you are barely of age to hold a sword, let alone battle the undead hordes of Lordaeron! I could not bear losing you. Even the thought...\n',12,0,100,1,0,14495,0,29775,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(29227,1,0,'Nothing could have kept me away from here, Darion. Not from my home and family.',12,0,100,1,0,14494,0,29773,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(29173,6,2,'The Scourge will destroy this place!',12,0,100,0,0,14685,0,29729,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29183,9,0,'When next we meet, it won\'t be on holy ground, paladin.',14,0,100,0,0,14812,0,29827,0,'The Lich King'),(29183,7,0,'Impossible...',14,0,100,0,0,14810,0,38080,0,'The Lich King'),(29183,8,0,'This... is not over!',14,0,100,0,0,14811,0,29826,0,'The Lich King'),(29183,5,0,'APOCALYPSE!',14,0,100,0,0,14808,0,38049,0,'The Lich King'),(29183,6,0,'What is this?',14,0,100,0,0,14809,0,32584,0,'The Lich King'),(29178,1,0,'ATTACK!!',14,0,100,0,0,14488,0,29787,0,'Lord Maxwell Tyrosus'),(29173,6,1,'You stand no chance!',12,0,100,0,0,14684,0,29728,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,6,0,'Kneel before the Highlord!',12,0,100,0,0,14683,0,29727,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29175,9,0,'We have all been witness to a terrible tragedy. The blood of good men has been shed upon this soil! Honorable knights, slain defending their lives -- our lives!',12,0,100,1,0,14594,0,29843,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29183,4,0,'How simple it was to draw the great Tirion Fordring out of hiding. You\'ve left yourself exposed, paladin. Nothing will save you.',12,0,100,0,0,14807,0,29785,0,'The Lich King'),(29183,3,0,'You were right, Fordring. I did send them in to die. Their lives are meaningless, but yours...',12,0,100,0,0,14806,0,29784,0,'The Lich King'),(29175,8,0,'Rise, Darion, and listen...\n',12,0,100,1,0,14593,0,29835,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,6,0,'ARTHAS!!!!',14,0,100,15,0,14591,0,29803,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,7,0,'Your end.',14,0,100,0,0,14592,0,29861,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,5,0,'You\'re a damned monster, Arthas!',12,0,100,25,0,14589,0,29783,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,4,0,'What you are feeling right now is the anguish of a thousand lost souls! Souls that you and your master brought here! The Light will tear you apart, Darion!',12,0,100,1,0,14588,0,29746,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,3,0,'Your master knows what lies beneath the chapel. That is why he dares not show his face! He\'s sent you and your death knights to meet their doom, Darion.',12,0,100,25,0,14587,0,29745,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,2,0,'Have you learned nothing, boy? You have become all that your father fought against! Like that coward, Arthas, you allowed yourself to be consumed by the darkness, the hate... feeding upon the misery of those you tortured and killed!',12,0,100,1,0,14586,0,29744,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29173,5,0,'The skies turn red with the blood of the fallen! The Lich King watches over us, minions! Leave only ashes and misery in your destructive wake!',14,0,100,0,0,14682,0,29722,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,4,0,'RISE!',14,0,100,0,0,14680,0,31198,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29173,3,0,'Soldiers of the Scourge, death knights of Acherus, minions of the darkness: hear the call of the Highlord!',14,0,100,0,0,14679,0,29699,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29204,71,0,'%s flees.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29758,0,'Orbaz'),(29228,1,0,'You have been gone a long time, Father. I thought...',12,0,100,1,0,14704,0,29770,0,'Darion Mograine'),(29228,0,0,'Father, you have returned!',12,0,100,0,0,14703,0,29769,0,'Darion Mograine'),(29227,0,0,'My son! My dear, beautiful boy!',12,0,100,5,0,14493,0,29762,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(29173,2,0,'Death knights of Acherus, the death march begins!',14,0,100,0,0,14681,0,29697,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29183,1,0,'He is mine now...',12,0,100,0,0,14805,0,29780,0,'The Lich King'),(29183,2,0,'Pathetic...',12,0,100,0,0,14804,0,29782,0,'The Lich King'),(29173,1,0,'The sky weeps at the glorious devastation of these lands! Soon, Azeroth\'s futile tears will rain down upon us!',14,0,100,0,0,14678,0,29696,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(29175,0,0,'You cannot win, Darion!',14,0,100,0,0,14584,0,29743,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29175,1,0,'Bring them before the chapel!',14,0,100,25,0,14585,0,29756,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(29183,0,0,'Touching...',14,0,100,0,0,14803,0,29779,0,'The Lich King'),(29173,0,0,'Soldiers of the Scourge, stand ready! Prepare to unleash your fury upon the Argent Dawn!',14,0,100,0,0,14677,0,29694,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(10096,4,0,'You have been sentenced to death for crimes against the Dark Iron nation!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5441,0,'grimstone SCRIPT_TEXT1'),(10096,0,0,'The Sons of Thaurissan shall watch you perish in the Ring of the Law!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5442,0,'grimstone SCRIPT_TEXT2'),(10096,1,0,'Unleash the fury and let it be done!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5443,0,'grimstone SCRIPT_TEXT3'),(10096,5,0,'Haha! I bet you thought you were done!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5444,0,'grimstone SCRIPT_TEXT4'),(10096,2,0,'But your real punishment lies ahead.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5445,0,'grimstone SCRIPT_TEXT5'),(10096,3,0,'Good riddance!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5446,0,'grimstone SCRIPT_TEXT6'),(9499,0,0,'Drink up! There\'\'s more where that came from!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5307,0,'Plugger_Spazzring'),(9028,0,0,'%s goes into a killing frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24143,0,'grizzle EMOTE_FRENZY_KILL'),(9019,0,0,'Come to aid the Throne!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'dagran SAY_AGGRO'),(9019,1,0,'Hail to the king, baby!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5431,0,'dagran SAY_SLAY'),(16295,0,0,'Let\'s go.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12393,0,'Ranger Lilatha'),(16295,1,0,'$n, let\'s use the antechamber to the right.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12187,0,'Ranger Lilatha'),(16295,2,0,'I can see the light at the end of the tunnel!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12188,0,'Ranger Lilatha'),(16295,3,0,'There\'s Farstrider Enclave now, $c. Not far to go... look out!  Troll ambush!!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12189,0,'Ranger Lilatha'),(16295,4,0,'Thank you for saving my life and bringing me back to safety, $n!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12191,0,'Ranger Lilatha'),(16295,5,0,'Captain Helios, I\'ve been rescued from the Amani Catacombs. Reporting for duty, sir!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12190,0,'Ranger Lilatha'),(16295,6,0,'Hey!  Could you come over and get me out of this cage?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,13382,0,'Ranger Lilatha'),(17768,0,0,'This is... Silvermoon? My head... Next time Bloodvalor needs a volunteer, I\'ll point him in a different direction. Paragon of Blood Knight virtue, indeed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14367,0,'Blood Knight Stillblade'),(6182,0,0,'To the house! Stay close to me, no matter what! I have my gun and ammo there!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2360,0,'stilwell SAY_DS_START'),(6182,1,0,'We showed that one!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5269,0,'stilwell SAY_DS_DOWN_1'),(6182,2,0,'One more down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2369,0,'stilwell SAY_DS_DOWN_2'),(6182,3,0,'We\'ve done it! We won!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2358,0,'stilwell SAY_DS_DOWN_3'),(6182,4,0,'Meet me down by the orchard--I just need to put my gun away.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3090,0,'stilwell SAY_DS_PROLOGUE'),(467,0,0,'Follow me, $n. I\'ll take you to the Defias hideout. But you better protect me or I am as good as dead.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,9,0,'defias traitor SAY_START'),(467,1,0,'The entrance is hidden here in Moonbrook.  Keep your eyes peeled for thieves.  They want me dead.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,10,0,'defias traitor SAY_PROGRESS'),(467,2,0,'You can go tell Stoutmantle this is where the Defias Gang is holed up, $n.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,11,0,'defias traitor SAY_END'),(467,3,0,'$n coming in fast!  Prepare to fight!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,489,0,'defias traitor SAY_AGGRO_1'),(467,3,1,'Help!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,485,0,'defias traitor SAY_AGGRO_2'),(24744,0,0,'Drain... life!',14,0,100,0,0,12389,0,25623,0,'vexallus SAY_AGGRO'),(24744,1,0,'Un...con...tainable.',14,0,100,0,0,12392,0,25626,0,'vexallus SAY_ENERGY'),(24744,2,0,'Un...leash.',14,0,100,0,0,12390,0,25625,0,'vexallus SAY_OVERLOAD'),(24744,3,0,'Con...sume.',14,0,100,0,0,12393,0,25627,0,'vexallus SAY_KILL'),(24744,4,0,'Vexallus discharges pure energy!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,23752,0,'vexallus EMOTE_DISCHARGE_ENERGY'),(24664,0,0,'Don\'t look so smug! I know what you\'re thinking, but Tempest Keep was merely a setback. Did you honestly believe I would trust the future to some blind, half-night elf mongrel?',14,0,100,0,0,12413,0,25386,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Intro 1'),(24664,1,0,'Oh no, he was merely an instrument, a stepping stone to a much larger plan! It has all led to this... and this time you will not interfere!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25387,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Intro 2'),(24664,2,0,'I\'ll turn your world... upside... down.',14,0,100,0,0,12418,0,25390,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Gravity Lapse Intro 2'),(24664,3,0,'Do not get... too comfortable.',14,0,100,0,0,12420,0,25392,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider to Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Gravity lapse Intro 2'),(24664,4,0,'Master, grant me strength.',14,0,100,0,0,12419,0,25391,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider to Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Power Feedback'),(24664,5,0,'Vengeance burns!',14,0,100,0,0,12415,0,25388,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Summon Phoenix'),(24664,6,0,'%s begins to cast Pyroblast!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,20775,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Announce Pyroblast'),(24723,0,0,'You only waste my time!',14,0,100,0,0,12378,0,25423,0,'selin SAY_AGGRO'),(24723,1,0,'My hunger knows no bounds!',14,0,100,0,0,12381,0,25424,0,'selin SAY_ENERGY'),(24723,2,0,'Yes!! I am a god!',14,0,100,0,0,12382,0,25425,0,'selin SAY_EMPOWERED'),(24723,3,0,'Enough distractions!',14,0,100,0,0,12388,0,25428,0,'selin SAY_KILL_1'),(24723,3,1,'I am invincible!',14,0,100,0,0,12385,0,34142,0,'selin SAY_KILL_2'),(24723,4,0,'No... more, I must have more!!',14,0,100,0,0,12383,0,25426,0,'selin SAY_DEATH'),(24723,5,0,'%s begins to channel from the nearby Fel Crystal. Destroy it!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,23753,0,'selin EMOTE_CRYSTAL'),(24560,0,0,'Annihilate them.',14,0,100,0,0,12395,0,25430,0,'delrissa SAY_AGGRO'),(24560,1,0,'Oh, the horror!',14,0,100,0,0,12398,0,25432,0,'delrissa LackeyDeath1'),(24560,2,0,'Well aren\'t you lucky?',14,0,100,0,0,12400,0,25433,0,'delrissa LackeyDeath2'),(24560,3,0,'Now I\'m getting annoyed.',14,0,100,0,0,12401,0,25434,0,'delrissa LackeyDeath3'),(24560,4,0,'Lackeys be damned! I\'ll finish you myself!',14,0,100,0,0,12403,0,25435,0,'delrissa LackeyDeath4'),(24560,5,0,'I call that a good start.',14,0,100,0,0,12405,0,25436,0,'delrissa PlayerDeath1'),(24560,6,0,'I could have sworn there were more of you...',14,0,100,0,0,12407,0,25437,0,'delrissa PlayerDeath2'),(24560,7,0,'Not really much of a \"group\" anymore, is it?',14,0,100,0,0,12409,0,25438,0,'delrissa PlayerDeath3'),(24560,8,0,'One is such a lonely number.',14,0,100,0,0,12410,0,25439,0,'delrissa PlayerDeath4'),(24560,9,0,'It\'s been a kick, really.',14,0,100,0,0,12411,0,25440,0,'delrissa PlayerDeath5'),(24560,10,0,'Not what I had... planned.',14,0,100,0,0,12397,0,25431,0,'delrissa SAY_DEATH'),(8856,1,0,'Good day to you both. I would speak to Lord Lescovar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3781,0,'tyrion spybot SAY_SPYBOT_1'),(8856,2,0,'Thank you. The Light be with you both.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3782,0,'tyrion spybot SAY_SPYBOT_2'),(8856,3,0,'Milord, your guest has arrived. He awaits your presence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3762,0,'tyrion spybot SAY_SPYBOT_3'),(8856,4,0,'I shall use the time wisely, milord. Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3791,0,'tyrion spybot SAY_SPYBOT_4'),(1755,0,0,'VanCleef sends word that the plans are underway. But he\'s heard rumors about someone snooping about.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,324,0,'lord gregor lescovar SAY_MARZON_1'),(1755,1,0,'The Defias shall succeed! No meek adventurer will stop us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3936,0,'lord gregor lescovar SAY_MARZON_2'),(8856,0,0,'By your command!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19352,0,'tyrion spybot SAY_QUEST_ACCEPT_ATTACK'),(7766,0,0,'Wait here, $n. Spybot will make Lescovar come out as soon as possible. Be ready! Attack only after you\'ve overheard their conversation.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3761,0,'tyrion spybot SAY_TYRION_1'),(1756,0,4,'We don\'t take kindly to miscreants, $r.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10949,0,'Stormwind Royal Guard'),(1754,0,0,'It\'s time for my meditation, leave me.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,322,0,'lord gregor lescovar SAY_LESCOVAR_2'),(11672,0,0,'%s refuses to die while its master is endangered!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,7865,0,'core rager EMOTE_LOWHP'),(11502,0,0,'Behold Ragnaros - the Firelord! He who was ancient when this world was young! Bow before him, mortals! Bow before your ending!',14,0,100,0,0,8040,0,7657,0,'ragnaros SAY_SUMMON_MAJ'),(11502,1,0,'TOO SOON! YOU HAVE AWAKENED ME TOO SOON, EXECUTUS! WHAT IS THE MEANING OF THIS INTRUSION???',14,0,100,0,0,8043,0,7636,0,'ragnaros SAY_ARRIVAL1_RAG'),(11502,2,0,'These mortal infidels, my lord! They have invaded your sanctum and seek to steal your secrets!',14,0,100,0,0,8041,0,7661,0,'ragnaros SAY_ARRIVAL2_MAJ'),(11502,3,0,'FOOL! YOU ALLOWED THESE INSECTS TO RUN RAMPANT THROUGH THE HALLOWED CORE? AND NOW YOU LEAD THEM TO MY VERY LAIR? YOU HAVE FAILED ME, EXECUTUS! JUSTICE SHALL BE MET, INDEED!',14,0,100,0,0,8044,0,7662,0,'ragnaros SAY_ARRIVAL3_RAG'),(11502,4,0,'NOW FOR YOU, INSECTS! BOLDLY, YOU SOUGHT THE POWER OF RAGNAROS. NOW YOU SHALL SEE IT FIRSTHAND!\n',14,0,100,0,0,8045,0,7685,0,'ragnaros SAY_ARRIVAL5_RAG'),(11502,5,0,'Come forth, my servants! Defend your master!',14,0,100,0,0,8049,0,8572,0,'ragnaros SAY_REINFORCEMENTS1'),(11502,6,0,'YOU CANNOT DEFEAT THE LIVING FLAME! COME YOU MINIONS OF FIRE! COME FORTH, YOU CREATURES OF HATE! YOUR MASTER CALLS!',14,0,100,0,0,8050,0,8573,0,'ragnaros SAY_REINFORCEMENTS2'),(11502,7,0,'By fire be purged!',14,0,100,0,0,8046,0,9426,0,'ragnaros SAY_HAND'),(11502,8,0,'TASTE THE FLAMES OF SULFURON!',14,0,100,0,0,8047,0,9427,0,'ragnaros SAY_WRATH'),(11502,9,0,'Die, insect!',14,0,100,0,0,8051,0,7626,0,'ragnaros SAY_KILL'),(11502,10,0,'MY PATIENCE IS DWINDLING! COME, GNATS, TO YOUR DEATH!',14,0,100,0,0,8048,0,0,0,'ragnaros SAY_MAGMABURST'),(4421,1,0,'Bah! My power rules here!',14,0,100,0,0,5816,0,0,0,'combat Text'),(4421,2,0,'Troublesome whelps. I\'ll teach you to interfere!',14,0,100,0,0,5813,0,0,0,'combat Text'),(28557,0,1,'I... I got a sick grandma at home... I... I\'m all she\'s got, $g mister:miss;.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29016,0,'Scarlet Peasant'),(28557,0,2,'I picked the wrong week to quit drinkin\'!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29014,0,'Scarlet Peasant'),(28936,1,0,'I\'ll tell you nothing, Scourge filth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29141,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,2,0,'I\'ll tell you everything! STOP! PLEASE!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,29149,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,3,0,'We... We have only been told that the \"Crimson Dawn\" is an awakening. You... You see, the Light speaks to the High General. It is the Light...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29150,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28939,0,0,'What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29133,0,'Scarlet Preacher'),(28086,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(28079,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(51451,0,0,'%s becomes enrage!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(28095,1,3,'Gekgek finally trap dumb cat. You Gekgek\'s now!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(19033,0,0,'Hello, what business brings you here? This is an orphanage for the children of Outland who have lost their parents and have no one else to look after them. Perhaps you are here because you are considering adoption?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(28357,4,3,'This one has awoken too soon. It retains emotion and memory...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27864,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,5,0,'You have been measured and found wanting...',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,27866,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(29519,1,4,'To battle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30218,0,'Unworthy Initiate'),(29519,1,5,'There is no hope for our future...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30216,0,'Unworthy Initiate'),(29519,1,3,'And now you die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30205,0,'Unworthy Initiate'),(29519,1,2,'HAH! You can barely hold a blade! Yours will be a quick death.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30222,0,'U