of the Living flame!',14,0,100,0,0,8035,0,7612,0,'majordomo SAY_AGGRO'),(12018,1,0,'The runes of warding have been destroyed! Hunt down the infidels, my brethren!',14,0,100,0,0,8039,0,7566,0,'majordomo SAY_SPAWN'),(12018,2,0,'Ashes to ashes!',14,0,100,0,0,8037,0,9425,0,'majordomo SAY_SLAY'),(12018,3,0,'Burn mortals! Burn for this transgression!',14,0,100,0,0,8036,0,0,0,'majordomo SAY_SPECIAL'),(12018,4,0,'Impossible! Stay your attack, mortals... I submit! I submit!',14,0,100,0,0,8038,0,7561,0,'majordomo SAY_DEFEAT'),(12018,5,0,'Behold Ragnaros - the Firelord! He who was ancient when this world was young! Bow before him, mortals! Bow before your ending!',14,0,100,0,0,8040,0,7657,0,'majordomo SAY_SUMMON_MAJ'),(12018,6,0,'These mortal infidels, my lord! They have invaded your sanctum and seek to steal your secrets!',14,0,100,0,0,8041,0,7661,0,'majordomo SAY_ARRIVAL2_MAJ'),(11982,0,0,'%s goes into a killing frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,7797,0,'magmadar EMOTE_FRENZY'),(6784,0,0,'Ugh.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5404,0,'calvin montague SAY_RIN_END_6'),(349,0,0,'My wounds are grave.  Forgive my slow pace but my injuries won\'t allow me to walk any faster.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,25,0,'corporal keeshan SAY_CORPORAL_1'),(349,1,0,'Ah, fresh air at last! I need a moment to rest.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26,0,'corporal keeshan SAY_CORPORAL_2'),(349,2,0,'The Blackrock infestation is thick in these parts.  I will do my best to keep the pace.  Let\'s go!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27,0,'corporal keeshan SAY_CORPORAL_3'),(349,3,0,'Marshal Marris, sir.  Corporal Keeshan of the 12th Sabre Regiment returned from battle and reporting for duty!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,29,0,'corporal keeshan SAY_CORPORAL_4'),(349,4,0,'Brave adventurer, thank you for rescuing me! I am sure Marshal Marris will reward your kind deed.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,30,0,'corporal keeshan SAY_CORPORAL_5'),(17238,0,0,'Beware!  We are attacked!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13616,0,'anchorite truuen SAY_WP_0'),(17238,1,0,'It must be the purity of the Mark of the Lightbringer that is drawing forth the Scourge to us.  We must proceed with caution lest we be overwhelmed!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13617,0,'anchorite truuen SAY_WP_1'),(17238,2,0,'This land truly needs to be cleansed by the Light!  Let us continue on to the tomb.  It isn\'t far now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13619,0,'anchorite truuen SAY_WP_2'),(1854,0,0,'Be welcome, friends!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13621,0,'anchorite truuen SAY_WP_3'),(17233,0,0,'Thank you for coming here in remembrance of me.  Your efforts in recovering that symbol, while unnecessary, are certainly touching to an old man\'s heart.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13622,0,'anchorite truuen SAY_WP_4'),(17233,1,0,'Please, rise my friend.  Keep the Blessing as a symbol of the strength of the Light and how heroes long gone might once again rise in each of us to inspire.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13623,0,'anchorite truuen SAY_WP_5'),(17233,2,0,'Thank you my friend for making this possible.  This is a day that I shall never forget!  I think I will stay a while.  Please return to High Priestess MacDonnell at the camp.  I know that she\'ll be keenly interested to know of what has transpired here.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13624,0,'anchorite truuen SAY_WP_6'),(14834,0,0,'PRIDE HERALDS THE END OF YOUR WORLD.  COME, MORTALS!  FACE THE WRATH OF THE SOULFLAYER!',14,0,100,0,0,8414,0,10447,0,'hakkar SAY_AGGRO'),(14834,1,0,'Fleeing will do you no good, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10635,0,'hakkar SAY_FLEEING'),(14834,2,0,'You dare set foot upon Hakkari holy ground? Minions of Hakkar, destroy the infidels!\n',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10594,0,'hakkar SAY_MINION_DESTROY'),(14834,3,0,'Minions of Hakkar, hear your God. The sanctity of this temple has been compromised. Invaders encroach upon holy ground! The Altar of Blood must be protected. Kill them all!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10546,0,'hakkar SAY_PROTECT_ALTAR'),(14509,0,0,'Shirvallah, fill me with your RAGE!',14,0,100,0,0,8419,0,10455,0,'thekal SAY_AGGRO'),(14509,1,0,'Hakkar binds me no more!  Peace at last!',14,0,100,0,0,8424,0,10451,0,'thekal SAY_DEATH'),(14517,0,0,'Lord Hir\'eek, grant me wings of vengeance!',14,0,100,0,0,8417,0,10027,0,'jeklik SAY_AGGRO'),(14517,1,0,'I command you to rain fire down upon these invaders!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10369,0,'jeklik SAY_RAIN_FIRE'),(14517,2,0,'Finally...death!  Curse you, Hakkar!  Curse you!',14,0,100,0,0,8422,0,10452,0,'jeklik SAY_DEATH'),(14515,0,0,'Bethekk, your priestess calls upon your might!',14,0,100,0,0,8416,0,10461,0,'arlokk SAY_AGGRO'),(14515,1,0,'Feast on $n, my pretties!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10472,0,'arlokk SAY_FEAST_PANTHER'),(14515,2,0,'At last, I am free of the Soulflayer!',14,0,100,0,0,8412,0,10450,0,'arlokk SAY_DEATH'),(11382,0,0,'I\'ll feed your souls to Hakkar himself!',14,0,100,0,0,8413,0,0,0,'mandokir SAY_AGGRO'),(11382,1,0,'Ding!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10505,0,'mandokir SAY_DING_KILL'),(11382,2,0,'I\'m keeping my eye on you, $N!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'mandokir SAY_WATCH'),(11382,3,0,'Don\'t make me angry. You won\'t like it when I\'m angry.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'mandokir SAY_WATCH_WHISPER'),(11380,0,0,'Hey! Grats, mon!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10601,0,'mandokir SAY_GRATS_JINDO'),(11380,1,0,'Welcome to the great show, friends.  Step right up to die!',14,0,100,0,0,8425,0,10449,0,'jindo SAY_AGGRO'),(14510,0,0,'Draw me to your web mistress Shadra. Unleash your venom!',14,0,100,0,0,8418,0,0,0,'marli SAY_AGGRO'),(14510,1,0,'Shadra, make of me your avatar!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10443,0,'marli SAY_TRANSFORM'),(14510,2,0,'Aid me my brood!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10448,0,'marli SAY_SPIDER_SPAWN'),(14510,3,0,'Bless you, mortals, for this release...Hakkar controls me no longer!',14,0,100,0,0,8423,0,10459,0,'marli SAY_DEATH'),(11136,0,0,'Praise be to Egan!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6453,0,'freed soul SAY_ZAPPED0'),(11136,0,1,'Rivendare must be destroyed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6455,0,'freed soul SAY_ZAPPED1'),(2476,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'combat Frenzy'),(42230,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(1978,7,0,'Try to take better care of yourself, Quinn.  You were lucky this time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,538,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1978,6,0,'Hello, Quinn.  How are you faring?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,537,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1978,5,0,'If I am excused, then I\'d like to check on Quinn...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,536,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1978,4,0,'Masses of wolves are to the east, and whoever lived at Malden\'s Orchard is gone.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,535,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1950,0,0,'It\'s good to see you again, Erland.  What is your report?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,534,0,'Rane Yorick'),(1978,2,0,'We\'re almost there!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,483,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1978,3,0,'We made it!  Thanks, $n.  I couldn\'t have gotten here without you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,484,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1978,1,0,'Be careful, $n.  Those wolves like to hide among the trees.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,482,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1951,0,0,'I\'ve been better.  Ivar the Foul got the better of me...',12,33,100,0,0,0,0,539,0,'Quinn Yorick'),(1978,0,0,'Let\'s get to the others, and keep an eye open for those wolves outside...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,481,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(24981,0,1,'Commence location defense.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24015,0,'Converted Sentry'),(24981,0,0,'Objective acquired.  Initiating security routines.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24014,0,'Converted Sentry'),(6109,0,0,'Come, little ones. Face me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9071,0,'azuregos SAY_TELEPORT'),(9623,3,0,'Bad, $n. $n, bad!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5157,0,'A-Me 01'),(9623,3,1,'$n, no hurt A-Me. A-Me, good.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5158,0,'A-Me 01'),(9623,2,0,'A-Me home! A-Me, good! Good A-Me. Home. Home. Home.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5156,0,'A-Me 01'),(9623,1,0,'Good... good, A-Me. A-Me good. Home. Find home.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5063,0,'A-Me 01'),(9623,0,0,'A-Me operational.  A-Me go home.  You speak to A-Me to change locomotion settings.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5062,0,'A-Me 01'),(9999,0,0,'Well, I\'m not sure how far I\'ll make it in this state... I\'m feeling kind of faint...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5391,0,'ringo SAY_RIN_START_1'),(9999,0,1,'If I look woozy, slap me.  If I pass out, use the canteen.  Now let\'s go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5392,0,'ringo SAY_RIN_START_2'),(9999,1,0,'The heat... I can\'t take it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5396,0,'ringo SAY_FAINT_1'),(9999,1,1,'Maybe... you could carry me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5397,0,'ringo SAY_FAINT_2'),(9999,1,2,'Uuuuuuggggghhhhh....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5394,0,'ringo SAY_FAINT_3'),(9999,1,3,'I\'m not feeling so well...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5395,0,'ringo SAY_FAINT_4'),(9999,2,0,'Where... where am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26240,0,'ringo SAY_WAKE_1'),(9999,2,1,'I am feeling a little better now, thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5399,0,'ringo SAY_WAKE_2'),(9999,2,2,'Yes, I must go on.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5398,0,'ringo SAY_WAKE_3'),(9999,2,3,'How am I feeling? Quite soaked, thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5401,0,'ringo SAY_WAKE_4'),(9999,3,0,'Spraggle! I didn\'t think I\'d make it back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5402,0,'ringo SAY_RIN_END_1'),(9997,0,0,'Ringo! You\'re okay!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5405,0,'ringo SAY_SPR_END_2'),(9999,4,0,'Oh... I\'m feeling faint...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5403,0,'ringo SAY_RIN_END_3'),(9999,5,0,'%s faints and falls onto the ground.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5393,0,'ringo EMOTE_RIN_END_4'),(9999,6,0,'%s stands up after a short pause.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ringo EMOTE_RIN_END_5'),(9999,7,0,'Ugh.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5404,0,'ringo SAY_RIN_END_6'),(9997,1,0,'Ringo? Wake up! Don\'t worry, I\'ll take care of you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5406,0,'ringo SAY_SPR_END_7'),(9999,8,0,'%s fades away after a long pause.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ringo EMOTE_RIN_END_8'),(3850,3,0,'For once I agree with you... scum.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1329,0,'prisoner ashcrombe SAY_BOSS_DIE_AS'),(7766,1,0,'That\'s it! That\'s what you were waiting for! KILL THEM!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4613,0,'lord gregor lescovar SAY_TYRION_2'),(26935,0,0,'I\'m old enough to shoot beasts like you right between the eyes... at twice this distance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26110,0,'Sasha'),(26935,1,0,'Don\'t you dare talk about my father, monster.  He was twice the man you\'ll ever be.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26113,0,'Sasha'),(26935,2,0,'I\'d rather be dead than be one of you!  You think you\'re still human?  You\'re... animals!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26112,0,'Sasha'),(26935,3,0,'Surprise, you scum!  You\'re going to tell me where my sister is or I\'ll put a bucketful of truesilver bullets through your wife\'s heart.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26884,0,'Sasha'),(26935,4,0,'Where is Anya?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26889,0,'Sasha'),(26935,5,0,'There is one last thing.  I need to know where Arugal is.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26890,0,'Sasha'),(26971,0,0,'How old are you, lass?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26107,0,'Anatoly'),(26971,1,0,'You won\'t get away with this, you know?  You\'re just a kid.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26106,0,'Anatoly'),(26971,2,0,'Your father was weak, Sasha... he didn\'t have the guts to do what had to be done.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26109,0,'Anatoly'),(26971,3,0,'We\'ll all end up serving the Lich King, kid.  Better this way than becoming a rotten corpse.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26108,0,'Anatoly'),(26971,4,0,'Stop!  Do not shoot!  Do not hurt Tatjana!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26885,0,'Anatoly'),(26971,5,0,'The brat\'s held prisoner in the wolf den on the other side of the mountain.  She was to be taken to Arugal.  Are we free to go now?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26886,0,'Anatoly'),(26971,6,0,'Forgive me, Tatjana... ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26887,0,'Anatoly'),(26971,7,0,'Nothing you can do can compare to what Arugal can do to us!  I will tear you apart myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26888,0,'Anatoly'),(26935,6,0,'Anya!!  You\'re all right!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26915,0,'Sasha'),(26935,7,0,'Badmoon?  You mean Bloodmoon?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26916,0,'Sasha'),(26935,8,0,'Don\'t worry, sister... no one can hurt you now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26917,0,'Sasha'),(27646,0,0,'You won\'t eat me, will you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26914,0,'Anya'),(27646,1,0,'Sister!  The mean men were going to take me to Badmoon Isle.  They wanted to turn me into one of them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26918,0,'Anya'),(27646,2,0,'That\'s what I said!  Badmoon!  Sasha... don\'t ever leave me again!  First they took papa, then they took you... I don\'t want to be alone with them!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26919,0,'Anya'),(25610,1,2,'You have my thanks, stranger.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24833,0,'Scourge Prisoner'),(25610,1,1,'Freedom at last! I must return to Warsong Hold at once!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24832,0,'Scourge Prisoner'),(25610,1,0,'Thank you, friend.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24831,0,'Scourge Prisoner'),(25610,0,3,'Should I ever escape this prison...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24830,0,'Scourge Prisoner'),(25610,0,2,'Kill me... Kill me now!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24829,0,'Scourge Prisoner'),(25610,0,1,'Don\'t let them turn me into one of those aberrations!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24828,0,'Scourge Prisoner'),(25610,0,0,'Somebody please... Help...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24827,0,'Scourge Prisoner'),(23905,0,0,'Marksmen, form up and take your positions!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22447,0,'Major Mills'),(30086,0,0,'Taste my steel, little $g boy : girl;!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30750,0,'say'),(30086,1,0,'You fight well, little one. I am bested for now. We will meet again I assure you. When we do I will be better prepared!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30821,0,'say'),(30081,0,0,'You dare to touch ME?! You won\'t keep me from proving myself to the Lich King!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30746,0,'say'),(30180,0,0,'Onu\'zun gonna kill you dead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30856,0,'say'),(30162,0,0,'Grrrrrrrr! I\'ll kneecap ya!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30822,0,'say'),(30162,1,0,'WHEE!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30828,0,'say'),(36642,1,0,'The style of this blade and its markings hinted that it might be a dragonforged sword. At last, we will have our answer.',12,0,100,1,0,16745,0,37469,0,'Myralion Sunblaze - Say 1'),(36642,2,0,'After all these years, can it really be --',12,0,100,6,0,16746,0,37470,0,'Myralion Sunblaze - Say 2'),(36642,3,0,'It falls to us to see Quel\'Delar restored for the Sunreavers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37514,0,'Myralion Sunblaze - Say 3'),(36624,1,0,'I knew this was a dragonforged blade when I first laid eyes on it.',12,0,100,1,0,16604,0,37465,0,'Caladis Brightspear - Say 1'),(36624,2,0,'But can it be? Is this really --',12,0,100,6,0,16605,0,37466,0,'Caladis Brightspear - Say 2'),(36624,3,0,'I vow that the Silver Covenant will see Quel\'Delar restored.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37518,0,'Caladis Brightspear - Say 3'),(36656,1,0,'You are not welcome here, minion of the Lich King!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37887,0,'Silver Covenant Sentinel - Say 1'),(37846,1,0,'Quel\'Delar.',12,0,100,1,0,16808,0,37484,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 1'),(37846,2,0,'Quiet, fools. If I had wished to kill you, you\'d already be dead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37894,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 2'),(37846,3,0,'As Quel\'Serrar was forged by the dragons and given to the kaldorei, its twin, Quel\'Delar, was given to my people.',12,0,100,1,0,16809,0,37485,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 3'),(37846,4,0,'The king bestowed the blade upon my friend, Thalorien Dawnseeker.',12,0,100,1,0,16800,0,37486,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 4'),(37846,5,0,'But even Thalorien\'s skill and Quel\'Delar\'s magic could not save Silvermoon from the might of the Scourge.',12,0,100,1,0,16801,0,37487,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 5'),(37846,6,0,'Thalorien fell before the gates of the Sunwell, buying time for others to escape.',12,0,100,1,0,16802,0,37488,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 6'),(37846,7,0,'After the battle, I recovered the sword from the field. I bore it to Northrend in the service of my prince, seeking to avenge our people\'s defeat.',12,0,100,16,0,16803,0,37490,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 7'),(37846,8,0,'Arthas shattered our forces and took the most powerful of us into his service as the San\'layn.',12,0,100,1,0,16804,0,37491,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 8'),(37846,9,0,'My memories of Thalorien went cold and so did his blade.',12,0,100,1,0,16805,0,37492,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 9'),(37846,10,0,'It was I who brought Quel\'Delar here, to return it to its makers. In breaking the weapon, so did I break its power.',12,0,100,25,0,16806,0,37493,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 10'),(37846,11,0,'Quel\'Delar will never serve another!',12,0,100,5,0,16807,0,37494,0,'Blood Queen Lana\'thel - Say 11'),(30891,0,0,'The Blessed Banner of the Crusade has been planted.\nDefend the banner from all attackers!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,31539,0,'Blessed Banner of the Crusade'),(31003,0,0,'BY THE LIGHT! Those damned monsters! Look at what they\'ve done to our people!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,31560,0,'Crusader Lord Dalfors'),(31003,1,0,'Burn it down, boys. Burn it all down.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31561,0,'Crusader Lord Dalfors'),(31003,2,0,'Let \'em come. They\'ll pay for what they\'ve done!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31562,0,'Crusader Lord Dalfors'),(31003,3,0,'We\'ve done it, lads! We\'ve taken the pinnacle from the Scourge! Report to Father Gustav at once and tell him the good news! We\'re gonna get to buildin\' and settin\' up! Go!',14,0,100,71,0,0,0,31573,0,'Crusader Lord Dalfors'),(31013,0,0,'Leave no survivors!',14,0,100,0,0,14793,0,31567,0,'The Lich King'),(31013,1,0,'Cower before my terrible creations!',14,0,100,0,0,14800,0,31568,0,'The Lich King'),(31013,2,0,'Feast my children! Feast upon the flesh of the living!',14,0,100,0,0,14801,0,31569,0,'The Lich King'),(31013,3,0,'Lay down your arms and surrender your souls!',14,0,100,0,0,14802,0,31570,0,'The Lich King'),(15989,0,0,'Sapphiron lifts off into the air!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32801,3,'Sapphiron'),(15989,1,0,'Sapphiron resumes his attacks!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32802,3,'Sapphiron'),(15989,2,0,'%s takes a deep breath.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,24548,3,'Sapphiron'),(15989,3,0,'%s enrages!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,3,'Sapphiron'),(32867,0,0,'You will not defeat the Assembly of Iron so easily, invaders!',14,0,100,0,0,15674,0,34321,0,'Steelbreaker - Aggro'),(32867,1,0,'So fragile and weak!',14,0,100,0,0,15675,0,34322,0,'Steelbreaker - Slay 1'),(32867,1,1,'Flesh... such a hindrance.',14,0,100,0,0,15676,0,34323,0,'Steelbreaker - Slay 2'),(32867,2,0,'You seek the secrets of Ulduar? Then take them!',14,0,100,0,0,15677,0,34324,0,'Steelbreaker - Power'),(32867,3,0,'My death only serves to hasten your demise.',14,0,100,0,0,15678,0,34325,0,'Steelbreaker - Death'),(32867,4,0,'Impossible...',14,0,100,0,0,15679,0,34326,0,'Steelbreaker - Encounter defeated'),(32867,5,0,'This meeting of the Assembly of Iron is adjourned!',14,0,100,0,0,15680,0,34335,0,'Steelbreaker - Berserk'),(32927,0,0,'Nothing short of total decimation will suffice.',14,0,100,0,0,15657,0,34328,0,'Runemaster Molgeim - Aggro'),(32927,1,0,'The world suffers yet another insignificant loss.',14,0,100,0,0,15658,0,34329,0,'Runemaster Molgeim - Slay 1'),(32927,1,1,'Death is the price of your arrogance.',14,0,100,0,0,15659,0,34330,0,'Runemaster Molgeim - Slay 2'),(32927,2,0,'Decipher this!',14,0,100,0,0,15660,0,34331,0,'Runemaster Molgeim - Rune of Death'),(32927,3,0,'Face the lightning\'s surge!',14,0,100,0,0,15661,0,34332,0,'Runemaster Molgeim - Rune of Summon'),(32927,4,0,'The legacy of storms shall not be undone.',14,0,100,0,0,15662,0,34333,0,'Runemaster Molgeim - Death'),(32927,5,0,'What have you gained from my defeat? You are no less doomed, mortals.',14,0,100,0,0,15663,0,34334,0,'Runemaster Molgeim - Encounter defeated'),(32927,6,0,'This meeting of the Assembly of Iron is adjourned!',14,0,100,0,0,15664,0,34335,0,'Runemaster Molgeim - Berserk'),(32857,0,0,'Whether the world\'s greatest gnats or the world\'s greatest heroes, you are still only mortal.',14,0,100,0,0,15684,0,34314,0,'Brundir - Aggro'),(32857,1,0,'A merciful kill!',14,0,100,0,0,15685,0,34315,0,'Brundir Slay 1'),(32857,1,1,'HAH!',14,0,100,0,0,15686,0,34316,0,'Brundir - Slay 2'),(32857,2,0,'Stand still and stare into the light!',14,0,100,0,0,15687,0,33962,0,'Brundir - Special'),(32857,3,0,'Let the storm clouds rise and rain down death from above!',14,0,100,0,0,15688,0,34317,0,'Brundir - Flight'),(32857,4,0,'The power of the storm lives on.',14,0,100,0,0,15689,0,34318,0,'Brundir - Death'),(32857,5,0,'You rush headlong into the maw of madness!',14,0,100,0,0,15690,0,34319,0,'Brundir - Encounter defeated'),(32857,6,0,'This meeting of the Assembly of Iron is adjourned!',14,0,100,0,0,15691,0,34335,0,'Brundir - Berserk'),(32857,7,0,'%s begins to Overload!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34004,0,'Brundir - Overload'),(11596,0,0,'Ah...the wondrous sound of kodos.  I love the way they make the ground shake... inspect the beast for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7303,0,'kodo round SAY_SMEED_HOME_1'),(11596,0,1,'Hey, look out with that kodo! You had better inspect that beast before I give you credit!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7301,0,'kodo round SAY_SMEED_HOME_2'),(11596,0,2,'That kodo sure is a beauty.  Wait a minute, where are my bifocals?  Perhaps you should inspect the beast for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7302,0,'kodo round SAY_SMEED_HOME_3'),(10556,0,0,'Ow!  OK, I\'ll get back to work, $n!',12,1,100,0,0,7514,0,5774,0,'Lazy Peon to Player'),(7358,3,0,'To me, my servants!',14,0,100,0,0,5828,0,6189,0,'amnennar SAY_SUMMON_60'),(7358,2,0,'I am the hand of the Lich King!',14,0,100,0,0,5827,0,6192,0,'amnennar SAY_HEALTH_75'),(7358,1,0,'Too easy.',12,0,100,0,0,5826,0,6188,0,'amnennar SAY_SLAY'),(7358,0,0,'You\'ll never leave this place alive.',14,0,100,0,0,5825,0,6187,0,'amnennar SAY_AGGRO'),(22916,0,0,'Lurosa, I am entrusting the Relics of Aviana to $n, who will take them to Morthis Whisperwing. I must return completely to the Emerald Dream now. Do not let $n fail!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20601,0,'clintar SAY_END'),(3465,0,0,'Stay close, $n. I\'ll need all the help I can get to break out of here. Let\'s go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1065,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_START'),(3465,1,0,'At last! Free from Northwatch Hold! I need a moment to catch my breath....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1066,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_AT_LAST'),(3465,2,0,'Now I feel better. Let\'s get back to Ratchet. Come on, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1067,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_PROCEED'),(3465,3,0,'Looks like the Southsea Freebooters are heavily entrenched on the coast. This could get rough.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1068,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_FREEBOOTERS'),(3465,4,0,'Help! $n attacking!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1074,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_AGGRO_1'),(3465,4,1,'$n heading this way fast! Time for revenge!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1075,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_AGGRO_2'),(3465,4,2,'$n coming right at us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1072,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_AGGRO_3'),(3465,4,3,'Get this $n off of me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1073,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_AGGRO_4'),(3465,5,0,'Almost back to Ratchet! Let\'s keep up the pace...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1069,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_ALMOST'),(3465,6,0,'Ah, the sweet salt air of Ratchet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1070,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_SWEET'),(3465,7,0,'Captain Brightsun, $n here has freed me! $n, I am certain the Captain will reward your bravery.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1071,0,'gilthares SAY_GIL_FREED'),(6238,0,0,'Ready when you are, warrior.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2421,0,'big will SAY_BIG_WILL_READY'),(6248,0,0,'The Affray has begun.  $n, get ready to fight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2301,0,'twiggy SAY_TWIGGY_BEGIN'),(6248,1,0,'You!  Enter the fray!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2318,0,'twiggy SAY_TWIGGY_FRAY'),(6248,2,0,'Challenger is down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2355,0,'twiggy SAY_TWIGGY_DOWN'),(6248,3,0,'The Affray is over!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2320,0,'twiggy SAY_TWIGGY_OVER'),(3439,0,0,'Alright, alright! I think I can figure out how to operate this thing...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1031,0,'wizzlecrank SAY_START'),(3439,1,0,'Arrrgh! This isn\'t right!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1039,0,'wizzlecrank SAY_STARTUP1'),(3439,2,0,'Okay, I think I\'ve got it, now. Follow me, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1032,0,'wizzlecrank SAY_STARTUP2'),(3282,0,0,'There\'s the stolen shredder! Stop it or Lugwizzle will have our hides!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,1040,0,'wizzlecrank SAY_MERCENARY'),(3439,3,0,'Looks like we\'re out of the woods, eh? Wonder what this does...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1033,0,'wizzlecrank SAY_PROGRESS_1'),(3439,4,0,'Come on, don\'t break down on me now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1043,0,'wizzlecrank SAY_PROGRESS_2'),(3439,5,0,'That was a close one! Well, let\'s get going, we\'re almost there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1041,0,'wizzlecrank SAY_PROGRESS_3'),(3439,6,0,'Hm... I don\'t think this blinking red light is a good thing...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1044,0,'wizzlecrank SAY_END'),(12717,0,0,'Are you sure that you are ready? If we do not have a group of your allies to aid us, we will surely fail.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8566,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_START1'),(12717,1,0,'This will be a tough fight, $n. Follow me closely!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8555,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_START2'),(12717,2,0,'This is the brazier, $n. Put it out. Vorsha is a beast, worthy of praise from no one!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8556,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_BRAZIER'),(12717,3,0,'Now we must wait. It won\'t be long before the naga realize what we have done.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8410,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_BRAZIER_WAIT'),(12717,4,0,'Be on your guard, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8412,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_ON_GUARD'),(12717,5,0,'Perhaps we will get a moment to rest. But I will not give up until we have faced off against Vorsha!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8413,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_REST'),(12717,6,0,'We have done it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8569,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_DONE'),(12717,7,0,'You have my deepest gratitude. I thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8558,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_GRATITUDE'),(12717,8,0,'I am going to patrol the area for a while longer and ensure that things are truly safe.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8564,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_PATROL'),(12717,9,0,'Please return to Zoram\'gar and report our success to the Warsong Runner.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8565,0,'muglash SAY_MUG_RETURN'),(17772,0,0,'I\'m in jeopardy! Help me if you can!',14,0,100,0,0,11007,0,18537,0,'jaina hyjal ATTACKED 1'),(17772,0,1,'They\'ve broken through!',14,0,100,0,0,11049,0,18538,0,'jaina hyjal ATTACKED 2'),(17772,1,0,'Don\'t give up! We must prevail!',14,0,100,0,0,11006,0,18540,0,'jaina hyjal BEGIN'),(17772,2,0,'Stay alert! Another wave approaches.',14,0,100,0,0,11008,0,0,0,'jaina hyjal INCOMING'),(17772,3,0,'Hold them back as long as possible!',14,0,100,0,0,11050,0,18541,0,'jaina hyjal RALLY 1'),(17772,3,1,'We must hold strong!',14,0,100,0,0,11051,0,18542,0,'jaina hyjal RALLY 2'),(17772,4,0,'We are lost! Fall back!',14,0,100,0,0,11009,0,18543,0,'jaina hyjal FAILURE'),(17772,5,0,'We have won valuable time. Now we must pull back.',14,0,100,0,0,11011,0,15309,0,'jaina hyjal SUCCESS'),(17772,6,0,'I did... my best.',14,0,100,0,0,11010,0,18539,0,'jaina hyjal DEATH'),(17852,0,0,'I will lay down for no one!',14,0,100,0,0,11031,0,18544,0,'thrall hyjal ATTACKED 1'),(17852,0,1,'Bring the fight to me and pay with your lives!',14,0,100,0,0,11061,0,18545,0,'thrall hyjal ATTACKED 2'),(17852,1,0,'Hold them back! Do not falter!',14,0,100,0,0,11030,0,18731,0,'thrall hyjal BEGIN'),(17852,2,0,'Make ready for another wave! LOK-TAR OGAR!',14,0,100,0,0,11032,0,0,0,'thrall hyjal INCOMING'),(17852,3,0,'Victory or Death!',14,0,100,0,0,11059,0,18732,0,'thrall hyjal RALLY 1'),(17852,3,1,'Do not give an inch of ground!',14,0,100,0,0,11060,0,18733,0,'thrall hyjal RALLY 2'),(17852,4,0,'It is over! Withdraw! We have failed....',14,0,100,0,0,11033,0,18734,0,'thrall hyjal FAILURE'),(17852,5,0,'We have played our part, and done well at that. It is up to the others now.',14,0,100,0,0,11035,0,15312,0,'thrall hyjal SUCCESS'),(17852,6,0,'Uraaa...',14,0,100,0,0,11034,0,0,0,'thrall hyjal DEATH'),(17848,0,0,'You there, fetch water quickly! Get these flames out before they spread to the rest of the keep! Hurry, damn you!',14,0,100,0,0,10428,0,15737,0,'lieutenant drake SAY_ENTER'),(17848,1,0,'I know what you\'re up to, and I mean to put an end to it, permanently!',14,0,100,0,0,10429,0,16650,0,'lieutenant drake SAY_AGGRO'),(17848,2,0,'No more meddling for you!',14,0,100,0,0,10432,0,16662,0,'lieutenant drake SAY_SLAY1'),(17848,2,1,'You will not interfere!',14,0,100,0,0,10433,0,16663,0,'lieutenant drake SAY_SLAY2'),(17848,3,0,'Time to bleed!',14,0,100,0,0,10430,0,16659,0,'lieutenant drake SAY_MORTAL'),(17848,4,0,'Run, you blasted cowards!',14,0,100,0,0,10431,0,16660,0,'lieutenant drake SAY_SHOUT'),(17848,5,0,'Thrall... must not... go free.',14,0,100,0,0,10434,0,16664,0,'lieutenant drake SAY_DEATH'),(17876,0,0,'Very well then. Let\'s go!',14,0,100,0,0,10465,0,17622,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_START_EVENT_PART1'),(17876,1,0,'As long as we\'re going with a new plan, I may as well pick up a weapon and some armor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15893,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_ARMORY'),(17876,2,0,'A rider approaches.',12,0,100,0,0,10466,0,15908,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_SKARLOC_MEET'),(17876,3,0,'I\'ll never be chained again!',14,0,100,0,0,10467,0,17623,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_SKARLOC_TAUNT'),(17876,4,0,'Very well. Tarren Mill lies just west of here. Since time is of the essence...',14,0,100,0,0,10468,0,15916,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_START_EVENT_PART2'),(17876,5,0,'Let\'s ride!',12,0,100,0,0,10469,0,15948,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_MOUNTS_UP'),(17876,6,0,'Taretha must be in the inn. Let\'s go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15977,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_CHURCH_END'),(17876,7,0,'Taretha! What foul magic is this?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15978,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_MEET_TARETHA'),(17876,8,0,'Who or what was that?',14,0,100,0,0,10470,0,16017,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_EPOCH_WONDER'),(17876,9,0,'No!',14,0,100,0,0,10471,0,16020,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_EPOCH_KILL_TARETHA'),(17876,10,0,'Goodbye, Taretha. I will never forget your kindness.',14,0,100,0,0,10472,0,16089,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_EVENT_COMPLETE'),(17876,11,0,'Things are looking grim....',14,0,100,0,0,10458,0,17610,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_LOW_HP1'),(17876,11,1,'I\'ll fight... to the last!',14,0,100,0,0,10459,0,17611,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_LOW_HP2'),(17876,12,0,'Taretha....',14,0,100,0,0,10460,0,17612,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_DIE1'),(17876,12,1,'A good day... to die.',14,0,100,0,0,10461,0,17613,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_DIE2'),(17876,13,0,'I have earned my freedom!',14,0,100,0,0,10448,0,17600,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_AGGRO1'),(17876,13,1,'This day is long overdue! Out of my way!',14,0,100,0,0,10449,0,17601,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_AGGRO2'),(17876,13,2,'I am a slave no longer!',14,0,100,0,0,10450,0,17602,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_AGGRO3'),(17876,13,3,'Blackmoore has much to answer for!',14,0,100,0,0,10451,0,17603,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_AGGRO4'),(17876,14,0,'You have forced my hand!',14,0,100,0,0,10452,0,17604,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_KILL1'),(17876,14,1,'It should not have come to this!',14,0,100,0,0,10453,0,17605,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_KILL2'),(17876,14,2,'I did not ask for this!',14,0,100,0,0,10454,0,17606,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_RANDOM_KILL3'),(17876,15,0,'I am truly in your debt, strangers.',14,0,100,0,0,10455,0,17607,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_LEAVE_COMBAT1'),(17876,15,1,'Thank you, strangers. You have given me hope.',14,0,100,0,0,10456,0,17608,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_LEAVE_COMBAT2'),(17876,15,2,'I will not waste this chance. I will seek out my destiny.',14,0,100,0,0,10457,0,17609,0,'thrall hillsbrad SAY_TH_LEAVE_COMBAT3'),(18887,0,0,'I\'m free! Thank you all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16082,0,'taretha SAY_TA_FREE'),(18887,1,0,'Thrall, you escaped!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15979,0,'taretha SAY_TA_ESCAPED'),(17862,0,0,'Thrall! You didn\'t really think you would escape, did you?  You and your allies shall answer to Blackmoore... after I\'ve had my fun.',14,0,100,0,0,10406,0,15909,0,'skarloc SAY_ENTER'),(17862,1,0,'You\'re a slave! That\'s all you\'ll ever be!',14,0,100,0,0,10407,0,16673,0,'skarloc SAY_TAUNT1'),(17862,2,0,'I don\'t know what Blackmoore sees in you. For my money you\'re just another ignorant savage!',14,0,100,0,0,10408,0,16674,0,'skarloc SAY_TAUNT2'),(17862,3,0,'Thrall will never be free!',14,0,100,0,0,10409,0,16675,0,'skarloc SAY_SLAY1'),(17862,3,1,'Did you really think you would leave here alive?',14,0,100,0,0,10410,0,16676,0,'skarloc SAY_SLAY2'),(17862,4,0,'Guards... guards!',14,0,100,0,0,10411,0,16677,0,'skarloc SAY_DEATH'),(18096,0,0,'Thrall! Come outside and face your fate!',14,0,100,0,0,10418,0,16016,0,'epoch hunter SAY_ENTER1'),(18096,0,1,'Taretha\'s life hangs in the balance. Surely you care for her. Surely you wish to save her... ',14,0,100,0,0,10419,0,16019,0,'epoch hunter SAY_ENTER2'),(18096,0,2,'Ah, there you are. I had hoped to accomplish this with a bit of subtlety, but I suppose direct confrontation was inevitable. Your future, Thrall, must not come to pass and so... you and your troublesome friends must die!',14,0,100,0,0,10420,0,16021,0,'epoch hunter SAY_ENTER3'),(18096,1,0,'Enough, I will erase your very existence!',14,0,100,0,0,10421,0,16023,0,'epoch hunter SAY_AGGRO1'),(18096,1,1,'You cannot fight fate!',14,0,100,0,0,10422,0,16693,0,'epoch hunter SAY_AGGRO2'),(18096,2,0,'You are... irrelevant.',14,0,100,0,0,10425,0,16694,0,'epoch hunter SAY_SLAY1'),(18096,2,1,'Thrall will remain a slave. Taretha will die. You have failed.',14,0,100,0,0,10426,0,16695,0,'epoch hunter SAY_SLAY2'),(18096,3,0,'Not so fast!',14,0,100,0,0,10423,0,16691,0,'epoch hunter SAY_BREATH1'),(18096,3,1,'Struggle as much as you like...',14,0,100,0,0,10424,0,16692,0,'epoch hunter SAY_BREATH2'),(18096,4,0,'No! The master will... not be... pleased.',14,0,100,0,0,10427,0,16696,0,'epoch hunter SAY_DEATH'),(26529,0,0,'Play time!',14,0,100,0,0,13428,0,27716,3,'meathook SAY_AGGRO'),(26529,1,0,'Boring...',14,0,100,0,0,13430,0,29943,3,'meathook SAY_SLAY_1'),(26529,1,1,'Why you stop moving?',14,0,100,0,0,13431,0,29944,3,'meathook SAY_SLAY_2'),(26529,1,2,'Get up! Me not done!',14,0,100,0,0,13432,0,29945,3,'meathook SAY_SLAY_3'),(26529,2,0,'New toys!',14,0,100,0,0,13429,0,29942,3,'meathook SAY_SPAWN'),(26529,3,0,'This not fun...',14,0,100,0,0,13433,0,29941,3,'meathook SAY_DEATH'),(26532,0,0,'Prince Arthas Menethil, on this day, a powerful darkness has taken hold of your soul. The death you are destined to visit upon others will this day be your own.',14,0,100,0,0,13408,0,27911,3,'epoch SAY_INTRO | culling SAY_PHASE314'),(26532,1,0,'We\'ll see about that, young prince.',14,0,100,0,0,13409,0,27920,3,'epoch SAY_AGGRO'),(26532,2,0,'Tick tock, tick tock...',14,0,100,0,0,13410,0,30451,3,'epoch SAY_TIME_WARP_1'),(26532,2,1,'Not quick enough!',14,0,100,0,0,13411,0,30452,3,'epoch SAY_TIME_WARP_2'),(26532,2,2,'Let\'s get this over with.',14,0,100,0,0,13412,0,30453,3,'epoch SAY_TIME_WARP_3'),(26532,3,0,'There is no future for you.',14,0,100,0,0,13413,0,30454,3,'epoch SAY_SLAY_1'),(26532,3,1,'This is the hour of our greatest triumph!',14,0,100,0,0,13414,0,30455,3,'epoch SAY_SLAY_2'),(26532,3,2,'You were destined to fail.',14,0,100,0,0,13415,0,30456,3,'epoch SAY_SLAY_3'),(26532,4,0,'',12,0,100,0,0,13416,0,0,3,'epoch SAY_DEATH'),(26530,0,0,'Ah, the entertainment has arrived!',14,0,100,0,0,13472,0,29947,3,'salramm SAY_AGGRO'),(26530,1,0,'You are too late, champion of Lordaeron. The dead shall have their day.',14,0,100,0,0,13471,0,27717,3,'salramm SAY_SPAWN'),(26530,2,0,'The fun is just beginning!',14,0,100,0,0,13473,0,29948,3,'salramm SAY_SLAY_1'),(26530,2,1,'Ah! Quality materials.',14,0,100,0,0,13474,0,29949,3,'salramm SAY_SLAY_2'),(26530,2,2,'Don\'t worry; I\'ll make good use of you!',14,0,100,0,0,13475,0,29950,3,'salramm SAY_SLAY_3'),(26530,3,0,'You only advance... the master\'s plan...',14,0,100,0,0,13483,0,29946,3,'salramm SAY_DEATH'),(26530,4,0,'BOOM! Hahahahah...',14,0,100,0,0,13478,0,29953,3,'salramm SAY_EXPLODE_GHOUL_1'),(26530,4,1,'Blood... destruction... EXHILARATING!',14,0,100,0,0,13479,0,29954,3,'salramm SAY_EXPLODE_GHOUL_2'),(26530,5,0,'I want a sample...',14,0,100,0,0,13480,0,29955,3,'salramm SAY_STEAL_FLESH_1'),(26530,5,1,'Such strength... it must be mine!',14,0,100,0,0,13481,0,29956,3,'salramm SAY_STEAL_FLESH_2'),(26530,5,2,'Your flesh betrays you.',14,0,100,0,0,13482,0,29957,3,'salramm SAY_STEAL_FLESH_3'),(26530,6,0,'Say hello to some friends of mine.',14,0,100,0,0,13476,0,29951,3,'salramm SAY_SUMMON_GHOULS_1'),(26530,6,1,'Come, citizens of Stratholme! Meet your \"saviors.\"',14,0,100,0,0,13477,0,29952,3,'salramm SAY_SUMMON_GHOULS_2'),(26499,0,0,'Glad you could make it, Uther.',12,0,100,396,0,12828,0,27314,3,'culling SAY_PHASE101'),(26499,1,0,'As if I could forget. Listen, Uther, there\'s something about the plague you should know...',12,0,100,0,0,12829,0,27316,3,'culling SAY_PHASE103'),(26499,2,0,'Oh, no. We\'re too late. These people have all been infected! They may look fine now, but it\'s just a matter of time before they turn into the undead!',12,0,100,5,0,12830,0,27317,3,'culling SAY_PHASE104'),(26499,3,0,'This entire city must be purged.',12,0,100,396,0,12831,0,27319,3,'culling SAY_PHASE106'),(26499,4,0,'Damn it, Uther! As your future king, I order you to purge this city!',12,0,100,5,0,12832,0,27321,3,'culling SAY_PHASE108'),(26499,5,0,'Then I must consider this an act of treason.',12,0,100,396,0,12833,0,27323,3,'culling SAY_PHASE110'),(26499,6,0,'Have I? Lord Uther, by my right of succession and the sovereignty of my crown, I hereby relieve you of your command and suspend your paladins from service.',12,0,100,0,0,12834,0,27325,3,'culling SAY_PHASE112'),(26499,7,0,'It\'s done! Those of you who have the will to save this land, follow me! The rest of you... get out of my sight!',12,0,100,1,0,12835,0,27327,3,'culling SAY_PHASE114'),(26499,8,0,'Jaina?',12,0,100,0,0,12836,0,27329,3,'culling SAY_PHASE116'),(26499,9,0,'Take position here, and I will lead a small force inside Stratholme to begin the culling. We must contain and purge the infected for the sake of all of Lordaeron!',14,0,100,0,0,14327,0,27466,3,'culling SAY_PHASE118'),(26499,10,0,'Everyone looks ready. Remember, these people are all infected with the plague and will die soon. We must purge Stratholme to protect the remainder of Lordaeron from the Scourge. Let\'s go.',12,0,100,0,0,14293,0,27535,3,'culling SAY_PHASE201'),(26499,11,0,'I can only help you with a clean death.',12,0,100,0,0,14294,0,27548,3,'culling SAY_PHASE203'),(26499,12,0,'That was just the beginning.',12,0,100,1,0,14295,0,27553,3,'culling SAY_PHASE205'),(26499,13,0,'I won\'t allow it, Mal\'Ganis! Better that these people die by my hand than serve as your slaves in death!',14,0,100,397,0,14296,0,27577,3,'culling SAY_PHASE208'),(26499,14,0,'Mal\'Ganis will send out some of his Scourge minions to interfere with us. Those of you with the strongest steel and magic shall go forth and destroy them. I will lead the rest of my forces in purging Stratholme of the infected.',14,0,100,1,0,14885,0,27584,3,'culling SAY_PHASE209'),(26499,15,0,'Champions, meet me at the Town Hall at once. We must take the fight to Mal\'Ganis.',14,0,100,0,0,14297,0,28890,3,'culling SAY_PHASE210'),(26499,16,0,'Follow me, I know the way through.',12,0,100,1,0,14298,0,27800,3,'culling SAY_PHASE301'),(26499,17,0,'Yes, I\'m glad I could get to you before the plague.',12,0,100,0,0,14299,0,27812,3,'culling SAY_PHASE303'),(26499,18,0,'What is this sorcery?',12,0,100,0,0,14300,0,27814,3,'culling SAY_PHASE304'),(26499,19,0,'Mal\'Ganis appears to have more than Scourge in his arsenal. We should make haste.',12,0,100,1,0,14301,0,27840,3,'culling SAY_PHASE306. NEEDS VERIFICATION'),(26499,20,0,'More vile sorcery! Be ready for anything!',12,0,100,0,0,14302,0,27882,3,'culling SAY_PHASE307'),(26499,21,0,'Let\'s move on.',12,0,100,396,0,14303,0,27889,3,'culling SAY_PHASE308'),(26499,22,0,'Watch your backs: they have us surrounded in this hall.',12,0,100,1,0,14304,0,27901,3,'culling SAY_PHASE309'),(26499,23,0,'One less obstacle to deal with.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31356,3,'culling SAY_PHASE310. NEEDS VERIFICATION'),(26499,24,0,'Mal\'Ganis is not making this easy.',12,0,100,396,0,14305,0,27902,3,'culling SAY_PHASE311'),(26499,25,0,'They\'re very persistent.',12,0,100,396,0,14306,0,27904,3,'culling SAY_PHASE312'),(26499,26,0,'What else can he put in my way?',12,0,100,396,0,14307,0,27905,3,'culling SAY_PHASE313'),(26499,27,0,'I do what I must for Lordaeron, and neither your words nor your actions will stop me.',12,0,100,396,0,14309,0,27916,3,'culling SAY_PHASE315'),(26499,28,0,'The quickest path to Mal\'Ganis lies behind that bookshelf ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,14308,0,27906,3,'culling SAY_PHASE401'),(26499,29,0,'This will only take a moment.',12,0,100,432,0,14310,0,28040,3,'culling SAY_PHASE402'),(26499,30,0,'I\'m relieved this secret passage still works.',12,0,100,0,0,14311,0,28041,3,'culling SAY_PHASE403'),(26499,31,0,'Let\'s move through here as quickly as possible. If the undead don\'t kill us, the fires might.',12,0,100,396,0,14312,0,28562,3,'culling SAY_PHASE404'),(26499,32,0,'Rest a moment and clear your lungs, but we must move again soon.',12,0,100,396,0,14313,0,28045,3,'culling SAY_PHASE405'),(26499,33,0,'That\'s enough; we must move again. Mal\'Ganis awaits.',12,0,100,396,0,14314,0,28047,3,'culling SAY_PHASE406'),(26499,34,0,'At last some good luck. Market Row has not caught fire yet. Mal\'Ganis is supposed to be in Crusaders\' Square, which is just ahead. Tell me when you\'re ready to move forward.',12,0,100,396,0,14315,0,28048,3,'culling SAY_PHASE407'),(26499,35,0,'Justice will be done.',12,0,100,0,0,14316,0,28563,3,'culling SAY_PHASE501'),(26499,36,0,'We\'re going to finish this right now, Mal\'Ganis. Just you... and me.',12,0,100,5,0,14317,0,28520,3,'culling SAY_PHASE502'),(26499,37,0,'I\'ll hunt you to the ends of the earth if I have to! Do you hear me? To the ends of the earth!',12,0,100,0,0,14318,0,28529,3,'culling SAY_PHASE503'),(26499,38,0,'You performed well this day. Anything that Mal\'Ganis has left behind is yours. Take it as your reward. I must now begin plans for an expedition to Northrend.',12,0,100,1,0,14319,0,28530,3,'culling SAY_PHASE504'),(26528,0,0,'Watch your tone with me, boy. You may be the prince, but I\'m still your superior as a paladin!',12,0,100,397,0,12839,0,27315,3,'culling SAY_PHASE102'),(26528,1,0,'What?',12,0,100,5,0,12840,0,27318,3,'culling SAY_PHASE105'),(26528,2,0,'How can you even consider that? There\'s got to be some other way.',12,0,100,6,0,12841,0,27320,3,'culling SAY_PHASE107'),(26528,3,0,'You are not my king yet, boy! Nor would I obey that command even if you were!',12,0,100,396,0,12842,0,27322,3,'culling SAY_PHASE109'),(26528,4,0,'Treason? Have you lost your mind, Arthas?',12,0,100,5,0,12843,0,27324,3,'culling SAY_PHASE111'),(26528,5,0,'You\'ve just crossed a terrible threshold, Arthas.',12,0,100,397,0,12844,0,27328,3,'culling SAY_PHASE115'),(26497,0,0,'Arthas! You can\'t just--',12,0,100,396,0,12837,0,27326,3,'culling SAY_PHASE113'),(26497,1,0,'I\'m sorry, Arthas. I can\'t watch you do this.',12,0,100,396,0,12838,0,27330,3,'culling SAY_PHASE117'),(28167,1,0,'What? This can\'t be!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,27549,0,'RP2_LINE_CITIZEN2'),(28169,0,0,'Oh, no...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27552,0,'RP2_LINE_RESIDENT1'),(31126,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve finally arrived Prince Arthas. You\'re here just in the nick of time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27811,0,'culling SAY_PHASE302'),(31126,1,0,'There\'s no need for you to understand, Arthas. All you need to do is die.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27815,0,'culling SAY_PHASE305'),(26533,0,0,'Yes, this is the beginning. I\'ve been waiting for you, young prince. I am Mal\'Ganis.',14,0,100,1,0,14410,0,27574,3,'malganis SAY_INTRO_1 | culling SAY_PHASE206'),(26533,1,0,'As you can see, your people are now mine. I will now turn this city household by household, until the flame of life has been snuffed out... forever.',14,0,100,0,0,14411,0,27575,3,'malganis SAY_INTRO_2 | culling SAY_PHASE207'),(26533,2,0,'This will be a fine test, Prince Arthas.',14,0,100,0,0,14413,0,31344,3,'malganis SAY_AGGRO'),(26533,3,0,'All too easy.',14,0,100,0,0,14416,0,31347,3,'malganis SAY_KILL_1'),(26533,3,1,'The Dark Lord is displeased with your interference.',14,0,100,0,0,14417,0,31348,3,'malganis SAY_KILL_2'),(26533,3,2,'It is Prince Arthas I want, not you!',14,0,100,0,0,14418,0,31349,3,'malganis SAY_KILL_3'),(26533,4,0,'Anakh kyree!',14,0,100,0,0,14422,0,30412,3,'malganis SAY_SLAY_1'),(26533,4,1,'My Onslaught will wash over the Lich King\'s forces!',14,0,100,0,0,14423,0,30413,3,'malganis SAY_SLAY_2'),(26533,4,2,'Your death is in vain, tiny mortal.',14,0,100,0,0,14424,0,30414,3,'malganis SAY_SLAY_3'),(26533,4,3,'Your time has come to an end.',14,0,100,0,0,14425,0,30415,3,'malganis SAY_SLAY_4'),(26533,5,0,'Time out.',14,0,100,0,0,14414,0,31345,3,'malganis SAY_SLEEP_1'),(26533,5,1,'You seem tired.',14,0,100,0,0,14415,0,31346,3,'malganis SAY_SLEEP_2'),(26533,6,0,'Gah! I spent too much time in that weak little shell.',14,0,100,0,0,14426,0,30275,3,'malganis SAY_30HEALTH'),(26533,7,0,'Kirel narak! I am Mal\'Ganis. I AM ETERNAL!',14,0,100,0,0,14427,0,30276,3,'malganis SAY_15HEALTH'),(26533,8,0,'ENOUGH! I waste my time here. I must gather my strength on the homeworld.',14,0,100,0,0,14428,0,30277,3,'malganis SAY_ESCAPE_SPEECH_1'),(26533,9,0,'You\'ll never defeat the Lich King without my forces. I\'ll have my revenge... on him AND you!',14,0,100,0,0,14429,0,30278,3,'malganis SAY_ESCAPE_SPEECH_2'),(26533,10,0,'Your journey has just begun, young prince. Gather your forces and meet me in the arctic land of Northrend. It is there that we shall settle the score between us. It is there that your true destiny will unfold.',14,0,100,0,0,14412,0,28528,3,'malganis SAY_OUTRO'),(17879,0,0,'Why do you aid the Magus? Just think of how many lives could be saved if the portal is never opened, if the resulting wars could be erased....',14,0,100,0,0,10412,0,16814,0,'chrono lord deja SAY_ENTER'),(17879,1,0,'If you will not cease this foolish quest, then you will die!',14,0,100,0,0,10414,0,16815,0,'chrono lord deja SAY_AGGRO'),(17879,2,0,'You have outstayed your welcome, Keeper. Be gone!',14,0,100,0,0,10413,0,16817,0,'chrono lord deja SAY_BANISH'),(17879,3,0,'I told you it was a fool\'s quest!',14,0,100,0,0,10415,0,16818,0,'chrono lord deja SAY_SLAY1'),(17879,3,1,'Leaving so soon?',14,0,100,0,0,10416,0,16819,0,'chrono lord deja SAY_SLAY2'),(17879,4,0,'Time... is on our side.',14,0,100,0,0,10417,0,16816,0,'chrono lord deja SAY_DEATH'),(17881,0,0,'The time has come to shatter this clockwork universe forever! Let us no longer be slaves of the hourglass! I warn you: those who do not embrace this greater path shall become victims of its passing!',14,0,100,0,0,10400,0,16827,0,'aeonus SAY_ENTER'),(17881,1,0,'Let us see what fate has in store....',14,0,100,0,0,10402,0,16828,0,'aeonus SAY_AGGRO'),(17881,2,0,'Your time is up, slave of the past.',14,0,100,0,0,10401,0,16829,0,'aeonus SAY_BANISH'),(17881,3,0,'One less obstacle in our way!',14,0,100,0,0,10403,0,16831,0,'aeonus SAY_SLAY1'),(17881,3,1,'No one will stop us!',14,0,100,0,0,10404,0,16832,0,'aeonus SAY_SLAY2'),(17881,4,0,'We will triumph. It is only a matter... of time.',14,0,100,0,0,10405,0,16830,0,'aeonus SAY_DEATH'),(17881,5,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10645,0,'aeonus EMOTE_FRENZY'),(15608,0,0,'The time has come! Gul\'dan, order your warlocks to double their efforts! Moments from now the gateway will open and your Horde will be released upon this ripe, unsuspecting world!',14,0,100,0,0,10435,0,16787,0,'medivh SAY_ENTER'),(17651,0,0,'You\'ve got my attention, dragon.  You\'ll find I\'m not as easily scared as the villagers below.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14295,0,'Image of Medivh'),(15608,2,0,'Champions! My shield grows weak!',14,0,100,0,0,10437,0,16792,0,'medivh SAY_WEAK75'),(15608,3,0,'My powers must be concentrated on the portal! I do not have time to hold the shield!',14,0,100,0,0,10438,0,16794,0,'medivh SAY_WEAK50'),(15608,4,0,'The shield is nearly gone! All that I have worked for is in danger!',14,0,100,0,0,10439,0,16795,0,'medivh SAY_WEAK25'),(15608,5,0,'No! Damn this feeble, mortal coil!',14,0,100,0,0,10441,0,16790,0,'medivh SAY_DEATH'),(15608,6,0,'I am grateful for your aid, champions. Now, Gul\'dan\'s Horde will sweep across this world like a locust swarm, and all my designs, all my carefully-laid plans will at last fall into place.',14,0,100,0,0,10440,0,16796,0,'medivh SAY_WIN'),(15608,7,0,'Orcs of the Horde! This portal is the gateway to your new destiny! Azeroth lies before you, ripe for the taking!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19909,0,'medivh SAY_ORCS_ENTER'),(15608,8,0,'Gul\'dan speaks the truth! We should return at once to tell our brothers of the news! Retreat back through the portal!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19911,0,'medivh SAY_ORCS_ANSWER'),(17880,0,0,'Why do you persist? Surely you can see the futility of it all. It is not too late! You may still leave with your lives...',14,0,100,0,0,10442,0,16821,0,'temporus SAY_ENTER'),(17880,1,0,'So be it... you have been warned.',14,0,100,0,0,10444,0,16822,0,'temporus SAY_AGGRO'),(17880,2,0,'Keeper! The sands of time have run out for you.',14,0,100,0,0,10443,0,16824,0,'temporus SAY_BANISH'),(17880,3,0,'You should have left when you had the chance.',14,0,100,0,0,10445,0,16825,0,'temporus SAY_SLAY1'),(17880,3,1,'Your days are done.',14,0,100,0,0,10446,0,16826,0,'temporus SAY_SLAY2'),(17880,4,0,'My death means... little.',14,0,100,0,0,10447,0,16823,0,'temporus SAY_DEATH'),(23002,0,0,'You, there! Hand over that moonstone and nobody gets hurt!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20715,0,'sprysprocket SAY_START'),(23002,1,0,'Just chill!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21320,0,'sprysprocket SAY_WHISPER_CHILL'),(23002,2,0,'All right, you win! I surrender! Just don\'t hurt me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20720,0,'sprysprocket SAY_END'),(23002,3,0,'%s takes the Southfury moonstone and escapes into the river. Follow her!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,20708,0,'sprysprocket EMOTE_START'),(3568,0,0,'%s growls in acknowledgement before straightening and making her way off into the forest.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1340,0,'Mist'),(3519,0,0,'Mist! I feared I would never see you again! Yes, I am well, do not worry for me. You must rest and recover your health.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1330,0,'Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak'),(15381,0,0,'We must act quickly or all shall be lost!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10909,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_1'),(15381,1,0,'NOW, STAGHELM! WE GO NOW! Prepare your magic!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10915,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_2'),(15381,2,0,'Stay close...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10917,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_3'),(15381,3,0,'The sands of time will halt, but only for a moment! I will now conjure the barrier.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10930,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_4'),(15381,4,0,'FINISH THE SPELL, STAGHELM! I CANNOT HOLD THE GLYPHS OF WARDING IN PLACE MUCH LONGER! CALL FORTH THE ROOTS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10920,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_5'),(15381,5,0,'It... It is over, Lord Staghelm. We are victorious. Albeit the cost for this victory was great.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10923,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_6'),(15381,6,0,'There is but one duty that remains...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10924,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_7'),(15381,7,0,'Before I leave this place, I make one final offering to you, Lord Staghelm. Should a time arise in which you must gain entry to this accursed fortress, use the Scepter of the Shifting Sands on the sacred gong. The magic holding the barrier together will dissipate and the horrors of Ahn\'Qiraj will be unleashed upon the world once more.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10925,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_8'),(15381,8,0,'Lord Staghelm, where are you going? You would shatter our bond for the sake of pride?\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10931,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_9'),(15381,9,0,'And now you know all that there is to know, mortal... ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10935,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_10'),(15381,10,0,'%s hands the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to Fandral Staghelm.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10926,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_EMOTE_1'),(15381,11,0,'%s shakes his head in disappointment.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10933,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_EMOTE_2'),(15381,12,0,'%s kneels down to pick up the fragments of the shattered scepter.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10934,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_EMOTE_3'),(15382,0,0,'My forces cannot overcome the Qiraji defenses. We will not be able to get close enough to place your precious barrier, dragon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10910,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_1'),(15382,1,0,'It is done, dragon. Lead the way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10916,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_2'),(15382,2,0,'Ancient ones guide my hand... Wake from your slumber! WAKE AND SEAL THIS CURSED PLACE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10921,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_3'),(15382,3,0,'After the savagery that my people have witnessed and felt, you expect me to accept another burden, dragon? Surely you are mad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10927,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_4'),(15382,4,0,'I want nothing to do with Silithus, the Qiraji and least of all, any damned dragons!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10928,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_5'),(15382,5,0,'My son\'s soul will find no comfort in this hollow victory, dragon. I will have him back. Though it takes a millennia, I WILL have my son back!  ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10932,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_6'),(15382,6,0,'%s falls to one knee - exhausted.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10922,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_EMOTE_1'),(15382,7,0,'%s hurls the Scepter of the Shifting Sands into the barrier, shattering it.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10929,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_EMOTE_2'),(15379,0,0,'Aye, Fandral, remember these words: Let not your grief guide your faith. These thoughts you hold... dark places you go, night elf. Absolution cannot be had through misguided vengeance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10914,0,'anachronos the ancient CAELESTRASZ_SAY_1'),(15379,1,0,'Do not forget the sacrifices made on this day, night elf. We have all suffered immensely at the hands of these beasts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10907,0,'anachronos the ancient CAELESTRASZ_SAY_2'),(15379,2,0,'Alexstrasza grant me the resolve to drive our enemies back!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10902,0,'anachronos the ancient CAELESTRASZ_YELL_1'),(15380,0,0,'Anachronos, this diversion will give you and the young druid time enough to seal the gate. Do not falter. Now, let us see how they deal with chaotic magic.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10904,0,'anachronos the ancient ARYGOS_SAY_1'),(15380,1,0,'Let them feel the wrath of the Blue Flight! May Malygos protect me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10901,0,'anachronos the ancient ARYGOS_YELL_1'),(15380,2,0,'%s nods knowingly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10913,0,'anachronos the ancient ARYGOS_EMOTE_1'),(15378,0,0,'There is a way...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10911,0,'anachronos the ancient MERITHRA_SAY_1'),(15378,1,0,'We will push them back, Anachronos. This I vow. Uphold your end of this task. Let not your hands falter as you seal our fates behind the barrier.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10908,0,'anachronos the ancient MERITHRA_SAY_2'),(15378,2,0,'Succumb to the endless dream, little ones. Let it consume you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10903,0,'anachronos the ancient MERITHRA_YELL_1'),(15378,3,0,'%s glances at her compatriots.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10912,0,'anachronos the ancient MERITHRA_EMOTE_1'),(33515,1,1,'The secret dies with you.',14,0,100,0,0,15474,0,34354,0,'Auriaya SAY_SLAY_1'),(33515,1,2,'There is no escape.',14,0,100,0,0,15475,0,34355,0,'Auriaya SAY_SLAY_2'),(33515,2,0,'You waste my time!',14,0,100,0,0,15477,0,34358,0,'Auriaya SAY_BERSERK'),(33515,3,0,'%s begins to cast Terrifying Screech.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34450,0,'Auriaya EMOTE_FEAR'),(33515,4,0,'%s begins to activate the Feral Defender!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34162,0,'Auriaya EMOTE_DEFENDER'),(33515,5,0,'%s begins to activate the Feral Defender!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34162,0,'Auriaya EMOTE_DEFENDER'),(33113,0,0,'Hostile entities detected. Threat assessment protocol active. Primary target engaged. Time minus 30 seconds to re-evaluation.',14,0,100,0,0,15506,0,33487,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_AGGRO'),(33113,1,0,'Threat assessment routine modified. Current target threat level: 0. Acquiring new target.',14,0,100,0,0,15521,0,33507,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_SLAY'),(33113,2,0,'Total systems failure. Defense protocols breached. Leviathan unit shutting down.',14,0,100,0,0,15520,0,33506,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_DEATH'),(33113,3,0,'Threat re-evaluated. Target assessment complete. Changing course.',14,0,100,0,0,15507,0,33488,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_TARGET_1'),(33113,3,1,'Pursuit objective modified. Changing course.',14,0,100,0,0,15508,0,33489,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_TARGET_2'),(33113,3,2,'Hostile entity\'s stratagem predicted. Re-routing battle function. Changing course.',14,0,100,0,0,15509,0,33490,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_TARGET_3'),(33113,4,0,'Orbital countermeasures enabled.',14,0,100,0,0,15510,0,33491,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_HARDMODE'),(33113,5,0,'*ALERT* Static defense system failure. Orbital countermeasures disabled.',14,0,100,0,0,15511,0,33492,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_TOWER_NONE'),(33113,6,0,'Hodir\'s Fury online. Acquiring target.',14,0,100,0,0,15512,0,33493,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_TOWER_FROST'),(33113,7,0,'Mimiron\'s Inferno online. Acquiring target.',14,0,100,0,0,15513,0,33495,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_TOWER_FLAME'),(33113,8,0,'Freya\'s Ward online. Acquiring target.',14,0,100,0,0,15514,0,33497,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_TOWER_NATURE'),(33113,9,0,'Thorim\'s Hammer online. Acquiring target.',14,0,100,0,0,15515,0,33499,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_TOWER_STORM'),(33113,10,0,'Unauthorized entity attempting circuit overload. Activating anti-personnel countermeasures.',14,0,100,0,0,15516,0,33501,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_PLAYER_RIDING'),(33113,11,0,'System malfunction. Diverting power to support systems.',14,0,100,0,0,15517,0,33503,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_OVERLOAD_1'),(33113,11,1,'Combat matrix overload. Powering doooow...',14,0,100,0,0,15518,0,33504,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_OVERLOAD_2'),(33113,11,2,'System restart required. Deactivating weapons systems.',14,0,100,0,0,15519,0,33505,0,'Flame Leviathan SAY_OVERLOAD_3'),(33113,12,0,'%s pursues $n.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33502,0,'Flame Leviathan EMOTE_PURSUE'),(33113,13,0,'%s\'s circuits overloaded.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33304,0,'Flame Leviathan EMOTE_OVERLOAD'),(33113,14,0,'Automatic repair sequence initiated.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33538,0,'Flame Leviathan EMOTE_REPAIR'),(32906,0,0,'The Conservatory must be protected!',14,0,100,0,0,15526,0,33303,0,'Freya SAY_AGGRO'),(32906,1,0,'Elders grant me your strength!',14,0,100,0,0,15527,0,33520,0,'Freya SAY_AGGRO_WITH_ELDER'),(32906,2,0,'Forgive me.',14,0,100,0,0,15529,0,34106,0,'Freya SAY_SLAY_1'),(32906,2,1,'From your death springs life anew!',14,0,100,0,0,15530,0,34107,0,'Freya SAY_SLAY_2'),(32906,3,0,'His hold on me dissipates. I can see clearly once more. Thank you, heroes.',14,0,100,0,0,15531,0,33524,0,'Freya SAY_DEATH'),(32906,4,0,'You have strayed too far. Wasted too much time....',14,0,100,0,0,15532,0,33605,0,'Freya SAY_BERSERK'),(32906,5,0,'Eonar, your servant requires aid!',14,0,100,0,0,15528,0,33517,0,'Freya SAY_SUMMON_CONSERVATOR'),(32906,6,0,'Children, assist me!',14,0,100,0,0,15533,0,33519,0,'Freya SAY_SUMMON_TRIO'),(32906,7,0,'The swarm of the elements shall overtake you!',14,0,100,0,0,15534,0,33518,0,'Freya SAY_SUMMON_LASHERS'),(32906,8,0,'A |cFF00FFFFLifebinder\'s Gift|r begins to grow!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33370,0,'Freya EMOTE_LIFEBINDERS_GIFT'),(32906,9,0,'Allies of Nature have appeared!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33427,0,'Freya EMOTE_ALLIES_OF_NATURE'),(32906,10,0,'Freya begins to cast |cFFFF0000Ground Tremor!|r',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33312,0,'Freya EMOTE_GROUND_TREMOR'),(32906,11,0,'Freya casts |cFF00FF00Strengthened Iron Roots!|r',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33991,0,'Freya EMOTE_IRON_ROOTS'),(32913,0,0,'Mortals have no place here!',14,0,100,0,0,15493,0,34123,0,'Elder Ironbranch SAY_AGGRO'),(32913,1,0,'I return you whence you came!',14,0,100,0,0,15494,0,34124,0,'Elder Ironbranch SAY_SLAY_1'),(32913,1,1,'Begone!',14,0,100,0,0,15495,0,34125,0,'Elder Ironbranch SAY_SLAY_2'),(32913,2,0,'Freya! They come for you.',14,0,100,0,0,15496,0,34126,0,'Elder Ironbranch SAY_DEATH'),(32914,0,0,'This place will serve as your graveyard.',14,0,100,0,0,15500,0,34129,0,'Elder Stonebark SAY_AGGRO'),(32914,1,0,'<Angry roar>',14,0,100,0,0,15501,0,0,0,'Elder Stonebark SAY_SLAY_1'),(32914,1,1,'Such a waste....',14,0,100,0,0,15502,0,34130,0,'Elder Stonebark SAY_SLAY_2'),(32914,2,0,'Matron, flee! They are ruthless....',14,0,100,0,0,15503,0,34132,0,'Elder Stonebark SAY_DEATH'),(32915,0,0,'Matron, the Conservatory has been breached!',14,0,100,0,0,15483,0,34115,0,'Elder Brightleaf SAY_AGGRO'),(32915,1,0,'Fertilizer.',14,0,100,0,0,15485,0,34118,0,'Elder Brightleaf SAY_SLAY_1'),(32915,1,1,'Your corpse will nourish the soil.',14,0,100,0,0,15486,0,34119,0,'Elder Brightleaf SAY_SLAY_2'),(32915,2,0,'Matron, one has fallen!',14,0,100,0,0,15487,0,34121,0,'Elder Brightleaf SAY_DEATH'),(32845,0,0,'You will suffer for this trespass!',14,0,100,0,0,15552,0,34336,0,'Hodir SAY_AGGRO'),(32845,1,0,'Tragic. To come so far, only to fail.',14,0,100,0,0,15553,0,34337,0,'Hodir SAY_SLAY_1'),(32845,1,1,'Welcome to the endless winter.',14,0,100,0,0,15554,0,34338,0,'Hodir SAY_SLAY_2'),(32845,2,0,'Winds of the north consume you!',14,0,100,0,0,15555,0,34339,0,'Hodir SAY_FLASH_FREEZE'),(17968,6,0,'No, it cannot be! Nooo!',14,0,100,0,0,10992,0,14991,0,'Archimonde - SAY_DEATH'),(32845,4,0,'I... I am released from his grasp... at last.',14,0,100,0,0,15557,0,33484,0,'Hodir SAY_DEATH'),(32845,5,0,'ENOUGH! This ends now!',14,0,100,0,0,15558,0,34340,0,'Hodir SAY_BERSERK'),(32845,6,0,'%s shatters the Rare Cache of Hodir!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,33323,0,'Hodir SAY_HARD_MODE_MISSED'),(32845,7,0,'%s begins to cast Flash Freeze!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33314,0,'Hodir - EMOTE_FREEZE'),(32845,8,0,'%s gains Frozen Blows!',41,0,100,0,0,15556,0,33313,0,'Hodir - EMOTE_BLOW'),(33118,0,0,'Insolent whelps! Your blood will temper the weapons used to reclaim this world!',14,0,100,0,0,15564,0,34306,0,'Ignis SAY_AGGRO'),(33118,1,0,'Arise, soldiers of the iron crucible! The Maker\'s will be done!',14,0,100,0,0,15565,0,34307,0,'Ignis SAY_SUMMON'),(33118,2,0,'I will burn away your impurities!',14,0,100,0,0,15566,0,34308,0,'Ignis SAY_SLAG_POT'),(33118,3,0,'Let the inferno consume you!',14,0,100,0,0,15567,0,34309,0,'Ignis SAY_SCORCH_1'),(33118,3,1,'BURN! Burn in the Maker\'s fire!',14,0,100,0,0,15568,0,34310,0,'Ignis SAY_SCORCH_2'),(33118,4,0,'More scraps for the scrap heap.',14,0,100,0,0,15569,0,34311,0,'Ignis SAY_SLAY_1'),(33118,4,1,'Your bones will serve as kindling.',14,0,100,0,0,15570,0,34312,0,'Ignis SAY_SLAY_2'),(33118,5,0,'LET IT BE FINISHED!',14,0,100,0,0,15571,0,33871,0,'Ignis SAY_BERSERK'),(33118,6,0,'I. Have. Failed.',14,0,100,0,0,15572,0,34313,0,'Ignis SAY_DEATH'),(33118,7,0,'%s begins to cast Flame Jets!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33465,0,'Ignis EMOTE_JETS'),(32930,0,0,'None shall pass!',14,0,100,0,0,15586,0,34133,0,'Kologarn SAY_AGGRO'),(32930,1,0,'KOL-THARISH!',14,0,100,0,0,15587,0,34135,0,'Kologarn SAY_SLAY_1'),(32930,1,1,'YOU FAIL!',14,0,100,0,0,15588,0,34137,0,'Kologarn SAY_SLAY_2'),(32930,2,0,'Just a scratch!',14,0,100,0,0,15589,0,34143,0,'Kologarn SAY_LEFT_ARM_GONE'),(32930,3,0,'Only a flesh wound!',14,0,100,0,0,15590,0,34144,0,'Kologarn SAY_RIGHT_ARM_GONE'),(32930,4,0,'OBLIVION!',14,0,100,0,0,15591,0,34140,0,'Kologarn SAY_SHOCKWAVE'),(32930,5,0,'I will squeeze the life from you!',14,0,100,0,0,15592,0,34138,0,'Kologarn SAY_GRAB_PLAYER'),(32930,6,0,'Master, they come....',14,0,100,0,0,15593,0,34141,0,'Kologarn SAY_DEATH'),(32930,7,0,'I am invincible!',14,0,100,0,0,15594,0,34142,0,'Kologarn SAY_BERSERK'),(32930,8,0,'Kologarn casts Stone Grip!',41,0,100,0,0,15592,0,33864,0,'Kologarn EMOTE_STONE_GRIP'),(33210,0,0,'Be on the lookout! Mole machines will be surfacing soon with those nasty Iron dwarves aboard!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33607,0,'Expedition Commander SAY_AGGRO'),(33210,1,0,'Move quickly! She won\'t remain grounded for long!',14,0,100,0,0,15648,0,33606,0,'Expedition Commander SAY_GROUND_PHASE'),(33210,2,0,'We have lost our engineers, this will not end well!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33818,0,'Expedition Commander SAY_ENGINEERS_DEAD'),(33287,0,0,'Give us a moment to prepare to build the turrets.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33820,0,'Expedition Engineer SAY_AGGRO'),(33287,1,0,'Ready to move out, keep those dwarves off of our backs!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33816,0,'Expedition Engineer SAY_START_REPAIR'),(33287,2,0,'Fires out! Let\'s rebuild those turrets!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33821,0,'Expedition Engineer SAY_REBUILD_TURRETS'),(33186,0,0,'%s is grounded permanently!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33931,0,'Razorscale EMOTE_PERMA_GROUND'),(33186,1,0,'%s takes a deep breath...',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33657,0,'Razorscale EMOTE_BREATH'),(33233,0,0,'Harpoon Turret is ready for use!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33857,0,'Razorscale Controller EMOTE_HARPOON'),(33271,0,0,'Your destruction will herald a new age of suffering!',14,0,100,0,0,15542,0,34053,0,'General Vezax SAY_AGGRO'),(33271,1,0,'You thought to stand before the legions of death and survive?',14,0,100,0,0,15543,0,34050,0,'General Vezax SAY_SLAY_1'),(33271,1,1,'Defiance... a flaw of mortality.',14,0,100,0,0,15544,0,34051,0,'General Vezax SAY_SLAY_2'),(33271,2,0,'The black blood of Yogg-Saron courses through me! I. AM. UNSTOPPABLE!',14,0,100,0,0,15545,0,34055,0,'General Vezax SAY_SURGE_OF_DARKNESS'),(33271,3,0,'Oh, what horrors await....',14,0,100,0,0,15546,0,34054,0,'General Vezax SAY_DEATH'),(33271,4,0,'Your defeat was inevitable.',14,0,100,0,0,15547,0,34052,0,'General Vezax SAY_BERSERK'),(33271,5,0,'Behold now: terror absolute!',14,0,100,0,0,15548,0,34056,0,'General Vezax SAY_HARDMODE'),(33271,6,0,'The saronite vapors mass and swirl violently, merging into a monstrous form!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33594,0,'General Vezax - EMOTE_ANIMUS'),(33271,7,0,'A saronite barrier appears around General Vezax!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33646,0,'General Vezax - EMOTE_BARRIER'),(33271,8,0,'General Vezax roars and surges with dark might!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33471,0,'General Vezax - EMOTE_SURGE_OF_DARKNESS'),(33488,0,0,'A cloud of saronite vapors coalesces nearby!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33587,0,'Saronite Vapor - EMOTE_VAPORS'),(33293,0,0,'New toys? For me? I promise I won\'t break them this time!',14,0,100,0,0,15724,0,33508,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_AGGRO'),(33293,1,0,'So tired. I will rest for just a moment!',14,0,100,0,0,15725,0,33446,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_HEART_OPENED'),(33293,2,0,'I\'m ready to play!',14,0,100,0,0,15726,0,33448,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_HEART_CLOSED'),(33293,3,0,'NO! NO! NO! NO! NO!',14,0,100,0,0,15727,0,33453,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_TYMPANIC_TANTRUM'),(33293,4,0,'I... I think I broke it.',14,0,100,0,0,15728,0,33509,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_SLAY_1'),(33293,4,1,'I guess it doesn\'t bend that way.',14,0,100,0,0,15729,0,33510,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_SLAY_2'),(33293,5,0,'I\'m tired of these toys. I don\'t want to play anymore!',14,0,100,0,0,15730,0,33512,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_BERSERK'),(33293,6,0,'You are bad... Toys... Very... Baaaaad ',14,0,100,0,0,15731,0,33511,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_DEATH'),(33293,7,0,'Time for a new game! My old toys will fight my new toys!',14,0,100,0,0,15732,0,0,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor SAY_SUMMON'),(33293,8,0,'%s\'s heart is exposed and leaking energy.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33447,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor EMOTE_HEART_OPENED'),(33293,9,0,'%s\'s heart is severed from his body.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34023,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor EMOTE_HEART_CLOSED'),(33293,10,0,'%s begins to cause the earth to quake.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33454,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor EMOTE_TYMPANIC_TANTRUM'),(33293,11,0,'%s consumes a scrap bot to repair himself!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33856,0,'XT-002 Deconstructor EMOTE_SCRAPBOT'),(32865,13,0,'And now it falls to you, champions, to avenge us all. The task before you is great, but I will lend you my aid as I am able. You must prevail.',14,0,100,0,0,15749,0,33954,0,'Thorim SAY_END_HARD_3'),(32865,12,0,'Behold the hand behind all the evil that has befallen Ulduar, left my kingdom in ruins, corrupted my brother, and slain my wife.',14,0,100,0,0,15748,0,33953,0,'Thorim SAY_END_HARD_2'),(32865,11,0,'You! Fiend! You are not my beloved! Be gone!',14,0,100,0,0,15747,0,33952,0,'Thorim SAY_END_HARD_1'),(32865,10,0,'I need time to reflect.... I will aid your cause if you should require it. I owe you at least that much. Farewell.',14,0,100,0,0,15746,0,33951,0,'Thorim SAY_END_NORMAL_3'),(32865,9,0,'Sif... was Sif here? Impossible--she died by my brother\'s hand. A dark nightmare indeed....',14,0,100,0,0,15745,0,33950,0,'Thorim SAY_END_NORMAL_2'),(32865,8,0,'I feel as though I am awakening from a nightmare, but the shadows in this place yet linger.',14,0,100,0,0,15744,0,33949,0,'Thorim SAY_END_NORMAL_1'),(32865,7,0,'Stay your arms! I yield!',14,0,100,0,0,15743,0,33948,0,'Thorim SAY_DEATH'),(32865,6,0,'Failures! Weaklings!',14,0,100,0,0,15742,0,33274,0,'Thorim SAY_WIPE'),(32865,6,1,'Pathetic.',14,0,100,0,0,15740,0,35768,0,'Thorim SAY_SLAY_2'),(32865,5,0,'My patience has reached its limit!',14,0,100,0,0,15741,0,33365,0,'Thorim SAY_BERSERK'),(32865,4,0,'Can\'t you at least put up a fight!?',14,0,100,0,0,15739,0,34239,0,'Thorim SAY_SLAY_1'),(32865,3,0,'Impertinent whelps, you dare challenge me atop my pedestal? I will crush you myself!',14,0,100,0,0,15738,0,33148,0,'Thorim SAY_JUMPDOWN'),(32865,2,0,'Do not hold back! Destroy them!',14,0,100,0,0,15736,0,34241,0,'Thorim SAY_SPECIAL'),(32865,0,0,'Interlopers! You mortals who dare to interfere with my sport will pay... Wait--you...',14,0,100,0,0,15733,0,33145,0,'Thorim SAY_AGGRO_1'),(32865,1,0,'I remember you... In the mountains... But you... what is this? Where am--',14,0,100,0,0,15734,0,33270,0,'Thorim SAY_AGGRO_2'),(16483,0,0,'The last thing I remember is the ship falling and us getting into the pods.  I\'ll go see how I can help.  Thank you!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,13408,0,'draenei survivor SAY_HEAL1'),(16483,0,1,'Where am I?  Who are you?  Oh no!  What happened to the ship?',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,13409,0,'draenei survivor SAY_HEAL2'),(16483,0,2,'$C, you saved me!  I owe you a debt that I can never repay.  I\'ll go see if I can help the others.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,12451,0,'draenei survivor SAY_HEAL3'),(16483,0,3,'Ugh... what is this place?  Is that all that\'s left of the ship over there?',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,13410,0,'draenei survivor SAY_HEAL4'),(16483,1,0,'Oh, the pain...',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,13440,0,'draenei survivor SAY_HELP1'),(16483,1,1,'Everything hurts. Please, make it stop...',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,13441,0,'draenei survivor SAY_HELP2'),(16483,1,2,'Ughhh... I hurt.  Can you help me?',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,13411,0,'draenei survivor SAY_HELP3'),(16483,1,3,'I don\'t know if I can make it. Please help me...',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,13442,0,'draenei survivor SAY_HELP4'),(17243,3,0,'What\'s the big idea? You nearly blew my cover, idiot! I told you to put the compass and navigation maps somewhere safe - not out in the open for any fool to discover.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13777,0,'geezle SPARK_SAY_2'),(17318,0,0,'What\'s the big idea, Spark? Why\'d you call for this meeting?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13776,0,'geezle GEEZLE_SAY_1'),(17312,0,0,'Our house is this way, through the thicket.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13744,0,'magwin SAY_START'),(17312,1,0,'Help me!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13770,0,'magwin SAY_AGGRO'),(17312,2,0,'My poor family. Everything has been destroyed.',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,13745,0,'magwin SAY_PROGRESS'),(17312,3,0,'Father! Father! You\'re alive!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,13746,0,'magwin SAY_END1'),(17312,4,0,'You can thank $n for getting me back here safely, father.',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,13748,0,'magwin SAY_END2'),(17312,5,0,'%s hugs her father.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,13747,0,'magwin EMOTE_HUG'),(17243,4,0,'The Master has gone to great lengths to secure information about the whereabouts of the Exodar. You could have blown the entire operation, including the cover of our spy on the inside.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13778,0,'geezle SPARK_SAY_3'),(17318,1,0,'Relax, Spark! I have it all under control. We\'ll strip mine the Exodar right out from under \'em - making both you and I very, very rich in the process.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13779,0,'geezle GEEZLE_SAY_4'),(17243,5,0,'Relax? Do you know what Kael\'thas does to those that fail him, Geezle? Eternal suffering and pain... Do NOT screw this up, fool.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13780,0,'geezle SPARK_SAY_5'),(17243,6,0,'Our Bloodmyst scouts have located our contact. The fool, Velen, will soon leave himself open and defenseless -- long enough for us to strike! Now get out of my sight before I vaporize you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13781,0,'geezle SPARK_SAY_6'),(17318,2,0,'Yes, sir. It won\'t happen again...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13782,0,'geezle GEEZLE_SAY_7'),(17375,0,0,'[Furbolg] The Stillpine furbolgs will not soon forget your bravery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13978,0,'stillpine capitive CAPITIVE_SAY_1'),(17375,0,1,'[Furbolg] Thank you, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13837,0,'stillpine capitive CAPITIVE_SAY_2'),(17375,0,2,'[Furbolg] Those remaining at Stillpine Hold will welcome you as a hero!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13979,0,'stillpine capitive CAPITIVE_SAY_3'),(6729,0,0,'Aku\'mai is dead! At last, I can leave this wretched place.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,2848,0,'morridune SAY_MORRIDUNE_1'),(6729,1,0,'Speak with me to hear my tale.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2849,0,'morridune SAY_MORRIDUNE_2'),(17682,0,0,'Thank you for saving me, $N! My father will be delighted!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14323,0,'Princess Stillpine'),(11218,0,0,'Liladris has been waiting for me at Maestra\'s Post, so we should make haste, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,6209,0,6540,0,'kerlonian SAY_KER_START'),(11218,1,0,'%s looks very sleepy...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6811,0,'kerlonian EMOTE_KER_SLEEP_1'),(11218,1,1,'%s suddenly falls asleep.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6542,0,'kerlonian EMOTE_KER_SLEEP_2'),(11218,1,2,'%s begins to drift off...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6541,0,'kerlonian EMOTE_KER_SLEEP_3'),(11218,2,0,'This looks like the perfect place for a nap...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6813,0,'kerlonian SAY_KER_SLEEP_1'),(11218,2,1,'Yaaaaawwwwwnnnn...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6543,0,'kerlonian SAY_KER_SLEEP_2'),(11218,2,2,'Oh, I am so tired...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6544,0,'kerlonian SAY_KER_SLEEP_3'),(11218,2,3,'You don\'t mind if I stop here for a moment, do you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6545,0,'kerlonian SAY_KER_SLEEP_4'),(11218,3,0,'Be on the alert! The Blackwood furbolgs are numerous in this area...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6867,0,'kerlonian SAY_KER_ALERT_1'),(11218,3,1,'It\'s quiet... Too quiet...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6868,0,'kerlonian SAY_KER_ALERT_2'),(11218,4,0,'Oh, I can see Liladris from here... Tell her I\'m here, won\'t you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6643,0,'kerlonian SAY_KER_END'),(11218,5,0,'%s wakes up!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6612,0,'kerlonian EMOTE_KER_AWAKEN'),(2917,0,0,'Ok, $n, let\'s go find where I left that mysterious fossil. Follow me!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,925,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_START'),(2917,1,0,'Something tells me this $n wants the mysterious fossil too. Help!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,941,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_AGGRO'),(2917,2,0,'Now where did I put that mysterious fossil? Ah, maybe up there...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,926,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_RAMP1_1'),(2917,3,0,'Hrm, nothing up here.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,927,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_RAMP1_2'),(2917,4,0,'No mysterious fossil here... Ah, but my copy of Green Hills of Stranglethorn.  What a good book!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,928,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_BOOK'),(2917,5,0,'I bet you I left it in the tent!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,929,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_TENT1_1'),(2917,6,0,'Oh wait, that\'s Hollee\'s tent... and it\'s empty.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,930,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_TENT1_2'),(2917,7,0,'Interesting... I hadn\'t noticed this earlier...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,931,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_MOSS'),(2917,8,0,'%s inspects the ancient, mossy stone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,932,0,'remtravel EMOTE_REM_MOSS'),(2917,9,0,'Oh wait! I\'m supposed to be looking for that mysterious fossil!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,933,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_MOSS_PROGRESS'),(2917,10,0,'Nope, didn\'t leave the fossil back here!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,935,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_PROGRESS'),(2917,11,0,'Ah, I remember now! I gave the mysterious fossil to Hollee! Check with her.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,936,0,'remtravel SAY_REM_REMEMBER'),(2917,12,0,'%s goes back to work, oblivious to everything around him.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,937,0,'remtravel EMOTE_REM_END'),(4966,0,0,'Why don\'t we deal with you now, Hendel? Lady Proudmoore will speak to you back in the tower.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1663,0,'hendel SAY_PROGRESS_1_TER'),(4966,1,0,'Please... please... Miss Proudmore. I didn\'t mean to...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1759,0,'hendel SAY_PROGRESS_2_HEN'),(4966,2,0,'I apologize for taking so long to get here. I wanted Lady Proudmoore to be present also.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1761,0,'hendel SAY_PROGRESS_3_TER'),(4966,3,0,'We can only stay a few moments before returning to the tower. If you wish to speak to us more you may find us there.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1808,0,'hendel SAY_PROGRESS_4_TER'),(4966,4,0,'%s, too injured, gives up the chase.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,8224,0,'hendel EMOTE_SURRENDER'),(23864,0,0,'This land was mine long before your wretched kind set foot here.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22370,0,'zelfrax SAY_ZELFRAX1'),(23864,1,0,'All who venture here belong to me, including you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22371,0,'zelfrax SAY_ZELFRAX2'),(7807,0,0,'Emergency power activated!  Initializing ambulatory motor!  CLUCK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3824,0,'Homing Robot OOX-22/FE'),(7807,1,0,'Physical threat detected!  Evasive action!  CLUCK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3795,0,'Homing Robot OOX-22/FE'),(7807,1,1,'Threat analyzed!  Activating combat plan beta!  CLUCK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3796,0,'Homing Robot OOX-22/FE'),(7807,2,0,'CLUCK!  Sensors detect spatial anomaly -- danger imminent!  CLUCK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3822,0,'Homing Robot OOX-22/FE'),(7807,3,0,'Flight systems online!  CLUCK!  Engaging rockets for transport to Booty Bay!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3823,0,'Homing Robot OOX-22/FE'),(23616,0,0,'%s howls in delight at the sight of his lunch!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,22068,0,'kyle EMOTE_SEE_LUNCH'),(23616,1,0,'%s eats his lunch.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,22069,0,'kyle EMOTE_EAT_LUNCH'),(23622,2,0,'%s thanks you with a special dance.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,22070,0,'kyle EMOTE_DANCE'),(4508,8,0,'I think I\'ll rest a moment and catch my breath before heading back to Ratchet. Thanks for all the help!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1493,0,'Willix the Importer'),(4508,7,0,'Finally! I\'ll be glad to get out of this place.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1490,0,'Willix the Importer'),(4508,6,0,'Glad to be out of that wretched trench. Not much nicer up here though!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1488,0,'Willix the Importer'),(4508,5,0,'I think I see a way for us to get out of this big twisted mess of a bramble.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1487,0,'Willix the Importer'),(4508,4,0,'I don\'t see how these foul animals live in this place... sheesh it smells!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1486,0,'Willix the Importer'),(4508,3,0,'There could be danger around every corner here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1485,0,'Willix the Importer'),(4508,2,0,'There\'s blueleaf tuber in this trench! It\'s like gold waiting to be mined I tell you!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1484,0,'Willix the Importer'),(4508,1,0,'Up there is where Charlga Razorflank resides. Blasted old crone.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,1483,0,'Willix the Importer'),(4508,0,0,'Woo hoo! Finally getting out of here. It\'s going to be rough though. Keep your eyes peeled for trouble.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1482,0,'Willix the Importer'),(6669,0,0,'*Threshwackonator First Mate unit prepared to follow*',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,3012,0,'threshwackonator EMOTE_START'),(6669,1,0,'YARRR! Swabie, what have ye done?! He\'s gone mad! Baton down the hatches! Hoist the mast! ARRRR! Every man for hi\'self!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2704,0,'threshwackonator SAY_AT_CLOSE'),(9453,0,0,'That kodo sure is a beauty.  Wait a minute, where are my bifocals?  Perhaps you should inspect the beast for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7302,0,'kodo round SAY_SMEED_HOME_3'),(7784,0,0,'Emergency power activated!  Initializing ambulatory motor!  CLUCK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3794,0,'Homing Robot OOX-17/TN'),(7784,1,0,'Physical threat detected!  Evasive action!  CLUCK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3795,0,'Homing Robot OOX-17/TN'),(7784,1,1,'Threat analyzed!  Activating combat plan beta!  CLUCK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3796,0,'Homing Robot OOX-17/TN'),(7784,2,0,'CLUCK!  Sensors detect spatial anomaly -- danger imminent!  CLUCK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3797,0,'Homing Robot OOX-17/TN'),(7805,0,0,'No one challenges the Wastewander nomads -- not even robotic chickens!  ATTACK!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3812,0,'oox SAY_OOX17_AMBUSH_REPLY'),(7784,3,0,'Flight systems online!  CLUCK!  Engaging rockets for transport to Booty Bay!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3816,0,'Homing Robot OOX-17/TN'),(5955,0,0,'I\'m thirsty.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2222,0,'tooga SAY_TOOG_THIRST'),(5955,0,1,'Torta must be so worried.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2228,0,'tooga SAY_TOOG_WORRIED'),(5955,1,0,'Torta, my love! I have returned at long last.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2137,0,'tooga SAY_TOOG_POST_1'),(6015,0,0,'You have any idea how long I\'ve been waiting here? And where\'s dinner? All that time gone and nothing to show for it?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2138,0,'tooga SAY_TORT_POST_2'),(5955,2,0,'My dearest Torta, I have been gone for so long. Finally we are reunited. At long last our love can blossom again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2139,0,'tooga SAY_TOOG_POST_3'),(6015,1,0,'Enough with the rambling. I am starving! Now, get your dusty shell into that ocean and bring momma some grub.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2140,0,'tooga SAY_TORT_POST_4'),(5955,3,0,'Yes, Torta. Whatever your heart desires...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2141,0,'tooga SAY_TOOG_POST_5'),(6015,2,0,'And try not to get lost this time....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2145,0,'tooga SAY_TORT_POST_6'),(15727,0,0,'%s is weakened!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11476,0,'cthun EMOTE_WEAKENED'),(15509,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,7798,0,'huhuran EMOTE_ENRAGE'),(15509,1,0,'%s goes into a berserker rage!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,4428,0,'huhuran EMOTE_BERSERK'),(15516,0,0,'You will be judged for defiling these sacred grounds!  The laws of the Ancients will not be challenged!  Trespassers will be annihilated!\n',14,0,100,0,0,8646,0,11442,0,'sartura SAY_AGGRO'),(15516,1,0,'I sentence you to death!',14,0,100,0,0,8647,0,11443,0,'sartura SAY_SLAY'),(15516,2,0,'I serve to the last!',14,0,100,0,0,8648,0,11444,0,'sartura SAY_DEATH'),(15263,0,0,'Are you so eager to die? I will be happy to accommodate you...',14,0,100,0,0,8615,0,11445,0,'skeram SAY_AGGRO1'),(15263,0,1,'Cower mortals! The age of darkness is at hand.',14,0,100,0,0,8616,0,0,0,'skeram SAY_AGGRO2'),(15263,0,2,'Tremble! The end is upon you.',14,0,100,0,0,8621,0,0,0,'skeram SAY_AGGRO3'),(15263,1,0,'Let your death serve as an example!',14,0,100,0,0,8617,0,11446,0,'skeram SAY_SLAY1'),(15263,1,1,'Spineless wretches! You will drown in rivers of blood!',14,0,100,0,0,8619,0,0,0,'skeram SAY_SLAY2'),(15263,1,2,'The screams of the dying will fill the air. A symphony of terror is about to begin!',14,0,100,0,0,8620,0,0,0,'skeram SAY_SLAY3'),(15263,2,0,'Prepare for the return of the ancient ones!',14,0,100,0,0,8618,0,0,0,'skeram SAY_SPLIT'),(15263,3,0,'You only delay the inevitable!',14,0,100,0,0,8622,0,11447,0,'skeram SAY_DEATH'),(10638,0,0,'Here they come! Defend yourselves!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,6149,0,'Kanati Greycloud'),(10646,0,0,'Be on guard... Arnak has some strange power over the Grimtotem... they will not be happy to see me escape.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,5926,0,'Lakota Windsong'),(10646,1,0,'Look out, the Grimtotem are upon us!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,5927,0,'Lakota Windsong'),(10646,2,0,'Here they come.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,5928,0,'Lakota Windsong'),(10646,3,0,'More Grimtotems are coming this way!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,5929,0,'Lakota Windsong'),(10646,4,0,'Finally, free at last... I must be going now, thanks for helping me escape. I can get back to Freewind Post by myself.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,5930,0,'Lakota Windsong'),(10427,0,0,'Lets go, $n. I am ready to reach Whitereach Post.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,5648,0,'Pao\'ka Swiftmountain'),(10427,1,0,'Now this looks familiar. If we keep heading east, I think we can... Ahh! Wyvern on the attack!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,5654,0,'Pao\'ka Swiftmountain'),(10427,2,0,'Thanks a bunch... I can find my way back to Whitereach Post from here. Be sure to talk with Motega Firemane; perhaps you can keep him from sending me home.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,5683,0,'Pao\'ka Swiftmountain'),(3679,0,0,'%s tosses fitfully in troubled sleep.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1268,0,'Naralex EMOTE_AWAKENING_1'),(3678,10,3,'This $n is a minion from Naralex\'s nightmare no doubt!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1276,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_AGGRO'),(3678,10,4,'Help!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1277,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_AGGRO'),(3678,10,2,'I can\'t handle this $n alone! Help!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1275,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_AGGRO'),(3678,10,1,'Deal with this $n! I need to prepare to awake Naralex!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1274,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_AGGRO'),(3678,9,0,'At last! Naralex awakes from the nightmare.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,1267,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_9'),(3678,10,0,'Attacked! Help get this $n off of me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1273,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_AGGRO'),(3678,8,0,'%s begins to perform the awakening ritual on Naralex.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1265,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_8'),(3678,7,0,'Protect me brave souls as I delve into the Emerald Dream to rescue Naralex and put an end to this corruption!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,1264,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_7'),(3678,6,0,'Beyond this corridor, Naralex lies in fitful sleep. Let us go awaken him before it is too late.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,1263,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_6'),(3678,5,0,'The caverns have been purified. To Naralex\'s chamber we go!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1259,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_5'),(3678,4,0,'Within this circle of fire I must cast the spell to banish the spirits of the slain Fanglords.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1258,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_4'),(3678,3,0,'Come. We must continue. There is much to be done before we can pull Naralex from his nightmare.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,1257,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_3'),(3678,2,0,'These caverns were once a temple of promise for regrowth in the Barrens. Now, they are the halls of nightmares.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1256,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_2'),(3678,0,0,'At last! Naralex can be awakened! Come aid me, brave adventurers!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,2101,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_ALL_DONE'),(3678,1,0,'I must make the necessary preparations before the awakening ritual can begin. You must protect me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1255,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_PROGRESS_1'),(7607,0,0,'Oh no!  Here they come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3744,0,'weegli blastfuse SAY_WEEGLI_OHNO'),(7607,1,0,'Ok, here I go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3785,0,'weegli blastfuse SAY_WEEGLI_OK_I_GO'),(29120,0,0,'Eternal agony awaits you!',14,0,100,0,0,14054,0,32308,0,'anub arak SAY_AGGRO'),(29120,1,0,'Soon the master\'s voice will call to you.',14,0,100,0,0,14057,0,32311,0,'anub arak SAY_SLAY_1'),(29120,1,1,'You have made your choice.',14,0,100,0,0,14056,0,32310,0,'anub arak SAY_SLAY_2'),(29120,1,2,'You shall experience my torment first hand!',14,0,100,0,0,14055,0,32309,0,'anub arak SAY_SLAY_3'),(29120,2,0,'Ahhh... RAAAAAGH! Never thought... I would be free of him....',14,0,100,0,0,14069,0,32317,0,'anub arak SAY_DEATH'),(29120,3,0,'Your armor is useless against my locusts!',14,0,100,0,0,14060,0,32314,0,'anub arak SAY_LOCUST_1'),(29120,3,1,'Uunak-hissss tik-k-k-k-k!',14,0,100,0,0,14067,0,32315,0,'anub arak SAY_LOCUST_2'),(29120,3,2,'A pestilence upon you!',14,0,100,0,0,14068,0,32316,0,'anub arak SAY_LOCUST_3'),(29120,4,0,'Auum na-l ak-k-k-k, isshhh.',14,0,100,0,0,14058,0,32312,0,'anub arak SAY_SUBMERGE_1'),(29120,4,1,'Come forth, my brethren! Feast on their flesh!',14,0,100,0,0,14059,0,32313,0,'anub arak SAY_SUBMERGE_2'),(29120,5,0,'I was king of this empire once, long ago. In life I stood as champion. In death I returned as conqueror. Now I protect the kingdom once more. Ironic, yes? ',14,0,100,0,0,14053,0,0,0,'anub arak SAY_INTRO'),(28684,0,0,'This kingdom belongs to the Scourge. Only the dead may enter!',14,0,100,0,0,14075,0,32271,0,'krik thir SAY_AGGRO'),(28684,1,0,'You were foolish to come.',14,0,100,0,0,14077,0,32273,0,'krik thir SAY_SLAY_1'),(28684,1,1,'As Anub\'arak commands!',14,0,100,0,0,14078,0,32274,0,'krik thir SAY_SLAY_2'),(28684,2,0,'I should be grateful... but I long ago lost the capacity....',14,0,100,0,0,14087,0,32283,0,'krik thir SAY_DEATH'),(28684,3,0,'They hunger....',14,0,100,0,0,14085,0,32281,0,'krik thir SAY_SWARM_1'),(28684,3,1,'Dinner time, my pets!',14,0,100,0,0,14086,0,32282,0,'krik thir SAY_SWARM_2'),(28684,4,0,'Keep an eye on that tunnel. We must not let anyone through!',14,0,100,0,0,14082,0,32278,0,'krik thir SAY_PREFIGHT_1'),(28684,4,1,'I hear footsteps. Be on your guard.',14,0,100,0,0,14083,0,32279,0,'krik thir SAY_PREFIGHT_2'),(28684,4,2,'I sense the living. Be ready.',14,0,100,0,0,14084,0,32280,0,'krik thir SAY_PREFIGHT_3'),(28684,5,0,'We are besieged! Strike out and bring back their corpses!',14,0,100,0,0,14079,0,32275,0,'krik thir SAY_SEND_GROUP_1'),(28684,5,1,'We must hold the gate. Attack! Tear them limb from limb!',14,0,100,0,0,14080,0,32276,0,'krik thir SAY_SEND_GROUP_2'),(28684,5,2,'The gate must be protected at all costs. Rip them to shreds!',14,0,100,0,0,14081,0,32277,0,'krik thir SAY_SEND_GROUP_3'),(28189,0,0,'My liege, the infiltration and control of the Alliance power structure by our cultists is well underway.',12,0,100,0,0,14211,0,25357,0,'thassarian SAY_TALBOT_1'),(28189,1,0,'The power you\'ve bestowed upon me has granted me great mental influence over human minds.  I bear these offerings as proof of my progress.',12,0,100,0,0,14212,0,25358,0,'thassarian SAY_TALBOT_2'),(28189,2,0,'Allow me to take care of the intruders, lord.  I will feed their entrails to the maggots.',12,0,100,0,0,14213,0,25361,0,'thassarian SAY_TALBOT_3'),(28189,3,0,'Yes, my lord!',12,0,100,0,0,14214,0,25365,0,'thassarian SAY_TALBOT_4'),(26203,0,0,'Your progress in this region has been impressive, blood prince.  I am pleased.',12,0,100,0,0,14756,0,25362,0,'thassarian SAY_LICH_1'),(26203,1,0,'Now this is a surprise, Thassarian.  I hadn\'t heard from Mograine or the other death knights for months.  You\'ve come to rejoin the Scourge, I take it?',12,0,100,0,0,14757,0,25363,0,'thassarian SAY_LICH_2'),(26203,2,0,'Do not fail me, San\'layn.  Return to Icecrown with this fool\'s head or do not bother to return.',12,0,100,0,0,14758,0,25364,0,'thassarian SAY_LICH_3'),(26170,0,0,'Leryssa!',14,0,100,0,0,14664,0,25359,0,'thassarian SAY_THASSARIAN_1'),(26170,1,0,'What have you done to my sister, you motherless elf scum!?',14,0,100,0,0,14665,0,25360,0,'thassarian SAY_THASSARIAN_2'),(26170,2,0,'I would sooner slit my own throat.  You will pay for what you did to your own men, Arthas... for what you did to me!  I swear it.',12,0,100,0,0,14666,0,25366,0,'thassarian SAY_THASSARIAN_3'),(26170,3,0,'Leryssa... you... you\'re all right!',12,0,100,0,0,14667,0,25844,0,'thassarian SAY_THASSARIAN_4'),(26170,4,0,'I cannot return home with you just yet, Leryssa.  I am not quite done with the Scourge.',12,0,100,0,0,14668,0,25845,0,'thassarian SAY_THASSARIAN_5'),(26170,5,0,'You might be right, sister.  My obligations to my land and King have been fulfilled.  But there is something that I still owe to myself.',12,0,100,0,0,14669,0,25846,0,'thassarian SAY_THASSARIAN_6'),(26170,6,0,'Do not worry, Leryssa.  I will come back to you when I am done.  Nothing in the world will stop me from coming home to the only family that I have left.',12,0,100,0,0,14670,0,25850,0,'thassarian SAY_THASSARIAN_7'),(25250,0,0,'What... what happened to me?',12,7,100,0,0,14196,0,25841,0,'thassarian SAY_ARLOS_1'),(25250,1,0,'Ugh!  My head won\'t stop spinning...',12,7,100,0,0,14197,0,25847,0,'thassarian SAY_ARLOS_2'),(25251,0,0,'Thassarian!  You\'re alive!',14,0,100,0,0,14489,0,25842,0,'thassarian SAY_LERYSSA_1'),(25251,1,0,'I thought... I thought you were... dead.',12,0,100,0,0,14490,0,25843,0,'thassarian SAY_LERYSSA_2'),(25251,2,0,'Don\'t leave me again!  You want to fight for your country, but they don\'t even want you!  They sent you here to die!',12,0,100,0,0,14491,0,25848,0,'thassarian SAY_LERYSSA_3'),(25251,3,0,'I know that look in your eye... I\'m not going to be able to talk you out of this.  If you die on me again...',12,0,100,0,0,14492,0,25849,0,'thassarian SAY_LERYSSA_4'),(25504,2,0,'I see a break in the mist up ahead. We\'re getting closer!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24748,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,3,0,'FATHER! Father, I\'m saved!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24749,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,1,0,'I can feel my father\'s aura. He\'s definitely this way... come on, $n.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24747,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,0,0,'Thank you for doing this, $r. I... I think I know how to get back to my father. Please don\'t let the bad things hurt me.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24746,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25478,0,0,'Pathetic fool! A servant of Malygos would sooner die than aid an enemy....',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24735,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,1,0,'Aargh! Do your worst, $c! I\'ll tell you NOTHING!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24736,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,2,0,'Aahhhh! Release me! I am of no use to you. I swear it!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24737,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,3,0,'Stop! I beg you, please stop. Please....',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24738,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,4,0,'Alright! I am beaten. Your precious archmage is held in a prison, elevated and sealed. Even if you manage to reach her, Salrand herself holds the key. Your mission is folly!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24739,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,5,0,'Enough! I\'ve told you all that I know. Your continued abuse is senseless!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24740,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,6,0,'Noooo! This torture is inhumane! You have what you want... why don\'t you just kill me?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24755,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25589,0,0,'Um, hello? Is there anyone out there?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24763,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,1,0,'Right then, no time to waste. Let\'s get outa here!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24772,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25827,0,0,'Well...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25243,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_1'),(25827,1,0,'Finally!  This charade is over... Arthas give me strength!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25245,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_2'),(25827,2,0,'You don\'t know who you\'re messing with, $c!  Death beckons!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25246,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_3'),(25827,3,0,'I suppose this is it, then?  I won\'t go down quietly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25244,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_4'),(25248,0,0,'Well...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25243,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_1'),(25248,1,0,'Finally!  This charade is over... Arthas give me strength!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25245,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_2'),(25248,2,0,'You don\'t know who you\'re messing with, $c!  Death beckons!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25246,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_3'),(25248,3,0,'I suppose this is it, then?  I won\'t go down quietly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25244,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_4'),(25828,0,0,'Well...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25243,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_1'),(25828,1,0,'Finally!  This charade is over... Arthas give me strength!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25245,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_2'),(25828,2,0,'You don\'t know who you\'re messing with, $c!  Death beckons!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25246,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_3'),(25828,3,0,'I suppose this is it, then?  I won\'t go down quietly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25244,0,'hidden cultist SAY_HIDDEN_CULTIST_4'),(4832,2,0,'Dust to dust.',14,0,100,0,0,5803,0,6172,0,'lord kelriss SAY_DEATH'),(4832,1,0,'Sleep...',14,0,100,0,0,5804,0,0,0,'lord kelriss SAY_SLEEP'),(4832,0,0,'Who dares disturb my meditation?',14,0,100,0,0,5802,0,6171,0,'lord kelriss SAY_AGRRO'),(4979,0,0,'Hey, thanks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22111,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST1'),(4979,1,0,'...receive 50 percent off deserter undergarments? What is this garbage?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22555,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST2'),(4979,1,1,'...to create a fund for the purchase of hair gel? I like my hair the way it is, thanks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22562,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST2'),(4979,1,2,'...the deserters seek a Theramore where citizens will be free to juggle at all hours of the day? What is this nonsense?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22559,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST2'),(4979,1,3,'...to establish the chicken as the official symbol of Theramore?! These guys are nuts!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22561,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST2'),(4979,1,4,'...as a deserter, you\'ll enjoy activities like tethered swimming and dog grooming? How ridiculous!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22556,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST2'),(4979,2,0,'This... this is a joke, right?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22113,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST3'),(4979,2,1,'I\'d never join anything like this. Better keep this, though. It\'ll come in handy in the privy...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22116,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST3'),(4979,2,2,'What a bunch of lunatics! You actually believe this stuff?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22115,0,'theramore guard SAY_QUEST3'),(28860,0,0,'It is my charge to watch over these eggs. I will see you burn before any harm comes to them!',14,0,100,0,0,14093,0,31400,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_AGGRO'),(28860,1,0,'This pathetic siege ends NOW!',14,0,100,0,0,14103,0,31368,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_BERSERK'),(28860,2,0,'Burn, you miserable wretches!',14,0,100,0,0,14098,0,31907,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_BREATH'),(28860,3,0,'Shadron! Come to me! All is at risk!',14,0,100,0,0,14105,0,31318,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_CALL_SHADRON'),(28860,4,0,'Tenebron! The eggs are yours to protect as well!',14,0,100,0,0,14106,0,31319,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_CALL_TENEBRON'),(28860,5,0,'Vesperon, the clutch is in danger! Assist me!',14,0,100,0,0,14104,0,31320,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_CALL_VESPERON'),(28860,6,0,'Such is the price... of failure....',14,0,100,0,0,14107,0,31341,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_DEATH'),(28860,7,0,'Such flammable little insects....',14,0,100,0,0,14099,0,31363,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_SPECIAL_1'),(28860,7,1,'Your charred bones will litter the floor!',14,0,100,0,0,14100,0,31904,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_SPECIAL_2'),(28860,7,2,'How much heat can you take?',14,0,100,0,0,14101,0,31905,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_SPECIAL_3'),(28860,7,3,'All will be reduced to ash!',14,0,100,0,0,14102,0,31906,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_SPECIAL_4'),(28860,8,0,'You will make a fine meal for the hatchlings.',14,0,100,0,0,14094,0,31908,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_SLAY_1'),(28860,8,1,'You are at a grave disadvantage.',14,0,100,0,0,14096,0,31909,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_SLAY_2'),(28860,8,2,'This is why we call you lesser beings!',14,0,100,0,0,14097,0,31910,0,'sartharion SAY_SARTHARION_SLAY_3'),(28860,9,0,'The lava surrounding %s churns!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,31362,0,'sartharion WHISPER_LAVA_CHURN'),(30452,0,0,'You have no place here! Your place... is among the departed!',14,0,100,0,0,14122,0,31993,0,'tenebron SAY_TENEBRON_AGGRO'),(30452,1,0,'No contest.',14,0,100,0,0,14123,0,31994,0,'tenebron SAY_TENEBRON_SLAY_1'),(30452,1,1,'Typical. Just as I was having fun...',14,0,100,0,0,14124,0,31995,0,'tenebron SAY_TENEBRON_SLAY_2'),(30452,2,0,'I should not... have held back...',14,0,100,0,0,14129,0,32000,0,'tenebron SAY_TENEBRON_DEATH'),(30452,3,0,'To darkness I condemn you.',14,0,100,0,0,14125,0,31996,0,'tenebron SAY_TENEBRON_BREATH'),(30452,4,0,'It is amusing to watch you struggle. Very well, witness how it is done!',14,0,100,0,0,14128,0,31999,0,'tenebron SAY_TENEBRON_RESPOND'),(30452,5,0,'Arrogant little creatures, to challenge powers you do not yet understand.',14,0,100,0,0,14126,0,31997,0,'tenebron SAY_TENEBRON_SPECIAL_1'),(30452,5,1,'I am no mere dragon. You will find that I am much, much more.',14,0,100,0,0,14127,0,31998,0,'tenebron SAY_TENEBRON_SPECIAL_2'),(30451,6,0,'%s begins to open a Twilight Portal!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32554,0,'Shadron WHISPER_OPEN_PORTAL'),(30451,0,0,'I fear nothing! Least of all you!',14,0,100,0,0,14111,0,31985,0,'shadron SAY_SHADRON_AGGRO'),(30451,1,0,'You are insignificant.',14,0,100,0,0,14112,0,31986,0,'shadron SAY_SHADRON_SLAY_1'),(30451,1,1,'Such mediocre resistance...',14,0,100,0,0,14113,0,31987,0,'shadron SAY_SHADRON_SLAY_2'),(30451,2,0,'We... are superior! How could this... be?',14,0,100,0,0,14118,0,31984,0,'shadron SAY_SHADRON_DEATH'),(30451,3,0,'You are easily bested!',14,0,100,0,0,14114,0,31988,0,'shadron SAY_SHADRON_BREATH'),(30451,4,0,'I will take pity on you, Sartharion, just this once.',14,0,100,0,0,14117,0,31991,0,'shadron SAY_SHADRON_RESPOND'),(30451,5,0,'Father taught me well.',14,0,100,0,0,14115,0,31989,0,'shadron SAY_SHADRON_SPECIAL_1'),(30451,5,1,'On your knees!',14,0,100,0,0,14116,0,21749,0,'shadron SAY_SHADRON_SPECIAL_2'),(30449,6,0,'You pose no threat, lesser beings! Give me your worst!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32002,0,'Vesperon WHISPER_OPEN_PORTAL'),(30449,0,0,'You pose no threat, lesser beings! Give me your worst!',14,0,100,0,0,14133,0,32002,0,'vesperon SAY_VESPERON_AGGRO'),(30449,1,0,'The least you could do is put up a fight!',14,0,100,0,0,14134,0,32003,0,'vesperon SAY_VESPERON_SLAY_1'),(30449,1,1,'Was that the best you can do?',14,0,100,0,0,14135,0,32004,0,'vesperon SAY_VESPERON_SLAY_2'),(30449,2,0,'I still have some... fight... in me-e-e...',14,0,100,0,0,14140,0,32009,0,'vesperon SAY_VESPERON_DEATH'),(30449,3,0,'I will pick my teeth with your bones!',14,0,100,0,0,14136,0,32005,0,'vesperon SAY_VESPERON_BREATH'),(30449,4,0,'Father was right about you, Sartharion. You ARE a weakling.',14,0,100,0,0,14139,0,32008,0,'vesperon SAY_VESPERON_RESPOND'),(30449,5,0,'Aren\'t you tricky? I have a few tricks of my own...',14,0,100,0,0,14137,0,32006,0,'vesperon SAY_VESPERON_SPECIAL_1'),(30449,5,1,'Unlike you, I have many talents!',14,0,100,0,0,14138,0,32007,0,'vesperon SAY_VESPERON_SPECIAL_2'),(30449,7,0,'A Vesperon Disciple appears in the Twilight!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32960,0,'Vesperon - WHISPER_OPENED_PORTAL'),(26631,0,0,'The chill you feel is the herald of your doom!',14,0,100,0,0,13173,0,26932,0,'novos SAY_AGGRO'),(26631,1,0,'Such is the fate of all who oppose the Lich King!',14,0,100,0,0,13175,0,28035,0,'novos SAY_KILL'),(26631,2,0,'Your efforts... are in vain.',14,0,100,0,0,13174,0,28034,0,'novos SAY_DEATH'),(26631,3,0,'Bolster my defenses! Hurry, curse you!',14,0,100,0,0,13176,0,26933,0,'novos SAY_NECRO_ADD'),(26631,4,0,'Surely you can see the futility of it all!',14,0,100,0,0,13177,0,27777,0,'novos SAY_REUBBLE_1'),(26631,4,1,'Just give up and die already!',14,0,100,0,0,13178,0,30036,0,'novos SAY_REUBBLE_2'),(26632,0,0,'Tharon\'ja sees all! The work of mortals shall not end the eternal dynasty!',14,0,100,0,0,13862,0,29606,0,'tharon ja SAY_AGGRO'),(26632,1,0,'As Tharon\'ja predicted!',14,0,100,0,0,13863,0,29611,0,'tharon ja SAY_KILL_1'),(26632,1,1,'As it was written!',14,0,100,0,0,13864,0,29612,0,'tharon ja SAY_KILL_2'),(26632,2,0,'Your flesh serves Tharon\'ja now!',14,0,100,0,0,13865,0,29613,0,'tharon ja SAY_FLESH_1'),(26632,2,1,'Tharon\'ja has a use for your mortal shell!',14,0,100,0,0,13866,0,29614,0,'tharon ja SAY_FLESH_2'),(26632,3,0,'No! A taste... all too brief!',14,0,100,0,0,13867,0,29615,0,'tharon ja SAY_SKELETON_1'),(26632,3,1,'Agghh!! Tharon\'ja will have more!',14,0,100,0,0,13868,0,29616,0,'tharon ja SAY_SKELETON_2'),(26632,4,0,'Im... impossible! Tharon\'ja is eternal! Tharon\'ja... is....',14,0,100,0,0,13869,0,29617,0,'tharon ja SAY_DEATH'),(26630,0,0,'Mo\' guts! Mo\' blood! Mo\' food!',14,0,100,0,0,13181,0,30041,0,'trollgore SAY_AGGRO'),(26630,1,0,'Me gonna carve you and eat you!',14,0,100,0,0,13185,0,30042,0,'trollgore SAY_KILL'),(26630,2,0,'So hungry! Must feed!',14,0,100,0,0,13182,0,30043,0,'trollgore SAY_CONSUME'),(26630,3,0,'Corpse go boom!',14,0,100,0,0,13184,0,30044,0,'trollgore SAY_EXPLODE'),(26630,4,0,'Aaaargh...',14,0,100,0,0,13183,0,0,0,'trollgore SAY_DEATH'),(36497,0,0,'Finally, a captive audience!',14,0,100,0,0,16595,0,38486,0,'bronjham SAY_AGGRO'),(36497,1,0,'Fodder for the engine.',14,0,100,0,0,16596,0,38490,0,'bronjham SAY_SLAY_1'),(36497,1,1,'Another soul to strengthen the host!',14,0,100,0,0,16597,0,38491,0,'bronjham SAY_SLAY_2'),(36497,2,0,'The Devourer awaits...',14,0,100,0,0,16598,0,38487,0,'bronjham SAY_DEATH'),(36497,3,0,'The vortex of the harvested calls to you!',14,0,100,0,0,16599,0,38488,0,'bronjham SAY_SOUL_STORM'),(36497,4,0,'I will sever your soul from your body!',14,0,100,0,0,16600,0,38489,0,'bronjham SAY_CORRUPT_SOUL'),(36502,0,0,'You dare look upon the host of souls? I SHALL DEVOUR YOU WHOLE!',14,0,100,0,0,16884,0,38012,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_ANGER_AGGRO'),(36502,0,1,'You dare look upon the host of souls? I SHALL DEVOUR YOU WHOLE!',14,0,100,0,0,16890,0,38012,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_DESIRE_AGGRO'),(36502,1,0,'Damnation!',14,0,100,0,0,16885,0,38548,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_ANGER_SLAY_1'),(36502,1,1,'Doomed for eternity!',14,0,100,0,0,16886,0,38549,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_ANGER_SLAY_2'),(36502,2,0,'Damnation!',14,0,100,0,0,16896,0,38548,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_SORROW_SLAY_1'),(36502,2,1,'Doomed for eternity!',14,0,100,0,0,16897,0,38549,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_SORROW_SLAY_2'),(36502,3,0,'Damnation!',14,0,100,0,0,16891,0,38548,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_DESIRE_SLAY_1'),(36502,3,1,'Doomed for eternity!',14,0,100,0,0,16892,0,38549,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_DESIRE_SLAY_2'),(36502,4,0,'The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable.',14,0,100,0,0,16887,0,38547,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_ANGER_DEATH'),(36502,4,1,'The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable.',14,0,100,0,0,16898,0,38547,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_SORROW_DEATH'),(36502,4,2,'The swell of souls will not be abated! You only delay the inevitable.',14,0,100,0,0,16893,0,38547,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_DESIRE_DEATH'),(36502,5,0,'%s casts |cFFFFFF00Mirrored Soul!|r',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,37368,0,'devoureur EMOTE_MIRRORED_SOUL'),(36502,6,0,'%s begins to |cFFFF0000Unleash Souls!|r',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36659,0,'devoureur EMOTE_UNLEASH_SOUL'),(36502,7,0,'SUFFERING! ANGUISH! CHAOS! RISE AND FEED!',14,0,100,0,0,16888,0,38019,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_ANGER_UNLEASH_SOUL'),(36502,7,1,'SUFFERING! ANGUISH! CHAOS! RISE AND FEED!',14,0,100,0,0,16899,0,38019,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_SORROW_UNLEASH_SOUL'),(36502,7,2,'SUFFERING! ANGUISH! CHAOS! RISE AND FEED!',14,0,100,0,0,16894,0,38019,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_DESIRE_UNLEASH_SOUL'),(36502,8,0,'%s begins to cast Wailing Souls!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36658,0,'devoureur EMOTE_WAILING_SOUL'),(36502,9,0,'Stare into the abyss and see your end.',14,0,100,0,0,16889,0,38020,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_ANGER_WAILING_SOUL'),(36502,9,1,'Stare into the abyss and see your end.',14,0,100,0,0,16895,0,38020,0,'devoureur SAY_FACE_DESIRE_WAILING_SOUL'),(38160,0,0,'Excellent work, champions! We shall set up our base camp in these chambers. My magi will get the Scourge transport device working shortly. Step inside it when you are ready for your next mission. I will meet you on the other side.',14,0,100,0,0,16625,0,37369,0,'jaina SAY_JAINA_OUTRO'),(38161,0,0,'Excellent work, champions! We shall set up our base camp in these chambers. My magi will get the Scourge transport device working shortly. Step inside when you are ready for your next mission. I will meet you on the other side.',14,0,100,0,0,17044,0,37387,0,'sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_OUTRO'),(25208,0,0,'Together we will fight our way out of here. Are you ready?',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,24310,0,'Lurgglbr'),(25208,1,0,'Then we leave!',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,24311,0,'Lurgglbr'),(25208,2,0,'This is far enough. I can make it on my own from here.',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,24312,0,'Lurgglbr'),(25208,3,0,'Thank you for rescuing me, $r. Please tell the king that I am back.',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,24313,0,'Lurgglbr'),(37597,0,0,'Thank the Light for seeing you here safely! We have much work to do if we are to defeat the Lich King and put an end to the Scourge.',12,0,100,0,0,16617,0,37370,2,'jaina SAY_INTRO_1'),(37597,1,0,'Our allies within the Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have broken through the front gate of Icecrown and are attempting to establish a foothold within the citadel. ',12,0,100,0,0,16618,0,37371,2,'jaina SAY_INTRO_2'),(37597,2,0,'Their success hinges upon what we discover within these cursed halls. Although our mission is fraught with peril, we must persevere!',12,0,100,0,0,16619,0,37372,2,'jaina SAY_INTRO_3'),(37597,3,0,'With the attention of the Lich King drawn towards the front gate, we will be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat the Scourge once and for all.',12,0,100,0,0,16620,0,37373,2,'jaina SAY_INTRO_4'),(37597,4,0,'King Varian\'s SI:7 agents have gathered information about a private sanctum of the Lich King\'s deep within a place called the Halls of Reflection. ',12,0,100,0,0,16621,0,37374,2,'jaina SAY_INTRO_5'),(37597,5,0,'We will carve a path through this wretched place and find a way to enter the Halls of Reflection. I sense powerful magic hidden away within those halls. Magic that could be the key to destroying the Scourge!',12,0,100,0,0,16622,0,37375,2,'jaina SAY_INTRO_6'),(37597,6,0,'Your first mission is to destroy the machines of death within this malevolent engine of souls and clear a path for our soldiers. ',12,0,100,0,0,16623,0,37376,2,'jaina SAY_INTRO_7'),(37597,7,0,'Make haste, champions! I will prepare the troops to fall in behind you.',12,0,100,0,0,16624,0,37377,2,'jaina SAY_INTRO_8'),(37596,3,0,'We will cut a swath of destruction through this cursed place and find a way to enter the Halls of Reflection. If there is anything of value to be found here, it will be found in the halls.',12,0,100,0,0,17041,0,37383,2,'sylvanas SAY_INTRO_4'),(37596,1,0,'With the attention of the Lich King turned towards the front gate, we\'ll be working our way through the side in search of information that will enable us to defeat him - once and for all.',12,0,100,0,0,17039,0,37381,2,'sylvanas SAY_INTRO_2'),(37596,2,0,'Our scouts have reported that the Lich King has a private chamber, outside of the Frozen Throne, deep within a place called the Halls of Reflection. That is our target, champions. ',12,0,100,0,0,17040,0,37382,2,'sylvanas SAY_INTRO_3'),(37596,4,0,'Your first mission is to destroy the machines of death within this malevolent engine of souls and clear a path for our soldiers. ',12,0,100,0,0,17042,0,37376,2,'sylvanas SAY_INTRO_5'),(37596,5,0,'The Dark Lady watches over you. Make haste!',12,0,100,0,0,17043,0,37384,2,'sylvanas SAY_INTRO_6'),(38112,0,0,'Men, women, and children... None were spared the master\'s wrath. Your death will be no different.',14,0,100,0,0,16710,0,37931,0,'falric SAY_AGGRO'),(38112,1,0,'Sniveling maggot!',14,0,100,0,0,16711,0,37941,0,'falric SAY_SLAY_1'),(38112,1,1,'The children of Stratholme fought with more ferocity!',14,0,100,0,0,16712,0,37942,0,'falric SAY_SLAY_2'),(38112,2,0,'Marwyn, finish them...',14,0,100,0,0,16713,0,37943,0,'falric SAY_DEATH'),(38112,3,0,'Despair... so delicious...',14,0,100,0,0,16715,0,37945,0,'falric SAY_IMPENDING_DESPAIR'),(38112,4,0,'Fear... so exhilarating...',14,0,100,0,0,16716,0,37946,0,'falric SAY_DEFILING_HORROR'),(37221,3,0,'Stand back! Touch that blade and your soul will be scarred for all eternity! I must attempt to commune with the spirits locked away within Frostmourne. Give me space. Back up, please. ',14,0,100,0,0,16634,0,37594,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_4'),(37221,2,0,'Frostmourne: the blade that destroyed our kingdom...',14,0,100,0,0,16633,0,37593,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_3'),(37221,1,0,'What is that! Up ahead! Could it be? Heroes, at my side!',14,0,100,0,0,16632,0,37592,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_2'),(37221,0,0,'The chill of this place... I can feel my blood freezing.',14,0,100,0,0,16631,0,37591,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_1'),(37221,4,0,'Uther! Dear Uther! I... I\'m so sorry.',12,0,100,0,0,16635,0,37595,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_5'),(37221,5,0,'Arthas is here? Maybe I...',12,0,100,0,0,16636,0,37596,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_6'),(37221,6,0,'But Uther, if there\'s any hope of reaching Arthas. I... I must try.',12,0,100,0,0,16637,0,37597,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_7'),(37221,7,0,'Tell me how, Uther? How do I destroy my prince? My...',12,0,100,0,0,16638,0,37598,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_8'),(37221,8,0,'You\'re right, Uther. Forgive me. I... I don\'t know what got a hold of me. We will deliver this information to the King and the knights that battle the Scourge within Icecrown Citadel.',12,0,100,0,0,16639,0,37599,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_9'),(37221,9,0,'Who could bear such a burden?',12,0,100,0,0,16640,0,37600,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_10'),(37221,10,0,'Then maybe there is still hope...',12,0,100,0,0,16641,0,37601,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_11'),(37221,11,0,'You won\'t deny me this, Arthas! I must know... I must find out... ',14,0,100,0,0,16642,0,37602,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_INTRO_END'),(37226,0,0,'SILENCE, PALADIN!',14,0,100,0,0,17225,0,37613,0,'Lich King SAY_LK_INTRO_1'),(37226,1,0,'So you wish to commune with the dead? You shall have your wish.',14,0,100,0,0,17226,0,37614,0,'Lich King SAY_LK_INTRO_2'),(37226,2,0,'Falric. Marwyn. Bring their corpses to my chamber when you are through.',14,0,100,0,0,17227,0,37615,0,'Lich King SAY_LK_INTRO_3'),(38113,0,0,'Death is all that you will find here!',14,0,100,0,0,16734,0,37948,0,'marwyn SAY_AGGRO'),(38112,5,0,'As you wish, my lord.',14,0,100,0,0,16717,0,37953,0,'Falric SAY_FALRIC_INTRO_1'),(38112,6,0,'Soldiers of Lordaeron, rise to meet your master\'s call!',14,0,100,0,0,16714,0,37944,0,'Falric SAY_FALRIC_INTRO_2'),(37223,0,0,'I... I don\'t believe it! Frostmourne stands before us - unguarded - just as the gnome claimed. Come, heroes!',14,0,100,0,0,17049,0,37568,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_1'),(37223,1,0,'Standing this close to the blade that ended my life... The pain... It is renewed.',14,0,100,0,0,17050,0,37569,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_2'),(37223,2,0,'I dare not touch it. Stand back! Stand back as I attempt to commune with the blade! Perhaps our salvation lies within...',14,0,100,0,0,17051,0,37570,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_3'),(37223,3,0,'Uther... Uther the Lightbringer. How...',12,0,100,0,0,17052,0,37571,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_4'),(37223,4,0,'The Lich King is here? Then my destiny shall be fulfilled on this day! ',12,0,100,0,0,17053,0,37572,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_5'),(37223,5,0,'There must be a way...',12,0,100,0,0,17054,0,37573,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_6'),(37223,6,0,'Who could bear such a burden?',12,0,100,0,0,17055,0,37600,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_7'),(37223,7,0,'The Frozen Throne...',12,0,100,0,0,17056,0,37575,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_8'),(37223,8,0,'You will not escape me that easily, Arthas! I will have my vengeance! ',14,0,100,0,0,17057,0,37576,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_INTRO_END'),(37225,0,0,'Jaina! Could it truly be you?',14,0,100,0,0,16666,0,37603,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_1'),(37225,1,0,'Jaina, you haven\'t much time. The Lich King sees what the sword sees. He will be here shortly. ',12,0,100,0,0,16667,0,37604,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_2'),(37225,2,0,'No, girl. Arthas is not here. Arthas is merely a presence within the Lich King\'s mind. A dwindling presence...',12,0,100,0,0,16668,0,37605,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_3'),(37225,3,0,'Jaina, listen to me. You must destroy the Lich King. You cannot reason with him. He will kill you and your allies and raise you all as powerful soldiers of the Scourge.',12,0,100,0,0,16669,0,37606,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_4'),(37225,4,0,'Snap out of it, girl. You must destroy the Lich King at the place where he merged with Ner\'zhul - atop the spire, at the Frozen Throne. It is the only way.',12,0,100,0,0,16670,0,37607,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_5'),(37225,5,0,'There is... something else that you should know about the Lich King. Control over the Scourge must never be lost. Even if you were to strike down the Lich King, another would have to take his place. For without the control of its master, the Scourge would run rampant across the world - destroying all living things.',12,0,100,0,0,16671,0,37608,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_6'),(37225,6,0,'A grand sacrifice by a noble soul...',12,0,100,0,0,16672,0,37609,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_7'),(37225,7,0,'I do not know, Jaina. I suspect that the piece of Arthas that might be left inside the Lich King is all that holds the Scourge from annihilating Azeroth.',12,0,100,0,0,16673,0,37610,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_8'),(37225,8,0,'No, Jaina! ARRRRRRGHHHH... He... He is coming. You... You must...',12,0,100,0,0,16674,0,37611,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_A2_9'),(37225,9,0,'Careful, girl. I\'ve heard talk of that cursed blade saving us before. Look around you and see what has been born of Frostmourne.',12,0,100,0,0,16659,0,37583,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_H2_1'),(37225,10,0,'You haven\'t much time. The Lich King sees what the sword sees. He will be here shortly. ',12,0,100,0,0,16660,0,37584,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_H2_2'),(37225,11,0,'You cannot defeat the Lich King. Not here. You would be a fool to try. He will kill those that follow you and raise them as powerful soldiers of the Scourge. But for you, Sylvanas, his reward for you would be worse than the last.',12,0,100,0,0,16661,0,37585,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_H2_3'),(37225,12,0,'Perhaps, but know this: there must always be a Lich King. Even if you were to strike down Arthas, another would have to take his place, for without the control of the Lich King, the Scourge would wash over this world like locusts, destroying all that they touched.',12,0,100,0,0,16662,0,37586,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_H2_4'),(37225,13,0,'I do not know, Banshee Queen. I suspect that the piece of Arthas that might be left inside the Lich King is all that holds the Scourge from annihilating Azeroth.',12,0,100,0,0,16663,0,37587,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_H2_5'),(37225,14,0,'Alas, the only way to defeat the Lich King is to destroy him at the place where he was created.',12,0,100,0,0,16664,0,37588,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_H2_6'),(37225,15,0,'Aye. ARRRRRRGHHHH... He... He is coming. You... You must...',12,0,100,0,0,16665,0,37589,0,'Uther SAY_UTHER_INTRO_H2_7'),(36477,0,0,'Our work must not be interrupted! Ick, take care of them!',14,0,100,0,0,16926,0,37222,0,'Krick SAY_AGGRO'),(36477,1,0,'We could probably use these parts.',14,0,100,0,0,16927,0,37223,0,'Krick SAY_SLAY_1'),(36477,1,1,'Arms and legs are in short supply! Thanks for your contribution!',14,0,100,0,0,16928,0,37224,0,'Krick SAY_SLAY_2'),(36477,2,0,'Enough moving around! Hold still while I blow them all up!',14,0,100,0,0,16929,0,36538,0,'Krick SAY_BARRAGE_1'),(36477,3,0,'%s begins rapidly conjuring explosive mines!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36550,0,'Krick SAY_BARRAGE_2'),(36477,4,0,'Quickly! Poison them all while they\'re still close!',14,0,100,0,0,16930,0,36537,0,'Krick SAY_POISON_NOVA'),(36477,5,0,'No, that one! That one! Get that one!',14,0,100,0,0,16931,0,36536,0,'Krick SAY_CHASE_1'),(36477,5,1,'I\'ve changed my mind, go get that one instead!',14,0,100,0,0,16932,0,37225,0,'Krick SAY_CHASE_2'),(36477,5,2,'What are you attacking him for? The dangerous one is over there!',14,0,100,0,0,16933,0,37226,0,'Krick SAY_CHASE_3'),(36477,6,0,'Wait! Stop! Don\'t kill me, please! I\'ll tell you everything!',14,0,100,0,0,16934,0,36841,0,'Krick SAY_KRICK_OUTRO_1'),(36477,7,0,'What you seek is in the master\'s lair, but you must destroy Tyrannus to gain entry. Now, within the Halls of Reflection you will find Frostmourne. It... It holds the truth.',14,0,100,0,0,16935,0,36842,0,'Krick SAY_KRICK_OUTRO_3'),(36477,8,0,'I swear it is true! Please, don\'t kill me!!',14,0,100,0,0,16936,0,36843,0,'Krick SAY_KRICK_OUTRO_5'),(36477,9,0,'Urg... no!!',14,0,100,0,0,16937,0,36844,0,'Krick SAY_KRICK_OUTRO_8'),(36476,0,0,'%s begins to unleash a toxic poison cloud!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36531,0,'Ick SAY_ICK_POISON_NOVA'),(36476,1,0,'%s is chasing you. Run!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,36529,0,'Ick SAY_ICK_CHASE_1'),(36658,0,0,'Another shall take his place. You waste your time.',14,0,100,0,0,16752,0,36765,0,'Tyrannus SAY_TYRANNUS_DEATH'),(36794,1,0,'Worthless gnat! Death is all that awaits you!',14,0,100,0,0,16753,0,36852,0,'Tyrannus SAY_TYRANNUS_OUTRO_7'),(36794,2,0,'Do not think that I shall permit you entry into my master\'s sanctum so easily. Pursue me if you dare.',14,0,100,0,0,16754,0,36853,0,'Tyrannus SAY_TYRANNUS_OUTRO_9'),(36658,3,0,'Your pursuit shall be in vain, intruders, for the Lich King has placed an army of undead at my command! Behold!',14,0,100,0,0,16755,0,36708,0,'Tyrannus SAY_AMBUSH_1'),(36658,4,0,'Persistent whelps! You will not reach the entrance of my lord\'s lair! Soldiers, destroy them!',14,0,100,0,0,16756,0,36709,0,'Tyrannus SAY_AMBUSH_2'),(36658,5,0,'Rimefang, trap them within the tunnel! BURY THEM ALIVE!',14,0,100,0,0,16757,0,36714,0,'Tyrannus SAY_GAUNTLET_START'),(36658,6,0,'Alas, brave, brave adventurers, your meddling has reached its end. Do you hear the clatter of bone and steel coming up the tunnel behind you? That is the sound of your impending demise.',14,0,100,0,0,16758,0,37233,0,'Tyrannus SAY_TYRANNUS_INTRO_1'),(36658,7,0,'Ha, such an amusing gesture from the rabble. When I have finished with you, my master\'s blade will feast upon your souls. Die.',14,0,100,0,0,16759,0,37234,0,'Tyrannus SAY_TYRANNUS_INTRO_3'),(36658,8,0,'I shall not fail the Lich King. Come and meet your end!',14,0,100,0,0,16760,0,38718,0,'Tyrannus SAY_AGGRO'),(36658,9,0,'Such a shameful display. You are better off dead.',14,0,100,0,0,16761,0,38715,0,'Tyrannus SAY_SLAY_1'),(36658,9,1,'Perhaps you should have stayed... in the mountains!',14,0,100,0,0,16762,0,38716,0,'Tyrannus SAY_SLAY_2'),(36658,10,0,'Impossible.... Rimefang.... warn....',14,0,100,0,0,16763,0,38714,0,'Tyrannus SAY_DEATH'),(36658,11,0,'Rimefang, destroy this fool!',14,0,100,0,0,16764,0,36648,0,'Tyrannus SAY_MARK_RIMEFANG_1'),(36658,12,0,'The frostwyrm Rimefang gazes at $n and readies an icy attack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36649,0,'Tyrannus SAY_MARK_RIMEFANG_2'),(36658,13,0,'Power... overwhelming!',14,0,100,0,0,16765,0,38717,0,'Tyrannus SAY_DARK_MIGHT_1'),(36658,14,0,'%s roars and swells with dark might!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36628,0,'Tyrannus SAY_DARK_MIGHT_2'),(37592,0,0,'Heroes! We will hold off the undead as long as we can, even to our dying breath. Deal with the Scourgelord!',14,0,100,0,0,17150,0,37232,0,'Gorkun SAY_GORKUN_INTRO_2'),(37592,1,0,'Brave champions, we owe you our lives, our freedom.... Though it be a tiny gesture in the face of this enormous debt, I pledge that from this day forth, all will know of your deeds, and the blazing path of light you cut through the shadow of this dark citadel. ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37320,0,'Gorkun SAY_GORKUN_OUTRO_1'),(37592,2,0,'This day will stand as a testament not only to your valor, but to the fact that no foe, not even the Lich King himself, can stand when Alliance and Horde set aside their differences and---',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37321,0,'Gorkun SAY_GORKUN_OUTRO_2'),(36993,0,0,'I\'m not so naive as to believe your appeal for clemency, but I will listen.',14,0,100,0,0,16611,0,36854,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_OUTRO_2'),(36993,1,0,'Frostmourne lies unguarded? Impossible!',14,0,100,0,0,16612,0,36856,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_OUTRO_4'),(36993,2,0,'What a cruel end. Come, heroes. We must see if the gnome\'s story is true. If we can separate Arthas from Frostmourne, we might have a chance at stopping him.',14,0,100,0,0,16613,0,36855,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_OUTRO_10'),(36993,3,0,'Heroes, to me!',14,0,100,0,0,16614,0,37479,0,'Jaina SAY_JAYNA_OUTRO_3'),(36993,4,0,'The Frost Queen is gone. We must keep moving - our objective is near.',12,0,100,0,0,16615,0,37478,0,'Jaina SAY_JAYNA_OUTRO_4'),(36993,5,0,'I... I could not save them... Damn you, Arthas! DAMN YOU!',12,0,100,0,0,16616,0,37480,0,'Jaina SAY_JAYNA_OUTRO_5'),(36990,0,0,'Why should the Banshee Queen spare your miserable life?',14,0,100,0,0,17033,0,36845,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_OUTRO_2'),(36990,1,0,'Frostmourne? The Lich King is never without his blade. If you are lying to me...',14,0,100,0,0,17034,0,36846,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_OUTRO_4'),(36990,2,0,'A fitting end for a traitor. Come, we must free the slaves and see what is within the Lich King\'s chamber for ourselves.',14,0,100,0,0,17035,0,36847,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_OUTRO_10'),(36990,3,0,'Take cover behind me! Quickly!',14,0,100,0,0,17037,0,37540,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_OUTRO_3'),(36990,4,0,'I thought he\'d never shut up. At last, Sindragosa silenced that long-winded fool. To the Halls of Reflection, champions! Our objective is near... I can sense it.',12,0,100,0,0,17036,0,37541,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANAS_OUTRO_4'),(26588,0,0,'Um... I think one of those wolves is back...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25803,0,'emily SAY_WORGHAGGRO1'),(26588,1,0,'He\'s going for Mr. Floppy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25804,0,'emily SAY_WORGHAGGRO2'),(26588,2,0,'Oh, no! Look, it\'s another wolf, and it\'s a biiiiiiig one!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25806,0,'emily SAY_WORGRAGGRO3'),(26588,3,0,'He\'s gonna eat Mr. Floppy! You gotta help Mr. Floppy! You just gotta!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26892,0,'emily SAY_WORGRAGGRO4'),(26588,4,0,'There\'s a big meanie attacking Mr. Floppy! Help!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26893,0,'emily SAY_RANDOMAGGRO'),(26588,5,0,'Let\'s get out of here before more wolves find us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25805,0,'emily SAY_VICTORY1'),(26588,6,0,'Don\'t go toward the light, Mr. Floppy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25809,0,'emily SAY_VICTORY2'),(26588,7,0,'Mr. Floppy, you\'re ok! Thank you so much for saving Mr. Floppy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25810,0,'emily SAY_VICTORY3'),(26588,8,0,'I think I see the camp! We\'re almost home, Mr. Floppy! Let\'s go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26894,0,'emily SAY_VICTORY4'),(26588,9,0,'Mr. Floppy revives',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'emily TEXT_EMOTE_WP1'),(26588,10,0,'The Ravenous Worg chomps down on Mr. Floppy',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'emily TEXT_EMOTE_AGGRO'),(26588,11,0,'Are you ready, Mr. Floppy? Stay close to me and watch out for those wolves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25802,0,'emily SAY_QUEST_ACCEPT'),(26588,12,0,'Thank you for helping me to get back to the camp. Go tell Walter that I\'m safe now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26891,0,'emily SAY_QUEST_COMPLETE'),(27570,0,0,'We\'re all gonna die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26848,0,'venture co straggler SAY1'),(27570,0,1,'Gotta get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26847,0,'venture co straggler SAY2'),(27570,0,2,'No way I\'m stickin\' around!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26851,0,'venture co straggler SAY3'),(27570,0,3,'Forget this! I\'m going home!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26850,0,'venture co straggler SAY4'),(27570,0,4,'I didn\'t sign up for this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26849,0,'venture co straggler SAY5'),(27463,0,0,'Ahh.... better.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26657,0,'wounded skirmisher RANDOM_SAY_1'),(27463,0,1,'Whoa - I nearly died there. Thank you, $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26659,0,'wounded skirmisher RANDOM_SAY_2'),(27463,0,2,'Thank you, $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26656,0,'wounded skirmisher RANDOM_SAY_3'),(29305,0,0,'We fought back da Scourge. What chance joo thinkin\' JOO got?',14,0,100,0,0,14721,0,31427,0,'Moorabi - Aggro'),(29304,6,0,'As %s falls, the altar set into the floor on his balcony begins to glow faintly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31199,0,'Slad\'ran - Activate Altar'),(29304,5,0,'%s begins to cast Poison Nova!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,30757,0,'Slad\'ran - Poison Nova'),(29304,4,0,'A thousssand fangsss gonna rend your flesh!',14,0,100,0,0,14445,0,30370,0,'Slad\'ran - Summon Constrictors'),(29304,3,0,'Minionsss of the scale, heed my call!',14,0,100,0,0,14444,0,30369,0,'Slad\'ran - Summon Snakes'),(29304,0,0,'Drakkari gonna kill anybody who tressspasss on these landsss!',14,0,100,0,0,14443,0,31711,0,'Slad\'ran - Aggro'),(29304,1,0,'You not breathin\'? Good.',14,0,100,0,0,14446,0,31712,0,'Slad\'ran - Slay 1'),(29304,1,1,'Ssscared now?',14,0,100,0,0,14447,0,31713,0,'Slad\'ran - Slay 2'),(29304,1,2,'I eat you next, mon.',14,0,100,0,0,14448,0,31714,0,'Slad\'ran - Slay 3'),(29304,2,0,'I sssee now... Ssscourge wasss not... our greatessst enemy....',14,0,100,0,0,14449,0,31715,0,'Slad\'ran - Death'),(29305,3,0,'Get ready for somethin\'... much... BIGGAH!',14,0,100,0,0,14722,0,31428,0,'Moorabi - Transform'),(29305,1,1,'Who gonna stop me? You?',14,0,100,0,0,14726,0,31431,0,'Moorabi - Slay 2'),(29305,1,2,'Not so tough now!!',14,0,100,0,0,14727,0,31432,0,'Moorabi - Slay 3'),(29305,2,0,'If our gods can die... den so can we....',14,0,100,0,0,14728,0,31433,0,'Moorabi - Death'),(29305,7,0,'As %s falls, the altar set into the floor on his balcony begins to glow faintly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31199,0,'Moorabi - Activate Altar'),(29305,6,0,'%s transforms into a Mammoth!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,30388,0,'Moorabi - Transformed'),(29305,5,0,'%s begins to transform!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,30385,0,'Moorabi - Begin Transform'),(37955,12,0,'%s goes into a berserker rage!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34057,0,'blood queen lana thel EMOTE_BERSERK_RAID'),(36853,11,0,'%s goes into a berserker rage!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34057,0,'sindragosa EMOTE_BERSERK_RAID'),(15956,0,0,'Just a little taste...',14,0,100,0,0,8785,0,13000,0,'anubrekhan SAY_AGGRO1'),(15956,0,1,'There is no way out.',14,0,100,0,0,8786,0,13002,0,'anubrekhan SAY_AGGRO2'),(15956,0,2,'Yes, run! It makes the blood pump faster!',14,0,100,0,0,8787,0,13003,0,'anubrekhan SAY_AGGRO3'),(15956,1,0,'Ahh... welcome to my parlor.',14,0,100,0,0,8788,0,13004,0,'anubrekhan SAY_GREET1'),(15956,1,1,'I hear little hearts beating. Yes... beating faster now... soon the beating will stop.',14,0,100,0,0,8790,0,13006,0,'anubrekhan SAY_GREET2'),(15956,1,2,'Where to go? What to do? So many choices that all end in pain, end in death.',14,0,100,0,0,8791,0,13007,0,'anubrekhan SAY_GREET3'),(15956,1,3,'Which one shall I eat first? So difficult to choose. They all smell so delicious...',14,0,100,0,0,8792,0,13008,0,'anubrekhan SAY_GREET4'),(15956,1,4,'Closer now. Tasty morsels. I\'ve been too long without food, without blood to drink.',14,0,100,0,0,8793,0,13009,0,'anubrekhan SAY_GREET5'),(15956,2,0,'Shhh... it will all be over soon.',14,0,100,0,0,8789,0,13005,0,'anubrekhan SAY_SLAY'),(15953,0,0,'Your old lives, your mortal desires mean nothing... you are acolytes of the master now, and you will serve the cause without question! The greatest glory is to die in the master\'s service!',14,0,100,0,0,8799,0,12852,0,'faerlina SAY_GREET'),(15953,1,0,'Slay them in the master\'s name!',14,0,100,0,0,8794,0,12856,0,'faerlina SAY_AGGRO1'),(15953,1,1,'You cannot hide from me!',14,0,100,0,0,8795,0,12857,0,'faerlina SAY_AGGRO2'),(15953,1,2,'Kneel before me, worm!',14,0,100,0,0,8796,0,12858,0,'faerlina SAY_AGGRO3'),(15953,1,3,'Run while you still can!',14,0,100,0,0,8797,0,12859,0,'faerlina SAY_AGGRO4'),(15953,2,0,'You have failed!',14,0,16,0,0,8800,0,12854,0,'faerlina SAY_SLAY1'),(15953,2,1,'Pathetic wretch!',14,0,16,0,0,8801,0,12855,0,'faerlina SAY_SLAY2'),(15953,3,0,'The master will avenge me!!',14,0,100,0,0,8798,0,12853,0,'faerlina SAY_DEATH'),(16064,0,0,'C\'mon an\' fight ye wee ninny!',14,0,100,0,0,8899,0,13034,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_AGGRO'),(16064,5,0,'To arms, ye roustabouts! We\'ve got company!',14,0,100,0,0,8903,0,13038,3,'korthazz SAY_KORT_TAUNT1'),(16064,6,0,'I\'ve heard about enough a\' yer snivelin\'! Shut yer flytrap before I shut it for ye\'!',14,0,100,0,0,8904,0,13039,3,'korthazz SAY_KORT_TAUNT2'),(16064,1,2,'I\'m gonna\' enjoy killin\' these slack-jawed daffodils!',14,0,100,0,0,8905,0,13040,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_TAUNT3'),(16064,2,0,'I like my meat extra crispy!',14,0,100,0,0,8902,0,13037,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_SPECIAl'),(16064,3,0,'Next time, bring more friends!',14,0,30,0,0,8901,0,13036,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_SLAY'),(16064,4,0,'What a bloody waste this is!',14,0,100,0,0,8900,0,13035,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_DEATH'),(16065,0,0,'Defend yourself!',14,0,100,0,0,8892,0,13010,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_AGGRO'),(16065,5,0,'Come, Zeliek, do not drive them out. Not before we\'ve had our fun!',14,0,100,0,0,8896,0,13014,3,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_TAUNT1'),(16065,6,0,'I do hope they stay alive long enough for me to... introduce myself.',14,0,100,0,0,8897,0,13015,3,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_TAUNT2'),(16065,1,2,'The first kill goes to me! Anyone care to wager?',14,0,100,0,0,8898,0,13016,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_TAUNT3'),(16065,2,0,'Your life is mine!',14,0,100,0,0,8895,0,13013,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_SPECIAL'),(16065,3,0,'Who\'s next?',14,0,30,0,0,8894,0,13012,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_SLAY'),(16065,4,0,'Touche...',14,0,100,0,0,8893,0,13011,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_DEATH'),(30549,0,0,'You seek death?',14,0,100,0,0,14571,0,13051,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_AGGRO1'),(30549,0,1,'None shall pass!',14,0,100,0,0,14572,0,13052,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_AGGRO2'),(30549,0,2,'Be still!',14,0,100,0,0,14573,0,13053,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_AGGRO3'),(30549,5,0,'Enough prattling. Let them come. We shall grind their bones to dust.',14,0,100,0,0,14577,0,13058,3,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_TAUNT1'),(30549,6,0,'Conserve your anger. Harness your rage. You will all have outlets for your frustrations soon enough.',14,0,100,0,0,14578,0,13059,3,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_TAUNT2'),(30549,1,2,'Life is meaningless. It is in death that we are truly tested.',14,0,100,0,0,14579,0,13060,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_TAUNT3'),(30549,2,0,'Bow to the might of the Scourge!',14,0,100,0,0,14576,0,13057,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_SPECIAL'),(30549,3,0,'You will find no peace in death.',14,0,30,0,0,14574,0,13055,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_SLAY1'),(30549,3,1,'The master\'s will is done.',14,0,30,0,0,14575,0,13056,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_SLAY2'),(30549,4,0,'Death... will not stop me.',14,0,100,0,0,14580,0,33116,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_DEATH'),(16063,0,0,'Flee, before it\'s too late!',14,0,100,0,0,8913,0,13097,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_AGGRO'),(16063,5,0,'Invaders, cease this foolish venture at once! Turn away while you still can!',14,0,100,0,0,8917,0,13101,3,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_TAUNT1'),(16063,6,0,'Perhaps they will come to their senses... and run away as fast as they can.',14,0,100,0,0,8918,0,13102,3,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_TAUNT2'),(16063,1,2,'Do not continue! Turn back while there\'s still time!',14,0,100,0,0,8919,0,13103,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_TAUNT3'),(16063,2,0,'I have no choice but to obey!',14,0,100,0,0,8916,0,13100,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_SPECIAL'),(16063,3,0,'Forgive me!',14,0,30,0,0,8915,0,13099,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_SLAY'),(16063,4,0,'It is... as it should be. ',14,0,100,0,0,8914,0,13098,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_DEATH'),(16060,2,0,'You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13032,3,'Gothik SAY_INTRO_3'),(16060,3,0,'Now there is only one way out- to walk the lonely path of the damned.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13033,3,'Gothik SAY_INTRO_4'),