00,25,0,0,0,28862,0,'engineer helice SAY_WP_5'),(28787,3,0,'It\'s getting a little hot over here. Shall we move on?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,28860,0,'engineer helice SAY_WP_4'),(28787,2,1,'Or THIS is what you get.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28859,0,'engineer helice SAY_WP_3'),(28787,1,1,'Listen up, Venture Company goons! Rule #1: Never keep the prisoner near the explosives.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,28857,0,'engineer helice SAY_WP_2'),(28787,0,1,'Let\'s get the hell out of here.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28856,0,'engineer helice SAY_WP_1'),(28604,0,0,'Ouch! Watch where you\'re tugging!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28592,0,'adventurous dwarf SAY_DWARF_OUCH'),(28604,1,0,'Glad I could help!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,28593,0,'adventurous dwarf SAY_DWARF_HELP'),(30154,0,0,'I\'m not afraid of anything -- bring it on!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30807,0,'agnetta SAY_AGGRO'),(29434,0,0,'Let me know when you\'re ready. I\'d prefer sooner than later... what with the slowly dying from poison and all.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30645,0,'injured goblin SAY_QUEST_START'),(29434,1,0,'I\'m going to bring the venom sac to Ricket... and then... you know... collapse. Thank you for helping me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30646,0,'injured goblin SAY_END_WP_REACHED'),(28070,7,0,'What in the name o\' Madoran did THAT do? Oh! Wait: I just about got it...',14,0,100,0,0,14276,0,27590,0,'brann SAY_SPAWN_OOZE'),(27977,3,0,'Break.... you....',14,0,100,0,0,14178,0,29559,0,'krystallus SAY_SHATTER'),(28070,9,0,'Take a moment and relish this with me. Soon... all will be revealed. Okay then, let\'s do this!',14,0,100,0,0,14247,0,30523,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_INTRO_1'),(27975,1,1,'You had it coming!',14,0,100,0,0,13489,0,29566,0,'maiden of grief SAY_SLAY_2'),(27975,1,2,'My burden grows heavier...',14,0,100,0,0,13490,0,29567,0,'maiden of grief SAY_SLAY_3'),(27975,1,3,'This is your fault!',14,0,100,0,0,13491,0,29568,0,'maiden of grief SAY_SLAY_4'),(28070,8,0,'Ha, that did it! Help\'s a-comin\'! Take this, ya glowin\' iron brute!',14,0,100,0,0,14277,0,27591,0,'brann SAY_SPAWN_EARTHEN'),(27975,3,0,'So much lost time... that you\'ll never get back!',14,0,100,0,0,13492,0,29570,0,'maiden of grief SAY_STUN'),(28070,6,0,'This is a wee bit trickier than before... Oh, bloody--incomin\'!',14,0,100,0,0,14275,0,27589,0,'brann SAY_SPAWN_TROGG'),(28070,5,0,'Don\'t worry! Ol\' Brann\'s got yer back! Keep that metal monstrosity busy, and I\'ll see if I can\'t sweet talk this machine into helping ye!',14,0,100,0,0,14274,0,31555,0,'brann SAY_SPAWN_DWARF'),(27978,1,1,'Armies of iron will smother the world!',14,0,100,0,0,14183,0,29585,0,'Sjonnir SAY_SLAY_2'),(27978,1,2,'Folvynn buul hrom onn!',14,0,100,0,0,14181,0,29583,0,'Sjonnir SAY_SLAY_3'),(28070,4,0,'Time to get some answers! Let\'s get this show on the road!',14,0,100,0,0,14259,0,30561,0,'brann SAY_ESCORT_START'),(28070,0,1,'Press on; that\'s the way!',14,0,100,0,0,14245,0,30526,0,'brann SAY_KILL_2'),(28070,0,2,'Keep it up now. Plenty of death-dealing for everyone!',14,0,100,0,0,14246,0,0,0,'brann SAY_KILL_3'),(28070,3,0,'I\'m doin\' everything I can!',14,0,100,0,0,14260,0,30562,0,'brann SAY_PLAYER_DEATH_1'),(28070,3,1,'Light preserve ye!',14,0,100,0,0,14261,0,30563,0,'brann SAY_PLAYER_DEATH_2'),(28070,3,2,'I hope this is all worth it!',14,0,100,0,0,14262,0,30564,0,'brann SAY_PLAYER_DEATH_3'),(28070,2,0,'Not yet... not ye--',14,0,100,0,0,14258,0,30522,0,'brann SAY_DEATH'),(28070,0,0,'Now that\'s earnin\' your supper!',14,0,100,0,0,14244,0,30525,0,'brann SAY_KILL_1'),(28070,1,0,'I\'m all kinds of busted up... might not... make it.',14,0,100,0,0,14257,0,28121,0,'brann SAY_LOW_HEALTH'),(27978,1,0,'Flesh is no match for iron!',14,0,100,0,0,14182,0,29584,0,'Sjonnir SAY_SLAY_1'),(27978,2,0,'Loken will not rest... until the forge is retaken! You change... nothing!',14,0,100,0,0,14184,0,29586,0,'Sjonnir SAY_DEATH'),(27977,2,0,'Uuuuhhhhhhhhhh......',14,0,100,0,0,14179,0,29560,0,'krystallus SAY_DEATH'),(27978,0,0,'Soft, vulnerable shells. Brief fragile lives. You cannot escape the curse of flesh!',14,0,100,0,0,14180,0,29582,0,'Sjonnir SAY_AGGRO'),(27977,1,0,'Ha.... ha... hah....',14,0,100,0,0,14177,0,29558,0,'krystallus SAY_KILL'),(27977,0,0,'Crush....',14,0,100,0,0,14176,0,29556,0,'krystallus SAY_AGGRO'),(27975,2,0,'I hope you all rot! I never... wanted... this.',14,0,100,0,0,13493,0,29574,0,'maiden of grief SAY_DEATH'),(27975,1,0,'Why must it be this way?',14,0,100,0,0,13488,0,29564,0,'maiden of grief SAY_SLAY_1'),(27975,0,0,'You shouldn\'t have come... now you will die!',14,0,100,0,0,13487,0,29563,0,'maiden of grief SAY_AGGRO'),(19710,4,0,'%s raises his hammer menacingly...',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,20710,0,'ironhand EMOTE_HAMMER'),(19710,3,0,'My calculations did not...',14,0,100,0,0,11114,0,20030,0,'ironhand SAY_DEATH_1'),(19710,2,0,'A foregone conclusion.',14,0,100,0,0,11110,0,20031,0,'ironhand SAY_SLAY_1'),(19710,1,0,'With the precise angle and velocity...',14,0,100,0,0,11112,0,18662,0,'ironhand SAY_HAMMER_1'),(28070,20,0,'Tell me how the dwarves came to be, and start at the beginning!',14,0,100,0,0,14264,0,30566,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_02'),(28070,21,0,'Right, right... I know the earthen were made from stone to shape the deep regions o\' the world. But what about the anomalies? Matrix non-stabilizin\' and what-not?',14,0,100,0,0,14265,0,30567,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_04'),(28070,22,0,'Necrowhatinthe-- Speak bloody Common, will ye?',14,0,100,0,0,14266,0,30568,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_06'),(28070,23,0,'Old Gods, huh? So they zapped the earthen with this Curse of Flesh... and then what?',14,0,100,0,0,14267,0,30577,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_08'),(28070,24,0,'If they killed the Old Gods, Azeroth would\'ve been destroyed...',14,0,100,0,0,14268,0,30578,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_10'),(28070,25,0,'What protectors?',14,0,100,0,0,14269,0,30579,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_12'),(28070,26,0,'Aesir and Vanir... Okay, so the Forge o\' Wills started makin\' new earthen... but what happened to the old ones?',14,0,100,0,0,14270,0,30580,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_14'),(28070,27,0,'Hold everything! The Aesir and Vanir went to war? Why?',14,0,100,0,0,14271,0,30581,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_16'),(28070,28,0,'This \"Loken\" sounds like a nasty character. Glad we don\'t have to worry about the likes o\' him anymore. So... if I\'m understandin\' ye right, the original earthen eventually woke up from this stasis, and by that time the destabili-whatever had turned \'em into proper dwarves. Or at least... dwarf ancestors.',14,0,100,0,0,14272,0,30582,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_18'),(28070,29,0,'Well, now... that\'s a lot to digest. I\'m gonna need some time to take all this in. Thank ye.',14,0,100,0,0,14273,0,30583,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_20'),(28070,30,0,'Loken?! That\'s downright bothersome... We might\'ve neutralized the iron dwarves, but I\'d lay odds there\'s another machine somewhere else churnin\' out a whole mess o\' these iron vrykul!',14,0,100,0,0,14278,0,28591,0,'brann SAY_VICTORY_SJONNIR_1'),(28070,31,0,'I\'ll use the forge to make batches o\' earthen to stand guard... But our greatest challenge still remains: find and stop Loken!',14,0,100,0,0,14279,0,30584,0,'brann SAY_VICTORY_SJONNIR_2'),(28070,32,0,'I think it\'s time to see what\'s behind the door near the entrance. I\'m going to sneak over there, nice and quiet. Meet me at the door and I\'ll get us in.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31660,0,'brann SAY_ENTRANCE_MEET'),(19220,1,0,'I\'m looking for a team player...',14,0,100,0,0,11197,0,18716,0,'pathaleon SAY_DOMINATION_1'),(30897,1,0,'Additional background is relevant to your query: following global combat between Aesir and Vanir--',14,0,100,0,0,13762,0,30606,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_15_MARN'),(30897,2,0,'Unknown. Data suggests that impetus for global combat originated with prime designate Loken, who neutralized all remaining Aesir and Vanir, affecting termination of conflict. Prime designate Loken then initiated stasis of several seed races, including earthen, giants and vrykul, at designated holding facilities.',14,0,100,0,0,13763,0,30607,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_17_MARN'),(30897,3,0,'Essentially that is correct.',14,0,100,0,0,13764,0,30608,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_19_MARN'),(19220,0,0,'We are on a strict timetable. You will not interfere!',14,0,100,0,0,11193,0,20041,0,'pathaleon SAY_AGGRO'),(30898,1,0,'Accessing... Creators arrived to extirpate symbiotic infection. Assessment revealed that Old God infestation had grown malignant. Excising parasites would result in loss of host--',14,0,100,0,0,13757,0,30603,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_09_KADD'),(30898,2,0,'Correct. Creators neutralized parasitic threat and contained it within the host. Forge of Wills and other systems were instituted to create new earthen. Safeguards were implemented, and protectors were appointed.',14,0,100,0,0,13758,0,30604,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_11_KADD'),(30898,3,0,'Designations: Aesir and Vanir. Or in the common nomenclature, storm and earth giants. Sentinel Loken designated supreme. Dragon Aspects appointed to monitor evolution on Azeroth.',14,0,100,0,0,13759,0,30605,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_13_KADD'),(19219,3,0,'Can\'t say I didn\'t warn you....',14,0,100,0,0,11163,0,19953,0,'Mechano-Lord Capacitus - Killing a player'),(19219,4,0,'Bully!',14,0,100,0,0,11167,0,19957,0,'Mechano-Lord Capacitus - Death'),(19219,2,0,'Think you can hurt me, huh?  Think I\'m afraid a\' you?',14,0,100,0,0,11165,0,19955,0,'Mechano-Lord Capacitus - Yells'),(19219,1,0,'Go ahead, gimme your best shot.  I can take it!',14,0,100,0,0,11166,0,19956,0,'Mechano-Lord Capacitus - Yells'),(19219,0,0,'You should split while you can.',14,0,100,0,0,11162,0,19952,0,'Mechano-Lord Capacitus - Aggro'),(19218,2,0,'Measure twice; cut once.',14,0,100,0,0,11104,0,20037,0,'Gatewatcher Gyro-Kill - Sawblades'),(19218,3,0,'An unforeseen... contingency.',14,0,100,0,0,11106,0,20039,0,'Gatewatcher Gyro-Kill - On Death'),(30899,5,0,'Accessing... In the early stages of it\'s development cycle, Azeroth suffered infection by parasitic necrophotic symbiotes.',14,0,100,0,0,13771,0,30612,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_05_ABED'),(30899,6,0,'Designation: Old Gods. Old Gods rendered all systems, including earthen, defenseless in order to facilitate assimilation. This matrix destabilization has been termed \"the Curse of Flesh\". Effects of destabilization increased over time.',14,0,100,0,0,13772,0,30613,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_07_ABED'),(30899,7,0,'Acknowledged, Branbronzan. Session terminated.',14,0,100,0,0,13773,0,30614,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_21_ABED'),(29305,4,0,'Da ground gonna swallow you up!',14,0,100,0,0,14723,0,31429,0,'Moorabi - Quake'),(27655,3,0,'Poor blind fools!',14,0,100,0,0,13638,0,27412,0,'Mage-Lord Urom - SAY_AGGRO'),(27655,4,0,'%s begins to cast Empowered Arcane Explosion!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,27903,0,'Mage-Lord Urom - EMOTE_ARCANE_EXPLOSION'),(27655,5,0,'A taste... just a small taste... of the Spell-Weaver\'s power!',14,0,100,0,0,13639,0,31829,0,'Mage-Lord Urom - SAY_ARCANE_EXPLOSION'),(27655,5,1,'So much unstable energy... but worth the risk to destroy you!',14,0,100,0,0,13640,0,31830,0,'Mage-Lord Urom - SAY_ARCANE_EXPLOSION'),(27655,6,0,'Everything I have done... has been for Azeroth....',14,0,100,0,0,13644,0,31834,0,'Mage-Lord Urom - SAY_DEATH'),(27655,7,0,'If only you understood!',14,0,100,0,0,13641,0,31831,0,'Mage-Lord Urom - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(27655,7,1,'Now do you see? Do you?!',14,0,100,0,0,13642,0,31832,0,'Mage-Lord Urom - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(27655,7,2,'Unfortunate, but necessary.',14,0,100,0,0,13643,0,31833,0,'Mage-Lord Urom - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(30452,6,0,'Tenebron begins to hatch eggs in the Twilight!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32959,0,'Tenebron WHISPER_OPEN_PORTAL'),(30452,7,0,'Tenebron begins to hatch eggs in the Twilight!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32959,0,'Tenebron WHISPER_OPENED_PORTAL'),(15990,0,0,'Your forces are nearly marshaled to strike back against your enemies, my liege.',14,0,100,0,0,14467,0,12990,3,'kelthuzad SAY_SAPP_DIALOG1'),(15990,1,0,'It is good that you serve me so faithfully. Soon, all will serve the Lich King and in the end, you shall be rewarded...so long as you do not falter.',14,0,100,0,0,8881,0,0,0,'kelthuzad SAY_SAPP_DIALOG2_LICH'),(15990,2,0,'Yes, master. The time of their ultimate demise draws close.... What is this?',14,0,100,0,0,14468,0,12991,3,'kelthuzad SAY_SAPP_DIALOG3'),(15990,3,0,'Your security measures have failed! See to this interruption immediately!',14,0,100,0,0,8882,0,0,0,'kelthuzad SAY_SAPP_DIALOG4_LICH'),(15990,4,0,'As you command, master!',14,0,100,0,0,14469,0,12992,3,'kelthuzad SAY_SAPP_DIALOG5'),(15990,5,0,'No!!! A curse upon you, interlopers! The armies of the Lich King will hunt you down. You will not escape your fate...',14,0,100,0,0,14484,0,13150,3,'kelthuzad SAY_CAT_DIED'),(15990,16,0,'Who dares violate the sanctity of my domain? Be warned, all who trespass here are doomed.',14,0,100,0,0,14463,0,0,3,'kelthuzad SAY_TAUNT1'),(15990,17,0,'Fools! You think yourselves triumphant? You have only taken one step closer to the abyss!',14,0,100,0,0,14464,0,12985,3,'kelthuzad SAY_TAUNT2'),(15990,18,0,'I grow tired of these games. Proceed, and I will banish your souls to oblivion!',14,0,100,0,0,14465,0,12986,3,'kelthuzad SAY_TAUNT3'),(15990,19,0,'You have no idea what horrors lie ahead. You have seen nothing! The frozen heart of Naxxramas awaits you!',14,0,100,0,0,14466,0,27382,3,'kelthuzad SAY_TAUNT4'),(15990,7,0,'Pray for mercy!',14,0,100,0,0,14475,0,12995,0,'kelthuzad SAY_AGGRO1'),(15990,7,1,'Scream your dying breath!',14,0,100,0,0,14476,0,12996,0,'kelthuzad SAY_AGGRO2'),(15990,7,2,'The end is upon you!',14,0,100,0,0,14477,0,12997,0,'kelthuzad SAY_AGGRO3'),(15990,8,0,'The dark void awaits you!',14,0,100,0,0,14478,0,13021,0,'kelthuzad SAY_SLAY1'),(15990,8,1,'%s cackles maniacally.',16,0,100,0,0,14479,0,13022,0,'kelthuzad SAY_SLAY2'),(15990,9,0,'Agghhhh! Do... not... rejoice! Your victory is a hollow one, for I shall return with powers beyond your imagining!',14,0,100,0,0,14480,0,13019,0,'kelthuzad SAY_DEATH'),(15990,10,0,'Your soul is bound to me, now!',14,0,100,0,0,14472,0,13017,0,'kelthuzad SAY_CHAIN1'),(15990,10,1,'There will be no esca