tle....',14,0,100,0,0,10332,0,17503,0,'gargolmar SAY_AGGRO_2'),(17306,3,2,'I\'m going to enjoy this...',14,0,100,0,0,10333,0,17504,0,'gargolmar SAY_AGGRO_3'),(17306,4,0,'Say farewell!',14,0,100,0,0,10334,0,17500,0,'gargolmar SAY_KILL_1'),(17306,4,1,'Much too easy.',14,0,100,0,0,10335,0,17501,0,'gargolmar SAY_KILL_2'),(3584,2,0,'%s hides among the bushes.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,1186,0,'Therylune'),(16807,0,0,'You wish to fight us all at once? This should be amusing!\n',14,0,100,0,0,10262,0,15594,0,'nethekurse SAY_INTRO'),(16807,1,0,'You can have that one, I no longer need him!',14,0,100,0,0,10263,0,15569,0,'nethekurse PEON_ATTACK_1'),(16807,1,1,'Yes, beat him mercilessly! His skull is as thick as an ogre\'s!\n',14,0,100,0,0,10264,0,15575,0,'nethekurse PEON_ATTACK_2'),(16807,1,2,'Don\'t waste your time on that one, he\'s weak!',14,0,100,0,0,10265,0,15573,0,'nethekurse PEON_ATTACK_3'),(16807,1,3,'You want him? Very well, take him!',14,0,100,0,0,10266,0,15572,0,'nethekurse PEON_ATTACK_4'),(16807,2,0,'One pitiful wretch down. Go on, take another one! ',14,0,100,0,0,10267,0,15579,0,'nethekurse PEON_DIE_1'),(16807,2,1,'Ah, what a waste... next!',14,0,100,0,0,10268,0,15584,0,'nethekurse PEON_DIE_2'),(16807,2,2,'I was going to kill him anyway!',14,0,100,0,0,10269,0,15582,0,'nethekurse PEON_DIE_3'),(16807,2,3,'Thank you for saving me the trouble. Now it\'s my turn to have some fun!\n',14,0,100,0,0,10270,0,15589,0,'nethekurse PEON_DIE_4'),(16807,3,0,'Beg for your pitiful life!',14,0,100,0,0,10259,0,14130,0,'nethekurse SAY_TAUNT_1'),(16807,3,1,'Run, coward, run!   ',14,0,100,0,0,10260,0,14132,0,'nethekurse SAY_TAUNT_2'),(16807,3,2,'Your pain amuses me!',14,0,100,0,0,10261,0,14148,0,'nethekurse SAY_TAUNT_3'),(16807,4,0,'I\'m already bored!',14,0,100,0,0,10271,0,16864,0,'nethekurse SAY_AGGRO_1'),(16807,4,1,'Come on, show me a real fight!',14,0,100,0,0,10272,0,15595,0,'nethekurse SAY_AGGRO_2'),(16807,4,2,'I had more fun torturing the peons!',14,0,100,0,0,10273,0,16863,0,'nethekurse SAY_AGGRO_3'),(16807,5,0,'You lose.',14,0,100,0,0,10274,0,16865,0,'nethekurse SAY_SLAY_1'),(16807,5,1,'Oh, just die!',14,0,100,0,0,10275,0,16866,0,'nethekurse SAY_SLAY_2'),(16807,6,0,'What... a shame.',14,0,100,0,0,10276,0,16862,0,'nethekurse SAY_DIE'),(19523,0,0,'Smash!',14,0,100,0,0,10306,0,30471,0,'omrogg GoCombat_1'),(19523,1,0,'If you nice me let you live.',14,0,100,0,0,10308,0,14048,0,'omrogg GoCombat_2'),(19523,2,0,'Me hungry!',14,0,100,0,0,10309,0,35064,0,'omrogg GoCombat_3'),(19524,0,0,'Why don\'t you let me do the talking?',14,0,100,0,0,10317,0,14047,0,'omrogg GoCombatDelay_1'),(19524,1,0,'No, we will NOT let you live.',14,0,100,0,0,10318,0,16916,0,'omrogg GoCombatDelay_2'),(19524,2,0,'You\'re always hungry.  That\'s why we so fat!',14,0,100,0,0,10319,0,16919,0,'omrogg GoCombatDelay_3'),(19523,3,0,'You stay here.  Me go kill someone else!',14,0,100,0,0,10303,0,16898,0,'omrogg Threat_1'),(19524,3,0,'What are you doing?',14,0,100,0,0,10315,0,16901,0,'omrogg Threat_2'),(19523,4,0,'We kill someone else!',14,0,100,0,0,10302,0,16895,0,'omrogg Threat_3'),(19523,5,0,'Me not like this one...',14,0,100,0,0,10300,0,14043,0,'omrogg Threat_4'),(19524,4,0,'That\'s not funny!',14,0,100,0,0,10314,0,16899,0,'omrogg ThreatDelay1_1'),(19523,6,0,'Me get bored.',14,0,100,0,0,10305,0,16902,0,'omrogg ThreatDelay1_2'),(19524,5,0,'I\'m not done yet, idiot!',14,0,100,0,0,10313,0,16896,0,'omrogg ThreatDelay1_3'),(19524,6,0,'Hey, you numbskull!',14,0,100,0,0,10312,0,14044,0,'omrogg ThreatDelay1_4'),(19523,7,0,'Ha ha ha.',14,0,100,0,0,10304,0,16900,0,'omrogg ThreatDelay2_1'),(19524,7,0,'Bored? He was almost dead!',14,0,100,0,0,10316,0,16903,0,'omrogg ThreatDelay2_2'),(19523,8,0,'Hey!',14,0,100,0,0,10307,0,16917,0,'omrogg ThreatDelay2_3'),(19523,9,0,'We kill his friend!',14,0,100,0,0,10301,0,14045,0,'omrogg ThreatDelay2_4'),(19523,10,0,'This one die easy!',14,0,100,0,0,10310,0,16922,0,'omrogg Killing_1'),(19524,8,0,'I\'m tired.  You kill next one!',14,0,100,0,0,10320,0,16921,0,'omrogg Killing_2'),(19524,9,0,'That\'s because I do all the hard work!',14,0,100,0,0,10321,0,16923,0,'omrogg KillingDelay_1'),(19523,11,0,'That\'s because I do all the hard work!',14,0,100,0,0,10321,0,16923,0,'omrogg KillingDelay_2'),(16809,0,0,'This all... your fault!',14,0,100,0,0,10311,0,16924,0,'omrogg YELL_DIE_L'),(16809,1,0,'I... hate... you.',14,0,100,0,0,10322,0,16925,0,'omrogg YELL_DIE_R'),(16809,2,0,'%s enrages',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'omrogg EMOTE_ENRAGE'),(16808,0,0,'Ours is the TRUE Horde! The only Horde!',14,0,100,0,0,10323,0,17614,0,'kargath SAY_AGGRO1'),(16808,0,1,'I\'ll carve the meat from your bones!',14,0,100,0,0,10324,0,17616,0,'kargath SAY_AGGRO2'),(16808,0,2,'I am called Bladefist for a reason. As you will see.',14,0,100,0,0,10325,0,17617,0,'kargath SAY_AGGRO3'),(16808,1,0,'For the real Horde!',14,0,100,0,0,10326,0,17619,0,'kargath SAY_SLAY1'),(16808,1,1,'I am the ONLY warchief!',14,0,100,0,0,10327,0,17620,0,'kargath SAY_SLAY2'),(16808,2,0,'The true Horde... will prevail.',14,0,100,0,0,10328,0,17621,0,'kargath SAY_DEATH'),(17085,0,0,'Avruu\'s magic... it still controls me.  You must fight me, mortal.  It\'s the only way to break the spell!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13448,0,'Aeranas'),(17085,1,0,'Avruu\'s magic is broken!  I\'m free once again!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13447,0,'Aeranas'),(17077,0,0,'%s lifts its head into the air, as if listening for something.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13430,0,'Ancestral Spirit Wolf'),(17077,1,0,'%s lets out a howl that rings across the mountains to the north and motions for you to follow.',16,0,100,0,0,9036,0,13446,0,'Ancestral Spirit Wolf'),(17023,0,0,'Gul\'dan speaks the truth! We should return at once to tell our brothers of the news! Retreat back through the portal!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19911,0,'ancestral wolf SAY_WOLF_WELCOME'),(16993,0,0,'Thank you for agreeing to help. Now, let\'s get out of here, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13289,0,'Wounded Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(16993,1,0,'Over there! They\'re following us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13255,0,'Wounded Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(16993,2,0,'Allow me a moment to rest. The journey taxes what little strength I have.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13290,0,'Wounded Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(16993,3,0,'Do you hear something?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13389,0,'Wounded Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(16993,4,0,'Falcon Watch, at last! Now, where\'s my... Oh no! My pack, it\'s missing! Where has - ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13292,0,'Wounded Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(16993,5,0,'You won\'t keep me from getting to Falcon Watch!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13659,0,'Wounded Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(18210,4,0,'It is best that we split up now, in case they send more after us. Hopefully one of us will make it back to Garrosh. Farewell, stranger.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,15001,0,'maghar captive SAY_MAG_COMPLETE'),(18445,0,0,'Thanks, $n! How many times have you saved my life now? Three? That makes us blood in my book!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15424,0,'corki NPC_CORKI'),(20812,0,0,'This is the last time I get caught! I promise! Bye!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,15308,0,'Corki'),(18369,0,0,'Thanks, $r! I\'m sure my dad will reward you greatly! Bye!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15297,0,'corki NPC_CORKI_3'),(20209,0,0,'Warning!  %s emergency shutdown process initiated by $n.  Shutdown will complete in two minutes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18155,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_START'),(20209,1,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in one minute.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18156,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_60'),(20209,2,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in thirty seconds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17884,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_30'),(20209,3,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in ten seconds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17885,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_10'),(20209,4,0,'Emergency shutdown complete.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17900,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_COMPLETE'),(20417,0,0,'Warning!  %s emergency shutdown process initiated by $n.  Shutdown will complete in two minutes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18155,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_START'),(20417,1,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in one minute.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18156,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_60'),(20417,2,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in thirty seconds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17884,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_30'),(20417,3,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in ten seconds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17885,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_10'),(20417,4,0,'Emergency shutdown complete.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17900,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_COMPLETE'),(20417,5,0,'Manaforge shutdown aborted.  Resuming manaforge activity.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17886,0,'manaforge_control fail'),(20418,0,0,'Warning!  %s emergency shutdown process initiated by $n.  Shutdown will complete in two minutes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18155,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_START'),(20418,1,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in one minute.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18156,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_60'),(20418,2,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in thirty seconds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17884,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_30'),(20418,3,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in ten seconds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17885,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_10'),(20418,4,0,'Emergency shutdown complete.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17900,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_COMPLETE'),(20440,0,0,'Warning!  %s emergency shutdown process initiated by $n.  Shutdown will complete in two minutes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18155,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_START'),(20440,1,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in one minute.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18156,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_60'),(20440,2,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in thirty seconds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17884,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_30'),(20440,3,0,'Emergency shutdown will complete in ten seconds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17885,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_10'),(20440,4,0,'Emergency shutdown complete.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17900,0,'manaforge_control EMOTE_COMPLETE'),(20209,5,0,'Manaforge shutdown aborted.  Resuming manaforge activity.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17886,0,'manaforge_control fail'),(19830,0,0,'You cannot be serious!  We are severely understaffed and can barely keep this manaforge functional!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,18166,0,'dawnforge SAY_ARCANIST_ARDONIS_1'),(19830,1,0,'Yes, my lord.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19189,0,'dawnforge SAY_ARCANIST_ARDONIS_2'),(21504,0,0,'Indeed, it is not a request.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19185,0,'dawnforge SAY_PATHALEON_CULATOR_IMAGE_1'),(21504,1,0,'Duro will be reinforced!  Ultris was a complete disaster.  I will NOT have that mistake repeated!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,19187,0,'dawnforge SAY_PATHALEON_CULATOR_IMAGE_2'),(21504,2,0,'We\'ve had too many setbacks along the way: Hellfire Citadel, Fallen Sky Ridge, Firewing Point...  Prince Kael\'thas will tolerate no further delays.  I will tolerate nothing other than complete success!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19188,0,'dawnforge SAY_PATHALEON_CULATOR_IMAGE_2_1'),(21504,3,0,'I am returning to Tempest Keep.  See to it that I do not have reason to return!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19191,0,'dawnforge SAY_PATHALEON_CULATOR_IMAGE_2_2'),(19831,0,0,'We need you to send reinforcements to Manaforge Duro, Ardonis.  This is not a request, it\'s an order.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18165,0,'dawnforge SAY_COMMANDER_DAWNFORGE_1'),(19831,1,0,'You will do as ordered.  Manaforge Duro has come under heavy attack by mana creatures and the situation is out of control.  Failure to comply will not be tolerated!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18167,0,'dawnforge SAY_COMMANDER_DAWNFORGE_2'),(19831,2,0,'My lord!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19186,0,'dawnforge SAY_COMMANDER_DAWNFORGE_3'),(19831,3,0,'Yes, my lord.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19189,0,'dawnforge SAY_COMMANDER_DAWNFORGE_4'),(19831,4,0,'See to it, Ardonis!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,19190,0,'dawnforge SAY_COMMANDER_DAWNFORGE_5'),(20464,0,0,'Bessy, you\'re home. Thank the Light!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18181,0,'Thadell'),(20415,0,0,'Mooooo...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18179,0,'Bessy'),(20415,1,0,'Moooooooooo!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18180,0,'Bessy'),(21648,0,0,'Thank you, mortal.',12,11,100,0,0,0,0,19849,0,'mature netherwing drake SAY_JUST_EATEN'),(23139,5,0,'But... My lord, I do not understand. $n... He is the orc that has...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21805,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,3,0,'All hail Lord Illidan!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21802,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,4,0,'Lord Illidan, this is the Dragonmaw that I, and others, have told you about. He will lead us to victory!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21803,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,2,0,'Lord Illidan will be here shortly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21800,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,1,0,'Warriors of Dragonmaw, gather \'round! One among you has attained the rank of highlord! Bow your heads in reverence! Show your respect and allegiance to Highlord $n!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21799,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23146,1,0,'Yes... Yes we move now... Please no hurt us...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21302,0,'Dragonmaw Enforcer'),(23139,0,0,'Come, $n. Lord Stormrage awaits.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21798,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23146,0,0,'Who... Who is you?? What you want?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21300,0,'Dragonmaw Enforcer'),(22083,0,0,'What is the meaning of this, Mor\'ghor?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21804,0,'overlord morghor LORD_ILLIDAN_SAY_1'),(22083,1,0,'SILENCE!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,21807,0,'overlord morghor LORD_ILLIDAN_SAY_2'),(22083,2,0,'Blathering idiot. You incomprehensibly incompetent buffoon...\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21808,0,'overlord morghor LORD_ILLIDAN_SAY_3'),(22083,3,0,'THIS is your hero?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21809,0,'overlord morghor LORD_ILLIDAN_SAY_4'),(22083,4,0,'You have been deceived, imbecile.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21810,0,'overlord morghor LORD_ILLIDAN_SAY_5'),(22083,5,0,'This... whole... operation... HAS BEEN COMPROMISED!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21811,0,'overlord morghor LORD_ILLIDAN_SAY_6'),(22083,6,0,'I expect to see this insect\'s carcass in pieces in my lair within the hour. Fail and you will suffer a fate so much worse than death.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21812,0,'overlord morghor LORD_ILLIDAN_SAY_7'),(23141,0,0,'You will not harm the $g boy:girl;, Mor\'ghor! Quickly, $n, climb on my back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21825,0,'Yarzill'),(21027,0,0,'I sense the tortured spirits, $n. They are this way. Come quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18668,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_START'),(21027,1,0,'Watch out!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18687,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_AGGRO1'),(21027,1,1,'Naga attackers! Defend yourself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18688,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_AGGRO2'),(21027,2,0,'Grant me protection, $n. I must break through their foul magic!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18669,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_PROGRESS1'),(21027,3,0,'The naga of Coilskar are exceptionally cruel to their prisoners. It is a miracle that I survived inside that watery prison for as long as I did. Earthmother be praised.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18685,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_PROGRESS2'),(21027,3,1,'Lady Vashj must answer for these atrocities. She must be brought to justice!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18684,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_PROGRESS4'),(21027,3,2,'The tumultuous nature of the great waterways of Azeroth and Draenor are a direct result of tormented water spirits.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18675,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_PROGRESS5'),(21027,4,0,'Now we must find the exit.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18670,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_FIND_EXIT'),(21027,5,0,'It shouldn\'t be much further, $n. The exit is just up ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18671,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_JUST_AHEAD'),(21027,6,0,'Thank you, $n. Please return to my brethren at the Altar of Damnation, near the Hand of Gul\'dan, and tell them that Wilda is safe. May the Earthmother watch over you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18672,0,'wilda SAY_WIL_END'),(19685,0,0,'Follow me, stranger.  This won\'t take long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17239,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,1,0,'Shattrath was once the draenei capital of this world. Its name means \"dwelling of light.\"',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17240,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,2,0,'When the Burning Legion turned the orcs against the draenei, the fiercest battle was fought here. The draenei fought tooth and nail, but in the end the city fell.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17268,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,3,0,'The city was left in ruins and darkness... until the Sha\'tar arrived.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17269,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,4,0,'Let us go into the Lower City.  I will warn you that as one of the only safe havens in Outland, Shattrath has attracted droves of refugees from all wars, current and past.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17270,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,5,0,'The Sha\'tar, or \"born from light\" are the naaru that came to Outland to fight the demons of the Burning Legion.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17242,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,6,0,'They were drawn to the ruins of Shattrath City where a small remnant of the draenei priesthood conducted its rites inside a ruined temple on this very spot.\n',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17271,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,7,0,'The priesthood, known as the Aldor, quickly regained its strength as word spread that the naaru had returned and reconstruction soon began.  The ruined temple is now used as an infirmary for injured refugees.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17272,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,8,0,'It wouldn\'t be long, however, before the city came under attack once again.  This time, the attack came from Illidan\'s armies. A large regiment of blood elves had been sent by Illidan\'s ally, Kael\'thas Sunstrider, to lay waste to the city.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17245,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,9,0,'As the regiment of blood elves crossed this very bridge, the Aldor\'s exarchs and vindicators lined up to defend the Terrace of Light.  But then the unexpected happened.\n',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17274,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,10,0,'The blood elves laid down their weapons in front of the city\'s defenders; their leader, a blood elf elder known as Voren\'thal, stormed into the Terrace of Light and demanded to speak to A\'dal.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17247,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,11,0,'As the naaru approached him, Voren\'thal kneeled before him and uttered the following words: \"I\'ve seen you in a vision, naaru. My race\'s only hope for survival lies with you. My followers and I are here to serve you.\"',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17275,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,12,0,'The defection of Voren\'thal and his followers was the largest loss ever incurred by Kael\'s forces. And these weren\'t just any blood elves.  Many of the best and brightest amongst Kael\'s scholars and magisters had been swayed by Voren\'thal\'s influence.\n',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17250,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,13,0,'The naaru accepted the defectors, who would be known as the Scryers; their dwelling lies in the platform above.  Only those initiated with the Scryers are allowed there.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17276,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,14,0,'The Aldor are followers of the Light and forgiveness and redemption are values they understand. However, they found hard to forget the deeds of the blood elves while under Kael\'s command.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17253,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,15,0,'Many of the priesthood had been slain by the same magisters who now vowed to serve the naaru.  They were not happy to share the city with their former enemies.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17277,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,16,0,'The Aldor\'s most holy temple and its surrounding dwellings lie on the terrace above.  As a holy site, only the initiated are welcome inside.\n',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17278,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,17,0,'The attacks against Shattrath continued, but the city did not fall, as you can see. On the contrary, the naaru known as Xi\'ri led a successful incursion into Shadowmoon Valley - Illidan\'s doorstep.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17257,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,18,0,'There he continues to wage war on Illidan with the assistance of the Aldor and the Scryers.  The two factions have not given up on their old feuds, though.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17279,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,19,0,'Such is their animosity that they vie for the honor of being sent to assist the naaru there. Each day, that decision is made here by A\'dal.  The armies gather here to receive A\'dal\'s blessing before heading to Shadowmoon.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17280,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,20,0,'Khadgar should be ready to see you again.  Just remember that to serve the Sha\'tar you will most likely have to ally with the Aldor or the Scryers. And seeking the favor of one group will cause the others\' dislike.\n',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17262,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19685,21,0,'Good luck stranger, and welcome to Shattrath City.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,17281,0,'Khadgar\'s Servant'),(19720,3,0,'2...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17356,0,'\"Dirty\" Larry'),(19720,4,0,'Time to meet your maker!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17357,0,'\"Dirty\" Larry'),(19720,2,0,'1...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17355,0,'\"Dirty\" Larry'),(19720,1,0,'Now I\'m gonna give you to the count of \'3\' to get out of here before I sick the dogs on you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17354,0,'\"Dirty\" Larry'),(19720,0,0,'Time to teach you a lesson in manners, little $g boy:girl;!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,17353,0,'\"Dirty\" Larry'),(20912,0,0,'It is a small matter to control the mind of the weak... for I bear allegiance to powers untouched by time, unmoved by fate. No force on this world or beyond harbors the strength to bend our knee... not even the mighty Legion! ',14,0,100,0,0,11122,0,19112,0,'skyriss SAY_INTRO'),(20912,1,0,'Bear witness to the agent of your demise!',14,0,100,0,0,11123,0,19113,0,'skyriss SAY_AGGRO'),(20912,2,0,'Your fate is written.',14,0,100,0,0,11124,0,19813,0,'skyriss SAY_KILL_1'),(20912,2,1,'The chaos I have sown here is but a taste....',14,0,100,0,0,11125,0,19814,0,'skyriss SAY_KILL_2'),(20912,3,0,'You will do my bidding, weakling.',14,0,100,0,0,11127,0,19816,0,'skyriss SAY_MIND_1'),(20912,3,1,'Your will is no longer your own.',14,0,100,0,0,11128,0,19817,0,'skyriss SAY_MIND_2'),(20912,4,0,'Flee in terror.',14,0,100,0,0,11129,0,19818,0,'skyriss SAY_FEAR_1'),(20912,4,1,'I will show you horrors undreamed of.',14,0,100,0,0,11130,0,19819,0,'skyriss SAY_FEAR_2'),(20912,5,0,'We span the universe, as countless as the stars!',14,0,100,0,0,11131,0,19821,0,'skyriss SAY_IMAGE'),(20912,6,0,'I am merely one of... infinite multitudes.',14,0,100,0,0,11126,0,19815,0,'skyriss SAY_DEATH'),(17975,3,0,'The specimens... must be preserved.',14,0,100,0,0,11149,0,19949,0,'High Botanist Freywinn SAY_DEATH'),(17975,4,0,'...mumble...Petals of Fire...mumble...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16945,0,'High Botanist Freywinn SAY_OOC_RANDOM'),(17975,4,1,'...mumble mumble...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16946,0,'High Botanist Freywinn SAY_OOC_RANDOM'),(17975,4,2,'...thorny vines...mumble...ouch!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16947,0,'High Botanist Freywinn SAY_OOC_RANDOM'),(17980,0,0,'%s emits a strange noise.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10755,0,'laj EMOTE_SUMMON'),(17977,0,0,'Who disturbs this sanctuary?',14,0,100,0,0,11230,0,20024,0,'warp SAY_AGGRO'),(17977,1,0,'You must die! But wait: this does not-- No, no... you must die!',14,0,100,0,0,11231,0,20025,0,'warp SAY_SLAY_1'),(17977,1,1,'What am I doing? Why do I...',14,0,100,0,0,11232,0,20026,0,'warp SAY_SLAY_2'),(17977,2,0,'Children, come to me!',14,0,100,0,0,11233,0,18376,0,'warp SAY_SUMMON_1'),(17977,2,1,'Maybe this is not-- No, we fight! Come to my aid!',14,0,100,0,0,11234,0,20022,0,'warp SAY_SUMMON_2'),(17977,3,0,'So... confused. Do not... belong here.',14,0,100,0,0,11235,0,20028,0,'warp SAY_DEATH'),(18805,0,0,'Tal anu\'men no sin\'dorei!',14,0,100,0,0,11134,0,20849,0,'solarian SAY_AGGRO'),(18805,1,0,'You are hopelessly outmatched!',14,0,100,0,0,11139,0,20854,0,'solarian SAY_SUMMON1'),(18805,2,0,'I will crush your delusions of grandeur!',14,0,100,0,0,11140,0,20855,0,'solarian SAY_SUMMON2'),(18805,3,0,'Your soul belongs to the abyss!',14,0,100,0,0,11136,0,20851,0,'solarian SAY_KILL1'),(18805,3,1,'By the blood of the Highborne!',14,0,100,0,0,11137,0,20852,0,'solarian SAY_KILL2'),(18805,3,2,'For the Sunwell!',14,0,100,0,0,11138,0,20853,0,'solarian SAY_KILL3'),(18805,4,0,'The warmth of the sun... awaits.',14,0,100,0,0,11135,0,20850,0,'solarian SAY_DEATH'),(18805,5,0,'Enough of this!  Now I call upon the fury of the cosmos itself.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20372,0,'solarian SAY_VOIDA'),(18805,6,0,'I become ONE... with the VOID!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20373,0,'solarian SAY_VOIDB'),(19622,0,0,'Energy. Power. My people are addicted to it... a dependence made manifest after the Sunwell was destroyed. Welcome to the future. A pity you are too late to stop it. No one can stop me now! Selama ashal\'anore!',14,0,100,0,0,11256,0,20195,0,'kaelthas SAY_INTRO'),(19622,1,0,'Capernian will see to it that your stay here is a short one.',14,0,100,0,0,11257,0,19004,0,'kaelthas SAY_INTRO_CAPERNIAN'),(19622,2,0,'Well done, you have proven worthy to test your skills against my master engineer, Telonicus.',14,0,100,0,0,11258,0,19005,0,'kaelthas SAY_INTRO_TELONICUS'),(19622,3,0,'Let us see how your nerves hold up against the Darkener, Thaladred! ',14,0,100,0,0,11259,0,19006,0,'kaelthas SAY_INTRO_THALADRED'),(19622,4,0,'You have persevered against some of my best advisors... but none can withstand the might of the Blood Hammer. Behold, Lord Sanguinar!',14,0,100,0,0,11260,0,19003,0,'kaelthas SAY_INTRO_SANGUINAR'),(19622,5,0,'As you see, I have many weapons in my arsenal....',14,0,100,0,0,11261,0,19053,0,'kaelthas SAY_PHASE2_WEAPON'),(19622,6,0,'Perhaps I underestimated you. It would be unfair to make you fight all four advisors at once, but... fair treatment was never shown to my people. I\'m just returning the favor.',14,0,100,0,0,11262,0,19060,0,'kaelthas SAY_PHASE3_ADVANCE'),(19622,7,0,'Alas, sometimes one must take matters into one\'s own hands. Balamore shanal!',14,0,100,0,0,11263,0,19195,0,'kaelthas SAY_PHASE4_INTRO2'),(19622,8,0,'I have not come this far to be stopped! The future I have planned will not be jeopardized! Now you will taste true power!!',14,0,100,0,0,11273,0,20208,0,'kaelthas SAY_PHASE5_NUTS'),(19622,9,0,'You will not prevail!',14,0,100,0,0,11270,0,20204,0,'kaelthas SAY_SLAY1'),(19622,9,1,'You gambled. And lost.',14,0,100,0,0,11271,0,20205,0,'kaelthas SAY_SLAY2'),(19622,9,2,'This was child\'s play.',14,0,100,0,0,11272,0,20206,0,'kaelthas SAY_SLAY3'),(19622,10,0,'Obey me!',14,0,100,0,0,11268,0,20202,0,'kaelthas SAY_MINDCONTROL1'),(19622,10,1,'Bow to my will.',14,0,100,0,0,11269,0,18259,0,'kaelthas SAY_MINDCONTROL2'),(19622,11,0,