tstar'),(35564,1,0,'Somone stop that ghoul!',12,36,100,0,0,0,0,35950,0,'Risen Arelas Brightstar'),(35564,2,0,'That had to hurt! Brains!',12,36,100,0,0,0,0,35952,0,'Risen Arelas Brightstar'),(35545,0,0,'What a Brains shot!',12,36,100,0,0,0,0,35954,0,'Risen Jaeren Sunsworn'),(35545,1,0,'Somone stop that ghoul!',12,36,100,0,0,0,0,35950,0,'Risen Jaeren Sunsworn'),(35545,2,0,'That had to hurt! Brains!',12,36,100,0,0,0,0,35952,0,'Risen Jaeren Sunsworn'),(34928,0,0,'Thank you, good herald. Your words are too kind.',12,0,100,2,0,16245,0,35762,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress - SAY_INTRO_1'),(34928,1,0,'May the Light give me strength to provide a worthy challenge.',12,0,100,16,0,16246,0,35763,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress - SAY_INTRO_2'),(34928,2,0,'Well, then. Let us begin.',14,0,100,0,0,16247,0,35229,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress - SAY_AGGRO'),(34928,3,0,'Take this time to consider your past deeds.',14,0,100,0,0,16248,0,35764,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress - SAY_MEMORY_SUMMON'),(34928,4,0,'Even the darkest memory fades when confronted!',14,0,100,0,0,16249,0,35231,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress - SAY_MEMORY_DEATH'),(34928,5,0,'Take your rest.',14,0,100,0,0,16250,0,35765,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress - SAY_KILL_PLAYER'),(34928,5,1,'Be at ease.',14,0,100,0,0,16251,0,35766,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress - SAY_KILL_PLAYER'),(34928,6,0,'Excellent work!',14,0,100,0,0,16252,0,35232,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress - SAY_DEFEATED'),(35119,0,0,'Are you up to the challenge? I will not hold back.',12,0,100,397,0,16134,0,35347,0,'Eadric the Pure - SAY_INTRO'),(35119,1,0,'Prepare yourselves!',14,0,100,0,0,16135,0,35758,0,'Eadric the Pure - SAY_AGGRO'),(35119,2,0,'%s begins to radiate light. Shield your eyes!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35415,0,'Eadric the Pure - EMOTE_RADIANCE'),(35119,3,0,'%s targets $n with the Hammer of the Righteous!',41,0,100,0,0,16136,0,35408,0,'Eadric the Pure - EMOTE_HAMMER_RIGHTEOUS'),(35119,4,0,'Hammer of the Righteous!',14,0,100,0,0,16136,0,35442,0,'Eadric the Pure - SAY_HAMMER_RIGHTEOUS'),(35119,5,0,'You! You need more practice.',14,0,100,0,0,16137,0,35759,0,'Eadric the Pure - SAY_KILL_PLAYER'),(35119,5,1,'Nay, nay, and I say yet again nay! Not good enough.',14,0,100,0,0,16138,0,35760,0,'Eadric the Pure - SAY_KILL_PLAYER'),(35119,6,0,'I yield! I submit. Excellent work. May I run away now?',14,0,100,0,0,16139,0,35761,0,'Eadric the Pure - SAY_DEFEATED'),(35451,0,0,'You spoiled my grand entrance, rat.',12,0,100,0,0,16256,0,35546,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_INTRO_1'),(35451,1,0,'Did you honestly think an agent of the Lich King would be bested on the field of your pathetic little tournament?',12,0,100,396,0,16257,0,35548,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_INTRO_2'),(35451,2,0,'I\'ve come to finish my task.',12,0,100,396,0,16258,0,35549,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_INTRO_3'),(35451,3,0,'This farce ends here!',14,0,100,0,0,16259,0,35767,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_AGGRO'),(35451,4,0,'My rotting flesh was just getting in the way!',14,0,100,0,0,16262,0,35771,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_PHASE_2'),(35451,5,0,'I have no need for bones to best you!',14,0,100,0,0,16263,0,35772,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_PHASE_3'),(35451,6,0,'Pathetic.',14,0,100,0,0,16260,0,35768,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_KILL_PLAYER'),(35451,6,1,'A waste of flesh.',14,0,100,0,0,16261,0,35769,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_KILL_PLAYER'),(35451,7,0,'No! I must not fail... again...',14,0,100,0,0,16264,0,35770,0,'The Black Knight - SAY_DEATH'),(32273,0,0,'How dare you interfere with our work!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32639,3,'Infinite Corruptor - SAY_AGGRO'),(32273,1,0,'My time... has run out...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32642,3,'Infinite Corruptor - SAY_DEATH'),(32273,2,0,'The process is finally complete! My work here is done.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32666,3,'Infinite Corruptor - SAY_FAIL'),(22834,0,0,'%s snaps up to a kneeling position, but seems as though he\'s somewhere else.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20523,0,'Clintar Dreamwalker (line 0)'),(22834,1,0,'What are you doing in Ysera\'s realm, interloper? Leave us, I say! Your kind are not welcome here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,20524,0,'Clintar Dreamwalker (line 1)'),(22834,2,0,'%s gets to his feet, beginning to recognize his surroundings.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20525,0,'Clintar Dreamwalker (line 2)'),(22834,3,0,'You -- you\'re not one of them! Let\'s get out of sight before they find us! Hurry!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20538,0,'Clintar Dreamwalker (line 3)'),(22834,4,0,'They\'re following me, $r! Quickly, tell me why you\'re here before we\'re discovered! If they catch up to me, it will mean my death and yours!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20532,0,'Clintar Dreamwalker (line 4)'),(17307,0,0,'You have faced many challenges.... Pity they were all in vain! Soon your people will kneel to MY lord!',14,0,100,0,0,10292,0,13981,0,'vazruden the herald SAY_INTRO'),(17536,0,0,'Nazan descends from the sky.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,20472,0,'nazan EMOTE'),(16151,1,2,'Perhaps you would rather test yourselves against a more formidable opponent?!',14,0,100,0,0,9299,0,15379,0,'attumen SAY_APPEAR3'),(16151,2,0,'Come Midnight, let\'s disperse this petty rabble!',14,0,100,0,0,9168,0,13456,0,'attumen SAY_MOUNT'),(15471,0,0,'They come now. Try not to get yourself killed, young blood.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11012,0,'andorov SAY_ANDOROV_INTRO'),(15471,1,0,'Remember, Rajaxx, when I said I\'d kill you last?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11028,0,'andorov SAY_ANDOROV_ATTACK'),(15341,0,0,'The time of our retribution is at hand! Let darkness reign in the hearts of our enemies!',14,0,100,0,0,8612,0,11440,0,'rajaxx SAY_WAVE3'),(15341,1,0,'No longer will we wait behind barred doors and walls of stone! No longer will our vengeance be denied! The dragons themselves will tremble before our wrath!\n',14,0,100,0,0,8610,0,11439,0,'rajaxx SAY_WAVE4'),(15341,2,0,'Fear is for the enemy! Fear and death!',14,0,100,0,0,8608,0,11438,0,'rajaxx SAY_WAVE5'),(15341,3,0,'Staghelm will whimper and beg for his life, just as his whelp of a son did! One thousand years of injustice will end this day!\n',14,0,100,0,0,8611,0,11437,0,'rajaxx SAY_WAVE6'),(15341,4,0,'Fandral! Your time has come! Go and hide in the Emerald Dream and pray we never find you!\n',14,0,100,0,0,8607,0,11436,0,'rajaxx SAY_WAVE7'),(15341,5,0,'Impudent fool! I will kill you myself!',14,0,100,0,0,8609,0,11435,0,'rajaxx SAY_INTRO'),(10813,1,0,'Damn you mortals! All my plans of revenge, all my hate...I will be avenged...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6442,0,'Balnazzar SAY_DEATH'),(10813,0,0,'You fools think you can defeat me so easily? Face the true might of the Nathrezim!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6447,0,'Balnazzar SAY_TRANSFORM'),(15340,2,0,'%s drains your mana and turns to stone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11474,0,'moam EMOTE_ENERGIZE'),(15341,8,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'rajaxx EMOTE_FRENZY'),(15341,6,0,'Breathe your last!',14,0,100,0,0,8604,0,11433,0,'rajaxx SAY_SLAY'),(15341,7,0,'Warriors, Captains, continue the fight!',14,0,100,0,0,8613,0,11434,0,'rajaxx SAY_DEATH'),(15340,0,0,'%s senses your fear.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11441,0,'moam EMOTE_AGGRO'),(15340,1,0,'%s bristles with energy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12781,0,'moan EMOTE_MANA_FULL'),(15370,0,0,'%s sets eyes on $n!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11074,0,'buru EMOTE_TARGET'),(8127,2,0,'Rise and defend your master!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4177,0,'Antu\'sul'),(28902,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,7798,0,'Warlord Zol\'Maz'),(28444,0,0,'%s calls upon the mighty armies of the Scourge!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,28683,0,'Highlord Darion Morgraine'),(28444,1,0,'Armies of the Scourge, hear my call! The scarlet apocalypse has begun! Tear this land asunder and leave only death in your wake!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,28684,0,'Highlord Darion Morgraine'),(22924,0,0,'It would\'ve taken years to find the Book of the Raven without you, young sparrowhawk. Return to your home in Nagrand with our gratitude.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20752,0,'Arthorn Windsong'),(22924,1,0,'This is it! This is really it -- the Book of the Raven!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20753,0,'Arthorn Windsong'),(22924,2,0,'There\'s something else here, too. After a description of a bloody battle and the downfall of the raven, there\'s a prophecy. Anzu will haunt the dreams of his enemies, twisting them to effect a return to this world...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20757,0,'Arthorn Windsong'),(22924,3,0,'It\'s all here... how the raven\'s followers captured and subdued the spirits of rivals, trapping them forever within stone statues! The tablet even mentions the raven god\'s name -- Anzu. I\'d thought it was lost to history!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20756,0,'Arthorn Windsong'),(22924,4,0,'The tablet has the confirmation we need, just as I thought. Now, we have to use this information to draw out and defeat this Anzu before he can do any more damage to the Emerald Dream!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20758,0,'Arthorn Windsong'),(22924,5,0,'Since the sparrowhawks have proven such a success in hunting down the raven stones, Watcher Elaira has trained another one to relay my voice at a great distance. He can help us communicate as you investigate the bird spirits revealed in the tablet!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21607,0,'Arthorn Windsong'),(18447,0,0,'The threat be over! $n be savin\' us all!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,18820,0,'Toki'),(15299,0,0,'%s begins to slow!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11343,0,'EMOTE_SLOW'),(15299,1,0,'%s is freezing up!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11345,0,'EMOTE_FREEZE'),(15299,2,0,'%s is frozen solid!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11695,0,'EMOTE_FROZEN'),(15299,3,0,'%s begins to crack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11346,0,'EMOTE_CRACK'),(15299,4,0,'%s looks ready to shatter!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11347,0,'EMOTE_SHATTER'),(15299,5,0,'%s explodes!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,28803,0,'EMOTE_EXPLODE'),(1416,0,0,'Follow me, good Paladin.  I\'ll have your barding done faster than I could down a Dwarven stout.  Mmmm... stout.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,9776,0,'Grimand Elmore'),(1416,1,0,'Well, that should do it.  Come now, back to the shop to finish our business!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,9779,0,'Grimand Elmore'),(5901,0,0,'Spirits of Water, I give you praise, and I beg of you a favor. You have heard $n\'s pleas, and I trust $ghis:her; intent is noble. Please, will you aid us?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,6586,0,'Islen Waterseer'),(5901,1,0,'Thank you, great spirit. Thank you!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,6599,0,'Islen Waterseer'),(9316,0,0,'Ok, let\'s get started.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1610,0,'Wenikee Boltbucket'),(9316,1,0,'... oops.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,4730,0,'Wenikee Boltbucket'),(2080,0,0,'Now let us place this rare earth in my planter...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1239,0,'Denalan'),(2080,1,0,'Thank you again, $n.  This rare earth will be very helpful in my experiments.',12,7,100,2,0,0,0,1240,0,'Denalan'),(2080,2,0,'%s hurries to his planter.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1159,0,'Denalan'),(2080,3,0,'I hope this frond takes root...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1160,0,'Denalan'),(2080,4,0,'%s removes the seeds from the Glowing Fruit...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1156,0,'Denalan'),(2080,5,0,'Let\'s see how these seeds grow in my prepared soil...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1157,0,'Denalan'),(2080,6,0,'%s plants the fruit seeds.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1158,0,'Denalan'),(3569,0,0,'Kill!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1176,0,'Bogling'),(2911,0,0,'By the stars! A spirit has been summoned!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1180,0,'Archaeologist Flagongut'),(2911,1,0,'It\'s a mystery of the past indeed! But a key to our future!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1181,0,'Archaeologist Flagongut'),(3442,0,0,'Ok, let\'s take a look at this thing...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,4727,0,'Sputtervalve'),(3442,1,0,'Oh, darn...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,4728,0,'Sputtervalve'),(2150,0,0,'Ribbit! No!! This cannot...ribbit...be! You have duped me with...ribbit...your foul trickery! Ribbit!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,886,0,'Zenn Foulhoof'),(1931,0,0,'I... I... don\'t... feel... right...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,425,0,'Captured Scarlet Zealot'),(1931,1,0,'My mind... my flesh... I\'m... rotting...!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,428,0,'Captured Scarlet Zealot'),(1373,0,0,'%s gestures to the pitcher of water sitting on the edge of the well.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1528,0,'Jarven Thunderbrew'),(1373,1,0,'Hey there, Belm!  Give me a mug of Thunder Ale, and one for my good friend $n.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,125,0,'Jarven Thunderbrew'),(1373,2,0,'How goes the barrel watching...?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,126,0,'Jarven Thunderbrew'),(1373,3,0,'Well, back to business for me.  But it sure was nice taking that short break, and it\'s always nice drinking Thunder Ale!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,128,0,'Jarven Thunderbrew'),(28030,0,1,'Eternal damnation is your future.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29427,0,'Quetz\'lun'),(28030,0,2,'My judgment is final.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29430,0,'Quetz\'lun'),(28030,0,3,'Beg for your life. Plead. It will do you no good!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29426,0,'Quetz\'lun'),(28030,0,4,'Burn in the fires of my fury!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29431,0,'Quetz\'lun'),(28030,0,5,'Die!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28793,0,'Quetz\'lun'),(28030,0,6,'You killed me and now I will kill you... over and over!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29428,0,'Quetz\'lun'),(28030,0,7,'I find you wanting.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29424,0,'Quetz\'lun'),(28752,0,0,'NOOOOOOOOOoooooooo.......!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28797,0,'Mu\'funu'),(28754,0,0,'FIRE! AHHHHHHHH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28800,0,'Tua-tua'),(28754,1,0,'The high priestess is reduced to charcoal.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28799,0,'Tua-Tua'),(28388,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(28756,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Hawinni'),(27629,0,0,'Are you ready for battle, $c?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29966,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,0,1,'Take us into battle, $n!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26908,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,0,2,'Shall we destabilize the shrine first or disable the enemy?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29964,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,0,3,'We\'ve been expecting you, $n. Now we have the upper hand.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29965,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,0,4,'I can\'t believe the blues would attack us. Let\'s give some of it back!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29961,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,0,5,'I am ready. Let\'s defend the temple!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29960,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,0,6,'Where to first?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29962,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,0,7,'Your reputation precedes you, $n. This should be interesting.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29963,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,1,0,'I never thought that I\'d be riding into battle with a $r on my back.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27376,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,1,1,'Another blue down. We make a great team!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27374,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,1,2,'With you and I working together, this battle will be over in no time.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27375,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,1,3,'Malygos has clearly gone insane.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27380,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,1,4,'Nice one, kid.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27373,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,1,5,'I\'ve never seen anything like this before. I\'m glad that you\'re here.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27379,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,1,6,'I\'m glad you saw that one!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27377,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,1,7,'Just hang on. We\'ll get through this.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27378,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(27629,2,0,'We should get out of here. I need to renew!',42,0,100,0,3000,0,0,28879,0,'Wyrmrest Defender'),(24255,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(24539,0,0,'Do not test me, scurvy dog!  I\'m trained in the way of the Blood Knights!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23810,0,'Silvermoon Hary - start to fight'),(314,0,0,'Wait...you are not my husband.  But he must have sent you.  And you...look..delicious!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,111,0,'Eliza'),(314,0,1,'Aber?  Is that you...?  Oh...I\'m so hungry, Aber!  SO HUNGRY!!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,110,0,'Eliza'),(39425,0,0,'Turn back, intruders! These halls must not be disturbed!',14,0,100,0,0,18580,0,0,0,'Temple Guardian Anhuur - SAY_AGGRO'),(39425,1,0,'Beacons of light, bestow upon me your aegis!',14,0,100,0,0,18581,0,0,0,'Temple Guardian Anhuur - SAY_SHIELD'),(39425,2,0,'%s becomes protected by his defense beacons! Disable them by pulling the levers below!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Temple Guardian Anhuur - EMOTE_SHIELD'),(39425,3,0,'%s is no longer protected by the beacons!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Temple Gu