,13419,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,2,'Be at peace, my sweet, sweet, Luhanaa.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13425,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,3,'I\'ll never forget you, my love.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13420,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,4,'If I ever find the ones responsible for the crash...!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13423,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,5,'We should never have come along.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13421,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,6,'Why, Luhanaa?  Why?!',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,13418,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,7,'I miss you so much!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13422,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,8,'You\'ll always be here, with me.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13424,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,9,'%s weeps softly.',16,0,100,18,0,0,0,13414,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,10,'%s bows his head and sighs, clearly exhausted.',16,0,100,2,0,0,0,13417,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,11,'%s breaks down into huge, wracking sobs.',16,0,100,18,0,0,0,13416,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(17073,0,12,'%s stares in silence at the grave marker before him.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13415,0,'Draenei Mourner - Random Say'),(16589,0,0,'So there we were - me and the battalion, doing a routine recon down the bone road. We\'d sent the scout up ahead to look around in case anything dangerous come up.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12617,0,'Guard Captain Cragtar - Speech Text 0'),(16589,1,0,'Sure enough, scout came runnin\' back, talkin\' bout some orcs down the path. They hadn\'t seen us yet so we figured we\'d go get acquainted.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12618,0,'Guard Captain Cragtar - Speech Text 1'),(16589,2,0,'Big red suckers! Bigger than any orc I\'d ever seen. Muscles out to here, tusks out to here... ',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12625,0,'Guard Captain Cragtar - Speech Text 2'),(16589,3,0,'%s nods.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,12627,0,'Guard Captain Cragtar - Speech Text 3'),(16589,4,0,'Fel orcs...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12628,0,'Guard Captain C