,0,0,0,24173,0,'Shattered Sun Bombardier'),(25144,0,1,'Keep your eye on the demons.  We\'re not concerned with killing Scourge today.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24184,0,'Shattered Sun Bombardier'),(25162,0,0,'Attention!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26245,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,1,0,'Alright, quiet down. We have a lot to do and very little time to do it in, people.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24210,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,2,0,'I\'ve stood with some of you draenei before at Skettis, and others in Shadowmoon Valley. But now we\'re on Azeroth, and the situation looks grim.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24211,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,3,0,'First though, you sin\'dorei listen up. I run a tight ship... this isn\'t going to be like what you\'re used to with the Scryers. Pull your weight, or get back on the boat!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24212,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,4,0,'Now that that\'s out of the way, welcome to the Isle of Quel\'Danas. The Sunwell\'s on the plateau to the south, and Prince Kael\'thas is holed up in the Magisters\' Terrace to the east.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24213,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,5,0,'We\'re here as support for the so-called \'adventurers\' that the brass has called in. We\'ll help them hold the key points on the island, and keep the heat off so that they can do their jobs.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24214,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,6,0,'If none of you ladies have any questions, you can get further instructions and assignments from your squad leaders. That\'s it. Good luck!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24215,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,7,0,'Attention!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26245,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,8,0,'Welcome to the Sunwell. Despite the mild temperatures and scenic vistas, you\'re not on vacation, ladies and gentlemen!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24216,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,9,0,'The current situation looks like this: we\'re holding what we can while those with more experience and better equipment are moving against Prince Kael\'thas.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24217,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,10,0,'I know, we thought he was dead too, but that\'s not the case. He\'s trying to use the Sunwell to bring the master of the Burning Legion, Kil\'Jaeden, into this world.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24218,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,11,0,'Let me assure you people that if he\'s successful, this world will suffer far worse than Outland ever did! So, let\'s make sure that doesn\'t come to pass.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24219,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,12,0,'Warriors will be deployed to hold key positions, while you marksmen will be assigned to keep the enemy fliers at bay.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24220,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,13,0,'I\'m awaiting orders on your specific assignments. In the meantime, stay here and be ready to move at a moment\'s notice!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24221,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,14,0,'Attention!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26245,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,15,0,'Hello to you new recruits. I\'m Drill Sergeant Bahduum. For the next few days, you\'re going to receive orientation.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24195,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,16,0,'The Isle of Quel\'Danas has been overrun by the forces of Prince Kael\'thas Sunstrider. Intel had him pegged as deceased. Intel was wrong.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24196,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,17,0,'Up on the plateau, he and his demon friends are trying to reignite the Sunwell and open a rift to bring their head-honcho, Kil\'Jaeden, back into the world.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24197,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,18,0,'Our job is to clear out as much of his fodder as we can, while supporting the specialists that the powers-that-be are having brought in.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24198,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,19,0,'Needless to say, a lot of us won\'t be going home. But if you remember your training and keep your wits about you, you\'ll greatly increase your chances.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24199,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(25162,20,0,'That\'s all I have to say for now. Stay focused, boys and girls.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24200,0,'Drill Sergeant Bahduum'),(1161,0,0,'DESTROY!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1915,0,'Stonesplinter Trogg'),(1161,0,1,'KILL!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30905,0,'Stonesplinter Trogg'),(1161,0,2,'CRUSH!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1913,0,'Stonesplinter Trogg'),(1162,0,0,'DESTROY!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1915,0,'Stonesplinter Scout'),(1162,0,1,'KILL!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30905,0,'Stonesplinter Scout'),(1162,0,2,'CRUSH!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1913,0,'Stonesplinter Scout'),(1163,0,0,'DESTROY!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1915,0,'Stonesplinter Skullthumper'),(1163,0,1,'KILL!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30905,0,'Stonesplinter Skullthumper'),(1163,0,2,'CRUSH!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1913,0,'Stonesplinter Skullthumper'),(1165,0,0,'DESTROY!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1915,0,'Stonesplinter Geomancer'),(1165,0,1,'KILL!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30905,0,'Stonesplinter Geomancer'),(1165,0,2,'CRUSH!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1913,0,'Stonesplinter Geomancer'),(1166,0,0,'DESTROY!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1915,0,'Stonesplinter Seer'),(1166,0,1,'KILL!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30905,0,'Stonesplinter Seer'),(1166,0,2,'CRUSH!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1913,0,'Stonesplinter Seer'),(1167,0,0,'DESTROY!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1915,0,'Stonesplinter Digger'),(1167,0,1,'KILL!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30905,0,'Stonesplinter Digger'),(1167,0,2,'CRUSH!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1913,0,'Stonesplinter Digger'),(1169,0,0,'Time to die, $C.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1935,0,'Dark Iron Insurgent'),(1169,0,1,'Feel the power of the Dark Iron Dwarves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1936,0,'Dark Iron Insurgent'),(1172,0,0,'Yip! Me kill!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1920,0,'Tunnel Rat Vermin'),(1172,0,1,'Me no run from $C like you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1921,0,'Tunnel Rat Vermin'),(1173,0,0,'Yip! Me kill!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1920,0,'Tunnel Rat Scout'),(1173,0,1,'Me no run from $C like you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1921,0,'Tunnel Rat Scout'),(13601,0,0,'Mine! Mine! Mine!  Gizlock is the ruler of this domain!  You shall never reveal my presence!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8852,0,'Tinkerer Gizlock'),(1174,0,0,'Yip! Me kill!