,'%s focuses on $n!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,19321,0,'Shirrak the Dead Watcher - Emote Focus'),(11143,0,0,'Prepare to be Malowned!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6504,0,'Postmaster Malown SAY_AGGRO'),(17225,0,0,'An ancient being awakens in the distance...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13647,3,'Nightbane - EMOTE_SUMMON'),(17225,1,0,'What fools! I shall bring a quick end to your suffering!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13649,3,'Nightbane - YELL_AGGRO'),(17225,2,0,'Miserable vermin. I shall exterminate you from the air!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20023,3,'Nightbane - YELL_FLY_PHASE'),(17225,3,0,'Enough! I shall land and crush you myself!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13676,3,'Nightbane - YELL_LAND_PHASE'),(17225,3,1,'Insects! Let me show you my strength up close!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13677,3,'Nightbane - YELL_LAND_PHASE'),(17225,4,0,'%s takes a deep breath.',41,7,100,0,0,0,0,24548,3,'Nightbane - EMOTE_BREATH'),(28671,0,0,'What is this you pathetic, little worm? Come to die?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28837,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28671,1,0,'I recognize your stench. You\'re the one who stealthed by me on the back of that snow leopard runt!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28838,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28671,2,0,'What? How is this possible?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28833,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28671,3,0,'Wait... STOP! You can\'t take back the power!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28877,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28671,4,0,'NOOOOooooooooooooooooo!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28855,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28785,0,0,'TIME TO DIE, FOOL!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28832,0,'Spirit of Quetz\'lun'),(28785,1,0,'I\'ve returned to invite you to my housewarming in the underworld!',14,0,100,0,0,7056,0,28842,0,'Spirit of Quetz\'lun'),(28785,2,0,'I\'d say come along quietly, but we both know that\'s not going to happen. My little friend here is going to ease your way into the afterlife.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28843,0,'Spirit of Quetz\'lun'),(28785,3,0,'Well done. I\'ll see to it that my prophet enjoys his eternal stay with me.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28876,0,'Spirit of Quetz\'lun'),(25831,0,0,'ED-210 online!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25013,0,'ED-210 - Just summoned'),(25830,0,0,'Twonky!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25012,0,'Twonky - On aggro'),(11382,4,0,'%s goes into a rage after seeing his raptor fall in battle!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10545,0,'Bloodlord Mandokir - Ohgan Dead'),(28646,0,0,'We\'re off!  Watch out for those vines!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28664,0,'Pilot Vic to Vic\'s Flying Machine'),(28646,1,0,'Looks like the Scourge have hit the area ahead pretty bad...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28665,0,'Pilot Vic to Vic\'s Flying Machine'),(28646,2,0,'You see that?  She\'s... huge!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28666,0,'Pilot Vic to Vic\'s Flying Machine'),(28646,3,0,'Here we go!  Hold on tight -- there\'s rough wind ahead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28667,0,'Pilot Vic to Vic\'s Flying Machine'),(28646,4,0,'The glacier is seeping in from Icecrown... and undead everywhere!  Wait \'til the professor gets a hold of this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28699,0,'Pilot Vic to Vic\'s Flying Machine'),(28646,5,0,'They\'re coming at us!  Be quick with those rockets!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28668,0,'Pilot Vic to Vic\'s Flying Machine'),(28646,6,0,'Aggggh!  I\'m hit!  You\'re going to have to get us back!  Quick, before the plane explodes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28669,0,'Pilot Vic to Vic\'s Flying Machine'),(28710,0,0,'The engine\'s blown!  Fly Vic\'s Flying Machine back to Lakeside Landing!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,28756,0,'Vic\'s Flying Machine to Pilot Vic'),(2287,0,2,'Raaar!!! Me smash $r!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,1927,0,'on Aggro Text'),(2287,0,1,'Me smash! You die!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,1926,0,'on Aggro Text'),(2287,0,0,'I\'ll crush you!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,1925,0,'on Aggro Text'),(29579,0,0,'I... I can understand you now! Well, now that we can talk to each other, you have some explaining to do!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30624,0,'Brann Bronzebeard text0'),(29579,1,0,'How did you get my communicator from the Explorers\' League?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30625,0,'Brann Bronzebeard text1'),(18732,4,0,'The darkness in your souls draws you ever closer...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16302,0,'Grandmaster Vorpil SAY_DRAW'),(29579,3,0,'You have my thanks for dispatching the iron dwarves. But why would the Horde have an interest in me?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,30626,0,'Brann Bronzebeard text3'),(19255,0,4,'The warchief\'s put a price on Arazzius\'s head! As of right now, that no-good piece of demon refuse is enemy number one.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16391,0,'General Krakork'),(29579,5,0,'That wouldn\'t be Scout Vor\'takh, would it? Even I know of his reputation for ruthlessness. He means to abduct me, then?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30627,0,'Brann Bronzebeard text5'),(29579,6,0,'If you\'ve seen the journal, then you know what I\'ve been discovering. The titans\' own creations are at war with each other!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30628,0,'Brann Bronzebeard text6'),(29579,7,0,'Loken and his iron dwarf minions have ousted the Earthen from Ulduar and taken over the city.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30629,0,'Brann Bronzebeard text7'),(29579,8,0,'If we spend our time and strength fighting with each other, Loken will use Ulduar\'s resources to destroy both Horde and Alliance.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,30630,0,'Brann Bronzebeard text8'),(29579,9,0,'Speak to the commander at your post, $g lad:lass;, and persuade him to abandon Vor\'takh\'s foolish plan.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,30631,0,'Brann Bronzebeard Text10'),(55869,1,0,'How I HATE this place. My captors may be long-dead, but don\'t think I won\'t take it all out on you miserable treasure-hunters.',14,0,100,0,0,25779,0,0,0,'Alizabal - Intro'),(55869,2,0,'I hate adventurers.',14,0,100,0,0,25777,0,0,0,'Alizabal - Aggro'),(55869,3,0,'I hate martyrs.',14,0,100,0,0,25786,0,0,0,'Alizabal - Seething Hate'),(55869,4,0,'I hate armor.',14,0,100,0,0,25785,0,0,0,'Alizabal - Skewer'),(55869,5,0,'Alizabal skewers $N to the ground.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alizabal - Skewer Announce'),(55869,6,0,'I hate standing still.',14,0,100,0,0,25791,0,0,0,'Alizabal - Blade Dance'),(55869,7,0,'Feel my hatred!',14,0,100,0,0,25787,0,0,0,'Alizabal - ???'),(55869,8,0,'My hate will consume you!',14,0,100,0,0,25789,0,0,0,'Alizabal - ???'),(55869,9,0,'I hate you all.',14,0,100,0,0,25790,0,0,0,'Alizabal - ???'),(55869,10,0,'I hate mercy.',14,0,100,0,0,25783,0,0,0,'Alizabal - Slay 1'),(55869,11,0,'My hatred burns!',14,0,100,0,0,25788,0,0,0,'Alizabal - ???'),(55869,12,0,'I hate... every one of you...',14,0,100,0,0,25778,0,0,0,'Alizabal - Death'),(22181,1,0,'The %s appears ready to be wrangled.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21366,0,'Aether Ray'),(2211,0,0,' I raise my brew and hope to be rid of the likes of you! Cheers, you no good scoundrel, $n!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,576,0,'Captured Mountaineer'),(27376,0,0,'What do you mean my time has come?! I\'ll kill you where you stand!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,26449,0,'Deathguard Schneider before going hostile'),(27376,1,0,'Hey, over here!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,26451,0,'Deathguard Schneider upon LoS'),(27378,0,0,'You can\'t possibly mean to.... I\'ll write you up for this, $c!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,26450,0,'Senior Scrivener Barriga before going hostile'),(27378,1,0,'If you\'d be so kind, please let me out of here!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,26452,0,'Senior Scrivener Barriga upon LoS'),(27379,0,0,'No! I beg you! Please don\'t kill me!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,26454,0,'Engineer Burke before going hostile'),(27379,1,0,'Can someone let me out of here? I need to get back to Venomspite and finish my shift.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,26453,0,'Engineer Burke upon LoS'),(27381,0,0,'What is the meaning of this?! Stop! I\'ll double whatever they\'re paying you!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,26458,0,'Chancellor Amai before going hostile'),(27381,1,0,'I just arrived in Venomspite. How could I have possibly wronged you?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,26459,0,'Chancellor Amai upon Los'),(26179,0,0,'Victory or death! For the Horde!',14,1,100,15,0,0,0,25667,0,'Taunka\'le Refugee'),(26184,0,0,'Victory or death! For the Horde!',14,1,100,15,0,0,0,25667,0,'Taunka\'le Refugee'),(28859,15,0,'Alexstrasza, another of your brood falls!',14,0,100,0,3600,14534,0,31784,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 3)'),(28859,15,1,'Little more than gnats!',14,0,100,0,2650,14535,0,31785,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 3)'),(28859,15,2,'Your red allies will share your fate!',14,0,100,0,3000,14536,0,31786,0,'Malygos - Killed Player (Phase 3)'),(28859,16,0,'Still standing? Not for long.',14,0,100,0,3600,14537,0,31787,0,'Malygos - Spell Casting 1(Phase 3)'),(28859,16,1,'Your cause is lost!',14,0,100,0,2000,14538,0,31788,0,'Malygos - Spell Casting 2 (Phase 3)'),(28859,16,2,'Your fragile mind will be shattered!',14,0,100,0,4000,14539,0,31789,0,'Malygos - Spell Casting 3 (Phase 3)'),(28859,17,0,'Unthinkable! The mortals will destroy... everything! My sister, what have you...',14,0,100,0,8500,14540,0,31790,0,'Malygos - Death'),(28859,18,0,'%s fixes his eyes on you!',42,0,100,0,3000,0,0,31321,0,'Malygos - Surge of Power warning (Phase 3)'),(28859,19,0,'%s goes into a berserker rage!',41,0,100,0,10000,0,0,34057,0,'Malygos - Hit berserk timer (Any phase)'),(32295,0,0,'I did what I had to, brother. You gave me no alternative.',14,0,100,0,4000,14406,0,32626,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder'),(32295,1,0,'And so ends the Nexus War. ',14,0,100,0,4000,14407,0,32627,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder'),(32295,2,0,'This resolution pains me deeply, but the destruction, the monumental loss of life had to end. Regardless of Malygos\' recent transgressions, I will mourn his loss. He was once a guardian, a protector. This day, one of the world\'s mightiest has fallen.',14,0,100,0,24000,14408,0,32628,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder'),(32295,3,0,'The red dragonflight will take on the burden of mending the devastation wrought on Azeroth. Return home to your people and rest. Tomorrow will bring you new challenges, and you must be ready to face them. Life... goes on.',14,0,100,0,22000,14409,0,32629,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder'),(27654,5,0,'%s begins to cast Magic Pull!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,27550,0,'drakos EMOTE_PULL'),(144129,1,1,'Hey! Get away from that!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5053,0,'Plugger_Spazzring'),(30835,0,0,'My lady.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31446,0,'Image of a Shadow Cultist'),(30835,1,0,'There is word from Jotunheim. The sleep-watchers there believe that they have found someone of significance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31476,0,'Image of a Shadow Cultist'),(30835,2,0,'The cultist practically sputters.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31477,0,'Image of a Shadow Cultist'),(30835,3,0,'Look like, my lady? A vrykul, I suppose. They did not actually show him to me. Ever since The Shadow Vault....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31478,0,'Image of a Shadow Cultist'),(30835,4,0,'A name? Oh, yes, the name! I believe it was Iskalder.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31479,0,'Image of a Shadow Cultist'),(30835,5,0,'Right away, my lady.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,31480,0,'Image of a Shadow Cultist'),(30836,0,0,'Report.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31481,0,'Image of Vardmadra'),(30836,1,0,'Describe this vrykul. What does he look like?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31482,0,'Image of Vardmadra'),(30836,2,0,'I am not interested in excuses. Perhaps they gave you a name?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31483,0,'Image of Vardmadra'),(30836,3,0,'Iskalder?! You fool! Have you no idea who that is? He\'s only the greatest vrykul warrior who ever lived!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31484,0,'Image of Vardmadra'),(30836,4,0,'Return to Jotunheim and tell them to keep him asleep until I arrive. I will judge this vrykul with my own eyes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31485,0,'Image of Vardmadra'),(21502,0,0,'Doom Lord Kazzak will be pleased. You are to increase the pace of your attacks. Destroy the orcish and dwarven strongholds with all haste.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19150,0,'Razuun'),(21502,1,0,'Don\'t worry about that. I\'ve increased production at the Deathforge. You\'ll have all the infernals you need to carry out your orders. Don\'t fail, Jovaan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19151,0,'Razuun'),(21502,2,0,'Yes?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,19152,0,'Razuun'),(21502,3,0,'Crate? I didn\'t send you a crate, Jovaan. Don\'t you have more important things to worry about? Go see to them!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,19281,0,'Razuun'),(21633,0,0,'Everything is in readiness, warbringer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19274,0,'Jovaan'),(21633,1,0,'Warbringer, that will require the use of all the hold\'s infernals. It may leave us vulnerable to a counterattack.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19275,0,'Jovaan'),(21633,2,0,'It shall be as you say, warbringer. One last question, if I may...',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,19279,0,'Jovaan'),(21633,3,0,'What\'s in the crate?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,19280,0,'Jovaan'),(33273,0,0,'Are those winter hyacinths? For me?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33423,0,'Maiden of Drak\'Mar'),(33273,1,0,'It\'s been so long since a traveler has come here bearing flowers.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33424,0,'Maiden of Drak\'Mar'),(33273,2,0,'The lake has been too lonely these past years. The travelers stopped coming and evil came to these waters.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33425,0,'Maiden of Drak\'Mar'),(33273,3,0,'Your gift is a rare kindness, traveler. Please take this blade with my gratitude. Long ago, another traveler left it here, but I have little use for it.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33426,0,'Maiden of Drak\'Mar'),(29621,0,0,'How did you find me? Did Landgren tell?',12,0,100,0,0,14201,0,30281,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29621,1,0,'You thought I would just let you kill me?',12,0,100,0,0,14205,0,30279,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29621,2,0,'WHAT?! No matter. Even without my sphere, I will crush you! Behold my true identity and despair!',14,0,100,0,0,14207,0,30273,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29621,3,0,'AHAHAHAHAHA! Incompetence at its finest!',12,0,100,0,0,14821,0,30282,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29621,4,0,'Kirel narak! I am Mal\'Ganis. I AM ETERNAL!',14,0,100,0,0,14427,0,30276,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29621,5,0,'ENOUGH! I waste my time here. I must gather my strength on the homeworld.',14,0,100,0,0,14428,0,30277,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29621,6,0,'You\'ll never defeat the Lich King without my forces. I\'ll have my revenge... on him AND you!',14,0,100,0,0,14429,0,30278,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(26811,0,0,'I could sleep forever, mon....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26149,0,'Ancient Drakkari Warmonger'),(26811,0,1,'Finally, I can be restin\'...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26151,0,'Ancient Drakkari Warmonger'),(26811,0,2,'Free at last, mon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26148,0,'Ancient Drakkari Warmonger'),(26811,0,3,'Where\'s mah mummy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26150,0,'Ancient Drakkari Warmonger'),(26812,0,0,'I could sleep forever, mon....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26149,0,'Ancient Drakkari Soothsayer'),(26812,0,1,'Finally, I can be restin\'...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26151,0,'Ancient Drakkari Soothsayer'),(26812,0,2,'Free at last, mon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26148,0,'Ancient Drakkari Soothsayer'),(26812,0,3,'Where\'s mah mummy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26150,0,'Ancient Drakkari Soothsayer'),(24405,0,0,'Thank you!',12,0,100,17,0,0,0,37237,0,'Adarrah'),(26814,0,0,'Alright, kid. Stay behind me and you\'ll be fine.',12,0,100,60,0,0,0,26027,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,1,0,'Their ceremonial chamber, where I was to be sacrificed...',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,26028,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,2,0,'Time to put an end to all this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26029,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,3,0,'You\'re free to go, miss.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26057,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,4,0,'Odd. That usually does it.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,26030,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,5,0,'Just as well, I\'ve had enough of this place.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26053,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,6,0,'What\'s this?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26036,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,7,0,'Aww, not a snake!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26037,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,8,0,'Listen, kid. I can handle this thing. You just watch my back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26065,0,'Harrison Jones'),(26814,9,0,'See ya \'round, kid!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26066,0,'Harrison Jones'),(30395,0,0,'My brother, Stormhoof, was a far greater warrior than I. While I trained to be the chieftain of our clan, he prepared for a larger quest.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31151,0,'Chieftain Swiftspear'),(30395,1,0,'How could he be in danger? All he wanted was to give us power over the elements that made life harsh for us here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31152,0,'Chieftain Swiftspear'),(30395,2,0,'He sought an artifact... a horn, I think. He left the village on a long journey in search of it.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,31153,0,'Chieftain Swiftspear'),(30395,3,0,'I know that a terrible enemy pursued him after he won the horn, but I... I don\'t recall... what happened... next.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,31154,0,'Chieftain Swiftspear'),(30395,4,0,'It is as though my memories are shrouded in mist. I cannot even recall what became of my brother. Is this how you mean that he is in danger?',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,31155,0,'Chieftain Swiftspear'),(30395,5,0,'The disturbances in the tomb, they must be involved. Look around you, $n. Do you see them?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,31156,0,'Chieftain Swiftspear'),(30395,6,0,'Yes, they are at fault, but I am powerless to stop them. Will you warn the people of Tunka\'lo, stranger, that their past and their ancestors are in danger?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31157,0,'Chieftain Swiftspear'),(26593,0,0,'Perfect.  As long as you don\'t go hacking and slashing your way through, they\'ll never know the difference.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26606,0,'Serinar'),(10300,0,0,'Remember, I need your help to properly channel. I will ask you to aid me several times on our path, so please be ready.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7365,0,'Ranshalla SAY_QUEST_START'),(10300,1,0,'This blue light... It\'s strange. What do you think it means?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,7375,0,'Ranshalla SAY_ENTER_OWL_THICKET'),(10300,2,0,'We\'ve found it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7380,0,'Ranshalla SAY_REACH_TORCH_1'),(10300,2,1,'Please, light this while I am channeling.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7378,0,'Ranshalla SAY_REACH_TORCH_2'),(10300,2,2,'This is the place. Let\'s light it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7379,0,'Ranshalla SAY_REACH_TORCH_3'),(10300,3,0,'Let\'s find the next one.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7410,0,'Ranshalla SAY_AFTER_TORCH_1'),(10300,3,1,'We must continue on now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7411,0,'Ranshalla SAY_AFTER_TORCH_2'),(10300,4,0,'It is time for the final step; we must activate the altar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7385,0,'Ranshalla SAY_REACH_ALTAR_1'),(10300,5,0,'I will read the words carved into the stone, and you must find a way to light it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7386,0,'Ranshalla SAY_REACH_ALTAR_2'),(10300,6,0,'The altar is glowing! We have done it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7412,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_ALTAR_1'),(10300,7,0,'What is happening? Look!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7388,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_ALTAR_2'),(12116,8,0,'It has been many years...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7389,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_3'),(12116,9,0,'Who has disturbed the altar of the goddess?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7390,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_4'),(10300,10,0,'Please, priestesses, forgive us for our intrusion. We do not wish any harm here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7391,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_ALTAR_5'),(10300,11,0,'We only wish to know why the wildkin guard this area...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7392,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_ALTAR_6'),(12116,12,0,'Enu thora\'serador. This is a sacred place.\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7393,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_7'),(12116,13,0,'We will show you...\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7394,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_8'),(12116,14,0,'Look above you; thara dormil dorah... ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7413,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_9'),(12116,15,0,'This gem once allowed direct communication with Elune, herself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7414,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_10'),(12116,16,0,'Through the gem, Elune channeled her infinite wisdom...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7415,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_11'),(12116,17,0,'Realizing that the gem needed to be protected, we turned to the goddess herself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7417,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_12'),(12116,18,0,'Soon after, we began to have visions of a creature... A creature with the feathers of an owl, but the will and might of a bear...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7418,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_13'),(12116,19,0,'It was on that day that the wildkin were given to us. Fierce guardians, the goddess assigned the wildkin to protect all of her sacred places.\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7419,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_14'),(12152,20,0,'Anu\'dorini Talah. Ru shallora enudoril.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7416,0,'Voice of Elune SAY_VOICE_ALTAR_15'),(12116,21,0,'But now, many years later, the wildkin have grown more feral, and without the guidance of the goddess, they are confused...\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7422,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_16'),(12116,22,0,'Without a purpose, they wander... But many find their way back to the sacred areas that they once were sworn to protect.\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7424,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_17'),(12116,23,0,'Wildkin are inherently magical; this power was bestowed upon them by the goddess.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7427,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_18'),(12116,24,0,'Know that wherever you might find them in the world, they are protecting something of importance, as they were entrusted to do so long ago.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7428,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_19'),(12116,25,0,'Please, remember what we have shown you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7431,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_20'),(12116,26,0,'Farewell.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7432,0,'Priestess of Elune SAY_PRIESTESS_ALTAR_21'),(10300,27,0,'Thank you for your help, $n. I wish you well in your adventures. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7434,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_END_1'),(10300,28,0,'I want to stay here and reflect on what we have seen. Please see Erelas and tell him what we have learned.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7435,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_END_2'),(10300,29,0,'%s begins chanting a strange spell...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,7467,0,'Ranshalla EMOTE_CHANT_SPELL'),(9026,0,0,'I will be reborn, mortals! Incendius shall raise me from these ashes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5059,0,'Overmaster Pyron'),(1494,0,0,'Mmmh...I SMELL FOOD!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,731,0,'Negolash Yell on Summon'),(23577,4,0,'Whatchoo been doin\', pacin\' yourselves?',14,0,100,0,0,12025,0,24321,0,'Halazzi SAY_BERSERK'),(23577,3,1,'You gonna leave in pieces!',14,0,100,0,0,12024,0,23616,0,'Halazzi SAY_MELEE_2'),(23577,3,0,'Me gonna carve ya now!',14,0,100,0,0,12023,0,23615,0,'Halazzi SAY_MELEE_1'),(23577,2,0,'Spirit, come back to me!',14,0,100,0,0,12022,0,22964,0,'Halazzi SAY_MERGE'),(23577,1,0,'I fight wit\' untamed spirit....',14,0,100,0,0,12021,0,22963,0,'Halazzi SAY_SPLIT'),(23577,0,0,'Get on ya knees and bow.... to da fang and claw!',14,0,100,0,0,12020,0,23612,0,'Halazzi SAY_AGGRO'),(24239,0,0,'Da shadow gonna fall on you....',14,0,100,0,0,12041,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_AGGRO'),(24239,1,0,'Dis a nightmare ya don\' wake up from!',14,0,100,0,0,12043,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(24239,1,1,'Azzaga choogo zinn!',14,0,100,0,0,12044,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(24239,2,0,'Darkness comin\' for you...',14,0,100,0,0,12046,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_SPIRIT_BOLTS'),(24239,2,1,'Your soul gonna bleed!',14,0,100,0,0,12047,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_SPIRIT_BOLTS'),(24239,3,0,'Your will belong ta me now!',14,0,100,0,0,12045,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass -  SAY_SIPHON_SOUL'),(24239,4,0,'It not gonna make no difference.',14,0,100,0,0,12048,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_PET_DEATH'),(24239,4,2,'You gonna die worse dan him..',14,0,100,0,0,12049,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_PET_DEATH'),(24239,4,1,'Dat no bodda me.',14,0,100,0,0,12050,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_PET_DEATH'),(24239,5,0,'Dis not... da end for me!',14,0,100,0,0,12051,0,0,0,'Hex Lord Malacrass - SAY_DEATH'),(28303,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(28803,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(52958,0,0,'Ancients of Zandalar, grant dis one da power ta\' mock death itself!',14,14,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Hierophant'),(52958,0,1,'Ancients of Zandalar, grant dis one da ability ta\'mock death itself!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(100497,0,0,'You should have fled! Now I\'ll feed your bones to the storm crows!',14,0,100,0,0,58379,0,0,0,'Ursoc to Player'),(23863,0,0,'Everybody try to keep de Amani Empire down. Now we got friends. We wit de Zandalari now. We part of something bigger. You can\'t stop us all. De whole world gonna drown in blood!!',14,0,100,0,0,24231,0,0,0,'Daakara - SAY_INTRO'),(23863,1,0,'De Zandalari give us strength. Nobody push around de Amani no more!',14,0,100,0,0,24353,0,0,0,'Daakara - SAY_AGGRO'),(23863,2,0,'Got me some new tricks... like me brudda bear....',14,0,100,0,0,24226,0,23175,0,'Daakara - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(23863,2,1,'Lot more gonna fall like you!',14,0,100,0,0,24227,0,0,0,'Daakara - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(23863,2,2,'Oh, look you... dead.',14,0,100,0,0,24228,0,0,0,'Daakara - SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(23863,3,0,'Dere be no hidin\' from da eagle!',14,0,100,0,0,24225,0,23176,0,'Daakara - SAY_FIRE_BREATH'),(23863,4,0,'Let me introduce you to me new bruddas: fang and claw!',14,0,100,0,0,24220,0,23177,0,'Daakara - SAY_TRANSFORMS_BEAR'),(23863,5,0,'Ya don\' have to look to da sky to see da dragonhawk!',14,0,100,0,0,24224,0,23178,0,'Daakara - SAY_TRANSFORMS_EAGLE'),(23863,6,0,'Fire kill you just as quick!',14,0,100,0,0,24230,0,23179,0,'Daakara - SAY_TRANSFORMS_LYNX'),(23863,7,0,'Ya don\' have to look to da sky to see da dragonhawk!',14,0,100,0,0,24223,0,0,0,'Daakara - SAY_TRANSFORMS_DRAGONHAWK'),(23863,8,0,'Da Amani di chuka!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23181,0,'Daakara - SAY_ABSORBS_BEAR_SPIRIT'),(23863,9,0,'Mebbe me fall... but da Amani empire... never going to die.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23183,0,'Daakara - SAY_ABSORBS_EAGLE_SPIRIT'),(23863,10,0,'%s absorbs the essence of the lynx spirit!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Daakara - SAY_ABSORBS_LYNX_SPIRIT'),(23863,11,0,'%s absorbs the essence of the dragonhawk spirit!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Daakara - SAY_ABSORBS_DRAGONHAWK_SPIRIT'),(23863,12,0,'Mebbe me fall... but da Amani empire... never going to die.',14,0,100,0,0,24222,0,0,0,'Daakara - SAY_DEATH'),(23879,0,0,'%s shimmers and begins to fade away...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Amani Dragonhawk Spirit'),(23877,0,0,'%s shimmers and begins to fade away...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Amani Lynx Spirit'),(23878,0,0,'%s shimmers and begins to fade away...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Amani Bear Spirit'),(24374,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Amani\'shi Berserker'),(102681,0,0,'Peace is but a fleeting dream! Let the Nightmare reign!',14,0,100,0,0,58509,0,0,0,'Taerar'),(102679,2,0,'At last... the long dream comes.',14,0,100,0,0,58499,0,0,0,'Ysondre to Player'),(102679,1,0,'Come forth, dreamers... and claim your vengeance!',14,0,100,0,0,58500,0,0,0,'Ysondre to Player'),(102679,0,0,'The strands of life have been severed! The dreamers must be avenged!',14,0,100,0,0,58510,0,0,0,'Ysondre to Player'),(28918,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(29699,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(52962,0,0,'Ancients of Zandalar, mark \'dem for de black road.',14,14,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Archon'),(52962,0,1,'Ancients of Zandalar, grant dis one da ability ta\'mock death itself!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(23586,0,0,'Invaders! Sound the alarm!',14,0,100,0,0,12104,0,23109,0,'Amani\'shi Scout'),(24175,0,0,'Akil\'zon, the invaders approach!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Amani\'shi Lookout'),(28034,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(52956,0,0,'Ancestors be beside me, let \'dem hear yo\' voice!',14,14,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Juggernaut'),(28988,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(52956,0,1,'Ancients of Zandalar, grant dis one da ability ta\'mock death itself!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(23580,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(23597,0,0,'More intruders! Sound da alarm!',14,0,100,25,0,12104,0,23252,0,'Amani\'shi Guardian'),(24043,0,0,'A creature emerges from the shadows!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Amani Lynx'),(52939,0,0,'You kill the trollbear, mon? It be safe for me to make my way back now?',14,0,100,0,0,2850,0,0,0,'Hazlek'),(52939,1,0,'Hello out there. Anybody be hearin\' Hazlek?',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Hazlek'),(52939,2,0,'Hey! Don\'t ya be forgettin\' about Hazlek over here.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hazlek'),(52939,3,0,'I could be pickin\' this lock in my sleep. Just come an\' say when it be safe to make my escape.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hazlek'),(52945,0,0,'Dat be so much better. I be weak, but I remember hearin\' da Amani and da Zandalari talkin\' about treasure hidden in dis very room.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Kasha'),(52945,1,0,'Maybe it be in dis urn over here. Stand back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kasha'),(52945,2,0,'Hmm. Dat\'s not da one. Let\'s try one o\' da other vases.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Kasha'),(52945,3,0,'Dere be somethin\' in dat one. Go take look.',12,0,100,1,0,2871,0,0,0,'Kasha'),(52943,0,0,'My liberators! Come down and have a word wit\' Norkani.',14,0,100,0,0,12029,0,0,0,'Norkani'),(52943,1,0,'Norkani still be needin\' your help!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Norkani'),(52943,2,0,'At last, Norkani is free!',12,0,100,4,0,2871,0,0,0,'Norkani'),(52943,3,0,'Now, where have dey put Norkani\'s things?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Norkani'),(52943,4,0,'Stand clear....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Norkani'),(52943,5,0,'Please take dis. Norkani be havin\' no use for it.',12,0,100,66,0,6391,0,0,0,'Norkani'),(52941,0,0,'Don\'t be forgettin\' about me!',14,0,100,1,0,2850,0,0,0,'Bakkalzu'),(52941,1,0,'It be good to be free again!',12,0,100,4,0,2859,0,0,0,'Bakkalzu'),(52941,2,0,'Allow me ta show you something I discovered. Now where\'d I see dat satchel?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Bakkalzu'),(52941,3,0,'Help yourselves. It be suicide for a scout to walk around wit\' so much weighing me down.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Bakkalzu'),(52924,3,0,'Da Amani know we\'re here. Now is da time to attack! ',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Vol\'jin - SAY_INTRO_4'),(52924,2,0,'Hear me, Zandalari schemers... Da Darkspears and our allies will deny you rulership of da Amani!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Vol\'jin - SAY_INTRO_3'),(52924,1,0,'Da ritual to open da gates be requirin\' both of us to hit da gong together.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vol\'jin - SAY_INTRO_3'),(52924,0,0,'Follow me, $c. It be takin\' da both of us to open these gates.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vol\'jin - SAY_INTRO_1'),(28952,0,0,'I\'M FREE, LITTLE DRAKKARI. TIME TO PAY FOR YOUR MANY TRESSPASSES!',14,0,100,33,0,771,0,29177,0,'Akali'),(28996,0,0,'Enough!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,31126,0,'Prophet of Akali'),(28996,1,0,'And now, Akali, my master will have your blood and I will take some of your power as well!',14,0,100,397,0,0,0,29180,0,'Prophet of Akali'),(28996,2,0,'It is done. Run back to your masters. Run back to Har\'koa. Tell her that I am coming!',14,0,100,14,0,0,0,29183,0,'Prophet of Akali'),(28401,1,0,'No, not Akali too!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29237,0,'Har\'koa'),(29021,0,0,'And yet we see only doom in your future. It is your destiny that you do this, $n, but we fear that the prophet is too powerful for you and your friends. Still, you must try.',12,0,100,0,0,12196,0,29236,0,'Akil\'zon'),(29022,0,0,'Once more we hear your call, Khufu. We have wisdom for you and $n. You face great peril and must act swiftly or you all and Har\'koa will die.',12,0,100,0,0,643,0,29233,0,'Halazzi'),(29023,0,0,'The gusty essence of deceased Quetz\'lun\'s wardens must be gathered to draw him near. To Har\'koa must both of these rarities be delivered.',12,0,100,0,0,9919,0,29235,0,'Jana\'lai'),(29024,0,0,'The unblemished heart of the guardian must be secured to show defiance and strength. Jealous Zim\'Rhuk keeps those who harbor it.',12,0,100,0,0,473,0,29234,0,'Nalorakk'),(28215,9,0,'Time for more smart Dajik tip! Lot of dead things mean lot of chance of being dead thing. Dajik leaving now.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28167,0,'Dajik'),(28215,8,1,'Huh... where are we? This not right. I not tell you find hardknuckles, did I?',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,28140,0,'Dajik'),(28215,8,0,'If you here to poke more softknuckles, Dajik going to poke you too. That a bad Goregek habit.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,28139,0,'Dajik'),(28215,7,2,'Something big make pillars and crystals and everything. Frenzyheart not care much cause it not here anymore.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28194,0,'Dajik'),(28215,7,1,'Time for more smart Dajik tip! Crystals work little too good for back scratch. No try.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28191,0,'Dajik'),(28215,7,0,'Sometimes big-tongues try to come get crystals. Not now because they not like it when we kill them.',12,0,34,0,0,0,0,28192,0,'Dajik'),(28215,6,0,'This not first queen slain by Frenzyheart. Seem like there always more.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28160,0,'Dajik'),(28215,5,0,'Dajik\'s last learner eaten by sand-thing. We do better this time though!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28164,0,'Dajik'),(28215,4,0,'No! You killed queen thing! What have you... wait, nevermind. Sorry, that okay.',12,0,100,0,7000,0,0,28161,0,'Dajik'),(28215,3,4,'Time for more smart Dajik tip! Try not to catch stinger with face. Not work so much.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28185,0,'Dajik'),(28215,3,3,'Drone things not as tough as they look. Wasp things a bit nastier.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28187,0,'Dajik'),(28215,3,2,'In case you wonder, wasp sting not feel so good. No need to try.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28190,0,'Dajik'),(28215,3,1,'Time for more smart Dajik tip! Try not to catch stinger with face. Not work so much.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28185,0,'Dajik'),(28215,3,0,'Seem like there more wasps every time Dajik come back. Why they not run out?',12,0,20,0,0,14212,0,28189,0,'Dajik'),(28215,2,4,'Time for more smart Dajik tip! Make sure thing dead before reach in mouth for loots.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28177,0,'Dajik'),(28215,2,3,'I was going draw picture of best attack plan... but you have my chalk.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28186,0,'Dajik'),(28215,2,2,'Dajik not think he seen you eat anything. You eat sometimes, yeah?',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28183,0,'Dajik'),(28215,2,1,'Make sure you not forget anything. I forgot stuff once.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28143,0,'Dajik'),(28215,2,0,'We came for something, yes? Can\'t remember.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28188,0,'Dajik'),(28215,1,4,'Not sure how thing got here. Not matter if dead though.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28163,0,'Dajik'),(28215,1,2,'Hah! Maybe you learn a little after all!',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28159,0,'Dajik'),(28215,1,3,'Yes! Stab few more time just in case! Stab good!',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28162,0,'Dajik'),(28215,1,1,'Did you see face? Looked so scared, \"Ah, big thing going to smash me!\" Hah.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28181,0,'Dajik'),(28215,1,0,'Get the stuff off of body! Dajik hate it when he go skin something and there stuff in the way. So annoying.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28179,0,'Dajik'),(28215,0,7,'Oh! Dajik has idea! Make chicken sounds and maybe they come to you!',12,0,13,0,0,0,0,28174,0,'Dajik'),(28215,0,6,'I placed most of the spikes. Good amount of pointiness I think. You like?',12,0,13,0,0,0,0,28144,0,'Dajik'),(28215,0,5,'Time for more smart Dajik tip! If Goregek let chickens out again, make Goregek get chickens back again.',12,0,13,0,0,0,0,28171,0,'Dajik'),(28215,0,4,'Maybe you not notice, chicken move kind of fast.',12,0,13,0,0,0,0,28172,0,'Dajik'),(28215,0,3,'There reason Frenzyheart not chase back chickens. Look kind of dumb to lose to chicken.',12,0,12,0,0,0,0,28173,0,'Dajik'),(28215,0,2,'Let\'s just eat bristlepine instead, okay? All done with chasing.',12,0,12,0,0,0,0,28176,0,'Dajik'),(28215,0,1,'Lot of strong Frenzyheart here. Dajik taught most of them. First time I teach something like you though. You not a Frenzyheart, you know.',12,0,12,0,0,0,0,28145,0,'Dajik'),(28215,0,0,'Frenzyheart came here not long ago for new home... big-tongue homes pretty nice, so we maybe take those too. They ugly anyway.',12,0,12,0,0,0,0,28141,0,'Dajik'),(28214,5,0,'Frenzyheart feed Kartak big-tongues so Kartak not eat us. That why we smarter than you, slave thing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27981,0,'Goregek'),(28214,4,0,'Hah! Goregek the greatest hunter ever! Goregek get biggest hardknuckle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28057,0,'Goregek'),(28214,3,7,'There was hundreds of times these hardknuckles before Goregek.',12,0,12,0,0,0,0,27990,0,'Goregek'),(28214,3,6,'Get out of way silly slave thing! Goregek\'s kill!',12,0,12,0,0,0,0,28056,0,'Goregek'),(28214,3,5,'Better not get in Goregek\'s way!',12,0,12,0,0,0,0,27993,0,'Goregek'),(28214,3,4,'You just watch slave thing, Goregek take care of these hardknuckles!',12,0,12,0,0,0,0,27992,0,'Goregek'),(28214,3,3,'Run away softknuckle! Goregek gonna get you!',12,0,13,0,0,0,0,28069,0,'Goregek'),(28214,3,2,'Run away dumb softknuckle! We gonna poke you more!',12,0,13,0,0,0,0,28071,0,'Goregek'),(28214,3,1,'Hardknuckles still walk on hands... seem kind of dumb to Goregek.',12,0,13,0,0,0,0,27991,0,'Goregek'),(28214,3,0,'Careful slave thing, the big bad softnuckles might eat you! Hah!',12,0,13,0,0,0,0,27995,0,'Goregek'),(28214,2,3,'You just get yourself beat up! Hah! You so dumb, slave thing.',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,27994,0,'Goregek'),(28214,2,2,'Pitch was weakling anyway... why else you think Goregek not bother with him?',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,27969,0,'Goregek'),(28214,2,1,'Elder maybe says other stuff, but you always be slave thing to Goregek.',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,27965,0,'Goregek'),(28214,2,0,'Why Goregek even bring you. You useless.',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28015,0,'Goregek'),(28214,1,6,'That how it done, slave thing. Maybe you figure out how someday.',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,28058,0,'Goregek'),(28214,1,5,'Frenzyheart the strongest!',12,0,15,0,0,0,0,27983,0,'Goregek'),(28214,1,4,'Squeal! Squeal! So good!',12,0,15,0,0,0,0,28068,0,'Goregek'),(28214,1,3,'I stabbed it in the face! Goregek so good.',12,0,15,0,0,0,0,28012,0,'Goregek'),(28214,1,2,'Next time, maybe Goregek let you try.',12,0,15,0,0,0,0,28016,0,'Goregek'),(28214,1,1,'Hah! Goregek\'s kill!',12,0,15,0,0,0,0,28009,0,'Goregek'),(28214,1,0,'Goregek best hunter... ever.',12,0,15,0,0,0,0,28011,0,'Goregek'),(28214,0,5,'You wait until Goregek ready.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,27987,0,'Goregek'),(28214,0,6,'You wait, slave thing. Goregek eating.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28062,0,'Goregek'),(28214,0,4,'Gorgek gonna catch chicken good!',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28065,0,'Goregek'),(28214,0,2,'Goregek go get drink. You sit in corner til Goregek ready.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,27985,0,'Goregek'),(28214,0,3,'Goregek hungry. Go get on fire spit, slave thing. Tell Goregek when you well roasted.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,27986,0,'Goregek'),(28214,0,1,'Goregek get some sleep. Go bring foodstuffs back, slave thing.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,27988,0,'Goregek'),(28214,0,0,'Home! You better have brought back meat for Goregek, slave.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,27984,0,'Goregek'),(28122,5,0,'This fight\'s all yours!',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,28873,0,'Moodle'),(28122,6,0,'It\'s a small comfort to see that they haven\'t brought any back in undeath.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28400,0,'Moodle'),(28122,4,5,'Where are they dragging those bodies? What are they doing to them?',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28398,0,'Moodle'),(28122,4,3,'It\'s hard to believe any of them survived this.',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,28399,0,'Moodle'),(28122,4,4,'There are more that might still be alive! We need to keep moving.',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28397,0,'Moodle'),(28122,4,2,'It\'s good to see some of the mosswalker were more resilient than I thought.',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,28402,0,'Moodle'),(28122,4,1,'I know I talk down to them, but I never want to see any of my people die.',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,28401,0,'Moodle'),(28122,4,0,'The Mosswalkers were good people... they did not deserve this.',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,28382,0,'Moodle'),(28122,3,2,'Here I am, brain the size of a planet, and they ask me to take you to the other village. Call that job satisfaction? \'Cause I don\'t.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28396,0,'Moodle'),(28122,3,1,'Planning to sit on your butt some more, or are we going to go do something that\'s actually useful?',12,0,34,0,0,0,0,28394,0,'Moodle'),(28122,3,0,'Going to go take a nap? I apologize in advance for accidentally stepping on your face while you sleep.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28395,0,'Moodle'),(28122,2,1,'Yeah, let\'s go now.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28391,0,'Moodle'),(28122,2,2,'I\'m done here.',12,0,34,0,0,0,0,28392,0,'Moodle'),(28122,2,0,'There some reason why we\'re still here? I\'d love to hear it.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28393,0,'Moodle'),(28122,1,1,'Another falls to our onslaught.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,28384,0,'Moodle'),(28122,1,0,'I can\'t believe... they\'re all... dead.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,28377,0,'Moodle'),(28122,0,3,'Yay... more dirt.',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28363,0,'Moodle'),(28122,0,2,'Hey... maybe we\'ll find some more useless bugs.',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28365,0,'Moodle'),(28122,0,0,'What the heck are shiny rabbits doing here anyway?',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28366,0,'Moodle'),(28122,0,1,'Here I am, digging up some useless bauble from the ground at the will of someone I just recently met... does that seem right to you?',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28368,0,'Moodle'),(28121,5,0,'Tartek no match for you! You got the skills. Yeah!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28315,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,4,2,'Time to hide puppy-men! We coming for you... better get in your hill things!',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28353,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,4,1,'Teach you to steal our treasures! Our treasures are... ours, okay?!',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28317,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,4,0,'We know you have dragon thing! We not scared! We going to get you and dragon thing!',12,0,34,0,0,0,0,28352,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,3,2,'Home home home... place of the shinies!',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28339,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,3,1,'Great Ones keep home safe because they like Oracles I think! They know we good and nice.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28344,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,2,5,'Lets go jump off tree! Fun fun!',12,0,15,0,0,0,0,28341,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,3,0,'Chase the hatchlings! Chase the hatchlings! So fast!',12,0,34,0,0,0,0,28342,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,2,4,'Misty. Very misty. Seem sort of misty to you? Maybe not so much.',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28327,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,2,3,'Hello! You\'re pretty strong and nice and stuff. I like you. Lets stay friends, okay?',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28921,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,2,1,'Ever trip over own feet? We have. Kind of hurt. No do it, not fun. Nope.',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28920,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,2,2,'Want us to help with something? What we help with? We good at helping.',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28922,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,2,0,'Mistcaller really good at controlling weather with shrine. They know just which crystals to use! Really good!',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28330,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,1,2,'Killing Spree!',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28334,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,1,1,'Vic...tor...ious! Dun nun nun dun da da!',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28338,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,1,0,'You like that? Bet not! Bet not cause you dead! Hahah!',12,0,34,0,0,0,0,28332,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,0,3,'We are fast digger! Really fast! See... all done! That was fast, huh?',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28309,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,0,2,'Can never have too many shiny crystals! Nope!',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28310,0,'Jaloot'),(28121,0,1,'More treasures! Treasures of all kinds! Yay treasures!',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28307,0,'Jaloot'),(28120,4,0,'Hiss... hiss... dead. All dead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28279,0,'Lafoo'),(28121,0,0,'Shiny things! Shiny things! Not as shiny as my crystal, but still shiny!',12,0,25,0,0,0,0,28308,0,'Jaloot'),(28120,3,0,'Home good, but not stay long! More adventures!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28340,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,2,4,'You got funny looking eyeballs.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28286,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,2,3,'Never met Great Ones. Nope, just met their shrines.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28289,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,2,2,'Big comfy tree. Good home.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28290,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,2,1,'You have pie? Someone gave us pie year ago. Really yummy.',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28306,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,1,0,'No come back this time!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28277,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,2,0,'One day maybe you can be Soo-dryskin. Like?',12,0,20,0,0,0,0,28293,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,0,4,'Crunchy bugs so delicious. Want?',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28291,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,0,5,'That weird. Someone took our bugs. You have maybe?',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28303,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,0,3,'Dig, dig, dig...',12,0,16,0,0,0,0,28266,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,0,2,'Treasure for Lafoo! Treasure for shrine!',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,28265,0,'Lafoo'),(28120,0,1,'Maybe more shiny bugs! We like bugs!',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,28267,0,'Lafoo'),(2812