na'),(33437,0,0,'We will hold until the reinforcements come. As long as men with stout hearts are manning the walls and the throne, Stormwind will hold.',12,0,100,274,0,15585,0,33670,0,'King Llane'),(33441,0,0,'Your resilience is admirable.',12,0,100,0,0,15598,0,33608,0,'The Lich King'),(33441,1,0,'I will break you... as I broke him!',12,0,100,0,0,15599,0,33609,0,'The Lich King'),(33442,0,0,'Arrrrrrgh!',14,0,100,0,0,15470,0,33610,0,'Immolated Champion'),(33442,1,0,'I\'m not afraid of you!',12,0,100,0,0,15471,0,33611,0,'Immolated Champion'),(33523,0,0,'It is done. All have given that which must be given. I now seal the Dragon Soul forever.',12,0,100,0,0,15631,0,33656,0,'Neltharion'),(33523,1,0,'For it to be as it must, yes.',12,0,100,273,0,15632,0,33659,0,'Neltharion'),(33495,0,0,'That terrible glow... should that be?',12,0,100,0,0,15702,0,33658,0,'Ysera'),(33535,0,0,'It is a weapon like no other. It must be like no other.',12,0,100,1,0,15610,0,33660,0,'Malygos'),(33552,0,0,'A thousand deaths....',12,0,100,0,0,15762,0,33616,0,'Yogg-Saron'),(33552,1,0,'Your petty quarrels only make me stronger.',12,0,100,0,0,15764,0,34188,0,'Yogg-Saron'),(33552,2,0,'Yrr n\'lyeth... shuul anagg!',12,0,100,0,0,15766,0,33628,0,'Yogg-Saron'),(33552,3,0,'He will learn... no king rules forever; only death is eternal!',12,0,100,0,0,15767,0,33629,0,'Yogg-Saron'),(33552,4,0,'His brood learned their lesson before too long. You will soon learn yours!',12,0,100,0,0,15765,0,33663,0,'Yogg-Saron'),(33241,0,0,'As you wish, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34417,0,'Freya (Observation Ring) - On Gossip Select'),(33241,1,0,'Eonar, your servant calls for your blessing!',14,0,100,0,0,15535,0,34367,0,'Freya (Observation Ring) - On Gossip Select'),(33213,0,0,'As you wish, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34417,0,'Hodir (Observation Ring) - On Gossip Select'),(33213,1,0,'The veil of winter will protect you, champions!',14,0,100,0,0,15559,0,34366,0,'Hodir (Observation Ring) - On Gossip Select'),(33242,0,0,'As you wish, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34417,0,'Thorim (Observation Ring) - On Gossip Select'),(33242,1,0,'Golganneth, lend me your strength! Grant my mortal allies the power of thunder!',14,0,100,0,0,15750,0,34369,0,'Thorim (Observation Ring) - On Gossip Select'),(33244,0,0,'As you wish, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34417,0,'Mimiron (Observation Ring) - On Gossip Select'),(33244,1,0,'Combat matrix enhanced. Behold wonderous rapidity!',14,0,100,0,0,15630,0,34368,0,'Mimiron (Observation Ring) - On Gossip Select'),(32236,1,1,'Not a sentry!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32635,0,'Dark Subjugator'),(32236,1,2,'You\'ve got it all wrong. I\'m a subjugator!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32636,0,'Dark Subjugator'),(32414,0,0,'You\'ve come to address the men, sir?',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,32823,0,'Lordaeron Captain'),(32443,0,0,'Rise, Sindragosa!  Rise and lead the Frostbrood into war!',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,32874,0,'Lich King'),(32588,0,0,'Prepare to die!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,32912,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(26648,8,0,'Now swim back with the knowledge I have granted you. Do what you can for them, $r.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,25870,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,9,0,'Very well, $n, you have failed to act. The prophecy is not yours to learn. Do not call upon me again until you have found your backbone!',14,0,100,33,0,11557,0,25866,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,7,0,'Tell the mystic that his people are to stand and fight alongside the Horde and Alliance against the forces of Malygos and the Lich King.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,25869,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,6,0,'Simply put, you must tell the tuskarr that they cannot run. If they do so, their spirits will be destroyed by the evil rising within Northrend.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,25868,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,5,0,'Well done, $n. Your display of respect is duly noted. Now, I have information for you that you must convey to the Kalu\'ak.',14,0,100,33,0,11557,0,25867,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,4,0,'I\'m rather curious as to what will happen, should you ignore this and NOT jump into the water.',14,0,100,33,0,11557,0,0,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,3,0,'Though you are compelled, the choice, and the last step before you leap, are yours. You have twenty more seconds to decide.',14,0,100,33,0,11557,0,25865,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,2,0,'I will lay a mild compulsion upon you. Jump into the depths before me so that you put yourself into my element and thereby display your submission.',14,0,100,33,0,11557,0,25864,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,1,0,'I sense uncertainty in you, and I do not trust it whether you are with them, or not. If you wish my augury for the Kalu\'ak, you will have to prove yourself first.',14,0,100,33,0,11557,0,25863,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(26648,0,0,'Little $n, why do you call me forth? Are you working with the trolls of this land? Have you come to kill me and take my power as your own?',14,0,100,33,0,11557,0,25854,0,'Oacha\'noa'),(30299,0,0,'You didn\'t think that I was going to let you walk in here and take the Heart of the Storm, did you?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,30972,0,'Overseer Narvir'),(30299,1,0,'You may have killed Valduran, but that will not stop me from completing the colossus.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30973,0,'Overseer Narvir'),(37226,3,0,'Foolish girl. You seek that which I killed long ago. He is merely a ghost now. A faint echo in my mind... ',14,0,100,0,0,17229,0,37617,0,'Lich King SAY_LK_JAINA_INTRO_END'),(37226,4,0,'I will not make the same mistake again, Sylvanas. This time there will be no escape. You will all serve me in death!',14,0,100,0,0,17228,0,37616,0,'Lich King SAY_LK_SYLVANAS_INTRO_END'),(36723,0,0,'You are not worthy to face the Lich King!',14,0,100,0,0,16921,0,38664,0,'general SAY_AGGRO'),(36723,1,0,'Master, I have failed...',14,0,100,0,0,16922,0,36921,0,'general SAY_DEATH'),(36954,3,0,'Succumb to the chill of the grave.',14,0,100,0,0,17218,0,37175,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_WALL_02'),(36954,2,0,'There is no escape!',14,0,100,0,0,17217,0,37177,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_WALL_01'),(36954,1,0,'I will not make the same mistake again, Sylvanas. This time there will be no escape. You will all serve me in death!',14,0,100,0,0,17213,0,37173,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_AGGRO_H'),(30824,0,0,'FIRE! FIRE!',14,0,100,0,0,16732,0,38681,0,'Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar - Fire'),(36955,0,0,'He is too powerful. We must leave this place at once! My magic can hold him in place for only a short time. Come quickly, heroes!',14,0,100,1,0,16644,0,36821,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_AGGRO'),(36955,1,0,'I will destroy this barrier. You must hold the undead back!',14,0,100,0,0,16607,0,38536,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_WALL_01'),(36955,2,0,'Another ice wall! Keep the undead from interrupting my incantations so that I may bring this wall down.',14,0,100,0,0,16608,0,38537,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_WALL_02'),(36955,3,0,'He is toying with us! I will show him what happens to ice when it meets fire!',14,0,100,0,0,16609,0,0,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_WALL_03'),(36955,4,0,'Your barriers can\'t hold us back much longer, monster! I will shatter them all!',14,0,100,0,0,16610,0,38539,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_WALL_04'),(36955,5,0,'There\'s an opening up ahead. GO NOW!',14,0,100,1,0,16645,0,38551,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_ESCAPE_01'),(36955,6,0,'We\'re almost there... Don\'t give up!',14,0,100,0,0,16646,0,38538,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_ESCAPE_02'),(36955,7,0,'It... It\'s a dead end. We have no choice but to fight. Steel yourselves, heroes, for this is our last stand!',14,0,100,1,0,16647,0,36992,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_TRAP'),(36955,8,0,'Forgive me, heroes. I should have listened to Uther. I... I just had to see for myself. To look into his eyes one last time. I am sorry.',14,0,100,1,0,16648,0,36990,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_FINAL_2'),(36955,9,0,'We now know what must be done. I will deliver this news to King Varian and Highlord Fordring.',14,0,100,1,0,16649,0,36991,0,'Jaina SAY_JAINA_FINAL_3'),(37554,0,0,'He\'s... too powerful. Heroes, quickly... come to me! We must leave this place at once! I will do what I can to hold him in place while we flee.',14,0,100,0,0,17058,0,37168,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_AGGRO'),(37554,1,0,'No wall can hold the Banshee Queen. Keep the undead at bay, heroes. I will tear this barrier down!',14,0,100,0,0,17029,0,38540,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_WALL_01'),(37554,2,0,'Another barrier? Stand strong, champions. I will bring the wall down.',14,0,100,0,0,17030,0,38541,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_WALL_02'),(37554,3,0,'I grow tired of these games, Arthas! Your walls can\'t stop me!',14,0,100,0,0,17031,0,38542,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_WALL_03'),(37554,4,0,'You won\'t impede our escape, fiend! Keep the undead off me while I bring this barrier down.',14,0,100,0,0,17032,0,38543,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_WALL_04'),(37554,5,0,'There\'s an opening up ahead. GO NOW!',14,0,100,1,0,17059,0,38551,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_ESCAPE_01'),(37554,6,0,'We\'re almost there... Don\'t give up!',14,0,100,0,0,17060,0,38538,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_ESCAPE_02'),(37554,7,0,'BLASTED DEAD END! So this is how it ends. Prepare yourselves, heroes, for today we make our final stand!',14,0,100,5,0,17061,0,37170,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_TRAP'),(37554,8,0,'We are safe... for now. His strength has increased tenfold since our last battle. It will take a mighty army to destroy the Lich King. An army greater than even the Horde can rouse.',14,0,100,1,0,17062,0,37171,0,'Sylvanas SAY_SYLVANA_FINAL_2'),(36954,7,0,'Minions, sieze them.  Bring their corpses back to me.',14,0,100,0,0,17222,0,38670,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_ABON'),(36954,4,0,'Another dead end.',14,0,100,0,0,17219,0,37176,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_WALL_03'),(36954,5,0,'How long can you fight it?',14,0,100,0,0,17220,0,38668,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_WALL_04'),(29542,0,0,'I will not die so quickly this time!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32624,0,''),(29560,0,0,'Well done. Let\'s get this over with.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30223,0,''),(29560,1,0,'Come, Landgren, cough up your soul so that I can ask you a very important question.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30231,0,''),(29560,2,0,'YOU WILL TELL ME WHERE WESTWIND IS OR I WILL DESTROY YOUR SOUL!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,30241,0,''),(29560,3,0,'Then you leave me no choice. I won\'t say that I won\'t enjoy this.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30244,0,''),(29560,4,0,'Very well. Tell me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30246,0,''),(29560,5,0,'A hidden hollow? How very interesting. You\'ve served your purpose, Landgren, but I\'m afraid there\'ll be no resurrection for you this time!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,30248,0,''),(29560,6,0,'Now that the unpleasantness is finished with, let\'s talk about you dealing with Grand Admiral Westwind.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,30251,0,''),(29572,0,0,'You\'ll get nothing out of me, monster. I am beyond your ability to influence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30242,0,''),(29572,1,0,'No.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30243,0,''),(29572,2,0,'STOP! It isn\'t worth it. I\'ll tell you where he is.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30245,0,''),(29572,3,0,'On the south end of the island is a cave -- a hidden hollow. The grand admiral has holed himself up in there, preparing for the final battle against the Lich King.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30247,0,''),(29572,4,0,'AAAEEEEIIIiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii........................................',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30250,0,''),(27435,3,0,'3...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24593,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27435,4,0,'2...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24594,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27435,5,0,'1...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24595,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(29919,2,0,'What is this?!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30711,0,'Thane'),(29919,3,0,'My answer? Here\'s my answer, little messenger!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30713,0,'Thane'),(29919,4,0,'I will feed you to the dogs!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30499,0,'Thane'),(30924,0,0,'Now fight me, $n! Kill Iskalder!',14,0,100,0,0,1167,0,31540,0,'Possessed Iskalder'),(30945,0,0,'Iskalder, there you are. What is this? Engaged in battle already?',14,0,100,457,0,13824,0,31528,0,'Vardmadra'),(30945,1,0,'NO! How is this possible?',14,0,100,457,0,13825,0,31530,0,'Vardmadra'),(30945,2,0,'I know not how this was possible, but you must still be judged Iskalder. Wait... what is this?',14,0,100,457,0,13824,0,31531,0,'Vardmadra'),(30945,3,0,'Stay away from me creature! Do not touch me!',14,0,100,0,0,1168,0,31533,0,'Vardmadra to Nightswood'),(30945,4,0,'Ahahahahahaha! It is done. Return to my cave. We have much to discuss!',14,0,100,457,0,1167,0,31534,0,'Vardmadra to '),(30955,0,0,'This? This is me taking control of you. This is me setting up my final revenge!',14,0,100,457,0,13824,0,31532,0,'Lady Nightswood'),(27455,0,0,'Captain, why are the guards not at their posts?',12,0,100,6,0,12725,0,26714,0,'Prince Arthas'),(27455,1,0,'Uther had my troops recalled? Damn it! If my warriors abandon me, I\'ll never defeat Mal\'Ganis. The ships must be burned before the men reach the shore!\n',12,0,100,5,0,12726,0,26716,0,'Prince Arthas'),(27455,2,0,'Burned down to their frames! No one goes home until our job here is done!\n',12,0,100,15,0,12727,0,26718,0,'Prince Arthas'),(27455,3,0,'Spare me, Muradin. You weren\'t there to see what Mal\'Ganis did to my homeland.\n',12,0,100,1,0,12728,0,26732,0,'Prince Arthas'),(27455,4,0,'Behold, Muradin, our salvation, Frostmourne.\n',12,0,100,1,0,12729,0,27207,0,'Prince Arthas'),(27455,5,0,'I would gladly bear any curse to save my homeland.\n',12,0,100,1,0,12730,0,27211,0,'Prince Arthas'),(27455,6,0,'Damn the men! Nothing shall prevent me from having my revenge, old friend. Not even you.\n',12,0,100,5,0,12731,0,27214,0,'Prince Arthas'),(27455,7,0,'Now, I call out to the spirits of this place. I will give anything or pay any price, if only you will help me save my people.\n',12,0,100,396,0,12732,0,27215,0,'Prince Arthas'),(27480,0,0,'Isn\'t that a bit much, lad?\n',12,0,100,6,0,12733,0,26717,0,'Muradin'),(27480,1,0,'You lied to your men and betrayed the mercenaries who fought for you. What\'s happening to you, Arthas? Is vengeance all that\'s important to you?\n',12,0,100,1,0,12734,0,26731,0,'Muradin'),(27480,2,0,'Hold, lad. There\'s an inscription on the dais. It\'s a warning. It says, \"Whomsoever takes up this blade shall wield power eternal. Just as the blade rends flesh, so must power scar the spirit.\" Oh, I should\'ve known. The blade is cursed! Let\'s get the hell out of here!\n',12,0,100,0,0,12735,0,27209,0,'Muradin'),(27480,3,0,'Leave it be, Arthas. Forget this business and lead your men home.\n',12,0,100,396,0,12736,0,27212,0,'Muradin'),(27480,4,0,'O\' my head... Wh... Where am I?\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27217,0,'Muradin'),(27480,5,0,'Who... Who am I?\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27218,0,'Muradin'),(27851,0,0,'The walls of Frostmourne Cavern shudder and shake.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,27196,0,'Thel\'zan Spell Dummy'),(21293,0,0,'Hide! Hide before they see you! Back up!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,19180,0,'Borak'),(21293,1,0,'The time to strike is at hand. Terminate Icarius.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,19181,0,'Borak'),(21293,2,0,'You have it. Do not lose it again!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,19183,0,'Borak'),(21410,0,0,'What is it, my lord?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,19172,0,'Zarath'),(21410,1,0,'My lord, surely you do not expect me to leave you unattended. Lord Illidan would have my head if anything were to happen to you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19174,0,'Zarath'),(21410,2,0,'As you wish, my lord.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,19176,0,'Zarath'),(21409,0,0,'Halt!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19511,0,'Icarius'),(21409,1,0,'Zarath you must return to the Black Temple at once! I... I seem to have misplaced Lord Illidan\'s orders. Quickly!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,19173,0,'Icarius'),(21409,2,0,'Zarath, I am perfectly capable of making it up this road to Eclipse Point. If we do not deliver the missive, Lord Illidan will have both of our heads! You are dismissed!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19175,0,'Icarius'),(21409,3,0,'Ah, sweet, sweet bloodthistle... Probably left behind by one of those filthy addicts at Eclipse Point.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19177,0,'Icarius'),(21409,4,0,'Their loss is most definitely my gain...',12,0,100,275,0,0,0,19178,0,'Icarius'),(21409,5,0,'%s puts the bundle of bloodthistle in his robe.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,19179,0,'Icarius'),(21409,6,0,'Ah, damn it all! Clever trap. Too bad you\'ll never live to tell the tale...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19184,0,'Icarius'),(30409,1,2,'I\'ll kill you little one and then I will add your body parts to what we\'re creating!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31104,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(30409,0,0,'You\'ve come for the doctor\'s plans! You\'ll only find death!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31119,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(30409,1,0,'I will never give you the information you seek!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31095,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(30409,1,1,'You waste my time. I will tell you nothing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31098,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(25729,0,0,'This is it, $n. The start of the end of the world. And you\'re here to see it off...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24909,0,'Shadowstalker Getry'),(25729,1,0,'Let\'s go...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24910,0,'Shadowstalker Getry'),(25729,2,0,'I... I can\'t believe it... Saurfang... I... I am honored... honored to have fought along side you, sir.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24933,0,'Shadowstalker Getry'),(25729,3,0,'You should return to Warsong Hold now, friend. Hellscream will surely want to hear of what just happened here... of Saurfang...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24934,0,'Shadowstalker Getry'),(25618,0,0,'Is this it? Is this all the mighty Horde could muster?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,24911,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,1,0,'Pathetic.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,24912,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,2,0,'I\'ve never understood your type. The hero...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24913,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,3,0,'Why won\'t you just let go? Why do you fight the inevitable?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,24914,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,4,0,'The Lich King cannot be stopped. Accept it.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,24915,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,5,0,'This world is coming to an end. Let. It. Burn.',12,0,100,397,0,0,0,24916,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,6,0,'Take $g him:her; away and prepare $g him:her; for reanimation.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24917,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,7,0,'What\'s this now?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24921,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,8,0,'Then you are a fool.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,24926,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,9,0,'You? A lone orc? Against me and...',12,0,100,397,0,0,0,24928,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,10,0,'RISE!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24929,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25618,11,0,'I will reanimate them all as servants of the Lich King! Bring them here...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24836,0,'Varidus the Flenser'),(25751,0,0,'I\'ll rip your shriveled heart out with my bare hands before any harm comes to $n, necromancer.',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24918,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25751,1,0,'You were never alone, $n.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24919,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25751,2,0,'This world that you seek to destroy is our home.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24920,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25751,3,0,'We will fight you with every fiber of our being - until we are nothing more than dust and debris. We will fight until the end.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24924,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25751,4,0,'A fool who is about to end you, necrolord. There will be nothing left of you for the Lich King to reanimate!',12,1,100,397,0,0,0,24927,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25751,5,0,'%s\'s eyes glow red for a brief moment.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11563,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25751,6,0,'Is that the best you can do?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13130,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25751,7,0,'You\'ll make no mention of me. Either of you!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24938,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(29881,0,0,'They are coming for you.',15,0,100,0,0,14376,0,30483,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,1,'Give in to your fear.',15,0,100,0,0,14377,0,30484,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,2,'Kill them all... before they kill you.',15,0,100,0,0,14378,0,30485,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,3,'They have turned against you. Now... take your revenge.',15,0,100,0,0,14379,0,30486,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,4,'Tell yourself again that these are not truly your friends.',15,0,100,0,0,14380,0,30487,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,5,'There is no escape. Not in this life. Not in the next.',15,0,100,0,0,14381,0,30488,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,6,'You are a pawn of forces unseen.',15,0,100,0,0,14382,0,30489,0,'An Unknown V