,'Amphitheater Vendor'),(30098,0,7,'Popcorn!  Peanuts!  Ale!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30836,0,'Amphitheater Vendor'),(10162,7,0,'THIS CANNOT BE!!! Rend, deal with these insects.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5709,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,8,0,'The Warchief shall make quick work of you, mortals. Prepare yourselves!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,5720,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,9,0,'Taste in my power!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5726,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,10,0,'Your victory shall be short lived. The days of both the Alliance and Horde are coming to an end! The next time we meet shall be the last.',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,5824,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,11,0,'The mortals have fallen! The new age of the Blackrock legion is at hand!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5710,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,12,0,'In this world where time is your enemy, it is my greatest ally. This grand game of life that you think you play in fact plays you. To that I say...',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,9907,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius SAY_GAMESBEGIN_1 (BWL)'),(10162,13,0,'Let the games begin!',14,0,100,22,0,8280,0,9845,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius SAY_GAMESBEGIN_2 (BWL)'),(10162,14,0,'Ah...the heroes. You are persistent, aren\'t you? Your ally here attempted to match his power against mine - and paid the price. Now he shall serve me...by slaughtering you. ',14,0,100,23,0,8279,0,9794,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius SAY_VAEL_INTRO (BWL)'),(10429,0,0,'Impossible!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5673,0,'Warchief Rend Blackhand'),(11583,0,0,'Well done, my minions. The mortals\' courage begins to wane! Now, let\'s see how they contend with the true Lord of Blackrock Spire!!!',14,0,100,0,0,8288,0,9973,0,'Nefarian // nefarian SAY_AGGRO'),(30755,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(30037,0,0,'Haraak foln!',12,0,100,0,0,13541,0,30506,0,'Mjordin Combatant'),(31832,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(30404,0,0,'WHO DARES?! I AM GOING TO FLAY THE FLESH FROM YOUR B