2,0,100,0,0,0,0,10153,0,'Silas Darkmoon'),(14823,0,1,'We\'re back and better than ever!  It\'s the Darkmoon Faire friend, and it\'s your lucky day!  Sparing no expense, we\'ve gathered wonders and treats from around the world for your delight.  Whether you\'re young or old, rich or poor, the Darkmoon Faire has it all!  Be sure to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate, and choose from several exotic and wondrous prizes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10160,0,'Silas Darkmoon'),(14823,0,2,'Come one, come all.  Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!  Don\'t be shy.  Step right up to Lhara and buy yourself an exotic artifact from far off lands.  If you\'re one of the lucky few who have found Darkmoon Cards, have a word with Professor Paleo.  Hungry?  Thirsty?  You\'re in luck!  Refreshments are available right here from Sylannia and Stamp.  I recommend the Darkmoon Special Reserve to wash down some Red Hot Wings.  And if the future is what you seek, then run, don\'t walk, to speak with Sayge.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10154,0,'Silas Darkmoon'),(14823,0,3,'Welcome one and all to the Darkmoon Faire, the greatest event in all the world!  We have it all... delicious food, strong drink, exotic artifacts, fortunes read, amazing prizes and excitement without end!  Don\'t forget to turn in your Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets to Gelvas Grimegate!  All it takes is five or more and you\'re on your way to the most wondrous prizes on all of Azeroth.  Everybody is a winner!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10155,0,'Silas Darkmoon'),(8256,0,0,'Poor Dorius. If I ever get my hands on those Dark Irons, so help me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4287,0,'Curator Thorius'),(9082,0,0,'Well done, soldiers! At ease!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,4692,0,'Thal\'trak Proudtusk'),(23567,0,0,'Mysterious hoofprints, scorched shields, stray badges... how do we make sense of all this?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,22038,0,'Inspector Tarem'),(23573,0,0,'I don\'t think Drazzit\'s going to have any luck finding anyone to kill this raptor. I mean, he\'s already raised the reward twice...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22379,0,'Krixil Slogswitch'),(23995,0,0,'I thought we talked about this, Brogg. You can\'t stay in this building. Sure, it can house you, but there\'s no room for anyone else!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22588,0,'Axle'),(23995,1,0,'Yes, we said you can stay here, but this building is our headquarters! All of our manuals and blueprints are stored here!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22590,0,'Axle'),(23995,2,0,'I\'m inclined to say they made ogres too big! I can see I\'m not going to convince you to move now, but don\'t think this is permanent!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22592,0,'Axle'),(23579,0,0,'You said Brogg could stay here! You promised Brogg you\'d help regain Stonemaul clan mound!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22589,0,'Brogg'),(23579,1,0,'But this the only building that fit Brogg! Goblins make buildings too small!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22591,0,'Brogg'),(10220,0,0,'%s lets loose a guttural growl as her body collapses. A horrifying howl can be heard echoing through the halls of Blackrock Spire. Something is very, very angry.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5548,0,'Halycon DEATH'),(10584,0,0,'You have summoned me, fool!  Now DIE!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5832,0,'Urok Doomhowl SUMMON'),(10584,1,0,'Me smash! You die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1926,0,'Urok Doomhowl AGGRO'),(23089,1,0,'I cannot do this alone...',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,21548,0,'SAY_AKAMA_ALONE'),(23089,2,0,'I thank you for your aid, brothers.  Our people will be redeemed!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,21554,0,'SAY_AKAMA_SALUTE'),(23089,0,0,'This door is all that stands between us and the Betrayer.  Stand aside, friends.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21563,0,'SAY_AKAMA_DOOR'),(22917,0,0,'Come, my minions. Deal with this traitor as he deserves!',14,0,100,0,0,11465,0,21251,0,'Illidan SAY_ILLIDAN_MINION'),(22917,1,0,'Who shall be next to taste my blades?',14,0,100,0,0,11473,0,21499,0,'Illidan SAY_ILLIDAN_KILL'),(22917,1,1,'This is too easy!',14,0,100,0,0,11472,0,21498,0,'Illidan SAY_ILLIDAN_KILL'),(22917,2,0,'I will not be touched by rabble such as you!',14,0,100