s into ruin, Krenna!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27027,0,'Gorgonna - Say 0'),(27726,1,1,'It doesn\'t have to end this way, you know?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27026,0,'Gorgonna - Say 1'),(27726,2,2,'We\'ll see about that.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27028,0,'Gorgonna - Say 2'),(27726,3,3,'Why... why sister?  Why did it have to come to this?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27033,0,'Gorgonna - Say 3'),(23162,1,0,'%s\'s flesh shatters in an unearthly rage!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21075,0,'Vakkiz the Windrager'),(23162,0,0,'Furious winds envelop Vakkiz as he writhes menacingly towards you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21905,0,'Vakkiz the Windrager'),(178748,1,0,'I am with you. For the Queen!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(28160,0,0,'I\'ll send you on my flying machine. Keep your eyes peeled for clues about what might\'ve happened to Hemet!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,27620,0,'Archmage Pentarus'),(7271,1,0,'Aaaahhhhhh!',14,0,100,0,0,5873,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(7271,0,0,'How dare you enter my sanctum!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3622,0,'Witch Doctor Zum\'rah'),(27061,0,0,'Xink\'s Shredder ready and available for woodland destruction.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26166,0,'Xink\'s Shredder'),(27061,1,0,'Xink\'s Shredder security features activated.  Returning to base.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26167,0,'Xink\'s Shredder'),(26660,0,0,'About time!  Get that lumber and get moving.  The horde won\'t be up there fighting forever, there\'s money to be made!',12,0,100,25,1000,0,0,26079,0,'Xink'),(22458,0,0,'Aright, listen up! Form a circle around me and move out!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20314,0,''),(22458,1,0,'Aright, $r, just keep us safe from harm while we work. We\'ll pay you when we return.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20328,0,''),(22458,2,0,'The dig site is just north of here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20329,0,''),(22458,3,0,'We\'re here! Start diggin\'!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20330,0,''),(22458,4,0,'I think there\'s somethin\' buried here, beneath the sand!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,20331,0,''),(22458,5,0,'Almost got it!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,20332,0,''),(22458,6,0,'By Brann\'s brittle bananas! What is it!? It... It looks like a drum.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,20333,0,''),(22458,7,0,'Have ye gone mad? You expect me to leave behind a drum without first beatin\' on it? Not this son of Ironforge! No sir!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20337,0,''),(22458,8,0,'Shut yer yaps! I\'m gonna bang on this drum and that\'s that!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20344,0,''),(22458,9,0,'IN YOUR FACE! I told you there was somethin\' here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20348,0,''),(22458,10,0,'Don\'t just stand there! Help $g him:her; out!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20361,0,''),(22458,11,0,'You\'ve been a tremendous help, $r! Let\'s get out of here before more of those things show up! I\'ll let Dwarfowitz know you did the job asked of ya\' admirably.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20363,0,''),(22464,0,0,'Wow... a drum.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20334,0,''),(22464,1,0,'This discovery will surely rock the foundation of modern archaeology.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20335,0,''),(22464,2,0,'Yea, great. Can we leave now? This desert is giving me hives.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20336,0,''),(22464,3,0,'This reminds me of that one time where you made us search Silithus for evidence of sand gnomes.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20339,0,''),(22464,4,0,'Or that time when you told us that you\'d discovered the cure for the plague of the 20th century. What is that even? 20th century?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20340,0,''),(22464,5,0,'I don\'t think it can top the one time where he told us that he\'d heard that Arthas\'s \"cousin\'s\" skeleton was frozen beneath a glacier in Winterspring. I\'ll never forgive you for that one, Letoll. I mean honestly... Arthas\'s cousin?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20342,0,''),(22464,6,0,'I dunno. It can\'t possibly beat the time he tried to convince us that we\'re all actually a figment of some being\'s imagination and that they only use us for their own personal amusement. That went over well during dinner with the family.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20343,0,''),(22464,7,0,'Say, do you guys hear that?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20346,0,''),(27986,2,0,'It\'s got my vote! That\'ll put hair on your chest like nothing else will.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28551,0,'Hemet Nesingwary'),(27986,3,0,'What a fight you missed, Dorian! It was one for the ages!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28026,0,'Hemet Nesingwary'),(27986,4,0,'There we were, riding into battle at full speed on the back of Stampy...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28027,0,'Hemet Nesingwary'),(27986,5,0,'Well, lad, you can start by readin\' The Green Hills of Stranglethorn. Then, maybe you can join me on one of my safaris. What do you say?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34687,0,'Hemet Nesingwary'),(28047,0,0,'I\'m always up for something of Grimbooze\'s.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,28554,0,'Hadrius Harlowe'),(28047,1,0,'Well, so far, it tastes like something my wife would drink...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28556,0,'Hadrius Harlowe'),(28047,2,0,'Now, there\'s the kick I\'ve come to expect from Grimbooze\'s drinks! I like it!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28557,0,'Hadrius Harlowe'),(28568,0,0,'Sure!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,28546,0,'Tamara Wobblesprocket'),(28568,1,0,'Oh my...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30307,0,'Tamara Wobblesprocket'),(28568,2,0,'Tastes like I\'m drinking... engine degreaser!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28548,0,'Tamara Wobblesprocket'),(24669,0,0,'Interference with the wakening ritual causes the vrykul to die.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31589,0,'Dormant Vrykul emote text'),(24669,0,1,'The vrykul dies from being awakened improperly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31588,0,'Dormant Vrykul emote text'),(24669,0,2,'The incorrect application of the awakening rod causes the dormant vrykul to expire.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31590,0,'Dormant Vrykul emote text'),(27619,0,0,'Rise, Arugal!  The power of the Lich King commands you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26865,0,'Prince Valanar - Silverpine'),(27624,0,0,'Yes... he shall suit our needs perfectly.  Have him sent to Solstice Village when you\'re ready.  Arthas will not be pleased if we fall behind schedule.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26867,0,'Prince Theraldis - Silverpine'),(9543,0,0,'No!  Get away from me!  Help!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4973,0,'Ribbly Screwspigot'),(28750,0,1,'Mphmm rmphhimm rrhumghph?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28655,0,'Blight Geist'),(28750,0,2,'Mhrrumph rummrhum phurr!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28757,0,'Blight Geist'),(28793,0,1,'Your disguise doesn\'t fool me, fleshling! Your defeat will please Drakuru!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28858,0,'Darmuk'),(23980,0,0,'I return! A second chance to carve your skull!',14,0,100,0,0,13209,0,29977,0,'Ingvar the Plunderer - SAY_AGGRO_2'),(23980,1,0,'I am a warrior born!',14,0,100,0,0,13214,0,29975,0,'Ingvar the Plunderer - SAY_SLAY_2'),(23980,2,0,'No! I can do... better! I can...',14,0,100,0,0,13211,0,29979,0,'Ingvar the Plunderer - SAY_DEATH_2'),(31279,1,0,'The Light\'s blessing be upon you for aiding me in my time of need, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31941,0,'Father Kamaros'),(31279,2,0,'I\'ve had my fill of this place. Let us depart.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31942,0,'Father Kamaros'),(31279,3,0,'You must tell my brothers that I live.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31944,0,'Father Kamaros'),(31279,4,0,'I have you to thank for my life. I will return to my comrades and spread word of your bravery. Fight the Scourge with all the strength you can muster, and we will be by your side.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,31943,0,'Father Kamaros'),(27411,0,0,'Were you bitten?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,26640,0,'Freed Alliance Scout Say1'),(27411,1,1,'Answer me!  Were you bloody bitten?',14,7,100,22,0,0,0,26641,0,'Freed Alliance Scout Yell'),(27411,2,2,'You don\'t even know, do you?  The trappers?  They\'re not human... we have to get out of here!  Come, quick!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26539,0,'Freed Alliance Scout Say2'),(27411,3,3,'Take Ducal\'s horse, he\'s one of them now!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26540,0,'Freed Alliance Scout Say3'),(27411,4,4,'There\'s lamp oil in the back - make use of it.  The fiends hate fire!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26644,0,'Freed Alliance Scout Say4'),(28105,0,1,'My treasure! You no steal from Tartek, dumb big-tongue traitor thing.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(28105,0,0,'My treasure! You no steal from Tartek, dumb big-tongue traitor thing.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27893,0,'Warlord Tartek'),(27899,2,7,'Listen. I\'m not supposed to tell you this, but there\'s going to be this party that you\'re invited to. Whatever you do, DO NOT DRINK THE PUNCH!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27313,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,6,'Wish I could remember how many of the Infinite Dragonflight were going to try to stop you. This fight was so long ago.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27312,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,5,'Sorry, but Chromie said that I couldn\'t reveal anything about your future to you. She said that if I did, I would cease to exist.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27311,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,4,'Wow, I\'d forgotten how inexperienced I used to be.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27307,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,3,'No matter what, you can\'t die, because that would mean that I would cease to exist, right? But, I was here before when I was you. I\'m so confused!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27306,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,2,'What? Am I here alone. We both have a stake in this, you know!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27305,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,0,'I can\'t believe that I used to wear that.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27301,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,1,'Look at you fight; no wonder I turned to drinking.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27304,0,'Future You'),(27899,1,0,'Heads up... here they come. I\'ll help as much as I can. Let\'s just keep them off of the hourglass!',15,0,100,396,0,0,0,27251,0,'Future You'),(27899,0,0,'Hey there, $n, don\'t be alarmed. It\'s me... you... from the future.  I\'m here to help.',15,0,100,396,0,0,0,27239,0,'Future You'),(28948,0,0,'Ahh... there you are. The master told us you\'d be arriving soon.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,29127,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,1,0,'Please, follow me, $n. There is much for you to see....',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,29128,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,2,0,'Ever since his arrival from Drak\'Tharon, the master has spoken of the time you would be joining him here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29172,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,3,0,'You should feel honored. You are the first of the master\'s prospects to be shown our operation.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29171,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,4,0,'The things I show you now must never be spoken of outside Voltarus. The world shall come to know our secret soon enough!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29173,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,5,0,'Here lie our stores of blight crystal, without which our project would be impossible.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29174,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,6,0,'I understand that you are to thank for the bulk of our supply.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29175,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,7,0,'These trolls are among those you exposed on the battlefield. Masterfully done, indeed....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29176,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,8,0,'We feel it best to position them here, where they might come to terms with their impending fate.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29433,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,9,0,'This is their destiny....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29434,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,10,0,'The blight slowly seeps into their bodies, gradually preparing them for their conversion.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29435,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,11,0,'This special preparation grants them unique powers far greater than they would otherwise know.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29436,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,12,0,'Soon, the master will grant them the dark gift, making them fit to serve the Lich King for eternity!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29437,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,13,0,'Stay for as long as you like, $n. Glory in the fruits of your labor!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29438,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,14,0,'Your service has been invaluable in fulfilling the master\'s plan. May you forever grow in power....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29439,0,'Malmortis say'),(31235,0,0,'Thank the Light for granting me another chance. And thank you, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31826,0,'Crusader Olakin Sainrith'),(31235,1,0,'Without your help, I would\'ve been doomed to a life of undeath among the Lich King\'s gruesome creations.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31827,0,'Crusader Olakin Sainrith'),(31235,2,0,'There will be time for a proper thanks later, but there is still a battle to be fought!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,31828,0,'Crusader Olakin Sainrith'),(30313,0,0,'Temple of Invention analysis commencing.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31498,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,1,0,'Temple of Invention verified to be intact.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31499,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,2,0,'Mechanical servants appear to have turned against each other. Several attendants have been piled together in an unorganized manner.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31500,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,3,0,'Remaining mechagnome guardians corrupted by unknown source.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31501,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,4,0,'Watcher Mimir verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31502,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,5,0,'Temple of Winter analysis commencing.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31504,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,6,0,'Temple of Winter verified to be in tact.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31506,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,7,0,'Temple guardians verified to be deceased. Sulfurous odor suggests that death resulted from a fire-based entity.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31507,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,8,0,'Previously established cold weather patterns at the temple have ceased.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31508,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,9,0,'Watcher Hodir verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31509,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,10,0,'Temple of Life analysis commencing.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31515,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,11,0,'Temple of Life verified to be damaged beyond repair.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31512,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,12,0,'Evidence indicates a significant battle. The opponent of Watcher Freya estimated to be of similar size and strength to Watcher Freya.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31513,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,13,0,'Temple guardians are no longer present. Plant forms associated with temple are deceased.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31514,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,14,0,'Watcher Freya verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31510,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,15,0,'Temple of Order analysis commencing.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31516,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,16,0,'Temple of Order verified to be in tact.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31517,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,17,0,'No indications of struggle are present. No guardians are present.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31518,0,'Mobile Databank'),(30313,18,0,'Watcher Tyr verified to no longer be present. Analysis complete.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,31519,0,'Mobile Databank'),(31222,0,0,'When I am done here, I am going to mount your heads upon the walls of Azjol-Nerub!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31836,0,'Dark Master say 1'),(31242,0,0,'Ah, there you are! Remember me? Of course you do! Wait right there, I\'m coming down.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31882,0,'Sigrid Iceborn say 1'),(31242,1,0,'I told you I\'d be better prepared when next we met. I\'ve fought and won the Hyldsmeet, trained at Valkyrion, and here I am.  Come and get some!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31883,0,'Sigrid Iceborn say 2'),(31277,0,0,'ENOUGH!  You tiny insects are not worthy to do battle within this sacred place!  You do not fight with honor!  You do not even ascend! ',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31935,0,'Thane say 1'),(31277,1,0,'Fight me and die you cowards!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31936,0,'Thane say 2'),(31277,2,0,'Haraak foln!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,30506,0,'Thane say 3'),(14688,0,0,'Hardly a fitting introduction, Spear-Wife.  Now, who is this outsider that I\'ve been hearing so much about?',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31956,0,'Prince Sandoval say 1'),(14688,1,0,'I will make this as easy as possible for you.  Simply come here and die.  That is all that I ask for your many trespasses.  For your sullying of this exalted place of battle.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31957,0,'Prince Sandoval say 2'),(14688,2,0,'FOR YOUR EFFRONTERY TO THE LICH KING!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31972,0,'Prince Sandoval say 3'),(31135,0,0,'Valhalas is yours to win or die in, $n. But whatever you do, stay within the bounds of the arena. To flee is to lose and be dishonored.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,31744,0,'Greiff quest 1 say 1'),(31135,1,1,'$n and $g his : her; comrades in arms have chosen to accept honorable combat within the sacred confines of Valhalas.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31745,0,'Greiff quest 1 say 2'),(31135,2,2,'There can be only one outcome to such a battle: death for one side or the other. Let $n prove $g himself : herself; upon the bones of those outsiders who have fallen before!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31746,0,'Greiff quest 1 say 3'),(31135,3,3,'The fallen heroes of Valhalas emerge from the ground to do battle once more!',41,0,0,0,0,14998,0,31756,0,'Greiff quest 1 say 4'),(31135,4,4,'$n has defeated the fallen heroes of Valhalas battles past. This is only a beginning, but it will suffice.',14,0,0,0,0,14998,0,31755,0,'Greiff quest 1 say 5'),(31135,5,5,'Prepare yourself. Khit\'rix will be entering Valhalas from the southeast. Remember, do not leave the ring or you will lose the battle.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,31771,0,'Greiff quest 2 say 1'),(31135,6,6,'$n has accepted the challenge of Khit\'rix the Dark Master. May the gods show mercy upon $g him : her; for Khit\'rix surely will not.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31770,0,'Greiff quest 2 say 2'),(31135,7,7,'Khit\'rix the Dark Master skitters into Valhalas from the southeast!',41,0,0,0,0,14998,0,32753,0,'Greiff quest 2 say 3'),(31135,8,8,'Khit\'rix the Dark Master has been defeated by $n and $g his : her; band of companions. Let the next challenge be issued!',14,0,0,0,0,14998,0,31820,0,'Greiff quest 2 sasy 4'),(31135,9,9,'Sigrid Iceborn has returned to the heights of Jotunheim to prove herself against $n.  When last they met, $n bested her in personal combat.  Let us see the outcome of this match.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,31892,0,'Greiff quest 3 say 1'),(31135,10,10,'Circling Valhalas, Sigrid Iceborn approaches to seek her revenge!',41,0,0,0,0,14998,0,32757,0,'Greiff quest 3 say 2'),(31135,11,11,'$n has defeated Sigrid Iceborn for a second time.  Well, this time $g he : she; did it with the help of $g his : her; friends, but a win is a win!',14,0,0,0,0,14998,0,31921,0,'Greiff quest 3 say 3'),(31135,12,12,'Carnage is coming!  Remember, no matter what you 