,2,0,'True masters learn to make blood serve more than just their strength in battle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29869,0,'Lord Thorval'),(29196,3,0,'Stripping energy from our foes, both fighting and fallen, allows us to persevere where lesser beings fall exhausted.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29870,0,'Lord Thorval'),(29196,4,0,'And every foe that falls, energy sapped and stolen, only further fuels our assault.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29871,0,'Lord Thorval'),(29196,5,0,'As masters of blood, we know battle without end...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29872,0,'Lord Thorval'),(29196,6,0,'We know hunger never to be quenched...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29873,0,'Lord Thorval'),(29196,7,0,'We know power never to be overcome...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29874,0,'Lord Thorval'),(29196,8,0,'As masters of blood, we are masters of life and death itself.  Against us, even hope falls drained and lifeless.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29875,0,'Lord Thorval'),(21651,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(18457,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(20866,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(18989,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(20886,2,0,'Yes, that was quite satisfying.',14,0,100,0,0,11239,0,19969,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Kill'),(20886,0,0,'Have you come to kill Dalliah?  Can I watch?',14,0,100,1,0,11237,0,19968,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Aggro Dalliah First'),(20886,1,0,'At last, a target for my frustrations!',14,0,100,0,0,11238,0,19967,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Aggro'),(20885,2,1,'You chose the wrong opponent.',14,0,100,0,0,11088,0,19981,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Kill'),(20885,3,0,'Reap the whirlwind!',14,0,100,0,0,11089,0,19982,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Cast Whirlwind'),(20885,1,1,'Reap the Whirlwind!',14,0,50,0,0,11089,0,0,0,'on Cast Text'),(20885,2,0,'Completely ineffective.  Just like someone else I know.',14,0,100,0,0,11087,0,19980,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Kill'),(20885,0,0,'Don\'t worry about me; kill that worthless dullard instead!',14,0,100,1,0,11085,0,19979,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Aggro Soccothrates First'),(20885,1,0,'It is unwise to anger me!',14,0,100,0,0,11086,0,19978,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Aggro'),(28907,9,0,'TERROR!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29057,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,10,0,'CHAOS!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,29058,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,8,0,'No mercy for the weak!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,29056,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,7,0,'Leave no survivors in your wake, brothers and sisters!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,29055,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,6,0,'ALL. MUST. DIE.',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,29054,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,5,0,'The Lich King has spoken to each of you! Let his words resonate among you once more!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,29053,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,4,0,'With each enemy slain, our strength grows! We mustn\'t relent! \n',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29052,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,3,0,'The Scarlet fleet lies in ruin upon the sundered coast!\n',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,29051,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,2,0,'The corpses of those that try only serve to feed our expanding host!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29050,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,0,0,'The sky itself feeds upon the suffering of the conquered!\n',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29048,0,'Prince Valanar'),(28907,1,0,'The Scarlet Crusade is powerless to stop us!\n',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29049,0,'Prince Valanar'),(29305,1,0,'I crush joo cockroaches!',14,0,100,0,0,14725,0,31430,0,'Moorabi - Slay 1'),(5089,0,0,'Alright! Alright! We surrender... Just put your weapons down, I\'ll cooperate!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1756,0,'Balos Jacken'),(3644,0,0,'Anaya...? Do my eyes deceive me? Is it really you?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1278,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),(3644,1,0,'That the fates should be so cruel as to permit us only this after a thousand years apart...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1280,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),(3644,2,0,'Do you hate me, my love? That I was forced to destroy your living form, that your spirit be released from unhappy bondage.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1281,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),(3644,3,0,'No! Anaya... Anaya! Don\'t leave me! Please...',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,1286,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),(3644,4,0,'How, my love? How will I find the strength to face the ages of the world without you by my side...',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,1287,0,'Cerellean Whiteclaw'),(3843,0,0,'The ages have been cruel to you and I, my love, but be assured, it is, and at long last we are reunited.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1279,0,'Anaya'),(3843,1,0,'Let it not trouble your heart, beloved. You have freed me from slavery, and for that I love you all the more.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1282,0,'Anaya'),(3843,2,0,'Sadly, even this must be cut short... The ties that bind me to this world weaken, and pull me away...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1283,0,'Anaya'),(3843,3,0,'Farewell, Cerellean, until we are joined once again...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1284,0,'Anaya'),(3843,4,0,'%s\'s soft voice trails away into the mists, \"Know that I love you always...\"',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,1285,0,'Anaya'),(3946,0,0,'The numbers of my companions dwindles, goddess, and my own power shall soon be insufficient to hold back the demons of Felwood.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1356,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(3946,1,0,'Goddess, grant me the power to overcome my enemies! Hear me, please, my need is desperate and my cause is just!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1357,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(3946,2,0,'What... what is this? Could this be the answer to my prayers? Elune has granted me a weapon--this scythe--to defeat the demons.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1358,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(4509,0,0,'In the throes of the Sundering, Ameth\'Aran was at the whim of the terror that gripped the land. There was little hope for survival.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1471,0,'Sargath'),(4509,1,0,'Athrikus came to us. He told us that he could save us from harm. He cast a spell upon us to protect us from harm.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1472,0,'Sargath'),(4509,2,0,'When the shaking stopped, his true motives were revealed. We were trapped, and he was slowly draining our powers.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1474,0,'Sargath'),(4509,3,0,'There were hundreds imprisoned by his spell. Now only a few remain in their prisons. He would speak to us sometimes.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1497,0,'Sargath'),(4509,4,0,'He worried that his power weakened, that soon even we last of his precious soulgems would fade and die.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1498,0,'Sargath'),(4509,5,0,'His lieutenant, Ilkrud Magthrull possesses a tome which might indicate the location of the remaining soulgems.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1475,0,'Sargath'),(35476,0,0,'Of course I was the one chosen to summon a demon for the competitors. I am Wilfred Fizzlebang, master summoner! Demons quail before the mere thought of being under my will!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35818,0,'Wilfred Fizzlebang'),(35476,0,1,'Soon all the world will know the name of Wilfred!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35816,0,'Wilfred Fizzlebang'),(28256,0,0,'So the oracle has decided to aid you, outlander. Very well, I will offer you what I know.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27697,0,'Voice of Nozronn'),(28256,1,0,'Your companion seeks the shardhorn patriarch Farunn, who holds himself aloof from his brothers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27698,0,'Voice of Nozronn'),(28256,2,0,'Farunn walks the lands north of what your people call the Bittertide Falls. You will find him alone, but you will see he requires no defenders.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27699,0,'Voice of Nozronn'),(28256,3,0,'Return to your companion. Tell him to go forth and claim his prize in Farunn.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27701,0,'Voice of Nozronn'),(28256,4,0,'Once he has done so, tell him to leave this land in peace. He does not belong here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27702,0,'Voice of Nozronn'),(2015,0,2,'My talons will shred your puny body, $R.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2230,0,'Bloodfeather Harpy'),(2017,0,0,'You will be easy prey, $c.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2231,0,'on Aggro Text'),(2017,0,1,'My talons will shred your puny body, $r.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2230,0,'on Aggro Text'),(2017,0,2,'A fine trophy your head will make, $r.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2229,0,'on Aggro Text'),(3395,0,0,'I am summoned!  Intruders, come to my tent and face your death!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,1079,0,'Verog the Dervish'),(3451,0,0,'Looks like you\'ll have to go ahead to Ratchet and tell Sputtervalve that I\'ve wrecked the shredder.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pilot Wizzlecrank'),(3451,1,0,'I\'ll stay behind and guard the wreck. Hurry! Hopefully no one will notice the smoke...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pilot Wizzlecrank'),(2006,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(8761,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(8877,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Sandfury Zealot'),(34980,0,0,'You dare to challenge Drottinn Hrothgar, king of the seas?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35227,0,'Drottinn Hrothgar'),(32576,0,0,'The Helmsman comes for you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24734,0,'Orabus the Helmsman'),(32576,1,0,'Now you face Orabus, fool!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24845,0,'Orabus the Helmsman'),(31057,0,0,'Hello. Master Fras Siabi is not in at this time. Please come back tomorrow to Fras Siabi\'s Premium Tobacco! Beep!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31716,0,'Mechanical Greeter RY7R'),(30994,0,0,'No remedy seems to work - the entire city has sickened...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31583,0,'Magistrate Barthilas'),(30994,0,1,'The soldiers are spreading panic with the rumors of bad food. Neighbors are accusing one another of poison. The city will fall into bedlam!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31584,0,'Magistrate Barthilas'),(30994,0,2,'Everyone is falling ill - this is an epidemic!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31582,0,'Magistrate Barthilas'),(30994,1,0,'I pray the illness I\'m feeling is due to stress ulcers...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31587,0,'Magistrate Barthilas'),(30994,1,1,'How can I possibly help the city in such a widespread crisis?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31581,0,'Magistrate Barthilas'),(30994,1,2,'I\'m at a loss. What can one simple man do in the face of disaster?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31586,0,'Magistrate Barthilas'),(29369,0,0,'Your mother was a wrench and your father smelled of seaforium!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30238,0,'Stormforged Taskmaster