ry Bloodwarder'),(18952,0,0,'Death to the interlopers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12837,0,'Bonechewer Scavenger'),(19138,0,0,'May it be so.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16780,0,'Anchorite Attendant'),(19188,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Raging Colossus'),(19196,0,0,'I feel that war is fast approaching.  The fruit vendor has enlisted the help of an ogre.  I shall have to enlist help as well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22060,0,'Cro Threadstrong'),(19196,1,0,'FRUIT VENDOR!!! Your cart is still in our way!  We will give you one more hour to move it from our area.  Do not test our patience anymore!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16296,0,'Cro Threadstrong'),(19223,0,0,'I could have sworn I had more apples.  Grok!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16307,0,'Granny Smith'),(19223,1,0,'What is that poor orc yelling about? Someone should see what is going on.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16314,0,'Granny Smith'),(17117,5,0,'%s hugs you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14679,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),(15692,0,0,'Ye\'ll be feasting on me blade this Winter Veil!  Yeargh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11397,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15692,0,1,'No scallywag $c is taking our Winter Veil plunder!  Get \'em!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11398,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(19227,0,6,'Ya look tired, $c. I be havin\' somethin\' for ya. These amulets, they can help ya leap obstacles and swim through the rivers like ya be born to it. They energize the food ya be eatin\', makin\' yer wounds close before yer eyes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16324,0,'Griftah'),(19227,0,5,'C\'mere, $r. Ya don\'t want to be riskin\' yerself in a dungeon, do ya? Filthy work, and for what? Some worthless trinket? Nah, what ya need be one of my amulets. Guaranteed to work!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16323,0,'Griftah'),(19227,0,4,'Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin\' nothin\' on the tried and true mystical methods of ol\' Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16322,0,'Griftah'),(19227,0,3,'Dangerous out there, innit? Know what ya need? Protection. I can help ya defy death itself! Ya wear this madstone \'round yer neck, see, and then ya be able to come back if ya find yerself in the spirit world! Just a quick jaunt to yer corpse and up ya come, fresh and new!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16321,0,'Griftah'),(19227,0,2,'Ya look lovesick. Special someone be gettin\' ya down, eh? No worries, no worries. Ya get this medallion from me, ya wear it when ya see \'em, and they be all over ya, $G man:sweetheart;!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16320,0,'Griftah'),(19227,0,0,'Hey! Hey, $r! I be havin\' just the thing for ya. Ya ever see a tikbalang? Frightenin\' creatures. Prone to stealin\' ya away. What ya need is one of my tikbalang wards. Guaranteed to ward away all tikbalangs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16318,0,'Griftah'),(19227,0,1,'Look over here, $c! I got somethin\' for ya. Just what ya need. It\'s soap, right... and it\'s on a rope! No offense, $G man:honey;, but yer a little ripe, know what I\'m sayin\'?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16319,0,'Griftah'),(19283,0,2,'Hey, $G man:lady;? Got some money?  I got five kids to feed!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16612,0,'Vagrant'),(19283,0,1,'Spare a copper, $G sir:madam;?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16611,0,'Vagrant'),(19308,0,0,'This war - and don\'t mistake this for anything but a war - is not going to win itself. If we do not fight, scratch, claw, and kick for every speck of land on this shattered world, all will be lost.',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,16456,0,'Marshal Isildor'),(19308,0,1,'How many more soldiers need to die before we start paying attention out there?',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,16453,0,'Marshal Isildor'),(19308,0,2,'Do you think that demons will play fair? These beasts are more savage than orcs and more cunning than the undead. Do not attempt to engage Legion by normal standards of war.',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,16454,0,'Marshal Isildor'),(19346,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen, I have a request to make of you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16506,0,'Harbinger Erothem'),(19346,1,0,'We\'ve just sent another inexperienced squad into Nagrand. Might you offer a prayer for them?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16507,0,'Harbinger Erothem'),(19346,2,0,'May it be so.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16780,0,'Harbinger Erothem'),(21928,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(21305,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(19362,0,0,'If I see any lazy peons here, I\'ll load them into a catapult and launch them off to the Black Temple!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16557,0,'Kor\'kron Defender'),(20684,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(33642,0,0,'Here I have amassed what may well be the greatest depository of lore in all of Outland. Even the grand libraries of Silvermoon City pale in comparison. Please... look, read, browse to your heart\'s content. You\'ll find everything organized and clearly labeled.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(19378,5,0,'Please bless and protect them, and grant them success over those who seek to do us harm...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16534,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19378,4,0,'Into our struggle against the darkness we have sent our children.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16533,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19378,3,0,'Light that we embrace, we beseech thee...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16531,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19378,2,0,'My friends, please join me in humble supplication to the Light.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16526,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19378,1,0,'A noble request. It would be an honor, Erothem.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16524,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19378,0,0,'Of course, my friend. How can I be of service to you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16521,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19412,0,0,'A cool breeze caresses your face. Gentle, melodic humming resonates throughout the chamber.\n',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16804,0,'D\'ore'),(19419,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Raging Shardling'),(19440,0,0,'You are spotted by the %s!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16781,0,'Eye of Grillok'),(19442,0,0,'%s calls for his worgs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17593,0,'Worg Master Kruush'),(19453,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Sunfury Captain'),(19475,0,0,'It\'s coming along, Wafflefry. Haven\'t you got a product demonstration to do or something?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,25086,0,'Harbinger Haronem'),(19535,0,0,'Ahh, another powerful traveler. The nether can be dangerous; you\'ll want the most potent spells at your disposal. I carry the finest reagents, common and exotic. Come, buy - you won\'t be sorry!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17001,0,'Dealer Zijaad'),(19632,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Lykul Stinger'),(19664,0,0,'Nothing like a tankard full to wash down one of my magnificent muffins.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18620,0,'Muffin Man Moser'),(19664,1,0,'Yea, that hit the spot.  Muffins for sale!  Get your fresh muffins right here!',12,0,100,7,0,0,0,18621,0,'Muffin Man Moser'),(19664,2,0,'I\'ve got muffins right over here.  Come on over!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18616,0,'Muffin Man Moser'),(19664,2,1,'Yea, yea, I\'m the muffin man.  You know why?  Because I sell muffins, that\'s why!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18617,0,'Muffin Man Moser'),(19671,10,0,'There can\'t be too many more of these collectors. Just keep me safe as I do my job.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17255,0,'Cryo-Engineer Sha\'heen'),(19827,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Dark Conclave Ravenguard'),(19926,0,0,'Looks like I picked the wrong day to quit mana tapping...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17571,0,'Spellreaver Marathelle'),(27440,0,0,'Saurfang is here, Sagai! Saurfang! The brother of Broxigar himself, here to aid our efforts!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 1'),(20140,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Sunfury Centurion'),(20221,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Sunfury Flamekeeper'),(20279,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Ragestone Threshalisk'),(20280,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Ragestone Trampler'),(20342,0,0,'Yea, Nat?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17967,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20342,1,0,'Which one?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17969,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20342,2,2,'I worry about you sometimes, Nat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17990,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20342,2,1,'Impossible!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17989,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20342,2,0,'It\'ll never happen, Nat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17988,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20344,19,0,'Well, he comes back to the king all pretendin\' to be nice, draws his sword, and runs the king through, elbow to ... well you know... kills him on the spot.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17987,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,18,0,'But tragically, Arthas is consumed by the evil and becomes evil himself...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17986,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,17,0,'This one\'s real grim... So the king\'s kid, Arthas... Well he goes out to battle evil, along with Uther... *Nat pats his brow dry*',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17985,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,16,0,'If that weren\'t crazy enough, they decide to quit the ice-cream business and become adventurers... They travel all over the place and finally disappear into some portal. I woke up in a cold sweat after that one...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17984,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,15,0,'Well in this dream, they somehow end up inventing something called ice-cream and flavoring it with strawberries... Well, long story short, they end up striking it rich!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17983,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,13,0,'I\'m like some kind of fishing god...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17981,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,14,0,'I can\'t even believe this one... You know those two loud-mouthed ruffians, Foror and Tigule?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17982,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,12,0,'And people from all over the world come to me to pay homage... and learn to fish.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17980,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,11,0,'In this dream, I was fishin\' master of the world. I moved to some place called Kalimdor...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17979,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,10,0,'And if that weren\'t crazy enough, that big demon gets killed by a bunch of little floating light things... Oh, I was also a female elf in that one... Yep...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17978,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,9,0,'Out of nowhere, some 300 foot tall demon or somethin\' walks up and starts climbin\' the tree...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17977,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,7,0,'Crazy, isn\'t it?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17975,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,8,0,'So I\'m on some mountain with some big ol\' tree. Bunch of elves runnin\' around all over...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17976,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,6,0,'He ends up destroying the whole keep, freeing all the orcs we\'re keeping in the camps, and rising to power as the king of orcs... Warchief or somethin\'.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17974,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,4,0,'Could ya imagine such a thing, Hal? Could ya?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17972,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,5,0,'That one where I\'m in Durnholde and that one orc that Blackmoore keeps as his personal slave breaks out...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17973,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,3,0,'Tarren Mill is destroyed by some crazy force of undead and forever more becomes an enemy to Southshore.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17971,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,1,0,'Had that dream again last night...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17968,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,2,0,'That one dream... The crazy one. Remember?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17970,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,0,0,'Hal...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17966,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20350,0,0,'Keep your voice down, Helcular. Strangers abound...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18033,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),(20350,1,0,'Necromancy. It is called necromancy. And yes, I have it within my power to bless you with this gift.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18042,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),(20350,2,0,'That is none of your concern, Helcular, as you are neither Kirin Tor nor a necromancer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18044,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),(20350,3,0,'But to be perfectly frank, I do not give a damn what the Kirin Tor think! They are fools, set in their archaic ways.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18050,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),(20350,4,0,'In due time, Helcular... All in due time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18052,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),(20353,0,0,'So you can teach me this... this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18041,0,'Helcular'),(20353,1,0,'And the Kirin Tor? What have they to say of necromancy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18043,0,'Helcular'),(20353,2,0,'Then teach me, Kel\'Thuzad. Teach me everything you know...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18051,0,'Helcular'),(20600,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Maggoc'),(21066,0,0,'%s whispers softly in reverent tones under her breath.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18715,0,'Rina Moonspring'),(21218,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Vashj\'ir Honor Guard'),(21644,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Skettis Wing Guard'),(19466,0,0,'Hold your tongue, knave!  Do not dare use that tone with a priestess of the Light!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,16873,0,'Exarch Orelis'),(21694,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Bog Overlord'),(21717,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Dragonmaw Wrangler'),(21769,0,0,'What is it that you want from me, shaman?',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,19608,0,'Overlord Or\'barokh'),(21769,1,0,'Do you not have eyes? Did you not see the demons on our very doorstep? I do not have the soldiers to spare!',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,19609,0,'Overlord Or\'barokh'),(21769,2,0,'Pray to your gods, shaman. Perhaps they will come to your aid. The Horde, however, cannot...',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,19610,0,'Overlord Or\'barokh'),(21838,0,0,'Who calls me to this world?  The stars are not yet aligned... my powers fail me!  You will pay for this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21639,0,'Terokk'),(21907,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Cabal Initiate'),(22105,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Decrepit Clefthoof'),(22143,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Gordunni Back-Breaker'),(22199,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Slaag'),(22343,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Deathshadow Archon'),(22381,0,0,'Incompetent fools!  Auchindoun should\'ve been ours... look at yourselves scrambling like rats!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20166,0,'Hathyss the Wicked'),(22844,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Ashtongue 