100,6,0,0,0,19612,0,'Thane Yoregar'),(22374,0,0,'Who dares slay one of my Kargath\'s commanders?  You will pay for this... in flesh!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20156,0,'Hand of Kargath'),(22992,0,0,'Fool! The essence of the hawk will never be yours!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20767,0,'Guardian of the Hawk'),(22992,1,0,'The time of the Raven is nigh, but yours will end here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20768,0,'Guardian of the Hawk'),(22993,0,0,'You dare to disturb the loyal followers of the Raven?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20769,0,'Guardian of the Eagle'),(22993,1,0,'You will die for your hubris, $c!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20770,0,'Guardian of the Eagle'),(22994,0,0,'The falcon is vanquished, doomed never to rise again! Your quest is futile!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20771,0,'Guardian of the Falcon'),(22994,1,0,'The raven will return to us as foretold in the prophecy and you are powerless to stop it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20772,0,'Guardian of the Falcon'),(23049,0,0,'Berserker Stance! Attack them recklessly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21443,0,'Shadowmoon Weapon Master'),(25804,0,0,'You seek to deafen me? Pathetic... Wait... What\'s that sound?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25120,0,'Harold Lane'),(25806,0,7,'It\'s gonna be veal tonight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25020,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),(25806,0,6,'I wonder what Nesingwary will give me for your hide!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25016,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),(25806,0,5,'No way! Rhino head helmet for the low, low price of thirty rhino heads? I\'ll take two at those prices!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25116,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),(25806,0,4,'Just fifty more hooves and I\'ll have the new gun!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25018,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),(25806,0,3,'Give it up, little beast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25023,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),(25806,0,2,'I\'m sure ol\' Hemet can do something with your bones!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25017,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),(25806,0,0,'Now THIS is a sport!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25022,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),(25806,0,1,'KILL KILL KILL!!!!!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25019,0,'Loot Crazed Poacher'),(25885,0,0