yes, I haven\'t forgotten Hyjal, or Silithus, or the march of the Legion, or every other damnable confrontation the 7th Legion has faced. It... I don\'t want the soldiers to hear this, Two-bit, but for the first time in my life...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 3'),(27156,3,0,'You are right, of course, old friend. Let us hope that these heroes arrive soon.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 4'),(27159,0,0,'It does get worse, old friend. According to my calculations, without suitable materials to repair our parapets, the walls protecting this keep will crumble in twelve hours.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 1'),(28103,0,0,'Urgreth begins to emanate a powerful dark energy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29932,0,'Urgreth of the Thousand Tombs'),(28608,0,0,'The Crusade will be victorious!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29717,0,'Scarlet Medic'),(28608,0,1,'Let the purging begin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29720,0,'Scarlet Medic'),(28608,0,2,'You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29719,0,'Scarlet Medic'),(15402,0,0,'Such... dark... energy!  How can this be possible?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13397,0,'Apprentice Mirveda'),(30331,0,0,'Hold on, little $r.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31000,0,'King Jokkum - Mount up'),(30331,1,0,'Thorim! Come, show yourself!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31018,0,'King Jokkum - Conversation start'),(30331,2,0,'The deeds of your $r servant defy $g his:her; stature, Stormlord. $g His:Her; efforts have succeeded in softening the hearts of my people.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,31051,0,'King Jokkum - Conversation 20 sec in'),(30331,3,0,'Never have such humble words come from mighty Thorim. I shall deliver your words to Dun Niffelem.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,31052,0,'King Jokkum - Conversation 40 sec in'),(30331,4,0,'The events of that dark day are hereby forgiven by my people.  They shall never again be spoken of.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,31053,0,'King Jokkum - Conversation 48 sec in'),(30331,5,0,'To signify our reforged friendship, I have something which belongs to you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31054,0,'King Jokkum - Conversation 57 sec in'),(30331,6,0,'As the great explosion filled the region, my father cast a rune at the great hammer that it might not be had by our enemies. It was his final act...',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,31057,0,'King Jokkum - Conversation 63 sec in'),(30331,7,0,'We welcome the opportunity to fight by your side, mighty Thorim.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31059,0,'King Jokkum - Conversation 75 sec in'),(30331,8,0,'I must return to Dun Niffilem. We shall speak again soon, Stormlord.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,31060,0,'King Jokkum - Conversation 80 sec in'),(30390,0,0,'King Jokkum, you have summoned me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31001,0,'Thorim  - Conversation 18 sec in'),(30390,1,0,'Jokkum, son of Arngrim, I have always regretted my actions here. In my grief, I brought great harm to those closest to me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31003,0,'Thorim  - Conversation 26 sec in'),(30390,2,0,'I would ask your forgiveness for the suffering I have caused you and your people.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31062,0,'Thorim - Conversation 32 sec in'),(30390,3,0,'Krolmir... I thank you Jokkum. I hadn\'t dared hope it still existed. It shall soon see glorious battle once again!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,31063,0,'Thorim - Conversation 68 sec in'),(30007,10,1,'$n has defeated Yg... Yggg-really big worm!',14,0,100,15,0,13908,0,30684,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,10,2,'$n has defeated Yg... Yggg-really big worm!',14,0,100,15,0,13909,0,30684,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,10,3,'$n has defeated Yg... Yggg-really big worm!',14,0,100,15,0,13907,0,30684,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,11,0,'$n is victorious once more!',14,0,100,15,0,13908,0,15469,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,11,1,'$n is victorious once more!',14,0,100,15,0,13909,0,15469,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,11,2,'$n is victorious once more!',14,0,100,15,0,13905,0,15469,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,12,0,'And with AUTHORITY, $n dominates the magnataur lord! Stinkbeard\'s clan is gonna miss him back home in the Dragonblight!',14,0,100,15,0,13908,0,30687,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,13,0,'From the Savage Ledge of Icecrown, Vladof the Butcher and his mammoth, Enormos! There ain\'t gonna be a thing left of our challengers, folks! Prepare for a downpour of blood, guts and tears!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30707,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,14,0,'I DON\'T BELIEVE IT! WE HAVE A NEW CHAMPION OF ANGUISH!!! Vladof the Butcher has been defeated by a ragtag crew of nobodies! Incredible finish!',14,0,100,15,0,13908,0,30716,2,'Gurgthock'),(30007,15,0,'All that\'s left of the challenger is a red stain on the floor!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30676,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,15,1,'Avert your eyes, ladies and gentlemen! It\'s a bloodbath!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30680,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,15,2,'Call in the clowns! It\'s turned into a circus in there!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30677,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,15,3,'OOOF! That one\'s gonna require the \"scraper.\"',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30678,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,15,4,'OUTTA NOWHERE -- WHAMO! DEAD!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30679,0,'Gurgthock'),(30007,15,5,'They went down like a sack of orc skulls!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30675,0,'Gurgthock'),(30014,1,0,'%s emerges!',41,0,100,0,0,13878,0,30683,0,'Yggdras'),(30017,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,24144,0,'Stinkbeard'),(28403,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(30024,0,0,'I am the baddest of the bad, the coolest of the cool! To my side, my elements, let us freeze and rule!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(30026,1,0,'Al\'Akir grant my enemies a cold, swift death!',14,0,100,0,0,13878,0,30702,0,'Az\'Barin, Prince of the Gust'),(30026,2,0,'I bring a gust so strong, it can knock down trees! Minions, assist me, they shall not do as they please!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30769,0,'Az\'Barin, Prince of the Gust'),(30019,1,0,'I\'ll melt the flesh off your bones!',14,0,100,0,0,13878,0,30689,0,'Duke Singen <The New Hotness>'),(30019,2,0,'To burn my kingdom, you can\'t use fire! Come my servants, I am not ready to retire!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30768,0,'Duke Singen <The New Hotness>'),(102672,4,0,'I dreamed the Dream. Now I wake...',14,0,100,0,0,58665,0,0,0,'Nythendra to Player'),(30025,0,0,'I\'m the king of dirt, there is none higher! To my aid, minions - assist your sire!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(30020,0,0,'Come, land-dwellers, face the fury of tusk and whisker!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30704,0,'Orinoko Tuskbreaker'),(30020,1,0,'Whisker! Where are you?! Assist me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30784,0,'Orinoko Tuskbreaker'),(102672,3,0,'Breathe deeply. Embrace your fate.',14,0,100,0,0,58667,0,0,0,'Nythendra to Breath Stalker'),(30023,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(30022,1,0,'Yes, my precious, we will tear them apart! For the one true king!',14,0,100,15,0,13907,0,30708,0,'Vladof the Butcher'),(30022,2,0,'Useless mongrel! I\'ll kill \'em myself!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30709,0,'Vladof the Butcher'),(30022,3,0,'Vladof dismounts!',41,0,100,1,0,0,0,30710,0,'Vladof the Butcher'),(30022,4,0,'%s begins to spin, encased in a magical shield!',41,0,100,1,0,0,0,30791,0,'Vladof the Butcher'),(27156,1,0,'Grim news, my pint-sized companion. Should we suffer a defeat here the ramifications will be felt across this frozen wasteland. Lord Fordragon and our armies at the Wrathgate will be defenseless against an assault from Naxxramas.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 2'),(27156,0,0,'The mine is lost. All of our defenders have perished and the miners resurrected as Scourge aberrations!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 1'),(27278,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(26198,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27209,0,0,'Come to play?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26472,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(28136,1,0,'<sigh>... This is the end of me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27520,0,''),(28142,1,0,'<sigh>... This is the end of me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27520,0,''),(28148,1,0,'Ohhh, I... cannot go on....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27527,0,''),(7357,3,0,'Slay them, my brethren! For the Scourge!',14,0,100,0,0,5822,0,6184,0,'Mordresh Fire Eye - SAY_AGGRO'),(8516,0,0,'All right, stay close.  These fiends will jump right out of the shadows at you if you let your guard down.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4493,0,'Belnistrasz SAY_QUEST_ACCEPTED'),(8516,1,0,'Okay, here we go.  It\'s going to take about five minutes to shut this thing down through the ritual.  Once I start, keep the vermin off of me or it will be the end of us all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4501,0,'Belnistrasz SAY_EVENT_START'),(8516,2,0,'Three minutes left -- I can feel the energy starting to build!  Keep up the solid defense!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4504,0,'Belnistrasz SAY_EVENT_THREE_MIN_LEFT'),(8516,3,0,'Just two minutes to go!  We\'re half way there, but don\'t let your guard down!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4505,0,'Belnistrasz SAY_EVENT_TWO_MIN_LEFT'),(8516,4,0,'One more minute!  Hold on now, the ritual is about to take hold!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4506,0,'Belnistrasz SAY_EVENT_ONE_MIN_LEFT'),(8516,5,0,'That\'s it -- we made it!  The ritual is set in motion, and idol fires are about to go out for good!  You truly are the heroes I thought you would be!',14,0,100,4,0,0,0,4507,0,'Belnistrasz SAY_EVENT_END'),(8516,6,0,'You\'ll rue the day you crossed me, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9008,0,'Belnistrasz SAY_AGGRO'),(8516,7,0,'Watch out for the $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9006,0,'Belnistrasz SAY_WATCH_OUT'),(4420,0,0,'For Victory! For Agamaggan!',14,0,100,0,0,5812,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(8567,1,0,'Me feast on you all!',14,0,100,0,0,5824,0,6186,0,'Glutton - SAY_SLAY'),(8567,0,0,'Me smell stench of the living!',14,0,100,0,0,5823,0,6185,0,'Glutton - SAY_AGGRO'),(31810,0,0,'Right. Let\'s see if we can finish this keystone.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32385,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(31810,1,0,'The keystone is completed! We\'ve done it, $n!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,32391,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(31810,2,0,'Who knows what secrets await within Ulduar\'s archives? I\'m off to discover them. Thank you again for your help, $n. Without it, I\'d still be searching for that key.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,32393,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(31814,0,0,'Welcome, Brann Bronzebeard. I am all that remains of this temple\'s guardian.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32386,0,'A Distant Voice'),(31814,1,0,'You have proven yourself as an explorer and seeker of knowledge.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32387,0,'A Distant Voice'),(31814,2,0,'You have been a steadfast ally to the Earthen.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32388,0,'A Distant Voice'),(31814,3,0,'You and your companion have proven yourselves in combat and in the pursuit of the keystone.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32389,0,'A Distant Voice'),(31814,4,0,'Your motives are pure. The keystone\'s parts shall be reunited. Go to Ulduar and learn the answers to your questions, Brann Bronzebeard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32390,0,'A Distant Voice'),(27631,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Angrathar Aberration on enrage'),(27784,0,0,'Next, I shall speak of the most powerful entities within the pinnacle of Naxxramas. Truly, these are two of the greatest threats to all of Northrend.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27054,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Pinnacle of Naxxramas'),(27784,1,0,'Next, I shall speak of the death knight wing of Naxxramas. Within its corrupted halls, the echo of battle rings day and night, as our finest warriors are corrupted and twisted into the Scourge\'s greatest warriors.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27053,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Death knight wing of Naxxramas'),(27784,2,0,'Next, I shall speak of the blighted abomination wing of Naxxramas. There, the Scourge develop the strongest and most hideous aberrations of their armies.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27052,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Blighted abomination wing of Naxxramas'),(27784,3,0,'Next, I shall speak of the accursed spider wing of Naxxramas. It is there the Scourge breed even more poisonous and dangerous versions of their kin.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27051,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Accursed spider wing of Naxxramas'),(27784,4,0,'Next, I shall speak of the dread plague wing of Naxxramas, where the Scourge seek to improve upon the deadly blight which they spread across Lordaeron.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27050,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Dread plague wing of Naxxramas'),(27784,5,0,'I shall leave this image on display for your perusal. Study your opponents\' strengths, for a creature\'s strength can also be its weakness.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27059,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - End of talk'),(27784,6,0,'Sapphiron. Once a noble blue dragon within the mountains of Northrend, Sapphiron was slain by Arthas during his campaign through the frozen north. Resurrected to serve him, Sapphiron guards Kel\'thuzad\'s lair eternally, awaiting those who would dare tresspass upon his master.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27079,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,7,0,'The lich, Kel\'Thuzad. He serves the Lich King without question, a necromancer of great prowess in life, turned into a master of necromancy after his death. It is said he is the most loyal of the Lich King\'s subjects.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27080,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,8,0,'Kel\'thuzad has survived trials that would have long since shattered the souls of even the greatest of the Brotherhood. He readily gave his life at Arthas\'s hand, later to be brought back - reborn in the power of the Sunwell. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27081,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,9,0,'In the Plaguelands, Kel\'thuzad was again defeated by the agents of the Argent Dawn. However, his phylactery was delivered to a false agent of the Brotherhood. We have yet to discover who stole his phylactery or why. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27082,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,10,0,'Pay attention. This is Instructor Razuvious, Kel\'Thuzad\'s appointed trainer of all death knights. It is said that his own technique is so potent, only a disciple of his could possibly withstand his might.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27060,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,11,0,'Gothik, the Harvester. A master of necromancy and conjuration, Gothik is said to be able to beckon forth legions of the undead at a moment\'s notice. It is with his guidance that even the weakest of Death Knights can raise the dead.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27061,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,12,0,'The most powerful death knights within Naxxramas are the four horsemen. They represent the pinnacle of Kel\'Thuzad\'s guard. The first, Thane Korth\'azz, holds the power of flame. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27062,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,13,0,'The next, Lady Blaumeux, calls forth the power of shadows, drawing the souls of the living into the voracious embrace.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27063,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,14,0,'Sir Zeliek, a paladin in life, so strong in his faith, that even in undeath, the power of the light still heeds his call, smiting his foes in battle.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27064,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,15,0,'The final death knight, Lord Mograine, was the finest warrior that the death knights had ever seen. However, after the events in Azeroth, he vanished without a trace. It is yet to be seen who Kel\'Thuzad has appointed in his place.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27065,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,16,0,'Behold, Patchwerk. When word of his existence first reached the ears of the Brotherhood, none believed the tales of an abomination with such immense speed and strength. Fewer still believed it when he fell the first time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27074,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,17,0,'Grobbulus, the first of what was to be an army of flesh giants. It carried the plague slime of Naxxramas within its body, injecting the living ooze into the bodies of its foe. The recipient of this foul injection would usually flee to his allies, bringing them down with him.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27075,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,18,0,'Gluth, the foul plague-dog of Naxxramas, was said to have an appetite so voracious that even the living were not enough to satisfy his hunger. Feugen was said to feed him an army of zombies daily, recycling the remains of undead too weak to use in combat.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27077,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,19,0,'Thaddius, built from the flesh of women and children, it is said that their souls are fused together - eternally bound within that foul prison of flesh. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27078,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,20,0,'Anub\'Rekhan, one of the finest Spider Lords of Azjol\'Nerub, was brought under the control of the Scourge when he and his former commander, Anub\'arak, were finally defeated by Lich King many years ago. It is said that he was the most loyal of Anub\'arak\'s commanders.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27066,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,21,0,'The Grand Widow Faerlina, a botanist in life, breeder and caretaker of arachnids in death, she overseers the spider wing, developing the most potent of poisons for the Lich King. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27070,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,22,0,'Maexxna, born deep within the mountains of Northrend many ages ago, she was captured within the dread citadel Naxxramas, where she gives birth to her brood, feeding them the corpses of all who dare venture too deeply into Naxxramas.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27073,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,23,0,'Behold, Noth the Plaguebringer. Responsible for the creation of the process that distills the souls of the living and places them within the cold cage of undeath, Noth was observed to be refining this process even now. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27055,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,24,0,'Observe, Heigan the Unclean. The mastermind behind the plague cauldrons that turned the wilderness of Azeroth into the Plaguelands. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27056,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,25,0,'It is said that Heigan has rigged the very walls and floors of Naxxramas itself with a vast array of traps, which he can trigger at will.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27057,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,26,0,'Loatheb. The hideous result of fusing the living plague of the Plaguelands with the bog beasts of Azeroth, Loatheb is said to control the power of healing itself. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27058,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(22007,0,0,'Samia, do you know who Kolphis Darkscale is?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,19717,0,'Tree Warden Chawn OOC text'),(21983,0,0,'Yes, he\'s the second-in-command of the wyrmcult at the Blackwing Coven to the west.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19718,0,'Samia Inkling OOC text'),(21114,0,0,'YEOW!!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,18798,0,'Station Technician'),(21114,0,1,'I\'M ON FIRE!!!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,18792,0,'Station Technician'),(21114,0,2,'IT BURNS!!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,18794,0,'Station Technician'),(21114,0,3,'I\'M ON FIRE!!!  AGAIN!!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,18793,0,'Station Technician'),(21114,0,4,'WHY ME!?!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,18796,0,'Station Technician'),(21114,0,5,'Not again...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,18795,0,'Station Technician'),(21118,0,0,'LET\'S ROCK!!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,19143,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event'),(21118,1,0,'FIRE UP THE DEF GUNS!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,19673,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event'),(21118,2,0,'Where\'s our back up?  I want them here now!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,19140,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event'),(21118,3,0,'Last push boys!  Let \'em have it!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,19453,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event'),(21118,4,0,'Nice work soldiers!  This is the last of them!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,19455,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event'),(21118,4,1,'This is the last of them.  Don\'t get sloppy!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,19454,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event'),(21118,5,0,'We can handle it from here.  Roughriders you are dismissed.',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,19674,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event'),(21118,6,0,'Come on you apes. You want to live forever?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,19095,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event random combat text'),(21118,6,1,'Warm it up and give \'em everything you\'ve got.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,19096,0,'Razak Ironsides - Ravager invasion event random combat text'),(21118,6,2,'I only have one rule. Everyone fights. No one quits.',12,