t da power!',14,0,100,0,0,12026,0,23613,0,'Halazzi - Killed unit'),(23557,4,1,'Ya all gonna fail!',14,0,100,0,0,12027,0,23614,0,'Halazzi - Killed unit'),(23557,5,0,'Chaga... choka\'jinn.',14,0,100,0,0,12028,0,23611,0,'Halazzi - Death'),(23557,6,0,'Whatch you be doing? Pissin\' yourselves...',14,0,100,0,0,12025,0,0,0,'Halazzi - Death'),(36939,0,0,'Rise up, sons and daughters of the Horde! Today we battle a hated enemy of the Horde! LOK\'TAR OGAR!',14,0,100,0,0,17087,0,37689,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_1'),(36939,1,0,'Kor\'kron, take us out!',14,0,100,0,0,17088,0,37691,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_2'),(36939,2,0,'What is that? Something approaching in the distance.',14,0,100,0,0,17089,0,37692,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_3'),(36939,3,0,'ALLIANCE GUNSHIP! ALL HANDS ON DECK!',14,0,100,0,0,17090,0,37694,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_4'),(36939,4,0,'You answer to Saurfang now!',14,0,100,0,0,17091,0,37697,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_5'),(36939,5,0,'You will know our business soon. Kor\'kron, ANNIHILATE THEM!',14,0,100,0,0,17092,0,37698,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_6'),(36939,6,0,'This is not your battle, dwarf. Back down or we will be forced to destroy your ship.',14,0,100,0,0,17083,0,37685,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_INTRO_A'),(36939,7,0,'You DARE board my ship? Your death will come swiftly.',14,0,100,0,0,17083,0,37712,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_BOARD'),(36939,8,0,'Reavers, Sergeants, attack!',14,0,100,0,0,17081,0,37710,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_ENTER_SKYBREAKER'),(36939,9,0,'Axethrowers, hurl faster!',14,0,100,0,0,17079,0,37708,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_AXETHROWERS'),(36939,10,0,'Rocketeers, reload!',14,0,100,0,0,17080,0,37709,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_ROCKETEERS'),(36939,11,0,'We\'re taking hull damage, get a battle-mage out here to shut down those cannons!',14,0,100,0,0,17082,0,37711,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_MAGES'),(36939,12,0,'The Alliance falter. Onward to the Lich King!',14,0,100,0,0,17084,0,37713,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_VICTORY'),(36939,13,0,'Damage control! Put those fires out. You haven\'t seen the last of the Horde!',14,0,100,0,0,17085,0,37714,0,'High Overlord Saurfang - SAY_SAURFANG_WIPE'),(36948,0,0,'Fire up the engines! We got a meetin\' with destiny, lads!',14,0,100,0,0,16962,0,37677,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_INTRO_1'),(36948,1,0,'Hold on to yer hats!',14,0,100,0,0,16963,0,37678,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_INTRO_2'),(36948,2,0,'What in the world is that? Grab me spyglass, crewman!',14,0,100,0,0,16964,0,37679,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_INTRO_3'),(36948,3,0,'By me own beard! HORDE SAILIN\' IN FAST \'N HOT!',14,0,100,0,0,16965,0,37680,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_INTRO_4'),(36948,4,0,'EVASIVE ACTION! MAN THE GUNS!',14,0,100,0,0,16966,0,37681,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_INTRO_5'),(36948,5,0,'Cowardly dogs! Ye blindsided us!',14,0,100,0,0,16967,0,37682,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_INTRO_6'),(36948,6,0,'Not me battle? I dunnae who ye think ye are, mister, but I got a score to settle with Arthas and yer not gettin\' in me way! FIRE ALL GUNS! FIRE! FIRE!',14,0,100,0,0,16968,0,37683,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_INTRO_7'),(36948,7,0,'Move yer jalopy or we\'ll blow it out of the sky, orc! The Horde\'s got no business here.',14,0,100,0,0,16969,0,37699,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_INTRO_H'),(36948,8,0,'What\'s this then?! Ye won\'t be takin\' this son o\' Ironforge\'s vessel without a fight!',14,0,100,0,0,16958,0,37704,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_BOARD'),(36948,9,0,'Marines, Sergeants, attack!',14,0,100,0,0,16956,0,37702,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_ENTER_ORGRIMMS_HAMMER'),(36948,10,0,'Riflemen, shoot faster!',14,0,100,0,0,16954,0,37700,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard - SAY_MURADIN_RIFLEMAN'),(36948,11,0,'Mortar team, reload!',14,0,100,0,0,169