uction of elder servants will result in loss of enhancements on watcher Freya. However, permanent damage to Freya\'s person and possessions, including her watcher sigil, highly probable.',12,0,100,0,0,15448,0,33878,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,10,0,'Commencing watcher Hodir status analysis.',12,0,100,0,0,15453,0,33883,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,11,0,'Hodir\'s sigil appears to be located inside a cache of artifacts.',12,0,100,0,0,15454,0,33884,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,12,0,'Watcher Hodir\'s temperament and behavior highly unstable. Destruction of cache highly probable during prolonged combat.',12,0,100,0,0,15455,0,33885,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,13,0,'Allies present in the field of battle are likely to provide synergies and minimize combat duration.',12,0,100,0,0,15456,0,33886,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,14,0,'Preservation of cache is essential to recovering Hodir\'s sigil.',12,0,100,0,0,15457,0,34059,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,15,0,'Commencing watcher Thorim status analysis.',12,0,100,0,0,15449,0,33880,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,16,0,'An external influence, under illusory guise of Thorim\'s deceased mate, Sif, has been detected.',12,0,100,0,0,15450,0,33881,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,17,0,'Mental interference from this presence dangerously close to triggering partial memory damage.',12,0,100,0,0,15451,0,33882,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,18,0,'Tactical analysis suggests approaching the arena from the front and splitting secondary force through a side passage at the ground level. This will maximize odds of reaching Thorim\'s outlook before mental domination by external presence is complete.',12,0,100,0,0,15452,0,34058,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,19,0,'Commencing watcher Mimiron status analysis.',12,0,100,0,0,15458,0,33887,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,20,0,'Watcher Mimiron\'s sigil is linked to a self-destruct mechanism connected to the entirety of the Corridors of Ingenuity.',12,0,100,0,0,15459,0,33888,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,21,0,'Trigger for self-destruct mechanism is codenamed \"Big Red Button\", Mimiron\'s own creation.',12,0,100,0,0,15461,0,33889,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,22,0,'To retrieve Mimiron\'s sigil, initiate self-destruct sequence and defeat Mimiron before its completion.',12,0,100,0,0,15462,0,33890,0,'Archivum System'),(33235,0,0,'You\'ve defeated the Iron Council and unlocked the Archivum!  Well done, lads!',14,0,100,5,0,15827,0,33833,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,1,0,'Now, this is what we call a nice find!',12,0,100,5,0,15808,0,33904,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,2,0,'New orders! Unlock the entry to the Celestial Planetarium.',12,0,100,25,0,15818,0,33932,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,3,0,'Four watchers? Sigils? Could ye be a little less cryptic, confounded machine?',12,0,100,274,0,15819,0,33933,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,4,0,'I\'ll show ye access, ye wretched machine. Here it is again: Norgannon\'s key!',12,0,100,5,0,15809,0,33905,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,5,0,'Looks just like all the other titan archives me lads have found... only older... and bigger.',12,0,100,5,0,15810,0,33906,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,6,0,'Wait a second: this doesn\'t look right! Next to this blinking light... what\'s this Algalon signal? ',12,0,100,5,0,15811,0,33907,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,7,0,'Prime Designate? Where have I \'eard that before? By my grandfather\'s beard, Loken is Azeroth\'s Prime Designate. Loken\'s death triggered this!',12,0,100,5,0,15812,0,33908,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,8,0,'Well? Who\'s on the listening side of the signal? What\'s going to happen?',12,0,100,5,0,15813,0,33909,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,9,0,'Planetary re-origination? Speak plainly, ye blasted machine!',12,0,100,5,0,15814,0,33910,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,10,0,'Hear that, lads? It\'s only the end of the world! Well, what are ye waiting for, ye rusty machine? Initiate Reply-code Alpha. All is well! Pints are on me!',12,0,100,5,0,15815,0,33911,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,11,0,'Well, what\'s this Algalon going to be looking for with his diagnostics? What are our chances?',12,0,100,5,0,15816,0,33912,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,12,0,'Blast it, lads. Looks like we\'ve got a fight ahead of us.',12,0,100,5,0,15817,0,33913,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,13,0,'How do we get the sigils from them, then? Just walk up to them and ask them nicely?',12,0,100,5,0,15820,0,33934,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,14,0,'You\'re going to tell us how to... \"un-compromise\" the sigils, aren\'t you?',12,0,100,5,0,15821,0,33935,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33235,15,0,'I\'ve dreamed of roaming the halls of the titans for years. I never thought I\'d be pitted against their creations.',12,0,100,5,0,15822,0,33936,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(33874,23,0,'Access to the Archivum granted.  Intrusion protection mechanisms suspended.',12,0,100,0,0,15427,0,33895,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,24,0,'Initiating query.  The Algalon Failsafe is an automated emergency signal following a Prime Designate\'s demise.',12,0,100,0,0,15428,0,33896,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,25,0,'Affirmative.  Timestamp of Prime Designate Loken\'s destruction coincides with signal activation.',12,0,100,0,0,15429,0,33897,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,26,0,'Searching...  Destruction of Prime Designate is considered the first warning sign of systemic  planetary failure.  Algalon observer entity\'s arrival is followed by planetary diagnostics resulting in one of two possible reply signals.  Reply-code Alpha, signaling \"All is well\" and Reply-code Omega, signaling planetary re-origination.',12,0,100,0,0,15430,0,33898,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,27,0,'The decomposition of the planet and its living organisms into base elements: metals, rocks, gases. This is followed by a period of reconstitution of each element into the original planetary blueprint.',12,0,100,0,0,15431,0,33899,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,28,0,'Request denied.  Reply-codes built into Algalon observer entity.  He is both messenger and message.',12,0,100,0,0,15432,0,33900,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,29,0,'Algalon diagnostics assess danger of systemic Old God corruption in planetary vital functions.  Calculating chance of Omega Reply-code...',12,0,100,0,0,15433,0,33901,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,30,0,'Request denied. Access requires manual verification of the four watchers\' sigils.',12,0,100,0,0,15436,0,33937,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,31,0,'The four watchers of Ulduar: Freya, Thorim, Hodir, and Mimiron. The sigils are tied to their physical and mental integrity. All four sigils are required for access to the Celestial Planetarium.',12,0,100,0,0,15437,0,33938,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,32,0,'Analyzing watcher status. Please wait.',12,0,100,0,0,15438,0,33939,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,33,0,'Corruption found. External influence gaining control over watchers. Sigils compromised.',12,0,100,0,0,15439,0,33940,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,34,0,'Sufficient use of force would trigger a reset in watcher functions, removing the external influence.',12,0,100,0,0,15440,0,33941,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,35,0,'As for not endangering the sigils during this process, I can analyze each watcher\'s status and make that information available to you upon completion of calculations.',12,0,100,0,0,15441,0,33942,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,36,0,'Fragment analysis underway.',12,0,100,0,0,15463,0,34061,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,37,0,'Object identified: Val\'anyr, hammer of ancient kings.',12,0,100,0,0,15464,0,34062,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,38,0,'Created by the titans themselves, Val\'anyr was given to the first earthen king, Urel Stoneheart. With the hammer he was to create and give life to the rest of his brethren.',12,0,100,0,0,15465,0,34063,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,39,0,'Val\'anyr was shattered during the first war between the earthen and the iron dwarves. The weapon\'s remnants were believed lost in the conflict.',12,0,100,0,0,15466,0,34064,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,40,0,'Probability of successful repair by ordinary means available in this world is close to nil. Please hold while theoretical means are analyzed.',12,0,100,0,0,15467,0,34065,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,41,0,'Powerful acidic content theoretically found inside the being known as Yogg-Saron would account for the liquification of saronite. Submersion in this substance might be sufficient to rebind an alloy of titan origin.',12,0,100,0,0,15468,0,34066,0,'Archivum System'),(12923,0,0,'I\'m saved! Thank you, doctor!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8355,0,''),(12924,0,0,'I\'m saved! Thank you, doctor!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8355,0,''),(12925,0,0,'I\'m saved! Thank you, doctor!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8355,0,''),(17123,0,0,'Welcome, kind spirit.  What has brought you to us?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,13512,0,'Earthcaller Ryga'),(36954,6,0,'Arise minions.  Do not let them pass.',14,0,100,0,0,17216,0,38669,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_GHOUL'),(30824,1,0,'Get on board, now! This whole mountainside could collapse at any moment.',14,0,100,0,0,16733,0,37212,0,'Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar - Final'),(30344,1,0,'Quickly, climb aboard! We mustn\'t tarry here! There\'s no telling when this whole mountainside will collapse.',14,0,100,0,0,16722,0,37213,0,'High Captain Justin Bartlett - Final'),(30344,0,0,'FIRE! FIRE!',14,0,100,0,0,16721,0,36993,0,'High Captain Justin Bartlett - Fire'),(16980,0,0,'Intruders have breached the inner sanctum. Hasten the destruction of the green dragon! Leave only bones and sinew for the reanimation!',14,0,0,0,0,17251,0,38682,0,'The Lich King - Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_LICH_KING_INTRO'),(29,1,0,'Let the battle for the Strand of the Ancients begin!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,28844,3,'Kanrethad'),(29,2,0,'Round 1 - Finished!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,28989,3,'Kanrethad'),(29260,1,0,'Sparklight\'s vehicle emporium is open for business!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30230,0,'Rigger Sparklight'),(29262,1,0,'Rigspark\'s vehicle shop is open for business!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30229,0,'Gorgril Rigspark'),(22515,1,0,'The Gate of the Blue Sapphire is under attack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29296,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Blue Sapphire is under attack'),(22515,2,0,'The Gate of the Green Emerald is under attack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29297,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Green Emerald is under attack'),(22515,3,0,'The Gate of the Red Sun is under attack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29298,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Red Sun is under attack'),(22515,4,0,'The Gate of the Purple Amethyst is under attack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29299,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Purple Amethyst is under attack'),(22515,5,0,'The Gate of the Yellow Moon is under attack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29300,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Yellow Moon is under attack'),(22515,6,0,'The Gate of the Yellow Moon was destroyed!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29304,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Yellow Moon was destroyed'),(22515,7,0,'The Gate of the Purple Amethyst was destroyed!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29305,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Purple Amethyst was destroyed'),(22515,8,0,'The Gate of the Red Sun was destroyed!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29306,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Red Sun was destroyed'),(22515,9,0,'The Gate of the Green Emerald was destroyed!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29307,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Green Emerald was destroyed'),(22515,10,0,'The Gate of the Blue Sapphire was destroyed!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29308,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Gate of the Blue Sapphire was destroyed'),(22515,11,0,'The Eastern Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!',41,0,100,0,0,8212,0,29925,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Eastern Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance'),(22515,12,0,'The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!',41,0,100,0,0,8212,0,29926,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance'),(22515,13,0,'The Southern Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance!',41,0,100,0,0,8212,0,29927,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Southern Graveyard has been captured by the Alliance'),(22515,14,0,'The Eastern Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!',41,0,100,0,0,8174,0,29928,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Eastern Graveyard has been captured by the Horde'),(22515,15,0,'The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!',41,0,100,0,0,8174,0,29929,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Western Graveyard has been captured by the Horde'),(22515,16,0,'The Southern Graveyard has been captured by the Horde!',41,0,100,0,0,8174,0,29930,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The Southern Graveyard has been captured by the Horde'),(22515,17,0,'The relic chamber is under attack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33072,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The relic chamber is under attack'),(22515,18,0,'The chamber has been breached! The titan relic is vulnerable!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33073,3,'World Trigger - SOA - The chamber has been breached'),(36954,8,0,'Death\'s cold embrace awaits.',14,0,100,0,0,17221,0,37174,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_WINTER'),(36954,9,0,'Nowhere to run! You\'re mine now...',14,0,100,0,0,17223,0,36994,0,'Lich King SAY_LICH_KING_END_DUN'),(27914,0,0,'I have arrived. Shall we set to work, then?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27295,0,'Ethereal Soul-Trader'),(27914,1,0,'Ah, more essence to capture...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27336,0,'Ethereal Soul-Trader'),(27914,2,0,'Here is your share.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27341,0,'Ethereal Soul-Trader'),(23224,0,1,'Yes, unless I have anything to do with it.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21157,0,''),(23224,0,2,'I see that happening sometime between tomorrow and the next decade. Definitely.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21158,0,''),(23224,0,3,'Looks good for you...and bad for me.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21160,0,''),(23224,0,4,'I\'ve consulted my fellow imps, and we think YES, except for that one imp.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21161,0,''),(23224,0,5,'The outlook is positive, but I\'m still negative.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21162,0,''),(23224,0,6,'It pains me to say this, but \"Yes\".',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21163,0,''),(23224,0,7,'When dwarves fly! They do? Then yes!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21164,0,''),(23224,0,8,'Sure, but you\'re not going to like it.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21165,0,''),(23224,0,9,'Be quiet \'bout what you hear and see around here, $r.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21166,0,''),(23224,0,10,'Unfortunately... yes.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21169,0,''),(23224,0,11,'I can\'t see why not, although, I can\'t see a lot of things right now.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21170,0,''),(23224,0,12,'I would bet your soul on it.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21171,0,''),(23224,0,13,'Yes, but if anyone asks... It wasn\'t me who told you.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21172,0,''),(23224,0,14,'Didn\'t you already ask that once? Yes already!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21173,0,''),(23224,0,15,'Please... Is Kil\'jaeden red?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21175,0,''),(23224,0,16,'Yeah, sure. You just keep thinking that.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21176,0,''),(23224,0,17,'I suppose.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21177,0,''),(23224,0,18,'Definitely.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21178,0,''),(23224,0,19,'Jump three times and dance for ten minutes and it will definitely happen!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21179,0,''),(23224,0,20,'Word on the peninsula is YES!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21180,0,''),(23224,0,21,'Oh, that one\'s for sure.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21181,0,''),(23224,0,22,'Yes, but not in the way you imagine.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21182,0,''),(23224,0,23,'Yes, yes, a thousand times, yes already!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21183,0,''),(23224,0,24,'Yes, now stop pestering me!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21184,0,''),(23224,0,25,'The answer will be a yes if you let me out of here.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21185,0,''),(23224,0,26,'It\'s as sure as the warts on my backside!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21186,0,''),(23224,0,27,'The answer is yes in here, I don\'t see why it would be any different out there.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21187,0,''),(23224,0,28,'Three words - \"ab - so - lutely\"!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21188,0,''),(23224,0,29,'Yes, but I hoped I would never have to answer that.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21189,0,''),(23224,0,30,'Ask me again later - I\'m trying to scratch my nose and it\'s hard to concentrate.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21190,0,''),(23224,0,31,'Why should I answer that?  Do you tell fortunes when people shake YOU?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21191,0,''),(23224,0,32,'Yes, it will rain.  That\'s not what you asked?  Too bad!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21192,0,''),(23224,0,33,'I\'m sorry, I can only speak Demonic.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21193,0,''),(23224,0,34,'Yes!  I mean no!  I mean... which answer gets me out of here?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21194,0,''),(23224,0,35,'Yes, No, Maybe so.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21195,0,''),(23224,0,36,'It won\'t matter, you\'ll be dead by tomorrow.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21196,0,''),(23224,0,37,'You should be asking \"Is that rogue behind me going to kill me?\"',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21197,0,''),(23224,0,38,'It\'s times like these that I wish I had a longer cooldown.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21198,0,''),(23224,0,39,'%s shrugs. Who knows?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21199,0,''),(23224,0,40,'It\'s like my mother always said: [Demonic] \"Razxx khaj jhashxx xashjx.\"',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21205,0,''),(23224,0,41,'%s is ignoring you.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21206,0,''),(23224,0,42,'Why me?  Why not a goblin, or a gnome...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21207,0,''),(23224,0,43,'What happens in the twisting nether, stays in the twisting nether.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21208,0,''),(23224,0,44,'Avoid taking unnecessary gambles. Your lucky numbers are two, two and half, and eleven-teen.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21209,0,''),(23224,0,45,'Wouldn\'t you like to know?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21210,0,''),(23224,0,46,'Oh, oh, oh!  I can see this one clearly...  Nah, lost it.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21211,0,''),(23224,0,47,'This was NOT in my contract!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21212,0,''),(23224,0,48,'XRA RAHKI MAZIZRA!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21213,0,''),(23224,0,49,'4 8 15 16 23 42',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21214,0,''),(23224,0,50,'Are you making fun of me?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21215,0,''),(23224,0,51,'What kind of imp do you think I am?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21216,0,''),(23224,0,52,'Say please.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21217,0,''),(23224,0,53,'Want to trade places?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21218,0,''),(23224,0,54,'Do you ask this question to everything that\'s trapped in a ball?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21219,0,''),(23224,0,55,'Hey! You try arranging furniture with some jerk shaking your house!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21220,0,''),(23224,0,56,'I can make that happen. Just sign below the dotted line...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21221,0,''),(23224,0,57,'Reply hazy and slightly damp. Dry thoroughly and try again.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21222,0,''),(23224,0,58,'Concentrate (on releasing me from this infernal prison) and try again later.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21223,0,''),(23224,0,59,'Please insert 25 silver pieces and try again.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21224,0,''),(23224,0,60,'Are you my pal, Danny?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21225,0,''),(23224,0,61,'You remember the time you tried to drill that hole in your head?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21226,0,''),(23224,0,62,'Oh that\'s right, don\'t make any effort to make your own fortune!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21227,0,''),(23224,0,63,'Two words - imp-possible!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21228,0,''),(23224,0,64,'You need Arcane Intellect, because that answer is obvious!  NO!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21229,0,''),(23224,0,65,'Not on your life!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21230,0,''),(23224,0,66,'I don\'t have to be a fortune-telling imp to know the answer to that one - NO!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21231,0,''),(23224,0,67,'The odds are 32.33 (repeating of course) percent chance of success.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21232,0,''),(23224,0,68,'When Blackrock freezes over!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21233,0,''),(23224,0,69,'Hahahaha, you\'re kidding right?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21234,0,''),(23224,0,70,'Inconceivable!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21235,0,''),(23224,0,71,'My sources say \"no\". Before the torture, that is.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21236,0,''),(23224,0,72,'That\'s about as likely as me getting out of this ball.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21237,0,''),(23224,0,73,'You picked the wrong time to shake me today, buddy!  Prepare for disappointment.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21238,0,''),(23224,0,74,'Not unless you\'re some kind of super-person.  And don\'t kid yourself, you\'re not.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21239,0,''),(23224,0,75,'That\'s about as likely as me getting a date with a succubus.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21240,0,''),(23224,0,76,'My fortune telling powers are immeasurable - your chances are though: NO CHANCE',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21241,0,''),(23224,0,77,'NO - and don\'t try shaking me again for a better answer!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21242,0,''),(23224,0,78,'Yes is my answer...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21243,0,''),(23224,0,79,'...NOT!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21244,0,''),(23224,0,80,'I\'m gonna have to give this one the big N-O.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21245,0,''),(23224,0,81,'The outlook is very bad - for YOU that is!  Haha, take it!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21246,0,''),(23224,0,82,'Survey says: BZZZT!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21247,0,''),(14467,0,0,'Kroshius live? Kroshius crush!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9633,0,'Kroshius'),(25334,0,0,'%s gains fuel.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,26171,0,'Horde Siege Tank'),(29368,0,0,'How predictable! But then, who would expect a rock to think like anything other than one?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,30895,0,''),(29368,1,0,'If you\'re so eager to fight, I\'ll oblige you. But know that nothing you do here can prevent the completion of the iron colossus!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,30896,0,''),(29801,0,0,'At last, the tyranny of the stormforged is at its end!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,30891,0,''),(29801,1,0,'We\'ve defeated Valduran and we\'ll fell his colossus.',12,0,100,0,25,0,0,33052,0,''),(30152,0,0,'No more will your minions assail the creatures of stone and their allies.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30893,0,''),(30152,1,0,'I am your doom, Valduran!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,30894,0,''),(30152,2,0,'Well fought! The day is ours, but the war goes on!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,33053,0,''),(27238,0,0,'My beautiful mill. You! You\'ll die for this!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,26418,0,'Foreman Kaleiki'),(26287,0,0,'Thel\'zan\'s phylactery drops to the ground beneath Icestorm',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,27125,0,'Icestorm'),(27843,0,0,'I\'ll flush her out, $N! You just be ready for her when she comes in!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27120,0,'Wyrmbait'),(27844,0,0,'FIRE! FIRE! BRING HER DOWN!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27123,0,'Legion Commander Tyralion'),(25802,0,0,'You challenge Kaw, destroyer of mammoths? Then face me and feel my thunder!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25071,0,'Kaw the Mammoth Destroyer'),(27383,0,0,'I was... once like you. Mortal. Soft. Only flesh and bone. WEAK AND TIMID!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27157,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),(27383,1,0,'Our lord, Arthas saw in me the frailty of man.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27159,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),(27383,2,0,'\"Serve me in life and I will promise to rend the weakness from your soul. To erase it from existence!\" To be chosen... blessed by the Lich King in such a way.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27160,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),(27383,3,0,'So serve him I did... Were it not for me the glorious dread citadel of Naxxramas may never have returned to Northrend.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27161,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),(27383,4,0,'But enough talk... You have fought hard and come from the distant reaches of this world to face the Duskbringer. I shall not disappoint...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27162,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),(27383,5,0,'Just as our lord saved me, so too shall I save you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27163,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),(27383,6,0,'THIS WILL BE THE LAST TIME YOU UTTER THAT NAME, PALADIN! Breathe your dying breath!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27176,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),(27383,7,0,'Rise, my minions! Your master commands it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27164,0,'Thel zan the Duskbringer'),(3118,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(5822,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3117,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3115,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3116,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(26639,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27431,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(27713,0,0,'What is it?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27143,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27857,0,0,'Steel yourselves, soldiers. $N has provided us us with the final piece of this puzzle. The dread lich, Thel\'zan, will soon come out of hiding, only to be rendered powerless against us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27155,0,'Legion Commander Yorik'),(27857,1,0,'It is this phylactery, Thel\'zan\'s phylactery - that is the key to this victory!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27156,0,'Legion Commander Yorik'),(27857,2,0,'LEGION, STEADY YOURSELVES!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27158,0,'Legion Commander Yorik'),(27858,0,0,'Honor, courage, compassion and justice! Those were once the virtues you fought for as a cleric of the Argent Dawn, Thel\'zan.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27173,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(27858,1,0,'You dedicated your whole life to fighting the Scourge. You saw what they did to our beloved Lordaeron. The Lich King took everything from you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27174,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(27858,2,0,'So how, then, did Father Inigo Montoy, bastion of virtue for the Argent Dawn, become the embodiment of that which he hated most?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27175,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(27858,3,0,'Now, be free and join the battle! Let us end this together!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27182,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(27858,4,0,'Victory for the Alliance!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27180,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(27858,5,0,'You have saved Wintergarde! With Thel\'zan\'s filth washed away, the 7th Legion will easily clean up the remaining Scourge. When you are done here, report to Angrathar!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27181,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(32149,0,2,'It was awful... I dreamt I was fighting against my friends.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35293,0,'Fallen Hero\'s Spirit'),(32149,0,3,'I can\'t hear the screams anymore. Is this the end?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35294,0,'Fallen Hero\'s Spirit'),(32149,0,4,'I\'m so tired. Just let me rest for a moment.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35295,0,'Fallen Hero\'s Spirit'),(32149,0,1,'My nightmare, is it finally over?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35292,0,'Fallen Hero\'s Spirit'),(22911,0,0,'You dare summon me?',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,20773,0,'Vim\'gol the Vile'),(22911,1,0,'Now me grow bigger and crush you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21264,0,'Vim\'gol the Vile'),(27247,0,0,'Yes, your eminence. Come on!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,26609,0,'Devout Bodyguard'),(27439,0,0,'I know a place nearby where we can speak in private, my child. Follow me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26629,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),(27439,1,0,'Did you think that I could not see through your flimsy disguise, $N?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,26631,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),(27439,2,0,'There is much that you do not understand, $R. The Master sees all.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26632,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),(27439,3,0,'He told me that you would come for me. I won\'t die by your hand, though. I have seen what you have done to my compatriots.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,26633,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),(27439,4,0,'No. I will leave this world in a manner of my own choosing. And I will return, the grand admiral\'s will permitting!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,26634,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),(27439,5,0,'AAAEEEEIIIiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii........................................',12,0,100,0,0,2943,0,26636,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),(23311,0,0,'ARGH! BOOTERANG!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21335,0,'Disobedient Dragonmaw Peon'),(23311,0,1,'AYAYA! One day me have dat booterang...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21336,0,'Disobedient Dragonmaw Peon'),(23311,0,2,'HEY! No more booterang! Me sorry! Me work!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21332,0,'Disobedient Dragonmaw Peon'),(23311,0,3,'OOF! Booterang hurted me! Me tink work better den booterang!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21333,0,'Disobedient Dragonmaw Peon'),(23311,0,4,'OWWWW! Ok, ok, me go back to work!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21331,0,'Disobedient Dragonmaw Peon'),(23311,0,5,'WHY IT PUT DA BOOTERANG ON DA SKIN?? WHY??',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21334,0,'Disobedient Dragonmaw Peon'),(27492,1,0,'That\'s correct. My men report that the roads from here to the shore are held by the undead. You\'ll need to find an alternate route back to your ships.',12,0,100,378,4000,12724,0,26712,0,'Alliance Emissary 1 -