 cow and her new bull find true love.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23859,0,'Reef Cow to Attracted Reef Bull'),(23967,0,0,'Ahahaha! I must find the secrets!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22495,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,1,'I don\'t want to know anymore. Make me forget!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22496,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,2,'When one studies and digs, one reveals the truth.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22497,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,3,'We\'re safe; IT will never reach us here!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22498,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,4,'The end is nigh! That Which Must Not Be Named is almost free!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22499,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,5,'IT\'s coming! HIDE!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22500,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,6,'If only there were more time!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22501,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,7,'Forgive me oh great one. I did not mean to learn the truth!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22502,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,8,'The truth shall set you free. Like us, you will be with IT forever!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22503,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,9,'Now that you know the truth, I can\'t let you leave!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22504,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,10,'It\'ll all be over soon. Soon you will be in the embrace of That Which Must Not Be Named!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22505,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,11,'Intruder! You were sent to destroy us!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22506,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,12,'You cannot leave... IT mustn\'t find us!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22507,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,13,'If you\'re here, then IT might be close behind!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22508,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,14,'I will put an end to your life before you realize the horrible truth!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22509,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(23967,0,15,'Now you\'ll have to join us... permanently!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,22510,0,'Deranged Explorer'),(17246,0,0,'Yarr, Admiral. Let me think about it... Arrr... It be comin\' into focus.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13699,0,'\"Cookie\" McWeaksauce'),(17246,1,0,'It looks like it be succulent pork ribs basted with its own delectable juices and a side o\' Captain Sander\'s Secret Sauce - fer dippin\'.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13700,0,'\"Cookie\" McWeaksauce'),(17246,2,0,'And fer dessert we be havin\' cheesecake, flown in fresh from Stormwind on the wings o\' angels...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13701,0,'\"Cookie\" McWeaksauce'),(17246,3,0,'No. Not really...',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,13703,0,'\"Cookie\" McWeaksauce'),(17246,4,0,'It be chicken...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13704,0,'\"Cookie\" McWeaksauce'),(17240,0,0,'Hey, Cookie! What\'s for dinner tonight? And don\'t say chicken!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,13698,0,'Admiral Odesyus'),(17240,1,0,'Wow! Really?',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,13702,0,'Admiral Odesyus'),(17240,2,0,'I hate you so much, Cookie.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13705,0,'Admiral Odesyus'),(17242,0,0,'Of course! Anything for you, darling!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,13712,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),(17242,1,0,'Alright, let me take a look at that tablet.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13713,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),(17242,2,0,'%s slowly reads the tablet, mouthing the words in their native tongue.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,13714,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),(17242,3,0,'Naga warlord! Oh dear...',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,13715,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),(17242,4,0,'Well, you aren\'t going to like what I have to tell you, young missy. This tablet is a naga communication. Their leader, Warlord Sriss\'tiz, has ordered his naga to take the rest of the island by force.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13716,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),(17242,5,0,'And it looks like he\'s got reinforcements comin\' from Nazjatar!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,13717,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),(17242,6,0,'We\'ve got to do something about this!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,13718,0,'Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart'),(17241,0,0,'Adamant, could you please take a look at this tablet and try to decipher the runes?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13711,0,'Priestess Kyleen Il\'dinare'),(17241,1,0,'Thank you, Adamant. I think I know just the person for the job.',12,7,100,2,0,0,0,13719,0,'Priestess Kyleen Il\'dinare'),(17214,0,0,'Now to apply the ointment to her wounds.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13596,0,'Anchorite Fateema'),(17214,1,0,'It appears that the ointment is ineffective. Such a pity...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13597,0,'Anchorite Fateema'),(17214,2,0,'Man\'ari... But how... We are not eredar! She must know! If there are others like her, we must find them and explain...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13608,0,'Anchorite Fateema'),(17215,0,0,'There may still be a solution. Come here, $n. I will explain what I need.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,13598,0,'Daedal0'),(17215,1,0,'This should do it...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13599,0,'Daedal'),(17215,2,0,'Wake up little creature. Wake up from your slumber... You are safe now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13600,0,'Daedal'),(17117,0,0,'%s groans.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,13601,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),(17117,1,0,'%s sits up.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,13602,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),(17117,2,0,'Whe... Where am I? What... What is this place?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,13603,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),(17117,3,0,'BY THE LIGHT OF ELUNE! Eredar! Cursed demons, what have you done to me? I have not come alone, we will fight you as we have in the past! I...',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,13604,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),(17117,4,0,'%s falls back into a coma.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13605,0,'Injured Night Elf Priestess'),(17375,0,3,'[Furbolg] The prophecy is true!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13980,0,'Stillpine Captive'),(17375,0,4,'%s growls at its captors.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13977,0,'Stillpine Captive'),(4721,0,0,'The Earth Mother watch over us; under cover of the night as in the day. Let this fire illuminate both our bodies and spirits and remind us of our honored ancestors, who are ever present and guiding our way.',12,3,100,1,0,0,0,8677,0,'Zangen Stonehoof'),(17702,0,0,'Face the wrath of Bristlelimb!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14322,0,'High Chief Bristlelimb'),(24277,0,0,'Enough of this charade!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23064,0,'Garwal'),(8696,0,0,'Thank again, $n.  Now I\'ll just wait here until it\'s safe to leave.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4575,0,'Henry Stern'),(28355,2,0,'I\'m working on it, I just don\'t want to sell it until I\'m happy with it. It shouldn\'t be long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27808,0,'Wright Williams'),(28355,3,0,'Sir, our customers are complaining that there\'s too much Deathweed in our Anesthetics.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27802,0,'Wright Williams'),(28347,0,0,'Wright, have you finished that new concoction you\'ve been working on? I\'m tired of these spores filling up my shop!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27804,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,1,0,'Then put twice as much in next time!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27805,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,2,0,'Remember, kid: You\'re always more wrong than you think you are. Double It!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27807,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,3,0,'Only put half as much in next time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27806,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,4,0,'That\'s what you always say. Sometimes I think you\'re never going to finish that thing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27810,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,5,0,'Greetings.',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,43337,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,5,1,'Greetings, $c.',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,43330,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,5,2,'Greetings! Please have a look around.',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,43333,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,5,3,'Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,43335,0,'Miles Sidney'),(28347,5,4,'Welcome. May I help you find something?',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,43336,0,'Miles Sidney'),(16364,0,0,'%s releases the last of its energies into the nearby runestone, successfully reactivating it.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12272,0,'Infused Crystal'),(16183,0,0,'Where... where am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12726,0,'Courier Dawnstrider'),(15951,0,0,'Good riddance... now none shall be able to repeat my mistakes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11713,0,'Magister Duskwither'),(16196,0,0,'You\'re not going anywhere just yet, handsome.  Not until you regain your strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12728,0,'Apothecary Thedra'),(27788,0,0,'I was almost ghoul bait! Thanks for the rescue!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27097,0,'Injured 7th Legion Soldier'),(27788,0,1,'It\'s a good thing you came along, ally! We were done for!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27098,0,'Injured 7th Legion Soldier'),(27788,0,2,'Thanks for the cover fire! It\'s a MADHOUSE down there!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27095,0,'Injured 7th Legion Soldier'),(27788,0,3,'Wow, I thought I was a goner! Thanks, friend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27096,0,'Injured 7th Legion Soldier'),(17058,0,2,'Faster, scum!  The Master won\'t be pleased if we don\'t find the Ata\'mal crystal he\'s after.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16421,0,'Illidari Taskmaster'),(17058,1,0,'You dare interfere with the Master\'s endeavors?  You will pay, foolish mortal!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16438,0,'Illidari Taskmaster'),(17058,1,1,'Slay these intruders, filthy Dreghood!  I promise you neverending pain if you disobey me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16439,0,'Illidari Taskmaster'),(17058,1,2,'Go, you little wretches! Show these fools that our Master is not to be trifled with!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16440,0,'Illidari Taskmaster'),(17058,1,3,'Do not even think of fleeing, Broken wretches!  I promise you a fate worse than death if you don\'t slay these intruders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16441,0,'Illidari Taskmaster'),(16794,0,0,'...a potent concoction!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13678,0,'Apothecary Azethen'),(16794,1,0,'But where could I ever find a suitable test subject?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,13682,0,'Apothecary Azethen'),(16794,2,0,'Drink this, you blue brute!  Disobey me and I promise you a slow, painful death!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,13683,0,'Apothecary Azethen'),(16794,3,0,'Hmmm... looks like I\'m going to need a new test subject.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,13684,0,'Apothecary Azethen'),(16938,0,0,'Put me out of this misery!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16471,0,'Dreghood Brute'),(16938,0,1,'Forgive me... I have no choice.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16469,0,'Dreghood Brute'),(21257,0,0,'Thank you, $n.  Now, to perform the test...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19022,0,'Apothecary Zelana'),(21257,1,0,'Ah, I see...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19023,0,'Apothecary Zelana'),(21257,2,0,'Yes, this is unfortunate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19024,0,'Apothecary Zelana'),(21257,3,0,'$n, I have confirmed that this blood is from the Bonechewer clan of orcs, tainted with demonic power.  I\'m afraid, however, that my current equipment can delve no deeper into this mystery...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19025,0,'Apothecary Zelana'),(21279,0,0,'Please excuse me while I begin my tests...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19065,0,'Apothecary Albreck'),(21279,1,0,'Interesting...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19066,0,'Apothecary Albreck'),(21279,2,0,'But what is this?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19067,0,'Apothecary Albreck'),(21279,3,0,'Oh, my!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19068,0,'Apothecary Albreck'),(21279,4,0,'If my blood hadn\'t clotted long ago, it would be boiling with rage right now...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19069,0,'Apothecary Albreck'),(16795,0,0,'I pity you, Forsaken.  Your soul is devoid of light.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,13685,0,'Draenei Prisoner'),(19354,0,0,'Work these Broken wretches to the bones, Illidari!  If there\'s anything of value in this forsaken place we shall find it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16472,0,'Arzeth the Merciless'),(19354,0,1,'Do not allow these wretches a moment of rest! If there\'s an Ata\'mal crystal here then we shall find it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16476,0,'Arzeth the Merciless'),(19354,0,2,'Keep a close eye on this Broken scum! Far too many have escaped from us!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16474,0,'Arzeth the Merciless'),(19354,0,3,'We will find what the Master is looking for! Failure is not an option!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16475,0,'Arzeth the Merciless'),(20680,1,0,'That Broken worm gave you that staff, didn\'t he?  Did he also tell you he\'s the one that sold out his tribe?  No matter, you will both pay for this!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,18349,0,'Arzeth the Powerless'),(19191,0,0,'What insolence! What arrogance! To believe you could defeat me on my own doorstep!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,17653,0,'Arazzius the Cruel'),(19191,1,0,'Master, I have failed...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16429,0,'Arazzius the Cruel'),(19273,0,0,'Speak with Wing Commander Brack, $n.  He\'ll outfit you with one of our armored wyvern destroyers.  And, good luck!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,17964,0,'Forward Commander To\'arch'),(19255,0,0,'Yea, we got problems. I think that\'s crystal clear. The question is, what are we gonna do about it?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16392,0,'General Krakork'),(19255,0,1,'Get used to it, girls. We\'re out here for the rest of our miserable lives as far as I\'m concerned. Welcome to Hellfire Peninsula, your new home.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16394,0,'General Krakork'),(19255,0,2,'How many more of you grunts do I need to send back to mommy and daddy in a body bag before you grow a brain and realize that runnin\' head first into a Legion kill squad is suicide? And don\'t nod your thick skulls at me as if you know what I\'m talkin\' about!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16393,0,'General Krakork'),(19255,0,3,'I\'m not gonna lie to you, soldiers. We\'re getting our butts kicked out there! Now which one of you is orc enough to do something about it?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16390,0,'General Krakork'),(20677,0,0,'You\'ve freed me!  The winds speak to my people once again and grant us their strength.  I thank you, stranger.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18358,0,'Morod the Windstirrer'),(20678,0,0,'I am free!  I will ask the spirit of fire to return to us so that my people may have the courage to fight their masters!  I thank you, $r.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,18356,0,'Akoru the Firecaller'),(20679,0,0,'I\'m free!  The spirit of water returns to my people.  It will bring us the wisdom we need to survive in this harsh land.  I am in your debt, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18357,0,'Aylaan the Waterwaker'),(19270,0,0,'If you are ready to laugh, head over to the World\'s End Tavern!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16380,0,'Shattrath Saul'),(18756,0,0,'I, like, so don\'t get it...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16888,0,'Haris Pilton'),(18756,0,1,'Psshh... whatever.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16882,0,'Haris Pilton'),(18756,0,2,'That\'s hot.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16881,0,'Haris Pilton'),(18756,0,3,'That joke\'s hot.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16887,0,'Haris Pilton'),(19228,0,0,'Hey all!  So how long until the jokes spawn?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16382,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,0,1,'I just flew in from Ironforge and, Boy!, are my mount\'s wings tired!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16649,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,0,2,'Hey folks, go easy on me... it\'s my first time.',12,0,100,24,0,0,0,16328,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,0,3,'Thanks for coming out to see me!  I hope you are ready for a good time, because I am.',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,16327,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,1,0,'I never met a tauren I didn\'t like...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16378,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,2,0,'To eat!!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16379,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,3,0,'Last week I was in Goldshire. Have you been there?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16651,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,4,0,'That town\'s so small, I asked a kid to draw me a map. He drew it on the back of a Defias wanted poster...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16652,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,5,0,'to scale!!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16653,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,6,0,'Impersonation time!!  I call this, \"The Silly Tauren.\"',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16337,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,7,0,'The comedian clears his throat.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16338,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,8,0,'The comedian impersonates a tauren.',16,0,100,5,0,6386,0,16580,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,9,0,'Here\'s a good one, why do watermelons have water in them? ',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16333,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,10,0,'Because they are planted in the spring!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16336,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,11,0,'What\'s the deal with women?  I mean they are always like...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16339,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,12,0,'The comedian impersonates a human female.',16,0,100,5,0,6143,0,16583,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,13,0,'And then gnomes are even worse!  They are always saying stuff like...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16340,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,14,0,'The comedian impersonates a gnome.',16,0,100,5,0,6133,0,16581,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,15,0,'What time is it when an elekk sits on your fence?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16368,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,16,0,'Time to get a new fence!!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16369,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,17,0,'If I knew it was going to be like this, I\'d have worn my Greater Boots of Laughter.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16388,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,17,1,'Apparently my reputation with you people is hostile.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16385,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,17,2,'Wow!  The laughs don\'t drop very often here, do they?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16389,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,18,0,'Hey! Hey! Hey! It\'s Raliq the drunk... His momma\'s so fat she didn\'t just make the front cover of Ogre Today...',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,16667,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,19,0,'She made the back cover too!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16668,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,20,0,'The gnomes used to be a nice respectful people...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16669,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,21,0,'The other day I saw one walking down the street shouting, \"Once you go gnome, you never go home!\"',12,0,100,1,0,4415,0,16670,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,22,0,'I love blood elf women.  Especially when they say stuff like this...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16374,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,23,0,'The comedian impersonates a blood elf.',16,0,100,5,0,9643,0,16582,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,24,0,'So the blood elves think they\'re just one step away from ruling the world...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16682,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,25,0,'Twelve steps is more like it!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16683,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,26,0,'One last impersonation.  It\'s tough, but let\'s see if you can guess who it is...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16351,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,27,0,'The comedian impersonates an orc.',16,0,100,5,0,7195,0,16584,0,'Perry Gatner');
INSERT INTO `creature_text` VALUES (19228,28,0,'Now that the show\'s done, can someone run me through Scarlet Monestary?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16381,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,28,1,'Thank you! Don\'t forget to tip your waiters! Good night folks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16341,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,28,2,'Well, it\'s time to take these comedic muscles elsewhere. Have a good night all!',12,0,100,23,0,0,0,16348,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,28,3,'Is it over already?  You\'ve been great folks.  Walk safely and have a good night.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16343,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,29,0,'How many kobolds does it take to change a lantern wick?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16657,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,30,0,'You no take candle!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16658,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,31,0,'Goldshire\'s inn advertises a lakeside view...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16655,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,32,0,'I saw a murloc swim by my window.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16656,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,33,0,'Have you ever noticed that all those cute, orc kids look the same?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16331,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,34,0,'It\'s too bad they don\'t stay cute.  There must be some rite of passage in the Barrens called, \"Climb ugly tree and fall out.\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16334,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,35,0,'I\'ve heard that gnomes can grant wishes...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16375,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,36,0,'Well I wish they\'d go away!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16376,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,37,0,'Look who\'s here, it\'s Raliq the drunk... His momma\'s so fat dragons won\'t eat her...',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,16665,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,38,0,'They don\'t know where to store the leftovers!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16666,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,39,0,'My wife and I were happy for 23 years...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16370,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,40,0,'And then we met!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16371,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,41,0,'What do you call a broken boomerang?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16372,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,42,0,'A stick!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16373,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,43,0,'So this gnome tells a tauren that he\'s been to Molten Core.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16332,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,44,0,'The tauren says, \"That\'s a load of bull.\"',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16335,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,45,0,'How desperate do you have to be for allies that you recruit your livestock?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16680,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,46,0,'I own a dog, but I\'m not giving him a sword.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16681,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19271,1,0,'Perry Gatner! What an act!  The cantina is open all night long, so please, stay and enjoy yourselves!',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,16384,0,'Albert Quarksprocket'),(19271,0,0,'Thank you all for coming tonight.  Now put your hands together to welcome Shattrath\'s best, Perry Gatner!',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,16383,0,'Albert Quarksprocket'),(17831,0,0,'$n, let\'s go see if this plan will work.  Come along, Buddy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14608,0,'Watcher Leesa\'oh'),(17831,1,0,'Ok, let\'s see about using those mushrooms you brought back to grow the bog lords a new food supply.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14609,0,'Watcher Leesa\'oh'),(17831,2,0,'Wait and see what happens!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14615,0,'Watcher Leesa\'oh'),(17831,3,0,'Oh Buddy, you big baby!  Look, it\'s working.  It\'s really working!!  Now all I need to do is grow more of these mushrooms here and the bog lords will likely leave the sporelings alone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14610,0,'Watcher Leesa\'oh'),(17831,4,0,'Oh, thank you, $n!  You\'ve made it possible to save both the sporelings from the bog lords, and the bog lords from our wrath.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14611,0,'Watcher Leesa\'oh'),(17955,0,0,'The %s takes a piece of the mushroom tree and holds it to its \'nose\'.  Seemingly satisfied, it eats it!',16,0,100,36,0,0,0,14612,0,'Hungry Bog Lord'),(17955,1,0,'The %s uproots the rest of the mushroom tree and makes off with it.',16,0,100,36,0,0,0,14613,0,'Hungry Bog Lord'),(19468,0,0,'Look, sweetheart.  No one\'s talking about storming Tempest Keep ourselves, but when we see a target of opportunity we have to take it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16872,0,'Spymaster Thalodien'),(19468,1,0,'...and just look at where that got us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16889,0,'Spymaster Thalodien'),(19468,2,0,'Finally some talk of action from the big guy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16891,0,'Spymaster Thalodien'),(19541,0,4,'Netherock?!  That thing\'ll squish you flat with one step of its massive foot!  No thanks!',12,0,20,1,0,0,0,19659,0,'Netherstorm Agent'),(19541,0,3,'Last time someone went out to try to collect the bounty on Netherock, all we got back was a compressed layer of foolhardy adventurer!',12,0,20,1,0,0,0,19660,0,'Netherstorm Agent'),(19541,0,2,'Hmm, arcane annihilators are pretty tough.  I wonder if Papa Wheeler knows what he\'s asking for?',12,0,20,1,0,0,0,17116,0,'Netherstorm Agent'),(19541,0,1,'Maybe I should gather up some other agents and head out there after this shift?',12,0,20,1,0,0,0,17115,0,'Netherstorm Agent'),(19541,0,0,'Good thing that we\'re surrounded by neighbors with excess machine parts.',12,0,20,1,0,0,0,17119,0,'Netherstorm Agent'),(19467,0,0,'With all due respect, A\'dal sent us here to investigate Kael\'s activities, not mount a full-scaled attack.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16870,0,'Anchorite Karja'),(19467,1,0,'The magistrix will be happy to know  I\'m  fluent in Thalassian.  Your courtesy is not lost on me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16875,0,'Anchorite Karja'),(19467,2,0,'Back to the topic...  we should focus our attention on these manaforges.  We need to learn what the enemy is doing with them and why.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16876,0,'Anchorite Karja'),(19469,0,0,'I\'m surrounded by idiots!',12,10,100,5,0,0,0,16874,0,'Magistrix Larynna'),(19469,1,0,'We\'ve told you all there is to know!  Do you forget that many of us used to be trusted followers of Kael\'thas?',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,16883,0,'Magistrix Larynna'),(1410,0,0,'You won\'t escape alive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16249,0,'Firewing Bloodwarder'),(1410,0,1,'I will have your energy and then your life!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16254,0,'Firewing Bloodwarder'),(5355,0,2,'You won\'t escape alive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16249,0,'Firewing Defender'),(5355,0,3,'You know too much!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16251,0,'Firewing Defender'),(16769,1,0,'For Kael\'thas!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16252,0,'Firewing Warlock'),(16769,1,1,'You won\'t escape alive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16249,0,'Firewing Warlock'),(16769,1,2,'Kill them before they get away!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16250,0,'Firewing Warlock'),(16769,1,3,'I will have your energy and then your life!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16254,0,'Firewing Warlock'),(22483,0,0,'AAAAEEEEEEIIIIIIII!!!!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,20308,0,'Sand Gnome'),(22483,0,1,'AHHHH-YAAA-YAAA-YAAA!!!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,20309,0,'Sand Gnome'),(22807,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(20418,5,0,'Manaforge shutdown aborted.  Resuming manaforge activity.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17886,0,'manaforge_control fail'),(20440,5,0,'Manaforge shutdown aborted.  Resuming manaforge activity.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17886,0,'manaforge_control fail'),(20218,0,0,'Stop the emergency shutdown! Kael will have our heads if he hears about this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17931,0,'Sunfury Technician'),(20218,0,1,'Stop this immediately!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18131,0,'Sunfury Technician'),(20218,0,2,'The naaru\'s emergency shutdown will disable the manaforge permanently! It must be aborted!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17932,0,'Sunfury Technician'),(24126,0,0,'Excellent.  What\'s the lowdown?  Do we have a bodycount?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,22797,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(24126,1,0,'Well, spit it out!  What\'s the bad news?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22798,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(24126,2,0,'Severe stomach pain?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,22800,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(24126,3,0,'SEVERE STOMACH PAIN?',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,22801,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(24126,4,0,'We are the Royal Apothecary Society!  Inducing belly aches is not part of our job description!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22802,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(24126,5,0,'Am I surrounded by amateurs?  I want a full analysis of the new strain by tomorrow morning!  Get on it, Ravien!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,22803,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(24126,6,0,'We were making progress with our plague in Undercity.  All of a sudden our strains keep failing!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,22406,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(24126,6,1,'The last ten strains from Undercity... all of them worthless!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,22403,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(24126,6,2,'I cannot work under these conditions!  We need a viable strain!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,22404,0,'Apothecary Lysander'),(23782,0,0,'Reports from the test on the enemy fleet have come in, sir!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22793,0,'Apothecary Ravien'),(23782,1,0,'Well... the good news is we forced the reinforcements to turn back.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,22794,0,'Apothecary Ravien'),(23782,2,0,'The plague was not quite... fatal.  However, reports of harmful effects include nausea, loss of equilibrium and severe stomach pain.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,22795,0,'Apothecary Ravien'),(23782,3,0,'Yes, sir!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,22796,0,'Apothecary Ravien'),(27349,0,0,'The %s moans but seems otherwise unaffected by the blight.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26389,0,'Scarlet Onslaught Prisoner'),(27250,0,0,'Huh?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,26274,0,'Junior Apothecary Schlemiel'),(27250,1,0,'But... I followed your instructions precisely! Sorry?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,26277,0,'Junior Apothecary Schlemiel'),(27250,2,0,'Eep!',12,0,100,34,0,1368,0,26281,0,'Junior Apothecary Schlemiel'),(27248,0,0,'Schlemiel!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,26273,0,'Apothecary Vicky Levine'),(27248,1,0,'Apparently you flubbed this batch of blight. What do you have to say for yourself?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,26275,0,'Apothecary Vicky Levine'),(27248,2,0,'Sorry? SORRY?! Here\'s sorry for you!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,26279,0,'Apothecary Vicky Levine'),(27248,3,0,'Oops. I guess it IS working! That\'s odd.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,26280,0,'Apothecary Vicky Levine'),(27248,4,0,'I\'m gonna need a cleanup and a new assistant over here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,26289,0,'Apothecary Vicky Levine'),(24703,0,0,'The Scourge has us surrounded. We can hold the village for awhile, but if we can\'t defeat them, they will overrun us.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,24791,0,'Chieftain Wintergale'),(24703,1,0,'The time has come to act. We must decide how to deal with the Scourge before it consumes us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24807,0,'Chieftain Wintergale'),(24706,0,0,'The choice is clear. We must attack. I know the odds are against us, but Taunka do not go quietly to the slaughter.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,24792,0,'Durm Icehide'),(24706,1,0,'I\'ll die with my axes in my hands and drenched in the blood of our foes!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,24793,0,'Durm Icehide'),(24703,2,0,'I won\'t sacrifice my warriors for romantic notions of glorious death on the battlefield. What use is fighting for survival if no one survives?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24798,0,'Chieftain Wintergale'),(24703,3,0,'There will be a time for battle, Durm. But first, we must find a way to even the odds. What would you have me do, Aeire?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,24799,0,'Chieftain Wintergale'),(24709,0,0,'The ancestors knew a way to confound an enemy\'s senses. We could use this knowledge to discover the Scourge\'s weakness or strike at their commanders. Without their leaders, the Scourge would fall before our warriors.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24800,0,'Sage Aeire'),(24706,2,0,'A dishonorable scheme.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,24801,0,'Durm Icehide'),(24703,4,0,'What is your honor worth, Durm? Your life? Mine? The life of blind old Greatfather Mahan, who raised you from childhood?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24802,0,'Chieftain Wintergale'),(24703,5,0,'Honor is meaningless to a dead man. A warrior may throw himself into battle for honor\'s sake, but a chieftain is responsible for far more. We will follow Sage Aeire\'s plan and continue to defend our village.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24803,0,'Chieftain Wintergale'),(24709,1,0,'I\'ll take those. We can\'t have the mighty chieftain cowering in fear of a few hides.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,24811,0,'Sage Aeire'),(24703,6,0,'Aeire, $n has brought your hides. Please, take them before they make me ill.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,24810,0,'Chieftain Wintergale'),(25256,0,0,'We are surrounded... Our enemies press in from all sides, young Hellscream.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24486,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,1,0,'The Scourge descends like locust from the north.',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,24487,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,2,0,'The Alliance holds the only secure shipping lane in this region, and even that is at risk of being lost to those dreaded mists.',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,24488,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,3,0,'Our only viable port for resupply is held by the Forsaken on the other side of this blasted continent!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24489,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,4,0,'Anything our zeppelins cannot haul must be brought in by ship and travel the length of Northrend to reach us.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24490,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25237,0,0,'%s grunts.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24491,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(25237,1,0,'Shipping lanes... supplies... You bore me to death! We need nothing more than the warrior spirit of the Horde, Saurfang! Now that we are firmly entrenched in this frozen wasteland, nothing shall stop us!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24492,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(25256,5,0,'Siege engines, ammunition, heavy armor... How do you propose to shatter the walls of Icecrown without those?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24493,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25237,2,0,'Propose? I will show you what I propose!',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,24494,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(25237,3,0,'There... Now we now have a shipping lane.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24495,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(25237,4,0,'And just for good measure...',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24496,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(25256,6,0,'So the prodigal son has spoken!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24497,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,7,0,'Your father\'s blood runs strong in you, Hellscream. Impatient as always... Impatient and reckless.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24498,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,8,0,'You rush headlong into all-out war without a thought of the consequences.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24500,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25237,5,0,'Do not speak to me of consequences, old one. ',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,24501,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(25256,9,0,'I drank of the same blood your father did, Garrosh. Mannoroth\'s cursed venom pumped through my veins as well.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24502,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,10,0,'I drove my weapons into the bodies and minds of my enemies.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24503,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,11,0,'And while Grom died a glorious death - freeing us all from the blood curse - he could not wipe away the terrible memory of our past.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24504,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,12,0,'His act could not erase the horrors we committed. ',12,1,100,274,0,0,0,24505,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,13,0,'%s pauses.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24506,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,14,0,'The winter after the curse was lifted, hundreds of veteran orcs like me were lost to despair.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24507,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,15,0,'Our minds were finally free, yes... Free to relive all of the unthinkable acts that we had performed under the Legions\' influence.',12,1,100,273,0,0,0,24508,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,16,0,'%s nods.',16,1,100,273,0,0,0,24509,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,17,0,'I think it was the sounds of the draenei children that unnerved most of them... You never forget...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24510,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,18,0,'Have you ever been to Jaggedswine Farm? When the swine are of age for the slaughter... It\'s that sound. The sound of the swine being killed... It resonates the loudest. Those are hard times for us older veterans.',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,24511,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25237,6,0,'But surely you cannot think that those children were born into innocence? They would have grown up and taken arms against us!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24512,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(25256,19,0,'%s shakes his head.',16,1,100,274,0,0,0,24513,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,20,0,'I am not speaking solely of the children of our enemies...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24515,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,21,0,'%s pauses.',16,1,100,1,0,0,0,24506,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,22,0,'I won\'t let you take us down that dark path again, young Hellscream. I\'ll kill you myself before that day comes...',12,1,100,274,0,0,0,24516,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25237,7,0,'How have you managed to survive for so long, Saurfang? Not fallen victim to your own memories?',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,24518,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(25256,23,0,'I don\'t eat pork...',12,1,100,274,0,0,0,24519,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,24,0,'%s spits.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24520,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(23940,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(24546,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(23946,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(23794,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(23983,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(24540,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(24014,0,0,'You too will serve the Lich King.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23663,0,'Necrolord'),(23990,0,2,'You tiny creatures disgust me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22816,0,'Gjalerbron Rune-Caster'),(23990,0,1,'My life for Ymiron!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22702,0,'Gjalerbron Rune-Caster'),(23990,0,0,'For Ymiron!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22697,0,'Gjalerbron Rune-Caster'),(24123,0,0,'These are all excellent. It\'s going to be hard to choose just one.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22854,0,'Nokoma Snowseer'),(24123,1,0,'I think I\'ve found the one I\'ll use. Now I have to begin the task of carving it. I don\'t think it\'s going to be easy. I don\'t even know what a female yeti\'s mating call sounds like!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,22855,0,'Nokoma Snowseer'),(24123,2,0,'I\'ve got most of the basic carving done, but it needs to be tested before I can continue. Are you willing to help me with that, $n?',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,22856,0,'Nokoma Snowseer'),(24152,0,0,'Wait a minute...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,22958,0,'Apothecary Malthus'),(24152,1,0,'It\'s just...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,22959,0,'Apothecary Malthus'),(24152,2,0,'Beer! Mere beer!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22960,0,'Apothecary Malthus'),(24152,3,0,'There\'s absolutely nothing out of the ordinary about it.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22961,0,'Apothecary Malthus'),(24152,4,0,'You! Not a word to Grick about this! Do you hear me?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,22962,0,'Apothecary Malthus'),(23989,0,4,'There will be no everlasting life for you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22822,0,'Gjalerbron Sleep-Watcher'),(23989,0,3,'Look what\'\'s come to play.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22820,0,'Gjalerbron Sleep-Watcher'),(23989,0,2,'You tiny creatures disgust me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22816,0,'Gjalerbron Sleep-Watcher'),(23989,0,1,'My life for Ymiron!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22702,0,'Gjalerbron Sleep-Watcher'),(23989,0,0,'For Ymiron!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22697,0,'Gjalerbron Sleep-Watcher'),(23991,0,6,'I will break you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22823,0,'Gjalerbron Warrior'),(23991,0,5,'Your race is a disease upon the world!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22824,0,'Gjalerbron Warrior'),(23991,0,4,'There will be no everlasting life for you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22822,0,'Gjalerbron Warrior'),(23991,0,3,'Look what\'\'s come to play.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22820,0,'Gjalerbron Warrior'),(23991,0,2,'You tiny creatures disgust me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22816,0,'Gjalerbron Warrior'),(23991,0,1,'My life for Ymiron!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22702,0,'Gjalerbron Warrior'),(23991,0,0,'For Ymiron!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22697,0,'Gjalerbron Warrior'),(24362,0,0,'They keep their tools in boxes that look like this. Look for them near the pavilions.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,23552,0,'Longrunner Pembe'),(24362,1,0,'I\'m only going to carve the runes I think will give you command over a giant.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23246,0,'Longrunner Pembe'),(24362,2,0,'I\'m omitting the runes for \"north\" and \"west\" because I\'m not sure how they impact the giant. I\'m also including a rune to limit how long you can control it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23247,0,'Longrunner Pembe'),(24362,3,0,'There we go, the Rune of Command... hopefully. Not nearly as vicious as its Iron Dwarf cousin, but functional.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23248,0,'Longrunner Pembe'),(27683,4,0,'And thank you... thank you for freeing me from the shackles of the damned.  You are a hero... I know you will go on to great deeds.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26942,0,'Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch'),(27683,5,0,'The Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch fades away...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26944,0,'Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch'),(27683,3,0,'My time is done... I offered myself to Alexstrasza in life, but I have nothing left to offer in death.  She will need a new keeper for her shrine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26941,0,'Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch'),(27683,1,0,'Dahlia spits on the ground at the thought of the name.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26943,0,'Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch'),(27683,2,0,'The Lich King is stretching his hand far now... fearlessly treading on the most sacred lands of all of the flights.  He intends to force us to action.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26940,0,'Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch'),(27683,0,0,'I\'ve lived here and kept this shrine with the blessing of the Alexstrasza for longer than I can remember.  In its darkest hour, I\'ve failed... I fell at the feet of that damned death knight...  Bloodbane.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26939,0,'Remnant of Dahlia Suntouch'),(27210,0,0,'Now I\'ll show you the REAL power of the Onslaught!',12,0,100,0,0,14192,0,27593,0,'High General Abbendis'),(27951,0,0,'Kill them Abbendis! Do not fail me!',14,0,100,25,0,14198,0,27354,0,'Admiral Barean Westwind'),(27951,1,0,'The grand admiral studies you a moment through narrowed eyes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27355,0,'Admiral Barean Westwind'),(27951,2,0,'You served your purpose.',12,0,100,0,0,14199,0,27357,0,'Admiral Barean Westwind'),(27951,3,0,'I will see you in Icecrown, weakling... if you live that long!',12,0,100,0,0,14200,0,27358,0,'Admiral Barean Westwind'),(27203,0,0,'Be purified by steel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26404,0,'Onslaught Footman'),(27203,0,1,'By the Light!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26403,0,'Onslaught Footman'),(27203,0,2,'In the name of the Light!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26402,0,'Onslaught Footman'),(27203,0,3,'You will be cleansed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26401,0,'Onslaught Footman'),(27159,3,0,'I have heard whisperings from the east that our esteemed Scarab Lord has joined the battle, as have entire batallions from Shattrath: heroes blessed by A\'dal himself, granted rank as Hand of A\'dal!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 4'),(27159,1,0,'We have been through worse and survived, Leoric. Do not forget Hyjal...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 2'),(27159,2,0,'Say no more, Leoric. We all feel the chill in our bones. Yet, each day, heroes arrive from across the world - and beyond.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 3'),(27357,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(26705,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27178,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27351,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(26780,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(26943,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(27246,0,0,'It is good that you have come my child.  The Light\'s protection has worn thin on you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26271,0,'Bishop Street'),(2964,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(2978,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(2977,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(2979,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(2976,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(5785,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(2949,1,0,'%s attempts to run awa