2935,0,'Ranid Glowergold'),(28718,0,2,'Welcome. May I help you find something?',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32811,0,'Ranid Glowergold'),(28718,0,3,'Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32810,0,'Ranid Glowergold'),(28718,0,4,'Greetings! Please have a look around.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32809,0,'Ranid Glowergold'),(28718,0,5,'Greetings, $c.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32808,0,'Ranid Glowergold'),(28718,0,6,'Welcome.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32936,0,'Ranid Glowergold'),(34044,0,0,'Just in time. Let\'s see this thing off, then.',12,0,100,0,0,15826,0,34084,0,'Brann Bronzebeard'),(16128,0,0,'We received Brann\'s message, and we have begun preparations.',12,0,100,1,0,15649,0,33982,0,'Rhonin'),(16128,1,0,'Citizens of Dalaran! Raise your eyes to the skies and observe!',14,0,100,0,0,15650,0,33983,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,2,0,'Today our world\'s destruction has been averted in defiance of our very makers!',14,0,100,0,0,15651,0,33984,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,3,0,'Algalon the Observer, herald of the titans, has been defeated by our brave comrades in the depths of the titan city of Ulduar.',14,0,100,0,0,15652,0,33985,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,4,0,'Algalon was sent here to judge the fate of our world.',14,0,100,0,0,15653,0,33986,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,5,0,'He found a planet whose races had deviated from the titans\' blueprints. A planet where not everything had gone according to plan.',14,0,100,0,0,15654,0,33987,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,6,0,'Cold logic deemed our world not worth saving. Cold logic, however, does not account for the power of free will. It\'s up to each of us to prove this is a world worth saving.',14,0,100,0,0,15655,0,33988,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,7,0,'That our lives... our lives are worth living.',14,0,100,0,0,15656,0,33989,2,'Rhonin'),(28217,4,0,'Oh no! Some puppy-men followed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27799,0,'Injured Rainspeaker Oracle'),(28325,0,0,'You hear a low guttural growl from nearby.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27831,0,'Ravenous Mangal Crocolisk'),(28327,0,0,'Shaman Vekjik comes out of the underbrush nearby.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27738,0,'Shaman Vekjik'),(28327,1,0,'You help Rainspeaker! I saw you help Rainspeaker! Traitor thing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27739,0,'Shaman Vekjik'),(28327,2,0,'If you want to be friends with big-tongues, you not friends with Frenzyheart! I tell village! We no trust you anymore!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27740,0,'Shaman Vekjik'),(28327,3,0,'Shaman Vekjik scurries off towards Frenzyheart Hill.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27741,0,'Shaman Vekjik'),(28077,0,0,'Dumb big-tongue lover! You not friend of Frenzyheart no more. Frenzyheart will get you good.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27798,0,'Frenzyheart Tracker'),(28213,0,0,'The %s screams with rage and rushes to the aid of her babies.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27607,0,'Hardknuckle Matriarch'),(28113,3,0,'The mosswalker victim groans in pain.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28638,0,'Mosswalker Victim'),(28092,0,0,'Omega Rune deployed.  Activation successful.',12,0,100,51,0,0,0,33004,0,'The Etymidian'),(28033,0,0,'Finally, we have the parts to repair the Spirit of Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29878,0,'Weslex Quickwrench'),(28033,1,0,'Let\'s see, just a tweak here and an adjustment there...',12,0,100,432,0,0,0,29879,0,'Weslex Quickwrench'),(28033,2,0,'And there she is, the Spirit of Gnomeregan!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,29880,0,'Weslex Quickwrench'),(28033,3,0,'You can use her, but I don\'t want to hear any complaints about saw blades in your seat. I had to fix \'er with what we could find.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29881,0,'Weslex Quickwrench'),(28998,0,0,'Behold, mon! We be creatin\' da greatest Scourge army ever seen!',12,0,100,396,0,14023,0,29441,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,1,0,'These be da first of many! We shall sweep across Zul\'Drak like da wind....',12,0,100,396,0,14024,0,29442,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,2,0,'What treachery is this?! You be payin\' for this deceit with your life, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,14025,0,29885,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,3,0,'The Scepter of Domination glows brightly! Use it now!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,29886,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,4,0,'How could dis be? Da Lich King said he be havin\' great plans for you, mon...',14,0,100,0,0,14027,0,29917,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,4,1,'Ya done turned your back on destiny, mon. Now you gunna die!',14,0,100,0,0,14029,0,29919,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,4,2,'Fool! Ya coulda been havin\' great power, mon!',14,0,100,0,0,14026,0,29916,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,4,3,'Your betrayal not gunna be slowin\' me down none, mon.',14,0,100,0,0,14030,0,29920,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,4,4,'I shoulda known not to be trustin\' nobody!',14,0,100,0,0,14028,0,29918,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,4,5,'I never needed ya, mon. I can crush Zul\'Drak without ya!',14,0,100,0,0,14031,0,29921,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,5,0,'ENOUGH!',14,0,100,22,0,14020,0,29922,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,6,0,'Dis foolish treachery has cost ya your destiny!',14,0,100,396,0,14021,0,29923,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,7,0,'Master, dis mortal scum be double-crossin\' us. Dey must be made to suffer!',12,0,100,396,0,14022,0,29969,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28998,8,0,'Disguise Failing! Avoid Scourge Contact!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,28891,0,'Overlord Drakuru'),(28498,7,0,'You have failed me, Drakuru!',12,0,100,396,0,14762,0,29986,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,8,0,'It is you who should suffer. Be content that your death is a quick one....',12,0,100,397,0,14763,0,29982,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,9,0,'As for you...',12,0,100,397,0,14764,0,29983,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,10,0,'I spare your insignificant life as a reward for this amusing betrayal. There may yet be a shred of potential in you.',12,0,100,396,0,14765,0,29984,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,11,0,'Be warned...',12,0,100,396,0,14766,0,29989,0,'The Lich King'),(28498,12,0,'When next we meet I shall require much more to justify your life.',12,0,100,396,0,14767,0,29985,0,'The Lich King'),(28479,0,0,'Gods of old, we beseech you. What must we do? How can we save the gods of this land?',15,0,100,6,0,0,0,28431,0,'Witch Doctor Khufu'),(28514,0,0,'But try they must or all will be lost. The Drakkari will be the death of both themselves and their gods!',12,0,100,0,0,473,0,28435,0,'Nalorakk'),(28515,0,0,'The spotted one must be sought. Their fates are entwined.',12,0,100,0,0,9919,0,28432,0,'Jan\'alai'),(28516,0,0,'But she is chained. A way must be found to free her.',12,0,100,0,0,12196,0,28433,0,'Akil\'zon'),(28517,0,0,'To her altar this mortal must travel. What they must do will not be easy. In the end it may prove impossible.',12,0,100,0,0,643,0,28434,0,'Halazzi'),(28176,0,0,'Let us see if it is truly impervious.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27783,0,'Rimblat Earthshatter'),(28176,1,0,'Nothing.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27766,0,'Rimblat Earthshatter'),(28175,0,0,'Saronite you say?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27779,0,'Crusade Commander Korfax'),(28175,1,0,'Never heard of it. Looks like pure evil.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27748,0,'Crusade Commander Korfax'),(28175,2,0,'Let\'s see how it holds up to the might of my axe!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27749,0,'Crusade Commander Korfax'),(28175,3,0,'What the? My reaper didn\'t even scratch it! That\'s the toughest ore I\'ve ever seen!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27750,0,'Crusade Commander Korfax'),(28175,4,0,'Oof!',12,0,100,0,0,9410,0,27788,0,'Crusade Commander Korfax'),(28177,0,0,'By the Goddess. It\'s as if Nature can\'t touch it!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27763,0,'Rayne'),(28177,1,0,'Gah!',12,0,100,0,0,9410,0,27786,0,'Rayne'),(28178,0,0,'%s rolls his eyes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27784,0,'Avenger Metz'),(28178,1,0,'No surprise there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27769,0,'Avenger Metz'),(28178,2,0,'What?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27770,0,'Avenger Metz'),(28178,3,0,'Fine. Just remember though, the power of the Holy Light isn\'t something to be invoked casually, brother.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27771,0,'Avenger Metz'),(28178,4,0,'What\'s it doing?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27772,0,'Avenger Metz'),(28178,5,0,'Whoa!',12,0,100,0,0,9410,0,27787,0,'Avenger Metz'),(28178,6,0,'%s grunts.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27776,0,'Avenger Metz'),(28244,0,0,'Now we will see why this ore is so important to the Scourge.',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,27746,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,1,0,'Korfax, what can you tell from this saronite?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27747,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,2,0,'Rayne, Rimblat, what about the power of nature and the elements?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27759,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,3,0,'Metz?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27767,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,4,0,'You know what.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,27768,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,5,0,'%s dusts himself off.',16,0,100,0,0,9410,0,27789,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,6,0,'Clearly this is getting us nowhere. We need to get this saronite to Highlord Fordring for further study.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27774,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,7,0,'Thank you for trying, my friends. We\'ll unlock its secrets. Hopefully before it\'s too late.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27775,0,'Eitrigg'),(28284,0,0,'Oh, these are sticky! I wonder how they shoot the webbing?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27734,0,'Specialist Cogwheel'),(28284,1,0,'ACK! Oh no, I webbed myself! It\'s sticky. MY HAIR!',12,0,100,15,0,6906,0,27735,0,'Specialist Cogwheel'),(28284,2,0,'Okay! Let me just see if I can fashion these disgusting parts into something useful.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27736,0,'Specialist Cogwheel'),(28284,3,0,'Eureka!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,27737,0,'Specialist Cogwheel'),(28780,0,0,'Explosive Charges will detonate in 5 seconds...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28816,0,'Explosive Charges Bunny'),(28780,1,0,'Explosive Charges will detonate in 4 seconds...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28817,0,'Explosive Charges Bunny'),(28780,2,0,'Explosive Charges will detonate in 3 seconds...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28818,0,'Explosive Charges Bunny'),(28780,3,0,'Explosive Charges will detonate in 2 seconds...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28819,0,'Explosive Charges Bunny'),(28780,4,0,'Explosive Charges will detonate in 1 seconds...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28820,0,'Explosive Charges Bunny'),(29775,0,0,'Use of the Inventor\'s Disk detected. Emergency protocol gamma activated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30402,0,'Archivist Mechaton'),(29775,1,0,'Verifying status of Norgannon\'s shell.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30403,0,'Archivist Mechaton'),(29775,2,0,'Norgannon\'s shell accounted for and secure. It will be available for transfer once user\'s identity has been verified.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30404,0,'Archivist Mechaton'),(29775,3,0,'Standby to verify identity as Keeper Mimir.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30405,0,'Archivist Mechaton'),(29775,4,0,'Identity verification failed. User is not Keeper Mimir.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,30406,0,'Archivist Mechaton'),(29775,5,0,'The Inventor\'s Disk has fallen into the hands of an unauthorized user.  Activating defense protocol.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30407,0,'Archivist Mechaton'),(29775,6,0,'Impostor must be dealt with. The Inventor\'s Disk must be recovered.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30408,0,'Archivist Mechaton'),(30381,2,0,'But the North Wind did not silently accept defeat. Instead, it gathered power and bided its time, deciding the best revenge was to destroy your memory, and with it, your village.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32751,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,3,0,'The wind used its minions to distort the history of this place, changing the stories your people told, destroying the spirits of the honored dead.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32752,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,4,0,'It would\'ve succeeded if $N and I hadn\'t tracked the North Wind\'s historical corruptions to their source: your ancient battle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32754,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,5,0,'With my help, $N travelled back in time to your battle, and ensured that history was set right. The North Wind\'s fate was sealed, and your story restored.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32755,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,6,0,'Rest well, hero.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,32762,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,7,0,'This isn\'t right at all, $n. In the tale Wind Tamer Barah told me, Stormhoof was a hero, not a villain.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,31041,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,8,0,'The North Wind is the ancient enemy of the taunka, a ruler among the elements, and the very force which bleeds the life from these ancient people.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31044,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,9,0,'They would rather die than bow before the North Wind. Something is amiss here.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,31046,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,10,0,'The Lorehammer...',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,31049,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,11,0,'It confirms our suspicions. The threads of time have been severed and rewoven in the wrong pattern. But, how?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31050,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,12,0,'There\'s no doubt that something has distorted the true history of Stormhoof and the warriors of Camp Tunka\'lo. But, what?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31259,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,13,0,'No! The true voice of history will triumph. We will restore all you have destroyed!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,31263,0,'Xarantaur'),(30381,14,0,'$n, we must hurry and discover when the North Wind has started distorting the timeline. Only then can we defeat him and correct it.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31264,0,'Xarantaur'),(30388,0,0,'The horn! Use the horn on it while it\'s weak!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31183,0,'Stormhoof'),(30388,1,0,'Go to the center of the temple and use the Horn of Elemental Fury!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,36207,0,'Stormhoof'),(30550,0,0,'Do not trouble yourself, little tauren. Neither Stormhoof, nor you and your ally will stand in my way.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31260,0,'Image of the North Wind'),(30550,1,0,'Even now, my power grows. I have long waited for the day when my revenge would be complete.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31261,0,'Image of the North Wind'),(30550,2,0,'Stormhoof and his kin will be erased from history and these lands will be restored to their rightful owner!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31262,0,'Image of the North Wind'),(30474,0,0,'Fool! You will never defeat me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31180,0,'North Wind'),(30474,1,0,'I will never allow you to use the Horn of Elemental Fury against us! Die, weakling!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31181,0,'North Wind'),(30479,0,0,'This is Camp Tunka\'lo, the village ruled by my brother, but I... I don\'t remember you.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,32747,0,'Stormhoof\'s Spirit'),(30479,1,0,'The North Wind? It still troubles my people?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,32749,0,'Stormhoof\'s Spirit'),(30479,2,0,'You both have my thanks and that of the village, though many will never know of your deeds.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,32756,0,'Stormhoof\'s Spirit'),(30479,3,0,'I cannot remain here. I must return to my cairn where I belong, but when I see the ancestors again, it is I who will tell your story.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32759,0,'Stormhoof\'s Spirit'),(29525,0,0,'Thank you, thank you!  Time to get away from these crazy blue women!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30803,0,'Zeev Fizzlespark'),(28511,1,0,'The Eye of Acherus is in your control.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,28465,0,'Eye of Acherus'),(28511,0,0,'The Eye of Acherus launches towards its destination.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,28507,0,'Eye of Acherus'),(34143,0,0,'Self-destruct sequence initiated.',14,0,100,0,0,15413,0,34268,0,''),(34143,1,0,'Self-destruct sequence terminated. Override code A905..',14,0,100,0,0,15414,0,34284,0,''),(34143,2,0,'This area will self-destruct in ten minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15415,0,34283,0,''),(34143,3,0,'This area will self-destruct in nine minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15416,0,34282,0,''),(34143,4,0,'This area will self-destruct in eight minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15417,0,34281,0,''),(34143,5,0,'This area will self-destruct in seven minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15418,0,34280,0,''),(34143,6,0,'This area will self-destruct in six minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15419,0,34273,0,''),(34143,7,0,'This area will self-destruct in five minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15420,0,34274,0,''),(34143,8,0,'This area will self-destruct in four minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15421,0,34275,0,''),(34143,9,0,'This area will self-destruct in three minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15422,0,34276,0,''),(34143,10,0,'This area will self-destruct in two minutes.',14,0,100,0,0,15423,0,34277,0,''),(34143,11,0,'This area will self-destruct in one minute.',14,0,100,0,0,15424,0,34278,0,''),(34143,12,0,'Self-destruct sequence finalized. Have a nice day.',14,0,100,0,0,15425,0,34279,0,''),(27227,0,0,'Where... where am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26240,0,'Prospector Rokar'),(27227,1,0,'Wait a minute here! You promised to spare me if I helped you. I held up my end o\' the bargain!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,26874,0,'Prospector Rokar'),(27227,2,0,'By the Light, Brann\'s alive? I\'d never help you capture him!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26879,0,'Prospector Rokar'),(26666,0,0,'Stay your blade, Chieftain. He may yet have value to us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26875,0,'Scout Vor\'takh'),(26666,1,0,'Remember the dwarven journal that was discovered? Well, this dwarf could be exactly what we need to track down Brann Bronzebeard and capture him.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26878,0,'Scout Vor\'takh'),(26666,2,0,'You will if you wish to keep your head attached to your shoulders.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26880,0,'Scout Vor\'takh'),(26666,3,0,'Does that satisfy you, Tormak?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,26881,0,'Scout Vor\'takh'),(27221,0,0,'Let\'s see if this works.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26239,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),(27221,1,0,'You are among the Taunka of Camp Oneqwah, dwarf.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26251,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),(27221,2,0,'If you agree to help us against our mutual enemy, you will come to no harm here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26252,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),(27221,3,0,'Think about it, prospector, but make up your mind swiftly. We must act soon.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,26253,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),(27221,4,0,'I\'ll admit, dwarf, I was pleasantly surprised to see your plan succeed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26871,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),(27221,5,0,'We can\'t just let you return to your companions and we can\'t take you with us...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26873,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),(27221,6,0,'He will live so long as he proves useful. I\'d be careful if I was you, dwarf.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,26882,0,'Tormak the Scarred'),(26484,2,0,'By the Light, you killed Limpy Joe and took the meat! How did you know where to find us?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,26639,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,3,0,'Well, if you\'ve come to kill me, too, can you at least wait until I\'ve fed Griselda? Poor girl hasn\'t eaten in days.',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,26642,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,4,0,'Here, girl. I\'ve got one last meal for you before Limpy Joe\'s killer does us in!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,26643,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,5,0,'How could you kill poor, defenseless old Joe? And why did you bring the meat back?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,26645,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,6,0,'You\'re an enigma, that\'s what you are... And let me tell you, enigmas and I don\'t get along....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,26646,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,7,0,'I think you\'d best leave before Griselda decides she\'s in the mood for dessert.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,26647,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,8,0,'Wake up, Griselda. Here, girl.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25700,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,9,0,'They\'ll never find us here, will they? We won\'t let them get us like they got Limpy Joe and Flannel McGee!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,25701,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,9,1,'No, we escaped from those monsters! They\'re nothing like us, Griselda.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,25702,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,9,2,'We\'re hunters, you and I. No wolfmen here, no ma\'am.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,25703,0,'Hugh Glass'),(26484,9,3,'Keep an eye out for them, girl! Don\'t let them get us!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,25704,0,'Hugh Glass'),(14848,1,0,'The Stormpike Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!',14,0,100,0,0,8173,0,9057,3,'Herald'),(14848,2,0,'The Stormpike Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!',14,0,100,0,0,8212,0,9058,3,'Herald'),(14848,3,0,'The Stormpike Graveyard was taken by the Horde!',14,0,100,0,0,8213,0,9059,3,'Herald'),(14848,4,0,'The Stormpike Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!',14,0,100,0,0,8174,0,9060,3,'Herald'),(14848,5,0,'The Snowfall Graveyard was taken by the Alliance!',14,0,100,0,0,8173,0,9061,3,'Herald'),(14848,6,0,'The Snowfall Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Alliance will capture it!',14,0,100,0,0,8212,0,9062,3,'Herald'),(14848,7,0,'The Snowfall Graveyard was taken by the Horde!',14,0,100,0,0,8213,0,9063,3,'Herald'),(14848,8,0,'The Snowfall Graveyard is under attack!  If left unchecked, the Horde will capture it!',14,0,100,0,0,