ks? This is a waste of time.',12,0,100,1,0,16028,0,35554,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(35372,2,0,'Speak for yourself, Thrall.',12,0,100,1,0,16029,0,35555,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(35372,3,0,'Words of a fool, you mean. The Horde will destroy the undead without your aid, human, or that of the pompous king.',12,0,100,274,0,16030,0,35556,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(35372,4,0,'Bah.',12,0,100,1,0,16031,0,35557,0,'Garrosh Hellscream'),(35368,0,0,'Garrosh, I expect you to control yourself here. I do not want a repeat of the Violet Citadel.',12,0,100,1,0,16181,0,35552,0,'Thrall'),(35368,1,0,'We are guests here, Garrosh, and you will conduct yourself honorably.',12,0,100,0,0,16182,0,35558,0,'Thrall'),(35368,2,0,'Thank you for the invitation, Lord Fordring. We look forward to observing these games.',12,0,100,66,0,16183,0,35559,0,'Thrall'),(35368,3,0,'Wise words.',12,0,100,1,0,16184,0,35560,0,'Thrall'),(35368,4,0,'Garrosh, enough!',12,0,100,5,0,16185,0,35561,0,'Thrall'),(35368,5,0,'Of course, Tirion. I apologize for his outburst.  It will not be repeated.',12,0,100,0,0,16186,0,35562,0,'Thrall'),(35361,4,0,'King Varian, Lady Jaina. Welcome to the tournament. Your place in the coliseum is waiting.',12,0,100,1,0,16054,0,35522,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,5,0,'My people are here to ensure they honor the rules of engagement. It will do your subjects well to see you in the stands.',12,0,100,1,0,16055,0,35525,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,6,0,'%s nods and gestures for his guests to follow.',16,0,100,273,0,0,0,35526,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35321,0,0,'Tirion.',12,0,100,1,0,16070,0,35521,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),(35321,1,0,'You ask much of me, Tirion, to sit and watch, trusting the savages to keep themselves in check.',12,0,100,1,0,16071,0,35524,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),(35321,2,0,'Perhaps. I doubt the effectiveness of this gambit. We would be better served preparing our armies for the final assault.',12,0,100,1,0,16072,0,35527,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),(35321,3,0,'But if my presence is required in these games to gain your support in the battle, then I will remain.  For now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35528,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),(35320,0,0,'Thank you. It\'s the least I can do to support this; we need to stand together.',12,0,100,2,0,16120,0,35523,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(35320,1,0,'I\'m sure Thrall will have his people under control...',12,0,100,274,0,16121,0,35529,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(35361,7,0,'Combatants of the Alliance and Horde! You are welcome under the banner of the Argent Crusade.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35799,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,8,0,'To the south lies our goal. We will march to the Citadel and cut out the heart of the Scourge where it dwells.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,35800,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,9,0,'But this is no task to be taken lightly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35801,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,10,0,'A massive attack with every able-bodied man would end in needless slaughter. Every soldier lost would rise as the enemy. Azeroth would be left defenseless against the undead threat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35802,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,11,0,'Instead, we require a small, concentrated strike force for the attack to succeed. For that reason, we have created the Argent Tournament.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35803,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,12,0,'Within these walls, you will be tested. Your skill in combat will be matched against the fiercest dangers Northrend has to offer under the watchful eyes of your leaders.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35805,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,13,0,'Your prowess, your might, and your cunning will be under close watch. These games will determine the best Azeroth has to offer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35806,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(35361,14,0,'The victors will take their rightful place in the assault upon the Citadel. We will stand together in the face of evil, and Arthas WILL fall!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35807,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(33853,0,0,'This tournament is the biggest event in ages! Buy something to bring home to your family and show your kids.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33837,0,'Broxel Goldgrasp'),(33853,0,1,'Hey! Check out these doublets! Now you can sport your city\'s colors without having a tabard flapping around and getting in the way!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33836,0,'Broxel Goldgrasp'),(33853,0,2,'Want to show your pride without flailing around on one of those beasts? Whichever city you\'re rooting for, I got what you need!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33835,0,'Broxel Goldgrasp'),(35501,0,0,'The Warchief of the Horde, Thrall, and Overlord Garrosh Hellscream have arrived upon the tournament grounds! Clear the way to the entrance!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,35811,0,'Herald Beluus'),(35501,1,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring approaches the stage to address those gathered upon the tournament grounds! Make way to the stage area to attend him!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,35812,0,'Herald Beluus'),(35501,2,0,'His Majesty, King Varian Wrynn, and Lady Jaina Proudmoore have touched down upon the tournament grounds! Make way!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,35810,0,'Herald Beluus'),(33417,0,0,'Now, I will imbue this crystal with the Light\'s power to cut through lies and deceit.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33540,0,'Crusader Rhydalla'),(33417,1,0,'Grant us the ability to know the truth. If a murderer walks in our midst, guide us in our search for justice.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33541,0,'Crusader Rhydalla'),(48344,0,0,'KROSHIUS CRUSH!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kroshius'),(48332,0,0,'If you\'ve been wrasslin\' with oil, be sure to avoid all sources of sparks or open flame, such as candles, lighters, mages, Kester\'s shop, and Deputy Clunky!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deputy Clunky'),(48332,0,1,'Always wear head protection while on the job! You never know when Miss Darla might have to smack you in the face!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deputy Clunky'),(48332,0,2,'When you\'re doggone tired, it\'s mighty easy to slip up on the job, pardner! Be sure to get at least two hours\' rest between shifts!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deputy Clunky'),(19228,0,4,'Whoa!  Is all that applause for me?  Thanks for coming out!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16326,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,47,0,'Used to be you couldn\'t trust a goblin...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16671,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,48,0,'Who am I kiddin\'? If you trade with goblins you\'d better have iron plating in your coinpurse.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,16672,0,'Perry Gatner'),(18166,0,0,'Do not burden A\'dal with mundane questions, $r.  This being\'s will is all that keeps our enemies from crushing this city.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17238,0,'Khadgar'),(18166,1,0,'Show our guest around Shattrath, will you?  Keep an eye out for pickpockets in the Lower City.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17266,0,'Khadgar'),(26527,0,0,'Oh, no! Adventurers, something awful has happened! A colleague of mine has been captured by the Infinite Dragonflight, and they\'re doing something horrible to him! Keeping Arthas is still your highest priority, but if you act fast you could help save a Guardian of Time!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32670,3,'Chromie'),(26527,1,0,'Adventurers, you must hurry! The Guardian of Time cannot last for much longer!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32678,3,'Chromie'),(26527,2,0,'I can barely sense the Guardian of Time! His timeline is fading quickly!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32679,3,'Chromie'),(22273,0,0,'Die, interloper!  Your puny device cannot pierce the dark magics of Hellfire Citadel!',12,0,100,397,0,0,0,20020,0,'Fel Warden'),(22259,0,0,'Your end has come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,53515,0,'Hellfire Wardling'),(22259,0,1,'An intruder!  Begone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20027,0,'Hellfire Wardling'),(22259,0,2,'An intruder!  Begone!',12,0,100,0,0,8152,0,20027,0,'Hellfire Wardling'),(22259,0,3,'You will burn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,53513,0,'Hellfire Wardling'),(22259,0,4,'Die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,53514,0,'Hellfire Wardling'),(22259,0,5,'Your end has come!',12,0,100,0,0,8152,0,53515,0,'Hellfire Wardling'),(22259,0,6,'Die!',12,0,100,0,0,8152,0,53514,0,'Hellfire Wardling'),(22366,0,0,'Thank you for allowing me to visit, $n.  You have a very colorful soul, but it\'s a little brighter than I prefer... or I might have stayed longer!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,20154,0,'Demoniac Visitation'),(47339,0,0,'Go away, kid, you\'re botherin\' me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impsy'),(47339,1,0,'Right in the face! Ow ow ow...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impsy'),(47339,2,0,'Catch Impsy in the sack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impsy'),(47366,0,0,'I\'ll talk, I\'ll talk! Anything! Just keep that perfumed bag away from me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impsy'),(47369,0,0,'%s flees in terror!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,0,1,'%s screams at the top of its lungs!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,0,2,'%s starts sobbing uncontrollably!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,1,0,'The colors! Nooooooooooooooo!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,1,1,'AAAAAAAAAAAAHHH!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,1,2,'It burns! IT BURNS!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,1,3,'It\'s so intense!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,1,4,'It\'s too much!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,1,5,'Get it away!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47369,1,6,'Make it stop! MAKE IT STOP!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jadefire Imp to Rainbow! - Channeller'),(47308,0,0,'BEES! Jump in water to get them off!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Felwood Honey Bunny'),(9454,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Xavathras'),(47556,0,0,'Hee hee... hee hee hee... ha ha ha!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drizle'),(47556,1,0,'Don\'t call me dummy, dummy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drizle'),(47556,2,0,'Run!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drizle'),(47558,0,0,'Shh! They can hear you, dummy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ferli'),(47558,1,0,'Ow! Now they can see us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ferli'),(31283,0,0,'Ah, the hand of the Ebo