emental - Death'),(29394,0,0,'Not yet, Ymiron, I have other plans for you. You will serve me better within Utgarde Pinnacle. And if these insects survive to find you again, you will get the chance to avenge your wife.',14,0,100,1,0,14748,0,23803,0,'The Lich King'),(24023,0,0,'Give me your souls that I might slay the enemy!',14,0,100,0,0,13774,0,22622,0,'Queen Angerboda'),(24023,1,0,'You will not stop my work here!  My husband-king will awaken!',14,0,100,0,0,13775,0,22636,0,'Queen Angerboda'),(24023,2,0,'The ritual proceeds too slowly. More sacrifices are needed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23802,0,'Queen Angerboda'),(24023,2,1,'Soon, my love. Soon you will waken and all of Azeroth will know fear!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23795,0,'Queen Angerboda'),(24023,2,2,'Awaken, Ymiron, the time of your continued reign is nigh.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23796,0,'Queen Angerboda'),(24023,2,3,'Double your efforts! King Ymiron will awaken and then he will ascend!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23799,0,'Queen Angerboda'),(24023,2,4,'Sleep no longer, my love. With the might of the Lich King behind you, the world will tremble.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23797,0,'Queen Angerboda'),(24023,2,5,'Why is this ritual taking so long? Your master promised that your assistance would speed the process!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23798,0,'Queen Angerboda'),(15214,28,0,'Let the battle begin!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,30961,2,'Invisible Stalker'),(15214,27,0,'The Battle for Lake Wintergrasp is about to begin!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,30960,2,'Invisible Stalker'),(23780,1,0,'What fool dares to enter her majesty\'s dominion unannounced?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22663,0,'High Executor Anselm'),(23780,2,0,'Is that all you\'ve come to say?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22686,0,'High Executor Anselm'),(23780,3,0,'Send these scumbags back to hell!  Fire at will!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22687,0,'High Executor Anselm'),(23780,4,0,'Is that all you\'ve come to say?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22686,0,'High Executor Anselm'),(24041,0,0,'Ah, but it is you who intrudes on our master\'s territory.  He could wipe you out in an instant for that transgression alone!  Arthas does not have much love or patience for his escaped slaves.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22665,0,'Prince Keleseth'),(24041,1,0,'But... he has learned of your victory over Stormwind\'s North Fleet and thinks you have potential.  Potential to see reason and abandon Sylvanas\' childish rebellion.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22669,0,'Prince Keleseth'),(24041,2,0,'Arthas is prepared to offer you power beyond your imagination.  The puny army you lead here would pale in comparison to the phalanxes at your command if you returned to the Scourge\'s embrace.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22671,0,'Prince Keleseth'),(24041,3,0,'Behold the Vrykul!   A race that has perfected war and destruction to the point of an art form.  Already they\'ve cast their lot with the Lich King!  Their dwellings surround you and their numbers are easily five times yours.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22722,0,'Prince Keleseth'),(24041,4,0,'The choice is yours, Anselm.  Return to the Lich King\'s army and fight alongside them or remain loyal to your so-called queen and suffer their wrath as they drive you from their homelands!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22723,0,'Prince Keleseth'),(24041,5,0,'Such a futile gesture.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22758,0,'Prince Keleseth'),(23778,0,0,'Keep them split from their main force!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22382,0,'Dark Ranger Lyana'),(23778,0,1,'Cover fire, now!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22381,0,'Dark Ranger Lyana'),(23778,0,2,'Keep firing!  Cut off their reinforcements!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22380,0,'Dark Ranger Lyana'),(24252,0,0,'The foot bone\'s connected to the... hip bone!  The hip bone\'s connected to this... other bone!  Hmmmhmmmmhmmm...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,23066,0,'\"Hacksaw\" Jenny'),(24252,0,1,'It\'s hard work putting these things together!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,23065,0,'\"Hacksaw\" Jenny'),(28313,0,0,'Yes, yes, we should do whatever we can to help them.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,27726,0,'Apothecary Scyllis'),(7564,0,0,'I\'m going to carefully mix this - oops! ...Well, I spilled a little, but