,'The Leaper'),(29840,1,0,'Mrmrmmrmrmrmrm... mrmrmrmr?!',12,0,100,1,0,12937,0,30459,0,'The Leaper'),(29770,0,0,'Who intrudes upon my ritual?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30462,0,'Lady Nightswood'),(29770,1,0,'You dare?! Where is Baron Sliver? I would have words with him!',12,0,100,34,0,1173,0,30458,0,'Lady Nightswood'),(29769,0,0,'Crush... maim... DESTROY!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30461,0,'Vile'),(29769,1,0,'Vile free? Vile love $n!',12,0,100,34,0,1446,0,30460,0,'Vile'),(32239,0,0,'It is time.  May the Light give us strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32578,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32239,1,0,'Keep your heads down and follow my lead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32616,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32239,2,0,'Here it comes.  Stand ready.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32619,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32239,3,0,'Something\'s wrong... I sense a dark presence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32620,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32239,4,0,'The Lich King is here.  May the Light guide our blades.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32621,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32239,5,0,'You sound a little too confident.  Especially considering the way our last encounter ended.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,32592,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32239,6,0,'That might be, but I don\'t need to stand on holy ground to run that disembodied heart of yours with the Ashbringer.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32589,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32239,7,0,'The heart... the last remaining vestige of your humanity.  I had to stop it from being destroyed.  I had to see for myself.  And at last I\'m sure...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32590,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32239,8,0,'Only shadows from the past remain.  There\'s nothing left to redeem!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32595,0,'Highlord Tirion Fordring'),(32311,0,0,'Take courage, crusaders.  You do not fight alone!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32708,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(32311,1,0,'The Lich King is badly hurt.  We ought to stay behind and finish him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32725,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(32312,0,0,'Quick, through the portal!  He won\'t stay down for long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32707,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(32312,1,0,'Patience... we will get our chance soon enough.  Be content that for once, it is Tirion who is in our debt.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32726,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(32184,0,0,'Uninvited guests!  Did you think you\'d go unnoticed inside my dominion?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32582,0,'The Lich King'),(32184,1,0,'I must confess... you were not altogether unexpected.  I hope you find your final resting place... to your liking.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32585,0,'The Lich King'),(32184,2,0,'Last time we met, you had the advantage of fighting on holy ground.  You\'ll find that our situation has been... reversed.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,32588,0,'The Lich King'),(32184,3,0,'I call your bluff.  You\'re a paladin after all.  Your obsession with redemption goes beyond the inane.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32593,0,'The Lich King'),(32184,4,0,'You surely wouldn\'t destroy humanity\'s only chance to redeem its most wayward son.  You\'d sooner die!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32594,0,'The Lich King'),(32184,5,0,'Arrrrggggggggggh!!!!',14,0,100,34,0,0,0,32694,0,'The Lich King'),(32184,6,0,'You... will pay for that, old man.  Slay them all!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32698,0,'The Lich King'),(32241,0,0,'Tirion\'s down!  Defend him with your lives!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32687,0,'Disguised Crusader'),(27435,1,0,'Detonation in 5...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24591,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27435,0,0,'%s armed.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24590,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(21024,0,0,'Stand back, $n. The spirits may lash out.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18749,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21129,0,0,'Why have you captured us?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18750,0,'Scorned Spirit of Earth'),(21130,0,0,'What is it that you hope to gain from this?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18751,0,'Scorned Spirit of Fire'),(21024,1,0,'We wish to help you, spirit. We seek your wisdom.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18753,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21131,0,0,'Wisdom? It was your people that caused the insufferable wrath of Cyrukh.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18754,0,'Scorned Spirit of Water'),(21132,0,0,'Why should we help you? The world is ruined. Destroyed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18755,0,'Scorned Spirit of Air'),(21024,2,0,'You are right, spirit. It was my people that did this to you. Allow us to make it right.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18757,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21024,3,0,'Please tell us this: Who or what is Cyrukh?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18758,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21129,1,0,'Fool! Cyrukh the fire lord! When the tie was severed, Cyrukh awoke. It is the tears of Cyrukh that fill this land with molten rock.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18759,0,'Scorned Spirit of Earth'),(21024,4,0,'The... The fire lord? An elemental lord was unearthed? Of course... Gul\'dan you were a damned fool!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,18760,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21130,1,0,'He is insane now. Driven mad during the shattering. There is no rest for the elements.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18761,0,'Scorned Spirit of Fire'),(21024,5,0,'There must be a way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18762,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21131,1,0,'Yes, a way. Destroy Cyrukh. Destroy an elemental lord.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18763,0,'Scorned Spirit of Water'),(21024,6,0,'Do not doubt my comrades and I, spirit. Tell us how to conjure the fire lord. My allies will destroy him.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18764,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21132,1,0,'You must utter the words...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18765,0,'Scorned Spirit of Air'),(21129,2,0,'Yes... Yes... the words. The words of damnation. The words spoken by the dark one. Your master.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18766,0,'Scorned Spirit of Earth'),(21130,2,0,'Yes... Gul\'dan...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18767,0,'Scorned Spirit of Fire'),(21024,7,0,'We will find these words. We will summon your master and we will destroy him.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18768,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21129,3,0,'Talk. More talk... Now release us, mortal.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18769,0,'Scorned Spirit of Earth'),(21024,8,0,'%s nods.',16,0,100,273,0,0,0,18756,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21024,9,0,'Now to recover the lost words!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,18778,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(21024,10,0,'%s bows.',16,0,100,2,0,0,0,18752,0,'Earthmender Torlok'),(23364,0,0,'The %s screams out for its mother.',16,0,100,0,0,431,0,21420,0,'Black Dragon Whelpling'),(23282,0,0,'Get away from my clutch!!!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21696,0,'Obsidia'),(20802,6,0,'Keep these things off me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18438,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(20802,6,1,'I\'m under attack! I repeat, I am under attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18439,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(19544,1,0,'There it is! I could\'ve sworn it wasn\'t here last time I checked...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16929,0,'Conjurer Luminrath'),(19543,0,0,'I don\'t know what I was thinking, going out without my sword. I would\'ve put it on if I\'d seen it here...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16931,0,'Battle-Mage Dathric'),(19546,0,0,'I can\'t sleep without a good bedtime story. Now I\'m certain to rest well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16932,0,'Abjurist Belmara'),(26097,0,0,'Thank you for saving us. We accidentally uncovered the pieces of Gearmaster Mechazod and reassembled him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25205,0,'Fizzcrank Gnome Ghost'),(26097,1,0,'In return, he \'de-cursed\' us, saying that we were being \'fixed\' by returning us to the state of being mechanical constructs.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25207,0,'Fizzcrank Gnome Ghost'),(26097,2,0,'He claims that all creations of the Titans fall prey to what he calls, \'The Curse of Flesh\'. He says that the original gnomes were once mechagnomes.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25208,0,'Fizzcrank Gnome Ghost'),(26097,3,0,'He\'s quite insane! Someone must put a stop to his madness before it\'s too late for everyone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25209,0,'Fizzcrank Gnome Ghost'),(25602,0,0,'Now, $n, let us release their souls and hear what they have to say.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,25204,0,'Greatmother Taiga'),(25602,1,0,'This is dire news indeed!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,25211,0,'Greatmother Taiga'),(25380,0,0,'And remember, $n, the bloodspore powder can be used to weaken all magnataur in Gammoth.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24994,0,'Primal Mighthorn'),(25834,0,0,'You were looking for me, child? Why do you come to kill me, $n? I only wish to help.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,25024,0,'Gearmaster Mechazod'),(25834,1,0,'Now that I have been reassembled, we can return to a time of perfection... the time of the Titans!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,25025,0,'Gearmaster Mechazod'),(25834,2,0,'But, I can see it in your eyes, hear it in your pulse rate. You would destroy me despite my offer of immortality!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,25026,0,'Gearmaster Mechazod'),(25834,3,0,'Very well. It saddens me that it has come to this. I look upon all of you as if you were my children. I will slay you if I must!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,25027,0,'Gearmaster Mechazod'),(23837,1,0,'There is a noise from behind you!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,25215,0,'ELM General Purpose Bunny'),(25849,0,0,'It\'s really going to work this time... right?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,25143,0,'Fezzix Geartwist'),(25849,1,0,'It works, Dorain! Look! It actually works...',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,25148,0,'Fezzix Geartwist'),(25849,2,0,'Here I goooooooooo!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25150,0,'Fezzix Geartwist'),(25849,3,0,'OUCH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25151,0,'Fezzix Geartwist'),(25849,4,0,'I give up! So much for goblin ingenuity!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,25152,0,'Fezzix Geartwist'),(25983,0,0,'Fezzix, I think we\'ve solved your little engine problem.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,25132,0,'Dorain Frosthoof'),(25401,0,0,'%s armed.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24590,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,1,0,'Detonation in 5...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24591,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,2,0,'4...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24592,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,3,0,'3...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24593,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,4,0,'2...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24594,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,5,0,'1...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24595,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(32687,0,0,'There goes the finest $c I have the honor of knowing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32866,0,'Linda Ann Kastinglow'),(32687,0,1,'$n, you\'re an inspiration.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32867,0,'Linda Ann Kastinglow'),(32687,0,2,'A fine example of a $g man:woman;, that $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32868,0,'Linda Ann Kastinglow'),(32687,0,3,'You couldn\'t ask for a finer person than $n, I say.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32869,0,'Linda Ann Kastinglow'),(32687,0,4,'$n, wonderful to see you. Wonderful.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32870,0,'Linda Ann Kastinglow'),(32687,0,5,'$n! Ah, fantastic to see you out and about. Busy as always, hm?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32871,0,'Linda Ann Kastinglow'),(32692,0,0,'There goes the finest $c I have the honor of knowing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32866,0,'Arcanist Alec'),(32692,0,1,'$n, you\'re an inspiration.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32867,0,'Arcanist Alec'),(32692,0,2,'A fine example of a $g man:woman;, that $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32868,0,'Arcanist Alec'),(32692,0,3,'You couldn\'t ask for a finer person than $n, I say.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32869,0,'Arcanist Alec'),(32692,0,4,'$n, wonderful to see you. Wonderful.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32870,0,'Arcanist Alec'),(32692,0,5,'$n! Ah, fantastic to see you out and about. Busy as always, hm?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32871,0,'Arcanist Alec'),(25250,2,0,'Your offer will be carefully considered, harbinger.  In the meantime we will make use of your delegation in an advisory role.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24790,0,'General Arlos'),(25301,0,0,'Our troops, general, consist mostly of villagers and peasants.  Good men, but not quite rid of the prejudices and superstitions of their upbringing.  They\'re not ready to fight alongside our more exotic allies.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24789,0,'Counselor Talbot'),(25285,0,0,'Give the word, general.  I will have two regiments at your disposal in a month\'s time.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24787,0,'Harbinger Vurenn'),(25285,1,0,'Very well, general.  Should you change your mind, my people will be more than willing to provide military assistance.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24788,0,'Harbinger Vurenn'),(32451,0,2,'She said to meet her right here... maybe I\'m in the wrong place?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33069,0,'Dalaran Citizen'),(32451,0,1,'Luckily, the Lich King\'s grasp has not reached Dalaran yet.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33068,0,'Dalaran Citizen'),(32451,0,0,'Sometimes it\'s nice to get away from the sanctum and get some fresh air.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33067,0,'Dalaran Citizen'),(32236,1,3,'It was an accident. I was framed. Don\'t drop me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32637,0,'Dark Subjugator'),(23734,0,0,'That should slow the infection down a little.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,22251,0,'Anchorite Yazmina'),(23734,1,0,'I can only hope the treatment will work.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,22828,0,'Anchorite Yazmina'),(23734,2,0,'I just don\'t have the medical supplies I need to properly treat all of you.',12,7,100,1,0,5495,0,22829,0,'Anchorite Yazmina'),(23734,3,0,'Oh my, let me change those bandages!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,22250,0,'Anchorite Yazmina'),(23734,4,0,'Don\'t worry, soldier. Yazmina is going to take care of you.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,22830,0,'Anchorite Yazmina'),(23734,5,0,'%s shakes her head.',16,7,100,274,0,0,0,22831,0,'Anchorite Yazmina'),(23728,0,0,'%s clears his throat.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,22737,0,'Guard Captain Zorek'),(23728,1,0,'I look across this base and all I see is fear... Are you gonna be scared when the Lich King\'s armies are sittin\' pretty in Stormwind? Ironforge? NO! You\'re not. And do you know why? Because you\'ll be dead, that\'s why.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,22738,0,'Guard Captain Zorek'),(23728,2,0,'So when you\'re feeling that tinglin\' sensation at the base of your spine and you\'re \'bout ready to wet your pants, embrace it. Let it enrage you. That fear is the only thing that\'s gonna keep you breathin\'.',12,7,100,25,0,0,0,22739,0,'Guard Captain Zorek'),(23728,3,0,'Am I clear? Do you understand what I\'m sayin\'? I don\'t wanna have to send any more coffins or letters home.',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,22740,0,'Guard Captain Zorek'),(24852,0,0,'Launching.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23860,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),(24852,1,0,'System failure in 3... 2...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23930,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),(31238,0,0,'Come, Cloudwing. Let\'s do a lap.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32247,0,'Hira Snowdawn'),(31238,0,1,'Feeling as restless as I am, Cloudwing? Then let us fly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32252,0,'Hira Snowdawn'),(31238,0,2,'I\'m bored, Cloudwing. Go, go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32251,0,'Hira Snowdawn'),(31238,1,0,'%s sighs softly and rolls her shoulders.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,32249,0,'Hira Snowdawn'),(31238,1,1,'%s looks around Krasus\' Landing, bored.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,32244,0,'Hira Snowdawn'),(31238,1,2,'%s yawns quietly into the palm of her hand.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,32245,0,'Hira Snowdawn'),(19610,0,0,'A skunk! Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeew! Don\'t touch me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17857,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19610,1,0,'Get it away from me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17858,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19610,2,0,'Show us a trick, Ravandwyr!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17852,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19610,3,0,'Let me outta here! Guys... guys?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17874,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19610,4,0,'Oh man, he got you good!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17875,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19610,5,0,'Remember how you\'re always telling us to chill?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,17876,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19610,6,0,'That was the best trick ever! Ok, boys, let\'s go get a drink.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,17853,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19610,7,0,'My eyebrows! You singed my eyebrows!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,20285,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19610,8,0,'Don\'t worry. It\'s an improvement!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,20286,0,'Irradiated Worker'),(19217,0,0,'Oh, another show already? Very well then...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17848,0,'Ravandwyr'),(19217,1,0,'%s sighs audibly and glances at Sagan.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17849,0,'Ravandwyr'),(19217,2,0,'I shall transform my familiar, Sagan, into something truly wondrous!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,17855,0,'Ravandwyr'),(19217,3,0,'And, for my next trick...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17850,0,'Ravandwyr'),(19217,4,0,'A simple practical joke.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,17877,0,'Ravandwyr'),(19217,5,0,'Thank you for watching, everyone! If you\'d be so kind as to bring your non-irradiated currency to tomorrow\'s performance, I\'d appreciate it.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,17856,0,'Ra