e attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17108,0,'Vacillating Voidcaller'),(32641,0,0,'Our friendship is OVER!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33025,0,'Drix Blackwrench'),(32641,0,1,'Hey, yea, I\'ve always wanted to be stranded somewhere.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33024,0,'Drix Blackwrench'),(32641,0,2,'Oh, I see how it is... You\'re gonna do me like that, eh?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33023,0,'Drix Blackwrench'),(32641,0,3,'You\'re just gonna leave me here? How am I supposed to get home?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33026,0,'Drix Blackwrench'),(32642,0,0,'Really, mon? Just like dat you be leavin\' Mojodishu behind?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33027,0,'Mojodishu'),(32642,0,1,'Dis bad mojo what you doin\'. Don\'t say Mojodishu didn\'t warn ya!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33028,0,'Mojodishu'),(32642,0,2,'Be dat way den!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33029,0,'Mojodishu'),(31254,0,2,'The undead are upon us!',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,32027,0,'Lordaeron Footsoldier'),(31254,0,1,'Stand your ground, men!',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,32026,0,'Lordaeron Footsoldier'),(31254,0,0,'Has Prince Arthas turned against us?',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,32025,0,'Lordaeron Footsoldier'),(31033,0,8,'%s cheers at you.',16,1,100,71,0,0,0,25275,0,'Crusader of Virtue'),(31033,0,7,'Hero, I am honored.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,31391,0,'Crusader of Virtue'),(31033,0,2,'You honor us with your presence, $n.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,31386,0,'Crusader of Virtue'),(31033,0,1,'There goes the hero of the Vanguard!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,31385,0,'Crusader of Virtue'),(19228,49,0,'Is it just me, or is the Horde about the ugliest enemy we could find?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,16678,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,50,0,'Just so you guys don\'t feel left out, all I said was how attractive the blood elves are.  It loses something in the translation.',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,16679,0,'Perry Gatner'),(19228,0,6,'Are you ready to laugh!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16329,0,'Perry Gatner'),(4880,0,0,'Ok, let\'s get started.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1610,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,1,0,'Now let\'s look for the herb.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1611,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,2,0,'Nope, not here...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1612,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,3,0,'There must be one around here somewhere...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1613,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,4,0,'Ah, there\'s one!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1614,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,5,0,'Come, $n!  Let\'s go over there and collect it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1615,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,6,0,'%s picks the herb from the ground.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1616,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,7,0,'Ok, now let\'s get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1617,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,8,0,'I can make it from here.  Thanks, $n!  And talk to my employer about a reward!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1618,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,9,0,'%s disappears back into the swamp.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1619,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,10,0,'Help! I\'m under attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1629,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(4880,10,1,'Help!  The beast is on me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1630,0,'\"Stinky\" Ignatz'),(31333,0,0,'No, my beloved.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32040,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Player'),(31333,1,0,'They must not discover the fate of the young paladin. Not yet.',12,11,100,5,0,0,0,32041,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Player'),(31333,2,0,'Come to me, $n.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32048,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Player'),(31334,0,0,'My Queen, do they know?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,32038,0,'Korialstrasz to Player'),(31334,1,0,'%s nods.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,32046,0,'Korialstrasz to Player'),(31334,2,0,'They will not.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32047,0,'Korialstrasz to Player'),(28451,0,0,'What a fight you missed, Dorian! It was one for the ages!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28026,0,'Hemet'),(28451,1,0,'There we were, riding into battle at full speed on the back of Stampy...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28027,0,'Hemet'),(28451,2,0,'Everything was shaking all over the place. I could hardly steady my gun.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28028,0,'Hemet'),(28451,3,0,'And then we saw her, the fearsome beast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28029,0,'Hemet'),(28451,4,0,'It took all of $n\'s skill to maintain control of Stampy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28030,0,'Hemet'),(28451,5,0,'The battle was a haze of blood, lead, and sweat. The broodmother\'s attacks came faster and faster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28032,0,'Hemet'),(28451,6,0,'But, in the end, $n and I prevailed through our wits and teamwork. And now we have this glorious trophy as a memento of our victory.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28033,0,'Hemet'),(28451,7,0,'Do I detect a bit of jealousy, Dorian?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28036,0,'Hemet'),(28376,0,0,'Well, I don\'t know. I was here tending the fire and discussing the drawbacks of cogs with Zootfizzle. That\'s pretty epic, too, in its own way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28037,0,'Dorian'),(28376,1,0,'It\'s your lucky day, Zootfizzle. $n has brought back more hatchlings for you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28892,0,'Dorian'),(28376,2,0,'Well, you can always go back to the camp and help Weslex with all his cogs...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28894,0,'Dorian'),(28374,0,0,'I\'m not here to be the keeper of your hatchlings, Dorian. I\'m doing research of my own, as well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28893,0,'Zootfizzle'),(28374,1,0,'No, not the cogs! Anything but the cogs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28895,0,'Zootfizzle'),(21315,0,0,'The skies will darken and all will go quiet. Only then will you know the sweet serenity of death...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19291,0,'Ruul the Darkener'),(21315,1,0,'Your world is at an end.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19290,0,'Ruul the Darkener'),(28229,0,0,'More intruders? You\'ll soon learn, no one messes with the Venture Company!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27611,0,'Venture Co. Air Patrol'),(27987,0,0,'Over here, to the southeast. I see they got you too...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27610,0,'Monte Muzzleshot'),(144129,0,1,'Enjoy!  You won\'t find better ale anywhere!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5308,0,'Plugger Spazzring'),(33662,0,0,'Any luck?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34184,0,'Kirin Tor Battle-Mage to Player'),(33662,1,0,'Keep at it. If our suspicions are right and this is a transporter, it could prove extremely useful in our assault.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34186,0,'Kirin Tor Battle-Mage to Player'),(33701,0,0,'I heard a story or two of a Lore Keeper in Uldaman that fit your description. Do you serve a similar purpose?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33702,0,'High Explorer Dellorah to Player'),(33701,1,0,'Frontal defense systems? Is there something I should let Brann know before he has anyone attempt to enter the complex?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33704,0,'High Explorer Dellorah to Player'),(33701,2,0,'Can you detail the nature of these defense systems?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33706,0,'High Explorer Dellorah to Player'),(33701,3,0,'Got it. At least we don\'t have to deal with those orbital emplacements.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33708,0,'High Explorer Dellorah to Player'),(33701,4,0,'Rhydian, make sure you let Brann and Archmage Pentarus know about those defenses immediately.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33709,0,'High Explorer Dellorah to Player'),(33701,5,0,'And you mentioned an imprisoned entity? What is the nature of this entity and what is its status?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33710,0,'High Explorer Dellorah to Player'),(33701,6,0,'Yogg-Saron is here? It sounds like we really will have our hands full then.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33713,0,'High Explorer Dellorah to Player'),(33626,0,0,'Not a bit. For the life of me, I can\'t figure out how this thing works.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34183,0,'Hired Engineer to Player'),(33626,1,0,'I know, I know... I haven\'t given up yet. Don\'t get your hopes up though, this technology is way beyond me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34187,0,'Hired Engineer to Player'),(33686,3,0,'Primary defensive emplacements consist of iron constructs and Storm Beacons, which will generate additional constructs as necessary. Secondary systems consist of orbital defense emplacements.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33712,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_4'),(33686,2,0,'Compromise of complex detected, security override enabled - query permitted.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33707,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_3'),(33686,1,0,'Access to the interior of the complex is currently restricted. Primary defensive emplacements are active. Secondary systems are currently non-active.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33705,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_2'),(33686,0,0,'I was constructed to serve as a repository for essential information regarding this complex. My primary functions include communicating the status of the frontal defense systems and assessing the status of the entity that this complex was built to imprison.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33703,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_1'),(33696,0,0,'%s nods.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,33715,0,'Archmage Rhydian to Player'),(33696,1,0,'%s whispers something to Brann.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,33716,0,'Archmage Rhydian to Player'),(32149,0,0,'At last... now I can rest.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35291,0,'Fallen Hero\'s Spirit'),(31254,0,3,'We make our stand here!',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,32028,0,'Lordaeron Footsoldier'),(31254,0,4,'The rumors were true!  The prince has gone mad!',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,32029,0,'Lordaeron Footsoldier'),(19169,0,1,'Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24334,0,'Blood Elf Commoner to Blood Elf Commoner'),(19169,0,2,'During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24333,0,'Blood Elf Commoner to Blood Elf Commoner'),(19178,0,0,'Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24334,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),(19178,0,1,'During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24333,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),(19178,0,2,'The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24335,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),(19178,0,3,'During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom.',12,1,100,396,0,0,0,24333,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),(19178,0,4,'Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune\'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that\'s just a 