y incants a glamour, which beckons forth Highborne spirits. The chamber resonates with their ancient song about the Sin\'dorei...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,19197,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner EMOTE_LAMENT'),(15190,0,0,'Yes!  I\'m cured!  I\'m cure... whoa, got up too fast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10675,0,'Noggle Ficklespragg'),(15190,1,0,'Thanks for finding my reagents!  *yawn*  That poison\'s made me... a bit tired...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10676,0,'Noggle Ficklespragg'),(15189,0,0,'You were always the troublemaker in the family, Noggle.  Always!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10751,0,'Beetix Ficklespragg'),(15181,0,0,'Soldiers of Kalimdor! Heroes of Silithus! One among you has dealt a vicious blow to our mortal enemies! $n and $g his:her; allies have relieved the Ruins of Ahn\'Qiraj of its merciless leader! Ossirian the Unscarred, scourge of Silithus, has finally been destroyed and his armies wholly dismantled!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11355,0,'Commander Mar\'alith'),(15215,0,0,'You will make a fitting sacrifice!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10742,0,'Mistress Natalia Mar\'alith'),(3188,0,0,'I thank you, $n.  And my brother thanks you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,983,0,'Master Gadrin'),(8127,1,0,'Lunch has arrived, my beautiful children. Tear them to pieces!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4166,0,'Antu\'sul'),(8127,0,0,'The children of Sul will protect their master. Rise once more Sul\'lithuz!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,4178,0,'Antu\'sul'),(26635,0,0,'Help mon! There\'s too many of dem!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26538,0,'Risen Drakkari Warrior'),(26635,1,0,'Backup! We need backup!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26537,0,'Risen Drakkari Warrior'),(17587,0,0,'Help! I think this creature might be too tough for me to handle alone.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14167,0,'17587'),(17587,0,1,'Can anyone hear me? I need help! This creature is going to kill me!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14168,0,'17587'),(17587,0,2,'I can\'t hold it off any longer! Tell the exarch that I gave it my best.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14169,0,'17587'),(17587,1,0,'Thanks again!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14170,0,'17587'),(17587,1,1,'Thanks for the heal, $n!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14166,0,'17587'),(17587,2,0,'Another victory for the Draenei!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14171,0,'17587'),(17587,2,1,'Another infected beast destroyed!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14172,0,'17587'),(17587,2,2,'Hah! This is easy.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14174,0,'17587'),(17587,2,3,'How could you think yourself a match for the draenei champion!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14173,0,'17587'),(17587,3,0,'Kill as many infected nightstalkers as I can find... This should be easy.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14165,0,'17587'),(17587,3,1,'I\'m supposed to be hunting infected nightstalkers... This should be easy.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14175,0,'17587'),(17587,3,2,'Where in the nether are these damnable lashers??',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14176,0,'17587'),(17587,3,3,'Hrm, azure snapdragons? Where do they come up with these names? Daedal has gone mad!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14177,0,'17587'),(17587,3,4,'These stags look nothing like talbuks.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14178,0,'17587'),(17587,3,5,'I wonder what that little purple creature at the village is... It\'s certainly beautiful.',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14179,0,'17587'),(17587,4,0,'Time to meet your maker, $n!',12,35,100,0,0,0,0,14180,0,'17587'),(25496,0,0,'Become ashes in the mist!',12,0,50,53,0,0,0,24719,0,'Kvaldir Mist Lord'),(25496,0,1,'The subjugation of these people has only just begun... so much time for fun and games.',12,0,50,53,0,0,0,24718,0,'Kvaldir Mist Lord'),(25496,0,2,'Burn, land dweller! BURN!',12,0,50,53,0,0,0,24717,0,'Kvaldir Mist Lord'),(25801,0,0,'Your impetuousness will be your end!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25103,0,'Nedar'),(25801,0,1,'You dare challenge Nedar, lord of the tundral!?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25102,0,'Nedar'),(25801,0,2,'You don\'t stand a chance!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25104,0,'Nedar'),(20802,5,0,'Done! Back up! Back up!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18437,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(20802,4,0,'Alright, keep me protected while I plant this disruptor. This shouldn\'t take very long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18436,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(20802,3,0,'Look there, fleshling! Salhadaar\'s conduits! He\'s keeping well fed....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18435,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(20802,2,0,'With this much void waste and run-off, a toxic void horror can\'t be too far behind.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18434,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(20802,1,0,'By the second sun of K\'aresh, look at this place! I can only imagine what Salhadaar is planning. Come on, let\'s keep going.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18433,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(20802,0,0,'Let\'s do this... Just keep me covered and I\'ll deliver the package.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18432,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(20474,0,0,'Protect the conduit! Stop the intruders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18441,0,'Ethereum Nexus-Stalker - Protect Conduct'),(20482,0,0,'Hostiles detected. Ending transmission.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,18190,0,'Image of Commander Ameer - On aggro'),(20482,1,0,'Protectorate transmission complete.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18191,0,'Ameer - Quest rewarded'),(33785,0,0,'Get off that horse and fight me man-to-man!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,34169,0,'The Black Knight'),(33785,1,0,'I will not fail you, master!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,34185,0,'The Black Knight'),(33522,0,0,'$N challenges the Black Knight to trial by combat!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33803,0,'Squire Cavin'),(33522,1,0,'Good luck, $N.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33804,0,'Squire Cavin'),(21861,0,0,'From the darkest night shall rise again the raven, shall take flight in the shadows, shall reveal the nature of its kind. Prepare yourself for its coming, for the faithful shall be elevated to take flight with the raven, the rest be forgotten to walk upon the ground, clipped wings and shame.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,19475,0,'The Voice of the Raven God - The First Prophecy'),(21861,1,0,'Steel your minds and guard your thoughts. The dark wings will cloud and consume the minds of the weak, a flock of thralls whose feet may never leave the ground.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,19476,0,'The Voice of the Raven God - The Second Prophecy'),(21861,2,0,'The Old blood will flow once again with the coming of the raven, the return of the darkness in the skies. Scarlet night, and the rise of the old.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,19477,0,'The Voice of the Raven God - The Third Prophecy'),(21861,3,0,'The raven was struck down once for flying too high, unready. The eons have prepared the Dark Watcher for its ascent, to draw the dark cloak across the horizon.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,19478,0,'The Voice of the Raven God - The Fourth Prophecy'),(11980,2,0,'Indeed, the time has come to end this charade.',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,20128,0,'Zuluhed the Whacked'),(11980,1,0,'Foolish mortals. Did you think that I would not strike you down for your transgressions?',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,20127,0,'Zuluhed the Whacked'),(11980,0,0,'Lord Illidan, bless me with the power of the flight!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20126,0,'Zuluhed the Whacked'),(2775,0,0,'Nothing will stop us! You will die!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,855,0,'Daggerspine Marauder'),(2775,0,1,'You\'ve plundered our treasures too long.  Prepare to meet your watery grave!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,854,0,'Daggerspine Marauder'),(2610,0,0,'All hands to battle stations! Naga incoming!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6372,0,'Shakes Breen'),(2610,1,0,'If we can just hold them now, I am sure we will be in the clear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,863,0,'Shakes Breen'),(30401,0,0,'King Stormheart is putting you to the test, eh? He must see something in you to begin with or I doubt he\'d put you through such a sacred ritual.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30942,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,1,0,'I know you\'re new to our kind, so I\'ll catch you up a bit while we\'re on our way over.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30943,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,2,0,'Years back, my father and several other frostborn were returning from a trek across Dragonblight. There was a heavy blizzard... far worse than we\'ve ever seen since.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30944,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,3,0,'They crossed a trail of blood-soaked snow and followed it to find a dwarf wandering and speaking in a dialect they couldn\'t make out... and not a dwarf of our kind mind you, but a mountain dwarf - something our kind had never seen before.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30945,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,4,0,'The dwarf seemed lost, having no memory of where he came from, or even of his own name. Not being the kind to leave a dwarven cousin to die in the snow, my father\'s party took him in and continued back towards Frosthold.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30946,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,5,0,'Not long later, out of nowhere, the snow burst before them and a jormungar the size of Veranus herself came down upon their party... one of them was swallowed whole before they even had time to react.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30947,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,6,0,'My father thought they were all doomed... but behind him, a furious roar rumbled across the snow, and he turned to see the mountain dwarf growing in size, his skin taking on a stone-like texture, and his hands sizzling with lightning.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30948,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,7,0,'The dwarf barreled forward with a sound like rolling thunder and hurled a shining metal hammer, lightning coursing over its surface, directly into the jormungar\'s throat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30949,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,8,0,'The jormungar collapsed instantly, its head barely still attached to its convulsing body. My father turned to the dwarf in awe and raised a fist in praise...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30950,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,9,0,'The stranger having no name of his own, my father deemed \"Yorg,\" a name reserved for champions of legend. Years later, he now stands before us as Yorg Stormheart, King of the Frostborn.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30952,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,10,0,'King Stormheart has trained us well... turned us into even more fearsome warriors than we could have boasted during the time of our war with the Frost Giants.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30953,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,11,0,'And as one of the fiercest tests put upon a warrior of the frostborn, we are made to face a creature far larger than ourselves--giants, dragons, jormungar--as a testament to the fact that size will never be our weakness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30955,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,12,0,'This is the test put before you this day. Return to us only once The Iron Watcher is dead, and be revered as a warrior of the frostborn.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30956,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(30401,13,0,'He is slow from the rust of the ages... be quick on your feet and he will not best you. You have King Stormheart\'s favor - do not disappoint.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31343,0,'Velog Icebellow'),(20454,0,0,'Prepare to enter oblivion, meddlers. You have unleashed a god!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,18443,0,'Nexus-King Salhadaar'),(5416,0,0,'%s takes a big swig of ale.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1857,0,'Infiltrator Marksen'),(5416,1,0,'That was refreshing. Now there\'s information that needs to be told...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1858,0,'Infiltrator Marksen'),(5416,2,0,'I believe the Forsaken are misleading the allies of the Horde.... wait... I feel so... dizzy...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1859,0,'Infiltrator Marksen'),(5416,3,0,'%s writhes in pain.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1860,0,'Infiltrator Marksen'),(5416,4,0,'AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARGH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1861,0,'Infiltrator Marksen'),(26626,0,0,'Don\'t be so quick to escape! I have a parting gift....',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26474,0,'Scourge Reanimator'),(26626,1,0,'Rise my warriors and fight for your new liege!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26464,0,'Scourge Reanimator'),(26626,2,0,'Please enjoy their company, the Lich King sends his regards!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26473,0,'Scourge Reanimator'),(19169,0,3,'The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24335,0,'Blood Elf Commoner to Blood Elf Commoner'),(19169,0,4,'The festival of the moon was ever more important to the kaldorei. The great festival of the druids is surely in full swing.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,16171,0,'Blood Elf Commoner to Blood Elf Commoner'),(19176,0,0,'During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24333,0,'Tauren Commoner to Tauren Commoner'),(19176,0,1,'Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune\'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that\'s just a legend.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24332,0,'Tauren Commoner to Tauren Commoner'),(19176,0,2,'The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24335,0,'Tauren Commoner to Tauren Commoner'),(19176,0,3,'Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24334,0,'Tauren Commoner to Tauren Commoner'),(19175,0,0,'Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune\'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that\'s just a legend.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24332,0,'Orc Commoner to Orc Commoner'),(19175,0,1,'The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24335,0,'Orc Commoner to Orc Commoner'),(19175,0,2,'During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24333,0,'Orc Commoner to Orc Commoner'),(19175,0,3,'Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them.',12,1,100,274,0,0,0,24334,0,'Orc Commoner to Orc Commoner'),(19175,0,4,'The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival.',12,1,100,274,0,0,0,24335,0,'Orc Commoner to Orc Commoner'),(19177,0,0,'During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24333,0,'Troll Commoner to Troll Commoner'),(19177,0,1,'Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24334,0,'Troll Commoner to Troll Commoner'),(19177,0,2,'We should go to Moonglade to see the druids\' great festival of the moon.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,16211,0,'Troll Commoner to Troll Commoner'),(19177,0,3,'The druids of Nighthaven 