Commoner'),(30399,0,0,'It is time I put an end to my brother\'s madness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31078,0,'Thorim'),(30399,1,0,'Loken!!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,31079,0,'Thorim'),(30399,2,0,'Stand up and fight me, you worthless traitor!  ',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,31080,0,'Thorim'),(30399,3,0,'Do not dare...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31083,0,'Thorim'),(30399,4,0,'Speak...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31116,0,'Thorim'),(30399,5,0,'Her name!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31117,0,'Thorim'),(30396,0,0,'You seem eager to join your beloved Sif, brother.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31082,0,'Loken'),(30396,1,0,'ENOUGH!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,31126,0,'Loken'),(30396,2,0,'Looks like you can still best me in a fair fight, little brother.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31110,0,'Loken'),(30396,3,0,'Unfortunately for you.... this fight is anything but fair!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31111,0,'Loken'),(30396,4,0,'Thanks to your little friend, you\'ve left the Temple of Storms, where you were at your strongest.  Instead we fight closer to my master\'s power.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31112,0,'Loken'),(30396,5,0,'Minions!  Take my brother and his drake to their new dwellings.  Make sure the beast makes it alive.  I have special plans for the broodmother.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31128,0,'Loken'),(30396,6,0,'As for your life, mortal.  I will be generous.  After all... why would I destroy my most useful servant?  I waited for you for weeks inside that Hyldnir mine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31127,0,'Loken'),(30396,7,0,'The shape wasn\'t mine, of course.  And had you not been so reckless, you would\'ve seen past my illusion.  But you came through for me, and for that... I must thank you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31133,0,'Loken'),(18475,0,0,'Come out, little birdies! Mug\'gok want to play!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15463,0,'Muggok'),(18475,1,0,'No hurt Mug\'gok\'s feelings, bird-men!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15464,0,'Muggok'),(18475,2,0,'Fine! Birdies be dat way! Mug\'gok find new friends!',14,0,100,14,0,0,0,15465,0,'Muggok'),(22862,0,3,'Pathetic worm... your master\'s days are over!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20671,0,'Caalen'),(22862,0,4,'For Xi\'ri!  For the Sha\'tar!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20667,0,'Caalen'),(22862,0,5,'Your end is at hand, Illidari!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20668,0,'Caalen'),(23152,0,0,'Pitiful wretches. You dared invade Illidan\'s temple? Very well, I shall make it your death bed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20719,0,'Vagath'),(22990,0,0,'Now is the time, Maiev! Unleash your wrath!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20742,0,'Akama'),(22989,0,0,'I\'ve waited for this moment for years. Illidan and his lapdogs will be destroyed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20743,0,'Maiev'),(22990,1,0,'Slay all who see us! Word must not get back to Illidan.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20744,0,'Akama'),(22989,1,0,'Meet your end, demon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Maiev'),(23152,1,0,'You\'ve sealed you fate, Akama. The Master will learn from your betrayal!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20745,0,'Vagath'),(22990,2,0,'Akama has no master, not anymore.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20746,0,'Akama'),(22990,3,0,'Our plans are in danger already. It appears Maiev\'s decided to do things her own way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20748,0,'Akama'),(22990,4,0,'%s\'s attention shifts to a crack along the temple\'s southern wall.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20749,0,'Akama'),(22990,5,0,'We must carry on with or without Maiev. Inside! Quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20750,0,'Akama'),(18528,0,0,'%s falls silent and a quiet tension falls over nearby Sha\'tar forces as Xi\'ri makes his decision.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20737,0,'Xiri'),(18528,1,0,'%s begins channeling the powers of the light.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20693,0,'Xiri'),(24381,0,0,'Arise from the earth, my brothers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23311,0,'Megalithe'),(24381,1,0,'Our iron masters have a mission for us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23312,0,'Megalithe'),(24381,2,0,'Follow me into the mountains to carry out the plan of the masters!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23315,0,'Megalithe'),(24381,3,0,'We will not fail!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23332,0,'Megalithe'),(251,0,0,'Here goes nothing...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1862,0,'Maybell Maclure'),(12737,0,0,'$s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Mastok Wrilehiss enrage at 30%'),(49141,9,0,'Nice work!  You\'ve found them.  Let\'s bring these back to Mordo.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49303,0,'Darnell'),(49141,8,0,'Hey, give me a hand, $n!  I can\'t find the supplies that Mordo needed!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49301,0,'Darnell'),(49141,7,0,'Hmm...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49299,0,'Darnell'),(49141,6,0,'Maybe they\'re over here?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49298,0,'Darnell'),(49141,4,0,'No, not over here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49300,0,'Darnell'),(49141,5,0,'Now, where could those supplies be?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49297,0,'Darnell'),(49141,3,0,'Let\'s see now... where could they be...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49302,0,'Darnell'),(49141,2,0,'This way!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49296,0,'Darnell'),(49141,0,0,'Greetings, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49305,0,'Darnell'),(49141,1,0,'The Shadow Grave is this way.  Follow me, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49295,0,'Darnell'),(1568,0,0,'Let\'s see, I just saw a corpse with a jaw that would fit you',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,50126,0,'Undertaker Mordo'),(1568,1,0,'That should do the job. Come back right away if it falls off again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,50127,0,'Undertaker Mordo'),(50414,0,0,'T-thank you, Under-t-taker.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,50128,0,'Risen Recruit'),(39117,3,0,'Your mortal remains have been gathered, here in this place where you spent your childhood!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,39156,0,'Shadow Priestess Malia'),(39117,2,0,'Devlin Agamand! Listen to my voice!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,39155,0,'Shadow Priestess Malia'),(39117,0,0,'Very well. Follow me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39153,0,'Shadow Priestess Malia'),(39117,1,0,'Now it is time for us to begin.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39154,0,'Shadow Priestess Malia'),(38980,3,0,'Mother... father... Thurman... where are you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39163,0,'Spirit of Devlin Agamand'),(38980,2,0,'You people... what are you doing here? Why are you in my house?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39162,0,'Spirit of Devlin Agamand'),(38980,1,0,'Wait, am I... home?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39161,0,'Spirit of Devlin Agamand'),(38980,0,0,'What\'s going on here?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39160,0,'Spirit of Devlin Agamand'),(1538,0,0,'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2628,0,'Scarlet Friar'),(1538,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Friar'),(1538,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil. Now you will die!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Friar'),(1540,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Vanguard'),(1540,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Vanguard'),(1540,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Vanguard'),(1539,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Neophyte'),(1539,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Neophyte'),(1539,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Neophyte'),(1537,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Zealot'),(1537,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Zealot'),(1537,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Zealot'),(1536,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Scarlet Missionary'),(1536,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Missionary'),(1536,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Missionary'),(1536,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Missionary'),(1535,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Warrior'),(1535,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Warrior'),(1535,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Warrior'),(39038,0,0,'Father!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39138,0,'Lilian'),(39038,1,0,'Shut up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39140,0,'Lilian'),(39038,2,0,'You raised me to be a killer.  How am I doing, daddy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39141,0,'Lilian'),(39038,3,0,'But wait... I remember now. You taught me to only kill the undead. So you do want me to kill myself, daddy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39143,0,'Lilian'),(39038,4,0,'Then again, why kill myself... when I can kill YOU instead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39145,0,'Lilian'),(39038,5,0,'Thanks for everything... father.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39146,0,'Lilian'),(39097,1,0,'I, ah...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39142,0,'High Priest Benedictus Voss'),(39097,0,0,'Lilian... you\'re... it\'s so nice to see you well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39139,0,'High Priest Benedictus Voss'),(11057,0,0,'Now THAT\'s what I call oomph! I wish all our potions did this!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,44553,0,'Apothecary Dithers'),(49337,2,0,'Good, you\'re still here. Now, where\'s Deathguard Saltain?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49457,0,'Darnell'),(49337,3,0,'Ah, here he is.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49458,0,'Darnell'),(49337,4,0,'Let\'s get moving, $n. Saltain said that we\'d fine some corpses up here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49459,0,'Darnell'),(49337,5,0,'I think I see some corpses up ahead. Let\'s go, $n! You do the searching and fighting. I\'ll do the lifting.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49460,0,'Darnell'),(66168,0,0,'I see. Well then, let\'s get to work, $n! The Dark Lady needs us, right?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49351,0,'Valdred Moray'),(66168,1,0,'Valdred Moray, reporting for duty, sir!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,49408,0,'Valdred Moray'),(66167,0,0,'Who are you calling a monster? You\'re the monster! I\'m just a man who died.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49345,0,'Marshal Redpath'),(38999,3,0,'Gebler, father, why would you...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39001,0,'Lilian Voss'),(38999,2,0,'What? NO! This can\'t be! Gebler, you know me... we were friends once!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38996,0,'Lilian Voss'),(38999,1,0,'Gebler, you came! What did he say?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38994,0,'Lilian Voss'),(38999,0,0,'Yes, my... wait, be quiet! I hear the lieutenant approaching.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39000,0,'Lilian Voss'),(39002,3,0,'Unfortunately, you were too dangerous in life, and you\'re far too dangerous in undeath. I will enjoy killing you, you Scourged witch...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38998,0,'Scarlet Lieutenant Gebler'),(39002,2,0,'The High Priest sends his regrets. He had hoped that one day you would be a powerful weapon against our enemies.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38997,0,'Scarlet Lieutenant Gebler'),(39002,1,0,'High Priest Voss denounces you as a daughter. He\'s ordered that you be executed immediately.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38995,0,'Scarlet Lieutenant Gebler'),(39002,0,0,'The time has come, my little captive... word has come back from your father.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38993,0,'Scarlet Lieutenant Gebler'),(38910,0,0,'You don\'t understand... I CAN\'T be undead! Not me, not now...',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,38982,0,'Lilian Voss'),(1543,0,0,'The %s is ready to be captured!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38854,0,'Vile Fin Puddlejumper'),(1541,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1150,0,'Vile Fin Murloc'),(1934,0,0,'Get out of my kitchen!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44544,0,'Tirisfal Farmer'),(1545,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vile Fin Muckdweller'),(1544,0,0,'The %s is ready to be captured!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38854,0,'Vile Fin Minor Oracle'),(1935,0,0,'Get out of my kitchen!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44544,0,'Tirisfal Farmhand'),(10665,0,0,'What could be taking so long?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5955,0,'Junior Apothecary Holland'),(10665,0,1,'How long can it take to pick a handful of weeds?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5956,0,'Junior Apothecary Holland'),(10665,0,2,'At this rate I could have gathered them myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5957,0,'Junior Apothecary Holland'),(10665,0,3,'If you want something done right, do it yourself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5958,0,'Junior Apothecary Holland'),(10665,0,4,'As if I had all eternity.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5959,0,'Junior Apothecary Holland'),(10665,0,5,'Ah, this must be him now... NO?  Bah!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5960,0,'Junior Apothecary Holland'),(10665,0,6,'Maybe I should have just bought SOME off of Faruza?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5961,0,'Junior Apothecary Holland'),(10665,0,7,'I had TO go AND requisition an Abomination... an Abomination!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5962,0,'Junior Apothecary Holland'),(1521,0,1,'The cold dark beckons...',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,39008,0,'Gretchen Dedmar'),(1657,0,0,'The Agamand Mills is held by the Scourge, $C.  Join us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,575,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1657,0,1,'Here to visit the family?  Die, fool!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,574,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1521,0,0,'So cold...',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,39007,0,'Gretchen Dedmar'),(21318,0,0,'I... I have died... I was in so much pain... engulfed in darkness... Can you see me, $r?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18993,0,'Spirit of Ar\'tor '),(21024,11,0,'I hear what you hear, brother. Look behind you...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19336,0,'Earthmender Torlok to Cyrukh the Firelord'),(21685,0,0,'You do not fight alone, $n! Together, we will banish this spawn of hellfire!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19304,0,'Oronok Torn-heart'),(21685,1,0,'We leave, then, Torlok. I have only one request...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19341,0,'Oronok Torn-heart'),(21685,2,0,'The Torn-heart men give their weapons to Earthmender Torlok.',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,19342,0,'Oronok Torn-heart'),(21685,3,0,'Give these to the heroes that made this possible.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19343,0,'Oronok Torn-heart'),(21685,4,0,'We will set the elements free of your grasp by force!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19309,0,'Oronok Torn-heart'),(21685,5,0,'We will fight when you are ready.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19310,0,'Oronok Torn-heart'),(21685,6,0,'What say the elements, Torlok? I hear only silence.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19334,0,'Oronok Torn-heart'),(21685,7,0,'They are redeemed! Then we have won?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,19337,0,'Oronok Torn-heart'),(17008,0,0,'Be silent! The shattering is soon to come!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,18701,0,'Gul\'dan'),(17008,1,0,'Bear witness to the undeniable power of our dark master!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18702,0,'Gul\'dan'),(17008,2,0,'With his gift, I shall raze this land and reform it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18703,0,'Gul\'dan'),(17008,3,0,'Watch! See the ground shatter before us! Watch as the energy flows! It will feed our armies...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18704,0,'Gul\'dan'),(17008,4,0,'We will never be without power! I have secured our future! Bask in my glory!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18705,0,'Gul\'dan'),(17008,5,0,'It... is... done...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18706,0,'Gul\'dan'),(21181,0,0,'Cyrukh has awoken!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19298,0,'Cyrukh the Firelord'),(21181,1,0,'Cyrukh comes for you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19301,0,'Cyrukh the Firelord'),(21181,1,1,'You will suffer eternally!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19299,0,'Cyrukh the Firelord'),(21181,1,2,'Those that dare play with fire will be incinerated!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19302,0,'Cyrukh the Firelord'),(21181,1,3,'Little creature made of flesh, your wish is granted! Death comes for you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19308,0,'Cyrukh the Firelord'),(21310,0,0,'A flaming vortex takes shape.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,19303,0,'Shadowmoon Valley Invisible Trigger (Tiny)'),(21049,0,0,'You have damned us all... We are lost.',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18700,0,'Spirit of the Past'),(21049,0,1,'Stop! You must stop!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18698,0,'Spirit of the Past'),(21049,0,2,'Do not do this, Gul\'dan! The elements will never forgive us!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18697,0,'Spirit of the Past'),(21049,0,3,'Think of our younglings, Gul\'dan! You will destroy us all!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18699,0,'Spirit of the Past'),(21049,0,4,'We will take from the land if it refuses to give!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,18696,0,'Spirit of the Past'),(21049,0,5,'Tear the land asunder, Gul\'dan! Sever the tie!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,18694,0,'Spirit of the Past'),(21049,0,6,'They have abandoned us! Do not forget!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,18695,0,'Spirit of the Past'),(21740,0,0,'Yes... Well enough for the elements that are here, but the cipher is known to another... The spirits of fire are in turmoil... If this force is not stopped, the world where these mortals came from will cease.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19339,0,'Redeemed Spirit of Fire'),(21739,0,0,'Farewell, mortals... The earthmender knows what fire feels...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19340,0,'Redeemed Spirit of Earth'),(21739,1,0,'It is now as it should be, shaman. You have done well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19338,0,'Redeemed Spirit of Earth'),(23905,1,0,'Prepare to fire upon my command! Ready, aim...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22448,0,'Major Mills'),(23905,2,0,'FIRE AT WILL!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22449,0,'Major Mills'),(23905,3,0,'We did it! We\'ve defeated Tethyr!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22633,0,'Major Mills'),(21332,0,0,'It is dying! The second part of the Cipher of Damnation is ours. I...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19040,0,'Spirit Hunter to Veneratus the Many'),(21332,1,0,'I am fading... Return to Ar\'tor... Ret... rn... to...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19041,0,'Spirit Hunter to Veneratus the Many'),(21411,0,0,'%s cracks the rotten egg open and - to the horror and dismay of all around him - begins to drink from its putrid core.',16,0,100,92,0,0,0,19098,0,'Tobias the Filth Gorger to Player'),(21411,1,0,'That was life-changing... Excuse me for one minute.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,19099,0,'Tobias the Filth Gorger to Player'),(21411,2,0,'%s lets loose the most foul belch ever heard or smelled.',16,0,100,15,0,10593,0,19100,0,'Tobias the Filth Gorger to Player'),(21411,3,0,'Ok then, back to business.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19101,0,'Tobias the Filth Gorger to Player'),(18417,0,0,'The information you seek... I cannot give you that freely.  You will have to prove that your enemies are the same as mine.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,19890,0,'Altruis the Sufferer to Player'),(18417,1,0,'This book would give me unlimited power over my enemies... I would become... unstoppable!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19614,0,'Altruis the Sufferer to Player'),(18417,2,0,'No... you must take this from me, $n!  I feel its dark power swaying my will already!  Use it to destroy Varedis.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,19615,0,'Altruis the Sufferer to Player'),(21700,0,0,'Have no fear, $r.  Just play along.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,19402,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,1,0,'A mere nuisance, I assure you!  Tell the Master his prisoner will not escape while Akama and his Deathsworn watch over her.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19403,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,2,0,'Forgive my harsh methods, but the Betrayer cannot learn of the truth.  My secret must be kept at all costs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19405,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,3,0,'In due time, Maiev.  I\'ve spent years preparing to make my move - I can\'t afford to put my plans in peril by tipping my hand too soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19408,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,4,0,'The Heart of Fury... I witnessed its power long ago, when Velen wielded it.  I feel the same power coursing through it right now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19858,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,5,0,'With this crystal\'s powers, my Deathsworn and I... we\'d be unstoppable!  We could destroy Illidan!  We could... replace him as lords of Outland!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19859,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,6,0,'But that is not part of the vision I was granted... that is not... how my people will be freed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19860,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,7,0,'Please, $n.  You must take the Heart of Fury somewhere safe... you must take it to A\'dal!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19870,0,'Akama to Player'),(21699,0,0,'Release me immediately or face my wrath!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,19395,0,'Maiev Shadowsong'),(21699,1,0,'If we truly desire the same thing, Akama, then release me!  If Illidan is to die, it shall be by my hand!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,19407,0,'Maiev Shadowsong to Player'),(21699,2,0,'Curse you, Akama!  I am not a pawn in your game... my will is my own.  When I unleash my wrath upon Illidan it will have nothing to do with your foolish scheme!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19409,0,'Maiev Shadowsong to Player'),(21768,0,0,'Mortals, here?  What is the meaning of this, pathetic Broken!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19401,0,'Vagath to Player'),(21768,1,0,'You\'d do well not to toy with me, Akama.  Illidan has given me specific orders to keep a close watch on the Warden.  If I find out you\'re hiding anything from me, I will crush you with my own hands!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19404,0,'Vagath to Player'),(22865,0,0,'You disappoint me, Akama.  I wanted to question the treacherous worm myself!  I\'m beginning to question your allegiance, Broken.',12,0,100,1,0,11608,0,20628,0,'Illidan\'s Presence to Player'),(22865,1,0,'I do not sense lies in your voice, Akama.  That Kael\'thas would betray me does not come as a big surprise - I\'m not as oblivious as some would think. That one of your own was involved with him puts your loyalties into question.',12,0,100,5,0,11609,0,20629,0,'Illidan\'s Presence to Player'),(22865,2,0,'Send your Ashtongue into Tempest Keep and slay his most prized possession, the phoenix known as Al\'ar.  I must know that you\'re not on his side.  Do not think of betraying me, Broken.  We both know who owns your soul!',12,0,100,1,0,11610,0,20630,0,'Illidan\'s Presence to Player'),(21700,8,0,'Olum... old friend.  It is good to see that you are safe.',12,0,100,6,0,11600,0,20490,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,9,0,'Illidan will become suspicious... that much is for certain.  We will deal with it as we always do.',12,0,100,0,0,11601,0,20491,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,10,0,'You cannot... be serious, Olum.  Your sacrifice has already been too great.',12,0,100,274,0,11602,0,20492,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,11,0,'It appears your mind is set then.  We will guide you to the spirit world with as much kindness as we can.',12,0,100,396,0,11603,0,20493,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,12,0,'Farewell, dear friend. We shall meet you in the next world when our duties in this one are fulfilled.',12,0,100,0,0,11604,0,20494,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,13,0,'Master!  We\'ve found the traitor who escaped Vashj!  His body lies in front of me... lifeless!',12,0,100,0,0,11605,0,20495,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,14,0,'But, sire!  You have misjudged my actions... I do have knowledge of someone close to you who plans to betray you.  It is that dog, Kael\'thas!  He has allied with Kil\'jaeden and intends to replace you as Lord of Outland!',12,0,100,0,0,11606,0,20496,0,'Akama to Player'),(21700,15,0,'It will be done, my lord!',12,0,100,66,0,11607,0,20497,0,'Akama to Player'),(22820,0,0,'Akama, my friend!  Have you been informed?  I was found out by Vashj\'s followers.  Our secret is in peril!',12,0,100,0,0,11611,0,20498,0,'Seer Olum to Player'),(22820,1,0,'Illidan is looking for me.  I am not safe here... none of us are.',12,0,100,1,0,11612,0,20502,0,'Seer Olum to Player'),(22820,2,0,'Illidan will find me and when he does... he will pry the Ashtongue secret from me - such is the power of the Betrayer!  No... there is only one way.  My usefulness to the cause has come to an end. I must venture into the spirit world!',12,0,100,6,0,11613,0,20499,0,'Seer Olum to Player'),(22820,3,0,'My decision is final.  I will not be dissuaded.  I have devoted my life to our plan.  To jeopardize it now would betray all who have died for the cause long before me.',12,0,100,274,0,11614,0,20500,0,'Seer Olum to Player'),(22820,4,0,'I thank you, Akama.  You honor me by allowing me this moment, surrounded by my brothers.  Farewell, friend.  Guide our people well.',12,0,100,2,0,11615,0,20501,0,'Seer Olum to Player'),(17678,0,0,'Petulant children, pray to your gods for you are about to meet them!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14666,0,'Sironas SAY_SIRONAS_1 (pre aggro)'),(17606,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(17982,0,0,'There\'s no turning back now. Stay close and watch my back.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14648,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_1'),(17982,1,0,'There it is! Do you see where the large red crystal is jutting out from the Vector Coil? That\'s where I need to plant the first set of explosives.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,14649,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_2'),(17982,2,0,'Cover me!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,14650,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_3'),(17982,3,0,'It won\'t be much longer. Just keep them off me while I work.',12,0,100,69,0,0,0,14651,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_4'),(17982,4,0,'That\'ll do it! Quickly, take cover!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,14652,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_5'),(17982,5,0,'3...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14653,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_6'),(17982,6,0,'2...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14654,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_7'),(17982,7,0,'1...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14655,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_8'),(17982,8,0,'Don\'t get too excited, hero, that was the easy part. The challenge lies ahead! Let\'s go.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14656,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_9'),(17982,9,0,'What in the Nether is that?!?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,14657,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_10'),(17982,10,0,'Be ready for anything.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14658,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_11'),(17982,11,0,'Blessed Light! She\'s siphoning energy right out of the Vector Coil!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,14659,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_12'),(17982,12,0,'Cover me, we have to do this quickly. Once I blow the support on this side, it will disrupt the energy beams and she\'ll break out! I doubt very much that she\'ll be happy to see us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14660,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_13'),(17982,13,0,'I\'ve almost got it! Just a little more time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14661,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_14'),(17982,14,0,'Take cover and be ready for the fight of your life!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,14662,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_15'),(17982,15,0,'3...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14653,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_16'),(17982,16,0,'2...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14654,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_17'),(17982,17,0,'1...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14655,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_18'),(17982,18,0,'Holy mother of O\'ros!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,14663,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_19'),(17982,19,0,'I... I can\'t believe it\'s over. You did it! You\'ve destoyed the blood elves and their leader!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14664,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_20'),(17982,20,0,'Get back to Blood Watch. I\'ll see you there...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14665,0,'npc_demolitionist_legoso SAY_LEGOSO_21'),(17658,0,0,'All hail $N, savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst. Hero of the Hand of Argus, champion of the draenei people!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,14691,0,'Exarch Admetius'),(3230,0,0,'Hellfire Citadel is ours! The source of Illidan\'s fel orc army is no more! Magtheridon has fallen to the might of $n and $g his:her; allies!',14,1,100,22,0,0,0,20765,2,'Nazgrel to Player'),(3230,1,0,'The time for us to rise and strike at the fel orcs that remain is now! Do this for your Warchief! Do this for the Horde!',14,1,100,22,0,0,0,20766,2,'Nazgrel to Player'),(18481,0,0,'Silence descends upon Shattrath.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20776,2,'A\'dal to Player'),(18481,1,0,'%s\'s thoughts invade your mind.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20777,2,'A\'dal to Player'),(18481,2,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider has been defeated by $n and $g his:her; allies.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20778,2,'A\'dal to Player'),(18481,3,0,'The time to strike at the remaining blood elves of Tempest Keep is now. Take arms and let A\'dal\'s song of battle empower you!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20779,2,'A\'dal to Player'),(23054,0,0,'Your monkeys failed to finish the job, naaru. Beaten but alive... The same mistake was not made when we took command of your vessel.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,20792,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider to Player'),(23054,1,0,'All for what? Trinkets? You are too late. The preparations have already begun. Soon the master will make his return.',14,0,100,274,0,0,0,20793,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider to Player'),(23054,2,0,'And there is nothing you or that fool, Illidan, can do to stop me! You have both served me in your own right - unwittingly.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,20794,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider to Player'),(23054,3,0,'Lay down your arms and succumb to the might of Kil\'jaeden!',14,0,100,14,0,0,0,20796,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider to Player'),(16819,1,0,'The feast of corruption is no more! Magtheridon has fallen to the battle prowess of $n and $g his:her; allies! Witness the might of the Alliance! A pit lord commander is destroyed!',14,7,100,22,0,0,0,20754,2,'Force Commander Danath Trollbane to Player'),(16819,2,0,'Hear me brothers and sisters-in-arms! The time of our enemies is at an end! We must strike at the fel orcs that remain! Exterminate them like the vermin that they are! Carry with you the favor of the Sons of Lothar!',14,7,100,22,0,0,0,20755,2,'Force Commander Danath Trollbane to Player'),(12277,4,0,'Well, I\'m off to the Gelkis.  They\'re not as dumb as the Maraudines, but they\'re more reasonable.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7552,0,'Melizza Brimbuzzle'),(12277,3,0,'We\'re going to have to scratch the Maraudines off our list.  Too hard to work with...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7551,0,'Melizza Brimbuzzle'),(12277,2,0,'Hey Hornizz!  I\'m back!  And there are some people behind me who helped me out of a jam.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7550,0,'Melizza Brimbuzzle'),(12277,0,0,'Thanks $n.  Now let\'s get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7540,0,'Melizza Brimbuzzle'),(12277,1,0,'We made it!  Thanks again!  I\'m going to run ahead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7544,0,'Melizza Brimbuzzle'),(23139,6,0,'It will be done, my lord.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21823,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,7,0,'So you thought to make a fool of Mor\'ghor, eh? Before you are delivered to Lord Illidan, you will feel pain that you could not know to exist. I will take pleasure in exacting my own vengeance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21824,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,8,0,'I will not drag this out any further than it needs, Lady Sinestra. You have bent my ear, now tell me what it is that you want from Dragonmaw.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21307,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,9,0,'The... The master? He lives?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21310,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,10,0,'%s stammers.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21313,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23139,11,0,'Ye... Yes, yes... Of course. We need only the crystals and ore from this place. There is... We will need mounts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21314,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor'),(23467,0,0,'What is the meaning of this, Mor\'ghor?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21804,0,'Illidan'),(23467,1,0,'SILENCE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21807,0,'Illidan'),(23467,2,0,'Blathering idiot. You incomprehensibly incompetent buffoon...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21808,0,'Illidan'),(23467,3,0,'THIS is your hero?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21809,0,'Illidan'),(23467,4,0,'You have been deceived, imbecile.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21810,0,'Illidan'),(23467,5,0,'This... whole... operation... HAS BEEN COMPROMISED!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21811,0,'Illidan'),(23467,6,0,'I expect to see this insect\'s carcass in pieces in my lair within the hour. Fail and you will suffer a fate so much worse than death.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21812,0,'Illidan'),(23284,0,0,'Step aside lest I add you as another adornment to my armor. Your leader and I have matters to attend...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21301,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,1,0,'$s smiles.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21303,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,2,0,'I thought you would see it my way...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21304,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,3,0,'Overlord Mor\'ghor, I presume... A pleasure to finally make your acquaintance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21305,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,4,0,'I am Lady Sinestra.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21306,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,5,0,'You have no doubt heard about Nefarian\'s failures on Azeroth... While he has fallen, the experiment continues. My master... He continues the work that his progeny began.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21308,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,6,0,'$s nods.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21309,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,7,0,'You were once a chief lieutenant, Mor\'ghor. Your work in Grim Batol is not easily forgotten.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21311,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,8,0,'Now... We need the eggs that you recovered. The Netherwing eggs. They are, after all, a product of the master. We will pay whatever price that you ask.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21312,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,9,0,'The master will be most pleased with this news. The Black Dragonflight will provide you all that you ask. You will be allowed to ride upon the backs of our drakes as needed. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21315,0,'Sinestra'),(23284,10,0,'I thank you for your graciousness, Mor\'ghor. I must now take my leave.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21316,0,'Sinestra'),(38606,0,0,'What\'s this!?',12,0,100,5,0,17383,0,38201,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore to Player'),(38606,1,0,'He... he kept it? All this time, he kept it!?',12,0,100,5,0,17384,0,38202,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(38606,2,0,'I knew! ',12,0,100,5,0,17385,0,38203,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(38606,3,0,'I sensed a part of him still alive! Trapped... struggling... Oh, Arthas!',12,0,100,396,0,17386,0,38204,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(38606,4,0,'Perhaps - perhaps he might someday remember what he once was.',12,0,100,396,0,17387,0,38205,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(38606,5,0,'By the Light, may he at last find rest, free from the icy grip of that terrible blade.',12,0,100,396,0,17388,0,38206,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(38607,0,0,'Oh, lad...',12,0,100,396,0,17421,0,38171,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard'),(38607,1,0,'How I miss those endless days in Lordaeron...',12,0,100,396,0,17422,0,38172,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard'),(38607,2,0,'...sharpenin\' yer skill with this dull blade...',12,0,100,396,0,17423,0,38173,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard'),(38607,3,0,'...forgin\' ya into a weapon meant to withstand the demands of a great destiny.',12,0,100,396,0,17424,0,38174,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard'),(38607,4,0,'Heh... Yeh sure put them skills ta use, didn\'t yeh, lad?',12,0,100,6,0,17425,0,38175,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard'),(38607,5,0,'If only I\'da been able ta stop yeh that day, how different things mighta been.',12,0,100,396,0,17426,0,38176,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard'),(38607,6,0,'If only I\'da never discovered that accursed blade...',12,0,100,396,0,17427,0,38177,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard'),(38607,7,0,'Farewell, Arthas... my brother.',12,0,100,396,0,17428,0,38178,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard'),(38608,0,0,'Arthas...',12,0,100,396,0,17402,0,38160,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38608,1,0,'Alas, hero of Azeroth, you give me a greater gift than you know.',12,0,100,396,0,17403,0,38161,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38608,2,0,'Long have I struggled to forgive the prince for his terrible transgressions.',12,0,100,396,0,17404,0,38162,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38608,3,0,'My soul has been wracked with unbearable anxiety, dark thoughts... distancing me from the Light.',12,0,100,396,0,17405,0,38163,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38608,4,0,'I recall clearly the gleam of pride in his eye as he stood before me, eager to defeat the enemies of the Light...',12,0,100,396,0,17406,0,38165,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38608,5,0,'Eager to defend his people, no matter the cost.',12,0,100,396,0,17407,0,38166,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38608,6,0,'It is this memory of Arthas that I choose to keep in my heart.',12,0,100,396,0,17408,0,38167,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38608,7,0,'I shall always be in your debt, friend.',12,0,100,396,0,17409,0,38168,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38608,8,0,'Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,17410,0,38169,0,'Uther the Lightbringer'),(38609,0,0,'So, it is done.',12,0,100,396,0,17376,0,38179,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38609,1,0,'I had not dared to trust my senses - too many times has the Lich King made me to be a fool.',12,0,100,396,0,17377,0,38180,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38609,2,0,'Finally, he has been made to pay for the atrocities he imposed upon my people.',12,0,100,396,0,17378,0,38181,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38609,3,0,'May Azeroth never fail to remember the terrible price we paid for our weakness... for our pride.',12,0,100,396,0,17379,0,38183,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38609,4,0,'But what now, hero? What of those freed from his grasp, but still shackled to their mortal coils?',12,0,100,6,0,17380,0,38184,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38609,5,0,'Leave me. ',12,0,100,396,0,17381,0,38185,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38609,6,0,'I have much to ponder.',12,0,100,396,0,17382,0,38186,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38610,0,0,'Darion, my son.',12,0,100,396,0,17414,0,38152,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(38610,1,0,'At last, I am able to lay my eyes upon you again.',12,0,100,396,0,17415,0,38153,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(38610,2,0,'The Lich King tormented me without end, Darion.',12,0,100,396,0,17416,0,38154,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(38610,3,0,'Endlessly, he sought to break my will, to force me to serve him, to bind me to his blade...',12,0,100,396,0,17417,0,38155,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(38610,4,0,'Finally, when events demanded his full attention, he left me.',12,0,100,396,0,17418,0,38156,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(38610,5,0,'The one memory, I clung to, Darion... The one thought that kept me from giving in...',12,0,100,396,0,17419,0,38157,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(38610,6,0,'It was your sacrifice, my son, that again saved me from eternal peril.',12,0,100,396,0,17420,0,38158,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),(37120,4,0,'Father...',12,0,100,396,0,17411,0,38143,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(37120,5,0,'Father. I feared for your... your sanity.',12,0,100,396,0,17412,0,38150,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(37120,6,0,'Father... For you, I would give my life a thousand times.',12,0,100,396,0,17413,0,38151,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(19933,0,0,'Fascinating. What is it, Andormu?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17541,0,'Nozari'),(19933,1,0,'Hrm, are they tampering with the timeways?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17543,0,'Nozari'),(19933,2,0,'I hate it when you speak to me in that manner. I am your equal in every way, brother. Remember that the next time you are trapped amidst a temporal vortex, crying for help.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17546,0,'Nozari'),(19933,3,0,'Shall we?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17549,0,'Nozari'),(19933,4,0,'%s nods.',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,17551,0,'Nozari'),(19932,0,0,'Something very, very disturbing. We\'re starting to see more of them across the timeways.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17542,0,'Andormu'),(19932,1,0,'Nozari, I\'m not talking about a greedy wizard looking to improve his station in life by making a small adjustment to the past.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17544,0,'Andormu'),(19932,2,0,'These beings aren\'t giving themselves the winning numbers for the Stormwind lottery, dear.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17545,0,'Andormu'),(19932,3,0,'My apologies, Nozari. I have been a bit \'on edge\' as of late. These creatures are attempting to alter the timeways.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17547,0,'Andormu'),(19932,4,0,'You do recall the last time that this occurred, yes? Let us hope that the master need not be involved.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17548,0,'Andormu'),(19932,5,0,'Absolutely not. We must not place ourselves at risk. With the master away, we are all that is in place to keep the stream intact. Others are due to arrive any moment now. Heroes and adventurers from Azeroth...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17550,0,'Andormu'),(19747,0,0,'Make ready the chambers, another ally will soon join our ranks!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19416,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,1,0,'Our ally has arrived!  Clear the way to the materialization chamber!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19417,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,2,0,'Now, proceed to the translocator. Forge Camp Wrath awaits your arrival!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19418,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,3,0,'Prepare yourself for eternal torture, mortal!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20366,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,3,1,'WHAT?! Who dares to disturb the Burning Legion?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20365,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,3,2,'I shall enjoy the smell of the grease from your marrow crackling over the fire!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20368,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,3,3,'Nothing will prevent your doom!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20367,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,3,4,'You DARE to attack me?!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20369,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,3,5,'You will suffer slowly until the end of time for this affront!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20370,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(19747,4,0,'Release the hounds!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20395,0,'Baelmon the Hound-Master'),(10977,2,0,'Why do you chase me, Mechanical yeti?! WHY?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6317,0,'Quixxil'),(10977,3,0,'%s looks relieved.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6322,0,'Quixxil'),(10977,4,0,'I\'m jumpy as it is... and people insist on scaring me... Next time, though, I\'ll be ready!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6320,0,'Quixxil'),(7583,0,0,'%s jumps in fright!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6306,0,'Legacki'),(7583,1,0,'Ahhhhh!!! What is that thing?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6307,0,'Legacki'),(7583,2,0,'Umi sent you, didn\'t she? She told me to expect a surprise, but I never thought that this is what she meant!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6308,0,'Legacki'),(10980,0,0,'%s marches around, roaring and making a ruckus.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6327,0,'Umi\'s Mechanical Yeti'),(10980,1,0,'RAAAAAAAR!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6329,0,'Umi\'s Mechanical Yeti'),(1506,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,25,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Convert 1'),(1506,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,25,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Convert 2'),(1506,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!',12,7,25,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Convert 3'),(1506,0,3,'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!',12,7,25,0,0,0,0,2628,0,'Scarlet Convert 4'),(1507,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,25,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Initiate 1'),(1507,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,25,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Initiate 2'),(1507,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!',12,7,25,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Initiate 3'),(1507,0,3,'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!',12,7,25,0,0,0,0,2628,0,'Scarlet Initiate 4'),(1667,0,0,'These lands shall be cleansed!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,314,0,'Meven Korgal - Nearby aggro'),(1667,1,0,'These undead atrocities will be destroyed!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,316,0,'Meven Korgal - Spawn'),(1667,2,0,'The Scarlet Crusade shall not fail in its mission!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,317,0,'Meven Korgal - On aggro'),(20345,0,0,'Keep your voices down. There are strangers about...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18084,0,' Mograine - 1'),(20345,1,0,'Brothers and sisters, I have called you here today to discuss the fate of Lordaeron.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18085,0,' Mograine - 2'),(20345,2,0,'I hear things... Things that should not be.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18087,0,' Mograine - 3'),(20345,3,0,'The dead rise... Undead, from the frozen northlands. Whole cities have gone missing. I...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18088,0,' Mograine - 4'),(20345,4,0,'I have heard that Northrend is lost...',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,18089,0,' Mograine - 5'),(20345,5,0,'We must stand at the ready. I have faced undead before. They are ruthless killing machines, devoid of any emotion or compassion.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18091,0,' Mograine - 6'),(20345,6,0,'Propose? I propose that we prepare. That we prepare our loved ones, family and friends for the possibility of an undead holocaust.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,18095,0,' Mograine - 7'),(20345,7,0,'And there is this...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,18096,0,' Mograine - 8'),(20345,8,0,'I have had this object in my possession for 10 years. Since Blackrock Spire...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18099,0,' Mograine - 9'),(20345,9,0,'I wrested it free from the remains of an orc lieutenant - a dark caster... It is from their homeworld.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18100,0,' Mograine - 10'),(20345,10,0,'Do not get too close. I laid a hand upon it once... Only once and never again. The memories of that day still linger.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18101,0,' Mograine - 11'),(20345,11,0,'I surmise that this object is the living embodiment of shadows... darkness... It is a manifestation. It is a void.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18103,0,' Mograine - 12'),(20345,12,0,'No, old friend, it is very relevant.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18107,0,' Mograine - 13'),(20345,13,0,'Let me ask you this, brothers and sisters: Can good exist without evil? Can there be light without dark?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18108,0,' Mograine - 14'),(20345,14,0,'And if that answer is no, then could it be possible that because this artifact exists, its polar opposite must also exist?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,18109,0,' Mograine - 15'),(20345,15,0,'Could you imagine what the material manifestation of the Light could do against the undead?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18110,0,' Mograine - 16'),(20345,16,0,'It consumed the Light!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,18117,0,' Mograine - 17'),(20345,17,0,'BY THE LIGHT! Could it be? Could this be it?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,18122,0,' Mograine - 18'),(20345,18,0,'I must know... I will know.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,18123,0,' Mograine - 19'),(20345,19,0,'I... It... It is beautiful. What I felt when I touched it... The Light coursed through me and I through it... It healed my spirit.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18125,0,' Mograine - 20'),(20345,20,0,'Let us never again speak of this day. Our enemies are many. They need not know we hold such artifacts.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18128,0,' Mograine - 21'),(20345,21,0,'I have seen it... From this blessed crystal we will forge a weapon. This weapon will hold inside it a piece of each of us... And when it is used against undead, it shall cast them down. And in its wake, it will leave only ashes...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18129,0,' Mograine - 22'),(20345,22,0,'%s lowers his voice to a whisper.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18086,0,' Emote - 1'),(20345,23,0,'Gasps can be heard throughout the room.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18090,0,' Emote - 2'),(20345,25,0,'%s unlocks the chest.',16,0,100,25,0,0,0,18097,0,' Emote - 4'),(20345,26,0,'%s removes the gauntlet from his right arm and shows everyone his mangled hand.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18102,0,' Emote - 5'),(20345,27,0,'%s shakes his head.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18106,0,' Emote - 6'),(20345,28,0,'Shock then silence overtakes the crowd.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18113,0,' Emote - 7'),(20345,29,0,'%s reaches out to touch the light crystal.',16,0,100,25,0,0,0,18124,0,' Emote - 8'),(20345,30,0,'%s puts the crystal back inside the chest.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18127,0,' Emote - 9'),(20346,0,0,'I do not see how this evil artifact is relevant to the undead. We must destroy it!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,18104,0,' Isillien - 1'),(20346,1,0,'Nonsense, Mograine! It must be destroyed!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,18112,0,' Isillien - 2'),(20346,2,0,'Your hand! It is healed!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,18126,0,' Isillien - 3'),(20346,3,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,18130,0,' Isillien - 4'),(20347,0,0,'By the Light! What is it?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,18098,0,' Abbendis - 1'),(20347,1,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,18130,0,' Abbendis - 2'),(20348,0,0,'Is... Is it getting lighter? Its coloration... It is changing.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18121,0,' Fairbanks - 1'),(20348,1,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,18130,0,' Fairbanks - 2'),(20349,0,0,'Aye, I\'ve battled them as well. We are ill-prepared as a kingdom to withstand such an assault.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18093,0,' Tirion - 1'),(20349,1,0,'Impossible!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,18118,0,' Tirion - 2'),(20349,2,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,18130,0,' Tirion - 3'),(20349,3,0,'%s nods.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18092,0,' Emote - 3'),(20352,0,0,'What do you propose, Mograine?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,18094,0,' Doan - 1'),(20352,1,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,18130,0,' Doan - 2'),(21319,1,0,'Hah!  The Thunderspike is mine.  Die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18979,0,'Gor Grimgut'),(21319,0,0,'Puny $r cannot lift spear.  Gor lift spear!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18980,0,'Gor Grimgut'),(27191,0,0,'I\'m gonna jump this time Brote, I swear it!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 1'),(27198,6,0,'Has it really been an hour?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 7'),(27198,5,0,'Pray Scrotee... Find religion... Because if we ever get out of here, you will be wishing you were back in here!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 6'),(27198,4,0,'This is all your fault, you know...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 5'),(27198,2,0,'I hope one of us dies. I hope that one is you, Skrotee.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 3'),(27198,3,0,'Of all the hair-brained, idiotic, BRAINLESS ideas... \"Yeah Brote, it\'ll be great... The Forsaken will rain gold coins down on our heads!\"',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 4'),(27033,0,0,'Is Gothik the Harvester going to have to choke a geist?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 1'),(27198,0,0,'If I get out of here, I will CRUSH every clock I come into contact with...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 1'),(27198,1,0,'And you know what pisses me off more than anything, Skrotee? No, not that we\'ve been made into a living cuckoo clock for the amusement of the Forsaken. And not that we have to endure being spat upon and mocked every waking minute of our time here... What pisses me off the most is being made to wear these damned short-shorts...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 2'),(27846,0,0,'Patchy?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 1'),(27846,1,0,'Where are you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Text 2'),(28945,0,0,'The Crusade will be victorious!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28598,0,'Mayor Quimby'),(27539,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27687,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(32186,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(27749,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27576,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27677,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27540,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27560,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(26816,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(27588,0,0,'Without you we\'d be lost. Thanks for the ride!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26844,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27163,0,1,'Keep \'em off me for about 15 seconds and this thing is as good as dead.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26854,0,'7th Legion Siege Engineer'),(27163,0,2,'Cover me!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26852,0,'7th Legion Siege Engineer'),(27163,0,3,'When I\'m done with this plague wagon it\'ll look like a goblin built it! Keep me safe!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26855,0,'7th Legion Siege Engineer'),(27163,0,4,'Keep the bad guys off me!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26853,0,'7th Legion Siege Engineer'),(27163,1,0,'%s deftly assembles a strange machine.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,26856,0,'7th Legion Siege Engineer'),(27163,2,0,'That oughta do it! Just a few more seconds now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26858,0,'7th Legion Siege Engineer'),(23370,0,0,'MULVERICK!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,21429,0,'Dragonmaw Tower Controller'),(19383,0,0,'I don\'t understand you!',12,7,100,18,0,0,0,16540,0,'Captured Gnome to Guard Untula'),(19383,0,1,'Please don\'t beat me!',12,7,100,33,0,0,0,16541,0,'Captured Gnome to Guard Untula'),(19380,0,0,'Hurry up with that axe, you! I want it sharp enough to cut the wind!',12,1,100,60,0,1040,0,16532,0,'Guard Untula to 0'),(19380,0,1,'If you\'re no good at fixing, we\'ll see if you\'re good for eating. Now WORK!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,16538,0,'Guard Untula to 0'),(19995,4,0,'Ohh, look! Bloodmaul Brew! Mmmm...',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,18170,0,'Bladespire Brute to 21241'),(19995,4,1,'Bloodmaul Brew? Me favorite!',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,18171,0,'Bladespire Brute to 21241'),(19995,4,2,'Ohh, look! Bloodmaul Brew! Mmmm...',12,0,100,16,0,398,0,18170,0,'Bladespire Brute to 21241'),(19995,4,3,'Mmmm, Bloodmaul Brew!',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,17844,0,'Bladespire Brute to 21241'),(19995,5,0,'Ugh... Me not feel so guud.',12,0,100,92,0,0,0,18197,0,'Bladespire Brute to 21241'),(16808,3,0,'The Alliance dares to intrude this far into my fortress?  Bring out the Honor Hold prisoners and call for the executioner!  They\'ll pay with their lives for this trespass!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13721,3,'kargath SAY_CALL_EXECUTIONER_A'),(16808,4,0,'Thrall\'s false Horde dares to intrude this far into my fortress?  Bring out the Thrallmar prisoners and call for the executioner!  They\'ll pay with their lives for this trespass!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13722,3,'kargath SAY_CALL_EXECUTIONER_H'),(17918,0,2,'We must use this time wisely!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15192,0,'Time Keeper'),(17918,0,1,'We must hurry!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15191,0,'Time Keeper'),(17918,0,0,'There is no time to waste!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15190,0,'Time Keeper'),(19294,0,0,'Up here on the hill, $n.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,18293,0,'Earthbinder Galandria Nightbreeze'),(19294,1,0,'I have an idea.  Let\'s plant this shard in the ground and see what happens',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18289,0,'Earthbinder Galandria Nightbreeze'),(19294,2,0,'The evil emanating from the crystal shard has lured one of the colossi.  Put it down quick!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18291,0,'Earthbinder Galandria Nightbreeze'),(20763,0,0,'We\'re not too far from the Protectorate Watch Post, $n. This way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18566,0,'Captured Protectorate Vanguard to Player'),(20763,1,0,'Commander! This fleshling rescued me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18567,0,'Captured Protectorate Vanguard to Player'),(20763,2,0,'%s salutes Commander Ameer.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18568,0,'Captured Protectorate Vanguard to Player'),(3984,0,0,'Sidney is late. I thought he would be home by now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1365,0,'Nancy Vishas'),(3985,0,0,'He\'s your husband, woman. How am I to know where he is?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1366,0,'Grandpa Vishas'),(3984,1,0,'He must be overwhelmed with work at the Monastery. But still, he should have returned by now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1367,0,'Nancy Vishas'),(3985,1,0,'Cleansing the world of impure scum isn\'t an easy job, Nancy. Someone\'s got to do it.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1368,0,'Grandpa Vishas'),(3984,2,0,'Well, I\'m going outside to check. Something is amiss.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1369,0,'Nancy Vishas'),(3946,3,0,'I have failed... I have failed in my duty... failed my people... The worgen run rampant, and the Scythe of my goddess is lost.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1359,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(3946,4,0,'This evil I have unleashed... In whose hand does the power my goddess granted to me now lie... By whose hand is it directed?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1360,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(10804,0,0,'%s picks the orc target...',16,0,100,25,0,0,0,6107,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,1,0,'%s misses...',16,0,100,6,0,0,0,6140,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,2,0,'%s takes a more careful aim...',16,0,100,6,0,6247,0,6106,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,3,0,'%s misses again...',16,0,100,6,0,0,0,6141,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,4,0,'%s takes aim at the bottles...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6120,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,5,0,'%s misses...',16,0,100,15,0,0,0,6140,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,6,0,'%s takes aim at the bottles again...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6121,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,7,0,'%s misses again...',16,0,100,18,0,0,0,6141,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,8,0,'%s quickly shoots the orc dummy...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6137,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,9,0,'%s turns to the paper target...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6136,0,'Middlecamp'),(10804,10,0,'%s shoots from the hip at the bottles...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6138,0,'Middlecamp'),(10803,0,0,'%s casually points at the orc target...',16,0,100,25,0,0,0,6118,0,'Wheeler'),(10803,1,0,'%s hits!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6142,0,'Wheeler'),(10803,2,0,'%s quickly shoots the middle target dead center...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6124,0,'Wheeler'),(10803,3,0,'%s then takes aim at the bottles...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6122,0,'Wheeler'),(10803,4,0,'%s only hits the side of the box!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6123,0,'Wheeler'),(699,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Bloodscalp Beastmaster'),(671,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Bloodscalp Headhunter'),(14353,0,0,'OH NOES!  Da king is dead!  Uh... hail to da new king!  Yeah!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9348,0,'Mizzle the Crafty to 58960'),(14353,1,0,'Yar, he\'s dead all right.  That makes you da new king... well, all of you!  Gordok is yours now, boss!  You should talk to me so you can learn everything there is about being da king!  I was... is his assistant!  Yeah, that\'s why I\'m called da crafty one!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9411,0,'Mizzle the Crafty to 58960'),(11501,0,0,'You no challenge me, scrubs!  I\'m da king now, and I stay king FOREVER!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9481,0,'King Gordok to Player'),(14325,2,0,'%s begins to retaliate all attacks against him!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,9477,0,'Captain Kromcrush'),(11489,0,0,'You do not belong here!  Ancients, rise against these intruders!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(14325,0,0,'No one get past me and threaten da king!  Ungh, take it!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9418,0,'Captain Kromcrush'),(14325,1,0,'Help me crush these punys!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9478,0,'Captain Kromcrush'),(14469,0,0,'Stand back! Stand clear! The infernal will need to be given a wide berth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9634,0,'Niby the Almighty'),(14469,1,0,'BOW DOWN TO THE ALMIGHTY! BOW DOWN BEFORE MY INFERNAL DESTRO... chicken?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9635,0,'Niby the Almighty'),(14469,2,0,'Silence, servant! Vengeance will be mine! Death to Stormwind! Death by chicken!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9638,0,'Niby the Almighty'),(14470,0,0,'%s rolls on the floor laughing.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,9636,0,'Impsy'),(14470,1,0,'Niby, you\'re an idiot.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9637,0,'Impsy'),(32573,0,0,'%s cries out and writhes in agony before passing out.',16,0,100,15,0,0,0,23534,0,'Valgarde Captive to Dragonflayer Rune-Seer'),(23656,0,0,'Good!  Good! You are still alive.  More fun for me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23538,0,'Dragonflayer Rune-Seer to Valgarde Captive'),(23656,0,1,'These outsiders are weak and easily crushed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23536,0,'Dragonflayer Rune-Seer to 0'),(23656,0,2,'They are hardier than I would expect for their size.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23539,0,'Dragonflayer Rune-Seer to Valgarde Captive'),(20875,4,0,'%s absorbs the nature energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17107,0,'Negaton Screamer'),(20875,3,0,'%s absorbs the holy energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17110,0,'Negaton Screamer'),(20875,2,0,'%s absorbs the frost energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17106,0,'Negaton Screamer'),(20875,1,0,'%s absorbs the arcane energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17109,0,'Negaton Screamer'),(20875,0,0,'%s absorbs the fire energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17105,0,'Negaton Screamer'),(20875,5,0,'%s absorbs the shadow energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17108,0,'Negaton Screamer'),(27755,5,0,'$3486W Centrifuge Constructs remain.  We must find and destroy them to disable Varos Cloudstrider\'s protective shield.  The constructs should be about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29518,0,'Amber - Say gps 10 constructs'),(27755,6,0,'One Centrifuge Construct remains.  We must find and destroy it to disable Varos Cloudstrider\'s protective shield.  The construct should be about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29519,0,'Amber - Say gps 1 construct'),(27755,7,0,'The shield is down; Varos is vulnerable!  Defeating him should disperse the Azure Ring Guardians and allow us access to the upper bands.  Varos is on a floating platform about halfway up The Oculus, on the Band of Acceleration.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29520,0,'Amber - Say gps Varos'),(27755,8,0,'Mage-Lord Urom is our next target.  He should be hiding on one of the floating platforms on the Band of Transmutation, near the top of The Oculus.  Be warned, Urom is a powerful conjurer; he may not be alone.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,29521,0,'Amber - Say gps Lord Urom'),(27755,9,0,'Ley-Guardian Eregos is all that now stands between us and control of The Oculus.  He\'s flying above the Band of Alignment, at the very top of The Oculus.  Eregos is incredibly powerful; stay on my back 