'combat Enrage'),(61348,18,0,'What is this? I\'ve heard nothing of this emperor. Meng the Demented? According to these texts, Meng was the most foul and maniacal ruler to ever abuse the imperial throne.',12,0,100,275,0,31528,0,60865,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Mogu Archer'),(35660,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(35167,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(61348,23,0,'I hear a faint humming. It is coming from this direction!',12,0,100,25,0,30204,0,65194,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Mogu\'shan Secret-Keeper'),(48496,10,0,'We\'re still alive, Doctor Grapplehammer, despite your best efforts.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49128,0,'say Text'),(48496,9,0,'WHAT?!!!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,49126,0,'say Text'),(48496,8,0,'It\'s the one on the far right! Hurry, Hobart! It\'s going to eggsplode!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,49123,0,'say Text'),(48496,7,0,'Ya think? Hobart, the Micro Mechachicken is destabilizing. It\'s expanding!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49121,0,'say Text'),(48496,5,0,'Greely coughs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,49113,0,'say Text'),(48496,6,0,'Um, Hobart, you\'re at the controls.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49114,0,'say Text'),(48496,4,0,'The assistant shakes her head.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,49109,0,'say Text'),(48496,3,0,'Yes, Doctor Grapplehammer.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49106,0,'say Text'),(48496,2,0,'Greely sighs and rolls her eyes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,49105,0,'say Text'),(48496,1,0,'There. One Micro Mechachicken. I\'ll never understand how you come up with these names.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49103,0,'say Text'),(48496,0,0,'You don\'t have to yell, Hobart, I\'m standing right here. Sheesh!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,49102,0,'say Text'),(34835,1,0,'Darn, you got me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35127,0,'say Text on Beat'),(34835,0,0,'I was just comin\' to see you. Honest!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48863,0,'say Text on Aggro'),(35304,0,2,'You you tape us the songs Trolls!',12,0,50,5,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(35304,0,1,'Songs Trolls not make the Goblin nice work!',12,0,50,5,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(35304,0,0,'Trolls disent certain truck,chef!',12,0,50,5,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(35053,1,0,'You\'re the most handsome boyfriend a girl could hope for. Knock\'em dead, honey!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49012,0,'say Text'),(35053,2,0,'You are dresed Impress! Use your new powers below to make your party guests happy!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35444,0,'say Text'),(35053,0,0,'Make sure you pull plenty of moolah out of the bank. I don\'t want you buying any of that cheap clothing you usually like to wear. This party\'s important!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49023,0,'say Text'),(35054,1,0,'Look at you! I\'m the luckiest boyfriend on the island!!!',42,0,100,1,0,0,0,49013,0,'say Text'),(35054,0,0,'Make sure you pull plenty of moolah out of the bank. I don\'t want you buying any of that cheap clothing you usually like to wear. This party\'s important!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49023,0,'say Text'),(37602,0,0,'Still an unfortunate accident of fire-fireworks-lit flammable-gas - Lectriquea?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37106,2,0,'You got the juice,kid. That\'s for sure! Too bad that dragon had to come and ruin everything. No matter. You made us proud. Now get back to headquarters.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49027,0,'say Text'),(37106,0,0,'You gotta hurry,kid. We gotta get you into the game. But first, we gotta get the parts for that shredder!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49025,0,'say Text'),(37106,1,0,'Get into that shredder and win the game. The Bilgewater Cartel\'s counting on you!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49026,0,'say Text'),(35120,0,0,'You people cool your heels! $N is here. He\'s gonna be the next Trade Prince!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49024,0,'say Text'),(34872,5,0,'Useless! You are simply useless! I fear that we are all obligate to throw you into the Maelstrom!',14,0,50,22,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34872,4,0,'I can\'t to believe the nerve of those trolls. Rebelling after all that I\'ve done for them!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34872,3,0,'Chief, tell Chipie I\'ll kick him if  Kaja\'Cola  will get more later then that production has resumed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34872,1,0,'OUCH!',14,0,100,34,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34872,2,0,'Okay, okay! I understand the message!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34872,0,0,'It is always pleasant to receive a gift from the hand of the second in person. I\'m going to the baller immediately!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34876,0,0,'Oh no, you didn\'t!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34876,1,0,'What? Fine, fine... I\'ll pay my protection moolah to your goons!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35129,0,'say Text'),(48494,17,0,'The micro mechachicken quickly shrinks back to normal.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(48494,15,0,'Here goes nothing, I always loved you, Greely!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,49124,0,'say Text'),(48494,16,0,'Flipping the override switch now!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,49125,0,'say Text'),(48494,14,0,'I know... I know! Where\'s the override? The override?!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,49122,0,'say Text'),(48494,13,0,'Wait... something\'s wrong!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49120,0,'say Text'),(48494,11,0,'I\'m flipping the second switch!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49119,0,'say Text'),(48494,12,0,'The micro mechachicken begins to grow and Greely starts sneaking away from the machine.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(48494,10,0,'Grocery store owners everywhere will owe me a percentage of their profits!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49118,0,'say Text'),(48494,9,0,'Greely, can you feel it? My moment of success is at hand!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49117,0,'say Text'),(48494,8,0,'I am now flipping the switch!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49116,0,'say Text'),(48494,7,0,'Quite right, Greely. You passed today\'s pop quiz.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49115,0,'say Text'),(48494,6,0,'Flip the switch!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49112,0,'say Text'),(48494,5,0,'I\'ll soon be revered as the greatest goblin tinker of all times! Besides, that negligence case involving the creation of the gilgoblins will never stick.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49111,0,'say Text'),(48494,4,0,'I am going to end the horrible problem of food storage cutting into the profits of the Bilgewater Cartel!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49110,0,'say Text'),(48494,3,0,'Thank you. Now behold as I stabilize the highly unstable miniaturization process.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49108,0,'say Text'),(48494,2,0,'Excellent. Now back away from the Ultra Concave Fissionable Testing Platform. Slowly, if you please.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49107,0,'say Text'),(48494,1,0,'There\'s a great deal that you do not understand, my dear Greely. That is why you are the assistant and I... I am Hobart Grapplehammer!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49103,0,'say Text'),(48494,0,0,'Prepare the Micro Mechachicken!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,49101,0,'say Text'),(34877,1,0,'%s grunts and gives up, clearly beaten.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,35132,0,'say Text on Beat'),(34877,0,0,'< Jack reported something about the hammer, which would be its armead you think. >',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48865,0,'say Text on Aggro'),(37804,5,0,'I need a bucket!',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,5,1,'I am hungry! But where is the food good blood?',14,0,50,6,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,5,2,'If only I had someone with whom dance.',12,0,50,5,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,5,3,'I love Fireworks! It is necessary that its repeats in the eardrum and it we have blouisse the view.',12,0,50,5,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,0,0,'This party lacks a bit of brilliant',12,0,100,10,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,1,0,'Thanks !',12,0,100,17,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,2,0,'Passport delicious! And these are just the out-of A \"work?',12,0,100,7,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,3,0,'Wouhaya, Fireworks! Again, again!',12,0,50,400,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,3,1,'Woahhh! I have never seen anything as generally follows. Yet! Yet!',12,0,50,401,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,4,0,'This white Pa wine and sparkling is delicious. Where have you found?',12,0,50,17,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(37804,4,1,'Thank you. I was soon offcourse. Yum yum!',12,0,50,7,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34695,0,0,'Would one of you hurry up and finish off the other? Some of us are trying to make some moolah here!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36779,0,'say Text'),(34874,3,0,'Use your Hot Rod |TInterfaceIconsinv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to run over Hired Looters and get their loot.',41,0,100,1,0,0,0,48844,0,'say Text'),(34874,2,0,'Here they are! Okay, you three make sure that you help him out today. He\'s got a lot of stuff to take care of before the party!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49020,0,'say Text'),(34874,0,0,'Ooh, I think you\'re gonna like this,boss!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49019,0,'say Text'),(34874,1,0,'Use the Keys to the Hot Rod |TInterfaceIconsinv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to get into your car. Pick up your friends, Izzy, Ace, and Gobber.',41,0,100,1,0,0,0,48504,0,'say Text'),(35200,0,1,'Let\'s have a dance!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,35449,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35200,0,0,'We be here courtesy o\' the trade prince.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,35450,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35294,0,3,'Maybe I take dem bombs from ya an\' we see who go boom!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,49044,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35294,0,2,'Ya got some nerve,mon!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,49039,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35294,0,1,'Kezan for da trolls!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,49042,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35294,0,0,'I not gonna take it anymore,mon!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,49041,0,'on Aggro Text'),(34668,7,0,'The Trade Prince\'s yacht is about to set sail. Everyone, get to the dock! Hand over the keys, boss. I\'m driving. Just let me know when you\'re ready to go.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,40278,0,'say Text'),(34668,6,0,'I can\'t stand to watch. So many good memories. So much profit.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49071,0,'say Text'),(34668,5,0,'$N, you have to hurry and break your moolah out of the bank!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49016,0,'say Text'),(34668,4,0,'You better get upstairs pronto, boss. Trade Prince Gallywix is waiting for you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49015,0,'say Text'),(34668,3,0,'Go get \'em,boss!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37318,0,'say Text'),(34668,2,0,'Ace,Izzy,Gobber,you three make sure you tag a long with $N and help him take care of those dead beats!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49021,0,'say Text'),(34668,0,0,'Haha! that should be a blast!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,43954,0,'say Text'),(34668,1,0,'He\'ll get me more later? How are we supposed to get you promoted to Trade Prince without our number one product on the shelves?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49018,0,'say Text'),(34692,0,2,'Light be with you... for the very low price of a one silver tithe!',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,36722,0,'say Text'),(34692,0,1,'Just wanted to let you know that we\'re all counting on you!',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,36728,0,'say Text'),(34692,0,0,'It\'s not much, but it just might keep your green skin intact.',12,0,50,1,0,0,0,36727,0,'say Text'),(34693,0,0,'I\'ll address the CAP so that it activates automatically when you\'re at the villa. Do just well warning avoid pigs!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34693,1,0,'All what you have to do is let me show you how was a Visca cooperation. Then, head to one of the models to lead training on which Bamm is going to pull, start a pernicious attack and finish it with a Visca cooperation.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(34878,1,0,'Not the face, not the face!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35136,0,'say Text on Beat'),(34878,0,0,'I\'m tryin\' to run a business here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48864,0,'say Text on Aggro'),(37500,0,5,'Papers to weigh? Doors to stop? Windows to break? bam, Bam, BAM! Volcano rocks.',14,0,50,1,0,0,0,37103,0,'say Text'),(37500,0,4,'Volcano rocks. Million and one uses. Lava, java, sauna, banana....',14,0,50,1,0,0,0,37104,0,'say Text'),(37500,0,3,'Get your volcano rocks here! ...Great for cats!',14,0,50,1,0,0,0,37101,0,'say Text'),(37500,0,2,'Take home a piece of the Cataclysm! Volcano rocks for sale - hot, Hot, HOT!',14,0,50,1,0,0,0,37102,0,'say Text'),(37500,0,1,'Volcano rocks for sale! Hot off the mountain! You want \'em, I got \'em!',14,0,50,1,0,0,0,37099,0,'say Text'),(37500,0,0,'Volcano rocks - new low price! You\'re gonna love my rocks.',14,0,50,1,0,0,0,37100,0,'say Text'),(34697,0,0,'Insert your coins inside the Warrior NX-01, who\'s learn you. Then use the technique on one of the models to lead training.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text')