lly unarmed tauren. Good to meet you, pandaren.',12,0,100,66,0,28121,0,59555,0,'Korga Strongmane to Player'),(65471,6,0,'I have never seen a trainee with skills such as yours. I must tell the others.',12,0,100,509,0,33643,0,0,0,'Huojin Trainee'),(65471,5,0,'Your skills are too great. I yield.',12,0,100,508,0,33644,0,0,0,'Huojin Trainee'),(65471,4,0,'That was a good match. Thank you.',12,0,100,509,0,33645,0,0,0,'Huojin Trainee'),(65471,3,0,'Thank you for reminding me that I must train more diligently.',12,0,100,1,0,33645,0,0,0,'Huojin Trainee'),(65558,1,6,'I need to fight by you more often.',12,0,100,1,0,27328,0,60616,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(65558,2,0,'Let\'s do this, monkeyface!',12,0,100,5,0,27318,0,60619,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(34574,3,0,'Our immortality-the very essence of our beings!-was lost.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34794,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34574,1,0,'Much has changed for our people since the Battle of Mount Hyjal.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34792,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34574,2,0,'Nordrassil lies a pale shadow of what it once was, its power used to defeat Archimonde and drive back the Burning Legion.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34793,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34574,0,0,'%s fades into existence as you approach, nodding a subtle greeting.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34832,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(49480,0,0,'You\'ve come to help, $c? Let us stay together for a while.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49550,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,1,0,'The corruption goes much further than these spiders. I fear the true source is not within this cave.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49673,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,1,1,'His body screams for death, but his soul',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49672,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,1,2,'I weep at these atrocities we commit. It is almost unbearable.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49674,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,1,3,'Corruption this deep could not have come from outside.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49675,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,1,4,'It almost seems as if he was born with this corruption inside of him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49676,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,1,5,'They are surely unredeemable, but it still hurts to see them die.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49670,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,1,6,'The corruption is buried deep within him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49669,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,1,7,'My dear friends... I\'m sorry..',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49671,0,'Tarindrella'),(49480,2,0,'This totem has been corrupting the eggs! It seems a greater threat looms. The Gnarlpine remain tainted by something most foul.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49697,0,'Tarindrella'),(34757,0,0,'Don\'t get me wrong... I\'m grateful to have Shando Stormrage back, but this is all really suspicious. What happened to Fandral?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35024,0,'Doranel Amberleaf'),(34756,0,0,'Shh! Someone\'s here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35023,0,'Moriana Dawnlight'),(49479,3,0,'The ramp up to Aldrassil is just in sight over there. Circle around and find Tenaron up top.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49667,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),(2079,0,0,'I\'m sorry, Huntress. None of our new $cs are ready. They still have much to learn.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49681,0,'Ilthalaine'),(2079,1,0,'You\'ll find the trainer inside of Aldrassil, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49664,0,'Ilthalaine'),(2077,0,0,'You\'ll find the trainer inside of Aldrassil, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49664,0,'Melithar Staghelm'),(49477,0,0,'I fear time may not be on our side, Ilthalaine. The battle may carry to Teldrassil itself if we do not act soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49682,0,'Huntress Sandrya Moonfall'),(49478,0,0,'We will leave you to your training, Ilthalaine. This is your area of expertise.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49683,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),(49478,1,0,'Study well, $n. We may need you fighting by our side before the next moon fills.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49684,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),(49479,0,0,'Iverron\'s poison is cured, but it will take some time for him to recover.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49668,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),(49479,1,0,'Shadowthread Cave lies to the north. Be careful, it\'s dangerous there of late.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49665,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),(49479,2,0,'The moonwell is to the northeast, on the other side of the pool and up the hill.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49666,0,'Dentaria Silverglade'),(3438,0,0,'Come and face me! *snort* I can smell your $r stench from here.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,44319,0,'Kreenig Snarlsnout'),(14872,0,0,'Help! I\'m being chased by a swarm of bees!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,10259,0,'Trok'),(14872,0,1,'I\'m so tired of running, but these bees won\'t leave me alone!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,10260,0,'Trok'),(14872,0,2,'I didn\'t know bees didn\'t like fire!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,10261,0,'Trok'),(14872,1,3,'Karu will you please help get these bees off of me? They sting!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,10262,0,'Trok'),(22902,0,0,'A %s erupts into the waking world from the Emerald Dream!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20562,0,'Phantasmal Lash'),(22889,0,0,'A %s erupts into the waking world from the Emerald Dream!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20562,0,'Manifest Nightmare'),(54067,0,0,'This is great!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,52697,0,'Jaga'),(54067,0,1,'Thanks, $p! I\'ll tell my pa you helped me see the world!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,52696,0,'Jaga'),(54067,0,2,'Wahoo!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44157,0,'Jaga'),(34586,0,0,'%s smiles at you knowingly as it approaches.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34835,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34586,1,0,'With Malfurion Stormrage gone, the druids were left in disarray and in desperate need of a new leader.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34797,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34586,2,0,'Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm roused the druids and convinced the Circle of Ancients in Darkshore that it was time for our people to rebuild.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34798,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34586,3,0,'In an effort to regain immortality for our people, and with the approval of the Circle, Staghelm and the most powerful druids grew Teldrassil, upon whose boughs you now stand.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34799,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34586,4,0,'Though we have our new home, our immortal lives have not been restored.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34800,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34586,5,0,'The Shade of the Kaldorei closes its eyes and fades away.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34820,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34583,0,0,'%s stares into the moonwell, lost in distant memories.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34819,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34583,1,0,'The Arch Druid approached the dragons for their blessings, as the dragons had placed on Nordrassil in ancient times.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34801,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34583,2,0,'But Nozdormu, Lord of Time, refused to give his blessing, chiding the druid for his arrogance.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34802,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34583,3,0,'In agreement, Alexstrasza also refused Staghelm, and without her blessing, Teldrassil\'s growth has been flawed and unpredictable.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34803,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34583,4,0,'Staghelm retreated to his enclave in Darnassus, ever seeking a new direction by which to bless Teldrassil, and restore the immortality of our people.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34804,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34583,5,0,'The Shade of the Kaldorei closes its eyes and fades away.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34820,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(2081,0,0,'Some of our huntresses have already made their way to Ban\'ethil Barrow Den. They will find you when you get inside. Go ahead and speak to Citarre to secure a ride there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34694,0,'Sentinel Kyra Starsong'),(34249,0,0,'You\'re finally here. Take the scenic route?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34985,0,'Sentinel Huntress'),(34249,1,0,'The exit is to the northwest... the mist will lead the way.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34669,0,'Sentinel Huntress'),(34249,2,0,'The mist will lead the way.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34668,0,'Sentinel Huntress'),(34249,3,0,'The Rune of Nesting is located across the bridge in the upper section of the southern chamber.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34650,0,'Sentinel Huntress'),(34249,4,0,'The Sapphire of Sky is located at the separate room in the lower section of the northern chamber.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34651,0,'Sentinel Huntress'),(34249,5,0,'The Black Feather Quill is located down the ramp in the lower section of the southern chamber.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34652,0,'Sentinel Huntress'),(34249,6,0,'The Raven Claw Talisman is located on the ledge in the upper section of the northern chamber.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34653,0,'Sentinel Huntress'),(34249,7,0,'Oben Rageclaw resides at the double bridges in the western chamber, near the hallway that leads out of the Barrow Den.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34654,0,'Sentinel Huntress'),(34584,0,0,'%s approaches the moonwell slowly, a familiar, thoughtful look upon its face.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34834,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34584,1,0,'Over time, Staghelm only grew more disconnected from our people.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34805,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34584,2,0,'Some pose that he blames us, his people, for the loss of his son, long ago during the War of the Shifting Sands.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34806,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34584,3,0,'Others cite rumors of his escalating conflicts with Tyrande Whisperwind, the shining light of our people, our leader in Darnassus.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34807,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34584,4,0,'But many druids of the Cenarion Circle stand firm that he wants only what is best for all of the Kaldorei, and serve him unerringly towards that end.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34808,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34584,5,0,'Fandral Staghelm carries the burden of our sins and our follies, and in so doing deserves the respect of us all.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34809,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34584,6,0,'The Shade of the Kaldorei closes its eyes and fades away.',16,0,100,66,0,0,0,34820,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,0,0,'%s rests on the side of the moonwell in peaceful contemplation.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34833,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,1,0,'In weeks past, all of those living atop Teldrassil have found their memories blurry, as if time itself seized a portion of their lives.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34810,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,2,0,'We break from this haze to find that Fandral Staghelm and many of his closest followers have disappeared without a word.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34811,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,3,0,'But in his place, Shan\'do Stormrage awoke from the dream and returned to his beloved Tyrande Whisperwind.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34812,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,4,0,'And with his return came Alexstrasza and Ysera, to at long last offer their blessings upon Teldrassil',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34813,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,5,0,'Though a small corruption lingers, desperately longing to be cleansed, the boughs of Teldrassil itself seem changed. Growth has begun anew.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34814,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,6,0,'None know what to expect next, but with Malfurion and Tyrande reunited, a new hope dawns on the Kaldorei.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34815,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,7,0,'Hope for lasting relief from the shadow that has been cast on our people for so long.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,44123,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34585,8,0,'The Shade of the Kaldorei closes its eyes and fades away.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34820,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(10382,0,0,'%s collapses but the broken body rises again!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5772,0,'Mangled Cadaver'),(11142,0,0,'No tampering with the mail!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6470,0,'Undead Postman'),(32331,2,7,'Wait a minute!  If you\'re here, then that means that in the not-so-distant future I\'m going to be you helping me?  Are we stuck in a time loop?!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32777,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,6,'I just want you to know that if we get through this alive, I\'m making sure that we turn out better than you.  No offense.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32776,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,5,'It might help if you could tell me how many of these guys we\'re going to fight.  You can remember that, right, grandpa?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32775,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,3,'Looks like I\'m an underachiever.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32773,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,4,'I think I\'m going to turn to drinking after this.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32774,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,2,'Chromie said that if I don\'t do this just right, I might wink out of existence.  If I go, then you go!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32772,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,0,'This equipment looks cool and all, but couldn\'t we have done a little better?  Are you even raiding?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32770,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,1,'So, how does it all turn out in Icecrown?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32771,0,'Past You'),(32331,1,0,'Here come the Infinites!  I\'ve got to keep the hourglass safe.  Can you help?',15,0,100,6,0,0,0,32769,0,'Past You'),(32331,0,0,'Whoa! You\'re me, but from the future!  Hey, my equipment got an upgrade.  Cool!',15,0,100,25,0,0,0,32764,0,'Past You'),(19622,14,0,'%s begins to cast Pyroblast!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,20775,0,'kaelthas EMOTE_PYROBLAST'),(34965,0,0,'Foolish $c, you cannot stop the Kvaldir!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35393,0,'Mistcaller Yngvar'),(30107,0,0,'I can\'t thank you enough for all of your help in putting together the keystone. Great things will come of this, I assure you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31023,0,'Brann'),(30107,1,0,'Iron dwarves... everywhere.... they\'re making their way down from the top. They certainly are persistent.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31024,0,'Brann'),(30107,2,0,'They\'re trying to take down the plane! I can\'t pull up any steeper... you need to keep them off of us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31025,0,'Brann'),(30107,3,0,'There are more just ahead - keep at it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31026,0,'Brann'),(30107,4,0,'We\'re almost out... just a little bit further.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31027,0,'Brann'),(30107,5,0,'Barring stray boulders from those giants, we should be clear... it seems a mess from down there though.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31028,0,'Brann'),(30107,6,0,'Their numbers are unbelievable... I\'m glad to hear King Stormheart came to your aid. I only hear good things of him - I think it\'s high time we meet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31029,0,'Brann'),(30107,7,0,'Poor Creteus. He was a good keeper... I\'m glad he at least got to see his task to completion, I imagine that\'s all that really mattered to him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31030,0,'Brann'),(30107,8,0,'We\'re coming up on Frosthold. I would be very appreciative if you would introduce me to King Stormeheart before you go. I believe we are both very much in his debt.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31031,0,'Brann'),(30405,0,0,'By all the gods... it can\'t be... Muradin?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31032,0,'Brann'),(30405,1,0,'Come on boy, there\'s no mistak\'n it - it\'s definately you. Don\'t ya recognize your younger brother?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31033,0,'Brann'),(30405,2,0,'I can\'t believe this! You were dead! All accounts said so... what happened, Muradin. How did you get here?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31034,0,'Brann'),(30405,3,0,'Indeed! Magni will be so happy to see you too! He\'s gotten nothing but bad news for a long time now, but this changes everything!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31035,0,'Brann'),(30405,4,0,'He\'s here in Northrend, brother, looking for you. A seer in Wintergarde brought word that you were not dead, and he left Ironforge immediately to come find you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31036,0,'Brann'),(30405,5,0,'Speaking of which...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31087,0,'Brann'),(30405,6,0,'That\'s in the past, Muradin. Regrets won\'t change anything.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31096,0,'Brann'),(30405,7,0,'Aye, be safe Muradin. I\'d join you, but I\'m on top of the most amazing discovery the world has yet seen. I can\'t abandon it now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31102,0,'Brann'),(30408,0,0,'What\'s that? You talkin\' to me, lad?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31037,0,'Yorg'),(30408,1,0,'My brother... yes... I do have brothers...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31038,0,'Yorg'),(30408,2,0,'Muradin clutches his head and reels for a moment as the memories rush back to him.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31039,0,'Yorg'),(30408,3,0,'...Brann?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31040,0,'Yorg'),(30408,4,0,'I... I dunno, Brann. I\'ve been \'ere a long time... all I \'ave of me life before this place are flashes and nightmares.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31042,0,'Yorg'),(30408,5,0,'It\'s good te see you though, brother. More than words can say.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31043,0,'Yorg'),(30408,6,0,'Magn! Forgive me, the memories are comin\' back slowly, brother.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31045,0,'Yorg'),(30408,7,0,'The frostborn have been very good to me. They\'re strong people.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31048,0,'Yorg'),(30408,8,0,'Not much, Magni. I\'ve had nightmares of a human... tall... light hair... death black armor. His name rests on the tip of me tongue, but...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31089,0,'Yorg'),(30408,9,0,'...Arthas.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31091,0,'Yorg'),(30408,10,0,'Aye, I know. I watched him turn... I watched him give up all that was right and I didn\'t lift a hand... I didn\'t even consider it until it was too late.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31094,0,'Yorg'),(30408,11,0,'No... no they won\'t. But I can make this right. I have te. I\'m goin\' after the boy. I\'ll make\'m answer for everything he\'s done.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31097,0,'Yorg'),(30408,12,0,'I\'m sure, Magni. I\'ll see this through, don\'t ya worry.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31100,0,'Yorg'),(30408,13,0,'Go Brann. Bring back an epic tale when we meet again. Farewell for now, brothers...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31103,0,'Yorg'),(30411,0,0,'Look, Lagnus, I consider you a capable man, but my patience is wearing thin. I know that Muradin is here, can you point me to him or not?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31084,0,'Magni'),(30411,1,0,'Brother! There you are! I can barely believe my eyes... you\'re alive!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31085,0,'Magni'),(30411,2,0,'It\'s so good to see you again, Muradin. And what\'s this I heard about you being a King in your own right now? The Bronzebeards were always destined to greatness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31086,0,'Magni'),(30411,3,0,'So it seems! And you haven\'t lost any muscle yourself. Do you remember anything of what happened, Muradin? Fate as turned ill in your absence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31088,0,'Magni'),(30411,4,0,'Magni nods.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31092,0,'Magni'),(30411,5,0,'He\'s not the boy of your memories anymore, Muradin. He\'s become something else entirely.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31093,0,'Magni'),(30411,6,0,'Are you sure Muradin? I just got you back after years of thinking you were dead. I do not want to lose you again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31099,0,'Magni'),(30411,7,0,'So be it then. I have to return to my people, brothers. Come back to me in one piece.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31101,0,'Magni'),(30411,8,0,'...farewell brother.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31129,0,'Magni'),(24838,0,0,'Land ho, Mr. Kowalski! Port is in sight, sir!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23941,0,'Sailor Henders'),(24835,0,0,'Thank you, Mr. Henders.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23942,0,'First Mate Kowalski'),(24835,1,0,'Bring us into port, please, Mr. Mehran.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23943,0,'First Mate Kowalski'),(24837,0,0,'Aye aye, Mr. Kowalski.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23951,0,'Navigator Mehran'),(24835,2,0,'Captain Stash! We\'ll be arriving shortly, sir!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23944,0,'First Mate Kowalski'),(24833,0,0,'Thank you, Mr. Kowalski! You may return to your post to oversee docking!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23945,0,'Captain \"Stash\" Torgoley'),(24833,1,0,'Well done, all. Please bring us safely to our next port. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23946,0,'Captain \"Stash\" Torgoley'),(15954,4,0,'%s summons forth Skeletal Warriors!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32974,3,'Noth EMOTE_SUMMON'),(15954,5,0,'%s raises more skeletons!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32977,3,'Noth EMOTE_SUMMON_WAVE'),(15954,6,0,'%s teleports to the balcony above!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32331,3,'Noth EMOTE_TELEPORT_1'),(15954,7,0,'%s teleports back into the battle!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32976,3,'Noth EMOTE_TELEPORT_2'),(15936,4,0,'%s teleports and begins to channel a spell!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32332,3,'Heigan EMOTE_DANCE'),(15936,5,0,'%s rushes to attack once more!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32333,3,'Heigan EMOTE_DANCE_END'),(68,0,6,'Believe me when I tell you this: You\'re gonna wish you weren\'t born, sissy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10954,0,'Stormwind City Guard'),(68,0,7,'Your actions shame us all, $c. I hurt inside as I beat you senseless.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10955,0,'Stormwind City Guard'),(68,1,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0