,(15953,5,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,3,'Faerlina EMOTE_FRENZY'),(16428,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(16573,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1191,3,'Crypt Guard EMOTE_FRENZY'),(23562,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(15956,3,0,'Anub\'Rekhan begins to unleash an insect swarm!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,13443,3,'Anub\'Rekhan EMOTE_LOCUST'),(28788,0,0,'Impressive, death knight. Return to me in the world of the living for your reward.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,28835,0,'Salanar the Horseman'),(24314,0,0,'So then we too are cursed?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23116,0,'Ancient Male Vrykul'),(24314,1,0,'%s points to the infant.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23117,0,'Ancient Male Vrykul'),(24315,0,0,'%s sobs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23118,0,'Ancient Female Vrykul'),(24314,2,0,'The gods have forsaken us! We must dispose of it before Ymiron is notified!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,23119,0,'Ancient Male Vrykul'),(24315,1,0,'NO! You cannot! I beg of you! It is our child!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23120,0,'Ancient Female Vrykul'),(24314,3,0,'Then what are we to do, wife? The others cannot find out. Should they learn of this aberration, we will all be executed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23121,0,'Ancient Male Vrykul'),(24315,2,0,'I... I will hide it. I will hide it until I find it a home, far away from here...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23122,0,'Ancient Female Vrykul'),(24248,0,0,'%s turns to face you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23102,0,'The Lich King'),(24248,1,0,'%s grins. ',16,0,100,11,0,14820,0,23146,0,'The Lich King'),(24248,2,0,'Shamanism has brought you here... Its scent permeates the air. *The Lich King laughs* I was once a shaman.',12,0,100,0,0,14742,0,23147,0,'The Lich King'),(24327,0,0,'Shall we prepare it for you, my lord?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23152,0,'Val\'kyr Soulclaimer'),(24248,3,0,'No, minion. This one is not ready.',12,0,100,274,0,14743,0,23148,0,'The Lich King'),(24248,4,0,'Do you feel it, mortal? Death seeps through me, enveloping all that I touch. With just a snap of my finger your soul will languish in damnation for all eternity.',12,0,100,1,0,14744,0,23149,0,'The Lich King'),(24248,5,0,'But... It is not yet your time to serve the Lich King. Yes, a greater destiny awaits you. Power... You must become more powerful before you are to serve me.',12,0,100,1,0,14745,0,23150,0,'The Lich King'),(24248,6,0,'Now watch, val\'kyr. Observe as I apply pressure. Can you see that it is not yet ripe? Watch as it pops and falls lifeless to the floor.',12,0,100,1,0,14746,0,23151,0,'The Lich King'),(24248,7,0,'Persistence or stupidity? It matters not. Let this be a lesson learned, mortal!',12,0,100,1,0,14747,0,27351,0,'The Lich King'),(22431,0,0,'It is time. The rite of exorcism will now commence...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20400,0,'Barada'),(22431,1,0,'Prepare yourself. Do not allow the ritual to be interrupted or we may lose our patient...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20401,0,'Barada'),(22431,2,0,'Back foul beings of darkness! You have no power here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20404,0,'Barada'),(22431,3,0,'I... must not... falter',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20407,0,'Barada'),(22431,4,0,'The Light is my guide... it is my sustenance!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20408,0,'Barada'),(22431,5,0,'The power of light compells you! Back to your pit!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20405,0,'Barada'),(22431,6,0,'Be cleansed with Light, human! Let not the demonic corruption overwhelm you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20403,0,'Barada'),(22431,7,0,'Back! I cast you back... corruptor of faith! Author of pain! Do not return, or suffer the same fate as you did here today!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20419,0,'Barada'),(22432,0,0,'Keep away. The fool is mine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20402,0,'Colonel Jules'),(22432,1,0,'Ah! Cease the incantations, Anchorite! Cease, or I will show you such pain that your pathetic people have never imagined!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20414,0,'Colonel Jules'),(22432,2,0,'This is fruitless, draenei! You and your little helper cannot wrest control of this pathetic human. He is mine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20416,0,'Colonel Jules'),(22432,3,0,'I see your ancestors, Anchorite! They writhe and scream in the darkness... they are with us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20415,0,'Colonel Jules'),(22432,4,0,'I will tear your soul into morsels and slow roast them over demon fire.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20417,0,'Colonel Jules'),(33686,4,0,'Entity designate: Yogg-Saron. Security has been compromised. Prison operational status unknown. Unable to contact Watchers for notification purposes.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33711,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_5'),(24823,0,0,'Model U-9207 Iron Rune Construct does not appreciate your tone of voice. Commencing total annihilation of your rug, Lebronski.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23892,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),(24807,0,0,'Behold my perfect creation!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23873,0,'Walt'),(24717,0,0,'WHOA, WHOA, WHOA! Hold everything fellas!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23875,0,'Stanwad'),(24806,0,0,'Launching.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23860,0,'Iron Rune Construct'),(24717,1,0,'Oh dear lords of stone and steel, what... I repeat... WHAT are ya gonna do with that?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23878,0,'Stanwad'),(24717,2,0,'The dwarves all burst out in laughter.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,23876,0,'Stanwad'),(24719,0,0,'I\'m cryin\' here! Please, make the funny stop!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23885,0,'Gwendolyn'),(24720,0,0,'If only our pappy were alive to see this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23889,0,'Needlemeyer'),(24718,0,0,'Man, that will never work. The iron dwarves are never gonna fall for that hunk o\' junk!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23880,0,'Lebronski'),(24807,1,0,'You\'re out of your element, Lebronski! Uncalled for! Those iron dwarves won\'t know what hit \'em! Now why don\'t you get back to uncovering the mystery of the gigantic turd on your rug and leave the real scientists to their work! ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23883,0,'Walt'),(25784,0,0,'I thank you, friend of Dalaran.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24995,0,'Archmage Evanor'),(25784,1,0,'We mustn\'t tarry here... stay close - I\'ll take us somewhere safe.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24996,0,'Archmage Evanor'),(66166,0,0,'No. You\'re lying! My father will protect me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49337,0,'Lilian Voss'),(22293,0,0,'%s begins to sputter as its engine malfunctions.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20103,0,'Inactive Fel Reaver'),(10204,0,0,'Misha lets OUT a loud roar AS she rakes her claws AGAINST the gronn\'s altar.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20261,0,'Misha'),(21514,0,0,'Who dares defile the altar of Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20262,0,'Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater'),(21514,1,0,'I will crush it and flay it and eat its meat and crack its bones one by one when I am done.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,20264,0,'Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater'),(15928,6,0,'The polarity has shifted!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32324,3,'Thaddius EMOTE_POLARITY_SHIFTED'),(15929,3,0,'%s dies.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10453,3,'Stalagg EMOTE_FEIGN_DEATH'),(15930,3,0,'%s dies.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10453,3,'Feugen EMOTE_FEIGN_DEATH'),(15929,4,0,'%s is jolted back to life!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12155,3,'Stalagg EMOTE_FEIGN_REVIVE'),(15930,4,0,'%s is jolted back to life!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12155,3,'Feugen EMOTE_FEIGN_REVIVE'),(16218,0,0,'%s loses its link!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,12156,3,'Tesla Coil EMOTE_TESLA_LINK_BREAKS'),(16218,1,0,'%s overloads!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,12178,3,'Tesla Coil EMOTE_TESLA_OVERLOAD'),(24874,1,0,'From sundered ground the sacrament was stolen. The Shield of Aesirites is lost. Unrest will be eternal.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23970,0,'Fengir the Disgraced'),(24876,1,0,'The Staff of Storm\'s Fury pilfered. A curse upon this land! The storms will never cease!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23971,0,'Rodin the Reckless'),(24877,1,0,'The Frozen Heart of Isuldof will consume this land until it is returned. Woe unto those that hold the heart as the curse of frozen blood besets them...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23972,0,'Isuldof Iceheart'),(24875,1,0,'The anguish of ten-thousand years awaits any foolish enough to don the Ancient Armor of the Kvaldir. Beware the mist and fog, mortals; for with them comes your end.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23973,0,'Windan of the Kvaldir'),(15952,0,0,'Spiderlings appear on