adra to Player'),(31029,1,0,'Wrong, Balargarde. You WILL accept this challenge!',14,0,100,457,0,15644,0,31598,0,'Possessed Vardmadra to Overthane Balargarde'),(31029,2,0,'My lord.',14,0,100,457,0,15645,0,31631,0,'Possessed Vardmadra to The Lich King'),(31029,3,0,'But...!',14,0,100,0,0,15646,0,31633,0,'Possessed Vardmadra to The Lich King'),(31083,0,0,'Honor guard stay where you are.',14,0,100,1,0,15600,0,31628,0,'The Lich King to 0'),(31083,1,0,'Vardmadra. I\'d wondered where you disappeared to. How is Iskalder?',14,0,100,6,0,15601,0,31629,0,'The Lich King to 0'),(31083,2,0,'I see through your disguise, Lady Nightswood. YOU THINK THAT YOU CAN FOOL ME?!',14,0,100,5,0,15602,0,31632,0,'The Lich King to 0'),(31083,3,0,'You may continue your combat, overthane.',14,0,100,25,0,15603,0,31634,0,'The Lich King to 0'),(31083,4,0,'But nothing! Finish them! DO NOT FAIL ME, BALARGARDE!',14,0,100,5,0,15604,0,31636,0,'The Lich King to Overthane Balargarde'),(31083,5,0,'You have bested one of my finest, but your efforts are for naught.',14,0,100,1,0,15605,0,31693,0,'The Lich King to 0'),(31083,6,0,'The frozen heart of Icecrown awaits....',14,0,100,1,0,15606,0,31695,0,'The Lich King to 0'),(25629,0,0,'Foolish elemental slave! You an your master will pay for your medding!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24956,0,'Lord Kryxix'),(24015,0,0,'Your remains will be fed TO the sharks of Daggercap!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23619,0,'Winterskorn Defender'),(24015,0,1,'The sacrifices NOW bring themselves TO us? Have you NO sense!?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23618,0,'Winterskorn Defender'),(24015,0,2,'You dare challenge Winterskorn?! I will impale you ON your own puny flag!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23617,0,'Winterskorn Defender'),(28416,0,0,'I will not simply lay here and allow you to slay me! You will have to earn your right to draw another breath if you want to kill me, mortal!',14,0,100,0,0,478,0,28544,0,'Rhunok to Player'),(24284,0,0,'The vrykul clutches at his throat as he begins to gag and thrash about.',16,0,100,53,0,0,0,23087