rs now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(60878,0,1,'I\'m heading to the wound. Try to keep these beasts off of me.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60342,0,'Alliance Priest to 60848'),(60878,0,0,'Thank you for the help. I\'ll go help with the wound.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60248,0,'Alliance Priest to 60848'),(60877,0,4,'If all pandaren are like you, I think you may have made some new allies!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60345,0,'Alliance Priest to Player'),(60877,0,5,'You handle the beasts, we\'ll handle the wound.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60346,0,'Alliance Priest to Player'),(60877,0,6,'Keep these creatures off of us while we perform our healing.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60347,0,'Alliance Priest to Player'),(60877,0,7,'I\'d stand with you any day.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60348,0,'Alliance Priest to Player'),(56676,3,0,'Please grandchildren, can you remove this thorn?  I cannot do so on my own.',12,0,100,0,0,27825,0,55570,0,'Shen-zin Su to Player'),(56676,2,0,'The pain is unbearable, and I can no longer swim straight.',12,0,100,0,0,27824,0,55569,0,'Shen-zin Su to Player'),(56676,1,0,'There is a thorn in my side.  I cannot remove it.',12,0,100,0,0,27823,0,55568,0,'Shen-zin Su to Player'),(64881,3,0,'Does the turtle know we\'re here?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65640,0,'Hao to Lorewalker Amai'),(64881,4,0,'Hey!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65642,0,'Hao to Lorewalker Amai'),(64881,5,0,'Yeah, you should all be more like me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65643,0,'Hao to Lorewalker Amai'),(64881,6,0,'Does that mean our moms and dads and grandparents were all explorers, too?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65648,0,'Hao to Lorewalker Amai'),(64881,7,0,'I want to explore the world!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65651,0,'Hao to Lorewalker Amai'),(64881,8,0,'Oh. Well, forget it then.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65653,0,'Hao to Lorewalker Amai'),(64881,9,0,'What?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65655,0,'Hao to Lorewalker Amai'),(64881,10,0,'That\'s un-possible!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65657,0,'Hao to Lorewalker Amai'),(64880,0,0,'What is the song about?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65634,0,'Nan to Lorewalker Amai'),(64880,1,0,'Sheesh, Hao. Haven\'t you ever paid attention?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65638,0,'Nan to Lorewalker Amai'),(64880,2,0,'Even Hao?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,65641,0,'Nan to Lorewalker Amai'),(64880,3,0,'Blerch! I\'d rather jump off this bridge.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65644,0,'Nan to Lorewalker Amai'),(64880,4,0,'Because sea turtles always return to the beach where they were born!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65647,0,'Nan to Lorewalker Amai'),(64880,5,0,'Like Chen and Li Li Stormstout!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65650,0,'Nan to Lorewalker Amai'),(64880,6,0,'No you don\'t. It\'s full of trolls.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65652,0,'Nan to Lorewalker Amai'),(64880,7,0,'What? What?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65656,0,'Nan to Lorewalker Amai'),(64879,0,0,'Shen-zin Su!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65635,0,'Yin to Lorewalker Amai'),(64879,1,0,'...Whenever he got hungry?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65645,0,'Yin to Lorewalker Amai'),(64879,2,0,'But isn\'t Pandaria hidden somewhere? Nobody can find it!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65646,0,'Yin to Lorewalker Amai'),(64879,3,0,'But we don\'t explore very much anymore, do we?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65649,0,'Yin to Lorewalker Amai'),(64879,4,0,'Lorewalker! What ever happened to Liu Lang?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65654,0,'Yin to Lorewalker Amai'),(64879,5,0,'That\'s a sad story!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65658,0,'Yin to Lorewalker Amai'),(57670,0,0,'These are the densest stones across all of Shen-zin Su, yet they are as nothing before my mighty head.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56355,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(57670,1,0,'Any who yet doubt my strength are simply foolish.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,56356,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(65558,0,0,'Let\'s tackle this one together!',12,0,100,5,0,27320,0,60609,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(65558,1,0,'I like the way you fight!',12,0,100,5,0,27322,0,60610,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(60878,0,4,'If all pandaren are like you, I think you may have made some new allies!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60345,0,'Alliance Priest to 60848'),(60878,0,3,'I thought I was done for. Thank you!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60344,0,'Alliance Priest to 60848'),(60878,0,2,'You\'re a life-saver. I\'ll do everything I can to heal the wound.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60343,0,'Alliance Priest to 60848'),(64875,39,0,'Could you sing it once more, for the students who just arrived?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,65622,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,38,0,'Thank you, Ruolin! That was beautiful.',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,65621,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,37,0,'We tell his story, so that he will always be remembered.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,65620,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,36,0,'And I think he lived a very very good life. We owe everything we have to Liu Lang, the first pandaren explorer.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,65619,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,35,0,'It\'s not a sad story! Liu Lang himself said, \"Never mourn a life well-lived.\"',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65618,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,34,0,'Along with the budding staves of all the elders who came before us, growing now into giant trees.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,65617,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,33,0,'Well, it\'s true. If you ever go to the Wood of Staves, you can see it.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65616,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,32,0,'His umbrella... sprouted! It grew roots, flowered, and became a tree!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,65615,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(65471,2,0,'My skills are no match for yours. I admit defeat.',12,0,100,1,0,33646,0,0,0,'Huojin Trainee'),(65471,1,0,'You are an honorable opponent.',12,0,100,1,0,33646,0,0,0,'Huojin Trainee'),(65470,0,0,'I have never seen a trainee with skills such as yours. I must tell the others.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56445,0,'Trainee'),(65469,0,4,'Such skill for a new trainee.',12,0,100,509,0,33643,0,56431,0,'Aspiring Trainee to Training Target'),(65469,0,3,'I hope the instructors saw that!',12,0,100,0,0,33646,0,56434,0,'Aspiring Trainee to Training Target'),(65469,0,2,'That target didn\'t stand a chance.',12,0,100,509,0,33643,0,56433,0,'Aspiring Trainee to Training Target'),(65469,0,1,'You are bound for a great things, trainee.',12,0,100,507,0,33643,0,56435,0,'Aspiring Trainee to Training Target'),(60244,0,0,'You\'re departing so soon?  I am envious of your prowess, $c. Good luck to you.',12,0,100,2,0,33645,0,59711,0,'Trainee Guang to Player'),(60183,0,0,'I hope you\'re ready, $p. Jaomin Ro awaits you just over the bridge.',12,0,100,113,0,33645,0,59710,0,'Trainee Nim to Player'),(54611,0,0,'A challenger approaches.',12,0,100,113,0,0,0,59692,0,'Jaomin Ro to Player'),(54611,1,0,'You\'ve been trained well.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,55205,0,'Jaomin Ro to Player'),(54611,1,1,'Well fought. Master Shang will be pleased.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,55206,0,'Jaomin Ro to Player'),(54611,1,2,'Amazing! You\'re much stronger than you look.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,55207,0,'Jaomin Ro to Player'),(54611,1,3,'It seems I have more training to do. Thank you for the lesson.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,55208,0,'Jaomin Ro to Player'),(54611,1,4,'I bow to your skill. You bested me fairly.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,55209,0,'Jaomin Ro to Player'),(54611,1,5,'It was an honor to be defeated by you.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,55210,0,'Jaomin Ro to Player'),(54943,0,0,'Shhhh! Come quietly. She\'s practicing.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,59712,0,'Merchant Lorvo to Player'),(56503,0,0,'Master Shang has trained you well. Thank you, friend!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,53265,0,'Min Dimwind to Player'),(56503,1,0,'I couldn\'t have fought them off alone. Now, if you\'ll excuse me, I should go find my cart.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56452,0,'Min Dimwind to Player'),(56503,2,0,'Cart!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,56453,0,'Min Dimwind to Player'),(56503,3,0,'Hello, cart. Still upside-downed, I see.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56454,0,'Min Dimwind to Player'),(54130,0,0,'Look out! Its friendses are coming!',14,0,100,2,0,0,0,56473,0,'Amberleaf Scamp to Player'),(54130,1,0,'Run away!',14,0,100,2,0,0,0,56474,0,'Amberleaf Scamp to Player'),(54856,5,0,'Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"Go, children. We shall meet again very soon.\"',16,0,100,2,0,0,0,53844,0,'Master Li Fei to Player'),(54856,4,0,'Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"Overcome that challenge, and you shall be graced by Huo\'s presence. Rekindle his flame, and if your spirit is pure, he shall follow you.\"',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,53843,0,'Master Li Fei to Player'),(54567,0,0,'A challenge in compassion and humility. By helping Merchant Lorvo, it would seem you\'ve passed, $c. Master Shang would be pleased.',12,0,100,2,0,27404,0,60599,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(54567,1,0,'And so our path lays before us. Speak to Master Shang Xi, he will tell you what comes next.',12,0,100,0,0,27399,0,60046,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(59642,0,0,'Keep those creatures at bay while I meditate. We\'ll soon have the answers we seek.',12,0,100,0,0,27398,0,59161,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(59652,0,0,'Meet me up in the cave if you would, friend.',12,0,100,396,0,27397,0,59147,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(54856,0,0,'Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"The way of the Tushui... enlightenment through patience and meditation... the principled life.\"',16,0,100,6,0,0,0,53129,0,'Master Li Fei to Player'),(54856,1,0,'Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"It is good to see you again, Aysa. You\'ve come with respect, and so I shall give you the answers you seek.\"',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,53845,0,'Master Li Fei to Player'),(54856,2,0,'Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"Huo, the spirit of fire, is known for his hunger. He wants for tinder to eat. He needs the caress of the wind to rouse him.\"',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,53841,0,'Master Li Fei to Player'),(54856,3,0,'Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"If you find these things and bring them to his cave, on the far side of Wu-Song Village, you will face a challenge within.\"',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,53842,0,'Master Li Fei to Player'),(54568,0,0,'Take that monkeybutt!',12,0,100,5,0,27344,0,59757,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(60176,0,0,'The fire spirit is upset. It\'s dangerous to enter the shrine now...',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,59680,0,'Huojin Monk to Player'),(54135,0,0,'You have earned the right to proceed.  Huo lies beyond.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,55251,0,'Master Li Fei to Player'),(60248,0,0,'Is that... is that Huo?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,59751,0,'Chia-hui Autumnleaf to Player'),(60253,0,0,'It is! Well done, $p!',12,0,100,71,0,0,0,59752,0,'Brewer Lin to Player'),(54786,0,0,'Welcome, Huo. The people have missed your warmth.',12,0,100,2,0,27788,0,60608,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,1,0,'You have conquered every challenge I put before you, $n. You have found Huo and brought him safely to the temple.',12,0,100,1,0,27789,0,60600,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,2,0,'There is a much larger problem we face now, my students. Shen-zin Su is in pain. If we do not act, the very land on which we stand could die, and all of us with it.',12,0,100,1,0,27790,0,60601,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,3,0,'We need to speak to Shen-zin Su and discover how to heal it. And to do that, we need the four elemental spirits returned. Huo was the first.',12,0,100,1,0,27791,0,60602,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,4,0,'Ji, I\'d like you to go to the Dai-Lo Farmstead in search of Wugou, the spirit of earth.',12,0,100,1,0,27792,0,60603,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,5,0,'Aysa, I want you to go to the Singing Pools to find Shu, the spirit of water.',12,0,100,1,0,27793,0,60604,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,6,0,'And $n, you shall be the hand that guides us all. Speak with me for a moment before you join Aysa at the Singing Pools to the east.',12,0,100,1,0,27794,0,60605,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,7,0,'You\'ve returned with the spirits of water and earth. You make an old master proud.',12,0,100,1,0,27776,0,55295,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,8,0,'Wugou and Shu are welcome here. We will care for them well.',12,0,100,1,0,27777,0,55296,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,9,0,'The only remaining spirit is Dafeng, who hides somewhere across the Dawning Span to the west.',12,0,100,1,0,27778,0,55297,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(54786,10,0,'I can carry you to the top of the temple. Ji awaits you there to lead the way.',12,0,100,1,0,27779,0,55298,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(61127,0,0,'On it!',12,0,100,0,0,27306,0,60606,0,'Ji Firepaw to Fire Central Temple Turn-in Controller'),(61126,0,0,'Yes master.',12,0,100,2,0,27406,0,60607,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Fire Central Temple Turn-in Controller'),(60250,0,0,'Hey there! Are you the one that brought back the fire spirit?',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,59875,0,'Cai to Deng'),(60250,1,0,'Of course he was hot! Don\'t be dumb, Deng.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,59877,0,'Cai to Deng'),(60250,2,0,'Nuh uh. Bet they could for sure kick you over that hill, though! Hah!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,59880,0,'Cai to Deng'),(60250,3,0,'Okay bye.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,59878,0,'Cai to Deng'),(60249,0,0,'Was he hot?  I bet he was hot!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,59876,0,'Deng to Cai'),(60249,1,0,'I bet you\'re really strong, huh?  You could probably kick that bridge right in half if you wanted to!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,59879,0,'Deng to Cai'),(60249,2,0,'Bye!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,59884,0,'Deng to Cai'),(57638,0,0,'The reeds of the Singing Pools are the hardest in all of the land, but they are as air before my mighty brow.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56333,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(57638,1,0,'Many have tested my claim, and I yet stand proven.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,56334,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(54975,0,0,'I have to admit, that looked pretty fun!',12,0,100,0,0,27394,0,66056,1,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(54975,1,0,'And it looks to me like you made a new friend.',12,0,100,0,0,27395,0,66057,1,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(57712,0,0,'Hello friend!  You\'re welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Dai-Lo Farmstead.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,56406,0,'Delivery Cart Tender to Player'),(57712,1,0,'Hello friend!  You\'re welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Temple of Five Dawns.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,56415,0,'Delivery Cart Tender to Player'),(55477,0,0,'Wake... up... DANGIT!',12,0,100,15,0,27345,0,60447,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,1,0,'This is ridiculous...',12,0,100,274,0,27346,0,60448,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,2,0,'You sleep like a rock!',12,0,100,5,0,27347,0,60449,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,3,0,'There\'s no way you\'ll sleep through THIS.',12,0,100,274,0,27348,0,60450,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,4,0,'Seriously?',12,0,100,18,0,27349,0,60451,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,5,0,'Why...',12,0,100,507,0,27350,0,60452,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,6,0,'won\'t...',12,0,100,509,0,27351,0,60453,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,7,0,'you...',12,0,100,507,0,27352,0,60454,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,8,0,'just...',12,0,100,509,0,27353,0,60455,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,9,0,'WAKE UP?!',12,0,100,22,0,27354,0,60456,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,10,0,'I will break you, little rock man!',12,0,100,25,0,27355,0,60457,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(55477,11,0,'%s sighs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,55942,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(55483,0,0,'Gimme all your vegetables!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,54873,0,'Plump Virmen to Player'),(55483,0,1,'AIIIIEEEEEEE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,54874,0,'Plump Virmen to Player'),(55483,0,2,'This virmen land!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,54876,0,'Plump Virmen to Player'),(55483,0,3,'You no take carrot! You take turnip instead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,54877,0,'Plump Virmen to Player'),(55504,0,0,'Gimme all your vegetables!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,54873,0,'Plump Carrotcruncher to Player'),(55504,0,1,'AIIIIEEEEEEE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,54874,0,'Plump Carrotcruncher to Player'),(55504,0,2,'This virmen land!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,54876,0,'Plump Carrotcruncher to Player'),(55504,0,3,'You no take carrot! You take turnip instead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,54877,0,'Plump Carrotcruncher to Player'),(57669,0,0,'Our crafters build the finest wooden planks.  They would weather the most brutal of storms.  But they are as water before the storm of my crushing skull.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56343,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(57669,1,0,'Nothing made by pandaren hands can withstand me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,56344,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(55539,0,0,'%s snorts loudly, and continues sleeping.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,54991,0,'Wugou to Player'),(55694,0,0,'Hey $p! This way to Morning Breeze Village.',12,0,100,0,0,27294,0,54196,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(64885,0,0,'Hello $n! The Lorewalker is beginning her lesson just down these stairs if you want to listen in.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,65573,0,'Lorewalker Zan to Player'),(64875,0,0,'This is the Song of Liu Lang, the first pandaren explorer.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65583,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,1,0,'The song is written in the old tongue, the language of emperors and scholars. Hardly anyone speaks it anymore.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,65584,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,2,0,'It is all about his adventures.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,65585,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,3,0,'Brave Liu Lang set out to explore the world on the back of a sea turtle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65586,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,4,0,'Does anyone remember the turtle\'s name? Yin?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,65587,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,5,0,'That\'s right, the turtle was called Shen-zin Su. At first, he was only big enough for Liu Lang to sit on.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65588,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,6,0,'He grew and grew and grew, SO big, that now some people call him \"The Wandering Isle.\"',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65589,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,7,0,'Question, Hao?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,65590,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,8,0,'Yes, Hao - our home is on Shen-zin Su\'s back.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,65591,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,9,0,'Liu Lang discovered many things as he explored the world - oh - yes, Hao?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,65592,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,10,0,'That\'s a good question. Nobody has spoken to Shen-zin Su for many generations. He only ever spoke to Liu Lang.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65593,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,11,0,'But I am certain that Shen-zin Su knows we are here. And he cares for every one of us!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,65594,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,12,0,'Especially Hao! Liu Lang once said, \"Noble is he who always asks questions.\"',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,65595,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,13,0,'\"We should all be like children, for the world is our elder, and has many things to teach us.\"',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65596,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,14,0,'Students! Students! Pay attention now.',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,65597,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,15,0,'Does anyone know how often Liu Lang went back to Pandaria?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65598,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,16,0,'Haha, no Yin. Liu Lang would eat wherever he explored.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,65599,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,17,0,'He returned to the main continent of Pandaria once every five years.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65600,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,18,0,'You are right, Yin. It IS hidden away, behind a cloak of mists.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,65601,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,19,0,'Does anyone remember how Liu Lang was always able to find it? Nan?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,65602,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,20,0,'That\'s right! Liu Lang always had a way back home. Every five years, he would return, to pick up more explorers.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65603,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,21,0,'Yes Hao! Only the BRAVEST pandaren joined Liu Lang on his turtle to explore the world.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,65604,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,22,0,'Shen-zin Su hasn\'t made landfall for a long time. But that hasn\'t stopped some pandaren from exploring, anyway.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65605,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,23,0,'Yes, like Chen and Li Li! They\'re out, exploring the world. Maybe someday you will, too.',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,65606,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,24,0,'I\'m glad you asked, Yin. Liu Lang explored the world his entire life, and raised many children here on the Wandering Isle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65607,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,25,0,'Eventually he grew very old, and visited Pandaria one final time.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65608,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,26,0,'But nobody else wanted to go exploring with him. So he left.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,65609,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,27,0,'Shen-zin Su has never returned to Pandaria.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,65610,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,28,0,'Tired now, Liu Lang said goodbye to Shen-zin Su, his oldest friend.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65611,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,29,0,'Then, Liu Lang went up to the Wood of Staves, carrying with him a bamboo umbrella that he always took on his adventures.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,65612,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,30,0,'He opened his umbrella, planted it in the ground, and sat underneath its cool shade.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,65613,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(64875,31,0,'He closed his eyes, and became one with the land. And then - do you know what happened?',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,65614,0,'Lorewalker Amai to Lorewalker Ruolin'),(62087,10,0,'Some of your kind chose to join the Alliance.',12,0,100,14,0,30756,0,61598,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,9,0,'Moving on. I know that you are not the only pandaren to escape from that island.',12,0,100,396,0,30755,0,61597,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,8,0,'Hm. Good.',12,0,100,0,0,30754,0,61596,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,6,0,'Do you see it? Everyone in my Horde earns their keep. You and your friends will be no exception.',12,0,100,396,0,30752,0,61593,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,7,0,'Do you understand this, pandaren?',12,0,100,6,0,30753,0,61594,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(181954,9,0,'Terrors, arise and obey!',14,0,100,0,0,190058,0,214966,0,'Summoning'),(181954,10,0,'Kneel!',14,0,100,0,0,190120,0,214637,0,'Slay 01'),(3296,0,1,'Please tell me that you didn\'t just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I\'m not going to have to hurt you... ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10951,0,'Orgrimmar Grunt'),(62195,0,0,'Look! It\'s Ji Firepaw and $p!',14,0,100,66,0,0,0,61628,0,'Shang\'gok to Player'),(62195,1,0,'They\'re the ones who helped Korga Strongmane escape from the Alliance!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,61629,0,'Shang\'gok to Player'),(62087,0,0,'You\'ve made a wise decision to join my Horde.',12,0,100,273,0,30746,0,61586,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,1,0,'There are some that would call us barbarians... the \"mongrel races\" of Azeroth.',12,0,100,396,0,30747,0,61587,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,2,0,'They are ignorant, and blind to reality. Look around you, pandaren.',12,0,100,274,0,30748,0,61588,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,3,0,'You will find no better partner in battle than an orc.',12,0,100,397,0,30749,0,61589,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(100982,0,0,'I will meet you down at the gateway on the Molten Shore.',12,0,100,0,0,53104,0,103349,5,'Sevis Brightflame to Player'),(96436,1,0,'They won\'t escape us. Illidari, attack!',14,0,100,397,0,55234,0,98271,0,'Jace Darkweaver to Player'),(99916,0,0,'Plenty of souls were sacrificed here. The activator is powered.',12,0,100,273,0,55344,0,101656,0,'Sevis Brightflame to Player'),(96654,0,0,'$n, you made it through!',14,0,100,22,0,55054,0,0,0,'Belath Dawnblade to Player'),(99917,1,0,'Sevis looks down at the dying broken mystic.',16,0,100,3,0,55345,0,101659,5,'Sevis Brightflame to Player'),(99917,0,0,'$n, hurry! You don\'t have much time.',12,0,100,3,0,55345,0,101658,5,'Sevis Brightflame to Player'),(93105,3,0,'Ich sehe Eure Geheimnisse...',12,0,100,0,0,55222,0,0,0,'Inquisitor Baleful'),(93105,2,0,'My eyes... My eyes!',14,0,100,0,0,55223,0,96010,0,'Inquisitor Baleful to Ashtongue Stalker'),(93105,1,0,'Enough! My colossal infernal will crush you.',14,0,100,0,0,55224,0,99554,0,'Inquisitor Baleful'),(99915,1,0,'Your sacrifice will NOT be in vain!',12,0,100,0,0,55343,1,101655,0,'Sevis Brightflame to Player'),(99916,1,0,'I will move ahead and find Allari.',12,0,100,0,0,55346,1,101657,0,'Sevis Brightflame to Player'),(22984,1,0,'The door to The Den of Mortal Delights has opened.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21494,2,'Black Temple Trigger - when Lower Temple Defeated - Emote'),(22871,4,0,'Death really isn\'t so bad.',14,0,100,0,0,11516,0,21101,0,'Teron Gorefiend SAY_DOOM_BLOSSOM1'),(22871,4,1,'I have something for you...',14,0,100,0,0,11519,0,21104,0,'Teron Gorefiend SAY_DOOM_BLOSSOM2'),(22871,5,0,'Give in.',14,0,100,0,0,11518,0,21103,0,'Teron Gorefiend SPELL_CRUSHING_SHADOWS'),(22871,6,0,'The wheel... spins... again.',14,0,100,0,0,11521,0,21106,0,'Teron Gorefiend SAY_DEATH'),(104217,3,0,'Who needs henchmen? I\'ll burn you myself!',14,0,100,0,0,58639,0,0,0,'TALIXAE - AGGRO'),(104217,2,0,'You! Have a look over there!',14,0,100,0,0,58646,0,0,0,'TALIXAE - EVENT_3'),(104217,1,0,'What are you waiting for? Check out that noise!',14,0,100,0,0,58645,0,0,0,'TALIXAE - EVENT_2'),(104217,0,0,'Make yourself useful and take a look around!',14,0,100,0,0,58644,0,0,0,'TALIXAE - EVENT_1'),(104218,0,0,'Must you leave so soon, Grand Magistrix?',12,0,100,0,0,67729,0,117105,0,'Advisor Melandrus to Player'),(104218,1,0,'Impossible! My guards would never permit such an intrusion!',12,0,100,0,0,67728,0,117088,0,'Advisor Melandrus to Player'),(104218,2,0,'Finally. I\'ll make this quick.',14,0,100,0,0,58650,0,108987,0,'Advisor Melandrus to Player'),(104218,3,0,'If you blink... you bleed!',14,0,100,0,0,58654,0,108998,0,'Advisor Melandrus'),(104218,4,0,'The wind slices to the bone!',14,0,100,0,0,58655,0,108993,0,'Advisor Melandrus'),(104218,5,0,'Bleed for the Grand Magistrix!',14,0,100,0,0,58657,0,108995,0,'Advisor Melandrus'),(104218,6,0,'Elisande... forgive me!',14,0,100,0,0,58658,0,109002,0,'Advisor Melandrus to Player'),(104218,7,0,'Elisande... forgive me!',14,0,100,0,0,58658,0,109002,0,'Advisor Melandrus to Player'),(104251,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bell_01:20|tA %s has been alerted to your presence!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,109269,0,'Duskwatch Sentry to Player'),(104278,0,0,'The Legion.. will prevail!',14,0,100,0,0,71114,0,109577,0,'Felbound Enforcer to Player'),(104278,1,0,'You will never stop our plans!',14,0,100,0,0,71111,0,109580,0,'Felbound Enforcer to Player'),(104694,0,0,'Hey, keep it down out there! We\'re trying to have a party!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,116332,0,'Suramar Citizen to Player'),(104694,1,0,'Outsiders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121049,0,'Suramar Citizen'),(104694,2,0,'%s runs away in terror!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,121586,0,'Suramar Citizen to Watchful Inquisitor'),(104695,0,0,'You\'re not welcome here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121050,0,'Suramar Merchant'),(104696,0,0,'Outsiders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121049,0,'Suramar Civilian'),(105296,0,0,'Your arrival is fortuitous. Tonight, the nobles have gathered in honor of the Grand Magistrix.',12,0,100,396,0,70446,0,108582,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(105296,1,0,'Our spies report that Elisande herself will attend. This presents a rare opportunity to catch her away from her source of power.',12,0,100,396,0,70447,0,108583,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(105296,2,0,'We\'ll take a side entrance to the grounds... too many eyes are watching the front.',12,0,100,396,0,70448,0,108584,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(105296,3,0,'This is your best chance to eliminate the Grand Magistrix. Good luck!',12,0,100,396,0,70449,0,108586,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(106468,0,0,'You\'ve done well so far, but we must ensure you blend in at the party. I\'ll enhance your disguise, infusing it with latent magic to make you appear as one of the nobles.',12,0,100,396,0,70450,0,108585,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre'),(107324,0,0,'Intruders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121052,0,'Suramar Child'),(107435,0,0,'You insult my honor, $n. Who exactly are you?',12,0,100,463,0,0,0,111881,0,'Suspicious Noble to Player'),(107435,1,0,'$n, you think I would spy on my own? Maybe we should look closer at you instead!',12,0,100,463,0,0,0,111882,0,'Suspicious Noble to Player'),(107435,2,0,'Now now, let\'s not be hasty $n. Why don\'t you follow me so we can talk about this in a more private setting...',12,0,100,463,0,0,0,111875,0,'Suspicious Noble to Player'),(107435,3,0,'How dare you accuse me of such a thing, $n? Do you know who I am? I don\'t recognize you at all...',12,0,100,463,0,0,0,111874,0,'Suspicious Noble to Player'),(107435,4,0,'I don\'t know how you found me out, but now it\'s time to die!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,111886,0,'Suspicious Noble to Player'),(107435,5,0,'I don\'t know how you found me out, but now it\'s time to die!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,111886,0,'Suspicious Noble to Player'),(110443,0,0,'Do you expect me to waste time chattering with vapid nobles even as my enemies close in? Look there, you fool! We are not alone.',12,0,100,0,0,67614,0,117106,0,'Elisande to Player'),(110443,1,0,'Yet another failure, Melandrus. Consider this your chance to correct it. Dispose of these outsiders. I must return to the Nighthold.',12,0,100,0,0,67613,0,117104,0,'Elisande to Player'),(110958,0,0,'This wine is terrible. I\'ll wager Melandrus watered it down.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,118921,0,'Fancy Noble'),(110958,1,0,'I saw Spellblade Aluriel pacing about. She always seems so... angry.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,118920,0,'Fancy Noble'),(90417,0,0,'Nobody touch it! Not until our guest arrives.',12,0,100,1,0,67263,0,101006,0,'Archmage Khadgar to Player'),(104217,4,1,'Not very clever of you to challenge all of us!',14,0,100,0,0,58638,0,0,0,'TALIXAE - AGGRO_TEAM'),(104217,5,0,'Mortal flesh... so pretty when it burns!',14,0,100,0,0,58640,0,0,0,'TALIXAE - BURNING_INTESITY'),(104215,4,0,'Guards! To me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SAY_SIGNAL_BEACON'),(104215,0,0,'No trespassers allowed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SAY_AGGRO'),(104215,1,0,'My watch... is ended',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SAY_DEATH'),(104215,2,0,'Basely done... cowards!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SAY_DEATH_SOLEMN_NIGHT'),(104215,3,0,'Just what you deserved!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(104215,3,1,'That should teach you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(104215,3,2,'A job well done!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SAY_PLAYER_KILL'),(90417,1,0,'Any disturbance should catalyze the sequence. Just, uh, give it a poke or something.',12,0,100,1,0,67264,0,100058,0,'Archmage Khadgar to Player'),(90417,2,0,'Be careful, champion. The land of Suramar has been wild for ten thousand years.',12,0,100,0,0,67271,0,100062,0,'Archmage Khadgar to Player'),(97140,5,0,'In your absence, I will prepare a place for the detention of test subjects.',12,0,100,396,0,67262,0,107469,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(99070,0,0,'Jandvik is oursss.',12,0,100,61,0,0,0,105275,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(97140,6,0,'And here\'s another thing, Valtrois.',12,0,100,1,0,67255,0,105901,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,0,0,'Make haste for Suramar. You may be our last hope.',12,0,100,25,0,67269,0,100096,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,1,0,'Ith\'nala kanesh!',12,0,100,0,0,67270,0,100256,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,2,0,'I hope someone out there is listening...',12,0,100,0,0,67540,0,100262,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,3,0,'%s winces in pain and holds her side.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,100097,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,4,0,'Ngh... need to keep moving.',12,0,100,0,0,67541,0,100265,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,5,0,'Rath!',12,0,100,0,0,67542,0,100916,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,6,0,'Withered... I must be getting close.',12,0,100,0,0,67543,0,100268,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,7,0,'Rath-domaas!',12,0,100,0,0,67544,0,100002,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,8,0,'Stand down, Erasmus! Can you not see that Elisande has forsaken us?!',12,0,100,5,0,67545,0,100279,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,9,0,'An\'ah!',12,0,100,0,0,67546,0,100915,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98209,10,0,'That will buy me some time...',12,0,100,0,0,67547,0,100282,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98266,0,0,'Ith\'el kanesh!',12,0,100,0,0,67265,0,100088,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98266,1,0,'I am Thalyssra of the shal\'dorei... the Nightborne. First Arcanist in the court of Suramar.',12,0,100,1,0,67266,0,100089,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98266,2,0,'My people have made a dire pact. One that spells doom for this world.',12,0,100,603,0,67267,0,100091,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98266,3,0,'Time is short. If you have found this message, you are capable of finding me as well.',12,0,100,1,0,67268,0,100094,0,'Echo of First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,0,0,'Rath-anu\'tanos!',12,0,100,0,0,67511,0,100280,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,1,0,'We must take care. The withered ones prowl this area, ravenous in their hunger for magic and flesh alike.',12,0,100,0,0,67512,0,114540,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,2,0,'Such is the fate of nightborne who cannot drink of the Nightwell.',12,0,100,0,0,67513,0,100338,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,3,0,'This is my fate as well... unless...',12,0,100,0,0,67514,0,101935,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,4,0,'Look out!',12,0,100,0,0,67515,0,107590,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,5,0,'E\'rath omnas!',12,0,100,0,0,67516,0,100340,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,6,0,'Get them off the barrier!',12,0,100,0,0,67525,0,100544,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Withered Thirster'),(98312,7,0,'My strength is fading... we must find shelter...',12,0,100,0,0,67517,0,100339,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,8,0,'<cough> I... need a moment...',12,0,100,0,0,67518,0,100588,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,9,0,'The barrier is being drained!',12,0,100,0,0,67524,0,100543,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Withered Thirster'),(98312,10,0,'There are so many...',12,0,100,0,0,67519,0,100589,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,11,0,'Strange. Why do they not follow?',12,0,100,0,0,67520,0,100590,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98312,12,0,'<cough> I need to rest...',12,0,100,0,0,67521,0,100591,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(98548,0,0,'I will teleport you in past the main defenses. When you are ready to leave, activate this beacon so I can locate you and pull you back.',12,0,100,1,0,67333,0,118646,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(99213,0,0,'Die!',14,0,100,0,0,67547,0,100918,0,'Erasmus Moonblade to Erasmus Moonblade'),(99213,1,0,'Gah! A time stop spell... She will pay for that!',12,0,100,0,0,67549,0,100919,0,'Erasmus Moonblade to Erasmus Moonblade'),(99213,2,0,'This is not your business, outlander. Thalyssra has betrayed the Grand Magistrix and must be put down!',12,0,100,0,0,67550,0,100921,0,'Erasmus Moonblade'),(99213,3,0,'Witness the power of the Nightborne!',12,0,100,0,0,67551,0,100924,0,'Erasmus Moonblade'),(99213,4,0,'Who... are you?',12,0,100,0,0,67552,0,100925,0,'Erasmus Moonblade to Player'),(99267,0,0,'She must have come this way. Keep looking!',12,0,100,1,0,67554,0,100003,0,'Nightborne Scion to Player'),(99267,1,0,'The shal\'dorei are... chosen...',12,0,100,0,0,66014,0,116624,0,'Nightborne Scion to Player'),(99267,2,0,'We have... failed.',12,0,100,0,0,65810,0,116758,0,'Nightborne Scion to Player'),(99524,0,0,'Selentia wails, calling forth ancient keepers!',41,0,100,463,0,53888,0,101162,0,'Keeper Selentia to Player'),(99524,1,0,'The tethers have broken. Selentia is vulnerable!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,114593,0,'Keeper Selentia to Eternal Tether'),(101116,0,0,'My, my. You look rather gaunt, honored teacher. Are you eating enough? Ahahaha!',12,0,100,396,0,67293,0,104159,0,'Warpcaster Thwen to Player'),(101116,1,0,'You should be proud! Your handiwork is going to help us reclaim every corner of our ancient lands.',12,0,100,397,0,67294,0,104158,0,'Warpcaster Thwen to Player'),(101116,2,0,'Face it, old man. I have surpassed you.',12,0,100,0,0,67282,0,104232,0,'Warpcaster Thwen to Player'),(101116,3,0,'My warp field is not working! Where have you taken us?!',12,0,100,0,0,67290,0,104248,0,'Warpcaster Thwen to Player'),(101116,4,0,'No! This place... it must bend to my will!',12,0,100,0,0,67288,0,104270,0,'Warpcaster Thwen to Player'),(101116,5,0,'An\'ratha... an\'tal-thandros!',12,0,100,0,0,67289,0,104271,0,'Warpcaster Thwen to Player'),(101499,0,0,'That is far enough.',12,0,100,0,0,67418,0,103939,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,1,0,'Well, you are not from the palace... and you are no demon, at least not entirely.',12,0,100,274,0,67419,0,103940,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,2,0,'Identify yourself, before I teleport you to the depths of the Great Sea.',12,0,100,25,0,67420,0,103943,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,3,0,'What is this? A coin...',12,0,100,0,0,67421,0,103949,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,4,0,'The sign of the dusk lily... This is the First Arcanist\'s seal! Is she alive?!',12,0,100,1,0,67422,0,103950,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,5,0,'Then there is still a chance... Come quickly! I need your help.',12,0,100,1,0,67423,0,103969,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,6,0,'Right. The trap.',12,0,100,1,0,67424,0,103951,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,7,0,'N\'eth ana!',12,0,100,0,0,67425,0,103967,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,8,0,'The teleporter is just outside. Activate it first, then step on the pad.',12,0,100,0,0,67484,0,103970,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101499,9,0,'Go ahead, I am right behind you.',12,0,100,1,0,67287,0,104149,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101782,0,0,'Urgh!',12,0,100,482,0,67281,0,104162,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101782,1,0,'Good trick... <cough> Warping the space around your body like that.',12,0,100,0,0,67283,0,104233,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101782,2,0,'But what if that space is already unstable?',12,0,100,0,0,67284,0,104235,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101782,3,0,'<cough> Unstable... space...',12,0,100,0,0,67291,0,104249,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101782,4,0,'Thwen always took magic too lightly... She was a terrible student... <cough>',12,0,100,1,0,67285,0,104268,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101782,5,0,'I haven\'t much left... <cough> I will get us as close as I can... Come close.',12,0,100,0,0,67286,0,104269,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101821,0,0,'My magic... defeated?',12,0,100,0,0,66016,0,116433,0,'Nightborne Warpcaster to Player'),(101821,1,0,'Your age has ended!',12,0,100,0,0,65799,0,116705,0,'Nightborne Warpcaster to Player'),(101821,2,0,'Arash-falas...',12,0,100,0,0,65811,0,116791,0,'Nightborne Warpcaster to Player'),(101821,3,0,'Tor\'theras falar!',12,0,100,0,0,66017,0,116790,0,'Nightborne Warpcaster to Player'),(101821,4,0,'None may challenge us!',12,0,100,0,0,66026,0,116701,0,'Nightborne Warpcaster to Player'),(101821,5,0,'No! It is not my time....',12,0,100,0,0,66015,0,116778,0,'Nightborne Warpcaster to Player'),(101821,6,0,'Anath\'ashar!',12,0,100,0,0,65818,0,116709,0,'Nightborne Warpcaster to Player'),(101821,7,0,'Your death is fated!',12,0,100,0,0,65814,0,116703,0,'Nightborne Warpcaster to Player'),(101825,0,0,'Feel the might of the shal\'dorei!',12,0,100,0,0,65905,0,116690,0,'Nightborne Enforcer to Player'),(101848,0,0,'The darkness lifts... thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104167,0,'Absolon to Player'),(101848,1,0,'I left the City to find my daughter. She was one of those who dared speak against Elisande...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119837,0,'Absolon to Player'),(101848,2,0,'She is gone. I thought I would join her in the ruins as a mindless husk, but you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119838,0,'Absolon to Player'),(101848,3,0,'You saved me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119839,0,'Absolon to Player'),(101848,4,0,'I will seek shelter now. I hope we meet again, friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119840,0,'Absolon to Player'),(101852,0,0,'Here we are - my old sanctuary!',12,0,100,1,0,67275,0,104154,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101852,1,0,'Strange... the defenses are offline...',12,0,100,1,0,67276,0,104155,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101852,2,0,'Intruders! How did they get in here?!',12,0,100,1,0,67277,0,104156,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101852,3,0,'This coil taps into the ancient leylines. Crank it up to full power!',12,0,100,1,0,67278,0,104221,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101852,4,0,'Good. If we overcharge enough coils, the entire system will failsafe into a lockdown.',12,0,100,0,0,67280,0,104224,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101852,5,0,'There are more coils in the chamber below - and more intruders, I imagine.',12,0,100,0,0,67279,0,104223,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101852,6,0,'Thwen... I should have recognized your uniquely oafish meddling on my network.',12,0,100,25,0,67292,0,104157,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(101852,7,0,'I can deal with Thwen. You overload the coils!',12,0,100,1,0,67296,0,104161,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(107302,0,0,'Pearlhunter Phin stares at you in disbelief.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,111594,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,1,0,'Pearlhunter Phin waves a hand in front of its nose and groans loudly.',16,0,100,61,0,0,0,111596,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,2,0,'Pearlhunter Phin chuckles, then shakes their head in shame.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,111595,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,3,0,'Pearlhunter Phin points at the Leyscar Scuttler.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114473,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,4,0,'Mrglrgr! Mrlgrlr mrlgrl grlrglr. Mrglrgrl?',12,0,100,0,0,416,0,113697,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,5,0,'Pearlhunter Phin\'s jaw drops as it stares at you, bewildered.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113701,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,6,0,'Pearlhunter Phin\'s eyes roll back in its head as it sighs heavily.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113703,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,7,0,'Pearlhunter Phin hops around in frustration.',16,0,100,35,0,0,0,113702,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,8,0,'Pearlhunter Phin excitedly grabs the sand and begins scrubbing the flaw on the pearl.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113704,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,9,0,'Pearlhunter Phin presents the pearl to Mr. Mrglglrm.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113863,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,10,0,'Grlmgrl, mgrlgrg. Glrgrlmrgl mrglrlgr lrglr! Rlmgrlm mgrglrmg mrglrglrm. Mrlgrgmrlg gmrlgrl mlrglrg?',12,0,100,0,0,23615,0,113855,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,11,0,'Mrg, mrlgmrlg...',12,0,100,0,0,419,0,113856,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107302,12,0,'Glmrg! Gmlrgm mglrmgrl mrmglr!',12,0,100,0,0,18075,0,114794,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(107567,0,0,'Initiating self-destruct procedure.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,115099,0,'Suramar Shieldguard'),(108389,0,0,'Grgmrlg! Glrmg, mglrmglrgr.',12,0,100,0,0,420,0,113857,0,'Mrgrlilgrl to Player'),(108389,1,0,'Mrlgmrlg, mgrmlgr rgmlrgmlr?',12,0,100,0,0,416,0,114372,0,'Mrgrlilgrl to Player'),(108389,2,0,'Mrgrlilrgl shakes their head and looks at Pearlhunter Phin.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114373,0,'Mrgrlilgrl to Player'),(108389,3,0,'Mrglrg! Glrmglmrg mglrmgl gmlrg. Mrglmrg?',12,0,100,0,0,419,0,114374,0,'Mrgrlilgrl to Player'),(108390,0,0,'Mgrlgl. Gmrglmr?',12,0,100,0,0,18071,0,113858,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108390,1,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm knocks the pearl down, cracking it!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113860,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108390,2,0,'Mlgr! Mlgrmlrgrlmgr! Mlgrg mlgrmlgrrlm! Rlmgrlmgr!',12,0,100,0,0,419,0,113859,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108390,3,0,'Mrglrmglr? Grlmglrg!',12,0,100,0,0,18075,0,114362,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108390,4,0,'Grlgm. Mrglmrglr!',12,0,100,0,0,18077,0,114363,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108390,5,0,'Grmlrgm... mrglrgml mlrmglrg mrmg. Mrgl...',12,0,100,0,0,18073,0,114365,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108390,6,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm gestures at you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114366,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108390,7,0,'Glrgm! Mrglmrlg mrglmglr? Mrl? Grlm?!',12,0,100,0,0,18077,0,114367,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108390,8,0,'Mlrgmlrg. Mrlg mrglmr, mlrglrmgr? Grlgmlmrg rglmrglmr.',12,0,100,0,0,18075,0,114368,0,'Mr. Mrglglrm to Player'),(108709,0,0,'Pearlhunter Phin runs over and begins digging furiously.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114164,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,1,0,'Pearlhunter Phin throws their arms in the air, seemingly frustrated.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114160,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,2,0,'Mrlg. Grlgm.',12,0,100,0,0,417,0,114163,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,3,0,'Pearlhunter Phin hops around impatiently.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114159,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,4,0,'Mrgrlg! Glrgmrl mgrlgr...',12,0,100,0,0,415,0,114161,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,5,0,'Pearlhunter Phin groans and kicks a nearby rock.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114158,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,6,0,'GRGRLM! Mlrgmr, gmrlg Glrmrgl mrlg Mrgrlilrgl.',12,0,100,0,0,419,0,114167,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,7,0,'Pearlhunter Phin triumphantly pulls out handful of long fangs from the pile of sand.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114165,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,8,0,'Mrglrg! Grmgl, grmlgrmlg mlrgr lrrg.',12,0,100,0,0,417,0,114166,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,9,0,'Mrgrlilgrl! Mrglmr gmrlgrmglr?!',12,0,100,0,0,419,0,114782,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,10,0,'Pearlhunter Phin breaks the cocoon open.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114375,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,11,0,'Grmlrgr! Mlrgmlrg mglrm glrmg!',12,0,100,0,0,419,0,114369,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,12,0,'Mrglglrm! Mrlgmrlg mglr!',12,0,100,0,0,416,0,114370,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(108709,13,0,'Grlgr mrlgml. Mrglrglmr!',12,0,100,0,0,417,0,114371,0,'Pearlhunter Phin to Player'),(111863,0,0,'What is this place?',12,0,100,0,0,67381,0,94147,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,1,0,'This chamber... I have never seen anything like it.',12,0,100,0,0,67383,0,117057,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,2,0,'So dark...',12,0,100,0,0,67384,0,117539,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,3,0,'In\'alah!',12,0,100,463,0,67385,0,117454,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,4,0,'Much better.',12,0,100,0,0,67386,0,117220,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,5,0,'Old teleporters. Not so different from the ones in Suramar city. Seems they are inactive.',12,0,100,0,0,67387,0,117064,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,6,0,'Let us explore downstairs. Watch your step.',12,0,100,0,0,67388,0,117219,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,7,0,'Strange. The floor looks like... a map?',12,0,100,0,0,67389,0,117221,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,8,0,'And we are at the center...',12,0,100,0,0,67390,0,117551,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,9,0,'One thing is certain - leyline energy is being fed into this chamber from elsewhere.',12,0,100,0,0,67391,0,117222,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,10,0,'What could have required such power? A weapon, perhaps?',12,0,100,0,0,67392,0,117557,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,11,0,'And those keepers protecting it... How long their vigil must have been...',12,0,100,0,0,67393,0,117558,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,12,0,'<Sigh.> I have more questions now than before!',12,0,100,0,0,67394,0,117559,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,13,0,'For now, at least, we know the withered have learned to avoid this place.',12,0,100,0,0,67395,0,101214,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,14,0,'And nobody from the palace would think to search for us here.',12,0,100,0,0,67396,0,101215,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,15,0,'It is a perfect refuge. A temporary home, until I can return to Suramar.',12,0,100,0,0,67397,0,117561,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(111863,16,0,'But first, I will need allies.',12,0,100,0,0,67398,0,117562,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(32642,1,0,'Dis bad mojo what you doin\'. Don\'t say Mojodishu didn\'t warn ya!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33028,0,'Mojodishu to Player'),(32642,2,0,'Really, mon? Just like dat you be leavin\' Mojodishu behind?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33027,0,'Mojodishu to Player'),(91003,2,0,'Rokmora rears back for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:188169|h[Razor Shards]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,108748,0,'Rokmora'),(91003,1,0,'Rokmora creates |cFFFF0000|Hspell:215898|h[Crystaline Ground]|h|r! Don\'t move!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,114681,0,'Rokmora'),(91003,0,0,'Rok SMASH!',14,0,100,0,0,54551,0,102714,0,'Rokmora'),(94960,0,0,'The undeserving will perish!',14,0,100,0,0,54650,0,102955,0,'Hymdall'),(94960,1,0,'Resist! Fight to the last!',14,0,100,0,0,54646,0,102949,0,'Hymdall'),(94960,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Horn_03:20|t Hymdall blows the |cFFFF0404|Hspell:191284|h[Horn of Valor]|h|r summoning Storm Drakes!',41,0,100,0,0,54646,0,104163,0,'Hymdall'),(94960,3,0,'I will bleed the weakness from your veins!',14,0,100,0,0,54637,0,102942,0,'Hymdall'),(94960,4,0,'A battle well fought! The path forward is open.',14,0,100,0,0,54648,0,102951,0,'Hymdall'),(95674,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_hunter_lonewolf:20|t Fenryr begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:196543|h[Unnerving Howl]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,104038,0,'Fenryr'),(95674,1,0,'Wounded, Fenryr retreats to his den.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,104029,0,'Fenryr'),(95675,0,0,'Give up the aegis or die!',14,0,100,0,0,54614,0,102921,0,'God-King Skovald'),(95675,1,0,'By flame be scourged!',14,0,100,0,0,54628,0,102935,0,'God-King Skovald'),(95675,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelFlameRing:20|t Skovald begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:193826|h[Ragnarok]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,54628,0,106469,0,'God-King Skovald'),(95675,3,0,'All my plans... brought to ruin...',14,0,100,0,0,54620,0,102927,0,'God-King Skovald to Player'),(95676,0,0,'Throughout your trials, you have demonstrated strength, skill, and intellect-traits shared by the greatest of our vrykul kings. Now... you will face them in combat. Emerge victorious, and you may yet claim your prize!',14,0,100,0,0,54613,0,100271,0,'Odyn to Player'),(95676,1,0,'To the victor go the spoils... The Aegis of Aggramar is yours for the taking.',14,0,100,0,0,54578,0,100240,0,'Odyn to King Bjorn'),(95676,2,0,'Most impressive! I never thought I would meet anyone who could match the Valarjar\'s strength... and yet here you stand.',14,0,100,0,0,54584,0,102879,0,'Odyn to Odyn'),(95676,3,0,'There is one final trial that awaits: me. Should you triumph, I will carve your names in these sacred halls myself and grant you a reward worthy of your valor.',14,0,100,0,0,54583,0,102881,0,'Odyn to Odyn'),(95676,4,0,'It has been ages since I faced a worthy opponent. Let the battle begin!',14,0,100,0,0,54604,0,102913,0,'Odyn'),(95676,5,0,'Enough! I... I yield! You are truly remarkable creatures. As promised, you will have your just reward.',12,0,100,0,0,54598,0,102907,0,'Odyn'),(95833,0,0,'I will not fail you, Eyir!',14,0,100,0,0,54687,0,102993,0,'Hyrja'),(95833,1,0,'You will pollute these halls no more!',14,0,100,0,0,54681,0,102986,0,'Hyrja'),(95833,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EyeOfTheStorm:20|t Hyrja begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:192305|h[Eye of the Storm]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,122899,0,'Hyrja'),(95833,3,0,'Eyir... you were wrong to put your faith in me...',14,0,100,0,0,54683,0,102988,0,'Hyrja to Player'),(95843,0,0,'I will take joy in crushing you!',14,0,100,0,0,54577,0,102583,0,'King Haldor to King Haldor'),(95843,1,0,'My strength... fails.',14,0,100,0,0,54575,0,102585,0,'King Haldor to Player'),(95885,0,0,'It\'s so good to fight again.',14,0,100,0,0,55406,0,97634,0,'Tirathon Saltheril'),(95885,1,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_ShadowStrikes:20|t%s empowers himself with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191941|h[Darkstrikes]|h|r!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,103258,0,'Tirathon Saltheril to Player'),(95885,2,0,'My blades hunger.',14,0,100,0,0,55416,0,97641,0,'Tirathon Saltheril'),(95885,3,0,'My power.. Wasn\'t enough?',14,0,100,0,0,55408,0,97650,0,'Tirathon Saltheril to Player'),(95886,0,0,'So ... long ... where is my Lord of Fire, why does he not answer my call?',14,0,100,0,0,55437,0,97655,0,'Ash\'Golm'),(95886,1,0,'Your bones will blacken, your life extinguished.',14,0,100,0,0,55433,0,97659,0,'Ash\'Golm'),(95886,2,0,'We give rise to flame.',14,0,100,0,0,55432,0,97660,0,'Ash\'Golm'),(95886,3,0,'Your flesh will know the sweet caress of fire.',14,0,100,0,0,55434,0,97658,0,'Ash\'Golm to Player'),(95886,4,0,'Fire has a life of its own.',14,0,100,0,0,55431,0,97661,0,'Ash\'Golm'),(95886,5,0,'I am... Extinguished.',14,0,100,0,0,55426,0,97667,0,'Ash\'Golm to Player'),(95887,0,0,'Visitors? How exciting!',14,0,100,0,0,55424,0,97672,0,'Glazer'),(95887,1,0,'Watch your step!',14,0,100,0,0,55420,0,97676,0,'Glazer'),(95887,2,0,'If only I could see the future...',14,0,100,0,0,55474,0,97684,0,'Glazer to Player'),(95888,0,0,'So be it. I will slay you all.',14,0,100,0,0,55472,0,97689,0,'Cordana Felsong'),(95888,1,0,'Watch your step! It\'s a long way down.',14,0,100,0,0,55465,0,97696,0,'Cordana Felsong to Player'),(95888,2,0,'All night elf children learn to love the dark.',14,0,100,0,0,55463,0,97699,0,'Cordana Felsong'),(95888,3,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Shadowstep:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197823|h[Shadowsteps]|h|r away from the party. Reveal her with Elune\'s Light!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,103279,0,'Cordana Felsong'),(95888,4,0,'I will not be stopped! I have fought too long, suffered too much. Victory must be mine!',14,0,100,0,0,55461,0,97701,0,'Cordana Felsong to Cordana Felsong'),(95888,5,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_auspiciousspirits:20|tSpirits form in the shadows around the platform!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,103280,0,'Cordana Felsong'),(95888,6,0,'My powers have grown since joining the Legion. Here, let me show you.',14,0,100,0,0,55462,0,97700,0,'Cordana Felsong'),(95888,7,0,'Beaten? How! You are... nothing',14,0,100,0,0,55460,0,97702,0,'Cordana Felsong to Player'),(96015,0,0,'Ooohh... New subjects.',14,0,100,0,0,64824,0,97707,0,'Inquisitor Tormentorum'),(96015,1,0,'Your souls are mine.',14,0,100,0,0,64828,0,97711,0,'Inquisitor Tormentorum'),(96015,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Teleport:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:200898|h[Teleports]|h|r to nearby cells and begins releasing prisoners!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,105573,0,'Inquisitor Tormentorum'),(96015,3,0,'Let\'s see what\'s behind door number...',14,0,100,0,0,64827,0,97710,0,'Inquisitor Tormentorum'),(96015,4,0,'How terribly disappointing.',14,0,100,0,0,64829,0,97712,0,'Inquisitor Tormentorum to Player'),(96657,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_ragnaros_molteninferno.blp:20|t$n |cFFFF0000|Hspell:185828|h[Rekindles]|h|r a Fel Scorcher!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,96139,0,'Blade Dancer Illianna to Blade Dancer Illianna'),(97081,0,0,'Where they failed, we will succeed!',14,0,100,0,0,54570,0,102590,0,'King Bjorn'),(97081,1,0,'You have... bested me.',14,0,100,0,0,54578,0,102592,0,'King Bjorn to Player'),(97083,0,0,'Your cries of anguish will echo through eternity!',14,0,100,0,0,54574,0,102586,0,'King Ranulf to King Ranulf'),(97083,1,0,'I embrace the abyss!',14,0,100,0,0,54572,0,102588,0,'King Ranulf to Player'),(97084,0,0,'Seems I... underestimated you.',14,0,100,0,0,54578,0,102582,0,'King Tor to Player'),(97087,0,0,'I was looking for a chance to brawl!',14,0,100,274,0,0,0,104682,0,'Valarjar Champion to Valarjar Champion'),(97140,1,0,'Oculet!',12,0,100,0,0,67243,0,100883,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,7,0,'I advise you to stop turning up your nose from outsiders. We wouldn\'t be here without their help.',12,0,100,1,0,67256,0,105902,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,2,0,'It dries up...',12,0,100,0,0,67244,0,104371,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,13,0,'Agh!! Make them stop! Please make them stop!',12,0,100,0,0,67459,0,111608,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,14,0,'Let\'s continue.',12,0,100,0,0,67454,0,111812,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,15,0,'Tala nar\' valas.',12,0,100,0,0,67455,0,112341,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,16,0,'What a mess... What a rage...',12,0,100,0,0,67456,0,111667,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,17,0,'Something which gave you peace...',12,0,100,0,0,67464,0,118576,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,18,0,'Ahhh! Stop that! Let them stop!',12,0,100,0,0,67459,0,111608,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,0,0,'Oh... I\'ll never get used to that.',12,0,100,0,0,67411,0,99793,0,''),(97140,20,0,'Mm-mh... STOP IT!!!',12,0,100,0,0,67461,0,112350,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(97140,21,0,'You... did you manage to find something?',12,0,100,0,0,67463,0,118575,0,''),(97140,22,0,'Something that brings goodness...',12,0,100,0,0,67464,0,118576,0,''),(97140,24,0,'Yes... It\'s all good.',12,0,100,0,0,67465,0,112398,0,''),(97140,23,0,'Goodness, which we ourselves need so much.',12,0,100,0,0,67466,0,118583,0,''),(97140,26,0,'Thalyssra smiles warmly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,115439,0,''),(97140,25,0,'Present? To me?',12,0,100,0,0,67591,0,113328,0,''),(97140,27,0,'Thank you very much. Your help is invaluable.',12,0,100,0,0,67590,0,115440,0,''),(97202,0,0,'You will not deny Hyrja\'s ascendance!',14,0,100,0,0,54670,0,102975,0,'Olmyr the Enlightened'),(97202,1,0,'The Light shines eternal in you, Hyrja!',14,0,100,0,0,54671,0,102976,0,'Olmyr the Enlightened to Player'),(97219,0,0,'You sully this ritual with your presence, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,54672,0,102977,0,'Solsten'),(97219,1,0,'Hyrja... the fury of the storm is yours to command!',14,0,100,0,0,54673,0,102978,0,'Solsten to Player'),(97729,0,0,'I will rest now.',12,0,100,0,0,66047,0,102391,0,'Disturbed Apparition to Player'),(97729,1,0,'Our people... shu dalees-na.',12,0,100,0,0,66051,0,102393,0,'Disturbed Apparition to Player'),(97729,2,0,'Thandae-alah...',12,0,100,0,0,66044,0,102385,0,'Disturbed Apparition to Player'),(99013,0,0,'Thank you for your help. Your intervention saved my life.',12,0,100,0,0,55443,0,103226,0,'Drelanim Whisperwind to Player'),(99013,1,0,'If you intend to venture deeper you will find far more terrifying things lurking in our Vault.',12,0,100,0,0,55442,0,103227,0,'Drelanim Whisperwind to Player'),(99240,0,0,'The room\'s countermeasures are now armed.',16,0,100,0,0,55437,0,106822,0,'Countermeasures to Ash\'Golm'),(99859,0,0,'I can control it no longer. You must drown!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,116503,0,'Azurefall Guardian to Player'),(99859,1,0,'Free at last! Let us defeat this evil!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,101639,0,'Azurefall Guardian to Player'),(99859,2,0,'Thank you, stranger. The rage... the corruption is gone. Now I must tend to the waters I have neglected for so long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119825,0,'Azurefall Guardian to Player'),(102583,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_ragnaros_molteninferno.blp:20|tThe $n |cFFFF0000|Hspell:202663|h[Detonates]|h|r as it dies!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,122413,0,'Fel Scorcher to Fel Scorcher'),(102600,0,0,'You there! Outlander! Be a dear and step on that other switch, will you?',12,0,100,5,0,67475,0,117624,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(102600,1,0,'Ahhh, I recognize that symbol. So Thalyssra has recruited an outlander to our cause... Are we truly so desperate?',12,0,100,5,0,67478,0,117635,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(102600,2,0,'<Sigh.> Very well. I am Valtrois.',12,0,100,1,0,67479,0,117672,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(102600,3,0,'Out here, so far from the Nightwell, we must settle for any source of magic we can find.',12,0,100,1,0,67480,0,118569,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(102600,4,0,'It seems Thalyssra and I had the same idea - the old leyline feeds might keep us alive, if barely.',12,0,100,0,0,67481,0,118570,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(102600,5,0,'We just have to wake them up.',12,0,100,0,0,67482,0,118571,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(102600,6,0,'This coil projects a high-potency current. You will find a low-potency coil at the far end of the facility.',12,0,100,0,0,67427,0,105571,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(102600,7,0,'Both currents feed into the central chamber. Use the coils and switches to direct the currents and power all four seals in the central chamber!',12,0,100,0,0,67428,0,105575,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(102600,8,0,'You are dismissed. I will make my own way to Shal\'Aran.',12,0,100,0,0,67429,0,105742,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(103155,0,0,'I shall not squander this gift.',12,0,100,0,0,67407,0,105787,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(103511,0,0,'Lost Feathermane Kitten spots you and scampers away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,110347,0,'Lost Feathermane Kitten to Player'),(103568,0,0,'It is done!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,86779,0,'Mayruna Moonwing to Player'),(103569,0,0,'Fresh green food grows and your enemies are fewer. We seek only your blessing in return.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,108539,0,'Mythandros Irongrove to Player'),(103570,0,0,'Thank you.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,111252,0,'Mardranel Forestheart to Player'),(103571,1,0,'I will bring the blessing to Mythandros directly. See you there!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,120002,0,'Solendra Featherdown to Player'),(103570,1,0,'I will meet you on the other side.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,110286,0,'Mardranel Forestheart to Player'),(103570,2,0,'Your kittens are safe, Yowlon. Will you grant us your blessing so we may share this land with you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,110918,0,'Mardranel Forestheart to Player'),(103570,3,0,'Thank you, your highness.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,110920,0,'Mardranel Forestheart to Player'),(103571,0,0,'Our efforts were not in vain. The Moonwhisper Matriarch watches from afar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,108550,0,'Solendra Featherdown to Player'),(103712,0,0,'Yowlon purrs quietly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,108520,0,'Yowlon to Player'),(103712,1,0,'Yowlon leans downward to pluck a feather from his ankle tufts.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,110919,0,'Yowlon to Player'),(103712,2,0,'Yowlon deposits the feather into Mardranel\'s palm.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,110921,0,'Yowlon to Player'),(104234,0,0,'There were more of us when we set out. I would have died, if it were not for Mayruna\'s arrival.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119942,0,'Val\'sharah Refugee to Player'),(104235,0,0,'We owe our lives to Mythandros and his druid companions. We can call Suramar home, thanks to him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119943,0,'Val\'sharah Refugee to Player'),(104478,0,0,'Lost Owlkitten slowly raises its head and looks around.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,110283,0,'Lost Owlkitten to Player'),(104478,1,0,'Lost Owlkitten spots you and scampers away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,110284,0,'Lost Owlkitten to Player'),(104478,2,0,'Lost Owlkitten raises its nose to the air and chirps in recognition of its surroundings.',16,0,100,377,0,0,0,106914,0,'Lost Owlkitten to Player'),(104998,0,0,'Thalyssra lives? Come, let us talk in private.',12,0,100,0,0,67474,0,107605,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(105071,0,0,'We shall use the garden entrance.',12,0,100,0,0,67506,0,108574,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(105071,1,0,'Enchanted masks. Simply don the mask, and a magical costume will envelop your body.',12,0,100,0,0,67507,0,108575,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(105071,2,0,'It should be enough to fool the other guests, but stay clear of the guards.',12,0,100,0,0,67508,0,108577,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(105071,3,0,'I will find Ly\'leth. You stay out of trouble.',12,0,100,0,0,67509,0,108576,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(105071,4,0,'Just enjoy the party for a bit. You know... mingle.',12,0,100,0,0,67510,0,108943,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(105342,0,0,'This is not up for debate, Anarys. You are either with us, or against us. Choose wisely.',12,0,100,0,0,67504,0,109087,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(105342,1,0,'<sigh> Dear child... Do you not realize what he died for?',12,0,100,0,0,67505,0,109089,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(105342,2,0,'Our father\'s memorial is just around the corner. I am sure you will find Anarys nearby.',12,0,100,0,0,67238,0,114850,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(105342,3,0,'An\'anora!',12,0,100,0,0,67226,0,109431,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(105342,4,0,'True. You will have to make an appearance.',12,0,100,0,0,67227,0,109285,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(105351,0,0,'Hm. Yes. Fascinating.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,108409,0,'Masqued Reveler to Player'),(105351,1,0,'Curious...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,108406,0,'Masqued Reveler to Player'),(105351,2,0,'You know, the Magistrix has spies everywhere.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,108407,0,'Masqued Reveler to Player'),(105351,3,0,'Who let you in here?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,108411,0,'Masqued Reveler to Player'),(105351,4,0,'Psst. Table behind the house. Lady Ly\'leth is waiting for you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,108443,0,'Masqued Reveler to Player'),(105633,0,0,'AAAHHHhhhh!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,103052,0,'Understone Drudge to Understone Drudge'),(105636,0,0,'Intruders? Here?! Break them!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,102910,0,'Understone Drudge'),(105759,0,0,'Who goes there?!',12,0,100,0,0,65802,0,105557,0,'High Mage of the Duskwatch to Player'),(105759,1,0,'An illusion! What are you hiding?',12,0,100,0,0,66003,0,105559,0,'High Mage of the Duskwatch to Player'),(106239,0,0,'I will hear no more of your scheming! You endanger everything our father worked for!',12,0,100,274,0,67503,0,116440,0,'Anarys Lunastre to Player'),(106256,0,0,'Free... finally free. How do I get out of here?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122228,0,'Nightborne Captive to Webbed Victim'),(106256,1,0,'Please... kill every last one of these monsters.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122229,0,'Nightborne Captive to Webbed Victim'),(106256,2,0,'I... I think I can make it. Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122227,0,'Nightborne Captive to Webbed Victim'),(106495,0,0,'Dusk lily pods? I see...',12,0,100,0,0,67258,0,109660,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(106495,1,0,'Please excuse me. I must address this immediately.',12,0,100,0,0,67259,0,109662,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(106696,0,0,'It is done. I will dispose of the ashes and find Mayruna back at camp. Thank you, friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,110907,0,'Kalendros Irongrove to Player'),(107114,0,0,'The Tormenting Orb stares at all players inquisitively.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113561,0,'Tormenting Orb to Tormenting Orb'),(107126,0,0,'Arkan\'dor is in critical condition.',12,0,100,0,0,67330,0,118723,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(107126,1,0,'Without energy, it will not be able to take its final form and will perish.',12,0,100,0,0,67314,0,118612,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(107126,2,0,'Hurry, plant the seed!',12,0,100,0,0,67526,0,113688,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(107126,3,0,'Here it will be able to be powered by a power line.',12,0,100,0,0,67527,0,113689,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(107959,0,0,'Foolish surface-dwellers! Be gone!',12,0,100,0,0,67498,0,113069,0,'Orathiss to Player'),(107959,1,0,'Come, my children! Feast on their bones!',12,0,100,0,0,67494,0,118589,0,'Orathiss to Player'),(107959,2,0,'Grr... Persistent vermin...',12,0,100,0,0,67500,0,113076,0,'Orathiss to Player'),(107959,3,0,'The arcan\'dor will live again! With its power, we shall return to the surface!',12,0,100,0,0,67493,0,118590,0,'Orathiss'),(107959,4,0,'Nothing escapes from my web!',12,0,100,0,0,67495,0,118591,0,'Orathiss to Player'),(107959,5,0,'Hgnh... my prize... it grows heavy...',12,0,100,0,0,67496,0,118592,0,'Orathiss to Player'),(108008,0,0,'There she is!',12,0,100,0,0,67499,0,113189,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(108008,1,0,'She must not open the seed!',12,0,100,0,0,67501,0,113190,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(108008,2,0,'This passage will lead us out.',12,0,100,0,0,67534,0,113652,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(108008,3,0,'Not far now.',12,0,100,0,0,67535,0,113654,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(108008,4,0,'I know you have been rebuilding the old teleporters. The beacon here will connect us to your shal\'dorei friends.',12,0,100,0,0,67536,0,113655,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(111621,0,0,'Our magic will break you!',12,0,100,0,0,66022,0,116704,0,'Duskwatch Executor to Player'),(114357,0,0,'Get away from there!',14,0,100,0,0,67233,0,116446,0,'Anarys Lunastre to Player'),(114357,1,0,'You have come to help Ly\'leth destroy our family! Be gone!',14,0,100,397,0,67234,0,116445,0,'Anarys Lunastre to Player'),(114357,2,0,'Ngh! Who ARE you?!',12,0,100,0,0,67235,0,116444,0,'Anarys Lunastre to Player'),(114357,3,0,'She wants to preach her traitorous ideals to me further? Fine. Let us go.',12,0,100,0,0,67236,0,116442,0,'Anarys Lunastre to Player'),(114357,4,0,'Hmph... Someone will notice I am missing! They will come looking for me!',12,0,100,0,0,67237,0,116441,0,'Anarys Lunastre to Player'),(115279,0,0,'Is it true? We can be free of the Nightwell?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,123650,0,'Shal\'dorei Insurgent to Player'),(116206,0,0,'My life for the Legion.',12,0,100,0,0,55364,0,98760,0,'Felsoul Wrathguard to Player'),(99070,1,0,'For the Tidemistress...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105279,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99070,2,0,'Black abyss...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105283,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99070,3,0,'The Sashj\'tar will stand victoriousss.',12,0,100,61,0,0,0,104964,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99070,4,0,'The sea callsss me home...',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,105281,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99070,5,0,'The Tidemistress will stain Jandvik with vrykul blood.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104965,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99070,6,0,'You cannot stop usss!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105276,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99070,7,0,'I will gut you like a fish.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,105274,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99070,8,0,'Death to our enemiesss!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105277,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99070,9,0,'Sashj\'tar do not take prisonersss.',12,0,100,15,0,68513,0,104961,0,'Sashj\'tar Reef Runner to Player'),(99075,0,0,'The Sashj\'tar will wash over Jandvik like the tide upon the ssshore.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104971,0,'Sashj\'tar Stormcaller to Player'),(99075,1,0,'I will ssslay you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104960,0,'Sashj\'tar Stormcaller to Player'),(99075,2,0,'Jandvik will fall to the Sashj\'tar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104963,0,'Sashj\'tar Stormcaller to Player'),(99075,3,0,'Sashj\'tar do not take prisoners.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104967,0,'Sashj\'tar Stormcaller to Player'),(99304,0,0,'I honor the Tidemistress.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104986,0,'Trenchwalker Scavenger to Player'),(99304,1,0,'I return to the sea...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104988,0,'Trenchwalker Scavenger to Player'),(99544,0,0,'Find wood to construct a pyre. I will take care of moving his body.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105974,0,'Brandolf to Player'),(99562,0,0,'I see that you are no ally to these naga, $r! Get me out of this cage!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105168,0,'Katarine to Player'),(99562,1,0,'I must find Jarl Throndyr!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105169,0,'Katarine to Player'),(99563,0,0,'Why did you kick me, you mongrel of Fenrir?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,101718,0,'Fjolrik to Player'),(99563,1,0,'You are no naga! Where is Brandolf?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105170,0,'Fjolrik to Player'),(99564,0,0,'Come closer if you want to die, naga!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,101365,0,'Stokalfr to Player'),(99564,1,0,'Brandolf\'s alive! I must go to him!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105171,0,'Stokalfr to Player'),(99770,2,0,'You cannot stop the Tidemistresss...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105815,0,'Sashj\'tar Deep Witch to Player'),(99770,3,0,'I will ssslay you in the name of the Tidemistress!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105805,0,'Sashj\'tar Deep Witch to Player'),(99825,0,0,'They were going to eat me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106019,0,'Captured Vrykul to Player'),(99825,1,0,'I despise the sea!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106015,0,'Captured Vrykul to Player'),(99825,2,0,'Gratitude stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106014,0,'Captured Vrykul to Player'),(99948,0,0,'Kinsmen of Jandvik! Calder and Eynar have fallen in combat. They were not worthy to lead Jandvik.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,104569,0,'Toryl to Player'),(99948,1,0,'As the last remaining successor, it falls on me to lead our people against the invading Sashj\'tar naga!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,104570,0,'Toryl to Player'),(99948,2,0,'This outsider is under my aegis. Those that show aggression against $ghim:her; will answer to me.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,104571,0,'Toryl to Player'),(99948,3,0,'Without me, Jandvik will stand no chance in this battle. Come quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105994,0,'Toryl to Player'),(100777,0,0,'Nighteyes hoots at you in a grateful tone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,103174,0,'Nighteyes to Player'),(100864,0,0,'Vile... ssslime...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105883,0,'Cora\'kar to Player'),(100888,0,0,'By my blade!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,105245,0,'Jandvik Splintershield to Player'),(100888,1,0,'By your hand, I meet my end...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105250,0,'Jandvik Splintershield to Player'),(100888,2,0,'$R are not welcome here!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,104830,0,'Jandvik Splintershield to Player'),(100888,3,0,'Val\'kyr take me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104831,0,'Jandvik Splintershield to Player'),(100889,0,0,'I will cast you down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104835,0,'Jandvik Runecaller to Player'),(100889,1,0,'Judgment awaits...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105252,0,'Jandvik Runecaller to Player'),(100949,0,0,'The sssilence of the deep...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105280,0,'Sashj\'tar Lancer to Player'),(101765,0,0,'There!',12,0,100,0,0,66358,0,129805,0,'Syrana Starweaver to Player'),(101765,1,0,'Lothrius\' magic called to me. He must still be alive! Quickly- you can help us rejoin the others.',12,0,100,0,0,66359,0,109666,0,'Syrana Starweaver to Player'),(101765,2,0,'We will move when the way is clear. Your bravery is worth more than you know, friend.',12,0,100,0,0,66357,0,109667,0,'Syrana Starweaver to Player'),(101765,3,0,'It is Nightborne magic... but it called to us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,120199,0,'Syrana Starweaver to Player'),(101766,0,0,'Thank you for that welcome distraction.',12,0,100,2,0,66367,0,108941,0,'Thalrenus Rivertree to Player'),(101766,1,0,'I will take this opportunity to lay traps for the intruders. I am certain we will meet again!',12,0,100,2,0,66367,0,117046,0,'Thalrenus Rivertree to Player'),(101766,2,0,'We meet again! Lothrius and Syrana have just informed me of your deeds.',12,0,100,1,0,66387,0,117107,0,'Thalrenus Rivertree to Player'),(101766,3,0,'They will be upon us shortly. I can teleport us somewhere safe.',12,0,100,1,0,66388,0,117145,0,'Thalrenus Rivertree to Player'),(101766,4,0,'Here we go!',12,0,100,603,0,66389,0,118556,0,'Thalrenus Rivertree to Player'),(101766,5,0,'I detected a strange signal coming from this place.',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,120198,0,'Thalrenus Rivertree to Player'),(101767,0,0,'I didn\'t make it in time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105980,0,'Lyrea Windfeather to Player'),(101767,1,0,'Do not come back for us. We are already doomed by the Nightborne\'s betrayal.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,109645,0,'Lyrea Windfeather to Player'),(101768,0,0,'Sometimes I forget how talented Serena is. Welcome, as it were. It is high time we dealt with these intruders.',12,0,100,603,0,68991,0,109661,0,'Lothrius Mooncaller to Player'),(101768,1,0,'Manafiend!',12,0,100,0,0,66255,0,117035,0,'Lothrius Mooncaller to Imperial Spellbreaker'),(101768,2,0,'Be wary, my friend- their constructs do not seem at all effected by my runes.',12,0,100,1,0,68992,0,109405,0,'Lothrius Mooncaller to Player'),(101768,3,0,'You found them! I will have them properly preserved and sent somewhere safe immediately.',12,0,100,603,0,66257,0,117056,0,'Lothrius Mooncaller to Player'),(101768,4,0,'I have laid out a safe path for you. Touching the crystals will summon my guardians to you. Make good use of it and go swiftly!',12,0,100,603,0,66264,0,109664,0,'Lothrius Mooncaller to Player'),(101768,5,0,'We have also decided that it is time to leave this place.',12,0,100,1,0,66386,0,117109,0,'Lothrius Mooncaller to Player'),(101768,6,0,'Come. I see an opening in the rock.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,120200,0,'Lothrius Mooncaller to Player'),(101783,0,0,'Arash-falas...',12,0,100,0,0,66018,0,116791,0,'Nightborne Siegecaster to Player'),(101783,1,0,'The shal\'dorei will