. We were separated in the attack- I think he is still holding out at the Athenaeum.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,109650,0,'Serena Windfeather to Player'),(102425,2,0,'Thanks for everything, Beakbuck. I hope we meet again.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,109149,0,'Serena Windfeather to Player'),(102425,3,0,'Don\'t worry about me. Just focus on finding Lothrius.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,109150,0,'Serena Windfeather to Player'),(102426,0,0,'Beakbuck turns and charges toward you!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,109647,0,'Beakbuck to Player'),(102527,0,0,'Watch out! This is an imposter!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,105468,0,'Toryl to Player'),(102527,1,0,'Jandvik will never fall to your vile naga! Never!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,105469,0,'Toryl to Player'),(102527,2,0,'Get me out of this cage!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,105389,0,'Toryl to Player'),(102685,0,0,'I smash you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105056,0,'Sashj\'tar Overseer to Player'),(102685,1,0,'Little pest.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105358,0,'Sashj\'tar Overseer to Player'),(102685,2,0,'Little weakling...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105066,0,'Sashj\'tar Overseer to Player'),(102685,3,0,'Sashj\'tar survive...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105364,0,'Sashj\'tar Overseer to Player'),(102738,0,0,'Beaten... by a weakling... like you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104678,0,'Calder to Player'),(102739,0,0,'A puny outsider challenges me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104898,0,'Eynar to Player'),(102739,1,0,'I will see you... in Helheim...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104679,0,'Eynar to Player'),(102796,0,0,'Tidemistress... I have failed you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105344,0,'Siren Naz\'jul to Player'),(102828,0,0,'Tidemistress...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105062,0,'Sashj\'tar Sandcrusher to Player'),(102828,1,0,'Sashj\'tar destroy you!',12,0,100,0,0,68512,0,105060,0,'Sashj\'tar Sandcrusher to Finna Bjornsdottir'),(102828,2,0,'Too... strong...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105367,0,'Sashj\'tar Sandcrusher to Player'),(102840,0,0,'We have uninvited guestsss.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105270,0,'Commander Raz\'jira to Player'),(102840,1,0,'Jandvik will be oursss...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105271,0,'Comm