 are safe and the seawarden is dead. I will return to Jandvik now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106960,0,'Brytag to Player'),(104454,0,0,'You... useless... worm food...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104987,0,'Trenchwalker Guardian to Player'),(104459,0,0,'Forgalash... I was not... strong enough...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104989,0,'Seawarden Largush to Player'),(104586,0,0,'Slay them all... for Jandvik...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,107060,0,'Fjolrik to Player'),(104630,0,0,'Find Brytag... kill the naga...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,107146,0,'Kell to Player'),(105956,0,0,'Who goes there?',12,0,100,0,0,66421,0,108940,0,'Nightborne Eradicator to Player'),(106095,0,0,'Over here! I haven\'t much time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,109029,0,'Ivanel Meadowsong to Player'),(106095,1,0,'Ivanel Meadowsong reaches out toward the nearby hippogryph and weakly tries to shoo it away.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,109642,0,'Ivanel Meadowsong to Player'),(106095,2,0,'Go on, fly away!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,109643,0,'Ivanel Meadowsong to Player'),(106616,0,0,'Hearts are full of pity...',12,0,100,18,0,65979,0,112859,0,'Nightborne Child'),(106616,1,0,'Crashing! Clashing!',12,0,100,18,0,65978,0,112860,0,'Nightborne Child'),(106616,2,0,'Crashing! Clashing!',12,0,100,1,0,65978,0,112860,0,'Nightborne Child'),(106617,0,0,'Outside lies doom.',12,0,100,0,0,65777,0,112861,0,'Nightborne Child'),(106617,1,0,'Ring around the city...',12,0,100,0,0,65778,0,112858,0,'Nightborne Child'),(106617,2,0,'No fair, I never get to be the Grand Magistrix!',12,0,100,0,0,65771,0,112863,0,'Nightborne Child'),(106897,0,0,'I believe our wounds have healed enough. I will continue my scouting. Be well, Lilryia.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122610,0,'Nighteyes to Player'),(107225,0,0,'I see! You are the one I was waiting for. All I need is a full boat and I\'ll be on my way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,111360,0,'Deline to Player'),(107225,1,0,'Ah! This cask contains a large amount of arcwine. Go ahead and put it into the gondola.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,111356,0,'Deline to Player'),(107318,0,0,'Keep it down, brats. You will join the others soon.',12,0,100,0,0,66315,0,115406,0,'Guard Morgaine to Player'),(107598,0,0,'Of course. I agree that this whole business is... distasteful. Even still, the sort of influence you would have...',12,0,100,1,0,67586,0,116280,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(107598,1,0,'It is not much, but please take it.',12,0,100,1,0,67581,0,113199,0,'Vanthir to Shal\'dorei Civilian'),(107601,0,0,'The Afflicted Nightborne Citizen shivers violently while staring blankly into the distance.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114128,0,'Afflicted Citizen to Player'),(107603,0,0,'I\'m starving!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114601,0,'Shal\'dorei Civilian to Vineyard Enforcer'),(107603,2,0,'My daughter is dying! Please, you must help me save her!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114607,0,'Shal\'dorei Civilian to Vineyard Enforcer'),(107603,1,0,'I am shal\'dorei! I will not be denied!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114780,0,'Shal\'dorei Civilian to Player'),(107604,0,0,'S-soon, little one. Soon,  I promise.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114127,0,'Afflicted Citizen to Player'),(107604,1,0,'Is the shipment in? Please tell me there is more... please...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114136,0,'Afflicted Citizen to Player'),(107606,0,0,'Father, I\'m thirsty... can I have some mana juice?',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,114126,0,'Nightborne Child to Player'),(107712,0,0,'Oh where could she have gone...',12,0,100,0,0,66374,0,113899,0,'Verene to Player'),(107712,1,0,'Do you think Korine could be with the other children?',12,0,100,0,0,66377,0,113185,0,'Verene to Player'),(107712,2,0,'Oh my sweet little girl! Are you hurt? Were they mean to you?',12,0,100,0,0,66378,0,113268,0,'Verene to Player'),(107712,3,0,'You\'re home now. Thank goodness.',12,0,100,0,0,66379,0,113271,0,'Verene to Player'),(107712,4,0,'Thank -you-. I cannot begin to express my gratitude.',12,0,100,0,0,66376,0,114305,0,'Verene to Player'),(107997,0,0,'Let me see...',12,0,100,0,0,67572,0,113182,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(107997,1,0,'Silgryn quickly shuffles through the stack of letters.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113183,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(107997,2,0,'Hm. They\'ve been rounding up a lot of people lately. Children, too.',12,0,100,0,0,67573,0,113184,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(107997,3,0,'Very possible. I\'ll have our friend here follow a guard in and find out.',12,0,100,0,0,67574,0,113186,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(108063,0,0,'Mommy!',12,0,100,0,0,66227,0,113824,0,'Korine to Player'),(108063,1,0,'They yelled and put me in a cage! I missed you...',12,0,100,0,0,66251,0,113269,0,'Korine to Player'),(108068,0,0,'I did not know if I would make it out of this alive. Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114054,0,'Accused Suramar Citizen to Player'),(108075,0,0,'I want my mommy...',12,0,100,0,0,66239,0,113217,0,'Korine to Player'),(108075,1,0,'AH! NO!',12,0,100,0,0,66240,0,113218,0,'Korine to Player'),(108075,2,0,'Waaaah!',12,0,100,0,0,66241,0,113219,0,'Korine to Player'),(108075,3,0,'.... Waaaaah!!',12,0,100,0,0,66250,0,113246,0,'Korine to Player'),(108075,4,0,'I... *sniff* I know this street, maybe.',12,0,100,0,0,66242,0,113220,0,'Korine to Player'),(108075,5,0,'Uh... yeah... YEAH! That\'s Vanthir\'s house!',12,0,100,0,0,66243,0,113221,0,'Korine to Player'),(108075,6,0,'Bye!',12,0,100,0,0,66244,0,116983,0,'Korine to Player'),(108096,0,0,'After her!',12,0,100,463,0,66319,0,113257,0,'Duskwatch Scion to Player'),(108344,0,0,'He found more?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113848,0,'Donatien to Player'),(108344,1,0,'Donatien takes a quick draught of the mana-wine.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113851,0,'Donatien to Player'),(108345,0,0,'W-what?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113839,0,'Clotaire to Player'),(108345,1,0,'Clotaire tentatively sips at the wine, then takes a deep gulp.',16,0,100,0,0,65974,0,113841,0,'Clotaire to Player'),(108346,0,0,'But you need...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113820,0,'Lunette to Player'),(108346,1,0,'Lunette nods and takes a drink.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113822,0,'Lunette to Player'),(108347,0,0,'Nightwell be praised... I thought I was going to die.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113831,0,'Ambrena to Player'),(108347,1,0,'Ambrena shakily takes a drink.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,113836,0,'Ambrena to Player'),(108385,0,0,'Much better. Thank you. Thank you so much.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113823,0,'Lunette to Player'),(108386,0,0,'It isn\'t far. Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113834,0,'Ambrena to Player'),(108387,0,0,'Vanthir came through again... how can he keep this up?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113852,0,'Donatien to Player'),(108388,0,0,'Hush you... Thank Vanthir for me, won\'t you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113843,0,'Clotaire to Player'),(108411,0,0,'They are waiting for you in the tavern.',12,0,100,0,0,67575,0,116279,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(108411,1,0,'Try to relax, friend. We will find her.',12,0,100,0,0,67569,0,113900,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(108807,0,0,'Take a drink, darling. You will feel better.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113818,0,'Eneas to Player'),(108807,1,0,'We will survive until tomorrow. Vanthir always takes care of us. You know that.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113821,0,'Eneas to Player'),(108808,0,0,'Get up...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113817,0,'Brigitte to Player'),(108810,0,0,'I will get her home. It is nice to know Vanthir still thinks of us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113832,0,'Chloe to Player'),(108811,0,0,'It is Arcwine. For you. Go on, brother.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113840,0,'Audric to Player'),(108811,1,0,'Hah. Not so fast! You may choke.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113842,0,'Audric to Player'),(108812,0,0,'Yes! Plenty for both of us today.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113849,0,'Iseult to Player'),(109409,0,0,'So generous! Thank you, I owe you my life!',12,0,100,7,0,0,0,115295,0,'Nightborne Wretch to Player'),(109473,0,0,'Who goes there?!',12,0,100,0,0,66005,0,118520,0,'Duskwatch Shroud to Player'),(111318,0,0,'I was so certain he was dead...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119885,0,'Noressa to Player'),(111318,1,0,'Noressa quickly glances over the letter.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,119886,0,'Noressa to Player'),(111318,2,0,'Oh, Absolon...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119887,0,'Noressa to Player'),(111318,3,0,'Thank you. I will hold his words in my heart.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119891,0,'Noressa to Player'),(111530,0,0,'Hah! Where are your manafiends now?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122538,0,'Imperial Arcanist to Player'),(111530,1,0,'What?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,120909,0,'Imperial Arcanist to Player'),(111539,0,0,'I will join my fallen brothers and sisters. Goodbye, Lyrea.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,120114,0,'Kailea Windfeather to Player'),(111619,0,0,'Dissent is forbidden, by order of Grand Magistrix Elisande!',12,0,100,0,0,66005,0,124226,0,'Duskwatch Shroud'),(111619,1,0,'Something\'s not quite right...',12,0,100,0,0,65803,0,124630,0,'Duskwatch Shroud to Player'),(111774,0,0,'Val\'kyr!  The Call has gone out!  Prepare yourselves!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,122615,0,'Matilda Skoptidottir to Player'),(111871,0,0,'Inconceivable...',12,0,100,0,0,65808,0,116788,0,'Ley Line Researcher to Player'),(111871,1,0,'Tor\'theras falar!',12,0,100,432,0,65809,0,116780,0,'Ley Line Researcher to Player'),(111872,0,0,'No! It is not my time....',12,0,100,0,0,66015,0,116778,0,'Leyline Researcher to Player'),(111900,0,0,'I will follow you through. Thank you for allowing me to accompany you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121191,0,'Rosaine to Player'),(112301,0,0,'I fear nothing!',12,0,100,0,0,68513,0,117446,0,'Finna Bjornsdottir to Player'),(112301,1,0,'I will crush you!',12,0,100,0,0,68464,0,104829,0,'Finna Bjornsdottir to Player'),(112301,2,0,'This should be good!',12,0,100,0,0,68512,0,117445,0,'Finna Bjornsdottir to Player'),(113597,0,0,'The shal\'dorei are... chosen...',12,0,100,0,0,65697,0,116624,0,'Duskwatch Adjudicator to Player'),(113679,0,0,'We will cleanse the universe in fire.',12,0,100,0,0,55370,0,98766,0,'Wrathguard Soulsplitter to Player'),(113679,1,0,'This is where you die.',12,0,100,0,0,55362,0,98765,0,'Wrathguard Soulsplitter to Player'),(113738,0,0,'An illusion! What are you hiding?',12,0,100,0,0,65819,0,124629,0,'Duskwatch Moonmage to Player'),(113777,0,0,'My spear is yours.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,122617,0,'Val\'kyr of Odyn to Player'),(113793,0,0,'They shall fear our wrath.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122620,0,'Val\'kyr of Odyn to Player'),(113794,0,0,'My life for Odyn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122619,0,'Val\'kyr of Odyn to Player'),(114470,0,0,'Confess! You are harboring traitors to Suramar!',12,0,100,0,0,65771,0,124223,0,'Duskwatch Orbitist'),(114549,0,0,'Vanthir... Vanthir!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,120312,0,'Withering Suramar Citizen to Player'),(114549,1,0,'Mind is... slipping...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,120313,0,'Withering Suramar Citizen to Player'),(114876,0,0,'You flee at the cost of your life!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124634,0,'Vengeful Wrathguard'),(114876,1,0,'Stay inside if you want to live!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124633,0,'Vengeful Wrathguard'),(115631,0,0,'Hurry! We\'re not safe here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124196,0,'Desperate Refugee to Player'),(115631,1,0,'I am safe... thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124195,0,'Desperate Refugee'),(115697,0,0,'There are demons everywhere...',12,0,100,0,0,55370,0,124198,0,'Desperate Refugee to Player'),(115697,1,0,'This city has devolved to madness...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124194,0,'Desperate Refugee'),(115703,0,0,'We... we were almost killed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124193,0,'Desperate Refugee'),(117412,0,0,'This cannot be...',12,0,100,0,0,65692,0,116434,0,'Felborne Trapper to Player'),(97729,3,0,'Desecrator...',12,0,100,0,0,66045,0,102387,0,'Disturbed Apparition to Player'),(97750,0,0,'My mind is... cleared. I will sleep now. Give Thaedris my love.',12,0,100,0,0,65609,0,102867,0,'Latara to Player'),(98306,0,0,'Curses upon you!',12,0,100,0,0,61255,0,121847,0,'Cliffclutch Screecher to Player'),(99065,0,0,'Off with you, then. Find me some cliffthorn.',12,0,100,0,0,65625,0,100992,0,'Thaedris Feathersong to Player'),(99485,0,0,'This world will... burn...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,101128,0,'Kozak the Afflictor to Player'),(99581,0,0,'We are Legion.',12,0,100,0,0,55369,0,102139,0,'Wrathguard Fury to Player'),(99581,1,0,'Feel my wrath!',12,0,100,0,0,55368,0,102138,0,'Wrathguard Fury to Player'),(99593,0,0,'You will pay for attacking my daughters!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102857,0,'Cliffclutch Matriarch to Player'),(99593,1,0,'First the cave dwellers, now this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102861,0,'Cliffclutch Matriarch to Player'),(99762,0,0,'For the Legion!',12,0,100,0,0,55192,0,96663,0,'Legion Endbringer to Player'),(99762,1,0,'You are easily dealt with.',12,0,100,0,0,55196,0,102131,0,'Legion Endbringer to Player'),(99762,2,0,'You dare attack us here?!',12,0,100,0,0,55191,0,96662,0,'Legion Endbringer to Player'),(99851,0,0,'My glaives have gone too long without tasting demon blood...',12,0,100,0,0,67593,0,101595,0,'Lyana Darksorrow to Player'),(99851,1,0,'If you wish to find me when Grimwing is slain... follow the trail of demon corpses.',12,0,100,0,0,71821,0,105159,0,'Lyana Darksorrow to Player'),(99890,0,0,'Speak now, demon. Lead me to your master and I may let you live.',12,0,100,0,0,71820,0,105176,0,'Lyana Darksorrow to Player'),(100053,0,0,'Now that the portal has been opened, the path to Azoran is clear.',12,0,100,0,0,67601,0,105686,0,'Lyana Darksorrow to Player'),(100301,0,0,'We must leave now. Soon we will be home.',12,0,100,0,0,65731,0,102081,0,'Astoril to Player'),(100301,1,0,'Do not be afraid. Soon all will be set right.',12,0,100,0,0,65754,0,102082,0,'Astoril to Player'),(100301,2,0,'We are here.',12,0,100,0,0,65729,0,102100,0,'Astoril to Player'),(100301,3,0,'Silence. I tire of your prattling. Do not worry, it will all be over soon.',12,0,100,0,0,65730,0,102102,0,'Astoril to Player'),(100301,4,0,'FEL MASTERS, I BRING YOU YOUR FINAL SACRIFICE! Nine times nine souls I have brought you, my own kith and kin!',12,0,100,0,0,65740,0,102103,0,'Astoril to Player'),(100331,0,0,'Yes, I am ready. Let us make haste. I worry that we will be found by our enemies.',12,0,100,0,0,65932,0,102083,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(100331,1,0,'I don\'t understand. This isn\'t the city. Wher-',12,0,100,0,0,65933,0,102101,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(100595,0,0,'Begone, filthy $c! Baelbug find the glaive and keeps it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106040,0,'Baelbug to Player'),(100595,1,0,'You no take warglaive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102723,0,'Baelbug to Player'),(100779,0,0,'I thank you for giving me newfound purpose. I will meet you at Shal\'Aran. I think I will be needing a source of magic after all.',12,0,100,0,0,65622,0,103155,0,'Thaedris Feathersong to Player'),(100823,0,0,'Enter the portal and fight your way to Azoran.',12,0,100,0,0,67599,0,101993,0,'Lyana Darksorrow to Player'),(100823,1,0,'Do not worry about reinforcements. I will guard this portal with my life.',12,0,100,0,0,71817,0,105725,0,'Lyana Darksorrow to Player'),(100823,2,0,'Time is short... Go swiftly!',12,0,100,0,0,71818,0,105726,0,'Lyana Darksorrow to Player'),(100878,0,0,'The Burning Legion has been dealt a great blow this day, but our work is far from over.',12,0,100,0,0,67600,0,105972,0,'Lyana Darksorrow to Player'),(101878,0,0,'You cannot hide from me.',12,0,100,0,0,55374,0,102155,0,'Felsoul Inquisitor to Player'),(102127,0,0,'What do you think you\'re doing?',12,0,100,0,0,68252,0,119572,0,'Menagerie Keeper to Player'),(102127,1,0,'Stop that at once!',12,0,100,0,0,68251,0,119571,0,'Menagerie Keeper to Player'),(102365,0,0,'Your human friend was taken by the demons. Grant me my freedom and I will tell you where he was taken!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106088,0,'Selthaes Starsong to Player'),(102365,1,0,'Your friend was taken to the felstalker pits beneath the great Burning Legion command ship.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106191,0,'Selthaes Starsong to Player'),(102365,2,0,'Sadly, it\'s probably too late for him... don\'t foolishly throw your lives away for a dead man!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106192,0,'Selthaes Starsong to Player'),(103155,1,0,'Hmm... The main conduit beneath Suramar city pulls ten times what we have here.',12,0,100,0,0,67321,0,118619,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(103155,2,0,'Come with me. I\'ll show you the channel.',12,0,100,0,0,67248,0,105904,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(103437,0,0,'We gotta get to Brambley, before it\'s too late!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105916,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,1,0,'Which fist do ye want? How about both!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106072,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),(103437,2,0,'Who ordered a knuckle sandwich?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106067,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),(103437,3,0,'Och, what happened to yer face? MAH FISTS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106071,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),(103437,4,0,'Aye, let\'s get him the key... but be on your guard. This place is crawling with demons.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105917,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,5,0,'Don\'t worry, I\'ll go easy on ye!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106069,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),(103437,6,0,'Ye wanna fight, eh? I\'ll give ye a fight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106064,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),(103437,7,0,'Now, THAT\'S a face worth punching!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106068,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),(103437,8,0,'Who needs an axe when ye\'ve got fists o\' steel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106065,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),(103437,9,0,'Och! This one fell off the ugly tree an\' hit my fists on the way down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106066,0,'Angus Stormbrew'),(103437,10,0,'Look! That\'s Brambley\'s helm, I\'d recognize it anywhere!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105919,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,11,0,'Brambley! No... no it canna\' be true!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,105918,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,12,0,'Those demons musta\' ate ol\' Brambley... look at him! He\'s just bones, now!',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,105920,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,13,0,'Curses upon ye, demons! CURSES UPON YE!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,105924,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,14,0,'Don\'t worry Brambley, I\'ll carry yer wee head to safety!',12,0,100,381,0,0,0,106438,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,15,0,'Here lies his mighty arm that defended the realm in so many battles!',12,0,100,381,0,0,0,106442,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,16,0,'I\'ll take ye home Brambley! Piece by piece, I swear it!',12,0,100,381,0,0,0,106445,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,17,0,'Och, looks like the demons chewed on this one. Aye, it\'s still moist...',12,0,100,381,0,0,0,106446,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,18,0,'Good eye! That\'s his alright... I\'d know it a mile away!',12,0,100,381,0,0,0,106444,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,19,0,'It\'s Brambley\'s Dagger! We\'ll take it home an\' bury it with the rest o\' him.',12,0,100,381,0,0,0,106447,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,20,0,'I can still hear Brambley\'s voice in my head, tellin\' me to stay alive.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106514,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103437,21,0,'I will laddy! I\'ll stay alive for the both of us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106515,0,'Angus Stormbrew to Player'),(103634,0,0,'Su\'esh eyes the wounds on Graedis.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,106272,0,'Su\'esh to Graedis Oenthar'),(103634,1,0,'Su\'esh looks hungrily at Graedis.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,106273,0,'Su\'esh to Graedis Oenthar'),(103670,0,0,'Angus, I\'m alive! I\'m up here!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,106452,0,'Brambley Morrison to Player'),(103670,1,0,'It IS my voice you daft dwarf! I\'m ALIVE!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,106453,0,'Brambley Morrison to Player'),(103677,0,0,'Enough of this! To me, Su\'esh! Destroy these interlopers!',14,0,100,0,0,65641,0,106261,0,'Graedis Oenthar'),(103677,1,0,'What\'s this? Listen to me! I am the alpha!',12,0,100,0,0,65642,0,106262,0,'Graedis Oenthar to Su\'esh'),(103677,2,0,'Is that how it is? Clever girl.',12,0,100,0,0,65643,0,106263,0,'Graedis Oenthar to Su\'esh'),(104161,0,0,'We should get out of here before it\'s too late.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,123298,0,'Brambley Morrison to Player'),(105640,0,0,'The creature shakes its head, coming to its senses!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,107211,0,'Freed Goat'),(105759,2,0,'An illusion! What are you hiding?',12,0,100,0,0,66003,0,124629,0,'High Mage of the Duskwatch to Player'),(106375,0,0,'Quickly, grab them!',12,0,100,0,0,55202,0,96653,0,'Felsoul Trickster to Player'),(106375,1,0,'Help! Baddies here!',12,0,100,0,0,55202,0,96655,0,'Felsoul Trickster to Player'),(106375,2,0,'Hmm... medium or well-done?',12,0,100,0,0,55202,0,102137,0,'Felsoul Trickster to Player'),(106375,3,0,'Tasty meats for me to eats.',12,0,100,0,0,55207,0,96658,0,'Felsoul Trickster to Player'),(106375,4,0,'Hey! You\'re not supposed to be here.',12,0,100,0,0,55206,0,96657,0,'Felsoul Trickster to Player'),(107134,0,0,'Well well, the little elf returns. You are most... persistent.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,111300,0,'Projection of Aargoss to Player'),(107134,1,0,'You have fulfilled your end of the bargain. As promised, I give you a taste of the Legion\'s power. Earn more by proving your strength!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,111301,0,'Projection of Aargoss to Player'),(107481,0,0,'It will be easier for me to travel on the road.',12,0,100,0,0,65938,0,116542,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(107481,1,0,'You must protect me!',12,0,100,0,0,66396,0,118677,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(107481,2,0,'Look at them... they are not even people any more. I cannot turn into one of them. We must reach Astoril quickly. Clear the path faster!',12,0,100,0,0,65951,0,104334,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(107481,3,0,'We must hurry.',12,0,100,0,0,66391,0,118672,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(107481,4,0,'I am too weak to defend myself. Help!',12,0,100,0,0,66393,0,118674,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(107481,5,0,'More exiles... like me. All I did was punish those servants... You would have done the same!',12,0,100,0,0,65931,0,104335,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(107481,6,0,'You must be Astoril! Finally! The first thing I shall do when I get back in the city is drink a cool, tall glass of arcwine.',12,0,100,0,0,65934,0,104336,0,'Iadreth to Player'),(107603,3,0,'Please help me... please...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114606,0,'Shal\'dorei Civilian to Vineyard Enforcer'),(108190,0,0,'Your death is certain!',12,0,100,0,0,65904,0,116682,0,'Magisterial Sleuth to Player'),(108870,0,0,'Oh no...',12,0,100,0,0,66343,0,115290,0,'Sylverin to Player'),(108871,0,0,'I shall dispose of you, lowborn!',12,0,100,0,0,66024,0,116678,0,'Vineyard Warden to Player'),(108872,0,0,'Margaux glances to each side, silently assessing the situation.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,114972,0,'Margaux to Player'),(108872,1,0,'A tour? Of course! I will show you the grounds myself.',12,0,100,0,0,66287,0,114973,0,'Margaux to Player'),(108872,2,0,'The courtyard you just left is open to visitors. From here forward, one of my staff must accompany you.',12,0,100,0,0,66288,0,114978,0,'Margaux to Player'),(108872,3,0,'You can purchase souvenirs and gifts from Sylverin, my assistant. Perhaps you could do that on your way out?',12,0,100,0,0,66289,0,114979,0,'Margaux to Player'),(108872,4,0,'This is our tasting pavilion. We serve only the finest varietals here - many of them enjoyed in the palace!',12,0,100,0,0,66290,0,114980,0,'Margaux to Player'),(108872,5,0,'Feel free to try the samples we have available today. We will continue the tour when you are finished.',12,0,100,0,0,66291,0,114982,0,'Margaux to Player'),(108875,0,0,'The Vineyards are open to special guests only. You must leave immediately.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114600,0,'Vineyard Enforcer'),(108875,1,0,'You are not authorized to enter the Vineyard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114598,0,'Vineyard Enforcer'),(108875,2,0,'Stand back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114763,0,'Vineyard Enforcer to Shal\'dorei Civilian'),(108875,3,0,'Very good.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121508,0,'Vineyard Enforcer to Vineyard Laborer'),(108875,4,0,'You there! Back to work!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,115111,0,'Vineyard Enforcer to Player'),(108875,5,0,'I will hear none of your excuses. Back to work!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,115113,0,'Vineyard Enforcer to Player'),(108875,6,0,'The Overseer will hear of this. Mark my words, Margaux.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,115115,0,'Vineyard Enforcer to Player'),(108877,0,0,'This is a heavy blend of barely-ripe shadowberry and manafruit, triple infused with Nightwell essence. It is best appreciated in small sips.',12,0,100,0,0,66178,0,114934,0,'Sacheverell Leburque to Player'),(108877,1,0,'This three year Infusion incorporates delightful berry elements with a scintillating melon bouquet. Refreshing, yes?',12,0,100,0,0,66176,0,114932,0,'Sacheverell Leburque to Player'),(108877,2,0,'Ah, this is a fine vintage. Seventh generation manafruit entangled with slippery nightsap flavors and a delicate walnut finish.',12,0,100,0,0,66177,0,114933,0,'Sacheverell Leburque to Player'),(108931,0,0,'I was just resting. I-',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,115112,0,'Vineyard Laborer to Player'),(108931,1,0,'Agh!',12,0,100,0,0,66279,0,115114,0,'Vineyard Laborer to Player'),(109144,0,0,'I\'ve procured a palanquin for you. Try to look imperious- it helps with the illusion.',12,0,100,0,0,67565,0,114863,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(109144,1,0,'The woman you are looking for is named Margaux. She has shown interest in our cause.',12,0,100,0,0,67566,0,114864,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(109223,0,0,'The building we approach now is called the Aging Chamber.',12,0,100,1,0,66268,0,115021,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,1,0,'If you are at all familiar with the wine crafting process, you know that it is necessary to allow the juice to ferment.',12,0,100,1,0,66271,0,115025,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,2,0,'We prefer to shorten the process using time magic. Such power is our birthright!',12,0,100,603,0,66269,0,115022,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,3,0,'To my left you will see one of our orchards.',12,0,100,1,0,66270,0,115023,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,4,0,'This one houses a species of tree that produces extra sweet fruit, which you tasted in the Infusion.',12,0,100,1,0,66272,0,115026,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,5,0,'The buildings before you house our bottling facilities.',12,0,100,1,0,66273,0,115028,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,6,0,'Each bottle is sealed with magic to prevent any of the Nightwell\'s essence from fading.',12,0,100,1,0,66274,0,115029,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,7,0,'A cask of arcwine from our vineyard can be safely stored for hundreds of years!',12,0,100,603,0,66275,0,115030,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,8,0,'Ahead you will see our distribution facility.',12,0,100,1,0,66276,0,115031,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,9,0,'Here we arrange to send hundreds of barrels and casks of arcwine out to the city.',12,0,100,1,0,66277,0,115032,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,10,0,'The Magistrix monitors these activities very-',12,0,100,1,0,66278,0,115033,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,11,0,'Don\'t hurt him!',12,0,100,603,0,66279,0,115034,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,12,0,'I am so sorry- please forgive this mistake. I will personally ensure it does not happen again.',12,0,100,20,0,66280,0,115035,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,13,0,'Where were we?',12,0,100,6,0,66281,0,115036,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,14,0,'Across this bridge is the most crucial part of our winemaking process.',12,0,100,1,0,66282,0,115038,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,15,0,'It is here that we instill our wine with Nightwell essence, which gives it the restorative properties our people enjoy.',12,0,100,1,0,66283,0,115039,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,16,0,'And this is where I leave you. I must prepare the next activity.',12,0,100,1,0,66284,0,115040,0,'Margaux to Player'),(109223,17,0,'I will meet you at the next station. My assistant Sylverin will be happy to show you how the infusion process works.',12,0,100,273,0,66285,0,115042,0,'Margaux to Player'),(110931,0,0,'Come to Furog, tiny elf-monsters!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119271,0,'Furog the Elfbreaker'),(110931,1,0,'I break your elf-thing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119284,0,'Furog the Elfbreaker to Withered Exile'),(110955,0,0,'Die, beast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119459,0,'Hulking Shocktrooper to Su\'esh'),(111002,0,0,'The enemy may be using magic to deceive us! Do not let your guard down!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,119473,0,'Doombringer Sinarus'),(111002,1,0,'Move quickly, and crush any who resist the Legion!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,119469,0,'Doombringer Sinarus'),(111013,0,0,'Kill it! Kill it now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119462,0,'Felsoul Champion to Su\'esh'),(111013,1,0,'Fools! Su\'esh has escaped the menagerie!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119461,0,'Felsoul Champion to Su\'esh'),(111013,2,0,'Su\'esh is loose! To arms!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119460,0,'Felsoul Champion to Su\'esh'),(112055,0,0,'Take your place near the table. Once we begin, it is important that we keep up the pace. These delicate ingredients spoil quickly.',12,0,100,1,0,66296,0,115231,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,1,0,'The juices need a little massaging- step into the vat and jump to squish the mixture around!',12,0,100,25,0,66303,0,115242,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,2,0,'The arcwine has soured... you must start over!',42,0,100,0,0,66293,0,123135,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,3,0,'Are you certain you are ready to participate? This batch will have to be destroyed.',12,0,100,0,0,66293,0,115228,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,4,0,'I feel as though you are losing focus. Is something else on your mind? Step back for a moment and we will try again.',12,0,100,0,0,66294,0,115229,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,5,0,'Well done. Now let me see...',12,0,100,1,0,66298,0,115236,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,6,0,'Let us add a little moisture. Just enough to keep the taps flowing.',12,0,100,0,0,66301,0,115240,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,7,0,'Exactly what it needed. But there is still something missing...',12,0,100,0,0,66299,0,115238,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,8,0,'You, my friend, are a natural. The blend needs something more, though. Let me think...',12,0,100,0,0,66297,0,115237,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,9,0,'Ah! It needs something floral, to add a little brightness.',12,0,100,0,0,66300,0,115239,0,'Margaux to Player'),(112055,10,0,'Excellent! You did very well- are you certain you have never made wine before? I will have this bottled immediately.',12,0,100,1,0,66297,0,115230,0,'Margaux to Player'),(113573,0,0,'Grawk... the Mother will get you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102726,0,'Cliffclutch Thornwitch to Player'),(114926,0,0,'HALT. Inspection required.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119793,0,'Arcane Sentinel to Player'),(114998,0,0,'Let there be no slack in their chains!',14,0,100,0,0,53329,0,123540,0,'Aargoss'),(115691,0,0,'Your death is fated!',12,0,100,0,0,65814,0,116703,0,'Felborne Magus to Player'),(115691,1,0,'I shall dispose of you, lowborn!',12,0,100,0,0,66024,0,116692,0,'Felborne Magus to Player'),(116050,0,0,'The shal\'dorei will rule this world!',12,0,100,0,0,66019,0,116430,0,'Duskwatch Conjurer to Player'),(98208,2,0,'I have not survived for ten thousand years just to fall to a swarm of rats.',14,0,100,0,0,58646,0,0,0,'VANDROS - AGGRO'),(98208,3,0,'Have you vermin ever witnessed such raw power? I think not.',14,0,100,0,0,58639,0,0,0,'VANDROS - CHRONO_SHARDS'),(98208,4,0,'I am a conduit of the Nightwell\'s glorious power! I am NIGHTBORNE!',14,0,100,0,0,58638,0,0,0,'VANDROS - BANISH_IN_TIME'),(98206,0,0,'Form up, maggots! Secure the breach until we receive orders from Gul\'dan!',14,0,100,0,0,58644,0,0,0,'XAKAL - INTRO'),(98206,1,0,'Good! Some entertainment! I was getting restless!',14,0,100,0,0,58645,0,0,0,'XAKAL - AGGRO'),(98206,2,0,'All who rise against the Legion are doomed!',14,0,100,0,0,58646,0,0,0,'XAKAL - FEL_FISSURE'),(98203,0,0,'Stay back! It\'s mine!',14,0,100,0,0,58644,0,0,0,'IVANYR - INTRO'),(98206,3,0,'All in my shadow will crumble and fall!',14,0,100,0,0,58639,0,0,0,'XAKAL - SHADOW_SLASH'),(98203,1,0,'Thieves! The mana is MINE! ',14,0,100,0,0,58645,0,0,0,'IVANYR - AGGRO'),(98203,2,0,'Go away!',14,0,100,0,0,58646,0,0,0,'IVANYR - VOLATILE_MAGIC'),(98548,1,0,'Now this is important - once that manastorm gets going, there will be too much interference for me to teleport anyone. You must get out before the storm!',12,0,100,5,0,67334,0,118647,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(98548,2,0,'Alright everybody, gather in close. Do not be shy now. Group hug.',12,0,100,0,0,67337,0,118644,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(98548,3,0,'Ahh, thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,71457,0,121587,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(104615,0,0,'Lemme hear your bones crunch!',12,0,100,0,0,54860,0,96412,0,'Greystone Flanker to Player'),(103155,3,0,'You don\'t seem to know how to handle ley line energy?',12,0,100,0,0,67249,0,105906,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(103155,4,0,'Let me teach you the basics of this art.',12,0,100,0,0,67250,0,105907,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(103769,0,0,'The Nightmare has corrupted dragons, gods, and legends. Your downfall will be simple and swift!',14,0,100,0,0,58726,0,109326,0,'Xavius'),(103769,1,0,'I\'ll slice into the heart of you!',14,0,100,0,0,58737,0,109348,0,'Xavius to Player'),(103769,2,0,'Time to crush your dreams!',14,0,100,0,0,58751,0,109353,0,'Xavius'),(103769,3,0,'Nightmares are... never... forgotten...',14,0,100,0,0,58736,0,109347,0,'Xavius to Player'),(104245,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bell_01:20|tAn alarm has been sounded! A reinforcement has entered the fray!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,109270,0,'Arcane Beacon to Duskwatch Sentry'),(104278,2,0,'The Emissary must be notified!',14,0,100,0,0,71112,0,109579,0,'Felbound Enforcer to Player'),(104695,1,0,'%s runs away in terror!',16,0,100,11,0,0,0,121586,0,'Suramar Merchant'),(104696,1,0,'How did you get in here?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121051,0,'Suramar Civilian'),(105759,3,0,'None may challenge us!',12,0,100,0,0,66026,0,116701,0,'High Mage of the Duskwatch to Player'),(108930,0,0,'Legion, come to our aid!',12,0,100,0,0,65978,0,114783,0,'Nightborne Envoy'),(107126,4,0,'Alien, talk to Valtrua soon!',12,0,100,0,0,67313,0,118611,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(107126,5,0,'As I was afraid, the lasso is in trouble.',12,0,100,0,0,66368,0,114957,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(107126,6,0,'Meet at the temple of Fal\'adora. To save the future, you need to understand the past.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,118552,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(107253,0,0,'You\'ll find Lorin in the square. Sylessa frequents the canals. Just search the bazaar for Cyrille. They\'ll catch your eye.',12,0,100,0,0,66207,0,117194,0,'Arluin to Player'),(107253,1,0,'Is that what she\'s up to? Brave girl. I\'d be delighted to help, but...',12,0,100,0,0,68043,0,119243,0,'Arluin to Player'),(107253,2,0,'Always a pleasure. Do things my way and she\'ll be advisor before dinner.',12,0,100,0,0,66192,0,116295,0,'Arluin to Player'),(107253,3,0,'Arluin beckons you over.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,121788,0,'Arluin to Player'),(107253,4,0,'I... will go home. I have no business among such esteemed individuals.',12,0,100,1,0,66188,0,116511,0,'Arluin to Player'),(107253,5,0,'I accept your gratitude, by the way!',12,0,100,603,0,66189,0,116512,0,'Arluin to Player'),(107333,0,0,'Intruder! Face my blade!',12,0,100,0,0,69824,0,115553,0,'Overseer Durant'),(107333,1,0,'She sealed her fate, as you have sealed yours!',12,0,100,0,0,69825,0,115554,0,'Overseer Durant'),(107333,2,0,'You cannot defy me!',12,0,100,0,0,69827,0,115597,0,'Overseer Durant'),(107333,3,0,'Elisande will have your heads for this!',12,0,100,0,0,69828,0,115598,0,'Overseer Durant'),(107333,4,0,'T-traitors...',12,0,100,0,0,69829,0,111870,0,'Overseer Durant to Player'),(107342,0,0,'You will bow to us!',12,0,100,0,0,65667,0,116700,0,'Duskwatch Spell-Fencer to Player'),(107348,0,0,'Understood.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,132592,0,'Sylessa to Player'),(107349,0,0,'Very well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114217,0,'Lorin to Player'),(107350,0,0,'Say no more.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,111644,0,'Cyrille to Player'),(107350,1,0,'Vengeance for Margaux!',12,0,100,0,0,69825,0,115599,0,'Cyrille to Overseer Durant'),(107350,2,0,'I can see why Arluin put his faith in you. Give him our regards.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,111927,0,'Cyrille to Player'),(107350,3,0,'Cyrille places a Dusk Lily atop Overseer Durant\'s corpse.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,120682,0,'Cyrille to Player'),(107632,0,0,'There is a reason we live on the opposite side of the city, my friend.',12,0,100,274,0,67567,0,116281,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,1,0,'I could change much for our people... yes...',12,0,100,1,0,67568,0,116282,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,2,0,'Meet me within the Sanctum of Order. I must prepare for the ceremony.',12,0,100,1,0,68065,0,119291,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,3,0,'I humbly accept this appointment. It is an honor beyond words.',12,0,100,0,0,66267,0,116515,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,4,0,'My lord, you have lost your sense of decorum. It is already decided.',12,0,100,1,0,66265,0,116519,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,5,0,'Tal\'ashar it is. I name my friend here as my champion.',12,0,100,25,0,68147,0,119381,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,6,0,'I am modifying your disguise to allow you to fight like one of us.',15,0,100,0,0,68150,0,119388,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,7,0,'Win me a title, won\'t you?',12,0,100,1,0,68151,0,119389,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,8,0,'I wish this had not been necessary, but you have done well.',12,0,100,0,0,68152,0,119395,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(107632,9,0,'I will send you back to the tavern when you are ready.',12,0,100,0,0,68153,0,119396,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(108871,1,0,'The shal\'dorei are... chosen...',12,0,100,0,0,66014,0,116624,0,'Vineyard Warden to Player'),(108871,2,0,'The shal\'dorei will rule!',12,0,100,0,0,65801,0,116707,0,'Vineyard Warden to Player'),(109048,0,0,'To me, servant!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114785,0,'Arcane Engineer to Player'),(109461,0,0,'My hand slipped! Forgive me!',12,0,100,430,0,0,0,121692,0,'Vineyard Porter to Player'),(109461,1,0,'Flee! The Magistrix will kill us for failing her!',12,0,100,430,0,0,0,115419,0,'Vineyard Porter to Spellsinger Quiris'),(109461,2,0,'Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,115479,0,'Vineyard Porter to Spellsinger Quiris'),(109461,3,0,'Take the arcwine. I am getting out of here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,115481,0,'Vineyard Porter to Spellsinger Quiris'),(109509,0,0,'This shipment is worth more than you are! How dare you treat it so carelessly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121691,0,'Spellsinger Quiris to Player'),(109509,1,0,'You will pay for this delay!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,115487,0,'Spellsinger Quiris to Player'),(109509,2,0,'Elisande... will hear... of this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,115488,0,'Spellsinger Quiris to Player'),(109670,0,0,'Show your identification. COMPLY.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119796,0,'Chronarch Defender to Player'),(109670,1,0,'Scanning arcane essence...',12,0,100,0,0,65819,0,119797,0,'Chronarch Defender to Player'),(109670,2,0,'Stand by for screening.',12,0,100,0,0,66004,0,119794,0,'Chronarch Defender to Player'),(110354,0,0,'I will wrestle my title from your champion\'s lifeless hands, Ly\'leth!',12,0,100,0,0,66216,0,116532,0,'Coryn'),(110354,1,0,'You cannot match me! I am your better!',12,0,100,0,0,66217,0,116533,0,'Coryn'),(110354,2,0,'I will have what is owed me!',12,0,100,0,0,66220,0,116534,0,'Coryn'),(110354,3,0,'I was... framed...',12,0,100,0,0,66221,0,116535,0,'Coryn to Enhanced Illusion'),(110365,0,0,'A challenger? Don\'t make me laugh!',12,0,100,0,0,66332,0,116536,0,'Ruven'),(110365,1,0,'The Legion brings us power unending!',12,0,100,0,0,66333,0,116537,0,'Ruven'),(110365,2,0,'I will not be defeated by the likes of you!',12,0,100,0,0,66335,0,116539,0,'Ruven'),(110365,3,0,'They... promised...',12,0,100,0,0,66336,0,116540,0,'Ruven to Player'),(110538,0,0,'We must learn why the old arcan\'dor failed. Its shattered bones may have the answers.',12,0,100,0,0,66383,0,118555,0,'Valewalker Farodin to Player'),(110654,0,0,'Run!',12,0,100,0,0,66336,0,118743,0,'Frightened Laborer to Player'),(110655,0,0,'Get moving!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,118738,0,'Duskmere Smuggler to Player'),(110656,0,0,'You will not interfere with my research!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,118752,0,'Arcanist Lylandre to Lylandre\'s Fire Crystal'),(110679,0,0,'You are not leaving my sight until an advisor is appointed. Promise me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119494,0,'Aurore to Player'),(110679,1,0,'Thank you. Do let Ly\'leth know that I stand with her.',12,0,100,0,0,65866,0,119496,0,'Aurore to Player'),(110680,0,0,'I think they meant to kill me!',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,118819,0,'Ailen Astravar to Player'),(110680,1,0,'I am getting off this infernal ship! I will return to my mother at once.',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,119490,0,'Ailen Astravar to Player'),(110804,0,0,'Yes, mother.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119495,0,'Ailen to Player'),(110874,0,0,'That is the symbol of House Stelleris... but that could not be. Coryn was Ruven\'s dearest friend...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,119179,0,'Distraught Noble to Player'),(110874,1,0,'No, that\'s simply impossible...',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,119180,0,'Distraught Noble to Player'),(110875,0,0,'Preposterous! A joke at my lord\'s expense? Only a madman would attempt it!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,119181,0,'Shamed Noble to Player'),(110875,1,0,'... But if anyone would laugh, it would be THEM.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,119182,0,'Shamed Noble to Player'),(110876,0,0,'Absolutely NOT! Why would he do such a thing? Has he no honor?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,119177,0,'Disgruntled Servant to Player'),(110876,1,0,'... Why WOULD he do such a thing...?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,119178,0,'Disgruntled Servant to Player'),(110967,0,0,'Filthy backstabbing cretin! That title should have been mine!',12,0,100,603,0,66003,0,116517,0,'Coryn to Player'),(110967,1,0,'You impinge upon my honor! You besmirch my name with baseless accusations!',12,0,100,603,0,66214,0,116518,0,'Coryn to Player'),(110967,2,0,'I will reclaim my honor! I invoke the ancient rite- Tal\'ashar!',12,0,100,603,0,66219,0,116524,0,'Coryn to Player'),(110967,3,0,'I have no need to hide behind a champion. I will defend my own honor.',12,0,100,1,0,68148,0,119382,0,'Coryn to Player'),(110967,4,0,'Meet me atop the Sanctum when you are ready to die, whelp.',12,0,100,603,0,68149,0,119383,0,'Coryn to Player'),(111484,0,0,'Now is the age of the shal\'dorei!',12,0,100,0,0,65707,0,116677,0,'Duskwatch Spellshield to Hungering Withered'),(111485,0,0,'Lowborn scum!',12,0,100,0,0,65907,0,116685,0,'Duskwatch Spellshield to Player'),(111485,1,0,'Anath\'ashar!',12,0,100,0,0,65910,0,116688,0,'Duskwatch Spellshield to Player'),(111485,2,0,'Die, outlander!',12,0,100,0,0,65909,0,116708,0,'Duskwatch Spellshield to Player'),(111485,3,0,'Feel the might of the shal\'dorei!',12,0,100,6,0,65663,0,116676,0,'Duskwatch Spellshield to Player'),(111489,0,0,'Your death is fated!',12,0,100,273,0,65864,0,116703,0,'Loyalist Sycophant to Hungering Withered'),(111489,1,0,'Your star is fading!',12,0,100,0,0,65866,0,116684,0,'Loyalist Sycophant to Hungering Withered'),(111489,2,0,'We have... failed.',12,0,100,0,0,65859,0,116789,0,'Loyalist Sycophant to Player'),(111490,0,0,'Tremble before our strength!',12,0,100,273,0,65664,0,116683,0,'Loyalist Sycophant to Player'),(111621,1,0,'No! It is not my time....',12,0,100,0,0,66015,0,116768,0,'Duskwatch Executor to Player'),(111903,0,0,'The Lunastre Attendant nods to you and calmly exits the tavern.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,121185,0,'Lunastre Attendant to Player'),(114263,0,0,'Well done... so far! But I will judge for myself whether you are worthy!',14,0,100,0,0,77575,0,123103,0,'Odyn to Hymdall'),(114263,1,0,'It seems I have been too gentle. Have at thee!',14,0,100,0,0,77574,0,123102,0,'Odyn'),(114263,2,0,'A shocking weakness!',14,0,100,0,0,77587,0,123669,0,'Odyn'),(114263,3,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Polearm_2H_OdynSpear_D_01.blp:20|t Odyn targets you with a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228918|h[Stormforged Spear]|h|r!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,123528,0,'Odyn to Player'),(114263,4,0,'Feel the fury of the storm!',14,0,100,0,0,77586,0,123668,0,'Odyn'),(114263,5,0,'ENOUGH! Your worth is proven! With you as my champions, Helya will fall and I will at long last be free of the curse that binds me here.',14,0,100,0,0,77579,0,123114,0,'Odyn'),(114323,1,0,'%s goes into a berserker rage!',41,0,100,53,0,0,0,34057,2,'Guarm'),(114360,0,0,'Fall in line!',14,0,100,0,0,77598,0,123659,0,'Hyrja to Player'),(114360,1,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_PRIEST_FLASHOFLIGHT.BLP:20|t Hyrja targets |cFFFF0000$n|r with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228162|h[Shield of Light]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,77598,0,124555,0,'Hyrja to Player'),(114361,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Horn_03:20|t Hymdall begins to blow the |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228012|h[Horn of Valor]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,77592,0,123522,0,'Hymdall'),(114361,1,0,'Only cowards fear the call of battle!',14,0,100,0,0,77592,0,123661,0,'Hymdall'),(114474,0,0,'Tor\'theras falar!',12,0,100,0,0,65689,0,116432,0,'Duskwatch Highblade to First Arcanist Thalyssra'),(114537,0,0,'Oh no... Odyn\'s mighty champions have come to end my reign. Whatever shall I do?',14,0,100,0,0,77477,0,123584,0,'Helya to Player'),(114537,1,0,'So kind of you to deliver your souls to me... it will save my Val\'kyr the trouble of fetching them from the surface world.',14,0,100,0,0,77478,0,123585,0,'Helya to Player'),(114537,2,0,'Come, mortals. You have earned an eternity of torment!',14,0,100,0,0,77479,0,123586,0,'Helya to Deepbrine Monstrosity'),(114537,3,0,'Your souls belong to me!',14,0,100,0,0,77480,0,123587,0,'Helya to Player'),(114537,4,0,'Relish the cold kiss of the sea!',14,0,100,0,0,77492,0,123605,0,'Helya to Player'),(114537,5,0,'Darkness upon your soul!',14,0,100,0,0,77490,0,123603,0,'Helya'),(114537,6,0,'Soon you will join the ranks of my Kvaldir!',14,0,100,0,0,77495,0,123608,0,'Helya to Helya'),(114537,7,0,'Your doom lurks within the fog!',14,0,100,0,0,77498,0,123611,0,'Helya to Helya'),(114537,8,0,'Your efforts are for naught, mortals! Odyn will NEVER be free!',14,0,100,0,0,77496,0,123609,0,'Helya to Helya'),(114537,9,0,'You\'ll catch your death of cold!',14,0,100,0,0,77500,0,123613,0,'Helya'),(114537,10,0,'Breathe deep... and despair!',14,0,100,0,0,77501,0,123614,0,'Helya'),(114537,11,0,'He... must not... win...',14,0,100,0,0,77488,0,123601,0,'Helya to Player'),(115166,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Icon_ShadowCouncilOrb_purple.blp:20|t An |cFFFF0000|Hspell:227920|h[Orb of Corruption]|h|r is following you!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,123580,0,'Orb of Corruption to Player'),(96590,0,0,'Gonna BASH you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,111786,0,'Gurbog da Basher'),(97200,1,0,'Vrykul dogs, get over here and fight or I\'ll kill you myself!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Seacursed Soulkeeper'),(97200,0,0,'I will sharpen my blade with your bones!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Seacursed Soulkeeper to Player'),(97097,0,0,'Harbaron won\'t have your kind around here, mortal.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Helarjar Champion to Player'),(97043,2,0,'Fight them. Earn your freedom!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Seacursed Slaver'),(97043,0,0,'Want to live? Kill these fools.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Seacursed Slaver'),(97043,1,0,'Fool. Our curse will be your undoing...',14,0,100,11,0,0,0,0,0,'Seacursed Slaver to Player'),(96759,0,0,'You ALL will regret trespassing in my realm.',14,0,100,0,0,54387,0,0,0,'HELYA - INTRO'),(96759,1,0,'You have come far enough. Time to die.',14,0,100,0,0,54371,0,0,0,'HELYA - AGGRO'),(96759,2,0,'Your fate rains down!',14,0,100,0,0,54378,0,0,0,'HELYA - TAIN_OF_SEA'),(96759,2,1,'Embrace your fate, fools!',14,0,100,0,0,54388,0,0,0,'HELYA - TAIN_OF_SEA'),(96759,3,0,'You will pay for that.',14,0,100,0,0,54385,0,0,0,'HELYA - TENTACLE DIE'),(96759,3,1,'I am losing my patience.',14,0,100,0,0,54386,0,0,0,'HELYA - TENTACLE DIE'),(96759,3,2,'No! This is not possible!',14,0,100,0,0,54384,0,0,0,'HELYA - TENTACLE DIE'),(96759,3,3,'What manner of creatures ARE you??',14,0,100,0,0,54382,0,0,0,'TENTACLE DIE'),(96759,3,4,'Odyn values these creatures?',14,0,100,0,0,54377,0,0,0,'HELYA - TENTACLE DIE'),(96759,4,0,'An eternity of agony awaits you.',14,0,100,0,0,54376,0,0,0,'HELYA - CORRUPTED BELLOW'),(96756,0,0,'Your souls will drift for eternity in the tides of the underworld!',14,0,100,0,0,54404,0,102193,0,'Ymiron, the Fallen King to Player'),(96756,0,1,'Mortals... Your wretched kind murdered MY people... destroyed MY kingdom! Now you, too, will know what it feels like to lose EVERYTHING!',14,0,100,0,0,54371,0,0,0,'YMIRON - AGGRO_2'),(96756,0,2,'Mortals... I fell to your wretched kind once before. It WILL NOT happen again!',14,0,100,0,0,54403,0,0,0,'YMIRON - AGGRO_3'),(96756,1,0,'Another drop in the sea of souls!',14,0,100,66,0,54367,0,102185,0,'Ymiron, the Fallen King to Player'),(96756,1,1,'FLEE, COWARDS!',14,0,100,0,0,54360,0,0,0,'YMIRON - SCREAM OF DEAD'),(96756,1,2,'COWER BEFORE ME!',14,0,100,0,0,54359,0,0,0,'YMIRON - SCREAM OF DEAD'),(96754,0,0,'The spirits grow hungry from the scent of blood',14,0,100,0,0,54387,0,0,0,'HARBARON - INTRO'),(96754,1,0,'New passengers... New souls. I will guide you to depths of helheim for a small price: your flesh and blood',14,0,100,0,0,54371,0,0,0,'HARBARON - AGGRO'),(96754,1,1,'All who enter Helheim must pay the blood price. Resist if you wish... In the end, I always get my payment',14,0,100,0,0,54378,0,0,0,'HARBARON - AGGRO'),(96754,2,0,'Arise, servitor! Claim our blood debt',14,0,100,0,0,54388,0,0,0,'HARBARON - SCREAM OF DEAD'),(96754,2,1,'Spirits! Sweep these mortals into the tides!',14,0,100,0,0,54385,0,0,0,'HARBARON - SCREAM OF DEAD'),(96754,2,2,'If I cannot bleed the payment for you, the spirits will!',14,0,100,0,0,54386,0,0,0,'HARBARON - SCREAM OF DEAD'),(104906,0,0,'Harbaron begins to drain the soul of the %s.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,107439,0,'Captured Val\'kyr'),(104906,1,0,'The %s returns to the Halls of Valor...',16,0,100,0,0,54376,0,107436,0,'Captured Val\'kyr to Captured Val\'kyr'),(109388,0,0,'As you wish. I will meet the Lieutenant where we met last. Send word for her to expect me.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,115280,0,'Nightborne Spy to Player'),(109388,1,0,'Keep an eye out for rebels. You can\'t be too careful.',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,115284,0,'Nightborne Spy to Player'),(109388,2,0,'If you see someone stealing arcwine, report them at once!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,115285,0,'Nightborne Spy to Player'),(109407,0,0,'A list of traitors? You will have to get this to Lieutenant Piet at once.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,115279,0,'Nightborne Sergeant to Player'),(109954,0,0,'My illusions will be your end!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,116340,0,'Magister Phaedris to Player'),(109954,1,0,'The illusion... is broken.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,116341,0,'Magister Phaedris to Player'),(110698,0,0,'Who is there?',12,0,100,0,0,67306,0,118774,0,'Arluelle to Player'),(110698,1,0,'<Cough.> Arluin, is that you? It is so dark...',12,0,100,0,0,67307,0,118775,0,'Arluelle to Player'),(110698,2,0,'I understand... He never could stay out of trouble...',12,0,100,0,0,67308,0,118776,0,'Arluelle to Player'),(110698,3,0,'Thank you... I will remember this.',12,0,100,0,0,67309,0,118777,0,'Arluelle to Player'),(111523,0,0,'Something\'s not quite right...',12,0,100,1,0,65803,0,118519,0,'Duskwatch Warpcaster to Player'),(111620,0,0,'Die, outlander!',12,0,100,0,0,65820,0,116708,0,'Duskwatch Executor to Player'),(111901,0,0,'Now, as before, we do what we must to carry on.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,125324,0,'Suramar Refugee to Player'),(111902,0,0,'This fruit actually cured Thalyssra? Amazing.',12,0,100,7,0,0,0,125323,0,'Suramar Refugee to Player'),(112145,0,0,'Perhaps there is a new path for us after all...',12,0,100,0,0,67374,0,118753,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(112145,1,0,'You have my thanks, outlander.',12,0,100,0,0,67375,0,118756,0,'Arcanist Valtrois to Player'),(112146,0,0,'This tree came at a high cost... You are sure it can sustain us?',12,0,100,0,0,67331,0,118739,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(112146,1,0,'We are on the brink of a new age for the Nightborne.',12,0,100,0,0,67376,0,118771,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(112146,2,0,'Without you, none of this would have been possible.',12,0,100,0,0,67377,0,118772,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(112146,3,0,'For now, we shall gather our strength. When the time comes, I trust we can call upon you to help us liberate Suramar.',12,0,100,0,0,67378,0,118773,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(112147,0,0,'Hmm... a little tart, with a hint of- oh, my... there it is.',12,0,100,0,0,67372,0,118645,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(112147,1,0,'Astounding.',12,0,100,0,0,67373,0,118742,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(113061,0,0,'Yes. We are close.',12,0,100,0,0,67339,0,118660,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,1,0,'There! Place the manastorm generator near the conduit.',12,0,100,0,0,67342,0,118665,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to First Mate Snellig'),(113061,2,0,'Something is wrong... The temporal warp sequencer-',12,0,100,0,0,67344,0,118669,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,3,0,'The fuse is broken. We must trigger the manastorm manually.',12,0,100,0,0,67346,0,118670,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,4,0,'We have no choice. This must be done.',12,0,100,0,0,67348,0,118681,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,5,0,'Rath, anu\'telar!',12,0,100,463,0,67349,0,118682,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,6,0,'We just need to hold out until the storm is over!',12,0,100,0,0,67350,0,118683,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,7,0,'Erath-omnas!',12,0,100,0,0,67353,0,118704,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to First Mate Snellig'),(113061,8,0,'It is too dangerous! The arcane torrents would tear us apart!',12,0,100,0,0,67355,0,118705,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to First Mate Snellig'),(113061,9,0,'What are you doing?!',12,0,100,0,0,67358,0,81078,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to First Mate Snellig'),(113061,10,0,'Arluin! NO!!',12,0,100,0,0,67359,0,118709,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to First Mate Snellig'),(113061,11,0,'Oculeth, get us out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,67361,0,118711,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to First Mate Snellig'),(113061,12,0,'Ugh... we made it...',12,0,100,0,0,67362,0,118712,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,13,0,'Where is Arluin?!',12,0,100,0,0,67363,0,118713,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,14,0,'Oh no...',12,0,100,0,0,67364,0,115290,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,15,0,'Do not speak! You are wounded-',12,0,100,0,0,67366,0,118716,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,16,0,'Yes. You saved us. Please... try to rest.',12,0,100,0,0,67368,0,118719,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,17,0,'He is gone.',12,0,100,0,0,67370,0,118720,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113061,18,0,'Come... Let us check on the others.',12,0,100,0,0,67371,0,118721,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(113062,0,0,'This is not looking real conduit-y. You sure the old man knows his stuff?',12,0,100,0,0,67338,0,118661,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113062,1,0,'Whatever you gotta do, do it quick! Lots of guards heading our way.',12,0,100,0,0,67343,0,118668,0,'Arluin to First Mate Snellig'),(113062,2,0,'Small words, please.',12,0,100,0,0,67345,0,118679,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113062,3,0,'Wait, aren\'t we supposed to leave BEFORE the storm starts?',12,0,100,0,0,67347,0,118680,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113062,4,0,'Easier said than done...',12,0,100,0,0,67351,0,118684,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113062,5,0,'The manastorm is only getting stronger! We need to shut that thing down!',12,0,100,0,0,67354,0,118700,0,'Arluin to First Mate Snellig'),(113062,6,0,'Damn it...',12,0,100,0,0,67356,0,118706,0,'Arluin to First Mate Snellig'),(113062,7,0,'You guys owe me...',12,0,100,0,0,67357,0,118707,0,'Arluin to First Mate Snellig'),(113062,8,0,'Hhghh-AAAHHHH!!!',14,0,100,16,0,67360,0,118710,0,'Arluin to First Mate Snellig'),(113062,9,0,'<cough> Nghh...',12,0,100,0,0,67365,0,118715,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113062,10,0,'We pulled it off... <wheeze> didn\'t we?',12,0,100,0,0,67367,0,118718,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113062,11,0,'Hey... <cough> Tell Vanthir I said... thanks... for every...',12,0,100,0,0,67369,0,118717,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113114,0,0,'I heard about this crazy job you guys are planning. You weren\'t thinking of leaving me out, were you?',12,0,100,0,0,67301,0,118629,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113114,1,0,'Look, I am not blind. I see what is happening in Suramar.',12,0,100,1,0,67303,0,118630,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113114,2,0,'I am not sitting this one out. The stakes are too high. So I am in, you got that?',12,0,100,0,0,67304,0,118631,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113114,3,0,'Oh and don\'t worry about my usual fee - you can pay me when the job is done.',12,0,100,1,0,67305,0,118632,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113114,4,0,'Get in, plant the device, get out before it goes off. Not the most complicated job I have been on.',12,0,100,1,0,67335,0,118648,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113166,0,0,'You will bow to us!',12,0,100,0,0,65667,0,116700,0,'Duskwatch Arcblade to First Arcanist Thalyssra'),(113166,1,0,'Scum like you should obey your betters.',12,0,100,0,0,65867,0,116706,0,'Duskwatch Arcblade to Player'),(113207,0,0,'I never met a lock I could not open.',12,0,100,0,0,67340,0,118663,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113207,1,0,'Just give me one moment.',12,0,100,0,0,67341,0,118664,0,'Arluin to Player'),(113208,0,0,'Look out!',12,0,100,0,0,67341,0,114489,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(114472,0,0,'Arash-falas...',12,0,100,0,0,65900,0,116431,0,'Duskwatch Highblade to Player'),(114474,1,0,'Im... impossible.',12,0,100,0,0,65688,0,116429,0,'Duskwatch Highblade to Player'),(114868,0,0,'It is hopeless to resist...',12,0,100,0,0,66020,0,116783,0,'Felborne Enforcer to Player'),(114904,0,0,'Line them up!',14,0,100,36,0,0,0,123594,0,'Soul Engine Jailer to Player'),(114904,1,0,'Ah, look, another prisoner!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,123595,0,'Soul Engine Jailer to Player'),(114904,2,0,'Just in time for the next ferry. It\'s off to the Soul Engine with you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,123746,0,'Soul Engine Jailer to Player'),(114948,0,0,'There you are! Over here!',12,0,100,0,0,78391,0,124353,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(114948,1,0,'Elisande knows about Vanthir\'s involvement in the rebellion. He is gone.',12,0,100,0,0,78392,0,123461,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(114948,2,0,'I will move ahead and clear out a safe haven for the survivors. Stay strong, my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,78360,0,124361,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(114948,3,0,'Now all we need is a to make contact with--',12,0,100,0,0,78554,0,123716,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(114948,4,0,'Thalyssra?!',12,0,100,0,0,65777,0,124165,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(114948,5,0,'What manner of spell is this?',12,0,100,0,0,78524,0,124166,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(114948,6,0,'Fear not, First Arcanist. I will see to it that our friend here comes to no harm.',12,0,100,0,0,78594,0,124160,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(114948,7,0,'I am sadly familiar with Vanthir\'s captor.',12,0,100,0,0,78595,0,124161,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(114958,0,0,'Elisande must be stopped!',12,0,100,0,0,79245,0,123450,0,'Duskwatch Subjugator to Player'),(114958,1,0,'This is too much... if I must be labeled a traitor then so be it!',12,0,100,397,0,79245,0,123451,0,'Duskwatch Subjugator to Player'),(114958,2,0,'I knew there were others! I will no longer bloody my hands for Elisande!',12,0,100,0,0,79245,0,123449,0,'Duskwatch Subjugator to Player'),(114978,0,0,'Oh, thank you! This masterpiece is worth my life a hundred times over.',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,123472,0,'Master Devlyn to Player'),(114983,0,0,'Behind you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124769,0,'Thorvos to Player'),(114983,1,0,'I am right behind you! Go!',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,124770,0,'Thorvos to Player'),(114984,0,0,'F-father... Run...',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,123479,0,'Valanth to Player'),(114985,0,0,'%s spits on the corpse of the demon.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,123473,0,'Scarleth to Player'),(114985,1,0,'I know where to find Shal\'Aran. Come, ladies. We are no longer safe in the city.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,123476,0,'Scarleth to Player'),(114998,1,0,'More come from Suramar every hour! Move out! Make room!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,123543,0,'Aargoss'),(114998,2,0,'We must not leave the Soul Engine waiting!',14,0,100,0,0,78451,0,123542,0,'Aargoss'),(114998,3,0,'Ha! You walk willingly to your death, mortal!',12,0,100,0,0,78444,0,124519,0,'Aargoss'),(114998,4,0,'I will take great pleasure in grinding your soul to nothing!',12,0,100,0,0,78445,0,124520,0,'Aargoss'),(114998,5,0,'Shaza-kiel!',12,0,100,0,0,78446,0,124521,0,'Aargoss to Player'),(114998,6,0,'You are nothing! Insignificant gnat!',12,0,100,0,0,78447,0,124522,0,'Aargoss'),(114998,7,0,'No! ... I will be... fuel...',12,0,100,0,0,78448,0,124523,0,'Aargoss to Player'),(115014,0,0,'Hmm... medium or well-done?',12,0,100,0,0,53329,0,102137,0,'Felsoul Imp to Player'),(115014,1,0,'Tasty meats for me to eats.',12,0,100,0,0,55207,0,96658,0,'Felsoul Imp to Player'),(115018,0,0,'I hope she sees this...',12,0,100,0,0,78550,0,124501,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(115018,1,0,'This way! Everyone into the boat!',12,0,100,0,0,78551,0,124502,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(115018,2,0,'Excellent timing as usual, Deline.',12,0,100,0,0,78552,0,124503,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(115049,0,0,'See that these people escape the city, Deline. $n, stay with me.',12,0,100,0,0,78557,0,123713,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(115049,1,0,'This way!',12,0,100,397,0,78553,0,123714,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(115078,0,0,'He will be fine. The fruit will bring him back.',12,0,100,0,0,78582,0,124539,0,'Arluelle to Player'),(115243,0,0,'I have urgent news, Thalyssra.',12,0,100,0,0,78611,0,124022,0,'Image of Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(115243,1,0,'The portal to my estate is secure. You will want to hear this in person.',12,0,100,0,0,78612,0,124023,0,'Image of Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(115247,0,0,'Welcome home, First Arcanist. Thank you for coming on such short notice.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124055,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(115247,1,0,'I have heard terrible rumors about our friend Vanthir.',12,0,100,0,0,78616,0,124063,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(115247,2,0,'He is to be made an example for all to see.',12,0,100,0,0,78617,0,124535,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(115247,3,0,'I do not know. I only hope we are not too late.',12,0,100,0,0,78619,0,124537,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(115247,4,0,'Be safe, Thalyssra. I must return to the palace.',12,0,100,0,0,78406,0,124075,0,'Ly\'leth Lunastre to Player'),(115248,0,0,'Thank you, Advisor. What news?',12,0,100,0,0,78615,0,124056,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115248,1,0,'How much time do we have?',12,0,100,0,0,78618,0,124536,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115248,2,0,'Keep your voice down, Silgryn. It is good to see you too.',12,0,100,0,0,78408,0,124164,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115248,3,0,'One that will find our friend.',12,0,100,0,0,78525,0,124167,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115277,0,0,'I will find him. Preferably without being seen.',12,0,100,0,0,78416,0,123637,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115277,1,0,'This must be where he took many meals...',12,0,100,0,0,78409,0,123698,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115277,2,0,'There it is. We are coming, Vanthir.',12,0,100,0,0,78410,0,123699,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115277,3,0,'This garden likely gave him many hours of respite. His essence is strong and bright, here.',12,0,100,0,0,78411,0,123700,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115277,4,0,'I can feel him! He is still alive, at least.',12,0,100,0,0,78412,0,123701,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115277,5,0,'One of his suppliers must have served him here. Reminders of a simpler time.',12,0,100,0,0,78413,0,123702,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115277,6,0,'Perfect. This will be enough to find him.',12,0,100,0,0,78414,0,123703,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,0,0,'Talk to me, Vanthir...',12,0,100,0,0,78526,0,124129,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,1,0,'The moment he was taken from the Waning Crescent he felt such terrible fear... but not for himself.',12,0,100,0,0,78527,0,124130,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,2,0,'Fear for those that he sheltered, those he sacrificed for.',12,0,100,0,0,78528,0,124131,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,3,0,'He was taken somewhere dark and isolated. He began to feel hunger settling its roots in his gut.',12,0,100,0,0,78529,0,124132,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,4,0,'Hunger that did not pass, but grew...',12,0,100,0,0,78530,0,124133,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,5,0,'... Until he could think of nothing else!',12,0,100,0,0,78531,0,124134,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,6,0,'He is near to withering. His thoughts are jumbled, frantic... I just need to...',12,0,100,0,0,78532,0,124135,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,7,0,'Focus! There!',12,0,100,0,0,78533,0,124136,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,8,0,'He is being held at the Terrace of Order! It must be time for the display...',12,0,100,0,0,78534,0,124137,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,9,0,'That took more out of me than I thought it would. You will have to free Vanthir without me. I am sorry.',12,0,100,0,0,78580,0,124154,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115557,10,0,'Thank you, Silgryn. Be careful.',12,0,100,0,0,78581,0,124162,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115604,0,0,'Vanthir struggles to his feet.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,125238,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(115604,1,0,'Relief... at last...',12,0,100,0,0,78596,0,124540,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(115604,2,0,'Aran\'ethil... The nightmare is over!',12,0,100,0,0,78597,0,124541,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(115604,3,0,'They wanted to make an example. We have stolen their message and made it ours.',12,0,100,0,0,78568,0,124543,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(115604,4,0,'All will see... hope... in the Dusk Lily.',12,0,100,0,0,78569,0,124544,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(115604,5,0,'<Cough.> I need... to rest now. Thank you. Thank you for everything.',12,0,100,0,0,78566,0,124545,0,'Vanthir to Player'),(115607,0,0,'You think to stop this demonstration? Very well. I will make an example of you first!',12,0,100,0,0,78599,0,124260,0,'Thoramir'),(115607,1,0,'She... was right... about you...',12,0,100,0,0,78607,0,124269,0,'Thoramir to Arluelle'),(115608,0,0,'I know.',12,0,100,0,0,78608,0,124270,0,'Silgryn to Arluelle'),(115608,1,0,'Lay still, my friend. We will get you out.',12,0,100,0,0,78610,0,124538,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(115608,2,0,'Welcome back, old friend.',12,0,100,0,0,78598,0,124542,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(115608,3,0,'We will see him back to safety. Go inform Thalyssra of our success.',12,0,100,0,0,78567,0,124546,0,'Silgryn to Player'),(115710,0,0,'No need to delay. Onto the pad with you.',12,0,100,25,0,78389,0,123457,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(115710,1,0,'I will get you as close to the Crescent as I can. We will be in touch.',12,0,100,0,0,78390,0,124348,0,'Chief Telemancer Oculeth to Player'),(115736,0,0,'She is waiting for you just outside.',12,0,100,1,0,78535,0,124504,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115736,1,0,'Come. I do not want to keep her waiting.',12,0,100,0,0,78613,0,124024,0,'First Arcanist Thalyssra to Player'),(115991,0,0,'Father!!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,124735,0,'Emille to Player'),(115992,0,0,'I\'m going!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,124736,0,'Brigitte to Player'),(116001,0,0,'Praise all that is good... you are both safe. Come, let us get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,123469,0,'Eneas to Player'),(116013,0,0,'You think you can hide from Elisande? Die, traitors!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,124768,0,'Duskwatch Punisher to Player'),(116085,0,0,'Arluelle places a dusky purple flower before the little planter.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,124894,0,'Arluelle to Player'),(116085,1,0,'Do you remember me, outlander?',12,0,100,1,0,78536,0,124505,0,'Arluelle to Player'),(116085,2,0,'My brother rests here. My name is Arluelle.',12,0,100,1,0,78537,0,124507,0,'Arluelle to Player'),(23191,3,0,'I will not last much longer!',14,0,100,0,0,11385,0,21784,0,'Akama SAY_LOW_HEALTH'),(23191,4,0,'No! Not yet!',14,0,100,0,0,11386,0,21785,0,'Akama SAY_DEAD'),(50039,0,1,'Time to join your friends, kissin\' the dirt!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49838,0,'Goblin Assassin on Aggro'),(50039,0,0,'We\'ll kill anybody for the right price!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49837,0,'Goblin Assassin on Aggro'),(42937,0,2,'The grapes were VERY TASTY!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blackrock Invader'),(42937,0,3,'Eat you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blackrock Invader'),(42937,0,4,'Beg for life!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,42877,0,'on Aggro Text'),(26117,1,0,'A wonderful specimen.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25324,0,'Raelorasz - say_drake_1'),(26117,1,1,'Sleep now, young one....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25323,0,'Raelorasz - say_drake_2'),(26117,1,2,'Yes, this one should advance my studies nicely....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25326,0,'say_drake_3'),(17257,5,0,'The Legion will consume you all!',14,0,100,0,0,10258,0,17347,0,'Magtheridon - Death'),(17257,4,0,'I will not be taken so easily! Let the walls of this prison tremble... and fall!',14,0,100,0,0,10257,0,17336,0,'Magtheridon - Collapse'),(17257,3,0,'Not again! Not again...',14,0,100,0,0,10256,0,17348,0,'Magtheridon - Banished'),(17257,2,0,'Did you think me weak? Soft? Who is the weak one now?',14,0,100,0,0,10255,0,17349,0,'Magtheridon - Slay'),(17257,1,0,'I... am... unleashed!',14,0,100,15,0,10253,0,17346,0,'Magtheridon - Free'),(17257,0,5,'My blood will be the end of you!',14,0,100,0,0,10252,0,17344,0,'Magtheridon - Taunt06'),(17257,0,4,'How long do you believe your pathetic sorcery can hold me?',14,0,100,0,0,10251,0,17343,0,'Magtheridon - Taunt05'),(17257,0,3,'Away, you mindless parasites! My blood is my own!',14,0,100,0,0,10250,0,17342,0,'Magtheridon - Taunt04'),(17257,0,2,'Illidan is an arrogant fool! I will crush him and reclaim Outland as my own!',14,0,100,0,0,10249,0,17341,0,'Magtheridon - Taunt03'),(17257,0,1,'Vermin! Leeches! Take my blood and choke on it!',14,0,100,0,0,10248,0,17340,0,'Magtheridon - Taunt02'),(17257,0,0,'Wretched, meddling insects! Release me, and perhaps I will grant you a merciful death!',14,0,100,0,0,10247,0,17339,0,'Magtheridon - Taunt01'),(23418,5,0,'%s becomes enraged!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'SUFF_EMOTE_ENRAGE'),(23419,4,0,'I\'ll be waiting.',14,0,100,0,0,11413,0,21757,0,'DESI_SAY_AFTER'),(22947,6,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'shahraz EMOTE_ENRAGE'),(22947,7,0,'%s goes into a berserker rage!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,4428,0,'shahraz EMOTE_BERSERK'),(3394,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(5838,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3380,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3379,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(14718,1,0,'%s attempts to to get help!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),(14718,0,0,'%s attempts to get help!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6311,0,'Horde Laborer'),(3273,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(9523,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(34635,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(34509,0,0,'Pigs! Scum! I will cleave your heads like apples!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,34677,0,'say Text'),(3269,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3265,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3271,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(34503,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(6020,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3382,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(34790,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3384,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(5629,0,0,'$R, I\'ll have your head.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34971,0,'on Aggro Text'),(3386,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(34706,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3279,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3276,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3278,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(3280,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(34846,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(16790,0,0,'Thank you, $N. It looks like they\'re going to get along just fine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13666,0,'Falconer Drenna Riverwind'),(17424,0,0,'Now, let\'s see....',12,0,100,69,0,0,0,14281,0,'Anchorite Paetheus'),(17424,1,0,'In the process of translating this, I believe I\'ve learned more about the drunken exploits of a certain \'Andrew Clementine\' than about the journal\'s author.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14282,0,'Anchorite Paetheus'),(17424,2,0,'But, no matter. Mister Clementine\'s... err, \'contribution\' notwithstanding, this seems to be the journal of a man named Nolkai. The entries toward the end describe a brutal battle.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,14283,0,'Anchorite Paetheus'),(17424,3,0,'Take a look at this passage...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14285,0,'Anchorite Paetheus'),(22103,0,0,'There, it is completed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19808,0,'Baron Sablemane'),(20913,0,0,'Now to begin the repairs.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18651,0,'Tashar'),(20913,1,0,'It\'s working! Ghabar will be pleased to hear the news.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18652,0,'Tashar'),(17433,0,0,'These pictographs tell a story. This figure at the beginning, almost looks like one of the creatures we encountered at Azure Watch...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14030,0,'Vindicator Aalesia'),(17433,1,0,'No, this can\'t be... It says this creature willingly became a servant of the Legion. He transforms into a satyr and receives the Legion\'s \"blessing.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,14031,0,'Vindicator Aalesia'),(17433,2,0,'We must defeat these satyr, $n. We will not suffer the Legion\'s presence in these lands.',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,14032,0,'Vindicator Aalesia'),(794,0,0,'Dang! Fish arent biting here either. I am gonna go back to my ol fishin hole!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,894,0,'Matt'),(794,1,0,'Gee, fish sure dont seem to be biting here. Maybe I should go over to Crystal Lake to try my luck there!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,893,0,'Matt'),(20281,0,0,'Let\'s proceed at a brisk pace.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17941,0,'Drijya'),(20281,1,0,'We\'ll start at that first energy pylon, straight ahead. Remember, try to keep them off of me.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,17942,0,'Drijya'),(20281,2,0,'I\'m done with this pylon. On to the next.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17943,0,'Drijya'),(20281,3,0,'Alright, pylon two down. Now for the heat manifold.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17944,0,'Drijya'),(20281,4,0,'That should do it. The teleporter should blow any second now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17945,0,'Drijya'),(20281,5,0,'Ok, let\'s get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17946,0,'Drijya'),(20281,6,0,'Thank you, $N! I couldn\'t have done it without you. You\'ll let Gahruj know?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17949,0,'Drijya'),(20281,7,0,'Keep them off me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17950,0,'Drijya'),(20281,8,0,'Very well.  Before we head down there, take a moment to prepare yourself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17940,0,'Drijya'),(23843,0,0,'I brought you a housewarming gift, Jarl.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22348,0,'Mordant Grimsby'),(23843,1,0,'Go on, open it. I think you\'ll like it.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,22349,0,'Mordant Grimsby'),(23843,2,0,'Jarl?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22350,0,'Mordant Grimsby'),(23843,3,0,'Jarl, you haven\'t been yourself ever since I arrived. What\'s going on?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22352,0,'Mordant Grimsby'),(23843,4,0,'I came out here to visit you, Jarl! And I find you living in an empty cabin in the middle of nowhere, babbling about frogs? You\'re hopeless!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,22354,0,'Mordant Grimsby'),(4792,0,0,'Unless it\'s something I can eat, I don\'t want it.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,22351,0,'\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl'),(4792,1,0,'Nothing. Wanna help me whip up some frog leg stew?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,22353,0,'\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl'),(26450,0,0,'The fallen of Pal\'ea will not rest, son.  Find the naga priestess!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,25684,0,'Ariut'),(21151,0,0,'Right.  We just busted our tails to haul all of this stuff up here, and you want to work more?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18816,0,''),(20555,0,0,'Who dares place this affront upon the altar of Goc?',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,20381,0,'Goc'),(20555,1,0,'Who dares rouse Goc from his restful slumber?',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,20317,0,'Goc'),(20555,2,0,'Your name is as insignificant to me as the names of the thousands who have died under the might of Goc. I will crush you and $N',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,20321,0,'Goc'),(22473,0,0,'It\'s only right that you know the name of the one who will take your life.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,20323,0,'Baron Sablemane'),(22473,1,0,'Baron Sablemane. It will be on your lips as you gasp your dying breath.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,20324,0,'Baron Sablemane'),(22473,2,0,'Let us begin.',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,20325,0,'Baron Sablemane'),(22473,3,0,'We will speak again, but away from here.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,20327,0,'Baron Sablemane'),(22448,0,0,'I am Rexxar, son of the Mok\'Nathal, champion of the Horde.',14,0,100,397,0,0,0,20318,0,'Rexxar'),(22448,1,0,'And their torment at your hands is at an end. By my name, I shall put an end to your life.',14,0,100,113,0,0,0,20319,0,'Rexxar'),(22448,2,0,'Prepare yourself for the end.',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,20320,0,'Rexxar'),(22448,3,0,'I could not have achieved this victory without you. We will speak back at Thunderlord Stronghold.',14,0,100,397,0,0,0,20326,0,'Rexxar'),(14850,0,0,'Would you like something more to eat sir?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10066,0,'Gruk'),(14850,1,0,'Right away sir.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10267,0,'Gruk'),(14850,2,0,'Here is your bread sir.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10184,0,'Gruk'),(14850,3,0,'As you wish sir.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10266,0,'Gruk'),(14859,0,0,'More bread boy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10183,0,'Guard Taruc'),(14859,1,0,'Aaahh... Very good. Now scat!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10265,0,'Guard Taruc'),(17393,0,0,'[Furbolg] Come, $n. Let us leave the water together, purified.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13901,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Yor'),(17393,1,0,'[Furbolg] We go now, together. We will seek Vark.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13903,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Yor'),(17393,2,0,'[Furbolg] Follow me to Vark.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13907,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Yor'),(17393,3,0,'[Furbolg] Hurry, $n. Vark awaits you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13927,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Yor'),(22452,0,0,'You have brought me back too soon! I am weak yet... What is this! Who... It matters not! DIE!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20298,0,'Reanimated Exarch'),(23038,0,0,'The arakkoa are hidden... everywhere!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21917,0,'Sky Commander Adaris'),(23042,0,0,'Rest now, Adaris. You need to recover your strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21918,0,'Severin'),(21790,0,0,'I\'ve rigged a few control consoles down the slope. Get one quickly and take control of the fel reaver! You\'ll only have a limited amount of time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19666,0,'Plexi'),(17426,0,0,'Morae... Is that you?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,14262,0,'Galaen'),(17426,1,0,'No... you\'re not Morae, but I sense that you have met. When you see her, tell her that I survived the crash, only to be done in by the infiltrators.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,14263,0,'Galaen'),(17426,2,0,'Let her know... my last thought was of her...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14264,0,'Galaen'),(21789,0,0,'I\'ve rigged a few control consoles down the slope. Get one quickly and take control of the fel reaver! You\'ll only have a limited amount of time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19666,0,'Nakansi'),(16551,0,0,'Yes, Zhanna, it\'s me! Your signal is weak.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13687,0,'Technician Dyvuun'),(16551,1,0,'Zhanna! Gah, I have to get this thing fixed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13692,0,'Technician Dyvuun'),(17268,0,0,'Dyvuun, is that you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13686,0,'Image of Technician Zhanaa'),(17268,1,0,'I can barely hear you... <static> aking up!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13688,0,'Image of Technician Zhanaa'),(19447,0,0,'Light, lead the fallen from untruth to truth, from darkness to Light and from death to immortality.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16769,0,'Brother Daniels'),(19447,1,0,'Light be with you now and forever.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16770,0,'Brother Daniels'),(19447,2,0,'Light, give me strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16767,0,'Brother Daniels'),(19447,3,0,'The priest kneels in silent prayer.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16772,0,'Brother Daniels'),(22952,3,0,'Valiant effort.',14,0,100,0,0,11525,0,21699,0,'council vera SLAY'),(22952,4,0,'A glorious kill!',14,0,100,0,0,11526,0,21701,0,'council vera SLAY_COMT'),(22952,5,0,'You got... lucky.',14,0,100,0,0,11527,0,21703,0,'council vera DEATH'),(23872,2,0,'DAMN RIGHT! We\'ll show \'em why you don\'t cross the Dark Iron dwarves!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,22389,0,'Coren Direbrew SAY_INTRO3'),(23872,3,0,'You\'ll pay for this insult, $c!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,25921,0,'Coren Direbrew SAY_INSULT'),(23872,4,0,'Smash their kegs! DRAIN BREWFEST DRY!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Coren Direbrew'),(23872,5,0,'Your Brewfest is a sham! One day, everyone will recognize that Dire Brew is the best!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Coren Direbrew'),(23795,0,0,'No way!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,22397,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist SAY_ANTAGONIST_1'),(23795,0,1,'NO!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,22399,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist SAY_ANTAGONIST_1'),(23795,0,2,'Not on your life',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,22398,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist SAY_ANTAGONIST_1'),(23795,1,0,'Yeah!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,22393,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist SAY_ANTAGONIST_2'),(23795,1,1,'You said it!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,22395,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist SAY_ANTAGONIST_2'),(23795,1,2,'Damn straight!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,22396,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist SAY_ANTAGONIST_2'),(23795,1,3,'Right!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,22394,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist SAY_ANTAGONIST_2'),(23795,2,0,'Never cross a Dark Iron, $C.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,1934,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist to Player'),(23795,2,1,'Feel the power of the Dark Iron Dwarves!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,1936,0,'Dark Iron Antagonist to Player'),(20551,0,0,'I hope this damned thing works. *Araxes pounds on the portable transponder.*',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18256,0,'Agent Araxes'),(20551,1,0,'I\'m here, commander.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18267,0,'Agent Araxes'),(20551,2,0,'We\'ve located the mark, commander. Ya-six and I have been separated. Requesting backup.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18268,0,'Agent Araxes'),(20553,0,0,'Araxes, come in... Are you there Araxes? Visibility is nil. Warp storms blocking us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18249,0,'Image of Commander Ameer'),(20553,1,0,'Copy. Status report, soldier.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18250,0,'Image of Commander Ameer'),(20553,2,0,'Copy that, Araxes. Backup is on the way. Hold your position. I repeat, hold your position.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18269,0,'Image of Commander Ameer'),(20553,3,0,'Ameer, over and out.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18270,0,'Image of Commander Ameer'),(20564,0,0,'Araxes! Send help! I\'m pinned down in the mines. I... I\'m not sure where I am exactly but I had the presence of mind to drop tracers on the ground behind me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18281,0,'Image of Agent Ya-six'),(20564,1,0,'I can\'t follow the tracers back out, too many flesh beasts in the way. Send someone in... Follow the tracers... Ya-six, out.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18282,0,'Image of Agent Ya-six'),(34574,4,0,'The Betrayer was freed from his prison, and Shand\'do Stormrage disappeared into the emerald dream.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34795,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34574,5,0,'A dark time for all.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34796,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(34574,6,0,'The Shade of the Kaldorei closes its eyes and fades away.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,34820,0,'Shade of the Kaldorei'),(3514,1,0,'Take with you the blessing of the wind\'s embrace. May it make your descent from Aldrassil more... direct.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,34602,0,'Tenaron Stormgrip'),(3514,0,0,'Greetings, $c.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,13306,0,'Tenaron Stormgrip'),(17257,6,0,'%s\'s bonds begin to weaken!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13689,0,'Magtheridon - Weaken'),(17257,7,0,'%s is nearly free of his bonds!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13690,0,'Magtheridon - Nearly free'),(17257,8,0,'%s breaks free!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13691,0,'Magtheridon - Breaks free'),(17257,9,0,'%s begins to cast Blast Nova!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,18739,0,'Magtheridon - Blast Nova'),(41989,0,0,'Why dis happen?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frightened Peon'),(41989,0,1,'You is friend. Tanks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frightened Peon'),(41989,0,2,'Oof! You touch naughty spot!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frightened Peon'),(98949,201,0,'Tremble beneath me.',14,0,100,0,0,54501,0,0,0,'Smashspite the Hateful'),(98949,200,0,'I will paint this keep with your blood!',14,0,100,0,0,54504,0,0,0,'Smashspite the Hateful'),(98900,0,0,'Ok! We definitely got \'em this time!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wyrmtongue Trickster to Player'),(98810,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wrathguard Bladelord'),(98792,3,0,'AHHH! WE SORRY! WE PROMISE!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wyrmtongue Scavenger to Player'),(98792,1,0,'Ahh! They coming! RUN!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wyrmtongue Scavenger to Player'),(98792,2,0,'Graa.... Ooh... oooWAAAAAHHHH!!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wyrmtongue Scavenger to Player'),(98792,0,0,'Ha! We\'ll get \'em wit\' these big rocks!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wyrmtongue Scavenger to Player'),(98706,0,0,'Brothers and Sisters, the invaders come for us. Repel them! Attack!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander Shemdah\'sohn to Risen Archer'),(98696,202,0,'No! I can see now... betrayed...',14,0,100,0,0,54514,0,0,0,'Illysanna Ravencrest to Player'),(98696,0,0,'The hunt is eternal...',14,0,100,0,0,54513,0,0,0,'Illysanna Ravencrest'),(98696,201,0,'You can not escape.',14,0,100,0,0,54561,0,0,0,'Illysanna Ravencrest to Player'),(98696,200,0,'We will bury you here, fools.',14,0,100,0,0,54515,0,0,0,'Illysanna Ravencrest'),(98542,202,0,'I feed on your essence...',14,0,100,0,0,54522,0,0,0,'Amalgam of Souls'),(98542,0,0,'Consume! Devour!',14,0,100,0,0,54518,0,100957,0,'Amalgam of Souls'),(98542,200,0,'Consume! Devour!',14,0,100,0,0,54518,0,0,0,'Amalgam of Souls'),(98542,201,0,'The harvest has come!',14,0,100,0,0,54516,0,0,0,'Amalgam of Souls to Player'),(31104,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(30277,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(30284,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(30329,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Enrage'),(30179,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(30319,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(30111,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(17406,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(12856,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(34177,0,0,'%s a