2,0,100,1,0,0,0,49860,0,'Aggra to Player'),(35838,1,0,'Mkay, m\'ne ta oor!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,36349,0,'Pygmy Witchdoctor'),(36470,0,0,'Hurry, $n, deploy the Town-In-A-Box. Our people are trapped inside! Oh! I almost forgot your parachute.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,49886,0,'Foreman Dampwick to Player'),(35838,0,0,'Taronto bosch!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,36348,0,'Pygmy Witchdoctor'),(34748,0,0,'What were those Alliance ships doing firing at us?! Did I see a Horde ship, too?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35009,0,'Goblin Survivor to Player'),(34748,1,0,'Blowing open my escape pod. I like your style, $n!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35004,0,'Goblin Survivor to Player'),(34748,2,0,'$n! Please tell me that monster, the Trade Prince, didn\'t survive?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35007,0,'Goblin Survivor to Player'),(34748,3,0,'$n, it\'s you! Thanks, $g man : sweetie;!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35003,0,'Goblin Survivor to Player'),(35649,0,0,'Hello there, $n. So nice of you to rescue me. No hard feelings, right?',12,0,100,3,0,19562,0,35947,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Player'),(35650,0,0,'We need all of our bombs and tools to survive on this deserted island, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49827,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(35650,1,0,'Dampwick\'s at the cave entrance just to the southeast.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49832,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(35650,2,0,'We need some new friends if we\'re going to survive all of this. Hopefully, the orcs won\'t just kill you on sight.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,49835,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(35758,0,0,'The monkeys are going to get a kick out of those bananas!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,49830,0,'Bamm Megabomb to Player'),(35758,1,0,'That was the most beautiful thing that I\'ve ever seen!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,49831,0,'Bamm Megabomb to Player'),(35769,0,0,'The kaja\'mite has gone and made these monkeys smart! Keep that miner safe, $n.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,49833,0,'Foreman Dampwick to Player'),(35769,1,0,'On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, I lay claim to this mine!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,49834,0,'Foreman Dampwick to Player'),(35786,0,0,'$n, you gotta get those teraptor hatchlings before they get us!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,49828,0,'Maxx Avalanche to Player'),(35786,1,0,'Did you hear the matriarch growling up on the cliff? Steer clear of her!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,49829,0,'Maxx Avalanche to Player'),(35813,0,0,'Okay, here we go. You\'re gonna cover me, right?',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,35995,0,'Frightened Miner to Player'),(35813,1,0,'Whoa! What\'s with all of the cave paintings? Ack, do I hear monkeys?!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36102,0,'Frightened Miner to Player'),(35813,2,0,'Hey, why am I doing all of the work here?',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36017,0,'Frightened Miner to Player'),(35813,3,0,'Did I ever tell you that I was a mid-level accountant with the company back on Kezan? I worked for you for years. Do you even know my name?',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36014,0,'Frightened Miner to Player'),(35813,4,0,'That\'s good enough for now. I\'ll make my way out on my own. Thanks for the escort, $n.',12,0,100,396,0,16458,0,36018,0,'Frightened Miner to Player'),(35813,5,0,'That\'s good enough for now. I\'ll make my way out on my own. Thanks for the escort, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36018,0,'Frightened Miner to Player'),(24741,0,0,'Now get us some real eggs!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'say Text'),(26798,2,0,'Gaagh...',14,0,100,0,0,13460,0,29624,0,'Commander Kolurg'),(30453,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Frenzy'),(46379,0,0,'Get up you,lazy bums,there\'s fighting to do!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(46381,0,0,'Start fighting or start bleeding!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(46381,0,1,'Time to fight!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(46381,0,2,'Freedom!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(46375,0,0,'Get up you,lazy bums,there\'s fighting to do!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Say'),(46252,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(46250,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'combat Flee'),(46261,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,