nd'),(1935,0,3,'Why won\'t you leave us alone?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44543,0,'Tirisfal Farmhand'),(66185,0,0,'Father!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39138,0,'Vengeful Forsaken (Lilian Voss)'),(66185,1,0,'Shut up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39140,0,'Vengeful Forsaken (Lilian Voss)'),(66185,2,0,'You raised me to be a killer.  How am I doing, daddy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39141,0,'Vengeful Forsaken (Lilian Voss)'),(66185,3,0,'But wait... I remember now. You taught me to only kill the undead. So you do want me to kill myself, daddy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39143,0,'Vengeful Forsaken (Lilian Voss)'),(66185,4,0,'Then again, why kill myself... when I can kill YOU instead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39145,0,'Vengeful Forsaken (Lilian Voss)'),(66185,5,0,'Thanks for everything... father.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39146,0,'Vengeful Forsaken (Lilian Voss)'),(39097,2,0,'Lilian, I...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39144,0,'High Priest Benedictus Voss'),(38999,4,0,'The world of the living may have turned its back on me, but I\'m no damned Scourge. Just go.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38999,0,'Lilian Voss'),(38980,4,0,'No... I remember. My family is dead. And so am I.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39164,0,'Spirit of Devlin Agamand'),(38980,5,0,'And my soul.... my soul belongs to the Scourge!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39165,0,'Spirit of Devlin Agamand'),(38980,6,0,'DIE, YOU WRETCHES!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,39166,0,'Spirit of Devlin Agamand'),(39117,4,0,'Resist the Lich King\'s will, Devlin! Come to us!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,39157,0,'Shadow Priestess Malia'),(39117,5,0,'I had better return to my post. You can find me downstairs if you need anything.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39158,0,'Shadow Priestess Malia'),(38553,0,0,'It\'s time to join the fray, $n!  With you on our side the scales will surely tip in our favor!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Krennan Aranas to Player'),(37803,0,0,'We will not die as slaves... we\'re Gilneans!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Marcus'),(37803,1,0,'This is our land. They\'re not going to take it away without a fight!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(36288,0,0,'Are you one of the good worgen, $g mister:ma\'am;?  Did you see Cynthia hiding in the sheds outside?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ashley to Player'),(44086,0,0,'You can\'t do this to us!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,44377,0,'Panicked Citizen to Gilneas City Guard'),(44086,1,1,'It means we go from here! The screams are stronger every night.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Panicked Citizen Random Saying'),(44086,2,2,'Why are the doors closed data?',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Panicked Citizen Random Saying'),(35552,2,0,'My men and I will hole up inside the Light\'s Dawn Cathedral.  I\'ve already given the order and the cannons are on their way.  Lead our people well, Genn.',12,0,100,66,0,19696,0,36105,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(35552,1,0,'Not a chance, boy.  Gilneas is going to need its king\'s undivided attention.  Can\'t have your father wondering whether his child is alive or not.',12,0,100,66,0,19696,0,36104,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(35551,0,0,'I\'ll stay behind with the Royal Guard, father.  It is my duty to Gilneas.',12,0,100,1,0,19622,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Player'),(35552,0,0,'We need to keep the worgen\'s attention in the city, Genn.  It\'s the only shot we have for the survivors to make it to Duskhaven.',12,0,100,274,0,19507,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(35911,0,0,'If we can make it past the gates into Duskhaven we\'ll be safe.  The eastern mountains are virtually impassable.',12,0,100,1,0,19719,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(35911,1,0,'We were fools to take up arms against each other, Darius.  The worgen would\'ve never stood a chance.',12,0,100,1,0,19696,0,36108,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(17651,1,0,'You dare challenge me at my own dwelling?  Your arrogance is astounding, even for a dragon!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14297,0,'Image of Medivh'),(98027,0,0,'Hi, $ct!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Laughing Sister to Player'),(115445,0,0,'Free at last! Do what you can for the others, I\'ll be fine...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Shipwrecked Soldier to Player'),(115453,0,0,'Freedom? I will 