g.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143615,0,''),(341,0,0,'Somebody... please... get... rock... off... me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43173,0,'Foreman Oslow'),(131345,2,0,'Use the lessons I have taught you to maintain control. Become a weapon for the Alliance... even as you skirt the edge of darkness.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143206,0,''),(130993,1,1,'Now, for the first time in ages, we can walk beneath a sky not befouled by the Legion\'s madness... and feel the earth under our hooves again.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,141913,0,''),(130993,2,2,'But we must not grow complacent. One war ends, the next begins. Such is the life of a soldier.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,141914,0,''),(130993,3,3,'Your duty begins in Stormwind. Explore this world of Azeroth. Get to know the people and places we have sworn to defend.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,141915,0,''),(130993,4,4,'And always walk in the Light, $p.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,141916,0,''),(37073,0,0,'You break our cave, I break your skull!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36904,0,'Rockjaw Goon'),(37073,1,0,'Trogg cave all gone!  You pay for this!!',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,36905,0,'Rockjaw Goon to Player'),(37080,0,0,'Thanks!  I can make it from here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36982,0,'Wounded Coldridge Mountaineer'),(37080,1,0,'Thanks!  I can make it from here.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,36982,0,'Wounded Coldridge Mountaineer to Player'),(37080,2,0,'Yer a lifesaver!  For Ironforge!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,36983,0,'Wounded Coldridge Mountaineer to Player'),(37081,0,0,'Get back, ye filthy beast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37007,0,'Joren Ironstock'),(37081,1,0,'Get back, ye filthy beast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37007,0,'Joren Ironstock to Rockjaw Invader'),(37081,2,0,'For Ironforge!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37009,0,'Joren Ironstock to Rockjaw Invader'),(37108,0,0,'Da spirits be angry with us.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36962,0,'Soothsayer Shi\'kala'),(37108,1,0,'I don\' know why the spirits be rejectin\' us so.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36958,0,'Soothsayer Shi\'kala'),(37108,2,0,'Don\' worry, child.  Grik\'nir gonna help us get through this.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36959,0,'Soothsayer Shi\'kala'),(37112,0,0,'I am from the elemental plane!',14,12,100,0,0,0,0,36949,0,'Wayward Fire Elemental'),(37112,1,0,'I AM FROM THE ELEMENTAL PLANE!',12,12,100,0,0,0,0,37019,0,'Wayward Fire Elemental'),(37173,0,0,'What we gon\' do now, you ask?  We wait.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36957,0,'Soothsayer Rikkari'),(37173,1,0,'Grik\'nir says he gon\' talk to the elemental, get it to fight on our side.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36960,0,'Soothsayer Rikkari'),(37173,2,0,'Soon enough we take over dis valley.  Soon enough.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36961,0,'Soothsayer Rikkari'),(37174,0,0,'Our land be a land of ice an\' snow.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36963,0,'Soothsayer Mirim\'koa'),(37174,1,0,'But beneath the earth, child, there always be fire.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36964,0,'Soothsayer Mirim\'koa'),(37174,2,0,'De spirit come from deep down to talk with Grik\'nir.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36965,0,'Soothsayer Mirim\'koa'),(37507,0,0,'You be dead soon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10434,0,'Frostmane Blade'),(37518,0,0,'<Static>$bIs this thing on?  Hello?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,37115,0,'Milo Geartwinge'),(37518,1,0,'Ahh, there you are.  Hello!  I figured that, while you\'re flying to Kharanos, I\'d give you some data about what\'s going on outside of Coldridge Valley.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,37117,0,'Milo Geartwinge'),(37518,2,0,'It seems you Coldridge folks are dreadfully under-informed about the events of the last few days.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,37118,0,'Milo Geartwinge'),(37518,3,0,'If you thought you had problems with trolls in Coldridge, wait \'til you get to Kharanos!  That big cataclysm got the trolls all stirred up out here.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,37119,0,'Milo Geartwinge'),(37518,4,0,'And if you\'ll look to your left, you\'ll see that the gnomes have retaken Gnomeregan.  Hooray for us!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43112,0,'Milo Geartwinge'),(37518,5,0,'There\'s plenty else going on out here, too.  We\'ve opened up the path to the airport, there\'s rumors of Dark Irons in the east... oh, and I think something weird is going on with that dwarf king, Magni.  Might want to check it out.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43113,0,'Milo Geartwinge'),(37518,6,0,'And here we are!  Welcome to Kharanos!  Watch your step on the way out.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43115,0,'Milo Geartwinge'),(40950,0,0,'There\'s no substitute for live observers, but I need those mountaineers here. We\'ll have to rely on those little gnomish observer bots for now...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,43522,0,'Captain Tharran to Player'),(40950,1,0,'Most of our steam tanks are out of commission and we\'re losing mountaineers quickly.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,43236,0,'Captain Tharran'),(40950,2,0,'We can\'t keep up the operation much longer. Delber and his team must launch their attack from Steelgrill\'s Depot as soon as possible!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,43243,0,'Captain Tharran'),(40950,3,0,'Glad to hear it. I\'ll send Delber any forces I can spare.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,43253,0,'Captain Tharran'),(40950,4,0,'There\'s no substitute for live observers, but I need those mountaineers here. We\'ll have to rely on those little gnomish observer bots for now...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,43522,0,'Captain Tharran to Player'),(40951,0,0,'It won\'t be long before we\'re out of supplies too, Captain. Between the trolls and the yeti raids, we\'ll be down to half rations within a week.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43242,0,'Quartermaster Glynna to Captain Tharran'),(40991,0,0,'Tell Captain Tharran that I\'ll be back in Kharanos as soon as I\'ve verified that the bot is working correctly.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,41005,0,'Mountaineer Dunstan to Player'),(40994,0,0,'I can\'t wait to get out there and help in the fight against those trolls.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,41006,0,'Mountaineer Lewin to Player'),(41056,0,0,'We\'ve been fighting nonstop since the cataclysm. It\'ll be nice to get a rest, if a brief one.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,41008,0,'Mountaineer Valgrum to Player'),(41121,0,0,'Iman m t\'ief fu Fus\'obeah italaf ',12,14,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frostmane Seer to Player'),(41237,0,0,'%s gasps for air.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29786,0,'Kharanos Mountaineer to Constriction Totem'),(41237,1,0,'Thank you for freeing me!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,41181,0,'Kharanos Mountaineer to Constriction Totem'),(41251,0,0,'Can\'t... lift... tools...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frostmane Builder'),(41251,1,0,'Take curse away!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frostmane Builder'),(41251,2,0,'Why everyone else get so big?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,50322,0,'Frostmane Builder to Player'),(41251,3,0,'No make me small!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,50321,0,'Frostmane Builder to Player'),(41335,0,0,'Delber and his men are working overtime, captain. He has devised a means of delivering an assault team to the rear flank of the battle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43245,0,'Covert Operative to Captain Tharran'),(41335,1,0,'We\'ve also secured air support for the operation and will be ready to deploy soon. If any of your men want to join the assault team, just send them to Delber.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43248,0,'Covert Operative to Captain Tharran'),(41578,0,0,'The Frostmane trolls have been raiding the ranch continuously.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,41525,0,'Sergeant Flinthammer to Player'),(41578,1,0,'As it is, there are barely enough of us to keep them from taking everything.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,41526,0,'Sergeant Flinthammer to Player'),(41578,2,0,'They just take the rams and go. The herd can\'t take any more.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,41527,0,'Sergeant Flinthammer to Player'),(41578,3,0,'One of the mountaineers has seen something. Keep your eyes open!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,41528,0,'Sergeant Flinthammer to Player'),(41603,0,0,'If you want your rams back, come get them, cowards!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,41519,0,'Frostmane Raider to Player'),(41611,0,0,'Does anyone hear something strange?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,41521,0,'Amberstill Mountaineer to Player'),(41611,1,0,'There it is again! I know I heard something!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,41522,0,'Amberstill Mountaineer to Player'),(41611,2,0,'Frostmane raiders! Sound the alarm!',14,0,100,5,0,7234,0,41523,0,'Amberstill Mountaineer to Player'),(41611,3,0,'To arms, mountaineers! Take back those rams!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,41524,0,'Amberstill Mountaineer to Player'),(41671,0,0,'I can\'t wait to get home to my family. Thank you, stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Trapped Miner - rescued'),(41671,1,0,'I can\'t wait to get home to my family. Thank you, stranger.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,41542,0,'Trapped Miner to Player'),(41671,2,0,'Light bless you, stranger. You\'ve saved me!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,41540,0,'Trapped Miner to Player'),(41671,3,0,'You\'re the best thing I\'ve seen since the troggs showed up!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,41541,0,'Trapped Miner to Player'),(41763,0,0,'%s gasps for air and shivers in the cold.',16,0,100,20,0,0,0,41593,0,'Frozen Mountaineer'),(42010,0,0,'Long live the Dark Iron!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,41821,0,'General Grimaxe to Dark Iron Golem'),(42129,0,0,'How dare you storm into my throne room and attempt to spread this conspiratorial nonsense!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,42005,0,'Moira Thaurissan to Player'),(42129,1,0,'I will not let you and this treasonous Commander Stonebreaker steal my son\'s birthright!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,42006,0,'Moira Thaurissan to Player'),(42129,2,0,'Both of you know I would never order such a thing! Why would I set one half my son\'s inheritance against the other?',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,42022,0,'Moira Thaurissan to Player'),(42129,3,0,'No, this is the work of a traitor to both our peoples. Despite my best efforts, some Dark Irons remain in the grip of Twilight\'s Hammer.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42026,0,'Moira Thaurissan to Player'),(42129,4,0,'The cult must have someone in the city to coordinate this kind of attack. That only leaves one suspect, Ambassador Slaghammer!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42028,0,'Moira Thaurissan to Player'),(42129,5,0,'If we were in Shadowforge City, I would have you tossed into the Ring of Law for your transgressions, Ambassador. The darkest dungeons of Ironforge will have to do for now.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,42044,0,'Moira Thaurissan to Arrest the Ambassador Credit'),(42131,0,0,'Muradin has a point. If you cannot govern your own people, you have no place at this table.',12,7,100,273,0,0,0,42017,0,'Falstad Wildhammer to Player'),(42153,0,0,'I go willingly, $c. My purpose in my master\'s plan is fulfilled.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42046,0,'Ambassador Slaghammer to Player'),(42153,1,0,'Do as you will with me. I am not afraid. That halfbreed runt will never be my emperor! Long live Twilight\'s Hammer!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,42043,0,'Ambassador Slaghammer to Arrest the Ambassador Credit'),(42928,0,0,'That is quite an accusation, Moira. It\'s hardly your throne room in the first place.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,42007,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard to Player'),(42928,1,0,'I know Commander Stonebreaker and I will vouch for his loyalty and his honesty. We must take his word.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42008,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard to Player'),(42928,2,0,'What cause do the Dark Irons have for taking up arms against Ironforge? Are you unable to control your own people, Moira?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,42012,0,'Muradin Bronzebeard to Player'),(131345,0,0,'Some will tell you that the Light is the only path. The one weapon that can stop the enemies of Azeroth.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143203,0,''),(130986,1,0,'Congratulations.',12,0,100,0,0,96043,1,146010,5,'Vigilant Quoram to Player'),(130986,2,0,'I am told power comes from unlikely places.',12,0,100,0,0,96046,1,146013,5,'Vigilant Quoram to Player'),(130986,3,0,'For now.',12,0,100,0,0,96048,1,146015,5,'Vigilant Quoram to Player'),(130986,4,0,'Fine.',12,0,100,0,0,96049,1,146016,5,'Vigilant Quoram to Player'),(130993,0,0,'For thousands of years, the Lightforged fought demons in the Twisting Nether. The Xenedar was the only home we knew.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,141912,0,''),(130986,0,0,'Why have you returned?',12,0,100,0,0,96042,1,146009,5,'Vigilant Quoram to Player'),(131345,1,0,'But we see alternatives. Many roads--many possibilities--that are open to us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143204,0,''),(23616,2,0,'%s thanks you with a special dance.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,22070,0,'kyle EMOTE_DANCE'),(341,0,1,'Hurts... Hurts 