 away from my flying machine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36157,0,'Gyrochoppa Pilot to Player'),(36143,0,0,'Find the Precious Cargo!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,36177,0,'Gyrochoppa to Player'),(36161,0,0,'Spirits of the sea, rise and lay waste to my enemies!',14,0,100,0,0,20141,0,36198,0,'Thrall'),(36403,0,0,'I want you all to listen good... anyone who\'s not with me can start looking for a new job!',14,0,100,15,0,19593,0,36384,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Player'),(36425,0,0,'Uh oh, it\'s the Trade Prince.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49864,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(36615,0,0,'On my way!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38775,0,'Doc Zapnozzle to Goblin Survivor'),(36513,0,0,'You think you\'re such a bigshot, saving everyone and making friends with these orc savages?!',14,0,100,25,0,16459,0,36460,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Player'),(36513,1,0,'I\'m gonna crush you! I\'m the Trade Prince! Me! I gotta plan that\'s gonna get me off of this island and make me the king of Azshara!',14,0,100,25,0,19585,0,36461,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Player'),(36513,2,0,'Mark my words! I\'m gonna get you, $n! I\'ll get you all! Out of my way!',14,0,100,15,0,16459,0,36462,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Player'),(36519,0,0,'Is that a volcano over on that other island?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36392,0,'Evol Fingers'),(36608,5,0,'You made the right choice. We all owe you a great deal, $n. Try not to get yourself killed out here.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36548,0,'Doc Zapnozzle to Player'),(36608,3,0,'Come on! Clear!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36546,0,'Doc Zapnozzle to Player'),(36608,4,0,'That\'s all I\'ve got. It\'s up to $g him : her; now. You hear me, $n? Come on, snap out of it! Don\'t go into the Light!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36547,0,'Doc Zapnozzle to Player'),(36622,0,0,'I will see you up top, $n. Thank you again for my freedom!',12,0,100,0,0,20140,0,36558,0,'Thrall to Player'),(36471,0,0,'Hobart\'s right behind you, $g sir : ma\'am;.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,49888,0,'Foreman Dampwick to Player'),(36608,2,0,'Stay back, I\'m going to resuscitate $g him : her;! I hope these wet jumper cables don\'t kill us all!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36545,0,'Doc Zapnozzle to Player'),(36608,1,0,'That\'s $n! $G He\'s : She\'s; the whole reason we\'re still breathing and not crispy fried critters back on Kezan.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36544,0,'Doc Zapnozzle to Player'),(36608,0,0,'Gizmo, what are you doing just sitting there? Don\'t you recognize who that is laying next to you?!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,36543,0,'Doc Zapnozzle to Player'),(36600,1,0,'Yeah, there\'s tons of people still trapped in the escape pods, boss. Oh, wait. I guess you\'re not the boss anymore. Anyways, they\'re all probably going to drown if you don\'t get them out.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49824,0,'Geargrinder Gizmo to Player'),(36600,0,0,'Yeah, there\'s tons of people still trapped in the escape pods, boss. Oh, wait. I guess you\'re not the boss anymore. Anyways, they\'re all probably going to drown if you don\'t get them out.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49824,0,'Geargrinder Gizmo to Player'),(38120,0,0,'It\'s really quite simple, $n. Just attach these fireworks to the wild cluckers and I\'ll use this controller to fly them into the cage.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,49894,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38120,1,0,'$n, over here if you please.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,41262,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38120,2,0,'Don\'t underestimate the Mechachicken, $n. After all, it is a Hobart Grapplehammer invention!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,49900,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38120,3,0,'Greely, load The Biggest Egg Ever into the Poultryizer. Mechnuggets for everyone!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,38106,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38120,4,0,'Shut it down, shut it down! The eggs are bad!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38170,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38120,5,0,'The marketing research Megs has conducted suggests that a naga invasion is imminent!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,49934,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38120,6,0,'Take your time, my $g boy : girl;. Now what can I modify this shredder boot to be? Hmm.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,50086,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38120,7,0,'I\'ve set the Bootzooka to fire several rockets per shot. I\'m fairly certain that I perfectly calibrated the targeting.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,50087,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38120,8,0,'Booster rockets for cages. What will I think of next? I am a genius!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,50112,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Player'),(38122,0,0,'Hey, $n, come over here, would ya? I\'ve got something for you to do.',12,0,100,70,0,6820,0,41261,0,'Bamm Megabomb to Player'),(38122,1,0,'Now get us some real eggs.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,49899,0,'Bamm Megabomb to Player'),(38124,0,0,'Genius idea, sir. Your brain power never ceases to amaze me!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,38119,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38124,1,0,'This thing is huge! Reverse the polarity on the Poultryizer. We\'ll have to shove it in through the outtake.',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,38141,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38124,2,0,'There it goes.  It should only be a moment now....',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,38142,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38124,3,0,'$n, get to the Mechashark X-Steam Controller. Rid us of the Hammer menace!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49911,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38124,4,0,'Look for the mounds of glowing stuff on the ground.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50082,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38124,5,0,'Greely drools a little as she continues her mindless labor.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,50101,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38124,6,0,'Get rid of those Steamwheedle Sharks before they trounce us!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50105,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38124,7,0,'It\'s time for a little sabotage!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,50109,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38124,8,0,'Deliver the footbomb uniform to the Slave Pits. Hurry, $n!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,50111,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(38359,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,36719,0,'Vashj\'elan Warrior'),(38381,0,0,'We can discuss the cut after you come back with the hides. I\'m thinking ninety-ten.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,49948,0,'Brett \"Coins\" McQuid to Player'),(38387,0,0,'$n, hop into one of those B.C. Eliminators and wipe out the pygmies!',14,0,100,25,0,18259,0,49973,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38387,1,0,'You\'re going to have to take the fight to them, $n. Look for Izzy just outside their village.',12,0,100,273,0,18259,0,49974,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38387,2,0,'Those zombies are slow. You don\'t have to run right through them. Don\'t let them eat your brains, $n!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50013,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38387,3,0,'Goblin grenades versus gnomish land mines. Show them who\'s better, $n!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50095,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38387,4,0,'I forget... did you take flying lessons back on Kezan?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,50097,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38387,5,0,'Better hurry up, $n. I think that Thrall has news on where our people are being held.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,50099,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38387,6,0,'First she left you for Chip, and now the Trade Prince! She was never good enough for you, $n.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,50114,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38387,7,0,'$n, get into the Ultimate Footbomb Uniform behind you and get down to the docks. Help Thrall kick the Trade Prince\'s butt!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43948,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38409,0,0,'Bull\'s-eye!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,38644,0,'Goblin Survivor to B.C. Eliminator'),(38409,1,0,'What do you think? Zombie Kill of the Week?',14,0,100,274,0,0,0,38646,0,'Goblin Survivor to B.C. Eliminator'),(38409,2,0,'Ooh, that\'s gotta hurt!',14,0,100,274,0,0,0,38645,0,'Goblin Survivor to B.C. Eliminator'),(38409,3,0,'That hurt!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38773,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38409,4,0,'Doc!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38766,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38409,5,0,'Chocolate-flavored vanilla!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37330,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38409,6,0,'Invisible condiments. For an unobstructed view of your food.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37360,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38409,7,0,'Giant gnomes. No, wait... tiny giants!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37359,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38409,8,0,'Shoes with wheels on them. And gloves with wheels - for when you fall down.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37361,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38409,9,0,'Mom detectors.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37414,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38409,10,0,'Headshoes!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37332,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38432,0,0,'You hear that, naga? $n is on $g his : her; way to settle our \"negotiations\"!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,49938,0,'Megs Dreadshredder to Player'),(38432,1,0,'Everybody loves a pool pony. It\'s our fastest selling toy behind the Kablooey Bombs: Infant Edition.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49951,0,'Megs Dreadshredder to Player'),(38432,2,0,'That pygmy helm should fool them, at least for a little while. Get back to town!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,44571,0,'Megs Dreadshredder to Player'),(38441,0,0,'I never liked that guy. He stole your girlfriend. I say, good riddance!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,50108,0,'Ace to Player'),(38441,1,0,'I never liked that guy. He stole your girlfriend. I say, good riddance!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,50108,0,'Ace to Player'),(38448,0,0,'WHO DARES?!',14,0,100,15,0,15136,0,38338,0,'Faceless of the Deep to Player'),(38448,1,0,'Little goblins? I remember when your race was created.',14,0,100,1,0,15139,0,38346,0,'Faceless of the Deep to Player'),(38448,2,0,'I care nothing for your threats or these naga. Prepare to be removed from existence.',14,0,100,25,0,15140,0,38349,0,'Faceless of the Deep to Player'),(38448,3,0,'Now, young $n, you will die!',14,0,100,0,0,15140,0,38359,0,'Faceless of the Deep to Player'),(38455,0,0,'I got these little hellions on a short leash, $n. The naga won\'t attack us while we have their hatchlings.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38356,0,'Ace to Player'),(38455,1,0,'You ready to make their leader surrender, $g buddy : lady;? Okay, here we go.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38357,0,'Ace to Player'),(38455,2,0,'We\'ve got your hatchlings. You better not attack us if you know what\'s good for you!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,38375,0,'Ace'),(38455,3,0,'We know you were getting ready to attack us. You brought this on yourselves.',14,0,100,5,0,3434,0,38377,0,'Ace'),(38455,4,0,'You naga keep your distance. We\'re not kidding around here!',14,0,100,5,0,3434,0,38374,0,'Ace'),(38455,5,0,'Alright, naga leader, come on out from hiding and surrender in the name of $n and the Bilgewater Cartel!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,38381,0,'Ace to Player'),(38455,6,0,'Um, dude, this does not look good. I\'m out of here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,38358,0,'Ace to Faceless of the Deep'),(38517,0,0,'Okay. We\'re going to move away from the exploding volcano and try to hook up with the orcs for the final assault on the Trade Prince. See you on the other side... I hope.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39240,0,'Slinky Sharpshiv to Player'),(38643,0,0,'The other captives are up in the volcano... they\'re being sacrificed, or worse, zombiefied!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,38572,0,'Goblin Captive to Oomlot Shaman'),(38643,1,0,'I really can\'t thank you enough!',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,38570,0,'Goblin Captive to Oomlot Shaman'),(38643,2,0,'They were trying to change me into a zombie!!!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,38568,0,'Goblin Captive to Oomlot Shaman'),(38643,3,0,'They took the others up into the volcano. Some to turn into zombies, some to sacrifice to their turtle god, Volcanoth!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,38571,0,'Goblin Captive to Oomlot Shaman'),(38643,4,0,'I\'m free! I owe you my life!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,38565,0,'Goblin Captive to Oomlot Shaman'),(38643,5,0,'I felt my life slipping out of me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38567,0,'Goblin Captive to Oomlot Shaman'),(38647,0,0,'$n, you gotta get in there and rescue our people!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,50007,0,'Izzy to Player'),(38647,1,0,'Goblin zombies? The Town-In-A-Box has to be warned!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,50008,0,'Izzy to Player'),(38696,0,0,'Echuta, gobin!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38555,0,'Yngwie'),(38696,1,0,'GOBIN!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38552,0,'Yngwie to Player'),(38738,0,0,'Get in there and show those zombies what the Bilgewater Buccaneers are made of, kid!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,50072,0,'Coach Crosscheck to Player'),(38738,1,0,'You\'re going to love this!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,50083,0,'Coach Crosscheck to Player'),(38738,2,0,'We\'re gonna make you the ultimate footbomb uniform, kid. But first, we need parts. Lots of them.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,50106,0,'Coach Crosscheck to Player'),(38745,0,0,'Little help here!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38767,0,'Kezan Citizen'),(38745,1,0,'How about this: Instant water! Just add... oh.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37333,0,'Kezan Citizen'),(38745,2,0,'Bagel-holes!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37420,0,'Kezan Citizen'),(38855,0,0,'Stay out of the way of Volcanoth\'s breath!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,38847,0,'Volcanoth to Player'),(38869,0,0,'Hang on, $n! We have to get out of here, NOW!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38874,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(38928,0,0,'$n, come on! Get over here!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38908,0,'Sassy Hardwrench to Player'),(39065,0,0,'Deliver justice for our dead, $n.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,50094,0,'Aggra to Player'),(39065,1,0,'You honor us with your actions on behalf of our dead, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50096,0,'Aggra to Player'),(39066,0,0,'Run, Bastia! Get $n to Sky Falls and the labor mine.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50100,0,'Kilag Gorefang to Player'),(39066,1,0,'Run, Bastia! Get $n to Sky Falls and the labor mine.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50100,0,'Kilag Gorefang to Player'),(39193,0,0,'You no mine ore, you get beating!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39319,0,'Brute Overseer to Player'),(39193,1,0,'Break time over!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39322,0,'Brute Overseer to Player'),(39193,2,0,'Me like beat you up!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39320,0,'Brute Overseer to Player'),(39193,3,0,'Me get big bonus for capture you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39316,0,'Brute Overseer to Player'),(39193,4,0,'Back to work!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36805,0,'Brute Overseer to Player'),(39194,0,0,'What? You\'re not supposed to be here. You\'re dead!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39340,0,'Blastshadow the Brutemaster to Player'),(39195,0,0,'Kill that goblin, quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39341,0,'Delicia Whipsnaps to Player'),(39195,1,0,'NOOOOOOO!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,39297,0,'Delicia Whipsnaps to Blastshadow the Brutemaster'),(39198,0,0,'So I have this idea for a movie. Three gnomes find a bracelet of power...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37334,0,'Ace to Player'),(39199,0,0,'I\'VE GOT AN IDEA!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,39259,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(39199,1,0,'We\'ve got to get our people out of here, $n! The key is to get them to drink plenty of Kaja\'Cola Zero-One!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,50102,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(39199,2,0,'We\'re not a part of your system!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,39312,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(39199,3,0,'$n, we need to escape through the northern tunnel!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50103,0,'Assistant Greely to Player'),(39201,0,0,'A binary number system. It uses only two numbers. 6 and 11.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37358,0,'Gobber to Player'),(39426,0,0,'But, sweetie...?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39465,0,'Candy Cane to Player'),(39456,0,0,'Tell my husband I love him very much!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39499,0,'Captured Goblin to Player'),(39456,1,0,'Mommy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39497,0,'Captured Goblin to Player'),(39456,2,0,'3... 2... 1...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39498,0,'Captured Goblin to Player'),(39456,3,0,'Tell my wife I love her very much!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39499,0,'Captured Goblin to Player'),(39456,4,0,'Um... you do realize there\'s a bottom to this cage?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39496,0,'Captured Goblin to Player'),(39582,0,0,'I\'m so money!',14,0,100,0,0,19579,0,39574,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Thrall'),(39582,1,0,'No one attacks the Big G and lives!',14,0,100,0,0,19565,0,47396,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Player'),(39582,2,0,'Here\'s some of that moolah back that I took from you!',14,0,100,0,0,19577,0,39572,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Thrall'),(39582,3,0,'I SEE THE TRAITOR IS HERE TO RESCUE YOU, WARCHIEF. HOW CONVENIENT. YOU WILL BOTH BOW TO ME OR FALL TOGETHER!',14,0,100,0,0,19567,0,39530,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix'),(39582,4,0,'I need to move these toxic assets onto a sucker... like you!',14,0,100,0,0,19570,0,39560,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix'),(39582,5,0,'Gotta trim some fat around here. I\'m downsizing the company!',14,0,100,0,0,19573,0,39558,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Ultimate Footbomb Uniform'),(39582,6,0,'Here, I need to unload some toxic assets!',14,0,100,0,0,19568,0,39551,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix'),(39582,7,0,'I\'m downsizing the cartel, starting with you!',14,0,100,0,0,19571,0,39556,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Thrall'),(39594,0,0,'Thrall grunts and thinks a moment on what to do with the Trade Prince.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,39585,0,'Thrall to Trade Prince Gallywix'),(39594,1,0,'For now, you will remain the Trade Prince of the Bilgewater Cartel.',14,0,100,1,0,22513,0,39586,0,'Thrall to Trade Prince Gallywix'),(39594,2,0,'I will send a representative from amongst your people to the new warchief, Garrosh Hellscream in Orgrimmar.',14,0,100,1,0,20148,0,39587,0,'Thrall to Trade Prince Gallywix'),(315,2,2,'It\'s all true, brother. Every word. You doubted it?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,43965,0,'Stalvan Mistmantle to Player'),(315,3,3,'You know why!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,43968,0,'Stalvan Mistmantle to Player'),(315,4,4,'Surely you\'ve felt anger. Anger so foul and vicious that it makes you want to tear someone to shreds...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43978,0,'Stalvan Mistmantle to Player'),(315,5,5,'Aren\'t you feeling it right now?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,43979,0,'Stalvan Mistmantle to Player'),(315,6,6,'You see, brother... we\'re not so different...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,43981,0,'Stalvan Mistmantle to Tobias Mistmantle'),(43453,0,0,'Brother!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43966,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(43453,1,1,'Tell me it\'s not true, brother. Tell me you didn\'t die a murderer!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,43967,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(43453,2,2,'But why?! How could you?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,43973,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(43797,3,3,'No... NO! STOP IT!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,43980,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(43797,4,4,'No...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43982,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Stalvan Mistmantle'),(33304,6,0,'Show yourself, elf-coward! Face your death with honor!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorat Yells'),(33304,5,0,'He must fall!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorat Says'),(33304,3,0,'Follow me closely, and prepare for battle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorat Says'),(33304,4,0,'Captain Elendilad conceals himself on the island ahead, cowardly issuing orders to his underlings.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorat Says'),(33304,0,0,'Thank you, friend. I could not rest knowing that my mission had not been completed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorat Says'),(33304,1,0,'...and that my mens\' sacrifice had not been avenged.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorat Says'),(33304,2,0,'We must hurry, now. I sense that my time is short.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorat Says'),(33440,0,1,'You stay close, $c. And don\'t let elfs near me!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Demoralized Peon 1'),(33440,0,2,'You keep a lookout, $c! The elfs are everywhere!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Demoralized Peon 2'),(33440,0,3,'Hmm. You don\'t look very tough... but okay.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Demoralized Peon 3'),(33440,1,4,'I have bad feeling about this....',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Demoralized Peon 4'),(33440,1,5,'I\'m trusting you... Don\'t let me die!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Demoralized Peon 5'),(33440,2,6,'There you go, $c.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Demoralized Peon 6'),(39270,2,1,'Thank you again.  I will return to Razor Hill now.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,39304,0,'Injured Razor Hill Grunt to Player'),(39270,2,0,'It was an honor to watch you fight, $n.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,39305,0,'Injured Razor Hill Grunt to Player'),(39270,1,2,'I was supposed to die in battle... ah well, another day.  I will follow you until I recover.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,39300,0,'Injured Razor Hill Grunt to Player'),(39270,1,1,'For the Warchief!  You lead, I will follow.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,39302,0,'Injured Razor Hill Grunt to Player'),(39270,1,0,'You\'ve saved my life, $c.  Protect me for a few more moments while I recover.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,39301,0,'Injured Razor Hill Grunt to Player'),(33266,0,0,'Death to the Alliance',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Wounded Mor\'shan Defender Says'),(33266,0,1,'Many thanks $C',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,'Wounded Mor\'shan Defender Says'),(33266,0,2,'For the Horde!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Wounded Mor\'shan Defender Says'),(38345,0,1,'Thank the Earth Mother!',12,0,100,5,10,0,0,38278,0,'Captured Brave'),(38345,0,2,'I can move again!',12,0,100,5,10,0,0,38279,0,'Captured Brave'),(38345,0,3,'The quilboar will pay!',12,0,100,15,10,0,0,38280,0,'Captured Brave'),(2948,1,1,'The totem is made, $n.',12,3,100,0,0,0,0,954,0,'Mull Thunderhorn'),(2948,1,0,'It is done.',12,3,100,0,0,0,0,953,0,'Mull Thunderhorn'),(2948,0,2,'%s enters a trance...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,999,0,'Mull Thunderhorn'),(2948,0,1,'%s holds high the items $n gave him...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,955,0,'Mull Thunderhorn'),(2948,0,0,'%s begins a rite of creation...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,952,0,'Mull Thunderhorn'),(39853,3,0,'My essence...will...persist...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Taerar'),(39853,2,0,'Peace is but a fleeting dream! Let the NIGHTMARE reign!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Taerar'),(39853,1,0,'Peace? PEACE?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Taerar'),(39853,0,0,'I knew you\'d return, Ysondre...It was only a matter of time...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Taerar'),(39407,1,0,'I\'ve returned only to end this, Taerar. This land will finally have peace.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ysondre'),(39407,0,0,'Come forth, Taerar! I stand before you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ysondre'),(2948,1,2,'I have the totem of cleansing, $n.',12,3,100,0,0,0,0,1005,0,'Mull Thunderhorn'),(2948,1,3,'The totem is made.  The well may now be cleansed.',12,3,100,0,0,0,0,1006,0,'Mull Thunderhorn'),(34571,0,0,'Welcome back, $n.  You were fortunate.  Krennan\'s treatment doesn\'t always work this well on people who\'ve had the Curse as long as you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Gwen Armstead to Player'),(34851,0,0,'What... what are those things on the rooftops?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Panicked Citizen to Player'),(35550,0,1,'Fire!',14,0,100,0,0,19710,0,36091,0,'King Genn Greymane'),(35550,0,2,'Hold the barricades!  Do not give them an inch!',14,0,100,0,0,19709,0,36090,0,'King Genn Greymane'),(35230,1,0,'You\'ll never catch us, you blasted mongrels!',14,0,100,0,0,19505,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(36287,0,0,'You are scary!  I just want my mommy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cynthia to Player'),(35369,0,0,'The pain is unbearable!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38739,0,'Josiah Avery'),(34913,0,0,'Stand your ground, men!',14,0,100,0,0,19617,0,35166,0,'Prince Liam Greymane'),(61348,25,0,'Fascinating, I have never heard tales of anything like this. The mogu hide their secrets well.',12,0,100,5,0,30183,0,65992,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Mogu\'shan Warden'),(35906,0,0,'We\'ve got Aranas!  Fire at will!',14,0,100,0,0,19634,0,0,0,'Lord Godfrey to Player'),(35907,0,0,'Thank you!  I owe you my life.',12,0,100,0,0,20922,0,0,0,'Krennan Aranas to King Greymane\'s Horse'),(36132,0,0,'Do exercise caution.  Don\'t expect anyone to invite you to their homes just yet.  But at least they won\'t shoot you outright.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Krennan Aranas to Player'),(36207,0,0,'Gilneas will soon belong to the Forsaken!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Assassin to Player'),(36231,0,0,'Barrel smell like gunpowder...',12,0,100,0,0,20909,0,0,0,'Horrid Abomination to Player'),(36231,1,0,'GAH!!!!  I CAN\'T SEE IN HERE!!!!',12,0,100,0,0,20908,0,0,0,'Horrid Abomination to Player'),(36231,2,0,'Uh-oh... this gonna hurts me...',12,0,100,0,0,20911,0,0,0,'Horrid Abomination to Player'),(19667,0,0,'Hail, Gezhe!  Seventeen more orders have been placed in the Hara\'samid Sector.  The markets of heavy veldarite have all but collapsed, as you predicted.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17184,0,'Consortium Nether Runner'),(36330,0,0,'Give it up, Krennan.  It\'s time to put this one down.  It\'s protocol.',12,0,100,274,0,19635,0,0,0,'Lord Godfrey to Player'),(36331,0,0,'I am not giving up on you.  I don\'t have a cure for the Curse yet... but there are treatments.  You will have control again.',12,0,100,274,0,20919,0,0,0,'Krennan Aranas to Player'),(36332,1,0,'I didn\'t think so.  Now hand me that potion, Krennan... and double the dosage.',12,0,100,1,0,19722,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(36332,0,0,'Tell me, Godfrey.  Those that stayed in Gilneas City so that we could live.  Were they following protocol?',12,0,100,1,0,19721,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(50415,0,0,'You\'ve been bitten by a worgen.  It\'s probably nothing, but it sure stings a little.$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_monsterfang_02.blp:32|t',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Josiah Event Trigger to Player'),(50474,0,0,'Hold them back!  We must protect the survivors!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gilneas City Guard'),(36290,0,0,'Hold your positions, men!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,36632,0,'Lord Godfrey'),(36291,0,0,'What\'s happening?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36633,0,'Melinda Hammond'),(36294,0,0,'Who dares to touch Koroth\'s banner!?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Koroth the Hillbreaker to Player'),(36294,1,0,'You puny thief!  Koroth find you!  Koroth smash your face in!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Koroth the Hillbreaker to Player'),(36440,1,0,'Thank you... *gasp*   I owe you my life.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowning Watchman to Player'),(36440,0,0,'I... I thought I was a goner.  Thanks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowning Watchman to Player'),(36440,0,1,'The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowning Watchman to Player'),(36458,0,0,'You do not mess with my kitty you son of a mongrel!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grandma Wahl to Lucius the Cruel'),(36461,0,0,'I\'ll be taking this cat.  It seems to work as the perfect bait.  Prepare to die now, fool!',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,0,0,'Lucius the Cruel to Player'),(36814,0,0,'Let the Scythe unbind that which was not meant to be bound!  Let the soul master the beast, lest the beast master the soul!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Talran of the Wild to Player'),(37065,0,0,'Just in time, $n.  Here come the Forsaken.',12,0,100,0,0,19605,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Player'),(37065,1,0,'You will come no further, Forsaken scum!  By the war banner of the ancient Greymane clan, I expel you from our ancestral lands!',14,0,100,0,0,19606,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Player'),(37067,0,0,'I wasn\'t ready to die in a marsh.  Thanks again!',12,0,100,0,0,19605,0,0,0,'Crash Survivor'),(37195,0,0,'Get our men in position immediately, Tobias.  We cannot let the Scythe fall into the hands of the Forsaken!!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(37195,1,0,'Lorna!',14,0,100,0,0,19511,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(37694,0,0,'Thank you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Villager'),(37806,0,0,'Worthless mongrel.  I will order our outhouses cleaned with this rag you call a banner.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Asther to Player'),(37808,0,0,'Corpse-men take Koroth\'s banner!  Corpse-men get smashed to bitses!!!',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,0,0,'Koroth the Hillbreaker to Player'),(37870,0,0,'Just as Goldrinn\'s spirit once blessed our druids, let $n be blessed with the wisdom of his race and the ferocity of the wolf god.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lyros Swiftwind to Player'),(37873,0,0,'Just as Daral\'nir soothes the cursed druids who gave into the beast and abandoned balance, let Tal\'doren soothe $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vassandra Stormclaw to Player'),(37876,0,0,'It\'s over Godfrey.  You have no support left among the eastern lords.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(37953,0,0,'How did you--?!  It doesn\'t matter -- I don\'t need a trap to defeat you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dark Scout to Player'),(37953,1,0,'How did you--?!  It doesn\'t matter -- I don\'t need a trap to defeat you.',12,0,100,1,0,19605,0,0,0,'Dark Scout to Player'),(38029,0,0,'Keep them occupied, my brothers!  Allow $n to retrieve the scythe!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38029,1,0,'Fall back!  Retreat into the woods!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38051,0,0,'Darius!  The Dark Rangers have the Scythe!  They got to it before we were able to reach it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38051,1,0,'It will be done!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38469,0,0,'Enough!',14,0,100,0,0,23517,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38469,1,0,'Let\'s see how brave Gilneas gets on without its stubborn leader!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38469,2,0,'Such a waste.  That arrow\'s poison was not meant to be wasted on your whelp.  We\'ll meet again, Genn!',12,0,100,0,0,19606,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner to Prince Liam Greymane'),(38470,0,0,'Block their retreat, Liam!  We\'ve got them right where we want them!',14,0,100,0,0,19725,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38470,1,0,'SYLVANAS!!',14,0,100,0,0,19726,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38470,2,0,'LIAM!!  NO!!!',14,0,100,0,0,19727,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38474,0,0,'FATHER!!!',14,0,100,0,0,19612,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38474,1,0,'We did it, father...',12,0,100,0,0,19606,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38474,2,0,'We took back our city... we took back...',12,0,100,0,0,19606,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner'),(38507,0,0,'Let us go at once.  We will track Sylvanas down.  For Gilneas!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38507,1,0,'Follow Tobias Mistmantle into the Cathedral District.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38507,2,0,'Let\'s do our best not to be seen, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38507,3,0,'Did you hear that, $n?  Sylvanas is headed to the cathedral.  Let\'s hurry!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38507,4,0,'Quick!  Hide in the water!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle to Player'),(38530,0,0,'You can assure Garrosh that this is a minor setback.  Our victory in Gilneas will be absolute.',12,0,100,1,0,20492,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner to Player'),(38530,1,0,'You\'d do well to watch your tone, General.  Neither you nor Garrosh have anything to worry about.  We\'ve ceased all production of the Plague, as he ordered.  We\'d never deploy it without his permission.',12,0,100,0,0,20493,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner to Player'),(38530,2,0,'Go with honor, General.',12,0,100,0,0,20494,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner to Player'),(38530,3,0,'What kind of question is that?  Of course we\'re deploying the Plague as planned!  Let the Gilneans enjoy their small victory.  Not even their bones will remain by tomorrow.',12,0,100,0,0,20495,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner to Player'),(38533,0,0,'It appears you\'re losing control of Gilneas, Sylvanas.  Garrosh fears he\'s going to have to carry out this invasion himself.',12,0,100,1,0,22620,0,0,0,'General Warhowl to Player'),(38533,1,0,'You sound very confident, your Majesty.  I seriously hope you do not plan to use the Plague.  Garrosh has explicitly forbidden it.',12,0,100,274,0,22621,0,0,0,'General Warhowl to Player'),(38533,2,0,'I will deliver my report to our leader, then.  By your leave, my lady.',12,0,100,66,0,22622,0,0,0,'General Warhowl to Player'),(38537,0,0,'My Lady!  Should I order my men to stop the deployment of the Plague?  Or are we to continue as planned?',12,0,100,66,0,20917,0,0,0,'High Executor Crenshaw to Player'),(38537,1,0,'As you wish!',12,0,100,66,0,20918,0,0,0,'High Executor Crenshaw to Player'),(38617,0,0,'Make sure everything is ready.  The orcs\' emissary is ready to meet Sylvanas inside the cathedral.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken General to Player'),(38766,0,0,'Crowley!  You and your elven allies are hereby ordered to serve along the king\'s army.  Cursed or not, you are still bound by Gilnean law!',12,0,100,25,0,19636,0,0,0,'Lord Godfrey to Player'),(38767,0,0,'No, old friend.  I\'ve come to you as an equal.',12,0,100,0,0,19723,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(38768,0,0,'Father!',14,0,100,0,0,19697,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley to Player'),(38781,0,0,'You did it! We\'re saved!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Gilnean Survivor to Player'),(43566,0,0,'Secure the rafters!',14,0,100,0,0,19688,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley'),(43566,1,0,'I want two sharpshooters to stay behind and cover the deck.  Everyone else, use the ropes to rappel down.  Let\'s give them hell!',14,0,100,0,0,19689,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley'),(43566,2,0,'Hands up, greenskins!  My men will give you your new bearing.  You try anything funny and we\'ll fill you with lead.',14,0,100,0,0,19690,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley'),(43566,3,0,'The rest of you, follow me downstairs!',14,0,100,0,0,19691,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley'),(43566,4,0,'We\'ve got the explosives  in the furnace room.  Just hold them off now!',12,0,100,0,0,19692,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley'),(43566,5,0,'That\'s... one big orc.',12,0,100,0,0,19693,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley'),(43566,6,0,'It\'s about to blow, jump on the Wyverns!',14,0,100,0,0,19694,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley'),(43566,7,0,'It\'s about to blow, jump on the Wyverns!',14,0,100,0,0,16419,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley'),(43727,0,0,'Everybody onboard the ships now!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley to Player'),(43749,0,0,'We must wait for the right time to strike!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle'),(43749,1,0,'Let\'s give everyone time to gather.  We\'ll need a handful of people to come with us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle'),(50893,0,0,'May the Light bless the spirits of our ancestors, for they\'ve chosen to allow my son to rest upon this holy ground.',12,0,100,1,0,19713,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(51409,0,0,'Look out! We\'re under attack!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley to Stagecoach Carriage'),(61348,26,0,'This seems to be a terminal controlling the device. Let\'s see here...',12,0,100,25,0,30184,0,65993,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,27,0,'Magnificent! It talks! This seems beyond what we thought the mogu were capable of.',12,0,100,5,0,30185,0,66000,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Invisible Stalker'),(61348,24,0,'This room pulses with energy, but feels unlike any we have seen so far.',12,0,100,5,0,30182,0,65991,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Mogu\'shan Warden'),(34864,1,2,'Gate is closed. Order from Prince Liam!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44373,0,''),(34864,1,1,'Everyone keep calm! We are controlling the situation.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44375,0,''),(34864,0,0,'No one\'s allowed to leave. Prince Liam\'s orders.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,44373,0,'Gilneas City Guard'),(36289,0,0,'Don\'t hurt me!  I was just looking for my sisters!  I think Ashley\'s inside that house!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'James to Player'),(33302,0,0,'How many times must I have you killed, orc?!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Elendilad Yells'),(33302,1,0,'Curse you, $N vermin! This forest belongs to the Kaldorei...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Elendilad Says on Death'),(50504,0,0,'Ishala! Ishala! Are you out there?!? Please, Ishala -- listen to my voice!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Belysra Starbreeze'),(50504,1,0,'I cannot leave without my child! Please, somebody, help!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Belysra Starbreeze'),(124299,0,0,'Follow me! Make haste and do not stray!',14,0,100,603,0,103587,0,0,0,'General Hammond Clay'),(124324,0,0,'For the Alliance!',14,0,100,4,0,102757,0,23351,0,'Darnassian Archer to Player'),(124792,0,0,'Soldiers! Fall in and form ranks!',14,0,100,53,0,103030,0,0,0,'Genn Greymane to Player'),(125622,0,0,'I should be able to make my way back. Thank you, friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51806,0,'Wounded Soldier to Player'),(125622,0,1,'Their attacks are relentless. Thank you for your help.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51807,0,'Wounded Soldier to Player'),(125622,0,2,'It was foolish of me to get caught away from the line. Thank you for the second chance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51804,0,'Wounded Soldier to Player'),(125622,0,3,'Thank you, Champion. I will find my own way out of here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,106867,0,'Wounded Soldier to Player'),(125622,0,4,'You have my thanks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12221,0,'Wounded Soldier to Player'),(125622,0,5,'I... I think I can make it. Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122227,0,'Wounded Soldier to Player'),(125622,0,6,'Thanks for the heal!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104950,0,'Wounded Soldier to Player'),(126309,0,0,'We\'ve done it.  Sylvanas will finally answer for her crimes. Champions, to my side...',12,0,100,0,0,105318,0,0,0,'Anduin Wrynn to High Overlord Saurfang'),(126612,0,0,'Winds of da eagle spirit gonna SCOUR YA BONES!',14,0,100,0,0,103583,0,0,0,'Windseeker Durja'),(126612,1,0,'Da Warchief... will ... stop ya...',14,0,100,0,0,103584,0,0,0,'Windseeker Durja to Player'),(133693,0,0,'You will come no further, Banshee Queen!',14,0,100,6,0,112408,0,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage to Player'),(133693,1,0,'You may pass through the wall, $n. The wisps will not harm you.',12,0,100,0,0,112411,0,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage to Player'),(134554,0,0,'Soldiers... No! Do not rush the--!',14,0,100,0,0,113732,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner to Player'),(134554,1,0,'Fools... At least now we know how dangerous the wisps can be.',14,0,100,0,0,113733,0,0,0,'Lady Sylvanas Windrunner to Player'),(134578,0,0,'After you.If you would like me to incapacitate any of them,just say so.But...quietly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139798,0,0,'Just a moment, your majesty! New information has come to light.',12,0,100,0,0,114090,0,0,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(140633,0,0,'I\'m on it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28613,0,'Druid of the Claw to Player'),(140633,1,0,'Mind the furbolgs. They have suddenly appeared in droves.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Druid of the Claw to Player'),(140633,2,0,'The Grove of the Ancients! Oh my...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Druid of the Claw to Player'),(140728,0,0,'After you, $n. If you would like me to incapacitate any of them, just say so. But... quietly.',12,0,100,0,0,112421,0,0,0,'Captain Delaryn Summermoon to Player'),(140728,1,0,'Careful, hero! We must do this quietly!',12,0,100,0,0,112432,0,0,0,'Captain Delaryn Summermoon to Player'),(140728,2,0,'The furbolgs are normally a peaceful tribe. Being ousted from their home must have sent them into a frenzy.',12,0,100,0,0,113294,0,0,0,'Captain Delaryn Summermoon to Player'),(140728,3,0,'Avoid being detected! We cannot draw too much attention...',12,0,100,0,0,112430,0,0,0,'Captain Delaryn Summermoon to Player'),(140728,4,0,'Kill this one quickly, before they alert the others!',12,0,100,0,0,112431,0,0,0,'Captain Delaryn Summermoon to Player'),(140728,5,0,'The Horde... there are so many of them...',12,0,100,0,0,112436,0,0,0,'Captain Delaryn Summermoon to Player'),(140728,6,0,'The Horde must have driven the furbolgs from their home.',12,0,100,0,0,112437,0,0,0,'Captain Delaryn Summermoon to Player'),(140801,0,0,'Death is the only way!',12,0,100,0,0,103702,0,0,0,'Forsaken Assassin to Player'),(140801,0,1,'For the Dark Lady!',12,0,100,0,0,103696,0,124586,0,'Forsaken Assassin to Player'),(140801,0,2,'Do you hear the screams?',12,0,100,0,0,103700,0,0,0,'Forsaken Assassin to Player'),(140801,0,3,'No survivors!',12,0,100,0,0,103698,0,0,0,'Forsaken Assassin to Player'),(140877,0,0,'It is only a matter of time before the Horde breaks through. They will attack us from both sides.',12,0,100,0,0,113286,0,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage to Player'),(140877,1,0,'Sylvanas seeks to engage me, and I plan to give her what she wants.',12,0,100,0,0,114508,0,0,0,'Malfurion Stormrage to Player'),(141999,0,0,'Malfurion! No!',12,0,100,5,0,113755,0,0,0,'Tyrande Whisperwind to Player'),(142408,0,0,'Elune help us!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,18516,0,'Lor\'danel Citizen to Player'),(142408,0,1,'It all happened so fast...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lor\'danel Citizen to Player'),(142408,0,2,'Curse the Horde! Lor\'danel did nothing to deserve this!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lor\'danel Citizen to Player'),(142408,0,3,'Lor\'danel did not stand a chance...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lor\'danel Citizen to Player'),(142408,0,4,'Why are they attacking us?!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,63937,0,'Lor\'danel Citizen to Player'),(142408,0,5,'I would be dead if not for you. Thank you.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lor\'danel Citizen to Player'),(143409,0,0,'Curse the Horde. Curse them all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darnassian Citizen to Player'),(143409,1,0,'... I don\'t... understand...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darnassian Citizen to Player'),(143409,2,0,'Darnassus cannot be lost... It cannot end like this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darnassian Citizen to Player'),(143409,3,0,'Praise Elune for you, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darnassian Citizen to Player'),(143562,0,0,'Malfunction!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Monstrous Shredder to Player'),(143580,0,0,'Hold tightly to my branches, $c.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Tree of Life to Player'),(143580,1,0,'The wrath of nature is upon you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tree of Life to Player'),(143580,2,0,'I will return you to safety, $n. Hold on tight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tree of Life to Player'),(144183,0,0,'I always hated this forest.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Orgrimmar Grunt to Player'),(144184,0,0,'Baby, I love burnin\' stuff!',12,0,100,0,0,103749,0,0,0,'Goblin Sapper to Player'),(144184,1,0,'You just made a big mistake!',12,0,100,0,0,103751,0,0,0,'Goblin Sapper to Player'),(144184,2,0,'Wasn\'t... worth it...',12,0,100,0,0,103755,0,0,0,'Goblin Sapper to Captain Delaryn Summermoon'),(31033,0,6,'We will battle along side you until the bitter end, $g sir:ma\'am;!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,31390,0,'Crusader of Virtue'),(227273,1,0,'Excellent-- more practice!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(227273,2,0,'Fighting is awful! Why would anyone want to do this?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(120922,0,0,'I hope this works.',12,0,100,669,0,112099,0,129993,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore to Player'),(121239,0,0,'Send those kids to the western edge of the foundry. I\'ll wait there and make sure nobody tries to snatch \'em.',12,0,100,1,0,111974,0,132532,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,1,0,'Meet me there when you\'ve got some information on those shipments.',12,0,100,1,0,111975,0,132533,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,2,0,'Cagney, get these kids on a ferry back to town. Taelia will make sure they get placed into a shelter.',12,0,100,1,0,111990,0,147991,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,3,0,'Mate, I\'ll see you up ahead.',12,0,100,1,0,111991,0,147992,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,4,0,'Quick, hide!',12,0,100,0,0,109860,0,134099,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,5,0,'Ooh, I call the empty barrel! You can have the other one.',12,0,100,25,0,109861,0,134100,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,6,0,'All right, here\'s the plan:',12,0,100,1,0,111943,0,149130,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,7,0,'Hit me.',12,0,100,1,0,111944,0,149131,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,8,0,'Come on, hit me!',12,0,100,5,0,111945,0,149132,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,9,0,'Don\'t be shy! Gimme your best shot.',12,0,100,1,0,111946,0,149133,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,10,0,'AUGH! OH, YOU BRUTE!',14,0,100,20,0,111947,0,149134,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,11,0,'GUARD! GUARD, HELP!! OHHH!!',14,0,100,5,0,111948,0,149135,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121239,12,0,'Quick! Hit that lever!',12,0,100,0,0,111949,0,132924,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Flynn Fairwind'),(121239,13,0,'Thanks for the lift, Tae. I\'ll report to the old man.',12,0,100,1,0,111971,0,133730,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(121603,0,0,'Let\'s go! Let\'s go! It\'s time for the tea party!',12,0,100,0,0,101477,0,131623,0,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(121603,1,0,'Up here! This is gonna be the best tea party ever!',12,0,100,0,0,101478,0,131624,0,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(121603,2,0,'Great! Sit down so we can start the party. With you and Smoochums helping, I can call the last guest!',12,0,100,1,0,101475,0,131625,0,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(122110,0,0,'New orders, then?',12,0,100,6,0,97771,0,143113,0,'Falconer Notley to Player'),(122110,1,0,'Come, Winston. Looks like we have witches to fight.',12,0,100,1,0,97772,0,143116,0,'Falconer Notley to Player'),(122112,0,0,'So the rumors are true? The Order of Embers is reformed?',12,0,100,0,0,97768,0,143109,0,'Ensign Yorrick to Player'),(122112,1,0,'And here I thought their tales were merely some historian\'s overactive imagination.',12,0,100,1,0,97769,0,143111,0,'Ensign Yorrick to Player'),(122112,2,0,'Thank you for delivering these orders, $c. I shall report to Miss Waycrest at once.',12,0,100,66,0,97770,0,143112,0,'Ensign Yorrick to Player'),(122115,0,0,'So you\'re the one behind this \"Order of Embers\" I\'ve been hearing about.',12,0,100,6,0,97765,0,143104,0,'Ensign Mace to Player'),(122115,1,0,'While I don\'t buy into all this hocus-pocus, anything is better than sitting here waiting for the coven to kill us all.',12,0,100,1,0,97766,0,143105,0,'Ensign Mace to Player'),(122115,2,0,'You have my blade, $c.',12,0,100,66,0,97767,0,143107,0,'Ensign Mace to Player'),(122169,0,0,'Yay! This is gonna be the best tea party ever! Let\'s find the other guests.',12,0,100,1,0,101540,0,131088,5,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(122169,1,0,'Trunksy! You know Miss Mary doesn\'t allow you in the house! You track mud everywhere!',12,0,100,1,0,101541,0,131086,5,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(122169,2,0,'Mr. Hawthorne was always trying to keep the doggies away from his animals. But now the doggies can finally have supper!',12,0,100,0,0,101537,0,131616,5,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(122169,3,0,'Oh Mr. Munchykins! You were hungry, weren\'t you? Come along now. It\'s time for tea.',12,0,100,1,0,101539,0,131085,5,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(122169,4,0,'Naughty Mayor Striggs! Always running away from your responsibilities to the townsfolk. Well, you can\'t run anymore!',12,0,100,1,0,101538,0,131081,5,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(122169,5,0,'Smoochums loves the woods. I\'m gonna make sure the doggies didn\'t get him!',12,0,100,1,0,101474,0,131440,5,'Abby Lewis to Player'),(122452,1,0,'They made me do it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,147960,0,'Foundry Worker to Company Watchman'),(138604,1,0,'Kul Tirans! Your deal with the Alliance will be your death sentence!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(138604,2,0,'The Horde will tear you apart!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(122454,0,0,'You\'ll pay for this...',12,0,100,0,0,109003,0,0,0,''),(122454,1,0,'Rats...',12,0,100,0,0,108997,0,0,0,''),(122681,0,0,'They won\'t catch me! I\'m too fast!',12,0,100,18,0,104808,0,132038,0,'Urchin Worker to Player'),(122681,1,0,'Now to find a warm fire!',12,0,100,18,0,104816,0,132042,0,'Urchin Worker to Player'),(122681,2,0,'I hope they have food on the boat!',12,0,100,0,0,104817,0,132043,0,'Urchin Worker to Player'),(122681,3,0,'I\'m goin\' back to school...',12,0,100,0,0,104809,0,132039,0,'Urchin Worker to Player'),(123123,0,0,'I can\'t thank you enough, mainlander. I\'m going to get as far away from this place as possible.',12,0,100,1,0,101563,0,137542,0,'Annie Warren to Player'),(123123,1,0,'If I were you, I\'d do the same.  Good luck.',12,0,100,1,0,101564,0,141643,0,'Annie Warren to Player'),(123264,1,0,'Priscilla... will have your head for this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(123399,0,0,'Is that... ale?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,132889,0,'Enthralled Sailor to Player'),(123399,1,0,'Whose idea was it to navigate near this forsaken grotto anyway?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,132891,0,'Enthralled Sailor to Player'),(123399,2,0,'The singing has finally stopped!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,132890,0,'Enthralled Sailor to Player'),(123399,3,0,'Love hurts.',12,0,100,17,0,0,0,144034,0,'Enthralled Sailor to Player'),(123399,4,0,'Love conquers all!',12,0,100,17,0,0,0,144029,0,'Enthralled Sailor to Player'),(123399,5,0,'Parting is such sweet sorrow.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144032,0,'Enthralled Sailor to Player'),(124022,0,0,'Hey! What\'s going on in there?!',12,0,100,5,0,111410,0,149136,0,'Ashvane Jailer to Player'),(124022,1,0,'You! Stop right there!',14,0,100,397,0,111411,0,149172,0,'Ashvane Jailer to Player'),(124022,2,0,'Wh-what?!',12,0,100,6,0,111412,0,149173,0,'Ashvane Jailer to Player'),(124022,3,0,'No! Noooo!!',12,0,100,0,0,113806,0,149174,0,'Ashvane Jailer to Player'),(124024,0,0,'Nobody escapes on my watch!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,156178,0,'Block Warden Carmine'),(124024,1,0,'Over my dead... body...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,156180,0,'Block Warden Carmine'),(124289,0,0,'Quality furs from all over Kul Tiras!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,133011,0,'\"Risky\" Liz Seminario'),(124311,0,0,'Grab your gear and let\'s pay the block warden a visit. We\'ll need his keys.',12,0,100,1,0,111951,0,132992,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124311,1,0,'Damn! The keys are ruined. That was some serious firepower!',12,0,100,1,0,111952,0,132993,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124311,2,0,'Just what kind of powder is this? Hey, help me grab some of this stuff.',12,0,100,6,0,111953,0,154545,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124311,3,0,'Oh! One more thing. Well, two.',12,0,100,396,0,111954,0,154659,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124311,4,0,'Ahh, that\'s better. I felt naked without these! Let\'s move.',12,0,100,396,0,111955,0,133036,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124311,5,0,'Maybe we can blow the lock? Sprinkle some of that powder on it.',12,0,100,396,0,111956,0,154601,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124311,6,0,'Ugh... smells like a freebooter\'s hammock.',12,0,100,396,0,111961,0,132916,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124311,7,0,'Yeah, I\'m officially done with this place.',12,0,100,274,0,113807,0,132917,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124311,8,0,'Come on, our ride should be waiting for us just up the beach.',12,0,100,396,0,111965,0,132923,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(124802,0,0,'You and Cooper make a wonderful team! Feel free to ride him around the estate as much as you\'d like.',12,0,100,1,0,108438,0,138023,0,'Lord Aldrius Norwington to Player'),(124802,1,0,'Welcome to the Norwington Equestrian Festival! We\'re still setting up, but you must participate in the festivities. I won\'t have it any other way!',12,0,100,11,0,108437,0,137012,0,'Lord Aldrius Norwington to Player'),(124882,0,0,'Heh... Heh... Shipments have already gone out...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,134442,0,'Roland Hacksaw to Player'),(124882,1,0,'Ah! More meat to grind into sausage!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,134439,0,'Roland Hacksaw to Player'),(124922,0,0,'Insipid $c! This village is mine. The Mother has willed it!',12,0,100,0,0,97669,0,133715,0,'Helena Gentle to Player'),(124922,1,0,'You should turn away now, lest you share their fate.',12,0,100,1,0,97670,0,133716,0,'Helena Gentle to Player'),(124953,0,0,'I will show you the coven\'s power!',12,0,100,0,0,97672,0,133717,0,'Helena Gentle'),(124953,1,0,'Our power is ancient. You will fall!',12,0,100,0,0,97673,0,133718,0,'Helena Gentle'),(124953,2,0,'You cannot stop... my curse...',12,0,100,0,0,97674,0,133719,0,'Helena Gentle to Player'),(125334,0,0,'Nickel stores the falcon in his pack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,137234,0,'Nickel to Player'),(125342,0,0,'Come at me, ya briny hags! I\'ll fly yer hides as me new colors!',14,0,100,22,0,103924,0,136092,0,'Captain Keelson to Player'),(125342,1,0,'Not bad, for a flea-bitten stowaway. Yer lucky I didn\'t find ye before we ran aground, or it\'d be your guts I\'m scrapin\' off me boots.',12,0,100,396,0,109583,0,136093,0,'Captain Keelson to Player'),(125342,2,0,'Careful \'bout stickin\' yer nose into Ashvane business. They\'re as filthy as they come.',12,0,100,0,0,109584,0,136094,0,'Captain Keelson to Player'),(125380,0,0,'That\'s better. Now, let\'s--',12,0,100,1,0,97605,0,138518,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(125380,1,0,'It\'s an ambush! Defend the villagers!',14,0,100,5,0,97607,0,138553,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(125382,0,0,'He\'s okay, he\'s okay! There\'s no need to-- AAH!',12,0,100,1,0,729,0,136800,0,'Eddie Norwington to Player'),(125385,0,0,'Look out! Enemies from the woods!',14,0,100,5,0,97606,0,138509,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(125385,1,0,'The traps aren\'t slowing them down anymore. More incoming!',12,0,100,1,0,97608,0,138527,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Misshapen Thrall'),(125385,2,0,'What in creation is that?',12,0,100,5,0,97609,0,138528,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Deathbound Shambler'),(125922,0,0,'I... please, calm down, calm down everyone! We are doing the best we can. We shall find a cure, and the cause!',12,0,100,1,0,109024,0,138691,0,'Brother Therold to Player'),(125922,1,0,'I grant you the blessings of the sea! May you experience its gentle embrace, as it accepts you as an ally.',12,0,100,0,0,109012,0,136292,0,'Brother Therold to Player'),(125922,2,0,'O sea, provide relief to the sick and downtrodden of Anglepoint Wharf. May we discover the source of the malady that plagues us!',12,0,100,1,0,109026,0,138822,0,'Brother Therold to Player'),(125922,3,0,'Be calm, children of the sea. We must put our faith in the waters to find a cure.',12,0,100,1,0,109027,0,138831,0,'Brother Therold to Player'),(125922,4,0,'I will move to scout further in town. Pray that the people there are safe!',12,0,100,1,0,109028,0,138853,0,'Brother Therold to Player'),(125924,0,0,'Them Outriggers are so brave! I could never go out and face them monsters! I\'m good on cargo duty.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,140700,0,'Anglepoint Dockworker to Player'),(125945,0,0,'I actually just received a shipment a few minutes ago! Want to take a look?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136221,0,'Aaron Gutier to Player'),(125945,1,0,'AAH! GET THIS THING OFF ME!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,136225,0,'Aaron Gutier to Player'),(125945,2,0,'I can\'t... help... AAAAAAAUUURGH!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,143054,0,'Aaron Gutier to Player'),(125947,0,0,'You know, I haven\'t seen that Stormsong kid in a few days. I wish they would put somebody more competent in charge of this place, but who am I to say?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136220,0,'Ginger Freelin to Player'),(125950,0,0,'I haven\'t received any fresh ingredients in days! How am I supposed to make my famous deep fried threshadon without fresh threshadon fins?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136218,0,'Julian Nichols to Player'),(125955,0,0,'How can management let this happen? That\'s it, we need to unionize.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136254,0,'Anglepoint Fishpacker to Player'),(125955,1,0,'I\'m used to monster parts in the shipments, but living monsters? Count me out.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136251,0,'Anglepoint Fishpacker to Player'),(125955,2,0,'Worms that eat faces? I\'m getting out of here!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136255,0,'Anglepoint Fishpacker to Player'),(125955,3,0,'It\'s time for my break anyway. I\'m outta here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136253,0,'Anglepoint Fishpacker to Player'),(125957,0,0,'Wh... what? Who are you? What is that?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136371,0,'Possessed Dockworker'),(125957,1,0,'Wh... what happened?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,136368,0,'Possessed Dockworker'),(125957,2,0,'That thing was controlling my brain?!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,136370,0,'Possessed Dockworker'),(125960,0,0,'Brannon Stormsong is a weak boy. The true power belongs to the sea!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136275,0,'Overseer Bates to Player'),(125960,1,0,'Ifis shuul qi\'nuq yyqzz...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136276,0,'Overseer Bates to Player'),(125961,0,0,'Brannon, you are naught but a foolish child. I have made a deal, and will lead this village to success without you!',12,0,100,1,0,109171,0,139307,0,'Brother Conway to Player'),(125961,1,0,'It is too late! You cannot stop our progress!',12,0,100,0,0,109172,0,136277,0,'Brother Conway to Player'),(125961,2,0,'Enough with this charade!',12,0,100,0,0,109173,0,136095,0,'Brother Conway'),(125961,3,0,'The world... shall drown... ak yar qi\'lwhuk h\'iwn...',12,0,100,0,0,109174,0,136278,0,'Brother Conway to Player'),(126020,0,0,'Ifis yahf an\'zig...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,140722,0,'K\'thir Harbinger to Player'),(126020,1,0,'Glory! Glory to the sea!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,140724,0,'K\'thir Harbinger to Player'),(126020,2,0,'You cannot stop the tides...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,140723,0,'K\'thir Harbinger to Player'),(126144,0,0,'The coven will swallow all!',12,0,100,0,0,97652,0,136559,0,'Sister Ashwell'),(126144,1,0,'The coven will claim you...',12,0,100,0,0,97653,0,136560,0,'Sister Ashwell to Player'),(126158,0,0,'You... you killed the love of my life!',12,0,100,0,0,105469,0,136296,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126158,1,0,'HOW COULD YOU?!',12,0,100,0,0,105470,0,136297,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126159,0,0,'What are these things!? I\'m getting out of here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,154071,0,'Frightened Woodsman to Player'),(126159,1,0,'Thank you! I was nearly a goner.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,154072,0,'Frightened Woodsman to Player'),(126159,2,0,'I\'m saved! I was about a moment away from being monster food!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,154070,0,'Frightened Woodsman to Player'),(126170,0,0,'You\'ll regret that!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,139072,0,'Mind-addled Enforcer'),(126170,1,0,'I\'ve got more power than you ever will!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,139071,0,'Mind-addled Enforcer'),(126170,2,0,'Oi! What\'re you doin\' here?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136509,0,'Mind-addled Enforcer to Player'),(126184,0,0,'You are too late! You cannot stop the tide that rises before you!',12,0,100,0,0,109164,0,136366,0,'Director Deepwarden to Player'),(126184,1,0,'Uq naggwa... our master... comes for you...',12,0,100,0,0,109165,0,136367,0,'Director Deepwarden to Player'),(126209,0,0,'The whispers... they overwhelm my thoughts...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136361,0,'Willing Cultist to Player'),(126209,1,0,'Y\'za qam yyqzz...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136359,0,'Willing Cultist to Player'),(126209,2,0,'My soul for the sea...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136360,0,'Willing Cultist to Player'),(126209,3,0,'I give myself fully for this power!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136356,0,'Willing Cultist to Player'),(126245,0,0,'These souls are mine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136163,0,'Sister Westwood to Player'),(126245,1,0,'My creations... cannot be beaten...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136164,0,'Sister Westwood to Player'),(126262,0,0,'The mistress will use your soul next!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137897,0,'Wicker-Bound Hunter to Player'),(126298,0,0,'Thank you for saving me, stranger. Conway and his men overthrew the village so fast... I didn\'t see it coming.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,139334,0,'Brannon Stormsong to Player'),(129887,0,0,'Think ye can pull one over on ME do ya?! I\'ll <hic> run ya through!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'First Mate Trixie Tornsail to Player'),(126438,1,0,'Finally! Free!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,138810,0,'Charmed Sailor to Wailing Siren'),(126441,0,0,'I will not have my work disrupted! Destroy this insect!',14,0,100,0,0,97646,0,136638,0,'Matron Levae to Player'),(126441,1,0,'Impressive... but it will take more than that to best a matron of the Heartsbane Coven!',12,0,100,0,0,97647,0,136573,0,'Matron Levae to Heartsbane Acolyte'),(126441,2,0,'Face my wrath!',12,0,100,0,0,97648,0,136574,0,'Matron Levae to Heartsbane Acolyte'),(126441,3,0,'You cannot win! The coven will not stop until all are made to serve!',12,0,100,0,0,97649,0,136575,0,'Matron Levae'),(126441,4,0,'My sisters are many... Kul Tiras will fall...',12,0,100,0,0,97650,0,136576,0,'Matron Levae to Curseformed Ravager'),(126490,0,0,'Ugh, still a bit foggy. Just need a little drink to clear my head.',12,0,100,0,0,105450,0,136364,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126490,1,0,'Ahh, that hits the spot. Let\'s get movin\'.',12,0,100,0,0,105451,0,136365,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126490,2,0,'<hic> Now, which way was it... left?',12,0,100,0,0,105452,0,136362,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126490,3,0,'No, no. It was DEFINITELY right.',12,0,100,0,0,105453,0,136363,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126490,4,0,'Watch yourself. Some nasty critters out here.',12,0,100,0,0,105454,0,136489,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126490,5,0,'Blimey, what a hike. Just need another little sip...',12,0,100,0,0,105456,0,136372,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Flynn Fairwind'),(126490,6,0,'Ahh. We\'re gettin\' close. I can feel it.',12,0,100,0,0,105457,0,136373,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Flynn Fairwind'),(126490,7,0,'<hic> Hey, lizard.',12,0,100,3,0,105461,0,136382,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Venomspine Saurolisk'),(126490,8,0,'Hey, it\'s dangerous out here! <hic> You really should stick with me, you know!',12,0,100,5,0,105467,0,136386,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126490,9,0,'Ah-ha! This looks familiar. We <hic> must be going the right way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136369,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Flynn Fairwind'),(126490,10,0,'Hmmm. We went right last time... so it MUST be left! Think my head\'s finally clearing up.',12,0,100,0,0,105458,0,136375,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Flynn Fairwind'),(126490,11,0,'Here we are. Freehold.',12,0,100,0,0,105459,0,136376,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Flynn Fairwind'),(126490,12,0,'This is a rough town. Just <hic> let me do the talkin\'.',12,0,100,0,0,105460,0,136377,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Flynn Fairwind'),(126522,0,0,'This town belongs to the coven, interloper!',12,0,100,0,0,97654,0,136562,0,'Sister Early'),(126522,1,0,'You will fall before the matron...',12,0,100,0,0,97655,0,136563,0,'Sister Early to Player'),(126523,0,0,'You should not have interfered!',12,0,100,0,0,97656,0,70520,0,'Sister Mooring'),(126523,1,0,'My sisters will avenge me...',12,0,100,0,0,97657,0,136566,0,'Sister Mooring to Player'),(126542,0,0,'SMASH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136406,0,'Ancient Sentinel to Player'),(129067,0,0,'It\'s a watery grave for you.',12,0,100,0,0,109572,0,0,0,'Cutwater Card Shark to Player'),(129095,0,0,'I\'ll run ya through!',12,0,100,1,0,109573,0,0,0,'Blacktooth Knuckleduster to Player'),(126620,0,0,'Once you have proof that the Ashvane Company\'s been selling weapons to these scumbags, come find me up the hill at the main gate.',12,0,100,1,0,105444,0,138028,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126620,1,0,'I\'ve been gone a long time. Let\'s hope I still have a few friends inside.',12,0,100,1,0,105445,0,138029,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(126629,0,0,'I... I think I may have messed myself...',12,0,100,24,0,0,0,154074,0,'Captured Villager to Player'),(126629,1,0,'No! No! Nooooooo!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,154077,0,'Captured Villager to Player'),(126629,2,0,'Get out! Save yourself!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,154075,0,'Captured Villager to Player'),(126629,3,0,'Get me out of here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,149509,0,'Captured Villager to Player'),(126675,0,0,'I\'m sorry, $c. We\'re completely out of seaweed. Everybody has felt too ill to go into the water to harvest. Give Therold my apologies.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136567,0,'Hera Copeland to Player'),(126719,0,0,'Bury me... with my rum...',12,0,100,15,0,109575,0,148246,0,'Irontide Cutthroat to Player'),(126719,1,0,'At least... I died fightin\'...',12,0,100,273,0,109582,0,148249,0,'Irontide Cutthroat to Player'),(126719,2,0,'Heh. Fresh meat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138756,0,'Irontide Cutthroat to Player'),(126729,0,0,'Free at last!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,127527,0,'Bridget Fairwater to Player'),(126729,1,0,'Thank you for freeing me from that foul construct.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137715,0,'Bridget Fairwater to Player'),(126729,2,0,'The witch was too much for me and I was trapped.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137716,0,'Bridget Fairwater to Player'),(126735,0,0,'I\'ll run ya through!',12,0,100,0,0,109574,0,148245,0,'Irontide Brinecaster to Player'),(126774,0,0,'So this... is what it feels like...',12,0,100,0,0,109577,0,148247,0,'Irontide Trickshot to Player'),(126861,0,0,'You are being watched.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,136686,0,'Ghostly Follower to Player'),(126861,1,0,'The Master waits for you to join him...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,136692,0,'Ghostly Follower to Player'),(126979,0,0,'$C! It\'s good to see a friendly... wait, what is that?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,136993,0,'Edwin Maldus to Player'),(126979,1,0,'Not the bees! Nooooo!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,136994,0,'Edwin Maldus to Player'),(126979,2,0,'They\'re in my eyes! My eyes!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,136995,0,'Edwin Maldus to Barbthorn Worker'),(126979,3,0,'Thank you, stranger! I thought those bees would be the end of me!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,136996,0,'Edwin Maldus to Player'),(126979,4,0,'It looks like you\'ve thinned them out a bit. I think I can make my way back from here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136997,0,'Edwin Maldus to Player'),(126979,5,0,'Now, $c!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,137010,0,'Edwin Maldus to Player'),(127006,0,0,'Alright Eddie, keep Hotshot calm.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136799,0,'Melissa Kenny to Player'),(127006,1,0,'Eddie!!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,136806,0,'Melissa Kenny to Player'),(127006,2,0,'Let\'s get going, $n. Lord Norwington will have my head if something happens to his son!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136835,0,'Melissa Kenny to Player'),(127080,0,0,'Gather before the Wicker Man, initiates. His favor will protect us from the curses that befall our land.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,136990,0,'Lord Autumnvale to Player'),(127080,1,0,'Well done, $c. You have earned my trust, and I will help you in your task.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136945,0,'Lord Autumnvale to Player'),(127091,0,0,'I\'m over here! He has the key! Please, help me!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,136836,0,'Eddie Norwington to Player'),(127091,1,0,'Is... Is it safe to get out? Troggs are really scary!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136918,0,'Eddie Norwington to Player'),(127091,2,0,'I think I can make it to Melissa if you cleared me a path. Thank you so much for saving me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136919,0,'Eddie Norwington to Player'),(127091,3,0,'I...I think that\'s fair.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136959,0,'Eddie Norwington to Player'),(127092,0,0,'Guuuurarrrrgh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137137,0,'Bonegnasher Skullcrusher to Player'),(127125,0,0,'You me snack now, too!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137132,0,'Cragg the Stoneshaker to Player'),(127125,1,0,'Me... kill... you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137135,0,'Cragg the Stoneshaker to Player'),(127144,0,0,'Alright Eddie. I think riding lessons will continue on the estate for now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,136958,0,'Melissa Kenny to Player'),(127156,0,0,'Come on! Let\'s get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137096,0,'Nigel Rifthold to Player'),(127159,1,0,'I\'m going to hide with Marcus!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137038,0,'Amelia Tidecrest to Player'),(127160,0,0,'Oh, thank you! It was quite uncomfortable in here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137027,0,'Euphemia Batten-Chase to Player'),(127159,0,0,'Thank you! I was gonna run out of rocks up here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137037,0,'Amelia Tidecrest to Player'),(127158,1,0,'I\'m going to find Marcus and wait with him. See ya there!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137021,0,'Jonathan \"Johnny\" Presterby to Player'),(127158,0,0,'Hey, thanks! Who knew troggs could use magic?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137020,0,'Jonathan \"Johnny\" Presterby to Player'),(127157,0,0,'I think I\'m gonna stand back over there. The, uh, light\'s better for reading. Good luck!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137999,0,'Marcus Howlingdale to Player'),(127393,0,0,'Hail to the Wicker Man!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,136992,0,'Wickerite Initiate to Player'),(127396,0,0,'This is all a bit too much for me. I\'m out of here!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,137026,0,'Initiate Peony to Player'),(127418,0,0,'These people are crazy! Help me, $c!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,137001,0,'Edwin Maldus to Player'),(127418,1,0,'Thank you again, $c. You arrived in the nick of time!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,137005,0,'Edwin Maldus to Player'),(127418,2,0,'Come on, let\'s put an end to this cult!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,137049,0,'Edwin Maldus to Player'),(127419,0,0,'You should not interfere with our works, lest you too become a sacrifice!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,137002,0,'Lord Autumnvale to Player'),(127419,1,0,'Die, interloper!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,137036,0,'Lord Autumnvale to Player'),(127537,0,0,'Thanks for the help, stranger. Remember to keep the salt outta yer britches.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137075,0,'Geraldine to Player'),(127548,0,0,'Oops! You snagged an angry crab!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,137109,0,'Fishing Rod to Player'),(127548,1,0,'The line broke!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,137108,0,'Fishing Rod to Player'),(127559,0,0,'Capital timing, my friend. We\'ve got a trogg attack on our hands!',12,0,100,1,0,108412,0,155533,0,'Lord Aldrius Norwington to Player'),(127559,1,0,'This is going to be the most exciting festival in years! Hop onto Cooper and show the troggs what for. You will find him most useful in combat!',12,0,100,4,0,108435,0,138025,0,'Lord Aldrius Norwington to Player'),(127613,0,0,'Before we begin, let me get prepared. Just a moment...',12,0,100,1,0,108384,0,137087,0,'Majo to Player'),(127613,1,0,'Well, enough dawdling, then. It is time to identify the perfect horse!',12,0,100,1,0,108402,0,137088,0,'Majo to Player'),(127709,0,0,'What peculiar wounds. They almost remind me of a bear. Do they look like bear wounds to you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137270,0,'Lord Kennings to Player'),(127709,1,0,'Hold it still! I can\'t get a good shot in if it keeps moving!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137752,0,'Lord Kennings'),(127709,2,0,'Or maybe not a bear. She looks like she ran afoul with an outlaw, or something.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137271,0,'Lord Kennings to Player'),(127709,3,0,'Face my trusty crossbow, vile fiend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137753,0,'Lord Kennings'),(127709,4,0,'More bear wounds. An outlaw and his pet bear, perhaps?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137274,0,'Lord Kennings to Player'),(127709,5,0,'Could it be a combination of the two? Man-bear, or is it bear-man?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137275,0,'Lord Kennings to Player'),(127709,6,0,'A yeti! Well, I was mostly correct. It is man-shaped and hairy like a bear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,141456,0,'Lord Kennings to Player'),(127715,0,0,'I can\'t believe we\'re here! My father used to tell me stories about this place.',12,0,100,5,0,97562,0,137379,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(127715,1,0,'It contains an ancient secret of our house, from back when the Waycrests first settled this land.',12,0,100,1,0,97563,0,137380,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(127715,2,0,'We just need to find the entrance!',12,0,100,6,0,97564,0,137381,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(127715,3,0,'That\'s it! The way is opening!',12,0,100,5,0,97565,0,137382,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(127715,4,0,'Thus is reborn the Order of Embers.',12,0,100,1,0,97590,0,137411,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(127715,5,0,'Now then, I believe we have some witches to kill.',12,0,100,273,0,97591,0,137412,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(127715,6,0,'Our work here is done, $n. I\'ll meet you at Arom\'s Stand.',12,0,100,1,0,97592,0,137718,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(127976,0,0,'Watch yourself, $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,137789,0,'Veteran Hunter to Player'),(128113,0,0,'Wait... what was that?',12,0,100,6,0,97569,0,146310,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,1,0,'Look out!',14,0,100,22,0,97570,0,141848,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,2,0,'Wait... look out!',14,0,100,6,0,97575,0,137391,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,3,0,'Hmm... It looks like some rubble blocks our path ahead. Can you clear the way?',12,0,100,25,0,97581,0,137396,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,4,0,'Wait... something\'s not right.',12,0,100,6,0,97582,0,137397,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,5,0,'$C, behind you!',14,0,100,25,0,97583,0,137400,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,6,0,'I\'ve never seen a construct that big before! Are you alright?',12,0,100,5,0,97584,0,137405,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,7,0,'What am I saying... of course you\'re alright. I can see it\'ll take more than a few stones to bring you down!',12,0,100,6,0,97585,0,137406,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,8,0,'Come along, the book should be in here!',12,0,100,25,0,97586,0,137407,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128113,9,0,'Here it is... the last resting place of the Order of Embers. Are you ready to revive ancient history?',12,0,100,1,0,97587,0,137408,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(128233,0,0,'%s continues rambling about taking responsibility for your own actions for several minutes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,137907,0,'Friendly Pete to Player'),(128286,0,0,'Save.... yourself....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,141343,0,'Cursed Raider to Player'),(128345,0,0,'Fool! You will die screaming!',14,0,100,0,0,104620,0,154748,0,'Deathcursed Terror'),(128345,1,0,'All of Kul Tiras will suffer. You are only the first!',14,0,100,0,0,104621,0,154749,0,'Deathcursed Terror'),(128345,2,0,'Gorak Tul... comes...',12,0,100,0,0,104622,0,154750,0,'Deathcursed Terror to Player'),(128349,0,0,'Some of our most valuable finds were left behind in this crate. Watch my back, $c, while I secure as much as possible.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138618,0,'Hilde Firebreaker to Player'),(128349,1,0,'A \"genuine Cranklefuse Prototype\". What a waste of metal, no space for trash though.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138619,0,'Hilde Firebreaker to Player'),(128349,2,0,'And this collection of bones must be courtesy of Birch, given the teeth marks on them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138620,0,'Hilde Firebreaker to Player'),(128349,3,0,'I\'ve finally reached the actual relics, now that all of the additions are out o\' the way. Shouldn\'t be too long now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138621,0,'Hilde Firebreaker to Player'),(128349,4,0,'Almost finished....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138622,0,'Hilde Firebreaker to Player'),(128349,5,0,'An\' done! Thanks for the the assistance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138623,0,'Hilde Firebreaker to Player'),(128349,6,0,'I can make me own way out. Be careful.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138666,0,'Hilde Firebreaker to Player'),(128409,0,0,'Thank you, $c. I\'ll speak with you somewhere safer.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,138316,0,'Officer Redfen to Player'),(128417,0,0,'May I announce the arrival of $gLord:Lady; $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138017,0,'Norwington Herald to Player'),(128582,0,0,'You are fools to resist. The Heartsbane will claim Kul Tiras!',14,0,100,0,0,97612,0,138531,0,'Sister Widdowson'),(128582,1,0,'The Mother... will take you...',12,0,100,0,0,97613,0,138532,0,'Sister Widdowson to Player'),(128679,0,0,'We\'re not waiting for your blessing any longer, Therold. We\'ve got monsters to kill.',12,0,100,1,0,108363,0,140698,0,'Rosaline Madison to Player'),(128679,1,0,'Let\'s go, Okri. The Outriggers are waiting.',12,0,100,1,0,108350,0,140699,0,'Rosaline Madison to Player'),(128679,2,0,'Get ready, Outriggers! These creatures are unlike anything we\'ve faced before!',14,0,100,0,0,108344,0,139383,0,'Rosaline Madison to Player'),(128680,0,0,'Inform me when you are prepared to go! Time is fleeting, and the monster shall not hesitate!',12,0,100,1,0,108334,0,140635,0,'Okri Putterwrench to Player'),(129082,0,1,'Thank you for saving me.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,138770,0,'Injured Thornspeaker to Player'),(129082,0,0,'We didn\'t expect such power! Be careful, Mainlander.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,157360,0,'Injured Thornspeaker to Player'),(128742,0,3,'Thank you. Once I find my pet I\'m leaving this cursed place!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,138773,0,'Injured Ranger to Player'),(128805,0,0,'Our children are falling ill!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,138688,0,'Anxious Villager to Player'),(128805,1,0,'You must help us, Therold! We need answers! We need a cure!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,138690,0,'Anxious Villager to Player'),(128806,0,0,'What is causing this illness?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,138689,0,'Anxious Villager to Player'),(128903,0,0,'It\'s a pity the turtle fellow didn\'t come here himself. His shell would have fetched a high price.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,141177,0,'Carentan to Player'),(128903,1,0,'I suppose I should lay low for awhile...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,141178,0,'Carentan to Player'),(128903,2,0,'Farewell, fool!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,141180,0,'Carentan to Player'),(128913,0,0,'Put the hat on. You can\'t be a scurvy sea dog without a hat!',12,0,100,1,0,105439,0,138743,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(128913,1,0,'Looking good. Let\'s tell the recruiter we\'ve come to volunteer.',12,0,100,1,0,105440,0,138744,0,'Flynn Fairwind to Player'),(128927,0,0,'There you go. Now, a toast to better days!',12,0,100,1,0,106017,0,140461,0,'Venrik to Player'),(128941,0,3,'How did those things even get in my stomach?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138783,0,'Taelia To Player'),(128941,0,2,'My stomach hasn\'t felt this good in days!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138781,0,'Taelia To Player'),(128941,0,1,'W...were those inside of me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138779,0,'Nauseated Villager to Player'),(128742,0,2,'I\'ve never seen spirits like these before. I\'m out of here!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,138771,0,'Injured Ranger to Player'),(128742,0,0,'Thank you!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,138772,0,'Injured Ranger to Player'),(128742,0,1,'Thank you, stranger. I thought I was done for.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,138769,0,'Injured Ranger to Player'),(126581,0,0,'The nobles may be a bit too uppity for my taste, but you can\'t help but like Norwington!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Roughneck Rider to Player'),(129098,0,0,'Aye-aye! Letter will get there fast fast! Full speed ahead, pretties!',12,0,100,113,0,0,0,141207,0,'Rodrigo to Player'),(129122,0,0,'That\'s enough singing from you two!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,148419,0,'Stabby Jane to Nolpe'),(129122,1,0,'Good work. Maybe some day these waters will be safe again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,148420,0,'Stabby Jane to Nolpe'),(129158,0,0,'My friend, lend me your aid!',12,0,100,0,0,108461,0,143222,0,'Brannon Stormsong to Player'),(129158,1,0,'My workers... I failed them.',12,0,100,0,0,108464,0,143221,0,'Brannon Stormsong to Player'),(129170,0,0,'Good girl. It\'s almost time for a treat!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143040,0,'Rulf to Player'),(129170,1,0,'Ho, ho! Look at what the house cat dragged in! Unbelievable!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143226,0,'Rulf to Player'),(129170,2,0,'Quite a catch, my friend. Let\'s see how he flies. Hyah!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,143227,0,'Rulf to Player'),(129170,3,0,'I\'ll get to work on the training. You go see Tagart, he\'s got more for you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,143230,0,'Rulf to Player'),(129181,0,0,'Looks like you\'ve had enough. You\'re outta here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,145723,0,'Barman Bill to Player'),(129392,0,0,'You\'re a life saver! I wonder where the Roughnecks will send me next...',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,141580,0,'\"Helpless\" Henry to Player'),(129575,0,0,'Ouch! What in blazes was that for?!',12,0,100,5,0,101551,0,140798,0,'Corlain Refugee to Player'),(129575,1,0,'Bloody mainlanders...',12,0,100,661,0,101553,0,140799,0,'Corlain Refugee to Player'),(129575,2,0,'Hey! Watch where you\'re pointing that thing!',12,0,100,396,0,101555,0,140800,0,'Corlain Refugee to Player'),(129575,3,0,'Ow!',12,0,100,33,0,101559,0,140802,0,'Corlain Refugee to Player'),(129575,4,0,'Clumsy oaf.',12,0,100,33,0,101559,0,140801,0,'Corlain Refugee to Player'),(129575,5,0,'The bloodflies are really biting these days, aren\'t they?',12,0,100,6,0,101561,0,140803,0,'Corlain Refugee to Player'),(129590,0,0,'All will melt.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,152756,0,'Prince Rathaw to Player'),(129590,1,0,'Life burns to ash...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,152773,0,'Prince Rathaw to Boss Tak'),(129625,0,0,'Ah, so Maynard sends his goons to solve his problems, as he always does. Well come, goon. I will take care of you as I did the others!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,148365,0,'Witch of the Woods to Player'),(129625,1,0,'You are a fool to get in my way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,141406,0,'Witch of the Woods to Player'),(129625,2,0,'My husband\'s exploitation of his workers will never end...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,141414,0,'Witch of the Woods to Player'),(129627,0,0,'Give me an axe and I will chop!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,152463,0,'Algerson Lumberjack'),(129627,1,0,'Show me wicker, show me beasts... I will fight them all!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,152462,0,'Algerson Lumberjack'),(129627,2,0,'Kul Tirans never go down without a fight!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,152461,0,'Algerson Lumberjack'),(129641,0,0,'Ugh, clumsy oaf.',12,0,100,6,0,101562,0,140801,0,'Corlain Refugee to Player'),(129641,1,0,'The coven will take your little town!',14,0,100,274,0,97735,0,140838,0,'Unmasked Witch to Player'),(129643,0,0,'The word is given. Let us ride to Corlain!',12,0,100,0,0,97797,0,143565,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(129655,0,0,'This guy don\'t seem too bright.',12,0,100,1,0,101039,0,141695,0,'Boss Tak to Player'),(129655,1,0,'Seems they got dragged thataway, up the glacier ta the northwest.',12,0,100,25,0,101041,0,141769,0,'Boss Tak to Player'),(129655,2,0,'One o\' our axes. We\'re on the right track.',12,0,100,1,0,101036,0,141594,0,'Boss Tak to Player'),(129655,3,0,'One o\' our rucksacks. Looks like we\'ve found the right place.',12,0,100,1,0,101037,0,141595,0,'Boss Tak to Player'),(129655,4,0,'This guy really ruffles m\' feathers!',12,0,100,1,0,101038,0,143217,0,'Boss Tak to Player'),(129655,5,0,'Welcome ta the Roughnecks!',12,0,100,1,0,101040,0,143201,0,'Boss Tak to Player'),(129669,0,0,'I\'m going to go check on the workers in the woods. If we\'re in danger here, I worry about their safety out there!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,148188,0,'Benjamin Algerson to Player'),(129669,1,0,'A witch... why is a witch targeting our operation?! I need to get out of here. I\'ll tell my father!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,148364,0,'Benjamin Algerson to Player'),(129670,0,0,'Algerson is tearing down the forests! We cannot let him continue his abuse of nature!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,148781,0,'Lyssa Treewarden to Player'),(129714,0,0,'Spiders... wooden beast... I\'ll take \'em all down!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140920,0,'Algerson Lumberjack to Player'),(129745,0,0,'Spiders are one thing, but tree men? Count me OUT!',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,140912,0,'Entangled Lumberjack to Player'),(129745,1,0,'I\'m used ta choppin\' wood, but the wood ain\'t normally fightin\' back!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140911,0,'Entangled Lumberjack to Player'),(129749,0,0,'For the... Horde...',12,0,100,0,0,103738,0,150947,0,'Rampaging Grunt to Player'),(129749,1,0,'Your death will bring me honor!',12,0,100,0,0,103736,0,150950,0,'Rampaging Grunt to Player'),(129753,0,0,'Bad juju comin\' for ya!',12,0,100,153,0,104237,0,151024,0,'Bloodthirsty Headhunter to Player'),(129753,1,0,'I see... da Other Side...',12,0,100,0,0,104239,0,151025,0,'Bloodthirsty Headhunter to Player'),(129753,2,0,'Lucky... shot...',12,0,100,0,0,104243,0,151029,0,'Bloodthirsty Headhunter to Player'),(129756,0,0,'Embrace your fate. All will drown.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,141078,0,'Mysterious Voice to Player'),(129836,0,0,'You bore me. Let\'s make you more... interesting.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,153147,0,'Spelltwister Moephus'),(129870,0,0,'Your death brings me glory.',12,0,100,0,0,104264,0,143909,0,'Briarback Boarmaster to Player'),(126438,0,0,'Thank you, hero!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Charmed Sailor to Wailing Siren'),(129887,1,0,'What?! <hic!> I\'ll teach \'em to badmouth MY crew!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,141170,0,'First Mate Trixie Tornsail to Player'),(129887,2,0,'Think ye can pull one over on ME do ya?! I\'ll <hic> run ya through!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,158179,0,'First Mate Trixie Tornsail to Player'),(129887,3,0,'Where\'s the lily-livered scum who\'s insultin\' <hic> the Irontide Raiders?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,141171,0,'First Mate Trixie Tornsail to Player'),(129906,0,0,'You are 