,4,0,'I\'ll rake ye from stem to stern!',12,0,100,0,0,99514,0,148736,0,'Stormsong Loyalist to Player'),(130006,5,0,'I die... for my house...',12,0,100,6,0,99530,0,148744,0,'Stormsong Loyalist to Player'),(130006,6,0,'I\'m going down... with the ship...',12,0,100,5,0,99524,0,148741,0,'Stormsong Loyalist to Player'),(130006,7,0,'Send me bones... to the sea...',12,0,100,274,0,99526,0,148742,0,'Stormsong Loyalist to Player'),(130008,0,0,'You... are... relieved...',12,0,100,0,0,99583,0,142004,0,'Stormsong Marshal to Player'),(130008,1,0,'You\'ll pay the price for disobeying!',12,0,100,0,0,99561,0,141988,0,'Stormsong Marshal to Player'),(130009,0,0,'Tides preserve me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,142012,0,'Exhausted Laborer to Player'),(130009,1,0,'A thousand thanks, stranger!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,142014,0,'Exhausted Laborer to Player'),(130009,2,0,'The harvesters have turned on us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,142013,0,'Exhausted Laborer to Player'),(130009,3,0,'Foreman Scripps has lost his mind. They all have!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,142018,0,'Exhausted Laborer to Player'),(130009,4,0,'They won\'t let us leave!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,142016,0,'Exhausted Laborer to Player'),(130009,5,0,'Tides bless you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,142015,0,'Exhausted Laborer to Player'),(130039,0,0,'I\'ll have ye... written up... for this...',12,0,100,0,0,100839,0,141999,0,'Brinebrawn Cannoneer to Player'),(130039,1,0,'Worthless... maggot...',12,0,100,14,0,100832,0,141995,0,'Brinebrawn Cannoneer to Player'),(130073,0,0,'Alert the kraul!',12,0,100,0,0,104247,0,147819,0,'Briarback Lookout'),(130073,1,0,'Intruder! Thorn-breaker!',12,0,100,0,0,104247,0,147820,0,'Briarback Lookout'),(130073,2,0,'I die well...',12,0,100,0,0,104272,0,143913,0,'Briarback Lookout to Player'),(130073,3,0,'Guards! To me!',12,0,100,0,0,104246,0,147818,0,'Briarback Lookout'),(130073,4,0,'No retreat, no surrender!',12,0,100,0,0,104260,0,143907,0,'Briarback Lookout to Player'),(130075,0,0,'We claim this land!',12,0,100,0,0,104254,0,143903,0,'Briarback Geomancer to Player'),(130075,1,0,'My walk... ends.',12,0,100,0,0,104266,0,143910,0,'Briarback Geomancer to Player'),(130078,0,0,'I don\'t want to be quilboar food!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,147869,0,'Captured Farmer to Player'),(130078,1,0,'Hey, give me a hand with these ropes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,160485,0,'Captured Farmer'),(130078,2,0,'Don\'t let them eat me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,160484,0,'Captured Farmer'),(130078,3,0,'Thank goodness you\'re here. Those cookpots were getting empty...',12,0,100,0,0,104248,0,147870,0,'Captured Farmer to Player'),(130078,4,0,'Where are the militia? Where are the Stormsong?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,147872,0,'Captured Farmer to Player'),(130078,5,0,'I\'m getting out of here, I don\'t care how many quills they stick in me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,147871,0,'Captured Farmer to Player'),(130078,6,0,'See, I knew strange beings in the ocean is no basis for a system of government!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,147873,0,'Captured Farmer to Player'),(130094,3,0,'How can... this be...',12,0,100,0,0,99706,0,143403,0,'Tidesage Seacaller to Player'),(130094,4,0,'Drown as your last light fades!',12,0,100,0,0,99685,0,143386,0,'Tidesage Seacaller to Player'),(130094,5,0,'I am blind no longer.',12,0,100,0,0,101375,0,149702,0,'Tidesage Seacaller'),(130094,6,0,'I will live eternal in the abyss.',12,0,100,0,0,101368,0,149697,0,'Tidesage Seacaller'),(130094,7,0,'None can stop the endless tide!',12,0,100,0,0,99683,0,143385,0,'Tidesage Seacaller to Player'),(130094,8,0,'Ah... I hear the voice! The thousand truths!',12,0,100,0,0,101370,0,0,0,'Tidesage Seacaller'),(130098,0,0,'Ak\'uq awtgssh zz ShGla\'yos ',12,0,100,1,0,103716,0,0,0,'Risen Cultist to Player'),(130098,1,0,'Your soul will know only hunger.',12,0,100,0,0,103719,0,149636,0,'Risen Cultist to Player'),(130131,0,0,'Activating countermeasures.',12,0,100,35,0,104195,0,141973,0,'Rewired Harvester to Player'),(130131,1,0,'Foreign entity detected in port A.',12,0,100,35,0,104202,0,141981,0,'Rewired Harvester to Player'),(130159,0,0,'Haaa-ha! Take that, ya bilge-suckers!',12,0,100,0,0,114174,0,160293,0,'Taelia to Player'),(130216,0,0,'The entrance tae the chamber is this way. Come on!',12,0,100,0,0,114467,0,0,0,''),(130271,0,0,'NUB NUB, GET UP HERE AND SWAB THESE DOOKS!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,141461,0,'Angry Voice to Player'),(130326,0,0,'Hang in there, hopefully we can get more medical supplies soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,142620,0,'Southport Falconer to Player'),(130360,0,0,'They belong to me now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,141557,0,'Anthemusa to Player'),(130360,1,0,'No! My thralls! Return to me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,146004,0,'Anthemusa to Player'),(130364,0,1,'Last mistake you\'ll ever make.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,148225,0,'Mutinous Falconer'),(130363,0,0,'Shoulda kept your nose clean, outsider.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,148221,0,'Hardened Mutineer'),(130364,0,0,'Shoulda kept your nose clean, outsider.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,148221,0,'Mutinous Falconer'),(130375,0,0,'I know Fernn was behind this! Tell me what you\'re trying to achieve!',14,0,100,603,0,0,0,146464,0,'Tallis Skyheart to Player'),(130419,0,0,'What... what is going on?',12,0,100,6,0,97676,0,133721,0,'Cyril White to Player'),(130424,0,0,'You saved my hide again! I\'m going back to camp before I catch a cold.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,141623,0,'\"Helpless\" Henry to Player'),(130531,0,0,'We will never... rest...',12,0,100,0,0,101165,0,143356,0,'Shipwright Turncoat to Player'),(130531,1,0,'I saw the truth... in the depths...',12,0,100,61,0,101169,0,143372,0,'Shipwright Turncoat to Player'),(130531,2,0,'All who oppose us will perish!',12,0,100,14,0,101146,0,143346,0,'Shipwright Turncoat to Player'),(130531,3,0,'I was only... following orders...',12,0,100,0,0,101159,0,143352,0,'Shipwright Turncoat to Player'),(130531,4,0,'My death stops... nothing...',12,0,100,274,0,101163,0,143355,0,'Shipwright Turncoat to Player'),(130554,0,0,'Tidesages... preserve me...',12,0,100,0,0,101189,0,143351,0,'Bolstered Tideguard to Player'),(130554,1,0,'We have... already won...',12,0,100,0,0,101193,0,143354,0,'Bolstered Tideguard to Player'),(130556,0,0,'They were probably planning this out for months. Skyheart was out on a routine munitions check at the camp when the revolt started.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,146435,0,'Injured Marine to Player'),(130556,1,0,'I took a bullet from a man I considered a friend. I remember him saying something about an upcoming increase in pay...',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,146436,0,'Injured Marine to Player'),(130556,2,0,'Just what are those soldiers trying to solve by doing this? This fort is first line of defense for that seagate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,146441,0,'Injured Marine to Player'),(130556,3,0,'A few days before the attack I noticed some questionable individuals meeting with a few of the mutineers. I should have informed someone.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,146445,0,'Injured Marine to Player'),(130556,4,0,'I lost a friend and my bird in the mutiny. Once I get back into fighting form, the traitorous scum will feel my fury.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,146450,0,'Injured Marine to Player'),(130600,0,0,'Lucktail runs away to safety!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,141691,0,'Lucktail'),(130601,0,0,'Lucktail runs toward the waterfalls!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,141694,0,'Lucktail'),(130714,0,0,'I feel Reid\'s power calling out like a beacon. Quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,111099,0,145724,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130715,0,0,'I\'ll scout ahead. Meet you at the shoreline!',12,0,100,1,0,111163,0,143266,0,'Taelia to Player'),(130729,0,0,'Oh yeah, you will surely save us.',12,0,100,0,0,109226,0,146585,0,'Brennadam Citizen to Player'),(130733,0,0,'I was so scared! Thank you!',12,0,100,0,0,104863,0,141819,0,'Panicked Child to Player'),(130733,1,0,'I\'m scared!',12,0,100,0,0,104874,0,153691,0,'Panicked Child to Player'),(130733,2,0,'I want my daddy!',12,0,100,0,0,104861,0,141818,0,'Panicked Child to Player'),(130746,0,0,'MrrOWWww.',14,0,100,0,0,116618,0,143894,0,'Scratchy to Player'),(130822,0,0,'My life... for... Azshara...',12,0,100,0,0,98675,0,144698,0,'Zeth\'jir Enthraller to Player'),(130823,0,0,'My queen... I have... failed...',12,0,100,0,0,98677,0,148017,0,'Zeth\'jir Tidemaiden to Player'),(130824,0,0,'To the abyss with you!',12,0,100,0,0,98671,0,142518,0,'Zeth\'jir Seacaller to Player'),(130824,1,0,'Perish, landwalker!',12,0,100,0,0,98672,0,142519,0,'Zeth\'jir Seacaller to Player'),(130899,0,0,'If you want something done right...',12,0,100,0,0,110743,0,150951,0,'Commander Wormwood to Player'),(130899,1,0,'You will never... stop her...',12,0,100,0,0,110744,0,150956,0,'Commander Wormwood to Player'),(130904,0,0,'Thank the tides not everyone has lost their damn mind. Half the house has gone mad!',12,0,100,1,0,109737,0,143268,0,'Samuel Williams to Player'),(130904,1,0,'Don\'t have to tell me twice!',12,0,100,396,0,109736,0,143274,0,'Samuel Williams to Player'),(130933,0,0,'I will do some scouting and meet you further down the path!',12,0,100,1,0,103328,0,143210,0,'Inquisitor Cleardawn to Player'),(130934,0,0,'Let us see this done.',12,0,100,1,0,108762,0,143233,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,1,0,'Those laborers... they\'re being held by tidesage magic! We must help them.',12,0,100,0,0,108784,0,143269,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,2,0,'Make your way to the shoreline on the other side of the yard. Find a young Proudmoore cadet--Taelia. Go!',12,0,100,0,0,104192,0,143272,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,3,0,'Sea to sea, ashes to ashes, tide to tide.',12,0,100,0,0,108751,0,143136,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,4,0,'Fly, you fools!',12,0,100,0,0,108779,0,143155,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,5,0,'The currents will carry ye, oh fallen.',12,0,100,0,0,108752,0,143138,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,6,0,'Tidemother cleanse your wicked flesh.',12,0,100,0,0,108753,0,143139,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,7,0,'May the abyssal depths welcome your weary soul.',12,0,100,0,0,108754,0,143140,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,8,0,'Run to your families. We will settle this.',12,0,100,0,0,108780,0,143156,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,9,0,'Fear not, brother. The waves judge not your surface.',12,0,100,0,0,108757,0,143143,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,10,0,'Good, this blade is still sharp. A sharp blade is a safe one.',12,0,100,0,0,108785,0,143127,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,11,0,'Wonder not for whom the lighthouse shines. It shines for thee.',12,0,100,0,0,108758,0,143152,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,12,0,'You are free now, brothers and sisters.',12,0,100,0,0,99518,0,143158,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,13,0,'Hear the storm\'s song, and know peace.',12,0,100,0,0,108759,0,143153,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,14,0,'Be gone! Your work is done here.',12,0,100,0,0,108782,0,143160,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,15,0,'It is not safe here. You must leave this place.',12,0,100,0,0,108783,0,143163,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,16,0,'Let your soul wash away from its mortal shell, and flow into the waters.',12,0,100,0,0,108760,0,143154,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,17,0,'Let your heart know hatred no longer.',12,0,100,0,0,108761,0,143278,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,18,0,'We must not let these lost souls wander any longer. I would have words with you, $p.',12,0,100,0,0,108749,0,143133,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,19,0,'I know not what darkness took your mind, sister, but it will torment our people no longer.',12,0,100,0,0,108793,0,143167,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,20,0,'I am glad the innocent are safe, but much remains to be done.',12,0,100,0,0,108777,0,143329,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,21,0,'The ocean\'s mists hide much, but this beacon shall let us reach them.',12,0,100,0,0,108786,0,143130,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,22,0,'A bit waterlogged, but still legible. These incantations will serve us well.',12,0,100,0,0,108787,0,143131,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130934,23,0,'I will prepare the ritual to release these souls. Meet me by the shoreline just north of here.',12,0,100,0,0,108750,0,143282,0,'Brother Pike to Player'),(130952,0,0,'House Stormsong will rule this land!',12,0,100,0,0,101362,0,143420,0,'Sister Ava to Player'),(130952,1,0,'You will kneel before your queen, peasant!',12,0,100,0,0,101363,0,143422,0,'Sister Ava'),(130952,2,0,'I\'ll have you drawn and quartered for that!',12,0,100,0,0,101364,0,143424,0,'Sister Ava'),(130952,3,0,'She will... take you... too...',12,0,100,0,0,101360,0,143421,0,'Sister Ava to Player'),(131014,0,0,'I have everything I need. Speak to me when you\'re ready to begin the ritual.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,152494,0,'Rikal to Player'),(131084,0,0,'Abyss take you...',12,0,100,0,0,98687,0,144697,0,'Zeth\'jir Tideguard to Player'),(131085,0,0,'For the queen!',12,0,100,0,0,98682,0,142515,0,'Zeth\'jir Tidelord to Player'),(131103,0,0,'So Marshal Reade believes that you are the key to driving back the coven?',12,0,100,1,0,97774,0,143121,0,'Captain Joan Cleardawn to Player'),(131103,1,0,'I have my doubts... but I will carry out my orders.',12,0,100,1,0,97775,0,143122,0,'Captain Joan Cleardawn to Player'),(131103,2,0,'I will join the others and await your command, $c.',12,0,100,66,0,97776,0,143123,0,'Captain Joan Cleardawn to Player'),(131111,0,0,'Heh, It\'s about time.',12,0,100,1,0,97773,0,143119,0,'Lieutenant Sterntide to Player'),(131249,0,0,'Listen up! We need to get you ready to fight, and quick.',12,0,100,1,0,111748,0,146234,0,'Taelia to Player'),(131272,0,0,'Help! Save us!',12,0,100,0,0,109259,0,153693,0,'Brennadam Villager to Player'),(131272,1,0,'Not them, not again!',12,0,100,0,0,109273,0,153140,0,'Brennadam Villager'),(131272,2,0,'The villager groans in pain.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,158243,0,'Brennadam Villager'),(131359,0,0,'So, you found us out. You must think yourself so clever.',12,0,100,1,0,97778,0,143377,0,'Suspicious Refugee to Player'),(131359,1,0,'No matter. Soon your discovery will die with you. Attack, my pets!',12,0,100,1,0,97779,0,143378,0,'Suspicious Refugee to Player'),(131359,2,0,'You\'re strong, but you will fall to the coven like everyone else!',12,0,100,1,0,97780,0,143379,0,'Sister Littlefield'),(131359,3,0,'But... I was promised... greatness...',12,0,100,1,0,97781,0,143381,0,'Sister Littlefield to Player'),(131409,0,0,'I thought I was going to die out here!',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,142905,0,'Stranded Battalion Soldier to Player'),(131409,1,0,'I will not forget your bravery.',12,0,100,1,0,98683,0,142906,0,'Stranded Battalion Soldier to Player'),(131409,2,0,'You saved my life!',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,142909,0,'Stranded Battalion Soldier to Player'),(131409,3,0,'These naga are monsters!',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,142902,0,'Stranded Battalion Soldier to Player'),(131409,4,0,'Avenge those of us who could not be saved.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,142903,0,'Stranded Battalion Soldier to Player'),(131442,0,0,'Night\'s coming! Be sure to keep those watchfires going! Call out if you need more fuel.',12,0,100,1,0,103543,0,144198,0,'Leandro Royston'),(131448,0,0,'You put out those fires and I\'ll set up what we need in the lab. Oh, what fun this shall be!',12,0,100,1,0,103469,0,144771,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131496,0,0,'You enter my tunnels? How foolish!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144852,0,'Foreman Razorgnarl to Player'),(131496,1,0,'Does not matter. We are everywhere... below your feet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,143916,0,'Foreman Razorgnarl to Player'),(131519,0,0,'Thank you...',12,0,100,0,0,97824,0,147065,0,'Hexthralled Falconer to Player'),(131519,1,0,'The Mother... guides my blade...',12,0,100,0,0,97818,0,147062,0,'Hexthralled Falconer to Player'),(131519,2,0,'I am... free...',12,0,100,0,0,97820,0,147063,0,'Hexthralled Falconer to Player'),(131530,0,0,'I am bidden...',12,0,100,0,0,97810,0,147058,0,'Hexthralled Guardsman to Player'),(131530,1,0,'The curse... is lifted...',12,0,100,0,0,97828,0,147067,0,'Hexthralled Guardsman to Player'),(131530,2,0,'The darkness... fades...',12,0,100,0,0,97827,0,147066,0,'Hexthralled Guardsman to Player'),(131530,3,0,'My life... for the coven...',12,0,100,0,0,99326,0,147060,0,'Hexthralled Guardsman to Player'),(131538,0,0,'They\'re in here! Flush them out!',14,0,100,0,0,98192,0,146311,0,'Heartsbane Sister to Player'),(131579,0,0,'I thought I was done for!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143965,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(131579,1,0,'Thank you!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,132040,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(131579,2,0,'I thought I was going to be dragged into the forest!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,143969,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(131579,3,0,'I\'ll head back to the barricade!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,143967,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(131579,4,0,'They\'ve already taken people into the forest!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143968,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(131636,0,0,'Alright men, let us take this tower and drive the coven from Corlain!',14,0,100,5,0,99178,0,146288,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(131636,1,0,'Glory to House Waycrest!',14,0,100,0,0,99179,0,146289,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(131636,2,0,'Excellent work, Inquisitor! This tower will provide us a vantage over Corlain and all of its holdings.',12,0,100,5,0,99181,0,146291,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(131636,3,0,'The barrier is down! Waycrest Manor lies ahead!',14,0,100,5,0,102093,0,147862,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(131636,4,0,'Inquisitors! This is our chance to rescue Lord and Lady Waycrest... and put an end to this insufferable coven!',12,0,100,5,0,102972,0,149007,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(131636,5,0,'Stick close, and do not stop your advance until we\'ve breached the manor gates!',12,0,100,1,0,102973,0,149009,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(131636,6,0,'For House Waycrest!',12,0,100,22,0,102974,0,149010,0,'Marshal Everit Reade to Player'),(131638,0,0,'Oh, Alexander... I wish you were here now...',12,0,100,1,0,103806,0,149850,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(131638,1,0,'Fight it, Marshal!',12,0,100,5,0,103807,0,149017,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(131638,2,0,'Marshal, no...',12,0,100,661,0,103808,0,149020,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(131638,3,0,'Mother... what have you done?',12,0,100,6,0,103809,0,149021,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(131638,4,0,'Inquisitors, the final battle is upon you. May the winds be at your back.',12,0,100,5,0,108232,0,149022,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(131638,5,0,'I will join you inside, Inquisitor.',12,0,100,1,0,108233,0,149025,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(131638,6,0,'I may not be of much use in combat, but my mother must be brought to justice... and I must be there to see it through.',12,0,100,1,0,108234,0,149027,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(131638,7,0,'For my father, and for Drustvar!',12,0,100,6,0,108235,0,149026,0,'Lucille Waycrest to Player'),(131639,0,0,'I\'ll leave you to the mystery, then... while I see about cracking more coven skulls!',12,0,100,1,0,101048,0,147950,0,'Inquisitor Mace to Player'),(131639,1,0,'You\'ve screeched at the wrong woman, witch!',12,0,100,0,0,104624,0,149013,0,'Inquisitor Mace to Player'),(131639,2,0,'Aye ma\'am. We\'ll put the coven in the ground.',12,0,100,66,0,104625,0,149023,0,'Inquisitor Mace to Player'),(131639,3,0,'Inquisitors, on me! Glory to House Waycrest!',12,0,100,22,0,104626,0,149024,0,'Inquisitor Mace to Player'),(131640,0,0,'Thank you, $c! I was not looking forward to meeting the end of a pike.',12,0,100,5,0,104206,0,149097,0,'Inquisitor Notley to Player'),(131640,1,0,'Keep moving, we\'ve got this! Go for the eyes, Winston!',12,0,100,0,0,104207,0,149012,0,'Inquisitor Notley to Player'),(131641,0,0,'You found him! We should leave quickly. The coven has this place surrounded!',12,0,100,5,0,102567,0,146309,0,'Inquisitor Yorrick to Player'),(131641,1,0,'Your alacrity is appreciated, $c. We will convene with Miss Waycrest.',12,0,100,1,0,104213,0,149095,0,'Inquisitor Yorrick to Player'),(131641,2,0,'We\'ll cover the flanks. $n, stay with Lucille and the Marshal!',12,0,100,0,0,104214,0,149014,0,'Inquisitor Yorrick to Player'),(131642,0,0,'Now if you don\'t mind, I\'ve got a few more scores to settle.',12,0,100,1,0,104225,0,147923,0,'Inquisitor Sterntide to Player'),(131642,1,0,'Thanks for the assist.',12,0,100,1,0,104227,0,149093,0,'Inquisitor Sterntide to Player'),(131654,0,0,'Hang on, Scratchy! Help is on the way!!',14,0,100,0,0,104795,0,143893,0,'Meredith to Player'),(131654,1,0,'We\'re gonna get you down, Scratchy! Just be good!',14,0,100,0,0,104802,0,143898,0,'Meredith'),(131654,2,0,'Yay! Thank you!',12,0,100,0,0,104796,0,143978,0,'Meredith to Player'),(131654,3,0,'Come on, Scratchy! Let\'s go!',12,0,100,0,0,104797,0,143979,0,'Meredith to Player'),(131671,0,0,'Corlain belongs to the coven!',12,0,100,0,0,103382,0,152725,0,'Sister Adela'),(131671,1,0,'You cannot... prevail...',12,0,100,0,0,103383,0,152727,0,'Sister Adela to Player'),(131719,0,0,'The terror of the sea, swayed by Deepwarden\'s dark master! Perhaps too large a monster even for the Outriggers.',12,0,100,1,0,108339,0,140659,0,'Okri Putterwrench to Player'),(131720,0,0,'Excellent! I\'ll tell you what to add to the cauldron. Be sure to follow my instructions or the results could be.... explosive.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,144144,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131720,1,0,'We need to add some saltpeter to give it some kick!',12,0,100,1,0,28232,0,144150,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131720,2,0,'You\'ve done some alchemy before! I can tell!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144085,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131720,3,0,'Now carefully add in some hearthbloom.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144151,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131720,4,0,'Well done! Now we need...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,144084,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131720,5,0,'Next, we need a few drops of volatile sap. Be careful not to jostle the jar too much!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144153,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131720,6,0,'Precisely! Now let\'s see what else...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144086,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131720,7,0,'Add in some sulfur. Watch the fumes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144152,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131720,8,0,'Excellently done! We should be able to use this against those monstrous wooden creatures. Ah... but do watch it doesn\'t spill.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,144168,0,'Warren Ashton to Player'),(131748,0,0,'Okay! Lets go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144080,0,'Penny \"Precious\" Hardwick to Player'),(131748,1,0,'Please, don\'t leave me.',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,144336,0,'Penny \"Precious\" Hardwick to Player'),(131748,2,0,'Is this the right way?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,146028,0,'Penny \"Precious\" Hardwick to Player'),(131748,3,0,'Good thing I wore my boots!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144356,0,'Penny \"Precious\" Hardwick to Player'),(131748,4,0,'Where are you going?',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,144527,0,'Penny \"Precious\" Hardwick to Player'),(131748,5,0,'Ooh, pretty!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,146040,0,'Penny \"Precious\" Hardwick to Player'),(131764,0,0,'A Hexthralled Crossbowmen has you in his sights! Evade!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,144229,0,'Winston to Player'),(131764,1,0,'Winston is flying outside of your range. Return to Corlain!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,152730,0,'Winston to Player'),(131841,0,0,'Our lengthy history has seen few days as great as this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,156315,0,'Jinson to Player'),(131879,0,0,'I\'ll help reinforce the village\'s defenses. I will meet you there!',12,0,100,1,0,103331,0,144266,0,'Inquisitor Cleardawn to Player'),(131879,1,0,'$n will assist you in whatever you might need, Master. I will go see if I can\'t help Mayor Royston.',12,0,100,1,0,103347,0,150544,0,'Inquisitor Cleardawn to Player'),(132017,0,0,'Whoa, you\'re really strong!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,147697,0,'Ancel Mildenhall to Flowing Honey'),(132017,1,0,'Take that!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,147698,0,'Ancel Mildenhall to Flowing Honey'),(132017,2,0,'Wh... why would he leave his boot here? Unless he was eaten!?',12,0,100,669,0,0,0,146487,0,'Ancel Mildenhall to Player'),(132017,3,0,'It didn\'t stand a chance!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,147699,0,'Ancel Mildenhall to Bubbling Mead'),(132017,4,0,'Dad\'s been carrying that book with him everywhere lately...',12,0,100,669,0,0,0,146489,0,'Ancel Mildenhall to Player'),(132160,0,0,'My blood... feeds them.',12,0,100,0,0,104277,0,146466,0,'Vinemaster Smagh to Player'),(132161,0,0,'No... we must... grow.',12,0,100,0,0,104279,0,146468,0,'Vinemaster Orgsteen to Player'),(132162,0,0,'We will... never go back...',12,0,100,0,0,104281,0,146470,0,'Vinemaster Guff to Player'),(132163,0,0,'All who fail to obey must be culled!',12,0,100,0,0,111124,0,145810,0,'Tideguard Pontus'),(132163,1,0,'Gaze upon the shadow of your demise.',12,0,100,0,0,103714,0,149629,0,'Tideguard Pontus'),(132163,2,0,'They await... in the depths...',12,0,100,0,0,111125,0,145873,0,'Tideguard Pontus to Player'),(132193,0,0,'Get back, or ye\'ll be meetin\' my hammer!',12,0,100,0,0,99197,0,146307,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,1,0,'Alright, ye jus\' lead the way...',12,0,100,1,0,99199,0,146457,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,2,0,'Just ye try! Ye\'ll taste my hammer, witch!',12,0,100,5,0,99202,0,146451,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,3,0,'Hmm. Ain\'t much here, but I got a notion how to maximize its potential.',12,0,100,1,0,99379,0,146381,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,4,0,'Let me work this fer a spell. Meanwhile, I believe I spied an old hand cannon in the repair heap over there.',12,0,100,0,0,99380,0,146382,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,5,0,'Fetch it fer me, an\' we\'ll see what we can do.',12,0,100,0,0,99381,0,146383,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,6,0,'That\'s the one! Jus\' toss it atop the table there.',12,0,100,1,0,99382,0,146384,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,7,0,'I\'ll need te modify this here hand cannon a mite first...',12,0,100,0,0,99384,0,146386,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,8,0,'Ah, there we go!',12,0,100,1,0,99385,0,146387,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132193,9,0,'All that\'s left is to give the girl a name. How bout we call her \"Witchrend?\"',12,0,100,1,0,99386,0,146388,0,'Angus Ballaster to Player'),(132292,0,0,'<sigh> I\'m never getting out of here.',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,148771,0,'Raimond Mildenhall'),(132355,0,0,'Eureka! I\'m free!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,148769,0,'Raimond Mildenhall to Player'),(132374,0,0,'Oh, thanks again for taking care of those spiders. Not sure how much longer I would\'ve lasted.',12,0,100,1,0,101567,0,146365,0,'Elsie Wright to Player'),(132374,1,0,'If it\'s all the same to you, I\'m getting out of here before more of those things come from the mine!',12,0,100,1,0,101568,0,146366,0,'Elsie Wright to Player'),(132377,0,0,'Thank you! I thought I was a goner.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,152793,0,'Bleak Hills Miner to Player'),(132377,1,0,'I\'m never stepping foot in this mine again!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,152795,0,'Bleak Hills Miner to Player'),(132377,2,0,'They came out of nowhere!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,152794,0,'Bleak Hills Miner to Player'),(132395,0,0,'Go, my pets! Rip them apart!',14,0,100,1,0,104175,0,150290,0,'Sister Noella Briarwood to Player'),(132395,1,0,'Acolyte, tear that barricade down!',14,0,100,0,0,104176,0,150291,0,'Sister Noella Briarwood to Briarwood Eradicator'),(132395,2,0,'My demolisher will rip you to shreds! You only forestall the inevitable!',14,0,100,0,0,104177,0,150292,0,'Sister Noella Briarwood to Briarwood Annihilator'),(132395,3,0,'A minor inconvenience! Once my forces regroup, this miserable town will be ours!',14,0,100,0,0,104178,0,150418,0,'Sister Noella Briarwood to Briarwood Siegebreaker'),(132395,4,0,'Interlopers! You will die!',12,0,100,0,0,104165,0,145949,0,'Sister Noella Briarwood to Player'),(132395,5,0,'We will... have revenge...',12,0,100,0,0,104172,0,145945,0,'Sister Noella Briarwood to Player'),(132720,0,0,'Leonard will provide you some back up. Just give him a whistle and he\'ll do what he does best.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,146452,0,'Hawkmaster Lloyd to Player'),(132994,0,0,'While I am thankful for your help, I must ask that you not rummage through my daughter\'s undergarments...',12,0,100,1,0,103407,0,149816,0,'Lord Arthur Waycrest to Player'),(132994,1,0,'I don\'t believe I left them with Lucy\'s letters, but I suppose it\'s prudent to be sure.',12,0,100,6,0,103408,0,149817,0,'Lord Arthur Waycrest to Player'),(132994,2,0,'Oh, you\'ve found it! Thank the tides!',12,0,100,5,0,103409,0,149821,0,'Lord Arthur Waycrest to Player'),(132994,3,0,'Please inform the happy couple I will be down shortly.',12,0,100,1,0,103410,0,149822,0,'Lord Arthur Waycrest to Player'),(132994,4,0,'Oh, and do convey my apologies for the delay.',12,0,100,1,0,103411,0,149823,0,'Lord Arthur Waycrest to Player'),(132994,5,0,'Alexander, have you prepared the--wait, what was that!?',12,0,100,1,0,103418,0,149834,0,'Lord Arthur Waycrest to Player'),(132994,6,0,'An ambush! Lucy, get behind me! Guards, to arms!',14,0,100,5,0,103419,0,149837,0,'Lord Arthur Waycrest to Player'),(133006,0,0,'Why would my husband put his notebook in Lucille\'s pack? Are you daft?',12,0,100,5,0,105947,0,149818,0,'Lady Meredith Waycrest to Player'),(133006,1,0,'We are looking for a book. Don\'t you think we would have already checked the bookcase?',12,0,100,6,0,105948,0,149819,0,'Lady Meredith Waycrest to Player'),(133006,2,0,'Are you trying to waste our time?',12,0,100,5,0,105949,0,149820,0,'Lady Meredith Waycrest to Player'),(133006,3,0,'Idiot! There can be no witnesses!',12,0,100,5,0,105951,0,149841,0,'Lady Meredith Waycrest to Player'),(133006,4,0,'You had better!',12,0,100,5,0,105952,0,149843,0,'Lady Meredith Waycrest to Player'),(133021,0,1,'I will throw you to the waves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144113,0,'Overseer Howling'),(133021,0,0,'Boralus belongs to us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144074,0,'Overseer Howling'),(133024,0,0,'Boralus belongs to us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144074,0,'Stablemaster Diana'),(133099,0,0,'The things I\'ve seen... You must stop them!',12,0,100,35,0,0,0,146661,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(133099,1,0,'I\'m heading back to Falconhurst!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,146658,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(133100,0,0,'When they dragged me out here, I thought it was the end!',12,0,100,35,0,0,0,146655,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(133100,1,0,'Ahhhhhhhhhhh! Get me out of here! Ahhhhhhhhh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,146659,0,'Captive Villager to Player'),(133101,