er'),(133616,1,0,'How\'s that fer chummin\' the waters?',12,0,100,0,0,109244,0,147407,0,'Coxswain Hook to Player'),(133616,2,0,'Is that all you got?',12,0,100,0,0,109242,0,147402,0,'Coxswain Hook to Player'),(133616,3,0,'Like stabbin\' fish on dry land!',12,0,100,0,0,109241,0,147401,0,'Coxswain Hook to Player'),(133665,0,0,'Now this is what I call fishin\'!',12,0,100,0,0,112151,0,147642,0,'Master Gunner Line to Player'),(133665,1,0,'Bullseye! Er, fisheye!',12,0,100,0,0,112153,0,157676,0,'Master Gunner Line to Player'),(133665,2,0,'Like shootin\' fish in a barrel!',12,0,100,0,0,112154,0,157677,0,'Master Gunner Line to Player'),(133736,0,0,'Forgive... me...',12,0,100,0,0,97822,0,147064,0,'Hexthralled Falconer to Player'),(133799,0,0,'Mph mph mph!',12,0,100,0,0,111427,0,147425,0,'\"Sinker\" to Player'),(133841,0,0,'The Heartsbane have granted me unrivaled power! You will fall!',12,0,100,0,0,100814,0,147858,0,'Captain Goodspeed'),(133841,1,0,'That\'s... impossible...',12,0,100,0,0,100815,0,147859,0,'Captain Goodspeed to Player'),(133892,0,0,'I... obey...',12,0,100,0,0,97812,0,147059,0,'Hexthralled Crossbowman to Player'),(133907,0,0,'Hmm...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,147768,0,'Ancel Mildenhall to Player'),(133907,1,0,'What\'s this?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,147769,0,'Ancel Mildenhall to Player'),(133940,0,0,'Our boars will feed on you.',12,0,100,0,0,104246,0,143905,0,'Briarback Reinforcements to Player'),(133953,0,0,'Over here!',12,0,100,0,0,104597,0,141847,0,'Sergeant Calvin to Player'),(133953,1,0,'I just want to wish you good luck. We\'re all counting on you.',12,0,100,0,0,104598,0,148012,0,'Sergeant Calvin to Player'),(133953,2,0,'You actually did it! Quickly, over here!',12,0,100,0,0,104606,0,148116,0,'Sergeant Calvin to Player'),(134004,0,0,'Enough!',12,0,100,25,0,106526,0,148147,0,'Gorak Tul'),(134055,0,0,'You... will... fall...',12,0,100,0,0,99702,0,143400,0,'Tidesage Initiate to Player'),(134166,0,0,'You got any more business in town, now\'s the time to do it. Let me know when 