,2,0,'Bwonsamdi has given me another chance!',12,0,100,71,0,106079,0,0,0,''),(129120,0,0,'Thank you. I can make it from here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,148920,0,'Temple Defender to Player'),(129120,1,0,'You have no idea what they\'ve put us through...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,148918,0,'Temple Defender to Player'),(129120,2,0,'I should be able to make my way to safety.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,148921,0,'Temple Defender to Player'),(129164,1,0,'Stay strong! I will check on Satao.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144289,0,'Chronicler Jabari to Player'),(129164,0,0,'Oof! Not de most graceful of exits, but one I do appreciate!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,146051,0,'Chronicler Jabari to Player'),(129185,1,0,'Oh no, here it comes...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,144049,0,'Guard Satao to Player'),(129185,0,0,'Ugh, I feel dizzy... Bwonsamdi was calling me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,140281,0,'Guard Satao to Player'),(133140,0,0,'Rastakhan\'s Might is mine! Taste de bitter wind of defeat!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(129260,0,0,'Go. Gather what is needed to heal dis snakeman. I will fill in Julwaba on what we know.',12,0,100,6,0,109864,0,0,0,''),(134558,0,0,'We have dominion over all!',12,0,100,0,0,103603,0,0,0,''),(130603,0,0,'Another pterrordax too weak for the Faithless!',12,0,100,0,0,105765,0,0,0,''),(129276,0,0,'Death be de only escape.',12,0,100,0,0,107041,0,0,0,''),(129276,1,0,'Dis one be mine!',12,0,100,603,0,107039,0,0,0,''),(129311,0,0,'This pleases me! Bring more to my lair... I must commune with the master!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(129319,0,0,'Hello? Is anyone dere?',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,140197,0,'Bladeguard Tarkaj to Player'),(129319,1,0,'Please, I\'m injured... Have mercy on a fellow Zandalari!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140200,0,'Bladeguard Tarkaj to Player'),(129319,2,0,'$p...?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,140210,0,'Bladeguard Tarkaj to Player'),(129330,0,0,'What you doing out here, $p? I thought you were dead!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140262,0,'Bladeguard Tarkaj to Player'),(129330,1,0,'My first drink in Vol\'dun. I\'ve been lost in da dunes since we were 