s. Perhaps we have stumbled upon one we were not meant to reveal.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140748,0,'Batu to Player'),(129603,0,0,'Zak\'rajan has enslaved us for countless ages. Free us....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140791,0,'Released Spirit to Player'),(129603,1,0,'Even de loa have abandoned us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140792,0,'Released Spirit to Player'),(129603,2,0,'Spirits be powerful weapons... if you can control \'em.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140790,0,'Released Spirit to Player'),(129603,3,0,'Why does Bwonsamdi refuse to let us into de Other Side?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,140786,0,'Released Spirit to Player'),(129620,0,0,'Aaahhh!!',14,0,100,0,0,102550,0,0,0,''),(129672,0,0,'Let my spirit go free. Please...',12,0,100,0,0,107073,0,153655,0,'Tortured Spirit to Player'),(129672,1,0,'We are coming for you, Zak\'rajan...',12,0,100,0,0,107070,0,153654,0,'Tortured Spirit to Player'),(129672,2,0,'Zak\'rajan betrayed us all!',12,0,100,0,0,107065,0,140929,0,'Tortured Spirit to Player'),(129672,3,0,'De end... at last.',12,0,100,0,0,110685,0,153653,0,'Tortured Spirit to Player'),(129672,4,0,'You\'ll be next, Zak\'rajan...',12,0,100,0,0,107071,0,153654,0,'Tortured Spirit to Player'),(129708,0,0,'Back in the day, I could have handled a swarm of these slithering worms. They came at me in the dark. I was overrun! Their orders seem to be, boiled down, \"Hurry! Azshara wants her prize!\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,139353,0,'Rauloo the Hardened to Player'),(129709,0,0,'It was just little murlocs here, then there was a storm, then naga streaming up the beach. They took me first, and I am rather embarrassed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,138799,0,'Crosh to Player'),(129710,0,0,'These naga are afraid. Something else is driving them. This is not merely loyalty to Queen Azshara.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,153372,0,'Akru to Player'),(129712,0,0,'The naga are looking for something here. It will be for Azshara. We must stop them, or obfuscate their goal.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,139350,0,'Kono to Player'),(129717,0,0,'Oh my! This is just awful. These are or