hunted...',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'ATTUMEN - DEATH'),(113971,1,1,'A pure mind is an orderly mind.',14,0,100,0,0,77789,0,123844,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,2,0,'Purified!',14,0,100,0,0,77784,0,123827,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,2,1,'A teachable moment.',14,0,100,0,0,77785,0,123830,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,3,0,'All shall be sanctified!',14,0,100,0,0,77775,0,123772,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,4,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_InnerFire:20|t%s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:227789|h[Sacred Ground]|h|r at you!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,123100,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,5,0,'The righteous have nothing to fear!',14,0,100,0,0,77778,0,123775,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,5,1,'Step into the light, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,77779,0,123807,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,6,0,'By fire be cleansed!',14,0,100,0,0,77777,0,123774,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(114312,0,1,'The master has not been himself for quite some time. Perhaps a feast will brighten his spirit.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - INTRO'),(114312,1,0,'I don\'t believe the master is expecting you!',14,0,100,0,0,58644,0,0,0,'MORES - AGGRO'),(114312,1,1,'I do so detest party crashers!',14,0,100,0,0,58644,0,0,0,'MOROES - AGGRO'),(114312,1,2,'I\'ll drag you out by your scruff!',14,0,100,0,0,58645,0,0,0,'MOROES - AGGRO'),(114312,1,3,'May we see your invitation?',14,0,100,0,0,58646,0,0,0,'MOROES - AGGRO'),(114312,2,0,'May I take your jacket?',14,0,100,0,0,58639,0,0,0,'MOROES - COAT_JACKET'),(114312,2,1,'Mind your manners!',14,0,100,0,0,58638,0,0,0,'MOROES - COAT_JACKET'),(114312,3,0,'I insist you dress for dinner!',14,0,100,0,0,58640,0,0,0,'MOROES - VANISH'),(114312,4,0,'Stop troubling the master\'s guests!',14,0,100,0,0,58642,0,0,0,'MOROES - GHASTLY'),(114312,5,0,'Nothing a good sprinkling of sawdust can\'t handle.',14,0,100,0,0,58647,0,0,0,'MOROES - KILL'),(114312,5,1,'I\'ll have the cleaning crew take care of this... mess.',14,0,100,0,0,58648,0,0,0,'MOROES - KILL'),(114312,5,2,'Hm! Seems that one had enough for the evening.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - KILL'),(114312,5,3,'Stop being such a nuisance!',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - KILL'),(114312,6,0,'Perhaps your party would be more comfortable at the children\'s table.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - WIPE'),(114312,6,1,'The guards really must do a better job of keeping out the ruffians.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - WIPE'),(114312,7,0,'Seems I\'ll be... retiring... for... the evening...',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - DEATH'),(114312,7,1,'Master... I hope... I served you... well...',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - DEATH'),(114312,7,2,'I fear that I am currently... indisposed...',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - DEATH'),(114312,7,3,'I will just need... a moment...',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'MOROES - DEATH'),(114895,0,0,'Learn the meaning of torment!',14,0,100,0,0,77532,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - AGGRO'),(114895,0,1,'Come forth and burn! ',14,0,100,0,0,77534,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - AGGRO'),(114895,1,0,'Burn from the inside!',14,0,100,0,0,77523,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - IGNITE_SOUL'),(114895,1,1,'Your soul betrays your allies!',14,0,100,0,0,77522,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - IGNITE_SOUL'),(114895,1,2,'Your lifeblood is my weapon!',14,0,100,0,0,77524,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - IGNITE_SOUL'),(114895,2,0,'I\'ve toyed with you long enough!',14,0,100,0,0,77545,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - PHASE_AIR'),(114895,2,1,'Miserable vermin. I shall exterminate you from the air!',14,0,100,0,0,77528,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - PHASE_AIR'),(114895,3,0,'Enough! I will finish you myself!',14,0,100,0,0,77529,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - PHASE_3'),(114895,3,1,'I will end you!',14,0,100,0,0,77546,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - PHASE_3'),(114895,3,2,'Time to end this!',14,0,100,0,0,77544,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - PHASE_3'),(114895,4,0,'Run, cowards!',14,0,100,0,0,77525,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - BELLOWING_ROAR'),(114895,4,1,'Weak-willed mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,77526,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - BELLOWING_ROAR'),(114895,4,2,'Your courage falters!',14,0,100,0,0,77527,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - BELLOWING_ROAR'),(114895,5,0,'I\'ll reduce you to ashes!',14,0,100,0,0,77533,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - KILL'),(114895,5,1,'Kindling for the fire!',14,0,100,0,0,77535,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - KILL'),(114895,5,2,'Pathetic!',14,0,100,0,0,77536,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - KILL'),(114895,5,3,'Who\'s next?!',14,0,100,0,0,77537,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - KILL'),(114895,6,0,'Mortals never learn.',14,0,100,0,0,77539,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - WIPE'),(114895,6,1,'Pitiful... as expected.',14,0,100,0,0,77538,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - WIPE'),(114895,6,2,'You called me here only to die at my feet?',14,0,100,0,0,77540,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - WIPE'),(114895,7,0,'It is... never... over...',14,0,100,0,0,77541,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - DEATH'),(114895,7,1,'I will... never... be free...',14,0,100,0,0,77542,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - DEATH'),(114895,8,0,'Am I damned to answer the summons of mortals for all eternity?',14,0,100,0,0,77530,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - DEATH'),(114895,9,0,'So be it! You will suffer for your insolence!',14,0,100,0,0,77531,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - DEATH'),(114895,10,0,'The strange chill of a dark presence winds through the air',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'NIGHTBANE - START TIMER'),(115038,0,0,'You\'ve got my attention, dragon. You\'ll find I\'m not as easily scared as the villagers below.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'IMAGE_MEDIVH_REPLY'),(115038,1,0,'You dare challenge me at my own dwelling? Your arrogance is astounding, even for a dragon.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'IMAGE_MEDIVH_REPLY'),(115038,2,0,'I do not know what you speak of, dragon... but I will not be bullied by this display of insolence. I\'ll leave Karazhan when it suits me!',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'IMAGE_MEDIVH_REPLY'),(115038,3,0,'He should not have angered me. I must go... recover my strength now...',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'IMAGE_MEDIVH_REPLY'),(115213,0,0,'Your dabbling in the arcane has gone too far, Medivh. You\'ve attracted the attention of powers beyond your understanding. You must leave Karazhan at once!',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'IMAGE_OF_ARCANAGOS'),(115213,1,0,'A dark power seeks to use you, Medivh! If you stay, dire days will follow. You must hurry, we don\'t have much time!',14,0,100,0,0,77690,0,0,0,'IMAGE_OF_ARCANAGOS'),(115213,2,0,'You leave me no alternative. I will stop you by force if you won\'t listen to reason.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'IMAGE_OF_ARCANAGOS'),(115213,3,0,'What have you done, wizard? This cannot be! I\'m burning from... within!',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'IMAGE_OF_ARCANAGOS'),(114284,0,0,'We all deserve a chance to fly! Hey, do you really think the Wizard will de-greenify me?',14,0,100,0,0,77153,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - INTRO'),(114284,1,0,'I don\'t have any friends... well, apart from you, Galindre.',14,0,100,0,0,77154,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - INTRO'),(114284,2,1,'Together, we\'re unlimited!',14,0,100,0,0,77146,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - AGGRO'),(114284,3,0,'Sorry to bring you down!',14,0,100,0,0,77147,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - DEFY_GRAVITY'),(114284,3,1,'You deserve a chance to fly!',14,0,100,0,0,77148,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - DEFY_GRAVITY'),(114284,4,0,'Come see my minions, and let them be heard!',14,0,100,0,0,77149,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - SUMMON_ASSISTANTS'),(114284,4,1,'Elekkamomen otunbuntu rotu kerlaramen!',14,0,100,0,0,77150,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - SUMMON_ASSISTANTS'),(114284,5,0,'For the first time, I feel... wikket.',14,0,100,0,0,77151,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - KILL'),(114284,5,1,'That was quite the commotion!',14,0,100,0,0,77152,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - KILL'),(114284,6,0,'How beautifully... tragic.',14,0,100,0,0,77145,0,0,0,'ELFYRA - DEATH'),(114251,0,0,'Elfyra, come down from there! You\'re fluttering about like one of those horrible monkey creatures!',14,0,100,0,0,77161,0,0,0,'GALINDRE - INTRO'),(114251,1,0,'Of course, dear! Though that old frock of yours... Oh, look! Some new friends have come to pay us a visit.',14,0,100,0,0,77162,0,0,0,'GALINDRE - INTRO'),(114251,2,0,'If you\'re my friend, you\'ll make the hozen get rid of these interlopers... then we\'re off to see the Wizard!',14,0,100,0,0,77163,0,0,0,'GALINDRE - INTRO'),(114251,3,0,'Follow my lead and you\'ll be popular!',14,0,100,0,0,77158,0,0,0,'GALINDRE - AGGRO'),(114251,4,0,'This place could stand to be Galindre-fied!',14,0,100,0,0,77157,0,0,0,'GALINDRE - MAGIC_MAGNIFICIENT'),(114251,4,1,'Now for something most magnificent!',14,0,100,0,0,77156,0,0,0,'GALINDRE - MAGIC_MAGNIFICIENT'),(114251,5,0,'That one needed a makeover.',14,0,100,0,0,77159,0,0,0,'GALINDRE - KILL'),(114251,5,1,'Have you misplaced your wikket mind?',14,0,100,0,0,77160,0,0,0,'GALINDRE - KILL'),(114261,0,0,'So ya wanna rumble, do ya?',14,0,100,0,0,77136,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - AGGRO'),(114261,0,1,'Let\'s dance!',14,0,100,0,0,77137,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - AGGRO'),(114261,1,0,'It\'s you and me against the world, baby!',14,0,100,0,0,77135,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - INTRO'),(114261,2,0,'Wanna go for a spin?',14,0,100,0,0,77132,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - DASHING_GALE'),(114261,3,0,'Now that\'s what I call a hot foot!',14,0,100,0,0,77133,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - BURNING_LEG_SWEEP'),(114261,4,0,'Beat it!',14,0,100,0,0,77138,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - KILL'),(114261,4,1,'Go on! Scram!',14,0,100,0,0,77139,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - KILL'),(114261,5,0,'A gang that don\'t own the fields, is nothing!',14,0,100,0,0,77140,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - WIPE'),(114261,5,1,'I dug you punks a early grave!',14,0,100,0,0,77141,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - WIPE'),(114261,6,0,'I\'ll never... stop saying... Mrrgria...?',14,0,100,0,0,77142,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - DEATH'),(114261,6,1,'There\'s a... place for us... somewhere...',14,0,100,0,0,77143,0,0,0,'TOE_KNEE - DEATH'),(114328,0,0,'Luminore! Mrs. Cauldrons! Babblet! Let us dispose with these interlopers!',14,0,100,0,0,77088,0,0,0,'COGGLESTON - AGGRO'),(114328,1,0,'Quickly now! Get rid of them!',14,0,100,0,0,77094,0,0,0,'COGGLESTON - KARA_KAZHAM'),(114328,2,0,'Delightful! One less guest for dinner!',14,0,100,0,0,77089,0,0,0,'COGGLESTON - KILL'),(114328,3,0,'Never stand in the way of true love!',14,0,100,0,0,77090,0,0,0,'COGGLESTON - WIPE'),(114328,4,0,'It seems... my rose... has... wilted...',14,0,100,0,0,77091,0,0,0,'COGGLESTON - DEATH'),(114328,5,0,'Oh no, no, no... this won\'t do! You outsiders will ruin our final chance to break the curse!',14,0,100,0,0,77105,0,0,0,'COGGLESTON - CONVERSATION'),(114328,6,0,'It\'s working! It\'s working!',14,0,100,0,0,77106,0,0,0,'COGGLESTON - CONVERSATION'),(114329,0,0,'Zee true love, eet burnses!',14,0,100,0,0,77095,0,0,0,'LUMINORE - HEAT_WAVE'),(114329,1,0,'The candle! Mine!',14,0,100,0,0,77092,0,0,0,'LUMINORE - KILL'),(114329,2,0,'No... take... zee... candle...',14,0,100,0,0,77093,0,0,0,'LUMINORE - DEATH'),(114330,0,0,'That will teach you to flirt with my boyfriend!',14,0,100,0,0,77099,0,0,0,'BABLET - KILL'),(114330,1,0,'Only beauty... can kill... a brute...',14,0,100,0,0,77100,0,0,0,'BABLET - DEATH'),(114522,0,0,'Hope I don\'t spoil your appetite, dearies!',14,0,100,0,0,77096,0,0,0,'MRS_CAULDRON - SOUP_SPRAY'),(114522,1,0,'That didn\'t go very well at all, did it?',14,0,100,0,0,77098,0,0,0,'MRS_CAULDRON - KILL'),(114522,2,0,'Guess I\'m... sleeping in... the cupboard.',14,0,100,0,0,77097,0,0,0,'MRS_CAULDRON - DEATH'),(114350,0,0,'This is who I am. I was tainted from birth, polluted from before my conception, a bad seed grown to bear bitter fruit.',14,0,100,0,0,77556,0,123824,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,1,0,'You\'re just like the others, aren\'t you?',14,0,50,0,0,77558,0,123832,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,1,1,'Hello, champions. I\'ve been expecting you.',14,0,50,0,0,77552,0,123831,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_infernoblast:20|tYou are targeted by |cFFF00000|Hspell:227615|h[Inferno Bolt]|h|r!',42,0,100,0,0,77558,0,123231,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,2,1,'You grow weaker... I grow stronger!',14,0,100,0,0,77564,0,0,0,'SHADE_MEDIVH - PIERCING_MISSILES'),(114350,3,0,'The inherent nature of fire...',14,0,50,0,0,77561,0,123812,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,3,1,'Burn... just like that dragon!',14,0,50,0,0,77570,0,123813,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,4,0,'|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHAMAN_IMPROVEDFIRENOVA:20|tShade of Medivh begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:228269|h[Flame Wreath]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,77550,0,123526,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,5,0,'It burns, burns, burns!',14,0,50,0,0,77550,0,123819,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,5,1,'I suggest staying put.',14,0,50,0,0,77566,0,123820,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,6,0,'Winter is here!',14,0,50,0,0,77572,0,123821,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,6,1,'Keep still. Let it end.',14,0,50,0,0,77555,0,123822,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,7,0,'So many pieces of me...',14,0,50,0,0,77565,0,123817,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,7,1,'Carrion for the birds...',14,0,50,0,0,77562,0,123818,0,'Shade of Medivh'),(114350,8,0,'A memory, frozen in time!',14,0,100,0,0,77560,0,123809,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,8,1,'The tower needed a new decoration.',14,0,100,0,0,77571,0,123810,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,8,2,'All goes as planned.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'SHADE_MEDIVH - DEATH'),(114350,8,3,'The tower needed a new decoration.',14,0,100,0,0,77571,0,0,0,'SHADE_MEDIVH - DEATH'),(114350,9,0,'A basic spell... but effective.',14,0,100,0,0,77549,0,123816,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,9,1,'Once you get used to it, you can kill friends as easily as anyone else.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'SHADE_MEDIVH - DEATH'),(114350,10,0,'Just. Gets. Easier.',14,0,33,0,0,77551,0,123826,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,10,1,'A fitting end for a thief!',14,0,33,0,0,77554,0,123829,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(114350,10,2,'All goes as planned.',14,0,33,0,0,77557,0,123828,0,'Shade of Medivh to Player'),(113971,1,0,'The lesson is complete.',14,0,100,0,0,77788,0,123843,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,0,1,'The stench of corruption is upon you!',14,0,100,0,0,77787,0,123840,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(113971,0,0,'And so begins your purification!',14,0,100,0,0,77786,0,123837,0,'Maiden of Virtue'),(114247,0,0,'Welcome to the-- TERMINATE INTRUDERS!',14,0,100,0,0,77229,0,123421,0,'The Curator'),(114247,0,1,'The Menagerie is for-- ERADICATE! ERADICATE!',14,0,100,0,0,77181,0,123138,0,'The Curator'),(114247,1,0,'Countermeasures deployed.',12,0,100,0,0,77224,0,123423,0,'The Curator'),(114247,1,1,'DETERRENT ACTIVATED!',12,0,100,0,0,77227,0,123424,0,'The Curator'),(114247,2,0,'Overload in progress. Prepare for-- PURGE! PURGE! PURGE!',12,0,100,0,0,77183,0,123140,0,'The Curator'),(114247,3,0,'EXTERMINATED!',12,0,100,0,0,77184,0,123141,0,'The Curator'),(114247,3,1,'Attention guests: DIE! DIE! DIE!',12,0,100,0,0,77185,0,123142,0,'The Curator'),(114247,4,0,'Curator is no longer op... er... ation... al.',14,0,100,0,0,77182,0,123139,0,'The Curator'),(114462,0,0,'Defense protocols activated.',14,0,100,0,0,78201,0,124001,0,'Curator to Medivh'),(93823,0,0,'Welcome to Skyhold! Here the brave live on forever!',12,0,100,0,0,60356,0,98601,0,'Danica the Reclaimer to Player');
INSERT INTO `creature_text` VALUES (93823,1,0,'Behind you lies the Eye of Odyn, which peers across all of Azeroth! This way lies the Forge, where the mightiest weapons of the valarjar are crafted by Helgar, the greatest smith in the Halls.',12,0,100,0,0,60358,0,98370,0,'Danica the Reclaimer to Player'),(93823,2,0,'Across the way lies the Arena of Glory, where warriors vie for supremacy in epic combat. Before us lies the Great Mead Hall where drink and stories flow freely!',12,0,100,0,0,60359,0,105450,0,'Danica the Reclaimer to Player'),(93823,3,0,'Odyn awaits ahead. I will go forth and announce you. Be respectful!',12,0,100,0,0,60360,0,98372,0,'Danica the Reclaimer to Player'),(98206,4,1,'Reinforcements to me! NOW!',14,0,100,0,0,58638,0,0,0,'XAKAL - FEL_BATS'),(98206,5,0,'More fuel to stop the fel fires.',14,0,100,0,0,58640,0,0,0,'XAKAL - KILL'),(98206,5,1,'Another notch for my fel blade.',14,0,100,0,0,58642,0,0,0,'XAKAL - KILL_2'),(98206,5,2,'No match for the great Xakal!',14,0,100,0,0,58647,0,0,0,'XAKAL - KILL_3'),(98206,6,0,'Gather, minions! Feast on their corpses, where the blacken is still warm.',14,0,100,0,0,58648,0,0,0,'XAKAL - WIPE'),(98206,7,0,'No... NO! None can best... the great Xakal...',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'XAKAL - DEAD'),(98203,2,1,'Get away from my mana!',14,0,100,0,0,58639,0,0,0,'IVANYR - VOLATILE_MAGIC'),(98203,3,0,'Thieving wretch!',14,0,100,0,0,58638,0,0,0,'IVANYR - KILL'),(98203,3,1,'I warned you!',14,0,100,0,0,58640,0,0,0,'IVANYR - KILL'),(98203,3,2,'I will not be consumed!',14,0,100,0,0,58642,0,0,0,'IVANYR - KILL'),(98203,4,0,'More... more...',14,0,100,0,0,58647,0,0,0,'IVANYR - DEATH'),(98203,5,0,'No! I need more...',14,0,100,0,0,58648,0,0,0,'IVANYR - OVERCHARGE'),(98203,5,1,'No! I will not succumb.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'IVANYR - OVERCHARGE'),(98208,5,0,'Enough! You little beasts are getting out of hand!',14,0,100,0,0,58640,0,0,0,'VANDROS - REACH_ON_TIME'),(98208,6,0,'For the glory of Elisande!',14,0,100,0,0,58642,0,0,0,'VANDROS - KILL'),(98208,6,1,'Think of this as a mercy killing.',14,0,100,0,0,58647,0,0,0,'VANDROS - KILL'),(98208,6,2,'So brave, but so... shortsighted.',14,0,100,0,0,58648,0,0,0,'VANDROS - KILL'),(98208,7,0,'Alas... blind courage only triumphs in the fairy tales.',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'VANDROS - WIPE'),(98208,8,0,'The Grand Magistrix... will have your heads for this...',14,0,100,0,0,58641,0,0,0,'VANDROS - DEATH'),(43247,0,9,'Get this damned line moving!',12,7,100,15,0,0,0,43754,0,'Redridge Citizen'),(43247,0,10,'You\'re good for nothing, Solomon!',12,7,100,14,0,0,0,43755,0,'Redridge Citizen'),(43247,0,11,'You can forget about re-election, magistrate!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,43756,0,'Redridge Citizen'),(43247,0,12,'No justice, no peace!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,43757,0,'Redridge Citizen'),(43247,0,13,'If you don\'t do something about these gnolls, we will!',12,7,100,25,0,0,0,43758,0,'Redridge Citizen'),(43247,0,14,'Please help me! I\'m the last member of my family left. Everyone else has been kidnapped!',12,7,100,15,0,0,0,43759,0,'Redridge Citizen'),(43247,1,0,'Forget you, Solomon. I\'ll find my family by myself.',12,7,100,14,0,0,0,43760,0,'Redridge Citizen'),(61348,19,0,'A secret passage has opened beneath the platform, this way!',14,0,100,5,0,30200,0,65190,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,20,0,'Look at the dust along the floor, these dark halls have not seen footfalls for many centuries.',12,0,100,1,0,30201,0,65191,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,21,0,'Once, the mogu enslaved all of the races of Pandaria, and bent them to their nefarious will.',12,0,100,25,0,30202,0,65192,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(35378,0,0,'This mastiff will help you find the hidden worgen.',12,0,100,0,0,19696,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley to Player'),(35550,0,0,'Fire!',14,0,100,0,0,19710,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane'),(35230,0,0,'Let\'s round up as many of them as we can.  Every worgen chasing us is one less worgen chasing the survivors!',12,0,100,0,0,19506,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(49231,0,0,'I see. Well then, let\'s get to work, $n! The Dark Lady needs us, right?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49351,0,'Valdred Moray'),(49231,1,0,'Valdred Moray, reporting for duty, sir!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,49408,0,'Valdred Moray'),(49230,0,0,'Who are you calling a monster? You\'re the monster! I\'m just a man who died.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49345,0,'Marshal Redpath'),(38895,0,0,'No. You\'re lying! My father will protect me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49337,0,'Lilian Voss'),(36440,2,0,'The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowning Watchman to Player'),(36606,0,0,'We will overcome this.  Do not give into panic.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Queen Mia Greymane'),(37694,1,0,'The Forsaken will pay for what they\'ve done!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Villager'),(37694,2,0,'It\'s true then?  Even those afflicted by the Curse are fighting the Forsaken!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Villager'),(34851,1,0,'Help...!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39313,0,'Panicked Citizen to Player'),(34851,2,0,'I die of fear...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39313,0,'Panicked Citizen to Player'),(34864,1,3,'In the woods is something strange going on, and to go beyond the city is unsafe.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44374,0,''),(34864,2,2,'It isn\'t safe to leave, there\'s something lurking out there in the woods.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,44374,0,'Gilneas City Guard'),(34913,0,1,'Defeat these foul beasts!',14,0,100,0,0,19618,0,35167,0,'Prince Liam Greymane'),(35905,0,0,'Rescue Krennan Aranas by using your vehicle\'s ability.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_groupneedmore.blp:64|t',42,0,100,0,0,20921,0,0,0,'King Greymane\'s Horse to Player'),(36283,0,0,'You must return to the Duskmist Shore!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Catapult to Player'),(19667,0,1,'Heraazi exports are on the rise, sir.  We\'ve already bribed the appropriate taxation officers and contraband will begin to arrive within days.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17186,0,'Consortium Nether Runner'),(19667,1,0,'By your leave, sir.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17185,0,'Consortium Nether Runner'),(18265,0,0,'Nothing surprising there.  Come back with some real news, will you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17191,0,'Gezhe'),(18265,0,1,'As expected.  Very well, dismissed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17190,0,'Gezhe'),(19776,0,0,'All my bags are packed, I\'m ready to go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17413,0,'Experimental Pilot'),(19776,1,0,'You need to do what? All this science, I don\'t understand... Look, this is just my job, five days a week.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17416,0,'Experimental Pilot'),(19776,2,0,'I can\'t. I\'m not the man they think I am at home.  Besides, I didn\'t bring them out here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17419,0,'Experimental Pilot'),(19776,3,0,'This isn\'t the kind of place to raise your kids. It\'s cold, and there\'d be no one to raise them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17421,0,'Experimental Pilot'),(19776,4,0,'Oh no, no, no... I\'m a rocket man.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17423,0,'Experimental Pilot'),(19737,0,0,'The ship\'s not ready yet.  We still need to calibrate the fuse length to make sure that it doesn\'t burn out and leave you up there alone.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17414,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),(19737,1,0,'Essentially, it\'s going to be a long, long time till we are ready to launch.  Maybe you should just head back home to your family.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17417,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),(19737,2,0,'Why not? A family can give you strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17420,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),(19737,3,0,'Couldn\'t you raise them?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17422,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),(19737,4,0,'Well, it\'s like I said; it\'s going to be a while before we get this ship ready for flight.  We\'ll keep you informed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17424,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),(25986,0,0,'The Ore Cart squeaks against the rails as it is released.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25416,0,'Ore Cart'),(36608,6,0,'There are more survivors to tend to. I\'ll see you on the shore.',12,0,100,397,0,0,0,36549,0,'Doc Zapnozzle to Player'),(16231,0,0,'%s nods her head yes at what her advisor has to say.',16,0,100,273,0,0,0,13362,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16231,0,1,'%s disagrees with whatever it is that Valwyn has whispered to her.',16,0,100,274,0,0,0,13363,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16231,0,2,'%s seems nonplussed by whatever it is that her advisor has whispered in her ear.',16,0,100,6,0,0,0,13365,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16231,1,0,'Executor, your direct assault approach will cost us more lives than I am comfortable with. A more nuanced strategy is called for; one that involves us reclaiming the surrounding territory, starting with the villages so as to cut off all points of reinforcement to Deatholme.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12552,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16231,2,0,'I hear what you are saying, Mavren. Nevertheless, the final decision is mine. I appreciate your assistance, but the majority of the lives on the line are blood elf. I will not have those lives carelessly thrown away!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12571,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16231,3,0,'How long until Forsaken reinforcements arrive? Our position here is tenuous. Your Lady promised us more soldiers. We must be able to concentrate solely on Deatholme and the Scourge!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12557,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16231,4,0,'Mavren, I don\'t want excuses, I want results! The Farstriders aren\'t available and we\'ve received all that we\'re going to get from Silvermoon for now. I cannot ignore the Shadowpine trolls and Zul\'Aman... they\'re arrayed across our eastern border!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12572,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16231,5,0,'No, I was right to begin with. Deatholme must come last. We must secure all of the Ghostlands first. I will not commit the forces here to a battle against Dar\'khan with enemies to our flank and rear!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12562,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16231,6,0,'Disagree with me all you like, High Executor. I will weigh your counsel, and then we will take the steps to free all of Quel\'Thalas as I deem necessary. We shall continue this discussion anon.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12573,0,'Dame Auriferous'),(16252,0,0,'With all due respect, milady, you have not fought the Scourge as I have. The Lady appointed me to assist you in defeating Dar\'khan because of that, and you would do well to consider what I have to say.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12553,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,0,1,'I strongly disagree. Dar\'khan is not going to get reinforcements because he\'ll be bottlenecked. Deatholme has only one way in and out. Your traitor was a fool to corner himself there, and I intend to exploit that weakness!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12554,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,0,2,'This is war, Dame Auriferous, and in any war lives will be lost! The only areas that we need to secure are the two ziggurats. We will turtle in and take the Tower of the Damned and its master by brute force. Then you will have your Quel\'Thalas.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12555,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,0,3,'And if your Farstriders were here to reinforce us, I might agree. But, they are busying themselves instead with the Shadowpine trolls on your eastern border. The longer we wait for them, the stronger the Scourge will become.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12556,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,1,0,'I believe that you\'re making my argument for me, but yes it would be nice if we had more reinforcements. I would counter that it would be faster to pull the Farstriders from their senseless skirmishing with the trolls.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12558,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,1,1,'Dame Auriferous, we are the reinforcements. It may come to pass that The Lady will send more men in time. Better that you convince Silvermoon City to muster all of its forces and put them at our disposal here.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12559,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,1,2,'You are correct; we must concentrate on the Scourge. Ignore the trolls and the villages, and focus our attentions on Deatholme! With Dar\'khan defeated you will find that the rest of the Scourge \'body\' will fall quickly, lacking their \'head\'.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12560,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,1,3,'Forsaken reinforcements? Undercity is stretched thin with the Scourge on all sides. No, this will be a matter largely dealt with by the blood elves. We Forsaken are here as backup and advisors.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12561,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,2,0,'Again I strongly disagree with your view of the strategic situation. Your plan will spread our forces too thin. It will leave us with only a small force to assault Deatholme. I cannot in good conscience execute such a strategy.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12567,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,2,1,'Spread throughout the Ghostlands, our forces will be of little use in an assault on Deatholme. No, milady, I am here to kill Dar\'khan and that is what I intend to do!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12568,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,2,2,'We\'ve been over this before. Only a focused assault upon Deatholme will meet with success. These other targets are distractions that we can ill afford. I suggest that you inform your Captain Helios that he is to leave off his campaign against the Shadowpine trolls and focus solely on the Scourge.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12569,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16252,2,3,'Perhaps we should let the matter rest for the time being until your chef has prepared your meal? You look a bit piqued if you don\'t mind my saying. We can resume our discussion when you are feeling more yourself.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,12570,0,'High Executor Mavren'),(16289,0,0,'%s whispers something in the Dame\'s ear.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13361,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,1,0,'%s looks appalled at the Executor\'s tone!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12574,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,1,1,'%s tries to busy herself with other matters.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12575,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,1,2,'%s glares daggers in the direction of High Executor Mavren and Deathstalker Maltendis.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12576,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,1,3,'%s lifts her nose and sniffs in response to the High Executor\'s reply.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12577,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,1,4,'%s shakes her head in disbelief at what she is hearing out of the Forsaken\'s mouth.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12578,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,1,5,'%s blanches as much of the blood drains from her face.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12579,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,1,6,'%s reddens furiously at what she is hearing in response to her lady\'s question.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12580,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,1,7,'%s concentrates on the wall opposite her, clearly ignoring the looks of the Executor and his assistant.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12581,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16289,2,0,'%s looks disgusted at the deathstalker\'s flirtations.',16,0,100,274,0,0,0,13367,0,'Advisor Valwyn'),(16251,0,0,'%s nods in agreement.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12582,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(16251,0,1,'%s opens his mouth as if to add something, and then apparently thinks the better of it.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12583,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(16251,0,2,'%s looks over at Advisor Valwyn with a smirk on his face.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12584,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(16251,0,3,'%s grins at the High Executor\'s words.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12585,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(16251,0,4,'%s appears bored with the whole discussion.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12586,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(16251,0,5,'%s winks slyly at Advisor Valwyn.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12587,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(16251,0,6,'%s fidgets with his armor, clearly uncomfortable at the tone of the discussion.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12588,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(16251,0,7,'%s looks like he\'d rather be anywhere else but here.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12589,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(16251,1,0,'%s turns to Advisor Valwyn and winks lasciviously in her direction.',16,0,100,2,0,0,0,13366,0,'Deathstalker Maltendis'),(1476,0,0,'Stormy seas out there.  The sea spirits must be restless....hic!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,318,0,'Hargin Mundar'),(1476,0,1,'I saw a Sea Giant once.  It\'s not something I would care to see again.  Burp!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,319,0,'Hargin Mundar'),(1476,0,2,'I\'d go out and clear out some of those gnolls, but this leg has seen better days and I am afraid I\'d just wind up dead.',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,320,0,'Hargin Mundar'),(1476,0,3,'Watch your step out there.  Many an adventure seeker has not returned from the marsh.  hic!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,321,0,'Hargin Mundar'),(1476,1,0,'Huuup...Huuup...Bleeeeehh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,397,0,'Hargin Mundar'),(48572,0,1,'The sun has set on this mortal world, fools. Make peace with your end, for the hour of twilight falls!',14,0,100,0,0,23228,0,0,0,'Deathwing talk'),(34258,0,0,'Ã‚Â¡Adelante! Ã‚Â¡En Marcha!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(126841,0,0,'Raah! Kragg muerto!. Cazatiburones arrepentido!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sharkbait to player'),(125475,0,0,'Boy make yummy treat!',12,0,100,0,6000,0,0,0,0,'Boneface the Giant to player'),(125996,0,0,'Oh no ya don\'t, outsidah! Ya not gonna be takin\' from me my moneymakahs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mista Nice <Street Shaman>'),(134346,2,0,'First, a simple challenge: Guide Loh to the goal.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Toki to player'),(134346,1,0,'When telling these stories, we ask young tortollans to guide Loh around small mazes to complete different challenges.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Toki to player'),(134346,0,0,'We tortollans love the story of Loh, a young tortollan who traveled the world.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Toki to player'),(91797,3,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_summonwaterelemental:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:193051|h[Call the Seas]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,54164,0,99824,0,'King Deepbeard'),(91797,2,2,'The earth trembles before the rising tide!',14,0,33,0,0,54315,0,102308,0,'King Deepbeard'),(91797,2,1,'Pity you cannot survive without air!',14,0,33,0,0,54313,0,102306,0,'King Deepbeard'),(91797,2,0,'Before the crashing waves come the quake!',14,0,33,0,0,54314,0,102307,0,'King Deepbeard'),(91797,1,0,'How long can you hold your breath, I wonder?',14,0,100,0,0,54312,0,102305,0,'King Deepbeard'),(91797,0,1,'You weaklings will drown beneath these waves!',14,0,50,0,0,54316,0,102315,0,'King Deepbeard to Player'),(917