,0,0,'Zandalari Archon'),(52962,3,0,'De Darkspear be foolish.  No one gonna stand in our way.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Archon'),(52962,4,0,'De Zandalari got powers you never seen.  Wisdom of de most ancient of trolls, wisdom dat\'s rightfully yours.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Archon'),(52962,5,0,'Zul has seen tha\' future.  We gotta come together, or we all fall to de darkness.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Archon'),(52962,6,0,'Dis shattered world not done breakin, mon.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Archon'),(52962,7,0,'De tides of darkness gonna take over.  All da trolls be in danger.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Archon'),(52962,8,0,'De Darkspear be foolish.  No one gonna stand in our way.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Archon'),(52956,1,0,'De green fist of de troll empire gonna crush dis land and make it our own again.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Juggernaut'),(52956,2,0,'\'Dis be de only way, bruddahs.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Juggernaut'),(52956,3,0,'Zul has seen tha\' future.  We gotta come together, or we all fall to de darkness.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zandalari Juggernaut'),(23597,1,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Amani\'shi Guardian'),(28095,2,0,'No let it get away! We got it this time.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28493,0,'Tracker Gekgek'),(28095,2,1,'Careful! No let it scratch you like last time.',12,0,33,0,0,0,0,28495,0,'Tracker Gekgek'),(28095,2,2,'Ahh! It\'s coming right for us!',12,0,34,0,0,0,0,27754,0,'Tracker Gekgek'),(28575,0,1,'If Rhunok regains his strength, we all die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27908,0,'Rhunok\'s Tormentor'),(28575,0,2,'There are intruders about. Slay them before they ruin everything!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27910,0,'Rhunok\'s Tormentor'),(28575,0,3,'The bear god must be kept enfeebled so that the prophet can finish the ritual.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27909,0,'Rhunok\'s Tormentor'),(28575,0,4,'Keep him weak!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27907,0,'Rhunok\'s Tormentor'),(17491,0,4,'Lok\'tar Illadari!\n',12,0,100,0,