'),(315,0,2,'Tilloa is that you?  Why no!  It\'s just some dirty $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,507,0,'Stalvan Mistmantle - On Aggro'),(20886,3,1,'Defend yourself, for all the good it will do....',14,0,100,0,0,11242,0,19972,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Knock Away'),(20886,3,0,'On guard!',14,0,100,0,0,11241,0,19971,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Knock Away'),(20885,4,1,'Ahh... just what I needed.',14,0,100,0,0,11092,0,19985,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Cast Heal'),(20885,5,0,'Now I\'m really angry.',14,0,100,0,0,11093,0,19986,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Death'),(20885,6,0,'More than you can handle, scryer?',14,0,100,1,0,11094,0,19987,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Soccothrates at 25%'),(20885,6,1,'I suppose I\'ll end up fighting them all myself.',14,0,100,1,0,11095,0,19988,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Soccothrates at 25%'),(20885,6,2,'I\'ve grown used to cleaning up your messes.',14,0,100,1,0,11096,0,19989,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Soccothrates at 25%'),(20885,7,0,'Congratulations.  I\'ve wanted to do that for years.',14,0,100,66,0,11097,0,19990,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Soccothratess dies'),(20886,4,0,'Knew this was... the only way out.',14,0,100,0,0,11243,0,19973,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Death'),(20886,5,0,'Having problems, Dalliah?  How nice.',14,0,100,1,0,11244,0,19974,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Dalliah at 25%'),(20886,5,1,'This may be the end for you, Dalliah.  What a shame that would be.',14,0,100,1,0,11245,0,19975,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Dalliah at 25%'),(20886,5,2,'I suggest a new strategy: you draw their attacks while I gather reinforcements.',14,0,100,1,0,11246,0,19976,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Dalliah at 25%'),(20886,6,0,'Finally!  Well done!',14,0,100,66,0,11247,0,19977,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Dalliah dies'),(20886,7,0,'Did you call on me?',14,0,100,397,0,11236,0,20051,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Conversation with Dalliah part 1'),(20886,8,0,'To do your heavy lifting, most likely.',14,0,100,396,0,0,0,20052,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Conversation with Dalliah part 2'),(20886,9,0,'Then I\'ll commit myself to ignoring you.',14,0,100,396,0,0,0,20053,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Conversation with Dalliah part 3'),(20886,10,0,'You\'re the one who should be-- Wait, we have company...',14,0,100,396,0,0,0,20054,0,'Wrath-Scryer Soccothrates - Conversation with Dalliah part 4'),(20885,8,0,'Why would I call on you?',14,0,100,396,0,0,0,20055,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Conversation with Soccothrates part 1'),(20885,9,0,'When I need someone to prance around like an overstuffed peacock, I\'ll call on you.',14,0,100,396,0,0,0,20056,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Conversation with Soccothrates part 2'),(20885,10,0,'What would you know about commitment, sheet-sah?',14,0,100,396,0,0,0,20057,0,'Dalliah the Doomsayer - Conversation with Soccothrates part 3'),(28068,0,4,'Finish them and then we will move south to kill their brethren!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27511,0,'Prophet of Sseratus'),(28068,0,3,'Kill these invaders who dare to defile our altar!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27510,0,'Prophet of Sseratus'),(28068,0,2,'They dare attack us? The fools! Do they not know we are now all-powerful?!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27509,0,'Prophet of Sseratus'),(28068,0,1,'The mojo of Sseratus is ours. Now all will be crushed under the might of the Drakkari!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27508,0,'Prophet of Sseratus'),(28068,0,0,'Drink deep my brothers!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27507,0,'Prophet of Sseratus'),(26334,0,3,'For the thane! For Loken!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25486,0,'Forgemaster Damrath'),(16414,0,1,'That was wasted on the likes of you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13437,0,'Ghostly Steward'),(16414,0,2,'How dare you disturb the master\'s dinner!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13438,0,'Ghostly Steward'),(15551,1,1,'You are not welcome here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13774,0,'Spectral Stable Hand - On Aggro'),(15551,1,0,'Intruder!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13773,0,'Spectral Stable Hand - On Aggro'),(16544,1,0,'You will succeed only in damning yourselves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13972,0,'Ethereal Thief'),(17959,1,1,'Get back to work you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14404,0,'Coilfang Slavehandler'),(17959,1,2,'This is terrible..... my arms grow tired from beating on you lazy peons!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14414,0,'Coilfang Slavehandler'),(17959,2,0,'Assist me slaves!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,18972,0,'Coilfang Slavehandler'),(19362,0,1,'Any time any of you peons want to take a break, the graveyard is right over there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16559,0,'Kor\'kron Defender'),(19378,6,0,'Continue to bless this, our ancient home, we beg.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16535,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19378,7,0,'Bless us with tolerance for our elven visitors.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16536,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19378,8,0,'By the naaru, may it be so.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16778,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),(19442,1,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Worg Master Kruush'),(4854,2,0,'Die! Die!',14,0,100,0,0,5854,0,6214,0,'Grimlok'),(26349,0,0,'You\'re too late! The accord has been negotiated. Only the details remain. Small details... like you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25716,0,'Goramosh'),(17839,0,1,'You are running out of time!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15183,0,'Rift Lord'),(17839,0,2,'The rift must be protected!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15182,0,'Rift Lord'),(21104,0,1,'You are running out of time!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15183,0,'Rift Keeper'),(21104,0,2,'The rift must be protected!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15182,0,'Rift Keeper'),(27209,5,0,'AHHHHHHHHH! Please... we know... that you... have a spy... disguised as... one of us! There... that\'s all that I know. Please... mercy... STOP!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26484,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(27209,4,0,'We know... that you don\'t... know why we\'re immune... to your so-called blight. Grand Admiral Westwind somehow gave the high abbot that prayer. I beg you... no more... please?!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26483,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(27209,2,0,'Wait... WAIT! What is it that you want to know?! I know you\'re the $c named $n.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26481,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(27209,3,0,'OW...NO! We know that you\'ve been stealing our armor and weapons and horses!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26482,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(27209,1,0,'Ow! I\'ll tell you NOTHING, filthy $r!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26480,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(30017,1,0,'Stinkbeard comin\' for you, little ones!',14,0,100,1,0,13907,0,30688,0,'Stinkbeard'),(30024,1,0,'For Neptulon! Strength of storm and sea, crush my enemies!',14,0,100,1,0,13878,0,30701,0,'Gargoral the Water Lord'),(30024,2,0,'I am the baddest of the bad, the coolest of the cool! To my side, my elements, let us freeze and rule!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,30770,0,'Gargoral the Water Lord'),(30025,1,0,'Arise, brothers of the earth! Watch as Erathius destroys the mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,13878,0,30700,0,'Erathius, King of Dirt'),(30025,2,0,'I\'m the king of dirt, there is none higher! To my aid, minions - assist your sire!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30767,0,'Erathius, King of Dirt'),(30023,1,0,'Korrak has come, weaklings! Snowfall belongs to Winterax! Erm, Korrak mean to say amphitheater belong to Winterax!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,30705,0,'Korrak the Bloodrager'),(30023,2,0,'No graveyard here for you to play wicked games on Korrak! DIE!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,30706,0,'Korrak the Bloodrager'),(27209,6,4,'I beg you... no more.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26504,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(27209,6,3,'They all... begged... for their... lives!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26501,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(27209,6,2,'Just... end it.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26499,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(27209,6,1,'Please... stop. I\'ll do... anything....',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26498,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(27209,6,0,'I TOLD YOU... I don\'t know... anything... else!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26496,0,'Torturer LeCraft'),(8567,2,0,'%s is getting hungry!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,4515,0,'Glutton - EMOTE_50%'),(8567,3,0,'%s is getting VERY hungry!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,4516,0,'Glutton - EMOTE 15%'),(19948,0,3,'I\'ll crush you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1925,0,'Bloodmaul Skirmisher on Aggro Text'),(19948,1,0,'Puny $r... you were a... horrible $g king : queen;.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21050,0,'Bloodmaul Skirmisher on death Quest 11000