y just fly Naxxramas over Wintergarde Keep and blow it up? I mean, that\'s what I would do if I were Kel\'Thuzad.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26973,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,3,'I wonder if we\'ll ever solve the mystery of the strange ore. There\'s gotta be some use for it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26974,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,4,'Hey, do any of you know McGoyver over at Valgarde? He\'s my uncle. You know what his title is? Pro. Yea, just \"Pro.\" I want to be a pro too.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26975,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,5,'Something straight up stinks in here! It\'s definitely not me. Gnomes smell like butter and sunshine. Not like those dwarves that smell like they were born from a trogg\'s armpit! None of you are dwarves, are you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26976,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,6,'I used to know a dwarf that claimed gnomes evolved from beneath the earth. That we all started out as sand gnomes. What a load of nonsense! Sand gnomes? PUH-LEASE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26977,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,7,'I\'ve never seen destruction like this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26978,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,8,'Keep the chatter down, people. We need to stay alert!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26979,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,9,'The smell of death covers every inch of this place.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26980,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,10,'Driver, I hear you single handedly airlifted our villagers out of this hell-hole. Is that true?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26981,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,11,'So does anyone know anything about Thel\'zan? Who is he? How did he come to leading the Scourge armies on the ground?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26982,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,12,'Look at this mess... The Scourge will pay for this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26983,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,13,'Where are all the corpses? What have they done to our people?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26984,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,1,14,'I hope I\'m alive to see Arthas get what\'s coming to him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26985,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(27588,2,0,'Reporting for duty, sir!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26954,0,'7th Legion Elite'),(14325,3,0,'Hey, who Fengus callin\' a gnoll lover?!  Take da prisoners to da king; you smart to bring them with their weapons and show da king that they a threat.  I\'ll go see if Fengus talk smack when I give him da beatdown!  HAR!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9416,0,'Captain Kromcrush'),(14325,4,0,'OK Fengus, where you at?!  You come call me a gnoll lover while I give you da hammer upside da head!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9424,0,'Captain Kromcrush'),(31397,1,0,'Please, no more.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32506,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,1,'Hit me again and you\'ll regret it!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32507,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,2,'Ow!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32508,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,3,'I\'m sorry. I\'ll work harder.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32509,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,4,'Soon the master will reclaim me!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32510,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(7524,0,4,'So tired... just want to rest...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48857,0,'Anguished Highborne'),(7524,0,5,'The crystal can still be found... if we can just find it again...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48856,0,'Anguished Highborne'),(7524,0,6,'The crystal will save us! We can be saved!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48858,0,'Anguished Highborne'),(48727,0,3,'The crystal has returned. You must leave...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48900,0,'Released Highborne Spirit'),(7523,0,4,'So tired... just want to rest...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48857,0,'Highborne'),(7523,0,5,'The crystal can still be found... if we can just find it again...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48856,0,'Highborne'),(7523,0,6,'The crystal will save us! We can be saved!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48858,0,'Highborne'),(9547,0,1,'Nagmara!  Have any mutton left?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4985,0,'Patron'),(9547,0,2,'Mistress, you tell Plugger that I want more of his ale.  I can\'t get enough!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4986,0,'Patron'),(9547,0,3,'Hey Nag, how about you slice me off a piece of that...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4987,0,'Patron'),(24966,0,1