0,0,264,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,4,0,'Now for that snack...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,283,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,5,0,'Good day, Elling!  Hullo Elaine!  Let me have a wheel of bleu cheese, eh?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,284,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,5,1,'Hullo, Trias clan!  A ball of your smoked mozzarella, if you please!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,285,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,6,0,'Yes ma\'am, business is brisk!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,295,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,7,0,'Thank you kindly!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,290,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,7,1,'Thanks for the cheese!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,291,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,8,0,'I should get back before Rema starts to worry...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,292,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,8,1,'Time to get back to the shop...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,293,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,9,0,'I\'m back!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,294,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1427,0,0,'Ah, much appreciated, Corbett.  We\'ll get these on the racks immediately.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,261,0,'Harlan Bagley'),(1427,0,1,'Ah yes, and promptly delivered.  As always, it\'s a pleasure doing business with you, Corbett.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,262,0,'Harlan Bagley'),(483,0,0,'Good day, Corbett.  Here\'s your cheese, fresh made this morning!  And how are things at your shop?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,286,0,'Elaine Trias'),(483,0,1,'Hi Corbett!  Here, you go!  I trust business is faring well at your clothier shop...?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,287,0,'Elaine Trias'),(17311,0,0,'Daughter!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13749,0,'Cowlen'),(3671,0,0,'None can stand against the Serpent Lords!',14,0,100,0,0,5786,0,6097,0,'Lady Anacondra on Aggro'),(37087,0,0,'Get ta work, boys!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,36970,0,'Jona Ironstock'),(37087,0,1,'Don\'t fret, we\'ll be outta here soon.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,36971,0,'Jona Ironstock'),(37087,0,2,'Let\'s keep this fire going, dwarves!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,36972,0,'Jona Ironstock'),(37087,0,3,'What\'s Joren doin\' out there, anyhow?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,36973,0,'Jona Ironstock'),(946,0,3,'I gonna make you into mojo!',12,0,10