you, strangers. Don\'t be delayin\' your fate. Come to me now. I make your sacrifice quick.',14,0,100,0,0,12079,0,23306,1,'Nalorakk - SAY_EVENT_2'),(46267,0,3,'You... you\'re not going to try to eat me, are you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,46480,0,'Rescued Survivor'),(46267,0,4,'I never would\'ve made it on my own...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,46481,0,'Rescued Survivor'),(46267,0,5,'Thank you for getting me out of there!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,46482,0,'Rescued Survivor'),(46267,0,6,'My family... did you find my family?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,46483,0,'Rescued Survivor'),(23576,12,0,'What could be better than servin\' da bear spirit for eternity? Come closer now. Bring your souls to me!',14,0,100,0,0,12078,0,23305,1,'Nalorakk - SAY_EVENT_1'),(42645,0,5,'I\'m free! I\'m really free!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,42584,0,'Captured Demolitionist'),(257072,0,0,'Burn... all...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(244658,0,0,'Thrall and I will locate their leader. Meet up with us once you\'ve disrupted their forces.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(1260,1,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Boss Bruggor'),(46449,0,0,'Stay with me. You\'re going to make it out of here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46501,0,'S.A.F.E. Operative'),(46025,0,0,'This path only leads deeper into the city. Keep going south toward the Loading Room.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,47191,0,'S.A.F.E. Officer'),(47323,1,0,'Alamar, I\'d  like to introduce you to $n, a recent escapee from Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47494,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(244675,1,0,'How... plan... fail?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(47349,0,0,'Follow me, $n, and I\'ll introduce you to your trainer, Drill Sergeant Steamcrank.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47516,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(47349,1,0,'Sergeant, allow me to introduce $n, who helped us rescue survivors in Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47517,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(47350,0,0,'Follow me, $n, and I\'ll introduce you to your trainer, Kelsey Steelspark.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47519,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(47350,1,0,'Kelsey, allow me to introduce $n, who helped us rescue survivors in Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47520,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(47351,0,0,'Follow me, $n, and I\'ll introduce you to your trainer, Bipsi Frostflinger.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47531,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(47351,1,0,'Bipsi, this is $n, one of the most recent survivors to emerge from Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47532,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(47359,0,0,'Follow me, $n, and I\'ll introduce you to your trainer, \"Doc\" Cogspin.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47533,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(47359,1,0,'Doc, this is $n, who helped Nevin\'s team get a number of survivors out of Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47534,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(103618,0,0,'Follow me, $n, and I\'ll introduce you to your trainer, Muffinus Chromebrew.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,106215,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(103618,1,0,'Muffinus, allow me to introduce $n, who helped us rescue survivors in Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,106216,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(11711,0,0,'Wait... did you hear that? Something approaches from the west!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7200,0,'Sentinel Aynasha'),(11711,1,0,'I\'ve run out of arrows! I\'m afraid if any more come you will need to take them on by yourself my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7199,0,'Sentinel Aynasha'),(11711,2,0,'Praise Elune! I don\'t know if I could have survived the day without you, friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7201,0,'Sentinel Aynasha'),(11711,3,0,'My leg feels much better now, the remedy must be working. If you will excuse me, I must go report to my superiors about what has transpired here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7202,0,'Sentinel Aynasha'),(11711,4,0,'Please speak with Sentinel Onaeya at Maestra\'s Post in Ashenvale, she will see to it that you are properly rewarded for your bravery this day.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7328,0,'Sentinel Aynasha'),(53494,0,0,'You are forbidden from my master\'s domain, mortals.',14,0,100,0,0,24441,0,52180,3,'Baleroc - Enter Combat'),(53494,1,0,'Fool mortals. Hurl yourselves into your own demise!',14,0,100,0,0,24446,0,52185,3,'Baleroc - Shards of Torment'),(53494,2,0,'Burn beneath my molten fury!',14,0,100,0,0,24459,0,52181,3,'Baleroc - Inferno Blade'),(53494,3,0,'By the Firelord\'s command, you, too, shall perish!',14,0,100,0,0,24447,0,52182,3,'Baleroc - Decimation Blade'),(53494,4,0,'You have been judged.',14,0,100,0,0,24449,0,52177,3,'Baleroc - Kill Player (1)'),(53494,4,1,'Behold your weakness.',14,0,100,0,0,24451,0,52178,3,'Baleroc - Kill Player (2)'),(53494,4,2,'None shall pass!',14,0,100,0,0,24452,0,52179,3,'Baleroc - Kill Player (3)'),(53494,5,0,'Mortal filth... the master\'s keep is forbidden....',14,0,100,0,0,24444,0,52650,3,'Baleroc - Death'),(53494,6,0,'Your flesh is forfeit to the fires of this realm.',14,0,100,0,0,24450,0,52183,3,'Baleroc - Berserk'),(53494,7,0,'%s goes into a berserker rage!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,4428,3,'Baleroc - Berserk (Emote)'),(53494,8,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_curse.blp:20|t%s readies his |cFF7A0080|Hspell:99352|h[Decimation Blade]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,52889,3,'Baleroc - Decimation Blade (Emote)'),(53494,9,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_sword_09.blp:20|t%s readies his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:99350|h[Inferno Blade]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,52890,3,'Baleroc - Inferno Blade (Emote)'),(27017,0,0,'Initiating energy collection.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26153,0,'War Golem'),(27017,1,0,'Energy collection complete.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26154,0,'War Golem'),(24042,0,0,'$N\'s concoction is ruined.  A new one must be created from scratch.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23540,0,'Generic Trigger LAB'),(24042,1,0,'The failed concoction spills on the floor and appears to come to life!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23071,0,'Generic Trigger LAB'),(24251,0,0,'The mixture!  It moves!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23101,0,'Chief Plaguebringer Harris'),(24900,0,0,'Its power courses through me! I AM A GOD!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23977,0,'Abdul the Insane'),(24900,0,1,'ABDUL IS STRONG LIKE BULL!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23978,0,'Abdul the Insane'),(24900,1,0,'The fury of the Vrykul will consume you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23976,0,'Abdul the Insane'),(24900,1,1,'ARE YOU CHALLENGING ME? I HAVE THE STRENGTH OF TEN MEN!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23979,0,'Abdul the Insane'),(24251,0,1,'It\'s alive!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,23099,0,'Chief Plaguebringer Harris'),(24118,1,0,'We find you unworthy of ascension, Halfdan. Let your soul know oblivion!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22792,0,'Val\'kyr Observer'),(10296,0,0,'At last - one among you is worthy of my knowledge. Worry not - I have probed your thoughts, no harm will come to you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,5555,0,'Vaelan'),(10296,1,0,'Listen carefully, for the lord of Blackrock will surely destroy you, should you not be prepared.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,5556,0,'Vaelan'),(10296,2,0,'%s is surrounded by a barrier of anti-magic.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5590,0,'Vaelan'),(10296,3,0,'I have discerned the path that you must take. Are you prepared?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,5591,0,'Vaelan'),(10299,0,0,'Begone, mortal. You are not worthy of my knowledge.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,5592,0,'Scarshield Infiltrator'),(20201,0,0,'Stop! Do not go any further, mortal. You are ill-prepared to face the forces of the Infinite Dragonflight. Come, let me help you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17814,0,'Saat'),(25209,0,3,'Did \'King Mrgl-Mrgl\' send you? I know what he truly is!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24438,0,'Claximus'),(25209,0,2,'What\'s this? You\'re not one of the Winterfin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24437,0,'Claximus'),(25209,0,1,'It\'s been a long time since last I tasted $r.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24436,0,'Claximus'),(25209,0,0,'What tiny morsel comes this way? Not one of the murloc I think.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24435,0,'Claximus'),(4489,0,0,'That is the wrong answer, $n. Be off with you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8393,0,'Braug Dimspirit'),(10817,6,0,'An\' surrounded by the Lich King\'s beasts, what could old Duggan do?',12,0,100,430,0,0,0,50912,0,'Duggan Wildhammer - Line 6'),(10817,5,0,'But tha\' mead was cursed with th\' plague o\' death, and now old Duggan, too.',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,50911,0,'Duggan Wildhammer - Line 5'),(10817,4,0,'A hundred crates of barley there ta\' be makin\' inta\' mead!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,50910,0,'Duggan Wildhammer - Line 4'),(10817,3,0,'An\' when he did arrive there, what\'d his dwarf eyes see?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,50909,0,'Duggan Wildhammer - Line 3'),(10817,2,0,'Where th\' scent of death is on th\' wind and everythin\' is mostly brown.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,50908,0,'Duggan Wildhammer - Line 2'),(10817,0,0,'Ooooooooh...',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,50906,0,'Duggan Wildhammer - Line 0'),(10817,1,0,'To the plaguelands went old Duggan, ta\' send them Scourge back inta\' th\' groun\'.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,50907,0,'Duggan Wildhammer - Line 1'),(951,0,2,'Let the Holy Light embrace you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49891,0,'Brother Paxton'),(951,0,4,'FIGHT ON, $G BROTHER:SISTER;!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49893,0,'Brother Paxton'),(951,1,0,'BY THE LIGHT BE RENEWED!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brother Paxton - SAY'),(6929,0,0,'Ooo, so strong!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!',12,0,100,23,0,0,0,10789,0,'Innkeeper Gryshka'),(11814,0,0,'Chugga-chugga, woo-woo!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!',12,0,100,275,0,0,0,10788,0,'Kali Remik'),(6746,0,0,'I may have ninety-nine problems, but dancin\' ain\'t one of them!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!',12,0,100,94,0,0,0,10787,0,'Innkeeper Pala'),(6741,0,0,'Bawk, bawk, bawk!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!',12,0,100,19,0,0,0,10786,0,'Innkeeper Norman'),(6740,0,0,'Ooo, so strong!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!',12,0,100,23,0,0,0,10797,0,'Innkeeper Allison'),(5111,0,0,'Bawk, bawk, bawk!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!',12,0,100,19,0,0,0,10798,0,'Innkeeper Firebrew'),(6826,0,0,'Chugga-chugga, woo-woo!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!',12,0,100,275,0,0,0,10799,0,'Talvash del Kissel'),(6735,0,0,'I may have ninety-nine problems, but dancin\' ain\'t one of them!  Happy Hallow\'s End, $n!',12,0,100,94,0,0,0,10800,0,'Innkeeper Saelienne'),(18810,0,0,'How can you have any pudding if you don\'t eat your fish?',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,15941,0,'Otonambusi'),(18810,0,1,'If you don\'t eat your fish, you can\'t have any pudding!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,15942,0,'Otonambusi'),(27056,0,0,'%s grins at Sentinel Amberline across the camp, waggling her long eyebrows suggestively.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29555,0,'Sentinel Sweetspring'),(27056,1,0,'%s peers at Modoru\'s Draenic robes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27085,0,'Sentinel Sweetspring'),(27056,2,0,'Pssst. Naohain. Why does Modoru still wear those ridiculous robes? He looks like some interdimensional bumpkin who stumbled out of Ammen Vale not six hours past.',12,2,100,0,0,0,0,27086,0,'Sentinel Sweetspring'),(27056,3,0,'Say, Modoru. Where did you get those... ah... \"wonderful\" robes of yours, hmmm?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,29546,0,'Sentinel Sweetspring'),(27056,4,0,'Oh. Oh... I see. How nice!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,29547,0,'Sentinel Sweetspring'),(27056,5,0,'%s bites back a laugh.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29548,0,'Sentinel Sweetspring'),(27055,0,0,'%s huffs with annoyance, glaring briefly at Sentinel Sweetspring before turning away with her nose in the air.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29557,0,'Sentinel Amberline'),(27052,0,0,'I... I do not know.',12,2,100,0,0,0,0,29544,0,'Naohain'),(27054,0,0,'%s beams, unaware that she is teasing him, answering in his thickly-accented Common.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29550,0,'Modoru'),(27054,1,0,'Well! You see, was gift from Grandmother Oluba. She hand-weave from finest silk on Draenor! Am quite proud of, yes.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,29552,0,'Modoru'),(27119,0,0,'%s snickers, nuzzling into Sentinel Sweetspring\'s ankles.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29553,0,'Snowpaw'),(26568,0,0,'Don\'t be shy, elfy. Don\'t you feel dis burnin\' love formin\' between us?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25790,0,'Zebu\'tan'),(26568,1,0,'Lookie what Zebu\'tan got for you! Roses for da rose!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25782,0,'Zebu\'tan'),(26568,2,0,'%s grumbles.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25783,0,'Zebu\'tan'),(26568,3,0,'Hey pretty lady, Zebu\'tan got two rugs over here! Why don\'t you come on over and keep he warm, eh?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25781,0,'Zebu\'tan'),(26568,4,0,'Dis troll tink you got a crush on he! Come on over!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25789,0,'Zebu\'tan'),(26569,0,0,'Get lost, creep!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25787,0,'Alys Vol\'tyr'),(26569,1,0,'Ewwww!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25785,0,'Alys Vol\'tyr'),(26569,2,0,'Not if you were the last troll on Azeroth!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25784,0,'Alys Vol\'tyr'),(26569,2,1,'I\'ve got a man! Now take a hike!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25788,0,'Alys Vol\'tyr'),(26569,3,0,'Never!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25786,0,'Alys Vol\'tyr'),(26564,0,0,'Faster! Faster! These armaments must be delivered to the Kor\'kron Vanguard TODAY!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25775,0,'Borus Ironbender'),(26564,0,1,'I will happily replace you all with goblins! Do not fail me!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25776,0,'Borus Ironbender'),(26564,0,2,'Overlord Agmar demands more of us! We must not disappoint!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25777,0,'Borus Ironbender'),(26564,0,3,'Don\'t make me jump off of this crate! I will beat your head in, orc.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25778,0,'Borus Ironbender'),(26649,0,0,'Pssst... Over here, by the mailbox. Come quickly and make sure you aren\'t followed.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,25823,0,'Messenger Torvus'),(4275,1,0,'You, too, shall serve!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6115,0,'Archmage Arugal - Aggro'),(4275,2,0,'Release your rage!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6535,0,'Archmage Arugal - Transforms player into a Worgen'),(4275,3,0,'Another falls!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6116,0,'Archmage Arugal - Killing a player'),(18966,0,0,'Soldiers of Azeroth, you now fight against the vile Burning Crusade. And the hopes and prayers of all Light-loving people march with you. In the company of our brave allies and brothers -in-arms you will hold your ground and break the demonic charge. You will stem the destructive tyranny that rages across so many worlds.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16625,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),(18966,0,1,'With each passing moment, I see the people of Azeroth prove again the reasons we have come. It is with solemn pride that I fight with you, and if I die this day, then I die among friends.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16633,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),(18966,0,2,'The demons should be in no doubt that we are their nemesis and, though they wish our destruction, it is we who bring about their ruin. Kazzak and his forces will be diminished and defeated by this coalition. And to do this, we must throw at them our bodies and hearts, for they seek no less than the obliteration of this world.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16627,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),(18966,0,3,'Fight on, good people of Azeroth. And take heart! Your brethren rush to this hellish portal and will soon throw themselves at these demons as you have so bravely done. May the Light keep you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16933,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),(18966,0,4,'Behold the power of the Light! Grace and glory to the Alliance!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16286,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),(18969,0,0,'Hunters, to me! Let us show these demons what it is to fight and die in Azeroth!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16616,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),(18969,0,1,'The spirits sing to us! They sing the song of battle!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16617,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),(18969,0,2,'Strike true, brothers and sisters! Today our quarry is demons!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16618,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),(18969,0,3,'Once again, we will show this Burning Legion that our world is not for the taking!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16620,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),(18969,0,4,'These fiends will fail! For Azeroth!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16621,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),(18969,0,5,'If it is our fate to die this day, then we will not go easy! Mark me, these demons will fall like wheat!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16622,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),(18969,0,6,'Though your sinews tire and your blood flows from cuts and wounds to this sodden ground, you fight for the spirits of your world. No evil force can stand against us!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16624,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),(18969,0,7,'My brethern, my commands-in-arms! I must go to seek the forces of the Horde and direct them here! Keep your spirits strong, brave hunters! Do not fall to the portal-spawned fiends!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16935,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),(24288,0,0,'Stone troggs are attacking!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ELM General Purpose Bunny Hide Body to Player'),(24288,1,0,'Here come more stone troggs. Defend the catapult!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ELM General Purpose Bunny Hide Body to Player'),(24288,2,0,' Looks like a last ditch effort by the stone troggs. Your destination is just around the corner!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ELM General Purpose Bunny Hide Body to Player'),(40789,0,0,'The Stone Dragon Broodmother approaches.',16,0,100,0,0,3525,0,0,0,'Generic Controller Bunny (CSA) to Player'),(42465,0,0,'They seek only power, as the Twilight do.  Yet you are confident that they will not turn on us.  Did I raise you to be fools?',12,0,100,1,0,21105,0,0,0,'Therazane'),(42465,1,0,'They slaughtered stone troggs, Gorik?  This is supposed to sway me?  It is not much of a feat.',12,0,100,1,0,21106,0,0,0,'Therazane to Therazane'),(42465,2,0,'What of you Boden?  What do you see in this \"champion?\"',12,0,100,1,0,21107,0,0,0,'Therazane to Therazane'),(42465,3,0,'That very well may be.  Even fools have uses though.  I keep you around after all.',12,0,100,1,0,21108,0,0,0,'Therazane to Therazane'),(42465,4,0,'And so the \"champion\" arrives.',12,0,100,1,0,21093,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,5,0,'So small.  So soft.  It\'s a wonder you\'ve even lasted this long down here, fleshling.',12,0,100,1,0,21094,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,6,0,'Or perhaps a testament to your abilities?',12,0,100,1,0,21095,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,7,0,'All of this for a piece of the World Pillar?  What exactly, shaman, do you intend to do with it?',12,0,100,1,0,21096,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,8,0,'And what then? Will you leave Deepholm to its denizens?',12,0,100,1,0,21097,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,9,0,'I\'m glad you\'re at least that perceptive.',12,0,100,1,0,21098,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,10,0,'I propose this: We will march on the Twilight cult and extinguish any utterings of Deathwing\'s name from this realm.  Your Earthen Ring will march with us.',12,0,100,1,0,21099,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,11,0,'You do this, and I will send Gorsik to the temple with our piece of the World Pillar.',12,0,100,1,0,21100,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,12,0,'Seal the rift and leave this place.',12,0,100,1,0,21101,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42465,13,0,'Save your thanks.  We march upon the Twilight Precipice as soon as our forces are gathered. I expect to see you on the battlefield.',12,0,100,1,0,21102,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(42466,0,0,'Speak with Terrath the Steady when you are ready to begin.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Player'),(42466,1,0,'Be swift, $c. The stone dragons will not give up easily.',12,0,100,1,0,21647,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Player'),(42466,2,0,'You\'ve strayed too far from the Stonemother\'s gaze, dragon.  It is time that you be put in your place.',14,0,100,1,0,21649,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Player'),(42466,3,0,'Jump from rock to rock to attract the attention of the Broodmother!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Player'),(42466,4,0,'She submits.  Well done, fleshling.',14,0,100,1,0,21650,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Aeosera'),(42466,5,0,'This champion also faced the Stone Dragons and their Broodmother with no glimpse of fear or hesitation.  I\'ve seen the most hardy of giants falter where the fleshling did not.',12,0,100,0,0,21653,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Therazane'),(42467,0,0,'Not wasted, Stonemother.  It has been very useful.',12,0,100,1,0,21757,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Player'),(42467,1,0,'It stands to reason that it may be here for exactly the reasons it says it is.',12,0,100,1,0,21758,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Player'),(42467,2,0,'You still have much to prove.  But you brought the stone.  That is an excellent start.',12,0,100,1,0,21759,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Player'),(42467,3,0,'The other Stone Lords have already heard my words.',12,0,100,1,0,21760,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Player'),(42467,4,0,'They should show you a degree of trust.',12,0,100,1,0,21761,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Player'),(42467,5,0,'At least enough so that you can prove yourself.',12,0,100,1,0,21762,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Player'),(42468,0,0,'You\'ve come to prove yourself, fleshling?  The Crumbling Depths lie northeast.  The stone you seek is within.',12,0,100,1,0,21767,0,0,0,'Felsen the Enduring to Player'),(42468,1,0,'I\'ve not spoken with the strangers, but I bore witness to their champion treading deep into the Crumbling Depths and returning unscathed.  It is clearly capable.',12,0,100,1,0,21768,0,0,0,'Felsen the Enduring to Therazane'),(42471,0,0,'Hah! Did you mistake me for Diamant, $r? Or perhaps some other whimpering, compliant stone trogg who cares?',14,0,100,1,0,21743,0,0,0,'Boden the Imposing to Player'),(42471,1,0,'If you seek peace, relinquish the World Pillar and leave Deepholm. This is our realm. Your only welcome here shall be found underneath my stone foot.',14,0,100,1,0,21744,0,0,0,'Boden the Imposing to Player'),(42471,2,0,'It\'s not bravery that drives it.  It strode before me like it thought this place its home. It is a fool.  It will surely get itself killed soon enough.',12,0,100,0,0,21749,0,0,0,'Boden the Imposing to Therazane'),(42472,0,0,'I have no love for the intruders, Stonemother, but these fleshlings went well out of their way to cleanse the filth from the Crimson Expanse. ',12,0,100,1,0,21879,0,0,0,'Gorsik the Tumultuous to Therazane'),(42472,1,0,'They are not the Twilight.  I see no reason to oppose their goals.',12,0,100,1,0,21880,0,0,0,'Gorsik the Tumultuous to Therazane'),(42479,0,0,'The line is secured to his ankle.  Pull away to trip him!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Servant of Therazane to Player'),(42573,0,0,'What have we here, $n?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Yevaa to Player'),(42573,1,0,'$n, you\'ve returned! Is that the middle fragment?',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Yevaa to Player'),(42614,0,0,'The Stone Dragons are here, fleshling.  Take wing!',14,0,100,1,0,21652,0,0,0,'Terrath the Steady to Zoltrik Drakebane'),(42731,0,0,'So it is certain den. Dese elementals were bound from dormant stone only recently.',12,0,100,1,0,21027,0,0,0,'Earthmender Norsala to Player'),(42731,1,0,'Only an elemental lord could bind so many elementals so quickly. It seems we\'re at war with da Stonemother herself...',12,0,100,1,0,21028,0,0,0,'Earthmender Norsala to Player'),(42747,1,2,'I heard them praying to their dark gods as everything went black... the Twilight\'s Hammer did this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,42635,0,'Slain Crew Member\'s Spirit to Player'),(42747,1,1,'They tricked us into ambushing the Horde gunship... but why?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,42634,0,'Slain Crew Member\'s Spirit to Player'),(42747,1,0,'They poisoned our supplies... we had cultists onboard all along...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,42633,0,'Slain Crew Member\'s Spirit to Player'),(42747,0,0,'Twilight scum!  You did this to us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,42637,0,'Slain Crew Member\'s Spirit to Player'),(42788,0,0,'I\'d started to think we\'d been left out here. Thanks for the hand!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Hargoth Dimblaze'),(42792,0,0,'Nice job! Let\'s finish him off.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Earthguard Sentinel'),(42801,0,0,'Ok, ok, I give up!  I\'ll tell you everything!',12,0,100,0,0,23551,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful'),(42801,1,0,'Gotcha!',12,0,100,0,0,20989,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful to Player'),(42801,2,0,'I hope you can fly, pipsqueak!',12,0,100,0,0,20990,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful to Player'),(42801,3,0,'You!  Let me go now!  Wait... no!  Don\'t let go!',14,0,100,0,0,20991,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful to Stormcaller Mylra'),(42823,0,0,'You face the glorious wrath of the Twilight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Priestess to Player'),(42892,0,0,'Over here, you ugly whale!',12,0,100,0,0,21001,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Stormbeak'),(42892,1,0,'Meet me back up top.  This two-headed freak has a few questions to answer!',12,0,100,0,0,21002,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Stormbeak'),(42900,0,0,'You hear a loud cracking noise as the rockling tries to smile.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quartz Rockling to Rockling Chain Bunny'),(42900,1,0,'The rockling looks confused for a moment before running off.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quartz Rockling to Rockling Chain Bunny'),(42900,2,0,'The rockling looks up at you questioningly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quartz Rockling to Rockling Chain Bunny'),(42900,3,0,'The rockling thuds happily upon the ground.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quartz Rockling to Rockling Chain Bunny'),(42914,0,0,'Therazane\'s finally gathered the nerve to challenge us, has she?',12,0,100,0,0,20933,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna to Player'),(42914,1,0,'You do realize there\'s no hope, don\'t you?  Deathwing has already risen.  Your world is doomed.',12,0,100,0,0,20935,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna'),(42914,2,0,'I\'m not that easy, hon.  Perhaps another time.',12,0,100,0,0,20937,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna'),(42916,0,0,'Therazane\'s doom is assured!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Soulreaper to Gorsik the Tumultuous'),(42917,0,0,'There is no hope for enemies of the Twilight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Duskwarden to Player'),(42918,0,0,'Ya handle yaself on da ground.  How about in da skies?',12,0,100,0,0,21615,0,0,0,'Zoltrik Drakebane'),(42923,0,0,'Deathwing will have his way with your Stonemother.',12,0,100,0,0,21511,0,0,0,'Boldrich Stonerender to Player'),(42923,1,0,'Agh...',12,0,100,0,0,21517,0,0,0,'Boldrich Stonerender to Player'),(42964,0,0,'Wait!  You can\'t do this!  You people must have a code of honor or something!',14,0,100,0,0,20992,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful to Stormbeak'),(42964,1,0,'Stop it, you tiny, angry woman!  I\'ll tell you everything!  What do you want to know?',14,0,100,0,0,20993,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful to Stormbeak'),(42964,2,0,'It was delivered to the forgemaster at Deathwing\'s Fall.  I swear... that\'s all I know!',14,0,100,0,0,20994,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful to Stormbeak'),(42964,3,0,'Happy now?  Pull me up, you vicious little dwarf!',14,0,100,0,0,20995,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful to Stormbeak'),(42964,4,0,'What? What have you done?  No!  Do you have any idea what the Twilight Council will do to me when they find out I\'ve talked!?  I would sooner die!',14,0,100,0,0,20996,0,0,0,'Mor\'norokk the Hateful to Stormbeak'),(42965,0,0,'All right, sunshine.  Time to spill your guts before I spill \'em for ya!',12,0,100,0,0,21003,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Stormbeak'),(42965,1,0,'I\'m a daughter of the Wildhammer Clan and a shaman of the Earthen Ring.  My code compels me to honor my ancestors and the elements.',12,0,100,0,0,21004,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Stormbeak'),(42965,2,0,'Doesn\'t say a damn thing about dog-ugly ogres.',12,0,100,0,0,21005,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Stormbeak'),(42965,3,0,'You can start by telling us where the World Pillar fragment is.  My gryphon\'s starting to look a bit tired from hauling you around.',12,0,100,0,0,21006,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Stormbeak'),(42965,4,0,'You were never in any danger, sweetheart.  My friends down below would\'ve caught you.  You\'re worth too much to us alive!',12,0,100,0,0,21007,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Stormbeak'),(42965,5,0,'Interesting.  I\'d never heard of the Twilight Council until now.',12,0,100,0,0,21008,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Stormbeak'),(43026,0,0,'Those who are not of the earth must be destroyed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deepstone Elemental to Player'),(43026,1,0,'You do not belong in the realm of earth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deepstone Elemental to Player'),(43039,0,0,'By the elements, this one is even bigger than the last!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Duskwarden to Agitated Tunneler'),(43039,1,0,'We are under attack! To arms!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Duskwarden to Agitated Tunneler'),(43044,0,0,'The shell\'s markings read: \"STORMWIND ROYAL INDUSTRIES\"',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,42942,0,'Unexploded Artillery Shell to Player'),(43047,0,0,'I am ready to meet with your so-called Earthcaller.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Player'),(43047,1,0,'The war between the Earthen and the stone troggs has raged for time beyond measure. But now in the chaos, the Stonefather, prisoner. They are threatening to kill him if we do not surrender.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Flint Oremantle'),(43047,2,0,'Earthcaller, my father, Stonefather Oremantle, has been taken prisoner by the stone troggs of Needlerock Spire.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Player'),(43047,3,0,'I demand that you send aid to Stonehearth. Help us with our war and to free Stonefather Oremantle.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Player'),(43047,4,0,'This one that assisted me should be adequate. Have them report to our force commander, Crag Rockcrusher at Stonehearth.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Player'),(43032,0,0,'The cannoneer\'s hands are black with gunpowder.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,42916,0,'Slain Cannoneer to Player'),(43071,0,0,'Indeed!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,0,0,'Crag Rockcrusher to Player'),(43082,0,0,'Thanks... this\'ll give us a couple more hours of not running into the rocks.  No guarantees after that.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'First Mate Moody to Player'),(43116,0,0,'You hear the sound of shuffling stones behind you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pebble to Player'),(43116,1,0,'Pebble sees the crystals ahead and excitedly rushes towards them!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pebble to Generic Controller Bunny (CSA)'),(43116,2,0,'Pebble bobbles around appreciatively.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pebble to Generic Controller Bunny (CSA)'),(43116,3,0,'Pebble races in circles, clearly happy.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pebble to Player'),(43138,0,0,'For Stonehearth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonehearth Defender to Stonefather\'s Banner'),(43138,1,0,'For the Stonefather!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonehearth Defender to Stonefather\'s Banner'),(43160,0,0,'Do you want to live forever?',14,0,100,0,0,1285,0,0,0,'Earthbreaker Dolomite'),(43160,1,0,'We have reinforcements! For the Stonefather!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Earthbreaker Dolomite'),(43168,0,0,'One of Clay\'s catapult teams is broken down on the front. $n, I need you to get some parts from him and get that catapult back in the fight!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Gravel Longslab to Player'),(43170,0,0,'Give me the reagents again when these stone troggs are dead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Earthen Geomancer to Player'),(43229,0,0,'Thank you, $r.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Earthen to Player'),(43229,1,0,'Kill a few for me, would you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Earthen to Player'),(43229,2,0,'You\'re a strange-looking creature. Thank you.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Earthen to Player'),(43229,3,0,'Don\'t worry about me. We have to rescue the king!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Earthen to Player'),(43229,4,0,'What happened?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Earthen to Player'),(43229,5,0,'I have to report back. Thank you, $c!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Earthen to Player'),(43229,6,0,'I think I can make it back on my own.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Earthen to Player'),(43339,0,0,'A Son of Kor has arrived to assist you, but watch out for his boulders!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorgonite to Player'),(43346,0,0,'I thought we\'d killed everybody... Mor\'norokk should be pleased with this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Saboteur to Player'),(43372,0,0,'No no no! Leave Glop alone! My mushrooms! Mine!',14,0,100,0,0,21769,0,0,0,'Fungalmancer Glop to Earthmender Norsala'),(43372,1,0,'Mushrooms grow big and strong. Too big to stomp on! So strong they stomp back!',14,0,100,0,0,21770,0,0,0,'Fungalmancer Glop to Earthmender Norsala'),(43372,2,0,'Mean... rock fiends...',14,0,100,0,0,21773,0,0,0,'Fungalmancer Glop to Player'),(43456,0,0,'POUND!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Troggzor the Earthinator'),(43456,1,0,'DESTROY!',14,0,100,51,0,0,0,0,0,'Troggzor the Earthinator'),(43503,0,0,'Let\'s finish with this quickly.',12,0,100,0,0,21030,0,0,0,'Earthmender Norsala to Player'),(43503,1,0,'You\'ve caused enough damage, Glop. The earth welcomes you no longer.',14,0,100,0,0,21031,0,0,0,'Earthmender Norsala to Player'),(43503,2,0,'After him, quickly!',14,0,100,0,0,21032,0,0,0,'Earthmender Norsala to Fungalmancer Glop'),(43635,0,0,'Alright, here we go!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Catapult Driver to Earthen Catapult'),(43635,1,0,'Stone troggs incoming!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Catapult Driver to Player'),(43635,2,0,'You stone troggs have no idea of what\'s coming!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Catapult Driver to Earthen Catapult'),(43635,3,0,'Damn, stone troggs! Over there!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Catapult Driver to Player'),(43635,4,0,'How\'d that feel, you stone trogg scum?!',14,0,100,14,0,0,0,0,0,'Catapult Driver to Earthen Catapult'),(43635,5,0,'Oh yeah! Tremble at the might of our catapults!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Catapult Driver to Earthen Catapult'),(43641,0,0,'The Stone Dragon Broodmother bows her head in surrender.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aeosera'),(43792,0,0,'You\'ve proven true to your word, Earthmender.  For that, we will spare you our wrath.  ',12,0,100,1,0,21078,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(43792,1,0,'Once your wounded are gathered, you can thank me by leaving.',12,0,100,1,0,21079,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(43802,0,0,'Is this the one you are wasting your time with, Diamant?',12,0,100,1,0,21087,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(43802,1,0,'Then you take responsibility for its actions, Stone Lord.  You will be the one answering to me when it shows its true intent.',12,0,100,1,0,21088,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(43802,2,0,'And you fleshling, consider for a moment that you are entirely surrounded by rock in this place.  The very earth you walk on bends to my will.',12,0,100,1,0,21089,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(43802,3,0,'If you betray us, there will be no escape for you.  I will crush your body so slowly that you shall hear every single one of your bones break.',12,0,100,1,0,21090,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(43802,4,0,'I\'m glad we had this talk.',12,0,100,1,0,21091,0,0,0,'Therazane to Player'),(43807,0,0,'You know where I stand, Stonemother.',12,0,100,0,0,21764,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Therazane'),(43807,1,0,'This champion has proved intent and capable.',12,0,100,0,0,21765,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Therazane'),(43807,2,0,'I see no reason to deny our trust.',12,0,100,0,0,21766,0,0,0,'Diamant the Patient to Therazane'),(43835,0,0,'Stop her!  We can still complete da binding!',14,0,100,0,0,21115,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Torunscar to Player'),(43835,1,0,'Thank da elements...',14,0,100,0,0,21116,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Torunscar to Player'),(43835,2,0,'It is done!  We are finished.',14,0,100,0,0,21113,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Torunscar to Player'),(43835,3,0,'With the pillar restored, dis realm is safe.  We must now attend to the wound on the surface.',14,0,100,0,0,21114,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Torunscar to Player'),(43836,0,0,'Got it. I\'ll head there right away.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windspeaker Lorvarius to Player'),(43837,0,0,'Your tale ends here, shaman. ',12,0,100,0,0,20938,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna to Player'),(43837,1,0,'Lorthuna is preparing a powerful spell - get behind cover!',41,0,100,0,0,20941,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna'),(43837,2,0,'Hah...',12,0,100,0,0,20940,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna to Player'),(43897,0,0,'$n, you\'re going to want to fly over these giants and stone troggs. Don\'t try to ride through them.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Pyrium Lodestone to Player'),(43898,0,0,'$n? It\'s about time you got here. What kept you? My father\'s life is in jeopardy!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Player'),(43901,0,0,'We came here to seal da rift Deathwing tore into Azeroth. We need the World Pillar to repair da hole on dis side.',12,0,100,1,0,21117,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Torunscar to Player'),(43901,1,0,'We\'ll leave. We\'ve no desire to stay where we\'re not welcome.',12,0,100,1,0,21118,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Torunscar to Player'),(43901,2,0,'We\'ll be doin\' exactly that then. Ya have our tanks, Stonemother.',12,0,100,1,0,21119,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Torunscar'),(43984,0,0,'Reactivated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Reactivated War Construct to Player'),(43984,1,0,'Destroy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Reactivated War Construct to Player'),(43984,2,0,'Kill nearest mystic.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Reactivated War Construct to Player'),(44135,0,0,'Ya need ta be more swift den that!',14,0,100,0,0,21616,0,0,0,'Zoltrik Drakebane to Zoltrik\'s Pyremaw'),(44135,1,0,'Me tink I\'ve had my fill of ya, mon.',14,0,100,0,0,21618,0,0,0,'Zoltrik Drakebane to Zoltrik\'s Pyremaw'),(44137,0,0,'If you can\'t fight Zoltrik at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t',42,0,100,0,0,21616,0,0,0,'Crystalspire Stone Drake to Player'),(44143,0,0,'Don\'t forget to grab a war guardian, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Slate Quicksand to Player'),(44148,0,0,'You hear rustling of heavy wings in the distance.  The matriarch approaches!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonescale Matriarch to Player'),(44148,1,0,'The Stonescale Matriarch is snared!  Avoid her attacks by staying on the move!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonescale Matriarch to Player'),(44152,0,0,'$n! You\'re a sight for sore eyes. Get over here and give me a hand, would you?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Player'),(44152,1,0,'Father! Let me get you free of those chains.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle'),(44152,2,0,'This hero represents the Earthen Ring. They need the middle fragment.',14,0,100,37,0,13092,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle'),(44152,3,0,'Sorry about my earlier rudeness. I was worried about my father. Friends?',14,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Flint Oremantle'),(44153,0,0,'You\'ve saved both myself and my son.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonefather Oremantle to Flint Oremantle'),(44153,1,0,'You have my gratitude and that of my people.',14,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonefather Oremantle to Flint Oremantle'),(44153,2,0,'Return to Pyrium Lodestone with the good news. We\'ll see you back at Stonehearth shortly.',14,0,100,66,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonefather Oremantle to Flint Oremantle'),(44153,3,0,'I\'ll see to it that you get the middle fragment of the World Pillar.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonefather Oremantle to Flint Oremantle'),(44204,0,0,'All hail, $n! Huzzah!',14,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonefather Oremantle to Player'),(44289,0,0,'Abyssion is approaching.  Get ready!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Abyssion to Player'),(44289,1,0,'Abyssion is snared!  Stay on the move to avoid his attacks.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Abyssion to Player'),(44289,2,0,'Abyssion is casting a powerful Shadow Nova, seek cover!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Abyssion'),(44289,3,0,'The First World Pillar Fragment drops from Abyssion\'s lifeless corpse!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Abyssion to Player'),(44352,0,0,'Thanks for the help. That one was far tougher for some reason.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Tawn Winterbluff'),(44353,0,0,'By the elements... that one... just wouldn\'t die...',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra'),(44372,0,0,'Do me know you? No matter. Me crush your bones!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Avalanchion to Player'),(44372,1,0,'NOOOOOOOOOoooooo....... not again!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Avalanchion to Player'),(44631,0,0,'That encampment has been begging for our attention. Let\'s get this done.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tharm Wildfire to Player'),(44633,0,0,'I\'m glad to hear we\'re fighting along side the Stonemother herself this time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Jalara to Player'),(44647,0,0,'Elements be with us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mariahn the Soulcleanser to Player'),(44666,0,0,'Thank you, Stonemother.  It was an honor to have...',12,0,100,0,0,21038,0,0,0,'Earthmender Norsala to Player'),(44673,0,0,'The cult is upon us! We need help in the Respite Chambers!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Player'),(44768,0,0,'Thank you... I wish I could help you find the forgemaster.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Miner to Player'),(44768,1,0,'The forgemaster\'s a terrible murderer.  Are you sure you want to go looking for him?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Miner to Player'),(44768,2,0,'Ah, yes... I know about the forgemaster!  I just overheard that he\'s not in the camp right now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Miner to Player'),(44768,3,0,'The forgemaster is meeting with the Twilight leadership.  Trust me, I traded some gossip for a loaf of stale bread!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Miner to Player'),(44768,4,0,'I don\'t know nothin\' bout no forgemaster.  Now tell me where this safe place you came from is!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Miner to Player'),(44768,5,0,'I heard the forgemaster keeps notes about his meetings  in a book at the tower overlooking the camp.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Enslaved Miner to Player'),(44835,0,0,'You will be destroyed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Haethen Kaul to Player'),(44835,1,0,'What?! You\'re immune to my air magic?',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Haethen Kaul to Player'),(44835,2,0,'My firebolt is useless! No matter you smug little insect. I will still destroy you!',14,0,100,14,0,0,0,0,0,'Haethen Kaul to Player'),(44835,3,0,'You\'re immune to my water spell! How can this be?',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Haethen Kaul to Player'),(44839,0,0,'The Twilight\'s Hammer has unearthed a titan Waygate and it appears that they\'re attempting to activate it.',42,0,100,0,0,1285,0,0,0,'Fly Over Kill Credit to Player'),(44879,0,0,'Here she comes, boss!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ogre Bodyguard to Player'),(44881,0,0,'Forgemaster!  I\'ve been informed the enemy has disrupted your operations.  Where is the fragment?',14,0,100,0,0,21623,0,0,0,'High Priestess Azil to Player'),(44881,1,0,'Well done.  Meet me inside the Stonecore for further instructions.',12,0,100,0,0,21624,0,0,0,'High Priestess Azil to Player'),(44881,2,0,'Let\'s just say we have friends in high places, forgemaster.',12,0,100,397,0,21625,0,0,0,'High Priestess Azil to Player'),(44936,0,0,'You no take crate!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Murkstone Trogg to Player'),(44956,0,0,'He\'s coming.  Get ready, lads!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Player'),(45027,0,0,'You made it!  Good!',12,0,100,4,0,22610,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45027,1,0,'This is the Temple of Earth.  It\'s the most important structure in Deepholm.',12,0,100,0,0,22611,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45027,2,0,'There was once a Titan-made stone inside.  It was known as the World Pillar.  The name was literal.  It bore the weight of all the elemental and magnetic forces in Deepholm.',12,0,100,0,0,22612,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45027,3,0,'It was shattered when Deathwing broke through the dome above and created the rift between the two worlds.  All of Deepholm is going to collapse into Azeroth if we do not put the World Pillar back together.',12,0,100,0,0,22613,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45027,4,0,'The first fragment was going to be delivered to us by a Horde gunship known as the Storm\'s Fury.  It never made it here.',12,0,100,0,0,22614,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45027,5,0,'We\'ve taken control of the temple and we\'re containing as much of the damage as we can.  Go inside and speak to Maruut; he\'s in charge.',12,0,100,0,0,22615,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45027,6,0,'We are all counting on you.',12,0,100,0,0,22616,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45028,0,0,'I hope you have a strong stomach.  Travelling through the breach is not for the weak.',12,0,100,0,0,22606,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45028,1,0,'We\'re at the center of the Maelstrom, the rift between Deepholm and Azeroth.  Watch as it threatens to tear your world apart!',12,0,100,0,0,22607,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45028,2,0,'Let us hope Thrall and the others can contain it while you\'re inside.',12,0,100,0,0,22608,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45028,3,0,'This is it!  Brace yourself!',14,0,100,0,0,22609,0,0,0,'Aggra to Player'),(45034,0,0,'I\'m on my way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yuldris Smolderfury to Player'),(45043,0,0,'Let me know when you\'re ready, $n.',12,0,100,25,0,4614,0,0,0,'Peak Grindstone to Player'),(45099,0,0,'Deepholm? I hate this place. Wait... you\'re not Initiate Goldmine!',14,0,100,51,0,0,0,0,0,'Magmatooth to Player'),(45099,1,0,'I know what you\'re after. I can sense it!',14,0,100,34,0,0,0,0,0,'Magmatooth to Player'),(45099,2,0,'This is not in my contract! Die, $r!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magmatooth to Player'),(45099,3,0,'NOOOOOO! You tell Goldmine he\'s a dead goblin! Our contract is over!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magmatooth to Player'),(47195,0,0,'$C, over here.',12,0,100,70,0,0,0,0,0,'Slate Quicksand to Player'),(47195,1,0,'Just let me know when you\'re ready for the ritual, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,23543,0,0,0,'Slate Quicksand to Player'),(47197,0,0,'Huzzah!',14,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Flint Oremantle to Player'),(51434,0,0,'The fragment is now in the dragon\'s custody, ma\'am.',12,0,100,2,0,20886,0,0,0,'Millhouse Manastorm to Player'),(51434,1,0,'Of course, ma\'am.  At once!',12,0,100,66,0,20888,0,0,0,'Millhouse Manastorm to Player'),(51434,2,0,'If you don\'t mind me asking.  How did we manage to recover the fragment?  How did we infiltrate our enemies\' forces without their knowledge?',12,0,100,6,0,20887,0,0,0,'Millhouse Manastorm to Player'),(23789,0,0,'Pitiful mortal, Onyxia answers to no one!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22285,0,'Smolderwing'),(23789,1,0,'Your pathetic challenge has not gone unnoticed. I shall enjoy toying with you before you die.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22286,0,'Smolderwing'),(9116,0,0,'May this evil aura be banished from this artifact!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8366,0,'Eridan Bluewind'),(9116,1,0,'I can feel the presence of evil leaving...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8367,0,'Eridan Bluewind'),(39959,0,0,'Armies of the depths, wash over our enemies as a tide of death!',14,0,100,0,0,18890,0,50510,0,'Lady Naz\'jar to Player'),(39959,1,0,'Meddlesome gnats! You think us defeated so easily?',14,0,100,0,0,18891,0,43121,0,'Lady Naz\'jar to Player'),(40586,0,0,'You have interfered with our plans for the last time, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,18886,0,50505,0,'Lady Naz\'jar to Player'),(40586,1,0,'Take arms, minions! Rise from the icy depths!',14,0,100,0,0,18892,0,50513,0,'Lady Naz\'jar'),(40586,2,0,'Destroy these intruders! Leave them for the great dark beyond!',14,0,100,0,0,18893,0,50514,0,'Lady Naz\'jar'),(40586,3,0,'Ulthok, stop them...',14,0,100,0,0,18889,0,50509,0,'Lady Naz\'jar to Player'),(40765,0,0,'Iilth vwah, uhn\'agth fhssh za.',14,0,100,0,0,18543,0,50522,0,'Commander Ulthok to Player'),(40765,1,0,'Where one falls, many shall take its place...',15,0,100,0,0,18543,0,50523,0,'Commander Ulthok to Player'),(40765,2,0,'Ywaq maq oou.',14,0,100,0,0,18542,0,50529,0,'Commander Ulthok to Player'),(40788,0,0,'A new host must be found.',14,0,100,0,0,18860,0,50534,0,'Mindbender Ghur\'sha to Erunak Stonespeaker'),(40788,1,0,'Is. This. Reality?',14,0,100,0,0,18867,0,50543,0,'Mindbender Ghur\'sha'),(40788,2,0,'They are outside the cycle...',14,0,100,0,0,18863,0,50538,0,'Mindbender Ghur\'sha to Player'),(40792,0,0,'Ahh - my fearless assistants, I assume.',14,0,100,0,0,19469,0,44263,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40792,1,0,'You may yet regret your presence here.',14,0,100,0,0,19470,0,44264,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40792,2,0,'As I purify these waters, the servants of filth will surely be stirred. Beware!',14,0,100,0,0,19471,0,44265,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40792,3,0,'Patience, guests. The waters are nearly cleansed.',14,0,100,0,0,19475,0,44269,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40792,4,0,'The beast has returned! It must not pollute my waters!',14,0,100,0,0,19476,0,44270,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40792,5,0,'Augh... Their filthiness stains me!',14,0,100,0,0,19472,0,44266,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40792,6,0,'My waters are cleansed! Drink in their power!',14,0,100,0,0,19478,0,44272,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40792,7,0,'Behold the power of pure water!',14,0,100,0,0,19477,0,44271,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40792,8,0,'Ozumat is vulnerable, strike now!',41,0,100,0,0,19477,0,50863,0,'Neptulon to Player'),(40825,0,0,'I thank you, my friends. Forgive me. I... I have grown too weak to be of any assistance.',14,0,100,0,0,18662,0,50533,0,'Erunak Stonespeaker'),(40825,1,0,'I am... weary. You must carry on without me. I shall take my leave once my strength has returned.',14,0,100,0,0,18664,0,50648,0,'Erunak Stonespeaker to Player'),(35170,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Worgen Alpha'),(37195,2,0,'Does this toad speak for you, Genn?  Do you come to our dwelling as a friend?  Or do you come as a tyrant?',14,0,100,0,0,19510,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(37195,3,0,'Aye, Genn.  It is not law that binds us.  It is something far stronger.  My men are ready to give their lives under your command.',12,0,100,273,0,19512,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(37701,0,0,'Consider yourselves lucky to be alive, Gilnean dogs!  Now get to work before we change our minds!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Slavedriver'),(37875,0,0,'No... I\'d sooner die than have one of your kind for a king!',12,0,100,0,0,19631,0,0,0,'Lord Godfrey to Player'),(38218,0,0,'The Forsaken think we\'re weak.  A broken people.  They think we\'ll roll over like a scared dog.',14,0,100,0,0,19623,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,1,0,'How wrong they are.  We will fight them in the fields until the last trench collapses and the last cannon is silenced.',14,0,100,0,0,19624,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,2,0,'We will fight them on the streets until the last shot is fired.  And when there\'s no more ammunition, we\'ll crush their skulls with the stones that pave our city.',14,0,100,0,0,19625,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,3,0,'We will fight them in the alleys, until our knuckles are skinned and bloody and our rapiers lay on the ground shattered.',14,0,100,0,0,19626,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,4,0,'And if we find ourselves surrounded and disarmed... wounded and without hope... we will lift our heads in defiance and spit in their faces.',14,0,100,25,0,19627,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,5,0,'But we will... NEVER SURRENDER!!!!!',14,0,100,0,0,19628,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,6,0,'FOR GILNEAS!!!',14,0,100,0,0,19651,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,7,0,'Attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Forsaken Infantry'),(38218,8,0,'Push them back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Forsaken Crossbowman'),(38218,9,0,'Abominations are blocking the way towards the military district!  This won\'t be easy.',12,0,100,0,0,19609,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,10,0,'You\'re a sight for sore eyes, Lorna.  Let\'s get those cannons manned!  The rest of you, lure the abominations into the open!',14,0,100,0,0,19610,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38218,11,0,'Crowley\'s troops are up ahead!  Press on!',14,0,100,0,0,19611,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane to Krennan Aranas'),(38331,0,0,'Gorerot crush puny worgen!!',14,0,100,0,0,20914,0,0,0,'Gorerot to Krennan Aranas'),(38415,0,0,'He\'s too strong!  Use the catapults to bring him down!',14,0,100,0,0,19499,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley'),(38415,1,0,'Let us join your father\'s force\'s, Liam.  They\'ll need our help against Sylvanas.',14,0,100,0,0,19500,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Krennan Aranas'),(38426,0,0,'The villagers were thankful to have Emberstone back.  They brought us a little something to help against the Forsaken!',12,0,100,0,0,19684,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley to Krennan Aranas'),(38766,1,0,'Impossible!',14,0,100,0,0,19637,0,0,0,'Lord Godfrey to Player'),(38767,1,0,'It is decided, then.  We will unite all Gilneans and drive the Forsaken from our lands.',12,0,100,0,0,19724,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(43749,2,0,'Time to go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias Mistmantle'),(50881,0,0,'You were a true man of the people, Liam.  Unlike any Royal I ever met.  We\'ll make them pay for this.',12,0,100,0,0,19686,0,0,0,'Lorna Crowley to Player'),(50893,1,0,'It is here, surrounded by the heroes and patriots of Gilneas where he belongs.',12,0,100,1,0,19714,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(50893,2,0,'We\'ll return, Liam.  I swear this to you.',12,0,100,66,0,19715,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(50902,0,0,'Gilneas will remember your courage forever, Liam.',12,0,100,66,0,19497,0,0,0,'Lord Darius Crowley to Player'),(35845,1,0,'The Alliance now controls the Twilight Shores beach head.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dave\'s Industrial Light and Magic Bunny (Small)(Sessile) to Player'),(42195,0,0,'Take us out, Mister Gearchum.',12,0,100,1,0,19660,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,1,0,'Chart a course east with all possible speed. We\'ll rendezvous with the main fleet.',12,0,100,5,0,19661,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,2,0,'Signal the fleet to fall into formation.',12,0,100,1,0,19663,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,3,0,'Order the fleet into close formation. Keep it tight, everyone!',12,0,100,25,0,19664,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,4,0,'Heart of Orgrimmar, you\'re coming in too low. Too low!',12,0,100,1,0,19665,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,5,0,'Pull up! Pull down! PULL SOMETHING!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,6,0,'The valley should mask our movements. Stay low. Stay close.',12,0,100,1,0,19666,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,7,0,'I don\'t want to see any more mistakes!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,8,0,'What - WHAT!? What does he think he\'s DOING? The carriers are unprotected.',12,0,100,5,0,19667,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,9,0,'What kind of madman orders away his close air support?',12,0,100,6,0,19668,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,10,0,'Mister Gearchum, signal the fleet. Defensive formations!',12,0,100,1,0,19669,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,11,0,'We\'re without our escort. I want to see interlocking fields of fire. Now, now!',12,0,100,5,0,19670,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,12,0,'What the WHAT!?',12,0,100,0,0,19671,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,13,0,'The guns, man the guns! Fire everything we\'ve got!',14,0,100,5,0,19672,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,14,0,'Egah - all hands aft. One\'s aboard. Shoot it! Kill it!',12,0,100,5,0,19673,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,15,0,'Somebody, DO SOMETHING! That\'s an order!',12,0,100,15,0,19674,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,16,0,'Tamp down the inflammants. Batten up the gear carriage. Rudder for the shore.',12,0,100,1,0,19675,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,17,0,'Everyone, to the parachutes!',14,0,100,15,0,19677,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42195,18,0,'Mayday! Mayday! Mayday! Bail out everyone. BAIL!',14,0,100,5,0,19676,0,0,0,'Captain Krazz'),(42243,0,0,'Aye aye, sir.',12,0,100,66,0,19597,0,0,0,'Fergus Gearchum'),(42243,1,0,'Approaching the Thandol Span, sir.',12,0,100,25,0,19599,0,0,0,'Fergus Gearchum'),(42243,2,0,'Oh, the Goblinity!',14,0,100,15,0,19600,0,0,0,'Fergus Gearchum'),(42243,3,0,'Coming up on the Twilight Highlands, Captain. ',12,0,100,25,0,19601,0,0,0,'Fergus Gearchum'),(42243,4,0,'Captain, sir! Alliance naval fleet sighted off the port bow.',12,0,100,25,0,19602,0,0,0,'Fergus Gearchum'),(42243,5,0,'It\'s tangled up in the rigging.',12,0,100,1,0,19603,0,0,0,'Fergus Gearchum'),(42243,6,0,'She\'s breaking up, sir!',12,0,100,5,0,19604,0,0,0,'Fergus Gearchum'),(42277,0,0,'Fellow warriors of the Horde. Hear me now!',14,0,100,15,0,20542,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,1,0,'Ahead hides our foe. Worshippers of chaos who seek to remake the world.',14,0,100,1,0,20564,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,2,0,'A new world is coming, friends. But it is not the world of their design.',14,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,3,0,'Together, we will crush the Twilight\'s Hammer, raze their stronghold,',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,4,0,'salt the earth, and burn the bodies. All will tremble at our might. ',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,5,0,'Then we will stand astride this world as its masters -',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,6,0,'united in our conviction, unrivaled in strength, beholden to no one. ',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,7,0,'Today, WE will remake the world. OUR world. FOR THE HORDE!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,8,0,'The Alliance steams in close formation without escort.',14,0,100,1,0,20543,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,9,0,'Air guard, attack!! Strafe them now, while they cannot maneuver!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh Formation Bunny'),(42277,10,0,'GET!',14,0,100,5,0,20544,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh\'s Airship'),(42277,11,0,'OFF!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh\'s Airship'),(42277,12,0,'MY!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh\'s Airship'),(42277,13,0,'SHIP!',14,0,100,5,0,21505,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Garrosh\'s Airship'),(42300,0,0,'Look - dwarves. Hah! They sulk like prairie dogs in holes in the ground.',12,0,100,25,0,21501,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Air Marine'),(42300,1,0,'A winner.',12,0,100,1,0,21502,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Air Marine'),(42300,2,0,'It\'s an attack!',14,0,100,5,0,21503,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Air Marine'),(42300,3,0,'They\'re after the Warchief -',12,0,100,5,0,21504,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Air Marine'),(42300,4,0,'The Warchief\'s zeppelin is in flames! It\'s going down!',12,0,100,25,0,21505,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Air Marine'),(42638,0,0,'I will help, but know that you\'re stepping into a viper\'s nest. Let me draw you a map - wha - behind you!',12,0,100,5,0,3325,0,0,0,'Herezegor Flametusk to Player'),(42638,1,0,'%s motions for you to speak with him again.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Herezegor Flametusk to Player'),(42638,2,0,'You fight without honor and die like vermin!',12,0,100,0,0,3325,0,0,0,'Herezegor Flametusk to Twilight Nightblade'),(42638,3,0,'%s scrawls out a depiction of his home port on a torn parchment.',16,0,100,397,0,0,0,0,0,'Herezegor Flametusk to Player'),(42638,4,0,'There you have it, $n. All the safe approaches to the Twilight Highlands. Unleash havoc on our foes!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Herezegor Flametusk to Player'),(42641,0,0,'My warriors! You have already proven your valor. This is why the Warchief has selected you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Warlord Krogg'),(42641,1,0,'Our destination is the Twilight Highlands. We strike at the beating heart of our enemy.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Warlord Krogg'),(42644,0,0,'All hail Samophlange!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Smoot'),(42644,1,0,'$n stiff-arms Smoot and throws him to the ground.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Smoot to Player'),(42646,0,0,'$gRight away, sir:Right away ma\'am;!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'AWOL Grunt to Player'),(42646,1,0,'Please don\'t tell the Warlord...',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'AWOL Grunt to Player'),(42646,2,0,'$gSir, yes sir:Ma\'am, yes ma\'am;!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'AWOL Grunt to Player'),(42646,3,0,'It won\'t happen again, $gsir:ma\'am;.',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,0,0,'AWOL Grunt to Player'),(42650,0,0,'We\'ll get right on this, $gsir:ma\'am;!',12,0,100,432,0,0,0,0,0,'Goblin Siegeworker to Player'),(42650,1,0,'We\'re on it!',12,0,100,432,0,0,0,0,0,'Goblin Siegeworker to Player'),(42650,2,0,'Yes $gsir:ma\'am;! Right away, $gsir:ma\'am;! ',12,0,100,432,0,0,0,0,0,'Goblin Siegeworker to Player'),(42671,0,0,'This baby is all mine! I call her, \"The Throttler.\"',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Engineer to Player'),(42671,1,0,'Ready for inspection! ...Be gentle.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Engineer to Player'),(42671,2,0,'Uh oh. Um. Oops.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Engineer to Player'),(42671,3,0,'Look, look, it\'s okay! It\'s just a tiny little glitch. See?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Engineer to Player'),(42671,4,0,'A little paint and it\'ll be fine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chief Engineer to Player'),(42707,0,0,'Cover the door - we\'ve got him!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Nightblade to Player'),(42709,0,0,'Oh no not de bar! Take it outside, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gravy to Player'),(42775,0,0,'What can I do for you, chief?',12,0,100,432,0,0,0,0,0,'Bilgewater Dockworker to Player'),(42777,0,0,'Nobody tells me how to run my business here.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Bilgewater Foreman to Player'),(42777,1,0,'It was just a couple of rivets. That ship had plenty!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Bilgewater Foreman'),(42777,2,0,'I\'m sure it would\'ve been seaworthy in calm waters.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Bilgewater Foreman'),(42777,3,0,'Less rivets mean a cleaner environment!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Bilgewater Foreman'),(42777,4,0,'...can we settle this with cash?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bilgewater Foreman'),(42777,5,0,'Okay okay, stop! Stop! You make a compelling argument.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Bilgewater Foreman'),(42777,6,0,'I\'ll double the worker shifts and put in my own money to get those ships seaworthy and back on schedule. Count on it!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Bilgewater Foreman'),(42978,0,0,'What do we do now? Surely the Warchief would want us to storm the port in force!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Admiral Stonefist to Player'),(43187,0,0,'Ornak orders a boat to push off for the fleet.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ornak to Player'),(43188,0,0,'See me if you need a boat to the shore, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Horzog to Player'),(43188,1,0,'Horzog orders a landing boat to be lowered into the water. ',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Horzog to Player'),(43193,0,0,'Perhaps. And perhaps we would win, but at what cost? Maybe $n has a better plan...',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Warlord Krogg to Player'),(43238,0,0,'I am ready, $n. Soon the Dragonmaw will join the Horde!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43238,1,0,'I hear a great Dragonmaw medicine man lives here, in the large hut to our right.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43238,2,0,'After these negotiations, I am looking forward to a long and prosperous life.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43238,3,0,'The Dragonmaw Warchief is in the largest building up on the hilltop here. I\'m sure he\'ll be reasonable.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43238,4,0,'This is it! Stay close and let me do the talking. I\'m an expert.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43238,5,0,'Most esteemed Warchief -',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43238,6,0,'Warchief, you misunderstand. Garrosh Hellscream will have a beach head on these shores, with or without your help. What we ask -',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43238,7,0,'But the Horde has assembled an enormous host! A vast fleet of war machines and hardened veterans. Hellscream would as soon crush you as-',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43238,8,0,'This is madness!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Horde Negotiator to Player'),(43581,0,0,'Abandon the port? Has Mor\'ghor beaten all the sense out of you? This attack is our best opportunity to take our destiny into our own - wait! Here comes $n from the Horde!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zaela to Player'),(43627,0,0,'For the Horde!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Dragonmaw Warrior to Player'),(43628,0,0,'Victory for the Dragonmaw!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dragonmaw Shaman to Player'),(43869,0,0,'She\'s going to blow! Get a parachute and jump!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zeppelin Explosion Bunny (Large)'),(43943,0,0,'Ahh, there she is. The battle-maiden of the Dragonmaw. Let me see your face.',12,0,100,1,0,20514,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(43943,1,0,'Blood and honor, hero. The Horde welcomes you. Your people will be put to the test as we obliterate Twilight\'s Hammer and lay claim to this distant shore. But first... some unfinished business.',12,0,100,273,0,20515,0,0,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(43962,0,0,'Wherever the Horde takes us, we will keep our heads high and our blood pure. Good riddance, Mor\'ghor. A new Dragonmaw dawns this day.',12,0,100,0,0,21600,0,0,0,'Zaela to Player'),(43962,1,0,'Hellscream, I am Zaela of the Dragonmaw. Your people have freed mine from tyranny. We are your instrument. The strength of the Dragonmaw is yours to command. For the Horde!',12,0,100,0,0,21601,0,0,0,'Zaela to Player'),(44024,0,0,'Step on through, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Artesh to Player'),(45982,0,0,'Hold the line!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gralok to Player'),(47206,0,0,'Zeppelin arrival in two minutes.',12,0,100,0,0,22491,0,0,0,'Loudspeaker'),(47206,1,0,'Zeppelin arrival in one minute. One minute.',12,0,100,0,0,22491,0,0,0,'Loudspeaker'),(47208,0,0,'You\'ll also find a complementary bag of peanuts.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,1,0,'Nothing keeps a fleet of combustible dirigibles safer than randomly flinging molten metal in every conceivable direction!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,2,0,'With Pleasure!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,3,0,'I can hit my house from here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,4,0,'No.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,5,0,'Maybe.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,6,0,'A little.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,7,0,'We call them \"Emergency Rampless Debarkation Devices.\"',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,8,0,'Oh hells no! Those things are death-traps!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,9,0,'From all of us at Bilgewater Harbor...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47208,10,0,'Have fun storming the Highlands!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,'Assistant Greely to Loudspeaker'),(47209,0,0,'Should your zeppelin be attacked en-route, panic is inadvisable.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,1,0,'Instead, look for a number of deck-mounted flak cannons positioned for just such an emergency.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,2,0,'Greely, show them how the guns work.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,3,0,'Simply aim and pull the trigger. Or don\'t aim. I wash my hands of the whole thing.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,4,0,'Greely, you\'re not randomly firing that thing into Bilgewater Port, are you?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,5,0,'In the unlikely event that a catastrophic failure does not instantly kill everyone aboard...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,6,0,'...a number of parachutes will appear along the railings.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,7,0,'Simply grab a nearby parachute to be vaulted clear of the burning zeppelin. Hopefully onto dry land.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,8,0,'Greely, would you like to demonstrate how our parachutes work?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,9,0,'Very well then. I see that the Spear of Durotar has almost arrived.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(47209,10,0,'Your safety and well-being are no longer any concern of mine.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Hobart Grapplehammer to Loudspeaker'),(45167,0,0,'Aye, friend. How fare the Wildhammer clans? We\'ve much to discuss!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Kurdran Wildhammer to Player'),(45168,0,0,'Thas\'it! Pulverize the beach! Leave nuthin\' but ... sand.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke'),(45168,1,0,'So long as we\'re sendin\' troops up the beach, we should double-up the artillery-fire. You know, to help.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke'),(45171,0,0,'Hold fast, $c. This is for yer own protection.',12,0,100,432,0,0,0,0,0,'Ephram Hardstone to Player'),(45171,1,0,'Here she comes. Oh, foul temptress of the sea...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Ephram Hardstone to Player'),(45171,2,0,'Avert yer eyes! Don\'t look at her!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Ephram Hardstone to Player'),(45171,3,0,'Don\'t listen to her voice!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Ephram Hardstone to Player'),(45171,4,0,'Don\'t look at her... ruby red... soft... sensual lips! Oh...',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,0,0,'Ephram Hardstone to Player'),(45171,5,0,'There! She reveals herself. Attack!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Ephram Hardstone to Player'),(45171,6,0,'Eh - what? Who? What\'s going on?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ephram Hardstone to Player'),(45173,0,0,'By wind and wave, by earth and fire... To Stormwind we go, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Talaa to Player'),(45210,0,0,'She\'s beautiful...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stranded Crewman to Player'),(45210,1,0,'Like an angel...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stranded Crewman to Player'),(45334,0,0,'I will prove myself to the master!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Bonebreaker to Player'),(45334,1,0,'Biting... clawing... clutching... tearing...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Bonebreaker to Player'),(45334,2,0,'Do you not feel the master\'s gaze?! It watches us all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Bonebreaker to Player'),(45524,0,0,'Aye, protect the tank while the boys make repairs! I\'ll try to get her moving again...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Siege Tank Commander to Siege Tank Controller Bunny'),(45524,1,0,'Ahh, blast it. C\'mon, c\'mon already!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Siege Tank Commander to Siege Tank Controller Bunny'),(45524,2,0,'There! We got it! Let\'s get \'er outta here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Siege Tank Commander to Siege Tank Controller Bunny'),(45527,0,0,'Defend the Siege Tank!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Siege Tank Controller Bunny to Player'),(45527,1,0,'Success! The Siege Tank is able to retreat.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Siege Tank Controller Bunny to Player'),(45668,0,0,'See, Cassius. I told you that we could depend upon $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Kurdran Wildhammer to Player'),(45708,0,0,'You\'ve crossed into the domain of red dragons, $r.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lirastrasza to Player'),(45708,1,0,'You and your allies have struck against my kind at the gates to Grim Batol in the past. You\'ve shown no respect for the sacred oath we would die to keep. You\'ll find no trust with me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lirastrasza to Player'),(45708,2,0,'Fortunately for you, your fate is not mine to decide. Calen awaits you by the tree.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lirastrasza to Player'),(45708,3,0,'My drakes shall be watching you. Choose your words and your actions carefully, $r.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lirastrasza to Player'),(45770,0,0,'Hop aboard, $n. Let\'s move!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thordun Hammerblow to Player'),(45770,1,0,'I hope you Alliance are here to give them Dragonmaw Orcs a good thumpin\'.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Thordun Hammerblow to Player'),(45770,2,0,'You\'ve got quite the setup here, friend. Come with me while I find out who\'s in charge.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Thordun Hammerblow to Lightning'),(45770,3,0,'Stuff me like a haggis! Kurdran Wildhammer - in the flesh. He lives!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Thordun Hammerblow to Lightning'),(45773,0,0,'Aaaagghhh!',14,0,100,0,0,1374,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Hellion to Wildhammer Gryphon'),(45773,1,0,'See you back at Victor\'s Point!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Hellion to Wildhammer Gryphon'),(45773,2,0,'Thanks for the company!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Hellion to Wildhammer Gryphon'),(45773,3,0,'Kill these ettins so that we can come back and finish the job.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Hellion to Wildhammer Gryphon'),(45773,4,0,'Stinking ettins!',14,0,100,0,0,1374,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Hellion to Wildhammer Gryphon'),(45796,0,0,'$n, over here. What do you have to report? Were you followed?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(45796,1,0,'We\'re going to have to deal with Cho\'gall and Skullcrusher sooner rather than later. Are you up to it, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(45968,0,0,'3...',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'\"Move the Mountain\" Hidden Explosives Bunny to Player'),(45968,1,0,'2...',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'\"Move the Mountain\" Hidden Explosives Bunny to Player'),(45968,2,0,'1...',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'\"Move the Mountain\" Hidden Explosives Bunny to Player'),(45986,0,0,'WHAT WAS THAT?!',14,0,100,33,0,10082,0,0,0,'Skullcrusher the Mountain to Player'),(45986,1,0,'THERE\'S NOTHING HERE EXCEPT FOR THIS FOG!',14,0,100,15,0,10081,0,0,0,'Skullcrusher the Mountain to Player'),(45986,2,0,'KEEP FIGHTING! I\'M GOING UP TOP TO SPEAK WITH CHO\'GALL!',14,0,100,33,0,0,0,0,0,'Skullcrusher the Mountain to Player'),(46114,0,0,'We should move out, $n. Up the ramp and then straight to Master Shaw.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,0,0,'SI:7 Squad Commander to Player'),(46114,1,0,'Wait! Do you hear something?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'SI:7 Squad Commander to Player'),(46114,2,0,'Cho\'gall!',12,0,100,397,0,23202,0,0,0,'SI:7 Squad Commander to Cho\'gall'),(46114,3,0,'Kill him!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'SI:7 Squad Commander to Cho\'gall'),(46137,0,0,'Alliance soldiers! So bold, so cavalier. (Scurry, scurry, scurry, mortals.) Your numbers are small, and you are too late. (Helpless and hopeless, helpless and hopeless.)',14,0,100,153,0,23202,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to Player'),(46137,1,0,'(Finish it! Finish them all!)',14,0,100,0,0,23205,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to SI:7 Squad Commander'),(46137,2,0,'Pathetic flesh!',14,0,100,15,0,23204,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to SI:7 Squad Commander'),(46143,0,0,'Be wary of taking to the sky above these ruins, $glad:lass;. The Twilight drakes have a taste for things that fly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Flynn Dunwald to Player'),(46174,0,0,'That\'s tha spirit!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Cayden Dunwald to Player'),(46174,1,0,'That all ya got?!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Cayden Dunwald to Player'),(46174,2,0,'Cayden\'s got an axe with your name on it!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Cayden Dunwald to Player'),(46174,3,0,'Come\'n get it!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Cayden Dunwald to Player'),(46175,0,0,'They\'ve gone too far! Some Twilight are goin\' to be dyin\' this day!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald'),(46175,1,0,'Soul-less, ale-hatin\', uncultured vagabonds! Ya better hide!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald'),(46175,2,0,'All my sweet delicious ale... gone... the horror...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald'),(46175,3,0,'The ale?! Why would they destroy the ale?! Monsters!',14,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald'),(46175,4,0,'Water?! Are you daft?! I need some ALE!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald to Player'),(46176,0,0,'Beak! No more hiding. Come out right now!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Donnelly Dunwald'),(46176,1,0,'Beak! Where are ya Beak?',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Donnelly Dunwald'),(46310,0,0,'No\'bu mog re\'ka Uruk mog Ogerin\'naz ',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Dragonmaw Marauder to Player'),(46310,1,0,'Ag ha thok Magan mog no\'bu ro\'th Zugas uruk zil\'nok il thukad il ',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Dragonmaw Marauder to Wildhammer Pack Mule'),(46310,2,0,'Uruk mog Ragath\'a o ',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dragonmaw Marauder to Player'),(46320,0,0,'Heads up, $n. The Dragonmaw are about to attack!',12,7,100,432,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Warbrand to Player'),(46320,1,0,'We did it! That\'ll learn those Dragonmaw to try an\' ambush a Wildhammer.',12,7,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Warbrand to Dave\'s Industrial Light and Magic Bunny (Small)(Sessile)'),(46320,2,0,'Okay, back to work. If we\'re fast we can finish up here before another attack.',12,7,100,11,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Warbrand to Dave\'s Industrial Light and Magic Bunny (Small)(Sessile)'),(46320,3,0,'That\'s right! They can keep on comin\', we\'ll keep knockin\' \'em down!',12,7,100,11,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Warbrand to Dave\'s Industrial Light and Magic Bunny (Small)(Sessile)'),(46320,4,0,'Halthar is dead! Sound the trumpets, and spread the news from Highbank to Thundermar!',12,7,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Warbrand to Dave\'s Industrial Light and Magic Bunny (Small)(Sessile)'),(46322,0,0,'The end of all things is upon us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shaman of the Black to Player'),(46322,1,0,'Behold the powers of the master!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shaman of the Black to Player'),(46322,2,0,'I will crush your bones to dust.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shaman of the Black to Player'),(46322,3,0,'Your life is meaningless. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shaman of the Black to Player'),(46322,4,0,'Stones of the earth, obey the call of the Twilight\'s Hammer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shaman of the Black to Player'),(46322,5,0,'Excellent, another stone to grind!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shaman of the Black to Player'),(46330,0,0,'Excuse me. I have some former captors to speak with.',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,0,0,'Freed Waterspout to Enslaved Waterspout'),(46330,1,0,'Time for a bit of revenge before I return home.',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,0,0,'Freed Waterspout to Enslaved Waterspout'),(46331,0,0,'My eternal thanks to you.',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,0,0,'Freed Inferno to Enslaved Inferno'),(46331,1,0,'There are Twilight\'s Hammer to be slain.',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,0,0,'Freed Inferno to Enslaved Inferno'),(46332,0,0,'Run, little Twilight cultists. Your doom draws near!',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,0,0,'Freed Tempest to Enslaved Tempest'),(46332,1,0,'I am enslaved no longer!',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,0,0,'Freed Tempest to Enslaved Tempest'),(46341,0,0,'We could have been civil about this, but no!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dame Alys Finnsson to Player'),(46342,0,0,'You\'ve come for training. Good!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Klem to Player'),(46343,0,0,'I knew you were coming. No one can resist me, not even you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mia the Rose to Player'),(46385,0,0,'Not bad.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Mathias Shaw'),(46385,1,0,'You\'re telegraphing your moves.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Mathias Shaw'),(46452,0,0,'I am eternally grateful to you, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,20702,0,0,0,'Lirastrasza to Player'),(46456,0,0,'$n, is that you? Please free me from these chains.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lirastrasza to Player'),(46472,0,0,'Ooh, this is gonna be good!',12,0,100,1,0,11778,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Mine Cart'),(46472,1,0,'Hang on!',12,0,100,0,0,11778,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Mine Cart'),(46472,2,0,'OH NO!',14,0,100,5,0,2929,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Mine Cart'),(46472,3,0,'My totems!!!',14,0,100,22,0,2929,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Mine Cart'),(46472,4,0,'JUMP!!!',14,0,100,22,0,11778,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Mine Cart'),(46513,0,0,'You destroyed their Earth rune! I bet there are three others. And, I bet they\'re all linked to the fire portal in the back.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Player'),(46513,1,0,'We better destroy them all. But first, I need to get the shrapnel out of my backside.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Player'),(46513,2,0,'Did you get wet? I\'m soaked! Okay, what do you want to bet the next rune is attuned to air?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Player'),(46513,3,0,'The blast of air totally dried my hair. That gives me a great idea for a spare flying machine engine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Player'),(46513,4,0,'Ahahahaha, that\'s the last of their runes! Twilight Suckers, no more elemental power for you!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Player'),(46513,5,0,'Wait! What\'s that over there?',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Player'),(46513,6,0,'Magmatooth?! NOOOOOOOO!',14,0,100,18,0,11778,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Player'),(46513,7,0,'Oh yeah? Um... get him!!!',14,0,100,14,0,20702,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Magmatooth'),(46513,8,0,'Take this, you ungrateful elemental. After all I\'ve done for you!',14,0,100,14,0,20702,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Magmatooth'),(46513,9,0,'Good riddance, you overblown, halfbaked, bomb ignition wannabe! See if I ever summon YOU again!',14,0,100,14,0,20702,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Magmatooth'),(46513,10,0,'Okay, let\'s get the controller off of him and use the portal to get out of here.',12,0,100,273,0,11778,0,0,0,'Initiate Goldmine to Magmatooth'),(46526,0,0,'You\'re ours now, $r.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Shadeprowler to Player'),(46553,0,0,'Keep your hands off me ale, ya unclean pint-hatin\' mongels!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald to Player'),(46553,1,0,'An\' where you think you\'re goin\', sonny?!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald to Player'),(46579,0,0,'Work harder, dark iron dogs!',14,0,100,0,0,11778,0,0,0,'Depths Overseer'),(46579,1,0,'Mining\'s all you dwarves are good for!',14,0,100,0,0,3525,0,0,0,'Depths Overseer'),(46579,2,0,'Don\'t let those spiders eat the Elementium!',14,0,100,0,0,11778,0,0,0,'Depths Overseer'),(46579,3,0,'I\'m going to turn you to ash if you don\'t work faster!',14,0,100,38,0,11778,0,0,0,'Depths Overseer'),(46579,4,0,'More Elementium for the Bastion of Twilight!',14,0,100,0,0,2929,0,0,0,'Depths Overseer'),(46579,5,0,'I see you there! Yes, you! Come here. I\'m going to bury you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Depths Overseer'),(46579,6,0,'More Elementium! Now!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Depths Overseer'),(46599,0,0,'Someone took refuge here after the attack, but no sign of Beak.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dunwald Hovel, South Credit to Player'),(46600,0,0,'This room reeks of a massacre. No sign of Beak.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dunwald Hovel, Northwest Credit to Player'),(46601,0,0,'These buildings lie entirely in ruin. Nowhere for Beak to hide here.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dunwald Hovel, East Credit to Player'),(46607,0,0,'You seem to have gained a companion. You should bring him back to Donnelly.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beak to Player'),(46607,1,0,'Beak squeaks in joy at the sight of Donnelly!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beak to Donnelly Dunwald'),(46611,0,0,'GOLDMINE! YOU THINK I\'VE FORGOTTEN?! I TOLD YOU THAT I\'D GET MY REVENGE!!!',14,0,100,34,0,11778,0,0,0,'Magmatooth to Player'),(46611,1,0,'YOU\'RE BOTH GOING TO BURN!',14,0,100,0,0,20702,0,0,0,'Magmatooth to Player'),(46611,2,0,'I\'LL GET YOU, GOLDMINE!',14,0,100,0,0,20702,0,0,0,'Magmatooth to Player'),(46624,0,0,'%s roars wildly, initiating a massive stomp attack!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darunga to Player'),(46627,0,0,'How\'s about a nice, refreshing ale?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald'),(46627,1,0,'Use Eoin\'s mug to replenish your health!',41,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald'),(46785,0,0,'Find the interlopers! I know that they have someone sneaking around to the north!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Cannon'),(46785,1,0,'Keep your weak, fleshy eyes open! There are intruders amongst us.',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Cannon'),(46785,2,0,'She\'s sent you to do her dirty work, has she? I\'ll deal with the countess after I\'ve killed you, fleshling!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Cannon to Player'),(46804,0,0,'Find Iain. Secure whatever gryphon riders he\'s gathered to cut them off before they reach the town.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Firebeard Militia'),(46813,0,0,'Them\'s DEFINITELY fightin\' words!',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,0,0,'Mullan Gryphon Rider to Player'),(46813,1,0,'The duel will begin in...',42,0,100,36,0,0,0,0,0,'Mullan Gryphon Rider to Player'),(46813,2,0,'Fine! Fine. You win this one.',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,0,0,'Mullan Gryphon Rider'),(46819,0,0,'Wh... what is this?',12,0,100,6,0,3418,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46819,1,0,'I\'m dead! Murdered by the Twilight\'s Hammer.',12,0,100,5,0,3415,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46819,2,0,'The Spirit of the Loch sent you here. You seek information.',12,0,100,1,0,20702,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46819,3,0,'They captured and enslaved us. Put us to work on a weapon.',12,0,100,1,0,3414,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46819,4,0,'A special project... an artifact for Cho\'gall.',12,0,100,1,0,20702,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46819,5,0,'We were to be rewarded for the best work we\'d ever done, and we were... with this.',12,0,100,274,0,3418,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46819,6,0,'They imbued it with the power of an Old God.',12,0,100,1,0,3414,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46819,7,0,'The weapon which you seek is called the Hammer of Twilight.',12,0,100,1,0,3417,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46819,8,0,'Now leave me be. I see the Light....',12,0,100,15,0,3416,0,0,0,'Corpse of Forgemaster Finlay to Player'),(46831,0,0,'Yes sir!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Firebeard Militia'),(46831,1,0,'Ready for some more?',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Firebeard Militia to Player'),(46831,2,0,'Keep it up.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Firebeard Militia to Player'),(46831,3,0,'Take this!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Firebeard Militia to Player'),(46831,4,0,'Keegan, sir. More elementals are breaking through on the west side of the rift.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Firebeard Militia'),(46900,0,0,'Back, vermin! (Insects! Weak and small!)',14,0,100,25,0,22110,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to \"Skullcrusher the Mountain\" Camera'),(46900,1,0,'Look, mortal, upon the instrument of your undoing. (The Hammer, hand of the Gods Below.) Forged of molten blood... (...gift of the master. His gift!) Shaped upon the Last Altar of Storm.',14,0,100,408,0,22111,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to \"Skullcrusher the Mountain\" Camera'),(46900,2,0,'The Hammer of Twilight. (The Hammer of Twilight!) Commissioned by the Aspect of Death. It is the breaker of worlds. It is not yours to wield. (Kill the intruders!) Kill them all!',14,0,100,408,0,22112,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to \"Skullcrusher the Mountain\" Camera'),(46900,3,0,'What Deathwing has set in motion... (...no man can stop.) No man! Least of all you wretches. (Show them. Show them their end!)',14,0,100,408,0,20702,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to \"Skullcrusher the Mountain\" Camera'),(46922,0,0,'We\'ll keep the buckets coming.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Firebeard Citizen to Player'),(46922,1,0,'Here\'s some more water.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Firebeard Citizen to Player'),(46922,2,0,'We\'ve got your back.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Firebeard Citizen to Player'),(46923,0,0,'Wha... my roses?! Did Cailin tell you?  I really can\'t thank you enough. I thought I\'d never smell home again...',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Meara to Player'),(46935,0,0,'The grand Crucible of Carnage awaits, $n. Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. WIN OR DIE!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,1,0,'Here we are once again, ladies and gentlemen. The epic struggle between life and death in the Crucible of Carnage! For this round we have $n versus... a really fat ogre? Wait, seriously?! That\'s all we could come up with on short notice? What am I paying you for? ',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,2,0,'Whatever, let the fight begin!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,3,0,'W-W-W-WINNER! We have a winner! Good job and stuff!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,4,0,'The battle is about to begin! $n vs. the vicious Dragonmaw, Torg Drakeflayer! I THINK he\'s vicious anyway - hard to tell. I just let him because they let us take over their old arena here. Here\'s hoping for some blood!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,5,0,'OOOOOOOH! Check that mess out! Amazing win! Way to stick it through him!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,6,0,'Imagine my surprise when I was approached by the genius forsaken, Calder Gray, and propsitioned with a combatant made of all the best features of our previous champions... LITERALLY! Who could refuse a chance to challenge CALDER\'S CREATION?!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,7,0,'You know what they say... if you can\'t beat \'em, join \'em! And in this case, you won\'t have the choice! Cruicible of Carnage, I adore you so.',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,8,0,'Bah, couldn\'t you have dragged it out a bit! People don\'t pay me when you make it look that easy! Add some theatrics to it, will ya?!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Calder Gray'),(46935,9,0,'They went down like a sack of orc skulls!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,10,0,'Hailing from the semi-distant wreck of a landscape that was once Gilneas, our champion arises! Keep your pants up $n, you don\'t want to show this guy a full moon!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,11,0,'There\'s no denying it - they really put that dog down! So much for our former champion!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,12,0,'It looks like we have one more challenger yet to face though, so let\'s get those wagers in!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,13,0,'The Twilight\'s Hammer: happy to serve local nefarious schemes anytime, anywhere. And today is no exception! Our final combatant hails from the not so distant Bastion of Twilight! Or is it the Twilight Bastion... bah, who cares!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,14,0,'You all love to hate him, and he\'s glad to shower his hate right back down on ya. LETS... GET... BLOODY!!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46935,15,0,'I DON\'T BELIEVE IT! WE HAVE A NEW CHAMPION OF CARNAGE!!! Our big, bad beefy challenger has been defeated by a ragtag crew of nobodies! Incredible finish!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurgthock to Player'),(46945,0,0,'All of the highlands belong to the Dragonmaw, even this pit!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Torg Drakeflayer to Player'),(46945,1,0,'Pitiful meat bags! Feel the full force of the Dragonmaw!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Torg Drakeflayer'),(46947,0,0,'Calder said that if I kill you, I get to have your parts!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Cadaver Collage to Player'),(46947,1,0,'Eww! Get away from me, you nasty thing!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Cadaver Collage to Player'),(46947,2,0,'As you wish, Daddy!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Cadaver Collage to Calder Gray'),(46947,3,0,'Oh! Too full... oh no... ',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Cadaver Collage to Calder Gray'),(46948,0,0,'Why hello chaps, I have a not so surprising surprise for you this eve.',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Geoffery Tulvan to Carriage Harness'),(46948,1,0,'I dare say I\'ve had enough of this. Time to bring out... THE BEAST WITHIN!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Geoffery Tulvan'),(46948,2,0,'Enough toying around! It\'s time to get my hands dirty!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Geoffery Wildwolf'),(46949,0,0,'This land shall be purged in the Twilight\'s Flame! ',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Emberscar the Devourer to Player'),(46949,1,0,'Burn in the liquid heat of the Firelands!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Emberscar the Devourer'),(46968,0,0,'The gryphon muscles tense and eyes tighten as soon as the bark is extended towards it.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mullan Gryphon to Player'),(47038,0,0,'He\'s too powerful!  You\'ve got to find a way to use those altars to give us an edge!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Cassius the White to Skullcrusher the Mountain'),(47038,1,0,'Kurdran is down!  You\'ve got to get him back into the fight or we\'re done for!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Cassius the White to Kurdran Wildhammer'),(47038,2,0,'Revive your fallen companion by right-clicking on their unconscious body!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cassius the White to Kurdran Wildhammer'),(47199,0,0,'Whispers... whispers in the wind... yes, master...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Stormbender to Player'),(47199,1,0,'You only delay the inevitable.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Stormbender to Player'),(47199,2,0,'Your screams will carry far on the winds....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twilight Stormbender to Player'),(47380,0,0,'(The master sees you! He sees! He sees! He wants! Wants wants...)',15,0,100,0,0,22109,0,0,0,'Voice of Cho\'gall to Player'),(47465,0,0,'There is fight left in me yet, scum.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Dragonmaw Straggler to Player'),(47512,0,0,'Go forth, my beautiful angel! Ah, it is so very sad when one\'s children leave the nest, isn\'t it?',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Calder Gray to Player'),(47512,1,0,'It\'s time for your ultimate attack, my darling!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Calder Gray to Cadaver Collage'),(47512,2,0,'What... my creation! It didn\'t even blot out the sky! I\'d better recheck my notes...',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Calder Gray to Calder Gray'),(47512,3,0,'Your bodies are all magnificent! If you\'d be willing to take a small whiff of this chloroform, I promise that you will all wake up 10 times stronger and 100 times more... unified in purpose.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Calder Gray to Calder Gray'),(47512,4,0,'No? Well... my offer stands. Just come by anytime and I\'ll be glad to give you the makeover you\'ve always dreamed of.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Calder Gray to Calder Gray'),(47592,0,0,'They\'re already assembled. I\'m trusting you to secure the route to Grim Batol. Don\'t let me down.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(47605,0,0,'$n! I\'m glad you made it.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(47611,0,0,'Lead the way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Lieutenant to Player'),(47611,1,0,'Break out the gatestone. Open this thing up.',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Lieutenant to Dragonmaw Gate Controller'),(47611,2,0,'It\'s never easy, is it? That\'s alright, we came prepared.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Lieutenant to Dragonmaw Gate Controller'),(47611,3,0,'Blow it open. There isn\'t a problem that some explosives can\'t solve.',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Lieutenant to Dragonmaw Gate Controller'),(47611,4,0,'Awaiting your orders.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Lieutenant to Player'),(47611,5,0,'Good working with you.',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Lieutenant to Grim Batol Credit'),(47612,0,0,'On it.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Demolitionist to Highbank Lieutenant'),(47612,1,0,'Almost done.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Demolitionist to Highbank Lieutenant'),(47612,2,0,'See you around!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Demolitionist to Grim Batol Credit'),(47613,0,0,'By a girl. Ouch.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Medic to Twilight Sentinel'),(47613,1,0,'Right away sir. Er... I don\'t see a slot to put it in?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Medic to Highbank Lieutenant'),(47613,2,0,'I kind of like you. Try not to get killed out there.',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Medic to Grim Batol Credit'),(47614,0,0,'Sir, I think the explosions and gunfire gave us away. You don\'t have to use hand signals.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highbank Sniper to Player'),(47855,0,0,'Follow the hatchlings into the Obsidian Lair.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Obsidian Hatchling Controller to Player'),(47905,0,0,'Well done. Find Lirastrasza and let her know that we\'ve succeeded.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Baleflame to Player'),(47929,0,0,'Baleflame! Your tender flesh shall be an appropriate meal for my whelps!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Obsidia to Player'),(47929,1,0,'Come, my children! Awaken and feast upon their flesh!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Obsidia'),(47929,2,0,'No! My clutch is the last...! Father... I\'ve failed you...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Obsidia to Player'),(47960,0,0,'Iso\'rath\'s stomach begins to churn as the brain is attacked!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brain of Iso\'rath to Player'),(48010,0,0,'Quit lookin\' at me, ya big purple eye-face! Ah, blast it all, $n. ',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,0,0,'Low Shaman Blundy to Player'),(48051,0,0,'I bring you back from the brink of death, $Gbrother:sister;. We are in need of your aid!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Thrall to Player'),(48051,1,0,'NOBUNDO! NOOO!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thrall to Player'),(48051,2,0,'You will die this day, Earthwarder! $n will see to it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thrall to Player'),(48051,3,0,'Aggra... this can\'t be... this has gone too far...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thrall to Player'),(48051,4,0,'Do something, you useless $r. My allies are giving their lives for you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thrall to Player'),(48051,5,0,'Muln falls! And the Earthen Ring dies with him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thrall to Player'),(48051,6,0,'You\'ve failed us all, $n. Deathwing has won. The world is doomed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thrall to Player'),(48051,7,0,'We\'re surrounded! Its defenses are too great. $n! Wake up!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thrall to Player'),(48059,0,0,'Wake up! We need you, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Yevaa to Player'),(48142,0,0,'A mortal dares peer into the eye! (Brave little plaything.) I see you, little one! You want to see what the Eye sees, do you? (Show it! Show it all!)',12,0,100,15,0,22107,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to Eye of Twilight Vehicle'),(48142,1,0,'Behold the chaos to come. (Madness, madness, bliss!) Do you like what you see mortal?',12,0,100,15,0,22108,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to Eye of Twilight Vehicle'),(48145,0,0,'The Alliance has made landfall master, and in great numbers upon the shore.',12,0,100,0,0,21073,0,0,0,'Twilight Servant to Player'),(48145,1,0,'Our agents have been outed and killed, master.',12,0,100,0,0,21075,0,0,0,'Twilight Servant to Player'),(48173,0,0,'Hey $n! Over here. We need you!',12,0,100,3,0,3980,0,0,0,'Colin Thundermar to Player'),(48173,1,0,'Here he comes, $n! Flying in from the west. Get your weapons ready!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Colin Thundermar to Player'),(48174,0,0,'What was that? Oh no, the Dragonmaw are here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nivvet Channelock to Player'),(48176,0,0,'Is that all you\'ve got!?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fanny Thundermar'),(48329,0,0,'You\'re truly a force to be reckoned with. The beast is done with. Let\'s get out of here. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Earthcaller Yevaa to Earthen Ring Gryphon'),(48364,0,0,'Unity? Now? The Thundermars weren\'t exactly unitin\' when them Twilight Shaman tore open our stronghold on the shore.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(48364,1,0,'Thundermar, if we weren\'t on holy ground I\'d pop you one so hard yer shoes would be the only thing left standin\'!',12,0,100,23,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(48364,2,0,'Here, what\'s this?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(48366,0,0,'In Thundermar the tales proclaimed',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to Russell Brower'),(48366,1,0,'Of a bold lass destined for fame',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to Russell Brower'),(48366,2,0,'With emerald green eyes and big man-crushing thighs',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to Russell Brower'),(48366,3,0,'And \"Fanny,\" a most fitting name.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to Russell Brower'),(48366,4,0,'Now let cheering dispel the twilight',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to Russell Brower'),(48366,5,0,'And let the Wildhammers unite!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to Russell Brower'),(48366,6,0,'They\'re short an\' they\'re stout, but no man can doubt:',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to Russell Brower'),(48366,7,0,'Firebeard and his Fanny are tight.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to Russell Brower'),(48367,0,0,'Friends. The Wildhammer way of life is threatened. Our enemies are too numerous for us to remain isolated from one another. We must unite!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Lachlan MacGraff to Player'),(48367,1,0,'Gentlemen, please -',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Lachlan MacGraff to Player'),(48367,2,0,'Ach! This\'ll be harder than I thought.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Lachlan MacGraff to Player'),(48369,0,0,'Oh, that\'s just like a Firebeard, can\'t see anything past yer own fat nose. We were up to arses and elbows in Dragonmaw. But did you send a single bird to help? NO!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Colin Thundermar to Player'),(48369,1,0,'I don\'t have to take this. I\'ll be part of no Alliance that has a Firebeard innit. That\'s me final word!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Colin Thundermar to Player'),(48408,0,0,'Lira sent me to watch your backs. If Obsidia is in here, I\'ll keep her busy while you finish her off.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Baleflame to Player'),(48410,0,0,'Haaaaaalp!',14,7,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Cliff Thundermar to Player'),(48410,1,0,'The Glopgut ogres stormed Thundermar while Colin was here at the summit. They kidnapped Fanny and ran for the hills!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Cliff Thundermar to Player'),(48410,2,0,'Colin is massing the Thundermars for a full-on assault of Glopgut\'s Hollow. ',12,7,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Cliff Thundermar to Player'),(48480,0,0,'None pass!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brogg Glopgut'),(48499,0,0,'$n? What are you doing here? And is that Keegan Firebeard behind you?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Fanny Thundermar to Player'),(48499,1,0,'Took yer sweet time, didn\'tcha?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Fanny Thundermar to Player'),(48499,2,0,'Aye, they was getting\' a wee handsy, so I took care of it. C\'mon then, I\'m done here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Fanny Thundermar to Player'),(48500,0,0,'Aye! We\'re here to rescue you!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(48500,1,0,'The ogres - ya kilt \'em!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(48500,2,0,'Did you see that, $n? What a woman!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(48530,0,0,'Be sure to talk to the MacGraffs, inside the sanctuary. They\'ll be orchestratin\' the ceremonies.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Fanny Thundermar to Player'),(48732,0,0,'We command the power of the elements. Storm, Earth and Fire!  I\'d never dress like an oversized chicken and shoot moon beams from the sky. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Jalara to Player'),(48743,0,0,'I thought for sure I was going to be this smelly beast\'s dinner!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hargoth Dimblaze to Tentacle of Iso\'rath'),(48758,0,0,'Keep yer eyes open, $n! That road is crawling with Dragonmaw.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Hammelhand to Player'),(48789,0,0,'That foul thing got stains all over my new robes!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Jalara to Tentacle of Iso\'rath'),(48793,0,0,'I\'m... so... dizzy. ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Earthmender Duarn to Tentacle of Iso\'rath'),(48795,0,0,'Thanks fer savin\' me! When you passed out, I thought we were done fer!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Tentacle of Iso\'rath'),(48917,0,0,'Woohoo! We got us a convoy!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Wildhammer Lookout to Player'),(49020,0,0,'Now hold yer breeks. The zeppelin will take a minute or so to pull around.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke'),(49020,1,0,'Bah, predictable! They\'ll see it comin\'!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke to \"Doc\" Schweitzer'),(49020,2,0,'But once ol\' $p here blasts through their bulkhead in a hail of splintered wood, blood, and phlegm then starts crawlin\' across the deck with both legs broken, oh aye, they\'ll not see THAT comin\' by a sweet mile, no sir!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke to \"Doc\" Schweitzer'),(49020,3,0,'It\'s almost here. Get ready!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke'),(49020,4,0,'She\'s here! Get in that cannon, damnit! Get ready to fire!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke'),(49026,0,0,'A big day, Firebeard. The Wildhammer united can never be stopped!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Kurdran Wildhammer to Player'),(49026,1,0,'Never doubt it. Here, allow me to give you my wedding gift.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Kurdran Wildhammer to Player'),(49026,2,0,'The only surviving egg of my late gryphon, Sky\'ree.  Honor it and care for it; her child is yours.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Kurdran Wildhammer to Player'),(49026,3,0,'I\'ll not hear a word of it. The egg is yours. I want you to see how committed I am to this union.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Kurdran Wildhammer to Player'),(49026,4,0,'And how committed the Alliance is to the Wildhammer cause!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Kurdran Wildhammer to Player'),(49026,5,0,'Ah, look. Here comes $n, escorting your bride!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Kurdran Wildhammer to Player'),(49027,0,0,'I hope you\'re right, Kurdran old friend.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(49027,1,0,'Kurdran - no, I couldn\'t! Sky\'ree was a legend, I can\'t-',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(49027,2,0,'Aye. Thank you, Kurdran.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Player'),(49027,3,0,'I do.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Keegan Firebeard to Grundy MacGraff'),(49028,0,0,'Where\'s your \"honor\" now, Horde scum?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tidebreaker Sailor to Axebite Infantry'),(49034,0,0,'Ladies and gentledwarves, we gather here in the shadow of Thunderstrike to honor the union of Fanny Thundermar and Keegan Firebeard.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Grundy MacGraff to Player'),(49034,1,0,'May their bond be as eternal as the wind, waves, stone and fire. ',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Grundy MacGraff to Player'),(49034,2,0,'Do you, Keegan and Fanny, accept one another into your lives, that two become as one, in union everlasting?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Grundy MacGraff to Player'),(49034,3,0,'Then, by the powers vested in me... the powers vested in me...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Grundy MacGraff to Player'),(49034,4,0,'...BY BLOOD AND SHADOW!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Grundy MacGraff to Player'),(49034,5,0,'I shall consume your lifeblood in the name of the master!!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Grundy MacGraff to Player'),(49163,0,0,'SAVE THE WEDDING!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kirthaven Wedding Vehicle to Player'),(49212,0,0,'The bombs are set! Run to the balcony and jump to escape!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skyshredder Bomb Controller Bunny to Player'),(49212,1,0,'BOOM!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skyshredder Bomb Controller Bunny to Player'),(49234,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_prayerofshadowprotection.blp:20|t The Beast Unleashed begins to emit an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:93717|h[Aura of Darkness]|h|r!',41,0,100,53,0,14046,0,0,0,'The Beast Unleashed'),(49234,1,0,'Uulwi gag erh\'ongg w\'ssh.',14,0,100,53,0,14046,0,0,0,'The Beast Unleashed'),(49252,0,0,'Oh, like you coulda done any better.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke to Player'),(49275,0,0,'Get it! Kill it!',12,0,100,5,0,14046,0,0,0,'Keely Dunwald'),(49277,0,0,'It\'s one of them!',12,0,100,0,0,14046,0,0,0,'Iain Firebeard'),(49278,0,0,'Stop that thing!',12,0,100,0,0,14046,0,0,0,'Cliff Thundermar'),(49279,0,0,'For the Wildhammer!',14,0,100,0,0,14046,0,0,0,'Russell Brower to The Beast Unleashed'),(49314,0,0,'Waaaaahhhhh!!',12,0,100,0,0,14046,0,0,0,'Donnelly Dunwald'),(49361,0,0,'You\'re okay, Firebeard. *urp* You\'re okay by me.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Colin Thundermar'),(49363,0,0,'Twilight\'s Hammer don\'t scare me none. Bring \'em on!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Keely Dunwald'),(49364,0,0,'BEST! WEDDING! EVAR! *Hic*',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Eoin Dunwald'),(49548,0,0,'Kazum ',14,1,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Krazzworks Laborer'),(49548,1,0,'Moth\'aga gesh ',14,1,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Krazzworks Laborer'),(49548,2,0,'L regAs grom ',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Krazzworks Laborer'),(49548,3,0,'Ha thok GUl gesh\'zugas il gesh ha osh\'kava magan tov\'nokaz zaga nogu thok ',14,1,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Krazzworks Laborer'),(49548,4,0,'MOg no\'ku re\'ka Gesh ',14,1,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Krazzworks Laborer'),(49548,5,0,'Kaz ogg Gesh ',14,1,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Krazzworks Laborer'),(49548,6,0,'L re\'Ka ogar il kil ',14,1,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Krazzworks Laborer'),(49818,0,0,'Neltharion! Look at yourself. Misshapen. Twisted. You\'re coming apart.',12,0,100,5,0,21049,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Player'),(49820,0,0,'Just as all life ends in death ... all order must end in chaos ... Come! Embrace the inevitable, as I have!',12,0,100,0,0,20278,0,0,0,'Deathwing to Player'),(49820,1,0,'The sun has set on this mortal world, fools. Make peace with your end, for the hour of Twilight falls.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deathwing to Deathwing and Alexstrasza Fight Vehicle - Cutscene [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(50286,0,0,'Yep! Off we go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke to Flintlocke\'s Seaplane'),(50286,1,0,'Easy ... does it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke to Flintlocke\'s Seaplane'),(50286,2,0,'Right then. I hate long plane rides. So I\'mma gonna kick in the after-market burners and ignite our entire fuel supply in one go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke to Flintlocke\'s Seaplane'),(50286,3,0,'Whatever yeh do... Don\'t. Black. Out!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fargo Flintlocke to Flintlocke\'s Seaplane'),(50360,0,0,'Flintlocke, if we have a big giant cannon, why don\'t we just shoot ... a cannonball?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'\"Doc\" Schweitzer'),(50465,0,0,'Good work. I\'ll keep the men pushing from here. Move forward and take the last gate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Mathias Shaw to Player'),(50469,0,0,'Here we go. Hold on tight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Earthen Ring Gryphon'),(50469,1,0,'Watch those tentacles! Their reach is frightening.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormcaller Mylra to Earthen Ring Gryphon'),(50641,0,0,'Attention!',14,7,100,15,0,0,0,0,0,'Victor\'s Point Captain'),(51140,0,0,'Don\'t let them out of sight! Quickly - come with me!',12,0,100,0,0,21513,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51140,1,0,'The battle is about to begin!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51140,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_flamebolt.blp:32|t  Use Your Fire Blast to incinerate Twilight Shadowdrakes.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51140,3,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_ravage.blp:32|t  When your enemies are weak, tear them from the sky with your Finishing Strike!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51140,4,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_healingway.blp:32|t  Your Lifebinder Boon will heal others while restoring your health and mana.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51159,0,0,'There - they\'ve fallen!',12,0,100,5,0,21514,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51159,1,0,'Mother, stay still. Your wounds are great.',12,0,100,1,0,21515,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51159,2,0,'Deathwing - he lives!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51159,3,0,'Mortal, take the dragon queen. Carry her to safety. Now! RUN! Get her away from here!',12,0,100,5,0,21520,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51159,4,0,'I will delay the Aspect of Death. Take her to safety. GO!',12,0,100,25,0,21521,0,0,0,'Calen to Player'),(51171,0,0,'Calen, no!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Calen'),(51186,0,0,'The black aspect\'s blood is cursed. Wherever it was shed - nothing will grow for ten thousand years.',12,0,100,0,0,21050,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Calen'),(51186,1,0,'The Earth Warder... he is dead.',12,0,100,0,0,21050,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Calen'),(51186,2,0,'But it is over. We can work now to bottle up the horrors he has unleashed.',12,0,100,0,0,21051,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Calen'),(51186,3,0,'Impossible!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Calen'),(51354,0,0,'Mortal, I want you to bear witness to this, but for your own safety stay back. Calen, you too.',12,0,100,1,0,21045,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51354,1,0,'Your life isn\'t yours to throw away, Calen. Should I fail, the fate of this world may rest on your shoulders.',12,0,100,5,0,21046,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51354,2,0,'It pains me, Neltharion - but I must end you, as I have ended Malygos.',12,0,100,1,0,21047,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51354,3,0,'I see the hollow metal shell of a once great ally, and the precious gift of the Titans wasted.',12,0,100,274,0,21048,0,0,0,'Alexstrasza the Life-Binder to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51355,0,0,'Lifebinder! Do you presume that I am at your beck and call? I have a world to unmake.',12,0,100,1,0,20275,0,0,0,'Deathwing to Player'),(51355,1,0,'\"End\" me? Lifebinder, you think life is yours to take away?',12,0,100,11,0,20276,0,0,0,'Deathwing to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51355,2,0,'Life is weak, mortal, fleeting ... fragile.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Deathwing to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51355,3,0,'Death is final. Death is eternal. Death is ... my realm.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Deathwing to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51355,4,0,'Look upon me and you see death incarnate, the unmaker of worlds.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Deathwing to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51355,5,0,'Then witness my new gifts, bestowed by this world\'s true masters.',12,0,100,5,0,20277,0,0,0,'Deathwing to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51356,0,0,'I will not leave your side.',12,0,100,274,0,21510,0,0,0,'Calen to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51356,1,0,'Yes, mother.',12,0,100,2,0,21512,0,0,0,'Calen to Deathwing Intro Cutscene Vehicle [INTERNAL ONLY]'),(51493,0,0,'This changes nothing. (Nothing nothing changes. Crush them, crush.)',12,0,100,1,0,22102,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to Player'),(51493,1,0,'What of our agents in Stormwind? (Stormwind! The eye, the eye sees into the city heart.) Bring me the eye.',12,0,100,1,0,22103,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to Player'),(51493,2,0,'(Blaspheme! Blaspheme disgust hate hate...) No matter. Where one eye closes, another opens. (The Master sees all! The Master knows all!) We will know our enemy\'s hearts, for they are weak. The eye. Now.',12,0,100,36,0,22105,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to Player'),(51493,3,0,'The shadow of the Master covers this world... (Darkness, all darkness.) Our enemies fight one another, across the Highland. Fools. (Blood, blood.) WAIT! There is another!',12,0,100,0,0,22106,0,0,0,'Cho\'gall to Eye of Twilight Vehicle'),(3848,0,0,'Putting the bottles away, %s sighs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14108,0,'Kayneth Stillwind'),(39921,0,0,'Meep!  $R is good friend.  Follow now!  We find intruder!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39943,0,'Faerie Dragon'),(39921,0,1,'We find evil ones now!  Follow!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,40300,0,'Faerie Dragon'),(39921,0,2,'They hide this way!  Quick!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,40301,0,'Faerie Dragon'),(39921,0,3,'We look for the evil ones now, yes?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,40302,0,'Faerie Dragon'),(39921,1,0,'We finds evil one!  Quick!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,39944,0,'Faerie Dragon'),(39921,1,1,'Over here!  You must stop them!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,40303,0,'Faerie Dragon'),(39921,1,2,'You must fight now, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,40304,0,'Faerie Dragon'),(39921,1,3,'Over here, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,40305,0,'Faerie Dragon'),(39926,0,0,'How did you find me?  It matters little... you will die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39945,0,'Twilight Inciter'),(39926,0,1,'I\'ve been spotted?  Time to die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39946,0,'Twilight Inciter'),(39926,0,2,'You will not give away my position, $c!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39947,0,'Twilight Inciter'),(39926,0,3,'You might have found me, but you won\'t bring word back to the others!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39948,0,'Twilight Inciter'),(39446,0,0,'Log\'loth og shandai, mortal. Only death is eternal. You will be undone.',12,0,100,0,0,21900,0,39639,0,'Lycanthoth Aggro'),(39446,1,0,'Fate subjugates faith, mortal. Your prayers are meaningless here.',12,0,100,0,0,21901,0,39640,0,'Lycanthoth 50% HP'),(38806,0,0,'BY FIRE BE PURGED!!!!',14,0,100,449,0,23335,0,39839,1,'Ragnaros to Player'),(39128,0,0,'No... it can\'t be.  Our forward outpost has been obliterated!',12,0,100,0,0,20950,0,39185,0,'Aronus to Player'),(39128,1,0,'Is it too late?  I feel Deathwing\'s presence nearby!',12,0,100,0,0,20951,0,39186,0,'Aronus to Player'),(39128,2,0,'The Firelord has risen!  We must send word to the others.  Let us hurry!',12,0,100,0,0,20952,0,39189,0,'Aronus to Player'),(14908,0,0,'I am going to practice and become a warrior like my father!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10293,0,'Mogg'),(14908,1,0,'Now to find an unsuspecting Harpy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10294,0,'Mogg'),(14908,2,0,'There\'s one! For the Horde!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10295,0,'Mogg'),(14908,3,0,'Take that you mangy Harpy! Hyaa!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10296,0,'Mogg'),(14908,4,0,'You can\'t get away from a warrior of the Horde! Take that! And that!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10297,0,'Mogg'),(14908,5,0,'Now go back home where you belong!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10298,0,'Mogg'),(14908,6,0,'Aaahhh... Another glorious victory for The Horde!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10299,0,'Mogg'),(14908,7,0,'Yes right away momma!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10301,0,'Mogg'),(14908,8,0,'When is poppa coming back from the fights in Warsong? It has been so long...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10303,0,'Mogg'),(14909,0,0,'Mogg, get inside. It is not safe out there while your father is gone.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10300,0,'Pooka'),(14909,1,0,'Soon child... Very soon.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10304,0,'Pooka'),(14872,0,3,'Karu will you please help get these bees off of me? They sting!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,10262,0,'Trok'),(34748,4,0,'Thanks, $n. You still owe me that money, $g man : lady;!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35008,0,'Goblin Survivor to Player'),(34748,5,0,'What, are you crazy?! Trying to blow me to smithereens like that!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35002,0,'Goblin Survivor to Player'),(34748,6,0,'Couldn\'t you have just used a crowbar?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,35006,0,'Goblin Survivor to Player'),(35838,2,0,'Eekum Bokum!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,36346,0,'Pygmy Witchdoctor'),(35918,0,0,'Time to go. I hope that we will meet again, $n.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,36115,0,'Orc Scout to Player'),(35918,1,0,'Do not wait long, Kilag. We will scout ahead.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,36111,0,'Orc Scout to Player'),(36042,4,0,'Lok\'tar!',12,0,100,0,0,4121,0,36602,0,'Orc Scout to Strangle Vine'),(36161,1,0,'Children of the watery depths, lay waste to those who foul your realm!',14,0,100,0,0,20143,0,36200,0,'Thrall'),(38409,11,0,'Mouse-sized beartraps... no... Bear-sized mousetraps!!',14,0,100,0,0,2304,0,37423,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38409,12,0,'Recycling! But, for stuff that\'s never been used before.',14,0,100,0,0,2304,0,37416,0,'Goblin Survivor'),(38745,3,0,'Upside-down boats!  They\'ll never capsize!',14,0,100,0,0,2304,0,37424,0,'Kezan Citizen'),(38746,0,0,'Doc! Help!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38772,0,'Gobber'),(39067,0,0,'They eagerly rush to their deaths. What fools!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,39102,0,'Scout Brax'),(39193,5,0,'You no slave! Work or die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39315,0,'Brute Overseer to Player'),(39193,6,0,'Me overseer, you slave!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39321,0,'Brute Overseer to Player'),(39193,7,0,'Trade Prince say hurt you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39318,0,'Brute Overseer to Player'),(39200,0,0,'Leashes... with pre-attached pets.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37327,0,'Izzy to Player'),(39200,1,0,'Houses made of dirt! When you clean them...THEY\'RE GONE.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37415,0,'Izzy to Player'),(39363,0,0,'I can\'t believe you\'d do this to me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39390,0,'Chip Endale to Player'),(39426,1,0,'I\'ve met cabin boys who were manlier than you. To think I ever wasted my time...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,40623,0,'Candy Cane to Player'),(39456,5,0,'Just open the door... oh no!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39500,0,'Captured Goblin to Player'),(39582,8,0,'Uncle! Uncle! I give! You guys are too much for me!',14,0,100,20,0,19580,0,39542,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix'),(39582,9,0,'I\'m beaten. You\'ve shown me the error of my ways. From here on out, I promise to reform the way the cartel is run!',14,0,100,274,0,19581,0,39536,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix'),(39582,10,0,'I\'m your goblin, Thrall. What would you have of me?',14,0,100,6,0,19582,0,39543,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix'),(39582,11,0,'It will be as you say! Long live the Bilgewater Cartel! For the Horde!',14,0,100,15,0,19583,0,39589,0,'Trade Prince Gallywix to Thrall'),(39594,3,0,'You will have a new home in Azshara and the Bilgewater Cartel will become a part of the Horde!',14,0,100,25,0,20149,0,39588,0,'Thrall to Trade Prince Gallywix'),(18248,0,0,'Grunting, %s turns away from the wanted poster, returning to his warm spot by the fire.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18782,0,'Nekthar'),(18248,1,0,'%s begins to read the wanted poster.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18781,0,'Nekthar'),(18384,0,0,'%s dons his wolf-fur vestments.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17039,0,'Malukaz'),(18384,1,0,'Wolf spirit of the forest, hear me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17044,0,'Malukaz'),(18384,2,0,'Long ago, you were a companion to my people. We gave ourselves to evil and you were forgotten.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17046,0,'Malukaz'),(18384,3,0,'But we have returned, spirit! We have returned to honor you again. Favor us with your presence once more.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17047,0,'Malukaz'),(18384,4,0,'May our bond with you never be broken again, spirit.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17055,0,'Malukaz'),(18384,5,0,'We have done it! Thrall would be proud.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17066,0,'Malukaz'),(19616,0,0,'%s howls in response to Malukaz\'s call.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17051,0,'Terokkar Wolf Spirit'),(19616,1,0,'%s expresses its approval.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17086,0,'Terokkar Wolf Spirit'),(19569,0,0,'I hope those blood elves across the way don\'t think that I\'m spying on them!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16952,0,'Netherologist Coppernickels'),(19569,1,0,'If I were smart, I\'d be selling this research for a seat on the rocket ship.  I have a feeling we\'re going to need to get out of here soon!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16955,0,'Netherologist Coppernickels'),(19569,2,0,'If this is right, we don\'t have long! Oh well.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16953,0,'Netherologist Coppernickels'),(19569,3,0,'This is the last time that I buy second-hand equipment from an ethereal!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,16951,0,'Netherologist Coppernickels'),(27010,0,0,'All these folks are keeping me busy.  Take this horse over to your stables.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,26522,0,'Celidh Aletracker to Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,0,0,'Hey Celidh!  Do you have any pets you want me to take over to the stable?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26428,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,1,0,'Let\'s go boy.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26432,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,2,0,'If I were king, I\'d have a horse like you.  I\'d make sure you didn\'t get lost, and I bet you\'d make sure I never got lost.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26478,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,3,0,'We\'d be best friends.  I bet me and Anduin would also be best friends, too.  Friends are important.  ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26479,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,4,0,'I\'ll take you to some other horses.  You probably miss being around other horses.  They can be your friend too.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26486,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(16580,0,0,'I say we fire it. Cut the rope.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16981,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),(16580,1,0,'You cut the rope. You have the knife.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16983,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),(16580,2,0,'Harumph! Coward.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16982,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),(16580,3,0,'You know, I think we can hit Honor Hold from here.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16986,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),(16580,4,0,'If General Krakork found out, he\'d eat us alive. Don\'t.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16988,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),(16580,5,0,'Ah! We can tell him Hagash stumbled into it and fired it accidentally!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16987,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),(19561,0,0,'I\'m blind, you stupid sow-spawn, not deaf. Don\'t even think about it.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,16990,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),(16580,7,0,'%s sighs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16989,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),(25317,1,0,'This is harder than it looks.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26488,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,1,'Did that seem okay?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26487,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,2,'My arm is getting sore.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26491,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,3,'Hmm....',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26492,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,4,'I think I\'m starting to get the hang of this.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26490,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,5,'This isn\'t easy.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26489,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,2,0,'You aren\'t going to let me sleep are you?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26497,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,2,1,'Are you going to be doing this for much longer?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26502,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,2,2,'Could you try to be a little quieter?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26500,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,3,0,'I just don\'t want to let anyone down.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26494,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,3,1,'I need to do something to keep myself busy.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26495,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,3,2,'I\'m just nervous.  Sorry.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26493,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(29369,1,0,'You\'re not worth the scrap you\'re made from!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,30237,0,'Stormforged Taskmaster'),(29369,1,1,'Your tinker must\'ve made you from tin, you lazy piles of slag!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,30235,0,'Stormforged Taskmaster'),(29369,1,2,'A pack of mechanical squirrels could mine faster than you!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,30233,0,'Stormforged Taskmaster'),(30275,0,0,'%s swipes at you with his claws!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,32763,0,'Wild Wyrm - SAY_SWIPE'),(30275,1,0,'DODGED!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,32794,0,'Wild Wyrm - SAY_DODGED'),(30275,2,0,'%s shrieks in pain and twists around, grabbing you with his mouth!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,32813,0,'Wild Wyrm - SAY_PHASE_2'),(30275,3,0,'Your Grip is Failing!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,32784,0,'Wild Wyrm - SAY_GRIP_WARN'),(30275,4,0,'FATAL STRIKE MISSED! KEEP PRYING!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,32795,0,'Wild Wyrm - SAY_STRIKE_MISS'),(36296,0,0,'Did they bother to tell you who I am and why I am doing this?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,38586,3,'SAY_INTRO_0'),(36296,1,0,'...or are they just using you like they do everybody else?',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,38600,3,'SAY_INTRO_1'),(36296,2,0,'But what does it matter.  It is time for this to end.',12,0,100,397,0,0,0,38591,3,'SAY_INTRO_2'),(36296,3,0,'Baxter! Get in here and help! NOW!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38592,3,'SAY_CALL_BAXTER'),(36296,4,0,'It is time, Frye!  Attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38593,3,'SAY_CALL_FRYE'),(36296,5,0,'...please don\'t think less of me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38597,3,'SAY_HUMMEL_DEATH'),(36272,0,0,'Great. We\'re not gutless, we\'re incompetent.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38596,3,'SAY_FRYE_DEATH'),(36565,0,0,'It has been the greatest honor of my life to serve with you, Hummel.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38595,3,'SAY_BAXTER_DEATH'),(3390,0,0,'%s places the spores within his alchemical instruments...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1076,0,'Apothecary Helbrim'),(3390,1,0,'Ah, good.  These spores have rendered nicely.  Thank you, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1077,0,'Apothecary Helbrim'),(17228,0,0,'How can I be expected to get any work done with that thing spreading its heresy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14383,0,'Draenei Artificer'),(17228,1,0,'%s sighs disgustedly as he turns back to his work.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14384,0,'Draenei Artificer'),(17228,2,0,'Turning to face Tuluun, the %s sneers contemptuously.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14381,0,'Draenei Artificer'),(17228,3,0,'We do not need your kind here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14382,0,'Draenei Artificer'),(17528,0,0,'Fools! Weaklings! Tzerak has no need of your assistance!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14070,1,'Tzerak'),(17663,0,0,'If only I could get back to the mushroom thicket. I have not seen such a mature cluster in my lifetime!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14269,0,'Jessera of Mac\'Aree'),(17703,0,0,'Don\'t you people ever check the mail?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14328,0,'Messenger Hermesius'),(17703,0,1,'How am I expected to deliver all of these messages?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14329,0,'Messenger Hermesius'),(17703,0,2,'I need to be re-assigned. This job is pushing me over the edge...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14330,0,'Messenger Hermesius'),(17703,0,3,'He thinks he\'s so damned important. Always pushing me around... I\'ll show him. I\'ll show all of them!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14332,0,'Messenger Hermesius'),(17703,0,4,'One of these days I\'m going to bust out the crystalline doomhammer and go positively orc on this town. Then they\'ll be sorry...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14331,0,'Messenger Hermesius'),(19847,0,0,'%s reads from the book of the dead.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17446,0,'Levixus'),(19847,1,0,'Shane Dabiri, Lee, Alex T., Rob F., J. A. B.,  A. Mayberry!',12,8,100,15,0,0,0,17454,0,'Levixus'),(19847,1,1,'Jeffrey Kaplan! Tom Chilton! Rob Pardo!',12,8,100,15,0,0,0,17447,0,'Levixus'),(19847,1,2,'Justin Thavirat! Roman Kenney! Our entire awesome art and animation team!',12,8,100,15,0,0,0,17448,0,'Levixus'),(19847,1,3,'Kevin Jordan and Jonathan LeCraft!',12,8,100,15,0,0,0,17453,0,'Levixus'),(19847,1,4,'CHRIS METZEN!',12,8,100,15,0,0,0,17449,0,'Levixus'),(19847,1,5,'Pat Nagle! World design team! Cory Stockton, Paul C., Jim Chadwick, Staats, Ed Hanes, Morris, Gotcher, Jesse!, Sarah B., Victor C., Dave A.! All of our amazing exterior artists!',12,8,100,15,0,0,0,17450,0,'Levixus'),(19847,1,6,'Scott Mercer! Geoff, Wyatt, Joe, Travis, Kris, Steven! Brazie!',12,8,100,15,0,0,0,17451,0,'Levixus'),(19847,1,7,'Luis, Brianna and Eric! Blizzard QA team! Of course our fans!',12,8,100,15,0,0,0,17452,0,'Levixus'),(21134,0,0,'A deep, bone chilling voice echoes from the %s...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,18774,0,'Eye of the Citadel'),(21134,1,0,'How dare you trifle with my playthings, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18775,0,'Eye of the Citadel'),(21134,2,0,'The orcs in my citadel will drink your blood and dovour you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18776,0,'Eye of the Citadel'),(22011,0,0,'And... if we do not?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19695,0,'Corok the Mighty'),(22012,0,0,'Lend us the strength of the giants of Shadowmoon, Corok. The master is a just ruler. He will be sure to take care of those that assisted in subduing the dissidents of this world.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19693,0,'Chancellor Bloodleaf'),(22012,1,0,'Then you become enemies of my lord, Illidan. Enemies of Illidan are destroyed. Are your giants able to withstand an attack from the forces of Eclipse Point?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19696,0,'Chancellor Bloodleaf'),(22012,2,0,'No... I did not think so...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19697,0,'Chancellor Bloodleaf'),(25274,0,0,'Keep \'em hot you big dummy!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25133,0,'Armorer Orkuruk'),(25274,0,1,'Those weapons ain\'t gonna build themselves! Faster!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25134,0,'Armorer Orkuruk'),(25274,0,2,'You call that a hammer strike? What kind of amateurs am I workin\' with here?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25135,0,'Armorer Orkuruk'),(25274,0,3,'You keep that garbage up and I\'ll ship you back to your momma in a box with a note strapped to your chest that reads: FAILURE.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25136,0,'Armorer Orkuruk'),(25274,0,4,'And WHAT are our soldiers supposed to do with that shoddy piece of junk?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25137,0,'Armorer Orkuruk'),(25274,0,5,'You\'re an embarassment to this entire operation! Pack up your stuff and get out!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,25138,0,'Armorer Orkuruk'),(25289,0,0,'Aye, solja! Lift off time!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24521,0,'Wind Master To\'bor'),(25286,0,0,'Yes sir!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24522,0,'Warsong Wind Rider'),(27299,0,0,'Tell me if this hurts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26296,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27299,0,1,'Let\'s try this one out...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26298,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27299,0,2,'I think I\'ve got it this time..',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26297,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27299,1,0,'How\'d that feel?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26299,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27299,1,1,'Was that potent enough?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26302,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27299,1,2,'Do you think that will get some answers?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26300,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27299,2,0,'Hmm...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26304,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27299,2,1,'True, our enemies would show us no mercy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26320,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27299,2,2,'True, but how far should we push?  At what point are we no better than our enemies?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26319,0,'Initiate Greer'),(27300,0,0,'You need more bite.  Do not show our enemies any mercy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26305,0,'Initiate Vernon'),(27300,0,1,'The more pain we can inflict, the quicker we can get our answers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26306,0,'Initiate Vernon'),(25379,1,0,'Look at \'em, Ug. You know what those are?',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,24631,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,2,0,'Those...',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,24633,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,3,0,'Those are cowards.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24634,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,4,0,'%s shakes his head.',16,1,100,274,0,0,0,24636,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,5,0,'No, blood of my blood, they are soldiers of the Alliance. Our sworn enemies.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24637,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,6,0,'They are here because they do not wish to defend their homes... their families...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24639,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,7,0,'They have given up and surrendered - willingly - to us.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24640,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,8,0,'Ug\'thor, they are afraid to die.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24641,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,9,0,'%s laughs.',16,1,100,11,0,0,0,24646,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,10,0,'That\'s right, Ug. Victory or death!',12,1,100,273,0,0,0,24647,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25379,11,0,'[In Broken Common] Hear boy, cowards? Boy die! Boy die for freedom!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,24648,0,'Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,0,0,'No, popo. They look kind of like the pigs. Are they pigs?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24632,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,1,0,'Are they cowardly pigs, popo?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24635,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,2,0,'But popo, what are they afraid of? Why are they here?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24638,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,3,0,'%s scratches his head.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24642,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,4,0,'I... I don\'t understand, popo.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24643,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,5,0,'%s puffs out his chest and stands on his tip-toes.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24644,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,6,0,'Lok\'tar ogar, popo!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24645,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(28357,4,2,'Another failure...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27861,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,4,1,'Useless...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27862,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,4,0,'Pathetic...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27865,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,3,1,'Listen, death knight... Listen for the voice of your master. He calls to you now.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27884,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,3,0,'Stand and be measured! Rise, for your master awaits your arrival. Go now!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27883,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,2,0,'Place upon it the trappings befitting a herald of Arthas.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27873,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,4,'A harbinger of death is reborn...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27872,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,3,'Marvel at its tenacity and vigor! A champion has been found!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27868,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,2,'CHAOS! DOOM! DESTRUCTION! This one will claim them all!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27871,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,1,'Amidst the wretch, a champion has been found.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27870,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,0,'The Lich King will be pleased with this initiate.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27869,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,0,0,'This one...',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,27876,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28383,0,0,'Yes, instructor.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27874,0,'Acherus Necromancer'),(28383,0,1,'Right away, instructor.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27881,0,'Acherus Necromancer'),(28383,1,0,'Rise, minions. Rise and feast upon the weak!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,27875,0,'Acherus Necromancer'),(28391,0,0,'I return from the grave to do my master\'s bidding.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27880,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,0,1,'The voice... such splendor... Arthas... My king....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27879,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,0,2,'Reborn, I shall become an instrument of doom...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27878,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,0,3,'Dark energy courses through me... Such power! I hunger for more!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27877,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,1,0,'Death to all that oppose us!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,27888,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,1,1,'Victory to the Scourge!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,27887,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,1,2,'I live only to serve the Lich King!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,27886,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,1,3,'As you command, instructor!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,27885,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,2,0,'Woe unto those that dare oppose the Scourge!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30176,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,2,1,'I am reborn, my king, only to serve you.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30179,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,2,2,'I am an instrument of your destruction, my king! Command me!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30175,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,2,3,'Our enemies will be annihilated!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30177,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,2,4,'A thousand-thousand lives I will sacrifice for you, my lord.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30172,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,2,5,'I am yours to command, my king!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30173,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,2,6,'There will be no survivors, my lord.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30180,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28391,2,7,'My king, the world will tremble in reverence...',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30174,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28394,0,2,'I hurt... suffering unbearable... end my pain... I beg of you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27859,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28394,0,1,'Who... who are you? Who... what am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27858,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28394,0,0,'Where am I? What is this place?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27856,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28472,0,0,'As disciples of blood, you strive to master the very lifeforce of your enemies.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29867,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28472,1,0,'Be it by blade or incantation, blood feeds our attacks and weakens our foes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29868,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28472,2,0,'True masters learn to make blood serve more than just their strength in battle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29869,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28472,3,0,'Stripping energy from our foes, both fighting and fallen, allows us to persevere where lesser beigns falls exhausted.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29870,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28472,4,0,'And every foe that falls, energy sapped and stolen, only further fuels our assault.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29871,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28472,5,0,'As masters of blood, we know battle without end...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29872,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28472,6,0,'We know hunger never to be quenched...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29873,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28472,7,0,'We know power never to be overcome...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29874,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28472,8,0,'As masters of blood, we are masters of life and death itself. Agains us, even hope falls drained and lifeless.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29875,0,'Lord Thorval'),(28890,0,1,'You will fly again, beast...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29043,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),(28890,1,0,'Surprise, surprise! Another ghoul!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29038,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),(28890,1,1,'Is Gothik the Harvester going to have to choke a geist?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29037,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),(28890,2,0,'Death is the only escape!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29039,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),(28897,0,0,'So hungry...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28955,0,'Scarlet Ghoul'),(28897,0,1,'Must feed...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28956,0,'Scarlet Ghoul'),(28897,0,2,'Smell flesh... close...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28958,0,'Scarlet Ghoul'),(29113,0,2,'The Highlord has requested more abominations!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,29635,0,'Noth the Plaguebringer'),(16502,0,0,'Oh no!  I\'m losing this one!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,13113,0,'Zalduun'),(29429,0,0,'Is it true?! Has someone finally come to get me out of this place?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30198,0,'Janks'),(29429,1,0,'No... no... that\'s not it, is it? That heartless lout probably sent you after the tools, didn\'t he?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30199,0,'Janks'),(29429,2,0,'Well... I guess I\'ll just keep an eye on the turrets... or something.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30200,0,'Janks'),(29429,3,0,'%s sighs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,30201,0,'Janks'),(29643,4,0,'Keep it to yourself.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30291,0,'Bailey'),(29643,5,0,'You better hope they don\'t survive it, lad.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30292,0,'Bailey'),(29643,6,0,'Cause I\'m just going to watch and laugh as they toss you in.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30293,0,'Bailey'),(29643,7,0,'There\'s got to be a way in somewhere.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30294,0,'Bailey'),(29643,8,0,'How\'d the goblin leave his tools there then?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30295,0,'Bailey'),(29643,9,0,'That\'s it, lad! It looks totally safe. Go for it, I\'ll be right behind ya!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30296,0,'Bailey'),(29643,10,0,'Pansy.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30312,0,'Bailey'),(29644,4,0,'That was close! You scared me.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30311,0,'Bellinger'),(29644,5,0,'I\'ve got an idea, Bailey...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30299,0,'Bellinger'),(29644,6,0,'No, no - this might work!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30300,0,'Bellinger'),(29644,7,0,'There\'s a path right there... only a few mines at the end in between us and the tools.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30301,0,'Bellinger'),(29644,8,0,'We wait for the next adventurer to come through and we tell him that\'s the way to go... then after they set off the mines, we just walk in and grab the tools!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30302,0,'Bellinger'),(29644,9,0,'It really doesn\'t look like it, Bailey.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30303,0,'Bellinger'),(29644,10,0,'Oh... good point. How about right there? That looks clear... kind of.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30304,0,'Bellinger'),(29644,11,0,'Uh... that\'s okay. It still kind of hurts from last time.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30305,0,'Bellinger'),(25258,0,0,'One last drink before we head to the front?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24475,0,'Footman Rob'),(25258,1,0,'Barkeep!  Bring out your strongest ale.  We\'re off to the front.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24478,0,'Footman Rob'),(25258,2,0,'You\'ll surely make an exception for us, eh?  We might not come back.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24479,0,'Footman Rob'),(25258,3,0,'I guess that\'s it then.  Off we go.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24482,0,'Footman Rob'),(25259,0,0,'Sure, why not?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,24476,0,'Footman George'),(25261,0,0,'That was the worst beer I\'ve ever had.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24483,0,'Footman Chuck'),(25260,0,0,'Hey, guys!  Wait up!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24761,0,'Footman Mitch'),(25245,0,0,'You lads know the drill.  No alcohol to servicemen on duty.  You want the general to kill me himself?',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,24744,0,'James Deacon'),(25245,1,0,'All right, all right... but you didn\'t get these from me!',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,24745,0,'James Deacon'),(25678,1,2,'Live, damn you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24868,0,'Part of the Doctor Razorgin ooc lines'),(4500,0,0,'Puny $r wanna fight Overlord Mok\'Morokk? Me beat you! Me boss here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1515,0,'Overlord Mok\'Morokk - on Quest Accept'),(4500,2,0,'Me still boss of ogres. Haw!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,1514,0,'Overlord Mok\'Morokk'),(122450,0,0,'Enemy combatants detected. Threat level nominal.',14,0,100,0,0,86397,0,132426,0,'Garothi Worldbreaker - Aggro'),(122450,1,0,'Targets cleared.',14,0,100,0,0,86401,0,132427,0,'Garothi Worldbreaker - Evade 1'),(122450,1,1,'Enemy combatants neutralized.',14,0,100,0,0,86974,0,135270,0,'Garothi Worldbreaker - Evade 2'),(122450,1,2,'No hostile targets remaining. Continuing patrol.',14,0,100,0,0,86975,0,135271,0,'Garothi Worldbreaker - Evade 3'),(122450,2,0,'|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_BossFelMagnaron_HandEmpowered.blp:20|t %s is powering the |cFFF000