4,0,'Tosamina'),(14498,0,2,'Clean this place up! We will not live in such squalor.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,9695,0,'Tosamina'),(14498,0,3,'It\'s my way or the Gold Road.  Is that understood?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,9696,0,'Tosamina'),(325,0,3,'When will someone do something about the undead?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,961,0,'Hogan Ference'),(325,0,4,'Where is everyone?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,962,0,'Hogan Ference'),(325,0,5,'I can\'t even visit my father\'s grave in peace anymore.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,963,0,'Hogan Ference'),(264,0,0,'Stay on the roads.  The forest is overrun with undead.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,61,0,'Commander Althea Ebonlocke'),(264,0,1,'Fear not.  The Night Watch will rid the land of this foul taint soon enough.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,62,0,'Commander Althea Ebonlocke'),(263,0,1,'The Night Watch alone cannot protect us forever.  We need the backing of the Stormwind Army.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,64,0,'Lord Ello Ebonlocke'),(270,0,1,'The forest is crawling with worgen and ghouls.  Something must be done!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,66,0,'Councilman Millstipe'),(265,0,0,'I sense evil brewing. . . .',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,73,0,'Madame Eva'),(265,0,1,'The stars speak to me.  They whisper of the horrors waiting in the night.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,74,0,'Madame Eva'),(265,0,2,'The future holds much death and uncertainty, not unlike the past.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,75,0,'Madame Eva'),(265,0,3,'The spirits whisper in my ear.  They are restless and full of angst.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,76,0,'Madame Eva'),(276,0,0,'The stars will be in perfect form tonight!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,77,0,'Viktori Prism\'Antras'),(276,0,1,'There is something greater than magic at work in the night sky.  One day they\'ll listen to me. . . .',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,79,0,'Viktori Prism\'Antras'),(14497,0,0,'It\'s so sad for you poor children.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,9689,0,'Shellene'),(14497,0,1,'Now children stop that!  I mean it!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,9690,0,'Shellene'),(14497,0,2,'All will be well children.  The Light shall see to that!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,9691,0,'Shellene'),(14497,0,3,'I believe you children are our future...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,9692,0,'Shellene'),(273,0,0,'This dark taint is downright bad for business.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,82,0,'Tavernkeep Smitts'),(3658,0,0,'Best weapons in the Barrens here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1212,0,'Lizzarik'),(3658,0,1,'Step right up! Finest selection of weapons this side of Ashenvale!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1213,0,'Lizzarik'),(3658,0,2,'Lizzarik has blades. Lizzarik has maces. Lizzarik has all your weapon needs right here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1214,0,'Lizzarik'),(3658,0,3,'Act quick! Once it\'s gone, it\'s gone! Get your weapons here now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1215,0,'Lizzarik'),(3627,0,7,'Ask me how to get a free drink at the Blue Recluse!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1192,0,'Erich Lohan'),(2080,7,0,'%s examines the Moss-twined Heart...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1126,0,'Denalan'),(2080,8,0,'$n, underneath the moss, this heart looks like a seed!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1127,0,'Denalan'),(2080,9,0,'Let\'s try planting it in some of my special, prepared soil...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1128,0,'Denalan'),(1657,1,0,'Mother, oh mother.  You should have listened to me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,572,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1657,1,1,'They thought I was weak.  Haha!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,567,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1657,1,2,'I am the head of the family.  Me.  ME!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,568,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1657,1,3,'I\'m cold, lord.  When will you keep your promise?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,569,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1657,1,4,'My family hates me.  Frightened idiots, all of them!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,570,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1657,1,5,'Father?  Are you proud of me now? HAHAH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,571,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1657,1,6,'Thurman my brother, who\'s laughing now?  Hah!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,573,0,'Devlin Agamand'),(1263,0,1,'Why do you run from me, Fluffy?!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,160,0,'Yarlyn Amberstill'),(1263,0,2,'Cmon, Fluffy! I just want to give you a bath!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,161,0,'Yarlyn Amberstill'),(1263,0,3,'Fluffy! Fluffy, stop running!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,162,0,'Yarlyn Amberstill'),(1263,0,4,'Carrots every day for a year if you stop!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,164,0,'Yarlyn Amberstill'),(1263,0,5,'Don	 make me get my pappy to catch you! He likes to catch bunnies using his rifle!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,165,0,'Yarlyn Amberstill'),(2616,0,0,'Where in the Outlands are those shipments? For days they keep me waiting!',14,7,100,5,0,0,0,737,0,'Privateer Groy'),(2616,0,1,'Stupidity! I\'m surrounded by stupidity!',14,7,100,5,0,0,0,738,0,'Privateer Groy'),(2616,0,2,'Orcs are smarter than those couriers! Where the blazes are they?',14,7,100,5,0,0,0,739,0,'Privateer Groy'),(3626,0,0,'%s returns the rude gesture to $n.',16,0,100,14,0,0,0,1521,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,1,0,'What can I do for you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1529,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,1,1,'What do you fancy, $g sir:miss,',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1530,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,1,2,'Been a tough day? A nice ale should loosen those worries right up.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1531,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,1,3,'Well hello, $n, what can I get you today?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1532,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,1,4,'Hi, What would you like?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1533,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,1,5,'Good day, $c. What would you like?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1534,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,1,6,'Look what the cat dragged in. What can I get you, $n?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1535,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,1,7,'Do you think I need more pieces of flair?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1536,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,2,0,'Feeling hot? Get something to cool you off down at the Pig and Whistle!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1200,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,2,1,'Nightly brawls and great drinks! Get it all at the Pig and Whistle!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1201,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,2,2,'Get a free beer at the Pig and Whistle!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1202,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,2,3,'Talk to me for a free beer at the Pig and Whistle!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1203,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,2,4,'Smoother than and elf, stronger than an orc! No better drinks in all of Stormwind!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1205,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,2,5,'Tired of all those pansy spellcaster drinks? Try something stronger at the Pig and Whistle!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1206,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,2,6,'Back from a long journey? Rest and relax at the Pig and Whistle!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1207,0,'Jenn Langston'),(3626,2,7,'Best drinks in Stormwind!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1208,0,'Jenn Langston'),(1328,0,0,'%s returns the rude gesture to $n.',16,0,100,14,0,0,0,1521,0,'Elly Langston'),(1328,1,0,'What can I do for you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1529,0,'Elly Langston'),(1328,1,1,'What do you fancy, $g sir:miss,',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1530,0,'Elly Langston'),(1328,1,2,'Been a tough day? A nice ale should loosen those worries right up.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1531,0,'Elly Langston'),(1328,1,3,'Well hello, $n, what can I get you today?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1532,0,'Elly Langston'),(1328,1,4,'Hi, What would you like?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1533,0,'Elly Langston'),(1328,1,5,'Good day, $c. What would you like?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1534,0,'Elly Langston'),(1328,1,6,'Look what the cat dragged in. What can I get you, $n?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1535,0,'Elly Langston'),(1328,1,7,'Do you think I need more pieces of flair?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1536,0,'Elly Langston'),(1378,1,0,'Do you ever think about anything other than fighting? I could circle you down on the stretch course!',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,234,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1378,2,0,'Argh! You\'re hopeless!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,236,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1378,3,0,'Ah, let me see. Yes probably nearing a hundred times now I\'d wager!',12,7,100,273,0,0,0,238,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1378,4,0,'I would have just dropped some Evershine in my tank and been back home before they realized I\'d gone!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,240,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1378,5,0,'Hey Stone, let\'s hit the circuit some time. We could run a few laps and see who wins?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,242,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1378,6,0,'Nothing you can say will ever get me in the arena against that monstrosity of a machine you call a steam tank!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,245,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1378,7,0,'Ha! I\'m more afraid that those old holes and gashes would burst that thing and I would be showered by the shrapnel!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,247,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1378,8,0,'Nothing beats the sound of a twin-carb, fork-ring steam engine burning pure firestone!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,249,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1378,9,0,'Bah! You wouldn\'t know a great steam engine if it smacked you upside the head!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,251,0,'Pilot Bellowfiz'),(1377,0,0,'Ah yes. I\'ve heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,233,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,1,0,'Bah! By the time you got in range of old Trollplow you would be in reduced to rubble!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,235,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,2,0,'Hey Fizzer, I ever tell you the time I was riding through the canals and some goblins in shredder suits tried to ambush me?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,237,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,3,0,'Brahaha! Tha look on their faces as old Trollplow\'s gun came swiveling around to meet them! Their saws couldn\'t even touch me!',12,7,100,11,0,0,0,239,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,4,0,'Bah! That\'s no fun!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,241,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,5,0,'Aye sure, just as long as we get to hit the arena right after!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,244,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,6,0,'Har! You scared I\'ll hurt your little dainty racer?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,246,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,7,0,'Haha! Sturdy old Trollplow has just a few meager battle scars!',12,7,100,11,0,0,0,248,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,8,0,'Ha! I\'d take the sound of a Crater Cannon XT blasting off a shell over that any day!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,250,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,9,0,'Maybe, but if it did hit me upside the head I\'d know exactly which cannon to use to blow it into the smallest bits!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,252,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1364,0,1,'$n!  Betrayer of Ragnaros!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,449,0,'Balgaras the Foul'),(1364,0,2,'The Dark Iron Dwarves shall reclaim their rightful lands!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,450,0,'Balgaras the Foul'),(1364,0,3,'Foolish $C!  You are no match for the minions of Ragnaros!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,451,0,'Balgaras the Foul'),(1364,0,4,'A worthless $R such as you, $n, has no right to walk these lands!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,452,0,'Balgaras the Foul'),(1364,0,5,'$n!  Prepare to meet your doom!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,453,0,'Balgaras the Foul'),(1364,0,6,'Who is this weak $C who challenges my might?  Die fool!',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,454,0,'Balgaras the Foul'),(1364,0,7,'I am Balgaras the Foul.  And you, $n, are about to become nothing more than ash and dust.',12,6,100,0,0,0,0,456,0,'Balgaras the Foul'),(2700,0,0,'%s begins to search through the badges of fallen Stromgarde defenders...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,873,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,1,0,'Privates Marcus, Tremane, Osgood, Lampret...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,874,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,1,1,'Privates Fontane, MacDugal, Wilcott...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,875,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,1,2,'Privates Theoric, Kitrin, Blythe, Agmond...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,876,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,1,3,'Privates Horus, Tilling, Rockwell...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,877,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,2,0,'...Sampson, Yorick, Chamley...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,878,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,2,1,'Clemens, Bartholemew, Enderman, Wyles...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,879,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,2,2,'Tormil, Gamlor, Shefferd, Cowry...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,880,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,2,3,'Martens, Reblock, Adinay, Nikeson...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,881,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,3,0,'%s sighs...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,882,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,4,0,'So many lost.  And so many more we must lose before this battle ends.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,883,0,'Captain Nials'),(2700,5,0,'Thank you for these badges, $n.  I will send news to the families of the deceased.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,884,0,'Captain Nials'),(2768,4,1,'Help!! I told you this place was cursed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,858,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe'),(2634,0,0,'Thank you again for your aid. May the wind always be at your back during your travels.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,765,0,'Princess Poobah'),(11917,0,1,'Yiieeeee! Me run!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1864,0,'Gogger Geomancer'),(11917,0,2,'No kill me! No kill me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1863,0,'Gogger Geomancer'),(11918,0,0,'You no take candle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1868,0,'Gogger Stonepounder'),(11918,0,1,'Yiieeeee! Me run!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1864,0,'Gogger Stonepounder'),(11918,0,2,'No kill me! No kill me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1863,0,'Gogger Stonepounder'),(14748,0,0,'Another fool falls for the trap!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10003,0,'Vilebranch Kidnapper'),(14748,0,1,'Dinner has arrived!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10004,0,'Vilebranch Kidnapper'),(14748,0,2,'The High Priestess will feast on your bones!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10005,0,'Vilebranch Kidnapper'),(679,0,0,'Raaar!!! Me smash $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1927,0,'Mosh\'Ogg Shaman'),(679,0,1,'Me smash! You die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1926,0,'Mosh\'Ogg Shaman'),(679,0,2,'I\'ll crush you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1925,0,'Mosh\'Ogg Shaman'),(710,0,0,'Raaar!!! Me smash $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1927,0,'Mosh\'Ogg Spellcrafter'),(710,0,1,'Me smash! You die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1926,0,'Mosh\'Ogg Spellcrafter'),(710,0,2,'I\'ll crush you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1925,0,'Mosh\'Ogg Spellcrafter'),(295,1,0,'So much to do, so much to do!  Where does the time go?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,86,0,'Innkeeper Farley'),(295,1,1,'If your glass is full may it be again!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,84,0,'Innkeeper Farley'),(346,0,0,'Pull up a stool and have a drink!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,47,0,'Barkeep Daniels'),(346,0,1,'The bottles are dusty but the liquor goes down clean!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,48,0,'Barkeep Daniels'),(11075,0,0,'$R flesh... must feed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6494,0,'Cauldron Lord Bilemaw'),(11076,0,0,'The Scourge beckons you, foolish $r.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6496,0,'Cauldron Lord Razarch'),(11077,0,0,'Who dares to approach this cauldron?  Taste my dark blade!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6495,0,'Cauldron Lord Malvinious'),(11078,0,0,'$C - I will consume your light!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,6497,0,'Cauldron Lord Soulwrath'),(18929,2,0,