liver the good news.',12,0,100,0,0,153036,0,0,0,''),(153211,1,0,'Hah! There! Come on, let\'s get outta here while we can!',12,0,100,0,0,152954,0,0,0,''),(156891,0,0,'All right, let\'s see what we can find.',12,0,100,0,0,153011,0,178906,0,'Bjorn Stouthands to Player'),(156929,0,0,'You saved my life! Allow me to return the favor. Hop on!',12,0,100,0,0,152936,0,0,0,''),(156943,0,0,'If ye feel a strange tingle, that means the illusion is working!',12,0,100,0,0,152955,0,0,0,''),(156954,0,0,'Thank you for saving me... but we still need to stop Gor\'groth!',12,0,100,0,0,153064,0,0,0,''),(166814,0,0,'I concede! Your strength will see our mission through.',12,0,100,4,0,156976,0,195857,0,'Horde Sparing Partner'),(157313,1,0,'Excellent, the fruition of our work may come sooner than I expected!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Foul-Tongue Cyrlix'),(157540,1,0,'Leaving already?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Wing Guard Alamar'),(157669,3,0,'For eternal glory!',12,0,100,0,0,150135,0,0,0,'Steelskin Vanguard to Secutor Mevix'),(157669,4,0,'I fought... to... the end...',12,0,100,0,0,150147,0,0,0,'Steelskin Vanguard to Serafk'),(157669,5,0,'The war... goes on...',12,0,100,0,0,150151,0,0,0,'Steelskin Vanguard to Player'),(157669,6,0,'Glorious battle!',12,0,100,0,0,150139,0,0,0,'Steelskin Vanguard to Player'),(157671,0,0,'You have met your match!',12,0,100,0,0,152327,0,0,0,'Prime Bladeguard to Steelskin Vanguard'),(157676,10,0,'Gah! Well, I forged it... but clearly you are the only one meant to wield it. Go on, then.',12,0,100,1,0,166616,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Guardian of the Blade'),(157676,9,0,'The enchantment\'s final guardian! Vanquish it and claim your runeblade!',12,0,100,0,0,166615,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Fragmented Echo'),(157676,8,0,'Just how many souls did he forge into this thing?!',12,0,100,1,0,166614,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Ephemeral Warrior'),(157676,7,0,'Keep those things off me while I work! This is a test of your skills as well as mine!',12,0,100,1,0,166613,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(157676,6,0,'Ah, he enchanted the blade. Of course he did. You might want to get ready for a fight.',12,0,100,0,0,166612,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(157676,5,0,'The Primus may have taught me a lot about the forge, but I\'ve learned a thing or two myself since then!',12,0,100,1,0,166611,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(157676,4,0,'Well? Are you ready to start or not?',12,0,100,1,0,166610,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(157676,3,0,'Hmm. Whatever his reason, a blade\'s no good without a hilt. Time to get to work.',12,0,100,1,0,166608,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(157676,2,0,'So this was the cause of all that commotion. A blade and a message from the Primus himself...',12,0,100,1,0,169257,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(157676,0,0,'Hmph. Can\'t you see I\'m busy?',12,0,100,1,0,166605,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(157676,1,0,'Is that... it can\'t be...',12,0,100,432,0,166606,0,0,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(158004,0,0,'Â¡Kala, pÃ³rtate bien! No $ulo:la; muerdas. Tal vez vino a ayudar.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zosime to Player'),(158004,1,0,'Ten paciencia, Kala. $n pronto regresarÃ¡ con tus juguetes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Zosime to Player'),(158005,1,0,'Gracias, $Uforastero:forastera;. Que la Arconte te guÃ­e.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Tamesis to Player'),(158007,0,0,'First you bring war, now a blade of the Primus. Your legend grows, mortal!',12,0,100,0,0,165006,0,0,0,'Margrave Krexus to Player'),(158078,2,0,'The legacy of Agthia is one to be experienced. When you are ready, ring the vesper to my right.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Keeper Mnemis'),(158078,3,0,'Agthia was the Paragon of Courage many eons ago. Take your time exploring the gardens and experiencing her legacy.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Keeper Mnemis'),(158084,2,0,'I follow in your path, Agthia. Selflessness. Faith. Service.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,0,0,'Contemplative Student to Player'),(158084,3,0,'The Void could have destroyed all of Bastion... all of the Shadowland