5522,0,6,'You\'ve strayed too far from your comfortable soil, $r.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24852,0,'Skadir Raider'),(25521,1,0,'You may have survived for our amusement, but now, you shall die at our hands!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24819,0,'Skadir Longboatsman'),(10741,0,0,'%s answers the call of Shy-Rotam.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6040,0,'Sian-Rotam'),(25032,0,5,'If it weren\'t for $n, we\'d all be long dead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24099,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,6,'$n, thank you again for helping us. We couldn\'t have achieved any of this without you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24100,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,7,'$Three cheers for $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24102,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,8,'It\'s an honor to serve with you, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24103,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,9,'If I were one of those Dawnblade blood elves, I\'d be swimming away from the island now that $n is here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24106,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,10,'How many wretched do you think $n has put out of their misery?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24107,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,11,'Snap to attention, $n, one of our finest, is here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24108,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,12,'Welcome back, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24110,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,13,'There\'s our $g hero : heroine; right there! How are you doing, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24111,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,14,'I guarantee that without $n, this whole offensive would have been a failure.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24112,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,15,'No matter what, your efforts will always be exalted here, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24113,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,16,'Lay waste to the demons on the Dead Scar lately, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24115,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,17,'$n, one of these days I want to buy you a drink.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24116,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,18,'$n, you have no idea what a relief it is to see you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24119,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,19,'What a coincidence... we were just talking about you, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24120,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,20,'Who needs sentries? $n is here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24121,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,21,'Hey, $n, try to leave some of the glory for us, would ya?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24122,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,22,'Do not fight the enemy unprepared, $n.  I can provide you with very powerful items... provided you have proven yourself to us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24302,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(25032,0,23,'I don\'t even want to think about what\'ll happen here if $n ever decides not to come back.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24117,0,'Eldara Dawnrunner'),(24035,1,6,'You saved my life!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22651,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(24035,1,7,'Thank goodness for you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22652,0,'Gjalerbron Prisoner'),(18174,1,0,'Who do they think they are?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14820,0,'Initiate Colin'),(18174,0,2,'Still, the Blood Knights will endure through this loss. We have no other choice... we must find another source.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14840,0,'Initiate Colin'),(18174,0,1,'Is... it true, what I\'ve heard?  That it was the Sun King himself?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14839,0,'Initiate Colin'),(18174,0,0,'Lady Liadrin is bound to find a way. She must.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14838,0,'Initiate Colin'),(18175,1,2,'I\'m quickly tiring of the haughty attitude I receive from those grubby bowslingers outside.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14819,0,'Initiate Emeline'),(18175,0,0,'Matters are so uncertain now that the chamber below is empty...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14831,0,'Initiate Emeline'),(18175,0,1,'It\'s gone. I can\'t believe it\'s gone. Who would have thought we\'d be betrayed like this?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14833,0,'Initiate Emeline'),(18175,1,0,'Our neighbors are positively laughable. Have you seen the way they turn up their noses at us?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14815,0,'Initiate Emeline'),(18175,1,1,'The rangers certainly have a high opinion of themselves.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14818,0,'Initiate Emeline'),(24035,1,4,'My thanks to you, hero!'