r stick close to me, kid.',12,0,100,1,0,157215,0,0,0,'Corcho Silbapum to Player'),(168462,1,0,'Time is money, $n. Let\'s go!',12,0,100,1,0,157214,0,0,0,'Corcho Silbapum to Player'),(166573,0,0,'We need to be ready for anything. Show me your skill in combat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195834,0,'Breka Grimaxe to Player'),(166573,1,0,'Throg will spar with you for now. I must speak to the crew about the rain.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,199040,0,'Breka Grimaxe to Player'),(166573,2,0,'$n! You survived! We need to regroup at once.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195918,0,'Breka Grimaxe to Player'),(166573,3,0,'Fine work. Next, we... rain? Our shaman said the skies would be clear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195844,0,'Breka Grimaxe to Player'),(166573,4,0,'Soldiers, brace yourselves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195893,0,'Breka Grimaxe to Player'),(166854,0,0,'Shuja said... you\'d be comin\'...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195978,0,'Won\'sa to Warlord Breka Grimaxe'),(166854,1,0,'We got ambushed... by da quilboar...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196667,0,'Won\'sa to Warlord Breka Grimaxe'),(166854,2,0,'So... hungry...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195968,0,'Won\'sa to Player'),(166906,0,0,'She\'s my daughter. Nothing could keep me from her.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195979,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Won\'sa'),(166906,1,0,'And as a soldier of the Horde, she knows we leave no one behind.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195980,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Won\'sa'),(166906,2,0,'Recruit. Quilboar pose a far greater threat than murlocs. You must be ready to face them in battle.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195981,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Player'),(166906,3,0,'Your next lesson begins now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195985,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Player'),(166906,4,0,'Eat first. I won\'t let you starve to death.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196668,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Player'),(166786,0,0,'My thanks. We\'ll find the expedition yet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195930,0,'Bo to Player'),(166791,0,0,'Mark my words, that storm was unnatural.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,195932,0,'Mithdran Rastrealba to Player'),(166796,0,0,'Quite