. That ain\'t right. Let\'s see... just gotta... there! Try it now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196329,0,'Cork Fizzlepop to Player'),(167019,6,0,'Oh ho! Who needs a giant boar when we can do THAT? Here, try it again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196340,0,'Cork Fizzlepop to Player'),(167019,7,0,'Now that\'s what I\'m talking about! Let\'s get back to Grimaxe.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196341,0,'Cork Fizzlepop to Player'),(167019,8,0,'You must be Warlord Breka! Shuja\'s mother! She always said you\'d save our hides.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196270,0,'Cork Fizzlepop to Player'),(167019,9,0,'No idea... but I\'ve got a way to find out!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196272,0,'Cork Fizzlepop to Warlord Breka Grimaxe'),(167021,0,0,'We\'re not safe just yet. Where are the others?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196271,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Cork Fizzlepop'),(167126,0,0,'Mother... I tried to stop the ogres on my own. But I failed. My strength was not enough.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196389,0,'Shuja Grimaxe to Warlord Breka Grimaxe'),(167126,1,0,'Mother! I failed... the Horde...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196369,0,'Shuja Grimaxe to Warlord Breka Grimaxe'),(167145,0,0,'Wretched ogre. Let\'s check on Shuja.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196370,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Shuja Grimaxe'),(167145,1,0,'Shuja, the Horde is strong not when we fight alone, but when we stand united. Now, tell me what\'s happened here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196390,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Shuja Grimaxe'),(167145,2,0,'Hang on, Shuja! Recruit, with me! Lok-tar ogar!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196368,0,'Warlord Breka Grimaxe to Shuja Grimaxe'),(167219,0,0,'I will join Bo farther north, where the harpies roost. Meet me there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196484,0,'Shuja Grimaxe to Player'),(167219,1,0,'Herbert. He\'s probably taking notes.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196487,0,'Shuja Grimaxe to Bo'),(167291,0,0,'They seem to have captured a Forsaken prisoner for their ritual.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196486,0,'Bo to Shuja Grimaxe'),(167291,1,0,'Count me in!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196490,0,'Bo to Shuja Grimaxe'),(167182,0,0,'A shame I must break such a fascinating spell. Keep the harpies away from me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196511,0,'Herbert Gloomburst to Player'),(167182,1,0,'I\'m free! Hahaha! Ahem. Let\'s make ourselves scarce, shall we?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196516,0,'Herbert Gloomburst to Player'),(167300,0,0,'I\'ve got your back! Let us strike them down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196517,0,'Herbert Gloomburst to Player'),(167300,1,0,'Something big is coming this way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196512,0,'Herbert Gloomburst to Player'),(167301,0,0,'You do not fight alone! Lok-tar ogar!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196518,0,'Shuja Grimaxe to Player'),(167301,1,0,'Then we slay it together. For the Horde!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196513,0,'Shuja Grimaxe to Player'),(167221,0,0,'Let\'s see if we can find one of those rituals.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196409,0,'Lana Jordan to Player'),(167221,1,0,'A dark pit and darker magic. I think we found the ritual.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196410,0,'Lana Jordan to Player'),(167226,0,0,'And make sure ya be stoppin\' dat ritual!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196420,0,'Won\'sa to Player'),(167250,0,0,'If... I die... so... do you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,183958,0,'Crenna Earth Daughter to Hrun'),(163031,0,0,'You... cheat...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,187271,0,'Gutgruck The Tough to Player'),(163031,1,0,'Me strong! You no can hurt!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,187272,0,'Gutgruck The Tough to Player'),(160280,4,0,'Single blow. Use all the power you hold!',12,0,100,1,0,156584,0,0,0,'Mikanikos'),(160280,2,0,'Sika, keep watch. $n, apply the reinforced armor!',12,0,100,0,0,156563,0,0,0,'Mikanikos'),(160280,3,0,'Lend Bron your power! Your bond will strengthen him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mikanikos'),(160280,1,0,'I built this goliath with a special core. Now with Phaestus, I can bind my soul to him!',12,0,100,1,0,156562,0,0,0,'Mikanikos'),(160280,0,0,'I will locate Phaestus. You collect metals! No scratches, no imperfections!',12,0,100,1,0,156538,0,0,0,'Mikanikos'),(178749,2,0,'Something large looms just beyond those gates...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wild Hunt Guardi