ine'),(165918,22,0,'Knights, secure the cave! We\'ll hold off these fiends.',14,0,100,1,0,161960,0,195282,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(165918,20,0,'Keep searching.',12,0,100,1,0,161945,0,194830,0,'Highlord Darion to Mawsworn Soulrenders'),(165918,19,0,'If one of our allies is trapped within that, I doubt we\'re going to get them out.',12,0,100,25,0,161944,0,194828,0,'Highlord Darion to Mawsworn Soulrenders'),(166980,27,0,'Indeed. Ive broken free countless times, only to end up back in a cage. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(165918,18,0,'I suggest we try not to get eaten!',12,0,100,6,0,161941,0,194823,0,'Highlord Darion to Serath the Gluttonous'),(165918,16,0,'Let\'s move on.',12,0,100,1,0,161943,0,194827,0,'Highlord Darion to Thelonia the Cruel'),(165918,17,0,'I hope our allies didn\'t end up in the belly of that... thing.',12,0,100,1,0,161940,0,194822,0,'Highlord Darion to Serath the Gluttonous'),(165918,14,0,'Looks like we\'ve secured the Lord Admiral. I\'ll signal the Ebon Blade to advance.',12,0,100,1,0,161947,0,194832,0,'Highlord Darion to jaina'),(165918,15,0,'Whatever is going on here, we don\'t want any part of it.',12,0,100,274,0,161942,0,194826,0,'Highlord Darion to Thelonia the Cruel'),(168130,0,0,'Hail, Zovaal! These souls are yours for the taking!',14,0,100,0,0,162298,0,196891,0,'Thelonia the Cruel'),(60741,1,0,'So we just wait until we think of something? Shen-zin Su is dying! Doing nothing risks everything!',12,0,100,6,0,27330,0,60191,0,'Ji Firepaw to Aysa Cloudsinger'),(60741,2,0,'I\'d rather die knowing that at least we tried.',12,0,100,1,0,27331,0,60193,0,'Ji Firepaw to Aysa Cloudsinger'),(60851,0,0,'We\'ll cover this front. You keep my priests safe.',12,0,100,396,0,27503,0,59720,0,'Delora Lionheart to Player'),(60852,0,0,'We stand by your side, friend.  This battle is not yours alone.',12,0,100,6,0,28119,0,59719,0,'Korga Strongmane to Player'),(60770,0,0,'Thank you for the help. I\'ll go help with the wound.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,