,0,100,0,0,27384,0,64848,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),(56416,1,0,'Get clear when it when it raises its weapon, it\'s even stronger than it looks.',12,0,100,0,0,27385,0,64849,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),(56416,2,0,'It\'s calling allies!  I\'ll keep him busy while you handle them.',12,0,100,0,0,27386,0,64850,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),(56416,3,0,'We\'re wearing him down.  Keep it up!',12,0,100,0,0,27387,0,64852,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),(56416,4,0,'I don\'t know what I would have done without you.  It\'s good that you came.',12,0,100,0,0,27388,0,64853,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Vordraka, the Deep Sea Nightmare'),(60729,0,0,'Ji may kill Shen-zin Su if we let him go through with this! Come with me, $p, quickly!',12,0,100,5,0,27412,0,55140,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(60729,1,0,'Ji, stop! This is reckless and stupid.',12,0,100,5,0,27413,0,60188,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(60729,2,0,'If you stop this, then maybe we can come up with one.',12,0,100,274,0,27414,0,60190,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(62087,4,0,'The tauren have made themselves useful. Look - this one is a shaman.',12,0,100,6,0,30750,0,61590,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,5,0,'Even a blood elf can hold a sword.',12,0,100,396,0,30751,0,61592,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(160358,0,0,'Forsworn protect me!',12,0,100,0,0,149460,0,190533,0,'Darksworn Forgehand to Player'),(160358,1,0,'Should... have hidden...',12,0,100,0,0,149482,0,190553,0,'Darksworn Forgehand to Player'),(161499,0,0,'Oh no! Baedos is eating too quickly! He might get indigestion, watch out!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Gerdus to Player'),(169292,0,0,'Yay! You good friend!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Appreciative Steward to Player'),(172714,1,0,'Archon be praised!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Trapped Caretaker to Player'),(172714,0,0,'Please be sure to get out safely as well! Farewell!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Trapped Caretaker to Player'),(3616,3,0,'%s continues his meditations...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1219,0,'Onu'),(5693,0,0,'This is Dalin Forgewright. He fled from Lordaeron when the plague struck, taking his love with him.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1988,0,'Godrick Farsan'),(5693,1,0,'When he came upon the refugees at the Greymane Wall, he felt it his duty to succor them, sending his woman on to Hillsbrad.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1992,0,'Godrick Farsan'),(5693,2,0,'And this is Comar Villard. Two weeks married, his wife was spirited away from the safety of Menethil Harbor.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1989,0,'Godrick Farsan'),(5693,3,0,'Five and five years, and he still searches for her, though she was no beauty, and there were many ladies that would take her place.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1993,0,'Godrick Farsan'),(5693,4,0,'Fools.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,1990,0,'Godrick Farsan'),(6244,0,0,'A thousand years ago, the immortal elves, demigods of the forest and dragons fought against the Legion on the slopes of Hyjal.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2310,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,1,0,'Anathera and Latherion fought back to back where the battle was thickest. Two lovers determined to survive the war together.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2311,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,2,0,'But it was not to be. As their foes pressed close, Anathera\'s armor was pierced by a demon\'s tainted blade. In the thick of battle, there would be nothing to save her.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2312,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,3,0,'Ignoring the battle that raged about him, Latherion dropped his guard to cradle his love in her dying moments. But the demons gave him no quarter, and quickly laid him low.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2314,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,4,0,'Where the two lovers fell, a tree would bloom. The elves call it the heartswood. It will surely serve your ends.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2317,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6245,0,0,'So this... this is how it ends, my love...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2316,0,'Anathera'),(6246,0,0,'Anathera!',12,7,100,15,0,0,0,2313,0,'Latherion'),(6246,1,0,'Anathera... I cannot bear to face the rest of eternity without you by my side... If you are taken from me, then let this be the day I also return to the earth...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2315,0,'Latherion'),(78495,0,0,'Boss, I got the recent threats sketched out on the table for ya whenever you be ready.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,87694,0,'Shadow Hunter Ukambe to Player'),(16222,2,0,'Even the Light is no match for the indomitable will of our people.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14793,0,'Silvermoon City Guardian'),(16222,3,0,'Your power strengthens us all.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14792,0,'Silvermoon City Guardian'),(8444,0,0,'There\'ll be a new trade risin\' up round your carcass, $n. We\'ll call it \'flesh-craftin.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4421,0,'Trade Master Kovic'),(6166,1,0,'Hip hip, hoorah!',12,7,100,4,0,0,0,2309,0,'Yorus Barleybrew'),(6166,0,0,'$n ran the Gauntlet!  Three cheers for $n!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,2308,0,'Yorus Barleybrew'),(167429,0,0,'Hey $n! I have some fresh armaments that the admiral thought you might be interested in purchasing.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,''),(165548,0,0,'Old Town, here we come!',12,0,100,1,0,155689,0,0,0,''),(156986,1,0,'Boss... counting... on me...',12,0,100,0,0,150272,0,0,0,''),(156986,0,0,'Me gonna bring you to boss!',12,0,100,0,0,150270,0,0,0,''),(160964,2,0,'You need to rescue Ralia Dreamchaser! She\'s somewhere deeper in the cave.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,''),(150237,0,0,'The geolord demands your demise!',12,0,100,0,0,150271,0,176076,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(160964,1,0,'Thank you! Ralia Dreamchaser tried to rescue us. She must be somewhere below.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,''),(163338,1,0,'You must stop the ritual before it is completed.',12,0,100,0,0,152982,0,0,0,''),(163338,0,0,'The ogres\' necromancy has ravaged the spirit world.',12,0,100,0,0,152981,0,0,0,''),(152571,0,0,'Just... a nibble...',12,0,100,0,0,150254,0,0,0,''),(162817,1,0,'Me never get... to see... ritual...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Torgok death'),(156676,1,0,'Sacrifice... for... ritual...',12,0,100,0,0,150271,0,178951,0,'Ogre Overseer death'),(150238,2,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quilboar Geomancer flee'),(150238,1,0,'I return... to... the earth...',12,0,100,0,0,150284,0,176083,0,'Quilboar Geomancer death'),(150238,0,0,'The geolord demands your demise!',12,0,100,0,0,150271,0,176076,0,'Quilboar Geomancer aggro'),(5413,0,0,'%s begins to work...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2341,0,'Furen Longbeard'),(5413,1,0,'Finished!  And the results are amazing.  I must convey them to my associates Grimand, Mathiel and Klockmort!',12,7,100,4,0,0,0,2342,0,'Furen Longbeard'),(5413,2,0,'Your armor is ready, $n.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2343,0,'Furen Longbeard'),(1416,2,0,'%s begins to work...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2346,0,'Grimand Elmore'),(1416,3,0,'Amazing!  It worked!  $n, I have your armor.',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,2347,0,'Grimand Elmore'),(6142,2,0,'%s begins to work...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2348,0,'Mathiel'),(6142,3,0,'It is done.  $n, your armor is ready.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2349,0,'Mathiel'),(6169,0,0,'%s begins to work...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2344,0,'Klockmort Spannerspan'),(6169,1,0,'Hooray hooray! $n! It\'s done!',12,7,100,4,0,0,0,2345,0,'Klockmort Spannerspan'),(6031,0,0,'%s begins to work...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2303,0,'Tormus Deepforge'),(6031,1,0,'$n!  I\'m finished!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2304,0,'Tormus Deepforge'),(9996,0,0,'I\'m very curious to see what this sample of water will do!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,5945,0,'Winna Hazzard'),(9996,1,0,'%s pours the corrupted water onto the cat.',16,0,100,16,0,0,0,5946,0,'Winna Hazzard'),(9996,2,0,'Haha! Perfect!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,5947,0,'Winna Hazzard'),(9937,0,0,'%s jumps into the moonwell, and goes underwater...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5939,0,'Common Kitten'),(9936,1,0,'%s follows $n obediently.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,5940,0,'Corrupted Kitten'),(7449,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Chillwind Ravager'),(432,1,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Shadowhide Brute'),(660,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Bloodscalp Witch Doctor'),(702,0,0,