ull-men...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12052,0,'Scarlet Commander Marjhan'),(16114,2,0,'Whatever. The revolting, unkempt Horde filth...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,12054,0,'Scarlet Commander Marjhan'),(16114,3,0,'Too little, too late. The dam has broken. We are a bump in the road at best.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,12056,0,'Scarlet Commander Marjhan'),(16114,4,0,'There is always... Ashbringer.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12058,0,'Scarlet Commander Marjhan'),(16114,5,0,'Thank you, Jessica.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,12143,0,'Scarlet Commander Marjhan'),(16114,6,0,'And might I add, that dress is lovely! You must tell me where you got it from.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12144,0,'Scarlet Commander Marjhan'),(16115,0,0,'Your leader takes residence at the doorstep to Naxxramas. Do you think he does not feel the pressure?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,12048,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,1,0,'%s lowers the sound of his voice to a whisper.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12049,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,2,0,'Even demons are capable of fear...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12050,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,3,0,'Scourge activity in the Plaguelands has increased ten-fold. We are receiving reports of Scourge attacks from as far away as Kalimdor! Now how do you suppose this has happened? How have the wretched undead done that which was previously thought impossible? Is nowhere safe?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12051,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,4,0,'Tauren.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12053,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,5,0,'You lack tact, Commander. This is not surprising. However, you are right in that the Horde will be forced to act. But not just the Horde. They already come - heroes from across the world.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12055,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,6,0,'So why are you here? What are we to do if there is no hope?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,12057,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,7,0,'So this is what you have come for? To try and claim that which is the reason for the Dawn\'s existence and the Crusade\'s downfall? You open old wounds with your words, Commander!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,12062,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,8,0,'The Ashbringer is dead and there will never be another like him. The lesser Mograine is a far cry from the man his father was. You know this, Commander! It was, after all, your own leadership that was responsible for the death of the Scarlet Highlord Mograine.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,12063,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,9,0,'It was your leadership that manipulated a grieving child to try and recover the sword. A child that has grown into a man with nothing but vengeance and hatred in his heart! And for what? You are no closer to the sword now than you were five years ago.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,12065,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,10,0,'Yet you think that recovering Ashbringer will somehow turn the tide of battle? Let me let you in on a little secret, Commander: The power of the Ashbringer came from the man who would wield it... I was there, Commander. I watched him burn legions of undead in righteous fire before he would even unsheathe the blade. Alas, your grasp on history is ... lacking.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12066,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,11,0,'Now be silent and note where you are, lest I inform Lord Fordring and his knights that you are no longer here on amicable terms. I am certain he would take great pleasure in seeing to your \'atonement.\'',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,12067,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,12,0,'The fish is exquisite, Jessica.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12138,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,13,0,'My compliments to the chef!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12137,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16115,14,0,'Delicious!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12139,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(16256,0,0,'Ok, you had the fish platter, Commander. Enjoy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12132,0,'Jessica Chambers'),(16256,1,0,'Father, you had the bowl of fruit? Right?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,12133,0,'Jessica Chambers'),(16256,2,0,'And for the ladies, roast baby boar. Enjoy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12134,0,'Jessica Chambers'),(16256,3,0,'Please let me know if you need anything else!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12135,0,'Jessica Chambers'),(16113,0,0,'Thank you, Mrs. Chambers.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12140,0,'Father Inigo Montoy'),(16113,1,0,'Is this a mango? Stupendous!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,12141,0,'Father Inigo Montoy'),(16113,2,0,'You\'ve really outdone yourself this time, Mrs. Chambers. Not a spot of mold to be found!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12142,0,'Father Inigo Montoy'),(16116,0,0,'Oh, quite succulent. Many thanks, Mrs. Chambers.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,12147,0,'Archmage Angela Dosantos'),(16116,1,0,'The boar is superb!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,12146,0,'Archmage Angela Dosantos'),(16116,2,0,'Indeed... lovely dress, Jessica.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,12145,0,'Archmage Angela Dosantos'),(16134,0,0,'Watch, druid. The earth still breathes. It yearns to be cleansed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,11946,0,'Rimblat Earthshatter'),(16135,0,0,'That is wonderous, Rimblat! Even this foul, sundered earth is not beyond healing.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,11945,0,'Rayne'),(9598,0,0,'Please, help me to get through this cursed forest, $r.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5004,0,'Arei'),(9598,1,0,'The corruption of Felwood has trapped my spirit here... I may never rest...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5037,0,'Arei'),(9598,2,0,'That I must fight against my own kind deeply saddens me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5008,0,'Arei'),(9598,3,0,'The corruption of the fel has not left any of the creatures of Felwood untouched, $n. Please, be on your guard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5005,0,'Arei'),(9598,4,0,'I can sense it now, $n. Ashenvale lies down this path.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5023,0,'Arei'),(9598,5,0,'I feel... something strange...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5026,0,'Arei'),(9598,6,0,'$n, my form has now changed! The true strength of my spirit is returning to me now... The cursed grasp of the forest is leaving me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5029,0,'Arei'),(9598,7,0,'Thank you, $n. Now my spirit will finally be at peace.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5036,0,'Arei'),(9598,8,0,'I sense the taint of corruption upon this $n. Help me destroy it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5473,0,'Arei'),(9598,8,1,'This creature suffers from the effects of the fel... We must end its misery.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5474,0,'Arei'),(9598,8,2,'This $n has been driven mad from the corruption!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5475,0,'Arei'),(18174,1,2,'Jealous, that\'s what they are. They\'re afraid to dedicate themselves to true power.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14822,0,'Initiate Colin'),(18174,1,3,'They simply fear what they cannot begin to understand.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14823,0,'Initiate Colin'),(28683,0,1,'Nobody steals Kitrik\'s horses!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28676,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,0,0,'Dirty, stinkin\', horse thief!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28675,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(166980,28,0,'It seems she has made a powerful ally. The shades whisper of someone called... the Jailer. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,29,0,'Its nearly charged! Do not falter! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,30,0,'Last I saw Anduin, they were taking him to the tower above. We need to find a way up there. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,31,0,'Look! On the platform ahead! That must be the waystone! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,32,0,'My ability to teleport is limited here, but I should be able to open a portal back to my staffs location. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,33,0,'My spell will get us past most of his guards, but there will likely be some who can see through it. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,34,0,'Once we find Anduin, my staff will serve as an anchor for me to teleport us back to safety. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,35,0,'Our only chance is to keep them at bay long enough for the waystone to fully charge. Every second counts! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,36,0,'Our way out of here--we hope. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,37,0,'So much for remaining unnoticed. Lets hurry. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,38,0,'Stay close, <name>. My spell has limited range.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,39,0,'Stay close. We cant afford to draw their attention. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166981,25,0,'We seek a waystone located beyond the Cauldron. Have you seen it?',12,0,100,0,0,163151,0,199151,0,'Thrall_q59767'),(166981,24,0,'It almost did, were it not for this champion.',12,0,100,6,0,163146,0,199147,0,'Thrall_q60644'),(165918,13,0,'Up ahead! It\'s Lady Proudmoore!',12,0,100,5,0,161946,0,194831,0,'Highlord Darion to jaina'),(165918,12,0,'Hold! What\'s that up ahead?',12,0,100,5,0,161938,0,201589,0,'Highlord Darion quest to stygian'),(165918,11,0,'The Lord Admiral is truly formidable, to have bested one of these monstrosities.',12,0,100,1,0,161937,0,201588,0,'Highlord Darion quest to stygian'),(165918,10,0,'It would be unwise to break the enchantment. Let\'s move along.',12,0,100,6,0,161936,0,201587,0,'Highlord Darion quest to a sheep'),(165918,9,0,'More of Lady Proudmoore\'s handiwork.',12,0,100,1,0,161935,0,201586,0,'Highlord Darion quest to a sheep'),(167263,2,0,'There is nowhere to run! Nothing escapes the Maw!',12,0,100,0,0,161898,0,199481,0,'Tariesh'),(167263,1,0,'Your cell awaits, mage! The Jailer has plans for you!',12,0,100,0,0,161897,0,195294,0,'Tariesh'),(167263,0,0,'You will not evade our grasp, mortals!',12,0,100,0,0,161896,0,195292,0,'Tariesh'),(6181,0,0,'Let\'s get to work, $n!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,2501,0,'Jordan Stilwell'),(6181,1,0,'Here you are, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,2504,0,'Jordan Stilwell'),(5497,0,0,'Here, $n.  Take a chest of containment coffers and a cantation of manifestation.  You will need them for your mission.',12,7,100,25,0,0,0,2681,0,'Jennea Cannon'),(4568,0,0,'Take a chest of containment coffers and a cantation of manifestation, $n.  You will need them for your mission.',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,2682,0,'Anastasia Hartwell'),(1309,0,0,'These are fine pieces, $n.  Let me get started on your robe.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2647,0,'Wynne Larson'),(1309,1,0,'That\'s it!  It\'s all finished, $n.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2648,0,'Wynne Larson'),(1309,2,0,'Ok, let\'s get to work!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2649,0,'Wynne Larson'),(1309,3,0,'Now where did I put that silver spool...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2651,0,'Wynne Larson'),(1309,4,0,'Aha!  There it is.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2650,0,'Wynne Larson'),(4969,0,0,'Yeah, okay, boss. No problem.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1715,0,'Old Town Thug'),(38867,0,0,'All right, boss. You sure though? Just seems like a waste of good practice.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1716,0,'Old Town Thug'),(38867,1,0,'%s cracks his knuckles.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1717,0,'Old Town Thug'),(7907,0,0,'Take a look around, $n. Perhaps you will find something that I have missed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4042,0,'Daryn Lightwind'),(7907,1,0,'%s gestures at the piles of books.',16,0,100,25,0,0,0,4043,0,'Daryn Lightwind'),(7764,0,0,'Feralas: A History... Hmmmm... Let me examine this for a moment.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4039,0,'Troyas Moonbreeze'),(7764,1,0,'%s skims the pages of the book.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,4040,0,'Troyas Moonbreeze'),(7764,2,0,'Amazing! I think I have found it, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4041,0,'Troyas Moonbreeze'),(6966,0,0,'Oh! I almost forgot! I slipped you a set of thieven\' tools. You\'ll need those where you\'re going.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3562,0,'Lucius'),(7053,5,0,'You cannot hide from me, rogue. I can smell your fear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3092,0,'Klaven Mortwake'),(1439,0,0,'My, that Black Claw stout packs quite a punch!',12,7,100,33,0,0,0,387,0,'Lord Baurles K. Wishock'),(1439,1,0,'I feel... dizzy.  It\'s so hot... in... here...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,388,0,'Lord Baurles K. Wishock'),(7207,1,0,'%s prepares his syringe.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,3563,0,'Doc Mixilpixil'),(7207,2,0,'%s examines the blood in the bottle.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,3564,0,'Doc Mixilpixil'),(7207,3,0,'Very interesting!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3565,0,'Doc Mixilpixil'),(7207,4,0,'%s seems to be talking to the squirrel and the statue. He periodically points in your direction.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,3566,0,'Doc Mixilpixil'),(7207,5,0,'This doesn\'t look good!',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,3568,0,'Doc Mixilpixil'),(6266,1,0,'Ok, let\'s get this orb made...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2663,0,'Menara Voidrender'),(6266,2,0,'All right.  It\'s made!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,2664,0,'Menara Voidrender'),(4576,0,0,'One moment while I stitch this together...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,2761,0,'Josef Gregorian'),(4576,1,0,'There.  I am finished with your robe, $n.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,2762,0,'Josef Gregorian'),(3484,0,0,'I shall now begin the robe...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,2665,0,'Kil\'hala'),(3484,1,0,'Your robe is complete, $n.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,2666,0,'Kil\'hala'),(9117,8,0,'I know it\'ll work this time...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,4839,0,'J.D. Collie'),(9117,8,1,'This will be my best experiment yet!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,4840,0,'J.D. Collie'),(9117,8,2,'I know it\'ll work this time... My last 13 tries were just practice!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,4842,0,'J.D. Collie'),(9117,9,0,'Now, if I add the yellow ones...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4841,0,'J.D. Collie'),(1834,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Paladin'),(1834,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Paladin'),(1834,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Paladin'),(1834,0,3,'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2628,0,'Scarlet Paladin'),(10608,0,0,'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Priest'),(10608,0,1,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Priest'),(10608,0,2,'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you wi