e us alone forever.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,108,0,'Sergeant Yohwa'),(1487,0,0,'Raaar!!! Me smash $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1925,0,'Splinter Fist Enslaver'),(1487,0,1,'Me smash! You die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1926,0,'Splinter Fist Enslaver'),(1487,0,2,'I\'ll crush you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1927,0,'Splinter Fist Enslaver'),(18713,0,0,'Rifling through the stacks of books and scrolls on the table, Lieutenant Gravelhammer begins to examine one in particular with interest.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,15827,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,1,0,'What?  What\'s this?!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,15829,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,1,1,'That is not even remotely imaginable!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,15830,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,1,2,'Looks like I picked a bad day to stop drinking.',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,15831,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,1,3,'How did this get missed?!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,15832,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,2,0,'Cap\'n, sir, we have a slight problem.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15833,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,3,0,'As you say, sir.  It would appear that someone failed to mention to me that the druids at the Cenarion Thicket have been wiped out!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15838,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,3,1,'Bad news.  We\'ve been hit again.  They\'re gone, but the front sentry tower is on fire.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15839,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,3,2,'One of our merchants has gone missing!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15840,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,3,3,'That group that recently arrived from Honor Hold -- they\'re mercs!  They\'re starting to stir up trouble.  Maybe I should have a talk with them?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15842,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,3,4,'One of our scouts is reporting that a shadowy group has moved into the ruins of Grangol\'var Village.  Oops, this report is over a week old.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15843,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,3,5,'We have reports from a scout in the field that one of the Cenarion druids has been taken captive up at Firewing Point.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15844,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18713,4,0,'Aye, aye, sir.  Right away!',12,7,100,66,0,0,0,15853,0,'Lieutenant Gravelhammer'),(18745,5,0,'At ease, lieutenant. Go on.',12,7,100,66,0,0,0,15834,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(18745,5,1,'What is it now, Gravel?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,15835,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(18745,5,2,'What else could possibly go wrong?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,15836,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(18745,5,3,'Yes, lieutenant?  Report.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15837,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(18745,6,0,'That\'s troubling news indeed.  See to it that it\'s taken care of immediately!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15849,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(18745,6,1,'I don\'t have time for this, lieutenant.  Make sure that you handle it.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15850,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(18745,6,2,'If we\'re to help with that in any way we\'ll need more people.  Call some of the scouts in to help with that.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15851,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(18745,6,3,'Lieutenant, I want you to make that your top priority.  Notify anyone that you think can help.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,15852,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(22459,0,0,'Praise the naaru, I\'m saved. I will try to make it clear on my own.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20143,0,'Freed Sha\'tar Warrior'),(22459,0,1,'I\'m hurt, but I can still run. Thank you, stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20144,0,'Freed Sha\'tar Warrior'),(22459,0,2,'My thanks, stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20145,0,'Freed Sha\'tar Warrior'),(22459,0,3,'I\'m too weak to fight with you.  Please find my friends.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20146,0,'Freed Sha\'tar Warrior'),(22483,0,2,'AWOOOOGAAAA!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,20310,0,'Sand Gnome'),(22483,0,3,'AYYAYAAYAA!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,20311,0,'Sand Gnome'),(1937,0,0,'%s concocts a potion for $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,885,0,'Apothecary Renferrel'),(8905,0,0,'Intruders!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4961,0,'Warbringer Construct'),(9017,0,0,'I cannot be destroyed! By the will of Ragnaros, I shall be reborn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5061,0,'