ord Darion quest 59914'),(165918,5,0,'We are vastly outnumbered. Let\'s try not to draw unwanted attention.',12,0,100,1,0,161930,0,195269,0,'Highlord Darion quest 59914'),(165918,4,2,'Let\'s get moving--before reinforcements arrive.',12,0,100,1,0,161929,0,195266,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(165918,4,1,'We have done all we can here.',12,0,100,1,0,161928,0,195265,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(165918,4,0,'We rally up ahead. Go!',12,0,100,25,0,161927,0,195264,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(165918,3,0,'This clarion will signal the Ebon Blade to converge on your foe. Use it wisely.',12,0,100,1,0,161922,0,201622,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(165918,2,2,'We are establishing a forward position. Go, make sure we hold it.',12,0,50,25,0,161921,0,195256,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(165918,2,1,'Regroup with your fellow knights. We will not be far behind.',12,0,50,5,0,161919,0,195255,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(165918,2,0,'Fight your way out of here. We will meet you ahead.',12,0,50,25,0,161918,0,195254,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(165918,1,0,'No sign yet of the High Priestess. Perhaps she charged ahead into the chaos.',12,0,100,1,0,161917,0,201850,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(165918,0,0,'You made it through the rift. Good. I doubt this mission could succeed without you.',12,0,100,1,0,161916,0,201849,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(14862,0,0,'Come, puny mortals. Come and face your end. The secrets of Ahn\'Qiraj will die with Roman\'khan!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10888,0,'Emissary Roman\'khan'),(4393,0,0,'The surface of the %s begins to bubble.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16647,0,'Acidic Swamp Ooze'),(4394,0,0,'The surface of the %s begins to bubble.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16647,0,'Bubbling Swamp Ooze'),(26406,0,0,'The EMP disrupts Iron Thane Furyhammer\'s shield!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26169,0,'The Anvil'),(26406,1,0,'%s recovers from the EMP and restores Iron Thane Furyhammer\'s shield.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2