only clue our mortal friend has to follow. It falls to us to open the way for them.',12,0,100,1,0,162362,0,195159,0,'q60154'),(167424,4,0,'But Honored Voice, we have so little anima in our reserves! Surely we should be more--',12,0,100,1,0,162370,0,195161,0,'q60154'),(167424,5,0,'Come, mortal. I will show you the way.',12,0,100,0,0,162371,0,195163,0,'q60154'),(167424,6,0,'Here, mortal. This teleporter will convey you to the Ring of Transference.',12,0,100,0,0,162376,0,202741,0,'q60154'),(32577,0,0,'Aye, captain!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24843,0,'Kvaldir Crewman'),(32578,0,0,'Aye, captain!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24843,0,'Kvaldir Crewman'),(32579,0,0,'Aye, captain!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24843,0,'Kvaldir Crewman'),(32580,0,0,'Aye, captain!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24843,0,'Kvaldir Crewman'),(32576,2,0,'A child has found a new toy! Crewman, take this infant\'s toy away!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24840,0,'Orabus the Helmsman'),(32576,2,1,'Crewman, show this ant the might of the Kvaldir!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24841,0,'Orabus the Helmsman'),(32576,2,2,'Crewman, tear this land walker apart!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24842,0,'Orabus the Helmsman'),(14509,2,0,'%s dies.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12195,0,'High Priest Thekal'),(14509,3,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1191,0,'High Priest Thekal'),(11347,2,0,'%s dies.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10453,0,'Zealoth Lor\'khan'),(11348,2,0,'%s dies.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12195,0,'Zealot Zath'),(175829,0,0,'We have precious little anima to spare. But the Honored Voice has blessed your mission, so we will use what we have.',12,0,100,0,0,162372,0,195164,0,'q60156'),(175829,1,0,'We will call down one of the soul conduits for use as a gateway to Bastion. These paths have been dormant for some time. Your arrival will be... unexpected.',12,0,100,0,0,162373,0,195166,0,'q60156'),(175132,0,0,'Welcome Kah-Sher. Is it true? Are we to open the gate again?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,206692,0,'q60156'),(175133,0,0,'Welcome Kah-Sher. Is it true? Are we to open the gate again?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,206692,0,'q60156'),(39326,0,0,'Grandmatron... you\'re alive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39455,0,'q25189'),(39325,0,0,'Let us be off then.  Take me to my grandson Raggaran.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39456,0,'q25189'),(39325,1,0,'I\'m tired of wading in water.  Let\'s make this a little bit easier on ourselves, shall we?  Spirit of water, come to our aid!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39452,0,'q25189'),(39325,2,0,'No!  M-my ankle!  I\'m not sure I can make it... after we\'ve come so far...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39457,0,'q25189'),(39325,3,0,'Spirits of air! Come to my aid!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,39458,0,'q25189'),(39325,4,0,'We can continue now, I think.  Let us press on.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39459,0,'q25189'),(39325,5,0,'Raggaran, I\'m safe.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39454,0,'q25189'),(18956,1,0,'Well done! Hurry, though, we don\'t want to be caught!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16056,0,'Lakka'),(3208,0,0,'%s enters a trance...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,986,0,'q25262'),(3208,1,0,'%s is burned by unleashed magic!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,987,0,'q25262'),(3208,3,0,'$n, unlocking the secret of these collars is beyond my skills...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,988,0,'q25262'),(166981,7,0,'Sylvanas! What does she want with him?',12,0,100,0,0,163075,0,202565,0,'Thrall_q59757'),(166981,6,0,'This is the Tremaculum. Here souls are tormented, twisted into wretched shades.',12,0,100,1,0,162142,0,196421,0,'Thrall_q59757'),(166981,3,0,'Another ambush! Bring them down!',14,0,100,1,0,161965,0,195287,0,'Thrall'),(166981,2,0,'Let\'s hope so. Our captors won\'t be pleased you\'ve managed to slip past them again.',12,0,100,1,0,161958,0,195340,0,'Thrall'),(167833,6,0,'This curse is tearing his soul apart!',12,0,100,0,0,163140,0,199141,0,'Anduin_q60644'),(167833,7,0,'You must defeat it, quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,163141,0,199142,0,'Anduin_q60644'),(167833,8,0,'I think he\'s coming to.',12,0,100,5,0,163143,0,199144,0,'Anduin_q60644'),(167833,9,0,'Baine, can you hear me?',12,0,100,6,0,163144,0,199145,0,'Anduin_q60644'),(166980,44,0,'The Jailer rules this realm. We know little about him, but its clear he has taken a special interest in us. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,45,0,'The Jailer. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(168162,0,0,'Anduin? I had thought my end had come...',12,0,100,0,0,163145,0,199146,0,'Baine_q60644'),(168162,1,0,'Then you have my eternal gratitude, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,163147,0,199148,0,'Baine_q60644'),(168162,2,0,'Understood. Lead the way.',12,0,100,0,0,163149,0,199150,0,'Baine_q60644'),(166980,54,0,'We must stand together if we hope to survive. Hold your ground! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(173615,0,0,'She is unchanged. Ever silent. Ever still.',12,0,100,0,0,162381,0,195127,0,'q60149'),(167833,10,0,'So many souls pouring into the Maw. The dead of Azeroth... Draenor... worlds beyond our imagination. All damned to this place.',12,0,100,0,0,163169,0,199240,0,'Anduin_q59767'),(166980,59,0,'Well, there goes our luck! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,56,0,'We should be safe enough here for the moment. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,57,0,'We should move quickly. Are you fit to travel? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,58,0,'Were overrun! Im getting us out of here! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(168162,3,0,'I spotted an obelisk of ancient stone upon the high ridge.',12,0,100,1,0,163152,0,199152,0,'Baine_q59767'),(168162,4,0,'It did not seem important. The Jailer\'s forces pay it little heed. What do you think it is?',12,0,100,6,0,163153,0,199153,0,'Baine_q59767'),(168162,5,0,'The Jailer\'s forces seem endless. There is no way we can fight through them all.',12,0,100,1,0,163179,0,197739,0,'Baine_q59767'),(168162,6,0,'The size of the Jailer\'s army rivals that of the Legion... and it\'s growing larger.',12,0,100,0,0,163178,0,199238,0,'Baine_q59767'),(168162,7,0,'To be forged into weapons for the Jailer.',12,0,100,0,0,163183,0,199259,0,'Baine_q59767'),(166980,46,0,'The stone responds to you, <name>! Try to activate it while we hold off the Jailers army!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,47,0,'Theres a cave just around the bend. With any luck, we can reach it before they notice. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,48,0,'Theres Anduin! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,49,0,'They manifest as malevolent shades that wander the darkness. I doubt theyd willingly help us. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,50,0,'Theyve found us! Be ready! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,51,0,'Tyrande? Here? No, I have not. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,52,0,'Very well... where to begin? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,53,0,'We cant stay here. Can you walk, Thrall? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(167833,11,0,'The waystone was said to be dormant, yet it seems to be reacting to our presence.',12,0,100,5,0,163157,0,197528,0,'Anduin_q59767'),(167833,12,0,'I can\'t find a way to activate it.',12,0,100,0,0,163158,0,197529,0,'Anduin_q59767'),(167833,13,0,'Here! This barrier will protect us!',12,0,100,0,0,163170,0,197738,0,'Anduin_q59767'),(172532,0,0,'An agent of the Maw is attacking Oribos! Defend the Arbiter!',12,0,100,0,0,155440,0,195105,0,'q60129'),(168252,0,0,'Hold. The Maw\'s power does linger upon them, but I sense... No, that cannot be possible!',12,0,100,0,0,155441,0,195106,0,'q60129'),(168162,8,0,'I think the stone is gaining power!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Baine_q59770'),(168162,9,0,'Jaina, something\'s wrong. It seems the waystone has stopped charging!',12,0,100,5,0,163176,0,203246,0,'Baine_q59770'),(166981,0,0,'I... will manage.',12,0,100,1,0,161950,0,195273,0,'Thrall '),(166981,1,0,'Thank you for coming to my aid, Jaina.',12,0,100,1,0,161951,0,195274,0,'Thrall '),(167425,3,0,'Wondrous news, Honored Voice! Mere moments ago, there was a disturbance at the boundary of the Maw. Then this mortal appeared, claiming to have broken free of it.',12,0,100,1,0,162358,0,195120,0,'q60148'),(167425,4,0,'Blessed be her voice.',12,0,100,1,0,162481,0,203004,0,'q60148'),(167486,0,0,'A living mortal! Surely their presence here serves the Purpose. If the Arbiter reacted to their arrival, perhaps they are the key to waking her.',12,0,100,1,0,159783,0,195121,0,'q60148'),(167486,1,0,'It is the Arbiter\'s place to judge souls, Kah-Sher, not ours. I will bring this mortal before her. With her voice have I spoken.',12,0,100,0,0,159784,0,195123,0,'q60148'),(167424,1,0,'Is this mortal worthy of such an audience? They may prove to be an agent of the Jailer!',12,0,100,1,0,162366,0,195122,0,'q60148'),(167424,2,0,'Blessed be her Voice.',12,0,100,1,0,164016,0,203810,0,'q60148'),(168252,1,0,'Come with us, stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,155443,0,195108,0,'q60129'),(167425,0,0,'The reports from our scryers were unmistakable. The Maw shuddered for a moment, as if reacting to some change.',12,0,100,0,0,162356,0,195113,0,'q60129'),(167425,1,0,'Another unexpected development. We shall see to their reception.',12,0,100,0,0,162363,0,197243,0,'q60129'),(167425,2,0,'Impossible!',12,0,100,5,0,131775,0,173301,0,'q60129'),(167424,0,0,'An ill omen, to be certain. What can it mean?',12,0,100,0,0,162364,0,195115,0,'q60129'),(172532,1,0,'Overseers! This stranger appeared at the city\'s edge. I believe them to be... a living mortal.',12,0,100,0,0,155444,0,195116,0,'q60129'),(167424,3,0,'You seek to open a doorway back to the realm of the living? Oh dear. Oribos is crowded enough with so many Brokers arriving every day.',12,0,100,1,0,162368,0,195139,0,'q60151'),(167425,5,0,'Now, now, Kah-Sher, be hospitable. Mortal, I suggest establishing your portals where you first arrived... just outside the city.',12,0,100,1,0,162361,0,195140,0,'q60151'),(164079,0,0,'As you wish. $n, please confirm where our acolytes should open the portals.',12,0,100,1,0,162352,0,195141,0,'q60151'),(167486,2,0,'I pray the Arbiter will awaken in your presence, mortal.',12,0,100,0,0,162380,0,195126,0,'q60148'),(166980,55,0,'We need to reach it before the Jailer takes notice. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(173615,1,0,'When you arrived in Oribos, I saw the Arbiter stir for the first time in many cycles. It gave me hope that she would awaken and resume her blessed Purpose.',12,0,100,0,0,162382,0,195128,0,'q60149'),(173615,2,0,'Mere words cannot describe the glory that was. Step forward, that I may show you.',12,0,100,0,0,162383,0,195129,0,'q60149'),(173615,3,0,'Now souls rich with anima travel only to the Maw. We have tried everything to stop it, to awaken our blessed Arbiter... to no avail.',12,0,100,0,0,162384,0,195130,0,'q60149'),(173615,4,0,'Without anima, drought has gripped the Shadowlands. The afterlives have grown isolated. Fear and uncertainty haunt us all.',12,0,100,0,0,162385,0,195131,0,'q60149'),(173615,5,0,'With countless souls feeding the Jailer, I fear he may grow strong enough to break free from the Maw.',12,0,100,0,0,162386,0,195132,0,'q60149'),(173615,6,0,'It is said he is filled with hatred for the Arbiter. If he strikes her down, it would bring the end of everything the First Ones made.',12,0,100,0,0,162387,0,195133,0,'q60149'),(173615,7,0,'Return to the lower levels. The overseers will prepare you for what is to come.',12,0,100,0,0,162388,0,195134,0,'q60149'),(167683,0,0,'I have opened countless portals in my lifetime. But never one that connected two planes of reality.',12,0,100,1,0,160909,0,195147,0,'q60151'),(167682,0,0,'I thought death was the end of existence. Here, it seems, Death is a power that offers new beginnings.',12,0,100,1,0,162389,0,195148,0,'q60151'),(3216,0,0,'%s inspects the Searing Collar...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,990,0,'q25263'),(3216,1,0,'Interesting, very interesting.  You found this in Durotar, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,991,0,'q25263'),(16219,0,3,'Idiot.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22239,0,'Ranger Valanna - Out of combat'),(16219,0,4,'Would you please shut up?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22240,0,'Ranger Valanna - Out of combat'),(16219,0,5,'With all due respect, sir, stick it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22243,0,'Ranger Valanna - Out of combat'),(25507,0,0,'Unit entering energy conservation mode.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25200,0,'Sunblade Protector'),(25507,1,0,'Local proximity threat detected. Exiting energy conservation mode.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25201,0,'Sunblade Protector'),(25507,1,1,'Unit is now operational and attacking targets.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25206,0,'Sunblade Protector'),(25507,2,0,'Enemy presence detected.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25203,0,'Sunblade Protector'),(25372,0,0,'Enemies spotted! Attack while I try to activate a Protector!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25202,0,'Sunblade Scout'),(22928,0,0,' I... I am free! Ethereum were planning on torturing me until I gave in to their requests. I fear that, had you not come along, I would have surely given in to their torment.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20633,0,'Paxivi'),(22928,1,0,' Know this, $r. Within Shaffar\'s chambers at the end of these tombs rests a creature of unimaginable power. It is held in check be the power of the stasis chamber. You must return to Ameer before you venture further if you wish to destroy it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20634,0,'Paxivi'),(18428,0,4,'My children will be made orphans!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15386,0,'Mag\'har Prisoner'),(18428,1,0,'Thank you, $r! Your service to the Mag\'har will not be forgotten.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,15387,0,'Mag\'har Prisoner'),(18428,1,1,'Death to the ogres!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,15388,0,'Mag\'har Prisoner'),(18428,1,2,'Many thanks, hero!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,15389,0,'Mag\'har Prisoner'),(18428,1,3,'Spirits watch over you, $r!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,15390,0,'Mag\'har Prisoner'),(23104,0,0,'The bogblossom explodes, spraying pollen wildly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20932,0,'Bogblossom Bunny'),(17969,5,0,'I can see my fellow druids from here.  Thank you, $n.  I\'m sure Ysiel will reward you for your actions!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14729,0,'Kayra Longmane'),(18042,0,0,'You won\'t escape us, druid!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14731,0,'Slaveb