,100,0,0,181479,0,211259,0,''),(178081,1,0,'By the Light! He\'s expanding the Maw around Oribos!',14,0,100,0,0,181477,0,211265,0,''),(178081,0,0,'Behind our quarry. Heroes, with me!',14,0,100,0,0,181488,0,210387,0,''),(176532,9,0,'For Saurfang! For the Horde! ',14,0,100,0,0,181528,0,211454,0,''),(176532,8,0,'Heroes, to me! Let\'s regroup with Jaina!',14,0,100,0,0,181581,0,210375,0,''),(176532,7,0,'I\'m in your debt, Highlord.',12,0,100,0,0,181534,0,210383,0,''),(176532,6,0,'Their forces are numberless!',14,0,100,0,0,181483,0,211449,0,''),(176532,5,0,'Is there no end to these creatures?!',14,0,100,0,0,181484,0,211450,0,''),(176532,4,0,'My defenses falter!',14,0,100,0,0,181577,0,210386,0,''),(176532,3,0,'With me, champions! Jaina needs our strength!',14,0,100,0,0,181579,0,210373,0,''),(176532,2,0,'Yield, Sylvanas!',14,0,100,0,0,181527,0,211453,0,''),(176532,0,0,'Blood and thunder!',14,0,100,0,0,181590,0,210382,0,''),(176532,1,0,'I\'ve opened the way! Go! Stop Sylvanas!',14,0,100,0,0,181580,0,210371,0,''),(176533,10,0,'Hold them back a little longer. The portal\'s nearly open!',14,0,100,0,0,181491,0,210369,0,''),(176533,9,0,'We\'re out of time! Oribos is being enveloped by the Maw!',14,0,100,0,0,181490,0,211271,0,''),(176533,8,0,'Sylvanas! Give Anduin to me!',14,0,100,0,0,181525,0,211455,0,''),(176533,7,0,'You don\'t have to do this! Surrender! ',14,0,100,0,0,181526,0,211456,0,''),(176533,6,0,'Hurry! Thrall needs us!',14,0,100,0,0,181583,0,210359,0,''),(176533,5,0,'Quickly, champions! Stop Sylvanas!',14,0,100,0,0,181584,0,210358,0,''),(176533,4,0,'Thank you, Bolvar.',12,0,100,0,0,181533,0,210367,0,''),(176533,3,0,'There\'s too many of them!',14,0,100,0,0,181482,0,211452,0,''),(176533,2,0,'Heroes! I need aid!',14,0,100,0,0,181569,0,210366,0,''),(176533,1,0,'Is the Jailer trying to break out of the Maw... or something else?',12,0,100,0,0,181489,0,211274,0,''),(63014,0,0,'Interested in catching some rare pets?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,62763,5,'Marcus Jensen - Random text'),(63014,0,1,'You look like someone that might be interested in some rare pets?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,62764,5,'Marcus Jensen - Random text'),(63014,0,2,'Are you eyeing my cat?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,63547,5,'Marcus Jensen - Random text'),(63596,0,0,'Interested in catching some rare pets?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,62763,5,'Audrey Burnhep - Random text'),(63596,0,1,'You look like someone that might be interested in some rare pets?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,62764,5,'Audrey Burnhep - Random text'),(63596,0,2,'Have you ever seen such a beautiful rabbit?  I can help you catch your own!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,62765,5,'Audrey Burnhep - Random text'),(178997,0,0,'You there! That is the property of Cartel So!',12,0,100,5,0,181676,0,210230,5,'So\'danah to Player'),(39364,0,0,'One day, The Wolf was very hungry, so he ran east to look for some food',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39438,0,'the wolf text'),(39364,1,0,'The Wolf had grown tired of eating boar meat.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39450,0,''),(39364,2,0,'The Wolf did not care for raptor meat.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39448,0,''),(39364,4,0,'He was hungry for kodo meat.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39445,0,''),(39364,5,0,'The Wolf ran and ran, looking for an easy meal.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39444,0,''),(39364,6,0,'The more he ran, the more his stomach growled.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39447,0,''),(39364,7,0,'He scoured the sands of Durotar, hunting for his prey.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39451,0,''),(39364,8,0,'The Wolf was lazy, and didn\'t want to work for his meal.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39446,0,''),(39365,0,0,'He happened upon a pair of battling kodos.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(39365,1,0,'Clever as he was, The Wolf decided to wait for one to defeat the other.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39439,0,''),(39365,2,0,'When the weaker Kodo died, The Wolf approached and tried to eat it.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39440,0,''),(39365,3,0,'The remaining Kodo, angry at The Wolf\'s impetuousness,',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,39441,0,''),(39365,4,0,'swiftly killed The Wolf before he had a chance to eat.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(18309,0,0,'What have the netherwi