re rather selective of who we befriend, $n.  You think you have what it takes?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17287,0,'Scryer Arcanist'),(7527,0,0,'%s will be armed in 10 seconds!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,3541,0,'Goblin Land Mine'),(7527,1,0,'%s will be armed in 5 seconds!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,3542,0,'Goblin Land Mine'),(7527,2,0,'%s is now armed!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,3543,0,'Goblin Land Mine'),(5391,5,0,'%s disappears into the swamp.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1856,0,'Galen Goodward'),(23365,0,0,'Thank you for helping us with the flasks.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21479,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,1,0,'Now that the flasks are ready, we can show the Skyguard our moves!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21445,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,2,0,'Watch out, Skyguard. Here comes Torkus Jr.!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,21446,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,3,0,'Commander, sir! Cadet Torkus Jr. reporting for duty, sir!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21447,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,4,0,'Yes, sir. An ogre, sir. But give us a chance, sir! We\'ve been preparing for this since the first time the Skyguard flew over Ogri\'la, sir!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21449,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,5,0,'Nonsense!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,21488,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,6,0,'%s makes a gesture of dismissal and heads for the launch pad.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21450,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,7,0,'Bronco? That sounds like a good one!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21472,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,8,0,'Bronco bucks %s from its back and escapes into the wild!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21468,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23365,9,0,'Come back, Mr. Bronco! We\'re gonna be in the Skyguard together!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,21476,0,'Torkus Jr.'),(23334,1,0,'Look here, lad. I admire your dedication, but I\'m not sure how to tell you this... You\'re an ogre, son.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,21448,0,'Sky Commander Keller'),(23334,2,0,'I don\'t think yer hearin\' me. Nether rays just aren\'t made for --',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21473,0,'Sky Commander Keller'),(23334,3,0,'No, lad, not Bronco! He\'s not been broken yet! You\'ll get yerself killed up there!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,21467,0,'Sky Commander Keller'),(22987,0,0,'%s cowers in fear as it realizies what the ogre has in mind.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21451,0,'Skyguard Nether Ray'),(23380,0,0,'%s hisses loudly at Torkus Jr.',16,0,100,35,0,0,0,21482,0,'Bronco'),(25167,0,0,'Why do you suffer the presence of this despicable Lady Liadrin? She and her followers distort the Light and make a mockery of all we stand for!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,24461,0,'General Tiras\'alan'),(18481,4,0,'Patience, general. The Light embraces all who enter Shattrath in good faith.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24462,0,'A\'dal'),(18481,5,0,'You are welcome in Shattrath, Lady Liadrin. We have long awaited your arrival.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24463,0,'A\'dal'),(17076,0,0,'Thank you for allowing me to speak, A\'dal. I know many of your allies despise me and my knights for our treatment of M\'uru.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24464,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(17076,1,0,'When he was given to us by \'Prince\' Kael\'thas, we believed his power would help us lead our people into a new age.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24485,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(17076,2,0,'I\'ve come to realize our path was a false one. We were betrayed by the man we called our prince. In his lust for power, he sent the felblood to attack us, and to spirit M\'uru away to the Sunwell.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24465,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(18481,6,0,'Both our peoples have suffered greatly at the hands of Kael\'thas and his agents, Lady Liadrin. Your people were not the authors of their own fate, but they will die if they do not change.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24466,0,'A\'dal'),(18481,7,0,'M\'uru accepted his role in this long ago, knowing full well what would happen to him. Will you accept your own?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24467,0,'A\'dal'),(17076,3,0,'I... I don\'t understand. You -- and M\'uru -- knew all along that this would occur?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24468,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(18481,8,0,'It wasn\'t I who foretold it, but Velen of the Draenei:',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24469,0,'A\'dal'),(18481,9,0,'\'Silvery moon, washed in blood,\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24470,0,'A\'dal'),(18481,10,0,'\'Led astray into the night, armed with sword of broken Light.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24471,0,'A\'dal'),(18481,11,0,'\'Broken, then betrayed by one, standing there bestride the sun.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24472,0,'A\'dal'),(18481,12,0,'\'At darkest hour, redemption comes, in knightly lady sworn to blood.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24473,0,'A\'dal'),(17076,4,0,'I see it clearly now. I renounce my loyalties to House Sunstrider and its false prince.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24474,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(17076,5,0,'I pledge the blades of my Blood Knights to the defeat of Kil\'jaeden and the restoration of Silvermoon.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24484,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(17076,6,0,'We will fight beside you, A\'dal.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,24477,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(18481,13,0,'The Shattered Sun Offensive will surely benefit from the addition of your knights, Lady Liadrin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24480,0,'A\'dal'),(18481,14,0,'The battle for the Sunwell is but the first step on your new path, Lady Liadrin. Shattrath is open to you and all who follow you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24481,0,'A\'dal'),(17109,0,0,'Hahaha!  That fool will never find out what I\'m up to!  Or, if he does, it\'ll be too late for the draenei!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,14094,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,0,1,'These orcs are fools!  So much power nearby just waiting to be taken, and all they do is sit on their hands and watch while others plunder the riches!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,14095,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,0,2,'I cannot wait to see the results of this latest batch!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14096,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,0,3,'Avuun dares to oppose me?!  I will crush him!  When I am done with the draenei, they\'ll wish that they were Lost Ones!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,14097,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,0,4,'Oh, would you please stop checking your nails and spanking yourself, for one moment?  Really, no one cares!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,14098,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,0,5,'Are you hungry?  I\'m hungry.  I just can\'t stand the thought of cured ham steak from Thultash again.  If only we could get some of that succulent roasted quail!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,14099,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,1,0,'You have something to say to my face?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,14106,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,2,0,'I thought not!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,14107,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,3,0,'I need some fresh air, not that there\'s any to be had in this swamp!  I\'m going out for a bit.  Tidy up a bit while I\'m gone, would you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,14101,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(17109,4,0,'Must you follow me everywhere? <sigh>',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,14102,0,'Cersei Dusksinger'),(1978,8,0,'Beware!  A $n is upon us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,541,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1978,8,1,'A $n attacks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,543,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(1978,8,2,'Beware!  I am under attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,544,0,'Deathstalker Erland'),(4452,7,0,'Hahah! $n, you make quite a partner!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,1481,0,'Kravel Koalbeard'),(3063,0,0,'Hulfnar!  Thontek!  Stand and address me.',12,3,100,1,0,0,0,6005,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,1,0,'I want you both to demonstrate the techniques I have taught you for the benefit of the younger students here.  Ready...  begin!',12,3,100,1,0,0,0,6020,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,2,0,'Enough talk you two!  Commence fighting!',12,3,100,22,0,0,0,6025,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,3,0,'Now that\'s a War Stomp!  Good job!',12,3,100,21,0,0,0,6072,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,3,1,'That\'s how it\'s done class!  You better be paying attention!',12,3,100,21,0,0,0,6073,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,3,2,'Now that\'s putting your hoof down!',12,3,100,21,0,0,0,6074,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,4,0,'Ish nu!  That\'s enough!',12,3,100,1,0,0,0,6091,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,5,0,'Well Done!',12,3,100,1,0,6575,0,6038,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,6,0,'Good, good.  Now bow to each other.',12,3,100,1,0,0,0,6098,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,7,0,'Now bow to me.',12,3,100,1,0,0,0,6099,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(3063,8,0,'Good job you two.  Now go have a seat.',12,3,100,1,0,0,0,6100,0,'Krang Stonehoof'),(10599,0,0,'Start running!',12,3,100,25,0,6280,0,5966,0,'Hulfnar Stonetotem'),(10599,1,0,'Bring it on!',12,3,100,22,0,6281,0,5967,0,'Hulfnar Stonetotem'),(10600,0,0,'Do not push me, or I will impale you on my horns!',12,3,100,22,0,6277,0,5968,0,'Thontek Rumblehoof'),(23038,1,0,'The elixir... give it to me, Severin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21083,0,'Sky Commander Adaris'),(23038,2,0,'I see them now... assassins from Skettis!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,21084,0,'Sky Commander Adaris'),(23038,3,0,'The arakkoa can send all the assassins they have... they will meet the same fate as these!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21086,0,'Sky Commander Adaris'),(23038,4,0,'Is this... blood in my lungs?  If I don\'t die to an assassin\'s blade, it\'ll be my old injuries that get me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21094,0,'Sky Commander Adaris'),(23042,1,0,'Adaris!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21132,0,'Severin'),(23042,2,0,'Rest now, friend.  You need your strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21133,0,'Severin'),(23306,0,0,'You over there!  I must speak with you!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21339,0,'Hazzik'),(23038,5,0,'Do not... bring Terokk into our world, $n...  That would be... madness...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21907,0,'Sky Commander Adaris'),(23038,6,0,'You\'re one of our bravest, $n.  All of the Skyguard is in your debt.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,21906,0,'Sky Commander Adaris'),(23383,0,0,'Thanks for your help.  Let\'s get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21481,0,'Skyguard Prisoner'),(23383,1,0,'Let\'s keep moving.  I don\'t like this place.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21484,0,'Skyguard Prisoner'),(23383,2,0,'Thanks again.  Sergeant Doryn will be glad to hear he has one less scout to replace this week.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21485,0,'Skyguard Prisoner'),(21644,1,0,'You\'ll go nowhere, Skyguard scum!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21490,0,'Skettis Wing Guard'),(21644,1,1,'Skettis prevails!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21491,0,'Skettis Wing Guard'),(21644,1,2,'No one escapes Skettis!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21492,0,'Skettis Wing Guard'),(21644,1,3,'Death to our enemies!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21493,0,'Skettis Wing Guard'),(24981,0,2,'Deployment successful.  Trespassers will be neutralized.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24016,0,'Converted Sentry'),(21277,0,0,'Hi.  Thanks for the help.  But please don\'t open the cage.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,18918,0,'Vindicator Vuuleen'),(21277,0,1,'Yes, the ogres are so stupid that they forgot to lock my cage.  But that\'s exactly how I like it, so please don\'t open it again.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,18919,0,'Vindicator Vuuleen'),(21277,0,2,'No.  Don\'t open the cage.  One of them might notice!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,18920,0,'Vindicator Vuuleen'),(21277,0,3,'Please leave the cage door closed.  Thanks.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,18921,0,'Vindicator Vuuleen'),(21277,1,0,'Psst, $r, up here near the entrance.  I\'m in the cage.  Hurry!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,18922,0,'Vindicator Vuuleen'),(20344,20,0,'That one where thousands of people are all watching us from up in the sky...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18060,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,21,0,'We\'re like their puppets - we dance and cry and fight and say silly things for their amusement.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18061,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20344,22,0,'Sometimes, even when I\'m awake, I think they\'re watching us. Maybe they\'re watching us right now...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18062,0,'Nat Pagle'),(20342,2,3,'No way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17991,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20342,2,4,'Nat, I\'ve heard a whopper or two in my day but that one takes the cake.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17992,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20342,2,5,'What you got in that pipe, Nat?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17993,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20342,2,6,'*Hal shakes his head* Nat, Nat, Nat...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17994,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20342,2,7,'Shut up and fish, Nat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17995,0,'Hal McAllister'),(20365,0,0,'You there! Yes, you, peasant $g boy:girl;. Come quickly, I must tell you something... I must tell you about my greatness, lest such things are lost in the void!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,18137,0,'Bartolo Ginsetti'),(20365,1,0,'Ooooh, YAH! Gaze upon my rippling musculature. Bask in the glow of my physique.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18138,0,'Bartolo Ginsetti'),(20432,0,0,'Spare a silver, friend?',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18148,0,'Beggar'),(20432,0,1,'Spare a copper? You won\'t need it soon. The end of days nears...',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18149,0,'Beggar'),(20432,0,2,'Got any food?',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18150,0,'Beggar'),(20432,0,3,'Please, $g sir:madam;, I have three hungry children! Did I say three? TEN HUNGRY CHILDREN!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18151,0,'Beggar'),(20432,0,4,'Psst... Spare a copper for some grog?',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18152,0,'Beggar'),(20432,0,5,'Will work for food...',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18153,0,'Beggar'),(20432,0,6,'Allow me to shine your shoes! Only one copper for the service!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,18154,0,'Beggar'),(17918,1,0,'One less threat to the timeways!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15193,0,'Time Keeper'),(17918,2,0,'Victory will be ours!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15194,0,'Time Keeper'),(17918,2,1,'Carry on! Victory at all costs!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15195,0,'Time Keeper'),(17918,2,2,'Continue the fight! Do not falter!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15196,0,'Time Keeper'),(9623,3,2,'Danger. Danger! $n try hurt A-Me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5159,0,'A-Me 01'),(9623,3,3,'A-Me, home. A-Me go home! $n, no stop A-Me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5160,0,'A-Me 01'),(13176,0,0,'Seasoned units are taking to the field!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,8754,0,'Smith Regzar'),(13176,1,0,'Our veterans are entering the field!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,8755,0,'Smith Regzar'),(13176,2,0,'Our champion units are equipped!  Beware, alliance!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,8756,0,'Smith Regzar'),(13176,3,0,'Thank you for the armor scraps, $n!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,8981,0,'Smith Regzar'),(13176,3,1,'Our cache of equipment grows!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,8982,0,'Smith Regzar'),(13257,0,0,'Seasoned units are entering the battle!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,8744,0,'Murgot Deepforge'),(13257,1,0,'Veteran units are entering the battle!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,8745,0,'Murgot Deepforge'),(13257,2,0,'Champion units are entering the battle!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,8746,0,'Murgot Deepforge'),(13257,3,0,'Great!  Let\'s keep those supplies coming, people!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,8975,0,'Murgot Deepforge'),(13257,3,1,'Thanks for the supplies, $n!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,8976,0,'Murgot Deepforge'),(15192,0,0,'A terrible and costly mistake you have made. It is not my time, mortals.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10658,0,'Anachronos'),(5398,0,0,'Hah!  Let us see the wooden human wave!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2045,0,'Warug'),(5398,1,0,'%s laughs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2047,0,'Warug'),(5398,2,0,'Hahah!  That was funny!  Funny wooden human!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2046,0,'Warug'),(844,0,0,'Wares for sale! Wares for sale! Come browse Antonio\'s wares before I must take my leave, citizens of Goldshire.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,721,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,0,1,'Come one, come all! Antonio\'s wares are for sale. I may not return for a great deal of time, so come one, come all.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,722,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,0,2,'Good people of Goldshire, come take advantage of my incredible prices on rare goods. I shall not return for some time!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,723,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,1,0,'Good bye, Goldshire. I\'ll be back soon enough-- perhaps a week\'s time.',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,724,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,2,0,'Known throughout the lands, Antonio Perelli\'s goods now for sale near Sentinel Hill! I must move on soon, so make haste.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,726,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,2,1,'Long-lasting, well-crafted items for sale near the Hill! Come one, come all! Time is short, so make haste.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,727,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,2,2,'The time has come for me to once again make my wares available to all who travel near Sentinel Hill! Come one, come all!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,728,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,3,0,'Thank you, all. I shall return again in about a week.',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,729,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,4,0,'Off to Darkshire then, I suppose.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,730,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,5,0,'%s lets out a deep sigh.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,683,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,6,0,'I hate this part of my job. Oh Duskwood, be gentle with poor Antonio.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,684,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,7,0,'Travelers and adventurers make haste to the town circle and take advantage of Antonio\'s wonderful prices! Come one, come all!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,688,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,7,1,'Well met, travelers of Duskwood! My incredible wares are on sale for a short time in Darkshire. Make haste!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,689,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,7,2,'Leave your battles or errands, and browse my incredible wares! Only in Darkshire for a short time... praise the Light for that.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,690,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,8,0,'Farewell, citizens of Darkshire. Until next time...',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,691,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,9,0,'Finally, Redridge. A pleasant change from the dark, cold fog of Duskwood.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,692,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,10,0,'Hello, hello, Amy. It\'s good to be back in Lakeshire and to see you, milady.',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,702,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,11,0,'I\'ve finally reached Lakeshire-- come one, come all, and take advantage of Antonio Perelli\'s wonderful deals.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,712,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,11,1,'Items powerful enough to help make the journey through Duskwood, Antonio Perelli\'s goods are now for sale here in Lakeshire.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,713,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,11,2,'Hear ye, hear ye! I\'ll pause to sell my wares for only a short time here in Lakeshire. Come to the town hall with haste!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,704,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,12,0,'Good to see you again, Amy. Be safe, luv. I\'m off to Goldshire now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,714,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,13,0,'Hello, my friends. It is good to see you again. Still keeping our borders free I see. Antonio appreciates your hard work.',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,716,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,14,0,'You\'re very welcome! I must be on my way... be safe, all of you.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,717,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,15,0,'Oh, I will, my friend. I will indeed. You, too, be safe.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,720,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,16,0,'Items of antiquity, weapons of war, armor or rarity. Who knows what Antonio will be carrying this week if you do not come look.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,685,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,16,1,'This week it could be eye of newt, or perhaps a treasure map. You\'ll never know unless you look. What could Antonio have?',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,686,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(844,16,2,'Adventurers from all over sell things to Antonio-- come look for yourselves what little treasures he has for you this week.',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,687,0,'Antonio Perelli'),(791,0,0,'We\'re doomed! Everybody hide!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Lindsay Ashlock'),(167279,0,0,'The town hall is so boring!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rachel'),(777,0,0,'Hello, Antonio. It\'s good to see you safely made it here again. Let me know if you need anything.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,703,0,'Amy Davenport'),(1423,0,1,'Please tell me that you didn\'t just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I\'m not going to have to hurt you... ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10951,0,'Stormwind City Guard'),(1423,0,0,'Taste blade, mongrel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10950,0,'Stormwind City Guard'),(18440,0,2,'YOU GUD IN DA BELLY!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15421,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,1,0,'Your daddy pay Warmaul and maybe we no eat you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,15426,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,2,0,'Ha-ha! Just kidding. We eat you for shure anyway!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,15427,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,3,0,'BAM! Look at dat gristle sizzle!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,15430,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,4,0,'And dis is da recipe for da bestest Broken chowder!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,15431,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,5,0,'First you need da spices.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,15432,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,6,0,'Da salt goes into da pot...',12,0,100,35,0,0,0,15433,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,7,0,'Den you put da pepper in da pot...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15434,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,8,0,'Now we gonna kick it up a notch wit da secret ingra... ingor... inrag... da secret sauce!',12,0,100,43,0,0,0,15435,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(18440,9,0,'And last, we put in da Corki!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,15436,0,'Warmaul Chef Bufferlo'),(8022,0,0,'Make no sound during the ritual.  One misstep could spell our doom...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4126,0,'Thadius Grimshade'),(8022,1,0,'Now, watch...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4127,0,'Thadius Grimshade'),(8022,2,0,'There.  It is done.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4128,0,'Thadius Grimshade'),(18294,0,0,'Hi, Harold.  I have your skins!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,15102,0,'Kristen Dipswitch'),(18294,1,0,'Ack!  Somebody help me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15104,0,'Kristen Dipswitch'),(18297,0,0,'I\'ll be taking those skins, tiny.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15111,0,'Gankly Rottenfist'),(18297,1,0,'%s rifles through Kristen\'s stuff and grabs her bundle of skins.',16,0,100,16,0,0,0,15109,0,'Gankly Rottenfist'),(18297,2,0,'Here are my skins, Harold.  Now give me the reward!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,15110,0,'Gankly Rottenfist'),(18218,0,0,'Uh... sure thing, Gankly.  Just...<cough>... wait right there.  <Cough>  Guys?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15112,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,1,0,'What\'s going on?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15090,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,2,0,'Um... guys?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15093,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,3,0,'Hemet?  Fitz?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15094,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,4,0,'Oh good, I was beginning to worry.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15095,0,'Harold Lane'),(18180,0,0,'Uh oh, those stags don\'t look pleased with us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15088,0,'Hemet Nesingwary'),(18180,1,0,'Look out, Fitz, they\'re coming right for us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15089,0,'Hemet Nesingwary'),(18200,0,0,'%s smiles and sheathes his rifle.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,15091,0,'Shado \'Fitz\' Farstrider'),(18218,5,0,'Shifting, %s moans from the pain of his thorn scratch.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,15157,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,5,1,'%s groans in pain.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,15158,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,5,2,'%s looks at his friends and then grunts painfully.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,15159,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,5,3,'%s wakes himself up snoring.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,15160,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,5,4,'%s winces when he touches the tender area around his scratch.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,15161,0,'Harold Lane'),(18218,5,5,'%s begins to whistle a tune, but then stops abruptly and moans.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,15162,0,'Harold Lane'),(17359,0,0,'What have you done to my life\'s work?!  DIE!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13793,0,'Tel\'athion the Impure'),(17359,1,0,'It is YOU who are wrong!  I will deal with you two after I have slain this meddlesome shaman!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14248,0,'Tel\'athion the Impure'),(6748,0,0,'Wrong!  It is YOU that will die, Tel\'athion the Impure!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14247,0,'Water Spirit'),(11980,3,0,'Destroy them! Destroy them all!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,20129,0,'Zuluhed the Whacked'),(12396,0,0,'A sacrifice will be due if I am ever called upon, mortal...',12,8,100,0,0,0,0,9590,0,'Doomguard Commander'),(4488,0,0,'You have done well, $n. Continue your search for knowledge, and remember the history you have learned.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,1608,0,'Parqual Fintallas'),(4488,1,0,'I\'m afraid not, $n. Now, feel the shame you have brought upon yourself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8394,0,'Parqual Fintallas'),(25209,1,0,'You\'re not one of mine. King Mrgl-Mrgl must have sent you to talk terms of surrender. Come closer so that I might see you better.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24460,0,'Claximus'),(25322,0,1,'The people of Kaskala are in your debt, $c.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24600,0,'Kaskala Shaman'),(25322,0,2,'May the ancestors always aid you, $c, as you have aided me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24601,0,'Kaskala Shaman'),(25396,0,2,'You cannot stop us all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13925,0,'Naxxanar Skeletal Mage'),(25396,0,3,'Your death will soon follow....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13926,0,'Naxxanar Skeletal Mage'),(25201,1,1,'No go with stranger!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24455,0,'Winterfin Tadpole'),(25201,1,2,'Eww... $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24456,0,'Winterfin Tadpole'),(25201,1,3,'You not $g da-da : ma-ma;!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24457,0,'Winterfin Tadpole'),(11190,0,1,'We don\'t take kindly to miscreants, $r.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10949,0,'Everlook Bruiser'),(11190,0,2,'Taste blade, mongrel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10950,0,'Everlook Bruiser'),(11190,0,3,'Please tell me that you didn\'t just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I\'m not going to have to hurt you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10951,0,'Everlook Bruiser'),(11190,0,4,'Get a rope!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10952,0,'Everlook Bruiser'),(11190,0,5,'As if we don\'t have enough problems, you go and create more!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10953,0,'Everlook Bruiser'),(11190,0,6,'Believe me when I tell you this: You\'re gonna wish you weren\'t born, sissy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10954,0,'Everlook Bruiser'),(11190,0,7,'Your actions shame us all, $c. I hurt inside as I beat you senseless.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10955,0,'Everlook Bruiser'),(11440,0,0,'I\'ll crush you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1925,0,'Gordok Enforcer'),(11440,0,1,'Me smash! You die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1926,0,'Gordok Enforcer'),(11440,0,2,'Raaar!!! Me smash $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1927,0,'Gordok Enforcer'),(15638,0,0,'Protect the innocent!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12822,0,'Arcane Patroller'),(15638,0,1,'Uphold the law!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12823,0,'Arcane Patroller'),(15638,0,2,'Serve the public trust!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,12824,0,'Arcane Patroller'),(22373,4,0,'The Avatar of Terokk has been defeated! Death to Terokk! Death to Skettis!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20270,0,'Defender Grashna'),(31279,5,0,'Face your judgment by the Light!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31950,0,'Father Kamaros'),(31279,5,1,'You will never take me alive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31952,0,'Father Kamaros'),(31279,5,2,'The Argent Crusade never surrenders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31953,0,'Father Kamaros'),(32800,5,0,'Face your judgment by the Light!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31950,0,'Father Kamaros'),(32800,5,1,'You will never take me alive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31952,0,'Father Kamaros'),(32800,5,2,'The Argent Crusade never surrenders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31953,0,'Father Kamaros'),(26966,0,0,'The boy believed he could essssscape... Neither of you shall make it out alive.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26102,0,'Shadowy Tormentor'),(26966,0,1,'Kill ussss all... More will come for him...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26103,0,'Shadowy Tormentor'),(26966,0,2,'Relent! This ssssoul iss not worth sssaving...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26104,0,'Shadowy Tormentor'),(26966,0,3,'You have made a grave misssstake...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26105,0,'Shadowy Tormentor'),(23093,0,0,'So my blood was not a sufficient payment, eh? Fine, let us recover your arcane essence. After this, I owe Balthas nothing.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20913,0,'Sar\'this'),(23093,1,0,'%s places a fetish at the ritual pile.',16,0,100,16,0,0,0,20914,0,'Sar\'this'),(23093,2,0,'The process is arduous. We must first summon forth acolytes of the elements. You must then destroy these acolytes so that my minions can make preparations.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20915,0,'Sar\'this'),(23093,3,0,'Well done!  Let\'s continue.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20916,0,'Sar\'this'),(23093,4,0,'Prepare yourself! The acolyte of water is soon to come...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20917,0,'Sar\'this'),(23093,5,0,'Come forth, acolyte of earth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20918,0,'Sar\'this'),(23093,6,0,'Fire, show yourself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20919,0,'Sar\'this'),(23093,7,0,'Now we call forth the arcane acolyte.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20920,0,'Sar\'this'),(23093,8,0,'It is yours my Lord!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20971,0,'Sar\'this'),(23100,0,0,'I require your life essence to maintain my existence in this realm.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20970,0,'Flawless Arcane Elemental'),(22357,0,0,'What do you hope to accomplish from this, insect?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21556,0,'Reth\'hedron the Subduer'),(22357,0,1,'I WILL CRUSH YOU LIKE A GNAT!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21557,0,'Reth\'hedron the Subduer'),(22357,0,2,'You cannot stop us!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21558,0,'Reth\'hedron the Subduer'),(22357,0,3,'You are making me angry, mortal!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21559,0,'Reth\'hedron the Subduer'),(22357,0,4,'I will break you in two! Relent, fool!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21560,0,'Reth\'hedron the Subduer'),(22357,0,5,'Flee now while you still have your life!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21561,0,'Reth\'hedron the Subduer'),(22357,1,0,'You will regret this, mortal! Reth\'hedron will return... I will have my vengeance!',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,21606,0,'Reth\'hedron the Subduer'),(24233,1,0,'%s removes his disguise',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,22999,0,'Cleric of the Crusade'),(24232,2,0,'The boy\'s death and, in fact, the deaths of all of the knights involved in the redemption of the blade could have been avoided.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23000,0,'Tirion Fordring'),(24232,3,0,'Their passing weighs heavily upon my soul.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23001,0,'Tirion Fordring'),(24232,4,0,'%s grimaces.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,23003,0,'Tirion Fordring'),(24232,5,0,'It should have been me that carried the blade to Northrend. The burden was mine to bear.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23004,0,'Tirion Fordring'),(24232,6,0,'But you are right, Irulon. The price of our freedom will undoubtedly cost thousands more of their lives.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23005,0,'Tirion Fordring'),(24232,7,0,'%s picks up the Ashbringer',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,23006,0,'Tirion Fordring'),(24232,8,0,'Do you hear me, Arthas? The Argent Crusade comes for you! Your kingdom shall crumble beneath the weight of justice! By the Light!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,23007,0,'Tirion Fordring'),(24191,0,0,'Lord Fordring, you mustn\'t reveal yourself!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,22998,0,'Lord Irulon Trueblade'),(24191,1,0,'The path of freedom has always been beset with tragedy, sire. We could not risk losing you. The Crusade could not have survived such a blow.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23002,0,'Lord Irulon Trueblade'),(32638,0,0,'Thanks, buddy! Thanks for nothing!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33014,0,'Hakmud of Argus'),(32638,0,1,'Why do you treat Hakmud like this, buddy?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33015,0,'Hakmud of Argus'),(32638,0,2,'What is Hakmud supposed to do now, buddy?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33016,0,'Hakmud of Argus'),(32638,0,3,'Hakmud cannot work under these conditions! Goodbye!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33017,0,'Hakmud of Argus'),(32638,0,4,'I thought we were friend, buddy! You leave Hakmud stranded?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,33018,0,'Hakmud of Argus'),(32639,0,0,'Nobody loves Gnimo...',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,33019,0,'Gnimo'),(32639,0,1,'Goodbye! You were Gnimo\'s best friend ever!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,33020,0,'Gnimo'),(32639,0,2,'Time for Gnimo to shut down.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,33021,0,'Gnimo'),(25465,0,0,'%s cackles maniacally.\n',16,0,100,0,0,8818,0,13022,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),(25465,1,0,'You only delay the inevitable! The dread citadel rises in the east as the armies of the dead march from the heart of Icecrown!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26163,0,'Kel\'Thuzad'),(18424,0,0,'Go on, get out of here!  Save yourself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15391,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,1,'BOOM!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15395,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,2,'Stop looking at me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15397,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,3,'They broke us all.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15398,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,4,'Can\'t... control... form.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15399,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,5,'Meow.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15400,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,6,'Roar!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15401,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,7,'Blinding white light, and then silence!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15402,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,8,'Too close to the truth, too close to the truth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15403,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,9,'Who are you to stare at me and pass judgment?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15453,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,10,'Do I know you?  If you\'re interested in joining the Cenarion Expedition step right in.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15454,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,11,'Careful who you talk to.  The teromoths have ears.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15455,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,12,'Not all dinner guests are gracious.  Mind your manners!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15456,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,13,'It knows all, it sees all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15457,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,0,14,'No need to wait outside in the rain.  Come in... you\'re welcome with us in here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15458,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,1,0,'You won\'t get my clothes!  Die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15418,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,1,1,'Filthy vermin.  Submit or perish!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15450,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,1,2,'You as well, Flutter?  We used to be such good friends.  I will miss you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15451,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,1,3,'Oops, my bad.  Sometimes I can\'t control my moonfire.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15452,0,'Warden Treelos'),(18424,1,4,'The vicious teromoths and I are just fine in here on our own, thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15459,0,'Warden Treelos'),(158281,1,0,'Goodbye.',12,0,100,0,0,158121,0,113727,0,'Greeter Mnemis to Kalisthene'),(25208,4,0,'Hey you, stranger, come here!',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,24314,0,'Lurgglbr'),(25208,4,1,'If only there were someone nearby who would help me escape.',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,24315,0,'Lurgglbr'),(25208,4,2,'You can\'t hold me against my will! You\'ve all been brainwashed!',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,24316,0,'Lurgglbr'),(25208,4,3,'Living in these caverns and following that mad lobstrok, Clacker, is unnatural! Let me free!',12,0,100,36,0,0,0,24317,0,'Lurgglbr'),(25504,4,0,'%s hugs Elder Mootoo.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24750,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,5,0,'The mist is death... senseless, without compassion.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24757,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,5,1,'So cold...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24964,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,5,2,'Everyone is dead... Everyone and everything...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24965,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,5,3,'How will we overcome the mist?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,27243,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,5,4,'I thought for sure that I would die like all the others!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,27244,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,5,5,'What was that! Did you see that?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,27245,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25504,5,6,'Have you heard of the taunka? They are supposedly related to tauren in some way. Can you imagine such a thing?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,27246,0,'Mootoo the Younger'),(25503,0,0,'Mootoo thanks you, $n.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24753,0,'Elder Mootoo'),(30186,0,0,