e going to make them wish they were never awakened!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30889,0,'Ebon Blade Prisoner'),(30197,0,0,'You have my thanks. I\'m going back to The Shadow Vault now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30874,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,0,1,'I\'ve tarried too long here. I must get back to The Shadow Vault. Farewell.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30875,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,0,2,'I will see you back at The Shadow Vault.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30876,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,0,3,'That\'s enough for me. I\'m heading back now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30877,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,0,4,'I\'d love to stay and kill vrykul with you all day, but I\'m sure the baron will be wondering where I am.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30878,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,0,5,'I have to go. You stay and kill more of these ugly mongrels.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30879,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,0,6,'Time to go. Don\'t let them capture you or they\'ll put you in the stew!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30880,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,0,7,'I\'m heading back now. I\'ll let the baron know that you liberated me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30881,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,1,0,'Let\'s do this.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30898,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,1,1,'Thanks. How can I help?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30899,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,1,2,'I can fight by your side for a few minutes before I need to return to The Shadow Vault.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30900,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,1,3,'Thank you, $c. I owe you.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30901,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,1,4,'Excellent. Let\'s kill some vrykul!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30902,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,1,5,'It\'s time for revenge!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30903,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,1,6,'Where\'s my damned helmet? Well, at least they left my sword here. Idiots.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30904,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30197,1,7,'Kill!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,30905,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(30198,0,0,'You have my thanks. I\'m going back to The Shadow Vault now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30874,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),(3019