ething so large?',12,0,100,6,0,27301,0,55575,0,'Ji Firepaw to Aysa Cloudsinger'),(56660,3,0,'A thorn?  And I left my tweezers at home.',12,0,100,6,0,27300,0,55574,0,'Ji Firepaw to Aysa Cloudsinger'),(56660,2,0,'When am I not respectful?  You hurt me, Aysa.',12,0,100,6,0,27299,0,55561,0,'Ji Firepaw to Aysa Cloudsinger'),(56660,1,0,'Bah, let a pandaren hope, would you?  I\'m going to miss the old man.',12,0,100,1,0,27298,0,55556,0,'Ji Firepaw to Aysa Cloudsinger'),(56686,3,0,'Now Shen-zin Su is ill, and we are all in danger. With the help of the elements, you will break the silence. You will speak to him.',12,0,100,1,0,27810,0,55531,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56686,2,0,'$p, our people have lived the wholes of their lives on this great turtle, Shen-zin Su, but not in hundreds of years has anyone spoken to him.',12,0,100,1,0,27809,0,55530,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56686,1,0,'Every elder reaches the day where he must pass on and plant his stave with the staves of his ancestors. Today is the day when my staff joins these woods.',12,0,100,1,0,27808,0,55529,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56686,0,0,'For 3,000 years, we have passed the knowledge of our people down. Elder to youth. Master to student.',12,0,100,1,0,27807,0,55528,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(55672,0,0,'And here we are. Help me with a couple small tasks while I prepare, if you would.',12,0,100,1,0,27805,0,56485,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56159,4,0,'You\'ve become strong indeed, child. This is good. You will need that strength soon.',12,0,100,1,0,27803,0,56484,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56159,3,0,'Defeat the Guardian of the Elders, and we may pass.',12,0,100,1,0,27802,0,55523,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56159,2,0,'Of the many ways to prove your worth, I require the simplest of you now. I must know that you will fight for our people. I must know that you can keep them safe.',12,0,100,1,0,27801,0,55522,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(64506,1,0,'You\'ve done it!  Now quickly, lets attack it while it\'s grounded.',12,0,100,0,0,27381,0,64767,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Zhao-Ren'),(64506,2,0,'It\'s down!  Let\'s finish it off.',12,0,100,0,0,27382,0,64768,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Zhao-Ren'),(56159,0,0,'Come child. We have one final journey to take together before your training is complete.',12,0,100,1,0,27797,0,55520,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56159,1,0,'Beyond the Elders\' Path lies the Wood of Staves, a sacred place that only the worthy may enter.',12,0,100,1,0,27800,0,55521,0,'Master Shang Xi to Player'),(64506,0,0,'That\'s the way to do it!',12,0,100,0,0,27380,0,64766,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Zhao-Ren'),(65558,3,0,'That all you\'ve got?!',12,0,100,5,0,27316,0,60620,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(65558,4,0,'This monkey\'s about to get slapped!',12,0,100,5,0,27317,0,60621,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(65558,5,0,'And he\'s down for the count! Good going.',12,0,100,5,0,27315,0,60622,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(65558,6,0,'See you at the dock!',12,0,100,0,0,27319,0,60618,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(57692,0,0,'This is magnificent!  I\'ve never seen craftsmanship so fine.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56363,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(57692,1,0,'There is only one thing to do.  I must smash it!  Once and for all, all shall know the power of my mighty brow.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56361,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(57692,2,0,'Oh... my head... it hurts so badly!  I\'ve... the pillar must contain enormous power... perhaps stronger even than my brow...',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,56362,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(57692,3,0,'I\'m... I\'m just going to lie down a while... until this headache goes away.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,56364,0,'Jojo Ironbrow to Player'),(55744,0,0,'Wait!',12,0,100,5,0,27400,0,54355,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(55744,1,0,'We need to wait for the winds to settle, then make a break for the cover of the far hallway.',12,0,100,1,0,27401,0,54356,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(55744,2,0,'Wait for another opening. I\'ll meet you on the far side.',12,0,100,1,0,27402,0,54357,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(55595,0,0,'Dafeng! What\'s wrong? Why are you hiding back here?',12,0,100,1,0,27403,0,54362,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(62087,14,0,'Do I make myself clear?',12,0,100,5,0,30760,0,61602,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62087,13,0,'The minute they put on that Alliance tabard, they died. I will NOT tolerate any lingering ties across enemy lines. Traitors to the Horde will die a traitor\'s death!',12,0,100,274,0,30759,0,61601,0,'Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(62822,0,0,'Ten years. I have faithfully brushed yak for ten years.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,63965,0,'Cousin Slowhands to Player'),(165050,0,0,'Let\'s see if you bleed!',12,0,100,0,0,151009,0,189697,0,'Rotbriar Scrapper to Player'),(165050,1,0,'Give me your best shot!',12,0,100,0,0,151007,0,189696,0,'Rotbriar Scrapper to Player'),(165051,1,0,'How... did this... happen...',12,0,100,0,0,151067,0,189779,0,'Rotbriar Tormentor to Player'),(62821,0,0,'I am yak rider. And this is my yak.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,63973,0,'Mystic Birdhat to Player'),(75839,0,0,'None live who assault the holy Auchenai.',14,0,100,0,0,46436,0,80470,0,'Vigilant Kaathar to Soulbinder Nyami'),(75839,1,0,'I will strike you down.',14,0,100,0,0,46434,0,80471,0,'Vigilant Kaathar to Player'),(75839,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_avengersshield:20|t %s hurls his |cFFF00000|Hspell:153480|h[Holy Shield]|h|r at $n!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,85067,0,'Vigilant Kaathar to Player'),(75839,3,0,'Auchindoun... is... doomed...',14,0,100,0,0,46435,0,80469,0,'Vigilant Kaathar to Player'),(75927,0,0,'Who dares meddle in the works of the Legion?!',14,0,100,0,0,46776,0,90295,0,'Azzakel to Cackling Pyromaniac'),(75927,1,0,'This world... ALL worlds... shall burn!',14,0,100,0,0,46774,0,90296,0,'Azzakel to Player'),(75927,2,0,'Die, insect!',14,0,100,0,0,46781,0,52204,0,'Azzakel to Player'),(75927,3,0,'Burn in the master\'s fire!',14,0,100,0,0,46780,0,90300,0,'Azzakel to Player'),(75927,4,0,'Come forth, servants!',14,0,100,0,0,46779,0,90299,0,'Azzakel'),(76177,0,0,'I will coil your souls into darkness!',14,0,100,0,0,43636,0,79416,0,'Soulbinder Nyami to Player'),(76177,1,0,'The spirits are mine to command!',14,0,100,0,0,43649,0,79422,0,'Soulbinder Nyami'),(76177,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SoulLeech_2.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:153477|h[Soul Vessel]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,43649,0,91481,0,'Soulbinder Nyami to Soulbinder Nyami'),(76177,3,0,'Too late... my Master... comes...',14,0,100,0,0,43637,0,79418,0,'Soulbinder Nyami to Player'),(76572,0,0,'Auchenai, secure this chamber.',14,0,100,25,0,43234,0,88952,0,'Auchenai Warden to Player'),(76572,1,0,'The barrier protecting Auchindoun is asunder.',12,0,100,1,0,43235,0,88953,0,'Auchenai Warden to Player'),(76572,2,0,'A foul force has penetrated these sacred chambers.',12,0,100,1,0,43236,0,88954,0,'Auchenai Warden to Player'),(76572,3,0,'Scout ahead while we establish a foothold.',12,0,100,603,0,43237,0,88956,0,'Auchenai Warden to Player'),(216638,3,0,'They mentioned something about the Underkeep. Have you heard of it?',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,''),(77704,0,0,'Champions! Nyami\'s agents - they went this way!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,83942,0,'Auchenai Warden to Player'),(77704,1,0,'No... Oh no...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,83944,0,'Auchenai Warden to Player'),(77734,0,0,'This power... you will be the first to know it.',14,0,100,0,0,44418,0,83269,0,'Teron\'gor'),(77734,1,0,'Elum... a liftetime of healing, now you shall fuel disease and decay!',14,0,100,0,0,44422,0,83272,0,'Teron\'gor'),(77734,2,0,'Wither away!',14,0,100,0,0,44434,0,44768,0,'Teron\'gor to Player'),(77734,3,0,'Quickly, now!',14,0,100,0,0,44438,0,83280,0,'Teron\'gor'),(77734,4,0,'More! I... need... more!',14,0,100,15,0,44439,0,83281,0,'Teron\'gor'),(77810,0,0,'It is done! As for you, I think it is fitting that one of my tools dispatches the others...',14,0,100,0,0,43644,0,88053,0,'Soulbinder Nyami to Soulbinder Nyami'),(77810,1,0,'Protector! Destroy these intruders!',14,0,100,0,0,43645,0,80536,0,'Soulbinder Nyami to Soulbinder Nyami'),(216638,0,0,'Thanks for the aid. These tunnels stretch on for ages.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,''),(216638,2,0,'The nerubians lured us into a trap. They wanted us away from Hallowfall.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(216638,1,0,'I can\'t believe we chased the nerubians all the way up to the surface!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,''),(210759,2,0,'%s begins mining.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(210759,3,0,'%s begins making a campfire.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(210759,4,0,'Ye got tae dodge!',12,0,100,0,0,247551,0,0,0,''),(216632,0,0,'Thanks for the aid! The others should be just up ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(198442,0,0,'The odds favor us!',12,0,100,0,0,203269,0,0,0,'Kodethi to Player'),(77693,0,0,'Nyami awaits you in the western ritual chamber, champions.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,83111,0,'Auchenai Defender to Player'),(79248,0,0,'Good! We must have arrived before Teron\'gor and Gul\'dan!',12,0,100,3,0,44644,0,81528,0,'Soulbinder Tuulani to Player'),(79248,1,0,'Nyami is working to bolster the defenses against their assault - follow me, we will report to her.',12,0,100,1,0,44654,0,81529,0,'Soulbinder Tuulani to Player'),(79248,2,0,'Beautiful, isn\'t it? Just think - you\'re one of the first outsiders to see inside Auchindoun.',12,0,100,6,0,44655,0,81530,0,'Soulbinder Tuulani to Player'),(79248,3,0,'Strange... why is the door sealed? No matter...',12,0,100,6,0,44656,0,81531,0,'Soulbinder Tuulani to Player'),(79248,4,0,'Let us proceed.',12,0,100,25,0,44657,0,81532,0,'Soulbinder Tuulani'),(79248,5,0,'The Vindicators and Exarchs of the past. Heroes all - their souls still remain with us here.',12,0,100,25,0,44658,0,81533,0,'Soulbinder Tuulani'),(122965,3,1,'Flesh for master!',14,0,100,0,0,97347,0,140455,0,'Vol\'kaal - Slay'),(122965,4,0,'Master take your parts. Make me stronger!',14,0,100,0,0,97348,0,140456,0,'Vol\'kaal - Evade'),(177353,0,0,'A cub\'s pained whimper sends nearby allies into a tantrum!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shardhide Scraper to Player'),(177423,1,0,'I understand, Bonesmith. Once the the vault is opened, you can be on your way.',12,0,100,0,0,181163,0,209111,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177566,1,0,'The Primus has fallen! His sigil will be claimed by the Banished One!',12,0,100,0,0,181187,0,209882,0,'Xalvez the Collector to Remnants of Kalvez'),(177570,1,0,'Occupy his forces while I find a way to escape!',12,0,100,0,0,181458,0,209361,0,'The Primus to Player'),(177570,2,0,'No. I will defy you!',12,0,100,0,0,181460,0,209363,0,'The Primus to Player'),(178010,2,0,'These records must reach Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Record Keeper'),(178010,3,0,'You have done well. I must get this data to Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Record Keeper'),(178157,1,0,'This shouldn\'t take long to fix. Just make sure I don\'t get gutted by any Mawsworn!',12,0,100,0,0,181147,0,209188,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(178191,0,0,'The Jailer will reward us for killing the Maw Walker!',14,0,100,0,0,181182,0,209189,0,'Xalvez the Collector'),(178191,1,0,'You won\'t be so fortunate when next we meet!',14,0,100,0,0,181185,0,209190,0,'Xalvez the Collector to Player'),(178372,1,0,'You once bound me with Domination. Now it is my weapon to wield.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Anduin'),(178774,0,0,'This is the Runecarver?! Doesn\'t look like much.',12,0,100,603,0,181315,0,211106,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(179974,0,0,'For Sinfall!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(180005,0,0,'$p! Would you join our hunt? We have need of a fourth.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Karras to Player'),(19671,11,0,'What do we have here? I thought you said the area was secure? This is now the third attack? If we make it out of here, I will definitely be deducting this from your reward. Now don\'t just stand there, destroy them so I can get to that collector.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17256,0,'Cryo-Engineer Sha\'heen'),(19671,12,0,'We\'re close to the exit. I\'ll let you rest for about thirty seconds, but then we\'re out of here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17258,0,'Cryo-Engineer Sha\'heen'),(19671,13,0,'Are you ready to go?',12,0,10