0148,0,'Captain Hartford'),(29490,1,1,'I\'ll have your gizzard for breakfast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30149,0,'Captain Hartford'),(29490,1,2,'Better than you have tried!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30151,0,'Captain Hartford'),(29490,1,3,'You may kill me, but I\'ll never tell you what you want!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30152,0,'Captain Hartford'),(29490,1,4,'I am Scarlet Onslaught. We don\'t rat out our leaders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30153,0,'Captain Hartford'),(29490,1,5,'You\'re just a filthy pawn of the Ebon Blade. Die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30154,0,'Captain Hartford'),(29490,1,6,'No, I don\'t know where he is and if I did, I wouldn\'t tell you -- even if my life depended on it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30155,0,'Captain Hartford'),(29490,1,7,'Your corpse will adorn my mast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30157,0,'Captain Hartford'),(29614,0,3,'The darkweaver pierces you with an evil grin as he shifts into an entirely different form.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,30265,0,'Onslaught Darkweaver'),(29614,0,4,'Now you know. Now you must die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30266,0,'Onslaught Darkweaver'),(29614,0,5,'Even in death there will be no escape for you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30267,0,'Onslaught Darkweaver'),(29614,0,6,'I shall feast upon your soul!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30268,0,'Onslaught Darkweaver'),(29614,0,7,'You will not leave this cavern alive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30269,0,'Onslaught Darkweaver'),(30751,0,0,'I will take pleasure in gutting you!',12,0,100,0,0,13533,0,30498,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,1,'I will feed you to the dogs!',12,0,100,0,0,13534,0,30499,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,2,'Your entrails will make a fine necklace.',12,0,100,0,0,13535,0,30500,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,3,'Die, maggot!',12,0,100,0,0,13536,0,30501,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,4,'You come to die!',12,0,100,0,0,13537,0,30502,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,5,'I spit on you!',12,0,100,0,0,13538,0,30503,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,6,'Sniveling pig!',12,0,100,0,0,13539,0,30504,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,7,'Ugglin oo bjorr!',12,0,100,0,0,13540,0,30505,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,8,'Haraak foln!',12,0,100,0,0,13541,0,30506,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(30751,0,9,'I\'ll eat your heart!',12,0,100,0,0,13542,0,30508,0,'Kul\'galar Oracle'),(20802,6,2,'I need to find a new line of work.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18440,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(20802,7,0,'Looks like my work here is done. Report back to the holo-image of Ameer over at the transponder.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,18442,0,'Protectorate Demolitionist'),(30475,3,0,'You may have defeated my champions, $c. I am something else entirely.',14,0,100,66,0,0,0,31212,0,'Thane Illskar'),(30475,4,0,'Pray to your gods for a quick death.',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,31213,0,'Thane Illskar'),(20116,0,0,'I\'ll crush you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1925,0,'Gurn Grubnosh'),(27978,3,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1191,0,'Sjonnir EMOTE_FRENZY'),(14517,4,0,'%s begins to cast a Great Heal!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10494,0,'High Priestess Jeklik'),(14517,3,0,'%s emits a deafening shriek!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10370,0,'High Priestess Jeklik'),(30250,0,2,'Your entrails will make a fine necklace.',12,0,100,0,0,13535,0,30500,0,'Valhalas Vargul'),(30250,0,3,'Die, maggot!',12,0,100,0,0,13536,0,30501,0,'Valhalas Vargul'),(30250,0,4,'You come to die!',12,0,100,0,0,13537,0,30502,0,'Valhalas Vargul'),(30250,0,5,'I spit on you!',12,0,100,0,0,13538,0,30503,0,'Valhalas Vargul'),(30250,0,6,'Sniveling pig!',12,0,100,0,0,13539,0,30504,0,'Valhalas Vargul'),(30250,0,7,'Ugglin oo bjorr!',12,0,100,0,0,13540,0,30505,0,'Valhalas Vargul'),(30250,0,8,'Haraak foln!',12,0,100,0,0,13541,0,30506,0,'Valhalas Vargul'),(30250,0,9,'I\'ll eat your heart!',12,0,100,0,0,13542,0,30508,0,'Valhalas Vargul'),(30409,1,3,'I will not let you destroy our hard work! Nergeld will be the end of you all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31105,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(30409,1,4,'When the doctor returns, your pitiful Shadow Vault will be laid to waste.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31106,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(30409,1,5,'Nergeld is only the first of a new army of vargul-powered flesh giants. You\'ve not known fear until now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31107,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(30409,1,6,'I have no time for this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31108,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(30409,1,7,'You\'re too late, puny one.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31109,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(30409,2,0,'The doctor entrusted me with the plans to Nergeld, our flesh giant amalgamation made entirely of vargul! It will be the most powerful creation of its kind and a whole legion of them will be created to destroy your pitiful forces!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31090,0,'Apprentice Osterkilgr'),(25639,0,2,'Rest now, you have fought well today.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24858,0,'Anchorite Elbadon'),(19493,0,0,'I told you only to summon me if that stupid elf returned! What\'s this? No matter, you won\'t detain me long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17887,0,'Ekkorash the Inquisitor'),(19938,0,0,'A flickering image of a female blood elf commander appears. From the surroundings, you can tell she must be inside Tempest Keep.',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,17529,0,'Image of Commander Sarannis'),(19938,1,0,'The blood elf doesn\'t appear to be a magister, but perhaps she holds something that is the key to the tower\'s curse.',16,0,100,25,0,0,0,17530,0,'Image of Commander Sarannis'),(21496,0,0,'Cansis, hold still. I\'m going to try to use this crystal.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19315,0,'Dertrok'),(21496,1,0,'Interesting... Let me try something.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,19317,0,'Dertrok'),(21496,2,0,'Cansis. You are a chicken.',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,19318,0,'Dertrok'),(21496,3,0,'Fascinating.',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,19389,0,'Dertrok'),(21692,0,0,'If you ever do that again, I will break your neck.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,19388,0,'Cansis'),(27888,0,0,'For Dalaran! Attack!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24890,0,'Warmage Archus'),(6175,0,0,'Don\'t forget the orphans of Stormwind!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2401,0,'John Turner'),(6175,0,1,'Help the children of Stormwind... victims of the war and plague!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2402,0,'John Turner'),(6175,0,2,'Give to the charities who seek to help the victims of these hard times! Please.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2403,0,'John Turner'),(6175,0,3,'Give of your hearts and your purses! Give to the children of Stormwind who have lost their parents.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2404,0,'John Turner'),(19556,0,0,'War drums echo in the distance.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16980,2,'Thrall'),(19556,1,0,'At long last, I am home...',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,16996,2,'Thrall'),(19556,2,0,'Hellscream! Blessed ancestors! He is the mirrored reflection of Grom, Drek\'Thar.',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,17080,0,'Thrall'),(19556,3,0,'I am sorry that I did not come sooner, young Hellscream. There is so much that I have to tell you about your father, but first you must tell me where I may find the Greatmother.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17096,0,'Thrall'),(18063,0,0,'We are honored by your presence, son of Durotan. The Greatmother awaits you at the hospice.',12,1,100,2,0,0,0,17098,0,'Garrosh'),(18063,1,0,'%s points towards the hospice.',16,1,100,25,0,0,0,17099,0,'Garrosh'),(19556,4,0,'I thank you, Garrosh. We have much to discuss when I return from my visit with the Greatmother.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17100,0,'Thrall'),(19556,5,0,'Greatmother...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17102,0,'Thrall'),(18141,0,0,'I have been expecting you, young one. Come closer - my eyes are not as sharp as they once were.\n',12,1,100,273,0,0,0,17101,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(18141,1,0,'Yes, you move like my son. You have his broad shoulders - ahh, and your mother\'s fierce eyes.\n',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17120,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(19556,6,0,'Greatmother...Am I...\n',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,17113,0,'Thrall'),(18141,2,0,'There is no doubt - you are the heir of Durotan... my grandson. Draka told me she was with child before she and your father left our world, but I never dared dream that they would survive...\n',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17123,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(19556,7,0,'They... did not, Greatmother. They were killed shortly after I was born. I never knew them. I was raised as a slave. To this day, I carry the name of Thrall.\n',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17122,0,'Thrall'),(18141,3,0,'Thrall? You\'ve been a slave only to the past, grandson! But no more! When last I saw him, Durotan told me the name he would give his unborn son... He was... so proud...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17126,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(18141,4,0,'%s wipes a tear away.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,17926,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(18141,5,0,'Go\'el. You are Go\'el, son of Durotan - rightful chieftain of the Frostwolves. This day, grandson - you are the great joy of my heart.\n',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,17927,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(19556,8,0,'I have dreamed of this moment all my life, Greatmother. \'Till now, all I\'ve had were Orgrim\'s stories about my parents and their adventures on Draenor. He was my greatest teacher and dearest friend. He died a hero... They all died as heroes - and for all of them, a song of honor remains.\n',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17928,0,'Thrall'),(18141,6,0,'I see that you hold the Doomhammer. Have all of our greatest heroes fallen, grandson?\n',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,17929,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(19556,9,0,'They died honorably, Greatmother.',12,1,100,273,0,0,0,17124,0,'Thrall'),(18141,7,0,'What of Grommash? What of Hellscream?\n',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,17930,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(19556,10,0,'He died our greatest hero. It was Grom who freed us all... I was by his side when he struck down Mannoroth and ended the curse forever.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17128,0,'Thrall'),(18141,8,0,'Blessed spirits! For twenty years, all we knew was that Grom was the first to drink from the cursed chalice and bring damnation down upon our people... It is the only truth his son, Garrosh has ever known.\n',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17129,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(18141,9,0,'Grandson, will you... Will you tell Garrosh what you have told me about his father?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17131,0,'Greatmother Geyah'),(19556,11,0,'Tell him? Greatmother, that boy\'s father died so that all of us could live free of the blood curse. I will tell him nothing. I will show him! Show him and any that would doubt Hellscream\'s resolve exactly what Grom Hellscream did for all orcs!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17132,0,'Thrall'),(19556,12,0,'Please excuse me, Greatmother. I will return soon.',12,1,100,2,0,0,0,17133,0,'Thrall'),(19556,13,0,'Garrosh, son of Hellscream, your father lived and died as our greatest hero. Honor me by allowing me to show you what your father sacrificed so that we could live free of the demon\'s grasp.',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,17134,0,'Thrall'),(18063,2,0,'As you wish, Thrall, son of Durotan.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17135,0,'Garrosh'),(19556,14,0,'Spirits give me strength! Take from my soul these old wounds and expose them for all to see! Let this child know his father! Let these people know their savior!',14,1,100,22,0,0,0,17136,0,'Thrall'),(18075,0,0,'%s laughs.',16,0,100,0,0,10624,0,17137,0,'Mannoroth'),(18075,1,0,'So predictable. I knew you would come. And I see you\'ve brought the mighty Hellscream.',12,0,100,1,0,10625,0,17138,0,'Mannoroth'),(18075,2,0,'His blood is mine, as is your whole misbegotten race.',12,0,100,1,0,10626,0,17139,0,'Mannoroth'),(19647,0,0,'%s roars in defiance.',16,0,100,15,0,0,0,17140,0,'Thrall'),(18075,3,0,'A worthy effort, but futile.',12,0,100,1,0,10627,0,17141,0,'Mannoroth'),(18075,4,0,'%s laughs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17137,0,'Mannoroth'),(18075,5,0,'The boy believed you could be saved, but he didn\'t know what burns within your soul when in your heart, you know we are the same.\n',12,0,100,1,0,10628,0,17142,0,'Mannoroth'),(18076,0,0,'NOOOO!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,17144,0,'Grom Hellscream'),(18076,1,0,'Thrall... The blood haze has lifted.',12,0,100,0,0,10629,0,17150,0,'Grom Hellscream'),(18076,2,0,'Grom\'s eyes go dim as the blood curse is lifted.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17151,0,'Grom Hellscream'),(18076,3,0,'The demon\'s fire has burnt out in my veins. I have... freed myself.\n',12,0,100,0,0,10630,0,17152,0,'Grom Hellscream'),(19647,1,0,'No, old friend. You\'ve freed us all...',12,0,100,0,0,10631,0,17153,0,'Thrall'),(18063,3,0,'%s collapses.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,17163,0,'Garrosh'),(18063,4,0,'For my entire life I have thought my bloodline cursed. I have lived beneath the shadow of my father\'s greatest failure.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17164,0,'Garrosh'),(18063,5,0,'I hated him for what he had done. I hated him for the burden he left me. But now...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17166,0,'Garrosh'),(18063,6,0,'You have shown me truths that I would have never known. You and your allies have gifted me with something that cannot bear a price: Redemption. Thrall, redeemer of the Mag\'har, you honor me as none ever have...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17167,0,'Garrosh'),(18063,7,0,'On this day, a great burden has been lifted from my chest. My heart swells with pride. And for the first time, I can proudly proclaim who I am. I can finally unleash the fury in my heart.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17168,0,'Garrosh'),(18063,8,0,'I am Garrosh Hellscream, son of Grom, chieftain of the Mag\'har! Let the battle call of Hellscream give you courage and strength! Be lifted by my rallying cry.',14,1,100,15,0,0,0,17169,0,'Garrosh'),(18063,9,0,'Thank you, son of Durotan.',12,1,100,2,0,0,0,17171,0,'Garrosh'),(19556,15,0,'%s places a hand on Garrosh\'s shoulder.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,17172,0,'Thrall'),(19556,16,0,'You need not thank me, Garrosh. Your father was a brother to me. I would do anything for you and the Mag\'har. I must now return to the Greatmother.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17173,0,'Thrall'),(19556,17,0,'I have returned, Greatmother. Garrosh has found his heart and his fury.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17175,0,'Thrall'),(18489,0,0,'Who is he? He looks so familiar.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17005,0,'Garadar Defender'),(18489,0,1,'Are the rumors true? Does he truly carry the Greatmother\'s bloodline?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17006,0,'Garadar Defender'),(18489,0,2,'Could it really be? The son of Durotan?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17007,0,'Garadar Defender'),(18489,0,3,'Has he come to lead us?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17008,0,'Garadar Defender'),(18489,0,4,'I have never felt such strength radiate from an orc. Is he... mortal...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17009,0,'Garadar Defender'),(18489,0,5,'He carries the Doomhammer!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17010,0,'Garadar Defender'),(18489,0,6,'For the first time, I feel safe. I do not know you, stranger, but I know that I would lay down my life for you if only you asked.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17011,0,'Garadar Defender'),(18489,0,7,'Son of Durotan... Grandson of Garad and Geyah... Bow your heads for a Warchief is among us...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17012,0,'Garadar Defender'),(18489,0,8,'I am unworthy, son of Durotan. We are all unworthy...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,17013,0,'Garadar Defender'),(27006,0,0,'You dare invade Magnataur lands?  Bonesunder gladly smash you and take your limbs as payment!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,26665,0,'Bonesunder'),(27006,1,0,'Bonesunder begins to cast Crack Bone!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28605,0,'Bonesunder'),(20041,0,0,'%s\'s hand begins to glow with Arcane energy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,19264,0,'Crystalcore Sentinel'),(19389,0,0,'%s lets out a massive roar, calling for aid!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2441,0,'Lair Brute'),(21350,0,0,'%s lets out a massive roar, calling for aid!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2441,0,'Gronn-Priest'),(24177,1,4,'Away... go...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22902,0,'Decomposing Ghoul'),(28068,1,0,'Mmm, more mojo.',14,0,100,35,0,4496,0,27531,0,'Prophet of Sseratus'),(28068,2,0,'NOOOOOOOOooooooo.........!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27532,0,'Prophet of Sseratus'),(28118,0,0,'You dare summon me?!',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,27501,0,'Watery Lord'),(28118,0,1,'Prepare to drown!',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,27502,0,'Watery Lord'),(28118,0,2,'The depths consume you!',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,27503,0,'Watery Lord'),(28118,0,3,'I will add your watery innards to my own.',12,0,100,34,0,0,0,27504,0,'Watery Lord'),(17015,4,0,'Another pilgrim has arrived! Bring water quickly, or we may lose her!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,13388,0,'Taleris Dawngazer'),(29311,6,0,'Ywaq maq oou; ywaq maq ssaggh. Ywaq ma shg\'fhn.',14,0,100,0,0,14049,0,32602,0,'Herald Volazj SAY_DEATH_2'),(29311,7,0,'They who dine on lost souls know only hunger.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32597,0,'Herald Volazj WHISPER_AGGRO'),(29311,8,0,'Gaze into the void. It is the perpetuity in which they dwell.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32604,0,'Herald Volazj WHISPER_INSANITY'),(29311,9,0,'They are the whisper on the shivering wind.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32605,0,'Herald Volazj WHISPER_SLAY_1'),(29311,10,0,'Their shadow will choke the land for eternity.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32606,0,'Herald Volazj WHISPER_SLAY_2'),(29311,11,0,'They drink your fear: it is the blood of life.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32607,0,'Herald Volazj WHISPER_SLAY_3'),(29311,12,0,'Where one falls, many shall take its place.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32608,0,'Herald Volazj WHISPER_DEATH_1'),(29311,13,0,'They do not die; they do not live. They are outside the cycle.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32609,0,'Herald Volazj WHISPER_DEATH_2'),(15931,0,0,'%s sprays slime across the room!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32318,0,'Grobbulus EMOTE_SLIME'),(15931,1,0,'%s injects you with a mutagen!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,32319,0,'Grobbulus EMOTE_MUTAGEN'),(7956,0,0,'I\'m ready when you are, $n. Lead the way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4079,0,'Kindal Moonweaver'),(7956,1,0,'We\'ve done it! Meet me back by Jer\'kai above the Grim Totem camp.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4080,0,'Kindal Moonweaver'),(7956,2,0,'No! The faerie dragons aren\'t making it, $n! I must return to Jer\'kai to make sure she hasn\'t been found. Elune be with you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4081,0,'Kindal Moonweaver'),(7956,3,0,'Quickly! $n attacks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4122,0,'Kindal Moonweaver'),(7956,3,1,'Die, $n. Elune will not have you harm her creatures any longer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4123,0,'Kindal Moonweaver'),(7956,3,2,'Death to you, $n. How dare you come within a bow\'s shot of me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4124,0,'Kindal Moonweaver'),(7956,3,3,'You dare touch me?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4125,0,'Kindal Moonweaver'),(7956,4,0,'Oh, no! We\'ve run out of time. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5285,0,'Kindal Moonweaver'),(6329,1,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1191,0,'Irradiated Pillager'),(17681,0,1,'Woot! Thanks!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14347,0,'Expedition Researcher'),(17681,0,2,'By the forehead signet of Velen, I am saved!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14348,0,'Expedition Researcher'),(17681,0,3,'I knew Cornelius wouldn\'t leave us behind!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,14349,0,'Expedition Researcher'),(28415,0,3,'It\'s too late for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27894,0,'Captive Footman'),(28415,1,0,'I\'m saved!',12,0,100,71,0,0,0,27896,0,'Captive Footman'),(28415,1,1,'I thought I was done for!',12,0,100,71,0,0,0,27897,0,'Captive Footman'),(28415,1,2,'Thank you!',12,0,100,71,0,0,0,27898,0,'Captive Footman'),(28415,1,3,'I am in your debt, friend.',12,0,100,71,0,0,0,27899,0,'Captive Footman'),(24211,0,7,'I owe you a life debt, stranger.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,22952,0,'Freed Winterhoof Longrunner'),(17770,0,0,'Hungarfen roars in pain. ',16,0,100,15,0,0,0,16594,0,'Hungarfen EMOTE_ROARS'),(25270,0,0,'Huh? Where me at? Dis don\'t look good! Me run now!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24626,0,'Warsong Peon'),(25270,0,1,'HOORAY! ME FREE!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24627,0,'Warsong Peon'),(25270,0,2,'Tanks, buddy!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24628,0,'Warsong Peon'),(25270,0,3,'Mister Mortuus gonna be so mad! Me go home now.',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24629,0,'Warsong Peon'),(25270,0,4,'Why it keep telling me to put da lotion in da basket? Me no like da lotion!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24630,0,'Warsong Peon'),(25414,0,0,'My axe is yours, hero! Together we will destroy these insects!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24614,0,'Warsong Hold Warrior'),(25414,1,0,'I must return to Warsong Hold. Battle hard, hero!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24615,0,'Warsong Hold Warrior'),(25414,1,1,'I must return to Warsong Hold, hero. May you swim in the blood of our enemies and feast upon their sorrow!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24616,0,'Warsong Hold Warrior'),(25420,0,0,'By the fury of the Sunwell, I am released!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24624,0,'Warsong Hold Mage'),(25420,0,1,'Vengeance shall be mine! For Quel\'thalas! For the sin\'dorei!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24625,0,'Warsong Hold Mage'),(25420,1,0,'Farewell, friend. I must return to Warsong Hold.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24617,0,'Warsong Hold Mage'),(25420,1,1,'Until we meet again, hero. Duty calls!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24618,0,'Warsong Hold Mage'),(25421,0,0,'Rescued! You have my thanks and my aid, friend.',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24622,0,'Warsong Hold Shaman'),(25421,0,1,'We will battle together to rid this quarry of the Scourge!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24623,0,'Warsong Hold Shaman'),(25421,1,0,'Spirits watch over you, friend. I must make my return to Warsong Hold.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24620,0,'Warsong Hold Shaman'),(25421,1,1,'Ancestors be with you, hero. Farewell!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,24621,0,'Warsong Hold Shaman'),(8421,0,0,'Bravo! Bravo! Good show. What? You thought I was dead?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,4393,0,'Dorius'),(8421,1,0,'Fools, I knew that if I played upon my brother\'s feeble emotions, he would send \'rescuers.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4394,0,'Dorius'),(8421,2,0,'How easy it was to manipulate you into recovering the last Suntara stone from those imbeciles of the Twilight\'s Hammer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4395,0,'Dorius'),(8421,3,0,'When I stumbled upon the Suntara stones at the Grimesilt Digsite, the power of Ragnaros surged through my being. It was Ragnaros that gave me a purpose.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4396,0,'Dorius'),(8421,4,0,'It was the will of Ragnaros that Obsidion be built. Obsidion will destroy the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire, uniting us with our bretheren in the fiery depths.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,4397,0,'Dorius'),(8421,5,0,'And ultimately, it was Ragnaros that named me when I was reborn as an acolyte of fire: Lathoric... Lathoric the Black.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4398,0,'Dorius'),(8421,6,0,'%s\'s laughter trails off...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,4399,0,'Dorius'),(17542,0,0,'%s stares at you in sheer wonderment.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14109,0,'Young Furbolg Shaman'),(17542,1,0,'I run now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,14110,0,'Young Furbolg Shaman'),(25773,0,2,'Oh no, not the transmatter... it\'ll probably malfunction!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24969,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25773,0,3,'But... but... I was perfect!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24970,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25773,0,4,'Where am I? Who are you? What\'s that strange feeling?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24971,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25773,0,5,'Mechazod is insane! You have to stop him before it\'s too late!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24972,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25773,0,6,'It was horrible! They\'ve all been changed!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24973,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25773,0,7,'He called it the Curse of the Flesh. Mechazod is deranged!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24974,0,'Fizzcrank Survivor'),(25753,0,3,'You have been detected. You will be assimilated or eliminated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24981,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25753,1,0,'Warning! Warning! Intruder alert! Intruder alert!',14,0,100,0,0,5805,0,4142,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25814,0,2,'The flesh is weak. We will make you better, stronger... faster.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25002,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(25814,0,3,'We can decurse you, we have the technology.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25003,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(25814,0,4,'The Gearmaster has plans for your weak flesh.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25004,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(25814,0,5,'Today, the Borean Tundra. Tomorrow, the world!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25005,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(25814,0,6,'You will be decursed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25006,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(25814,0,7,'Come be perfect with us, $g brother : sister;.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25007,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(25814,0,8,'Maintenance initiated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25008,0,'Fizzcrank Mechagnome'),(19316,0,0,'Tear it down, soldiers! We\'re shippin\' this thing back to Stormwind!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,16576,0,'Field Marshal Rohamus'),(19316,0,1,'We\'re gonna melt this hunk of junk down and make weapons with the ingots! Let\'s see how the Legion likes a taste of fel reaver served up Alliance style!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,16577,0,'Field Marshal Rohamus'),(19316,0,2,'Well done, soldiers! We weren\'t about to let the filthy animals of the Horde show us up!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,16578,0,'Field Marshal Rohamus'),(19316,0,3,'Let them throw another one of these overgrown tin cans at us! We\'ll show them what the Alliance is made of!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,16579,0,'Field Marshal Rohamus'),(21133,0,0,'%s inspects the talisman $n gave him...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20178,0,'Corporal Ironridge'),(21133,1,0,'Ah, this was from Private Denning.  I remember when he fell...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20179,0,'Corporal Ironridge'),(21133,1,1,'This one was from Corporal Stonewell... he died protecting a field hospital...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20180,0,'Corporal Ironridge'),(21133,1,2,'Ah, yes... Private Guarding.  He always was quick to laugh... until a Bleeding Hollow Raid tore out his throat!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20181,0,'Corporal Ironridge'),(21133,1,3,'This insignia is from Sergeant Rantack, once my superior.  You\'d never find a tougher soldier than old Rantack...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20182,0,'Corporal Ironridge'),(21133,2,0,'%s faces the Bleeding Hollow fort of Zeth\'Gor...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20183,0,'Corporal Ironridge'),(21133,3,0,'Damn you!  Damn all of you bleeding fel orcs!  May your souls rot in the belly of whatever Dark Power that fuels you!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,20184,0,'Corporal Ironridge'),(1854,2,0,'%s examines the Scourgestone closely.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10834,0,'High Priest Thel\'danis'),(1854,3,0,'The evil in these stones is strong, but it has been dispelled.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10835,0,'High Priest Thel\'danis'),(29384,0,3,'New directive: assist in the defeat of the iron dwarves.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,30765,0,'Captive Mechagnome'),(29384,1,0,'Does not compute. Unit malfunctioning. Directive: shut down.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,30766,0,'Captive Mechagnome'),(30035,0,0,'Thank you. I thought I was doomed.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,30720,0,'Fallen Earthen Defender'),(30035,0,1,'I was certain I was going to die out here.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,30721,0,'Fallen Earthen Defender'),(30035,0,2,'Let me fight by your side.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,30722,0,'Fallen Earthen Defender'),(30035,0,3,'Let us fight the irons together!',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,30723,0,'Fallen Earthen Defender'),(