$n, and I\'ll introduce you to your trainer, Alamar Grimm.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47493,0,'S.A.F.E. Guide'),(42317,1,0,'Take a look at this holotable. I want to show you a bit about Operation: Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,48277,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque'),(42317,0,0,'We assembled a mighty force and defeated Thermaplugg\'s servants, fighting our way into the city. But, the usurper Thermaplugg had one last trick up his sleeve...',12,0,100,1,0,20895,0,42408,0,'High Tinker Mekkatorque'),(42423,1,0,'Activate the Ultimate Atomic Protection System.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39886,0,'Thermaplugg\'s Brag-bot'),(42423,0,0,'No! No, no, NO!!! I won\'t allow you into my kingdom, usurper! I WON\'T ALLOW IT! ',12,0,100,0,0,17570,0,39885,0,'Thermaplugg\'s Brag-bot'),(42489,0,0,'We can\'t afford to let our enemy, Thermaplugg, continue to tighten his grip on the rest of Gnomeregan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43103,0,'Captain Tread Sparknozzle'),(42489,1,0,'He has ordered his crony, Razlo Crushcog, to keep us on the defensive. Hinkles, what\'s the latest intelligence on Razlo and his men?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43104,0,'Captain Tread Sparknozzle'),(42553,1,0,'At last, it\'s finished.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,42948,0,'Engineer Grindspark'),(42553,0,0,'Time to put the finishing touches on my bot.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,42947,0,'Engineer Grindspark'),(42598,0,0,'Initiating cleanup ... ...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,42476,0,'GS-9x Multi-Bot'),(42611,0,0,'My brother has spent years working on a cure for leper gnomes. Using his notes, I think I\'ve perfected a process for restoring gnomes who\'ve devolved to sludge.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42915,0,'Tock Sprysprocket'),(42645,0,4,'Finally, someone who\'s not a trogg!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,42583,0,'Captured Demolitionist'),(42645,0,3,'You have no idea how happy I am to see you!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42582,0,'Captured Demolitionist'),(42645,0,2,'Thanks. Now, let\'s blow up that cave!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,42581,0,'Captured Demolitionist'),(42645,0,1,'I don\'t ever want to smell unwashed trogg again!',12,