9650,1,0,'Elena sighs.',16,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Elena'),(159650,2,0,'That\'s a dangerous game he\'s playing. The Countess decides who occupies the estate, not Bogdan. Nonetheless, I accept the offer.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Elena'),(159513,0,0,'Feel no guilt from this deed. Trust that Nicolae is more than deserving of his fate.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Bogdan'),(159513,1,0,'I apologize for the state of things. Nicolae really let the manor fall into disrepair.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Bogdan'),(159657,0,0,'I will not let the manor fall into mortal hands!',12,0,100,0,0,153115,0,0,0,'Viscount Nicolae'),(159657,1,0,'The Countess... will avenge me....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Viscount Nicolae'),(159694,0,0,'Please, take a seat.',12,0,100,1,0,157841,0,0,0,'The Countess'),(159694,1,0,'Do you dare ignore my hospitality?',12,0,100,6,0,157846,0,0,0,'The Countess'),(159694,2,0,'Leave the same way you entered. We cannot risk others discovering our partnership.',12,0,100,1,0,157850,0,0,0,'The Countess'),(159731,0,0,'The Countess will... fall...',12,0,100,0,0,153129,0,0,0,'Redelav Courier'),(159664,0,0,'My death will not delay our plans...',12,0,100,0,0,153128,0,0,0,'Lord Andrei'),(160289,0,0,'We will break you, like all the rest!',12,0,100,432,0,150667,0,0,0,'Redelav Groundskeeper'),(161608,0,0,'You are not one of us!',12,0,100,0,0,150501,0,0,0,'Duchess Vanda'),(160009,0,0,'I assure you, my name is on the list. Just check again!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Madame Tassa'),(160009,1,0,'I\'m here for business, not pleasure. Now excuse me please, I\'m supposed to be meeting someone.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Madame Tassa'),(159961,0,0,'Yes, I am, thank you. It\'s rare that I get invited to these sorts of things.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Silviu'),(159961,1,0,'You\'re holding up the line!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Silviu'),(159961,2,0,'This cannot be the end!',12,0,100,0,0,150504,0,0,0,'Lord Silviu'),(159977,0,0,'I\'d rather be at home with my cat. Have you seen Lord Andrei? He should have been here by now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Sir Geofri'),(159977,1,0,'This cannot be the end!',12,0,100,0,0,150504,0,0,0,'Sir Geofri'),(159970,0,0,'How dare you speak to me!',12,0,100,0,0,150513,0,0,0,'Duchess Odeta'),(159970,1,0,'You will be... forgotten...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Duchess Odeta'),(159970,2,0,'My house will... prevail...',12,0,100,0,0,150517,0,0,0,'Duchess Odeta'),(159970,3,0,'What have you done?',12,0,100,0,0,150503,0,0,0,'Duchess Odeta'),(159970,4,0,'This cannot be the end!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Duchess Odeta'),(160006,0,0,'About as much as I enjoy a dagger to the eye. Soon, we won\'t have to endure these self-indulgent soirees.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Andrada'),(160006,1,0,'You do not belong here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Andrada'),(160006,2,0,'You do not belong here!',12,0,100,0,0,150511,0,0,0,'Lady Andrada'),(160006,3,0,'I will be avenged!',12,0,100,0,0,150507,0,0,0,'Lady Andrada'),(160006,4,0,'I deserve... better...',12,0,100,0,0,150654,0,0,0,'Lady Andrada'),(159980,0,0,'Not really, but you won\'t tell, will you? Lord Andrei is usually the life of the party, but I haven\'t seen him anywhere.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Madame Lenuta'),(159980,1,0,'Your presence is ruining this party!',12,0,100,0,0,150509,0,0,0,'Madame Lenuta'),(159980,2,0,'What have you done?',12,0,100,0,0,150503,0,0,0,'Madame Lenuta'),(159980,3,0,'My house will... prevail...',12,0,100,0,0,150517,0,0,0,'Madame Lenuta'),(159960,0,0,'You will not leave here alive!',12,0,100,0,0,150514,0,0,0,'Duke Avram'),(159960,1,0,'My house will... prevail...',12,0,100,0,0,150516,0,0,0,'Duke Avram'),(160012,0,0,'You will not leave here alive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sir Luca'),(160012,1,0,'You do not belong here!',12,0,100,0,0,150510,0,0,0,'Sir Luca'),(160012,2,0,'How dare you speak to me!',12,0,100,0,0,150512,0,0,0,'Sir Luca'),(160012,3,0,'Your presence is ruining this party!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sir Luca'),(160012,4,0,'I deserve... better...',12,0,100,0,0,150653,0,0,0,'Sir Luca'),(160012,5,0,'You 