e are on the cusp of victory!',12,0,100,0,0,178790,0,0,0,'Mawsworn Eradicator'),(168432,0,0,'$uSchlundgÃ¤nger:SchlundgÃ¤ngerin;! Ich mÃ¶chte kurz mit Euch sprechen.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ve\'rayn'),(184860,0,0,'Do not interfere, mortal.',12,0,100,0,0,178822,0,0,0,'Yggdreth the Despoiler'),(180523,0,0,'Please let the Highlord know that I would like to be sent on the front lines sooner rather than later.',12,0,100,0,0,183622,0,0,0,'Nadjia the Mistblade to Player'),(180521,0,0,'Unfortunately, we must assume the worst. One of the Mawsworn below may have my partner\'s report if she was found by them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whisperer Vyn'),(178727,1,0,'The archives... laid bare...',12,0,100,0,0,180330,0,0,0,'Interrogator Tzench'),(178727,0,0,'Do not interfere, mortal!',12,0,100,0,0,180329,0,0,0,'Interrogator Tzench'),(178713,1,0,'You must have been sent by Roh-Suir. I will go to him at once.',12,0,100,0,0,180687,0,0,0,'Archivist Roh-Senara'),(178713,0,0,'I am in your debt, mortal.',12,0,100,0,0,180686,0,0,0,'Archivist Roh-Senara'),(177269,12,0,'|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Broker_Debuff.BLP:20|t %s begins to form a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:350799|h[Collapsing Star]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,179846,0,0,0,'So\'leah'),(178470,1,0,'This will do. Now, Maw Walker, kindly activate the device with a touch of your anima.',12,0,100,1,0,180791,0,0,0,'Ve\'nari'),(178470,0,0,'We have need of open space... but not too exposed to prying eyes.',12,0,100,0,0,180793,0,0,0,'Ve\'nari'),(178069,2,0,'Hurry along now. We have much to discuss.',12,0,100,0,0,180792,0,0,0,'Ve\'nari'),(178069,1,0,'Oh dear, I seem to have left my bag in that musty cave. Retrieve it for me and we shall depart.',12,0,100,1,0,180823,0,0,0,'Ve\'nari'),(178069,0,0,'Ah, it worked! As I knew it would, of course.',12,0,100,0,0,180822,0,0,0,'Ve\'nari'),(162804,2,0,'There you are! I trust my bag isn\'t too heavy for you. Come along, then. We have much to do.',12,0,100,1,0,181918,0,0,0,'Ve\'nari'),(178311,0,0,'Vyraz\'s incompetent lackeys let