. I wonder how it got in there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29701,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28471,11,0,'Disciples... you will find with time that many healing spells fall victim to the degeneration of our strikes.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29798,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28471,12,0,'Some healers lack the knowledge to counter the diseases that we master.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29799,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28471,13,0,'This lack of knowledge is just one more weakness among many. There is little hope against the power of death itself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29800,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29232,0,0,'Me... back... master...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29813,0,'Forgotten Servant'),(29232,0,1,'Me come back... master. Me... loyal servant.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29814,0,'Forgotten Servant'),(29232,0,2,'Sorry... me gone... so long... master.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29815,0,'Forgotten Servant'),(29232,0,3,'Finally... home...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29812,0,'Forgotten Servant'),(28941,2,8,'The Scourge are running freely through the streets!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29099,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,2,9,'So much for the Scarlet \"paradise!\"',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29114,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,2,10,'You\'re useless, Quimby!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29110,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,2,11,'I want on that last ship! Don\'t leave us!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29113,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,2,12,'We were promised safety! Security!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29098,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,2,13,'We\'re done for! Save us, Quimby!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29104,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,2,14,'Naxxramas is gone? Who cares! Acherus is here now and the death knights are killing everybody!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29108,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28936,0,2,'I\'m through being courteous with your kind, human! What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29135,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,0,1,'Tell me what you know about \"Crimson Dawn\" or the beatings will continue!\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29134,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,0,0,'What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29133,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28919,0,0,'My task is done!',12,0,100,0,0,8849,0,29070,0,'Noth the Plaguebringer'),(28940,4,0,'The Light that guides us. This movement was set in motion before you came... We... We do as we are told. It is what must be done.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29151,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,3,0,'We... We have only been told that the \"Crimson Dawn\" is an awakening. You... You see, the Light speaks to the High General. It is the Light...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29150,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28940,2,0,'I\'ll tell you everything! STOP! PLEASE!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,29149,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28914,1,0,'Why do you care, Thassarian?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29189,0,'Orbaz Bloodbane'),(28914,0,0,'Make haste, $n. Use the portal!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,29443,0,'Orbaz Bloodlane'),(28913,1,0,'In life we were hated enemies - this is true...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29193,0,'Tharassian'),(28913,0,0,'What, Orbaz? That he\'s a blood elf?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29192,0,'Tharassian'),(28912,4,0,'There are more coming. Defend yourself! Don\'t fall out of the anti-magic field! They\'ll tear you apart without its protection!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29207,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,3,0,'Maintaining this barrier will require all of my concentration. Kill them all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29205,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,2,0,'I\'m still weak, but I think I can get an anti-magic barrier up. Stay inside it or you\'ll be destroyed by their spells.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29203,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,1,0,'I\'ll need to get my runeblade and armor... Just need a little more time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29201,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28912,0,0,'Damn the Crusade! I think my ribs are broken and I might be bleeding internally.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29197,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(29011,3,0,'It seems that I\'ll need to deal with you myself. The High Inquisitor comes for you, Scourge!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29216,0,'High Inquisitor Valroth'),(29011,2,0,'The Crusade will purge your kind from this world!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29215,0,'High Inquisitor Valroth'),(29011,1,0,'Scourge filth! By the Light be cleansed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29214,0,'High Inquisitor Valroth'),(29011,0,0,'Acolytes, chain them all up! Prepare them for questioning!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,29202,0,'High Inquisitor Valroth'),(29001,0,0,'Coward!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29219,0,'High Inquisitor Valroth'),(29000,0,0,'Scourge filth! DIE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28597,0,'Scarlet Commander Rodrick'),(29065,7,0,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Teldrassil, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29330,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29065,5,0,'You must remember the splendor of life, $g brother:sister;. You were a champion of the kaldorei once! This isn\'t you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29328,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29065,6,0,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29389,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29065,3,0,'$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29325,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29065,4,0,'You don\'t remember me? When you were a child your mother would leave you in my care while she served at the Temple of the Moon. I held you in my arms and fed you honey and sheep\'s milk to calm you until she would return. You were my little angel. Blasted Scourge... What have they done to you, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29326,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29065,1,0,'I\'d like to stand for...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29323,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29065,2,0,'$n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29324,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29065,0,0,'Come to finish the job, have you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29322,0,'Yazmina Oakenthorn'),(29076,0,0,'Hrm, what a strange tree. I must investigate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29413,0,'Scarlet Courier'),(29080,0,0,'The courier has arrived!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29421,0,'Scarlet Champion'),(29080,0,1,'$g He\'s:She\'s; finally here! The courier is here!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29422,0,'Scarlet Champion'),(28670,0,0,'Avoid incoming Scarlet Crusade arrows and javelins by moving out of their line of fire!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,29888,0,'Frostbrood Vanquisher'),(29110,0,1,'Suffer, insects!',14,0,100,22,0,14787,0,29467,0,'The Lich King'),(28471,0,0,'Moving on...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29794,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28471,0,1,'Dearest shadow realm, grace us with the presence of one of your many denizens.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29790,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28471,0,2,'What beast lies in store for us...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29792,0,'Lady Alistra'),(28471,0,3,'Let us coldly greet another inhabitant of the shadow realm...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29791,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29113,0,1,'Double your efforts! The final assault draws near!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,29639,0,'Noth the Plaguebringer'),(29113,0,0,'We need more flesh!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,29634,0,'Noth the Plaguebringer'),(181183,0,0,'Wir haben viel zu besprechen.',12,0,100,669,0,189763,0,0,0,'GÃƒÂ©nÃƒÂ©ralissime Bolvar Fordragon'),(178010,1,0,'You have saved these records from the Mawsworn. You have my thanks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Record Keeper'),(178010,0,0,'You have saved these records from the Mawsworn. You have my thanks.',12,0,100,0,0,183622,0,0,0,'Record Keeper to Player'),(178157,0,0,'You do the fighting, I\'ll do the fixing. The sooner I can get home to my forge, the better!',12,0,100,0,0,181164,0,209114,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177423,0,0,'I have assembled the message. Starting it now.',12,0,100,0,0,183622,0,209205,0,'Tal-Galan to Player'),(180028,1,0,'Popo never abandon friends!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,''),(178580,0,0,'Mawsworn, devourers... seems like everyone wants a piece of this place.',12,0,100,0,0,181170,0,209747,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(177566,0,0,'This prize belongs to the Jailer. We shall not fail our master!',12,0,100,0,0,181186,0,2098