in Darkanvil'),(79656,0,0,'Prophet, this hero - and many others from another world - have come to aid us.',12,0,100,1,0,45636,0,0,0,'Yrel'),(79635,0,0,'It is good to see you, my child. My people welcome your aid, champion. Come with me.',12,0,100,396,0,45389,0,0,0,'Prophet Velen'),(79635,1,0,'We will deal with one problem at a time. First, we must settle your people.',12,0,100,1,0,45391,0,0,0,'Prophet Velen'),(79635,2,0,'Here! This location commands the entrance to our valley.',12,0,100,1,0,45392,0,0,0,'Prophet Velen'),(79655,0,0,'Prophet, I must warn you: the Iron Horde intends to strike out against all who oppose him. We must prepare our defenses!',12,0,100,1,0,44825,0,0,0,'Vindicator Maraad'),(79470,0,0,'Plant your banner, and claim your destiny.',12,0,100,25,0,44819,0,0,0,'Vindicator Maraad'),(79470,1,0,'I assure you, my Prophet, the commander we\'ve chosen represents the very best of the Alliance.',12,0,100,1,0,44821,0,0,0,'Vindicator Maraad'),(82125,0,0,'I can open up a portal to Stormwind only briefly.',12,0,100,0,0,44990,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(79241,0,0,'I do hope my trust in your people is not misplaced.',12,0,100,0,0,45382,0,0,0,'Prophet Velen'),(82098,0,0,'Alright, come on through. Steady... Steady...',12,0,100,0,0,44537,0,0,0,'Foreman Zipfizzle'),(79436,0,0,'This is it, boys! Let\'s break some ground and take this world for the Alliance!',12,0,100,5,0,43531,0,0,0,'Baros Alexston'),(43300,0,3,'You ever notice how sarcastic the people living in Redridge are? Sometimes I feel like I just want to take a blow torch to that jackass Solomon\'s town hall.?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43462,0,''),(43270,0,2,'You think these bars can hold me?HAH!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,43296,0,''),(43270,0,1,'WhereÂ´s the rest of my crew?!!!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,43295,0,''),(43270,0,0,'If I never get out of here IÂ´am gonna crap over your Head,you ping sucking Ork.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,43294,0,''),(79243,0,0,'Let me know when you are ready to start construction, commander.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,81887,