0,'Commander! You have built a most impressive garrison. I am eager to see your men in action.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Exarch Akama'),(77617,0,0,'Just a few whacks more!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lunarfall Worker'),(60878,0,5,'You handle the beasts, we\'ll handle the wound.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60346,0,'Alliance Priest to 60848'),(60878,0,6,'Keep these creatures off of us while we perform our healing.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60347,0,'Alliance Priest to 60848'),(60878,0,7,'I\'d stand with you any day.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,60348,0,'Alliance Priest to 60848'),(56418,0,0,'There are healers under some of the wreckage!  Get them free.',14,0,100,0,0,27285,0,66060,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(56418,0,1,'Find the healers and get them free of the fight.  We need them here at the wound!',14,0,100,0,0,27286,0,66061,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(56418,0,2,'Stay close and keep these healers safe.  Our lives depend on it.',14,0,100,0,0,27287,0,66062,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(56418,0,3,'If we lose the healers, Shen-zin Su dies, and all of us with him!  Keep them safe.',14,0,100,0,0,27288,0,66063,0,'Ji Firepaw'),(60888,0,0,'I bear your presence only as a kindness to our new allies. Don\'t push me, human.',12,0,100,0,0,28117,0,60359,0,'Korga Strongmane to Player'),(60889,0,0,'Stand down, tauren, before I put you back in chains.',12,0,100,396,0,27522,0,60623,0,'Delora Lionheart to Player'),(56013,0,0,'You\'ve all accomplished a great thing in saving Shen-zin Su. You do us all proud.',12,0,100,1,0,27784,0,60632,0,'Spirit of Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56013,1,0,'It seems your journeys are not done. These new allies of ours come from a broken world that could use our help.',12,0,100,1,0,27785,0,60633,0,'Spirit of Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56013,2,0,'What of you, Ji? Will you join the Horde in their journey back?',12,0,100,6,0,27786,0,60629,0,'Spirit of Master Shang Xi to Player'),(56013,3,0,'And you, my young student? Where will you go?',12,0,100,6,0,27787,0,60631,0,'Spirit of Master Shang Xi to Player'),(57721,0,0,'Master Shang Xi, I would like to accompany the Alliance back to their home.',12,0,100,1,0,27405,0,60628,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Player'),(57720,0,0,'Yes... perhaps that is for the best. I like what I\'ve seen of them, and it sounds as though their world could use my help.',12,0,100,273,0,27305,0,60630,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(55944,0,0,'We need more healers at the tents. Recall the priests from the west.',14,0,100,22,0,27508,0,60625,0,'Delora Lionheart'),(55944,1,0,'Hold the line, sailors! Your brothers depend on you!',14,0,100,22,0,27505,0,59721,0,'Delora Lionheart'),(55944,2,0,'Tend to the wounded! This isn\'t over yet.',14,0,100,22,0,27506,0,59722,0,'Delora Lionheart'),(55944,3,0,'We have men in that wreckage! Get more men out there recovering the wounded.',14,0,100,22,0,27507,0,60624,0,'Delora Lionheart'),(56661,10,0,'We should let Elder Shaopai know and then plan our next move.',12,0,100,1,0,27441,0,55582,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,9,0,'Someone has crashed into our island.  Removing this thorn may be more complicated than we thought.',12,0,100,1,0,27440,0,55581,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,8,0,'It is a boat... a whole airship!  That\'s a bigger thorn than I was expecting.',12,0,100,1,0,27439,0,55578,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,0,0,'...Ji, they were in the Wood of Staves.  You know where Master Shang is now.',12,0,100,1,0,27431,0,55555,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,1,0,'Ji, be respectful when we speak to Shen-zin Su.',12,0,100,1,0,27432,0,55560,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,2,0,'I might if you embarrass us.',12,0,100,1,0,27433,0,55562,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,7,0,'We\'ll know soon enough.',12,0,100,1,0,27438,0,55576,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,3,0,'Shen-zin Su, we are the descendants of Liu Lang.  We\'ve sensed your pain, and we want to help.',14,0,100,1,0,27434,0,55563,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,4,0,'What ails you Shen-zin Su?  What can we do?',14,0,100,6,0,27435,0,55564,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,5,0,'Of course, Shen-zin Su!  But your shell is large, and I do not know where this thorn could be.',14,0,100,1,0,27436,0,55571,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(56661,6,0,'We will find it, and we will remove it.  You have our word!',14,0,100,1,0,27437,0,55573,0,'Aysa Cloudsinger to Shang Xi\'s Hot Air Balloon'),(62081,0,0,'Look at this!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,61630,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(62081,1,0,'Well, that\'s good news. Once we join the Horde, we certainly won\'t run out of things to do.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,61631,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(62081,2,0,'Emperor Hellscream, I am Ji...',12,0,100,1,0,27289,0,61633,0,'Ji Firepaw to Player'),(62081,3,0,'Yes, warchief.',12,0,100,2,0,27290,0,61595,0,'Ji Firepaw to Garrosh Hellscream'),(62081,4,0,'I... I believe so. Yes.',12,0,100,273,0,27291,0,61603,0,'Ji Firepaw to Garrosh Hellscream'),(80685,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gronnling Bonebreaker'),(86663,1,0,'I could do this blindfolded.',14,0,100,0,0,46433,0,0,0,'Rangari Jonaa'),(86663,2,0,'We may need more to hunt after this.',14,0,100,0,0,46432,0,0,0,'Rangari Jonaa'),(86663,3,0,'Start running. I will even give you a head start...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rangari Jonaa'),(86663,4,0,'I could do this blindfolded.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rangari Jonaa'),(86663,5,0,'We may need more to hunt after this.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rangari Jonaa'),(81356,0,0,'Back to the dust with you!',14,0,100,0,0,46564,0,0,0,'Rexxar'),(82832,0,0,'Shhh... You\'ll be okay, Nisha.',12,0,100,0,0,46557,0,0,0,'Rexxar'),(79322,0,0,'Hold your arms, brothers. I do not believe this one serves the ogres.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gladiator Akaani'),(75864,0,0,'What is this? A new challenger? We will enjoy watching you consumed by my little pet.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Slavemaster Ok\'mok'),(75864,1,0,'A meager victory. Let us see how you fair against my personal ogron.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Slavemaster Ok\'mok'),(75864,2,0,'Such impudence. I will see you consumed by my favorite pet.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Slavemaster Ok\'mok'),(75864,3,0,'That was my favorite ravager. You filthy savage. I will kill you with my own bare hands!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Slavemaster Ok\'mok'),(75835,0,0,'You will learn to salute after each kill, or I will take your other eye.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonemaul Slaver'),(83485,0,0,'My fists and gratitude are yours, stranger. How do you feel about killing an ogre chief before you go?',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Pitfighter Vaandaam'),(75819,0,0,'Don\'t hit me, stupid!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stonemaul Guard'),(79663,0,0,'My father is going to rip your horn off.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nazgrel'),(79668,0,0,'Did my father send you? I told them he would find a way to spring me! Thanks, stranger.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Nazgrel'),(75729,2,0,'You wade through a river of souls, stranger. It\'s best to turn back.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Restless Wanderer'),(75729,3,0,'This was once a place of peace. A place for eternal rest...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Restless Wanderer'),(75729,4,0,'An eternity in darkness... cannot... escape...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Restless Wanderer'),(75509,0,0,'Rivers of the damned, RISE! RISE in the name of darkness, RISE in the name of Ner\'zhul! The Shadowmoon beckons...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75509,1,0,'Ancestors of the Shadowmoon, shine in the darkness! Lend me your strength!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75509,2,0,'Restless spirits, HEED my command!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75509,3,0,'For Ner\'zhul...',14,0,100,0,0,43544,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75509,4,0,'Embrace the eternal darkness...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75509,5,0,'For Ner\'zhul...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75509,6,0,'Ancestors of the Shadowmoon, shine in the darkness! Lend me your strength!',14,0,100,0,0,43539,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75509,7,0,'Restless spirits, HEED my command!',14,0,100,0,0,43547,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75509,8,0,'The dead... Shall rise again...',14,0,100,0,0,43540,0,0,0,'Sadana Bloodfury'),(75506,1,0,'My life for Ner\'zhul!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shadowmoon Loyalist'),(75507,0,0,'Ner\'zhul will not hear us, he hears only darkness now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Weeping Spirit'),(75829,0,0,'Yes, come closer... your souls are strong and proud! I will feast on your terror!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nhallish'),(75829,1,0,'None escape the Void!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nhallish'),(75829,2,0,'Flee! Flee from your former masters!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nhallish'),(75829,3,0,'You cannot flee.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nhallish'),(75829,4,0,'You are just maggots swarming to the corpse of a dying god.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nhallish'),(76190,0,0,'I\'m free!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Liberated Soul'),(77700,0,0,'Rise and serve your master!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shadowmoon Exhumer'),(75452,0,0,'%s begins to |cFFFF0404|Hspell:153804|h[Inhale]|h|r his enemies!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bonemaw'),(75452,1,0,'%s\'s suction intensifies!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bonemaw'),(75452,2,0,'%s hisses, slinking back into the shadowy depths!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bonemaw'),(76407,0,0,'The Shadowmoon CANNOT be defeated - we walk in the realm of death itself.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ner\'zhul'),(76407,1,0,'A kindling of bone and shadow! Army of the dead, arise!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ner\'zhul'),(76407,2,0,'My power... Will ripple... Across eternity.',14,0,100,0,0,43683,0,0,0,'Ner\'zhul'),(81254,0,0,'Don\'t let them take the artifact!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Brak'),(81254,1,0,'Gronnlings, break their bones and bring them to me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Brak'),(81254,2,0,'Gronn, gnash them in your teeth!',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Brak'),(81254,3,0,'Impossible!',14,0,100,14,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Brak'),(81254,4,0,'Aggghh!',14,0,100,14,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Brak'),(82105,0,0,'The object we seek is here!',14,0,100,0,0,46558,0,0,0,'Rexxar'),(82105,1,0,'Get them!',14,0,100,22,0,46559,0,0,0,'Rexxar'),(82105,2,0,'Hahaha! I\'ve always enjoyed killing gronn.',14,0,100,53,0,46560,0,0,0,'Rexxar'),(82105,3,0,'Nisha, get her down here!',14,0,100,1,0,46561,0,0,0,'Rexxar'),(82105,4,0,'Well done. The artifact is yours to take.',12,0,100,0,0,46562,0,0,0,'Rexxar'),(86663,0,0,'Start running. I will even give you a head start...',12,0,100,0,0,46428,0,0,0,'Rangari Jonaa'),(86521,0,0,'I look forward to seeing your garrison, commander.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rangari Erdanii'),(82562,0,0,'Quickly now, I have a bad feeling about all this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Khaano'),(82476,0,0,'<coughs> What foul stench!  I don\'t think I got a full breath of it though...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Khaano'),(80721,0,0,'Please help... come to me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fungus Covered Shambler'),(82598,0,0,'We must hurry, $p! I have to get there now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Khaano'),(86282,0,0,'It\'s in my head, $p! I can\'t control myself! Kill me before I spread the disease!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Khaano'),(86282,1,0,'Tell D\'kaan... I am... sorry...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Khaano'),(82296,0,0,'I got dis $p!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beatface'),(85433,0,0,'Excellent, now to business!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Altauur'),(83025,0,0,'One shot, one kill!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grom\'kar Battlemaster'),(81603,0,0,'Light \'em up!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Champion Druna'),(81305,0,0,'Warsong arrows sing from the sky! They\'ll be the last thing you hear as I crush your skull.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fleshrender Nok\'gar'),(81305,1,0,'Start the funeral pyres!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fleshrender Nok\'gar'),(81305,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_rampage.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:164426|h[Reckless Provocation]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fleshrender Nok\'gar'),(81305,3,0,'Terror overwhelms you, death is near.