324,0,0,0,'Mo\'arg Crusher'),(103231,0,0,'My eyes see all.',12,0,100,0,0,55378,0,0,0,'Grim Inquisitor'),(103231,1,0,'This should prove enlightening.',12,0,100,0,0,55375,0,0,0,'Grim Inquisitor'),(103231,2,0,'I\'ll break your will.',12,0,100,0,0,55379,0,0,0,'Grim Inquisitor'),(90535,0,0,'They did... things... to me.',12,0,100,0,0,72651,0,0,0,'Demon Hunter'),(90535,1,0,'A warden tried to convince us to turn traitor. I heard screaming.',12,0,100,0,0,72653,0,0,0,'Demon Hunter'),(90660,0,0,'Help! Baddies here!',12,0,100,0,0,55204,0,0,0,'Burning Hellion'),(90660,1,0,'Tasty meats for me to eats.',12,0,100,0,0,55207,0,0,0,'Burning Hellion'),(90660,2,0,'Another morsel has come to say, hello.',12,0,100,0,0,55203,0,0,0,'Burning Hellion'),(90660,3,0,'We\'ll feast on your flesh and devour your soul.',12,0,100,0,0,55205,0,0,0,'Burning Hellion'),(103180,0,0,'A fatal mistake, mortal.',12,0,100,0,0,55149,0,0,0,'Vile Doombringer'),(90534,0,0,'Nightglaive went southwest with a warden named Cordana Felsong.',12,0,100,0,0,72661,0,0,0,'Demon Hunter'),(90622,0,0,'Feel the fel energy course through...',12,0,100,396,0,52659,0,0,0,'Cordana Felsong'),(90622,1,0,'We\'ve been expecting you, $p. How is Khadgar?',12,0,100,396,0,52662,0,0,0,'Cordana Felsong'),(90622,2,0,'Felsworn Nightglaive, prove yourself. I have other matters to attend to.',12,0,100,397,0,52660,0,0,0,'Cordana Felsong'),(90621,0,0,'Yes, my mistress...',12,0,100,2,0,52764,0,0,0,'Nightglaive the Traitor'),(90621,1,0,'I am more powerful than all of you!',12,0,100,0,0,52766,0,0,0,'Nightglaive the Traitor'),(90621,2,0,'If you only knew the Legion\'s power. Join us, Kor\'vas.',12,0,100,0,0,52763,0,0,0,'Nightglaive the Traitor'),(90621,3,0,'But, I was promised...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nightglaive the Traitor'),(90624,0,0,'Cyana. Do not give in!',14,0,100,0,0,57402,0,0,0,'Kor\'vas Bloodthorn'),(90624,1,0,'Never! You and your new mistress will die by my warglaives.',12,0,100,0,0,57405,0,0,0,'Kor\'vas Bloodthorn'),(90623,0,0,'You are nothing but a coward.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stellagosa'),(93326,0,0,'Do not linger here too long. The Legion is attacking everywhere.',12,0,100,274,0,52606,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(93326,1,0,'Khadgar nods to Stellagosa.',16,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(103580,0,0,'I am certain that if anyone can help you find this Pillar of Creation, it will be my grandfather.',12,0,100,1,0,58372,0,0,0,'Stellagosa'),(89943,0,0,'An aura of disease and pestilence surround the blade you carry, Death Knight. Keep your distance from Senegos.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Azurewing Keeper'),(89975,0,0,'Ahhhhh...',12,0,100,0,0,52851,0,0,0,'Senegos'),(89975,1,0,'Another Nightfallen attack? Bring my child to me, young one.',12,0,100,0,0,52857,0,0,0,'Senegos'),(89975,2,0,'Stellagosa. Do me one last favor. Your younger brothers and sisters need your help.',12,0,100,0,0,52855,0,0,0,'Senegos'),(89975,3,0,'You are a kind small thing, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,52847,0,0,0,'Senegos'),(90543,0,0,'Ahh... I feared we might lose that one. He was so weak when I found him. Pick him up and take him to Senegos.',12,0,100,0,0,52581,0,0,0,'Agapanthus'),(90896,0,0,'My keepers are overrun. We will require aid.',12,0,100,0,0,52580,0,0,0,'Agapanthus'),(90900,0,0,'Of course.',12,0,100,0,0,52868,0,0,0,'Stellagosa'),(90900,1,0,'Farewell, grandfather.',12,0,100,0,0,52872,0,0,0,'Stellagosa'),(89023,0,0,'Who goes there? Keep your hands and weapons where I can see them.',14,0,100,0,0,51893,0,0,0,'Nightwatcher Idri'),(88090,0,0,'I like your bravery, little one. I\'ll enjoy gutting you in front of my entire battalion.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fathom-Commander Zarrin'),(88090,1,0,'My lady, Athissa! I have... failed you...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fathom-Commander Zarrin'),(89402,0,0,'I will escort you to Prince Farondis, if that is what you truly wish.',12,0,100,0,0,52767,0,0,0,'Nightwatcher Idri'),(89402,1,0,'If you get the chance, spit on him for me.',12,0,100,0,0,52771,0,0,0,'Nightwatcher Idri'),(89341,0,0,'\"Going for a walk.\" Hah! He\'s probably out visiting that little common girl he fancies so much.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magister Garuhod'),(89341,1,0,'Those eggs will provide the perfect balance of texture and arcane power my cocktail needs.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Magister Garuhod'),(89134,0,0,'Thank you, stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elder Aldryth'),(89134,1,0,'I don\'t know what happened. I heard a loud crashing noise, and then I found myself stuck beneath this beam. Since then, I\'ve just been waiting.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elder Aldryth'),(89134,2,0,'Now, where did that lovely girl run off to?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elder Aldryth'),(88798,0,0,'You\'ll find the giants to the southeast. There are a few ways into their arena. Good luck.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Irisse'),(88869,0,0,'I am taking my leave, nightwatchers... though I doubt you will miss me.',12,0,100,0,0,52804,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,1,0,'Stay close, $n. Do not leave my side.',12,0,100,0,0,52530,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,2,0,'Hmm. How long has this road been flooded? I must have the groundskeepers attend to it.',12,0,100,0,0,52794,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,3,0,'I... I am sorry.',12,0,100,2,0,52787,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,4,0,'Look out!',12,0,100,0,0,52795,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,5,0,'I only did what I thought was right.',12,0,100,2,0,52808,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,6,0,'Gah! Watch out!',12,0,100,397,0,52536,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,7,0,'Where are you?',12,0,100,0,0,52788,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,8,0,'I cannot do this on my own. Stay with me.',12,0,100,0,0,52529,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88869,9,0,'Thaldrys, my trusted captain.',12,0,100,0,0,52538,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(89634,0,0,'You have some nerve showing your face around here.',12,0,100,0,0,52758,0,0,0,'Nar\'thalas Citizen'),(89634,1,0,'%s spits.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nar\'thalas Citizen'),(89634,2,0,'Coward.',12,0,100,0,0,52757,0,0,0,'Nar\'thalas Citizen'),(89634,3,0,'You did this to us, Farondis.',12,0,100,0,0,52761,0,0,0,'Nar\'thalas Citizen'),(88091,0,0,'Where is the Tidestone? Speak, you fool!',14,0,100,0,0,63239,0,0,0,'Athissa'),(88091,1,0,'Worthless...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Athissa'),(88091,2,0,'Enough of this! The Tidestone will be ours!',14,0,100,0,0,52617,0,0,0,'Athissa'),(88889,0,0,'Come with me.',12,0,100,0,0,52534,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88889,1,0,'I am truly sorry.',12,0,100,2,0,52802,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88889,2,0,'Please stay close, $p.',12,0,100,0,0,52532,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88889,3,0,'Where are you?',12,0,100,0,0,52788,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(88889,4,0,'Here, the Nar\'thalas Academy. This is where it all happened.',12,0,100,0,0,52791,0,0,0,'Prince Farondis'),(87368,0,0,'Farondis! You traitor! You brought this upon us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowned Magister'),(87369,0,0,'DIE... FARONDIS....',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Unbreathing Soul'),(89672,0,0,'Next student.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Instructor Delliana'),(89672,1,0,'Your turn.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Instructor Delliana'),(89672,2,0,'No. We will try it again.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Instructor Delliana'),(89672,3,0,'Now, you try.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Instructor Delliana'),(89672,4,0,'Well done!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Instructor Delliana'),(89672,5,0,'Still needs work.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Instructor Delliana'),(89667,0,0,'Abjuration, Conjuration, Divination, Necromancy...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowned Student'),(89667,1,0,'<sigh>... I feel like I\'ve been reading this same scroll for ten thousand years, and I STILL don\'t understand it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowned Student'),(89667,2,0,'I\'m trying to study over here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowned Student'),(89667,3,0,'Ow!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowned Student'),(89669,0,0,'Zzz... no, Headmistress! Not the paddle... zzzz....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowned Student'),(89669,1,0,'Just five more minutes...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Drowned Student'),(89660,0,0,'Your instructors should be down the ramp to the west. You\'d better hurry, before the second bell rings!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thyrillion'),(89661,0,0,'I said no point blank shots!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Instructor Nidriel'),(107334,0,0,'Would you mind? I\'m working on a very important paper, and it\'s difficult to concentrate with you neophytes shooting everything in sight.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sythorne'),(100993,2,0,'We are... infinite...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,101193,0,'Felblade Assassin to Player'),(111109,0,0,'The resources of Dalaran are at your disposal. From here, heroes of Alliance and Horde alike will search for the Pillars of Creation!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,123007,0,'Emissary Auldbridge to Player'),(111109,1,0,'I\'ve heard rumors of powerful artifacts that may be of use in your campaign. Keep an eye out and a useful lead just might present itself!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,123008,0,'Emissary Auldbridge to Player'),(111109,2,0,'Now I must attend to other visitors. Good luck, $n!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,123009,0,'Emissary Auldbridge to Player'),(96479,0,0,'Welcome. May I help you find something?',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,'Breanni'),(107326,0,0,'Enjoying the Midsummer Fire Festival, $c?',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,0,0,'Draemus'),(100323,0,0,'I hear the truth in your words, $c. We may walk very different paths, but I see you fight for a noble cause.',12,0,100,1,0,61902,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,0,0,'It seems you\'ve been followed, $c! Dark Riders!',12,0,100,5,0,60249,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,1,0,'The battle is won, but there will be more. Quickly, to Ariden\'s camp!',12,0,100,1,0,61883,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,2,0,'Do you wish to be left behind? Hurry!',14,0,100,5,0,61886,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,3,0,'Do you wish to be left behind? Hurry!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,4,0,'Try to keep up, $c!',14,0,100,22,0,61884,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,5,0,'Look out behind you!',14,0,100,22,0,61887,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,6,0,'Your skill in combat is impressive. We may yet survive this.',12,0,100,1,0,61888,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,7,0,'Riders on our flank! Be ready!',14,0,100,5,0,61892,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,8,0,'Let us press on. We are nearly there.',12,0,100,1,0,61893,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100578,9,0,'Here! The camp is in this clearing. Let us search it.',12,0,100,1,0,61894,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(99875,0,0,'None will be spared!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dark Rider'),(100707,0,0,'The artifact calls to us!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dark Rider'),(100729,0,0,'Understand, I cannot be a part of what you must do. When you are finished, meet me outside Karazhan.',12,0,100,1,0,61875,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(102469,0,0,'Join me in the grave!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forgotten Dead'),(102469,1,0,'No! I don\'t want to come back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forgotten Dead'),(102469,2,0,'Why would you bring me back here?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forgotten Dead'),(102459,0,0,'No! The blade must remain buried!',12,0,100,0,0,61877,0,0,0,'Laith Sha\'ol'),(102459,1,0,'You cannot have it!',12,0,100,53,0,61878,0,0,0,'Laith Sha\'ol'),(102522,0,0,'Ariden... no! Why did you unearth that cursed blade?',12,0,100,6,0,61879,0,0,0,'Laith Sha\'ol'),(102522,1,0,'It must be retrieved. He cannot control the unbridled wrath within.',12,0,100,5,0,61880,0,0,0,'Laith Sha\'ol'),(102522,2,0,'Go to the catacombs. The curse must be lifted!',12,0,100,25,0,61881,0,0,0,'Laith Sha\'ol'),(100812,0,0,'The sewer entrance is this way. Follow me!',12,0,100,0,0,61882,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(101282,0,0,'Take care! There is a dark energy emanating from the spirits of this place. We had best not get too close.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(101282,1,0,'It is done. The Dark Riders are defeated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(101282,2,0,'Now I can reclaim these stolen artifacts and return them to their rightful owners.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(101282,3,0,'You have proven an unexpected ally, $c. The weapon is yours. Let us hope it can turn the tide in this war.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Revil Kost'),(100850,0,0,'Do not think you have won! Conservator, do your duty!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102532,0,0,'You are a persistent one.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102532,1,0,'Very well! If you so thirst for the power of Apocalypse, then I will show it to you myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102532,2,0,'Feel the wrath of the world-ender!',14,0,100,15,0,60264,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102532,3,0,'It calls to souls long dead... RISE!',14,0,100,15,0,60265,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102532,4,0,'You are not the only one who can control the undead, death knight!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102532,5,0,'Sss... souls of the dead! Aid your master!',14,0,100,15,0,60268,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102532,6,0,'No! The power... is mine!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102532,7,0,'That voice... father?!',12,0,100,0,0,60267,0,0,0,'Ariden'),(102533,0,0,'The power was not yours, Ariden. You did not wield Apocalypse. Its dark energies wielded you as its weapon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Laith Sha\'ol'),(102533,1,0,'Rest now, my son. The curse is lifted.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Laith Sha\'ol'),(102533,2,0,'You are free.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Laith Sha\'ol'),(93471,0,0,'The $ct approaches! Knights, salute!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Knight of the Ebon Blade'),(97136,1,0,'You\'ve made quite the name for yourself, $n. It\'s good to see my instruction wasn\'t wasted.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Alistra'),(97111,1,0,'Deathlord, I must speak with you.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Illanna Dreadmoore'),(86563,0,0,'There you are. $n, over here. Azsuna awaits.',12,0,100,3,0,57419,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(86563,1,0,'Let me know when you are ready, champion.',12,0,100,1,0,58371,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(103660,0,0,'I prefer using the greatstaff Atiesh\'s raven form. Nothing\'s worse than saddle sores.',12,0,100,0,0,58376,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(103660,1,0,'The demon hunters have set up camp on the far side of the island. Perhaps they can help us locate the Pillar of Creation.',12,0,100,0,0,58375,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(103660,2,0,'Look there... naga forces. We have competition from Queen Azshara herself!',12,0,100,0,0,58374,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(103660,3,0,'She must also be after the Pillar of Creation. This is unexpected.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(103660,4,0,'Breathtaking. Imagine all of the arcane knowledge lost to the ages here.',12,0,100,0,0,60191,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(103660,5,0,'There... the Illidari. And, the Burning Legion is here, too.',12,0,100,0,0,60192,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(93325,0,0,'Hurry. The Illidari are about to be overrun.',12,0,100,397,0,52607,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(101822,0,0,'All Gilneans have a rage inside us, Tess. Your father more than most.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104132,0,'Commander Lorna Crowley'),(101822,1,0,'My father stands with the king. The Forsaken will never see our forces coming!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104134,0,'Commander Lorna Crowley'),(101822,2,0,'Such is the cost of vengeance. Gilneas has waited for it long enough.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104136,0,'Commander Lorna Crowley'),(101822,3,0,'Quickly, Tess! The gunship will be ready to leave soon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,104138,0,'Commander Lorna Crowley'),(108481,0,0,'Got some o\' the forge\'s best armor polish for the troops here, $n. Don\'t be shipping off without gettin\' some o\' those scuffs out first.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114060,0,''),(108583,0,0,'We have brought crystals infused with the Light from the Exodar. Allow us a moment to enhance your weapon before you battle with the Legion.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114258,0,''),(32971,0,0,'Be sure to stop by the bridges southeast of town. You should be able to secure a nightsaber to get you down to the ruins.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34158,0,'Ranger Glynda Nal\'Shea Quest accept 13562'),(33176,0,0,'And don\'t worry about the trolls underfoot while you\'re up there. They\'ll be trampled into the ground by the ancients\' strides.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34482,0,'On Quest accept Say Text'),(39317,0,1,'You don\'t belong here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Northwatch Scout to Player'),(39317,0,2,'Horde 