0,210320,0,'Slay 01'),(42386,1,0,'I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42381,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(44365,9,0,'Warchief, without these new Forsaken my people would die out... Our hold upon Gilneas and northern Lordaeron would crumble.',12,0,100,0,0,20468,0,44715,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent10'),(44365,8,0,'Agatha, show the Warchief!',12,0,100,5,0,20467,0,44709,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent09'),(44365,6,0,'As a race, we Forsaken are unable to procreate.',12,0,100,274,0,20465,0,44706,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent07'),(44365,7,0,'With the aid of the val\'kyr, we are now able to take the corpses of the fallen and create new Forsaken.',12,0,100,0,0,20466,0,44707,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent08'),(44365,5,0,'Very well, Warchief. I have solved the plight of the Forsaken!',12,0,100,5,0,20464,0,44705,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent06'),(44365,4,0,'...and they are part of the reason that I asked to see you.',12,0,100,1,0,20463,0,44703,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent05'),(44365,3,0,'With the death of the Lich King, many of the more intelligent Scourge became... unemployed. Those \'fiends,\' as you so delicately put it, are called val\'kyr. They are under my command now...',12,0,100,0,0,20462,0,44702,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent04'),(44365,1,0,'Ah, speak of the devil...',12,0,100,1,0,20460,0,44696,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent02'),(44365,2,0,'Warchief, so glad you could make it.',12,0,100,1,0,20461,0,44701,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent03'),(44365,0,0,'Where is that ogre-headed buffoon?',12,0,100,6,0,20459,0,44695,0,'VO_QE_SP_Sylvanas_SPEvent01'),(44629,7,0,'Cromush, you stay behind and make sure the Banshee Queen is well \"guarded.\" I will be expecting a full report when next we meet.',12,0,100,0,0,20503,0,44720,0,'VO_QE_Garrosh_SPEvent08'),(44629,6,0,'Watch your clever mouth