me herbs so I\'m going to go pick them up.',12,2,100,1,0,0,0,23735,0,'Becanna Edune'),(24735,6,0,'%s replants the herbs nearby.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23736,0,'Becanna Edune'),(24525,2,0,'Watch nah, ye bogfiddler!  I an\' I gunna show ye \'ow a jig meant fe be jigged to!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23580,0,'Zeh\'gehn'),(24480,0,0,'I thought you\'d never ask!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23477,0,'Mojo'),(23888,0,0,'$n, I would have words with you.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23634,0,'Mage-Lieutenant Malister'),(61083,0,0,'Die, insect!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(61083,1,0,'Maybe it be in dis urn over here. Stand back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(61083,2,0,'Thank you for you help.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(61083,3,0,'This is great!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(61082,0,0,'Die, insect!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(61082,1,0,'Maybe it be in dis urn over here. Stand back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(61082,2,0,'Thank you for you help.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(61082,3,0,'This is great!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(177924,5,0,'Incense. This is from the Sanctuary of Guidance. I bet he\'s headed there.',12,0,100,0,0,181074,0,209277,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(177924,6,0,'You should have fled when you had the chance.',12,0,100,0,0,179681,0,209799,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(177924,7,0,'Foolish... mortal...',12,0,100,0,0,179682,0,209800,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(178152,0,0,'I must... find safety...',12,0,100,0,0,179759,0,209130,0,'Tortured Attendant'),(178152,0,1,'I told them... I knew nothing...',12,0,100,0,0,179755,0,209128,0,'Tortured Attendant'),(178152,0,2,'Such... horror...',12,0,100,0,0,179762,0,209131,0,'Tortured Attendant'),(178152,0,3,'So much... pain...',12,0,100,0,0,179757,0,209129,0,'Tortured Attendant'),(178152,0,4,'They... seek the Fatescribe... couldn\'t tell them anything.',12,0,100,0,0,179753,0,209127,0,'Tortured Attendant'),(178152,0,5,'What... do they want with him?',12,0,100,0,0,179763,0,209132,0,'Tortured Attendant'),(177610,2,0,'Good news, $p! I found more monstrosities for you to vanquish!',12,0,100,0,0,181079,0,209582,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(177924,12,0,'Let us rendezvous near the Sanctuary of Guidance, $n. Make haste!',12,0,100,0,0,181078,0,209280,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(177610,3,0,'Mawsworn. Devourers. This place has seen its share of defilement.',12,0,100,0,0,181080,0,209084,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(177610,4,0,'Why does he need the anima? Such a tedious plan!',12,0,100,0,0,181090,0,209227,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(177610,5,0,'An illusion? How quaint.',12,0,100,0,0,181091,0,209228,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(177610,6,0,'This way! Hurry!',12,0,100,0,0,181092,0,209229,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(177610,7,0,'The Fatescribe! We have him!',12,0,100,0,0,181093,0,209085,0,'Caretaker Kah-Than'),(178235,0,0,'He has found us! Korthia is in grave peril!',12,0,100,0,0,180254,0,209221,0,'Fatescribe Roh-Kalo'),(178235,1,0,'Arbiter forgive me... but I have need of this anima.',12,0,100,0,0,180255,0,209220,0,'Fatescribe Roh-Kalo'),(178235,2,0,'Eternal Ones, grant me your guidance and wisdom.',12,0,100,0,0,180256,0,209225,0,'Fatescribe Roh-Kalo'),(178235,3,0,'An illusion... yes, that might work. Hide in plain sight. Employ their own tactics against them.',12,0,100,0,0,180257,0,209223,0,'Fatescribe Roh-Kalo'),(178235,4,0,'I need a scroll from the vault, and the anima to fuel its magic...',12,0,100,0,0,180258,0,209222,0,'Fatescribe Roh-Kalo'),(178235,5,0,'May the Purpose shield me. And may they never find me.',12,0,100,0,0,180259,0,209224,0,'Fatescribe Roh-Kalo'),(177228,1,0,'The nathrezim... serving the Jailer? But they were part of the Burning Legion. At least, that\'s what we were led to believe.',12,0,100,1,0,181101,0,209633,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(177228,2,0,'The dreadlords are masters of infiltration and illusion. Our covenant forces must remain vigilant.',12,0,100,1,0,181102,0,209935,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(177228,3,0,'Stay alert, Maw Walker. They could be... anywhere.',12,0,100,1,0,181103,0,209936,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(177927,2,0,'Our Fatescribe... taken. I pray the Purpose gives him comfort in that dark place.',12,0,100,1,0,181617,0,211457,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177449,0,0,'Good, you\'re here! Let\'s get this done. I don\'t want to linger in the Maw a moment longer than I have to!',12,0,100,1,0,181162,0,209110,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177228,4,0,'Secutor Mevix, gather your forces. Secure the vault exterior until the Maw Walker arrives with Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,1,0,181146,0,209109,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(178010,0,1,'Finally, I have important information for Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Record Keeper'),(178010,0,2,'These records must reach Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Record Keeper'),(178010,0,3,'You have done well. I must get this data to Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Record Keeper'),(178010,0,4,'You have my thanks. I shall deliver these records to Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Record Keeper'),(178010,0,5,'Thank you, stranger. I must get this data to Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Record Keeper'),(178157,2,0,'Not my most elegant work, but it\'ll hold. Meet you up top.',12,0,100,0,0,181148,0,209191,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177423,2,0,'I have assembled the message. Starting it now.',12,0,100,0,0,181149,0,209205,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177423,3,0,'That is all we have. If we can find additional records, I should be able to reconstruct more of the Primus\'s message.',12,0,100,0,0,181154,0,209210,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177449,2,0,'Stop him from what? Show the rest of the message!',12,0,100,1,0,181153,0,209209,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177449,1,0,'By the five houses... It\'s the Primus!',12,0,100,1,0,181150,0,209206,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(178225,0,0,'Should my suspicions prove true, my sigil will be at risk. I must entrust it to your vaults. Keep it safe at all costs.',12,0,100,669,0,181151,0,209207,0,'The Primus'),(178225,1,0,'If Zovaal obtains all five sigils, nothing can stop him from--',12,0,100,669,0,181152,0,209208,0,'The Primus'),(177423,4,0,'Record keepers, return to the Respite. You will be safe there.',12,0,100,0,0,181155,0,209236,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177423,5,0,'So it would seem. If we can locate more records, perhaps the answers will be found within them.',12,0,100,0,0,181157,0,209238,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177423,6,0,'If he confronted the Jailer, there may be nothing left of your master.',12,0,100,0,0,181159,0,209240,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177423,7,0,'Understood.',12,0,100,0,0,181161,0,209242,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177449,3,0,'So the Primus came to Korthia after he left Maldraxxus. He must have suspected the Jailer was plotting to escape.',12,0,100,1,0,181156,0,209237,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177449,4,0,'With the Primus gone, dark times fell upon Maldraxxus... and all the Shadowlands. We need to find him!',12,0,100,1,0,181158,0,209239,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177449,5,0,'Say that again and there will be nothing left of you. Understood?',12,0,100,1,0,181160,0,209241,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177451,0,0,'Our plan is ruined! There\'s no way to get across this chasm.',12,0,100,1,0,181165,0,209243,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177452,0,0,'Nonsense! Everything we need is right here. All that\'s required is a few strong bones!',12,0,100,1,0,181166,0,209245,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177452,1,0,'Bring me bones so I can make a hookshot and anchor points. We\'ll get across this chasm in no time!',12,0,100,1,0,181168,0,209692,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(178225,2,0,'...from reaching the Sepulcher. This must not come to pass.',12,0,100,669,0,181269,0,209685,0,'The Primus'),(178225,3,0,'Even locking my sigil away here may not be enough to--',12,0,100,669,0,181270,0,209686,0,'The Primus'),(30570,0,1,'I hate to disappoint people, but the Stone Crow\'s closed. If the kids from the orphanage were evacuated, I don\'t see why we should be open, either.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31729,0,'Emery Neill TALK_FLUFF 2'),(31027,0,0,'Look, I\'ll sell you shields today, but no maces. The last thing I want is for some innocent to get brained by one of my weapons.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31721,0,'Leeka Turner TALK_FLUFF 1'),(31027,0,1,'I don\'t know how much longer I\'ll be open today with all the commotion outside. If you need something repaired, I\'ll take a quick look.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31722,0,'Leeka Turner TALK_FLUFF 2'),(30547,0,0,'...zzz... ..snrk... c\'mere... gonna... gonna be Malowned... zzz..',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31230,0,'Postmaster Malown'),(30547,0,1,'...mrf... kids messin\'.. with th\' boxes... zzzz... teach \'em... lesson...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31231,0,'Postmaster Malown'),(29915,0,0,'You call that fighting? Let me go grab your dolly. Maybe she could teach you how to swing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30569,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),(29422,0,0,'Yes, sir!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,30120,0,'Forsaken Recruit'),(28951,0,0,'Welcome!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32807,0,'Breanni'),(28940,9,5,'By the Light be cleansed!, By the Light be cleansed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28602,0,'Scarlet Crusader'),(28939,9,0,'Scourge filth! DIE!, Scourge filth! DIE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28597,0,'Scarlet Preacher'),(28936,9,0,'Scourge filth! DIE!, Scourge filth! DIE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28597,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28216,7,0,'Not sure if you notice,, but there rumbling sometimes from the water in the big hole. I think there something down there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28243,0,'Zepik'),(28216,8,0,'Gorlocs are the bad-guys, just so you know.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28207,0,'Zepik'),(28216,9,0,'Good to stay away from Kartak. He only a friend of Frenzyheart so long as we keep his belly full... and he\'s got a big belly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28213,0,'Zepik'),(26890,0,0,'You are not welcome in our home. Leave and go find some other land to pillage!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25922,0,'Mistress of the Coldwind'),(26218,0,0,'The spirits have listened!  Can you feel it, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25615,0,'Elder Muahit'),(25589,5,0,'Filthy creature!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24777,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25326,0,0,'You peons work harder or I will come over there and beat you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24705,0,'Overlord Bor\'gorok'),(24038,0,0,'$n my child, come here, I have something to ask of you.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,22685,0,'Father Levariol'),(23440,0,0,'For the Dragonmaw!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,1937,0,'Dragonmaw Skybreaker'),(23440,1,0,'KILL THEM ALL!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21655,0,'Dragonmaw Skybreaker'),(22465,0,0,'I\'m only 4 years old.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20353,0,'Natasha'),(21925,0,0,'Feel my wrath, $r scum!  You will not get away with this!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19598,0,'Avatar of Sathal'),(21506,0,0,'Illidan\'s lapdogs!  You will pay for my imprisonment with your lives!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19577,0,'Azaloth'),(20780,0,0,'Do not die on me, vindicator!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18386,0,'Kaylaan'),(19674,0,0,'I don\'t give a damn what Shaffar\'s ethereals have placed over the entrance to the Mana-Tombs. You will work until those wards are removed and the Consortium can move in safely and take what\'s rightfully ours!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17224,0,'Nexus-Prince Haramad'),(19257,0,0,'INCOMING! Do not let them through! Focus fire! NOW, NOW, NOW!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,16395,0,'Arcanist Torseldori'),(18904,0,0,'Turn back, mortal... This is not your battle.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,16007,0,'Vision of the Forgotten'),(18471,13,0,'For the first time in the Ring of Blood\'s history, Mogor has chosen to exercise his right of battle! On this wartorn ground, $n will face Mogor, hero of the Warmaul!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15481,0,'Gurgthock'),(17841,0,0,'It\'s just like the structure you described at Umbrafen Lake.  Does this mean the naga are pumping water out of all the lakes in Zangarmarsh?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,14706,0,'Ysiel Windsinger'),(17841,1,0,'The naga are even pumping the water out of their own lake!  What purpose could that possibly serve?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,14712,0,'Ysiel Windsinger'),(17841,2,0,'There!  Those pipes all appear to be connected to that structure.  It can\'t possibly fit all the water they\'ve been stealing.  Where are they keeping it?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,14713,0,'Ysiel Windsinger'),(17841,3,0,'What we saw explains what happened in the Dead Mire.  There was a lake here once.  If we don\'t stop the naga, all of the marsh will soon look like this!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,14714,0,'Ysiel Windsinger'),(17693,0,0,'Invaders have breached the defenses!',14,0,100,0,0,10285,0,14309,0,'Churn'),(15491,0,0,'Pitiful, predictable mortals... You know not what you have done! The Master\'s will fulfilled. The Moonglade shall be destroyed and Malfurion along with it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11030,0,'Eranikus Say 0'),(15491,1,0,'%s lets loose a sinister laugh.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11296,0,''),(15491,2,0,'You are certainly not your father, insect. Should it interest me, I would crush you with but a swipe of my claws. Turn Shan\'do Stormrage over to me and your pitiful life will be spared along with the lives of your people.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11294,0,''),(15491,3,0,'My redemption? You are bold, little one. My redemption comes by the will of my god.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11297,0,''),(15491,4,0,'%s roars furiously.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11298,0,''),(15491,5,0,'Rise, servants of the Nightmare! Rise and destroy this world! Let there be no survivors...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11299,0,''),(15491,6,0,'Where is your savior? How long can you hold out against my attacks? ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11304,0,''),(15491,7,0,'Remulos, look how easy they fall before me? You can stop this, fool. Turn the druid over to me and it will all be over...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11306,0,''),(15491,8,0,'Defeated my minions? Then face me, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11305,0,''),(15491,9,0,'IT BURNS! THE PAIN... SEARING...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11314,0,''),(15491,10,0,'WHY? Why did this happen to ... to me? Where were you Tyrande? Where were you when I fell from the grace of Elune?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11315,0,''),(15491,11,0,'I... I feel... I feel the touch of Elune upon my being once more... She smiles upon me... Yes... I...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11316,0,''),(15491,12,0,'%s falls to one knee.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11319,0,''),(14523,0,0,'You dog!  Now I\'ll trap your soul into a shard and give you to my imp as a plaything!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9735,0,'Ulathek'),(13716,0,0,'You wish to learn of the stone? Follow me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,8952,0,'Celebras - Line 0'),(13716,1,0,'For so long I have drifted in my cursed form. You have freed me... Your hard work shall be repaid.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,8953,0,'Celebras - Line 1'),(13716,2,0,'Please do as I instruct you, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,8954,0,'Celebras - Line 2'),(13716,3,0,'Read this tome I have placed before you, and speak the words aloud.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,8950,0,'Celebras - Line 3'),(13716,4,0,'%s begins to channel his energy, focusing on the stone.',16,0,100,469,0,0,0,8951,0,'Celebras - Emote'),(13716,5,0,'Together, the two parts shall become one, once again.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,8948,0,'Celebras - Line 5'),(13716,6,0,'Shal myrinan ishnu daldorah...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,8949,0,'Celebras - Line 6'),(13716,7,0,'My scepter will once again become whole!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,8955,0,'Celebras - Line 7'),(13716,8,0,'Perhaps we can attempt this later. Please speak to me again if you wish to do so.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,8947,0,'Celebras the Redeemed'),(11360,0,0,'%s flees toward the safety of another tiger.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10549,0,'Zulian Cub'),(34520,0,0,'If you want, go get, big-tongue baby!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34704,0,'Wolvar Orphan'),(16159,0,0,'Am I hearing things?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13252,0,'Calliard random talk'),(16159,0,1,'Who goes there?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13251,0,'Calliard random talk'),(16159,0,2,'All quiet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13250,0,'Calliard random talk'),(11016,0,0,'I\'m ready, $n. Let\'s find my equipment and get out of here. I think I know where it is.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,6433,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,1,0,'We\'ve failed, $n!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6434,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,2,0,'Oh my! Look at this... all these candles. I\'m sure they\'re used for some terrible ritual or dark summoning. We best make haste!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,6456,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,3,0,'There! Over there!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,6457,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,4,0,'All I need now is a golden lasso.',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,6458,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,5,0,'Let\'s get out of here, $n. I\'m ready now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6459,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,6,0,'DIE, DEMON DOGS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6460,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,7,0,'Ah! Fresh air at last! I never thought I\'d see the day...',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,6461,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,8,0,'What was that?! Trey? TREY!?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,6463,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,9,0,'NO! What have they done to you!?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6467,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,10,0,'No! My friend... what\'s happened? This is all my fault...',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,6468,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,11,0,'I can travel faster on my own from here, $n. Meet Jessir Moonbow near Ashenvale. She should be with the druids of the Emerald Circle. She\'ll tell you what to do next. Thank you so much for your help!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,6469,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,12,0,'You will not stop me from escaping here, $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6801,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,12,1,'You kept me in that cell for too long, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6802,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(11016,12,2,'You will pay for what you\'ve done to Trey!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,6803,0,'Captured Arko\'narin'),(10740,0,0,'%s whimpers.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6270,0,'Awbee'),(10717,0,0,'%s is summoned through a temporal rift!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6033,0,''),(7843,0,0,'Aaaaahhh! So close to escaping.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,3829,0,'Gnomeregan Evacuee'),(7671,0,0,'%s\'s physical form is weakened. You notice the Stone of Binding near the creature is glowing! Strike now!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,3642,0,'Servant of Sevine'),(7670,0,0,'%s\'s physical form is weakened. You notice the Stone of Binding near the creature is glowing! Strike now!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,3642,0,'Servant of Allistarj'),(7669,0,0,'%s\'s physical form is weakened. You notice the Stone of Binding near the creature is glowing! Strike now!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,3642,0,'Servant of Grol'),(7668,0,0,'%s\'s physical form is weakened. You notice the Stone of Binding near the creature is glowing! Strike now!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,3642,0,'Servant of Razelikh'),(7572,0,0,'Per your request, Corporal Splithoof has come, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3764,0,'Fallen Hero of the Horde'),(6212,1,0,'Never cross a Dark Iron, $C.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1934,0,'Dark Iron Agent'),(6221,0,0,'No gnome will be left behind.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2422,0,'Addled Leper'),(6222,1,0,'No gnome will be left behind.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2422,0,'Leprous Technician'),(6223,1,0,'No gnome will be left behind.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2422,0,'Leprous Defender'),(6224,1,0,'No gnome will be left behind.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,2422,0,'Leprous Machinesmith'),(6114,0,0,'Farewell, $n.  And remember, a warrior never shows his back to his foe!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,2302,0,'Muren Stormpike'),(5353,0,0,'I have given you an oathstone of Ysera\'s Dragonflight, $n.  When you are ready and able to aid us, use it, and then we may begin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,4481,0,'Itharius'),(4781,0,0,'%s nervously crawls from the crate.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1638,0,'Snufflenose Gopher'),(4781,1,0,'%s wiggles his whiskers at $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1591,0,'Snufflenose Gopher'),(4781,2,0,'%s sniffs at the ground...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1592,0,'Snufflenose Gopher'),(2984,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting you, $n.',12,3,100,0,0,0,0,947,0,'Seer Wiserunner'),(2934,0,0,'%s accepts the relics from $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,921,0,'Keeper Bel\'dugur'),(2934,1,0,'Accept my thanks, $n.  Yagyin\'s journal shall be yours.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,922,0,'Keeper Bel\'dugur'),(2786,0,0,'%s stows the items $n gave him.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,919,0,'Gerrig Bonegrip'),(2786,1,0,'I thank you, $n.  My associates who will do great things with these...',12,7,100,2,0,0,0,920,0,'Gerrig Bonegrip'),(178580,4,0,'Pah! Built by amateurs!',12,0,100,0,0,181174,0,211000,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(178580,5,0,'Just need to link these parts together...',12,0,100,0,0,181175,0,211002,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(178580,6,0,'I\'m not exactly proud of this repair job, but it\'ll do. Let\'s get back to Tal-Galan.',12,0,100,0,0,181176,0,209750,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir to Player'),(177452,2,0,'Another fragment. The Primus has spoken of this Sepulcher before. Do you know what it is? Or where?',12,0,100,1,0,181271,0,209707,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177452,3,0,'Hmph. \"Keeper of Secrets\" indeed.',12,0,100,1,0,181273,0,211468,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177452,4,0,'Alright, Maw Walker. Fire on that grappling point and hold on tight!',12,0,100,1,0,181274,0,211469,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177451,1,0,'The Sepulcher is... not to be discussed. Even with allies.',12,0,100,1,0,181272,0,209708,0,'Tal-Galan says'),(177451,2,0,'The covenant forces are still defending the vault against the Mawsworn, but we must hurry.',12,0,100,1,0,181177,0,209765,0,'Tal-Galan says'),(177452,5,0,'We\'ve got a flayedwing tethered nearby for you, Maw Walker. That will get you right to the forward camp outside the vault.',12,0,100,1,0,181178,0,209766,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177459,0,0,'Reinforcements! Just in time. We are about to push toward the vault.',12,0,100,1,0,181179,0,209770,0,'Protector Kah-Rev'),(178640,0,0,'I have trained my entire existence for this moment. For this battle. I will follow your lead, Maw Walker!',12,0,100,0,0,181180,0,209773,0,'Protector Kah-Rev'),(178639,0,0,'You\'d fit well in Maldraxxus, Protector!',12,0,100,0,0,181181,0,209774,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(178638,0,0,'It is good to see you safe, friend!',12,0,100,1,0,181285,0,210013,0,'Tal-Galan'),(178638,1,0,'The threads of fate surprise us all.',12,0,100,1,0,181286,0,210015,0,'Tal-Galan'),(178638,2,0,'Come, my friend.',12,0,100,1,0,181287,0,210016,0,'Tal-Galan'),(178638,3,0,'These are desperate times.',12,0,100,1,0,181288,0,210018,0,'Tal-Galan'),(178638,4,0,'Tal-Xuhl. Your legacy will be remembered.',12,0,100,1,0,181289,0,210019,0,'Tal-Galan'),(178649,0,0,'Tal-Galan? I saw a vision of the Maw Walker, but not of you...',12,0,100,1,0,180339,0,210014,0,'Tal-Yor'),(178650,0,0,'Is it wise for you to join the battle, Tal-Galan?',12,0,100,1,0,180340,0,210017,0,'Tal-Rahl'),(178676,0,0,'My friends! Let us begin the ritual.',12,0,100,0,0,181290,0,209816,0,'Tal-Galan'),(178676,1,0,'The way is open! Come, Maw Walker.',12,0,100,0,0,181291,0,209817,0,'Tal-Galan'),(178689,0,0,'We should go. This is no place to linger.',12,0,100,0,0,181284,0,209818,0,'Protector Kah-Rev'),(112477,0,0,'EIN SCHMUTZIGER NACHWUCHS VON SUSHI! KLEINER DIEB! ICH WERDE KEINEN SCHMUTZIGEN FLECK VON DIR HINTERLASSEN!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,121358,0,''),(65153,10,0,'Hold your blade, adventurer!',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,47004,0,''),(65153,11,0,'This beast leads the Riverpaw gnoll gang and may be the key to ending gnoll aggression in Elwynn.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,47007,0,''),(65153,12,0,'We\\\'re taking him into custody in the name of King Anduin Wrynn.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,47008,0,''),(65153,13,0,'Take us to the Stockades, Andromath.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,47009,0,''),(42391,1,0,'I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42381,0,'West Plains Drifter to Player'),(42391,0,0,'Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don\'t want any trouble, ok? I didn\'t see who murdered \'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin\' your shoes.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42380,0,'West Plains Drifter to Player'),(42384,3,0,'Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,42383,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42383,11,0,'Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don\'t want any trouble, ok? I didn\'t see who murdered \'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin\' your shoes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42380,0,''),(42383,12,0,'I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42381,0,''),(42383,13,0,'Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42382,0,''),(42383,14,0,'Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42383,0,''),(42384,2,0,'Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,42382,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42384,1,0,'I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42381,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42384,11,0,'Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don\'t want any trouble, ok? I didn\'t see who murdered \'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin\' your shoes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42380,0,''),(42384,12,0,'I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42381,0,''),(42384,13,0,'Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42382,0,''),(42384,14,0,'Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42383,0,''),(42384,0,0,'Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don\'t want any trouble, ok? I didn\'t see who murdered \'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin\' your shoes.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42380,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42386,3,0,'Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,42383,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42386,2,0,'Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,42382,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42386,11,0,'Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don\'t want any trouble, ok? I didn\'t see who murdered \'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin\' your shoes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42380,0,''),(42386,12,0,'I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42381,0,''),(42386,13,0,'Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42382,0,''),(42386,14,0,'Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42383,0,''),(34959,0,1,'Are you looking at me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35391,0,''),(34959,0,2,'The hour of reckoning has come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,71227,0,''),(34959,3,0,'Why\'s the ground shaking, $n?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(177562,0,0,'Even damaged, the vault is glorious, is it not?',12,0,100,1,0,181292,0,209822,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177562,1,0,'But surely I should recover a few of these treasures...',12,0,100,1,0,181294,0,209825,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177562,2,0,'Yes, of course. Sigil first. Other relics later.',12,0,100,1,0,181296,0,209827,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177562,3,0,'The vault is opening!',12,0,100,1,0,181297,0,209879,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177562,4,0,'The Keeper of Secrets will not be subdued so easily!',12,0,100,0,0,181299,0,209885,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177562,5,0,'There is one last record here. It appears to be bound together with the sigil.',12,0,100,0,0,181301,0,209899,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177562,6,0,'That is all that remains of the message. Take the sigil, Maw Walker.',12,0,100,0,0,181304,0,209903,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177562,7,0,'So much knowledge. We cannot leave it behind!',12,0,100,5,0,181306,0,211077,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177562,8,0,'Very well. I can open the way back to Keeper\'s Respite. I pray I can return one day...',12,0,100,0,0,181308,0,211082,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177564,0,0,'There\'s no time for gawking! We must secure the sigil!',12,0,100,0,0,181293,0,209823,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177564,1,0,'Get this vault open NOW!',12,0,100,0,0,181295,0,209826,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177564,2,0,'The sigil belongs to the Primus!',12,0,100,0,0,181298,0,209881,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177564,3,0,'Take cover, keeper! This is our fight!',12,0,100,0,0,181300,0,209893,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177564,4,0,'I don\'t recognize the magic bound with the sigil. Perhaps Highlord Fordragon will',12,0,100,1,0,181305,0,209902,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177564,5,0,'The sigil is more important. Get us out of here!',12,0,100,1,0,181307,0,211081,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177566,2,0,'So be it. Let the slaughter begin!',12,0,100,0,0,181188,0,209886,0,'Xalvez the Collector to Remnants of Kalvez'),(177566,3,0,'The bonds of shared torment empower us!',14,0,100,0,0,181183,0,209887,0,'Xalvez the Collector to Remnants of Kalvez'),(177566,4,0,'Is this... the end?',12,0,100,0,0,181184,0,209894,0,'Xalvez the Collector to Remnants of Kalvez'),(178225,4,0,'...enough to keep it protected. Another safeguard is required.',12,0,100,669,0,181302,0,209900,0,'The Primus'),(178225,5,0,'I will bind it with another form of magic. One that even Zovaal cannot--',12,0,100,669,0,181303,0,209901,0,'The Primus'),(177228,5,0,'This magic bound with the Primus\'s sigil... is it familiar, Maw Walker?',12,0,100,6,0,181309,0,209911,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(177228,6,0,'It is much like the memories you restored to the Runecarver in Torghast. If you bring this to him, perhaps he will know how to untangle the sigil.',12,0,100,1,0,181310,0,209912,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(177228,7,0,'This is our only path forward. We have no choice but to try.',12,0,100,1,0,181312,0,209914,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(177228,8,0,'So be it. Good luck to you both.',12,0,100,1,0,181314,0,209916,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(177927,4,0,'Torghast!? Unacceptable. You might as well deliver it directly into the Jailer\'s hands!',12,0,100,5,0,181311,0,209913,0,'Tal-Galan'),(177568,0,0,'I\'m going with you, Maw Walker. I will ensure this Runecarver\'s work is up to par.',12,0,100,1,0,181313,0,209915,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177570,3,0,'Once, I hoped that all those ages spent in the Maw might change you.',12,0,100,0,0,181316,0,210866,0,'The Primus to Player'),(177570,4,0,'That you might repent for your sins.',12,0,100,0,0,181317,0,210867,0,'The Primus to Player'),(177570,5,0,'But you have only grown more malevolent.',12,0,100,0,0,181318,0,210868,0,'The Primus to Player'),(175662,0,0,'Your sigil will be mine.',12,0,100,0,0,181459,0,209362,0,'The Jailer'),(175662,1,0,'You will fail... again.',12,0,100,0,0,181461,0,209364,0,'The Jailer'),(175662,2,0,'Mawsworn. Take them.',12,0,100,0,0,181462,0,209365,0,'The Jailer'),(175662,3,0,'You will claim no victory this day, brother. Bear witness.',12,0,100,0,0,181464,0,209451,0,'The Jailer'),(178774,1,0,'I just got the Primus back. I cannot lose him again! FOR MALDRAXXUS!',12,0,100,0,0,181463,0,209366,0,'Bonesmith Heirmir'),(177228,9,0,'We are honored to have you among us, Primus. What is our course now that the Jailer has your sigil?',12,0,100,1,0,181327,0,209948,0,'Highlord Bolvar Fordragon'),(177194,0,0,'The mortals must face Zovaal in his sanctum. But as you know, a wise strategist always prepares contingencies.',12,0,100,669,0,181328,0,209949,0,'The Primus '),(177194,1,0,'he covenants have grown stronger, but are not yet whole. Each must remember its purpose... and find its future.',12,0,100,603,0,181329,0,209951,0,'The Primus '),(177194,2,0,'When this comes to pass, new sigils can be forged. They will be needed to pursue Zovaal, should our assault fail.',12,0,100,669,0,181330,0,209952,0,'The Primus '),(177194,3,0,'Highlord, send word to your allies in Oribos. They must defend the Arbiter\'s sigil at all costs.',12,0,100,0,0,181332,0,209954,0,'The Primus '),(177194,4,0,'Maw Walker, I will call for you when I am ready. May fortune favor us all.',12,0,100,0,0,181333,0,209955,0,'The Primus '),(166886,1,0,'No sign yet of the High Priestess. Perhaps she charged ahead into the chaos.',12,0,100,1,0,161917,0,201850,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(166886,2,2,'We are establishing a forward position. Go, make sure we hold it.',12,0,50,25,0,161921,0,195256,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(166886,2,1,'Regroup with your fellow knights. We will not be far behind.',12,0,50,5,0,161919,0,195255,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(166886,2,0,'Fight your way out of here. We will meet you ahead.',12,0,50,25,0,161918,0,195254,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(166886,3,0,'This clarion will signal the Ebon Blade to converge on your foe. Use it wisely.',12,0,100,1,0,161922,0,201622,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(166886,4,2,'Let\'s get moving--before reinforcements arrive.',12,0,100,1,0,161929,0,195266,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(166886,4,1,'We have done all we can here.',12,0,100,1,0,161928,0,195265,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(166886,4,0,'We rally up ahead. Go!',12,0,100,25,0,161927,0,195264,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine to Player'),(166886,5,0,'We are vastly outnumbered. Let\'s try not to draw unwanted attention.',12,0,100,1,0,161930,0,195269,0,'Highlord Darion quest 59914'),(166886,6,0,'Keep an eye out for clues that point to the whereabouts of our allies.',12,0,100,1,0,161931,0,195270,0,'Highlord Darion quest 59914'),(166886,7,0,'Frost magic. Looks like the work of our friend the Lord Admiral.',12,0,100,6,0,161933,0,201584,0,'Highlord Darion quest to Guard frozen '),(166886,8,0,'The conflict seems to move in this direction. We should follow the trail before it grows... cold.',12,0,100,1,0,161934,0,201585,0,'Highlord Darion quest to Guard frozen '),(166886,9,0,'More of Lady Proudmoore\'s handiwork.',12,0,100,1,0,161935,0,201586,0,'Highlord Darion quest to a sheep'),(166886,10,0,'It would be unwise to break the enchantment. Let\'s move along.',12,0,100,6,0,161936,0,201587,0,'Highlord Darion quest to a sheep'),(166886,11,0,'The Lord Admiral is truly formidable, to have bested one of these monstrosities.',12,0,100,1,0,161937,0,201588,0,'Highlord Darion quest to stygian'),(166886,12,0,'Hold! What\'s that up ahead?',12,0,100,5,0,161938,0,201589,0,'Highlord Darion quest to stygian'),(166886,13,0,'Up ahead! It\'s Lady Proudmoore!',12,0,100,5,0,161946,0,194831,0,'Highlord Darion to jaina'),(166886,14,0,'Looks like we\'ve secured the Lord Admiral. I\'ll signal the Ebon Blade to advance.',12,0,100,1,0,161947,0,194832,0,'Highlord Darion to jaina'),(166886,15,0,'Whatever is going on here, we don\'t want any part of it.',12,0,100,274,0,161942,0,194826,0,'Highlord Darion to Thelonia the Cruel'),(166886,16,0,'Let\'s move on.',12,0,100,1,0,161943,0,194827,0,'Highlord Darion to Thelonia the Cruel'),(166886,17,0,'I hope our allies didn\'t end up in the belly of that... thing.',12,0,100,1,0,161940,0,194822,0,'Highlord Darion to Serath the Gluttonous'),(166886,18,0,'I suggest we try not to get eaten!',12,0,100,6,0,161941,0,194823,0,'Highlord Darion to Serath the Gluttonous'),(166886,19,0,'If one of our allies is trapped within that, I doubt we\'re going to get them out.',12,0,100,25,0,161944,0,194828,0,'Highlord Darion to Mawsworn Soulrenders'),(166886,20,0,'Keep searching.',12,0,100,1,0,161945,0,194830,0,'Highlord Darion to Mawsworn Soulrenders'),(166886,21,0,'Something\'s flying at us from above!',12,0,100,22,0,161952,0,195275,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(166886,22,0,'Knights, secure the cave! We\'ll hold off these fiends.',14,0,100,1,0,161960,0,195282,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(166886,23,0,'What did Thrall mean by \"slip past them again\"? You\'ve escaped before?',12,0,100,6,0,161962,0,195285,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(166886,24,0,'Lord Admiral, before we found you, did you see any sign of the Night Warrior?',12,0,100,6,0,161966,0,195289,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(166886,25,0,'She leapt into the rift just ahead of us. She vowed to find Sylvanas Windrunner... at any cost.',12,0,100,1,0,161968,0,201851,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(166886,26,0,'Not if we end you first!',12,0,100,1,0,161971,0,195296,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine'),(166886,27,0,'Countless souls are now pouring into this realm. But some have been here for untold ages. Perhaps one of them knows a way out.',12,0,100,25,0,162121,0,195648,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59756'),(166886,28,0,'Knights of the Ebon Blade have ways to compel the dead to speak. If we seize one of them, we can extract its secrets.',12,0,100,1,0,162124,0,195650,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59756'),(166886,29,0,'Use the helm while it\'s weakened!',12,0,100,5,0,162125,0,195820,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59757'),(166886,30,0,'Useless. These souls are too fragmented. There must be another way...',12,0,100,5,0,162126,0,195821,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59757'),(166886,31,0,'This target poses a considerable threat. I will signal the Ebon Blade for assistance once we engage it.',12,0,100,25,0,162127,0,195822,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59758'),(166886,32,0,'Ebon Blade, to me! Tear this monstrosity down!',12,0,100,0,0,162128,0,195823,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59758'),(166886,33,0,'Now! Bend it to your will!',12,0,100,0,0,162129,0,195827,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59758'),(166886,34,0,'You\'re coming with us!',12,0,100,0,0,162131,0,195835,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59915'),(166886,35,0,'Speak, fiend!',12,0,100,0,0,162132,0,196084,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59915'),(166886,36,0,'Your arrival is timely.',12,0,100,1,0,163087,0,196073,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59776'),(166886,37,0,'Our friend has something to share.',12,0,100,25,0,163088,0,196074,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59776'),(166886,38,0,'Speak! How do we leave this place?',12,0,100,1,0,163089,0,196075,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59776'),(166886,39,0,'So there is a way out! Tell us where to find it!',12,0,100,5,0,163090,0,196077,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59776'),(166886,40,0,'Could you make sense of what it said, Lord Admiral?',12,0,100,6,0,163093,0,196081,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59776'),(166886,41,0,'Then it seems our course is clear.',12,0,100,25,0,163095,0,196083,0,'Highlord Darion Mograine_q59776'),(47626,0,0,'Ah, fresh meat!',14,0,100,0,0,19882,0,48179,0,'Admiral Ripsnarl - Aggro'),(47626,1,0,'Do you feel that chill running up your spine?',14,0,100,0,0,19877,0,47914,0,'Admiral Ripsnarl - Fog 1'),(47626,2,0,'The fog is rolling in...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,47915,0,'Admiral Ripsnarl - Fog 2'),(47626,3,0,'Your blood only increases my hunger!',14,0,100,0,0,19876,0,48009,0,'Admiral Ripsnarl - Slay'),(47626,4,0,'I can smell your fear...',14,0,100,0,0,19879,0,48006,0,'Admiral Ripsnarl - Go for the Throat 1'),(47626,4,1,'I will rip your heart from your chest!',14,0,100,0,0,19880,0,48007,0,'Admiral Ripsnarl - Go for the Throat 2'),(47626,5,0,'Multiple vapors appear from the fog!  Kill Admiral Ripsnarl before you are overwhelmed!',41,0,100,0,0,19878,0,50851,0,'Admiral Ripsnarl - Announce Vapor'),(47626,6,0,'You will...NOT find her...until it is too late...',14,0,100,0,0,19875,0,48010,0,'Admiral Ripsnarl - Death'),(25850,0,0,'%s trumpets in approval!',16,0,100,377,0,9914,0,25046,0,'Trapped Mammoth Calf'),(38037,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Nortet'),(38037,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Nortet'),(38247,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Ertezza'),(38247,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Ertezza'),(38246,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Seratha'),(38246,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Seratha'),(38244,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Legati'),(38244,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Legati'),(38245,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Tunari'),(38245,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Tunari'),(42618,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Voldreka'),(42618,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Voldreka'),(38243,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Zentabra'),(38243,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Zentabra'),(38242,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Nekali'),(38242,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Nekali'),(63310,0,0,'Not bad, $n. Not bad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37928,0,'Zabrax'),(63310,1,0,'Well done, $n!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37898,0,'Zabrax'),(187897,3,0,'Melidrussa... I have.. failed...',12,0,100,0,0,203354,0,218834,0,'Defier Draghar to Player'),(187897,4,0,'If only you could have understood the righteousness of our cause.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Defier Draghar'),(187897,5,0,'I will not allow you to disturb Melidrussa\'s work!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Defier Draghar'),(187897,6,0,'Melidrussa... I have.. failed...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Defier Draghar'),(100675,0,0,'I bring urgent news, My King. Danger is all around you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119325,0,''),(100458,0,0,'And with the return of the Illidari, we have a valuable weapon on our side. You were wise to accept them into Stormwind, King Anduin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102420,0,''),(100458,1,0,'I understand, husband. But for Maiev to release them, the situation must be even more dire than we know.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119321,0,''),(100456,0,0,'He died with honor, protecting his people. He was a true king.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,103480,0,''),(100457,0,0,'Having the Illidari among us makes me uneasy. Their kind has been locked away since my brother\'s fall.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119320,0,''),(100460,0,0,'His valor inspired us all, even in death. His spirit will be with us, always.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,103481,0,''),(100460,1,0,'You are not alone in this, My King. We stand behind you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102414,0,''),(100460,2,0,'To fight two wars at once would be folly. For all our sakes, we need the Horde\'s strength added to our own.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102416,0,''),(100460,3,0,'My people know the price of facing the demons as a world divided. It is time to unite our forces and defend our lands.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102421,0,''),(100454,0,0,'I can\'t believe he\'s really gone.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,103479,0,''),(100429,0,0,'At last, some good news on this day of sorrow.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,119292,0,''),(100429,1,0,'My father was a seasoned strategist, yet his army was shattered on the Broken Shore. How can I hope to succeed where he failed?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102413,0,''),(100429,2,0,'Velen is right. We must stand beside the demon hunters and focus on the Legion. Now is not the time to--',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102417,0,''),(100429,3,0,'Agreed. I\'m sorry, Jaina, but vengeance must wait. I trust you\'re mobilizing the Kirin Tor as we discussed?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102423,0,''),(100429,4,0,'We must not splinter like this... not now. Please, Jaina!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102649,0,''),(100429,5,0,'My father dead... disaster on the Broken Shore... Jaina fixed on revenge... Everything is falling apart.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102651,0,''),(100429,6,0,'I will hear what this demon hunter has to say.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,122249,0,''),(100428,0,0,'King Anduin, the hero of the Broken Shore approaches.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102263,0,''),(100428,1,0,'Have you forgotten the Horde\'s treachery? It\'s time to bring them to heel like the dogs they are!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102415,0,''),(100428,2,0,'The Horde betrayed your father and left us to die! To fight alongside those cowards would dishonor everything he stood for.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102418,0,''),(100428,3,0,'Dalaran will help protect the Eastern Kingdoms, but I will NOT allow the Horde to set foot within my city!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102648,0,''),(100428,4,0,'You disappoint me, King of Stormwind. But sooner or later, you will see the truth. You all will!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,113130,0,''),(21254,0,1,'Me no want to die.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19038,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,0,2,'Me sorry...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,19039,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,0,3,'Me sorry little birdy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18851,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,0,4,'Bird, you hurting me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18852,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,0,5,'ARGH!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18853,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,0,6,'Why you keep hurting me? Me said me sorry...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18854,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,0,7,'Me DO whatever birdy want. Just STOP the hurting.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18855,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,0,8,'Me NO can think RIGHT anymore!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18857,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,1,0,'Bird spell not working. Me is free!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19030,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,1,1,'I\'ll crush you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1925,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,1,2,'Me smash! You die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1926,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(21254,1,3,'Raaar!!! Me smash $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1927,0,'Dullgrom Dredger'),(19983,0,0,'Stupid ogre. You all need to be taught a lesson.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19032,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),(19983,0,1,'If freedom is what you seek, freedom is what you shall find.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19033,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),(19983,0,2,'You ogres are disposable.  That being said, it is time to take out the garbage.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19034,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),(19983,0,3,'I tire of these ogres. We should wipe them out, all of them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19035,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),(19983,0,5,'Do any of you other ogres want to join your friend?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19036,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),(34907,0,1,'YAAARRRGH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24847,0,'Kvaldir Harpooner'),(34907,0,2,'Be consumed by the mist!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24848,0,'Kvaldir Harpooner'),(34907,0,3,'Look what\'s lost its way...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24849,0,'Kvaldir Harpooner'),(34907,0,4,'I will heave your carcass into the ocean myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24850,0,'Kvaldir Harpooner'),(34907,0,5,'You\'re not even fit to be fed to Leviroth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24851,0,'Kvaldir Harpooner'),(34907,0,6,'You\'ve strayed too far from your comfortable soil, $N.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24852,0,'Kvaldir Harpooner'),(34947,0,0,'I shall draw your soul into the mist!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24846,0,'Kvaldir Berserker'),(34947,0,1,'YAAARRRGH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24847,0,'Kvaldir Berserker'),(34947,0,2,'Be consumed by the mist!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24848,0,'Kvaldir Berserker'),(34947,0,3,'Look what\'s lost its way...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24849,0,'Kvaldir Berserker'),(34947,0,4,'I will heave your carcass into the ocean myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24850,0,'Kvaldir Berserker'),(34947,0,5,'You\'re not even fit to be fed to Leviroth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24851,0,'Kvaldir Berserker'),(34947,0,6,'You\'ve strayed too far from your comfortable soil, $N.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24852,0,'Kvaldir Berserker'),(91109,0,0,'Behind me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,93565,0,''),(91109,1,0,'Dream work vi-',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(91109,2,0,'What is it? Damage?..',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,93570,0,''),(91109,3,0,'My best hippogriff is perfect for this task.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,102319,0,''),(104728,0,0,'You have to help me find him! Is there something I can do?',12,0,100,0,0,58045,0,107175,0,''),(104728,1,0,'Speak to me when you are ready to leave.',12,0,100,0,0,58070,0,107622,0,''),(104728,2,0,'There is no time to mourn. Elothir is beyond my reach now. Come, and do not delay.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,107928,0,''),(104728,3,0,'Shala\'nir is just ahead. You should be ready for whatever foulness awaits us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,107929,0,''),(104728,4,0,'These hoofprints follow the path to the left. After them, quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,108012,0,''),(104728,5,0,'Malfurion?! Call out to me!',12,0,100,0,0,58065,0,107553,0,''),(104728,6,0,'Not without you!',12,0,100,0,0,58064,0,107554,0,''),(104728,7,0,'By Elune, your foulness will be purged from this place!',12,0,100,0,0,58063,0,107556,0,''),(104799,0,0,'Ysera - no!',12,0,100,0,0,58087,0,107270,0,''),(104799,1,0,'Come with me. Ysera won\'t stop until this whole realm is plunged into the Nightmare.',12,0,100,0,0,58086,0,107271,0,''),(104799,2,0,'Xavius is using Malfurion to bait me, to distract me from what must be done. We are the only ones who can stop Ysera.',12,0,100,0,0,58085,0,107272,0,''),(104799,3,0,'Ah, Malfurion, my beloved! For a hundred hundred years he slept beneath Moonglade.',12,0,100,0,0,58084,0,107273,0,''),(104799,4,0,'Whenever I was plagued with doubt, I would descend into his barrow. I watched over him as he slept.',12,0,100,0,0,58083,0,107624,0,''),(104799,5,0,'Even in slumber, his presence calmed me. I left my fears below the earth and emerged, ready to lead my people.',12,0,100,0,0,58082,0,107625,0,''),(104799,6,0,'When Malfurion returned to my side, we worked as one. As if he had never been away. Have you ever loved as I have?',12,0,100,0,0,58081,0,107626,0,''),(104799,7,0,'Now Xavius has me by the throat. I must abandon my beloved, and contend with the most beautiful creature I have ever known.',12,0,100,0,0,58080,0,107627,0,''),(157242,0,1,'I lost sight of my goals. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(157242,0,2,'Of course, you are right. Thank you for reminding me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(157242,0,3,'I must not let the process overwhelm me. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(157242,1,1,'You don\'t know what this is lik',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(157242,1,2,'No! I-- Ahhh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(157242,1,3,'I can\'t do this! I can\'t do this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(157242,1,4,'That\'s what they always say!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(157242,2,1,'Oh! I feel... so much lighter.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(157242,2,2,'Thank you, I think that was meant to happen.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(157242,2,3,'Thank you... I think.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(157242,3,1,'I need to get out of here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them 2'),(157242,3,2,'I was tested, and I failed. I no longer walk the path.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them 2'),(168853,0,1,'I lost sight of my goals. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(168853,0,2,'Of course, you are right. Thank you for reminding me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(168853,0,3,'I must not let the process overwhelm me. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(168853,1,1,'You don\'t know what this is lik',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(168853,1,2,'No! I-- Ahhh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(168853,1,3,'I can\'t do this! I can\'t do this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(168853,1,4,'That\'s what they always say!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(168853,2,1,'Oh! I feel... so much lighter.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(168853,2,2,'Thank you, I think that was meant to happen.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(168853,2,3,'Thank you... I think.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(168853,3,1,'I need to get out of here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them 2'),(168853,3,2,'I was tested, and I failed. I no longer walk the path.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them 2'),(168852,0,1,'I lost sight of my goals. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(168852,0,2,'Of course, you are right. Thank you for reminding me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(168852,0,3,'I must not let the process overwhelm me. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick a safe answer'),(168852,1,1,'You don\'t know what this is lik',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(168852,1,2,'No! I-- Ahhh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(168852,1,3,'I can\'t do this! I can\'t do this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(168852,1,4,'That\'s what they always say!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Pick an unsafe answer'),(168852,2,1,'Oh! I feel... so much lighter.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(168852,2,2,'Thank you, I think that was meant to happen.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(168852,2,3,'Thank you... I think.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them'),(168852,3,1,'I need to get out of here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them 2'),(168852,3,2,'I was tested, and I failed. I no longer walk the path.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vulnerable Aspirant Defeat them 2'),(159791,0,1,'I lost them... I must report this to the Paragon.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Disciple of Purity to Vulnerable Aspirant'),(159791,0,2,'Please, do not let them hurt themselves or anyone else. I must report this immediately!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Disciple of Purity'),(157673,1,0,'A word of encouragement may be what these aspirants need.',12,0,100,1,0,158184,0,196657,0,'Disciple Kosmas'),(160645,0,0,'It.... hurts...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184229,0,'Acolyte Danysia'),(160645,1,0,'Lighter... and clearer.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184234,0,'Acolyte Danysia'),(159840,0,0,'We must act quickly.',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,182935,0,'Disciple Fotima'),(159840,1,0,'Let the vesper\'s song fill your mind!',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,184228,0,'Disciple Fotima'),(159840,2,0,'Let it go. It will pass.',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,184230,0,'Disciple Fotima'),(159840,3,0,'Her burden reveals itself. As with many, it is a memory of the one she could not save in life.',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,184231,0,'Disciple Fotima'),(159840,4,0,'Dispatch this remnant, so she may be purified.',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,184232,0,'Disciple Fotima'),(159840,5,0,'It is done. How do you feel, acolyte?',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,184233,0,'Disciple Fotima'),(159840,6,0,'You are one step closer to your ascension, sister.',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,184235,0,'Disciple Fotima'),(159840,7,0,'You have my thanks, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184236,0,'Disciple Fotima'),(165110,0,0,'Yes, ascended one.',12,0,100,66,0,158178,0,196655,0,'Pelagos'),(165110,1,0,'The Paragon is there, across the temple... and so many awaiting their rites.',12,0,100,66,0,158179,0,196206,0,'Pelagos'),(165110,2,0,'That went well. Certainly better than my last cleansing.',12,0,100,1,0,158180,0,196649,0,'Pelagos'),(160636,0,0,'Thank you, $n. I think you will find this exercise enlightening as well.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,182934,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,1,0,'As you will see, not all the memories that bind us are violent.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,183216,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,2,0,'Ah, I see. Bonds of kinship are strong indeed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184238,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,3,0,'A light touch will dismiss these images, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184239,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,4,0,'Stronger still are bonds forged in war. This acolyte fought alongside his people in a great conflict.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184240,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,5,0,'Closest to many are the bonds of family. They will not be easy to forget.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184241,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,6,0,'Just a little deeper... Oh!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,196695,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,7,0,'Wrestle control back, acolyte!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,196696,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,8,0,'Quickly, $n, dismiss these memories!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,196698,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,9,0,'Calm... calm... we will try again another time.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184242,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,10,0,'Are you still with us?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184267,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160636,11,0,'Rest, for now. That was a difficult thing you just endured.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184244,0,'Disciple Helene'),(160647,1,0,'I think so. Yes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184243,0,'Acolyte Galistos to Player'),(160647,2,0,'We will find Eridia. Stay safe, and go in service.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Acolyte Galistos to Player'),(165110,3,0,'I remember my family, doubtful they would recognize me now! I hope when I must forget, it goes... not like that.',12,0,100,1,0,158181,0,196651,0,'Pelagos'),(165110,4,0,'Many have fallen recently. The Temple of Loyalty is trying their best to bring them back to the path.',12,0,100,1,0,158182,0,196653,0,'Pelagos'),(159841,2,0,'This is the moment! Fight it!',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,0,0,'Disciple Lykaste'),(159841,3,0,'No! You must resist!',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,196633,0,'Disciple Lykaste'),(159841,4,0,'Acolyte! No!',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,196636,0,'Disciple Lykaste'),(159841,5,0,'Erisne... why? Why did you not fight?',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,184262,0,'Disciple Lykaste'),(159841,6,0,'I refuse to believe that to be true. Go. Loyalty awaits you, acolyte.',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,196637,0,'Disciple Lykaste'),(159841,7,0,'I must inform the Paragon. To lose an acolyte, at the end of their trials, no less...',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,196638,0,'Disciple Lykaste'),(159841,8,0,'Thank you. And I am sorry.',12,0,100,457,0,0,0,196639,0,'Disciple Lykaste'),(160709,0,0,'You were powerless before me. You are powerless now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,196630,0,'Erisne\'s Burden'),(160709,1,0,'You know the path forward. Let me in.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,196632,0,'Erisne\'s Burden'),(160646,0,0,'I am prepared.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,196629,0,'Acolyte Erisne'),(160646,1,0,'I am... powerless...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,196631,0,'Acolyte Erisne'),(168031,0,0,'Long have I toiled in this temple. And for what?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,196634,0,'Fallen Acolyte Erisne'),(168031,1,0,'No more. I will walk this path no longer!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,196635,0,'Fallen Acolyte Erisne'),(168031,2,0,'Look around you, disciple. We are all destined to fall, eventually.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184264,0,'Fallen Acolyte Erisne')