body destroyed each time, only to rise again.',12,0,100,1,0,30196,0,65178,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,8,0,'We have disturbed what should not have been disturbed. He cannot be free to escape this prison! You must destroy him!',12,0,100,5,0,30195,0,65177,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,7,0,'So the stories were true...',12,0,100,274,0,30194,0,65176,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,6,0,'We seem to have awakened a spirit of some kind.',12,0,100,6,0,30193,0,65175,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Cursed Mogu Sculpture'),(61348,5,0,'The door mechanism seems to have activated with the demise of the guardians. I fear what we may find within.',12,0,100,1,0,30181,0,65174,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Amethyst Guardian'),(61348,4,0,'That was close!',14,0,100,5,0,30180,0,46780,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Amethyst Guardian'),(61348,3,0,'The large Quilen seem to be guarding that door. Tread carefully, lest you wake them.',12,0,100,25,0,30179,0,65172,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Enormous Stone Quilen'),(61348,2,0,'The mogu held considerable power over the stones of the earth. Their magic lingers on, even centuries later.',12,0,100,1,0,30178,0,65171,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Stone Quilen'),(61348,1,0,'Many young Pandaren warriors have vanished into this...tomb. Have your wits about you.',12,0,100,1,0,30199,0,65170,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,0,0,'The ancient vaults of the mogu, untouched by time for thousands of years, who knows what secrets await?',12,0,100,1,0,30198,0,65168,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61140,3,0,'Death be a doorway, an\' time a window; I\'ll be back! AH-HAHAHAHAHAH!',14,0,100,0,0,29085,0,60656,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder to Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder'),(61140,2,0,'I be goin\' now; time ta find a new home for me soul.',14,0,100,1,0,29084,0,60655,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder to Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder'),(61140,1,0,'But it ain\'t no ting. Take your trinkets; you\'ll be needin\' dem.',14,0,100,14,0,29083,0,60654,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder to Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder'),(