s Army will crush the Emperor\'s foes.',14,0,100,0,0,29017,0,61486,0,'Ancient Mogu Machine'),(60648,4,0,'The Emperor\'s Courage burns everlasting.',14,0,100,0,0,29020,0,61489,0,'Ancient Mogu Machine'),(60648,5,0,'The Emperor\'s Courage appears in the alcoves!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,66160,0,'Ancient Mogu Machine'),(60648,3,0,'The Emperor\'s Strength appears in the alcoves!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,66158,0,'Ancient Mogu Machine'),(60648,2,0,'The Emperor\'s Strength grips this land with fists of iron.',14,0,100,0,0,29019,0,61488,0,'Ancient Mogu Machine'),(60648,1,0,'The Emperor\'s Rage echoes through the hills.',14,0,100,0,0,29018,0,61487,0,'Ancient Mogu Machine'),(60648,0,0,'The machine hums to life!  Get to the lower level!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,60536,0,'Ancient Mogu Machine to Player'),(60576,0,0,'%s goes into a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116982|h[Protective Frenzy]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,59989,0,'Stone Quilen'),(60410,3,0,'Drawing from reserve power.',14,0,100,0,0,28538,0,63825,0,'Elegon'),(60410,4,0,'Existence ends... I become nothing...',14,0,100,0,0,28535,0,63835,0,'Elegon to Player'),(60410,1,0,'Identification matrix mismatch. Unknown entities detected.',14,0,100,0,0,28545,0,65998,0,'Elegon to Invisible Stalker'),(60410,2,0,'Entering defensive mode.  Disabling output failsafes.',14,0,100,0,0,28534,0,60158,0,'Elegon'),(60410,0,0,'Sensors online. All cores operating at peak efficiency.',14,0,100,0,0,28544,0,65996,0,'Elegon to Invisible Stalker'),(60143,7,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_challangingroar.blp:20|tGara\'jal casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:117752|h[Frenzy]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,65382,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder'),(60143,6,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_agitatingtotem.blp:20|tGara\'jal summons a Spirit Totem. Use it to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116161|h[Cross Over]|h|r to the Spirit World!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,66277,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder'),(60143,4,0,'It be dyin\' time, now!',14,0,100,0,0,29080,0,63317,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder'),(60143,5,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_idol_02.blp:20|tGara\'jal selects random players to become |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122151|h[Voodoo Dolls]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,65370,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder'),(60143,3,0,'Fine, den! Time ta play, friends.',14,0,100,0,0,29088,0,59873,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder to Zandalari Skullcharger'),(60143,2,0,'Now you done made me angry!',14,0,100,0,0,29087,0,59872,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder to Zandalari Pterror Wing'),(60143,1,0,'No matter! We don\'t be needin\' what\'s back dat way anyhow!',14,0,100,0,0,29086,0,59871,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder to Zandalari Infiltrator'),(60047,0,0,'%s is about to Overload!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,61726,0,'Amethyst Guardian'),(60143,0,0,'A pair of Zandalari Trolls burst through the doors ahead of you!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,59870,0,'Gara\'jal the Spiritbinder to Zandalari Skullcharger'),(60043,1,0,'%s is about to Overload!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,61726,0,'Jade Guardian'),(60043,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_qirajicrystal_03.blp:20|t |c0093F8D1%s|r begins to petrify all players!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,59699,0,'Jade Guardian to Stone Guard Controller'),(60009,7,0,'If they only knew... what horrors await...',14,0,100,0,0,27815,0,61100,0,'Feng the Accursed to Player'),(60009,6,0,'Oh sage of the ages! Instill to me your arcane wisdom!',14,0,100,0,0,27821,0,61098,0,'Feng the Accursed to Phase Controller'),(60009,5,0,'You have been affected by |cFFFF0404|Hspell:116784|h[Wildfire Spark]|h|r !',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,61728,0,'Feng the Accursed to Player'),(60009,4,0,'%s begins to |cFFFF0404|Hspell:116711|h[Draw Flame]|h|r to his weapon!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,59886,0,'Feng the Accursed'),(60009,3,0,'Oh exalted one! Through me you shall melt flesh from bone!',14,0,100,0,0,27820,0,61097,0,'Feng the Accursed to Phase Controller'),(60009,2,0,'%s begins to channel a violent |cFFFF0404|Hspell:116040|h[Epicenter]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,59714,0,'Feng the Accursed to Feng the Accursed'),(60009,1,0,'Oh great spirit! Grant me the power of the earth!',14,0,100,0,0,27816,0,61096,0,'Feng the Accursed to Phase Controller'),(60009,0,0,'Tender your souls, mortals! These are the halls of the dead!',14,0,100,0,0,27814,0,61068,0,'Feng the Accursed'),(59915,1,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_qirajicrystal_02.blp:20|t |c00F19C88%s|r begins to petrify all players!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,59700,0,'Jasper Guardian to Stone Guard Controller'),(59915,0,0,'%s is about to Overload!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,61726,0,'Jasper Guardian'),(61348,28,0,'Oh dear...this could get messy. I will observe from a safer distance!',12,0,100,274,0,30186,0,66001,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Invisible Stalker'),(61348,29,0,'The machine has been destroyed, and so the mogu\'s power weakens.',12,0,100,4,0,30187,0,66005,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,30,0,'These discs look familiar, but I cannot place their origin.',12,0,100,25,0,30188,0,66007,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,31,0,'They call to me, the discs...I must...',12,0,100,6,0,30189,0,66008,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,32,0,'I...I see everything clearly now.',12,0,100,2,0,30190,0,66009,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,33,0,'The Titans! It would seem the mogu salvaged and repurposed ancient Titan technology to advance their empire!',12,0,100,5,0,30191,0,66010,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,34,0,'We must go, we are not done yet.',12,0,100,1,0,30192,0,66011,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,35,0,'May the great crane guide your steps.',12,0,100,66,0,31814,0,65202,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,36,0,'It is done, then. Yet...how many of these machines are hidden beneath the earth? How much do we not know about the dark secrets of the mogu?',12,0,100,4,0,30205,0,65195,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(61348,37,0,'I fear that our war against our ancient enemies is still far from over.',12,0,100,1,0,30206,0,65196,0,'Lorewalker Cho to Player'),(62004,0,0,'Your presence disturbs a lingering spirit!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,61566,0,'Ghost Essence to Cursed Mogu Sculpture'),(64068,0,0,'This is the closest any outsider has come to the Engine of Nalak\'sha.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,65930,0,'Mogu\'shan Engine Keeper to Mogu\'shan Warden'),(64068,1,0,'These secrets will die with you.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,65940,0,'Mogu\'shan Engine Keeper to Mogu\'shan Warden'),(27915,1,2,'We meet again, time traveller!',15,0,100,70,0,0,0,29168,0,'Chromie - WHISPER_COME_TALK'),(27915,1,1,'Quick, over here!',15,0,100,70,0,0,0,29169,0,'Chromie - WHISPER_COME_TALK'),(27915,1,0,'Come over here time traveller, we need to talk!',15,0,100,70,0,0,0,29167,0,'Chromie - WHISPER_COME_TALK'),(30553,1,0,'Don\'t worry too much. By the time I went off duty, we hadn\'t found a scrap of befouled grain here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32572,0,'Footman James - LINE_JAMES_2'),(30561,0,0,'The soldiers are doing important work. The safety of the people is more important, Mal, if you\'re interested in your customers living to spend another day.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32571,0,'Gryan Stoutmantle - LINE_GRYAN_1'),(31017,1,0,'%s grudgingly nods.',16,0,100,273,0,0,0,32569,0,'Mal Corricks - LINE_MAL_2'),(31017,2,0,'I can\'t argue with that.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32570,0,'Mal Corricks - LINE_MAL_3'),(31017,0,0,'Enough, Michael. Business is hurting enough with this scare as it is. We can use every copper.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,32560,0,'Mal Corricks - LINE_MAL_1'),(30553,0,0,'Orders are orders. If the Prince says jump...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31325,0,'Footman James - LINE_JAMES_1'),(30552,0,0,'It\'s a strange order, you can\'t deny. Suspicious food? Under that definition, you should arrest Belfast!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31326,0,'Fras Siabi - LINE_FRAS_1'),(30571,1,0,'I HEARD THAT! No more ale for you! Not a drop!',12,0,100,22,0,0,0,31327,0,'Michael Belfast - LINE_BELFAST_1'),(30571,0,0,'What were you doing in my cellar? There\'s a food scare going on, and the last thing I need is strangers rummaging around in my goods! Shoo!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,31323,0,'Michael Belfast - SAY_CELLAR'),(30571,0,1,'Hey! Stop rooting around in my cellar! Clear out!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,31322,0,'Michael Belfast - SAY_CELLAR'),(30551,0,0,'This whole situation seems a bit paranoid, don\'t you think?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31324,0,'Hearthsinger Forresten - LINE_FORREST_1'),(27885,7,0,'Oh, dear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27230,0,'LINE_JENA8'),(27885,6,0,'Thanks, Martha! I owe you one.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27229,0,'LINE_JENA7'),(27885,5,0,'Martha, I\'m out of flour for bread. You wouldn\'t happen to have any grain from that recent shipment, would you?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27224,0,'LINE_JENA6'),(27885,4,0,'Ah, I\'ll make him some fresh bread! I need to get some flour from Martha!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27223,0,'LINE_JENA5'),(27885,3,0,'Strawberries! Oh wait, they\'re not in season.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27222,0,'LINE_JENA4'),(27885,1,0,'I\'ve got plenty of cured bacon, but he had some for breakfast.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27220,0,'LINE_JENA2'),(27885,2,0,'I need to make something healthy for him, he\'s still not recovered from that illness from last week.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27221,0,'LINE_JENA3'),(27885,0,0,'Let\'s see, we had chicken last night.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27219,0,'LINE_JENA1'),(27884,0,0,'Oh hello, Jena. Of course you can borrow some grain. Help yourself.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27232,0,'LINE_MARTHA1'),(27884,1,0,'Oh, my.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27235,0,'LINE_MARTHA2'),(27907,3,0,'I guess I\'ll go find the authorities. If I\'m lucky they\'ll tell me it\'s the plague and that we\'re all going to die.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27259,0,'LINE_BARTLEBY3'),(27907,2,0,'Oh, come on! My cart broke, my horse lost a shoe, and now the cargo goes bad!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27258,0,'LINE_BARTLEBY2'),(27907,1,0,'Well, guess I should load everything back into the cart.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27257,0,'LINE_BARTLEBY1'),(27907,0,0,'I\'m going to lose my on time bonus because of this!',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,27255,0,'LINE_BARTLEBY_IDLE 1'),(27907,0,1,'I wasn\'t even supposed to be here today!',12,0,10,0,0,0,0,27256,0,'LINE_BARTLEBY_IDLE 2'),(27891,0,0,'Looks like a storm\'s coming in, Scruffy...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27236,0,'LINE_MALCOLM1'),(27891,2,0,'What did you find, boy?',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,27240,0,'LINE_MALCOLM3'),(27892,0,0,'%s begins to growl...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27237,0,'LINE_SCRUFFY1'),(27891,1,0,'What\'s wrong, pal?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27238,0,'LINE_MALCOLM2'),(27877,2,0,'You don\'t mind me checking out your merchandise for signs of tampering, do you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27205,0,'LINE_SERGEANT_START'),(27877,1,2,'Mr. Perelli, if you happen across any signs of Scourge activity or shady dealings in your travels, let the nearest Lordaeron soldier know.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27197,0,'LINE_SERGEANT_ASK_YES #3'),(27877,1,1,'You wouldn\'t happen to have any canned turtle soup from Hillsbrad, would you?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27195,0,'LINE_SERGEANT_ASK_YES #2'),(27877,0,3,'Do you plan on leaving the area soon if we have further questions?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27193,0,'LINE_SERGEANT_ASK_NO #4'),(27877,1,0,'Mr. Perelli, have these goods been under your supervision at all times?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27194,0,'LINE_SERGEANT_ASK_YES #1'),(27877,0,2,'Mr. Perelli, I know you travel around quite a bit hawking your goods. Surely you\'ve heard rumors or information about the Scourge?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27192,0,'LINE_SERGEANT_ASK_NO #3'),(27877,0,1,'Mr. Perelli, have you seen any signs of the undead? Any information you can provide would be appreciated by Prince Arthas.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27191,0,'LINE_SERGEANT_ASK_NO #2'),(27876,3,0,'You have to believe me, I\'m innocent!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,27213,0,'LINE_PERELLI2'),(27877,0,0,'Mr. Perelli, have you seen any suspicious activity by men wearing dark robes in the last few weeks?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27190,0,'LINE_SERGEANT_ASK_NO #1'),(27876,1,2,'Absolutely.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27203,0,'LINE_PERELLI_YES #3'),(27876,2,0,'What are you talking about, Sergeant!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27208,0,'LINE_PERELLI1'),(27876,1,1,'Yes, Sergeant Morigan.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27202,0,'LINE_PERELLI_YES #2'),(27876,0,1,'No, sir.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,27199,0,'LINE_PERELLI_NO #2'),(27876,0,2,'Nope.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,27200,0,'LINE_PERELLI_NO #3'),(27876,1,0,'Yes, sir.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27201,0,'LINE_PERELLI_YES #1'),(27876,0,0,'No, Sergeant.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,27198,0,'LINE_PERELLI_NO #1'),(27903,3,0,'Oh, close call. It\'s just the grain here.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27250,0,'LINE_ROGER4'),(27903,2,0,'Can\'t be me, I took a bath 3 days ago!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27249,0,'LINE_ROGER3'),(27903,1,0,'Wait, what\'s that smell?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27248,0,'LINE_ROGER2'),(27903,0,0,'Ok, enough work for now. Time for refreshments and a little conversation in the inn.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27247,0,'LINE_ROGER1'),(26499,39,0,'I can\'t afford to spare you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31355,3,'Arthas SAY_AGGRO_ZOMBIE'),(26499,40,0,'All officers should check in with me when their squads are ready. We\'ll enter Stratholme on my order.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27517,3,'Arthas RP1_LINE_ARTHAS11'),(28167,0,0,'Prince Arthas, may the light be praised! Many people in the town have begun to fall seriously ill, can you help us?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27547,0,'RP2_LINE_CITIZEN1'),(30570,0,0,'The Stone Crow\'s closed today, sorry. There are too many health concerns, and I\'m not about to have Ed under fire for supposedly making people sick.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31724,0,'Emery Neill TALK_FLUFF 1'),(27913,4,0,'Scourge forces have been spotted near the Elder\'s Square Gate!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27645,3,'Lordaeron Crier ELDERS_SQUARE'),(27913,3,0,'Scourge forces have been spotted near the Festival Lane Gate!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27644,3,'Lordaeron Crier FESTIVAL_LANE'),(27913,2,0,'Scourge forces have been spotted near the Market Row Gate!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27643,3,'Lordaeron Crier MARKET_ROW'),(27913,1,0,'Scourge forces have been spotted near the King\'s Square fountain!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27642,3,'Lordaeron Crier KINGS_SQUARE'),(27913,0,0,'All soldiers of Lordaeron should immediately report to the entrance of Stratholme, and await further orders from Prince Arthas.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27263,3,'Lordaeron Crier CALL_TO_GATES'),(28340,1,0,'There\'s no need for you to understand, Ar