 they!? I\'ll show those uptight cone heads in Stormwind the true power of Niby! BEHOLD!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,9617,0,'Niby the Almighty'),(14469,4,0,'%s shakes his fist in frustration.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,9618,0,'Niby the Almighty'),(14469,5,0,'Why you little!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9622,0,'Niby the Almighty'),(14470,2,0,'Niby, you are stupid.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9619,0,'Impsy'),(14470,2,1,'Oh my, what a surprise! Another failure!? But how, oh great one??',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9620,0,'Impsy'),(14470,2,2,'Awe inspiring, master. Your ineptitude is awe inspiring.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9621,0,'Impsy'),(14470,3,0,'Ack! Help! Crazed gnome trying to kill me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9623,0,'Impsy'),(14910,0,0,'Guard, Bring forth the prisoner. Place him in the Circle of Binding.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,10306,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,1,0,'Kneel, heathen.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,10309,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,2,0,'I said KNEEL!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,10311,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,3,0,'Do you know who I am, zealot?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10312,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,4,0,'I could crush you with but a single motion. Do not anger me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10314,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,5,0,'So Hakkar has returned?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10317,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,6,0,'We will never allow it... We have banished him from our world before and we will banish him again.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10320,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,7,0,'Times have changed. The young races will join us. You will never succeed.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,10325,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,8,0,'The Primal Gods? Impossible!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10330,0,'Exzhal'),(14910,9,0,'%s uses his index finger to make a cutting motion across his neck.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10332,0,'Exzhal'),(14911,0,0,'Right away, Servitor.',12,14,100,1,0,0,0,10307,0,'Zandalar Enforcer'),(14911,1,0,'Move!',12,14,100,0,0,0,0,10308,0,'Zandalar Enforcer'),(14911,2,0,'%s spits on the corpse of the fallen zealot.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10336,0,'Zandalar Enforcer'),(14912,0,0,'Curious. A Servitor of Rastakhan that does not know the Hakkari do not converse in the old tongue?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,10310,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,1,0,'You are a fool, soon to forfeit his life. No?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,10313,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,2,0,'%s laughs.',16,0,100,11,0,0,0,2047,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,3,0,'How pathetic. I am infused with the power of the Soulflayer. I fear nothing but the wrath of the almighty Hakkar. I serve no one but my master, Jin.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10316,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,4,0,'Do you really need to ask? Can you not feel him? Has the almighty King Rastakhan sent his Servitor and Hand here on a mission of diplomacy?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10318,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,5,0,'Oh yes, old one, Hakkar has returned. Soon the world shall crumble beneath his might. Consumed. Left in ruin...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10319,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,6,0,'%s laughs maniacally.',16,0,100,11,0,0,0,10321,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,7,0,'FOOL! Do you purport to have even one-tenth of the power you held during the Uprising? The nations were united and still were nearly consumed by a shadow of Hakkar. You stand no chance.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10322,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,8,0,'And now, even those nations that you would have called allies have recoiled and joined forces with us... Yes, old one, do not look so surprised.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10323,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,9,0,'Bloodscalp, Sandfury, Skullsplitter, Vilebranch and Witherbark. They all pledge their allegiance to Jin - their souls to Hakkar. You have lost.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10324,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,10,0,'The young races? The infants? Humans? Orcs? Dwarves? You expect to defeat the Hakkari? To destroy a GOD?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10326,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,11,0,'It shall NEVER happen. We are legion. We are united. Where are your heroes? Vol\'jin sits in sanctuary at the side of the young Warchief, unaware. Zul\'jin missing, probably dead.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10327,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,12,0,'And... do you expect to defeat the Primal Gods?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10328,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,13,0,'%s smirks.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10329,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,14,0,'Is it? Call out to them, Servitor.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10331,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,15,0,'Where are your Gods now? WHERE, SERVITOR?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10333,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,16,0,'Strike me down. I shall be reborn... Even more powerful...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10334,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,17,0,'%s drops his shoulders and exposes his neck.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10335,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(15416,1,0,'Attack!  Don\'t let them reach the gates!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ranger Jaela'),(15416,0,2,'The undead are approaching.  Attack!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,12863,0,'Ranger Jaela'),(15491,1,1,'%s lets loose a sinister laugh.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11296,0,'Eranikus Say 1'),(15491,2,2,'You are certainly not your father, insect. Should it interest me, I would crush you with but a swipe of my claws. Turn Shan\'do Stormrage over to me and your pitiful life will be spared along with the lives of your people.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11294,0,'Eranikus Say 2'),(15491,3,3,'My redemption? You are bold, little one. My redemption comes by the will of my god.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11297,0,'Eranikus Say 3'),(15491,4,4,'%s roars furiously.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11298,0,'Eranikus Say 4'),(15491,5,5,'Rise, servants of the Nightmare! Rise and destroy this world! Let there be no survivors...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11299,0,'Eranikus Say 5'),(15491,6,6,'Where is your savior? How long can you hold out against my attacks?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11304,0,'Eranikus Say 6'),(15491,7,7,'Remulos, look how easy they fall before me? You can stop this, fool. Turn the druid over to me and it will all be over...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11306,0,'Eranikus Say 7'),(15491,8,8,'Defeated my minions? Then face me, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11305,0,'Eranikus Say 8'),(15491,9,9,'IT BURNS! THE PAIN... SEARING...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11314,0,'Eranikus Say 9'),(15491,10,10,'WHY? Why did this happen to ... to me? Where were you Tyrande? Where were you when I fell from the grace of Elune?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11315,0,'Eranikus Say 10'),(15491,11,11,'I... I feel... I feel the touch of Elune upon my being once more... She smiles upon me... Yes... I...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11316,0,'Eranikus Say 11'),(15491,12,12,'%s falls to one knee.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11319,0,'Eranikus Say 12'),(15942,0,0,'Open fire!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,12417,0,'Ranger Sareyn'),(15942,0,1,'Enemy sighted!  Ready your weapons!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,12418,0,'Ranger Sareyn'),(15942,0,2,'Hold your positions!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,12419,0,'Ranger Sareyn'),(16781,1,1,'The Alliance fires burn strong and true!',12,7,100,4,0,0,0,24532,0,'Midsummer Celebrant Alliance'),(16781,2,1,'I love the firework show at the end of Midsummer Firefestival.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,24536,0,'Midsummer Celebrant  Goblin'),(17282,0,0,'We\'re never going to fire one of these, are we?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,19346,0,'Falcon Watch Ranger'),(17282,0,1,'Do we even have ammunition for these?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,19347,0,'Falcon Watch Ranger'),(17282,0,2,'What, exactly, are we ever going to fire these at?',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,19348,0,'Falcon Watch Ranger'),(17282,0,3,'I wonder how far this would launch that white cat...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,19349,0,'Falcon Watch Ranger'),(17391,3,0,'%s points across the river.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13872,0,'Stillpine Ancestor Coo'),(17715,0,0,'Who dares defile the statue of our beloved?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14366,0,'Atoph the Bloodcursed'),(17993,0,0,'Help! Someone help us!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16994,0,'Bloodwarder Protector'),(17993,1,0,'Get out of here, there are too many of them! Escape while you can!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,16993,0,'Bloodwarder Protector'),(18187,0,0,'If your people are as strong as you purport, I\'m sure you\'ll find your stride again.',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,14885,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,1,0,'%s taps a finger on her chin, lost in thought.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14896,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,1,1,'I suppose we\'ll see the measure of your dedication in due time.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14860,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,2,0,'I don\'t suppose Lor\'themar Theron is available for an audience yet?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14906,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,3,0,'I\'ll accept that answer for the time being, Kelemar, but my patience is not exactly boundless.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14910,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,4,0,'Remind me, ambassador... what precisely will your people be contributing to our efforts?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14854,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,5,0,'You should be used to those looks, Tatai. Do you remember the reason you were drafted into this job?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14927,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,6,0,'I\'m no happier about being your babysitter than you are about being watched. Just remember... it could have been worse.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14929,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,7,0,'Well, no one asked you, Tatai.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14887,0,'Cheneta'),(18187,8,0,'Tatai!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14862,0,'Cheneta'),(18188,0,0,'Bah! If I ever be in charge\'a dis place, da first t\'ing I be doin\' is stoppin\' alla dat. Ja be markin\' my words.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14897,0,'Tatai'),(18188,1,0,'Dis place be huge. Why ja be needin\' all dis space?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14882,0,'Tatai'),(18188,2,0,'Why be all dese t\'ings floatin\' an\' movin\' by demselves?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14904,0,'Tatai'),(18188,3,0,'Dis place be too bright fa my tastes.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14969,0,'Tatai'),(18188,4,0,'What help be ja givin\' de Horde, anyway?',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,14868,0,'Tatai'),(18188,5,0,'Just what I be t\'inkin\'. More delays.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14911,0,'Tatai'),(18188,6,0,'Ja be keepin\' away from me.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14913,0,'Tatai'),(18188,7,0,'I be gettin\' tired\'a dis. Dese elves, dey be treatin\' me like I stole somet\'in\'.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14919,0,'Tatai'),(18188,8,0,'Don\'t ja start...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14928,0,'Tatai'),(18188,9,0,'Dis be a big waste, if ja be askin\' me.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14886,0,'Tatai'),(18188,10,0,'%s grumbles under his breath.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14888,0,'Tatai'),(18188,11,0,'T\'ink ja be contributin\' less glarin\' in dis troll\'s direction?',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,14861,0,'Tatai'),(18188,12,0,'%s sighs in resignation and falls silent.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14863,0,'Tatai'),(18189,0,0,'This city is very... expansive, but it seems to be lacking something. I can\'t put my finger on what...',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,14891,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18189,1,0,'It seems that a great deal of your power is used for... and I hope you\'ll pardon the term... frivolous things. Isn\'t that, well, wasteful?',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,14892,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18189,2,0,'Tatai, please. We\'re guests here.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14898,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18189,3,0,'There\'s an ethereal beauty about this place... but for all the trees and plant life, it\'s still so... unnatural.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14918,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18189,4,0,'As you say, ambassador. We can wait.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14916,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18189,5,0,'Tell us, Ambassador Kelemar... how do the blood elves plan to aid us, exactly?',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,14870,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18189,6,0,'Dela Runetotem\'s brow furrows, but she remains silent.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14866,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18189,7,0,'My condolences. These past years have been hard on us all.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14890,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18189,8,0,'I don\'t know. It still seems like such a waste.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14903,0,'Dela Runetotem'),(18190,0,0,'You\'re not the only victims of the Scourge. Our lady Sylvanas sympathizes with your plight.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14889,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18190,1,0,'Your choice of decor is intriguing, Kelemar. Tell me - why the arcane frippery?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14905,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18190,2,0,'An understandable expenditure, as I see it. Show everyone, enemies and allies alike, that you\'re not afraid to use your power.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14900,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18190,3,0,'Such marvelous sights. I regret being unable to see it when I was younger.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14963,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18190,4,0,'Truly an advantageous alliance.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14864,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18190,5,0,'I thought we were going to speak with the regent lord. I\'m beginning to question whether or not he exists at all at this point.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14917,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18190,6,0,'This is becoming tiresome.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14915,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18190,7,0,'Troll, if you can\'t keep a civil tongue in your head, I\'ll be happy to remove it for you.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14912,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18190,8,0,'%s smirks triumphantly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,14914,0,'Kristine Denny'),(18191,0,0,'This is merely part of what Silvermoon once was. Much of the city was lost after Arthas swept through our lands.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14883,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,0,1,'We lost many of our kin in the war... so yes, the city is not perhaps as lively as it once was. We will endure, however.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14884,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,1,0,'It is not simply a beautification measure, but also a morale booster. It demonstrates to our people that we have a great deal of power at our fingertips, and with it... we can do nearly anything.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14895,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,2,0,'Think about it carefully, my friends. If we can afford to spend our magic on simple aesthetic enhancements, clearly we hold a vast reservoir of power at our beck and call.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14894,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,2,1,'This must be somewhat different from the environment to which you\'re accustomed. It is a visible demonstration of the power we hold, nothing more. We\'re mindful of our resources.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14893,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,3,0,'Yes, well... luckily for us all, the troll will not be in a position of power within our fair city anytime soon.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14899,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,4,0,'The regent lord is a very busy man. I\'m sure you understand.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14907,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,4,1,'He is unable to see you just yet, but do not trouble yourselves over it. I\'m certain he will find a way to fit you into his busy schedule.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14908,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,4,2,'In due course. There is no rush, after all - our hospitality is extended to you indefinitely. Even the troll.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14909,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,5,0,'Exercise caution during your stay. Some close-minded individuals may still cling to old alliances long since dissolved...',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14970,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,5,1,'Thank you for making the journey here. I hope you will find Silvermoon to your liking.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14964,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,5,2,'Behold the wonders of our fair city.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,14965,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,6,0,'Our people are strong. We bring you a mastery over arcane magics that you have previously lacked - ah, no offense intended, of course.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14857,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,6,1,'Surely you see the advantage in our relationship. The powers we command are immense. With our aid, your enemies could well be decimated.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14858,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,6,2,'I realize we have had somewhat differing loyalties in the past, but put your suspicions aside. Our considerable power has been pledged to your leaders in good faith.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14859,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,7,0,'I\'m afraid your ancestry is the cause, troll. Decades of fighting with your green-skinned brethren have hardened their hearts against your kind.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14922,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18191,8,0,'Keep your chin up. Perhaps with time, our people will see you as the ally you are, rather than the enemy you appear to be.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,14926,0,'Ambassador Kelemar'),(18688,0,5,'The spirits call... I am consumed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15704,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,6,'Cannot control... It draws me in... The void grows...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15710,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,7,'It is dying. It is dying. It is dying.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15707,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,8,'The cold embrace awaits...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16837,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,9,'The pain is unbearable.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15705,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,10,'What is happening to me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15703,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,11,'What is this trickery? I... ARGH...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16840,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,12,'What will become of us when it falls?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,15709,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,13,'What... What have I become? Arrrgghhh...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16835,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18688,0,14,'Thank you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,16836,0,'Ancient Orc Ancestor'),(18823,0,0,'What about the earth spirits?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,16110,0,'Minor Water Spirit'),(18904,0,1,'You cannot stop them...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,16008,0,'Vision of the Forgotten'),(18904,0,2,'We are infinite... eternal.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,16009,0,'Vision of the Forgotten'),(18904,0,3,'They lack control... Oshu\'gun calls to them...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,16010,0,'Vision of the Forgotten'),(18904,0,4,'It is a beacon. A remnant of a forgotten era.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,16011,0,'Vision of the Forgotten'),(18917,0,0,'%s chuckles softly.',16,0,100,11,0,0,0,16111,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,1,0,'The earth spirits are very much present in this chamber, my child. After all, we are underground, are we not?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,16112,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,2,0,'They are stoic, the spirits of the earth. Through them, the shaman learns to endure the hardships of life.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16113,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,3,0,'The rocks are here when we first enter this world, and they will remain long after we pass.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16115,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,4,0,'Stand... there is more to discuss.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16118,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,5,0,'Stop here a moment, my children, and close your eyes. Can you feel the air currents?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16041,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,6,0,'The two students close their eyes and bow their heads.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,16043,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,7,0,'The spirits of the air can be found even here, underground. They dislike being surrounded, constricted by the earth... their precious freedom is limited here.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16055,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,8,0,'They are flighty, these spirits, and easily distracted... but they will share their secrets with those who know how to listen.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16057,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,9,0,'%s smiles to himself as he watches the students fidget in their concentration.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16060,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,10,0,'Come. There is more to study than the secrets on the wind.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16061,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,11,0,'Can you feel the warmth here, my children?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,16073,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,12,0,'The students nod slowly, eyes rapt on their teacher.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16074,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,13,0,'Focus upon that warmth as I speak...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16075,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,14,0,'The strength of fire lies in change. Its strength is considerable, but ever-shifting... unpredictable.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16076,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,15,0,'This is extended to the spirits themselves. They are often quick to anger; it is important thet you learn to listen without falling prey to their tempers.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16077,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,16,0,'That is enough for now. Come.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16078,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,17,0,'The water here is peaceful, is it not? Listening to the trickle from the ceiling can aid you in finding its true voice...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16079,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,18,0,'The water spirits are perhaps the most outspoken. They are generous and understanding. Indeed, if you are having trouble hearing the voices, it is with water that you should begin.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16080,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,19,0,'Close your eyes, my children, and listen to the water within these halls.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,16081,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,20,0,'Both students close their eyes, straining to hear the voices.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,16104,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,21,0,'%s nods to himself and clears his throat.',16,0,100,273,0,0,0,16107,0,'Chakaa'),(18917,22,0,'Stand, my children... that\'s enough for now.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,16108,0,'Chakaa'),(18918,0,0,'Yes, teacher.',12,7,100,273,0,0,0,16050,0,'Drysc'),(18929,0,1,'Why couldn\'t mother have chosen something else to dedicate herself to?\n',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,16097,0,'Kyrenna'),(18929,0,2,'If only I had some wine to go with my cheese...\n',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,16093,0,'Kyrenna'),(19270,1,0,'TAUREN CHIEFTAINS! Playing LIVE, in the WORLD\'S END TAVERN! Be there, at the top of the hour! Banished from Shattrath? SNEAK BACK IN!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28504,2,'Shattrath Saul'),(19270,2,0,'Are you ready to rock? Then head over to the World\'s End Tavern! The Tauren Chieftains start their show at the top of the hour.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28496,2,'Shattrath Saul'),(19270,3,0,'Who? The Tauren Chieftains! What? A live performance! Where? The World\'s End Tavern! When? The top of the hour! BE THERE!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28502,2,'Shattrath Saul'),(19270,4,0,'Now, in Shattrath City: The Tauren Chieftains! Playing in the World\'s End Tavern at the top of the hour!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28481,2,'Shattrath Saul'),(19554,0,0,'You only hasten the inevitable. In time, all will be devoured!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,18602,0,'Dimensius the All-Devouring'),(19672,0,0,'It is if I\'m not the one that\'s going to be sent in to test it... Otherwise,, no.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17194,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19672,0,1,'What does that mean anyway? Ready? Can it ever be ready?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17195,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19672,0,2,'I\'m giving her all that I\'ve got,, captain. I don\'t think she can take much more of this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17196,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19672,0,3,'I can\'t bang on this device any faster,, captain! My wrapping is already beginning to unravel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17197,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19672,0,4,'Will you stop asking that?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17198,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19672,0,5,'Why don\'t you pick up a hammer and start banging on these structures instead of asking us if it\'s done every 5 minutes?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17199,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19672,0,6,'I\'ve had just about enough of your incessant whining,, captain. What are you even a captain of? I mean, the nerve!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17200,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19673,0,0,'I don\'t get paid enough for this nonsense.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17205,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19673,0,1,'Here goes nothing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17206,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19673,0,2,'This is gonna leave a mark...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17207,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19673,0,3,'If I make it through, I expect a pay raise.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17208,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19673,1,0,'%s runs his hands across his body to make sure everything is intact.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17211,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19673,2,0,'I made it! I made it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17209,0,'Consortium Engineer'),(19674,0,1,'I don\'t pay you engineers exorbitant amounts of gold so that I can hear the words \'no\' or \'can\'t\' exit your wrappings. Bring that barrier down or you\'ll find yourselves working the energy reclamation line on X-17.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17225,0,'Nexus-Prince Haramad'),(19674,0,2,'I\'m close to the edge, Morphalius. Another screw up and it\'ll be you running through that portal for Kaftiz\'s tests.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,17226,0,'Nexus-Prince Haramad'),(19676,0,0,'Is that damned thing safe to go through yet?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17201,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,0,1,'Is it done yet? What is taking so damned long?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17202,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,0,2,'You know, we could easily replace you with goblins. Is that what you want???',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17203,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,0,3,'I can\'t believe you imbeciles went to school for this! Does anybody here know what they\'re doing?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17204,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,1,0,'Alright, it looks safe. Get in there, engineer!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17210,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,2,0,'%s shrugs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17212,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,2,1,'%s shakes his head in disapproval.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,17213,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,3,0,'Oh well,, back to the drawing board.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17214,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,3,1,'I didn\'t like him much anyway. Too much talk,, not enough \'do.\'',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17215,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,3,2,'Damnit. How are we ever going to get through their security measures?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17216,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,3,3,'Nice going you incompetent morons! Another one of our engineers vaporized!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17217,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(19676,3,4,'Thankfully,, there\'s a steady stream of these fools chomping at the bit to get in here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,17218,0,'\"Captain\" Kaftiz'),(20448,0,0,'Stand back, $n. This may be an Ethereum trap.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20539,0,'Commander Ameer'),(20448,1,0,'%s uses the Ethereum prison key on the salvaged Ethereum prison.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20540,0,'Commander Ameer'),(20448,2,0,'Those fools! What have they done! What horrors do they hold? And for what purpose? I will need your help again, hero. Help us. Help your people.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20544,0,'Commander Ameer'),(20780,0,1,'I\'ve failed. The Light has abandoned me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18595,0,'Kaylaan'),(20780,0,2,'It is hopeless... I\'ve done all I can.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18594,0,'Kaylaan'),(20780,0,3,'Kael\'thas and the Legion... just what we needed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18387,0,'Kaylaan'),(20780,0,4,'Light! Do not fail me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,18385,0,'Kaylaan'),(22016,0,1,'As you command, Sir!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,19705,0,'Eclipsion Soldier'),(22016,0,2,'We shall not fail you Sir!',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,19706,0,'Eclipsion Soldier'),(22018,0,0,'Straighten up! I will not have soldiers in my unit looking so undisciplined before Val\'zareq.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19701,0,'Eclipsion Cavalier'),(22018,0,1,'You will do nothing to dishonor me before Val\'zareq.  Is that clear?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19702,0,'Eclipsion Cavalier'),(22018,0,2,'You are doing well. Keep it up!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,19703,0,'Eclipsion Cavalier'),(22304,0,0,'Get to work on those crystals!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21112,0,'Mo\'\'arg Extractor'),(22304,0,1,'Move it!  These crystals aren\'t going to collect themselves.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21114,0,'Mo\'\'arg Extractor'),(22304,0,2,'These crystals will work.  Get them!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21113,0,'Mo\'\'arg Extractor'),(22304,1,0,'At least you didn\'\'t screw this batch up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21116,0,'Mo\'\'arg Extractor'),(22304,1,1,'I can\'\'t believe you\'\'ve actually done something right for once.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21117,0,'Mo\'\'arg Extractor'),(22304,1,2,'You\'\'ve ruined this batch!  Why must I work with you worthless Gan\'\'arg.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,21115,0,'Mo\'\'arg Extractor'),(22465,0,1,'Have you seen my mommy and daddy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20355,0,'Natasha'),(22465,0,2,'Antelarion, is it safe to play in the forest yet?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,20357,0,'Natasha'),(22465,0,3,'I think I came from Eng-land, do you know where that is?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,20358,0,'Natasha'),(22465,0,4,'Antelarion says I fell off a big bird, as I fell he caught me... He is so pretty!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,20360,0,'Natasha'),(22900,0,0,'Commander... I am not long for this world... Taken to a holding pen... hundreds... thousands... beings from other worlds... Imprisoned... Imprisoned by Ethereum. Many of them our allies. Must... Must save the others... It... It\'s not too late...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,20542,0,'Tortured Protectorate Vanguard'),(22972,0,0,'%s looks at you for a moment, then motions for you to follow.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20689,0,'Cenarion Sparrowhawk'),(22972,1,0,'%s surveys the ground for buried raven stones.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20675,0,'Cenarion Sparrowhawk'),(22972,2,0,'%s locates a buried raven stone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20676,0,'Cenarion Sparrowhawk'),(22972,3,0,'%s doesn\'t seem to have had any luck finding raven stones nearby.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,21065,0,'Cenarion Sparrowhawk'),(23134,0,0,'%s returns to stone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20980,3,'Hawk Spirit'),(23135,0,0,'%s returns to stone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20980,3,'Falcon Spirit'),(23136,0,0,'%s returns to stone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,20980,3,'Eagle Spirit'),(23153,0,0,'Check those crystals over there!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21004,0,'Bash\'ir Surveyor (Entry: 23153)'),(23153,0,1,'Find what I am looking for and you may have a treat.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21007,0,'Bash\'ir Surveyor (Entry: 23153)'),(23153,0,2,'That grouping looks promising.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21006,0,'Bash\'ir Surveyor (Entry: 23153)'),(23153,1,0,'I am beginning to suspect you are worthless.  Do not disappoint me further.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21008,0,'Bash\'ir Surveyor (Entry: 23153)'),(23153,1,1,'Yes, that\'s it.  These will do nicely.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21009,0,'Bash\'ir Surveyor (Entry: 23153)'),(23153,1,2,'You\'ve found nothing?  Very well.  Over there next.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,21005,0,'Bash\'ir Surveyor (Entry: 23153)'),(23440,0,1,'Your bones will break under my boot, $r!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,1938,0,'Dragonmaw Skybreaker'),(23440,0,2,'Long live the Dragonmaw! Die you worthless $r!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,1939,0,'Dragonmaw Skybreaker'),(23440,1,1,'BURN IT DOWN!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,21656,0,'Dragonmaw Skybreaker'),(23656,0,3,'I enjoy the screams most of all.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23535,0,'Dragonflayer Rune-Seer'),(23656,0,4,'We shall see how much punishment these invaders can stand.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23537,0,'Dragonflayer Rune-Seer'),(23732,0,0,'That hit the shpot! Gimmie anudder one, Coot! *hic*',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,22200,0,'Sorely Twitchblade'),(23732,1,0,'You\'re shayin\' you wan... you wan... *hic* you wan\' me to dansh on dis bar? *hic*',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,22201,0,'Sorely Twitchblade'),(23732,2,0,'Maeshtro! Cue da mushic!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,22202,0,'Sorely Twitchblade'),(23905,4,0,'We defeated the sea monster!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,22634,0,'Major Mills'),(24077,0,0,'%s groans.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,22743,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24077,0,1,'%s screams in agony as the harpoon is removed.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,22744,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24077,0,2,'%s whimpers.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,22745,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24077,1,0,'Not... no... Our people... Wyrmskull... some live...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22747,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24077,1,1,'My injuries are too great. I won\'t make it... Our citizenry held in cages... ritual...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22748,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24077,1,2,'I\'m done for... too much blood lost... Forget about me, tell Keller... People still alive inside...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22749,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24077,1,3,'My family must know... I... for them... always for them...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22751,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24077,1,4,'They left us here impaled as a warning to the others... Several still alive... prisoners of...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22751,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24077,1,5,'Don\'t let my death go unavenged, stranger... give... them... hell...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22752,0,'Impaled Valgarde Scout'),(24321,11,0,'The crowd cheers.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23144,0,'King Ymiron'),(24321,12,0,'And now my first decree upon the Vrykul! All malformed infants born of Vrykul mother and father are to be destroyed upon birth! Our blood must remain pure always! Those found in violation of Ymiron\'s decree will be taken to Gjalerbron for execution!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,23145,0,'King Ymiron yell'),(24322,4,0,'Show them mercy, my king! They are of our flesh and blood!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,23128,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24322,4,1,'All hail our glorious king, Ymiron!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,23123,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24322,4,2,'Show the abberations no mercy, Ymiron!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23125,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24322,4,3,'They weaken us! Our strength is dilluted by their very existence! Destroy them all!',12,0,100,113,0,0,0,23129,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24322,4,4,'Vrykul must remain pure!',12,0,100,113,0,0,0,23127,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24323,2,0,'Shhh!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23131,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24323,3,0,'Let him speak! Be silent!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,23124,0,'Ancient Citizen of Nifflevar'),(24480,0,1,'Now that\'s what I call froggy-style!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23478,0,'Mojo'),(24480,0,2,'This won\'t take long, did it?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23479,0,'Mojo'),(24480,0,3,'I promise not to give you warts...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23480,0,'Mojo'),(24480,0,4,'There\'s just never enough Mojo to go around...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23481,0,'Mojo'),(24480,0,5,'Listen, $n, I know of a little swamp not too far from here....',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23482,0,'Mojo'),(24480,0,6,'Your lily pad or mine?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23483,0,'Mojo'),(24480,0,7,'Feelin\' a little froggy, are ya?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,23484,0,'Mojo'),(24480,1,0,'Mojo leaps into $n\'s pocket!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23485,0,'Mojo'),(24525,2,1,'Yah, me bredren!  Galang now and pass us a grog, just dead men yahso.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23579,0,'Zeh\'gehn'),(24525,2,2,'Yarrrr, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,23849,0,'Zeh\'gehn'),(24664,7,0,'Felomin Ashal! ',14,0,100,0,0,12417,0,25389,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Flame Strike'),(24664,8,0,'My demise accomplishes nothing! The master will have you! You will drown in your own blood! The world shall burn! Aaaghh!',14,0,100,5,0,12421,0,25393,0,'Kael\'thas Sunstrider - Death'),(24734,0,0,'Hmm... well, just be careful, he might be sweet on you. I don\'t trust that sister of his either...',12,2,100,0,0,0,0,23737,0,'Aleanna Edune'),(24734,1,0,'Alright, Becca, just leave them in the garden next to the bush. Watch out for wolves!',12,2,100,1,0,0,0,23738,0,'Aleanna Edune'),(24736,0,0,'Oh, these apples are utterly delicious!',12,7,100,7,0,0,0,23727,0,'Sulan Dunadaire'),(24736,1,0,'My brother simply must try these.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23728,0,'Sulan Dunadaire'),(24737,0,0,'%s nods silently...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23750,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,0,1,'%s listens impatiently...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23751,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,0,2,'%s sighs...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23749,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,1,0,'What? Why do you want me to do it?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,23719,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,2,0,'Alright, I\'ll tell her.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23720,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,3,0,'%s takes a deep breath.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23721,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,4,0,'Odd, she\'s usually here...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,23722,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,5,0,'Hi, uh, Becanna, I mean... uh, Elenna found some herbs! Can you go pick them up?',12,7,100,24,0,0,0,23723,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,6,0,'Thanks! If you uh, need any help, just come pick me up... I mean, come get me and I\'ll help!',12,7,100,24,0,0,0,23725,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,7,0,'%s turns slightly red and walks away.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,23726,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24737,8,0,'Thanks, but I\'m not very hungry right now.',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,23729,0,'William Dunadaire'),(24738,0,0,'William, I saw a fresh growth of herbs out on the ridge. Go ask Becanna to pick them up.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23712,0,'Elenna Edune'),(24738,1,0,'Come on, just do it.',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,23718,0,'Elenna Edune'),(24738,2,0,'Come on, Goodie, lets go scout the area.',12,2,100,0,0,0,0,23709,0,'Elenna Edune'),(24739,0,0,'... and have I told you about the time when I ventured deep into the heart of Blackrock Mountain?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,23739,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,0,1,'..with a mighty blow, I slew a Murloc, freeing the orb from his cold, slimy hands!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23744,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,0,2,'... not to forget that time I ventured deep within the forests of Zul\'Aman.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23745,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,0,3,'... the burning sands of Silithus scorched my face as we battled wave after wave of Silithid.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23746,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,0,4,'... the city was burned, a scorched ruin of what it once was. The armies of the undead rose where the people had once lived.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23747,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,0,5,'... did I tell you about the time that I explored the far reaches of Dire Maul?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,23748,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,1,0,'That was when I slew the Orc with a great slash and took away these spaulders.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23740,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,1,1,'I found a mighty axe there, freshly forged upon the fire.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23741,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,1,2,'There, I crafted this breastplate with my own hands, toiling for hours upon the forge.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23742,0,'Benjari Edune'),(24739,1,3,'There, deep within the pockets of a Troll was the beautiful gem, which I sold for a handsome price!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,23743,0,'Benjari Edune'),(25244,1,0,'There! There!, There! There!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,24654,1,'Warsong Marksman'),(25326,0,1,'This outpost is not ready! What would happen if Malygos and the blue dragonflight decided to strike?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24706,0,'Overlord Bor\'gorok'),(25326,0,2,'Work faster! We must push into Sholazar Basin before the Alliance!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24707,0,'Overlord Bor\'gorok'),(25326,0,3,'You peons are falling behind. Half rations until you pick up the pace!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24708,0,'Overlord Bor\'gorok'),(25326,0,4,'This is the most pathetic bunch of peons I\'ve ever seen! Where\'s my booterang?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24709,0,'Overlord Bor\'gorok'),(25326,0,5,'I swear that if you do not work faster I\'m going to feed you to my worg!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24710,0,'Overlord Bor\'gorok'),(25326,0,6,'Have you grunts no pride? You will have this outpost ready for the reinforcements from Warsong Hold or your worthless corpses will fill the graveyard!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24711,0,'Overlord Bor\'gorok'),(25326,0,7,'Time for a five-minute break. Haha, just kidding! What do you think this is, the Alliance?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24712,0,'Overlord Bor\'gorok'),(25416,0,1,'I will turn your bones to ash!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24676,0,'Simmer'),(25416,0,2,'You will be consumed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24677,0,'Simmer'),(25416,0,3,'There is no escape from my rise!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24678,0,'Simmer'),(25418,3,1,'You dare come into my pool?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24680,0,'Churn'),(25418,3,2,'Your death will not be pleasant!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24681,0,'Churn'),(25418,3,3,'Your corpse will feed my fish.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24682,0,'Churn'),(25446,0,0,'Marksmen! Front and center! Scourge attack incoming!',14,1,100,5,0,0,0,24657,1,'Warsong Captain'),(25446,1,0,'Marksmen, lock and load!',14,1,100,22,0,0,0,24659,1,'Warsong Captain'),(25446,2,0,'The Nerub\'ar have been punished for their transgression!',14,1,100,22,0,0,0,24660,1,'Warsong Captain'),(25446,3,0,'Let the forces of the Lich King gaze upon the carcass of this wretch and know that the Horde will not relent!',14,1,100,22,0,0,0,24673,1,'Warsong Captain'),(25446,4,0,'Gather, soldiers! Gather and take your trophies from the carapace of the enemy!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24674,1,'Warsong Captain'),(25446,5,0,'Settle down, soldier!',14,1,100,1,0,0,0,24655,1,'Warsong Captain'),(25446,6,0,'We\'ll be ready for \'em... You did a good job in warning us.',14,1,100,1,0,0,0,24656,1,'Warsong Captain'),(25478,7,0,'I\'ve given you the information, $r! You\'re wasting your time....',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,24756,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,8,0,'What more can you possibly want, $r?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26307,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,9,0,'Aargh!!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26308,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,10,0,'Stop!  Please...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26309,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,11,0,'Why are you here?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26310,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,12,0,'How can you possibly bring me lower?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26311,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,13,0,'What more can you take away from me?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26312,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,14,0,'You\'ve got a darkness in you, $r.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26313,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,15,0,'You aren\'t even asking me questions...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26314,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,16,0,'Are you trying to meet the real me?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26315,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25478,17,0,'You have shown me the face of true evil, $n.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,26316,0,'Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer'),(25589,0,1,'Hey, you! Yes, you! I can hear you! Get over here and get me outa here!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24764,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,0,2,'I\'m beginning to think that they all forgot about me!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24765,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,0,3,'A gnome tries to make some friends, and then BAMM... the next thing you know, he\'s in shackles!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24766,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,0,4,'I\'m right here. I know you can hear me. Ya think you could let me out of these chains?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24767,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,0,5,'I\'ll make you a deal: if you get me out of here alive, you\'ll get a reward larger than you can imagine!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24768,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,0,6,'Hey! Over here in Magmothregar\'s pit!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24769,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,0,7,'What? You think I want to be Magmothregar\'s next appetizer? Get me outa here!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24770,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,2,0,'Here we go.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24773,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,3,0,'I think it\'s up this way to the left.  Let\'s go!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24776,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,4,0,'Ah, fresh air! I can get myself back to the airstrip from here. Be sure to tell Fizzcrank I\'m back and safe. Thanks so much, $n!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,24774,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,5,1,'I came here to talk, but you mindless things tried to kill me instead!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24778,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,5,2,'You won\'t put me in chains again!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24779,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,5,3,'I AM NOT AN APPETIZER!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24780,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,5,4,'The only good vermen is a dead vermen!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24781,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,5,5,'Enough fighting! Let\'s finish this and get outa here!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24782,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,5,6,'Hey! I\'m walking here!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24783,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25589,5,7,'I can\'t believe my own people forgot about me. Die!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,24784,0,'Bonker Togglevolt'),(25629,1,0,'Feebleminded tinkerer, do you really think your pathetic creation can stop me?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,24998,0,'Lord Kryxix'),(25807,0,0,'Are you crazy? You\'re about to blow us sky high! I\'ll take care of this wreck once everything else is finished.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25043,0,'Iggy Tailspin Cogtoggle'),(26310,0,0,'Keristrasza! You\'ve bested my consort... and now YOU shall take her place!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25485,0,'Malygos'),(26604,3,0,'That\'s it! Far as I got... Whatd\'ya think?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,27292,0,'Mack Fearsen'),(26661,0,0,'The control components are working perfectly this time!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25924,0,'Zivlix'),(26661,1,0,'Who to test the bomb on? The Harpies? Ha ha... wait... what\'s that?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,25925,0,'Zivlix'),(26661,2,0,'NO! My machine... my bombs! THAT\'S IT! Those Harpies are going DOWN!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,25926,0,'Zivlix'),(26661,3,0,'Talk to Narf. Lets take care of those bird-brains once and for all.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,26078,0,'Zivlix'),(26676,0,1,'A fine meal you will make...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25896,0,'Anubar Invader'),(26676,0,2,'Anub\'arak may have uses for your carcass...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25897,0,'Anubar Invader'),(26676,0,3,'The feast has arrived! DIE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25898,0,'Anubar Invader'),(27432,0,0,'Me hungry.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26572,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,0,1,'Me sleepy.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26573,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,0,2,'Me cold.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26574,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,0,3,'Me scared of bug things.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26575,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,0,4,'Me got stuck in sticky bug rope.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26576,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,0,5,'Me no like rock place full of bugs.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26577,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,0,6,'Me no like new cold place.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26578,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,0,7,'It time for work! Zug zug!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26589,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,1,0,'Ha ha.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26582,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,1,1,'That funny.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26583,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,1,2,'Your head like rock.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26588,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,2,0,'Ow.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26584,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,2,1,'Stop it!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26585,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,2,2,'That hurt.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26586,0,'Warsong Peon'),(27432,2,3,'What that sound?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,26587,0,'Warsong Peon'),(28210,0,0,'Let\'s wrap it up, Miz. They\'ll be here in a second.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,27603,0,'Ognip Blastbolt'),(28216,0,5,'I not live here always... I traveled lot of world on my own not long ago. I like all the stories of beasts and dragons and gods and stuff.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28205,0,'Zepik'),(28216,0,6,'Elder Harkek pretty good Frenzyheart. He help me a lot when I was littler and not liking Dajik.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28206,0,'Zepik'),(28216,1,3,'We need to do this more often! This so funny... lightning hitting big-tongues everywhere!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28226,0,'Zepik'),(28216,1,4,'Good one! It not even see it coming.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28239,0,'Zepik'),(28216,1,5,'Hah! Leave some for Zepik too.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28240,0,'Zepik'),(28216,1,6,'No more play?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28241,0,'Zepik'),(28216,1,7,'Flame! Death! Destruction! The black fire rages within my heart! I must... release it! Hahah!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28242,0,'Zepik'),(28216,4,1,'I think one reason I like hunting big-tongues so much... they not as dumb as the other hunts. They give a real fight.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28228,0,'Zepik'),(28216,4,2,'Mist big-tongues are smart with their shrine thing sometimes... cover whole area with mist and it get hard to find any.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28229,0,'Zepik'),(28216,4,3,'Careful of big mistcaller guy... Zepik fought him once and barely got away. He lot stronger than rest of big-tongues here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28230,0,'Zepik'),(28216,6,1,'Many Frenzyheart lost at broken pillar. Today is not Zepik\'s day to be lost too.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28220,0,'Zepik'),(28216,6,2,'I thought about tricking big-tongues to come here,, but it too dangerous for me. You have good luck and I meet you back at hill.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28221,0,'Zepik'),(28216,6,3,'Bad plan to come here... many more adventures to be had before I risk this place. Be safe... I meet you later.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28222,0,'Zepik'),(28216,7,1,'Big-tongues don\'t usually come down here anymore... I had a big fight and killed lots.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28244,0,'Zepik'),(28216,7,2,'I always wonder where all the water go... doesn\'t make sense.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28245,0,'Zepik'),(28216,7,3,'Vekjik likes finding big-tongues that wander too far to throw in the basin. He help me trap some of the dumb ones. You should watch him sometime... it pretty funny actually.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28246,0,'Zepik'),(28216,7,4,'Battle here been going on for a while... these spark big-tongues have a lot more fight than the other ones.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28247,0,'Zepik'),(28216,7,5,'Big-tongues here worship shrine,, like at other places,, but this shrine sometimes have a guardian. Careful if it shows up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28248,0,'Zepik'),(28216,7,6,'Feels good to hunt with a not dumb hunter. You good at this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28249,0,'Zepik'),(28216,7,7,'Maybe I not be the only one big-tongues fear much longer. You scary when in the fight.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28250,0,'Zepik'),(28216,8,1,'I hope you planning something secret involving that big-tongue ending up dead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28208,0,'Zepik'),(28216,8,2,'If I step on its tail,, it was an accident.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28209,0,'Zepik'),(28216,8,3,'Normally I kill these things. You know that,, yeah?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28210,0,'Zepik'),(28216,8,4,'I not so happy about traveling with big-tongues.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28211,0,'Zepik'),(28216,8,5,'I see what you doing... maybe if we treat it nice it will lead us back to more big-tongues.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28212,0,'Zepik'),(28216,9,1,'I teach myself a lot of my big-tongue hunt here. Lot to kill.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28214,0,'Zepik'),(28216,9,2,'Something about sound of battle make this place more relaxing than main hill.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28215,0,'Zepik'),(28216,9,3,'Not mentioned much,, but Kartak ate dozen Frenzyheart before became \'friend.\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28216,0,'Zepik'),(28216,9,5,'Ever met Tartek? He one of our best fighters... leads in the northwest. I hear he captured one of the dragon things. No lie,, I a little jealous.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28217,0,'Zepik'),(28216,9,6,'Shaman Jakjek is quiet for a Frenzyheart,, but still very strong. He probably the only reason Kartak not turned on more of us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28218,0,'Zepik'),(28313,1,0,'Longrunner, your fodder... err, people will be a valuable resource against the vrykul. Did I say resource? I meant, \'ally.\' \n',12,1,100,25,0,0,0,27727,0,'Apothecary Scyllis'),(28406,3,0,'2...',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,29260,0,'Death Knight Initiate'),(28474,6,0,'Well done.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29840,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,5,3,'Your retention was poor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29839,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,5,2,'Death is the reward for your weakness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29838,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,5,1,'Such is the price of failure.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29837,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,5,0,'Do not be frightened child... welcome the cold embrace of death...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29836,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,3,0,'You are not overwhelmed just yet disciple... let the hungering cold of death halt this onslaught.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29673,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,0,5,'It is time for your challenge disciple. Use my teachings well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29671,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,0,3,'You have stood and listened long enough. Step forth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29669,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,0,2,'Do not let the ice in your blood slow your step. Prove your prowess, disciple.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29668,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,0,1,'It is time for your learning to be put to the test. Step forth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29667,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28474,0,0,'Step forth disciple. Show me what you have learned.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29664,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(28548,0,0,'The pure of heart will be allowed to remain in New Avalon. Those that the inquisitors find bereft of the holy Light will be turned away.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28580,0,'High General Abbendis'),(28548,1,0,'SILENCE! The Light has not abandoned us! The Light is stronger than ever among the pure!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28575,0,'High General Abbendis'),(28548,2,0,'We fight! We push them back, just as we have always done!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28568,0,'High General Abbendis'),(28548,3,0,'We are sending crusaders to reclaim what is rightfully ours! Any Scourge that stand in our way will be turned to ashes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28578,0,'High General Abbendis'),(28558,0,0,'But none of you could possibly have anything to worry about, right?',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,28582,0,'High Abbot Landgren'),(28586,7,1,'Flesh... is... weak!',14,0,100,0,0,14154,0,31412,0,'General Bjarngrim - Slay 2'),(28586,7,2,'Bolvin umyol marnjar.',14,0,100,0,0,14155,0,31413,0,'General Bjarngrim - Slay 3'),(28610,0,0,'What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29133,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,3,'\"Crimson Dawn!\" What is it! Speak!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29136,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,4,'I can keep this up for a very long time, Scarlet dog! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn!\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29137,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,5,'I\'ll tear the secrets from your soul! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn\" and your life may be spared!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29138,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,6,'Is your life worth so little? Just tell me what I need to know about \"Crimson Dawn\" and I\'ll end your suffering quickly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29139,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,7,'I grow tired of these games, human. Tell me of the \"Crimson Dawn\" or I will tear your spine out with my bare hands!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29140,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,0,'I\'ll tell you nothing, Scourge filth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29141,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,1,'You\'\'ll have to kill me, monster. I will tell you NOTHING!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29142,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,2,'Argh... The pain... The pain is almost as unbearable as the lashings I received in grammar school when I was but a child.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29143,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,3,'You... You\'ll get nothing... And like it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29144,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,4,'Do you think this to be pain? To be suffering? HAH! Destroy this mortal shell so that I may ascend to the heavens!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29145,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,5,'You hit like a girl. Honestly. Is that the best you can do?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29146,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,6,'The crimson what? Never heard of it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29147,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,7,'The pain is momentary. It pales in comparison to what the High General would do to me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29148,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,8,'You know nothing of pain, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29155,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,9,'HAH! I\'ve survived three separate inquisitions! This is nothing in comparison!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29156,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,10,'Look out! There\'s a bee loose and it\'s on a stinging rampage!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29157,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,11,'That one tickled...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29158,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,12,'I\'m going to send you back to the Lich King in pieces!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29159,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,13,'You\'ll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29160,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,14,'I used to work for Grand Inquisitor Isillien! Your idea of pain is a normal mid-afternoon for me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29161,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,15,'ARGH! You burned my last good tabard!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29162,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,8,0,'%s dies from the torture.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29154,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,1,'The Crusade will be victorious!, The Crusade will be victorious!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28598,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,2,'I will present your head to Abbendis myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28599,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,3,'You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28600,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,4,'Let the purging begin!, Let the purging begin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28601,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,5,'By the Light be cleansed!, By the Light be cleansed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28602,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28660,0,0,'Where do you expect us to stay? New Avalon cannot hold all of us!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28579,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28660,1,0,'The crowd gasps.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,28581,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28660,2,0,'What does the Light say to you now, Abbendis!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,28570,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28660,3,0,'Nor my husband and brothers!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28572,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28660,4,0,'What do we do? We\'ve lost everything!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28567,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28662,0,0,'I didn\'t see the Light step in to save my wife and children!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28571,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28662,1,0,'The Light has abandoned us!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28574,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28662,2,0,'Havenshire is lost!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28576,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28662,3,0,'The stables and mill are left abandoned! What will happen to our horses?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,28577,0,'Citizen of Havenshire'),(28845,0,1,'Must feed...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28956,0,'Scarlet Ghoul'),(28845,0,2,'GIVE ME BRAINS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28957,0,'Scarlet Ghoul'),(28845,0,3,'Smell flesh... close...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28958,0,'Scarlet Ghoul'),(28845,0,4,'Mommy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28959,0,'Scarlet Ghoul'),(28845,0,5,'$g Poppy:Mama;!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28960,0,'Scarlet Ghoul'),(28846,0,1,'I\'ll take you with me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28964,0,'Scarlet Ghost'),(28846,0,2,'The grave calls to us all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28966,0,'Scarlet Ghost'),(28846,0,3,'Die, Scourge filth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28968,0,'Scarlet Ghost'),(28846,0,4,'YOU KILLED ME!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28967,0,'Scarlet Ghost'),(28857,0,0,'Yer gonna have to shoot faster than that! I\'ve already got 11 kills!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28983,0,'Drostan'),(28857,0,1,'That\'s number 10! How many\'ve you got?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28984,0,'Drostan'),(28857,0,2,'Number 9! I could do this with my eyes closed!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28985,0,'Drostan'),(28857,0,3,'11! It\'s gonna take a bigger effort than that to beat ol\' Drostan!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28986,0,'Drostan'),(28857,1,0,'I\'m up to 15. Top that!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29080,0,'Drostan'),(28857,1,1,'That\'s my 16th and I\'m still going easy on ya!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29081,0,'Drostan'),(28857,1,2,'You\'re going to have to pick it up, or this isn\'t going to be much of a competition.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29082,0,'Drostan'),(28857,1,3,'Ha! 16! How many\'ve you got? 10, maybe 11 if you\'re lucky?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29083,0,'Drostan'),(28857,2,0,'That\'s my 25th kill. How far behind are you now?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29084,0,'Drostan'),(28857,2,1,'26th! Are you going to start killing, or what?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29091,0,'Drostan'),(28857,2,2,'My mother could hunt faster than you, $n.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29092,0,'Drostan'),(28857,2,3,'Kill number 26 and I\'m still just warming up.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29093,0,'Drostan'),(28857,3,0,'Well, now that I\'ve got a nice lead, I think I\'ll enjoy a little nap.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29096,0,'Drostan'),(28857,4,0,'Well, that was a relaxing nap. How\'s the game hunting going over there?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29097,0,'Drostan'),(28857,5,0,'I\'ve got a nice lead, yet. Think I\'ll do some fishin\'.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29101,0,'Drostan'),(28857,6,0,'Well, now we\'ve got a competition on our hands.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29112,0,'Drostan'),(28857,6,1,'Just got number 41! How\'s that for skill?',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29116,0,'Drostan'),(28857,6,2,'41! Two-thirds of the way there. Better step it up!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29117,0,'Drostan'),(28857,6,3,'Hey! I was just lining up a shot on that one. Kill stealer!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29118,0,'Drostan'),(28857,7,0,'Argh, just now getting number 48. This is getting tough.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29119,0,'Drostan'),(28857,7,1,'Someone\'s been killing all the game out from under me. Hard-won number 48, here.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29120,0,'Drostan'),(28857,7,2,'Number 48. Startin\' to slow down a bit, now.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29121,0,'Drostan'),(28857,7,3,'Gotta go elsewhere to find some more game. Was hoping to be beyond 48 by now.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29122,0,'Drostan'),(28857,8,0,'Ha, 54! In the home stretch now!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29123,0,'Drostan'),(28857,8,1,'Number 54! No way I\'m gonna let you beat me!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29124,0,'Drostan'),(28857,8,2,'54! Surely an insurmountable lead!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29125,0,'Drostan'),(28857,8,3,'That was 54! Soon you\'ll be congratulating me!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29126,0,'Drostan'),(28873,0,0,'We gunna drive all da scourge outta Zul\'Drak, mon - startin\' with you!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,28997,0,'Drakkari Chieftain'),(28873,0,1,'Die, nasty scourge!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,28995,0,'Drakkari Chieftain'),(28873,0,2,'I come to avenge my bruddas, mon!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,28994,0,'Drakkari Chieftain'),(28873,0,3,'Now you gunna die, mon!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,28993,0,'Drakkari Chieftain'),(28873,1,0,'Aaah....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28999,0,'Drakkari Chieftain'),(28873,1,1,'Ooof!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29000,0,'Drakkari Chieftain'),(28873,1,2,'Owww!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29001,0,'Drakkari Chieftain'),(28873,1,3,'Wha?!...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28998,0,'Drakkari Chieftain'),(28912,7,1,'Stand your ground! Use my anti-magic barrier to dampen their spells!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29224,0,'Koltira Deathweaver'),(28936,0,3,'\"Crimson Dawn!\" What is it! Speak!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29136,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,0,4,'I can keep this up for a very long time, Scarlet dog! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn!\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29137,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,0,5,'I\'ll tear the secrets from your soul! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn\" and your life may be spared!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29138,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,0,6,'Is your life worth so little? Just tell me what I need to know about \"Crimson Dawn\" and I\'ll end your suffering quickly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29139,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,0,7,'I grow tired of these games, human. Tell me of the \"Crimson Dawn\" or I will tear your spine out with my bare hands!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29140,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,1,'You\'\'ll have to kill me, monster. I will tell you NOTHING!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29142,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,2,'Argh... The pain... The pain is almost as unbearable as the lashings I received in grammar school when I was but a child.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29143,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,3,'You... You\'ll get nothing... And like it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29144,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,4,'Do you think this to be pain? To be suffering? HAH! Destroy this mortal shell so that I may ascend to the heavens!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29145,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,5,'You hit like a girl. Honestly. Is that the best you can do?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29146,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,6,'The crimson what? Never heard of it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29147,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,7,'The pain is momentary. It pales in comparison to what the High General would do to me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29148,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,8,'You know nothing of pain, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29155,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,9,'HAH! I\'ve survived three separate inquisitions! This is nothing in comparison!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29156,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,10,'Look out! There\'s a bee loose and it\'s on a stinging rampage!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29157,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,11,'That one tickled...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29158,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,12,'I\'m going to send you back to the Lich King in pieces!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29159,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,13,'You\'ll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29160,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,14,'I used to work for Grand Inquisitor Isillien! Your idea of pain is a normal mid-afternoon for me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29161,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,1,15,'ARGH! You burned my last good tabard!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29162,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,4,0,'The Light that guides us. This movement was set in motion before you came... We... We do as we are told. It is what must be done.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29151,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,5,0,'I know very litte else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There\'\'s nothing else... You must believe me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29152,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,6,0,'LIES! The pain you are about to endure will be talked about for years to come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29163,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,7,0,'NO! PLEASE! There is one more thing that I forgot to mention... A courier comes soon... From Hearthglen. It...',12,0,100,431,0,0,0,29153,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,8,0,'%s dies from the torture.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29154,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,9,1,'The Crusade will be victorious!, The Crusade will be victorious!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28598,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,9,2,'I will present your head to Abbendis myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28599,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,9,3,'You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28600,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,9,4,'Let the purging begin!, Let the purging begin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28601,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28936,9,5,'By the Light be cleansed!, By the Light be cleansed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28602,0,'Scarlet Commander'),(28939,0,1,'Tell me what you know about \"Crimson Dawn\" or the beatings will continue!\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29134,0,'Scarlet Preacher'),(28939,0,2,'I