 Avalon'),(28941,1,3,'You may take my life, but you won\'t take my freedom!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,28792,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,1,2,'Is this the best the Scourge can do?',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,28791,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,1,1,'Die Scourge dog! DIE!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,28789,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,1,0,'I won\'t go down that easy!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,28788,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,0,7,'HELP! HELP!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,28540,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,0,6,'Ask for anything and you shall have it! Just spare my life!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29088,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28941,0,5,'I\'m too young to die!',12,0,50,22,0,0,0,29086,0,'Citizen of New Avalon'),(28948,15,0,'Farewell',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,29440,0,'Malmortis say'),(28951,0,1,'Greetings, $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32808,0,'Breanni'),(28951,0,2,'Greetings! Please have a look around.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32809,0,'Breanni'),(28951,0,3,'Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32810,0,'Breanni'),(28951,0,4,'Welcome. May I help you find something?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32811,0,'Breanni'),(29001,0,1,'Come out and play.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29220,0,'High Inquisitor Valroth'),(29001,0,2,'LIGHT PURGE YOU!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29221,0,'High Inquisitor Valroth'),(29001,0,3,'You have come seeking deliverance? I have come to deliver!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29222,0,'High Inquisitor Valroth'),(29110,0,14,'Feast, my children! Feast upon the flesh of the living!',14,0,100,22,0,14801,0,29516,0,'The Lich King'),(29089,0,0,'%s falls asleep.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,6542,0,'Mini-Tyrael'),(29089,1,0,'%s becomes enraged.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,7798,0,'Mini-Tyrael'),(29194,5,3,'Your retention was poor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29839,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,5,2,'Death is the reward for your weakness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29838,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,5,1,'Such is the price of failure.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29837,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,5,0,'Do not be frightened child... welcome the cold embrace of death...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29836,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,4,0,'Frozen solid, ripe for the slaughter. Let loose a howling blast and shatter them into pieces, disciple.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29674,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,3,0,'You are not overwhelmed just yet disciple... let the hungering cold of death halt this onslaught.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29673,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,2,0,'Do not let it consider its next spell so freely, disciple... freeze its mind.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29666,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,1,0,'Its spells would be less threatening if its incantations were slowed by your icy touch...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29665,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,0,5,'It is time for your challenge disciple. Use my teachings well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29671,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,0,4,'Prove that you understand my teachings, disciple.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29670,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,0,3,'You have stood and listened long enough. Step forth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29669,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,0,2,'Do not let the ice in your blood slow your step. Prove your prowess, disciple.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29668,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,0,1,'It is time for your learning to be put to the test. Step forth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29667,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29194,0,0,'Step forth disciple. Show me what you have learned.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29664,0,'Amal\'thazad'),(29302,0,0,'Looks like you brought the whole family! What\'s your business here, then?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29933,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),(29302,1,0,'Work?  You are aware this is a warzone, citizen?  What is your profession?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29934,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),(29302,2,0,'Right.  Go ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29935,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),(29302,3,0,'Her Majesty sends Dark Rangers! Stand aside, boys!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29936,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),(29302,4,0,'You must be the sorriest bunch of recruits I\'ve seen today!  Fall in formations and report to High Executor Anselm!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29938,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),(29302,4,1,'Aren\'t you a sorry sight!  I suppose you\'re a little better than yesterday\'s bunch.  Formations, now!  Report for duty!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29939,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),(29302,4,2,'Wipe that worthless grin off your faces, recruits!  If the High Executor sees you like that he will kill you all himself!,',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29940,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),(29319,0,0,'It\'s an angry male!',42,0,100,0,0,473,0,33191,0,'Icepaw Bear'),(29319,1,0,'It\'s a female.',42,0,100,0,0,473,0,33192,0,'Icepaw Bear'),(29327,1,0,'It\'s a female.',42,0,100,0,0,643,0,33192,0,'Frost Leopard'),(29419,0,0,'We\'re here for civilian work, sir.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30118,0,'Julian Morris'),(29419,1,0,'Well... we\'re undertakers, sir.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30119,0,'Julian Morris'),(29437,0,1,'Why you hurt Rageclaw? You crazy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30337,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),(29437,0,2,'Rageclaw and troll friends no more!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30338,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),(29437,0,3,'You kill our pups! We kill you back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30339,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),(29437,0,4,'You leave den the hard way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30340,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),(29437,0,5,'You hurted the chief\'s lion seal! WHY YOU HURT LION SEAL??!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30341,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),(29437,0,6,'Why you smell so bad now? You smelled much less bad before!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30342,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),(29437,0,7,'Trolls is shameful. Trolls is killers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30343,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),(29439,0,1,'Why you hurt Rageclaw? You crazy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30337,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),(29439,0,2,'Rageclaw and troll friends no more!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30338,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),(29439,0,3,'You kill our pups! We kill you back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30339,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),(29439,0,4,'You leave den the hard way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30340,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),(29439,0,5,'You hurted the chief\'s lion seal! WHY YOU HURT LION SEAL??!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30341,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),(29439,0,6,'Why you smell so bad now? You smelled much less bad before!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30342,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),(29439,0,7,'Trolls is shameful. Trolls is killers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30343,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),(29519,1,0,'To battle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30218,0,'Unworthy Initiate'),(29620,0,0,'Gah! I spent too much time in that weak little shell.',14,0,100,0,0,14426,0,30275,0,'Mal\'Ganis'),(29620,1,0,'Kirel narak! I am Mal\'Ganis. I AM ETERNAL!',14,0,100,0,0,14427,0,30276,0,'Mal\'Ganis'),(29620,2,0,'ENOUGH! I waste my time here. I must gather my strength on the homeworld.',14,0,100,1,0,14428,0,30277,0,'Mal\'Ganis'),(29620,3,0,'Anakh kyree!',14,0,100,0,0,14422,0,30412,0,'Mal\'Ganis'),(29620,3,1,'My Onslaught will wash over the Lich King\'s forces!',14,0,100,0,0,14423,0,30413,0,'Mal\'Ganis'),(29620,3,2,'Your death is in vain, tiny mortal.',14,0,100,0,0,14424,0,30414,0,'Mal\'Ganis'),(29620,3,3,'Your time has come to an end.',14,0,100,0,0,14425,0,30415,0,'Mal\'Ganis'),(29620,4,0,'You\'ll never defeat the Lich King without my forces. I\'ll have my revenge... on him AND you!',14,0,100,25,0,14429,0,30278,0,'Mal\'Ganis'),(29621,3,1,'You gave in too soon!',12,0,100,0,0,14202,0,30409,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29621,3,2,'How disappointing for you.',12,0,100,0,0,14203,0,30410,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29621,3,3,'Unfortunate. The best was yet to come.',12,0,100,0,0,14204,0,30411,0,'Grand Admiral Westwind'),(29650,0,0,'It\'s those blasted iron dwarves again! Somehow, they found him before we did.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,30322,0,'Archaeologist Andorin'),(29650,1,0,'They\'re not going to give up until they find him. We can\'t allow that to happen, $n, and Brann knows it.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,30323,0,'Archaeologist Andorin'),(29650,2,0,'There are some rather cryptic instructions in this note. Brann must\'ve had some kind of backup plan, but he can\'t keep evading capture forever...',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,30324,0,'Archaeologist Andorin'),(29650,3,0,'It\'s up to you to find him before the irons do!',12,7,100,397,0,0,0,30325,0,'Archaeologist Andorin'),(29655,0,0,'Saragosa! What has become of you?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25480,0,'Malygos'),(29915,0,1,'My dead grandmater, rest her soul, could beat you... even now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30570,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),(29915,0,2,'I\'ve half a mind to cut you both down where you stand! The other half isn\'t arguing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30571,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),(29915,0,3,'Well hello, ladies. What do you think this is... Skorn?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30572,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),(29915,0,4,'You will practice until your lungs are bursting and your arms are aching, and then we\'ll really start!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30573,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),(29915,0,5,'Only the best of the best get a shot in Valhalas to go to Ymirheim. Everyone else dies... or worse!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30574,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),(29915,0,6,'Stop trying to hit him and HIT HIM already!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30575,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),(29915,0,7,'Are you trying to make me look bad? That\'s the only thing that you\'re good for today!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30576,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),(30274,0,1,'Glory and strength to you, $c. I bless you with all the strength left in me. May this nightmare soon end!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30977,0,'Freed Crusader Speach'),(30274,0,2,'Wisdom of the ages upon you, noble $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30978,0,'Freed Crusader Speach'),(30274,1,0,'Thank you and farewell, friend. I must return to the Argent Vanguard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30980,0,'Freed Crusader Speach'),(30686,0,0,'How dare you! I am the chief architect here and I make the final call on layouts! If you have a problem with my plans, feel free to file a grievance with Highlord Fordring. Now if you don\'t mind, I have work to attend!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31406,0,'Crusade Architect Silas'),(30714,0,0,'Dying must have completely destroyed your ability to perform simple arithmetic. Can\'t you see that there is no way you\'re going to make that structure\'s layout work? It\'ll collapse!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31404,0,'Crusade Engineer Spitzpatrick'),(31019,0,0,'Look, I\'m sorry, I really am, but all of my food is fresh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31792,0,'Stephanie Sindree'),(31019,1,0,'It wasn\'t my food!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31838,0,'Stephanie Sindree'),(31019,2,0,'Please, it\'s not my fault! If... if I give you a refund, maybe you can speak to a healer? I don\'t know what you expect me to do!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31840,0,'Stephanie Sindree'),(31023,0,0,'I just delivered it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32039,0,'Brandon Eiredeck'),(31023,1,0,'I didn\'t touch it! I promise you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32043,0,'Brandon Eiredeck'),(31023,2,0,'Please, I\'m just a delivery man!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32044,0,'Brandon Eiredeck'),(31023,3,0,'I haven\'t done anything!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32045,0,'Brandon Eiredeck'),(31126,2,0,'I bought food from this stall just yesterday and now my family\'s taken ill!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31791,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,3,0,'My husband and children are sick in bed because of the poison you sold me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31837,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,4,0,'Don\'t try to weasel out of this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31839,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,5,0,'That... no, keep your filthy money! It won\'t help my family!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31842,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,6,0,'I think it\'s your grain that\'s making us sick!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32032,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,7,0,'Give us one good reason why we shouldn\'t set fire to these sacks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32036,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,8,0,'The whole city\'s ill!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32031,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,9,0,'You brought this down on us! I\'d bet gold on it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32033,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,10,0,'My family\'s sick!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32030,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,11,0,'We were fine until we ate from this tainted grain of yours!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32035,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,12,0,'This is all your fault!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32037,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,13,0,'It\'s poison! Cartloads of poison!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32034,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,14,0,'We want to speak to the magistrate!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32058,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,15,0,'What are we supposed to do?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32059,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31126,16,0,'Where\'s Barthilas?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32057,0,'Agitated Stratholme Citizen'),(31127,0,0,'We need leadership!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32060,0,'Agitated Stratholme Resident'),(31127,1,0,'Stop hiding, Barthilas!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32061,0,'Agitated Stratholme Resident'),(31127,2,0,'Let us through!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32062,0,'Agitated Stratholme Resident'),(31127,3,0,'We\'ll drag you out here if we have to!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32063,0,'Agitated Stratholme Resident'),(31737,0,0,'Alright boys, let\'s do this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32351,0,'Skybreaker Squad Leader'),(31737,1,0,'Heads up!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32398,0,'Skybreaker Squad Leader'),(31737,2,0,'On your feet, boys!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32399,0,'Skybreaker Squad Leader'),(31737,3,0,'Nice work! We can only rest a moment.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32352,0,'Skybreaker Squad Leader'),(31737,4,0,'On your feet, boys! Move, move move!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32405,0,'Skybreaker Squad Leader'),(31737,5,0,'Thanks for keeping us covered back there! We\'ll hold the gate while we wait for reinforcements.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32353,0,'Skybreaker Squad Leader'),(31833,0,0,'On the move, men!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32409,0,'Kor\'kron Squad Leader'),(31833,1,0,'Incoming!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32407,0,'Kor\'kron Squad Leader'),(31833,2,0,'For the horde!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32418,0,'Kor\'kron Squad Leader'),(31833,3,0,'Quickly, catch your breaths before we press to the gate!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32410,0,'Kor\'kron Squad Leader'),(31833,4,0,'On your feet, men! Move, move move!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32411,0,'Kor\'kron Squad Leader'),(31833,5,0,'Time for some blood, men!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32416,0,'Kor\'kron Squad Leader'),(31833,6,1,'You\'ve got some fight in you! Blood and honor, friend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32412,0,'Kor\'kron Squad Leader'),(33817,0,0,'Crusaders and combatants, a true hero stands before you this day! $N, of the Sunreavers, has restored the ancient blade of Quel\'Delar as a symbol of our resolve to defeat the Lich King!',14,0,100,66,0,0,0,38084,0,'Justicar Mariel Trueheart to Player'),(33817,1,0,'Crusaders and combatants, a true hero stands before you this day! $n, of the Silver Covenant, has restored the ancient blade of Quel\'Delar as a symbol of our resolve to defeat the Lich King!',14,0,100,66,0,0,0,38039,0,'Justicar Mariel Trueheart to Player'),(34102,32,0,'In coming here, you have made a grave mistake. These tournament grounds are a bastion of the Light, and your power cannot match it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36139,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress'),(34102,33,0,'I am sorry, but you do not belong here, and you cannot be allowed to harm the innocents on the grounds.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36140,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress'),(34102,34,0,'Once more I apologize, but you chose this fate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36151,0,'Argent Confessor Paletress'),(34365,0,2,'Children, please behave yourselves! No one will want to adopt you if you keep acting like that!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34715,0,'Orphan Matron Aria'),(34850,0,0,'Stand ready, guards!  We don\'t know how many intruders we\'re dealing with, but the Headlands are overrun and we\'re cut off from the harbor towns.  Expect to be outnumbered.',12,0,100,1,0,19614,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane - Say 0'),(34850,1,0,'I want the perimeter secured and the gates manned by two guards at all times.  No one gets in, no one gets out.',12,0,100,1,0,19615,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane - Say 1'),(34850,2,0,'We protected Gilneas from the Scourge.  We protected Gilneas during the Northgate rebellion.  We will protect Gilneas from whatever this new threat may be.',12,0,100,25,0,19616,0,0,0,'Prince Liam Greymane - Say 2'),(34884,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(34981,0,0,'What in the world?  Let\'s get out of here!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35235,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(34981,0,1,'Let\'s go!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35236,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(34981,0,2,'No time to waste!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35237,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(34981,0,3,'Worgen!  Worgen everywhere!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35238,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(34981,0,4,'Flee!  They\'re everywhere!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35240,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(34981,0,5,'This place isn\'t safe.  Let\'s leave!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35239,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(34981,0,6,'Protect me, please!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,35234,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(35112,0,0,'Enough!  I\'ve made up my mind.  We need Crowley on our side.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane to Player'),(35115,0,0,'We ought to leave Crowley in prison with those beasts!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Godfrey to Player'),(35118,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(35456,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(35474,0,0,'Fools! Did you think our master blind? Did you think we did not know of this intrusion? Our elder sisters come, and there will be no escape from their wrath!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35819,1,'Vengeful Valkyr'),(35474,1,0,'Our sisters have been captured! Fall back!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35820,1,'Vengeful Valkyr'),(35501,3,0,'The Val\'kyr are attacking! Take cover!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,35828,1,'Herald Beluus'),(35550,1,0,'Hold the barricades!  Do not give them an inch!',14,0,100,0,0,19709,0,0,0,'King Genn Greymane'),(35836,0,0,'It\'s coming right for me!!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36037,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(35836,0,1,'Help me, please!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36038,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(35836,0,2,'There\'s one after me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36039,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(35836,0,3,'Help!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36040,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(35836,0,4,'I don\'t want to die!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36041,0,'Frightened Citizen to Player'),(35840,0,0,'We must stick together to survive.  Move around in groups.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36094,0,'Gwen Armstead'),(35840,1,0,'The plan is to keep moving south.  We can\\\'t go back to the Merchant Square.  It\\\'s not safe.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36094,0,'Gwen Armstead'),(35840,2,0,'The king\\\'s men will protect us.  We\\\'re almost there.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36094,0,'Gwen Armstead'),(36065,0,0,'This cannot be!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36154,0,'Fjola Lightbane to Priest Grimmin'),(36065,1,0,'We will have vengeance!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36155,0,'Fjola Lightbane to Priest Grimmin'),(36066,0,0,'This cannot be!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36154,0,'Eydis Darkbane to Priest Alorah'),(37205,0,0,'We must defend the Sunwell from the enemy at all costs.',12,0,100,1,0,16769,0,37154,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,1,0,'I am ordering you to withdraw to the Sunwell proper to help prepare the defenses.',12,0,100,25,0,16770,0,37155,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,2,0,'I will make my stand here and buy you as much time as I am able. Use it well and make our prince proud.',12,0,100,1,0,16771,0,37156,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,3,0,'It has been a great honor to fight beside you in defense of our land and our people.',12,0,100,2,0,16772,0,37157,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,4,0,'You, stranger... you are not one of my soldiers. Will you stay and stand with me to face the enemy?',12,0,100,0,0,16773,0,37158,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,5,0,'Listen well, Scourge defilers. None of you will reach the Sunwell so long as I stand!',14,0,100,53,0,16774,0,37159,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,6,0,'I... I wasn\'t meant to survive this attack.',12,0,100,6,0,16775,0,37196,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,7,0,'Why has this happened? Why have you come here?',12,0,100,1,0,16776,0,37197,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,8,0,'It\'s Quel\'Delar! You possess the sword!',12,0,100,6,0,16777,0,37198,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37205,9,0,'I don\'t know how, but the blade has chosen you to be its new wielder. Take it with my blessing, and wield it against the Scourge as I once did.',12,0,100,0,0,16778,0,37199,0,'Thalorien Dawnseeker'),(37542,0,0,'You will fall as your lands and your city have before you. My lord will win a great victory here, and none will remember your name!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,37160,0,'Morlen Coldgrip'),(37542,1,0,'Forward!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,37162,0,'Morlen Coldgrip'),(37542,2,0,'Ghouls, slay this patheric high elf!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,37301,0,'Morlen Coldgrip'),(37542,3,0,'You will fall before the might of the Scourge. Crypt raiders, attack!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,37302,0,'Morlen Coldgrip'),(37542,4,0,'I shall kill you myself!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37167,0,'Morlen Coldgrip'),(37763,0,0,'Look at it, Lor\'themar. It is certainly Quel\'Delar.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37444,0,'Grand Magister Rommath to Player'),(37763,1,0,'What is the meaning of this treachery?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37389,0,'Grand Magister Rommath to Player'),(37763,2,0,'It seems the captain is correct. Quel\'Delar is not to be ours after all.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37433,0,'Grand Magister Rommath to Player'),(37763,3,0,'Guards, return to your posts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37432,0,'Grand Magister Rommath to Player'),(37763,4,0,'You will have what you have come for, $N. Take the sword and begone. And you, Auric, have a care what you say in this sacred place.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37434,0,'Grand Magister Rommath to Player'),(37764,0,0,'We shall see.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37442,0,'Lor\'themar Theron to Player'),(37764,1,0,'So it is. You have my thanks, $N, for restoring Quel\'Delar to its rightful owners.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37388,0,'Lor\'themar Theron to Player'),(37765,0,0,'This is not my doing, Rommath. There is no treachery here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37430,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser to Player'),(37765,1,0,'Call off your men. Lor\'themar\'s own foolishness caused his injuries. Quel\'Delar is not chosen; it chooses its master.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37431,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser to Player'),(37765,2,0,'Carry the sword back to Dalaran through that portal, $N. You have done what many quel\'dorei have dreamt of for years. Quel\'Delar has been restored at last.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,37440,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser to Player'),(37781,0,0,'My Lord Regent! What have they done to you?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,37439,0,'Sunwell Honor Guard to Player'),(37781,1,0,'Drop your weapon and surrender, traitor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37390,0,'Sunwell Honor Guard to Player'),(38056,0,0,'My lords and ladies, I present $N, bearer of Quel\'Delar.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,37820,0,'Chamberlain Galiros to Player'),(48566,0,0,'You and I against an entire clan? Sounds like my kind of fight. The Bleeding Hollow orcs use savage blood magic to transform their warriors into hulking berserkers. With any luck, we will escape before they can complete their transformation ritual.It looks like Khadgar and the rest are on the move. Our work is nearly done, champion! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(49178,0,0,'FOOD FOR GROLNAR!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,49256,0,'Grolnar the Berserk'),(50338,0,0,'You wll never take me on. Fight to the death!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(54586,0,4,'You are an honorable opponent.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56438,0,'Trainee'),(54586,0,5,'You fight honorably, friend.',12,0,100,1,0,33645,0,56440,0,'Trainee'),(54586,0,6,'You fought well. I must learn more from you in the future.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56443,0,'Trainee'),(54586,0,7,'Your skills are too great. I yield.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56442,0,'Trainee'),(54587,0,1,'My skills are no match for yours. I admit defeat.',12,0,100,1,0,33645,0,56441,0,'Trainee'),(54587,0,2,'Thank you for reminding me that I must train more diligently.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56439,0,'Trainee'),(54587,0,3,'That was a good match. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56444,0,'Trainee'),(54587,0,4,'You are an honorable opponent.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56438,0,'Trainee'),(54587,0,5,'You fight honorably, friend.',12,0,100,1,0,33645,0,56440,0,'Trainee'),(54587,0,6,'You fought well. I must learn more from you in the future.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56443,0,'Trainee'),(54587,0,7,'Your skills are too great. I yield.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56442,0,'Trainee'),(54611,2,0,'Well fought. Master Shang will be pleased.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Jaomin Ro'),(54611,3,0,'You\'ve been trained well.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Jaomin Ro'),(54702,0,0,'We will raze this house to the ground!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(54763,0,0,'Help us, they destroy our homes!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(54855,0,0,'Help me, stranger!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(54918,0,0,'Enter the riot pit and then set off the fireworks. Be prepared to fight off several enemies at once. Anything is possible in the riot pit.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(54936,0,0,'You all gonna die !!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(55135,0,0,'Aim true! Send them limping back to Stormwind!',12,0,100,0,0,32520,0,68804,5,'General Nazgrim'),(55209,0,0,'Thank God you guys showed up. We can use all the help we can get to defend the orchard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(55506,0,0,'Go away!  Thiefs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(55556,0,0,'Hey, let me finish playing. I will help you for sure!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(55686,0,0,'Nazgrim gonna be real happy with Riko! Here! Report is done!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(55873,0,0,'Eat turnip, muno! Ookin dooker!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(56133,0,0,'Alright. I suppose we have stayed here long enough. These Thunderfoots are good people, but they\r\ndo not have enough ale between them to fill a cask. Let s go find something to drink. Shall we, L',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(56406,0,0,'Nazgrim gonna be real happy with Riko! Here! Report is done!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(56447,0,0,'Good bonk, Miss Fanny! You got nice control!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(56573,0,0,'Hmph. Y all any good at fightin virmen? Awright then! My place is just around the corner.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(56786,0,0,'The Elder Sage Rain-Zhu sent you? Very well. You shall help me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Elder Sage Rain-Zhu sent you? Very well. You shall help me.'),(56787,0,0,'The pools are clouded. I will need my staff to calm the spirits and speak to the water.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The pools are clouded. I will need my staff to calm the spirits and speak to the water.'),(58569,0,0,'Learn this spell well for it will burn the taint from all those who oppose us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59683,0,'Scarlet Purifier'),(58569,0,1,'Good. Channel the flames, feel them course through you.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,59682,0,'Scarlet Purifier'),(59377,0,0,'Who wants to get with me to Cho s Family Shrine ?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(59411,0,0,'We must resealed all Sha Fissures',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(59418,0,0,'We have to beat back the Sha forces',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(60893,0,0,'Thanks that you re here. I could use your help! Get clear when it when it raises its weapon, it s even stronger than it looks. It s calling allies! I ll keep him busy while you handle them. I don t know what I would have done without you. It s good that you came.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(62973,0,0,'We are looking for a brewer named Mudmug. Do you know of him? I ve probably beaten up about a million virmen back on the Wandering Isle! Oh, You have a virmen problem? We will be glad to help you, Mudmug.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(63626,0,1,'You look like someone that might be interested in some rare pets?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,62764,5,'Varzok - Random text'),(63626,0,2,'Careful with the scorpion, he may look friendly but he is a beast in battle!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,63546,5,'Varzok - Random text'),(64311,0,0,'NamastÃ© Visitor, have a great time',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(64596,0,0,'Yes, that s the stuff! Our cider is prized throughout the Jade Forest. I hope I can carry them all. Pandaria has not seen a full-scale war since the mists closed in. The Shado-Pan usually handle any trouble that crops up on the continent. Oof... I do not know what to make of your kind. Why have you brought your war to our shores? Why do you fight against this... Horde? Mayor Khang is so worried, he called the Shado-Pan to deal with your arrival. I still cannot believe Lord Taran Zhu is here! We do not wish to enter your conflict. But I fear that when war is on the horizon, peace is not a choice. Ah, such troubling thoughts. Our last emperor advised us not to live in the shadow of fear. Do you see now why we love to drink and celebrate?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(65470,0,1,'My skills are no match for yours. I admit defeat.',12,0,100,1,0,33645,0,56441,0,'Trainee'),(65470,0,2,'Thank you for reminding me that I must train more diligently.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56439,0,'Trainee'),(65470,0,3,'That was a good match. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56444,0,'Trainee'),(65470,0,4,'You are an honorable opponent.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56438,0,'Trainee'),(65470,0,5,'You fight honorably, friend.',12,0,100,1,0,33645,0,56440,0,'Trainee'),(65470,0,6,'You fought well. I must learn more from you in the future.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56443,0,'Trainee'),(65470,0,7,'Your skills are too great. I yield.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56442,0,'Trainee'),(65471,0,0,'I have never seen a trainee with skills such as yours. I must tell the others.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56445,0,'Trainee'),(65471,0,1,'My skills are no match for yours. I admit defeat.',12,0,100,1,0,33645,0,56441,0,'Trainee'),(65471,0,2,'Thank you for reminding me that I must train more diligently.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56439,0,'Trainee'),(65471,0,3,'That was a good match. Thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56444,0,'Trainee'),(65471,0,4,'You are an honorable opponent.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56438,0,'Trainee'),(65471,0,5,'You fight honorably, friend.',12,0,100,1,0,33645,0,56440,0,'Trainee'),(65471,0,6,'You fought well. I must learn more from you in the future.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,56443,0,'Trainee'),(65471,0,7,'Your skills are too great. I yield.',12,0,100,1,0,33643,0,56442,0,'Trainee'),(65493,0,0,'Come and play with me. Catch me if you can...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(65545,0,0,'Welcome to Morning Breeze Village',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(65550,0,0,'You have to take your balance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(70989,0,0,'I apologize for the deception, but it was necessary.In thousands of years, we have never seen one of your kind.It was imperative that I first measure the bearing of your heart.Come ride with me, little one. There is something I wish you to see. The Temple Priests are too frightened to face the truth...I grow old, little one. My time on this world is nearly done.Do you see the great statue in the distance?\r\nThe builders have toiled for many years, and it is nearly complete.A little more jade - the jade you helped to acquire - and it will be finished.With my last breath, I will transfer my life essence into the statue, and a new guardian will be born.Do not be saddened. The cycle is clear - it neither begins nor ends with me.Someday, you may also be called upon to defend all that is dear to you.When that day comes, seek all the light and wonder of this world, and fight. We live together, or we die together. All of Pandaria is connected.I grow weary. I must rest now.Good-bye, little one. I will see you soon enough.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(71930,0,0,'Who wants to get with me to Cho s Family Shrine ?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(73217,0,0,'I want all this gold back to the palace ASAP and then- Outta my way! The Alliance is here! No delays! No excuses! No promotions!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(78430,0,0,'The front lines are faltering. They cannot hold for much longer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(78996,0,0,'1 feel the flames dying down. What is happening, exarch? We have a visitor. Perhaps a savior. We are freed! Follow me, shaman. We will escape through the hills.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(79097,0,0,'You have entered my arena, strangers. You will either leave it as victors, or as corpses.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(80177,0,0,'Look what dragged itself through my jungle. Fresh meat!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(80793,0,0,'The pain!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,75975,0,'Lesser Warlock to Player'),(80793,1,0,'...kill... me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,76091,0,'Lesser Warlock to Player'),(81695,0,0,'You... strange invaders... You seek to disable the Dark Portal? 1 can help you. Just... set me free. Those Iron cowards were using us as conduits to power their portal. They will regret that. The Shadow Council thanks you.)',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(81696,0,0,'Seek out Gul dan if you truly wish to stop the Iron Horde. (Gul dan! Gul dan powers the portal!)',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(90100,0,0,'Halt! State your intentions! We re taking you to Katherine, all right. You will answer to her for your crimes against Kul Tiras. Clear the way! Dangerous prisoners coming through!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(90708,0,0,'Keep it up! We almost got them!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(90709,0,0,'It s about time you showed up! You heard him, rangers, we cut those demons down! Fire a volley on my mark.. NOW!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(90710,0,0,'Their reinforcements are endless! Those crystals again... If we can get close to them, we can bring this thing down.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(93719,0,0,'Your corpses will feed my hounds. Weaklings. Must I do everything myself? Very well, prepare yourselves! You will all burn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(110533,0,0,'Ha, you fool! You stand before the temple of a GOD. Your pitiful Light cannot reach you here. How fortunate that your friends have arrived just in time to watch you die. All you have worked for, all you have sacrificed, just to see your champions fall to ash one by one.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(122661,0,0,'When you left, you told your father you were going exploring. Not negotiating with mongrels from de Horde.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(123244,0,0,'MURDER!   Traitor!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(124292,0,0,'FOR THE ALLIANCE!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(124787,0,0,'That army is enormous... Give the word, and I will teleport us to saer',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(124979,0,0,'FOR THE ALLIANCE!!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(125134,0,0,'There s Lordaeron up ahead! Hurry up, the forces are already gathering!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(127961,0,0,'Apologies for my delay. Rokhan. Tell me of your status here. Has dis Captain Ariel been useful? Is she too busy to give a simple status report? Princess Talanji to you, Prince Dreven. And how do you know dat? Sylvanas ainÂ´t gonna like dat. We need ta be movin fast on our plan ta stop da Alliance, Prince Dreven. Dere be a collapsed tunnel dat connects Nazmir ta Vol dun. Take ya followers, use ya powers ta clear da rubble, den we be attackin da main Alliance forces. I see. I shall return to Zuldazar. Keep me informed of de Horde operations in Nazmir. And be careful. Rokhan',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(128694,0,0,'This key belongs to the first Keeper. His name was Sulthis, and he died at the hands of Korthek Long ago, Mythrax the Unraveler descended upon our lands. He slaughtered all in his path, troll and sethrak alike. Our loa sacrificed herself to save us from that monstrosity. She struck the C Thrax down, but not before it was able to destroy the disc at the heart of Atul Aman.After witnessing his destruction firsthand, we knew that something must be done to prevent anyone from raising Mythrax again. Although immensely powerful, Sulthis could not create the barrier alone. Korthek and I lent him our aid, and together, we sealed Mythrax within the great pyramid. As the sands continued to spread, Korthek grew hungry for war. He plotted to unearth the C  Thrax and use him as a weapon to conquer the continent.Korthek raised an army of like-minded sethrak, and they began to slaughter those who opposed them... Sulthis was the first to fall, but not before safeguarding his key. Those of us still loyal to Sethraliss were forced out of our home and into hiding. We have been fighting the Faithless ever since.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(129043,0,0,'Indubitably! I brought some extra machines for backup. Feel free to give them a spin',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(129179,0,0,'Your father was a man of honor, boy. You know nothing of the sort. I will NEVER stand down! I eat, sleep, and die by the sword. What price have you paid for your people?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(129409,0,0,'Follow me. I can lead you to de easiest way down. Dis will take you to de chamber below where Princess Talanji is waiting for you. Mind de step.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(130365,0,0,'You have no idea what you re up against, boy king. We ve only just begun!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(130367,0,0,'The Undercity is no longer safe for civilians. The war rages above, and dozens of spies have infiltrated our walls. We have herded the cowards to the Mage District an have secured the rest of the city.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(130938,0,0,'No time to waste! I Open a portal to report to the warchief!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(130969,0,0,'They just started closing gates suddenly, whats going on?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(131334,0,0,'Light be with you, $n. I plan to  seek the Legion upon Azeroth to continue our eternal battle.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143327,5,'Vindicator Minkey to Player'),(131347,0,0,'I have only heard stories of Stormwind before now. I will explore its streets and the wonders it holds. May the shadows guide you, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,143328,0,'Keira Onyxraven to Player'),(132237,0,0,'Some of our troops stole a boat and filled it with weapons. Take the fight to those undead monsters',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133122,0,0,'Ha! It be time for some fun!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133139,0,0,'I got the intel. We just gotta make it outta here with it! Plan B is ... What ?! DEFEAT!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133243,0,0,'Leave it to me, Dark Lady. I will lead the reserves in the assault. The Alliance will go no further, I swear it. Baine! Gather the catapults and every apothecary you can find. Send them to the keep at once! With us out in the open, we will outnumber them ten to one! Lor themar and I will handle the interlopers. I cant risk leaving the warchief unguarded. You are not to leave her side. Champions, with me! We rally in the keep! Your warchief commands it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133249,0,0,'If we turn tail now, we just become prey. No We will light - and die, if we must - for what we belive In!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133279,0,0,'Gotcha! Me life for da ma das!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133948,0,0,'FOR THE ALLIANCE!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(134039,0,0,'The city is stirring. We cannot linger here for long.Alright. Stay close. We all friends now, or fight your way free!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(134120,0,0,'I have lost track of the time I have sat in this cell. But it matter. Not in the end. After all she has done, I will never return to her Horde. igh Overlord Saurfang says: Make sure you know the difference between loyalty and honor. ligh Overlord Saurfang says: And pray you never have to choose. We both know you are not here for me. Those you seek are down the hall. I am. LokÂ´iar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(134201,0,0,'You have slain many innocents to get this far. But your little jailbreak is over. Surrender, and I will return you to the Stockades where you belong. There, you will await the kingÂ´s justice.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(135388,0,0,'Radio check. This is Alpha I. Address group, alpha squacion. Do you read me? Over! Roger! Yes! Calibration complete. All of you must orientthe instruments in very specie locations contact me when theyÂ´re in place. Authentication code is one-niner-niner. Instrument alignment is outside acceptable parameters... Belay that.. .. I can make this work. Sit tight, over. Execute to follow. See that big red button? Yeah, get clear of the area and DO press the big red button. Execute when ready. Over. Hah! Confirmed. Mission success. Perfection incarnate! love it when a plan comes together. Over and out.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(135440,0,0,'Know dis... Father is set in his ways, but he is most observant. I would wager he already knows of your role in freeing me from Stormwind. Just show respect and let him do de talking... and hopefully he will not throw you off de pyramid. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(137530,0,0,'This is a night for Kul Tiras!',12,0,100,1,0,104433,0,153439,3,'Daniel Poole'),(135441,0,0,'Follow me. I can lead you to de easiest way down.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,''),(135441,1,0,'Dis will take you to de chamber below where Princess Talanji is waiting for you. Mind de step.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,''),(135618,0,0,'Swiftwing, go find yerself a nice meal.  The King s brought in some right impressive heroes for this campaign.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136292,0,0,' \"Beware, beware the Daughter of the Seas.\" \"Beware,\" I heard him cry. His words carried upon the ocean breeze, As he sank beneath the tide. Those blood-soaked shores of Kalimdor, Where sailors fought and died. The admiral fell at Theramore, because she left his side. Why this? Why this oh Daughter of the Seas? Why this? Did you forget your seaside days? Always the pride of our nations eyes, How could she go astray? When she did flee across the ocean deep, the admiral followed west. What else but sail to save a daughters life, and pray she still drew breath? But there he found on the Western shores, Enemies pon the rise! But when he faced those savage foes His daughter stood aside. Buried deep beneath the waves, Betrayed by family. To his nation, with his last breath, cried, \"Beware the Daughter of the Seas.\" ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136432,0,0,' \"This place gives me the willies... I like it! Anywhere yer hackles raise, there s an opportunity for adventure an  the prospect o knowledge. We sent Captain Conrad ahead to build a fort. They say the blood trolls here might even be willin ta trade, but I cannae imagine that d come at a price worth payin. Still, this heres a land that works gainst the Zandalari and their Horde associates. The enemy of yer enemy is yer... wait, whats that sayin ? No matter. Look. Listen. Keep those sharp eyes peeled. Unforgivin lands aren t known ta forgive the unwary. And... eugh... keep yer nostrils pinched. Whats that foul-as-death rottin stench? Looks like our welcome party is here. Harrys an interestin one. Don t pay him no mind. Blast that! They won t get another red copper from us before me an Champion go see whats what.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136447,0,0,' We ve been expecting you, our esteemed advisors and future fast friends. Captain Conrad left me with instructions.Ah! Ah ha! Right to the point, yes, yes. Not to worry! All is in order. Let s retire to safer environs behind our forts walls, yes?  Nothing untoward, I assure you! Our glorious Captain is off negotiating trade agreements with the local trolls. Oh heavens! Well, indeed, yes. I suppose that is accurate, mmm. But Captain Conrad is a glory to behold. Impressive, no doubt. Trade agreements with trolls! We even have bats prepared to send another trade offering to Zalamar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136565,0,0,'Your blood for GÂ´huun!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136568,0,0,'I have established more trust with the blood trolls--these Nazmani-than I anticipated. They can be powerful tools against the Zandalari trolls and thelr Horde allies. There is much to understand about them yet. This blood magic... it is more potent than you could possibly imagine. The methods of the Nazmani were... offputting, at first. But I know them now. They are a simple people with simple desires. The desire for power. The yearning for the greater truth. The will of blood. Here, let me show you what I have learned. This Zandalari will be sacrificed for the Furtherance of our power.We will continue our... what are you looking at me like that for? DO YOU NOT APPROVE?This is nothing personal, you understand. But, you cannot be allowed to interrupt the progress I have made. The things I have learned... what I\r\nZandalari chave yet to discover...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136716,0,0,'I have established more trust with the blood trolls--these Nazmani-than I anticipated. They can be powerful tools against the Zandalari trolls and thelr Horde allies. There is much to understand about them yet. This blood magic... it is more potent than you could possibly imagine. The methods of the Nazmani were... offputting, at first. But I know them now. They are a simple people with simple desires. The desire for power. The yearning for the greater truth. The will of blood. Here, let me show you what I have learned. This Zandalari will be sacrificed for the Furtherance of our power.We will continue our... what are you looking at me like that for? DO YOU NOT APPROVE?This is nothing personal, you understand. But, you cannot be allowed to interrupt the progress I have made. The things I have learned... what I\r\nZandalari chave yet to discover...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136725,0,0,'Fine, we will investigate the Azerite. But then we MUST focus on the Alliance! Trade Prince Gallywix says: Yeah, whatever.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136907,0,0,'Ach! This chamber is in ruins, champion. It won t hold together for long! Azeroth calls tae ye, champion. She offers a gift... one born of her own essence.  The very Heart of Azeroth!  Infuse this amulet with power... it might be the only way tae save her!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(136916,0,0,'You cannot stop the sands from spreading! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(137008,0,0,'1 Il be out hunting for leads on James while you re calling in the ship. I m not going to let him stay in the clutches of those slippery bastards.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(137213,0,0,'Its time we get headed back. Wyrmbanes going to want a full report. Lets get moving! You better square yourself away, private.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(137401,0,0,' \"Champion! Place some o that slag on the unstable magma there. And prepare yerself. A mighty fine summon, lads. You have control o it. Show that batch o Horde what happens when they meddle with the Dark Iron!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(137537,0,0,'Our temple is the last bastion against the Faithless.Long ago, we lived as one. Korthek, Sulthis, and I led our people in harmony. We were entrusted by our loa to protect three keys which seal away an ancient and evil power beneath the sands. But we were betrayed. Korthek desired power and turned his back on our ancient traditions. Sulthis was slain, but his key was hidden. Now Korthek and his followers, the Faithless, hunt for mine. Had they searched me when I was captured they would have surely found it, but when they finally searched me I had already secretly hidden it somewhere they would not expect. I snuck it into the pocket of a prisoner they had just captured. I believe he called himself. \"James\". Its imperative for us all that the key remain out of Kortheks hands. Come, our temple is ahead',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(137552,0,0,'Its Boxofbeerx, thank the Light! Ill head to the temple. Its not safe here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(137559,0,0,'Oh! Theres some sort of stone in there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(137800,0,0,'Hmm... I donÂ´t believe that the captain would decide against siding with the Ashvane. He seems fairly set. Does this mean... I see. IÂ´ll go talk to Owings. I like my job, and I want to keep doing it. On my own terms.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(138131,0,0,'His heart grows weak... there is nothing more I can do for him but to end his suffering. Blood and thunder, my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(138178,0,0,'As one of the Alliance s greatest heroes, you will play a crucial role in achieving victory in this war. To aid your efforts, you will have the full support of the Alliance s finest soldiers--the 7th Legion, under the leadership of High Commander Halford Wyrmbane. For those situations that require a more... subtle approach, Master Mathias Shaw and his SI:7 operatives are at your disposal. My duties require that I return to Stormwind, but I look forward to hearing of your progress. I am confident that this campaign is in the right hands. Good luck to you all.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139098,0,0,'The Void, the elements <cough>...can nothing stop this damned disease? Why cid it have to end like this? Boorbik is right, sort of. You wonÂ´t get hurt if you help us, preferably before you die. One of the Forsaken. Perhaps itÂ´s a <cough> sign. Tell me, miss... Did you retain any sicknesses, any diseases that you had in life when you were returned? Do not try my patience, or IÂ´ll make you wish your disease already killed you. I need to see how good your magic is before we go any further..... WOW ! I will do what I can, Miss Voss. You want someone or something located, correct? Let me see what I can do without my book... There are Alliance and Kul Tiran forces at Sagehold. They are awaiting reinforcements and are vulnerable to an attack at this moment.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139102,0,0,'Hrm, the tidesage was here some time ago, I watched him protect and serve his family. There is no honor in that. We can just ask. We have no qualms with a crying mother. All I want to know is her husbandÂ´s location. No harm will come to she or her family. We must hurry if we are to get this tidesageÂ´s help.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139294,0,0,'The Horde... are you here to take more from me? My husband is dying, IÂ´m penniless... just leave my children be, please. Anything you do couldnÂ´t be worse than the disease... he went east to die in peace, away from the children. Please. lust leave us be',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139705,0,0,'Its tempting to overlook Sunwatcher and the Reliquary. I mean really... they are archaeologists, after all. But that would be a mistake. Those scoundrels are notorious for digging up powerful artifacts and unleashing them against their enemies.  What they cant use, they sell, which funds the Hordes war efforts. Light willing, we ll put a stop to that. Champion, stop. You see that?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139719,0,0,'I guess youÂ´re with me then, <name>. IÂ´ll see you at the Reliquary camp.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139721,0,0,'Small digsite, eh? Sounds like a job for a gnome... ... with a BUTTLOAD OF BOMBS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139742,0,0,'Hey! This is Horde territory! You re not supposed to be here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(139752,0,0,'My life for archaeology... Hkrrr!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140257,0,0,'LetÂ´s get this out of the way. The Alliance needs our support to prepare for a full invasion of Zuldazar.SEl agree. Shandris: Falstad and I have proposed a plan that was approved by King Wrynn. If we Die succeed. then our forces will stand a chance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140258,0,0,'Captain Ariel`s death will cripple the Horde`s operations within Nazmir and weaken Sylvanas`s dark rangers. We need information and allies within Nazmir to achieve this. Lucky for us, we have an opportunity. Keeshan? We can get information about the Horde`s movements if we save the tortollans. which should lead us to Captain Areiel.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140320,0,0,'I can tell you all about the Horde. I just need a little something in return. A good story! I was supposed to get great ones from Torga, but now heÂ´s dead. Do you have any good stories? This Ariel youÂ´re looking for is in the Necropolis. along with a whole host of Horde! She seemed real bothered by some missive she received. Said how she should be out killing the Alliance\r\ninstead of dealing with some nonsense. I knew after that I should leave before making any more deals for stories.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140399,0,0,'And I thought this would be a simple scouting mission. IÂ´ll enjoy this. Shandris, itÂ´s been... two, three thousand years? To think weÂ´d meet again like this, and with you helping a human, of all things.And you still cling to your outdated views on humans. I shouldÂ´ve killed you a long time ago.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140477,0,0,'My people are ready, Babadoon. For the Alliance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140510,0,0,'I lI blast ya big time, right in the mouth! The big G ain`t gonna like this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140567,0,0,'Alliance? Here in Zandalar?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140578,0,0,'The killing ends today, Dreven.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140603,0,0,'How many more of your kind must I kill before you understand to stay out of our way? YouÂ´re going to wish you burned with Darnassus!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140717,0,0,'Scram! ItÂ´s the Alliance!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140740,0,0,'The Alliance is counting on the void elves. We will not disappoint.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(140770,0,0,'Welcome to the Gallywix PAIN Palace. ya grimy chief! Eh, whatÂ´s the world done for me? Your ego is as bloated as your body. Think of the good you couldÂ´ve done for this world!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141192,0,0,'IÂ´m thinking a hundred laps around the Academy for every cadet I find.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141288,0,0,'But we cannot risk even one member of the Alliance being seen within Warport Rastari. There. You are now... a blood troll. At least temporarily.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141289,0,0,'Time to go plant some bombs... and not blow them up. For now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141291,0,0,'Babadoon, give the word when youÂ´re ready for us to begin preparations to blow this ship up Afterwards, I want you to report our success to King Wyrnn.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141530,0,0,'A blood troll? IÂ´ll end this quick before getting these plans to the Zandalari.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141533,0,0,'Blood trolls. Hah, youÂ´re too dumb to understand me Allance secress',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141535,0,0,'These Alliance battle plans are for our eyes only, time to die blood troll!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141567,0,0,'We re getting close. I can smell the foul stench of undeath. Not too close yet. I want to observe and formulate a plan before they know we re here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141644,0,0,'Oh... itÂ´s YOU. My, my, this IS a delight! IÂ´ve been looking forward to ending your meddlesome existence for some time.How the Dark Lady will laugh... when I tell her that you died in a trap like the mongrel you are!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141717,0,0,'You are too late! De captain is already reporting your location to Princess Talannji! Hah... de captain... will... kill all of you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(141719,0,0,'Alright, Babadoon. LetÂ´s finish this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(142228,0,0,'There will be no escape this time, abomination. Your death is long overdue.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(142299,0,0,'If this spreads... Azeroth is doomed. If we can t stop this corruption, who will?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(142308,0,0,'The trouble with undead has always been the lack of meat on their bones. I had to drain three to match the power from a night elf.No matter, I`ll simply tell Sylvanas that you killed them... before I killed you!Foolish girl. I knew their names when I drained the life from their husks.I ve grown weary of your feeble play at combat. I will entertain these foolish notions no longer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(142441,0,0,'IÂ´m sorry, Mother. But Jaina and I are here now Thank the tides that the three of us are together again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(142614,0,0,'Well, load them onto the ship! Those explosives are a safety hazard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(143169,0,0,'Bzzzzz... Beeeep... Brrrrr...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(143690,0,0,'You want to hear my story? I was on the flagship. I saw everything. Fine. I wll tell ya what happened. Better for ya to know. Better for ya to feel de fear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(144126,0,0,'Mistress, you tell Plugger that I want more of his ale.  I can\'t get enough!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,4986,0,'Guzzling Patron to Mistress Nagmara'),(144126,0,1,'Nagmara!  Have any mutton left?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,4985,0,'Guzzling Patron to Mistress Nagmara'),(144126,0,2,'Hey Nagmara!  How about a mug of Dark Iron Ale?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,4984,0,'Guzzling Patron to Mistress Nagmara'),(144127,0,0,'Mistress, you tell Plugger that I want more of his ale.  I can\'t get enough!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,4986,0,'Grim Patron to Mistress Nagmara'),(144127,0,1,'Hey Nag, how about you slice me off a piece of that...',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,4987,0,'Grim Patron to Mistress Nagmara'),(144163,0,0,'Hey Nag, how about you slice me off a piece of that...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,4987,0,'Hammered Patron to Mistress Nagmara'),(144457,0,0,'Alliance? Welcome to Castaway Encampment!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(145580,0,0,'DonÂ´t start, Tandred. It still feels strange to hear people call me that. IÂ´d always assumed Derek would become the next Lord Admiral.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(145632,0,0,'You bring the rest of the frozen zeppelins to an explosive end, Boorbik. IÂ´m going to join Rosaline and the other outriggers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(145751,0,0,'What do you mean the operation got stopped by a bunch of Azerite goop cominÂ´ outta the ground?! Fine, IÂ´ll just do it myself! And by do it myself, mean get this dude he over here to do it for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(145786,0,0,'Right thereÂ´s MekkatorqueÂ´s ship. King of the gnomes, or whatever those little freaks like to call him. He thinks heÂ´s soooooo much better than goblins! Yeah, well, you know what pal, at least half of us ainÂ´t RADIOACTIVE! Oh yeah, blowing up all his stuff. Yeah, I bet heÂ´d be cryinÂ´ and sobbinÂ´ the entire time, what a wimp!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(146015,0,0,'Just what kind of powder is this? Hey, help me grab some of this stuff. Oh! One more thing. Well. two.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(146073,0,0,'Nope... not dead. Just wishing we were dead. This must be how Sylvanas always feels.. Remember Jastor, you Â´re good enough, youÂ´re smart enough, and people HAVE to like you! Uh, hey thatÂ´s weird, who the heck put that in my mech?! IÂ´m gonna get to the bottom of this... just never mention this to anyone. Ever.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(146095,0,0,'Oh, yeah, got nabbed by Alliance near here. Want me to move mech?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(146212,0,0,'IÂ´m free! Well, as free as GallywixÂ´s personal insurance mechanic can get.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147139,0,0,'We cannot fly through dis fog, we have already lost several warriors to it. De Alliance are trying to delay Allian our attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147148,0,0,'The product of DaÂ´kani intellect and gnomish ingenuity. Technically speaking, it converts intelligence into size and strength, but we wonÂ´t weigh you down with specifics. Our co-inventor, Grong, has selflessly agreed to become embiggified for the greater good. But first, we need to run a small test.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147209,0,0,'I told you before, you will get nothing from... Hmm, what have we here? Release my men. They should prove quite adept at keeping the guards occupied.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147228,0,0,'Have my partners sent for me? Is it time?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147311,0,0,'We present to you: the Embiggifier!Adeptly named, it makes things big. Once the process is complete, weÂ´ll unleash him upon the Horde!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147362,0,0,'Go get Â´em, Guzbert!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147488,0,0,'Officer! This is the infamous Horde criminal Rexxar. He belongs in the deepest, darkest corner of this dungeon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147553,0,0,'Let s get down to the lower levels and find a way out.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147800,0,0,'An assault on the city of DazarÂ´alor will destabilize the HordeÂ´s relations with the Zandalari.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147846,0,0,'It is done. I will bring the scepter back to the Far Reach. Good luck to you all.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147885,0,0,'Yes, but at what cost? So many fallen... including Mekkatorque, whose life hangs by a thread. And I fear the death of Rastakhan will ignite a fire in the hearts of the Zandalari. But our mission was to drive a wedge between the Zandalari and the Horde. Instead, we may have strengthened their bond. We must continue the fight. But as we push toward victory, we must never lose sight of who we are and what we stand for. Our priests feel just as helpless. (Sighs) History will say we won a great victory in Zuldazar. Yet I find little cause for celebration. But enough of that. How are you faring? You held off the HordeÂ´s finest warriors so our fleet could withdraw. You risked everything for the Alliance, Jaina.  It is good to have you back with us, Auntie. I missed you. There is much to explain. Some I still donÂ´t fully understand... but IÂ´Â´ll tell you what I know.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147886,0,0,'Press the attack as the Zandalari mourn their fallen king? That would make us no better than the Banshee.   IÂ´m sorry. The mechanism preserving his body is unlike any magic I have encountered.It was a costly battle... in many ways. Still recovering, but... IÂ´ll be fine. You have enough on your mind without worrying about me. So much transpired while I was away. Anduin... IÂ´ve heard rumors about an old friend of mine--Calia Menethil. What happened in Arathi? Thank you. LetÂ´s find somewhere quiet to talk.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147887,0,0,'The Horde is losing on all fronts. The Alliance should achieve victory in a matter of weeks. Sylvanas! SheÂ´s the real problem here. I imagine she is already finding ways to turn this to her advantage.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(147888,0,0,'My king, the attack on Zuldazar was a resounding success. More than half the Zandalari vessels were destroyed in the initial strike, and the Horde fleet is in disarray. Their remaining ships cannot hope to stand against the Kul Tiran navy. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(148339,0,0,'Boss, this is the fifth time weÂ´ve had this talk, I really donÂ´t know why you think askinÂ´ me over and over is gonna change anythin. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(148445,0,0,'WeÂ´re outle fuel? That canit be right, we got plenty of Azerite left! Look at what this thing can do See? This thing is fine, I never refuel until that needle is WAY past empty, never had a problem',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(148909,0,0,'Quickly! Gather around. I will create the disguise Arcanist Valtrois says: Even my magic is not potent enough to cover up that smell.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(150087,0,0,'So many dead ... Come with me. The Lord Admiral is nearby.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(150101,0,0,'Ready? IÂ´ll get us down this water safely.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(150187,0,0,'This area is fascinating. donÂ´t you think? The power that thrums all around us is quite astonishing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(150196,0,0,'Over here, Champion! The nagaÂ´s attack is relentless!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(150207,0,0,'It seemed as if the Alliance ships were about to capture us. Then the naga sprung their trap. What could those fiends be up to?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(150476,0,0,'Baine Bloodhoof seeks to right a wrong done to your family. He asks to meet with you in secret... off the coast of Theramore. The Banshee Queen has eyes everywhere. Theramore is one of the few places she is not watching. You may not trust me, Lord Admiral, but King Anduin will vouch for both me and the chieftain.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(151000,0,0,'No. I am Okani, leader of the Waveblade clan. We share a common foe. Come, we will lead you to safety',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(151661,0,0,'You have my thanks, Akand. And your friend as well. I will return to camp. Please speak with me when you arrive.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(153815,0,0,'AzsharaÂ´s forces hold dominion over all of Nazjatar. The AzshÂ´ari are vile summoners, calling upon the tides to do their bidding. You are no longer Away. Those who wield the dark magic of the Void call themselves the Shirakess. But the Zanjir are the ones who pose the gravest threat. Something powerful lies hidden within their military stronghold.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(155241,0,0,'Oculeth, I am relieved you made it here. Azshara is blocking my teleportation spells. We need to ind a crack in her defenses. know just the thing, Thalyssra. Come along, Ð’Ð¸Ñ‚Ð°Ð»Ð¸Ð½ÐºÐ°. You will serve as my assistant! If we combine our powers, we should be able to open a gateway to Zuldazar without Azshara noticing. Here we are. With the merest touch of the Heart of Azeroth, the pathway will be stabilized.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(160600,0,0,'The world has become a much bigger place. I hope you enjoy discovering it, $n.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,184045,0,'Lulana to Player'),(165545,0,0,'Such a narrow vision. You disappoint me. No matter. We will find what we seek... in another.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(168199,0,0,'When I think of those Horde savages seizing his body and hanging it on display..',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(170151,0,0,' \"Indeed. And one of their tormentors- -and ours-is Sylvanas Windrunner. It seems she has made a powerful ally. The shades whisper of someone called... the Jailer. The Jailer rules this realm. We know little about him, but its clear he has taken a special interest in us.He has personally overseen our... treatment here.Whatever this Jailer and the Banshee are planning, it won t end well... for any of us. I caught glimpses of Baine and Anduin during myattempts to break free. They live...that s all I know for certain. But I have found no means of leaving the Maw. I can only manage to teleport short distances. This nightmare feels... inescapable.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(171789,0,0,'Come and learn about your leaders fate',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Come and learn about your leaders fate'),(171791,0,0,'Learn about your leaders fate',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Learn about your leaders fate'),(175405,0,0,'Pitiful mortal. I find your spirit... Unworthy',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181054,0,0,'Dervishian, scout the creche of the Ebon Scales. Cindrethresh and Veldragosa will seek the Healing Wings.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181056,0,0,'In here, Evoker',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181198,0,0,'Ah,your clan is as motivated as ever,Sansok Khan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181198,1,0,'Enter,Tomul.The khans eagerly await your report.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181594,0,0,'Zury! Cindrethresh! Can you bring down this barrier? Have you found the Earth-Warder?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182168,0,0,'Lapisagos has left us no choice,Zury.He means to destroy us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182168,1,0,'So today,we fight for each other.For all dracthyr!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182274,0,0,'Keep your talons sharp and your breath hot. Looks like we have a fight on our hands. Perhaps learning more about our foes will help us remember what happened.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182275,0,0,'Get us close to the target and then give the signal. evoker.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182297,0,0,'We wake up to find a hostile dragon in our creche, then fight off an elemental army at our doorstep. I want answers, Azurathel! Until the Earth-Warder is found, my weyrn takes orders only from me. Understood?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182317,0,0,'Neltharion would have our hides if he saw this mess. The Healing Wings need us. Get moving!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182441,0,0,'Fall back! Help the wounded!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182601,0,0,'You have my thanks, dracthyr. Now please, find-- The Neltharion you knew fell long, long ago. It is a... complicated tale.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182609,0,0,'His anger pushes him down a dark path. I dread the day we meet again. Not as friends, but as rivals on the field of battle.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(182696,0,0,'No. He is not in this chamber.But there is-- Well, this should be fun! Only fragments, A battle against a great foe. We claimed victory... I think. Though I fear we paid a terrible price for it. We will find answers. But first, we need to get our people out of here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(183302,0,0,'<cough> Wha-What...? toxin glands <cough> Help me, we shouldn - fallin - sleep - chhhhrr... <cough>',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(183543,0,0,'IÂ´m getting a bit concerned... we havenÂ´t heard back from the patrol up at RhoninÂ´s Shield.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(183960,0,0,'Fair skies and strong winds, Veldragosa.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184163,0,0,'Easy there, Cindre. Easy. Shhhh. I know. You are as brave and foolish as ever.. What ? Nonsense. I am perfectly <cough> fine. Just. hurry back with those toxin glands, evoker.\r\n<cough>',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184266,0,0,' I was our destiny to be the rest soldiers of draconking, We Diedged our lives to fight at Neltharions side Our LivEs.evoker. And whar was our vow worth to the as Dects? Nothing, They locked us away lik broken playchines. Welse are NoT brokenI am done taking orders! Our vow to serve the dragons is sundered... just as Neltharion broke his promises to us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184267,0,0,'I know what the Aspect asks of us, but the Healing Wings cannot join you.\r\nWe still have wounded, and these wingless drakonid have grown attached to us. No, my weyrn is not flying anywhere.\r\nI plan for us to cross the channel to the Dragon Isles. Plenty of others in need o our aid there, I suspect.\r\nThank you for helping my people, evoker.\r\nNo, make that Veldragosa. Thank you Veldragosa. Viridia, you could come with us. With... me. I am sorry, dear friend. My weyrn will remain in the Dragon Isles. If fate is kind, we will not be parted long. Fair skies and strong winds, Cindre.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184269,0,0,'Cut the chatter, Kodethil Hostiles could be lurking. Evoker, time to get those skills sharpened That beacon pulses with magic. It may have been placed there to contain us... or to send a signal.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184308,0,0,'This vault holds our legacy! We will not let Invaders claim it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184449,0,0,'Our orders were clear, Private Garrick. We have other threats to worry about.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184595,0,0,'The winds carried word of interesting times, but the arrival of your people has caused more of a stir man lexpected',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184765,0,0,'Yes, Timeless One.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(184870,0,0,'The Horde and Alliance have a long history of rivalry. But Toddy and I pursue knowledge, not violence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(185272,0,0,'Obey your directive!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(185599,0,0,'You think we will find anyone here who can help our efforts in de Azure Span? Glania can help direct you towards the Kirin TorÂ´s efforts in the Azure Span. Make sure to tell her Masud and Pakina sent you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(185603,0,0,'l am sorry, but I do not know how to do this fishing. Can it not wait?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(185608,0,0,'it you all insist on examining tish for this \"essenceÂ´ then the least you can do is help me catch more.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(185615,0,0,'None. I fear our assumptions are correct--itÂ´s a problem with the ley lines.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(185616,0,0,'Did you find any tomes detailing the Azure Oathstone?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(131667,4,2,'Thank... you...',14,0,33,0,0,97532,0,145091,0,'Soulbound Goliath to Player'),(131667,5,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Earthen_Pillar.blp:20|t$n is trapped in |cFFF00000|Hspell:260551|h[Soul Thorns]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,162151,0,'Soulbound Goliath to Player'),(185904,0,0,'Hope',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186126,35,0,'$n, bring me some leviathan bones! Small ones will be fine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Big Kinook'),(186175,0,0,'Our report? Hal Our report is that the rear flank is secure. You stand amidst the carnage that secured our victory.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186176,0,0,'Hunting Is abour precision. A clean kill leaves more usable material. ItÂ´s not about now many creatures. you can Kin. bur how many resources you can Dring back to your clan',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186177,0,0,'ItÂ´s done! Thank you for your assistance, all of you. IÂ´ve place a barrier around this ley line to ensure itÂ´s protected from further decay. ItÂ´s good we leaved this place before more of those gnolls descend',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186179,0,0,'1 can smell the rot on the wind.Ley lines? There is a Gleamcove deep within Brackenhide, yes. but the gnolls have made this forest thick with decay.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186739,8,0,'Me! Take care of them!',14,0,100,0,0,206965,0,0,0,''),(186739,9,0,'But... my... treasures...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(131667,4,1,'You have... released us...',14,0,33,0,0,97534,0,145093,0,'Soulbound Goliath to Player'),(186184,0,0,'You hear that voice too, donÂ´t you? ItÂ´s calling for Malygos, the previous blue dragon Aspect. WeÂ´ll fix this soon and find out what secrets the archives hold. DonÂ´t be alarmed, but my mirror images should vanish in a mo- ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186210,0,0,'I know we have faced an enemy like this before, but... I only recall flashes. Fragments.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186218,0,0,'We need to grab that dragon s attention so the Ebnon Scales can strike',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186224,0,0,'Hang in there, Hanu. YouÂ´re no good to Norukk dead. This is no time to chat. Our caravan was ambushed by gnolls. They took half my people and many left are seriously wounded',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186228,0,0,'No, Hanu! I will not lose you to Kargpaw. Our newfound friend is quite skilled. Trust in Nihill.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186274,0,0,'I have gathered the Blacktalon and we are preparing to take back the Obsidian Citadel. Your presence on this mission is most welcome. The dracthyr are formidable soldiers! reclaim.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186280,0,0,'IÂ´ll do what I can to repair any ley lines I find, and send my mirror images to keep an eye on things while IÂ´m gone.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186290,0,0,'Ohn Â´ahra, where is your song? Place the totems while I try again to commune with Ohn ahra. I am just a lowly initiate. I need your guidance! I hear nothing. IÂ´m not fit to be a mystic.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186304,0,0,'IÂ´ll join you once I deal with these proto dragons and the swath of elemental magic barraging me from the ground.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186331,0,0,'So rumors of Sabellian\'s greatness... we are excited to test our skills against one who champions his claims.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194533,0,0,'You have not shied away from your first challenge. An excellent sign.',12,0,100,1,0,210376,0,0,0,''),(186487,0,0,'Your message will be sent on the swiftest wings to the farthest reaches of the groves. Everyone must help!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186493,0,0,'The Earth-WarderÂ´s Forge created black-dragon-seared armor and weapons. A dragonkin equipped with such was a fair match for a hundred mortal soldiers. We must reignite the flames of the rorge so we can use its power again',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186509,0,0,'I will crush you to embers! My flame... flickers... On...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186511,0,0,'Choke on smoke and ash! Your end comes... soon...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186618,0,0,'Be on your guard. ThereÂ´s nothing so cunning and cruel as a Shadepaw gnoll.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186640,0,0,'Nazeralth! Good news from the outpost, I hope? We will draw their eyes above for you, Nazeralth.\r\nThat should give you some cover! We will meet you at a forward position when youÂ´ve done some good work. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186688,0,0,'IÂ´ll reinforce the wards around the tower and keep Raszageth busy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186767,0,0,'The djaradin scheme to claim the Obsidian Citadel... the black dragonflights seat of power! Enough of this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186825,0,0,'We shall return this world to its origins!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186854,0,0,'You dare defy the will of Malygos?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186940,0,0,'Go play with your birds. Shikaar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186941,0,0,'Two young Shikaar delivered some game from your travels. Bring it here. Now we must season the meat. Grab some spice from our stores... May OhnÂ´ahraÂ´s winds carry this tribute to you so you may join us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186946,0,0,'How long were we held in stasis? A very long time, by the look of our creche. Neltharion can explain what has happened. I am certain of it',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187129,0,0,'Commander! What news from the front?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187255,0,0,'Sorry, dragon bones. There ll be other rib cages to study, but only one me! I ll carry these bone fragments to our camp at the embassy. Thanks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187406,0,0,'Over here! And stay low! If even a single dragon egg is in danger, we cannot remain in the shadows.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187730,0,0,'Tell my friend what you told me. For your own safety. please donÂ´t stand too close. I am injured.. and unwell. If you insist. They came without warning. Foul, fetid gnolls.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187787,0,0,'The Maruuk have not seen such a massive conflict for generations. This war will spread across the entire plains',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187804,0,0,'Something is at the top of the rise. I will take a side route. Meet me up there!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187873,0,0,'Ah, Virag, what a pleasant surprise! And youÂ´ve made some new friends. I see. Greetings! I am Kalecgos, and I am searching for ley crystal caves. I beneve sense one nearby, and yet...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187900,0,0,'The outsider is alding the Khanam Matra!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(187990,0,0,'Ponoliak passed. Remember? Brena is chieftain now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188068,0,0,'Nokhud wants to destroy the Horn to prevent us from calling the green dragons. This might be a diversion, so we canÂ´t use all our forces to defend it. IÂ´ll confront Balakar with the khansguard and Tomul. Tigari Khan and Sansok Khan should prepare for battle with their clans. Once we find OhnÂ´ahra and call the green dragons, weÂ´ll attack Nokhudon Hold.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188106,0,0,'With this blessing. Braedalini, my people will know that you speak with my voice. Now go, quickly!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188150,0,0,'This day, you have proven yourself to the green dragontlight. It is a deed of kindness and sacrifice my people will not soon forget. Against hatred and chaos, the greatest weapon we wield is fellowship. So come, friends. Join me under the Ancient Bough.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188156,0,0,'We cannot lose any more.... I accept your offer to stand with us, Khanam Matra.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188179,0,0,'The forge lies nearby. We must work quickly, the area may not remain secure for long',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188181,0,0,'From the mystics who commune with the wind, her lightest touch. A lift. From the descendants of the matriarch, a drop of unbroken progeny. An ancient line, unforgotten. OhnÂ´ahraÂ´s spirit blesses us all. I accept your offering.I remember Teera well. You are... so much like her. I accept your offering.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188246,0,0,' Absolutely not! Try again. My first kill was quite some time ago. Nothing of it remains!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188299,0,0,'The red dragonflight wasnÂ´t ready for the surprise attack. The djaradin seem to be hoping for a tougher fight next time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188337,0,0,'A visitor!Welcome!Would you like some flowers?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(98267,11,0,'My name is Talisra. I\'m a shal\'dorai... nightborn, the first sorceress of Suramar.',12,0,100,0,0,67266,0,100089,0,''),(188344,0,0,'Where an Aspect failed, Sabellian succeeded. Despite Deathwing`s madness, despite the rage of the gronn, Sabellian and his kin survived, allowing us to achieve this moment.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188447,0,0,'Your remains will be the soll for our new future!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188601,0,0,'A bloodline... I have an Idea. Here, take this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(188652,0,0,'We obey the will of <cough> Malygos. Our Aspect warned us how dangerous <cough> your kind could be.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189022,0,0,'Come on, Wildfeather. Off to the next adventure!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189055,0,0,'I was almost proto-dragon food... How exhilaratino! Wait til Lazee hears about this aaventure!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189063,0,0,'Thanks for the save, buddy. I ll name the next cave I discover after you! Braedalini Cavern has a nice ring to it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189077,0,0,'Easy now, Wildfeather. Yer gonna need that energy soon enough!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189241,0,0,'Next question... Who was the primogenitor of the blue dragonflight?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189260,0,0,'The water that feeds into the Ruby Lifeshrine flows from the wellspring beneath Tyrhold. These sacred waters nurture the eggs in our care.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189261,0,0,'Each egg requires careful supervision to reach their full potential. We provide that care.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189262,0,0,'The blue dragonflight has endured terrible losses as of late. We must help them recover.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189322,0,0,'Soldiers of Stormwind, allow me to-- A thousand pardons, my dear spymaster, but I come bearing the tidings of the Dragon Aspects for Lord Commander Turalyon. As for the dracthyr, you have my word that they will cause no harm. They have come seeking refuge, not conflict. Hmph. Mortals...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189324,0,0,'After that long flight, I need food. Something more filling than our dusty rations from the Reach.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189386,0,0,'We come to join the almighty horde!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189593,0,0,'Where is that crate of bushfruit we were supposed to deliver?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189594,0,0,'Another scout ha gone missing.WhatÃ‚Â´s going on out there?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190014,0,0,'Great! Follow the path around the lake and meet me by the small grove ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189704,0,0,'1 hate being right all the time. I hate how insufferable you are. All. The. Time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189765,0,0,'A-hem. Duty calls! Now if you\'ll excuse me, I must be off to make a name for myself in the splendiferous Dragon Isles! ',12,0,100,0,0,202283,0,224954,0,''),(189763,0,0,'Eine Expedition zu den Dracheninseln?Klingt nach Spass!Da gibt es bestimmt viele Gipfel zu besteigen.Kommt zumende,SchÃ¼ler.Wir brechen auf !',12,0,100,0,0,202321,0,225019,0,''),(189939,0,0,'The elements obey my call... the blue dragons end today!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190155,0,0,'Cadet Sendrax is showing some real promise with her eager attitude. She will be leading her own regiment if she continues this way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190225,0,0,'Chieftain Ponoliak knows more about that kind of thing...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190226,0,0,'ThereÂ´s magic in the land everywhere! ItÂ´s in every rock, plant, animal... Why, the legend of Foxrose Fourtes goes... There once was...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190229,0,0,'What now? Lake lines? You mean rivers? What nonsense are you on about?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190235,0,0,'The order is given. Attack! Ebon Scales! Strike as one!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190269,0,0,'Stay behind me. I will endure the conduitsÂ´ flame while you grab the egg!For the Life-Binder! Now! Grab the egg! Get it to Alexstrasza! For the Flight! For... the future...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190314,0,0,'A leader is like a finely forged sword, they must be balanced, strong, and of pure metal. Though I like Wrathion, he is untempered Sabellian has been forged in fire, I belleve he is...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190563,0,0,'The djaradin were ancient foes of the dragons for a good reason. TheyÂ´re formidable fighters.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190564,0,0,'The djaradin consider the outpost a well-earned victory against their anclent foes. TheyÂ´re already talking about another raid. And another. And another.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190585,0,0,'The khansguard are the elite!Do you have what it takes?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(98267,10,0,'That will buy me some time...',12,0,100,0,0,67547,0,100282,0,''),(190771,0,0,'Thank you for your aid.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190899,0,0,'I heard rumors you were here. It is best you see the size of their defensive force for yourself. It is best vou see the size of their defensive force for yourself. So many... we do not have the forces to break through those defenses!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190932,0,0,'IÂ´ve been looking forward to this! For Balakar Khan!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190970,0,0,'Our enemies will be on the lookout for us and we cannot risk an encounter while transporting the eggs. So we shall travel as mortals do to avoid their gaze',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191126,0,0,'What are vou--Oh! ThatÂ´s a nice shine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191210,0,0,'I like your enthusiasm, but I do not think that is Aright. 1 do not think it is that sort of verse. We should think of something else.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191283,0,0,'Cross the bridge to see the Horn of Drusahl, Two-foot. It represents a pact between leera and a dragon named Merithra that ended the enmity between dragons and Maruuk. The dragons left, but after ten thousand years, they return. We are guided by OhnÂ´ahra, the Windmother, who led our founders to the plains. Her sonas advise our people, and I am interested to hear what the Khanam Matra says about the dragonsÂ´ return.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191325,0,0,'See these stone pillars? They are part of a barrier that keeps anyonefrom approaching. We must protect them, or the islandÂ´s defenses will fall',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191343,0,0,'Do you see? Those pylons empower KorolethÂ´s destructive power. If we cannot stop her, she will destroy the pillar, and the ward that protefts the Ancient Bough will fall!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191485,0,0,'The Maruuk centaur is divided into clans, four of which hold the most power. Clan Teerai is responsible for keeping traditions and their leader, the Khanam Matra, is the cultural leader of all Maruuk. Clan Shikaar is known for being the strongest hunters and can be found throughout the plains. Clan Nokhud recently came to power after defeating Clan Toghus, and Balakar Khan now leads them. Clan OhnÂ´ir feels a direct connection to their god, OhnÂ´ahra, who guided their founders to the Dragon Isles. The mystics of Clan OhnÂ´ir are initiated from different clans but all follow OhnÂ´ahraÂ´s call to serve their people. One of them shares a tale of their first kill, a mighty hornstrider, and keeps its horn as a trophy. - Thats me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191494,0,0,'No... I will not be defeated! Give me your strength, beast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191504,0,0,'Wherever those eggs go, I go. You will not return them to Alexstrasza without me. Why are we taking this ridiculous contraption, again? ItÂ´s agonizingly slow...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191685,0,0,'Thank you, VeldrOscHhat should... be.. ENOUGH! 1 thought I would be the one saving you. Dracthyr are formidable indeed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191711,0,0,'WrathionÂ´s able to make the hard choices, the ones that no one else will, all for the greater good.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191780,0,0,'Get our people out of here, Veldragosa. I will stay behind and search for survivors... and answers. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191807,0,0,'WeÂ´ll move swiftly.Dragonheart Outpost isnÂ´t far.',12,0,100,0,0,206658,0,221851,0,''),(191807,4,0,'But now,the land itself reawakens with glorious life!May we never tire of its beauty...',12,0,100,0,0,206663,0,227960,0,''),(191843,0,0,'IÂ´ll enjoy killing you. Balakar Khan will lead the centaur to.... victory.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191863,0,0,'Nozdormul Behold, the Bronze Aspect has comel',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191939,0,0,'Chief Ponollak was a great fighter. He once took a blow from a charging bruffalon for me. That would have killed a lesser man',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192091,0,0,'The Primalists are attacking! Get our defenses back up and running.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192270,0,0,'Sindragosa!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192387,0,0,'He is surprisingly stealthy. I am sure we can devise an effective strategy if we are not distracted by... The whispers... They distracted us at key mome They are quieter when you use your visage .Also, We have discovered some recordi artifice of our fatherÂ´s. He talked of a laboratory called Aberrus Sundered Flame partisan was killed by one of them. Nettharion... That must be why Sarkareth is here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192795,0,0,'The Obsidian Citadel may hold secrets of my peopleÂ´s past. I would not miss a chance to reclaim it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193287,0,0,'Welcome! I am glad you are ready to explore our wondrous isles. Our drakes are excited to take to the skies of the Dragon Isles once more, and for you to provide an extra set of eyes to help them. This is dragonriding. First you will learn how to glide with a drake and move efficiently about the peaks. Come, let us get started with some quick lessons. Call upon your drake companion, then drop off the edge while moving forward. You will glide to your destination!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193359,0,0,'Glensera oversees the Rostrum of Transformation. Talk to her about how your dragon can adapt to new. unique forms. You have already met Celormu, our resident gliding expert, but there is another here who can also teach you about your drake. Seek out Lithragosa and see what she has to say. Keep watch for our outposts, they are all over the Dragon Isles. As you explore, we will be there to aid you in your dragonriding journey!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193362,0,0,'Yes, I had expected Majordomo Selistra and Wrathion to be here by now...But I am honored to be the one to welcome you to the Dragon Isles! On my first real assignment, no less. What good fortune',12,0,100,0,0,204412,0,224985,0,''),(193371,0,0,'Ah, look who we have here!',12,0,100,0,0,204482,0,225346,0,''),(193372,0,0,'We saw the flare and assumed the worst. What is wrong, Cadet Sendrax? There was a reason for our absence. An ancient rival, the djaradin, have stirred to violence once again',12,0,100,0,0,204483,0,225347,0,''),(193393,0,0,'Welcome, honored guest! Take this guide, it shows the embassy s many amenities... if they weren t all in disrepair, that is. What a joy it is to see new signatures in the visitor log after all these years...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193450,0,0,'Apologies for my abrupt arrival. But the news I bring cannot wait for pleasantries. While you make preparations to board your vessel, I shall fly on ahead. Do try not to get seasick!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193456,0,0,'Despite some questionable methods, it is hard to deny Wrathions results. He has worked tirelessly to protect all creatures of Azeroth from numerous threats.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193637,0,0,'Chieftain Ponoliak carved that for my son, Nomurok. My son fell in Brackenhide, so... it seems only right this should return to the sea with its maker.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193757,0,0,'The old dragon who sat by the ledge? He took off a while ago and headed south',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193812,0,0,'One more set!',0,0,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Expedition Trainee - Periodic 1'),(193812,0,1,'I\'ll be ready for whatever\'s out there.',0,0,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Expedition Trainee - Periodic 2'),(193913,0,0,'Queen Alexstrasza is far more impressive than any statue you ll find in the Isles!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193917,0,0,'May this brazier once more guide every peaceful denizen of Azeroth to these shores!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194174,0,0,'What do you mean, Â´the whelplings do not want to flyÂ´ ? This should be second nature to them!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194636,0,0,'Merithra, we mean you no harm. The death of your brethren saddens our hearts as much as the death of our own kind. Balakar did this! Balakar and his clan, the Nokhud! They have shown their weakness and their cowardice by working with the Primalists. We hoped to resolve our civil war, but I now see there is only one path forward: we must vanquish them. Three clans stand with you, daughter of the Dream. Teeral. Shikaar. OhnÂ´ir. We must join you to repel the warmongers from our land.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194899,0,0,'More bloodshed it is, then. My forces will head there at once. See you in the fray, Champion!.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194902,0,0,'My sisters and I will answer MerithraÂ´s call. We will be right behind you to care for the wounded.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194903,0,0,'You heard the Champion! To battle, dragons! Do your flight proud.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194927,0,0,'Your support is welcome.Our forces are small in number.There are a few defenders among us but we are gardeners,not Fighters.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194927,1,0,'Within our gardens stands a portal to the Emerald Dream.We cannot empower our Oathstone without forces to defend our change from Primalist attacks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194936,0,0,'Is everything all right, Father?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195024,0,0,'You are awake! I am glad to see you are okay.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195032,0,0,'Someone find me a worthier opponent to butcher!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195136,0,0,'Come, little one. The Primalists have been dealt with. Our forces will make quick work of any foolish enough to linger.Without our allies, we could not have achieved this victory. Merithra is summoning their leaders to an audience. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195316,0,0,'And so, the storm begins. We cannot hear the WindmotherÂ´s song either. The storm has cast a cloud over her.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195523,0,0,'Maruukai is a sacred meeting place where Centaur from around the plains gather for the Khural, a time of truce and communion. Tigari Khan may help with deciphering an omen from the river. The final khan from Timberstep Outpost has arrived. The Nokhud are to be avoided. The Shikaar and other clans have already arrived, and the rise should be settled by the time they get there. This Khural will be memorable with the presence of an outsider and a green dragon emissary.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195899,0,0,'The ship to the Dragon Islands will leave very soon !!! Hurry if you still want to come along.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195900,0,0,'Ebon Scales! Strike as one!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195917,0,0,'This world ... is ... wrong!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(196310,0,0,'Come to the Skytop Observatory. I will introduce to others who can provide vou with information about the other wondrous things you may do with your drake!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(198079,0,0,'The Rugged Dragonscale sets sail soon! Hurry if you still want to come along!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(198401,0,0,'Welcome to our makeshift training ring. friend. I trust we are not disturbing anyone up here? I ve instructed the warders to be very careful to keep blasts of magic from falling down below. Scalecommander Azurathel would like me to meet him at the docks ? Lets go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199177,0,0,'Who is this ? This is an ancient work of magic. I sense NeltharionÂ´s handwork. This construct should have run out of essence long ago. The collectors... they are saturated with black dragon essence, far more than what you would detect in any one dragon. ItÂ´s almost as if. The symbols are conduits of power. If I understana correctly, it is drawing that power from the creches... from the dracthyr themselves. Neltharion was drawing the essence of the black dragonflight from dracthyr in stasis. This... siphon must have been empowering his dark enchantment while denying that power to the dracthyr.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199199,0,0,'Viridia is always so quick to see to others. I am glad she has someone like you present to help share her own burdens. My Dark Talons are quite self-sufficient. So long as you are aiding Viridia with her tasks, that is all we can ask. That said, Iam sure Azurathel would also appreciate a check-in. Not all dracthyr can match the might and grace of the Dark Talons.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199201,0,0,'I am Viridia, Scalecommander of the Healing Wings. We are here on a mission to help those dracthyr that were left behind and make the Reach safe for all. But we are finding ourselves stretched thin, and we need as much aid as we can muster... which is why your arrival is greatly appreciated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199204,0,0,'If Viridia has time to greet us, then things must be relatively stable for the moment. That is good. Do not worry about us. The Obsidian Warders are the finest, most well- discioned warrors mere are. <A wry look passes over AzurathelÂ´s face.> Perhaps Scalecommander Cindrethresh would benefit from your aid more than I. Just a thought.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199358,0,0,'If I die, make sure someone publishes my work. Better posthumously than never!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199401,0,0,'Only the strongest deserve to be NeltharionÂ´s heirs! What? No! Sarkareth, I will not fail you! He awaits you... in the darkness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199521,0,0,'This place, Ebyssian. It feels... familiar. I sense a great power within it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199531,0,0,'I... see. We have both lost many who were close to us. Yet there are others who may yet be saved.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199538,0,0,'Lead the way, Champion!. Here we are... at long last. Sarkareth! YouÂ´ll pay for the dracthyr blood youÂ´ve spilled! I remember this place. Neltharion told us it would hone our minds.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199539,0,0,'Here, we culled the weak from our ranks. The unworthy perished. The Earth Warder had the strength to see his vision made manifest. I will claim that strength and use it to lead our people to victory! You do not seek to lead.\r\nYou seek to dominate. Just like Neltharion before you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199851,0,0,'Those massive djaradin...they are beyond anything we encountered in the Waking Shores. Look there! That one appears to still be slumbering. Wait. Do you sense it? That flame infusing the lava...Is it...Shadowflame. The poison that drove Neltharion to madness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199852,0,0,'Let us see what they are guarding... Those are djaradin elders. Not just dragonslayers, but slayers of entire bloodlines. And the Primalists are awakening her. We must stop them. Quickly. We must end this. The corruption cannot be allowed to spread. Champion! Let us make our way to the empty shrine below.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199862,0,0,'He--He caught my arm with shadowflame. It was on his BREATH, Ebyssian! He was consuming-â€¢ ARRRG! It burns! It speaks! My well-being is of no concern right now! Fyrakk is the only thing you should- Arrrrinnng-â€¢ Fine. Only so that I may help you in our coming battle.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199863,0,0,'I saw! I know! Let us tend to your wounds, then we can talk about defeating this monster. You are my brother. I will not trade your life for FyrakkÂ´s, nor for anything.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199876,0,0,'Hush. Save your strength. It is my turn to tend to your wounds. You cannot just... rip their spears out. The barbs... hook behind our scales. I can heat the metal to soften the spearhead. Let-- ugh. Let me gather my strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199877,0,0,'You must... remove it quickly... I need to-- to... Sabellian, I--I am sorry... I tried to save us but-- I hesitated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199951,0,0,'Has Fyrakk always been that huge? He looks bigger than when we last fought. 1 believe he is growing more powerful as he absorbs the energy of the caldera.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199952,0,0,'Then it is imperative to strike now before he grows beyond us. Champion, you have dealt with monsters like this; you know this to be true. The black dragonflight will never allow another shadow-spawned monstrosity to arise!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199963,0,0,'Please. I consider myself to be an enterprising opportunist! I prefer the word\r\n\"resurrectionist. I deal in redemption. And I look forward to... redeeming... the bodies of you and your friends.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199964,0,0,'I will keep an eye on him while you figure out a way to bring down the shield! We must stop him! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199965,0,0,'Follow the dark whispers if you must, but do not drag our people down with you. Let them make their own choice! I believe in my flight. They will unite for a good cause.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200040,0,0,'Nice to have you along with us,Champion!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200046,0,0,'Before we enter this conflict, we must gather any information and resources available to us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200049,0,0,'*1... donÂ´t want to interrupt your reunion, but... Diibuck, we must get to the vault. The rest of you should go back to Loamm where itÂ´s safer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200051,0,0,'Put your weapons down! This ones friendly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200074,0,0,'What? Between large snails, poisonous moths, and the Sundered Flame, I think I rather stay with you, thank you very much! Besides, who are you that you think you are in charge? Pfft, right... Oh... you really are them? I uhh... I mean, no offense, but I thought you would be bigger... or meaner-looking. You know, dragons... dracthyr.  I mean, youÂ´ve got the tauren thing down. You look like one, smell like one and... I should just stop right here. But! If you are heading to the titan vault, then IÂ´m the person you want on your team! Of course! I know a lot about the titans! and Tubes over here? He knows a lot about it too! Yeah, no pressure or anything.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200080,0,0,'So long as we do not run headlong into danger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200081,0,0,'Ebyssian, let us scout the caldera while Nihill handles the djaradin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200085,0,0,'Stop wasting time, Wration! The giant hole bored through bedrock should be our primary concern while Ebyssian forces us to wait.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200101,0,0,'Ebyssian! What a joy to see you again so soon. Color me intrigued. Is this about Aberrus? Yes, of course... We must secure Aberrus. But I fear what I will see inside. You are right. Annoyingly, you usually are. Rest assured the Blacktalon--and my talons-- will be where you need them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200116,0,0,'YouÂ´re an uplander arenÂ´t ya? YouÂ´ve gotten yourself into quite the bind. Would vou like some help? Lead to your companions? ShouldnÂ´t be a problem. They may be out of sight, but very little escapes this nose.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200179,0,0,'l am no coward like you. I will embrace the power avallable to me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200265,0,0,'I think weÂ´re the first to visit these vaults in a long while',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200403,0,0,'Well met, Damos. ItÂ´s good to see an old friend. WeÂ´re going back into the Reach. That place was our prison for ten thousand years. ItÂ´s time we made it our home. Talon Damos will be my second-in-command for this mission. HeÂ´s a fine soldier. One of the best.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200558,0,0,'That Viridia! Always fretting over others before herself. You can tell her we are doing just fine. The people of Morqut have always been a hardy sort. Now that weÂ´ve returned to the Reach.WeÂ´re so excited to welcome all sorts of new interesting people With luck, weÂ´ll also be able to hear more new and interesting stories!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200562,0,0,'Oh, thatÂ´s very nice of her to ask! I believe, however, we are all set here. We began our preparations the moment Viridia extended her invitation. IsnÂ´t it something? Centaur, tuskarr, mortals. and dragons all united towards a commoncause. These islands are more than a unique opportunity for us as individuals. They are a chance to strengthen our bonds as a united community. our home is better than ever!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200590,0,0,'I do not wish to be the harbinger of bad news, but Sundered Flame soldiers are patrolling the Reach.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200903,0,0,'Giant boat eating crabs! IÂ´ll take the safe sands of VolÂ´ dun any day.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200951,0,0,'Next time, IÂ´m driving the boat... This is most embarrassing for both of you, but it makes for great photographs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200952,0,0,'Well, we finally found the one situation I didnÂ´t prepare for.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201025,0,0,'What they say ? \"Our Elder was taken from us by the dragons long ago. Imprisoned in Aberrus, they await. But the djaradin have not forgotten, and we will soon breach that prison and free them.\" ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201026,0,0,'YouÂ´re in luck. I recently came into possession of many... incendiary devices. IÂ´ll send them along.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201039,0,0,'These pirates know no decency, they are here just to loot and plunder.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201180,0,0,'More photos... wait for me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201232,0,0,'The Plan ? Keep low. We have not been spotted- Wrathion no! You are just going to-â€¢',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201236,0,0,'A titan expert, hmm? Perhaps we could use your expertise. Patience, Emberthal. I am sure that Rannan can figure it out soon enough.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201281,0,0,'I must recruit Emberthal to our quest. Wait for me at the entrance. I made a promise to her... That we would assist each other in our pursuits.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201366,0,0,'The niffen saw an eruption of fire in the cavern you came from. Was that Fyrakk? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201544,0,0,'Hello, nice to see you again. I went to Valdrakken to find Ebyssian, but it turns out he had already left, so I came here for the view instead. Do you want to stay a while?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201564,0,0,'Veritistrasz, have a look at this. It is a small ball, with 3 divots in it. They are clearly intended for small claws, likely drake sized? What is it? Some arcane creation of Neltharion? A long lost item of Titanic significance?! Waitâ€¦.. The game they are starting to play in AlgethÂ´ar Academy? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201580,0,0,'I usually prefer the stealthy approach as well, but now is the time to let dragons be dragons! Remind these weaklings who they with! Going to terrify them? Make them revaluate their life choices? Agreed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201581,0,0,'Place the cores around the foter. We will use them to contain the shadowflame as we draw it out of SabellianÂ´s wound. 1 will need your help. Zatech. Please, when you are ready, I will channel through us both. It is done. I have purged it from you. You are free.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201584,0,0,'Mmmm... weÂ´ll be eating good tonight. Young man, would you help an elder carry this ton of meat to her wagon just outside the nests?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201587,0,0,'Niff... Niff... Come over here ! WeÂ´ve got him! HeÂ´s stuck .. in ?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201589,0,0,'This certainly looks like one of fatherÂ´s gadgets... Wait, Champion! Before you go, I feel I must.. apologize. My temper got the best of me a moment ago. In truth. I reminded myself of my father in that moment. But that is not who I am.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201619,0,0,'We must get to the vault. The rest of you should go back to Loamm where itÂ´s safer.I am Scalecommander Emberthal, and this is... Ebyssian Team? Well, if you are staying, keep close to me. I donÂ´t want any harm to come to you.  I thought you said you were an expert.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201646,0,0,'It is fortunate that this elder still slumbers. The size of that spear beside her...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202451,0,0,'Ooh. I am definitely getting too old to do this solo. LetÂ´s take a breath and regroup',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202467,0,0,'Hey howdy, uplander! IÂ´m the main mole when it comes to zoominÂ´ around ten thousand leagues under the sun lands!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202468,0,0,'Almost as exciting as when we first hired the drogbar to help with guarding the town!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202599,0,0,'Why would the Sundered Flame defile their own heritage? What are they after?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202601,0,0,'The composition of this stonework is fascinating. Almost like it originated from deep below the earth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202602,0,0,'We must preserve this place! The layout is highly ceremonial. The turrets, the winding terraces... What does it all mean?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202603,0,0,'DonÂ´t get blood on these tiles! They date from before the Sundering!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202694,0,0,'Get me out of these blasted crystals! They are blocking my ability to transform! I normally do not fall prey to such creatures!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202743,0,0,'Fantastic! I needed to blow off some steam.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202766,0,0,'1 got your payment around here somewhere. One sec... No, no This one! Right... ? Oh, of course! I left them under my bed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202773,0,0,'He is surprisingly stealthy. I am sure we can devise an effective strategy if we are not distracted by... The whispers... They distracted us at key mome They are quieter when you use your visage .Also, We have discovered some recordi artifice of our fatherÂ´s. He talked of a laboratory called Aberrus Sundered Flame partisan was killed by one of them. Nettharion... That must be why Sarkareth is here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202775,0,0,'A dead Sundered Flame was in those nests? It never ends, does it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202788,0,0,'Champion! Yours is a most welcome face. Are these dragons with you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202873,0,0,'IÂ´m not leaving Brynnsahce here, I wonÂ´t--',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(202959,0,0,'SabellianÂ´s attack failed. Fyrakk emerged from the lava pool in a blaze of shadowflame and shattered the magic imprisoning lgira. Ebysslan raised the earth Itself to shield you from FyrakkÂ´s shadowflame.\r\nEbyssian then grabbed you and Sabellian and flew you out of the caldera. Fyrakk ordered Igira to stop you. She threw her massive spear at Ã‰byssian, puncturing his side. Ebyssian crash-landed just outside the caldera, alive but very injured.\r\nAssuming you were dead, Fyrakk flew away towards Loamm, burning everything in his path',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(203111,0,0,'Thank you for coming. The strong elemental presence here surprised us',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(203120,0,0,'Now that the storms have lifted, these naga are swarming ashore and pillaging the ruins!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(203904,0,0,'I do not know what Sarkareth is planning, but it cannot be anything good... Stop this. Sarkareth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(204057,0,0,'The Flame we can handle. What it would seem they are after, perhaps not so much.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(204200,0,0,'Someone fed Gumm rock candy again. IÂ´d pay ya for your goods, but the little dirt digger stole my crystal pouch.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(204254,0,0,'Welcome! Lots Â´o uplanders been coming lately. Darn exciting, if you ask me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(204300,0,0,'It was a team effort! Something you are incapable of understanding!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(204624,0,0,'Fine, take it! That crystal donÂ´ even smell like anything anyway.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(204650,0,0,'Perfect timing, Brynn! My trainee here needs a suitable sparring partner. IÂ´ll pay you for the goods after. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(204651,0,0,'Use any weapons you need to, bud!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(205658,0,0,'What? Between large snails, poisonous moths, and the Sundered Flame, I think I rather stay with you, thank you very much! Besides, who are you that you think you are in charge? Pfft, right... Oh... you really are them? I uhh... I mean, no offense, but I thought you would be bigger... or meaner-looking. You know, dragons... dracthyr.  I mean, youÂ´ve got the tauren thing down. You look like one, smell like one and... I should just stop right here. But! If you are heading to the titan vault, then IÂ´m the person you want on your team! Of course! I know a lot about the titans! and Tubes over here? He knows a lot about it too! Yeah, no pressure or anything.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(215316,0,0,'Thank God! Look, there are reinforcements on the way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(194927,2,0,'Merithra hopes that the Khanam Matra upholds her ancestorsÃ‚Â´pact to aid us in this time of need.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193586,0,0,'I have urgent news from Healer Selbekh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193586,1,0,'Taivan,Selbekh has ordered you stay put with tevatei.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193586,2,0,'She said doesnÃ‚Â´t want him getting in the way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(98267,12,0,'My people made a terrible deal that doomed this world to destruction.',12,0,100,0,0,67267,0,100091,0,''),(98267,13,0,'Time is running out. The magic contained in this message will bring you to me.',12,0,100,0,0,67268,0,100094,0,''),(98267,14,0,'Hurry. You are Suramar\'s last hope.',12,0,100,0,0,67269,0,100096,0,''),(98267,0,0,'IthÃ‚Â´el kanesh!',12,0,100,0,0,67270,0,100256,0,''),(98267,1,0,'Make haste for Suramar. You may be our last hope.',12,0,100,0,0,67269,0,100096,0,''),(98267,2,0,'I hope someone out there is listening...',12,0,100,0,0,67540,0,100262,0,''),(98267,3,0,'%s winces in pain and holds her side.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,100097,0,''),(98267,4,0,'Ngh... need to keep moving.',12,0,100,0,0,67541,0,100265,0,''),(98267,5,0,'Rath!',12,0,100,0,0,67542,0,100916,0,''),(98267,6,0,'Withered... I must be getting close.',12,0,100,0,0,67543,0,100268,0,''),(98267,7,0,'Rath-domaas!',12,0,100,0,0,67544,0,100002,0,''),(98267,8,0,'Stand down, Erasmus! Can you not see that Elisande has forsaken us?!',12,0,100,5,0,67545,0,100279,0,''),(98267,9,0,'An\'ah!',12,0,100,0,0,67546,0,100915,0,''),(190025,0,0,'I had to act!I feel better than ever.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(185179,0,0,'Between gossip amongst the clans at the Khural and news from my mother,the Khanam Mattra.I have a good sense of how my people feel,If you ever wish to know your standing with the Maruuk,come to me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(196707,0,0,'Im the quartermaster for the Maruuk. If you prove useful to us then maybe I can supply you with some of our goods. Well see. Dont get any big ideas.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181198,2,0,'We must assume the Nokhud want to destroy the Horn to prevent us from calling the green dragons.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181198,3,0,'Sasok is correct.This may be a diversion.We cannot commit all of our forces,even if is to defend our most sacred artifact.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181198,4,0,'I will take khansguard and confront Balakar myself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181198,5,0,'Tomul,Sipder,you will come with me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181198,6,0,'Tigari Khan,Sansok Khan,gather your clans and prepare for battle.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181198,7,0,'Once OhnÃ‚Â´ahra has been found and the green dragons have been called,we will march on Nohudon Hold.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192353,0,0,'Honored Khans!We have spotted a warband of Nokhud headed toward the Horn of Drusahl.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192353,1,0,'Balakar is leading them himself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192353,2,0,'Enough to overwhelm the village at the base of hill,but far from all their forces.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192353,3,0,'No,not yet.We are still looking for them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195546,0,0,'How large is the warband?We should be wary.This might be a diversion.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(181215,0,0,'What of Koroleth?Have you seen her or OhnÃ‚Â´ahra?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195136,1,0,'Without our allies,we could not have achieved this victory.Merithra is summong their leaders to an audience.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195136,2,0,'She asked for you as well,dracthyr.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195545,2,0,'Absoluely not!Try again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195545,1,0,'My first kill was quite some time ago.Nothing of it remains.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195545,0,0,'Yes,that makes sense.After their first hunt,a young hunter of our clan receives a ceremonial spear.Take mine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191156,0,0,'I like your enthusiasm,but i do not think that is right.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,