f crafters and gatherers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(192674,9,0,'That should do it.Take a look at your new equipment!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201517,0,0,'Do not mind me friends. Nothing to see here. I grew up in Outland, and I was not involved in any Deathwing related activities.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Voraxian'),(201517,1,0,'I do not see your friend here. I will leave and catch up once you find out where they went.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Voraxian'),(201517,2,0,'I will meet you at the Ruby Lifeshrine. Please be swift, I do not want to be there long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Voraxian'),(103155,5,0,'In the depths of the earth flow rivers of primitive secret magic. The lines of force are immutable and eternal, they are uncontrollable.',12,0,100,0,0,67251,0,105909,0,''),(103155,6,0,'However, their strength can be extracted, just like a thread from a piece of fabric.',12,0,100,0,0,67252,0,105911,0,''),(103155,7,0,'This channel stretches from the Anor lowlands. There are others that are still inactive.',12,0,100,0,0,67253,0,105930,0,''),(103155,8,0,'They need to be restored so that Shal\'Aran becomes the focus of power.',12,0,100,0,0,67254,0,105931,0,''),(132035,0,0,'Come on! Fal\'dorai dwell in the ruins below us.',12,0,100,0,0,67260,0,112920,0,''),(132035,1,0,'Jump down into the water.',12,0,100,0,0,67261,0,112921,0,''),(132035,2,0,'Hurry, plant the seed!',12,0,100,0,0,67526,0,113688,0,''),(132035,3,0,'Here it will be able to be powered by a power line.',12,0,100,0,0,67526,0,113689,0,''),(162103,0,0,'Let us begin.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Executor Tarvold'),(162102,0,0,'How dare you interrupt my research!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grand Proctor Beryllia'),(162133,2,0,'Wretched mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'General Kaal'),(162133,0,0,'None have ever escaped the Sanguine Depths, and neither will you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'General Kaal'),(162133,1,0,'Guards! Slay them all!',6,0,100,0,0,157652,0,0,0,'General Kaal'),(181198,8,0,'Unfortunately I cannot help you.Despite BalakarÃ‚Â´s death,the Nokhud are still a thorn in our side.Most of the plains is contested territory and my forces are stretched thin.Perhaps Sansok Khan can offer some aid.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(195543,0,0,'I know nothing of your missing friends,but Tomul might.She has led our scouting efforts and would best be able to aid you.Tell her that she is to assist you in this matter with whatever you need.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191485,1,0,'We have our hands full with these Nokhud hit and run raids,but if the khan commands it,then I will help.Let me gather some scouting reports.I will meet you and your friends outside the city.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(37596,0,0,'The Argent Crusade and the Knights of the Ebon Blade have assaulted the gates of the Icecrown Citadel and are preparing for a massive attack upon the Scourge. Our mission is a bit more subtle, but equally as important.',12,0,100,0,0,17038,0,37380,2,'sylvanas SAY_INTRO_1'),(202740,0,0,'BovanÂ´s visions led us to this forsaken place.Why?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200700,0,0,'My husband is.... gone.My Gaughter will grow up without a father because of the centaur.Just as I did.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200699,0,0,'This axe belonged to my friend Nawa.She would never willingly part with it.If you did not see a body,then chances are she may yet live.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200698,0,0,'This necklace belongs to Bovan!I would lead a search party if i could,but we are in no condition to leave the village.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200933,0,0,'This is ridiculous!the centaur in this outpost are my clansmen.They are not about to do anything to you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200932,0,0,'I will not enter a centaur outpost unless it is to do battle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(200983,0,0,'The centaur are interrogating us for information!But we donÂ´t know anything!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199409,0,0,'Place the items in the incense burner,Nihill,then step back.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199409,1,0,'Oh OhnÂ´ahra,grant us your aid!Show us where we may find Bovan Windtotem!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(199409,2,0,'Tomul,wait!DonÂ´t go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201424,0,0,'Bovan!He looks badly hurt....who is that centaur with him?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201424,1,0,'There is no time!Did you not see Bovan?We must reach him now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201424,2,0,'We can make our way in undetected!I have a few potions that will mask our presence.We have no time to find aid--we must go now or Bovan will die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201424,3,0,'So this is how aid me?By fleeing at the first oppotunity?Tagar was right!Your words are worth nothing--go then,coward!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201425,0,0,'I was afraid of this.His name is Jamoku.He is a powerful Nokud,an ally of the Primalists who leads a large army.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201425,1,0,'It means your friend is in Nokhudon Hold.This mission has now become too dangerous for just us to handle.I must speak with Sansok Khan.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201425,2,0,'That place is the seat of JamokuÂ´s power.We cannot rescue your friend alone against an army!It would be foolish to even try!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201425,3,0,'Even with those potions,the Nokhud wardogs will sniff us out in a second!I will not throw my life away for a lost cause!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201425,4,0,'Fine!If you truly insist on getting yourself killed,I will not stop you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(47442,0,0,'Johnny the Awesome has arrived, a Philistine. Give me your stupid tasks, which I will do purely out of pure enthusiasm, despising all your instructions regarding orientation on the terrain, because my map is rather arbitrary.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(106173,1,0,'Does she want to continue to impose her ideas on me? Well, let\'s go.',12,0,100,0,0,67236,0,116442,0,''),(106173,0,0,'I donâ€™t want to hear any more about your machinations! You endanger all of our father\'s work!',12,0,100,274,0,67502,0,109088,0,''),(188247,0,0,'brush 