und of trap snaps!',14,0,100,0,0,203440,0,0,0,'Gutshot'),(186116,7,0,'Come, cubs! FEEDING TIME!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gutshot'),(186116,8,0,'Rip them apart, beast!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gutshot'),(186121,4,0,'Rot and die!',14,0,100,0,0,203448,0,0,0,'Decatriarch Wratheye'),(186121,5,0,'NO! I will not lose more! The rot will come for you! And I... I will claim your withered bones... your homes... Everything!',14,0,100,0,0,203451,0,0,0,'Decatriarch Wratheye'),(186121,6,0,'This power obeys ME!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Decatriarch Wratheye'),(186121,7,0,'Choke and wither!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Decatriarch Wratheye'),(186121,8,0,'NO! I will not lose more! The rot will come for you! And I... I will claim your withered bones... your homes... Everything!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Decatriarch Wratheye'),(99398,0,0,'Welcome, $n. I\'m glad you received my message.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,100999,0,''),(99427,0,0,'Thank you both for meeting me in such an inhospitable location.I assure you that if I were able to join you in Dalaran,I would.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99427,1,0,'Precisely why IÂ´m here.If I canÂ´t return to my former position,then perhaps the council will at least consider restoring my access to the city.As a show of good faith.I have information to offer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99427,2,0,'You have my thanks,friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99427,3,0,'I once knew Lyandra Sunstrider,a distant relative of King Anasterian.Through she bore the Sunstrider name,in truth her branch of the family held no claim to the throne.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99427,4,0,'After KaelÂ´thasÂ´s betrayal,she became obsessed with finding FeloÂ´melorn to claim it for her own.I told her it was a foolÂ´s errand,that sheÂ´d never find the relic.Indeed,it has been many years since I last heard from her.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99427,5,0,'But with the LegionÂ´s coming,I decided to begin my own search for the location of the blade.I saw a vision of Lyandra with the weapon in hand.Around her the land was covered in ice,and an all-too-familiar fortress loomed behind her.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99427,6,0,'Indeed I do.And nothing happens in that citadel unless its master wills it.I would not be surprised to learn he had a hand in this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99398,1,0,'The wounds inficted by the Divine Bell incident run deep,Aethas.Others in the council are not as forgiving as I.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99398,2,0,'I will bring your case before the others...but I cannot promise the outcome will be in your favor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(99398,3,0,'Icecrown.You believe youÂ´ll find her there?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(45051,0,0,'I have not always been the Banshee Queen, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45201,0,''),(45051,1,0,'And my people have not always been the Forsaken.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45202,0,''),(45051,2,0,'Long ago this land comprised the northern kingdoms of Lordaeron, ruled by King Terenas Menethil.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45203,0,''),(45051,3,0,'Terenas had a son named Arthas.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45204,0,''),(45051,4,0,'Arthas... even saying his name makes my body quiver in rage.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45205,0,''),(45051,5,0,'This man-child, Arthas, took for himself a cursed blade known as Frostmourne.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45206,0,''),(45051,6,0,'Through Frostmourne, Arthas killed his own father and razed this land along with every living creature in it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45207,0,''),(45051,7,0,'My own death came at the hands of Arthas when he and his armies sacked my homeland, Quel\'Thalas, and murdered my people.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45208,0,''),(45051,8,0,'In his vast cruelty, Arthas severed my spirit from my body and raised me as a banshee to serve in his Scourge army.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45209,0,''),(45051,9,0,'A similar fate befell all that would die to the Scourge war machine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45210,0,''),(45051,10,0,'In death, they were reborn as mindless undead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45217,0,''),(45051,11,0,'But Arthas was not invincible! With each passing day his power waned - his grip over the will of the damned loosening.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45218,0,''),(45051,12,0,'It was when Arthas was at his weakest that I struck!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45219,0,''),(45051,13,0,'And though the hour of his atonement had come, the worm managed to escape his fate, returning to the frozen wastes of Northrend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45220,0,''),(45051,14,0,'With Arthas gone, so too was the control he held over the undead masses of Lordaeron. After recovering my body, I freed the remaining Scourge that were left behind.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45221,0,''),(45051,15,0,'From the cruelty and mercilessness of Arthas, the man who would be the Lich King, the Forsaken were born.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45222,0,''),(45051,16,0,'Our goal... Our sole purpose was to destroy the Lich King. We threw our lot in with the Horde and began our journey towards redemption.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45223,0,''),(45051,17,0,'Now the Lich King is dead and we have returned. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45224,0,''),(45051,18,0,'The people who called this land their home in life, do so in death as well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45225,0,''),(45051,19,0,'But the Alliance does not recognize our rights. They claim this land is their own while attempting to invalidate the claims of the founders of this kingdom.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45226,0,''),(45051,20,0,'I will never allow it... Never!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45227,0,''),(45051,21,0,'Lordaeron belongs to the Forsaken - always and forever.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45228,0,''),(132661,2,0,'Blood trolls surge across our nothern border.Dey drag our people off de swamps of Nazmir,never to be seen again.',12,0,100,0,0,102085,0,0,0,''),(132661,3,0,'Meanwhile,de Zanchuli Council,scheming politicians and decrepit old tusks,dismisses dis threat.Dey convince my father dat nothing need be done.',12,0,100,0,0,102086,0,0,0,''),(193170,0,0,'%s is being empowered by the Dreamsurge!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fulgurb'),(186766,2,0,'We\'ll remember you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captive Tuskarr'),(186766