,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vazallia'),(188140,0,0,'The advancing lava forces the existing wildlife to flee, but the proto-drakes move in and thrive.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Vazallia'),(39665,8,0,'Rom\'ogg sorry...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rom\'ogg Bonecrusher'),(39670,3,0,'Raz... Tired...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Raz the Crazed'),(43875,1,0,'The winds take me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Asaad'),(187266,1,0,'Grah!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Time-Lost Chieftain'),(195322,1,0,'Grah!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Qu\'ruk the Time-Lost'),(188948,3,0,'Should have run...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Embertooth Harvester'),(192700,0,0,'Outsiders are not permitted!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(186126,46,0,'Now, we need to add cream. $n, bring me a bucket of orca milk!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Big Kinook'),(186126,47,0,'I hear Head Chef Stacks brought some Westfall Stew today! $n, could you go pick some up for me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Big Kinook'),(186126,48,0,'That\'s it! Soup\'s done! COME AND GET IT!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Big Kinook'),(187600,0,0,'It is... not over.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Qalashi Stonemender'),(188693,2,0,'A fine trophy... I will... make.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Boneshaper Jardak'),(192474,6,0,'Whatever the deal between the two, it cannot mean good tidings for the rest of us.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zepharion'),(188158,3,0,'I shall continue my survey, perhaps there is more I can learn.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Baskilan'),(45228,0,0,'Ready then? Let\'s get a move on! Try and keep up, $n.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,45386,0,'Master Forteski'),(45228,1,0,'Onward, brothers and sisters!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,45387,0,'Master Forteski'),(45228,2,0,'What\'s this then?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,45388,0,'Master Forteski'),(45228,3,0,'BOMB! IT\'S A TRAP! RUN!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,45391,0,'Master Forteski'),(45228,4,0,'Remember this day as the day that Forteski saved your hide. Now run! Get back to Sylvanas!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,45394,0,'Master Forteski'),(45236,0,0,'Your doom!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,45389,0,'Packleader Ivar Bloodfang'),(43950,5,0,'You\'ve got a lot to make up for, Jitters. I won\'t give you the easy way out.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44297,0,''),(43950,4,0,'Every speck of suffering in my life is YOUR PATHETIC FAULT! I SHOULD KILL YOU!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,44295,0,''),(43950,3,0,'You brought the worgen to Duskwood! You led the Dark Riders to my farm, and hid while they murdered my family!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44294,0,''),(43950,2,0,'I remember now... it\'s all your fault!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44293,0,''),(43950,1,0,'JITTERS!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,44292,0,''),(43950,0,0,'Jitters...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44291,0,''),(43730,0,0,'Here we go...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44300,0,''),(43730,1,0,'It\'s working. Hold him still, Jitters.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44288,0,''),(43730,2,0,'Damn it, Jitters, I said HOLD!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44290,0,''),(43730,3,0,'Letting him go is the only thing that\'s going to separate you from the beasts now, my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44296,0,''),(288,0,0,'I... I can\'t...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44289,0,''),(41578,4,0,'Frostmane Raiders! Anxiety!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,41523,0,''),(45525,0,0,'Rise, Lord Vincent Godfrey. Be reborn as an instrument of my vengeance!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45740,0,''),(45525,1,0,'You live to serve me, Godfrey. Together we will crush the worgen uprising and retake Gilneas for the Forsaken.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45742,0,''),(45525,2,0,'Yes, of course...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45744,0,''),(45525,3,0,'Prepare your men. The Gilneas Liberation Front amasses at the Greymane Wall. Soon their reinforcements from Stormwind will arrive. We haven\'t a minute to waste.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45748,0,''),(45525,4,0,'Armor, weapons, whatever you may need, you will find at the supply depot behind me. Go now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45750,0,''),(45525,5,0,'Once again you have impressed me, $n. Without your aid, we would have not made it this far. Walk with me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45751,0,''),(44369,0,0,'I live again...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45741,0,''),(44369,1,0,'The irony of what I have become is not lost upon me, Lady Sylvanas.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45745,0,''),(44369,2,0,'Though as I have always said, better dead than worgen.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45746,0,''),(44369,3,0,'Or in this case, better undead than worgen.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45747,0,''),(44369,4,0,'As you wish, Banshee Queen.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45749,0,''),(132706,0,0,'I have a bad feeling about all dis...',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,0,0,''),(132706,1,0,'Zeb\'ahari is overrun!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,''),(132706,2,0,'Dey are here to kill de king!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(132717,0,0,'I am getting out of here!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,0,0,''),(132717,1,0,'I will go to de king!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133175,1,0,'Zul has foreseen your death!',12,0,100,0,0,99002,0,0,0,''),(133175,0,0,'You will see... how it ends...',12,0,100,0,0,99000,0,0,0,''),(132717,2,0,'Dis is not good!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133175,2,0,'Is this... what he... foresaw?',12,0,100,0,0,99002,0,0,0,''),(124063,0,0,'He is clinging to life, but only just. This wound refuses to close.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(133175,3,0,'In Zul\'s name, die!',12,0,100,0,0,99004,0,0,0,''),(114323,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_TWILIGHTFLAMEBREATH.BLP:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:227573|h[Guardian\'s Breath]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,124841,2,'Guarm to Player'),(43245,0,0,'Curse Master Jin\'do! It\'s been a long time since I\'ve seen this mask.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43362,0,''),(43245,1,0,'What brings you to my part of Stranglethorn Vale? I\'m not used to hosting guests from Zul\'Gurub.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43363,0,''),(43245,2,0,'What a disgrace... But that doesn\'t concern the old outcast Zanzil.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43366,0,''),(43245,3,0,'A friend? You were among those who spat and threw stones at me, Jin\'do. However, as the saying goes, whoever remembers the old is out of sight, right?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43369,0,''),(43245,4,0,'So you need Zanzil\'s help? Ok. See you in Zul\'Gurub... buddy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43370,0,''),(43246,0,0,'You are well aware of what I am doing here, Zanzil.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43364,0,''),(43246,1,0,'The Gurubashes are going through hard times. I\'m alive, and Mandokir is back... But the others are gone.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43365,0,''),(43246,2,0,'Well, Zanzil, I want to put this responsibility on you. I have obtained the bodies of High Priestess Jeklik and High Priest Venoxis.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43367,0,''),(43246,3,0,'I remember what these elixirs of yours are capable of. But will they help one old friend?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43368,0,''),(166980,25,0,'In here! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,26,0,'Indeed. And one of their tormentors--and ours--is Sylvanas Windrunner. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,24,0,'If theres a way out of the Maw, then there has to be a way back in. We will return for her. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,23,0,'Ive hidden inside this cave before. We cant stay long, but it should buy us a little time. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,22,0,'Ive had enough of your cages, fiend! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,21,0,'I wish we had more time for you to recover, but we need to move. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,20,0,'I was beginning to lose hope that Id see anyone from our world again. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,19,0,'I sense tendrils of magic tethering this rune to the tower. It should take us there. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,18,0,'I left some mirror images behind to keep them distracted. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,17,0,'I dont think the stone is responding to us. I think its responding to <name>.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,16,0,'I caught glimpses of Baine and Anduin during my attempts to break free. They live... thats all I know for certain. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,14,0,'I can make us invisible again. Give me a moment. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,15,0,'I can scarcely imagine the horrors such spirits have endured. I fear theres nothing left of them to save. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,13,0,'Hold the line! The waystone must finish charging! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,11,0,'Hold here. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,12,0,'Hold on, Baine! Do not let the Jailer take you! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,10,0,'Here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,9,0,'He has personally overseen our... treatment here. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,8,0,'Ebon Blade forces are positioned nearby. They will defend you! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,7,0,'Denizens call this realm \"the Maw.\" From what I have gathered, it was intended as a prison for the most foul, irredeemable souls that ever existed. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,6,0,'Careful. These eyes can see through my spell. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,5,0,'But I have found no means of leaving the Maw. I can only manage to teleport short distances. This nightmare feels... inescapable. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,4,0,'Anduin! How badly are you hurt? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,3,0,'All set. Lets get moving. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,2,0,'Agreed, but we have no idea how to find her. We will do our best, but this waystone may be our only means of escape. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,1,0,'\"Wretched\"? I heard you were soundly beaten by a force of \"wretched\" champions, witch! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,0,0,'What is this madness? ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,60,0,'Whatever this Jailer and the Banshee are planning, it wont end well... for any of us. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,61,0,'When the Jailer realizes our plan, hell send all his forces against us. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,62,0,'When you first arrived, I wasnt sure if you were even real... or if you were just another illusion meant to torment us. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(166980,63,0,'Youre troubled, Thrall. What is it? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Jaina Proudmoore'),(201575,19,0,'We have you pinned, Sarkareth! End this madness before more of your soldiers die. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,18,0,'Their ranks are broken! We have won! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,17,0,'The djaradin are scaling the walls! Champions, form ranks! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,16,0,'Shore up our flanks! I dont want any surprises from the Sundered Flame. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,15,0,'Secure our perimeter! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,14,0,'Name it, and I will see it removed. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,12,0,'I will not yield any ground. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,13,0,'Is this the fate of all who pursue this legacy? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,11,0,'I have been battle tested and hardened from years of battle against Gruul and his offspring.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,9,0,'I cannot... move... ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,10,0,'I do. It is nearly overwhelming. Thankfully, our champions seem unaffected. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,8,0,'I bring the future generation of a new, uncorrupted black dragonflight. Surely youll aid us in our efforts to settle here on Azeroth. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,7,0,'I believe our goals to be aligned, friend. I would be honored to have your continued support in our efforts to secure the citadel. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,6,0,'How did this elder get past our lines? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,5,0,'He means to flood the chamber with magma! Wrathion, we must hold it back. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,4,0,'Father?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,3,0,'Does Sarkareth wield some power that can tear at our minds? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,2,0,'Djaradin continue to threaten our position here. The black dragonflight welcomes your help in repelling these attackers. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,1,0,'Bring me a key as well, <name>. Together we shall restore the black dragon flight to glory.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,0,0,'All the more reason to stop Sarkareth now. He must not be allowed to claim whatever power still lurks here. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,20,0,'What do you mean? Where is Sarkareth? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,21,0,'Wrathion, I am beginning to question the wisdom of all of this. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,22,0,'Wrathion, I will take a contingent down these halls and root out Sarkareth. You take the other path and see what you can find. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,23,0,'You expect me to... I will not. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(201575,24,0,'You were draining this djaradin for your experiments? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sabellian'),(34749,0,0,'C\'mon mates! Take the ship and give no quarter!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35072,0,''),(34749,1,0,'Right, Cuthbert should be below decks. Come with me, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35073,0,''),(34749,2,0,'There she is, mon! Let\'s finish this business.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35076,0,''),(34749,3,0,'We did it! The Maiden\'s Dagger is mine, all mine!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35084,0,''),(34782,1,0,'Cap\'n Garvey will hear of this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35080,0,''),(52201,0,0,'Rocket launch in 3...',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,51250,0,''),(52201,1,0,'Rocket launch in 2...',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,51251,0,''),(52201,2,0,'Rocket launch in 1...',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,51252,0,'')