r the Firelord\'s abode!',14,0,100,0,0,24474,0,52416,0,'Majordomo Staghelm - Baleroc Outro'),(52571,13,0,'Beg for mercy now, and I may yet allow you to live. Well, \"heroes?\" What is your answer?',14,0,100,0,0,24475,0,52417,0,'Majordomo Staghelm - Baleroc Outro'),(189208,0,0,'By the Titans! This old thing sure clings to its secrets...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201554,0,0,'%s is being empowered by the Dreamsurge!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(197354,0,0,'%s is being empowered by the Dreamsurge!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(197344,0,0,'%s is being empowered by the Dreamsurge!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(201553,0,0,'%s is being empowered by the Dreamsurge!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(189668,10,0,'The blue dragons battled <name> fiercely, attempting to prevent it from absorbing stray Arcane Orbs that could allow it to grow further out of control.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,9,0,'Since you did so well on your lesson, feel free to take something from the Good Students Reward Chest. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,8,0,'Please excuse the mess! It has been quite some time since students have been here. I am just putting together my lesson plan. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,7,0,'As the dragons neared victory, <name> unleashed its full arcane power against them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,6,0,'Ah! Here we are! Ahem--long ago, members of the blue dragonflight accidentally overloaded an arcane elemental and created a powerful construct named Vexamus that quickly started to wreak havoc! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,5,0,'<name> began manifesting powerful Arcane Bombs in order to drive back the dragons.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,3,0,'The dragons absorbed the orbs! Not Vexamus. ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,4,0,'You should study harder. ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,2,0,'That is not what it says in the book! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,0,0,'Ahem! Vexamus did NOT absorb any arcane orbs. ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,1,0,'Are you trying to rewrite history? No orbs! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(189668,11,0,'Though Vexamus tried its best to defeat the dragons, it was ultimately destroyed. Well done! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Professor Maxdormu'),(196482,0,0,'',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190609,5,0,'You have been educated. ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(190609,6,0,'You will not pass the semester! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(190609,4,0,'Think about what you have done! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(190609,3,0,'These are sacred halls of learning! Only those registered may access them! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(190609,2,0,'Learn from this! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(190609,1,0,'Greetings, new--Who are you? You are not registered here! This room is only for students! Head to the registrar at once! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(190609,0,0,'Go to the corner! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(190609,7,0,'Demerit points for you! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(190609,8,0,'Poor marks for poor students! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echo of Doragosa'),(186616,0,0,'Can you stand against my might? ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Granyth'),(186616,1,0,'Die! This land is mine! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Granyth'),(186616,2,0,'Incarnates... save... me... ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Granyth'),(186616,3,0,'Tremble before primal power! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Granyth'),(186616,4,0,'Worthless! I will dispose of the outsiders myself! ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Granyth'),(186616,5,0,'Your sky darkens. ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Granyth'),(42371,0,0,'Father...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38143,0,'Vanessa van Cleef to Edwin van Cleef'),(42693,0,0,'|cFF768EBDFive years ago, in the heart of the Deadmines...|r |TInterface\\QuestFrame\\UI-QUESTLOG-BOOKICON.B