0,'To the barrier!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(209693,2,0,'Thank you for the warning! And the compliment.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Archmage Khadgar'),(209730,0,0,'Isn\'t it nice to fight on the same side for once?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,249260,0,'Chromie'),(209730,1,0,'Oooo, ominous!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,249262,0,'Chromie'),(209731,0,0,'For now.',12,0,100,0,0,96047,0,146014,0,'Eternus'),(209874,0,0,'I will be... avenged.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blazing Channeler'),(209876,0,0,'This power highlights our enemies clearly in red, for a time. They cannot hide behind trees and rocks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,247818,0,'Albon the Watcher'),(209876,1,0,'Now, slay them so that our forest is safe!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,247819,0,'Albon the Watcher'),(209882,0,0,'I will be... avenged.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incendiary Runebear'),(209894,0,0,'I will be... avenged.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Charred Fanatic'),(210008,0,0,'I thought maybe it was thirsty. I just wanted to give it a drink.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Guff Runetotem'),(210256,0,0,'Lyandris was pitifully easy to kill, and Kery\'nael barely has a will to break. They are all blind!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thaeldus Thorngale'),(210256,1,0,'I have tasted true power, purged the weak with it. Solarys is a fool to think I\'d turn from the Flame!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thaeldus Thorngale'),(210256,2,0,'I won\'t let her drag me around like we\'re children still--I am not so cowardly as to waver from the Flame\'s heat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thaeldus Thorngale'),(210256,3,0,'In fact, she has yet to witness my prize for loyalty. Allow me to demonstrate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thaeldus Thorngale'),(210256,4,0,'Nothing will hinder the Flame--we will have our ascension! I will cull all who stand in our way!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thaeldus Thorngale'),(210256,5,0,'You will burn with the--AGH! NO--IT HURTS!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thaeldus Thorngale'),(210256,6,0,'I am aware of her... misguided attempts to lead myself and my siblings astray.',12,0,100,