,0,100,0,0,25962,0,55304,0,'Nozdormu to Player'),(55624,2,0,'But first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara\'s Highborne lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,25963,0,55305,0,'Nozdormu to Player'),(55624,0,0,'I see you\'ve arrived. This is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world.',12,0,100,0,0,25961,0,55271,0,'Nozdormu to Player'),(55500,26,0,'The hunter became the prey.',12,0,100,0,0,26051,0,54838,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Peroth\'arn'),(55500,25,0,'Waiting to attack...',12,0,100,0,0,26100,0,54302,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,24,0,'Another demon, ready to be slaughtered.',12,0,100,0,0,26050,0,54574,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,23,0,'Too easy.',12,0,100,0,0,26075,0,54573,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,22,0,'The demons are no longer pouring from the palace. We can move ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,26074,0,54572,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,21,0,'The demons should all be leaving. We will be at the palace in no time.',12,0,100,0,0,26073,0,54750,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,20,0,'Destroy the portal energy focus!',12,0,100,0,0,26105,0,54710,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Dreadlord Defender'),(55500,19,0,'They stand unaware that their deaths are moments away.',12,0,100,0,0,26101,0,54575,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Legion Demon'),(55500,18,0,'Let us shut down this final portal and finish this.',12,0,100,0,0,26072,0,54736,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Legion Demon'),(55500,17,0,'Cut this one down from the shadows.',12,0,100,0,0,26071,0,54514,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,16,0,'The stench of sulfur and brimstone... These portals are as foul as the demons themselves.',12,0,100,0,0,26070,0,54512,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,15,0,'Smash the crystal. We need to move.',12,0,100,0,0,26104,0,54709,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Dreadlord Defender'),(55500,13,0,'I\'ll let you have the first kill.  Don\'t make me regret that.',12,0,100,0,0,26082,0,54308,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,12,1,'They will get what they deserve, in due time.',12,0,50,0,0,26067,0,54292,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,12,0,'They come endlessly from the palace.',12,0,50,0,0,26069,0,54510,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,11,0,'We\'re leaving. Stay close.',12,0,100,0,0,26055,0,54511,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,10,0,'Destroy the crystal so we can move on.',12,0,100,0,0,26103,0,54468,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Dreadlord Defender'),(55500,9,1,'Death to the Legion!',12,0,100,0,0,26056,0,54444,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Dreadlord Defender'),(55500,9,0,'My blades hunger.',12,0,100,0,0,26057,0,54503,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Corrupted Arcanist'),(55500,8,0,'Attack. I don\'t like to be kept waiting.',12,0,100,0,0,26081,0,54304,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Illidan Stormrage'),(55500,7,0,'My magic is fading. I\'m going through!',12,0,100,0,0,26064,0,54299,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Illidan Stormrage'),(55500,6,0,'I will hold them back so we can get past. Be ready.',12,0,100,0,0,26063,0,54297,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,5,1,'I\'ve seen a single Guardian Demon slaughter a hundred elves. Tread lightly.',12,0,50,0,0,26068,0,54296,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,5,0,'So many demons, not enough time.',12,0,50,0,0,26066,0,54288,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,4,0,'Come with me if you\'d like to live long enough to see me save this world!',12,0,100,0,0,26065,0,54284,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,2,2,'Are you here to help?',12,0,33,0,0,26524,0,54837,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,3,0,'We now hide in shadows, hidden from our enemies.',12,0,100,0,0,26054,0,54705,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,2,1,'Talk with me now.',12,0,33,0,0,26523,0,54836,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,2,0,'Explain your presence.',12,0,33,0,0,26080,0,54835,2,'Illidan Stormrage to Player'),(55500,1,0,'I think we stand a better chance fighting alongside one another.',12,0,100,0