e making that up.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,144,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1366,0,5,'If you could catch a fish big enough for your mouth we\'d never be hungry again.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,145,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1366,0,6,'Maybe we should go to the bridge and fish.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,146,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1367,0,0,'I caught a big one last week, it had three eyes!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,132,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1367,0,1,'My daddy says that in the ocean, there are fish so big they could swallow a whole ship.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,133,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1367,0,2,'My daddy can catch more fish than your daddy!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,134,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1367,0,3,'Look! Look! I caught something! Aww....it\'s just a stinky ol\' boot.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,135,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1367,0,4,'I heard that there are these huge fish that can walk on land to hunt, and eat people!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,139,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1367,0,5,'And one time, at camp, I caught a fish that was bigger than I am!!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,140,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1367,0,6,'I heard a story about this golden fish, and if you caught it you would get three wishes!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,141,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1367,1,0,'C\'mon, let\'s try somewhere else.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1086,0,'Billy and Adam conversations'),(1413,0,0,'If we change the direction of the flow of the Essence in the opposite, perhaps we will be able to change its polarity.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,201,0,'Ãâ€ÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃÂ¹ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ ÃÂÃÂ½Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¿'),(1413,0,2,'The portal is slightly unstable, but if a linking ritual is performed at that moment, it will remain in place.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,204,0,'Ãâ€ÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃÂ¹ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ ÃÂÃÂ½Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¿'),(1413,0,3,'When positively charged energies collide with negatively charged ones, they do not neutralize each other.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,205,0,'Ãâ€ÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃÂ¹ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ ÃÂÃÂ½Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¿ to ÃÅ¸Ã‘Æ’Ã