e stability of the flow.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,224,0,'ÃÂ¡Ã‘Å½ÃÂ·ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ½ÃÂ°'),(1415,2,7,'Only if I violate the initialization procedure.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,225,0,'ÃÂ¡Ã‘Å½ÃÂ·ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ½ÃÂ°'),(1432,3,0,'%s spits at |3-3($n).',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31673,0,'ÃÂ ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ°Ã‘â€šÃÂ¾ Ãâ€œÃÂ°ÃÂ»ÃÂ»ÃÂ¸ÃÂ½ÃÂ° to Player'),(1477,0,0,'Remember when Danath gathered all the mercenaries of Stormwind together and we marched to fight at Nethergarde?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,399,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,0,1,'I tell ye, I don\'t miss the Great War at all. I remember when we fought at Darrowmere. All night in the fog, lying in a muddy trench.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,400,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,0,2,'I miss the dwarven ale we used to get at that inn in Lordaeron. Remember that fight we started there?',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,401,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,0,3,'Less than a hundred of us, and over a thousand orcs. Only a handful of us managed to walk away from that one.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,402,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,0,4,'The best had to have been the look on Perenolde\'s face when our army comes marchin\' right up to his front door. What a battle!',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,403,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,0,5,'Battling that band of Twilight Hammer in the Morass, I could think of better places for a war.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,405,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,0,6,'Ahh yes, now I remember, your wedding night wasn\'t it?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,406,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,0,7,'Ahh the Glustewelt twins!',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,407,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,1,0,'I still have the scars from that night.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,408,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,1,1,'Broke both me legs that night. How could I forget?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,409,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,1,2,'I woke up in a bed in Northshire three weeks later. Don\'t remember a damn thing.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,410,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,1,3,'Wasn\'t that the night we had to pick up my thumb and carry it in your smoke pouch?',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,411,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,1,4,'I have a piece of iron in my back that will remind me of that night for the rest of my days.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,413,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,1,5,'Course I remember that night. Two inches to the left and you\'d be drinking with that elf, Morris. That was my best shirt, too.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,414,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,1,6,'Was that the third or fourth time you nearly got me gutted trying one of your crazy stunts?',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,415,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,1,7,'Aye and thanks for letting me carry my own hand back to the priests that night.',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,416,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,2,0,'Hehe, wimp.',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,417,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,2,1,'You screamed like a little girl, funniest thing I ever saw.',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,418,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,2,2,'It all worked out in the end.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,419,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,2,3,'Let\'s not even begin comparing battle scars, my friend.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,420,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,2,4,'Never seen anyone move so fast in my whole life.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,421,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,2,5,'You are constantly surprising me with what a person can live through.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,422,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,2,6,'Well, you\'re still here. I\'d say that is something worth drinking to.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,423,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,2,7,'You can thank me anytime for making your life more interesting.',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,424,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1477,3,0,'A warm tavern and a cold ale. What more could we ask for?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,432,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,0,0,'Remember when Danath gathered all the mercenaries of Stormwind together and we marched to fight at Nethergarde?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,399,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,0,1,'I tell ye, I don\'t miss the Great War at all. I remember when we fought at Darrowmere. All night in the fog, lying in a muddy trench.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,400,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,0,2,'I miss the dwarven ale we used to get at that inn in Lordaeron. Remember that fight we started there?',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,401,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,0,3,'Less than a hundred of us, and over a thousand orcs. Only a handful of us managed to walk away from that one.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,402,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,0,4,'The best had to have been the look on Perenolde\'s face when our army comes marchin\' right up to his front door. What a battle!',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,403,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,0,5,'Battling that band of Twilight Hammer in the Morass, I could think of better places for a war.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,405,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,0,6,'Ahh yes, now I remember, your wedding night wasn\'t it?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,406,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,0,7,'Ahh the Glustewelt twins!',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,407,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,1,0,'I still have the scars from that night.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,408,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,1,1,'Broke both me legs that night. How could I forget?',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,409,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,1,2,'I woke up in a bed in Northshire three weeks later. Don\'t remember a damn thing.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,410,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,1,3,'Wasn\'t that the night we had to pick up my thumb and carry it in your smoke pouch?',12,7,100,153,0,0,0,411,0,'Christoph Faral and Aedis Brom'),(1478,1,4,'I have a piece of iron in my back that will remind me of that night for the rest of my days.',12,7,100,396,0,0,0,413,0,'Christoph