. I should be able to swim back from here, but before I go, one quick thing...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33457,0,'Sentinel Aynasha'),(32964,2,0,'I was afforded a brief chance to attack their leader, and he was protected by some kind of magic. Make sure Morra hears of this before leading any kind of attack.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33459,0,'Sentinel Aynasha'),(32964,3,0,'Farewell newcomer. May Elune\'s blessing be with you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33460,0,'Sentinel Aynasha'),(32969,0,1,'Gershala... Dentaria will be so happy to see you alive.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33258,0,'Lor\'danel Sentinel'),(32971,2,0,'You there! We need able bodies as fast as possible. Lives depend on it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33858,0,'Ranger Glynda Nal\'Shea'),(32969,0,0,'Cerellean! You made it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33248,0,'Lor\'danel Sentinel'),(32972,0,0,'When the wounded arrive, we will be putting them up in the Inn while we tend to their recovery. Please find us there when you return.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33862,0,'Serendia Oakwhisper - 13520/the-boon-of-the-seas'),(32971,1,0,'Don\'t forget to check near the bridges southeast of town for a ride up to our forward post.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34159,0,'Ranger Glynda Nal\'Shea Quest accept 13589'),(33041,0,0,'EVEN IN THIS WEAKENED FORM, I WILL DESTROY YOU!!!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,33237,0,'Smart Text'),(33043,4,0,'Thank you for saving me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,131568,0,'ÃÅ¾ÃÂ±ÃÂµÃÂ·Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ¼ÃÂµÃÂ²Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ Ã‘â€žÃ‘Æ’Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ±ÃÂ¾ÃÂ»ÃÂ³ ÃÂ§ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ½ÃÂ¾ÃÂ»ÃÂµÃ‘ÂÃ‘Å’Ã‘Â to Ãâ€Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â€¦ ÃÂ¾Ã‘ÂÃÂºÃÂ²ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ½ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸Ã‘Â'),(33107,0,0,'Goddess watch over you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33257,0,'Priestess Alinya'),(33115,0,0,'Priestesses, I am to bring word that there are more survivors incoming. They are doing everything they can to sift through for the ones that are still alive, please send any help that you can!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33860,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Dentaria'),(33115,1,0,'Of course, Priestess.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33863,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Dentaria'),(33115,2,0,'Volcor... I\'m so glad to see that you made it. But where is Grimclaw?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33262,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Volcor'),(33115,3,0,'We\'ll worry about him later. I need to get you to safety.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33263,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Volcor'),(33115,4,0,'Thank you for your help, friend. I\'ll take it from here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33264,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Volcor'),(33115,5,0,'Cerellean! You made it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33248,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Cerellean'),(33115,6,0,'I\'ll get him back to Lor\'danel.  Thank you for your help, stranger.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33249,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Cerellean'),(33115,7,0,'Gershala... Dentaria will be so happy to see you alive.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33258,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Gershala'),(33115,8,0,'I\'ll take him back to the priestess. Thank you for your kindness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33259,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Gershala'),(33115,9,0,'Shaldyn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33261,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Shaldyn'),(33115,10,0,'I will see to it that Shaldyn is returned safely. Thank you, hero.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33260,0,'Lor\'Danel Sentinel - Q13518 the-last-wave-of-survivors @ Shaldyn'),(33181,0,0,'Finally, my soul will find peace... Oh, my dear Kirillian...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1224,0,'Anaya Dawnrunner'),(33202,0,0,'%s falls to the ground and begins to regenerate.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,33463,0,'Ãâ€Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ²ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ´Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â€¦ ÃÂ²ÃÂ¾ÃÂ´Ã‘â€¹ to 0'),(33202,2,0,'With the help of allies %s is fully restored.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,33464,0,'Ãâ€Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ²ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ´Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â€¦ ÃÂ²ÃÂ¾ÃÂ´Ã‘â€¹ to Ãâ€Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ²ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ´Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â€¦ ÃÂ²ÃÂ¾ÃÂ´Ã‘â€¹'),(33228,0,0,'Freya absorbs the essence of Eonar\'s Gift, healing the allies closest to her!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,34752,0,'Ãâ€ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÂ­ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ° to 0'),(33231,0,0,'Hollee!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,33382,0,'Elisa Steelhand'),(33231,1,0,'I know, lass, but you\'re safe now and with friends. I thought you were dead!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33384,0,'Elisa Steelhand'),(33231,2,0,'Of course. Don\'t think anything of it. And I won\'t hear of you trying to pay me back, either!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33387,0,'Elisa Steelhand'),(33231,3,0,'Anytime, lass. Anytime.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33389,0,'Elisa Steelhand'),(33232,0,0,'Great! Let\'s get out of here. I don\'t have a weapon, so I\'d really appreciate it if you could... you know... protect me?',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,33378,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,1,0,'Let\'s go.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,33379,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,2,0,'Taldan!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,33402,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,3,0,'This isn\'t happening. Oh no... my friends!',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,33403,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,4,0,'Hurry! We have to check on them!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,33404,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,5,0,'It\'s trashed, but it doesn\'t look like there are any bodies.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33405,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,6,0,'Sorry, but I had to check. Okay, let\'s get out of here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33406,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,7,0,'There\'s the refugee camp!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,33380,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,8,0,'I\'ll race you!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,33381,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,9,0,'Elisa! Oh, it\'s so good to get out of there! Auberdine is completely overrun with cultists and elementals',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,33383,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,10,0,'I have a favor to ask. Could you reward my friend here? I haven\'t any coin. I can pay you when we get back to Ironforge.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33386,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33232,11,0,'Oh, thank you, Elisa! Thank you!',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,33388,0,'Archaeologist Hollee'),(33