g in circles again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34530,0,'Archeologist Groff Q13911'),(34341,0,0,'More fodder for the Horde war machine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,41572,0,'Saurboz Quest 25945/were-here-to-do-one-thing-maybe-two'),(34341,1,0,'Looks like we\'ve got some of Rockrain\'s soldiers here. Dontrag, Utvoch, we\'re gonna need your expertise over at Krom\'gar Fortress.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,41573,0,'Saurboz Quest 25945/were-here-to-do-one-thing-maybe-two'),(34341,2,0,'As for the rest of you grunts, suit up! We got some killin\' to do.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,41574,0,'Saurboz Quest 25945/were-here-to-do-one-thing-maybe-two'),(34343,0,4,'Kill it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34539,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34343,2,0,'Superb! Gather your strength, whats-your-face. We\'ve got a long way to travel.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34524,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34343,3,0,'Ready? Let\'s move!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34525,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34343,4,0,'The ruins you see here are identical to ones I dug up a few months ago, but they\'re flooded! Curious, eh?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34526,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34343,5,0,'Ah, we\'re almost there, whos-yer-face! The camp where I left my notes is just around the corner!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34527,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34343,6,0,'By the three hammers, will you look at that! More ruins!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34528,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34343,7,0,'These ruins I\'ve found are IDENTICAL to the ones I just left! It\'s the find of a lifetime!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34529,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34343,8,0,'Nonsense. See? Here\'s my journal, right here. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34531,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34343,9,0,'What do you make of this, Ferd?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34532,0,'Prospector Remtravel Q13911'),(34353,0,0,'$GNOTHING:NOTHING:r;, |3-6($r)! DIE!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,40893,0,'ÃÅ¡Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¼\'ÃÂ³ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘ÂÃÂºÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ¿ÃÂ¾ÃÂ´ÃÂ¶ÃÂ¸ÃÂ³ÃÂ°Ã‘â€šÃÂµÃÂ»Ã‘Å’ to Player'),(34366,0,0,'Kill them all and burn the tower