ge - Quest 24434/commando-drop'),(36924,2,0,'Don\'t forget, $n - you can now use the summoning stone to port yourself back to my location in Valormok! ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36743,0,'Andorel\'s Image - Quest 24434/commando-drop'),(36926,0,0,'Boom, baby!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36758,0,'Ticker - Quest 24434/commando-drop'),(36928,0,0,'Okay, form it up! If it moves, shoot it. If it shoots... Move it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36756,0,'Patch - Quest 24434/commando-drop'),(36930,0,0,'Gassed up and good to go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36757,0,'Grit - Quest 24434/commando-drop'),(36937,0,0,'Your salvation has arrived... and it\'s affordably priced!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36793,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,1,'I\'ll take my fee out of your paycheck.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36794,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,2,'Have I got a heal for you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36796,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,3,'I\'ve got the best heals, anywhere!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36797,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,4,'Health from above!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36798,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,5,'I love the smell of salvation in the morning.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36799,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,6,'I\'ve got what you need!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36800,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,7,'Light is money, friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36801,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,8,'Rez incoming!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36802,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,9,'No more lying down on the job.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36803,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,10,'Not getting out of your debts that easy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36804,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,11,'Back to work!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36805,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,12,'Walk it off.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36806,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,13,'That\'s 3 for you, buddy. One more and my fee goes up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36807,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,14,'I\'m charging you for hazard pay on this one, pal.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36808,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36937,0,15,'You didn\'t even make it 20 more feet that time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36809,0,'Airborne Priest during Quest 24436/halo-drops'),(36958,0,0,'Chilly tickles!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36813,0,'Labgoblin'),(36958,0,1,'You make face soaky.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36814,0,'Labgoblin'),(36958,0,2,'My mouth tastes wet!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36815,0,'Labgoblin'),(36958,0,3,'...Is drink time?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36816,0,'Labgoblin'),(36958,1,0,'WARNING: Reactor Core Flushed!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,36156,0,'Labgoblin'),(36958,2,0,'We must push little cart!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36159,0,'Labgoblin'),(36973,0,0,'Ticker, blow this thing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(36974,0,0,'Enemy here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(36974,0,1,' Hostile ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(36976,0,0,'On it.',12,0,100,68,0,0,0,0,0,''),(36976,0,1,' It\'s set. Get clear!',12,0,100,68,0,0,0,0,0,''),(36976,1,0,'Almost done.',12,0,100,68,0,0,0,0,0,''),(36984,0,0,'Help!  My eyes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,22834,0,'Nine\'s Baby Raptor from Player'),(36984,0,1,'My eyes - auuugh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36534,0,'Nine\'s Baby Raptor from Player'),(36998,0,0,'You have my thanks. We were outnumbered until you arrived.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36995,0,'Skybreaker Protector - SAY_SECOND_SQUAD_RESCUED_ALLIANCE_0'),(36998,1,0,'Captain Muradin is waiting aboard The Skybreaker. We\'ll secure the area until you are ready for take off.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36996,0,'Skybreaker Protector - SAY_SECOND_SQUAD_RESCUED_ALLIANCE_1'),(36998,2,0,'Skybreaker infantry, hold position!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37000,0,'Skybreaker Protector - SAY_SECOND_SQUAD_RESCUED_ALLIANCE_2'),(36998,3,0,'A screeching cry pierces the air above!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,37161,0,'Frostwyrm - SAY_FROSTWYRM_SUMMON_0'),(37003,0,0,'Thank goodness you arrived when you did, heroes. Orgrim\'s Hammer has already left. Quickly now, to The Skybreaker! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36976,0,'Skybreaker Vindicator - SAY_FIRST_SQUAD_RESCUED_ALLIANCE_0'),(37026,0,0,'This ought to help!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36981,0,'Skybreaker Sorcerer - SAY_FIRST_SQUAD_RESCUED_ALLIANCE_1'),(37026,1,0,'%s summons a Skybreaker Battle Standard.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skybreaker Sorcerer - SAY_SUMMON_BATTLE_STANDARD'),(37030,0,0,'Thank the spirits for you, brothers and sisters. The Skybreaker has already left. Quickly now, to Orgrim\'s Hammer! If you leave soon, you may be able to catch them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37734,0,'Kor\'kron Primalist - SAY_FIRST_SQUAD_RESCUED_HORDE_0'),(37032,0,0,'Aka\'Magosh, brave warriors. The alliance is in great number here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37736,0,'Kor\'kron Defender - SAY_SECOND_SQUAD_RESCUED_HORDE_0'),(37032,1,0,'Captain Saurfang will be pleased to see you aboard Orgrim\'s Hammer. Make haste, we will secure the area until you are ready for take-off.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37737,0,'Kor\'kron Defender - SAY_SECOND_SQUAD_RESCUED_HORDE_1'),(37032,2,0,'A screeching cry pierces the air above!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,37161,0,'Frostwyrm - SAY_FROSTWYRM_SUMMON_0'),(37033,0,0,'This should be helpin\'ya!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Invoker - SAY_FIRST_SQUAD_RESCUED_HORDE_1'),(37033,1,0,'%s summons a Kor\'kron Battle Standard.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Invoker - SAY_SUMMON_BATTLE_STANDARD'),(37038,0,0,'Ð–Ð¸Ð²Ñ‹Ðµ? Ð—Ð´ÐµÑÑŒ?!',14,0,100,0,0,16925,0,38564,0,'ÃÅ“Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ¸Ã‘â€šÃÂµÃÂ»Ã‘Å’ÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ Ã‘ÂÃÂ²ÃÂµÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃÂ²ÃÂ°Ã‘â€šÃÂµÃÂ»Ã‘Å’ to 201888'),(37092,4,0,'%s Ð¸ÑÑ‡ÐµÐ·Ð°ÐµÑ‚ Ð² Ð·ÐµÐ¼Ð»Ðµ!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,36918,0,'Ãâ€™Ã‘â€¹Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€š to Player'),(37093,3,0,'%s Ñ€Ð°ÑÐ¿Ð°Ð´Ð°ÐµÑ‚ÑÑ Ð½Ð° Ð¾Ð±Ð»Ð°ÐºÐ¾ Ð·Ð°Ð³Ð°Ð´Ð¾Ñ‡Ð½Ñ‹Ñ… ÑÐ¿Ð¾Ñ€.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,36915,0,'ÃÂ¥ÃÂ»ÃÂµÃ‘â€°Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â€°ÃÂ°Ã‘Â ÃÂ»ÃÂ¾ÃÂ·ÃÂ° to Player'),(37167,0,0,'Lok\'tar ogar!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36977,0,'Stonetalon Prisoner Quest 24512/warriors-redemption'),(37167,0,1,'Vengeance...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36978,0,'Stonetalon Prisoner Quest 24512/warriors-redemption'),(37198,0,0,'<Static> Is this thing on? Hello?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(37198,1,0,'Ahh, there you are. Hello! I figured that, while you\'re flying to Kharanos, I\'d give you some data about what\'s going on outside of Coldridge Valley.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(37198,2,0,'It seems you Coldridge folks are dreadfully under-informed about the events of the last few days.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37118,0,''),(37198,3,0,'If you thought you had problems with trolls in Coldridge, wait \'til you get to Kharanos! That big cataclysm got the trolls all stirred up out here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(37198,4,0,'And if you\'ll look to your left, you\'ll see that the gnomes have retaken Gnomeregan. Hooray for us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(37198,5,0,'There\'s plenty else going on out here, too. We\'ve opened up the path to the airport, there\'s rumors of Dark Irons in the east... oh, and I think something weird is going on with that dwarf king, Magni. Might want to check it out.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(37198,6,0,'And here we are! Welcome to Kharanos! Watch your step on the way out.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(37487,0,0,'I remember when the Barrens was ... barren. And we liked it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37147,0,'Taurajo Refugee OOC'),(37487,0,1,'I\'ve had enough of this jungle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37143,0,'Taurajo Refugee OOC'),(37487,0,2,'I only understand a few words of the quilboar tongue, but I didn\'t like what I heard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37122,0,'Taurajo Refugee OOC'),(37487,1,0,'Free at last!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37120,0,'Taurajo Refugee Rescued Quillboar'),(37487,1,1,'Thank you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37121,0,'Taurajo Refugee Rescued Quillboar'),(37487,1,2,'Are the refugees still gathering at Camp Una\'fe?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37123,0,'Taurajo Refugee Rescued Quillboar'),(37487,1,3,'You\'re a savior! I don\'t know what those things wanted from us...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37124,0,'Taurajo Refugee Rescued Quillboar'),(37487,2,0,'Whew! I\'m never eating asparagus again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37142,0,'Taurajo Refugee Rescued from Plants'),(37487,2,1,'Get ... me ... out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37144,0,'Taurajo Refugee Rescued from Plants'),(37487,2,2,'I think this jungle wants to eat me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37145,0,'Taurajo Refugee Rescued from Plants'),(37487,2,3,'Thank you! That thing was shaking me like a ragdoll.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37146,0,'Taurajo Refugee Rescued from Plants'),(37503,3,0,'They must not break through to Sindragosa! Hurry up, stop them!',14,0,100,0,0,17167,0,37105,0,'ÃÅ¾ÃÂ±ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ³ ÃÂ¡ÃÂ¸ÃÂ½ÃÂ´Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ³ÃÂ¾Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€¹ to Player'),(37533,0,0,'%s Ð¸Ð·Ð´Ð°ÐµÑ‚ Ð¿Ñ€ÐµÐ´ÑÐ¼ÐµÑ€Ñ‚Ð½Ñ‹Ð¹ ÐºÑ€Ð¸Ðº, ÑÑ…Ð¾Ð¼ Ð·Ð°Ñ‚Ð¸Ñ…Ð°ÑŽÑ‰Ð¸Ð¹ Ð²Ð´Ð°Ð»Ð¸.',41,0,100,0,0,8470,0,37513,0,'ÃËœÃÂ½ÃÂµÃÂ¹ to Player'),(37534,0,0,'%s Ð¸Ð·Ð´Ð°ÐµÑ‚ Ð¿Ñ€ÐµÐ´ÑÐ¼ÐµÑ€Ñ‚Ð½Ñ‹Ð¹ ÐºÑ€Ð¸Ðº, ÑÑ…Ð¾Ð¼ Ð·Ð°Ñ‚Ð¸Ñ…Ð°ÑŽÑ‰Ð¸Ð¹ Ð²Ð´Ð°Ð»Ð¸.',41,0,100,0,0,8470,0,37513,0,'ÃÂ¥Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ±Ã‘â€šÃÂ¾Ã‘â€¦Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€š to Player'),(37570,0,0,'I will attempt to seal the scar, $n. Make sure nothing from the other side makes its way through!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38492,0,'Naralex during Quest 24601/the-nightmare-scar'),(37581,3,0,'Brave defenders, we owe you our lives, our freedom... And although this is too little gratitude for your fearlessness, know that we will spread the news of your deeds and the Light that you carry through these gloomy halls everywhere.',14,0,100,5,0,17151,0,37320,0,'Ãâ€œÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂºÃ‘Æ’ÃÂ½ Ãâ€“ÃÂµÃÂ»ÃÂµÃÂ·ÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ§ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ¿ to Player'),(37585,4,0,'%s is calling for help!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,81221,0,'ÃÂ ÃÂ°ÃÂ·ÃÂ²ÃÂµÃÂ´Ã‘â€¡ÃÂ¸ÃÂº ÃÂºÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ¿ÃÂ¾Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ¸ ÃÂ¡ÃÂµÃÂ²ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ½ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ¡Ã‘â€šÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ¶ÃÂ¸'),(37669,0,0,'Defend the hill!',42,0,100,0,0,3