n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38159,0,'Mahka reward Quest 24653/echoes-of-agamaggan'),(37812,1,0,'I see...she\'s using him to manipulate them all..',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38191,0,'Mahka reward Quest 24653/echoes-of-agamaggan'),(37812,2,0,'Come, Mankrik. Sit beside me and rest.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37740,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,3,0,'Look at this land, Mankrik. The Horde and Alliance tear the earth apart just to claw at each other in spite.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37742,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,4,0,'Such hatred is only bringing us destruction. I can see it in you as you fight the quilboar...your anger does nothing but wear you away.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37743,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,5,0,'You\'re destroying yourself, Mankrik.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37744,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,6,0,'You seek escape, not glory. It\'s suicide.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37746,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,7,0,'Because...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37748,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,8,0,'Because despite what you think, there may be people in this world who would mourn your passing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37749,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,9,0,'Please, Mankrik. Let go. Set down your blade.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37751,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,10,0,'Then...you do not need to bear it alone. Just sit next to me and forget your troubles, if only for a while.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37753,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37812,11,0,'Come see me whenever you are weary.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37754,0,'Mahka Quest 24633/mahkas-plea'),(37837,0,0,'So this is where you\'re hiding, Gar\'dul.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37495,0,'Warlord Bloodhilt During 24591/changing-of-the-gardul'),(37837,1,0,'You cower behind your walls! If it wasn\'t for $n here the Alliance would be marching through Mulgore.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,37496,0,'Warlord Bloodhilt During 24591/changing-of-the-gardul'),(37837,2,0,'Your excuses sicken me! Consider yourself relieved of command.',1