9021,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,4,0,'Right shoulder ... ARMS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39022,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,5,0,'PRESENT!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39023,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,6,0,'Look lively there, Grizwald.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39024,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,6,1,'When\'s the last time you cleaned that weapon, Holmberg?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39025,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,6,2,'Barkley, we do NOT aim with our eyes closed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39026,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,6,3,'Remember, you will not fire until you see the - whatever color their eyes are.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39027,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,6,4,'Fast. But not fast enough. We\'ll do it again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39028,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,6,5,'Jackson, you\'ve spilled your powder all over the ground. <Sigh>',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39029,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,7,0,'Gentlemen, our business is murder. And business is GOOD.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39030,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38636,8,0,'At ease.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39031,0,'Northwatch Guard @ Forward Command'),(38663,0,0,'Bastoon! Humiliate the interlopers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38742,0,'Karge Rageroar'),(38663,1,0,'Is that all you\'ve got, \'Hexmaster?\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38746,0,'Karge Rageroar when Hexmaster under 15% hp'),(38663,1,1,'BAH! Your shadows frighten no one, Bastoon. This one is mine.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38748,0,'Karge Rageroar when Hexmaster under 15% hp'),(38663,1,2,'HAH! Weakness! I expected nothing more.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38749,0,'Karge Rageroar when Hexmaster under 15% hp'),(38663,2,0,'No - no! This land... is ours...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38750,0,'Karge Rageroar under 10% hp'),(38666,3,0,'Ð”ÑƒÑ… Ð²ÐµÐ»Ð¸ÐºÐ¾Ð³Ð¾ Ð£Ñ‚ÐµÑ€Ð°, Ð¾Ð½Ð° Ð¿Ñ€ÐµÑÐ»ÐµÐ´ÑƒÐµÑ‚ Ð½Ð°Ñ! ÐžÑ€ÑƒÐ¶ÐµÐ½Ð¾ÑÐµÑ†, ÑÐ´ÐµÐ»Ð°Ð¹ Ð¶Ðµ Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾-Ð½Ð¸Ð±ÑƒÐ´ÑŒ! Ð—Ð°ÐºÐ¸Ð´Ð°Ð¹ ÐµÐµ Ð±ÑƒÐ»Ñ‹Ð¶Ð½Ð¸ÐºÐ°Ð¼Ð¸! Ð¯ Ð½Ðµ Ð·Ð½Ð°ÑŽ, Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾ Ð´ÐµÐ»Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒ!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,38688,0,'ÃÅ“ÃÂ°ÃÂºÃ‘ÂÃÂ¸ÃÂ¼ÃÂ¸ÃÂ»ÃÂ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ ÃÂ¡ÃÂµÃÂ²ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾ÃÂ·ÃÂµÃÂ¼Ã‘ÂÃÂºÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ to ÃÅ¸ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¼ÃÂµÃÂ½Ã‘â€šÃÂ¾'),(38697,0,0,'Aye aye sir! Immediately, sir!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38584,0,'Nathan Blaine on Accept Repel Boarders'),(38805,0,0,'Can\'t ... give up...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38707,0,'Smart Text'),(38805,0,1,'I think I can limp back to the fortress...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38706,0,'Smart Text'),(38805,0,2,'Orcs and trolls! Everywhere!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38708,0,'Smart Text'),(38805,0,3,'Thank you - this was turning into a massacre...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38704,0,'Smart Text'),(38805,0,4,'These bandages reek! I guess I shouldn\'t complain.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38705,0,'Smart Text'),(38805,0,5,'Why do these bandages smell like wet dog?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,38703,0,'Smart Text'),(38826,0,0,'Oke doke, boss. I will finish this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38745,0,'Hexmaster Bastoon'),(38826,1,0,'It be time to squeal, little piggy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38747,0,'Hexmaster Bastoon on aggro'),(38871,0,0,'Keep hacking at the overgrowth! If that doesn\'t work, we\'re going to start burning.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38948,0,'Teegan'),(38871,1,0,'I like the way you think, Bridgewater.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38949,0,'Teegan'),(38871,2,0,'Disgusting! We\'ll have to slash and burn our way to Forward Command.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38952,0,'Teegan'),(38871,3,0,'In a word? No.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38953,0,'Teegan'),(38871,4,0,'Stinking. Disgusting. Filthy animals!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38956,0,'Teegan'),(38871,5,0,'I was talking about you and Durty Pete.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38957,0,'Teegan'),(38871,6,0,'Now then, $n. Let\'s see what this what this crazy stick is capable of...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38839,0,'Teegan Quest 25015/make-em-squeal'),(38871,7,0,'Interesting. Very ... interesting.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38840,0,'Teegan Quest 25015/make-em-squeal'),(38872,0,0,'$n - help! The ropes ... please...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38860,0,''),(38872,1,0,'Ah, thank you! Suffice it to say... Negotiations did proceed as planned.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38862,0,''),(38872,2,0,'I should be able to get back to camp on my own.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38863,0,''),(38873,0,0,'Aye, the quilboar are a foul lot.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38959,0,'Groucho'),(38873,1,0,'Hang in there ol\' buddy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38849,0,'Groucho Quest 25015/make-em-squeal'),(38875,0,0,'%s belches loudly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38960,0,'Pete'),(38875,1,0,'Gol-Crawdad!?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38844,0,'Pete Quest 25015/make-em-squeal'),(38875,2,0,'Frappin\' cratchet! Sonnova HEY what!?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38845,0,'Pete Quest 25015/make-em-squeal'),(38875,3,0,'\'magonna - git! Git! Horkin\' nit, unfh, DABBIT!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38846,0,'Pete Quest 25015/make-em-squeal'),(38876,0,0,'Is that your plan, Teegan? Set fire to anything that gets in our way?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38950,0,'Hannah'),(38876,1,0,'Aren\'t you the least bit curious why the Barrens are suddenly in bloom, seemingly overnight?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38954,0,'Hannah'),(38876,2,0,'Stop shooting you senile idiot! You\'re going to kill somebody!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hannah Quest 25015/make-em-squeal'),(38932,3,0,'Ha! Ich hab dich eingeholt! Lass uns hier drinnen besser zusammenbleiben, okay?',12,0,100,1,0,21387,0,39070,0,'Zuni to Player'),(38932,4,0,'Ey, Mann, hier riecht\'s nach verfaultem Fisch.',12,0,100,0,0,21385,0,38262,0,'Zuni'),(38938,0,0,'Don\'t talk back to me, troll.  You know who was left in charge here.  Haven\'t you stopped to ask yourself why Thrall chose me instead of you?',12,0,100,25,0,20508,0,38897,0,'Vision of Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(38938,1,0,'You are lucky that I don\'t gut you right here, whelp.  You are foolish to think that you can speak to your Warchief in such ways.',12,0,100,5,0,20512,0,38903,0,'Vision of Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(38938,2,0,'And what exactly do you think that you are going to do about it?  Your threats are hollow.  Go slink away with the rest of your kind to the slums, I will endure your filth in my throne room no longer.',12,0,100,1,0,20509,0,38904,0,'Vision of Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(38938,3,0,'You have sealed your fate, troll.',12,0,100,1,0,20510,0,38901,0,'Vision of Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(38938,4,0,'%s spits at Vol\'jin\'s feet.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38906,0,'Vision of Garrosh Hellscream to Player'),(38939,0,0,'Vol\'jin.  It\'s good to see you, brother.',12,0,100,1,0,20133,0,42871,0,'Vision of Thrall to Player'),(38939,1,0,'Indeed.  Someone did try to kill me, but that is not my greatest concern at this moment.  The world itself calls for my aid.',12,0,100,1,0,20134,0,38879,0,'Vision of Thrall to Player'),(38939,2,0,'Vol\'jin, I chose Garrosh because he has the strength to lead our people in these trying times. ',12,0,100,1,0,20135,0,38881,0,'Vision of Thrall to Player'),(38939,3,0,'For all my supposed wisdom, there have been moments that I\'ve barely been able to hold the Horde together. The Wrath Gate and Undercity displayed that clearly enough.',12,0,100,1,0,20136,0,38883,0,'Vision of Thrall to Player'),(38939,4,0,'The Horde cries for a hero of old. An orc of true blood that will bow to no human and bear no betrayal. A warrior that will make our people proud again. Garrosh can be that hero.',12,0,100,1,0,20137,0,38884,0,'Vision of Thrall to Player'),(38939,5,0,'I did not make this decision lightly, Vol\'jin. I know our alliances will suffer for it. I know the Horde will be irreversibly changed. But I made this choice with confidence that Garrosh is exactly what the Horde needs.',12,0,100,1,0,20138,0,43775,0,'Vision of Thrall to Player'),(38939,6,0,'I\'m trusting you and the other leaders to not let this divide our people. You are stronger than that.',12,0,100,1,0,20139,0,43776,0,'Vision of Thrall to Player'),(38939,7,0,'Throm\'ka, old friend.',12,0,100,66,0,20147,0,38888,0,'Vision of Thrall to Player'),(38953,0,0,'Dere be no question why, Garrosh.  He gave ya tha title because ya be Grom\'s son and because tha people be wantin\' a war hero.',12,0,100,5,0,20098,0,38898,0,'Vision of Vol\'jin to Player'),(38953,1,0,'I tink ya be even more like ya father den ya thought, even witout da demon blood.',12,0,100,1,0,20099,0,43773,0,'Vision of Vol\'jin to Player'),(38953,2,0,'Ya be no Warchief of mine.  Ya not earned my respect and I\'ll not be seein\' tha Horde destroyed by ya foolish thirst for war.',12,0,100,1,0,20100,0,38899,0,'Vision of Vol\'jin to Player'),(38953,3,0,'I know exactly what I\'ll be doin\' about it, son of Hellscream.  I\'ll watch and wait as ya people slowly become aware of ya ineptitude.  I\'ll laugh as dey grow ta despise ya as I do.',12,0,100,1,0,20101,0,38900,0,'Vision of Vol\'jin to Player'),(38953,4,0,'And when tha time comes dat ya failure is complete and ya \"power\" is meaningless, I will be dere to end ya rule swiftly and silently.',12,0,100,1,0,20102,0,38905,0,'Vision of Vol\'jin to Player'),(38953,5,0,'Ya will spend ya reign glancin\' over ya shoulda and fearin\' tha shadows, for when tha time comes and ya blood be slowly drainin\' out, ya will know exactly who fired tha arrow dat pierced ya black heart.\n',12,0,100,1,0,20103,0,38944,0,'Vision of Vol\'jin to Player'),(38953,6,0,'And you yours, \"Warchief.\"',12,0,100,1,0,20104,0,38947,0,'Vision of Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,0,0,'I have sometin\' to show ya. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself.',12,0,100,1,0,20097,0,38892,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,1,0,'Tha Darkspear are \'ere because I led dem here.  Orgrimmar be no home as long as it be under Hellscream\'s hand. ',12,0,100,1,0,20105,0,42869,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,2,0,'Still, I fear I was lettin\' my temper drive me ta bein\' rash. Thrall devoted himself to makin\' the Horde what it is, so I\'ve no eagerness to be leavin\' it on a whim.  Dis will be needin\' much more thought.',12,0,100,1,0,20106,0,42870,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,3,0,'But dese be worries for older minds.  Ya still have much to learn.  Go help tha people of tha Darkspear.  I am sure we\'ll be speakin\' again real soon.',12,0,100,1,0,20107,0,43774,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,4,0,'Tha Sea Witch is dead, our home is reclaimed, but our future still be uncertain.',12,0,100,1,0,20108,0,38876,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,5,0,'I\'ve no love for Garrosh, dat much is sure, but leavin\' tha Horde is not a decision I be takin\' lightly.',12,0,100,1,0,20109,0,38878,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,6,0,'Dere\'s only one with tha answers I seek. Ya can stay and watch if ya like.',12,0,100,1,0,20110,0,38877,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,7,0,'Thrall!  I am glad ya be well.  Dere were rumors otherwise.',12,0,100,1,0,20111,0,38880,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,8,0,'I must beg ya council, my friend.  I can\'t be standin\' by Garrosh while he be turnin\' our people against each other for tha sake of war.  My respect for you does not extend to dis new Horde... I am tinkin\' of leadin\' my people away.',12,0,100,1,0,20112,0,38882,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,9,0,'I understand, brotha. I will tink on this and be troublin\' ya no furtha. You have a world to be savin\'.',12,0,100,6,0,20113,0,38885,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,10,0,'Ya be strong and proud, youngblood.  Tha Darkspear will be honored ta have you fight beside d\'em.',12,0,100,1,0,20114,0,38887,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,11,0,'Dese be dark times, but our people will be stayin\' with tha Horde for tha good of all.  ',12,0,100,1,0,20115,0,38889,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,12,0,'Thrall\'s words be true. Dey always be. The Horde is much more den a few old, stubborn leaders and a handful of heroes from Northrend. The people be cryin\' Garrosh\'s name... at least for now.',12,0,100,1,0,20116,0,38890,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,13,0,'Still, I be hopin\' Thrall will return to us one day. Tha future right now be lookin\' very grim... and very bloody.',12,0,100,1,0,20117,0,43777,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38966,14,0,'Go now. Make tha Darkspear proud. Dere are many wars ahead of us, an\' I\'m sure ya be havin\' a part to play in all of dem.',12,0,100,1,0,20118,0,43778,0,'Vol\'jin to Player'),(38968,0,0,'Joke\'s on you, mon. I found Jang\'thraze long ago. Had both of de halves...\'til some wily one come and steal one away in de night.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38912,0,''),(38968,1,0,'Now dat Sang\'thraze is mine again, de only thing ya be findin\' here...is ya own fresh grave.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38913,0,''),(38968,2,0,'Behold! Sul\'thraze the Lasher be rejoined!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38914,0,''),(38968,3,0,'Enough\'a dis...Chief Sandscalp can\'t reward me if I\'m dead, yah? Farewell, mon...for good.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38915,0,''),(38989,3,0,'Just let me know when ya ready mon.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39243,0,'Jornun to Player'),(39003,0,0,'Now we\'re cooking, $n.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,39037,0,'Sam Trawley to Player'),(39003,1,0,'Come an\' get it!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,39038,0,'Sam Trawley to Player'),(39003,2,0,'Yessir, those stormsnouts pack quite a punch.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,39039,0,'Sam Trawley to Player'),(39003,3,0,'Waldir Nu waldir ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ÃÂ¡Ã‘ÂÃÂ¼ ÃÂ¢Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ»ÃÂ»ÃÂ¸ to Player'),(39005,3,0,'Waldir Nu waldir ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ÃÂ Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃÂ¹ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂº ÃÂºÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ¿ÃÂ¾Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ¸ ÃÂ¡ÃÂµÃÂ²ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ½ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¹ Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ¶ÃÂ¸ to Player'),(39006,0,0,'Hmmmm... aye. But it\'s a wee bit - uh - wee, innit?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39171,0,'Siege Tank Engineer'),(39024,3,0,'Waldir Nu waldir ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ÃÅ¡ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ» to Player'),(39025,3,0,'Waldir Nu waldir ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ÃÂ¨ÃÂ°ÃÂ¹ÃÂ½ÃÂ° to Player'),(39034,0,0,'Into the Thunderdrome, $n! There\'s no getting out until someone\'s hit the sand. Let\'s start the show!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,39167,0,'DoctorText'),(39034,1,0,'Any Ladies and Gentlemen present should LEAVE NOW...for only REAL MEN AND WOMEN will be able to handle the gory spectacle about to unfold! Introducing the first fighter, the warrior of the Wastewander, the Ayatollah of Kaja-Cola...THE GINORMUS!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,39183,0,'DoctorText'),(39034,2,0,'The Ginormus has fallen! $n looks like he\'s ready for more!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'DoctorText'),(39034,3,0,'Our next fighter was found in the deepest tombs of Zul\'Farrak! Gorged on cursed blood, raised from death countless times, he now knows only fury and violence! Dare you face the mindless wrath of...ZUMONGA!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,39195,0,'DoctorText'),(39034,4,0,'$n has done it again! Zumonga dies once more!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,39232,0,'DoctorText'),(39034,5,0,'The faint of heart may wish to shield their eyes! Being brought into the ring now is a horror, captured from the dark tunnels of the Centipaar Hive! I give you the skittering death: SARINEXX!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,39233,0,'DoctorText'),(39034,6,0,'There is no stopping $n! Sarinexx has been massacred!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,39235,0,'DoctorText'),(39034,10,0,'And that\'s that, folks! This conflict\'s been settled the proper way, with VIOLENCE! Let\'s hear it for our contestants!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,40673,0,'DoctorText'),(39075,0,0,'There has been too much violence. Too much pain. But I have an honorable compromise. Just walk away.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,39397,0,'SummonedCreatureText'),(39083,0,0,'You are quite right, Trask.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39137,0,'Commander Roberts Reward Quest 25074/meet-me-at-triumph'),(39084,0,0,'Thank you, $n! Now I can begin my final assembly...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39168,0,'Mizzy Pistonhammer'),(39084,1,0,'Okay... structure? Check. Power? Check. Danger? Double-check. Let\'s fire up my masterpiece!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39169,0,'Mizzy Pistonhammer'),(39084,2,0,'Nonsense! Miniaturization is the future of warfare.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39177,0,'Mizzy Pistonhammer'),(39084,3,0,'I should mention I reversed the gearbox to accommodate the smaller form-factor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39179,0,'Mizzy Pistonhammer'),(39085,3,0,'Waldir Nu waldir ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ãâ€ºÃÂ¾ÃÂ³ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ ÃÂ£ÃÂ´ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÅ¡ÃÂ¾ÃÂ³Ã‘â€šÃ‘Â to Player'),(39088,0,0,'$n! You\'re alive! Have you heard?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39132,0,'Triumph Messenger to Player'),(39088,1,0,'They killed him! General Hawthorne - he was ambushed on the road by Horde assassins.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,39133,0,'Triumph Messenger to Player'),(39088,2,0,'His body was found strung up from a tree. Those animals... Those filthy animals!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,39134,0,'Triumph Messenger to Player'),(39094,3,0,'Were he still alive to avenge himself, General Hawthorne would have no doubt ordered a retaliatory massacre of biblical proportions.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,39136,0,'Barton Trask to Player'),(39124,3,0,'Waldir Nu waldir ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ÃÂ£Ã‘â€¡ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂº ÃÅ“ÃÂ¸ÃÂ·ÃÂ·ÃÂ¸ to Player'),(39139,3,0,'Waldir Nu waldir ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ÃÂ Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃÂ¹ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂº Ã‘â€žÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘â€šÃÂ° ÃÂ¢Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ¼Ã‘â€žÃÂ° to Player'),(39148,0,0,'ZUMONGA...KILL...',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,39197,0,'SummonedCreatureText'),(39156,3,0,'You\'ll find Marley Twinbraid up top, $gsir:ma\'am;.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,39227,0,'Twinbraid\'s Bodyguard to Player'),(39157,0,0,'%s yips in appreciation.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37760,0,'Lost Bloodtalon Hatchling to Player'),(39157,0,1,'%s bounces up and down.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37761,0,'Lost Bloodtalon Hatchling to Player'),(39157,0,2,'%s lets out a little screech.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37762,0,'Lost Bloodtalon Hatchling to Player'),(39157,0,3,'%s waves its horn at you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37763,0,'Lost Bloodtalon Hatchling to Player'),(39157,0,4,'%s skips after you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37764,0,'Lost Bloodtalon Hatchling to Player'),(39157,0,5,'%s almost falls on his face in excitement.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37765,0,'Lost Bloodtalon Hatchling to Player'),(39157,0,6,'%s taps his little claws on the ground as he runs to you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37766,0,'Lost Bloodtalon Hatchling to Player'),(39157,1,0,'%s schÃ¼ttelt sein Horn in Eure Richtung.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,37763,0,'Verirrtes Blutkrallenjungtier to Player'),(39184,0,0,'Hold on tight back there! Seat belts are for c