 LAVA!',14,0,100,0,0,20075,0,49421,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Battle'),(41376,4,0,'I have tried to be an accomodating host, but you simply will not die. Time to throw all pretexts aside and just KILL YOU ALL!',14,0,100,0,0,20077,0,49422,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Battle'),(41376,5,0,'Flesh turns to ash!',14,0,100,0,0,20074,0,49419,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Battle'),(41376,6,0,'It has been a pleasure!',14,0,50,0,0,20079,0,49424,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Battle'),(41376,6,1,'You really have to want it!',14,0,50,0,0,20081,0,49426,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Battle'),(41376,7,0,'Defeat has never tasted so bitter...',14,0,100,0,0,20083,0,49427,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Battle'),(41378,0,0,'There can be no disruptions! Mustn\'t keep the master waiting! Mustn\'t fail again!',14,0,0,0,0,19847,0,47028,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak aggro'),(41378,1,0,'There will never be another like me..',14,0,0,0,0,19848,0,47029,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak death'),(41378,2,0,'Nothing goes to waste...',14,0,0,0,0,19849,0,47029,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event02'),(41378,2,1,'Strip the flesh, harvest the organs!',14,0,0,0,0,19850,0,47030,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event03'),(41378,2,2,'Too early, but no choice... They must be tested! Face now my prime subjects!',14,0,0,0,0,19858,0,47034,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_Event11'),(41378,3,0,'Mix and stir, apply heat...',14,0,0,0,0,19851,0,41594,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event05'),(41378,4,0,'This one\'s a little unstable, but what\'s progress without failure?',14,0,0,0,0,19852,0,41596,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event06'),(41378,5,0,'How well does the mortal shell handle extreme temperature change? Must find out! For science!',14,0,0,0,0,19853,0,41595,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event07'),(41378,6,0,'When pushed to the edge, results may become unpredictable!',14,0,0,0,0,19854,0,41625,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event08'),(41378,7,0,'What they lack in intelligence they make up for in ferocity!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,47032,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event09'),(41378,7,1,'My failings will be your downfall!',14,0,0,0,0,19856,0,47033,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event10'),(41378,8,1,'Meet the brawn to my brains! Prime subjects, devour them!',14,0,0,0,0,19858,0,47035,0,'VO_BD_Maloriak_event12'),(41379,0,0,'Ha ha ha ha ha! The heroes have made it to the glorious finale! I take it you are in good spirits? Prepared for the final battle? Then gaze now upon my ultimate creation! RISE, SISTER!',14,0,0,0,0,20066,0,41762,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Intro'),(41379,1,0,'Behold, the Broodmother... Onyxia... REBORN. Perhaps my finest work.',14,0,0,0,0,20070,0,49416,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Intro'),(41379,2,0,'My dearest sibling... do you hunger? THEN FEAST UPON OUR ENEMIES!',14,0,0,0,0,20071,0,49417,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Intro'),(41406,3,0,'But I will trust you with even greater responsibility.',12,0,100,0,0,20736,0,41400,0,'ÃÂ­Ã‘ÂÃ‘ÂÃÂ¸ÃÂ½ÃÂ° to Player'),(41442,0,0,'I have no need for eyes to see my enemies. Your clumsy footsteps and foul stench give you away!',14,0,0,0,0,20820,0,48030,0,'VO_BD_ATRAMEDES aggro'),(41442,1,0,'Sighted, but blind to the truth. Embrace the finality of it all!',14,0,0,0,0,20821,0,48031,0,'VO_BD_ATRAMEDES kill'),(41442,1,1,'Death waits in the darkness!',14,0,0,0,0,20822,0,48033,0,'VO_BD_ATRAMEDES aggro'),(41442,2,0,'This miserable existence finally ends...',14,0,0,0,0,20823,0,48034,0,'VO_BD_ATRAMEDES death'),(41442,5,0,'You cannot hide from searing flame!',14,0,0,0,0,20826,0,48036,0,'VO_BD_ATRAMEDES searing flame'),(41442,6,0,'Yes, run! With every step your heart quickens. The beating, loud and thunderous... Almost deafening. You cannot escape!',14,0,0,0,0,20827,0,48038,0,'VO_BD_ATRAMEDES roaring flame'),(41457,0,0,'On your knees!',14,0,0,1,0,0,0,41461,0,'KillCreditText'),(41457,1,0,'Let this be a lesson to all Kvaldir. You are weak! Facing Azshara brings only death.',14,0,0,1,0,0,0,41468,0,'KillCreditText'),(41457,2,0,'Slink back to your pathetic mist. Return and we will slaughter every last one of you.',14,0,0,1,0,0,0,41469,0,'KillCreditText'),(41460,0,0,'Nechi owachi, $c. Hello and thank you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,45496,0,'EvStartText text'),(41460,1,0,'I will join you soon. Tog