,43456,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43302,0,4,'They called us the Bravo Company. When things needed killin\', we did the spillin\'... of blood.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43458,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43302,0,5,'So I hear Varian Wrynn is back. That true? Sorry, I\'m a bit out of the loop.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43461,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43302,0,6,'So what\'s up with the bridge in Lakeshire? Oslow ever finish building it?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43482,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43302,0,7,'Jorgensen is real dainty, by the way. He\'s a paladin, so be careful what you say around him or you\'re liable to make him cry.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43460,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43302,0,8,'You ever seen Keeshan kill an orc? It\'s a sight to behold, $g man:lady;.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43466,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43302,0,9,'Wait\'ll these orcs get a load of us. Bravo Company BACK IN BUSINESS!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43472,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43302,0,10,'So whatever happened to that hot little number in Stormwind? Lady Prestor was her name.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43474,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43303,0,0,'Messner is a master of fire magic. We invite him to all of our barbecues.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43459,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43303,0,1,'So I heard Thrall left the Horde. That true?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43469,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43303,0,2,'You ever notice how sarcastic the people living in Redridge are? Sometimes I feel like I just want to take a blow torch to that jackass Solomon\'s town hall.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43462,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43303,0,3,'I remember this one time, Keeshan and I were out fishing at the Lakeshire bridge and Keeshan farted. Don\'t think Oslow ever forgave Keeshan for that one...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43456,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43303,0,4,'They called us the Bravo Company. When things needed killin\', we did the spillin\'... of blood.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43458,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43303,0,5,'So I hear Varian Wrynn is back. That true? Sorry, I\'m a