1,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43305,0,6,'So what\'s up with the bridge in Lakeshire? Oslow ever finish building it?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43482,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43305,0,7,'I\'m probably the most important member of this team, being a paladin and all.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43471,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43305,0,8,'Wait\'ll these orcs get a load of us. Bravo Company BACK IN BUSINESS!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43472,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43305,0,9,'So whatever happened to that hot little number in Stormwind? Lady Prestor was her name.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43474,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43322,0,0,'You\'re back for more, huh?  Too bad, because I\'ve got a stronger potion mixed up this time!  Venoxis will live!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43320,0,'Zanzil @ Venoxis'),(43322,1,0,'I can\'t take much more of this...',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43321,0,'Zanzil @ Venoxis'),(43322,2,0,'Nooo!  Zanzil is a failure...',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43324,0,'Zanzil @ Venoxis'),(43324,1,0,'(Blood for the master!)',14,0,0,0,0,22069,0,47851,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent16'),(43324,1,1,'Such is your fate.',14,0,0,0,0,22070,0,47852,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent17'),(43324,1,2,'Pathetic flesh!',14,0,0,0,0,22071,0,47853,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent18'),(43324,1,3,'(Finish it! Finish them all!)',14,0,0,0,0,22072,0,47854,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent19'),(43324,1,4,'Embrace your end.',14,0,0,0,0,22073,0,47855,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent20'),(43324,1,5,'(Body and soul, to be swallowed whole!)',14,0,0,0,0,22088,0,47882,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent35'),(43324,1,6,'Now the Master has them.',14,0,0,0,0,22091,0,47885,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent38'),(43324,1,7,'(Chaos, madness! Like a hug for your brain.)',14,0,0,0,0,22092,0,47886,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent39'),(43324,2,0,'Give me your strength!',14,0,0,0,0,22078,0,47856,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent25'),(43324,2,1,'Behold the might of the hammer!',14,0,0,0,0,22079,0,47857,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent26'),(43324,2,2,'(Stop. Hammertime!)',14,0,0,0,0,22080,0,47858,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent27'),(43324,3,0,'Enough! (To His will all flesh succumbs. From His kingdom, chaos comes.) Yes - what he said.',14,0,0,0,0,22081,0,47859,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent28'),(43324,4,0,'(Infinite suffering!)',14,0,0,0,0,22082,0,47860,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent29'),(43324,4,1,'(*Snort*)',14,0,0,0,0,22083,0,47861,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent30'),(43324,4,2,'Behold the destiny of your fragile world!',14,0,0,0,0,22084,0,47862,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent31'),(43324,4,3,'More. More!',14,0,0,0,0,22085,0,47863,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent32'),(43324,4,4,'(Come, brothers! Feast on hope!)',14,0,0,0,0,22086,0,47864,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent33'),(43324,4,5,'(More. They need more.)',14,0,0,0,0,22087,0,47866,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent34'),(43324,5,0,'Everyone succumbs in the end.',14,0,0,0,0,22089,0,47883,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent36'),(43324,6,0,'(Now they see the darkness! Their eyes are open!)',14,0,0,0,0,22090,0,47884,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent37'),(43324,7,0,'Brother, it cannot be... (Destiny has come!) My strength... (Too proud! He speaks in blood! Listen!) My mind... (It is for His glory we serve!) What... is happening... (Gone is the dawn. Come shades of Twilight. Come madness, come havoc, come Infinite Night!)',14,0,0,0,0,22093,0,47868,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent40'),(43324,8,0,'(The claws of fate grasp the unbelievers!)',14,0,0,0,0,22094,0,47899,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent41'),(43324,8,1,'(The Master sees, the Master sees!)',14,0,0,0,0,22095,0,47900,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent42'),(43324,8,2,'(The Master\'s eye sees all that was and all to be, or not!)',14,0,0,0,0,22098,0,47903,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent45'),(43324,9,0,'What madness have we wrought? (Not yet enough!)',14,0,0,0,0,22096,0,47901,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent43'),(43324,10,0,'I... can\'t take much more... (Brother, it merely begins!)',14,0,0,0,0,22097,0,47902,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent44'),(43324,11,0,'Brother, we are shattered. (But the Master... I still hear... so angry... Master...?)',14,0,0,0,0,22099,0,47893,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent46'),(43324,12,0,'Brother, we are shattered. Let her finish them. (The Master does not want them near her... Brother? The Master seethes...)',14,0,0,0,0,22100,0,47894,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent47'),(43324,13,0,'It is finished. (The fate of all.)',14,0,0,0,0,22101,0,47892,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent48'),(43332,0,0,'What\'s goin\' on in here?',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43382,0,'Shade of the Hexxer @ Venoxis'),(43332,1,0,'Zanzil!  Finish with Venoxis, then we\'ll talk about your failures.',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43383,0,'Shade of the Hexxer @ Venoxis'),(43332,2,0,'Hakkar grows impatient.  And so do I.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43386,0,'Shade of the Hexxer @ Venoxis'),(43332,3,0,'You may have slain Jeklik, but you will not leave Zul\'Gurub alive.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,43387,0,'Shade of the Hexxer @ Venoxis'),(43332,4,0,'Prepare to die!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43388,0,'Shade of the Hexxer @ Venoxis'),(43333,0,0,'And if you\'ll look to your right, you\'ll see... my friend, about to get killed!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43389,0,'Sassy Hardwrench @ Venoxis'),(43333,1,0,'Quick!  Grab onto the ladder!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43390,0,'Sassy Hardwrench @ Venoxis'),(43355,0,0,'Thank you, Father Gavin. The world needs more like you and Buin in these dark times.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,43424,0,'Lowan Featherbreeze to Lowan Featherbreeze'),(43376,0,0,'How did you find me!?',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,43531,0,'Smart text'),(43377,0,0,'I haven\'t got any money! Get away!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Smart text'),(43396,0,0,'Ah, Maloriak. How gracious of you to finally appear from that quarantine you call a laboratory. What have you got this time?',12,0,0,0,0,20091,0,43488,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event23'),(43396,1,0,'By all means, enlighten me.',12,0,0,0,0,20092,0,43489,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event24'),(43396,2,0,'It appears as though your experiment has failed. That whelp has gone completely blind! Look at him.',12,0,0,0,0,20093,0,43490,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event25'),(43396,3,0,'LOOK AT HIM!',12,0,0,0,0,20156,0,43491,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event26'),(43396,4,0,'No, not yet.',12,0,0,0,0,20094,0,43492,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event27'),(43396,5,0,'This object of your chagrin may still prove... valuable... to me.',12,0,0,0,0,20095,0,43493,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event28'),(43396,6,0,'Leave now, pathetic alchemist. I anxiously await your next failure.',12,0,0,0,0,20096,0,43494,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event29'),(43404,3,0,'I present to you the prototype 25463-D!',12,0,100,21,0,19865,0,43498,0,'ÃÅ“ÃÂ°ÃÂ»ÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂº'),(43432,3,0,'Ð’Ð¾Ñ‚ Ñ‚Ð°Ðº!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,124067,0,'ÃÅ“ÃÂµÃ‘ÂÃ‘ÂÃÂ½ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ to Ãâ€ºÃÂ¾ÃÂ´ÃÂºÃÂ° ÃÅ¡ÃÂ¸Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ°'),(43440,0,0,'Ð’Ð¾Ð»ÐºÐ¾Ñ€... Ð¯ Ñ‚Ð°Ðº Ñ€Ð°Ð´Ð°, Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾ Ñ‚Ñ‹ Ð²Ñ‹Ð¶Ð¸Ð». ÐÐ¾ Ð³Ð´Ðµ Ð¶Ðµ Ð›ÑŽÑ‚Ñ‹Ð¹ ÐšÐ¾Ð³Ð¾Ñ‚ÑŒ?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33262,0,'Lordanel Sentinel'),(43448,0,0,'You got it, Johnny!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43525,0,''),(43457,0,0,'Ð’Ñ‹Ð²Ð¾Ð´Ð¸ Ð½Ð°Ñ Ð¾Ñ‚ÑÑŽÐ´Ð°, ÐœÐµÑÑÐ½ÐµÑ€.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43524,0,'Ãâ€ÃÂ¶ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½ Ãâ€ÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃÂ¹ ÃÅ¡ÃÂ¸Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ to Ãâ€ºÃÂ¾ÃÂ´ÃÂºÃÂ° ÃÅ¡ÃÂ¸Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ°'),(43457,3,0,'ÐœÑ‹ Ñ‚ÑƒÑ‚, Ð²ÑÐµ ÑƒÑ…Ð¾Ð´Ð¸Ð¼!',12,7,100,22,0,0,0,43526,0,'Ãâ€ÃÂ¶ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½ Ãâ€ÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃÂ¹ ÃÅ¡ÃÂ¸Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ to Ãâ€ºÃÂ¾ÃÂ´ÃÂºÃÂ° ÃÅ¡ÃÂ¸Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ°'),(43458,0,0,'Danforth, report.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43592,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43458,1,0,'Krakauer?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43594,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43458,2,0,'Jorgensen, what do you have on Render\'s Valley?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43597,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43458,3,0,'Death trap, eh? Messner, I got a plan. Gonna need some seaforium.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43599,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43458,4,0,'Not my problem, Messner. Make it happen.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43601,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43458,5,0,'$n, get your crap ready. I\'m sending you out into the field.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43602,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43459,0,0,'Seaforium? Where the hell am I gonna get seaforium from, Johnny?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43600,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43460,0,0,'Blackrocks all over the damned place, Johnny. One main tower at the choke and two smaller huts. It\'s a death trap.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43598,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43461,0,0,'Two ways to get behind enemy lines, Johnny. Three if you count bein\' dead.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43595,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43461,1,0,'North through Alther\'s Mill, but we\'d have to cut through an army of bloodthirsty worgs or south through Render\'s Valley.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43596,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43462,0,0,'The Blackrock orcs blew up the bridge leading to Stonewatch Keep. Frontal assault is out of the question.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43593,0,'Bravo Company @ Lake'),(43496,0,0,'The Bravo Company, all present and accounted for...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44172,0,'Darkblaze summoned for Quest 26714 Intro'),(43496,1,0,'Did you truly believe that the orcs had the presence of mind required to plan an invasion of this magnitude?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44173,0,'Darkblaze summoned for Quest 26714 Intro'),(43496,2,0,'No matter. You will die now, a paltry offering to Deathwing as our march upon Stormwind begins.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44174,0,'Darkblaze summoned for Quest 26714 Intro'),(43496,3,0,'Feed the master\'s rage! COME AND DIE!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,44175,0,'Darkblaze summoned for Quest 26714 Battle Aggro'),(43496,4,0,'I grow tired of these games!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,44176,0,'Darkblaze summoned for Quest 26714 Battle 25%'),(43496,5,0,'Suffer in flames!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,44177,0,'Darkblaze summoned for Quest 26714 Battle'),(43496,6,0,'You will die with me, Keeshan! This world has enough heroes!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,44209,0,'Darkblaze summoned for Quest 26714 Outro'),(43512,0,0,'You have your mop, now look for stains to swab!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,43610,0,'Quest 26633/swabbing-duty'),(43512,1,0,'You spot a stain on the deck!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,43605,0,'Quest 26633/swabbing-duty'),(43512,2,0,'Two more stains appear!  Keep cleaning!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,43606,0,'Quest 26633/swabbing-duty'),(43512,3,0,'The stains are appearing more quickly now!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,43607,0,'Quest 26633/swabbing-duty'),(43512,4,0,'Don\'t let stains sit for too long!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,43603,0,'Quest 26633/swabbing-duty'),(43512,5,0,'A stain is about to ruin the deck!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,43604,0,'Quest 26633/swabbing-duty'),(43512,6,0,'The deck is ruined.  Pick up another mop and try again.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,43608,0,'Quest 26633/swabbing-duty'),(43515,3,0,'Follow the path of the homeless and you will easily find the entrance to the Deadmines dungeon.',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,43612,0,'Moonbrook Player Trigger to Player'),(43557,0,0,'Let\'s take these ninjas out, boss.  I already see some of \'em up ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43635,0,'Dead-Eye Drederick McGumm during Quest 26648/our-mortal-enemies'),(43557,1,0,'I should get going back to the Crimson Veil.  See you there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43634,0,'Dead-Eye Drederick McGumm during Quest 26648/our-mortal-enemies'),(43572,0,0,'We\'\'re free! RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(43587,0,0,'Yarr, hold on tight, me hearty, fer thar be nary an oarsman so capable as I!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43660,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,1,0,'We be headin\' up t\' where the goblins say they found black gold.  That gold belongs t\' the Bloodsail!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43662,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,2,0,'I\'ll steer, you handle Ol\' Blasty.  An\' don\'t tie yer skivvies in a knot... I\'ll slow down when we get closer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43664,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,3,0,'On t\' the next one!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43672,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,4,1,'Ready... open fire!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43666,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,4,2,'That gold is ours!  Open fire, says I!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43669,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,4,3,'Here we are!  Fire at will!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43665,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,4,4,'Ahoy!  I see more o\' those goblins over there!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43675,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,4,5,'They be on either side of us!  Send \'em down to Neptulon\'s Locker!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43667,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43587,5,0,'Aye-aye, sir.  Heavin\' to and returnin\' back t\' shore.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43677,0,'Oarsman during Quest 26649/drive-by-piracy'),(43612,0,0,'Begone infidels, you are not welcome here!',1,0,0,0,0,19735,0,44791,0,'VO_TV_Barim_Engage01'),(43612,1,0,'May peace find you now.',1,0,0,0,0,19738,0,44793,0,'VO_TV_Barim_Kill01'),(43612,2,0,'Kneel before me and repent!',1,0,0,0,0,19737,0,44795,0,'VO_TV_Barim_Event02'),(43612,2,1,'The Heavens take you!',1,0,0,0,0,19736,0,44794,0,'VO_TV_Barim_Event01'),(43612,3,0,'Death is only the beginning!',1,0,0,0,0,19733,0,78550,0,'VO_TV_Barim_Death'),(43614,4,0,'%s falls into a frenzy!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,30726,0,'Ãâ€”Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ±ÃÂ¾Ã‘â€¦ÃÂ»ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¿'),(43626,0,0,'Victory for the Dragonmaw!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43717,0,''),(43636,0,0,'Draw yer own steel, ye harpy-lovin\' scoundrel!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43708,0,''),(43636,0,1,'I\'d never leave the Buccaneers, ye whale-tail skivvy-sniffer!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43707,0,''),(43636,0,2,'I\'d never turn sides, ye green-gilled murloc!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43709,0,''),(43636,0,3,'I\'ll poke out yer deadlights, ye lily-livered eel!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43714,0,''),(43636,0,4,'I\'ll run ye through, ye cannon-kissin\' cannonface!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43711,0,''),(43636,0,5,'I\'ll send ye to feed the fishes, ye flat-shanty trogg!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43713,0,''),(43636,0,6,'Mutiny? I\'ll show ye mutiny, ye cockle-knuckled squiffy!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(43659,0,0,'Yes Sir! We\'ve been biding our time in Gilneas far too long. We\'re ready for blood!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(43660,0,0,'We used to roam the seas... \'til that damned King Greymane shut down the harbors in Gilneas! If it weren\'t for him, we wouldn\'t be...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(43661,0,0,'Yes sir. We attack from the north at your signal. The B