,0,0,0,0,43822,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,1,'Best wishes from the Bravo Company.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43919,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,2,'WAR IS IN MY BLOOD!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,44127,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,3,'You brought this on yourself!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,44128,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,4,'Shoulda just left us alone.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,44129,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,5,'FEEL THE THUNDER!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,44130,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,6,'You\'re nothing!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,44131,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,7,'Your pain excites me!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,44132,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,8,'Nowhere to run!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43430,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,9,'You messed with the wrong soldier!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43431,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,0,10,'GET SOME!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43436,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43812,1,0,'You gutless bastard! You\'ve killed \'em all! Now I kill you!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,44210,0,'Keeshan summoned NPC'),(43814,0,0,'The worgen stares and hesitates!',42,0,50,0,0,0,0,44126,0,'20% Text'),(43826,0,0,'And keep the change you filthy animal!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43432,0,'Messner summoned NPC'),(43826,0,1,'I\'m just gettin\' warmed up!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43433,0,'Messner summoned NPC'),(43826,0,2,'Is that the best you can do?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43434,0,'Messner summoned NPC'),(43826,0,3,'I don\'t even have my gear on!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43435,0,'Messner summoned NPC'),(43826,0,4,'Eat dirt you filthy mongrel!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43427,0,'Messner summoned NPC'),(43826,0,5,'Back to your maker!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43428,0,'Messner summoned NPC'),(43826,0,6,'No good piece of crap!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43429,0,'Messner summoned NPC'),(43826,0,8,'Being a mage has its advantages, but the laundry bills are hell to pay.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43481,0,'Messner summoned NPC'),(43827,0,0,'So I heard Thrall left the Horde. That true?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43469,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,0,1,'Can\'t believe we\'re putting the old team back together. All thanks to you, $n.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43468,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,0,2,'And just like that, you\'re dead!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43437,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,0,4,'I\'ve had tougher craps.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43439,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,0,5,'Welcome to hell!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43440,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,0,6,'I\'m probably the most important member of this team, being a paladin and all.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43471,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,0,7,'You ever seen Keeshan kill an orc? It\'s a sight to behold, $g man:lady;.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43466,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,1,0,'You know, I\'ve always wondered why they call themselves orcs.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43451,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,2,0,'It\'s an ugly word, you know? It\'s a word I\'d use to describe defecating. For example:',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43452,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43827,3,0,'After that Pilgrim\'s Bounty dinner, I took a huge smelly orc.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43453,0,'Jorgensen summoned NPC'),(43828,0,0,'Is that the best you can do?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43434,0,'Danforth summoned NPC'),(43828,0,1,'Jorgensen is real dainty, by the way. He\'s a paladin, so be careful what you say around him or you\'re liable to make him cry.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43460,0,'Danforth summoned NPC'),(43828,0,2,'Revenge is a dish best served with a butt whompin\'!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43443,0,'Danforth summoned NPC'),(43828,0,3,'So whatever happened to that hot little number in Stormwind? Lady Prestor was her name.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43474,0,'Danforth summoned NPC'),(43828,0,4,'When this is all over, I\'m taking a vacation.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43478,0,'Danforth summoned NPC'),(43828,0,5,'You ever notice how sarcastic the people living in Redridge are? Sometimes I feel like I just want to take a blow torch to that jackass Solomon\'s town hall.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43462,0,'Danforth summoned NPC'),(43828,0,6,'I remember this one time, Keeshan and I were out fishing at the Lakeshire bridge and Keeshan farted. Don\'t think Oslow ever forgave Keeshan for that one...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43456,0,'Danforth summoned NPC'),(43828,0,7,'Wait\'ll these orcs get a load of us. Bravo Company BACK IN BUSINESS!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43472,0,'Danforth summoned NPC'),(43829,0,0,'You know, I kept hearing the Blackrock orcs talk about the return of Hellscream to the Horde. What\'s that all about? Isn\'t Hellscream dead?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43470,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43829,0,1,'Keeshan\'s a good man, $n. Any of us would give our lives for him.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43477,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43829,0,2,'Tired of orcs. We need to kill \'em all and let Thrall sort \'em out.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,44142,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43829,0,3,'I really missed you, Danforth.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43455,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43829,0,4,'Messner is a master of fire magic. We invite him to all of our barbecues.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43459,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43829,0,5,'They called us the Bravo Company. When things needed killin\', we did the spillin\'... of blood.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43458,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43829,0,6,'So I hear Varian Wrynn is back. That true? Sorry, I\'m a bit out of the loop.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43461,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43829,0,7,'So what\'s up with the bridge in Lakeshire? Oslow ever finish building it?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,43482,0,'Krakauer summoned NPC'),(43846,0,0,'All cannons!  Open fire on the Crimson Veil!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,43951,0,'Booty Bay Cannoneer during Booty Bay Pirate Quest chain'),(43864,3,0,'Dat not good.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44238,0,'Braz the Windreaver to Shandris Feathermoon'),(43867,3,0,'Cry havoc, brothers and sisters!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,39696,0,'Shandris Feathermoon to 39607'),(43904,0,0,'Brother!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43966,0,'Tobias Mistmantle Spawned for Quest 26674'),(43904,1,0,'Tell me it\'s not true, brother. Tell me you didn\'t die a murderer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,43967,0,'Tob