,12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fiona'),(45417,1,0,'Fiona laughs',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fiona'),(45417,2,0,'Gidwin, you can sit in front with me next time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fiona'),(45417,3,0,'ÐšÑÑ‚Ð°Ñ‚Ð¸, Ð¼Ð¾Ð¶ÐµÑˆÑŒ Ð¿Ð¾Ð»ÑŒÐ·Ð¾Ð²Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒÑÑ Ð»ÑŽÐ±Ñ‹Ð¼Ð¸ Ð²ÐµÑ‰Ð°Ð¼Ð¸, ÐºÐ¾Ñ‚Ð¾Ñ€Ñ‹Ðµ Ð½Ð°Ð¹Ð´ÐµÑˆÑŒ Ð² ÐºÐ°Ñ€Ð°Ð²Ð°Ð½Ðµ. Ð¢Ð¾Ð»ÑŒÐºÐ¾ Ð½Ðµ Ð·Ð°Ð±ÑƒÐ´ÑŒ Ð¿Ð¾Ñ‚Ð¾Ð¼ Ð²ÐµÑ€Ð½ÑƒÑ‚ÑŒ Ð²ÑÐµ Ð½Ð° ÑÐ²Ð¾Ð¸ Ð¼ÐµÑÑ‚Ð°!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46090,0,'ÃÂ¤ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½ÃÂ° to Player'),(45417,4,0,'The roads here are rough, Gidwin. I don\'t want to risk losing a horse.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fiona'),(45417,5,0,'Here we are!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fiona'),(45429,0,0,'Shotgun!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,1,0,'Because I won our bet. And I called shotgun.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,2,0,'Fine. I killed five zombies. And they were huge. How many undead did you kill?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,3,0,'I\'m going to bet that you only killed four.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,4,0,'I didn\'t. You just told me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,5,0,'So seriously, how did your undead hunting go? I want to hear stories.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,6,0,'Gidwin? Are you ignoring me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,7,0,'Giddy... you are mad at me, aren\'t you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,8,0,'Remember when we were kids, Gidwin? We would spend all day pretending to fight the trolls, or the murlocs, or the girls.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,9,0,'We had a name we called ourselves... what was it?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,10,0,'I\'m dead serious. I\'ve completely forgotten.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,11,0,'Actually, I agree with Fiona.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45429,12,0,' The Argent Crusade can wait for us a little while longer. Besides, our guest may want to get off the caravan soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarenar SunstrikeÃ‚Â '),(45431,0,0,'Hey now! Why do you get to sit in front?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,1,0,'Who says you won the bet? We haven\'t compared tallies yet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,2,0,'I\'m pretty sure I killed six.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,3,0,'H... how did you know that?',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,4,0,'Don\'t do this, Tarenar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,5,0,'You remember damn well enough what it was.',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,6,0,' <Sigh>... \"The Paladin Pals\".',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,7,0,'Maybe now I don\'t want to. Maybe I like it better sitting back here with my new friend. It smells like horses up there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,8,0,'We just rested a few minutes ago! Let\'s just go to Light\'s Hope Chapel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45431,9,0,'We won\'t lose a horse. Look at them! They look exactly like they did when we started.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin GoldbraidsÃ‚Â '),(45445,4,0,'Whoa! This is - um interesting!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,50400,0,'ÃÂ¢ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÂ£ÃÂ´ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÂ¡ÃÂ¾ÃÂ»ÃÂ½Ã‘â€ ÃÂ° to Ãâ€œÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ»ÃÂ¾Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂµÃÂ½Ã‘Å’ ÃÂ¡Ã‘â€šÃ‘Æ’ÃÂ¿ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂµÃÂ¹ ÃÂ¡ÃÂ¼ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘â€šÃÂ¸'),(45447,0,0,'I have been taken prisoner by the Twilight\'s Hammer.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,45614,0,''),(45447,1,0,'I\'m not certain where. Start with their western base overlooking Highperch.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,45615,0,''),(45447,2,0,'Stop! You have bested my wind serpent.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,45613,0,''),(45447,3,0,'Thanks for gifts. Let\'s see what you\'re worth, $c!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,45611,0,''),(45473,0,0,'What about you, Belmont? How will you get back?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45701,0,'Arthura Quest The Great Escape'),(45473,1,0,'So be it. Farewell, Belmont.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45706,0,'Arthura Quest The Great Escape'),(45473,2,0,'Oh my... hang on tight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45707,0,'Arthura Quest The Great Escape'),(45474,0,0,'I\'ll be fine, Arthura. The worgen lost our scent. It\'s doubtful that they even know we\'re here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45702,0,'Belmont Quest The Great Escape'),(45474,1,0,'I\'ll probably make it back to the Forsaken Front before you two, er, three.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45703,0,'Belmont Quest The Great Escape'),(45474,2,0,'Now move out! You must not keep the Banshee Queen waiting.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45704,0,'Belmont Quest The Great Escape'),(45574,0,0,'Ð‘Ñ€Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒÑ! ÐÑ‚Ð°ÐºÑƒÐ¹Ñ‚Ðµ |3-3($r)!',14,0,100,23,0,0,0,45708,0,'Vex\'tul'),(45631,0,0,'For the Horde...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45743,0,'Cromush Quest Rise Godfrey'),(45704,0,0,'%s Ð¿Ð¾Ð½Ð¸Ð¼Ð°ÐµÑ‚, Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾ ÐµÐµ Ð·Ð°Ð¼ÐµÑ‚Ð¸Ð»Ð¸, Ð¸ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ñ‚Ð²Ð¾Ñ€ÑÐµÑ‚ÑÑ Ð¼ÐµÑ€Ñ‚Ð²Ð¾Ð¹!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,46485,0,'Ãâ€”ÃÂ°Ã‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂ¸ÃÂ²Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ°Ã‘ÂÃ‘ÂÃ‘Â ÃÂ±Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Â to Ãâ€”ÃÂ°Ã‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂ¸ÃÂ²Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ°Ã‘ÂÃ‘ÂÃ‘Â ÃÂ±Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Â'),(45809,0,0,'%s is trying to escape in a panic!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1150,0,'Ãâ€˜ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ³ÃÂ¾ÃÂ²ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ¼ÃÂ°ÃÂºÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ°'),(45870,1,0,'It shall be I that earns the favor of our lord by casting out the intruders. My calmest wind shall still prove too much for them!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50596,0,''),(45870,2,0,'Begone, outsider!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50597,0,''),(45870,3,0,'Your presence shall no longer defile our home!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50598,0,''),(45870,4,0,'My power grows feeble, brothers. I shamefully must rely on you for a time.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50601,0,''),(45870,5,0,'You think to outrun the wind? A fatal mistake.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50599,0,''),(45870,6,0,'The power of our winds, UNLEASHED!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50600,0,''),(45871,1,0,'The honor of slaying the interlopers shall be mine, brothers! Their feeble bodies will freeze solid from my wind\'s icy chill!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50589,0,''),(45871,2,0,'Frozen solid.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50590,0,''),(45871,3,0,'Another mortal has taken their last breath!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50591,0,''),(45871,4,0,'Brothers, beware! These mortals are dangerous. I must pause and gather my strength.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50595,0,''),(45871,5,0,'You throw away your honor and flee as cowards? Then die!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50592,0,''),(45872,1,0,'As I am the strongest wind, it shall be I that tears the invaders apart!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50602,0,''),(45872,2,0,'Mere dust...',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50604,0,''),(45872,3,0,'Blown away!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50603,0,''),(45872,4,0,'The intruders stand fast, brothers, I cannot break them. Allow me a brief respite to strengthen my winds.',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50607,0,''),(45872,5,0,'Why do you flee, mortals? There is nowhere you can run or hide here!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,50606,0,''),(45878,0,0,'I feel slightly unhinged. I am not taking well to this... condition.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46020,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,0,1,'Crowley? I knew him. He was nothing more than a criminal before the curse took hold of our land. Now he\'s a great worgen hero? Sickening...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46021,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,0,2,'Bloodfang? When the attacks upon Gilneas first occurred, it was Bloodfang\'s worgen that lead the charge. This monster and his pack have been terrorizing these lands for years.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46022,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,0,3,'Just do as I say and this war will end without incident. Unless you count the death of every worgen in Lordaeron as an incident.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46023,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,0,4,'Never did I dream that our \"king\" would betray us as he did. To think that he had been a worgen in secret while he ruled over us. Sickening...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46024,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,0,5,'\"It\'s over, Godfrey...\" That\'s what he told me right before I jumped off of the cliff. NOTHING IS OVER, GREYMANE! I LIVE AGAIN!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46025,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,0,6,'We used to burn the worgen when we killed them - to be sure that they were dead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46026,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,0,7,'Gilneas was an impossible dream. Only a man of true vision could have seen it through... but Greymane? Never...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46027,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,0,8,'For pity\'s sake, Ashbury, cover yourself. Your leg bones are popping out.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46028,0,'Godfrey Random Speech'),(45878,1,0,'These cowering troopers should die in shame. This is an embarassment.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45951,0,'Godfrey to Cowering Trooper'),(45878,1,1,'The Dark Lady lets these mongrels live? Useless...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45948,0,'Godfrey to Cowering Trooper'),(45878,1,2,'Cowardly dog. Run back to your mommy and hide.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45947,0,'Godfrey to Cowering Trooper'),(45878,1,3,'I would have burned this whole place down with them in it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45950,0,'Godfrey to Cowering Trooper'),(45878,1,4,'Get out of my sight before I execute you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45952,0,'Godfrey to Cowering Trooper'),(45878,2,0,'Some people only want to watch the world burn. Others want to be the ones responsible for burning it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45974,0,'Godfrey Random Fire Speech'),(45878,2,1,'Through fire we purge this land of its impurities.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45975,0,'Godfrey Random Fire Speech'),(45878,2,2,'Reduced to ashes... Soon nothing will be left of Gilneas or the worgen taint.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45976,0,'Godfrey Random Fire Speech'),(45878,3,0,'HAH! Don\'t you recognize us, Dempsey? It\'s Godfrey. I have here Lord Walden and Baron Ashbury. We\'ve \"saved\" you and this is the thanks that we get?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46043,0,'Godfrey on From the Belly of the Beast'),(45878,4,0,'You always were a spineless coward, Dempsey.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46053,0,'Godfrey on From the Belly of the Beast'),(45878,5,0,'Lorna, is that how you greet old friends? ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46073,0,'Godfrey during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45878,6,0,'My kingdom? My kingdom is no more.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46076,0,'Godfrey during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45878,7,0,'Your father and Greymane saw to that... No, Gilneas died when they allowed murderous beasts to reign free. Unchecked.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46077,0,'Godfrey during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45878,8,0,'Now lay down your arms and surrender. We are not here to kill you. Not yet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46078,0,'Godfrey during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45878,9,0,'Quickly! We must head back to the Forsaken Front before we are discovered!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46084,0,'Godfrey during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45879,0,0,'I\'m losing my mind. Can\'t keep my thoughts together...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46037,0,'Walden Random Speech'),(45880,0,0,'I did not bring this wretched affliction upon myself, Godfrey. It was a \"gift,\" remember? Now kindly enjoy the \"gift\" and shut up.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46029,0,'Ashbury Random Speech'),(45910,0,0,'Is it safe?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45937,0,'Cowering Trooper on Rescue'),(45910,0,1,'Are... are they all dead?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45938,0,'Cowering Trooper on Rescue'),(45910,0,2,'They struck from the shadows. We didn\'t stand a chance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45939,0,'Cowering Trooper on Rescue'),(45910,0,3,'I thought I was done for!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45940,0,'Cowering Trooper on Rescue'),(45910,0,4,'You must be the hero that everyone is talking about. Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45941,0,'Cowering Trooper on Rescue'),(45910,0,5,'They\'re EVERYWHERE! WATCH OUT!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45943,0,'Cowering Trooper on Rescue'),(45910,0,6,'We overheard their orders... no survivors...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45944,0,'Cowering Trooper on Rescue'),(45941,0,0,'Ð’Ð¾Ñ‚ Ð¼Ñ‹ Ð¸ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ð±Ñ‹Ð»Ð¸!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45602,0,'ÃÂ¤ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½ÃÂ° to ÃÅ¡ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ²ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ ÃÂ¤ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹'),(45941,3,0,'Look, there is a tower on the left. Maybe we can stop and rest?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,45596,0,'ÃÂ¤ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½ÃÂ° to ÃÅ¡ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ²ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ ÃÂ¤ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹'),(45967,4,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1150,0,'Marshfin Murkdweller'),(45977,0,0,'Wha? What happened to me? WHO ARE YOU PEOPLE?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46041,0,'Sean Dempsey on From the Belly of the Beast'),(45977,1,0,'HELP! HELP! I\'ve been captured by monsters!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46042,0,'Sean Dempsey on From the Belly of the Beast'),(45977,2,0,'You... You saved me? I\'m a damned monster! YOU\'RE A DAMNED MONSTER! LOOK AT YOURSELF!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46049,0,'Sean Dempsey on From the Belly of the Beast'),(45979,0,0,'The cannon was rigged with an explosive trap!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,48790,0,'General Purpose Bunny JMF to Player'),(45979,1,0,'A shadowy figure appears in the ship\'s cabin!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,48276,0,'General Purpose Bunny JMF to Player'),(45992,0,0,'Do as the master commands, Theralion! Kill them!',14,0,0,0,0,21894,0,47523,0,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event01'),(45992,1,0,'You are worthless, Theralion!',14,0,0,0,0,21895,0,47524,0,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event02'),(45992,2,0,'Breathe your dying breath!',14,0,0,0,0,21896,0,47959,0,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event03'),(45992,3,0,'At least Theralion dies with me...',14,0,0,0,0,21897,0,47960,0,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event04'),(45992,4,0,'Theralion! I will engulf the Hallway! Cover their escape!',14,0,0,0,0,21898,0,47961,0,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event05'),(45992,5,0,'Enter Twilight!',14,0,0,0,0,21899,0,47962,0,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event06'),(45993,0,0,'The master was clearly speaking to you, Valiona. I am far too busy to attack ANYONE.',14,0,0,0,0,20300,0,47521,0,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event01'),(45993,1,0,'How dare you call me worthless! You will see why I am Mothers favored child!',14,0,0,0,0,20301,0,47522,0,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event02'),(45993,2,0,'Bare your soul to me, mortal.',14,0,0,0,0,20302,0,47908,0,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event03'),(45993,3,0,'I knew I should have stayed out of this...',14,0,0,0,0,20303,0,47910,0,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event04'),(45993,4,0,'You are not the boss of me Valiona! I will engulf as I please!',14,0,0,0,0,20304,0,47911,0,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event05'),(45993,5,0,'There is no escape from the fury of the Twilight Flight!',14,0,0,0,0,20305,0,47912,0,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event06'),(45993,6,0,'Writhe in AGONY!',14,0,0,0,0,20306,0,47913,0,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event07'),(45993,7,0,'Theralion cackles maniacally.',16,0,0,0,0,20307,0,0,0,'VO_BT_Theralion_Laugh1'),(45997,0,0,'So the Banshee Queen has sent assassins?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46072,0,'Lorna Crowley during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45997,1,0,'Godfrey? So the rumors are true.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46074,0,'Lorna Crowley during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45997,2,0,'You would betray your kingdom out of spite?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46075,0,'Lorna Crowley during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45997,3,0,'HAH! You\'ll have to kill me! DIE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46079,0,'Lorna Crowley during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(45997,4,0,'%s falls unconscious.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,46080,0,'Lorna Crowley during On Her Majesty\'s Service'),(46028,0,0,'Hello, old friend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46202,0,'Godfrey Quest Cities of Dust'),(46028,1,0,'Of course, mistress.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46207,0,'Godfrey Quest Cities of Dust'),(46028,2,0,'Something that should have been done a long time ago, you filthy animal.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46214,0,'Godfrey Quest Cities of Dust'),(46028,3,0,'Gilneas belongs to me, and so soon will the rest of Lordaeron!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46215,0,'Godfrey Quest Cities of Dust'),(46028,4,0,'NOW JOIN YOUR MISTRESS IN DEATH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46216,0,'Godfrey Quest Cities of Dust'),(46028,5,0,'FALL BACK, BROTHERS! TO SHADOWFANG!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,46217,0,'Godfrey Quest Cities of Dust'),(46028,6,0,'This land will quiver and shake in the wake of our destruction!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,46218,0,'Godfrey Quest Cities of Dust'),(46034,0,0,'Different master, same insatiable thirst for power.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,45093,0,'Agatha when resurrecting Forsaken Quest 27097 rise-forsaken'),(46034,0,1,'Rise and destroy our enemies!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,45115,0,'Agatha when resurrecting Forsaken Quest 27097 rise-forsaken'),(46034,0,2,'Bow before your new master!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,45114,0,'Agatha when resurrecting Forsaken Quest 27097 rise-forsaken'),(46034,0,3,'Rise, Forsaken!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,45088,0,'Agatha when resurrecting Forsaken Quest 27097 rise-forsaken'),(46034,0,4,'You serve the Banshee Queen now, mortal.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,45089,0,'Agatha when resurrecting Forsaken Quest 27097 rise-forsaken'),(46034,0,5,'Death is only the beginning.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,45090,0,'Agatha when resurrecting Forsaken Quest 27097 rise-forsaken'),(46034,0,6,'For the glory of the Dark Lady!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,45107,0,'Agatha when resurrecting Forsaken Quest 27097 rise-forsaken'),(46034,1,0,'Run...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45184,0,'Agatha Quest 27099 no-escape'),(46034,2,0,'RUN!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45185,0,'Agatha Quest 27099 no-escape'),(46035,0,0,'You can\'t be serious, Crowley. You miserable bastard!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46205,0,'Ivar Quest Cities of Dust'),(46036,0,0,'The Forsaken have broken through your defenses, magistrate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45161,0,'Darius for Quest No Escape'),(46036,1,0,'You are out of time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45162,0,'Darius for Quest No Escape'),(46036,2,0,'A decision must be made!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45163,0,'Darius for Quest No Escape'),(46036,3,0,'Die in battle and be raised as a servant of the Forsaken or...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45164,0,'Darius for Quest No Escape'),(46036,4,0,'Drink in my blood and be reborn as worgen, immune to the depravity of the Forsaken.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45165,0,'Darius for Quest No Escape'),(46036,5,0,'Help us destroy the Forsaken and retake Lordaeron for the Alliance!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,45166,0,'Darius for Quest No Escape'),(46036,6,0,'It\'s not over, Sylvanas. Not yet.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46189,0,'Darius Quest Cities of Dust'),(46036,7,0,'We will die trying!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46193,0,'Darius Quest Cities of Dust'),(46036,8,0,'LORNA? What... Where is she!? What have you done to her!?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46195,0,'Darius Quest Cities of Dust'),(46036,9,0,'GODFREY! You deceitful maggot!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46203,0,'Darius Quest Cities of Dust'),(46036,10,0,'Lorna... I... Release her. I will sound the retreat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46204,0,'Darius Quest Cities of Dust'),(46036,11,0,'Forgive me, daughter...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46210,0,'Darius Quest Cities of Dust'),(46083,0,0,'%s Ð¸Ð·Ð¼ÐµÐ½ÑÐµÑ‚ÑÑ, Ð¼ÐµÑ€Ñ†Ð°Ñ.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,9793,0,'Ãâ€Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂºÃÂ¾ÃÂ±ÃÂµÃÂ»Ã‘Å’-ÃÂ¿ÃÂ¾ÃÂ»Ã‘Æ’ÃÂºÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾ÃÂ²ÃÂºÃÂ° to 0'),(46124,0,0,'Onward, $n! We will beat back the Alliance dogs and secure Lordaeron for the Forsaken! For the Horde!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46139,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,1,0,'Accompany Lady Sylvanas Windrunner across the Battlefront.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,46257,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,2,0,'Lay down your arms and surrender!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,46142,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,3,0,'I will leave your cities in dust and your lives in ruin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46141,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,4,0,'Look at them, $p. They scurry like rats, veering headlong to their doom. Surely Crowley and Bloodfang can see the futility in this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46143,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,5,0,'To the Greymane Wall! We will force their hand.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46144,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,6,0,'Crowley, your forces have fallen before my mighty army. You have lost!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,46188,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,7,0,'You frivolously throw away the lives of your people while your own king sits atop his throne of lies, nary lifting a finger to help.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46190,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,8,0,'Is Gilneas worth the lives that have been lost? The lives that will be lost? You cannot win.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46191,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,9,0,'And your daughter? You could have saved her... You could have offered her your blood, yet you did not. Why?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46194,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,10,0,'Nothing, yet...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46196,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,11,0,'I now present you with a choice - a choice that I was never given.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46197,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,12,0,'I offer you the life of Lorna for your unconditional surrender.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46198,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,13,0,'Choose your next words wisely, Crowley. Deny me and she will serve me in undeath - forever.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46199,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,14,0,'Bring her, Godfrey!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,46200,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,15,0,'Release her, Godfrey.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46206,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,16,0,'Now leave here, Crowley, and never return.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46208,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,17,0,'Lordaeron belongs to the Forsaken.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46209,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,18,0,'SOLDIERS OF THE HORDE! WE ARE VICTORIOUS! LORDAERON IS W...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,46211,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,19,0,'%s dies.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,46212,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,20,0,'I saw... only darkness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46224,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,21,0,'And as I drifted towards nothingness, a brilliant light appeared, then another, and another... My dear val\'kyr.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46225,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,22,0,'I know now - beyond a shadow of a doubt - that the val\'kyr are our future.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46226,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46124,23,0,'We will never stop fighting for Lordaeron. Never...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46227,0,'Sylvanas Quest Cities of Dust'),(46149,3,0,'Blowin \'em to bits, boss!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,46330,0,'Southsea Grenadier to Tony Two-Tusk'),(46154,3,0,'Aye aye!',12,0,100,113,0,0,0,46326,0,'Southsea Burnmaster to Tony Two-Tusk'),(46173,0,0,'ÐšÑ‚Ð¾ ÑÑ‚Ð¾ ÑÐºÐ°Ð·Ð°Ð», Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾ Ð¿Ð¾Ð±ÐµÐ´Ð