will.)',14,0,0,0,0,22060,0,47497,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent07'),(46965,8,0,'Mortals, you merely separate the wheat from the chaff. (Unworthy, unworthy).',14,0,0,0,0,22062,0,47488,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent09'),(46965,9,0,'Valiona, Theralion, put them in their place.',14,0,0,0,0,22063,0,47518,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent10'),(46965,10,0,'(Come closer, closer. Let us see your faces. All will be humbled before his power.)',14,0,0,0,0,22064,0,47538,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent11'),(46965,11,0,'Welcome, mortals. (Frail little children). Few have laid eyes on this inner sanctum. (They reach out to touch the fire!)',14,0,0,0,0,22065,0,47585,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent12'),(46965,12,0,'It is here the chosen realize their destiny. (One with eternity). And it is here that you will realize yours.(End of the flesh. End of the flesh)!',14,0,0,0,0,22066,0,47587,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent13'),(46965,13,0,'Brothers of Twilight! The Hammer calls to you! (Fire water earth air). Leave your mortal shell behind. (Fire water earth air). Embrace your new forms for here and everafter! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate). And use your gifts to destroy the unbelievers. (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate)!!',14,0,0,0,0,22067,0,47588,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent14'),(46965,14,0,'Foolish mortals-(Usurper\'s children!) nothing you have done- (Spawn of a lesser god!) I am TRYING to speak here. (Words, words, words. The Master wants murder.) ALL falls to chaos. ALL will be destroyed. (Chaos, chaos!) Your work here today changes nothing. (Chaos, chaos, all things end) No mortal may see what you have and live. Your end has come.',14,0,0,0,0,22068,0,47591,0,'VO_BT_Chogall_BotEvent15'),(46986,0,0,'Light nobody wants to harm my child. But in our area has a lot of enemies.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Smart Text'),(46986,1,0,'Now approaching the great battle between the forces of Light and Darkness. Need our help and all the suffering of death will be meaningless.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Smart Text'),(46986,2,0,'Magtur you honestly fulfilled their duty . Are you ready to go back to the Light?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Smart Text'),(46986,3,0,'God keep you light!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Smart Text'),(46986,4,0,'Remember, Avuun. Not everyone who is looking for a way to have lost her.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Smart Text'),(46987,0,0,'A vision of Ysera appears before you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂ´ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂµ ÃËœÃÂ·ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘â€¹ to Player'),(46998,0,0,'A vision of Ysera appears before you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂ´ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂµ ÃËœÃÂ·ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘â€¹ to Player'),(46998,3,0,'Ð˜Ñ‚Ð°Ðº, Ð¢Ð¾Ñ€Ñ‚Ð¾Ð»Ð»Ð° Ð²ÑÑ‚ÑƒÐ¿Ð¸Ð» Ð² Ð¿Ñ€Ð¾Ñ‚Ð¸Ð²Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ð¾ÑÐ½Ð¸Ðµ Ð½Ð° Ð½Ð°ÑˆÐµÐ¹ ÑÑ‚Ð¾Ñ€Ð¾Ð½Ðµ. Ð¢Ñ‹ $gÐ¼ÑƒÐ´Ñ€:Ð¼ÑƒÐ´Ñ€Ð°;, $n. Ð¡Ð»Ð¾Ð¶Ð½Ð¾ Ð·Ð°Ñ€ÑƒÑ‡Ð¸Ñ‚ÑŒÑÑ Ð¿Ð¾Ð´Ð´ÐµÑ€Ð¶ÐºÐ¾Ð¹ ÑÑ‚Ð¾Ð³Ð¾ Ð”Ñ€ÐµÐ²Ð½ÐµÐ³Ð¾. ÐžÐ½ ÑÑ‚Ð°Ð½ÐµÑ‚ Ð½Ð°ÑˆÐ¸Ð¼ Ð²ÐµÑ€Ð½Ñ‹Ð¼ ÑÐ¾ÑŽÐ·Ð½Ð¸ÐºÐ¾Ð¼.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,47025,0,'Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂ´ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂµ ÃËœÃÂ·ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘â€¹ to Player'),(47002,0,0,'A vision of Ysera appears before you.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂ´ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂµ ÃËœÃÂ·ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘â€¹ to Player'),(47002,3,0,'The guardian of heaven has shot up again! Great news, $n. But we still have a lot to do. Your presence is needed in another part of the sacred mountain.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,47026,0,'Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂ´ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂµ ÃËœÃÂ·ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘â€¹ to Player'),(47006,0,0,'I smell the vile smell of Walden. Let him bleed!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,47189,0,'Ãâ€™ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¶ÃÂ°ÃÂº Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂ¸ ÃËœÃÂ²ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÅ¡Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾ÃÂ²ÃÂ°ÃÂ²Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ ÃÅ¡ÃÂ»Ã‘â€¹ÃÂº to Player'),(47006,1,0,'Ð“Ð¾Ð´Ñ„Ñ€Ð¸, Ñ‚Ð²Ð¾Ð¹ Ñ‡Ð°Ñ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¾Ð±Ð¸Ð»!',14,0,100,53,0,0,0,47366,0,'Ãâ€™ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¶ÃÂ°ÃÂº Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂ¸ ÃËœÃÂ²ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÅ¡Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾ÃÂ²ÃÂ°ÃÂ²Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ ÃÅ¡ÃÂ»Ã‘â€¹ÃÂº to 50916'),(47006,2,0,'Ð’ Ð°Ñ‚Ð°ÐºÑƒ, Ð±Ñ€Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒÑ! ÐŸÑƒÑÑ‚ÑŒ Ð¾Ð½ ÑƒÐ·Ð½Ð°ÐµÑ‚, Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾ Ñ‚Ð°ÐºÐ¾Ðµ ÑÑ€Ð¾ÑÑ‚ÑŒ ÑÑ‚Ð°Ð¸!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,47378,0,'Ãâ€™ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¶ÃÂ°ÃÂº Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂ¸ ÃËœÃÂ²ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÅ¡Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾Ã