siders me a villain! I will show him my true strength! I will show him that the demons no longer have power over me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48016,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47735,2,0,'You smell like death, man. You will regret coming close to me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48018,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47735,3,0,'We can fight like this for eternity. What do you really need?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48020,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47735,4,0,'Ð˜ Ñ‚Ñ‹ Ñ…Ð¾Ñ‡ÐµÑˆÑŒ, Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾Ð±Ñ‹ Ñ ÑƒÐºÑ€Ð°Ð» ÐµÐ³Ð¾. Ð—Ð°Ñ‡ÐµÐ¼?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48023,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47735,5,0,'Ð’Ð¾Ñ‚ Ð·Ð´ÐµÑÑŒ Ñ…Ñ€Ð°Ð½Ð¸Ñ‚ÑÑ Ñ‡ÐµÑ€ÐµÐ¿ Ð“ÑƒÐ»\'Ð´Ð°Ð½Ð°! Ð­Ñ‚Ð¸ Ð¶Ð°Ð»ÐºÐ¸Ðµ Ð´ÐµÐ¼Ð¾Ð½Ñ‹ Ð½Ðµ Ð¿Ð¾Ð¼ÐµÑˆÐ°ÑŽÑ‚ Ð¼Ð½Ðµ Ð·Ð°Ð²Ð»Ð°Ð´ÐµÑ‚ÑŒ Ð¸Ð¼!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48080,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47735,6,0,'Now at least the demons won\'t defile these forests. But if I get hold of this power, then none of Archimonde\'s lieutenants can compare with me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48081,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47735,7,0,'Ð”Ð°... ÑÑ‚Ð° ÑÐ¸Ð»Ð° Ð´Ð¾Ð»Ð¶Ð½Ð° Ð±Ñ‹Ñ‚ÑŒ Ð¼Ð¾ÐµÐ¹!',12,0,100,398,0,0,0,48082,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47735,8,0,'Now I\'m done!',14,0,100,419,0,0,0,48083,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47779,3,0,'ÐšÐ°Ðº Ñ…Ð¾Ñ‡ÐµÑˆÑŒ. ÐŸÑ€Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ð¾ ÑÐ¼Ð¾Ñ‚Ñ€Ð¸, Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾Ð±Ñ‹ Ð¾Ð½Ð¸ Ð½Ðµ Ð¿Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ñ€Ð°Ð´Ð°Ð»Ð¸.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,48781,0,'ÃÅ“Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â€šÃÂ¾ÃÂ½ ÃÅ¸ÃÂ»ÃÂ°ÃÂ¼Ã‘Â Ãâ€”ÃÂ²ÃÂµÃÂ·ÃÂ´ to Player'),(47781,0,0,'There\'s trouble at the Sludge Fields...',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(47790,0,0,'Look now what happens when you meddle in other things!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,48292,0,'Magistrate Burnside'),(47790,1,0,'BURN IN MY HATE!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,48293,0,'Magistrate Burnside'),(47811,3,0,'Flamestar!  I can return these dragons to their kind.  Let me take care of them.',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,48780,0,'John J. Keeshan to Player'),(47819,1,0,'Let\'s see where your self-confidence goes when you meet someone from your tribe, dreadlord!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,48124,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47819,2,0,'It\'s me, Malfurion. This is what I have become.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48359,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47819,3,0,'The leader of the undead has been killed. Over time, forests will get rid of damage.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48360,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47819,4,0,'Let it be so... brother.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,48361,0,'Illidan Stormrage'),(47872,0,0,'He killed everyone! EVERYONE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48177,0,''),(47872,0,1,'It... they planted us in the dirt like crops! Stillwater is insane! Get out of here while you still can!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48176,0,''),(47872,0,2,'M... maybe you\'re not all bad after all...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48173,0,''),(47872,0,3,'Should you ever be buried neck deep in a field of feces and urine, I will be sure to lend you a hand.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48178,0,''),(47872,0,4,'Thank you for saving my life. I owe you a debt of gratitude.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48174,0,''),(47900,0,0,'Hey there! Yes you, $c! Overseer Shtillets against my will grabbed me and put me in this cage. Help me get out of here, and I\'ll explain everything.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(47900,1,0,'ÐšÑ‚Ð¾-Ð½Ð¸Ð±ÑƒÐ´ÑŒ, ÑÐ´ÐµÐ»Ð°Ð¹Ñ‚Ðµ Ñ‚Ð°Ðº, Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾Ð±Ñ‹ ÑÑ‚Ð° Ð´ÐµÐ²Ð¾Ñ‡ÐºÐ° Ð·Ð°Ñ‚ÐºÐ½ÑƒÐ»Ð°ÑÑŒ!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,48245,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(47900,2,0,'Do you want a doll, baby? Maybe then you will stop crying?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48246,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(47900,3,0,'Kill either me or that girl!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,48247,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(47900,4,0,'Ð’Ð¾Ñ‚ ÑÑ‚Ð¾ Ð¸ ÐµÑÑ‚ÑŒ Ð¿Ð»Ð°Ð½ Ð¨Ñ‚Ð¸Ð»Ð»ÐµÑ†Ð°? ÐŸÑ‹Ñ‚Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒ Ð¼ÐµÐ½Ñ Ð´Ð¾ Ñ‚ÐµÑ… Ð¿Ð¾Ñ€, Ð¿Ð¾ÐºÐ° Ñ Ð½Ðµ ÑƒÐ¼Ñ€Ñƒ?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48248,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(47900,5,0,'What are you waiting for, Stillc? Kill me! Kill me now!!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,48249,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(47900,6,0,'How much more are you going to cry?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48250,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(47917,1,0,'What? Who are you?..',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48362,0,'Tichondrius'),(47923,0,0,'Blind fool! You have no idea what you are doing!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,48136,0,'EvStartText text'),(47923,1,0,'Enough! Stay your hand!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,48137,0,'EvStartText text'),(48001,0,0,'Alright, this is far too much mud.  Your disguise will be too dark and gloppy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48236,0,'Thelaron Direneedle to Player'),(48001,2,0,'There\'s not nearly enough hide here to make a proper disguise.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48235,0,'Thelaron Direneedle to Player'),(48001,4,0,'I\'ve got the proper amounts of mud and hide, but not enough thread to hold it together.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48239,0,'Thelaron Direneedle to Player'),(48001,5,0,'This... this is perfect!  This disguise shall be my masterpiece!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48241,0,'Thelaron Direneedle to Player'),(48020,0,0,'Overseer Stilllets, you are mentally deranged and are a threat to our lives. By the authority of the Dark Lady herself, I am awarding you with the death penalty.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,48309,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(48020,1,0,'So it will be with every traitor who was on the side of this idiot!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,48310,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(48020,2,0,'On knees!',12,0,100,15,0,0,0,48311,0,'Master Apothecary Lydon'),(48021,0,0,'You won\'t leave me to rot in this place! Take me with you!',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48285,0,'Johnny Awesome'),(48021,1,0,'Ð—Ð’Ð•Ð—Ð”ÐžÐ§ÐšÐ! Ð—Ð’Ð•Ð—Ð”ÐžÐ§ÐšÐ! ÐÐ•Ð•Ð•Ð¢!',14,0,100,0,0,15131,0,48283,0,'Johnny Awesome'),(48021,2,0,'It will not be in vain for them, Star. They will pay! They will all pay!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,48284,0,'Johnny Awesome'),(48044,1,0,'Yes, this place.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'smart text'),(48080,0,0,'Ð›Ð¸Ð´Ð¾Ð½?! Ð–Ð¸Ð²?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48306,0,'Warden Stillwater'),(48080,1,0,'So to whom are you $gdevoted:devoted;, $n!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,48307,0,'Warden Stillwater'),(48080,2,0,'Ð Ñ‚Ñ‹, Ð”Ð¶ÐµÐ½Ð½Ð¸? Ð¯ Ð´ÑƒÐ¼Ð°Ð», Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾ Ð¼ÐµÐ¶Ð´Ñƒ Ð½Ð°Ð¼Ð¸ Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾-Ñ‚Ð¾ ÐµÑÑ‚ÑŒ. Ð¢Ñ‹ Ñ€Ð°Ð·Ð±Ð¸Ð»Ð° Ð¼Ð¾Ðµ ÑÐµÑ€Ð´Ñ†Ðµ.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,48308,0,'Warden Stillwater'),(48080,3,0,'Am I a THREAT? Am I ABNORMAL ?!',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,48312,0,'Warden Stillwater'),(48080,4,0,'What we have been doing here is the natural course of evolution. This is how the Forsaken will prosper, rather than sprinkling glowing dust on dead bodies!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,48313,0,'Warden Stillwater'),(48080,5,0,'Kill them all! Let\'s use them as guinea pigs in our next experiment!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,48314,0,'Warden Stillwater'),(48080,6,0,'Ð”ÑƒÐ¼Ð°ÐµÑˆÑŒ, Ð²Ñ‹ Ð¿Ð¾Ð±ÐµÐ´Ð¸Ð»Ð¸? ÐŸÐžÐ”Ð£ÐœÐÐ™Ð¢Ð• Ð•Ð©Ð• Ð ÐÐ—! Ð˜ Ð²Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ñ€ÐµÐ¿ÐµÑ‰Ð¸Ñ‚Ðµ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸ Ð²Ð¸Ð´Ðµ Ð¼Ð¾ÐµÐ¹ Ð¸Ð½Ð¾Ð¹ Ñ„Ð¾Ñ€Ð¼Ñ‹!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,48324,0,'Warden Stillwater'),(48099,1,0,'NO! AHHHHHHH!!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(48100,1,0,'OW, MON!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,48328,0,''),(48110,3,0,'Don\'t forget to put on that disguise!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,48439,0,'Colonel Troteman to Player'),(48119,0,0,'It wasn\'t me, I swear!  You can\'t prove anything!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48430,0,'Smolderthorn Assassin to Player'),(48119,1,0,'Ouch!  What did I do?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48428,0,'Smolderthorn Assassin to Player'),(48119,3,0,'I don\'t recognize you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,48425,0,'Smolderthorn Assassin to Player'),(48119,4,0,'You\'ve been spotted!  Club your target to death before you are unmasked!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,48432,0,'Smolderthorn Assassin to Player'),(48124,3,0,'The dog stares at the wall...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,48845,0,'Ãâ€˜ÃÂµÃ‘Ë†ÃÂµÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ¼ÃÂ°Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ¸Ã‘â€ž'),(48134,1,0,'Ð“Ñ€ÑÐ·Ð½Ñ‹Ð¹ Ð´ÐµÐ¼Ð¾Ð½! Ð§Ñ‚Ð¾ Ñ‚Ñ‹ ÑÐ´ÐµÐ»Ð°Ð» Ñ Ð¼Ð¾Ð¸Ð¼ Ð±Ñ€Ð°Ñ‚Ð¾Ð¼?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48356,0,'Malfurion'),(48134,2,0,'At the cost of your soul? I no longer have a brother! Get out of here, and may your foot never set foot on these lands again!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,48357,0,'Malfurion'),(48135,1,0,'No! Illidan, how could you?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,48358,0,'Tyrande'),(48139,4,0,'%s Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ñ†ÐµÐ»Ð¸Ð²Ð°ÐµÑ‚ÑÑ Ð² |3-3($n)!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,48402,0,'ÃÂ¥Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ¼ÃÂ¾ÃÂ²Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ»ÃÂ¾ÃÂ²ÃÂµÃ‘â€  to Player'),(48159,0,0,'Well guys, we have an opponent! It\'s time to show the general what our little prisoner is capable of!',14,0,100,