µ!',14,0,100,0,0,23365,0,49066,0,'Ãâ€ºÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ´ Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂºÃ‘â€šÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÂÃÂµÃ‘â€žÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ to ÃÂ¥ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¼ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½'),(49023,1,0,'Get out, dirty Horde!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,50165,0,'ÃÂ¡Ã‘â€šÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ¶ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂº Ãâ€™Ã‘â€¹Ã‘ÂÃÂ¾ÃÂºÃÂ¾ÃÂ³ÃÂ¾ ÃÂ±ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ³ÃÂ° to Ãâ€”ÃÂ°ÃÂºÃÂ°ÃÂ»ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ¿ÃÂµÃ‘â€¦ÃÂ¾Ã‘â€šÃÂ¸ÃÂ½ÃÂµÃ‘â€ '),(49045,0,0,'Augh appears from the distance!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,50638,0,'Augh'),(49045,1,0,'GAAAH! How you kill croc?!',12,0,100,53,0,0,0,49169,0,'Augh'),(49045,2,0,'Augh smart! Augh already steal treasure while you no looking! ',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49170,0,'Augh'),(49045,3,0,'Augh da boss! Oh yeah!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49171,0,'Augh'),(49045,4,0,'Augh steal your treasure. Uhn uhn uhnnn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49173,0,'Augh'),(49045,5,0,'Who bad?! Augh bad!! Ugn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49172,0,'Augh'),(49226,0,0,'Welcome to my personal sanctum, heroes! I hope you find the accommodations to your liking. Herein you will find many of my failed experiments and ultimately my greatest triumph!',14,0,0,0,0,20090,0,49415,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event22'),(49226,1,0,'Mortals that fancy themselves HEROES have entered the Broken Hall! Oh, I do hope this \'raid\' will amuse me more than the last!',14,0,0,0,0,23379,0,49053,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ZoneIntro01'),(49226,2,0,'I should\'ve known better than to rely on something so stupidly named... to entertain me for long.',14,0,0,0,0,23373,0,49059,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronDead01'),(49226,3,0,'Hmm, the Omnotron Defense System. Centuries ago, these constructs were considered the dwarves greatest tactical achievements. With so many counters to each construct\'s attacks, I\'ll have to rectify these designs for them to provide me ANY entertainment!',14,0,0,0,0,23374,0,49054,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronIntro01'),(49226,4,0,'You would like to move away from that, wouldn\'t you? Too bad.',14,0,0,0,0,23375,0,49055,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell01'),(49226,5,0,'Stupid dwarves and your fascination with runes. Why would you create something that would help your enemy?',14,0,0,0,0,23376,0,49056,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell02'),(49226,6,0,'Lightning Conductor works much better in a crowd, yes?',14,0,0,0,0,23377,0,49057,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell03'),(49226,7,0,'Were you planing on using Toxitron\'s chemicals to damage the other constructs? Clever plan. Let me ruin that for you.',14,0,0,0,0,23378,0,49058,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell04'),(49226,8,0,'That malfunctioning piece of junk was murder on the repair bills.',14,0,0,0,0,20086,0,49411,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event18'),(49226,9,0,'I found this fascinating speciman in the lava underneath this very room. Magmaw should provide an adequate challenge for your pathetic little band!',14,0,0,0,0,23367,0,49060,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawIntro01'),(49226,10,0,'Finally someone to deal with that unsightly pest! You have my thanks, \"heroes.\"',14,0,0,0,0,20085,0,49410,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event17'),(49226,11,0,'You won! How... disappointing. I could\'ve easily watched you all continue to stand in the fire.',14,0,0,0,0,23366,0,49062,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawDead01'),(49226,12,0,'INCONCEIVEABLE! You may actually defeat my lava worm! Perhaps I can help... TIP the scales.',14,0,0,0,0,23368,0,49782,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawLowHealth'),(49226,13,0,'On second thought, what fun is an adequate challenge?',14,0,0,0,0,23369,0,49061,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawSummon01'),(49226,14,0,'Maloriak, try not to lose to these mortals! Semi-competent help is SO hard to create.',14,0,0,0,0,23372,0,49068,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MaloriakIntro01'),(49226,15,0,'Your mixtures are weak, Maloriak! They need a bit more... kick!',14,0,0,0,0,23370,0,49069,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Maloriak01'),(49226,16,0,'Congratulations! Allow me to grant you a title befitting the amazing achievement you just performed! Henceforth, you shall be known as the Slayer of Incompetent, Stupid and Disappointing Minions!',14,0,0,0,0,23371,0,49070,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MaloriakDead01'),(49226,17,0,'We never did see eye to eye... Good riddance I say!',14,0,0,0,0,20089,0,49414,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event21'),(49226,18,0,'You should\'ve been disposed of a long time ago.',14,0,0,0,0,23357,0,49077,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesDead'),(49226,19,0,'These shields are proving quite the nuisance!',14,0,0,0,0,23358,0,49076,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesGong'),(49226,20,0,'Atramedes, the heroes are RIGHT THERE!',14,0,0,0,0,23359,0,49075,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesImp01'),(49226,21,0,'Atramedes, are you going deaf as well as blind? Hurry up and kill them all!',14,0,0,0,0,23360,0,49074,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesIntro'),(49226,22,0,'Now that was really unnecessary.',14,0,0,0,0,23387,0,49412,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event19'),(49226,23,0,'Impressive! You managed to destroy one of my most horrific creations - a task I\'d thought impossible until now.',14,0,0,0,0,20088,0,49413,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event20'),(49226,24,0,'A shame to lose that experiment...',14,0,0,0,0,23361,0,49067,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronDead01'),(49226,25,0,'Ah, Chimaeron! Truly a living testament to my scientific prowess. I reworked and twisted his form countless times over the years and the final result is truly something to behold.',14,0,0,0,0,23362,0,49063,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronIntro01'),(49226,26,0,'Oh. You were expecting something else to happen just then, weren\'t you? Let\'s see how YOU adapt after a new set of adjustments, shall we?',14,0,0,0,0,23363,0,49064,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell01'),(49226,27,0,'Stop fighting yourself THIS INSTANT Chimaeron!',14,0,0,0,0,23364,0,49065,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell02'),(49226,28,0,'This fight has gone a bit stale. Allow me to spice things up!',14,0,0,0,0,23365,0,49066,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell03'),(49423,0,0,'I\'ll kill you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,82415,0,'Rotbrain Magus'),(49423,0,1,'Look what they\'ve done to me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,50325,0,'Rotbrain Magus'),(49423,0,2,'Who am I?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,50320,0,'Rotbrain Magus'),(49423,0,3,'You will die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,76125,0,'Rotbrain Magus'),(49424,0,0,'BLEEAAAGGHHH! I\'m a monster, don\'t look at me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,50326,0,'Marshal Redpath'),(49426,0,0,'Hi, $N! What do you think about my new gear?',12,0,100,23,0,0,0,49543,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),(49426,1,0,'They\'re making me into a Deathguard. Can you believe it?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49544,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),(49426,2,0,'I\'ll probably be staying here in Deathknell. If things work out, though... who knows? Maybe I\'ll get to meet the Dark Lady herself.',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,49545,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),(49426,3,0,'How about you? I\'ve heard that Sarvis is going to send you off to Calston Estate. Big assignment, eh?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49546,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),(49426,4,0,'Well, I won\'t hold you up. It\'s been a pleasure, $N. I hope our paths cross again soon.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,49547,0,'Deathguard Darnell'),(49427,0,0,'I found this amazing creature in the lava under this room. Magmar will be a worthy adversary for your little squad.',14,0,100,0,0,23367,0,49060,0,'ÃÂÃÂµÃ‘â€žÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ to ÃÅ“ÃÂ°ÃÂ³ÃÂ¼ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Å’'),(49427,1,0,'Incomprehensible! You seem to be able to destroy my lava worm! Perhaps I will help him.',14,0,100,0,0,23368,0,49782,0,'ÃÂÃÂµÃ‘â€žÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ to ÃÅ“ÃÂ°ÃÂ³ÃÂ¼ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Å’'),(49427,2,0,'Ð’Ñ‹ Ð¿Ð¾Ð±ÐµÐ´Ð¸Ð»Ð¸? Ð’Ð¾Ñ‚... Ð½ÐµÐ·Ð°Ð´Ð°Ñ‡Ð°. Ð Ð¼Ð½Ðµ Ð±Ñ‹Ð»Ð¾ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸ÑÑ‚Ð½Ð¾ ÑÐ¼Ð¾Ñ‚Ñ€ÐµÑ‚ÑŒ, ÐºÐ°Ðº Ð²Ñ‹ Ð¶Ð°Ñ€Ð¸Ñ‚ÐµÑÑŒ Ð² Ð¾Ð³Ð½Ðµ.',14,0,100,0,0,23366,0,49062,0,'ÃÂÃÂµÃ‘â€žÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ to ÃÅ“ÃÂ°ÃÂ³ÃÂ¼ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Å’'),(49429,0,0,'Poor Glubtok. When his powers manifested, his own ogre mound was the first to burn.',12,0,100,0,0,24602,0,49715,0,'Vanessa VanCleef glubtok 1'),(49429,1,0,'Deep within his soul, the one thing he feared most of all was...himself.',12,0,100,0,0,24603,0,49716,0,'Vanessa VanCleef glubtok 2'),(49429,2,0,'Most rogues prefer to cloak themselves in the shadows, but not Helix.',12,0,100,0,0,24604,0,49723,0,'Vanessa VanCleef helix 1'),(49429,3,0,'You never know what skitters in the darkness.',12,0,100,0,0,24605,0,49724,0,'Vanessa VanCleef helix 2'),(49429,4,0,'Can you imagine the life of a machine?',12,0,100,0,0,24606,0,49725,0,'Vanessa VanCleef foereaper 1'),(49429,5,0,'A simple spark can mean the difference between life...and death.',12,0,100,0,0,24607,0,49726,0,'Vanessa VanCleef foereaper 2'),(49429,6,0,'Ripsnarl wasn\'\'t always a bloodthirsty savage. Once, he even had a family.',12,0,100,0,0,24608,0,49742,0,'Vanessa VanCleef admiral 1'),(49429,7,0,'He was called James Harrington. A tragedy in three parts.',12,0,100,0,0,24609,0,49745,0,'Vanessa VanCleef admiral 2'),(49429,8,0,'I\'ve been waiting a long time for this, you know.',12,0,100,0,0,24613,0,49477,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 1'),(49429,9,0,'Biding my time, building my forces, studying the minds of my enemies.',12,0,100,0,0,24614,0,49478,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 2'),(49429,10,0,'I was never very good at hand-to-hand combat, you know. Not like my father.',12,0,100,0,0,24615,0,49479,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 3'),(49429,11,0,'But I always excelled at poisons.',12,0,100,0,0,24616,0,49480,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 4'),(49429,12,0,'Especially venoms that affect the mind.',12,0,100,0,0,24617,0,49481,0,'Vanessa VanCleef intro 5'),(49448,3,0,'Ð•Ñ‰Ðµ Ð½ÐµÑÐºÐ¾Ð»ÑŒÐºÐ¾ Ð¼Ð¸Ð½ÑƒÑ‚... ÐšÐµÐ½Ð°Ñ€Ð¸Ð¹ Ð²Ð¾Ñ‚-Ð²Ð¾Ñ‚ Ð±ÑƒÐ´ÐµÑ‚ Ð·Ð´ÐµÑÑŒ!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,49555,0,'ÃÅ¡ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¼ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ´ÃÂ¸Ã‘â‚¬ Ãâ€ÃÂ¶ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾ÃÂ´ ÃÅ¸ÃÂµÃ‘ÂÃÂ½Ã‘Å’ ÃÂ¢ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂµÃÂ¹ to Player'),(49450,3,0,'You don\'t have much time. Enemy reinforcements are on their way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49556,0,'Ãâ€œÃÂ¾ÃÂ»ÃÂ´Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ½ÃÂ½ to Player'),(49452,3,0,'Let\'s save the celebration for later, commander. The Twilight Dragons are Coming!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49560,0,'ÃÂÃÂ²ÃÂ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ° to Player'),(49541,0,0,'I will not share my father\'\'s fate! Your tale ends here!',14,0,100,0,0,24599,0,49748,0,'Vanessa VanCleef aggro'),(49541,1,0,'ENOUGH! I will not give you the pleasure.',14,0,100,0,0,24610,0,49753,0,'Vanessa VanCleef death 1'),(49541,1,1,'If I\'m going to die, I\'\'m taking you all with me!',14,0,100,0,0,24611,0,49752,0,'Vanessa VanCleef death 2'),(49541,1,2,'MY FATE IS MY OWN!',14,0,100,0,0,24612,0,49754,0,'Vanessa VanCleef death 3'),(49541,2,0,'The first of many!',14,0,100,0,0,24618,0,49749,0,'Vanessa VanCleef kill'),(49541,3,0,'Did you really think I would come to this fight alone!?',14,0,100,0,0,24620,0,49750,0,'Vanessa VanCleef adds'),(49541,4,0,'Fools! This entire ship is rigged with explosives! Enjoy your fiery deaths!',14,0,100,0,0,24621,0,49751,0,'Vanessa VanCleef spell 1'),(49541,5,0,'You didn\'t honestly think I would only plant ONE set of explosives, did you?',14,0,100,0,0,24622,0,50706,0,'Vanessa VanCleef spell 2'),(49794,3,0,'%s Ð±ÑƒÐ´ÐµÑ‚ Ð°ÐºÑ‚Ð¸Ð²Ð¸Ñ€Ð¾Ð²Ð°Ð½Ð° Ñ‡ÐµÑ€ÐµÐ· 3 ÑÐµÐºÑƒÐ½Ð´Ñ‹!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10894,0,'ÃÅ¸Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾Ã‘â€šÃÂ¸ÃÂ²ÃÂ¾ÃÂ²ÃÂ¾ÃÂ·ÃÂ´Ã‘Æ’Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ½ÃÂ°Ã‘Â ÃÂ¼ÃÂ¸ÃÂ½ÃÂ° to ÃÅ“ÃÂ¸ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸-ÃÂ´ÃÂ¸Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¶ÃÂ°ÃÂ±ÃÂ»Ã‘Å’'),(49799,0,0,'ÐœÐ°Ð»Ð¾Ñ€Ð¸Ð°Ðº, Ð¿Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ð°Ñ€Ð°Ð¹ÑÑ, Ñ‡Ñ‚Ð¾Ð± Ñ‚ÐµÐ±Ñ Ð½Ðµ ÑƒÐ±Ð¸Ð»Ð¸. Ð¡Ð¾Ð·Ð´Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒ Ð¿Ð¾Ð»ÑƒÑ†ÐµÐ½Ð½Ð¾Ð³Ð¾ Ð¿Ð¾Ð¼Ð¾Ñ‰Ð½Ð¸ÐºÐ° Ð¢ÐÐš ÑÐ»Ð¾Ð¶Ð½Ð¾!',14,0,100,0,0,23372,0,49068,0,'Ãâ€ºÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ´ Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂºÃ‘â€šÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÂÃÂµÃ‘â€žÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ to Player'),(49799,1,0,'Your infusions are weak, Maloriak! Add to them... spices!',14,0,100,0,0,23370,0,49069,0,'Ãâ€ºÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ´ Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂºÃ‘â€šÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÂÃÂµÃ‘â€žÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ to ÃÅ“ÃÂ°ÃÂ»ÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂº'),(49799,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ELEMENTAL_PRIMAL_SHADOW.BLP:20|t %s Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ð¼ÐµÐ½ÑÐµÑ‚ |cFF660099Ñ‚ÐµÐ¼Ð½ÑƒÑŽ|r Ð¼Ð°Ð³Ð¸ÑŽ Ðº ÐºÐ¾Ñ‚Ð»Ñƒ!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,49793,0,'Ãâ€ºÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ´ Ãâ€™ÃÂ¸ÃÂºÃ‘â€šÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ ÃÂÃÂµÃ‘â€žÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ to ÃÅ“ÃÂ°ÃÂ»ÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂº'),(49799,3,0,'Congratulations! Allow me to award you with a title that matches your great accomplishment. From now on, you will be called \"Killers of stupid, inept and useless ser