lt Q29094'),(52204,6,0,'Whoa! What\'s going on?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51025,0,'Gyrotilt Q29094'),(52204,7,0,'No, no, no...this can\'t be happening. This wasn\'t part of the travel plan!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51026,0,'Gyrotilt Q29094'),(52204,8,0,'Auuugh! Looks like we\'re taking an unexpected detour! Hold on tight!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51027,0,'Gyrotilt Q29094'),(52204,9,0,'Maybe if I press this green button. No, what about this blue one? Hold on, let me try resplicing some wires. Ow!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51028,0,'Gyrotilt Q29094'),(52225,1,0,'I really thought that I would die in this jungle.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51867,0,'SmartText'),(52227,0,0,' Help! Let me go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Balgor WhipshankÃƒâ€šÃ‚Â '),(52234,1,0,'Now let\'s see what Bwemba\'s conjured up...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51406,0,'SmartText'),(52234,2,0,'Ah... It be Kilnara. I shoulda know she be involved here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52234,4,0,'Da Zandalari, dey gone mad. We gotta make sure dey be stopped.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52234,5,0,'Dis is serious business. Venoxis ain\'t one to trifle wit\'.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52234,6,0,'Da Gurubashi be usin\' all sorts of voodoo to reclaim dere land.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51399,0,'SmartText'),(52234,7,0,'Ahh, dere you are! We been searching da entire jungle for ya!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52234,9,0,'Not all da places held together so well. We try to help as much as we can. But da source, it be Zul\'Gurub.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52274,0,0,'The Burning Blade sends its greetings.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Balgor WhipshankÃƒâ€šÃ‚Â '),(52274,1,0,'Which one should I take?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Balgor WhipshankÃƒâ€šÃ‚Â '),(52276,0,0,'Quickly now! Grab one of them while I take the supply cart!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Balgor WhipshankÃƒâ€šÃ‚Â '),(52276,1,0,'The fat one! He\'ll make for a fine sacrifice.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Balgor WhipshankÃƒâ€šÃ‚Â '),(52301,2,0,'You disssssturb the plans of Gurubashi, little one. It\'sss too late for you. Too late for all of you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52301,3,0,' My ssssserpents, dey already ssssslither beneath every rock an\' shrub of Ssssstranglethorn.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52301,4,0,'We will reclaim thisss land. Gurubashi land. An\'we kill anyone dat getssss in our way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52315,1,0,'It\'s got me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,51007,0,'SmartText'),(52390,1,0,'You kill him - you kill my cat! Why must I suffer so?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52390,3,0,'Stranglethorn belongs to da Gurubashi. You best be leavin\' before we bury you here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51224,0,'SmartText'),(52390,5,0,'Or stay if you want. We always be  needin\' more to sacrifice.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'SmartText'),(52409,0,0,'Come forth, my servants, defend your master!',14,0,100,0,0,24513,0,52207,0,'Ragnaros adds 1'),(52409,0,1,'Minions of fire, purge the outsiders!',14,0,100,0,0,24514,0,52208,0,'Ragnaros adds 2'),(52409,0,2,'Denizens of flame, come to me!',14,0,100,0,0,24515,0,52209,0,'Ragnaros adds 3'),(52409,0,3,'Arise, servants of fire! Consume their flesh!',14,0,100,0,0,24516,0,52210,0,'Ragnaros adds 4'),(52409,1,0,'Mortal insects! You dare trespass into MY domain? Your arrogance will be purged in living flame.',14,0,100,0,0,24517,0,52203,0,'Ragnaros intro'),(52409,2,0,'No, noooo- This was to be my hour of triumph...',14,0,100,0,0,24518,0,52222,0,'Ragnaros death heroic'),(52409,3,0,'Too soon! ... You have come too soon...',14,0,100,0,0,24519,0,52218,0,'Ragnaros death normal'),(52409,4,0,'You will be crushed!',14,0,100,0,0,24520,0,69202,0,'Ragnaros hammer drop 1'),(52409,4,1,'Die!',14,0,100,0,0,24521,0,135011,0,'Ragnaros hammer drop 2'),(52409,4,2,'Your judgement has come!',14,0,100,0,0,24522,0,52214,0,'Ragnaros hammer drop 3'),(52409,5,0,'Enough! I will finish this!',14,0,100,0,0,24523,0,52215,0,'Ragnaros hummer pickup 1'),(52409,5,1,'Fall to your knees, mortals! This ends now!',14,0,100,0,0,24524,0,52216,0,'Ragnaros h