l fail.',14,0,100,0,0,25931,0,55751,0,'Murozond event 03'),(54432,5,0,'Again...? Is this your plot, your scheme?',14,0,100,0,0,25932,0,55752,0,'Murozond event 04'),(54432,6,0,'The Hourglass\' power is exhausted. No more games, mortals. Relent, or perish.',14,0,100,0,0,25933,0,55753,0,'Murozond event 05'),(54432,7,0,'The \"End Time,\" I once called this place. I had not seen, by then; I did not know. You hope to... what? Stop me, here? Change the fate I worked so tirelessly to weave?',14,0,100,0,0,25934,0,55981,0,'Murozond intro 01'),(54432,8,0,'You crawl unwitting, like a blind, writhing worm, towards endless madness and despair. I have witnessed the true End Time. This? This is a blessing you simply cannot comprehend.',14,0,100,0,0,25935,0,55982,0,'Murozond intro 02'),(54432,9,0,'You asked for it.',14,0,100,0,0,25936,0,53040,0,'Murozond kill 01'),(54432,9,1,'The sand has run out.',14,0,100,0,0,25937,0,55748,0,'Murozond kill 02'),(54432,9,2,'Time ends.',14,0,100,0,0,25938,0,55749,0,'Murozond kill 03'),(54445,0,0,'You asked for it.',14,0,100,0,0,25917,0,53040,0,''),(54445,1,0,'Perhaps this will cool your heads...',14,0,100,0,0,25924,0,56578,0,''),(54445,2,0,'I wish you\'d surrendered.',14,0,100,0,0,25926,0,56577,0,''),(54445,3,0,'I understand, now. Farewell, and good luck.',12,0,100,0,0,25919,0,56574,0,''),(54445,4,0,'You forced my hand.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,56575,0,''),(54518,0,0,'I can\'t thank you enough!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,53036,0,''),(54518,0,1,'I\'m feeling better already.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,53034,0,''),(54518,0,2,'It doesn\'t hurt so much anymore.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,53035,0,''),(54518,0,3,'Time to get back to work!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,53033,0,''),(54518,0,4,'Thank you, |3-6($C).',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(54544,0,0,'Let the peaceful light of Elune sooth your souls in this dark time.',12,0,100,0,0,25972,0,53155,0,'Tyrande '),(54544,1,0,'Moon goddess, your light dims! I am lost without your guidance!',14,0,100,0,0,25973,0,53152,0,'Tyrande 80%'),(54544,2,0,'Tyrande gains