ke much more of this!',14,0,100,0,0,26297,0,55435,0,'Sky Captain Swayze event 05'),(55870,8,0,'Were going down, abandon the ship!',14,0,100,0,0,26298,0,55436,0,'Sky Captain Swayze event 06'),(55870,9,0,'Welcome aboard the Skyfire. You ready to chase down the end of the world?',14,0,100,0,0,26302,0,56304,0,'Sky Captain Swayze pre deathwing back 01'),(55870,10,0,'Our engines are damaged! We\'re sitting ducks up here!',14,0,100,0,0,26303,0,56079,0,'Sky Captain Swayze pre deathwing back 02'),(55971,0,0,'It\'s good to see you again, Alexstrasza. I have been busy in my absence.',14,0,100,0,0,26360,0,56080,0,''),(55971,1,0,'Twisting your pitiful whelps into mindless abominations, bent only to my will. It was a very...painful process.',14,0,100,0,0,26361,0,56646,0,''),(55971,2,0,'Mere whelps, experiments, a means to a greater end. You will see what the research of my clutch has yielding.',14,0,100,0,0,26362,0,55322,0,''),(55971,3,0,'Nefarian? Onyxia? Sinestra? They were nothing! Now you face my ultimate creation!',14,0,100,0,0,26363,0,56647,0,''),(55971,4,0,'The Hour of Twilight is nigh. The sun sets on your pitiful, mortal existence.',14,0,100,0,0,26364,0,56648,0,''),(56010,0,0,'L\'ordre doit tomber $N mais attention voici les Princes en hÃ©roÃ¯que !!',14,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,''),(56056,0,0,'C\'est parti $N et ton groupe, que le combat commence !',14,0,100,4,0,0,0,0,0,''),(56060,0,0,'Si vous Ãªtes bloquÃ© dans gilnÃ©as alors que vous avez dÃ©jÃ  fait toutes les quettes, venez me voir !!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(56062,0,0,'Ð’Ð´Ð¾Ð²Ð° Ð—ÐµÐ»ÐµÐ½Ð°Ñ Ð›Ð°Ð¿Ð° â€“ Ð½Ðµ Ð²ÐµÐ´ÑŒÐ¼Ð°. ÐžÐ½Ð° Ð¿Ñ€Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ð¾ Ð´ÐµÐ»Ð°ÐµÑ‚ Ð¾Ñ‡ÐµÐ½ÑŒ Ð¿Ñ€Ð°Ð²Ð´Ð¾Ð¿Ð¾Ð´Ð¾Ð±Ð½Ñ‹Ðµ ÑÑ‚Ð°Ñ‚ÑƒÐ¸ Ð¸Ð· Ð½ÐµÑ„Ñ€Ð¸Ñ‚Ð°.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,55754,0,'ÃÂ¢Ã‘â€ ÃÂ·Ã‘Æ’ Ãâ€“ÃÂµÃÂ»ÃÂµÃÂ·ÃÂ½ÃÂ¾ÃÂµ Ãâ€˜Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Å½Ã‘â€¦ÃÂ¾ to ÃÂÃÂ½Ã‘Å’ Ãâ€™ÃÂ¾ÃÂ·ÃÂ´Ã‘Æ’Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ ÃÅ“ÃÂµÃ‘â€¦'),(56099,0,0,'Excellent work. The fire of my heart glows with a brilliant purity unmatched; every spark of it I will channel into the Dragon Soul.',14,0,100,0,0,26497,0,56773,0,'Alexstrasza - dwbattle 1'),(56099,1,0,'I will cleanse whatever corruption I can; my fire will not harm you.',14,0,100,0,0,26498,0,56772,0,'Alexstrasza - dwbattle 2'),(56099,2,0,'He\'s completely mad!',14,0,100,0,0,26499,0,56774,0,'Alexstrasza - dwbattle 3'),(56099,3,0,'No! Such power! Deathwing\'s summoning of the final Cataclysm will destroy all life on Azeroth. Quickly, we must interrupt him!',14,0,100,0,0,26500,0,55773,0,'Alexstrasza - dwbattle 4'),(56099,4,0,'You have accomplished the impossible, succeeded where all Azeroth feared you would fail.',14,0,100,0,0,26501,0,55769,0,'Alexstrasza - dwvicrory 1'),(56099,5,0,'Before you is the Cache of the Aspects. Take from it what you will, for you have more than earned the right.',14,0,100,0,0,26502,0,56771,0,'Alexstrasza - dwvicrory 2'),(56100,0,0,' We are one step closer. The unknowable, transcendent power of the Emerald Dream I now give unto the Dragon Soul.',14,0,100,0,0,26141,0,56775,0,'Ysera - dwbattle 1'),(56100,1,0,'I will bring you closer to the Emerald Dream. Seek safety there when the fight becomes too intense.',14,0,100,0,0,26142,0,56776,0,'Ysera - dwbattle 2'),(56100,2,0,'Such rage I have never seen...',14,0,100,0,0,26143,0,56777,0,'Ysera - dwbattle 3'),(56100,3,0,'Deathwing is conjuring the final Cataclysm; even the Emerald Dream trembles. If we are to stop the spell, we must attack him together.',14,0,100,0,0,26144,0,56781,0,'Ysera - dwbattle 4'),(56101,0,0,'Well done! I will realign the flow of mana and fill the Dragon Soul with all my arcane might.',14,0,100,0,0,26258,0,56751,0,'Kalecgos - dwbattle 1'),(56101,1,0,'I will charge you with arcane energy to blast your foes.',14,0,100,0,0,26259,0,56752,0,'Kalecgos - dwbattle 2'),(56101,2,0,'Is he... coming apart?!',14,0,100,0,0,26260,0,56753,0,'Kalecgos - dwbattle 3'),(56101,3,0,'The Destroyer is gathering all his might for a blow that will split the world. Attack him, now! We must stop the final Cataclysm!',14,0,100,0,0,26261,0,55776,0,'Kalecgos - dwbattle 4'),(56102,0,0,'It is time. I will expend everything to bind every thread here, now, around the Dragon Soul. What comes to pass will NEVER be undone.',14,0,100,0,0,25948,0,56769,0,'Nozdormu - dwbattle 1'),(56102,1,0,'I will slow the Destroyer\'s attacks when I can.',14,0,100,0,0,25949,0,55786,0,'Nozdormu - dwbattle 2'),(56102,2,0,'Press the attack, heroes!',14,0,100,0,0,25950,0,56770,0,'Nozdormu - dwbattle 3'),(56102,3,0,'Hurry, heroes. In mere moments Deathwing\'s Cataclysm will complete what he begun and end the world. Join me in the attack, now!',14,0,100,0,0,25951,0,55774,0,'Nozdormu - dwbattle 4'),(56102,4,0,'...although, you may want to hurry.',14,0,100,0,0,25952,0,55770,0,'Nozdormu - dwvictory 1'),(56103,0,0,'It is done; at last the Destroyer has met his end. Now, we can begin to heal our world.',14,0,100,0,0,25901,0,55768,0,'Thrall - Maelstorm 01'),(56103,1,0,'Only you can give us our opening!',14,0,100,0,0,25902,0,55844,0,'Thrall - Maelstorm 02'),(56103,2,0,'Avenge the fallen! Continue the fight!',14,0,100,0,0,25903,0,56738,0,'Thrall - Maelstorm Slay 01'),(56110,3,0,'Ð˜Ñ‚Ð°Ðº, Ð´Ñ€ÑƒÐ·ÑŒÑ... ÐšÐ°Ðº Ð¼Ñ‹ Ð½Ð°Ð¹Ð´ÐµÐ¼ Ñ‚Ð°Ð¹Ð½Ð¾Ð³Ð¾ Ð¼Ð°ÑÑ‚ÐµÑ€Ð°?',12,0,100,6,0,31908,0,60483,0,'ÃÂ¡Ã‘ÂÃÂ¾ to Player'),(56115,3,0,'ÐšÐ°ÐºÐ¾Ð³Ð¾ Ð±Ð¾Ñ€Ñ‚ÐµÐ»Ñ?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,57169,0,'ÃÅ¡ÃÂµÃÂ½-ÃÅ¡ÃÂµÃÂ½ to Player'),(56138,0,0,'Incredible! He left me with this weird dirty guy!',12,0,100,0,0,30420,0,55485,0,'Ãâ€ºÃÂ¸ Ãâ€ºÃÂ¸ to Player'),(56138,3,0,'Wait, you said... Rough Porters?',12,0,100,6,0,30418,0,55475,0,'Ãâ€ºÃÂ¸ Ãâ€ºÃÂ¸ to Player'),(56165,3,0,'The conductive crystal is overloaded!',41,0,100,0,0,26228,0,54780,0,'ÃÂ¥Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂ»Ã‘Å’ÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ³Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¼ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¾Ã‘â€šÃÂ²ÃÂ¾ÃÂ´ to ÃÂ£ÃÂºÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ¾Ã‘â€°ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ½Ã‘â€¹ÃÂ¹ Ã‘ÂÃÂ»ÃÂµÃÂ¼ÃÂµÃÂ½Ã‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂ»Ã‘Å’ ÃÂ¼ÃÂ¾ÃÂ»ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹'),(56167,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_bloodnova.blp:20|t %s Ñ€Ð°Ð½ÐµÐ½Ð¾, Ð