. Cleanse this place of their foul presence! Lay our stories to rest!',14,0,100,0,0,30889,0,57604,0,'Talk of lorewalkter stonestep 2'),(56843,3,0,'You must destroy the source of the corruption! Quickly, before our cherished history is erased forever!',14,0,100,0,0,30890,0,57467,0,'Talk of lorewalkter stonestep 3'),(56843,4,0,'Oh, my. If I am not mistaken, it appears that the tale of Zao Sunseeker has come to life before us.',14,0,100,0,0,30901,0,57605,0,'Zao appears 0'),(56843,5,0,'According to the legend, long ago, there were five suns that burned brightly in the sky. When the winds blew, their intense heat caused great wildfires.',14,0,100,0,0,30902,0,57607,0,'Zao appears 1'),(56843,6,0,'Crops wilted, villages burned, and families wandered endlessly to seek refuge from the flames...',14,0,100,0,0,30903,0,57608,0,'Zao appears 2'),(56843,7,0,'I can allow this no longer!',14,0,100,0,0,27747,0,57748,0,'Zao appears 3'),(56843,8,0,'The fires, they are burning the library! Please, heroes! Purge this evil before the temple crumbles to ash!',14,0,100,0,0,30904,0,57610,0,'Zao appears 4'),(56843,9,0,'Zao has become corrupted too! Please, fight him with dignity...',14,0,100,0,0,30906,0,57746,0,'Zao enters combat 0'),(56843,10,0,'Ah, it is not yet over. From what see, we face the trial of the yaungol. Let me shed some light...',14,0,100,0,0,30896,0,57614,0,'trial appears 1'),(56843,11,0,'As the tale goes, the yaungol was traveling across the Kun\'lai plains when suddenly he was ambushed by two strange creatures!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,57986,0,'trial appears 2'),(56843,12,0,'The yaungol attacked the beasts with great determination and ferocity. Yet, the more he attacked, the more fearsome the beasts grew!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,57988,0,'trial appears 3'),(56843,13,0,'However, when he let it alone, the beast shrank to near nothingness.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,57989,0,'trial appears 4'),(56843,14,0,'For you see, strife feeds on conflict. when you have peace in your heart, strife will find somewh