0,0,0,59931,0,'EvStartText text'),(60532,0,0,'Prepare for the beating of your life, weakling!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59932,0,''),(60532,1,0,'I am... humbled.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59948,0,''),(60533,0,0,'Today is the day I defeat my rival!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59933,0,''),(60533,1,0,'I lost to $n, twice in a row? I can\'t believe it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(60534,0,0,'I apologize in advance for the beating you are about to suffer.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59934,0,''),(60534,1,0,'Very interesting...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,107292,0,''),(60535,0,0,'YAAAAAAAAHHHH!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59935,0,''),(60535,1,0,'Nice moves, sweetie. Maybe I\'ll see you again...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59951,0,''),(60536,0,0,'Your winning streak ends here, $n. Today, you fall by my spear.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59936,0,''),(60536,1,0,'My father forsaw this day in the waters. He told me that I would be defeated, but I refused to believe it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(60537,0,0,'I will not hold back on you, $n. Please, do me the same favor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59937,0,''),(60537,1,0,'It\'s been a while since I lost to a trainee. Thank you for the match.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59953,0,''),(60538,0,0,'Just give up! It\'s hopeless! You\'ll never beat me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59938,0,''),(60538,1,0,'How did... I don\'t... no, no NO! NOT AGAIN!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59954,0,''),(60539,0,0,'Good idea! Let\'s ookin\' get it on!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59939,0,''),(60539,1,0,'Tukka-Tuk pretty sad about losing to wimpy $n. Tukka-Tuk gonna go look at horizon and think about life.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(60540,0,0,'Don\'t rule me out be just cause I\'m a country boy! I got freakish strong arms, you know.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'EvStartText text'),(60540,1,0,'Nice moves. You keep reapin\' in those wins like grain, neighbor. I\'ll be rootin\' for you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,59956,0,'EvEndText text'),(60541,0,0,'<sigh>...Let\'s get this over with.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,59941,0,'EvStartText text'),(60541,1,0,'Now THAT\'S what I was looking for! You\'ve given me a reason to train again.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,59957,0,'EvEndText text'),(60542,0,0,'By the name of Chi-Ji, I smite you down!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59942,0,''),(60542,1,0,'Impossible...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,51720,0,''),(60543,0,0,'Give me everything you have, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59943,0,''),(60543,1,0,'Yes... yes, I believe you will do. I will see you again shortly, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(60544,0,0,'Ha ha! Don\'t pull any punches!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59944,0,''),(60544,1,0,'The taste of defeat... so strange and unfamiliar. Thank you for keeping me humble.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59960,0,''),(60545,0,0,'My hated rival... so glad you came.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59945,0,''),(60545,1,0,'Still clinging to the tailfeathers of Chi-Ji, and his idiotic notions of \"hope\"?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,60039,0,''),(60545,2,0,'I will show you the meaning of despair... and I will drag this whole island down with me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,60040,0,''),(60545,3,0,'N-no...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59961,0,''),(60546,0,0,'You stand no chance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59946,0,''),(60546,1,0,'Well fought. Until next time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,59962,0,''),(60572,0,0,'Do you feel it? Thunder is coming...',14,0,100,16,0,0,0,61233,0,'ÃÂÃÂ°ÃÂºÃÂº\'Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂºÃÂ°Ã‘Â to ÃËœÃÂ¼ÃÂ¿ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ°Ã‘â€šÃÂ¾Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘ÂÃÂºÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂ³ÃÂ²ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ´ÃÂµÃÂµÃ‘â€ '),(60580,0,0,'You know the wrong trolls.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,64652,0,'ÃÂÃÂ¼ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹Ã‘ÂÃÂºÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂºÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€šÃÂµÃÂ»Ã‘Å’ Ã‘â€¡ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ¿ÃÂ¾ÃÂ² to Player'),(60580,1,0,'Ð—Ð°Ð½Ð´Ð°Ð»Ð°Ñ€Ð¾Ð² Ñ‚ÐµÐ±Ðµ Ð½Ðµ Ð¾ÑÑ‚Ð°Ð½Ð¾Ð²Ð¸Ñ‚ÑŒ, ÑÐ»Ñ‹ÑˆÑŒ?',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,64649,0,'ÃÂÃÂ¼ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹Ã‘ÂÃÂºÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂºÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€šÃÂµÃÂ»Ã‘Å’ Ã‘â€¡ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ¿ÃÂ¾ÃÂ² to Player'),(60580,3,0,'You will regret it, do you hear?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,64648,0,'ÃÂÃÂ¼ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹Ã‘ÂÃÂºÃÂ¸ÃÂ¹ ÃÂºÃ‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€šÃÂµÃÂ»Ã‘Å’ Ã‘â€¡ÃÂµÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂµÃÂ¿ÃÂ¾ÃÂ² to Player'),(60581,3,0,'You know the wrong trolls.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,64652,0