ÑÑŒ, Ð½Ð°Ð¼ Ð¿Ñ€Ð¸Ð´ÐµÑ‚ÑÑ Ð·Ð´ÐµÑÑŒ Ð·Ð°Ð´ÐµÑ€Ð¶Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒÑÑ. ÐžÑ€Ð´Ð° Ð¼Ð¾Ð¶ÐµÑ‚ Ð·Ð°Ñ‰Ð¸Ñ‚Ð¸Ñ‚ÑŒ Ð½Ð°Ñ.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,65064,0,'ÃÂ§ÃÂ°ÃÂ½Ã‘Å’ ÃÂ¥ÃÂ¾ÃÂ¹-ÃÂ¡ÃÂ°ÃÂ½Ã‘Å’'),(64578,3,0,'I want to play with my toys. I want to go home.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,65062,0,'ÃÂ¦ÃÂ·Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ½ ÃÂ¦ÃÂ·Ã‘Å½ÃÂ½Ã‘Å’-ÃÅ¡ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€š'),(64579,3,0,'Can we go see the serpents?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,65056,0,'Jong Wik-Wung'),(64597,0,0,'Mmmmm, I haven\'t tasted a brew of this complexity and clarity since... well... since the golden age of the Stormstout Brewery! Whoever made this has a real talent.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,65914,0,'Nana Mudclaw to player'),(64616,0,0,'Very good. Let`s talk.',12,0,100,1,0,29136,0,65088,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,1,0,'Tong! Drinks, please.',12,0,100,1,0,29137,0,65089,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,2,0,'My father, Deathwing, tried to destroy the whole of Azeroth.',12,0,100,1,0,29138,0,65090,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,3,0,'He was misguided, of course, but he was right about one thing: Our world is... so fragile.',12,0,100,1,0,29139,0,65091,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,4,0,'Wa are a point of light in a universe of shadow. A candle in a tempest.',12,0,100,1,0,29140,0,65092,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,5,0,'Sometimes I think it was the very precariousness of our world that drove my father to madness.',12,0,100,1,0,29141,0,65093,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,6,0,'Ah, thank you Tong.',12,0,100,1,0,29142,0,65094,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,7,0,'Now to my point: I believe we are headed towards a reckoning. And no, I am not talking about the current conflict between the Aliance and the Horde.',12,0,100,1,0,29143,0,65095,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,8,0,'Believe me - what Garrosh Hellscream achieved in Theramore is nothing compared to the horrors that are even now bearing down on our fragile home.',12,0,100,1,0,29144,0,65096,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,9,0,'But the war deeply trubles me. Do you see my concern',12,0,100,1,0,29145,0,65097,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,10,0,'A divided Azeroth cannot possibly stand against the darkness.',12,0,100,1,0,29146,0,65098,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,11,0,'This war has to end. Soon. Before it consumes our Strength!',12,0,100,1,0,29147,0,65099,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,12,0,'You can rest assured that my loyalties lie with Horde.',12,0,100,1,0,29149,0,65101,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,13,0,'How do we bring a swift and decisive end to the conflict? I believe the answer lies with heroes like you.',12,0,100,1,0,29150,0,65102,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,26,0,'You can rest assured that my loyalties lie with Aliance.',12,0,100,1,0,29148,0,65100,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,28,0,'Tong! Something to eat, please.',12,0,100,1,0,34610,0,70329,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,29,0,'Garrosh Hellscream! Warchief of the Horde.',12,0,100,1,0,34574,0,70343,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,30,0,'He did not always command such power.',12,0,100,1,0,34575,0,70344,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,31,0,'On Draenor, he was a miserable wretch. The actions of his father hung heavy on his heart.',12,0,100,1,0,34576,0,70345,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,32,0,'I understand you, Garrosh. I know what it is like to bear the weight of your father\'s deeds.',12,0,100,1,0,34577,0,70346,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,33,0,'A warrior like Garrosh comes to power with something to prove.',12,0,100,1,0,34578,0,70347,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,34,0,'Your Horde finds itself at a turning point. This war will define you.',12,0,100,1,0,34579,0,70348,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,35,0,'What IS the Horde?',12,0,100,1,0,34580,0,70349,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,36,0,'Is it an instrument of vengeance, hellbent to carve out a future for its people?',12,0,100,1,0,34581,0,70350,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,37,0,'Is it a refuge for those who need shelter, a commonwealth of the downtrodden, built for mutual support?',12,0,100,1,0,34582,0,70351,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,38,0,'Or is it an alliance of convenience, a confederacy of unlikely partners free to pursue their own agendas?',12,0,100,1,0,34583,0,70352,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,39,0,'I asked you: Who is the soul of the Horde?',12,0,100,1,0,34584,0,70374,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,40,0,'We will find the answers here in Pandaria.',12,0,100,1,0,34585,0,70354,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,41,0,'Show me what your Horde is made of, Champion!',12,0,100,1,0,34586,0,70355,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,42,0,'Prove to me that your Horde is worthy of ruling over Azeroth.',12,0,100,1,0,34587,0,70356,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,44,0,'The High King. Varian Wrynn - Leader of the Alliance.',12,0,100,1,0,34561,0,70330,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,45,0,'Did you know, he was once a gladiator? Oh yes, I\'ve been doing my research.',12,0,100,1,0,34562,0,70331,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,46,0,'Suffering from amnesia, he fought for his life in Horde arenas.',12,0,100,1,0,34563,0,70332,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,47,0,'There, he earned the name \"Lo\'Gosh,\" or \"Ghost Wolf.\"',12,0,100,1,0,34564,0,70333,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,48,0,'He IS a fighter. But... is he a leader?',12,0,100,1,0,34565,0,70334,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,49,0,'Think about it! His enemies took advantage of my father\'s Cataclysm.',12,0,100,1,0,34566,0,70335,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,50,0,'Horde soldiers thundered across the realm in the wake of the devastation.',12,0,100,1,0,34567,0,70336,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,51,0,'Varian Wrynn didn\'t use the disaster to gain a military advantage.',12,0,100,1,0,34568,0,70337,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,52,0,'Is this because he is weak...? Or because he is principled?',12,0,100,1,0,34569,0,70338,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,53,0,'Here\'s the bigger question: Can principles win a war?',12,0,100,1,0,34570,0,70339,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,54,0,'Make no mistake. Pandaria will challenge your King.',12,0,100,1,0,34571,0,70340,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,55,0,'Let us see what he is truly made of.',12,0,100,1,0,34572,0,70341,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,56,0,'Let us see if your Alliance has what it takes to rule Azeroth.',12,0,100,1,0,34573,0,70342,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,57,0,'You have proven to be an exemplary hero. A champion for your cause.',12,0,100,1,0,34602,0,70371,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,58,0,'Do you recall our earlier conversation?',12,0,100,1,0,34603,0,70372,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,59,0,'We spoke of your Warchief. His inner conflicts and his outer conquests.',12,0,100,1,0,34604,0,70373,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,61,0,'Your efforts on Padaria\'s southern shore and elsewhere have given me my answer.',12,0,100,1,0,34606,0,70375,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,62,0,'YOU are the soul of the Horde.',12,0,100,1,0,34607,0,70376,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,63,0,'Your actions in the coming weeks will come to define your people.',12,0,100,1,0,34608,0,70377,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,64,0,'I want to make sure that you are properly equipped for the trials ahead.',12,0,100,1,0,34609,0,70378,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,65,0,'Tong: fetch my things!',12,0,100,1,0,34597,0,70366,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,66,0,'Your dedication to your cause deserves to be rewarded.',12,0,100,1,0,34598,0,70367,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,67,0,'Like you, I continue to refine my skills here in Pandaria. I think you will appreciate the outcome.',12,0,100,1,0,34599,0,70368,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,68,0,'Choose your reward!',12,0,100,1,0,34600,0,70369,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,71,0,'We discussed the merits of your High King. I have been observing him closely.',12,0,100,1,0,34590,0,70359,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,72,0,'It is true: he has the spirit of the wolf. And he fights like a wolf.',12,0,100,1,0,34591,0,70360,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,73,0,'Having seen him in action, I now know what that means.',12,0,100,1,0,34592,0,70361,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,74,0,'Wolves are pack animals.',12,0,100,1,0,34593,0,70362,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,75,0,'Your King is calling his pack to him, assembling an Alliance in the truest sense of the word.',12,0,100,1,0,34594,0,70363,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,76,0,'His journey is long. He has only taken the first steps.',12,0,100,1,0,34595,0,70364,0,'Smart Text'),(64616,77,0,'But with heroes like you in his pack, there is little your Alliance cannot accomplish.',12,0,100,1,0,34596,0,70365,0,'Smart Text'),(64623,3,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_improvedsoulleech:20|tÐ’Ñ‹ Ð¿Ð¾Ð¿Ð°Ð»Ð¸ Ð¿Ð¾Ð´ Ð´ÐµÐ¹ÑÑ‚Ð²Ð¸Ðµ Ð·Ð°ÐºÐ»Ð¸Ð½Ð°Ð½Ð¸Ñ |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126228|h[ÐŸÐ¾ÐºÐ°Ð»ÐµÑ‡ÐµÐ½Ð½Ð°Ñ Ð´ÑƒÑˆÐ°]|h|r! Ð£Ð±Ð¸Ð²Ð°Ñ‚ÑŒ!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,65154,0,'Severed Soul to Player'),(64631,3,0,'Feel the Big Scary Voodoo!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10438,0,'Ãâ€”ÃÂ½ÃÂ°Ã‘â€¦ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Å’ ÃÂ¸ÃÂ· ÃÂ¿ÃÂ»ÃÂµÃÂ¼ÃÂµÃÂ½ÃÂ¸ Ãâ€œÃ‘Æ’Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Æ’ÃÂ±ÃÂ°Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¸ to Player'),(64648,3,0,'The thing is covered in oil, set it on fire!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,65346,0,'ÃÅ¡ÃÂ°ÃÂ¿ÃÂ¸Ã‘â€šÃÂ°ÃÂ½ Ã‘ÂÃ‘â€šÃ‘â‚¬ÃÂ°ÃÂ¶ÃÂ¸ ÃÂ¨ÃÂ°ÃÂ´ÃÂ¾-ÃÅ¸ÃÂ°ÃÂ½ to ÃÅ¡Ã‘â‚¬ÃÂ¸\'Ã‘â€¡ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½'),(64738,3,0,'There are many bodies there. Great job, $p.',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,65384,0,'ÃÂ Ã‘â€¹Ã‘â€ ÃÂ°Ã‘â‚¬Ã‘Å’ ÃÂ² ÃÂºÃÂ°ÃÂ¿Ã‘Å½Ã‘Ë†ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½ÃÂµ to Player'),(64757,4,0,'Ð•ÑÑ‚ÑŒ, ÑÐ²ÐµÑ‚!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,65504,0,'ÃÂ¨ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â€ž to ÃÂ¨ÃÂ¾ÃÂ½Ã‘Æ’Ã‘â€ž'),(64764,0,0,'There are a lot of corpses out there.  Nicely done, $p.',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,65384,0,'Hooded Crusader to Player'),(64822,0,0,'I often venture out here to think. The view is breathtaking, would you agree?',12,0,100,1,0,29124,0,65109,0,'Smart Text'),(64822,1,0,'Pandaria is indeed a jewel. Such beauty. It makes you want to protect her, yes?',12,0,100,1,0,29125,0,65110,0,'Smart Text'),(64822,2,0,'I feel the same way about Azeroth herself.',12,0,100,1,0,29126,0,65111,0,'Smart Text'),(64822,3,0,'You have done great things, friend. I can assure you this is but the beginning of our work together.',12,0,100,1,0,29127,0,65112,0,'Smart Text'),(64822,4,0,'Behold: The power of the foes you`ve vanquished.',12,0,100,1,0,29128,0,65113,0,'Smart Text'),(64822,5,0,'And the wisdom of those you`ve outsmarted.',12,0,100,1,0,29129,0,65114,0,'Smart Text'),(64822,6,0,'Here! The embodiment of the fear that you`ve conquered. May it now strike terror into the hearts of your enemies!',12,0,100,1,0,29130,0,65115,0,'Smart Text'),(64822,7,0,'Finally, a gift from me. Make no mistake: the Black Dragonf