one of our history mentions the dragons fightin\' undead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191853,4,0,'It says here that before Malygos became an Aspect, he almost succumbed to undeath! That doesn\'t make any sense--what undeath are they talking about?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191853,5,0,'Huh! Neltharion used to be one of Alexstrasza\'s closest friends and confidants. ...it must have broken her heart tae see him fall tae madness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191853,6,0,'Ah ha! I knew the barrier override would be on one of these.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191853,7,0,'Press that final button and let\'s get out of here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,''),(191853,8,0,'Ye\'ve done it! Let\'s meet back in the main room and see if we can\'t get past that barrier.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190343,0,0,'Facility lockdown confirmed. Engaging threat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(190343,1,0,'Anomaly detected. Engaging defense protocol Gamma Theta Phi Omicron.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(193176,0,0,'%s is being empowered by the Dreamsurge!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(131825,2,0,'My thorns will rip you to shreds!',14,0,50,0,0,97508,0,144961,0,'Sister Briar to Player'),(131825,2,1,'The more you struggle, the more you\'ll bleed!',14,0,50,0,0,97507,0,144960,0,'Sister Briar to Player'),(135322,0,0,'|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Gem_Pearl_04.blp:20|t The Golden Serpent absorbs an Animated Gold, gaining |cFFFF0000|Hspell:265991|h[Luster]|h|r!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,156383,0,'The Golden Serpent to Animated Gold'),(54856,6,0,'Master Li Fei fades away.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,53130,0,'Master Li Fei to Player'),(131545,3,0,'No! You won\'t take him from me!',14,0,33,0,0,97500,0,145924,0,'Lady Waycrest to Lord Waycrest'),(131545,3,1,'I will never let him go!',14,0,33,0,0,97501,0,145925,0,'Lady Waycrest to Lord Waycrest'),(131545,3,2,'Our bond can never be broken!',14,0,33,0,0,97502,0,145926,0,'Lady Waycrest to Lord Waycrest'),(131545,4,0,'We will never be parted...',14,0,100,0,0,97493,0,145954,0,'Lady Waycrest to Player