he djaradin, have stirred to violence once again.',12,0,100,0,0,204486,0,225350,0,''),(193372,1,0,'I see.',12,0,100,0,0,204485,0,225349,0,''),(191807,3,0,'When the dragons left,and the land went domant,so too did the djaradin stumber.',12,0,100,0,0,206661,0,222019,0,''),(191807,1,0,'According to legend,the djaradin are the dragonsÂ´most formidable revals.',12,0,100,0,0,206659,0,221848,0,''),(191807,7,0,'Commander Lethanak!Cadet Sendrax and ally reporting on the majordomoÂ´s orders!',12,0,100,0,0,206665,0,222620,0,''),(191807,6,0,'The return of the diaradin will test us to the limit. May we prove worthy of the challenge! Commander Lethanak! Cadet Sendrax and ally reporting on the majordomos orders!',12,0,100,0,0,206664,0,222017,0,''),(191807,5,0,'We drakonids have stayed vigilant as we safeguarded the oathstones,symbols of the dragonflightsÂ´power.',12,0,100,0,0,206662,0,222018,0,''),(191807,2,0,'They were ruthless and powerful,killing countless dragons in ancient times.',12,0,100,0,0,206660,0,221849,0,''),(189767,0,0,'Neue Abenteuer?Bin dabei.Wo Arbeit wartet,ist mein Hammer immer bereit,eingesetzt zu werden!Wir sehen uns an den Docks!',12,0,100,0,0,204311,0,224956,0,''),(2713,9,0,'Found something... I think.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,820,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,0,0,'Well then, let\'s get this started. The longer we\'re here, the more damage the undead could be doing back in Hillsbrad.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,816,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,3,0,'%s begins rummaging through the apothecary\'s belongings.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,819,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,2,0,'Watch my rear! I\'ll see what I can find in all this junk...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,818,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,4,0,'I bet Quae\'ll think this is important. She\'s pretty knowledgeable about these things--no expert, but knowledgable.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,821,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,8,0,'Attack me if you will, but you won\'t stop me from getting back to Quae.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,897,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,6,0,'%s hands her pack to Quae.',16,7,100,0,0,0,0,891,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,5,0,'Okay, let\'s get out of here quick quick! Try and keep up. I\'m going to make a break for it.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,822,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,7,0,'We made it! Quae, we made it!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,892,0,'Kinelory'),(2713,1,0,'All right, this is where we really have to be on our paws. Be ready!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,817,0,'Kinelory'),(215967,1,0,'Hurry! If we free these stormrooks, we can fly there and try to end this madness!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(215967,2,0,'What is that orb? It\'s radiating dark energy... And it\'s affecting the stormrooks.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(215967,3,0,'While you go to the roosts, I will distract them here. We can link up later.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(215967,4,0,'Finally! I thought I\'d have to fight Gorren on my own...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(221296,0,0,'Defend the city!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(209059,3,0,'Alright, I\'ll hang back.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(209059,4,0,'We could use this minecart for a quick trip back.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(209059,5,0,'Troublemakers. Two of them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(209230,0,0,'|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Vehicle_ElectroCharge.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:444123|h[Lightning Torrent]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(207205,7,0,'I deserve... this power...',14,0,100,0,0,247952,0,0,0,''),(207205,1,0,'I command this rookery! By right.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(207205,2,0,'The might of my hammer!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(207205,3,0,'Crushed by my power!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(207205,4,0,'Feel my blessing!',14,0,100,0,0,247948,0,0,0,''),(207205,5,0,'Your death is my directive!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(207205,6,0,'My valor, your ruin!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(211260,1,0,'What... is that? What did Gorren bring here?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(211260,2,0,'The lift is out. If we want to keep going, we will have to go down the Stormrider way. Follow me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,''),(211260,3,0,'We have to take it down.',14,0,100,0,0,251768,0,0,0,''),(207207,2,0,'<