m was a step too far.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,4,'I\'d rather die than side with the titans!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,5,'I\'d rather die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,6,'I\'ll never side with the titans!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,7,'I\'m loyal to Terro. And Terro was loyal to Vyranoth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,8,'If Fyrakk turns the world to fire, where am I supposed to live?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,9,'If we don\'t follow through now, everything up to this point will be in vain.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,10,'Terro wanted us to stand with Vyranoth.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,11,'Vyranoth has a lot of nerve preaching to us about loyalty.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,12,'Vyranoth talks too much about how things SHOULD be done. Fyrakk just does it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,13,'You\'re nothing compared to the power of the elements!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,1,'Fyrakk will prevail!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,2,'Fyrakk won\'t rest until the Wellspring burns! Why try to resist?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(209174,0,0,'Fyrakk didn\'t abandon us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreambreaker Flametongue'),(210149,2,0,'More minecart! Now!',14,0,0,0,0,247818,0,0,0,'Ol Waxbeard - Minecart'),(210149,3,0,'|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Fixated_State_Red.blp|t %s targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:423693|h[Luring Candleflame!]|h|r',42,0,0,0,0,0,0,35830,0,'Ol Waxbeard - Luring Candleflame'),(210149,4,0,'Let\'s go, Wick!',14,0,0,0,0,247819,0,41444,0,'Ol Waxbeard - Reckless Charge'),(210149,5,0,'Weaklings! Help Waxbeard!',14,0,0,0,0,247816,0,44046,0,'Ol Waxbeard - Summon Help'),(210149,6,0,'No dodge minecart!',14,0,0,0,0,247817,0,47065,0,'Ol Waxbeard - Minecart Warning'),(210149,7,0,'Stupid weaklings... Stupid Wick...',14,0,0,0,0,247824,0,66932,0,'Ol Waxbeard - Death'),(210149,1,0,'Fight Waxbeard? Fight Wick? Stupid!',14,0,0,0,0,0,0,34611,0,'Ol Waxbeard - Combat Start'),(210149,0,0,'Move, weaklings! Here we come.',14,0,0,0,0,247811,0,34186,0,'Ol Waxbeard - Aggro'),(39270,2,2,'You fight well.  I will leave you now.  Lok\'tar ogar!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,39306,0,'Injured Razor Hill Grunt to Player'),(39270,2,3,'I feel much better now.  For the Horde!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,39303,0,'Injured Razor Hill Grunt to Player'),(91003,3,0,'Rok... no... break',14,0,100,0,0,54549,0,102713,0,'Rokmora'),(91797,7,2,'The oceans rest... but the wind still rises against you.',14,0,25,0,0,54320,0,102309,0,'King Deepbeard to Player'),(91797,7,3,'Gaaah... The winds will finish you, intruders.',14,0,25,0,0,54322,0,102310,0,'King Deepbeard to Player'),(91797,8,0,'Blood repays blood.',14,0,50,0,0,54329,0,102314,0,'King Deepbeard'),(91797,8,1,'Justice for the son you murdered!',14,0,50,0,0,54326,0,102313,0,'King Deepbeard'),(91797,9,0,'This was as inevitable as the tides, fools.',14,0,100,0,0,54332,0,102317,0,'King Deepbeard'),(246156,0,0,'Over here, $p. The rumors I mentioned began in this part of the city.',12,0,100,1,0,300619,0,296405,5,'Magister Umbric to Player'),(50039,0,2,'DIE!!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,49839,0,'Goblin Assassin on Aggro'),(42391,2,0,'Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,42382,0,'West Plains Drifter to Player'),(42391,3,0,'Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,42383,0,'West Plains Drifter to Player'),(42383,0,0,'Listen, $g pal:lady;, I don\'t want any trouble, ok? I didn\'t see who murdered \'em, but I sure heard it! Lot of yelling. Human voices... you dig? Now get out of here before I change my mind about beating you up and takin\' your shoes.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42380,0,'Transient to Player'),(42383,1,0,'I didn\'t see who killed \'em, $g bub:lady;, but I got a whiff. Smelled rich, kinda like you. Damn shame too. Furlbrows were a fixture around here. Nice people, always willin\' to share a meal or a patch of dirt.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42381,0,'Transient to Player'),(42383,2,0,'Who killed the Furlbrows? I\'ll tell you who killed the Furlbrows: KING VARIAN WRYNN, THAT\'S WHO! And he\'s killin\' the rest of us too. One bum at a time. The only thing I can tell you is that I saw some gnolls leavin\' the place a few hours before the law arrived.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,42382,0,'Transient to Player'),(42383,3,0,'Between you, me, and the tree, murlocs killed the Furlbrows. Yep, saw \'em with my own two eyes. Think they\'d been casin\' the joint for days, maybe months. They left in a hurry once they got wind of \"Johnny Law\" and the idiot brigade over there...',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,42383,0,'Transient to Player'),(42386,4,0,'Judgment day comes! The brotherhood will be reborn!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,42379,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42386,4,1,'Now you\'ve gone and done it! TIME FOR THE FIST!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,42389,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42386,4,2,'You\'ll get nothing out of me!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,42378,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42386,4,3,'Livin\' like an animal is hard enough without your insults!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,42386,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42386,4,4,'I ain\'t tellin\' you a damn thing!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,42385,0,'Homeless Stormwind Citizen to Player'),(42386,4,5,'Maybe I can sell your liver for