usashitake to Player'),(121818,0,0,'For the Legion! For Kil\'Jaeden!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8650,0,'Lord Kazzak'),(121818,1,0,'Your own strength feeds me, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8461,0,'Lord Kazzak'),(121818,2,0,'Kazzak is supreme!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,8651,0,'Lord Kazzak'),(108756,0,0,'You have won.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114453,0,'Navea the Purifier'),(108754,0,0,'You have bested me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114456,0,'Fingall Flamehammer'),(108751,0,0,'Well struck.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,114451,0,'Arctic Whitemace'),(108744,0,0,'Well struck.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114451,0,'Tessa Wybroff'),(108742,0,0,'You have bested me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,114456,0,'Fen Cinderpaw'),(43859,0,0,'I... I can\'t...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44289,0,'Jitters Quest 26760'),(43858,0,0,'Here we go...',12,0,100,390,0,0,0,44300,0,'Oliver Harris Quest 26760'),(43858,1,0,'It\'s working. Hold him still, Jitters.',12,0,100,669,0,0,0,44288,0,'Oliver Harris Quest 26760'),(43858,2,0,'Damn it, Jitters, I said HOLD!',12,0,100,603,0,0,0,44290,0,'Oliver Harris Quest 26760'),(43858,3,0,'Letting him go is the only thing that\'s going to separate you from the beasts now, my friend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,44296,0,'Oliver Harris Quest 26760'),(42941,0,0,'Hello, Ohgan\'aka.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,42845,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42941,1,0,'Oh yeah, Jin\'do.  We gonna take REAL good care of Ohgan\'aka.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42847,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42941,2,0,'I got a new cage built up, and we got plenty of ways to... teach her not to escape again.',12,0,100,14,0,0,0,42848,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42884,0,0,'Where you goin\', little one?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,42840,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42884,1,0,'You tryin\' to escape from Zul\'Gurub?',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42841,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42884,2,0,'Ain\'t NO ONE gonna escape Zul\'Gurub!  Not with Jin\'do in charge!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,42842,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42884,3,0,'You\'re lucky I don\'t kill ya right now... but I got bigger plans for ya.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42843,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42884,4,0,'Ya see... to summon Hakkar, I need Mandokir.  And Mandokir, he needs you.',12,0,100,396,0,0,0,42844,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42884,5,0,'Bloodlord, you gonna take better care of your possessions?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,42846,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42884,6,0,'Good, Good.  And you... yes, you... the meddling worm inside dat Mind Control spell.  Don\'t think Jin\'do can\'t see you.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,42849,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42884,7,0,'Whenever you get the GUTS to come back here, you better be ready.  \'Cause Jin\'do\'s got a surprise for you...',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,42850,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42871,0,0,'Da tiki!  Put it out!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,42859,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42871,1,0,'Ouch, mon!  I be trippin\'!',14,0,100,485,0,0,0,42838,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42871,2,0,'Aaaaahhh!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,42839,0,'quest : See Raptor 26773 / Be Raptor 26775'),(42871,3,0,'Get over here, bruddas, quick!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,42862,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42871,4,0,'Who left this here, mon?  Whooaahh...',14,0,100,485,0,0,0,42835,0,'quest See Raptor 26773 + Be Raptor 26775'),(42799,0,0,'Welcome to Zul\'Gurub, little one.  It might not look like much now, but give it time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,42745,0,'quest : See Raptor 26773 / Be Raptor 26775'),(42799,1,0,'Ahh... it\'s good to be home.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,42746,0,'quest : See Raptor 26773 / Be Raptor 26775'),(42799,2,0,'There\'s plenty others of your kind here, but I wouldn\'t worry about competition.  You\'re from the bloodline of Ohgan, my oldest friend.  You see... our souls are intertwined, yours and mine.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42747,0,'quest : See Raptor 26773 / Be Raptor 26775'),(42799,3,0,'Here we are.  Get ready for your training, little one.  I recommend you forget about that worthless $r $c and start thinking about your duties here in Zul\'Gurub.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,42748,0,'quest : See Raptor 26773 / Be Raptor 26775'),(258372,0,0,'Show your face, $p. I make you pay for meddling!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Spiritflayer Jin\'Ma - Spawn Yell'),(247106,0,0,'You disrupt de ritual, now you be de new sacrifice!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Consumption of Nalorakk - Aggro Yell'),(252948,0,0,'Me....run!',12,0,100,0,0,221108,0,302833,0,'Spiritpaw Cubs - Freed 1'),(252948,0,1,'Rrrr... free!',12,0,100,0,0,221109,0,302834,0,'Spiritpaw Cubs - Freed 2'),(252948,0,2,'Friend...yes!',12,0,100,0,0,221107,0,302832,0,'Spiritpaw Cubs - Freed 3'),(246831,0,0,'De ritual must be completed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Necrohex Soulbinder - Ritual Interrupted'),(208745,0,0,'You. No. Take. CANDLE!',14,0,100,0,0,247825,0,262503,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,1,0,'I mold you now!',14,0,33,0,0,247831,0,262509,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,1,1,'I make you candle!',14,0,33,0,0,247829,0,262507,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,1,2,'Wax and ruin!',14,0,33,0,0,247830,0,262508,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Shadowflames_Wave:20|t%s targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:421282|h[Darkflame Pickaxe]|h|r!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,3,0,'This why I king and you dead.',14,0,100,0,0,247832,0,262510,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,4,0,'You die!',14,0,33,0,0,247826,0,262504,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,4,1,'Snuffed out!',14,0,33,0,0,247827,0,262505,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,4,2,'Weaklings!',14,0,33,0,0,247828,0,262506,0,'The Candle King'),(208745,5,0,'But I... the king...',14,0,100,0,0,28232,0,262511,0,'The Candle King'),(231606,0,0,'Emberdawn begins casting Burning Gale!',68,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Emberdawn'),(231626,0,0,'You desecrate her sanctum? Begone!',14,0,100,0,0,298969,0,296241,0,'Kalis'),(231626,1,0,'Shadows descend!',14,0,100,0,0,298976,0,0,0,'Kalis to Kalis'),(231626,2,0,'Pierce your mind!',14,0,10