02,0,'E.D.N.A.'),(210108,8,0,'All intruders terminated.',14,0,100,0,0,247889,0,262610,0,'E.D.N.A.'),(210108,9,0,'All systems... shutting down...',14,0,100,0,0,247890,0,262611,0,'E.D.N.A.'),(246154,0,4,'We are Xal\'atath\'s finest weapon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Suspicious Citizen to Player'),(246154,0,5,'The apocalypse beckons. We answer her call.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Suspicious Citizen to Player'),(246155,0,4,'Are there cultists in the city? I had better hurry home...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Suspicious Citizen to Player'),(49337,0,0,'Hello again.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,49455,0,'Darnell'),(49337,1,0,'I know the way to Deathknell. Come with me!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,49456,0,'Darnell'),(234648,0,0,'Let\'s make an example of you.',14,0,100,0,0,306490,0,281368,0,'Kystia Manaheart'),(234648,1,0,'Flee the flame!',14,0,50,0,0,299094,0,297213,0,'Kystia Manaheart'),(234648,1,1,'Fear the fel!',14,0,50,0,0,299095,0,297214,0,'Kystia Manaheart'),(234648,2,0,'Learn your place!',14,0,50,0,0,299093,0,297210,0,'Kystia Manaheart'),(234648,2,1,'Back, you mongrels!',14,0,50,0,0,299092,0,297209,0,'Kystia Manaheart'),(234648,3,0,'Naughty little Nibbles!',14,0,50,0,0,299096,0,297215,0,'Kystia Manaheart to Nibbles'),(234648,3,1,'Nibbles! Drop it!',14,0,50,0,0,299097,0,297216,0,'Kystia Manaheart to Nibbles'),(234648,4,0,'Ahh, just what I needed.',14,0,50,0,0,299091,0,297208,0,'Kystia Manaheart'),(234648,4,1,'Nibbles, give mother a taste!',14,0,50,0,0,299090,0,297206,0,'Kystia Manaheart'),(234648,5,0,'But... my... magic...',14,0,100,0,0,299088,0,297202,0,'Kystia Manaheart to Player'),(234648,6,0,'Fel conquers all.',14,0,100,0,0,299087,0,297199,0,'Kystia Manaheart'),(234660,0,0,'|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Paladin_Lightofdawn.blp:20|t %s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:1230304|h[Light Infusion]|h|r at Kystia!',68,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nibbles to Kystia Manaheart'),(234660,1,0,'|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Fire_FelFlameBreath.blp:20|t %s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:1253811|h[Fel Spray]|h|r!',68,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nibbles to Player'),(234660,2,0,'%s makes her escape.',68,0,100,0,0,299088,0,0,0,'Nibbles to Nibbles'),(61836,1,0,'Pandaren? Here, in Stormwind?',12,0,100,6,5000,0,0,61406,0,'Moni Widdlesprock at Stormwind Trade District'),(61834,0,0,'Yes. Those are pandaren, Moni.',12,0,100,1,5000,0,0,61405,0,'Alyn Black at Stormwind Trade District'),(61837,0,0,'Welcome to Stormwind!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,61410,0,'Leria Nightwind at Stormwind Canals Bridge'),(61841,0,0,'Pandaren? I mussht be seein\' thingssh...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,61411,0,'Brunn Goldenmug at Stormwind Canals'),(61838,0,0,'Heh... pandaren. You must be here to join the Alliance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,61407,0,'Gaving Marlsbury at Stormwind Canals'),(61838,1,0,'Good move. It worked out well for me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,61408,0,'Gaving Marlsbury at Stormwind Canals'),(61839,0,0,'Quiet, Naanae. Outsiders approach.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,61412,0,'Lucas Severing at Stormwind Keep'),(61840,0,0,'Outsiders, yes - but their intentions are good.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,61413,0,'Naanae at Stormwind Keep'),(61840,1,0,'Look carefully, Lucas. The Light is strong with them. Particularly that one.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,61414,0,'Naanae at Stormwind Keep'),(61895,0,0,'Hey look! Gnolls!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,61401,0,'Marty at Stormwind City entrance'),(61896,0,0,'Those aren\'t gnolls, silly. Use your eyes.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,61402,0,'Josie at Stormwind City entrance'),(61896,1,0,'Those are FURBOLGS.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,61403,0,'Josie at Stormwind City entrance'),(61796,0,0,'Walk with me. All three of you.',12,0,100,1,0,29574,0,61424,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,1,0,'I understand you want to join the Alliance.',12,0,100,0,0,29575,0,61425,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,2,0,'We always have need of allies. I\'d be a fool to turn you away, especially at a time of war.',12,0,100,1,0,29576,0,61426,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,3,0,'But there are a number of things I need to make clear to you.',12,0,100,0,0,29577,0,61427,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,4,0,'First: the races of the Alliance look out for one another.',12,0,100,0,0,29578,0,61429,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,5,0,'You are expected to provide aid to Alliance members in need, whether they be human, gnome, draenei... or pandaren like yourselves.',12,0,100,1,0,29579,0,61430,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,6,0,'It is a simple guideline, but a meaningful one. Do you understand?',12,0,100,0,0,29580,0,61432,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,7,0,'Good. Because that brings me to my second point.',12,0,100,273,0,29581,0,61434,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,8,0,'Not all pandaren have chosen the same path as you three.',12,0,100,0,0,29582,0,61435,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,9,0,'Some have sided with the Horde.',12,0,100,0,0,29583,0,61436,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,10,0,'They, along with the other barbarian clans of the Horde, are your new enemies.',12,0,100,1,0,29584,0,61437,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,11,0,'Those who you once considered friends, or even those you might have loved, are now your sworn adversaries.',12,0,100,274,0,29585,0,61438,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,12,0,'I am deeply sorry, but the battle lines have been drawn. I will not tolerate any fraternizing with the enemy, as you could expose our Alliance to danger.',12,0,100,5,0,29586,0,61439,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,13,0,'Do I make myself clear?',12,0,100,0,0,29587,0,61440,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,14,0,'Very well. We are nearly finished, $p.',12,0,100,0,0,29588,0,61442,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,15,0,'Few people know this, but I was once a pit fighter myself. A gladiator for the Horde\'s amusement. So I know a thing or two about martial combat.',12,0,100,1,0,29568,0,66865,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,16,0,'Now, pandaren... let me see what you\'ve got!',12,0,100,5,0,29569,0,61454,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,17,0,'Don\'t hold back now! Let\'s have it!',12,0,100,5,0,29570,0,61455,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,18,0,'What\'s the matter? You\'ll have to do better than that.',12,0,100,6,0,29571,0,61456,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,19,0,'Come on, pandaren! HIT ME!',14,0,100,5,0,29572,0,61458,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(61796,20,0,'Ha ha ha haaa! I haven\'t felt like this in YEARS! Don\'t worry, $p... I\'ve been in worse scraps than this. A fighting spirit like yours is welcome in the Alliance.  Now, let\'s get back to business.',12,0,100,11,0,29573,0,61459,0,'King Varian Spawned in Stormwind Keep'),(17509,0,0,'Read the tome of divinity I have given you, $n.  When you have learned from the book, speak with me again.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,19811,0,'Jol'),(17551,0,0,'Thank you, kind $gsir:lady;!',12,35,100,2,0,0,0,17578,0,'Tavara'),(17551,1,0,'Please tell Guvan that I\'ll be fine, thanks to you.',12,35,100,3,0,0,0,14224,0,'Tavara'),(29611,0,0,'People of Stormwind! Citizens of the Alliance! Your king speaks!',14,7,100,22,0,0,0,31675,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),(29611,1,0,'Today marks the first of many defeats for the Scourge! Death knights, once in service of the Lich King, have broken free of his grasp and formed a new alliance against his tyranny!',14,7,100,22,0,0,0,31676,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),(29611,2,0,'You will welcome these former heroes of the Alliance and treat them with the respect that you would give to any ally of Stormwind!',14,7,100,22,0,0,0,31677,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),(29611,3,0,'Glory to the Alliance!',14,7,100,4,0,0,0,31678,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),(38052,0,0,'My brothers and sisters, words cannot describe what I felt upon seeing the Sunwell rekindled.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37809,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(38052,1,0,'In that moment, the Light revealed to me the truth of the terrible things I had done.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37811,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(38052,2,0,'Our people had walked a dark path and mine was among the darkest of them all.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37813,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(38052,3,0,'But the Light showed me that I was not lost. It helped me to find the strength to survive in spite of all that had happened and all the evil I had wrought.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37814,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(38052,4,0,'It is a strength that we sin\'dorei all share. It is a strength we will need to free ourselves of the addiction ravaging our people.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37815,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(38052,5,0,'It will be the most difficult battle we have ever faced, but our resolve and the power of the Sunwell will sustain us until we have been restored to our greatness.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37816,0,'Lady Liadrin'),(38047,0,0,'Well said, my lady. We sin\'dorei will be free and we shall be great again!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37817,0,'Blood Elf Pilgrim'),(37781,2,0,'Can that really be Quel\'Delar?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37441,0,'Sunwell Honor Guard'),(37764,2,0,'It is indeed Quel\'Delar. I had not thought I\'d live to see the day when Thalorien Dawnseeker\'s legendary sword would be restored to us.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37449,0,'Lor themar Theron'),(37764,3,0,'You are a hero and an inspiration to the sin\'dorei, $n, a symbol of our endurance in the face of tragedy and treachery.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37450,0,'Lor themar Theron'),(37763,5,0,'The regent speaks truly, $n. Thalorien\'s sacrifice could not prevent the fall of this very Sunwell.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37451,0,'Grand Magister Rommat'),(37763,6,0,'When you found the sword, it was broken and abandoned, much like Silvermoon after Kael\'thas\'s betrayal.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37452,0,'Grand Magister Rommat'),(37763,7,0,'Let Quel\'Delar be a sign that we will never give up, that we will face any enemy without fear.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37453,0,'Grand Magister Rommat'),(37765,3,0,'Quel\'Delar is not held in high esteem by the sin\'dorei alone. It holds a place in the heart of all children of Silvermoon.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37454,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(37765,4,0,'This blade has been returned to us for a reason, my lords. Now is the time to rally behind the bearer of Quel\'Delar and avenge the destruction of Silvermoon and the Sunwell.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37455,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser'),(37763,8,0,'Reclaim the sword, $n, and bear it through that portal to Dalaran. Archmage Aethas Sunreaver will be waiting to congratulate you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,37456,0,'Grand Magister Rommat'),(17824,0,0,'Treacherous whelp! Sironas will destroy you and your people!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,14637,0,'Captured Sunhawk Agent'),(49141,10,0,'I saw someone up there whose jaw fell off.  I wonder if Mordo can fix him up?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49304,0,'Darnell'),(900001,0,0,'Hello again.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,49455,0,'Darnell'),(900001,1,0,'I know the way to Deathknell. Come with me!',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,49456,0,'Darnell'),(900001,2,0,'Good, you\'re still here. Now, where\'s Deathguard Saltain?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49457,0,'Darnell'),(900001,3,0,'Ah, here he is.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,49458,0,'Darnell'),(1521,0,2,'Save me from the cold!',12,0,100,18,0,0,0,39009,0,'Gretchen Dedmar'),(4280,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Scarlet Preserver'),(4281,0,1,'You carry the taint of the scourge. Prepare to enter the twisting nether.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Scout'),(4281,0,2,'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2628,0,'Scarlet Scout'),(4281,0,3,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Scout'),(4281,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Scarlet Scout'),(4282,0,3,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Magician'),(4282,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Scarlet Magician'),(4283,0,2,'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2628,0,'Scarlet Sentry'),(4283,0,3,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Sentry'),(4283,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Scarlet Sentry'),(4284,0,2,'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2628,0,'Scarlet Augur'),(4284,0,3,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Augur'),(4284,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Scarlet Augur'),(4285,0,0,'The light condemns all who harbor evil. Now you will die!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2627,0,'Scarlet Disciple'),(4285,0,1,'You carry the taint of the scourge. Prepare to enter the twisting nether.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2625,0,'Scarlet Disciple'),(4285,0,2,'The Scarlet Crusade shall smite the wicked and drive evil from these lands!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2628,0,'Scarlet Disciple'),(4285,0,3,'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge\'s taint.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2626,0,'Scarlet Disciple'),(4285,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Scarlet Disciple'),(5957,1,1,'Don\'t make me go medieval on you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1403,0,'Birgitte Cranston'),(5957,1,2,'Keep it up, $n, and I\'ll beat some manners into you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1404,0,'Birgitte Cranston'),(23061,0,0,'Get away from my clutch!!!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21696,0,'Rivendark'),(23061,0,1,'I know you by your stench, little $n.  Here, in my perch, is where your bones shall finally rest.',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21706,0,'Rivendark'),(23061,0,2,'I tire of interruptions from the insignificant.  Your time has come, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21710,0,'Rivendark'),(23061,0,3,'The Skyguard shall pay for your temerity, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21714,0,'Rivendark'),(23061,0,4,'I believe that I shall feas