us with the presence of one of your many denizens.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29790,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,0,2,'What beast lies in store for us...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29792,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,0,3,'Let us coldly greet another inhabitant of the shadow realm...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29791,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,0,4,'There are many lessons left to learn, let us move onto our next subject...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29793,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,0,5,'Let us see what atrocity we can pull from the shadow realm this time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29695,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,1,0,'Skeletal mages. A perfect opportunity to display the utility of some of our powers.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29796,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,2,0,'Your spells will not be as potent as mine, but you will still find anti-magic shells to be entirely invaluable against a large number of magical attacks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29828,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,3,0,'The power you absorb from spells with your shell can be used to counter with your other attacks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29829,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,4,0,'Mages fear our kind... with reason. Play upon this fear, disciples.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29830,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,5,0,'Ghouls? We have quite enough of those already.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29702,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,6,0,'I often find the trouble with ghouls is that they outlive their usefulness too quickly. Let us let death and decay reclaim these.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29816,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,7,0,'At times, their corpses can prove more useful than the ghouls were themselves.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29817,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,8,0,'Hmm...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29818,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,9,0,'Unfortunate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29819,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,10,0,'A druid! How curious... I wonder how it got in there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29701,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,11,0,'Disciples... you will find with time that many healing spells fall victim to the degeneration of our strikes.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29798,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,12,0,'Some healers lack the knowledge to counter the diseases that we master.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29799,0,'Lady Alistra'),(29195,13,0,'This lack of knowledge is just one more weakness among many. There is little hope against the power of death itself.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29800,0,'Lady Alistra'),(3313,2,0,'%s throws a rotten apple at $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31671,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,3,0,'%s throws rotten banana on $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31672,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,4,0,'%s spits on $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31673,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,5,0,'Monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31662,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,5,1,'Murderer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31679,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,5,2,'GET A ROPE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31669,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,5,3,'How dare you set foot in our city!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31684,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,5,4,'You disgust me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31680,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,5,5,'Looks like we\'re going to have ourselves an execution.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31682,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,5,6,'Traitorous dog.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31665,0,'Trak\'gen'),(3313,5,7,'My family was wiped out by the Scourge! MONSTER!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31667,0,'Trak\'gen'),(5606,2,0,'%s throws a rotten apple at $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31671,0,'Goma'),(5606,3,0,'%s throws rotten banana on $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31672,0,'Goma'),(5606,4,0,'%s spits on $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31673,0,'Goma'),(5606,5,0,'Monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31662,0,'Goma'),(5606,5,1,'Murderer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31679,0,'Goma'),(5606,5,2,'GET A ROPE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31669,0,'Goma'),(5606,5,3,'How dare you set foot in our city!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31684,0,'Goma'),(5606,5,4,'You disgust me.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31680,0,'Goma'),(5606,5,5,'Looks like we\'re going to have ourselves an execution.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31682,0,'Goma'),(5606,5,6,'Traitorous dog.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31665,0,'Goma'),(5606,5,7,'My family was wiped out by the Scourge! MONSTER!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31667,0,'Goma'),(5609,2,0,'%s throws a rotten apple at $n.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31671,0,'Zazo'),(5609,3,0,'%s throws ro